__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God.",pt:"No princ\xedpio era o Verbo, e o Verbo estava com Deus, e o Verbo era Deus."},{verse:2,en:"The same was in the beginning with God.",pt:"Ele estava no princ\xedpio com Deus."},{verse:3,en:"All things were made by him; and without him was not any thing made that was made.",pt:"Todas as coisas foram feitas por interm\xe9dio dele, e sem ele nada do que foi feito se fez."},{verse:4,en:"In him was life; and the life was the light of men.",pt:"Nele estava a vida, e a vida era a luz dos homens;"},{verse:5,en:"And the light shineth in darkness; and the darkness comprehended it not.",pt:"a luz resplandece nas trevas, e as trevas n\xe3o prevaleceram contra ela."},{verse:6,en:"There was a man sent from God, whose name was John.",pt:"Houve um homem enviado de Deus, cujo nome era Jo\xe3o."},{verse:7,en:"The same came for a witness, to bear witness of the Light, that all men through him might believe.",pt:"Este veio como testemunha, a fim de dar testemunho da luz, para que todos cressem por meio dele."},{verse:8,en:"He was not that Light, but was sent to bear witness of that Light.",pt:"Ele n\xe3o era a luz, mas veio para dar testemunho da luz."},{verse:9,en:"That was the true Light, which lighteth every man that cometh into the world.",pt:"Pois a verdadeira luz, que alumia a todo homem, estava chegando ao mundo."},{verse:10,en:"He was in the world, and the world was made by him, and the world knew him not.",pt:"Estava ele no mundo, e o mundo foi feito por interm\xe9dio dele, e o mundo n\xe3o o conheceu."},{verse:11,en:"He came unto his own, and his own received him not.",pt:"Veio para o que era seu, e os seus n\xe3o o receberam."},{verse:12,en:"But as many as received him, to them gave he power to become the sons of God, even to them that believe on his name:",pt:"Mas, a todos quantos o receberam, aos que cr\xeaem no seu nome, deu-lhes o poder de se tornarem filhos de Deus;"},{verse:13,en:"Which were born, not of blood, nor of the will of the flesh, nor of the will of man, but of God.",pt:"os quais n\xe3o nasceram do sangue, nem da vontade da carne, nem da vontade do var\xe3o, mas de Deus."},{verse:14,en:"And the Word was made flesh, and dwelt among us, (and we beheld his glory, the glory as of the only begotten of the Father,) full of grace and truth.",pt:"E o Verbo se fez carne, e habitou entre n\xf3s, cheio de gra\xe7a e de verdade; e vimos a sua gl\xf3ria, como a gl\xf3ria do unig\xeanito do Pai."},{verse:15,en:"John bare witness of him, and cried, saying, This was he of whom I spake, He that cometh after me is preferred before me: for he was before me.",pt:"Jo\xe3o deu testemunho dele, e clamou, dizendo: Este \xe9 aquele de quem eu disse: O que vem depois de mim, passou adiante de mim; porque antes de mim ele j\xe1 existia."},{verse:16,en:"And of his fulness have all we received, and grace for grace.",pt:"Pois todos n\xf3s recebemos da sua plenitude, e gra\xe7a sobre gra\xe7a."},{verse:17,en:"For the law was given by Moses, but grace and truth came by Jesus Christ.",pt:"Porque a lei foi dada por meio de Mois\xe9s; a gra\xe7a e a verdade vieram por Jesus Cristo."},{verse:18,en:"No man hath seen God at any time; the only begotten Son, which is in the bosom of the Father, he hath declared him.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m jamais viu a Deus. O Deus unig\xeanito, que est\xe1 no seio do Pai, esse o deu a conhecer."},{verse:19,en:"And this is the record of John, when the Jews sent priests and Levites from Jerusalem to ask him, Who art thou?",pt:"E este foi o testemunho de Jo\xe3o, quando os judeus lhe enviaram de Jerusal\xe9m sacerdotes e levitas para que lhe perguntassem: Quem \xe9s tu?"},{verse:20,en:"And he confessed, and denied not; but confessed, I am not the Christ.",pt:"Ele, pois, confessou e n\xe3o negou; sim, confessou: Eu n\xe3o sou o Cristo."},{verse:21,en:"And they asked him, What then? Art thou Elias? And he saith, I am not. Art thou that prophet? And he answered, No.",pt:"Ao que lhe perguntaram: Pois que? \xc9s tu Elias? Respondeu ele: N\xe3o sou. \xc9s tu o profeta? E respondeu: N\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"Then said they unto him, Who art thou? that we may give an answer to them that sent us. What sayest thou of thyself?",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois: Quem \xe9s? para podermos dar resposta aos que nos enviaram; que dizes de ti mesmo?"},{verse:23,en:"He said, I am the voice of one crying in the wilderness, Make straight the way of the Lord, as said the prophet Esaias.",pt:"Respondeu ele: Eu sou a voz do que clama no deserto: Endireitai o caminho do Senhor, como disse o profeta Isa\xedas."},{verse:24,en:"And they which were sent were of the Pharisees.",pt:"E os que tinham sido enviados eram dos fariseus."},{verse:25,en:"And they asked him, and said unto him, Why baptizest thou then, if thou be not that Christ, nor Elias, neither that prophet?",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhe perguntaram: Por que batizas, pois, se tu n\xe3o \xe9s o Cristo, nem Elias, nem o profeta?"},{verse:26,en:"John answered them, saying, I baptize with water: but there standeth one among you, whom ye know not;",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jo\xe3o: Eu batizo em \xe1gua; no meio de v\xf3s est\xe1 um a quem v\xf3s n\xe3o conheceis."},{verse:27,en:"He it is, who coming after me is preferred before me, whose shoe\u2019s latchet I am not worthy to unloose.",pt:"aquele que vem depois de mim, de quem eu n\xe3o sou digno de desatar a correia da alparca."},{verse:28,en:"These things were done in Bethabara beyond Jordan, where John was baptizing.",pt:"Estas coisas aconteceram em Bet\xe2nia, al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o, onde Jo\xe3o estava batizando."},{verse:29,en:"The next day John seeth Jesus coming unto him, and saith, Behold the Lamb of God, which taketh away the sin of the world.",pt:"No dia seguinte Jo\xe3o viu a Jesus, que vinha para ele, e disse: Eis o Cordeiro de Deus, que tira o pecado do mundo."},{verse:30,en:"This is he of whom I said, After me cometh a man which is preferred before me: for he was before me.",pt:"este \xe9 aquele de quem eu disse: Depois de mim vem um var\xe3o que passou adiante de mim, porque antes de mim ele j\xe1 existia."},{verse:31,en:"And I knew him not: but that he should be made manifest to Israel, therefore am I come baptizing with water.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o o conhecia; mas, para que ele fosse manifestado a Israel, \xe9 que vim batizando em \xe1gua."},{verse:32,en:"And John bare record, saying, I saw the Spirit descending from heaven like a dove, and it abode upon him.",pt:"E Jo\xe3o deu testemunho, dizendo: Vi o Esp\xedrito descer do c\xe9u como pomba, e repousar sobre ele."},{verse:33,en:"And I knew him not: but he that sent me to baptize with water, the same said unto me, Upon whom thou shalt see the Spirit descending, and remaining on him, the same is he which baptizeth with the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o o conhecia; mas o que me enviou a batizar em \xe1gua, esse me disse: Aquele sobre quem vires descer o Esp\xedrito, e sobre ele permanecer, esse \xe9 o que batiza no Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:34,en:"And I saw, and bare record that this is the Son of God.",pt:"Eu mesmo vi e j\xe1 vos dei testemunho de que este \xe9 o Filho de Deus."},{verse:35,en:"Again the next day after John stood, and two of his disciples;",pt:"No dia seguinte Jo\xe3o estava outra vez ali, com dois dos seus disc\xedpulos"},{verse:36,en:"And looking upon Jesus as he walked, he saith, Behold the Lamb of God!",pt:"e, olhando para Jesus, que passava, disse: Eis o Cordeiro de Deus!"},{verse:37,en:"And the two disciples heard him speak, and they followed Jesus.",pt:"Aqueles dois disc\xedpulos ouviram-no dizer isto, e seguiram a Jesus."},{verse:38,en:"Then Jesus turned, and saw them following, and saith unto them, What seek ye? They said unto him, Rabbi, (which is to say, being interpreted, Master,) where dwellest thou?",pt:"Voltando-se Jesus e vendo que o seguiam, perguntou-lhes: Que buscais? Disseram-lhe eles: rabi (que, traduzido, quer dizer Mestre), onde pousas?"},{verse:39,en:"He saith unto them, Come and see. They came and saw where he dwelt, and abode with him that day: for it was about the tenth hour.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: Vinde, e vereis. Foram, pois, e viram onde pousava; e passaram o dia com ele; era cerca da hora d\xe9cima."},{verse:40,en:"One of the two which heard John speak, and followed him, was Andrew, Simon Peter\u2019s brother.",pt:"Andr\xe9, irm\xe3o de Sim\xe3o Pedro, era um dos dois que ouviram Jo\xe3o falar, e que seguiram a Jesus."},{verse:41,en:"He first findeth his own brother Simon, and saith unto him, We have found the Messias, which is, being interpreted, the Christ.",pt:"Ele achou primeiro a seu irm\xe3o Sim\xe3o, e disse-lhe: Havemos achado o Messias (que, traduzido, quer dizer Cristo)."},{verse:42,en:"And he brought him to Jesus. And when Jesus beheld him, he said, Thou art Simon the son of Jona: thou shalt be called Cephas, which is by interpretation, A stone.",pt:"E o levou a Jesus. Jesus, fixando nele o olhar, disse: Tu \xe9s Sim\xe3o, filho de Jo\xe3o, tu ser\xe1s chamado Cefas (que quer dizer Pedro)."},{verse:43,en:"The day following Jesus would go forth into Galilee, and findeth Philip, and saith unto him, Follow me.",pt:"No dia seguinte Jesus resolveu partir para a Galil\xe9ia, e achando a Felipe disse-lhe: Segue-me."},{verse:44,en:"Now Philip was of Bethsaida, the city of Andrew and Peter.",pt:"Ora, Felipe era de Betsaida, cidade de Andr\xe9 e de Pedro."},{verse:45,en:"Philip findeth Nathanael, and saith unto him, We have found him, of whom Moses in the law, and the prophets, did write, Jesus of Nazareth, the son of Joseph.",pt:"Felipe achou a Natanael, e disse-lhe: Acabamos de achar aquele de quem escreveram Mois\xe9s na lei, e os profetas: Jesus de Nazar\xe9, filho de Jos\xe9."},{verse:46,en:"And Nathanael said unto him, Can there any good thing come out of Nazareth? Philip saith unto him, Come and see.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Natanael: Pode haver coisa bem vinda de Nazar\xe9? Disse-lhe Felipe: Vem e v\xea."},{verse:47,en:"Jesus saw Nathanael coming to him, and saith of him, Behold an Israelite indeed, in whom is no guile!",pt:"Jesus, vendo Natanael aproximar-se dele, disse a seu respeito: Eis um verdadeiro israelita, em quem n\xe3o h\xe1 dolo!"},{verse:48,en:"Nathanael saith unto him, Whence knowest thou me? Jesus answered and said unto him, Before that Philip called thee, when thou wast under the fig tree, I saw thee.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Natanael: Donde me conheces? Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Antes que Felipe te chamasse, eu te vi, quando estavas debaixo da figueira."},{verse:49,en:"Nathanael answered and saith unto him, Rabbi, thou art the Son of God; thou art the King of Israel.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Natanael: Rabi, tu \xe9s o Filho de Deus, tu \xe9s rei de Israel."},{verse:50,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, Because I said unto thee, I saw thee under the fig tree, believest thou? thou shalt see greater things than these.",pt:"Ao que lhe disse Jesus: Porque te disse: Vi-te debaixo da figueira, cr\xeas? coisas maiores do que estas ver\xe1s."},{verse:51,en:"And he saith unto him, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Hereafter ye shall see heaven open, and the angels of God ascending and descending upon the Son of man.",pt:"E acrescentou: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que vereis o c\xe9u aberto, e os anjos de Deus subindo e descendo sobre o Filho do homem."}]}}),664,[]);
__d((function(e,s,a,t,o,n,i){o.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And the third day there was a marriage in Cana of Galilee; and the mother of Jesus was there:",pt:"Tr\xeas dias depois, houve um casamento em Can\xe1 da Galil\xe9ia, e estava ali a m\xe3e de Jesus;"},{verse:2,en:"And both Jesus was called, and his disciples, to the marriage.",pt:"e foi tamb\xe9m convidado Jesus com seus disc\xedpulos para o casamento."},{verse:3,en:"And when they wanted wine, the mother of Jesus saith unto him, They have no wine.",pt:"E, tendo acabado o vinho, a m\xe3e de Jesus lhe disse: Eles n\xe3o t\xeam vinho."},{verse:4,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Woman, what have I to do with thee? mine hour is not yet come.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Mulher, que tenho eu contigo? Ainda n\xe3o \xe9 chegada a minha hora."},{verse:5,en:"His mother saith unto the servants, Whatsoever he saith unto you, do it.",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o sua m\xe3e aos serventes: Fazei tudo quanto ele vos disser."},{verse:6,en:"And there were set there six waterpots of stone, after the manner of the purifying of the Jews, containing two or three firkins apiece.",pt:"Ora, estavam ali postas seis talhas de pedra, para as purifica\xe7\xf5es dos judeus, e em cada uma cabiam duas ou tr\xeas metretas."},{verse:7,en:"Jesus saith unto them, Fill the waterpots with water. And they filled them up to the brim.",pt:"Ordenou-lhe Jesus: Enchei de \xe1gua essas talhas. E encheram- nas at\xe9 em cima."},{verse:8,en:"And he saith unto them, Draw out now, and bear unto the governor of the feast. And they bare it.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes disse: Tirai agora, e levai ao mestre-sala. E eles o fizeram."},{verse:9,en:"When the ruler of the feast had tasted the water that was made wine, and knew not whence it was: (but the servants which drew the water knew;) the governor of the feast called the bridegroom,",pt:"Quando o mestre-sala provou a \xe1gua tornada em vinho, n\xe3o sabendo donde era, se bem que o sabiam os serventes que tinham tirado a \xe1gua, chamou o mestre-sala ao noivo"},{verse:10,en:"And saith unto him, Every man at the beginning doth set forth good wine; and when men have well drunk, then that which is worse: but thou hast kept the good wine until now.",pt:"e lhe disse: Todo homem p\xf5e primeiro o vinho bom e, quando j\xe1 t\xeam bebido bem, ent\xe3o o inferior; mas tu guardaste at\xe9 agora o bom vinho."},{verse:11,en:"This beginning of miracles did Jesus in Cana of Galilee, and manifested forth his glory; and his disciples believed on him.",pt:"Assim deu Jesus in\xedcio aos seus sinais em Can\xe1 da Galil\xe9ia, e manifestou a sua gl\xf3ria; e os seus disc\xedpulos creram nele."},{verse:12,en:"After this he went down to Capernaum, he, and his mother, and his brethren, and his disciples: and they continued there not many days.",pt:"Depois disso desceu a Cafarnaum, ele, sua m\xe3e, seus irm\xe3os, e seus disc\xedpulos; e ficaram ali n\xe3o muitos dias."},{verse:13,en:"And the Jews\u2019 passover was at hand, and Jesus went up to Jerusalem,",pt:"Estando pr\xf3xima a p\xe1scoa dos judeus, Jesus subiu a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:14,en:"And found in the temple those that sold oxen and sheep and doves, and the changers of money sitting:",pt:"E achou no templo os que vendiam bois, ovelhas e pombas, e tamb\xe9m os cambistas ali sentados;"},{verse:15,en:"And when he had made a scourge of small cords, he drove them all out of the temple, and the sheep, and the oxen; and poured out the changers\u2019 money, and overthrew the tables;",pt:"e tendo feito um azorrague de cordas, lan\xe7ou todos fora do templo, bem como as ovelhas e os bois; e espalhou o dinheiro dos cambistas, e virou-lhes as mesas;"},{verse:16,en:"And said unto them that sold doves, Take these things hence; make not my Father\u2019s house an house of merchandise.",pt:"e disse aos que vendiam as pombas: Tirai daqui estas coisas; n\xe3o fa\xe7ais da casa de meu Pai casa de neg\xf3cio."},{verse:17,en:"And his disciples remembered that it was written, The zeal of thine house hath eaten me up.",pt:"Lembraram-se ent\xe3o os seus disc\xedpulos de que est\xe1 escrito: O zelo da tua casa me devorar\xe1."},{verse:18,en:"Then answered the Jews and said unto him, What sign shewest thou unto us, seeing that thou doest these things?",pt:"Protestaram, pois, os judeus, perguntando-lhe: Que sinal de autoridade nos mostras, uma vez que fazes isto?"},{verse:19,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, Destroy this temple, and in three days I will raise it up.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Derribai este santu\xe1rio, e em tr\xeas dias o levantarei."},{verse:20,en:"Then said the Jews, Forty and six years was this temple in building, and wilt thou rear it up in three days?",pt:"Disseram, pois, os judeus: Em quarenta e seis anos foi edificado este santu\xe1rio, e tu o levantar\xe1s em tr\xeas dias?"},{verse:21,en:"But he spake of the temple of his body.",pt:"Mas ele falava do santu\xe1rio do seu corpo."},{verse:22,en:"When therefore he was risen from the dead, his disciples remembered that he had said this unto them; and they believed the scripture, and the word which Jesus had said.",pt:"Quando, pois ressurgiu dentre os mortos, seus disc\xedpulos se lembraram de que dissera isto, e creram na Escritura, e na palavra que Jesus havia dito."},{verse:23,en:"Now when he was in Jerusalem at the passover, in the feast day, many believed in his name, when they saw the miracles which he did.",pt:"Ora, estando ele em Jerusal\xe9m pela festa da p\xe1scoa, muitos, vendo os sinais que fazia, creram no seu nome."},{verse:24,en:"But Jesus did not commit himself unto them, because he knew all men,",pt:"Mas o pr\xf3prio Jesus n\xe3o confiava a eles, porque os conhecia a todos,"},{verse:25,en:"And needed not that any should testify of man: for he knew what was in man.",pt:"e n\xe3o necessitava de que algu\xe9m lhe desse testemunho do homem, pois bem sabia o que havia no homem."}]}}),665,[]);
__d((function(e,o,t,a,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"There was a man of the Pharisees, named Nicodemus, a ruler of the Jews:",pt:"Ora, havia entre os fariseus um homem chamado Nicodemos, um dos principais dos judeus."},{verse:2,en:"The same came to Jesus by night, and said unto him, Rabbi, we know that thou art a teacher come from God: for no man can do these miracles that thou doest, except God be with him.",pt:"Este foi ter com Jesus, de noite, e disse-lhe: Rabi, sabemos que \xe9s Mestre, vindo de Deus; pois ningu\xe9m pode fazer estes sinais que tu fazes, se Deus n\xe3o estiver com ele."},{verse:3,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, Verily, verily, I say unto thee, Except a man be born again, he cannot see the kingdom of God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade te digo que se algu\xe9m n\xe3o nascer de novo, n\xe3o pode ver o reino de Deus."},{verse:4,en:"Nicodemus saith unto him, How can a man be born when he is old? can he enter the second time into his mother\u2019s womb, and be born?",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Nicodemos: Como pode um homem nascer, sendo velho? porventura pode tornar a entrar no ventre de sua m\xe3e, e nascer?"},{verse:5,en:"Jesus answered, Verily, verily, I say unto thee, Except a man be born of water and of the Spirit, he cannot enter into the kingdom of God.",pt:"Jesus respondeu: Em verdade, em verdade te digo que se algu\xe9m n\xe3o nascer da \xe1gua e do Esp\xedrito, n\xe3o pode entrar no reino de Deus."},{verse:6,en:"That which is born of the flesh is flesh; and that which is born of the Spirit is spirit.",pt:"O que \xe9 nascido da carne \xe9 carne, e o que \xe9 nascido do Esp\xedrito \xe9 esp\xedrito."},{verse:7,en:"Marvel not that I said unto thee, Ye must be born again.",pt:"N\xe3o te admires de eu te haver dito: Necess\xe1rio vos \xe9 nascer de novo."},{verse:8,en:"The wind bloweth where it listeth, and thou hearest the sound thereof, but canst not tell whence it cometh, and whither it goeth: so is every one that is born of the Spirit.",pt:"O vento sopra onde quer, e ouves a sua voz; mas n\xe3o sabes donde vem, nem para onde vai; assim \xe9 todo aquele que \xe9 nascido do Esp\xedrito."},{verse:9,en:"Nicodemus answered and said unto him, How can these things be?",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Nicodemos: Como pode ser isto?"},{verse:10,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, Art thou a master of Israel, and knowest not these things?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Tu \xe9s mestre em Israel, e n\xe3o entendes estas coisas?"},{verse:11,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto thee, We speak that we do know, and testify that we have seen; and ye receive not our witness.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade te digo que n\xf3s dizemos o que sabemos e testemunhamos o que temos visto; e n\xe3o aceitais o nosso testemunho!"},{verse:12,en:"If I have told you earthly things, and ye believe not, how shall ye believe, if I tell you of heavenly things?",pt:"Se vos falei de coisas terrestres, e n\xe3o credes, como crereis, se vos falar das celestiais?"},{verse:13,en:"And no man hath ascended up to heaven, but he that came down from heaven, even the Son of man which is in heaven.",pt:"Ora, ningu\xe9m subiu ao c\xe9u, sen\xe3o o que desceu do c\xe9u, o Filho do homem."},{verse:14,en:"And as Moses lifted up the serpent in the wilderness, even so must the Son of man be lifted up:",pt:"E como Mois\xe9s levantou a serpente no deserto, assim importa que o Filho do homem seja levantado;"},{verse:15,en:"That whosoever believeth in him should not perish, but have eternal life.",pt:"para que todo aquele que nele cr\xea tenha a vida eterna."},{verse:16,en:"For God so loved the world, that he gave his only begotten Son, that whosoever believeth in him should not perish, but have everlasting life.",pt:"Porque Deus amou o mundo de tal maneira que deu o seu Filho unig\xeanito, para que todo aquele que nele cr\xea n\xe3o pere\xe7a, mas tenha a vida eterna."},{verse:17,en:"For God sent not his Son into the world to condemn the world; but that the world through him might be saved.",pt:"Porque Deus enviou o seu Filho ao mundo, n\xe3o para que julgasse o mundo, mas para que o mundo fosse salvo por ele."},{verse:18,en:"He that believeth on him is not condemned: but he that believeth not is condemned already, because he hath not believed in the name of the only begotten Son of God.",pt:"Quem cr\xea nele n\xe3o \xe9 julgado; mas quem n\xe3o cr\xea, j\xe1 est\xe1 julgado; porquanto n\xe3o cr\xea no nome do unig\xeanito Filho de Deus."},{verse:19,en:"And this is the condemnation, that light is come into the world, and men loved darkness rather than light, because their deeds were evil.",pt:"E o julgamento \xe9 este: A luz veio ao mundo, e os homens amaram antes as trevas que a luz, porque as suas obras eram m\xe1s."},{verse:20,en:"For every one that doeth evil hateth the light, neither cometh to the light, lest his deeds should be reproved.",pt:"Porque todo aquele que faz o mal aborrece a luz, e n\xe3o vem para a luz, para que as suas obras n\xe3o sejam reprovadas."},{verse:21,en:"But he that doeth truth cometh to the light, that his deeds may be made manifest, that they are wrought in God.",pt:"Mas quem pratica a verdade vem para a luz, a fim de que seja manifesto que as suas obras s\xe3o feitas em Deus."},{verse:22,en:"After these things came Jesus and his disciples into the land of Judaea; and there he tarried with them, and baptized.",pt:"Depois disto foi Jesus com seus disc\xedpulos para a terra da Jud\xe9ia, onde se demorou com eles e batizava."},{verse:23,en:"And John also was baptizing in Aenon near to Salim, because there was much water there: and they came, and were baptized.",pt:"Ora, Jo\xe3o tamb\xe9m estava batizando em Enom, perto de Salim, porque havia ali muitas \xe1guas; e o povo \xeda e se batizava."},{verse:24,en:"For John was not yet cast into prison.",pt:"Pois Jo\xe3o ainda n\xe3o fora lan\xe7ado no c\xe1rcere."},{verse:25,en:"Then there arose a question between some of John\u2019s disciples and the Jews about purifying.",pt:"Surgiu ent\xe3o uma contenda entre os disc\xedpulos de Jo\xe3o e um judeu acerca da purifica\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"And they came unto John, and said unto him, Rabbi, he that was with thee beyond Jordan, to whom thou barest witness, behold, the same baptizeth, and all men come to him.",pt:"E foram ter com Jo\xe3o e disseram-lhe: Rabi, aquele que estava contigo al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o, do qual tens dado testemunho, eis que est\xe1 batizando, e todos v\xe3o ter com ele."},{verse:27,en:"John answered and said, A man can receive nothing, except it be given him from heaven.",pt:"Respondeu Jo\xe3o: O homem n\xe3o pode receber coisa alguma, se n\xe3o lhe for dada do c\xe9u."},{verse:28,en:"Ye yourselves bear me witness, that I said, I am not the Christ, but that I am sent before him.",pt:"V\xf3s mesmos me sois testemunhas de que eu disse: N\xe3o sou o Cristo, mas sou enviado adiante dele."},{verse:29,en:"He that hath the bride is the bridegroom: but the friend of the bridegroom, which standeth and heareth him, rejoiceth greatly because of the bridegroom\u2019s voice: this my joy therefore is fulfilled.",pt:"Aquele que tem a noiva \xe9 o noivo; mas o amigo do noivo, que est\xe1 presente e o ouve, regozija-se muito com a voz do noivo. Assim, pois, este meu gozo est\xe1 completo."},{verse:30,en:"He must increase, but I must decrease.",pt:"\xc9 necess\xe1rio que ele cres\xe7a e que eu diminua."},{verse:31,en:"He that cometh from above is above all: he that is of the earth is earthly, and speaketh of the earth: he that cometh from heaven is above all.",pt:"Aquele que vem de cima \xe9 sobre todos; aquele que vem da terra \xe9 da terra, e fala da terra. Aquele que vem do c\xe9u \xe9 sobre todos."},{verse:32,en:"And what he hath seen and heard, that he testifieth; and no man receiveth his testimony.",pt:"Aquilo que ele tem visto e ouvido, isso testifica; e ningu\xe9m aceita o seu testemunho."},{verse:33,en:"He that hath received his testimony hath set to his seal that God is true.",pt:"Mas o que aceitar o seu testemunho, esse confirma que Deus \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:34,en:"For he whom God hath sent speaketh the words of God: for God giveth not the Spirit by measure unto him.",pt:"Pois aquele que Deus enviou fala as palavras de Deus; porque Deus n\xe3o d\xe1 o Esp\xedrito por medida."},{verse:35,en:"The Father loveth the Son, and hath given all things into his hand.",pt:"O Pai ama ao Filho, e todas as coisas entregou nas suas m\xe3os."},{verse:36,en:"He that believeth on the Son hath everlasting life: and he that believeth not the Son shall not see life; but the wrath of God abideth on him.",pt:"Quem cr\xea no Filho tem a vida eterna; o que, por\xe9m, desobedece ao Filho n\xe3o ver\xe1 a vida, mas sobre ele permanece a ira de Deus."}]}}),666,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,i,h){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"When therefore the Lord knew how the Pharisees had heard that Jesus made and baptized more disciples than John,",pt:"Quando, pois, o Senhor soube que os fariseus tinham ouvido dizer que ele, Jesus, fazia e batizava mais disc\xedpulos do que Jo\xe3o"},{verse:2,en:"(Though Jesus himself baptized not, but his disciples,)",pt:"(ainda que Jesus mesmo n\xe3o batizava, mas os seus disc\xedpulos)"},{verse:3,en:"He left Judaea, and departed again into Galilee.",pt:"deixou a Jud\xe9ia, e foi outra vez para a Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:4,en:"And he must needs go through Samaria.",pt:"E era-lhe necess\xe1rio passar por Sam\xe1ria."},{verse:5,en:"Then cometh he to a city of Samaria, which is called Sychar, near to the parcel of ground that Jacob gave to his son Joseph.",pt:"Chegou, pois, a uma cidade de Sam\xe1ria, chamada Sicar, junto da herdade que Jac\xf3 dera a seu filho Jos\xe9;"},{verse:6,en:"Now Jacob\u2019s well was there. Jesus therefore, being wearied with his journey, sat thus on the well: and it was about the sixth hour.",pt:"achava-se ali o po\xe7o de Jac\xf3. Jesus, pois, cansado da viagem, sentou-se assim junto do po\xe7o; era cerca da hora sexta."},{verse:7,en:"There cometh a woman of Samaria to draw water: Jesus saith unto her, Give me to drink.",pt:"Veio uma mulher de Sam\xe1ria tirar \xe1gua. Disse-lhe Jesus: D\xe1- me de beber."},{verse:8,en:"(For his disciples were gone away unto the city to buy meat.)",pt:"Pois seus disc\xedpulos tinham ido \xe0 cidade comprar comida."},{verse:9,en:"Then saith the woman of Samaria unto him, How is it that thou, being a Jew, askest drink of me, which am a woman of Samaria? for the Jews have no dealings with the Samaritans.",pt:"Disse-lhe ent\xe3o a mulher samaritana: Como, sendo tu judeu, me pedes de beber a mim, que sou mulher samaritana? (Porque os judeus n\xe3o se comunicavam com os samaritanos.)"},{verse:10,en:"Jesus answered and said unto her, If thou knewest the gift of God, and who it is that saith to thee, Give me to drink; thou wouldest have asked of him, and he would have given thee living water.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Se tivesses conhecido o dom de Deus e quem \xe9 o que te diz: D\xe1-me de beber, tu lhe terias pedido e ele te haveria dado \xe1gua viva."},{verse:11,en:"The woman saith unto him, Sir, thou hast nothing to draw with, and the well is deep: from whence then hast thou that living water?",pt:"Disse-lhe a mulher: Senhor, tu n\xe3o tens com que tir\xe1-la, e o po\xe7o \xe9 fundo; donde, pois, tens essa \xe1gua viva?"},{verse:12,en:"Art thou greater than our father Jacob, which gave us the well, and drank thereof himself, and his children, and his cattle?",pt:"\xc9s tu, porventura, maior do que o nosso pai Jac\xf3, que nos deu o po\xe7o, do qual tamb\xe9m ele mesmo bebeu, e os filhos, e o seu gado?."},{verse:13,en:"Jesus answered and said unto her, Whosoever drinketh of this water shall thirst again:",pt:"Replicou-lhe Jesus: Todo o que beber desta \xe1gua tornar\xe1 a ter sede;"},{verse:14,en:"But whosoever drinketh of the water that I shall give him shall never thirst; but the water that I shall give him shall be in him a well of water springing up into everlasting life.",pt:"mas aquele que beber da \xe1gua que eu lhe der nunca ter\xe1 sede; pelo contr\xe1rio, a \xe1gua que eu lhe der se far\xe1 nele uma fonte de \xe1gua que jorre para a vida eterna."},{verse:15,en:"The woman saith unto him, Sir, give me this water, that I thirst not, neither come hither to draw.",pt:"Disse-lhe a mulher: Senhor, d\xe1-me dessa \xe1gua, para que n\xe3o mais tenha sede, nem venha aqui tir\xe1-la."},{verse:16,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Go, call thy husband, and come hither.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Vai, chama o teu marido e vem c\xe1."},{verse:17,en:"The woman answered and said, I have no husband. Jesus said unto her, Thou hast well said, I have no husband:",pt:"Respondeu a mulher: N\xe3o tenho marido. Disse-lhe Jesus: Disseste bem: N\xe3o tenho marido;"},{verse:18,en:"For thou hast had five husbands; and he whom thou now hast is not thy husband: in that saidst thou truly.",pt:"porque cinco maridos tiveste, e o que agora tens n\xe3o \xe9 teu marido; isso disseste com verdade."},{verse:19,en:"The woman saith unto him, Sir, I perceive that thou art a prophet.",pt:"Disse-lhe a mulher: Senhor, vejo que \xe9s profeta."},{verse:20,en:"Our fathers worshipped in this mountain; and ye say, that in Jerusalem is the place where men ought to worship.",pt:"Nossos pais adoraram neste monte, e v\xf3s dizeis que em Jerusal\xe9m \xe9 o lugar onde se deve adorar."},{verse:21,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Woman, believe me, the hour cometh, when ye shall neither in this mountain, nor yet at Jerusalem, worship the Father.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Mulher, cr\xea-me, a hora vem, em que nem neste monte, nem em Jerusal\xe9m adorareis o Pai."},{verse:22,en:"Ye worship ye know not what: we know what we worship: for salvation is of the Jews.",pt:"V\xf3s adorais o que n\xe3o conheceis; n\xf3s adoramos o que conhecemos; porque a salva\xe7\xe3o vem dos judeus."},{verse:23,en:"But the hour cometh, and now is, when the true worshippers shall worship the Father in spirit and in truth: for the Father seeketh such to worship him.",pt:"Mas a hora vem, e agora \xe9, em que os verdadeiros adoradores adorar\xe3o o Pai em esp\xedrito e em verdade; porque o Pai procura a tais que assim o adorem."},{verse:24,en:"God is a Spirit: and they that worship him must worship him in spirit and in truth.",pt:"Deus \xe9 Esp\xedrito, e \xe9 necess\xe1rio que os que o adoram o adorem em esp\xedrito e em verdade."},{verse:25,en:"The woman saith unto him, I know that Messias cometh, which is called Christ: when he is come, he will tell us all things.",pt:"Replicou-lhe a mulher: Eu sei que vem o Messias (que se chama o Cristo); quando ele vier h\xe1 de nos anunciar todas as coisas."},{verse:26,en:"Jesus saith unto her, I that speak unto thee am he.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Eu o sou, eu que falo contigo."},{verse:27,en:"And upon this came his disciples, and marvelled that he talked with the woman: yet no man said, What seekest thou? or, Why talkest thou with her?",pt:"E nisto vieram os seus disc\xedpulos, e se admiravam de que estivesse falando com uma mulher; todavia nenhum lhe perguntou: Que \xe9 que procuras? ou: Por que falas com ela?"},{verse:28,en:"The woman then left her waterpot, and went her way into the city, and saith to the men,",pt:"Deixou, pois, a mulher o seu c\xe2ntaro, foi \xe0 cidade e disse \xe0queles homens:"},{verse:29,en:"Come, see a man, which told me all things that ever I did: is not this the Christ?",pt:"Vinde, vede um homem que me disse tudo quanto eu tenho feito; ser\xe1 este, porventura, o Cristo?"},{verse:30,en:"Then they went out of the city, and came unto him.",pt:"Sa\xedram, pois, da cidade e vinham ter com ele."},{verse:31,en:"In the mean while his disciples prayed him, saying, Master, eat.",pt:"Entrementes os seus disc\xedpulos lhe rogavam, dizendo: Rabi, come."},{verse:32,en:"But he said unto them, I have meat to eat that ye know not of.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, respondeu: Uma comida tenho para comer que v\xf3s n\xe3o conheceis."},{verse:33,en:"Therefore said the disciples one to another, Hath any man brought him ought to eat?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os disc\xedpulos diziam uns aos outros: Acaso algu\xe9m lhe trouxe de comer?"},{verse:34,en:"Jesus saith unto them, My meat is to do the will of him that sent me, and to finish his work.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: A minha comida \xe9 fazer a vontade daquele que me enviou, e completar a sua obra."},{verse:35,en:"Say not ye, There are yet four months, and then cometh harvest? behold, I say unto you, Lift up your eyes, and look on the fields; for they are white already to harvest.",pt:"N\xe3o dizeis v\xf3s: Ainda h\xe1 quatro meses at\xe9 que venha a ceifa? Ora, eu vos digo: levantai os vossos olhos, e vede os campos, que j\xe1 est\xe3o brancos para a ceifa."},{verse:36,en:"And he that reapeth receiveth wages, and gathereth fruit unto life eternal: that both he that soweth and he that reapeth may rejoice together.",pt:"Quem ceifa j\xe1 est\xe1 recebendo recompensa e ajuntando fruto para a vida eterna; para que o que semeia e o que ceifa juntamente se regozijem."},{verse:37,en:"And herein is that saying true, One soweth, and another reapeth.",pt:"Porque nisto \xe9 verdadeiro o ditado: Um \xe9 o que semeia, e outro o que ceifa."},{verse:38,en:"I sent you to reap that whereon ye bestowed no labour: other men laboured, and ye are entered into their labours.",pt:"Eu vos enviei a ceifar onde n\xe3o trabalhaste; outros trabalharam, e v\xf3s entrastes no seu trabalho."},{verse:39,en:"And many of the Samaritans of that city believed on him for the saying of the woman, which testified, He told me all that ever I did.",pt:"E muitos samaritanos daquela cidade creram nele, por causa da palavra da mulher, que testificava: Ele me disse tudo quanto tenho feito."},{verse:40,en:"So when the Samaritans were come unto him, they besought him that he would tarry with them: and he abode there two days.",pt:"Indo, pois, ter com ele os samaritanos, rogaram-lhe que ficasse com eles; e ficou ali dois dias."},{verse:41,en:"And many more believed because of his own word;",pt:"E muitos mais creram por causa da palavra dele;"},{verse:42,en:"And said unto the woman, Now we believe, not because of thy saying: for we have heard him ourselves, and know that this is indeed the Christ, the Saviour of the world.",pt:"e diziam \xe0 mulher: J\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9 pela tua palavra que n\xf3s cremos; pois agora n\xf3s mesmos temos ouvido e sabemos que este \xe9 verdadeiramente o Salvador do mundo."},{verse:43,en:"Now after two days he departed thence, and went into Galilee.",pt:"Passados os dois dias partiu dali para a Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:44,en:"For Jesus himself testified, that a prophet hath no honour in his own country.",pt:"Porque Jesus mesmo testificou que um profeta n\xe3o recebe honra na sua pr\xf3pria p\xe1tria."},{verse:45,en:"Then when he was come into Galilee, the Galilaeans received him, having seen all the things that he did at Jerusalem at the feast: for they also went unto the feast.",pt:"Assim, pois, que chegou \xe0 Galil\xe9ia, os galileus o receberam, porque tinham visto todas as coisas que fizera em Jerusal\xe9m na ocasi\xe3o da festa; pois tamb\xe9m eles tinham ido \xe0 festa."},{verse:46,en:"So Jesus came again into Cana of Galilee, where he made the water wine. And there was a certain nobleman, whose son was sick at Capernaum.",pt:"Foi, ent\xe3o, outra vez a Can\xe1 da Galil\xe9ia, onde da \xe1gua fizera vinho. Ora, havia um oficial do rei, cujo filho estava enfermo em Cafarnaum."},{verse:47,en:"When he heard that Jesus was come out of Judaea into Galilee, he went unto him, and besought him that he would come down, and heal his son: for he was at the point of death.",pt:"Quando ele soube que Jesus tinha vindo da Jud\xe9ia para a Galil\xe9ia, foi ter com ele, e lhe rogou que descesse e lhe curasse o filho; pois estava \xe0 morte."},{verse:48,en:"Then said Jesus unto him, Except ye see signs and wonders, ye will not believe.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus lhe disse: Se n\xe3o virdes sinais e prod\xedgios, de modo algum crereis."},{verse:49,en:"The nobleman saith unto him, Sir, come down ere my child die.",pt:"Rogou-lhe o oficial: Senhor, desce antes que meu filho morra."},{verse:50,en:"Jesus saith unto him, Go thy way; thy son liveth. And the man believed the word that Jesus had spoken unto him, and he went his way.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Vai, o teu filho vive. E o homem creu na palavra que Jesus lhe dissera, e partiu."},{verse:51,en:"And as he was now going down, his servants met him, and told him, saying, Thy son liveth.",pt:"Quando ele j\xe1 ia descendo, sa\xedram-lhe ao encontro os seus servos, e lhe disseram que seu filho vivia."},{verse:52,en:"Then enquired he of them the hour when he began to amend. And they said unto him, Yesterday at the seventh hour the fever left him.",pt:"Perguntou-lhes, pois, a que hora come\xe7ara a melhorar; ao que lhe disseram: Ontem \xe0 hora s\xe9tima a febre o deixou."},{verse:53,en:"So the father knew that it was at the same hour, in the which Jesus said unto him, Thy son liveth: and himself believed, and his whole house.",pt:"Reconheceu, pois, o pai ser aquela hora a mesma em que Jesus lhe dissera: O teu filho vive; e creu ele e toda a sua casa."},{verse:54,en:"This is again the second miracle that Jesus did, when he was come out of Judaea into Galilee.",pt:"Foi esta a segunda vez que Jesus, ao voltar da Jud\xe9ia para a Galil\xe9ia, ali operou sinal."}]}}),667,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,h,n){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After this there was a feast of the Jews; and Jesus went up to Jerusalem.",pt:"Depois disso havia uma festa dos judeus; e Jesus subiu a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:2,en:"Now there is at Jerusalem by the sheep market a pool, which is called in the Hebrew tongue Bethesda, having five porches.",pt:"Ora, em Jerusal\xe9m, pr\xf3ximo \xe0 porta das ovelhas, h\xe1 um tanque, chamado em hebraico Betesda, o qual tem cinco alpendres."},{verse:3,en:"In these lay a great multitude of impotent folk, of blind, halt, withered, waiting for the moving of the water.",pt:"Nestes jazia grande multid\xe3o de enfermos, cegos, mancos e ressicados [esperando o movimento da \xe1gua.]"},{verse:4,en:"For an angel went down at a certain season into the pool, and troubled the water: whosoever then first after the troubling of the water stepped in was made whole of whatsoever disease he had.",pt:"[Porquanto um anjo descia em certo tempo ao tanque, e agitava a \xe1gua; ent\xe3o o primeiro que ali descia, depois do movimento da \xe1gua, sarava de qualquer enfermidade que tivesse.]"},{verse:5,en:"And a certain man was there, which had an infirmity thirty and eight years.",pt:"Achava-se ali um homem que, havia trinta e oito anos, estava enfermo."},{verse:6,en:"When Jesus saw him lie, and knew that he had been now a long time in that case, he saith unto him, Wilt thou be made whole?",pt:"Jesus, vendo-o deitado e sabendo que estava assim havia muito tempo, perguntou-lhe: Queres ficar s\xe3o?"},{verse:7,en:"The impotent man answered him, Sir, I have no man, when the water is troubled, to put me into the pool: but while I am coming, another steppeth down before me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe o enfermo: Senhor, n\xe3o tenho ningu\xe9m que, ao ser agitada a \xe1gua, me ponha no tanque; assim, enquanto eu vou, desce outro antes de mim."},{verse:8,en:"Jesus saith unto him, Rise, take up thy bed, and walk.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Levanta-te, toma o teu leito e anda."},{verse:9,en:"And immediately the man was made whole, and took up his bed, and walked: and on the same day was the sabbath.",pt:"Imediatamente o homem ficou s\xe3o; e, tomando o seu leito, come\xe7ou a andar. Ora, aquele dia era s\xe1bado."},{verse:10,en:"The Jews therefore said unto him that was cured, It is the sabbath day: it is not lawful for thee to carry thy bed.",pt:"Pelo que disseram os judeus ao que fora curado: Hoje \xe9 s\xe1bado, e n\xe3o te \xe9 l\xedcito carregar o leito."},{verse:11,en:"He answered them, He that made me whole, the same said unto me, Take up thy bed, and walk.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhes respondeu: Aquele que me curou, esse mesmo me disse: Toma o teu leito e anda."},{verse:12,en:"Then asked they him, What man is that which said unto thee, Take up thy bed, and walk?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe, pois: Quem \xe9 o homem que te disse: Toma o teu leito e anda?"},{verse:13,en:"And he that was healed wist not who it was: for Jesus had conveyed himself away, a multitude being in that place.",pt:"Mas o que fora curado n\xe3o sabia quem era; porque Jesus se retirara, por haver muita gente naquele lugar."},{verse:14,en:"Afterward Jesus findeth him in the temple, and said unto him, Behold, thou art made whole: sin no more, lest a worse thing come unto thee.",pt:"Depois Jesus o encontrou no templo, e disse-lhe: Olha, j\xe1 est\xe1s curado; n\xe3o peques mais, para que n\xe3o te suceda coisa pior."},{verse:15,en:"The man departed, and told the Jews that it was Jesus, which had made him whole.",pt:"Retirou-se, ent\xe3o, o homem, e contou aos judeus que era Jesus quem o curara."},{verse:16,en:"And therefore did the Jews persecute Jesus, and sought to slay him, because he had done these things on the sabbath day.",pt:"Por isso os judeus perseguiram a Jesus, porque fazia estas coisas no s\xe1bado."},{verse:17,en:"But Jesus answered them, My Father worketh hitherto, and I work.",pt:"Mas Jesus lhes respondeu: Meu Pai trabalha at\xe9 agora, e eu trabalho tamb\xe9m."},{verse:18,en:"Therefore the Jews sought the more to kill him, because he not only had broken the sabbath, but said also that God was his Father, making himself equal with God.",pt:"Por isso, pois, os judeus ainda mais procuravam mat\xe1-lo, porque n\xe3o s\xf3 violava o s\xe1bado, mas tamb\xe9m dizia que Deus era seu pr\xf3prio Pai, fazendo-se igual a Deus."},{verse:19,en:"Then answered Jesus and said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, The Son can do nothing of himself, but what he seeth the Father do: for what things soever he doeth, these also doeth the Son likewise.",pt:"Disse-lhes, pois, Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que o Filho de si mesmo nada pode fazer, sen\xe3o o que vir o Pai fazer; porque tudo quanto ele faz, o Filho o faz igualmente."},{verse:20,en:"For the Father loveth the Son, and sheweth him all things that himself doeth: and he will shew him greater works than these, that ye may marvel.",pt:"Porque o Pai ama ao Filho, e mostra-lhe tudo o que ele mesmo faz; e maiores obras do que estas lhe mostrar\xe1, para que vos maravilheis."},{verse:21,en:"For as the Father raiseth up the dead, and quickeneth them; even so the Son quickeneth whom he will.",pt:"Pois, assim como o Pai levanta os mortos e lhes d\xe1 vida, assim tamb\xe9m o Filho d\xe1 vida a quem ele quer."},{verse:22,en:"For the Father judgeth no man, but hath committed all judgment unto the Son:",pt:"Porque o Pai a nigu\xe9m julga, mas deu ao Filho todo o julgamento,"},{verse:23,en:"That all men should honour the Son, even as they honour the Father. He that honoureth not the Son honoureth not the Father which hath sent him.",pt:"para que todos honrem o Filho, assim como honram o Pai. Quem n\xe3o honra o Filho, n\xe3o honra o Pai que o enviou."},{verse:24,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that heareth my word, and believeth on him that sent me, hath everlasting life, and shall not come into condemnation; but is passed from death unto life.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que quem ouve a minha palavra, e cr\xea naquele que me enviou, tem a vida eterna e n\xe3o entra em ju\xedzo, mas j\xe1 passou da morte para a vida."},{verse:25,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, The hour is coming, and now is, when the dead shall hear the voice of the Son of God: and they that hear shall live.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que vem a hora, e agora \xe9, em que os mortos ouvir\xe3o a voz do Filho de Deus, e os que a ouvirem viver\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"For as the Father hath life in himself; so hath he given to the Son to have life in himself;",pt:"Pois assim como o Pai tem vida em si mesmo, assim tamb\xe9m deu ao Filho ter vida em si mesmos;"},{verse:27,en:"And hath given him authority to execute judgment also, because he is the Son of man.",pt:"e deu-lhe autoridade para julgar, porque \xe9 o Filho do homem."},{verse:28,en:"Marvel not at this: for the hour is coming, in the which all that are in the graves shall hear his voice,",pt:"N\xe3o vos admireis disso, porque vem a hora em que todos os que est\xe3o nos sepulcros ouvir\xe3o a sua voz e sair\xe3o:"},{verse:29,en:"And shall come forth; they that have done good, unto the resurrection of life; and they that have done evil, unto the resurrection of damnation.",pt:"os que tiverem feito o bem, para a ressurrei\xe7\xe3o da vida, e os que tiverem praticado o mal, para a ressurrei\xe7\xe3o do ju\xedzo."},{verse:30,en:"I can of mine own self do nothing: as I hear, I judge: and my judgment is just; because I seek not mine own will, but the will of the Father which hath sent me.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o posso de mim mesmo fazer coisa alguma; como ou\xe7o, assim julgo; e o meu ju\xedzo \xe9 justo, porque n\xe3o procuro a minha vontade, mas a vontade daquele que me enviou."},{verse:31,en:"If I bear witness of myself, my witness is not true.",pt:"Se eu der testemunho de mim mesmo, o meu testemunho n\xe3o \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:32,en:"There is another that beareth witness of me; and I know that the witness which he witnesseth of me is true.",pt:"Outro \xe9 quem d\xe1 testemunho de mim; e sei que o testemunho que ele d\xe1 de mim \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:33,en:"Ye sent unto John, and he bare witness unto the truth.",pt:"V\xf3s mandastes mensageiros a Jo\xe3o, e ele deu testemunho da verdade;"},{verse:34,en:"But I receive not testimony from man: but these things I say, that ye might be saved.",pt:"eu, por\xe9m, n\xe3o recebo testemunho de homem; mas digo isto para que sejais salvos."},{verse:35,en:"He was a burning and a shining light: and ye were willing for a season to rejoice in his light.",pt:"Ele era a l\xe2mpada que ardia e alumiava; e v\xf3s quisestes alegrar-vos por um pouco de tempo com a sua luz."},{verse:36,en:"But I have greater witness than that of John: for the works which the Father hath given me to finish, the same works that I do, bear witness of me, that the Father hath sent me.",pt:"Mas o testemunho que eu tenho \xe9 maior do que o de Jo\xe3o; porque as obras que o Pai me deu para realizar, as mesmas obras que fa\xe7o d\xe3o testemunho de mim que o Pai me enviou."},{verse:37,en:"And the Father himself, which hath sent me, hath borne witness of me. Ye have neither heard his voice at any time, nor seen his shape.",pt:"E o Pai que me enviou, ele mesmo tem dado testemunho de mim. V\xf3s nunca ouvistes a sua voz, nem vistes a sua forma;"},{verse:38,en:"And ye have not his word abiding in you: for whom he hath sent, him ye believe not.",pt:"e a sua palavra n\xe3o permanece em v\xf3s; porque n\xe3o credes naquele que ele enviou."},{verse:39,en:"Search the scriptures; for in them ye think ye have eternal life: and they are they which testify of me.",pt:"Examinais as Escrituras, porque julgais ter nelas a vida eterna; e s\xe3o elas que d\xe3o testemunho de mim;"},{verse:40,en:"And ye will not come to me, that ye might have life.",pt:"mas n\xe3o quereis vir a mim para terdes vida!"},{verse:41,en:"I receive not honour from men.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o recebo gl\xf3ria da parte dos homens;"},{verse:42,en:"But I know you, that ye have not the love of God in you.",pt:"mas bem vos conhe\xe7o, que n\xe3o tendes em v\xf3s o amor de Deus."},{verse:43,en:"I am come in my Father\u2019s name, and ye receive me not: if another shall come in his own name, him ye will receive.",pt:"Eu vim em nome de meu Pai, e n\xe3o me recebeis; se outro vier em seu pr\xf3prio nome, a esse recebereis."},{verse:44,en:"How can ye believe, which receive honour one of another, and seek not the honour that cometh from God only?",pt:"Como podeis crer, v\xf3s que recebeis gl\xf3ria uns dos outros e n\xe3o buscais a gl\xf3ria que vem do \xfanico Deus?"},{verse:45,en:"Do not think that I will accuse you to the Father: there is one that accuseth you, even Moses, in whom ye trust.",pt:"N\xe3o penseis que eu vos hei de acusar perante o Pai. H\xe1 um que vos acusa, Mois\xe9s, em quem v\xf3s esperais."},{verse:46,en:"For had ye believed Moses, ye would have believed me: for he wrote of me.",pt:"Pois se cr\xeasseis em Mois\xe9s, crer\xedeis em mim; porque de mim ele escreveu."},{verse:47,en:"But if ye believe not his writings, how shall ye believe my words?",pt:"Mas, se n\xe3o credes nos escritos, como crereis nas minhas palavras?"}]}}),668,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,i,n){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After these things Jesus went over the sea of Galilee, which is the sea of Tiberias.",pt:"Depois disto partiu Jesus para o outro lado do mar da Galil\xe9ia, tamb\xe9m chamado de Tiber\xedades."},{verse:2,en:"And a great multitude followed him, because they saw his miracles which he did on them that were diseased.",pt:"E seguia-o uma grande multid\xe3o, porque via os sinais que operava sobre os enfermos."},{verse:3,en:"And Jesus went up into a mountain, and there he sat with his disciples.",pt:"Subiu, pois, Jesus ao monte e sentou-se ali com seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:4,en:"And the passover, a feast of the Jews, was nigh.",pt:"Ora, a p\xe1scoa, a festa dos judeus, estava pr\xf3xima."},{verse:5,en:"When Jesus then lifted up his eyes, and saw a great company come unto him, he saith unto Philip, Whence shall we buy bread, that these may eat?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus, levantando os olhos, e vendo que uma grande multid\xe3o vinha ter com ele, disse a Felipe: Onde compraremos p\xe3o, para estes comerem?"},{verse:6,en:"And this he said to prove him: for he himself knew what he would do.",pt:"Mas dizia isto para o experimentar; pois ele bem sabia o que ia fazer."},{verse:7,en:"Philip answered him, Two hundred pennyworth of bread is not sufficient for them, that every one of them may take a little.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Felipe: Duzentos den\xe1rios de p\xe3o n\xe3o lhes bastam, para que cada um receba um pouco."},{verse:8,en:"One of his disciples, Andrew, Simon Peter\u2019s brother, saith unto him,",pt:"Ao que lhe disse um dos seus disc\xedpulos, Andr\xe9, irm\xe3o de Sim\xe3o Pedro:"},{verse:9,en:"There is a lad here, which hath five barley loaves, and two small fishes: but what are they among so many?",pt:"Est\xe1 aqui um rapaz que tem cinco p\xe3es de cevada e dois peixinhos; mas que \xe9 isto para tantos?"},{verse:10,en:"And Jesus said, Make the men sit down. Now there was much grass in the place. So the men sat down, in number about five thousand.",pt:"Disse Jesus: Fazei reclinar-se o povo. Ora, naquele lugar havia muita relva. Reclinaram-se a\xed, pois, os homens em n\xfamero de quase cinco mil."},{verse:11,en:"And Jesus took the loaves; and when he had given thanks, he distributed to the disciples, and the disciples to them that were set down; and likewise of the fishes as much as they would.",pt:"Jesus, ent\xe3o, tomou os p\xe3es e, havendo dado gra\xe7as, repartiu-os pelos que estavam reclinados; e de igual modo os peixes, quanto eles queriam."},{verse:12,en:"When they were filled, he said unto his disciples, Gather up the fragments that remain, that nothing be lost.",pt:"E quando estavam saciados, disse aos seus disc\xedpulos: Recolhei os peda\xe7os que sobejaram, para que nada se perca."},{verse:13,en:"Therefore they gathered them together, and filled twelve baskets with the fragments of the five barley loaves, which remained over and above unto them that had eaten.",pt:"Recolheram-nos, pois e encheram doze cestos de peda\xe7os dos cinco p\xe3es de cevada, que sobejaram aos que haviam comido."},{verse:14,en:"Then those men, when they had seen the miracle that Jesus did, said, This is of a truth that prophet that should come into the world.",pt:"Vendo, pois, aqueles homens o sinal que Jesus operara, diziam: este \xe9 verdadeiramente o profeta que havia de vir ao mundo."},{verse:15,en:"When Jesus therefore perceived that they would come and take him by force, to make him a king, he departed again into a mountain himself alone.",pt:"Percebendo, pois, Jesus que estavam prestes a vir e lev\xe1-lo \xe0 for\xe7a para o fazerem rei, tornou a retirar-se para o monte, ele sozinho."},{verse:16,en:"And when even was now come, his disciples went down unto the sea,",pt:"Ao cair da tarde, desceram os seus disc\xedpulos ao mar;"},{verse:17,en:"And entered into a ship, and went over the sea toward Capernaum. And it was now dark, and Jesus was not come to them.",pt:"e, entrando num barco, atravessavam o mar em dire\xe7\xe3o a Cafarnaum; enquanto isso, escurecera e Jesus ainda n\xe3o tinha vindo ter com eles;"},{verse:18,en:"And the sea arose by reason of a great wind that blew.",pt:"ademais, o mar se empolava, porque soprava forte vento."},{verse:19,en:"So when they had rowed about five and twenty or thirty furlongs, they see Jesus walking on the sea, and drawing nigh unto the ship: and they were afraid.",pt:"Tendo, pois, remado uns vinte e cinco ou trinta est\xe1dios, viram a Jesus andando sobre o mar e aproximando-se do barco; e ficaram atemorizados."},{verse:20,en:"But he saith unto them, It is I; be not afraid.",pt:"Mas ele lhes disse: Sou eu; n\xe3o temais."},{verse:21,en:"Then they willingly received him into the ship: and immediately the ship was at the land whither they went.",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles de boa mente o receberam no barco; e logo o barco chegou \xe0 terra para onde iam."},{verse:22,en:"The day following, when the people which stood on the other side of the sea saw that there was none other boat there, save that one whereinto his disciples were entered, and that Jesus went not with his disciples into the boat, but that his disciples were gone away alone;",pt:"No dia seguinte, a multid\xe3o que ficara no outro lado do mar, sabendo que n\xe3o houvera ali sen\xe3o um barquinho, e que Jesus n\xe3o embarcara nele com seus disc\xedpulos, mas que estes tinham ido s\xf3s"},{verse:23,en:"(Howbeit there came other boats from Tiberias nigh unto the place where they did eat bread, after that the Lord had given thanks:)",pt:"(contudo, outros barquinhos haviam chegado a Tiber\xedades para perto do lugar onde comeram o p\xe3o, havendo o Senhor dado gra\xe7as);"},{verse:24,en:"When the people therefore saw that Jesus was not there, neither his disciples, they also took shipping, and came to Capernaum, seeking for Jesus.",pt:"quando, pois, viram que Jesus n\xe3o estava ali nem os seus disc\xedpulos, entraram eles tamb\xe9m nos barcos, e foram a Cafarnaum, em busca de Jesus."},{verse:25,en:"And when they had found him on the other side of the sea, they said unto him, Rabbi, when camest thou hither?",pt:"E, achando-o no outro lado do mar, perguntaram-lhe: Rabi, quando chegaste aqui?"},{verse:26,en:"Jesus answered them and said, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Ye seek me, not because ye saw the miracles, but because ye did eat of the loaves, and were filled.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que me buscais, n\xe3o porque vistes sinais, mas porque comestes do p\xe3o e vos saciastes."},{verse:27,en:"Labour not for the meat which perisheth, but for that meat which endureth unto everlasting life, which the Son of man shall give unto you: for him hath God the Father sealed.",pt:"Trabalhai, n\xe3o pela comida que perece, mas pela comida que permanece para a vida eterna, a qual o Filho do homem vos dar\xe1; pois neste, Deus, o Pai, imprimiu o seu selo."},{verse:28,en:"Then said they unto him, What shall we do, that we might work the works of God?",pt:"Pergutaram-lhe, pois: Que havemos de fazer para praticarmos as obras de Deus?"},{verse:29,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, This is the work of God, that ye believe on him whom he hath sent.",pt:"Jesus lhes respondeu: A obra de Deus \xe9 esta: Que creiais naquele que ele enviou."},{verse:30,en:"They said therefore unto him, What sign shewest thou then, that we may see, and believe thee? what dost thou work?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe, ent\xe3o: Que sinal, pois, fazes tu, para que o vejamos e te creiamos? Que operas tu?"},{verse:31,en:"Our fathers did eat manna in the desert; as it is written, He gave them bread from heaven to eat.",pt:"Nossos pais comeram o man\xe1 no deserto, como est\xe1 escrito: Do c\xe9u deu-lhes p\xe3o a comer."},{verse:32,en:"Then Jesus said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Moses gave you not that bread from heaven; but my Father giveth you the true bread from heaven.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: N\xe3o foi Mois\xe9s que vos deu o p\xe3o do c\xe9u; mas meu Pai vos d\xe1 o verdadeiro p\xe3o do c\xe9u."},{verse:33,en:"For the bread of God is he which cometh down from heaven, and giveth life unto the world.",pt:"Porque o p\xe3o de Deus \xe9 aquele que desce do c\xe9u e d\xe1 vida ao mundo."},{verse:34,en:"Then said they unto him, Lord, evermore give us this bread.",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois: Senhor, d\xe1-nos sempre desse p\xe3o."},{verse:35,en:"And Jesus said unto them, I am the bread of life: he that cometh to me shall never hunger; and he that believeth on me shall never thirst.",pt:"Declarou-lhes Jesus. Eu sou o p\xe3o da vida; aquele que vem a mim, de modo algum ter\xe1 fome, e quem cr\xea em mim jamais tar\xe1 sede."},{verse:36,en:"But I said unto you, That ye also have seen me, and believe not.",pt:"Mas como j\xe1 vos disse, v\xf3s me tendes visto, e contudo n\xe3o credes."},{verse:37,en:"All that the Father giveth me shall come to me; and him that cometh to me I will in no wise cast out.",pt:"Todo o que o Pai me d\xe1 vir\xe1 a mim; e o que vem a mim de maneira nenhuma o lan\xe7arei fora."},{verse:38,en:"For I came down from heaven, not to do mine own will, but the will of him that sent me.",pt:"Porque eu desci do c\xe9u, n\xe3o para fazer a minha vontade, mas a vontade daquele que me enviou."},{verse:39,en:"And this is the Father\u2019s will which hath sent me, that of all which he hath given me I should lose nothing, but should raise it up again at the last day.",pt:"E a vontade do que me enviou \xe9 esta: Que eu n\xe3o perca nenhum de todos aqueles que me deu, mas que eu o ressuscite no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:40,en:"And this is the will of him that sent me, that every one which seeth the Son, and believeth on him, may have everlasting life: and I will raise him up at the last day.",pt:"Porquanto esta \xe9 a vontade de meu Pai: Que todo aquele que v\xea o Filho e cr\xea nele, tenha a vida eterna; e eu o ressuscitarei no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:41,en:"The Jews then murmured at him, because he said, I am the bread which came down from heaven.",pt:"Murmuravam, pois, dele os judeus, porque dissera: Eu sou o p\xe3o que desceu do c\xe9u;"},{verse:42,en:"And they said, Is not this Jesus, the son of Joseph, whose father and mother we know? how is it then that he saith, I came down from heaven?",pt:"e perguntavam: N\xe3o \xe9 Jesus, o filho de Jos\xe9, cujo pai e m\xe3e n\xf3s conhecemos? Como, pois, diz agora: Desci do c\xe9u?"},{verse:43,en:"Jesus therefore answered and said unto them, Murmur not among yourselves.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: N\xe3o murmureis entre v\xf3s."},{verse:44,en:"No man can come to me, except the Father which hath sent me draw him: and I will raise him up at the last day.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m pode vir a mim, se o Pai que me enviou n\xe3o o trouxer; e eu o ressuscitarei no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:45,en:"It is written in the prophets, And they shall be all taught of God. Every man therefore that hath heard, and hath learned of the Father, cometh unto me.",pt:"Est\xe1 escrito nos profetas: E ser\xe3o todos ensinados por Deus. Portanto todo aquele que do Pai ouviu e aprendeu vem a mim."},{verse:46,en:"Not that any man hath seen the Father, save he which is of God, he hath seen the Father.",pt:"N\xe3o que algu\xe9m tenha visto o Pai, sen\xe3o aquele que \xe9 vindo de Deus; s\xf3 ele tem visto o Pai."},{verse:47,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that believeth on me hath everlasting life.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Aquele que cr\xea tem a vida eterna."},{verse:48,en:"I am that bread of life.",pt:"Eu sou o p\xe3o da vida."},{verse:49,en:"Your fathers did eat manna in the wilderness, and are dead.",pt:"Vossos pais comeram o man\xe1 no deserto e morreram."},{verse:50,en:"This is the bread which cometh down from heaven, that a man may eat thereof, and not die.",pt:"Este \xe9 o p\xe3o que desce do c\xe9u, para que o que dele comer n\xe3o morra."},{verse:51,en:"I am the living bread which came down from heaven: if any man eat of this bread, he shall live for ever: and the bread that I will give is my flesh, which I will give for the life of the world.",pt:"Eu sou o p\xe3o vivo que desceu do c\xe9u; se algu\xe9m comer deste p\xe3o, viver\xe1 para sempre; e o p\xe3o que eu darei pela vida do mundo \xe9 a minha carne."},{verse:52,en:"The Jews therefore strove among themselves, saying, How can this man give us his flesh to eat?",pt:"Disputavam, pois, os judeus entre si, dizendo: Como pode este dar-nos a sua carne a comer?"},{verse:53,en:"Then Jesus said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Except ye eat the flesh of the Son of man, and drink his blood, ye have no life in you.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Se n\xe3o comerdes a carne do Filho do homem, e n\xe3o beberdes o seu sangue, n\xe3o tereis vida em v\xf3s mesmos."},{verse:54,en:"Whoso eateth my flesh, and drinketh my blood, hath eternal life; and I will raise him up at the last day.",pt:"Quem come a minha carne e bebe o meu sangue tem a vida eterna; e eu o ressuscitarei no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:55,en:"For my flesh is meat indeed, and my blood is drink indeed.",pt:"Porque a minha carne verdadeiramente \xe9 comida, e o meu sangue verdadeiramente \xe9 bebida."},{verse:56,en:"He that eateth my flesh, and drinketh my blood, dwelleth in me, and I in him.",pt:"Quem come a minha carne e bebe o meu sangue permanece em mim e eu nele."},{verse:57,en:"As the living Father hath sent me, and I live by the Father: so he that eateth me, even he shall live by me.",pt:"Assim como o Pai, que vive, me enviou, e eu vivo pelo Pai, assim, quem de mim se alimenta, tamb\xe9m viver\xe1 por mim."},{verse:58,en:"This is that bread which came down from heaven: not as your fathers did eat manna, and are dead: he that eateth of this bread shall live for ever.",pt:"Este \xe9 o p\xe3o que desceu do c\xe9u; n\xe3o \xe9 como o caso de vossos pais, que comeram o man\xe1 e morreram; quem comer este p\xe3o viver\xe1 para sempre."},{verse:59,en:"These things said he in the synagogue, as he taught in Capernaum.",pt:"Estas coisas falou Jesus quando ensinava na sinagoga em Cafarnaum."},{verse:60,en:"Many therefore of his disciples, when they had heard this, said, This is an hard saying; who can hear it?",pt:"Muitos, pois, dos seus disc\xedpulos, ouvindo isto, disseram: Duro \xe9 este discurso; quem o pode ouvir?"},{verse:61,en:"When Jesus knew in himself that his disciples murmured at it, he said unto them, Doth this offend you?",pt:"Mas, sabendo Jesus em si mesmo que murmuravam disto os seus disc\xedpulos, disse-lhes: Isto vos escandaliza?"},{verse:62,en:"What and if ye shall see the Son of man ascend up where he was before?",pt:"Que seria, pois, se v\xedsseis subir o Filho do homem para onde primeiro estava?"},{verse:63,en:"It is the spirit that quickeneth; the flesh profiteth nothing: the words that I speak unto you, they are spirit, and they are life.",pt:"O esp\xedrito \xe9 o que vivifica, a carne para nada aproveita; as palavras que eu vos tenho dito s\xe3o esp\xedrito e s\xe3o vida."},{verse:64,en:"But there are some of you that believe not. For Jesus knew from the beginning who they were that believed not, and who should betray him.",pt:"Mas h\xe1 alguns de v\xf3s que n\xe3o cr\xeaem. Pois Jesus sabia, desde o princ\xedpio, quem eram os que n\xe3o criam, e quem era o que o havia de entregar."},{verse:65,en:"And he said, Therefore said I unto you, that no man can come unto me, except it were given unto him of my Father.",pt:"E continuou: Por isso vos disse que ningu\xe9m pode vir a mim, se pelo Pai lhe n\xe3o for concedido."},{verse:66,en:"From that time many of his disciples went back, and walked no more with him.",pt:"Por causa disso muitos dos seus disc\xedpulos voltaram para tr\xe1s e n\xe3o andaram mais com ele."},{verse:67,en:"Then said Jesus unto the twelve, Will ye also go away?",pt:"Perguntou ent\xe3o Jesus aos doze: Quereis v\xf3s tamb\xe9m retirar-vos?"},{verse:68,en:"Then Simon Peter answered him, Lord, to whom shall we go? thou hast the words of eternal life.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Sim\xe3o Pedro: Senhor, para quem iremos n\xf3s? Tu tens as palavras da vida eterna."},{verse:69,en:"And we believe and are sure that thou art that Christ, the Son of the living God.",pt:"E n\xf3s j\xe1 temos crido e bem sabemos que tu \xe9s o Santo de Deus."},{verse:70,en:"Jesus answered them, Have not I chosen you twelve, and one of you is a devil?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: N\xe3o vos escolhi a v\xf3s os doze? Contudo um de v\xf3s \xe9 o diabo."},{verse:71,en:"He spake of Judas Iscariot the son of Simon: for he it was that should betray him, being one of the twelve.",pt:"Referia-se a Judas, filho de Sim\xe3o Iscariotes; porque era ele o que o havia de entregar, sendo um dos doze."}]}}),669,[]);
__d((function(e,s,a,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After these things Jesus walked in Galilee: for he would not walk in Jewry, because the Jews sought to kill him.",pt:"Depois disto andava Jesus pela Galil\xe9ia; pois n\xe3o queria andar pela Jud\xe9ia, porque os judeus procuravam mat\xe1-lo."},{verse:2,en:"Now the Jews\u2019 feast of tabernacles was at hand.",pt:"Ora, estava pr\xf3xima a festa dos judeus, a dos tabern\xe1culos."},{verse:3,en:"His brethren therefore said unto him, Depart hence, and go into Judaea, that thy disciples also may see the works that thou doest.",pt:"Disseram-lhe, ent\xe3o, seus irm\xe3os: Retira-te daqui e vai para a Jud\xe9ia, para que tamb\xe9m os teus disc\xedpulos vejam as obras que fazes."},{verse:4,en:"For there is no man that doeth any thing in secret, and he himself seeketh to be known openly. If thou do these things, shew thyself to the world.",pt:"Porque ningu\xe9m faz coisa alguma em oculto, quando procura ser conhecido. J\xe1 que fazes estas coisas, manifesta-te ao mundo."},{verse:5,en:"For neither did his brethren believe in him.",pt:"Pois nem seus irm\xe3os criam nele."},{verse:6,en:"Then Jesus said unto them, My time is not yet come: but your time is alway ready.",pt:"Disse-lhes, ent\xe3o, Jesus: Ainda n\xe3o \xe9 chegado o meu tempo; mas o vosso tempo sempre est\xe1 presente."},{verse:7,en:"The world cannot hate you; but me it hateth, because I testify of it, that the works thereof are evil.",pt:"O mundo n\xe3o vos pode odiar; mas ele me odeia a mim, porquanto dele testifico que as suas obras s\xe3o m\xe1s."},{verse:8,en:"Go ye up unto this feast: I go not up yet unto this feast; for my time is not yet full come.",pt:"Subi v\xf3s \xe0 festa; eu n\xe3o subo ainda a esta festa, porque ainda n\xe3o \xe9 chegado o meu tempo."},{verse:9,en:"When he had said these words unto them, he abode still in Galilee.",pt:"E, havendo-lhes dito isto, ficou na Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:10,en:"But when his brethren were gone up, then went he also up unto the feast, not openly, but as it were in secret.",pt:"Mas quando seus irm\xe3os j\xe1 tinham subido \xe0 festa, ent\xe3o subiu ele tamb\xe9m, n\xe3o publicamente, mas como em secreto."},{verse:11,en:"Then the Jews sought him at the feast, and said, Where is he?",pt:"Ora, os judeus o procuravam na festa, e perguntavam: Onde est\xe1 ele?"},{verse:12,en:"And there was much murmuring among the people concerning him: for some said, He is a good man: others said, Nay; but he deceiveth the people.",pt:"E era grande a murmura\xe7\xe3o a respeito dele entre as multid\xf5es. Diziam alguns: Ele \xe9 bom. Mas outros diziam: n\xe3o, antes engana o povo."},{verse:13,en:"Howbeit no man spake openly of him for fear of the Jews.",pt:"Todavia ningu\xe9m falava dele abertamente, por medo dos judeus."},{verse:14,en:"Now about the midst of the feast Jesus went up into the temple, and taught.",pt:"Estando, pois, a festa j\xe1 em meio, subiu Jesus ao templo e come\xe7ou a ensinar."},{verse:15,en:"And the Jews marvelled, saying, How knoweth this man letters, having never learned?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os judeus se admiravam, dizendo: Como sabe este letras, sem ter estudado?"},{verse:16,en:"Jesus answered them, and said, My doctrine is not mine, but his that sent me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: A minha doutrina n\xe3o \xe9 minha, mas daquele que me enviou."},{verse:17,en:"If any man will do his will, he shall know of the doctrine, whether it be of God, or whether I speak of myself.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m quiser fazer a vontade de Deus, h\xe1 de saber se a doutrina \xe9 dele, ou se eu falo por mim mesmo."},{verse:18,en:"He that speaketh of himself seeketh his own glory: but he that seeketh his glory that sent him, the same is true, and no unrighteousness is in him.",pt:"Quem fala por si mesmo busca a sua pr\xf3pria gl\xf3ria; mas o que busca a gl\xf3ria daquele que o enviou, esse \xe9 verdadeiro, e n\xe3o h\xe1 nele injusti\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"Did not Moses give you the law, and yet none of you keepeth the law? Why go ye about to kill me?",pt:"N\xe3o vos deu Mois\xe9s a lei? no entanto nenhum de v\xf3s cumpre a lei. Por que procurais matar-me?"},{verse:20,en:"The people answered and said, Thou hast a devil: who goeth about to kill thee?",pt:"Respondeu a multid\xe3o: Tens dem\xf4nio; quem procura matar-te?"},{verse:21,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, I have done one work, and ye all marvel.",pt:"Replicou-lhes Jesus: Uma s\xf3 obra fiz, e todos v\xf3s admirais por causa disto."},{verse:22,en:"Moses therefore gave unto you circumcision; (not because it is of Moses, but of the fathers;) and ye on the sabbath day circumcise a man.",pt:"Mois\xe9s vos ordenou a circuncis\xe3o (n\xe3o que fosse de Mois\xe9s, mas dos pais), e no s\xe1bado circuncidais um homem."},{verse:23,en:"If a man on the sabbath day receive circumcision, that the law of Moses should not be broken; are ye angry at me, because I have made a man every whit whole on the sabbath day?",pt:"Ora, se um homem recebe a circuncis\xe3o no s\xe1bado, para que a lei de Mois\xe9s n\xe3o seja violada, como vos indignais contra mim, porque no s\xe1bado tornei um homem inteiramente s\xe3o?"},{verse:24,en:"Judge not according to the appearance, but judge righteous judgment.",pt:"N\xe3o julgueis pela apar\xeancia mas julgai segundo o reto ju\xedzo."},{verse:25,en:"Then said some of them of Jerusalem, Is not this he, whom they seek to kill?",pt:"Diziam ent\xe3o alguns dos de Jerusal\xe9m: N\xe3o \xe9 este o que procuram matar?"},{verse:26,en:"But, lo, he speaketh boldly, and they say nothing unto him. Do the rulers know indeed that this is the very Christ?",pt:"E eis que ele est\xe1 falando abertamente, e nada lhe dizem. Ser\xe1 que as autoridades realmente o reconhecem como o Cristo?"},{verse:27,en:"Howbeit we know this man whence he is: but when Christ cometh, no man knoweth whence he is.",pt:"Entretanto sabemos donde este \xe9; mas, quando vier o Cristo, ningu\xe9m saber\xe1 donde ele \xe9."},{verse:28,en:"Then cried Jesus in the temple as he taught, saying, Ye both know me, and ye know whence I am: and I am not come of myself, but he that sent me is true, whom ye know not.",pt:"Jesus, pois, levantou a voz no templo e ensinava, dizendo: Sim, v\xf3s me conheceis, e sabeis donde sou; contudo eu n\xe3o vim de mim mesmo, mas aquele que me enviou \xe9 verdadeiro, o qual v\xf3s n\xe3o conheceis."},{verse:29,en:"But I know him: for I am from him, and he hath sent me.",pt:"Mas eu o conhe\xe7o, porque dele venho, e ele me enviou."},{verse:30,en:"Then they sought to take him: but no man laid hands on him, because his hour was not yet come.",pt:"Procuravam, pois, prend\xea-lo; mas ningu\xe9m lhe deitou as m\xe3os, porque ainda n\xe3o era chegada a sua hora."},{verse:31,en:"And many of the people believed on him, and said, When Christ cometh, will he do more miracles than these which this man hath done?",pt:"Contudo muitos da multid\xe3o creram nele, e diziam: Ser\xe1 que o Cristo, quando vier, far\xe1 mais sinais do que este tem feito?"},{verse:32,en:"The Pharisees heard that the people murmured such things concerning him; and the Pharisees and the chief priests sent officers to take him.",pt:"Os fariseus ouviram a multid\xe3o murmurar estas coisas a respeito dele; e os principais sacerdotes e os fariseus mandaram guardas para o prenderem."},{verse:33,en:"Then said Jesus unto them, Yet a little while am I with you, and then I go unto him that sent me.",pt:"Disse, pois, Jesus: Ainda um pouco de tempo estou convosco, e depois vou para aquele que me enviou."},{verse:34,en:"Ye shall seek me, and shall not find me: and where I am, thither ye cannot come.",pt:"V\xf3s me buscareis, e n\xe3o me achareis; e onde eu estou, v\xf3s n\xe3o podeis vir."},{verse:35,en:"Then said the Jews among themselves, Whither will he go, that we shall not find him? will he go unto the dispersed among the Gentiles, and teach the Gentiles?",pt:"Disseram, pois, os judeus uns aos outros: Para onde ir\xe1 ele, que n\xe3o o acharemos? Ir\xe1, porventura, \xe0 Dispers\xe3o entre os gregos, e ensinar\xe1 os gregos?"},{verse:36,en:"What manner of saying is this that he said, Ye shall seek me, and shall not find me: and where I am, thither ye cannot come?",pt:"Que palavra \xe9 esta que disse: Buscar-me-eis, e n\xe3o me achareis; e, Onde eu estou, v\xf3s n\xe3o podeis vir?"},{verse:37,en:"In the last day, that great day of the feast, Jesus stood and cried, saying, If any man thirst, let him come unto me, and drink.",pt:"Ora, no seu \xfaltimo dia, o grande dia da festa, Jesus p\xf4s-se em p\xe9 e clamou, dizendo: Se algu\xe9m tem sede, venha a mim e beba."},{verse:38,en:"He that believeth on me, as the scripture hath said, out of his belly shall flow rivers of living water.",pt:"Quem cr\xea em mim, como diz a Escritura, do seu interior correr\xe3o rios de \xe1gua viva."},{verse:39,en:"(But this spake he of the Spirit, which they that believe on him should receive: for the Holy Ghost was not yet given; because that Jesus was not yet glorified.)",pt:"Ora, isto ele disse a respeito do Esp\xedrito que haviam de receber os que nele cressem; pois o Esp\xedrito ainda n\xe3o fora dado, porque Jesus ainda n\xe3o tinha sido glorificado."},{verse:40,en:"Many of the people therefore, when they heard this saying, said, Of a truth this is the Prophet.",pt:"Ent\xe3o alguns dentre o povo, ouvindo essas palavras, diziam: Verdadeiramente este \xe9 o profeta."},{verse:41,en:"Others said, This is the Christ. But some said, Shall Christ come out of Galilee?",pt:"Outros diziam: Este \xe9 o Cristo; mas outros replicavam: Vem, pois, o Cristo da Galil\xe9ia?"},{verse:42,en:"Hath not the scripture said, That Christ cometh of the seed of David, and out of the town of Bethlehem, where David was?",pt:"N\xe3o diz a Escritura que o Cristo vem da descend\xeancia de Davi, e de Bel\xe9m, a aldeia donde era Davi?"},{verse:43,en:"So there was a division among the people because of him.",pt:"Assim houve uma dissens\xe3o entre o povo por causa dele."},{verse:44,en:"And some of them would have taken him; but no man laid hands on him.",pt:"Alguns deles queriam prend\xea-lo; mas ningu\xe9m lhe p\xf4s as m\xe3os."},{verse:45,en:"Then came the officers to the chief priests and Pharisees; and they said unto them, Why have ye not brought him?",pt:"Os guardas, pois, foram ter com os principais dos sacerdotes e fariseus, e estes lhes perguntaram: Por que n\xe3o o trouxestes?"},{verse:46,en:"The officers answered, Never man spake like this man.",pt:"Responderam os guardas: Nunca homem algum falou assim como este homem."},{verse:47,en:"Then answered them the Pharisees, Are ye also deceived?",pt:"Replicaram-lhes, pois, os fariseus: Tamb\xe9m v\xf3s fostes enganados?"},{verse:48,en:"Have any of the rulers or of the Pharisees believed on him?",pt:"Creu nele porventura alguma das autoridades, ou algu\xe9m dentre os fariseus?"},{verse:49,en:"But this people who knoweth not the law are cursed.",pt:"Mas esta multid\xe3o, que n\xe3o sabe a lei, \xe9 maldita."},{verse:50,en:"Nicodemus saith unto them, (he that came to Jesus by night, being one of them,)",pt:"Nicodemos, um deles, que antes fora ter com Jesus, perguntou-lhes:"},{verse:51,en:"Doth our law judge any man, before it hear him, and know what he doeth?",pt:"A nossa lei, porventura, julga um homem sem primeiro ouvi-lo e ter conhecimento do que ele faz?"},{verse:52,en:"They answered and said unto him, Art thou also of Galilee? Search, and look: for out of Galilee ariseth no prophet.",pt:"Responderam-lhe eles: \xc9s tu tamb\xe9m da Galil\xe9ia? Examina e v\xea que da Galil\xe9ia n\xe3o surge profeta."},{verse:53,en:"And every man went unto his own house.",pt:"[E cada um foi para sua casa."}]}}),670,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Jesus went unto the mount of Olives.",pt:"Mas Jesus foi para o Monte das Oliveiras."},{verse:2,en:"And early in the morning he came again into the temple, and all the people came unto him; and he sat down, and taught them.",pt:"Pela manh\xe3 cedo voltou ao templo, e todo o povo vinha ter com ele; e Jesus, sentando-se o ensinava."},{verse:3,en:"And the scribes and Pharisees brought unto him a woman taken in adultery; and when they had set her in the midst,",pt:"Ent\xe3o os escribas e fariseus trouxeram-lhe uma mulher apanhada em adult\xe9rio; e pondo-a no meio,"},{verse:4,en:"They say unto him, Master, this woman was taken in adultery, in the very act.",pt:"disseram-lhe: Mestre, esta mulher foi apanhada em flagrante adult\xe9rio."},{verse:5,en:"Now Moses in the law commanded us, that such should be stoned: but what sayest thou?",pt:"Ora, Mois\xe9s nos ordena na lei que as tais sejam apedrejadas. Tu, pois, que dizes?"},{verse:6,en:"This they said, tempting him, that they might have to accuse him. But Jesus stooped down, and with his finger wrote on the ground, as though he heard them not.",pt:"Isto diziam eles, tentando-o, para terem de que o acusar. Jesus, por\xe9m, inclinando-se, come\xe7ou a escrever no ch\xe3o com o dedo."},{verse:7,en:"So when they continued asking him, he lifted up himself, and said unto them, He that is without sin among you, let him first cast a stone at her.",pt:"Mas, como insistissem em perguntar-lhe, ergueu-se e disse- lhes: Aquele dentre v\xf3s que est\xe1 sem pecado seja o primeiro que lhe atire uma pedra."},{verse:8,en:"And again he stooped down, and wrote on the ground.",pt:"E, tornando a inclinar-se, escrevia na terra."},{verse:9,en:"And they which heard it, being convicted by their own conscience, went out one by one, beginning at the eldest, even unto the last: and Jesus was left alone, and the woman standing in the midst.",pt:"Quando ouviram isto foram saindo um a um, a come\xe7ar pelos mais velhos, at\xe9 os \xfaltimos; ficou s\xf3 Jesus, e a mulher ali em p\xe9."},{verse:10,en:"When Jesus had lifted up himself, and saw none but the woman, he said unto her, Woman, where are those thine accusers? hath no man condemned thee?",pt:"Ent\xe3o, erguendo-se Jesus e n\xe3o vendo a ningu\xe9m sen\xe3o a mulher, perguntou-lhe: Mulher, onde est\xe3o aqueles teus acusadores? Ningu\xe9m te condenou?"},{verse:11,en:"She said, No man, Lord. And Jesus said unto her, Neither do I condemn thee: go, and sin no more.",pt:"Respondeu ela: Ningu\xe9m, Senhor. E disse-lhe Jesus: Nem eu te condeno; vai-te, e n\xe3o peques mais.]"},{verse:12,en:"Then spake Jesus again unto them, saying, I am the light of the world: he that followeth me shall not walk in darkness, but shall have the light of life.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus tornou a falar-lhes, dizendo: Eu sou a luz do mundo; quem me segue de modo algum andar\xe1 em trevas, mas ter\xe1 a luz da vida."},{verse:13,en:"The Pharisees therefore said unto him, Thou bearest record of thyself; thy record is not true.",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois, os fariseus: Tu d\xe1s testemunho de ti mesmo; o teu testemunho n\xe3o \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:14,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, Though I bear record of myself, yet my record is true: for I know whence I came, and whither I go; but ye cannot tell whence I come, and whither I go.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Ainda que eu dou testemunho de mim mesmo, o meu testemunho \xe9 verdadeiro; porque sei donde vim, e para onde vou; mas v\xf3s n\xe3o sabeis donde venho, nem para onde vou."},{verse:15,en:"Ye judge after the flesh; I judge no man.",pt:"V\xf3s julgais segundo a carne; eu a ningu\xe9m julgo."},{verse:16,en:"And yet if I judge, my judgment is true: for I am not alone, but I and the Father that sent me.",pt:"E, mesmo que eu julgue, o meu ju\xedzo \xe9 verdadeiro; porque n\xe3o sou eu s\xf3, mas eu e o Pai que me enviou."},{verse:17,en:"It is also written in your law, that the testimony of two men is true.",pt:"Ora, na vossa lei est\xe1 escrito que o testemunho de dois homens \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:18,en:"I am one that bear witness of myself, and the Father that sent me beareth witness of me.",pt:"Sou eu que dou testemunho de mim mesmo, e o Pai que me enviou, tamb\xe9m d\xe1 testemunho de mim."},{verse:19,en:"Then said they unto him, Where is thy Father? Jesus answered, Ye neither know me, nor my Father: if ye had known me, ye should have known my Father also.",pt:"Perguntavam-lhe, pois: Onde est\xe1 teu pai? Jesus respondeu: N\xe3o me conheceis a mim, nem a meu Pai; se v\xf3s me conhec\xeasseis a mim, tamb\xe9m conhecer\xedeis a meu Pai."},{verse:20,en:"These words spake Jesus in the treasury, as he taught in the temple: and no man laid hands on him; for his hour was not yet come.",pt:"Essas palavras proferiu Jesus no lugar do tesouro, quando ensinava no templo; e ningu\xe9m o prendeu, porque ainda n\xe3o era chegada a sua hora."},{verse:21,en:"Then said Jesus again unto them, I go my way, and ye shall seek me, and shall die in your sins: whither I go, ye cannot come.",pt:"Disse-lhes, pois, Jesus outra vez: Eu me retiro; buscar-me- eis, e morrereis no vosso pecado. Para onde eu vou, v\xf3s n\xe3o podeis ir."},{verse:22,en:"Then said the Jews, Will he kill himself? because he saith, Whither I go, ye cannot come.",pt:"Ent\xe3o diziam os judeus: Ser\xe1 que ele vai suicidar-se, pois diz: Para onde eu vou, v\xf3s n\xe3o podeis ir?"},{verse:23,en:"And he said unto them, Ye are from beneath; I am from above: ye are of this world; I am not of this world.",pt:"Disse-lhes ele: V\xf3s sois de baixo, eu sou de cima; v\xf3s sois deste mundo, eu n\xe3o sou deste mundo."},{verse:24,en:"I said therefore unto you, that ye shall die in your sins: for if ye believe not that I am he, ye shall die in your sins.",pt:"Por isso vos disse que morrereis em vossos pecados; porque, se n\xe3o crerdes que eu sou, morrereis em vossos pecados."},{verse:25,en:"Then said they unto him, Who art thou? And Jesus saith unto them, Even the same that I said unto you from the beginning.",pt:"Perguntavam-lhe ent\xe3o: Quem \xe9s tu? Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Exatamente o que venho dizendo que sou."},{verse:26,en:"I have many things to say and to judge of you: but he that sent me is true; and I speak to the world those things which I have heard of him.",pt:"Muitas coisas tenho que dizer e julgar acerca de v\xf3s; mas aquele que me enviou \xe9 verdadeiro; e o que dele ouvi, isso falo ao mundo."},{verse:27,en:"They understood not that he spake to them of the Father.",pt:"Eles n\xe3o perceberam que lhes falava do Pai."},{verse:28,en:"Then said Jesus unto them, When ye have lifted up the Son of man, then shall ye know that I am he, and that I do nothing of myself; but as my Father hath taught me, I speak these things.",pt:"Prosseguiu, pois, Jesus: Quando tiverdes levantado o Filho do homem, ent\xe3o conhecereis que eu sou, e que nada fa\xe7o de mim mesmo; mas como o Pai me ensinou, assim falo."},{verse:29,en:"And he that sent me is with me: the Father hath not left me alone; for I do always those things that please him.",pt:"E aquele que me enviou est\xe1 comigo; n\xe3o me tem deixado s\xf3; porque fa\xe7o sempre o que \xe9 do seu agrado."},{verse:30,en:"As he spake these words, many believed on him.",pt:"Falando ele estas coisas, muitos creram nele."},{verse:31,en:"Then said Jesus to those Jews which believed on him, If ye continue in my word, then are ye my disciples indeed;",pt:"Dizia, pois, Jesus aos judeus que nele creram: Se v\xf3s permanecerdes na minha palavra, verdadeiramente sois meus disc\xedpulos;"},{verse:32,en:"And ye shall know the truth, and the truth shall make you free.",pt:"e conhecereis a verdade, e a verdade vos libertar\xe1."},{verse:33,en:"They answered him, We be Abraham\u2019s seed, and were never in bondage to any man: how sayest thou, Ye shall be made free?",pt:"Responderam-lhe: Somos descendentes de Abra\xe3o, e nunca fomos escravos de ningu\xe9m; como dizes tu: Sereis livres?"},{verse:34,en:"Jesus answered them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Whosoever committeth sin is the servant of sin.",pt:"Replicou-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que todo aquele que comete pecado \xe9 escravo do pecado."},{verse:35,en:"And the servant abideth not in the house for ever: but the Son abideth ever.",pt:"Ora, o escravo n\xe3o fica para sempre na casa; o filho fica para sempre."},{verse:36,en:"If the Son therefore shall make you free, ye shall be free indeed.",pt:"Se, pois, o Filho vos libertar, verdadeiramente sereis livres."},{verse:37,en:"I know that ye are Abraham\u2019s seed; but ye seek to kill me, because my word hath no place in you.",pt:"Bem sei que sois descend\xeancia de Abra\xe3o; contudo, procurais matar-me, porque a minha palavra n\xe3o encontra lugar em v\xf3s."},{verse:38,en:"I speak that which I have seen with my Father: and ye do that which ye have seen with your father.",pt:"Eu falo do que vi junto de meu Pai; e v\xf3s fazeis o que tamb\xe9m ouvistes de vosso pai."},{verse:39,en:"They answered and said unto him, Abraham is our father. Jesus saith unto them, If ye were Abraham\u2019s children, ye would do the works of Abraham.",pt:"Responderam-lhe: Nosso pai \xe9 Abra\xe3o. Disse-lhes Jesus: Se sois filhos de Abra\xe3o, fazei as obras de Abra\xe3o."},{verse:40,en:"But now ye seek to kill me, a man that hath told you the truth, which I have heard of God: this did not Abraham.",pt:"Mas agora procurais matar-me, a mim que vos falei a verdade que de Deus ouvi; isso Abra\xe3o n\xe3o fez."},{verse:41,en:"Ye do the deeds of your father. Then said they to him, We be not born of fornication; we have one Father, even God.",pt:"V\xf3s fazeis as obras de vosso pai. Replicaram-lhe eles: N\xf3s n\xe3o somos nascidos de prostitui\xe7\xe3o; temos um Pai, que \xe9 Deus."},{verse:42,en:"Jesus said unto them, If God were your Father, ye would love me: for I proceeded forth and came from God; neither came I of myself, but he sent me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Se Deus fosse o vosso Pai, v\xf3s me amar\xedeis, porque eu sa\xed e vim de Deus; pois n\xe3o vim de mim mesmo, mas ele me enviou."},{verse:43,en:"Why do ye not understand my speech? even because ye cannot hear my word.",pt:"Por que n\xe3o compreendeis a minha linguagem? \xe9 porque n\xe3o podeis ouvir a minha palavra."},{verse:44,en:"Ye are of your father the devil, and the lusts of your father ye will do. He was a murderer from the beginning, and abode not in the truth, because there is no truth in him. When he speaketh a lie, he speaketh of his own: for he is a liar, and the father of it.",pt:"V\xf3s tendes por pai o Diabo, e quereis satisfazer os desejos de vosso pai; ele \xe9 homicida desde o princ\xedpio, e nunca se firmou na verdade, porque nele n\xe3o h\xe1 verdade; quando ele profere mentira, fala do que lhe \xe9 pr\xf3prio; porque \xe9 mentiroso, e pai da mentira."},{verse:45,en:"And because I tell you the truth, ye believe me not.",pt:"Mas porque eu digo a verdade, n\xe3o me credes."},{verse:46,en:"Which of you convinceth me of sin? And if I say the truth, why do ye not believe me?",pt:"Quem dentre v\xf3s me convence de pecado? Se digo a verdade, por que n\xe3o me credes?"},{verse:47,en:"He that is of God heareth God\u2019s words: ye therefore hear them not, because ye are not of God.",pt:"Quem \xe9 de Deus ouve as palavras de Deus; por isso v\xf3s n\xe3o as ouvis, porque n\xe3o sois de Deus."},{verse:48,en:"Then answered the Jews, and said unto him, Say we not well that thou art a Samaritan, and hast a devil?",pt:"Responderam-lhe os judeus: N\xe3o dizemos com raz\xe3o que \xe9s samaritano, e que tens dem\xf4nio?"},{verse:49,en:"Jesus answered, I have not a devil; but I honour my Father, and ye do dishonour me.",pt:"Jesus respondeu: Eu n\xe3o tenho dem\xf4nio; antes honro a meu Pai, e v\xf3s me desonrais."},{verse:50,en:"And I seek not mine own glory: there is one that seeketh and judgeth.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o busco a minha gl\xf3ria; h\xe1 quem a busque, e julgue."},{verse:51,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, If a man keep my saying, he shall never see death.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que, se algu\xe9m guardar a minha palavra, nunca ver\xe1 a morte."},{verse:52,en:"Then said the Jews unto him, Now we know that thou hast a devil. Abraham is dead, and the prophets; and thou sayest, If a man keep my saying, he shall never taste of death.",pt:"Disseram-lhe os judeus: Agora sabemos que tens dem\xf4nios. Abra\xe3o morreu, e tamb\xe9m os profetas; e tu dizes: Se algu\xe9m guardar a minha palavra, nunca provar\xe1 a morte!"},{verse:53,en:"Art thou greater than our father Abraham, which is dead? and the prophets are dead: whom makest thou thyself?",pt:"Porventura \xe9s tu maior do que nosso pai Abra\xe3o, que morreu? Tamb\xe9m os profetas morreram; quem pretendes tu ser?"},{verse:54,en:"Jesus answered, If I honour myself, my honour is nothing: it is my Father that honoureth me; of whom ye say, that he is your God:",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Se eu me glorificar a mim mesmo, a minha gl\xf3ria n\xe3o \xe9 nada; quem me glorifica \xe9 meu Pai, do qual v\xf3s dizeis que \xe9 o vosso Deus;"},{verse:55,en:"Yet ye have not known him; but I know him: and if I should say, I know him not, I shall be a liar like unto you: but I know him, and keep his saying.",pt:"e v\xf3s n\xe3o o conheceis; mas eu o conhe\xe7o; e se disser que n\xe3o o conhe\xe7o, serei mentiroso como v\xf3s; mas eu o conhe\xe7o, e guardo a sua palavra."},{verse:56,en:"Your father Abraham rejoiced to see my day: and he saw it, and was glad.",pt:"Abra\xe3o, vosso pai, exultou por ver o meu dia; viu-o, e alegrou-se."},{verse:57,en:"Then said the Jews unto him, Thou art not yet fifty years old, and hast thou seen Abraham?",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois, os judeus: Ainda n\xe3o tens cinquenta anos, e viste Abra\xe3o?"},{verse:58,en:"Jesus said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Before Abraham was, I am.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que antes que Abra\xe3o existisse, eu sou."},{verse:59,en:"Then took they up stones to cast at him: but Jesus hid himself, and went out of the temple, going through the midst of them, and so passed by.",pt:"Ent\xe3o pegaram em pedras para lhe atirarem; mas Jesus ocultou-se, e saiu do templo."}]}}),671,[]);
__d((function(e,s,o,a,n,t,i){n.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And as Jesus passed by, he saw a man which was blind from his birth.",pt:"E passando Jesus, viu um homem cego de nascen\xe7a."},{verse:2,en:"And his disciples asked him, saying, Master, who did sin, this man, or his parents, that he was born blind?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe os seus disc\xedpulos: Rabi, quem pecou, este ou seus pais, para que nascesse cego?"},{verse:3,en:"Jesus answered, Neither hath this man sinned, nor his parents: but that the works of God should be made manifest in him.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Nem ele pecou nem seus pais; mas foi para que nele se manifestem as obras de Deus."},{verse:4,en:"I must work the works of him that sent me, while it is day: the night cometh, when no man can work.",pt:"Importa que fa\xe7amos as obras daquele que me enviou, enquanto \xe9 dia; vem a noite, quando ningu\xe9m pode trabalhar."},{verse:5,en:"As long as I am in the world, I am the light of the world.",pt:"Enquanto estou no mundo, sou a luz do mundo."},{verse:6,en:"When he had thus spoken, he spat on the ground, and made clay of the spittle, and he anointed the eyes of the blind man with the clay,",pt:"Dito isto, cuspiu no ch\xe3o e com a saliva fez lodo, e untou com lodo os olhos do cego,"},{verse:7,en:"And said unto him, Go, wash in the pool of Siloam, (which is by interpretation, Sent.) He went his way therefore, and washed, and came seeing.",pt:"e disse-lhe: Vai, lava-te no tanque de Silo\xe9 (que significa Enviado). E ele foi, lavou-se, e voltou vendo."},{verse:8,en:"The neighbours therefore, and they which before had seen him that he was blind, said, Is not this he that sat and begged?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os vizinhos e aqueles que antes o tinham visto, quando mendigo, perguntavam: N\xe3o \xe9 este o mesmo que se sentava a mendigar?"},{verse:9,en:"Some said, This is he: others said, He is like him: but he said, I am he.",pt:"Uns diziam: \xc9 ele. E outros: N\xe3o \xe9, mas se parece com ele. Ele dizia: Sou eu."},{verse:10,en:"Therefore said they unto him, How were thine eyes opened?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe, pois: Como se te abriram os olhos?"},{verse:11,en:"He answered and said, A man that is called Jesus made clay, and anointed mine eyes, and said unto me, Go to the pool of Siloam, and wash: and I went and washed, and I received sight.",pt:"Respondeu ele: O homem que se chama Jesus fez lodo, untou-me os olhos, e disse-me: Vai a Silo\xe9 e lava-te. Fui, pois, lavei-me, e fiquei vendo."},{verse:12,en:"Then said they unto him, Where is he? He said, I know not.",pt:"E perguntaram-lhe: Onde est\xe1 ele? Respondeu: N\xe3o sei."},{verse:13,en:"They brought to the Pharisees him that aforetime was blind.",pt:"Levaram aos fariseus o que fora cego."},{verse:14,en:"And it was the sabbath day when Jesus made the clay, and opened his eyes.",pt:"Ora, era s\xe1bado o dia em que Jesus fez o lodo e lhe abriu os olhos."},{verse:15,en:"Then again the Pharisees also asked him how he had received his sight. He said unto them, He put clay upon mine eyes, and I washed, and do see.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os fariseus tamb\xe9m se puseram a perguntar-lhe como recebera a vista. Respondeu-lhes ele: P\xf4s-me lodo sobre os olhos, lavei-me e vejo."},{verse:16,en:"Therefore said some of the Pharisees, This man is not of God, because he keepeth not the sabbath day. Others said, How can a man that is a sinner do such miracles? And there was a division among them.",pt:"Por isso alguns dos fariseus diziam: Este homem n\xe3o \xe9 de Deus; pois n\xe3o guarda o s\xe1bado. Diziam outros: Como pode um homem pecador fazer tais sinais? E havia dissens\xe3o entre eles."},{verse:17,en:"They say unto the blind man again, What sayest thou of him, that he hath opened thine eyes? He said, He is a prophet.",pt:"Tornaram, pois, a perguntar ao cego: Que dizes tu a respeito dele, visto que te abriu os olhos? E ele respondeu: \xc9 profeta."},{verse:18,en:"But the Jews did not believe concerning him, that he had been blind, and received his sight, until they called the parents of him that had received his sight.",pt:"Os judeus, por\xe9m, n\xe3o acreditaram que ele tivesse sido cego e recebido a vista, enquanto n\xe3o chamaram os pais do que fora curado,"},{verse:19,en:"And they asked them, saying, Is this your son, who ye say was born blind? how then doth he now see?",pt:"e lhes perguntaram: \xc9 este o vosso filho, que dizeis ter nascido cego? Como, pois, v\xea agora?"},{verse:20,en:"His parents answered them and said, We know that this is our son, and that he was born blind:",pt:"Responderam seus pais: Sabemos que este \xe9 o nosso filho, e que nasceu cego;"},{verse:21,en:"But by what means he now seeth, we know not; or who hath opened his eyes, we know not: he is of age; ask him: he shall speak for himself.",pt:"mas como agora v\xea, n\xe3o sabemos; ou quem lhe abriu os olhos, n\xf3s n\xe3o sabemos; perguntai a ele mesmo; tem idade; ele falar\xe1 por si mesmo."},{verse:22,en:"These words spake his parents, because they feared the Jews: for the Jews had agreed already, that if any man did confess that he was Christ, he should be put out of the synagogue.",pt:"Isso disseram seus pais, porque temiam os judeus, porquanto j\xe1 tinham estes combinado que se algu\xe9m confessasse ser Jesus o Cristo, fosse expulso da sinagoga."},{verse:23,en:"Therefore said his parents, He is of age; ask him.",pt:"Por isso \xe9 que seus pais disseram: Tem idade, perguntai-lho a ele mesmo."},{verse:24,en:"Then again called they the man that was blind, and said unto him, Give God the praise: we know that this man is a sinner.",pt:"Ent\xe3o chamaram pela segunda vez o homem que fora cego, e lhe disseram: D\xe1 gl\xf3ria a Deus; n\xf3s sabemos que esse homem \xe9 pecador."},{verse:25,en:"He answered and said, Whether he be a sinner or no, I know not: one thing I know, that, whereas I was blind, now I see.",pt:"Respondeu ele: Se \xe9 pecador, n\xe3o sei; uma coisa sei: eu era cego, e agora vejo."},{verse:26,en:"Then said they to him again, What did he to thee? how opened he thine eyes?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe pois: Que foi que te fez? Como te abriu os olhos?"},{verse:27,en:"He answered them, I have told you already, and ye did not hear: wherefore would ye hear it again? will ye also be his disciples?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: J\xe1 vo-lo disse, e n\xe3o atendestes; para que o quereis tornar a ouvir? Acaso tamb\xe9m v\xf3s quereis tornar-vos disc\xedpulos dele?"},{verse:28,en:"Then they reviled him, and said, Thou art his disciple; but we are Moses\u2019 disciples.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o injuriaram, e disseram: Disc\xedpulo dele \xe9s tu; n\xf3s por\xe9m, somos disc\xedpulos de Mois\xe9s."},{verse:29,en:"We know that God spake unto Moses: as for this fellow, we know not from whence he is.",pt:"Sabemos que Deus falou a Mois\xe9s; mas quanto a este, n\xe3o sabemos donde \xe9."},{verse:30,en:"The man answered and said unto them, Why herein is a marvellous thing, that ye know not from whence he is, and yet he hath opened mine eyes.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes o homem: Nisto, pois, est\xe1 a maravilha: n\xe3o sabeis donde ele \xe9, e entretanto ele me abriu os olhos;"},{verse:31,en:"Now we know that God heareth not sinners: but if any man be a worshipper of God, and doeth his will, him he heareth.",pt:"sabemos que Deus n\xe3o ouve a pecadores; mas, se algu\xe9m for temente a Deus, e fizer a sua vontade, a esse ele ouve."},{verse:32,en:"Since the world began was it not heard that any man opened the eyes of one that was born blind.",pt:"Desde o princ\xedpio do mundo nunca se ouviu que algu\xe9m abrisse os olhos a um cego de nascen\xe7a."},{verse:33,en:"If this man were not of God, he could do nothing.",pt:"Se este n\xe3o fosse de Deus, nada poderia fazer."},{verse:34,en:"They answered and said unto him, Thou wast altogether born in sins, and dost thou teach us? And they cast him out.",pt:"Replicaram-lhe eles: Tu nasceste todo em pecados, e vens nos ensinar a n\xf3s? E expulsaram-no."},{verse:35,en:"Jesus heard that they had cast him out; and when he had found him, he said unto him, Dost thou believe on the Son of God?",pt:"Soube Jesus que o haviam expulsado; e achando-o perguntou- lhe: Cr\xeas tu no Filho do homem?"},{verse:36,en:"He answered and said, Who is he, Lord, that I might believe on him?",pt:"Respondeu ele: Quem \xe9, senhor, para que nele creia?"},{verse:37,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Thou hast both seen him, and it is he that talketh with thee.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: J\xe1 o viste, e \xe9 ele quem fala contigo."},{verse:38,en:"And he said, Lord, I believe. And he worshipped him.",pt:"Disse o homem: Creio, Senhor! E o adorou."},{verse:39,en:"And Jesus said, For judgment I am come into this world, that they which see not might see; and that they which see might be made blind.",pt:"Prosseguiu ent\xe3o Jesus: Eu vim a este mundo para ju\xedzo, a fim de que os que n\xe3o v\xeaem vejam, e os que v\xeaem se tornem cegos."},{verse:40,en:"And some of the Pharisees which were with him heard these words, and said unto him, Are we blind also?",pt:"Alguns fariseus que ali estavam com ele, ouvindo isso, perguntaram-lhe: Porventura somos n\xf3s tamb\xe9m cegos?"},{verse:41,en:"Jesus said unto them, If ye were blind, ye should have no sin: but now ye say, We see; therefore your sin remaineth.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Se fosseis cegos, n\xe3o ter\xedeis pecado; mas como agora dizeis: N\xf3s vemos, permanece o vosso pecado."}]}}),672,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that entereth not by the door into the sheepfold, but climbeth up some other way, the same is a thief and a robber.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: quem n\xe3o entra pela porta no aprisco das ovelhas, mas sobe por outra parte, esse \xe9 ladr\xe3o e salteador."},{verse:2,en:"But he that entereth in by the door is the shepherd of the sheep.",pt:"Mas o que entra pela porta \xe9 o pastor das ovelhas."},{verse:3,en:"To him the porter openeth; and the sheep hear his voice: and he calleth his own sheep by name, and leadeth them out.",pt:"A este o porteiro abre; e as ovelhas ouvem a sua voz; e ele chama pelo nome as suas ovelhas, e as conduz para fora."},{verse:4,en:"And when he putteth forth his own sheep, he goeth before them, and the sheep follow him: for they know his voice.",pt:"Depois de conduzir para fora todas as que lhe pertencem, vai adiante delas, e as ovelhas o seguem, porque conhecem a sua voz;"},{verse:5,en:"And a stranger will they not follow, but will flee from him: for they know not the voice of strangers.",pt:"mas de modo algum seguir\xe3o o estranho, antes fugir\xe3o dele, porque n\xe3o conhecem a voz dos estranhos."},{verse:6,en:"This parable spake Jesus unto them: but they understood not what things they were which he spake unto them.",pt:"Jesus prop\xf4s-lhes esta par\xe1bola, mas eles n\xe3o entenderam o que era que lhes dizia."},{verse:7,en:"Then said Jesus unto them again, Verily, verily, I say unto you, I am the door of the sheep.",pt:"Tornou, pois, Jesus a dizer-lhes: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: eu sou a porta das ovelhas."},{verse:8,en:"All that ever came before me are thieves and robbers: but the sheep did not hear them.",pt:"Todos quantos vieram antes de mim s\xe3o ladr\xf5es e salteadores; mas as ovelhas n\xe3o os ouviram."},{verse:9,en:"I am the door: by me if any man enter in, he shall be saved, and shall go in and out, and find pasture.",pt:"Eu sou a porta; se algu\xe9m entrar a casa; o filho fica entrar\xe1 e sair\xe1, e achar\xe1 pastagens."},{verse:10,en:"The thief cometh not, but for to steal, and to kill, and to destroy: I am come that they might have life, and that they might have it more abundantly.",pt:"O ladr\xe3o n\xe3o vem sen\xe3o para roubar, matar e destruir; eu vim para que tenham vida e a tenham em abund\xe2ncia."},{verse:11,en:"I am the good shepherd: the good shepherd giveth his life for the sheep.",pt:"Eu sou o bom pastor; o bom pastor d\xe1 a sua vida pelas ovelhas."},{verse:12,en:"But he that is an hireling, and not the shepherd, whose own the sheep are not, seeth the wolf coming, and leaveth the sheep, and fleeth: and the wolf catcheth them, and scattereth the sheep.",pt:"Mas o que \xe9 mercen\xe1rio, e n\xe3o pastor, de quem n\xe3o s\xe3o as ovelhas, vendo vir o lobo, deixa as ovelhas e foge; e o lobo as arrebata e dispersa."},{verse:13,en:"The hireling fleeth, because he is an hireling, and careth not for the sheep.",pt:"Ora, o mercen\xe1rio foge porque \xe9 mercen\xe1rio, e n\xe3o se importa com as ovelhas."},{verse:14,en:"I am the good shepherd, and know my sheep, and am known of mine.",pt:"Eu sou o bom pastor; conhe\xe7o as minhas ovelhas, e elas me conhecem,"},{verse:15,en:"As the Father knoweth me, even so know I the Father: and I lay down my life for the sheep.",pt:"assim como o Pai me conhece e eu conhe\xe7o o Pai; e dou a minha vida pelas ovelhas."},{verse:16,en:"And other sheep I have, which are not of this fold: them also I must bring, and they shall hear my voice; and there shall be one fold, and one shepherd.",pt:"Tenho ainda outras ovelhas que n\xe3o s\xe3o deste aprisco; a essas tamb\xe9m me importa conduzir, e elas ouvir\xe3o a minha voz; e haver\xe1 um rebanho e um pastor."},{verse:17,en:"Therefore doth my Father love me, because I lay down my life, that I might take it again.",pt:"Por isto o Pai me ama, porque dou a minha vida para a retomar."},{verse:18,en:"No man taketh it from me, but I lay it down of myself. I have power to lay it down, and I have power to take it again. This commandment have I received of my Father.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m ma tira de mim, mas eu de mim mesmo a dou; tenho autoridade para a dar, e tenho autoridade para retom\xe1-la. Este mandamento recebi de meu Pai."},{verse:19,en:"There was a division therefore again among the Jews for these sayings.",pt:"Por causa dessas palavras, houve outra dissens\xe3o entre os judeus."},{verse:20,en:"And many of them said, He hath a devil, and is mad; why hear ye him?",pt:"E muitos deles diziam: Tem dem\xf4nio, e perdeu o ju\xedzo; por que o escutais?"},{verse:21,en:"Others said, These are not the words of him that hath a devil. Can a devil open the eyes of the blind?",pt:"Diziam outros: Essas palavras n\xe3o s\xe3o de quem est\xe1 endemoninhado; pode porventura um dem\xf4nio abrir os olhos aos cegos?"},{verse:22,en:"And it was at Jerusalem the feast of the dedication, and it was winter.",pt:"Celebrava-se ent\xe3o em Jerusal\xe9m a festa da dedica\xe7\xe3o. E era inverno."},{verse:23,en:"And Jesus walked in the temple in Solomon\u2019s porch.",pt:"Andava Jesus passeando no templo, no p\xf3rtico de Salom\xe3o."},{verse:24,en:"Then came the Jews round about him, and said unto him, How long dost thou make us to doubt? If thou be the Christ, tell us plainly.",pt:"Rodearam-no, pois, os judeus e lhe perguntavam: At\xe9 quando nos deixar\xe1s perplexos? Se tu \xe9s o Cristo, dize-no-lo abertamente."},{verse:25,en:"Jesus answered them, I told you, and ye believed not: the works that I do in my Father\u2019s name, they bear witness of me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: J\xe1 vo-lo disse, e n\xe3o credes. As obras que eu fa\xe7o em nome de meu Pai, essas d\xe3o testemunho de mim."},{verse:26,en:"But ye believe not, because ye are not of my sheep, as I said unto you.",pt:"Mas v\xf3s n\xe3o credes, porque n\xe3o sois das minhas ovelhas."},{verse:27,en:"My sheep hear my voice, and I know them, and they follow me:",pt:"As minhas ovelhas ouvem a minha voz, e eu as conhe\xe7o, e elas me seguem;"},{verse:28,en:"And I give unto them eternal life; and they shall never perish, neither shall any man pluck them out of my hand.",pt:"eu lhes dou a vida eterna, e jamais perecer\xe3o; e ningu\xe9m as arrebatar\xe1 da minha m\xe3o."},{verse:29,en:"My Father, which gave them me, is greater than all; and no man is able to pluck them out of my Father\u2019s hand.",pt:"Meu Pai, que mas deu, \xe9 maior do que todos; e ningu\xe9m pode arrebat\xe1-las da m\xe3o de meu Pai."},{verse:30,en:"I and my Father are one.",pt:"Eu e o Pai somos um."},{verse:31,en:"Then the Jews took up stones again to stone him.",pt:"Os judeus pegaram ent\xe3o outra vez em pedras para o apedrejar."},{verse:32,en:"Jesus answered them, Many good works have I shewed you from my Father; for which of those works do ye stone me?",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Muitas obras boas da parte de meu Pai vos tenho mostrado; por qual destas obras ides apedrejar-me?"},{verse:33,en:"The Jews answered him, saying, For a good work we stone thee not; but for blasphemy; and because that thou, being a man, makest thyself God.",pt:"Responderam-lhe os judeus: N\xe3o \xe9 por nenhuma obra boa que vamos apedrejar-te, mas por blasf\xeamia; e porque, sendo tu homem, te fazes Deus."},{verse:34,en:"Jesus answered them, Is it not written in your law, I said, Ye are gods?",pt:"Tornou-lhes Jesus: N\xe3o est\xe1 escrito na vossa lei: Eu disse: V\xf3s sois deuses?"},{verse:35,en:"If he called them gods, unto whom the word of God came, and the scripture cannot be broken;",pt:"Se a lei chamou deuses \xe0queles a quem a palavra de Deus foi dirigida (e a Escritura n\xe3o pode ser anulada),"},{verse:36,en:"Say ye of him, whom the Father hath sanctified, and sent into the world, Thou blasphemest; because I said, I am the Son of God?",pt:"\xe0quele a quem o Pai santificou, e enviou ao mundo, dizeis v\xf3s: Blasfemas; porque eu disse: Sou Filho de Deus?"},{verse:37,en:"If I do not the works of my Father, believe me not.",pt:"Se n\xe3o fa\xe7o as obras de meu Pai, n\xe3o me acrediteis."},{verse:38,en:"But if I do, though ye believe not me, believe the works: that ye may know, and believe, that the Father is in me, and I in him.",pt:"Mas se as fa\xe7o, embora n\xe3o me creiais a mim, crede nas obras; para que entendais e saibais que o Pai est\xe1 em mim e eu no Pai."},{verse:39,en:"Therefore they sought again to take him: but he escaped out of their hand,",pt:"Outra vez, pois, procuravam prend\xea-lo; mas ele lhes escapou das m\xe3os."},{verse:40,en:"And went away again beyond Jordan into the place where John at first baptized; and there he abode.",pt:"E retirou-se de novo para al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o, para o lugar onde Jo\xe3o batizava no princ\xedpio; e ali ficou."},{verse:41,en:"And many resorted unto him, and said, John did no miracle: but all things that John spake of this man were true.",pt:"Muitos foram ter com ele, e diziam: Jo\xe3o, na verdade, n\xe3o fez sinal algum, mas tudo quanto disse deste homem era verdadeiro."},{verse:42,en:"And many believed on him there.",pt:"E muitos ali creram nele."}]}}),673,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,r,h){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now a certain man was sick, named Lazarus, of Bethany, the town of Mary and her sister Martha.",pt:"Ora, estava enfermo um homem chamado L\xe1zaro, de Bet\xe2nia, aldeia de Maria e de sua irm\xe3 Marta."},{verse:2,en:"(It was that Mary which anointed the Lord with ointment, and wiped his feet with her hair, whose brother Lazarus was sick.)",pt:"E Maria, cujo irm\xe3o L\xe1zaro se achava enfermo, era a mesma que ungiu o Senhor com b\xe1lsamo, e lhe enxugou os p\xe9s com os seus cabelos."},{verse:3,en:"Therefore his sisters sent unto him, saying, Lord, behold, he whom thou lovest is sick.",pt:"Mandaram, pois, as irm\xe3s dizer a Jesus: Senhor, eis que est\xe1 enfermo aquele que tu amas."},{verse:4,en:"When Jesus heard that, he said, This sickness is not unto death, but for the glory of God, that the Son of God might be glorified thereby.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, ao ouvir isto, disse: Esta enfermidade n\xe3o \xe9 para a morte, mas para gl\xf3ria de Deus, para que o Filho de Deus seja glorificado por ela."},{verse:5,en:"Now Jesus loved Martha, and her sister, and Lazarus.",pt:"Ora, Jesus amava a Marta, e a sua irm\xe3, e a L\xe1zaro."},{verse:6,en:"When he had heard therefore that he was sick, he abode two days still in the same place where he was.",pt:"Quando, pois, ouviu que estava enfermo, ficou ainda dois dias no lugar onde se achava."},{verse:7,en:"Then after that saith he to his disciples, Let us go into Judaea again.",pt:"Depois disto, disse a seus disc\xedpulos: Vamos outra vez para Jud\xe9ia."},{verse:8,en:"His disciples say unto him, Master, the Jews of late sought to stone thee; and goest thou thither again?",pt:"Disseram-lhe eles: Rabi, ainda agora os judeus procuravam apedrejar-te, e voltas para l\xe1?"},{verse:9,en:"Jesus answered, Are there not twelve hours in the day? If any man walk in the day, he stumbleth not, because he seeth the light of this world.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: N\xe3o s\xe3o doze as horas do dia? Se algu\xe9m andar de dia, n\xe3o trope\xe7a, porque v\xea a luz deste mundo;"},{verse:10,en:"But if a man walk in the night, he stumbleth, because there is no light in him.",pt:"mas se andar de noite, trope\xe7a, porque nele n\xe3o h\xe1 luz."},{verse:11,en:"These things said he: and after that he saith unto them, Our friend Lazarus sleepeth; but I go, that I may awake him out of sleep.",pt:"E, tendo assim falado, acrescentou: L\xe1zaro, o nosso amigo, dorme, mas vou despert\xe1-lo do sono."},{verse:12,en:"Then said his disciples, Lord, if he sleep, he shall do well.",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois, os disc\xedpulos: Senhor, se dorme, ficar\xe1 bom."},{verse:13,en:"Howbeit Jesus spake of his death: but they thought that he had spoken of taking of rest in sleep.",pt:"Mas Jesus falara da sua morte; eles, por\xe9m, entenderam que falava do repouso do sono."},{verse:14,en:"Then said Jesus unto them plainly, Lazarus is dead.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus lhes disse claramente: L\xe1zaro morreu;"},{verse:15,en:"And I am glad for your sakes that I was not there, to the intent ye may believe; nevertheless let us go unto him.",pt:"e, por vossa causa, folgo de que eu l\xe1 n\xe3o estivesse, para para que creiais; mas vamos ter com ele."},{verse:16,en:"Then said Thomas, which is called Didymus, unto his fellowdisciples, Let us also go, that we may die with him.",pt:"Disse, pois, Tom\xe9, chamado D\xeddimo, aos seus condisc\xedpulos: Vamos n\xf3s tamb\xe9m, para morrermos com ele."},{verse:17,en:"Then when Jesus came, he found that he had lain in the grave four days already.",pt:"Chegando pois Jesus, encontrou-o j\xe1 com quatro dias de sepultura."},{verse:18,en:"Now Bethany was nigh unto Jerusalem, about fifteen furlongs off:",pt:"Ora, Bet\xe2nia distava de Jerusal\xe9m cerca de quinze est\xe1dios."},{verse:19,en:"And many of the Jews came to Martha and Mary, to comfort them concerning their brother.",pt:"E muitos dos judeus tinham vindo visitar Marta e Maria, para as consolar acerca de seu irm\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"Then Martha, as soon as she heard that Jesus was coming, went and met him: but Mary sat still in the house.",pt:"Marta, pois, ao saber que Jesus chegava, saiu-lhe ao encontro; Maria, por\xe9m, ficou sentada em casa."},{verse:21,en:"Then said Martha unto Jesus, Lord, if thou hadst been here, my brother had not died.",pt:"Disse, pois, Marta a Jesus: Senhor, se meu irm\xe3o n\xe3o teria morrido."},{verse:22,en:"But I know, that even now, whatsoever thou wilt ask of God, God will give it thee.",pt:"E mesmo agora sei que tudo quanto pedires a Deus, Deus to conceder\xe1."},{verse:23,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Thy brother shall rise again.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Teu irm\xe3o h\xe1 de ressurgir."},{verse:24,en:"Martha saith unto him, I know that he shall rise again in the resurrection at the last day.",pt:"Disse-lhe Marta: Sei que ele h\xe1 de ressurgir na ressurrei\xe7\xe3o, no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:25,en:"Jesus said unto her, I am the resurrection, and the life: he that believeth in me, though he were dead, yet shall he live:",pt:"Declarou-lhe Jesus: Eu sou a ressurrei\xe7\xe3o e a vida; quem cr\xea em mim, ainda que morra, viver\xe1;"},{verse:26,en:"And whosoever liveth and believeth in me shall never die. Believest thou this?",pt:"e todo aquele que vive, e cr\xea em mim, jamais morrer\xe1. Cr\xeas isto?"},{verse:27,en:"She saith unto him, Yea, Lord: I believe that thou art the Christ, the Son of God, which should come into the world.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Marta: Sim, Senhor, eu creio que tu \xe9s o Cristo, o Filho de Deus, que havia de vir ao mundo."},{verse:28,en:"And when she had so said, she went her way, and called Mary her sister secretly, saying, The Master is come, and calleth for thee.",pt:"Dito isto, retirou-se e foi chamar em segredo a Maria, sua irm\xe3, e lhe disse: O Mestre est\xe1 a\xed, e te chama."},{verse:29,en:"As soon as she heard that, she arose quickly, and came unto him.",pt:"Ela, ouvindo isto, levantou-se depressa, e foi ter com ele."},{verse:30,en:"Now Jesus was not yet come into the town, but was in that place where Martha met him.",pt:"Pois Jesus ainda n\xe3o havia entrado na aldeia, mas estava no lugar onde Marta o encontrara."},{verse:31,en:"The Jews then which were with her in the house, and comforted her, when they saw Mary, that she rose up hastily and went out, followed her, saying, She goeth unto the grave to weep there.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os judeus que estavam com Maria em casa e a consolavam, vendo-a levantar-se apressadamente e sair, seguiram-na, pensando que ia ao sepulcro para chorar ali."},{verse:32,en:"Then when Mary was come where Jesus was, and saw him, she fell down at his feet, saying unto him, Lord, if thou hadst been here, my brother had not died.",pt:"Tendo, pois, Maria chegado ao lugar onde Jesus estava, e vendo-a, lan\xe7ou-se-lhe aos p\xe9s e disse: Senhor, se tu estiveras aqui, meu irm\xe3o n\xe3o teria morrido."},{verse:33,en:"When Jesus therefore saw her weeping, and the Jews also weeping which came with her, he groaned in the spirit, and was troubled,",pt:"Jesus, pois, quando a viu chorar, e chorarem tamb\xe9m os judeus que com ela vinham, comoveu-se em esp\xedrito, e perturbou-se,"},{verse:34,en:"And said, Where have ye laid him? They said unto him, Lord, come and see.",pt:"e perguntou: Onde o puseste? Responderam-lhe: Senhor, vem e v\xea."},{verse:35,en:"Jesus wept.",pt:"Jesus chorou."},{verse:36,en:"Then said the Jews, Behold how he loved him!",pt:"Disseram ent\xe3o os judeus: Vede como o amava."},{verse:37,en:"And some of them said, Could not this man, which opened the eyes of the blind, have caused that even this man should not have died?",pt:"Mas alguns deles disseram: N\xe3o podia ele, que abriu os olhos ao cego, fazer tamb\xe9m que este n\xe3o morreste?"},{verse:38,en:"Jesus therefore again groaning in himself cometh to the grave. It was a cave, and a stone lay upon it.",pt:"Jesus, pois, comovendo-se outra vez, profundamente, foi ao sepulcro; era uma gruta, e tinha uma pedra posta sobre ela."},{verse:39,en:"Jesus said, Take ye away the stone. Martha, the sister of him that was dead, saith unto him, Lord, by this time he stinketh: for he hath been dead four days.",pt:"Disse Jesus: Tirai a pedra. Marta, irm\xe3 do defunto, disse- lhe: Senhor, j\xe1 cheira mal, porque est\xe1 morto h\xe1 quase quatro dias."},{verse:40,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Said I not unto thee, that, if thou wouldest believe, thou shouldest see the glory of God?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: N\xe3o te disse que, se creres, ver\xe1s a gl\xf3ria de Deus?"},{verse:41,en:"Then they took away the stone from the place where the dead was laid. And Jesus lifted up his eyes, and said, Father, I thank thee that thou hast heard me.",pt:"Tiraram ent\xe3o a pedra. E Jesus, levantando os olhos ao c\xe9u, disse: Pai, gra\xe7as te dou, porque me ouviste."},{verse:42,en:"And I knew that thou hearest me always: but because of the people which stand by I said it, that they may believe that thou hast sent me.",pt:"Eu sabia que sempre me ouves; mas por causa da multid\xe3o que est\xe1 em redor \xe9 que assim falei, para que eles creiam que tu me enviaste."},{verse:43,en:"And when he thus had spoken, he cried with a loud voice, Lazarus, come forth.",pt:"E, tendo dito isso, clamou em alta voz: L\xe1zaro, vem para fora!"},{verse:44,en:"And he that was dead came forth, bound hand and foot with graveclothes: and his face was bound about with a napkin. Jesus saith unto them, Loose him, and let him go.",pt:"Saiu o que estivera morto, ligados os p\xe9s e as m\xe3os com faixas, e o seu rosto envolto num len\xe7o. Disse-lhes Jesus: Desligai-o e deixai-o ir."},{verse:45,en:"Then many of the Jews which came to Mary, and had seen the things which Jesus did, believed on him.",pt:"Muitos, pois, dentre os judeus que tinham vindo visitar Maria, e que tinham visto o que Jesus fizera, creram nele."},{verse:46,en:"But some of them went their ways to the Pharisees, and told them what things Jesus had done.",pt:"Mas alguns deles foram ter com os fariseus e disseram-lhes o que Jesus tinha feito."},{verse:47,en:"Then gathered the chief priests and the Pharisees a council, and said, What do we? for this man doeth many miracles.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os principais sacerdotes e os fariseus reuniram o sin\xe9drio e diziam: Que faremos? porquanto este homem vem operando muitos sinais."},{verse:48,en:"If we let him thus alone, all men will believe on him: and the Romans shall come and take away both our place and nation.",pt:"Se o deixarmos assim, todos crer\xe3o nele, e vir\xe3o os romanos, e nos tirar\xe3o tanto o nosso lugar como a nossa na\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:49,en:"And one of them, named Caiaphas, being the high priest that same year, said unto them, Ye know nothing at all,",pt:"Um deles, por\xe9m, chamado Caif\xe1s, que era sumo sacerdote naquele ano, disse-lhes: V\xf3s nada sabeis,"},{verse:50,en:"Nor consider that it is expedient for us, that one man should die for the people, and that the whole nation perish not.",pt:"nem considerais que vos conv\xe9m que morra um s\xf3 homem pelo povo, e que n\xe3o pere\xe7a a na\xe7\xe3o toda."},{verse:51,en:"And this spake he not of himself: but being high priest that year, he prophesied that Jesus should die for that nation;",pt:"Ora, isso n\xe3o disse ele por si mesmo; mas, sendo o sumo sacerdote naquele ano, profetizou que Jesus havia de morrer pela na\xe7\xe3o,"},{verse:52,en:"And not for that nation only, but that also he should gather together in one the children of God that were scattered abroad.",pt:"e n\xe3o somente pela na\xe7\xe3o, mas tamb\xe9m para congregar num s\xf3 corpo os filhos de Deus que est\xe3o dispersos."},{verse:53,en:"Then from that day forth they took counsel together for to put him to death.",pt:"Desde aquele dia, pois, tomavam conselho para o matarem."},{verse:54,en:"Jesus therefore walked no more openly among the Jews; but went thence unto a country near to the wilderness, into a city called Ephraim, and there continued with his disciples.",pt:"De sorte que Jesus j\xe1 n\xe3o andava manifestamente entre os judeus, mas retirou-se dali para a regi\xe3o vizinha ao deserto, a uma cidade chamada Efraim; e ali demorou com os seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:55,en:"And the Jews\u2019 passover was nigh at hand: and many went out of the country up to Jerusalem before the passover, to purify themselves.",pt:"Ora, estava pr\xf3xima a p\xe1scoa dos judeus, e dessa regi\xe3o subiram muitos a Jerusal\xe9m, antes da p\xe1scoa, para se purificarem."},{verse:56,en:"Then sought they for Jesus, and spake among themselves, as they stood in the temple, What think ye, that he will not come to the feast?",pt:"Buscavam, pois, a Jesus e diziam uns aos outros, estando no templo: Que vos parece? N\xe3o vir\xe1 ele \xe0 festa?"},{verse:57,en:"Now both the chief priests and the Pharisees had given a commandment, that, if any man knew where he were, he should shew it, that they might take him.",pt:"Ora, os principais sacerdotes e os fariseus tinham dado ordem que, se algu\xe9m soubesse onde ele estava, o denunciasse, para que o prendessem."}]}}),674,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then Jesus six days before the passover came to Bethany, where Lazarus was which had been dead, whom he raised from the dead.",pt:"Veio, pois, Jesus seis dias antes da p\xe1scoa, a Bet\xe2nia, onde estava L\xe1zaro, a quem ele ressuscitara dentre os mortos."},{verse:2,en:"There they made him a supper; and Martha served: but Lazarus was one of them that sat at the table with him.",pt:"Deram-lhe ali uma ceia; Marta servia, e L\xe1zaro era um dos que estavam \xe0 mesa com ele."},{verse:3,en:"Then took Mary a pound of ointment of spikenard, very costly, and anointed the feet of Jesus, and wiped his feet with her hair: and the house was filled with the odour of the ointment.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Maria, tomando uma libra de b\xe1lsamo de nardo puro, de grande pre\xe7o, ungiu os p\xe9s de Jesus, e os enxugou com os seus cabelos; e encheu-se a casa do cheiro do b\xe1lsamo."},{verse:4,en:"Then saith one of his disciples, Judas Iscariot, Simon\u2019s son, which should betray him,",pt:"Mas Judas Iscariotes, um dos seus disc\xedpulos, aquele que o havia de trair disse:"},{verse:5,en:"Why was not this ointment sold for three hundred pence, and given to the poor?",pt:"Por que n\xe3o se vendeu este b\xe1lsamo por trezentos den\xe1rios e n\xe3o se deu aos pobres?"},{verse:6,en:"This he said, not that he cared for the poor; but because he was a thief, and had the bag, and bare what was put therein.",pt:"Ora, ele disse isto, n\xe3o porque tivesse cuidado dos pobres, mas porque era ladr\xe3o e, tendo a bolsa, subtra\xeda o que nela se lan\xe7ava."},{verse:7,en:"Then said Jesus, Let her alone: against the day of my burying hath she kept this.",pt:"Respondeu, pois Jesus: Deixa-a; para o dia da minha prepara\xe7\xe3o para a sepultura o guardou;"},{verse:8,en:"For the poor always ye have with you; but me ye have not always.",pt:"porque os pobres sempre os tendes convosco; mas a mim nem sempre me tendes."},{verse:9,en:"Much people of the Jews therefore knew that he was there: and they came not for Jesus\u2019 sake only, but that they might see Lazarus also, whom he had raised from the dead.",pt:"E grande n\xfamero dos judeus chegou a saber que ele estava ali: e afluiram, n\xe3o s\xf3 por causa de Jesus mas tamb\xe9m para verem a L\xe1zaro, a quem ele ressuscitara dentre os mortos."},{verse:10,en:"But the chief priests consulted that they might put Lazarus also to death;",pt:"Mas os principais sacerdotes deliberaram matar tamb\xe9m a L\xe1zaro;"},{verse:11,en:"Because that by reason of him many of the Jews went away, and believed on Jesus.",pt:"porque muitos, por causa dele, deixavam os judeus e criam em Jesus."},{verse:12,en:"On the next day much people that were come to the feast, when they heard that Jesus was coming to Jerusalem,",pt:"No dia seguinte, as grandes multid\xf5es que tinham vindo \xe0 festa, ouvindo dizer que Jesus vinha a Jerusal\xe9m,"},{verse:13,en:"Took branches of palm trees, and went forth to meet him, and cried, Hosanna: Blessed is the King of Israel that cometh in the name of the Lord.",pt:"tomaram ramos de palmeiras, e sa\xedram-lhe ao encontro, e clamavam: Hosana! Bendito o que vem em nome do Senhor! Bendito o rei de Israel!"},{verse:14,en:"And Jesus, when he had found a young ass, sat thereon; as it is written,",pt:"E achou Jesus um jumentinho e montou nele, conforme est\xe1 escrito:"},{verse:15,en:"Fear not, daughter of Sion: behold, thy King cometh, sitting on an ass\u2019s colt.",pt:"N\xe3o temas, \xf3 filha de Si\xe3o; eis que vem teu Rei, montado sobre o filho de uma jumenta."},{verse:16,en:"These things understood not his disciples at the first: but when Jesus was glorified, then remembered they that these things were written of him, and that they had done these things unto him.",pt:"Os seus disc\xedpulos, por\xe9m, a princ\xedpio n\xe3o entenderam isto; mas quando Jesus foi glorificado, ent\xe3o eles se lembraram de que estas coisas estavam escritas a respeito dele, e de que assim lhe fizeram."},{verse:17,en:"The people therefore that was with him when he called Lazarus out of his grave, and raised him from the dead, bare record.",pt:"Dava-lhe, pois, testemunho a multid\xe3o que estava com ele quando chamara a L\xe1zaro da sepultura e o ressuscitara dentre os mortos;"},{verse:18,en:"For this cause the people also met him, for that they heard that he had done this miracle.",pt:"e foi por isso que a multid\xe3o lhe saiu ao encontro, por ter ouvido que ele fizera este sinal."},{verse:19,en:"The Pharisees therefore said among themselves, Perceive ye how ye prevail nothing? behold, the world is gone after him.",pt:"De sorte que os fariseus disseram entre si: Vedes que nada aproveitais? eis que o mundo inteiro vai ap\xf3s ele."},{verse:20,en:"And there were certain Greeks among them that came up to worship at the feast:",pt:"Ora, entre os que tinham subido a adorar na festa havia alguns gregos."},{verse:21,en:"The same came therefore to Philip, which was of Bethsaida of Galilee, and desired him, saying, Sir, we would see Jesus.",pt:"Estes, pois, dirigiram-se a Felipe, que era de Betsaida da Galil\xe9ia, e rogaram-lhe, dizendo: Senhor, quer\xedamos ver a Jesus."},{verse:22,en:"Philip cometh and telleth Andrew: and again Andrew and Philip tell Jesus.",pt:"Felipe foi diz\xea-lo a Andr\xe9, e ent\xe3o Andr\xe9 e Felipe foram diz\xea-lo a Jesus."},{verse:23,en:"And Jesus answered them, saying, The hour is come, that the Son of man should be glorified.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: \xc9 chegada a hora de ser glorificado o Filho do homem."},{verse:24,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, Except a corn of wheat fall into the ground and die, it abideth alone: but if it die, it bringeth forth much fruit.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Se o gr\xe3o de trigo caindo na terra n\xe3o morrer, fica ele s\xf3; mas se morrer, d\xe1 muito fruto."},{verse:25,en:"He that loveth his life shall lose it; and he that hateth his life in this world shall keep it unto life eternal.",pt:"Quem ama a sua vida, perd\xea-la-\xe1; e quem neste mundo odeia a a sua vida, guard\xe1-la-\xe1 para a vida eterna."},{verse:26,en:"If any man serve me, let him follow me; and where I am, there shall also my servant be: if any man serve me, him will my Father honour.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m me quiser servir, siga-me; e onde eu estiver, ali estar\xe1 tamb\xe9m o meu servo; se algu\xe9m me servir, o Pai o honrar\xe1."},{verse:27,en:"Now is my soul troubled; and what shall I say? Father, save me from this hour: but for this cause came I unto this hour.",pt:"Agora a minha alma est\xe1 perturbada; e que direi eu? Pai, salva-me desta hora? Mas para isto vim a esta hora."},{verse:28,en:"Father, glorify thy name. Then came there a voice from heaven, saying, I have both glorified it, and will glorify it again.",pt:"Pai, glorifica o teu nome. Veio, ent\xe3o, do c\xe9u esta voz: J\xe1 o tenho glorificado, e outra vez o glorificarei."},{verse:29,en:"The people therefore, that stood by, and heard it, said that it thundered: others said, An angel spake to him.",pt:"A multid\xe3o, pois, que ali estava, e que a ouvira, dizia ter havido um trov\xe3o; outros diziam: Um anjo lhe falou."},{verse:30,en:"Jesus answered and said, This voice came not because of me, but for your sakes.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: N\xe3o veio esta voz por minha causa, mas por causa de v\xf3s."},{verse:31,en:"Now is the judgment of this world: now shall the prince of this world be cast out.",pt:"Agora \xe9 o ju\xedzo deste mundo; agora ser\xe1 expulso o pr\xedncipe deste mundo."},{verse:32,en:"And I, if I be lifted up from the earth, will draw all men unto me.",pt:"E eu, quando for levantado da terra, todos atrairei a mim."},{verse:33,en:"This he said, signifying what death he should die.",pt:"Isto dizia, significando de que modo havia de morrer."},{verse:34,en:"The people answered him, We have heard out of the law that Christ abideth for ever: and how sayest thou, The Son of man must be lifted up? who is this Son of man?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe a multid\xe3o: N\xf3s temos ouvido da lei que o Cristo permanece para sempre; e como dizes tu: Importa que o Filho do homem seja levantado? Quem \xe9 esse Filho do homem?"},{verse:35,en:"Then Jesus said unto them, Yet a little while is the light with you. Walk while ye have the light, lest darkness come upon you: for he that walketh in darkness knoweth not whither he goeth.",pt:"Disse-lhes ent\xe3o Jesus: Ainda por um pouco de tempo a luz est\xe1 entre v\xf3s. Andai enquanto tendes a luz, para que as trevas n\xe3o vos apanhem; pois quem anda nas trevas n\xe3o sabe para onde vai."},{verse:36,en:"While ye have light, believe in the light, that ye may be the children of light. These things spake Jesus, and departed, and did hide himself from them.",pt:"Enquanto tendes a luz, crede na luz, para que vos torneis filhos da luz. Havendo Jesus assim falado, retirou-se e escondeu-se deles."},{verse:37,en:"But though he had done so many miracles before them, yet they believed not on him:",pt:"E embora tivesse operado tantos sinais diante deles, n\xe3o criam nele;"},{verse:38,en:"That the saying of Esaias the prophet might be fulfilled, which he spake, Lord, who hath believed our report? and to whom hath the arm of the Lord been revealed?",pt:"para que se cumprisse a palavra do profeta Isa\xedas: Senhor, quem creu em nossa prega\xe7\xe3o? e aquem foi revelado o bra\xe7o do Senhor?"},{verse:39,en:"Therefore they could not believe, because that Esaias said again,",pt:"Por isso n\xe3o podiam crer, porque, como disse ainda Isa\xedas:"},{verse:40,en:"He hath blinded their eyes, and hardened their heart; that they should not see with their eyes, nor understand with their heart, and be converted, and I should heal them.",pt:"Cegou-lhes os olhos e endureceu-lhes o cora\xe7\xe3o, para que n\xe3o vejam com os olhos e entendam com o cora\xe7\xe3o, e se convertam, e eu os cure."},{verse:41,en:"These things said Esaias, when he saw his glory, and spake of him.",pt:"Estas coisas disse Isa\xedas, porque viu a sua gl\xf3ria, e dele falou."},{verse:42,en:"Nevertheless among the chief rulers also many believed on him; but because of the Pharisees they did not confess him, lest they should be put out of the synagogue:",pt:"Contudo, muitos dentre as pr\xf3prias autoridades creram nele; mas por causa dos fariseus n\xe3o o confessavam, para n\xe3o serem expulsos da sinagoga;"},{verse:43,en:"For they loved the praise of men more than the praise of God.",pt:"porque amaram mais a gl\xf3ria dos homens do que a gl\xf3ria de Deus."},{verse:44,en:"Jesus cried and said, He that believeth on me, believeth not on me, but on him that sent me.",pt:"Clamou Jesus, dizendo: Quem cr\xea em mim, cr\xea, n\xe2o em mim, mas naquele que me enviou."},{verse:45,en:"And he that seeth me seeth him that sent me.",pt:"E quem me v\xea a mim, v\xea aquele que me enviou."},{verse:46,en:"I am come a light into the world, that whosoever believeth on me should not abide in darkness.",pt:"Eu, que sou a luz, vim ao mundo, para que todo aquele que cr\xea em mim n\xe3o permane\xe7a nas trevas."},{verse:47,en:"And if any man hear my words, and believe not, I judge him not: for I came not to judge the world, but to save the world.",pt:"E, se algu\xe9m ouvir as minhas palavras, e n\xe3o as guardar, eu n\xe3o o julgo; pois eu vim, n\xe3o para julgar o mundo, mas para salvar o mundo."},{verse:48,en:"He that rejecteth me, and receiveth not my words, hath one that judgeth him: the word that I have spoken, the same shall judge him in the last day.",pt:"Quem me rejeita, e n\xe3o recebe as minhas palavras, j\xe1 tem quem o julgue; a palavra que tenho pregado, essa o julgar\xe1 no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:49,en:"For I have not spoken of myself; but the Father which sent me, he gave me a commandment, what I should say, and what I should speak.",pt:"Porque eu n\xe3o falei por mim mesmo; mas o Pai, que me enviou, esse me deu mandamento quanto ao que dizer e como falar."},{verse:50,en:"And I know that his commandment is life everlasting: whatsoever I speak therefore, even as the Father said unto me, so I speak.",pt:"E sei que o seu mandamento \xe9 vida eterna. Aquilo, pois, que eu falo, falo-o exatamente como o Pai me ordenou."}]}}),675,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now before the feast of the passover, when Jesus knew that his hour was come that he should depart out of this world unto the Father, having loved his own which were in the world, he loved them unto the end.",pt:"Antes da festa da p\xe1scoa, sabendo Jesus que era chegada a sua hora de passar deste mundo para o Pai, e havendo amado os seus que estavam no mundo, amou-os at\xe9 o fim."},{verse:2,en:"And supper being ended, the devil having now put into the heart of Judas Iscariot, Simon\u2019s son, to betray him;",pt:"Enquanto ceavam, tendo j\xe1 o Diabo posto no cora\xe7\xe3o de Judas, filho de Sim\xe3o Iscariotes, que o tra\xedsse,"},{verse:3,en:"Jesus knowing that the Father had given all things into his hands, and that he was come from God, and went to God;",pt:"Jesus, sabendo que o Pai lhe entregara tudo nas m\xe3os, e que viera de Deus e para Deus voltava,"},{verse:4,en:"He riseth from supper, and laid aside his garments; and took a towel, and girded himself.",pt:"levantou-se da ceia, tirou o manto e, tomando uma toalha, cingiu-se."},{verse:5,en:"After that he poureth water into a bason, and began to wash the disciples\u2019 feet, and to wipe them with the towel wherewith he was girded.",pt:"Depois deitou \xe1gua na bacia e come\xe7ou a lavar os p\xe9s aos disc\xedpulos, e a enxugar-lhos com a toalha com que estava cingido."},{verse:6,en:"Then cometh he to Simon Peter: and Peter saith unto him, Lord, dost thou wash my feet?",pt:"Chegou, pois, a Sim\xe3o Pedro, que lhe disse: Senhor, lavas-me os p\xe9s a mim?"},{verse:7,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, What I do thou knowest not now; but thou shalt know hereafter.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: O que eu fa\xe7o, tu n\xe3o o sabes agora; mas depois o entender\xe1s."},{verse:8,en:"Peter saith unto him, Thou shalt never wash my feet. Jesus answered him, If I wash thee not, thou hast no part with me.",pt:"Tornou-lhe Pedro: Nunca me lavar\xe1s os p\xe9s. Replicou-lhe Jesus: Se eu n\xe3o te lavar, n\xe3o tens parte comigo."},{verse:9,en:"Simon Peter saith unto him, Lord, not my feet only, but also my hands and my head.",pt:"Disse-lhe Sim\xe3o Pedro: Senhor, n\xe3o somente os meus p\xe9s, mas tamb\xe9m as m\xe3os e a cabe\xe7a."},{verse:10,en:"Jesus saith to him, He that is washed needeth not save to wash his feet, but is clean every whit: and ye are clean, but not all.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Aquele que se banhou n\xe3o necessita de lavar sen\xe3o os p\xe9s, pois no mais est\xe1 todo limpo; e v\xf3s estais limpos, mas n\xe3o todos."},{verse:11,en:"For he knew who should betray him; therefore said he, Ye are not all clean.",pt:"Pois ele sabia quem o estava traindo; por isso disse: Nem todos estais limpos."},{verse:12,en:"So after he had washed their feet, and had taken his garments, and was set down again, he said unto them, Know ye what I have done to you?",pt:"Ora, depois de lhes ter lavado os p\xe9s, tomou o manto, tornou a reclinar-se \xe0 mesa e perguntou-lhes: Entendeis o que vos tenho feito?"},{verse:13,en:"Ye call me Master and Lord: and ye say well; for so I am.",pt:"V\xf3s me chamais Mestre e Senhor; e dizeis bem, porque eu o sou."},{verse:14,en:"If I then, your Lord and Master, have washed your feet; ye also ought to wash one another\u2019s feet.",pt:"Ora, se eu, o Senhor e Mestre, vos lavei os p\xe9s, tamb\xe9m v\xf3s deveis lavar os p\xe9s uns aos outros."},{verse:15,en:"For I have given you an example, that ye should do as I have done to you.",pt:"Porque eu vos dei exemplo, para que, como eu vos fiz, fa\xe7ais v\xf3s tamb\xe9m."},{verse:16,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, The servant is not greater than his lord; neither he that is sent greater than he that sent him.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: N\xe3o \xe9 o servo maior do que o seu senhor, nem o enviado maior do que aquele que o enviou."},{verse:17,en:"If ye know these things, happy are ye if ye do them.",pt:"Se sabeis estas coisas, bem-aventurados sois se as praticardes."},{verse:18,en:"I speak not of you all: I know whom I have chosen: but that the scripture may be fulfilled, He that eateth bread with me hath lifted up his heel against me.",pt:"N\xe3o falo de todos v\xf3s; eu conhe\xe7o aqueles que escolhi; mas para que se cumprisse a escritura: O que comia do meu p\xe3o, levantou contra mim o seu calcanhar."},{verse:19,en:"Now I tell you before it come, that, when it is come to pass, ye may believe that I am he.",pt:"Desde j\xe1 no-lo digo, antes que suceda, para que, quando suceder, creiais que eu sou."},{verse:20,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that receiveth whomsoever I send receiveth me; and he that receiveth me receiveth him that sent me.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Quem receber aquele que eu enviar, a mim me recebe; e quem me recebe a mim, recebe aquele que me enviou."},{verse:21,en:"When Jesus had thus said, he was troubled in spirit, and testified, and said, Verily, verily, I say unto you, that one of you shall betray me.",pt:"Tendo Jesus dito isto, turbou-se em esp\xedrito, e declarou: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que um de v\xf3s me h\xe1 de trair."},{verse:22,en:"Then the disciples looked one on another, doubting of whom he spake.",pt:"Os disc\xedpulos se entreolhavam, perplexos, sem saber de quem ele falava."},{verse:23,en:"Now there was leaning on Jesus\u2019 bosom one of his disciples, whom Jesus loved.",pt:"Ora, achava-se reclinado sobre o peito de Jesus um de seus disc\xedpulos, aquele a quem Jesus amava."},{verse:24,en:"Simon Peter therefore beckoned to him, that he should ask who it should be of whom he spake.",pt:"A esse, pois, fez Sim\xe3o Pedro sinal, e lhe pediu: Pergunta- lhe de quem \xe9 que fala."},{verse:25,en:"He then lying on Jesus\u2019 breast saith unto him, Lord, who is it?",pt:"Aquele disc\xedpulo, recostando-se assim ao peito de Jesus, perguntou-lhe: Senhor, quem \xe9?"},{verse:26,en:"Jesus answered, He it is, to whom I shall give a sop, when I have dipped it. And when he had dipped the sop, he gave it to Judas Iscariot, the son of Simon.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: \xc9 aquele a quem eu der o peda\xe7o de p\xe3o molhado. Tendo, pois, molhado um bocado de p\xe3o, deu-o a Judas, filho de Sim\xe3o Iscariotes."},{verse:27,en:"And after the sop Satan entered into him. Then said Jesus unto him, That thou doest, do quickly.",pt:"E, logo ap\xf3s o bocado, entrou nele Satan\xe1s. Disse-lhe, pois, Jesus: O que fazes, faze-o depressa."},{verse:28,en:"Now no man at the table knew for what intent he spake this unto him.",pt:"E nenhum dos que estavam \xe0 mesa percebeu a que prop\xf3sito lhe disse isto;"},{verse:29,en:"For some of them thought, because Judas had the bag, that Jesus had said unto him, Buy those things that we have need of against the feast; or, that he should give something to the poor.",pt:"pois, como Judas tinha a bolsa, pensavam alguns que Jesus lhe queria dizer: Compra o que nos \xe9 necess\xe1rio para a festa; ou, que desse alguma coisa aos pobres."},{verse:30,en:"He then having received the sop went immediately out: and it was night.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele, tendo recebido o bocado saiu logo. E era noite."},{verse:31,en:"Therefore, when he was gone out, Jesus said, Now is the Son of man glorified, and God is glorified in him.",pt:"Tendo ele, pois, sa\xeddo, disse Jesus: Agora \xe9 glorificado o Filho do homem, e Deus \xe9 glorificado nele;"},{verse:32,en:"If God be glorified in him, God shall also glorify him in himself, and shall straightway glorify him.",pt:"se Deus \xe9 glorificado nele, tamb\xe9m Deus o glorificar\xe1 em si mesmo, e logo o h\xe1 de glorificar."},{verse:33,en:"Little children, yet a little while I am with you. Ye shall seek me: and as I said unto the Jews, Whither I go, ye cannot come; so now I say to you.",pt:"Filhinhos, ainda por um pouco estou convosco. Procurar-me- eis; e, como eu disse aos judeus, tamb\xe9m a v\xf3s o digo agora: Para onde eu vou, n\xe3o podeis v\xf3s ir."},{verse:34,en:"A new commandment I give unto you, That ye love one another; as I have loved you, that ye also love one another.",pt:"Um novo mandamento vos dou: que vos ameis uns aos outros; assim como eu vos amei a v\xf3s, que tamb\xe9m v\xf3s vos ameis uns aos outros."},{verse:35,en:"By this shall all men know that ye are my disciples, if ye have love one to another.",pt:"Nisto conhecer\xe3o todos que sois meus disc\xedpulos, se tiverdes amor uns aos outros."},{verse:36,en:"Simon Peter said unto him, Lord, whither goest thou? Jesus answered him, Whither I go, thou canst not follow me now; but thou shalt follow me afterwards.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Sim\xe3o Pedro: Senhor, para onde vais? Respondeu Jesus; Para onde eu vou, n\xe3o podes agora seguir-me; mais tarde, por\xe9m, me seguir\xe1s."},{verse:37,en:"Peter said unto him, Lord, why cannot I follow thee now? I will lay down my life for thy sake.",pt:"Disse-lhe Pedro: Por que n\xe3o posso seguir-te agora? Por ti darei a minha vida."},{verse:38,en:"Jesus answered him, Wilt thou lay down thy life for my sake? Verily, verily, I say unto thee, The cock shall not crow, till thou hast denied me thrice.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Dar\xe1s a tua vida por mim? Em verdade, em verdade te digo: N\xe3o cantar\xe1 o galo at\xe9 que me tenhas negado tr\xeas vezes."}]}}),676,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Let not your heart be troubled: ye believe in God, believe also in me.",pt:"N\xe3o se turbe o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o; credes em Deus, crede tamb\xe9m em mim."},{verse:2,en:"In my Father\u2019s house are many mansions: if it were not so, I would have told you. I go to prepare a place for you.",pt:"Na casa de meu Pai h\xe1 muitas moradas; se n\xe3o fosse assim, eu vo-lo teria dito; vou preparar-vos lugar."},{verse:3,en:"And if I go and prepare a place for you, I will come again, and receive you unto myself; that where I am, there ye may be also.",pt:"E, se eu for e vos preparar lugar, virei outra vez, e vos tomarei para mim mesmo, para que onde eu estiver estejais v\xf3s tamb\xe9m."},{verse:4,en:"And whither I go ye know, and the way ye know.",pt:"E para onde eu vou v\xf3s conheceis o caminho."},{verse:5,en:"Thomas saith unto him, Lord, we know not whither thou goest; and how can we know the way?",pt:"Disse-lhe Tom\xe9: Senhor, n\xe3o sabemos para onde vais; e como podemos saber o caminho?"},{verse:6,en:"Jesus saith unto him, I am the way, the truth, and the life: no man cometh unto the Father, but by me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Eu sou o caminho, e a verdade, e a vida; ningu\xe9m vem ao Pai, sen\xe3o por mim."},{verse:7,en:"If ye had known me, ye should have known my Father also: and from henceforth ye know him, and have seen him.",pt:"Se v\xf3s me conhec\xeasseis a mim, tamb\xe9m conhecer\xedeis a meu Pai; e j\xe1 desde agora o conheceis, e o tendes visto."},{verse:8,en:"Philip saith unto him, Lord, shew us the Father, and it sufficeth us.",pt:"Disse-lhe Felipe: Senhor, mostra-nos o Pai, e isso nos basta."},{verse:9,en:"Jesus saith unto him, Have I been so long time with you, and yet hast thou not known me, Philip? he that hath seen me hath seen the Father; and how sayest thou then, Shew us the Father?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: H\xe1 tanto tempo que estou convosco, e ainda n\xe3o me conheces, Felipe? Quem me viu a mim, viu o Pai; como dizes tu: Mostra-nos o Pai?"},{verse:10,en:"Believest thou not that I am in the Father, and the Father in me? the words that I speak unto you I speak not of myself: but the Father that dwelleth in me, he doeth the works.",pt:"N\xe3o cr\xeas tu que eu estou no Pai, e que o Pai est\xe1 em mim? As palavras que eu vos digo, n\xe3o as digo por mim mesmo; mas o Pai, que permanece em mim, \xe9 quem faz as suas obras."},{verse:11,en:"Believe me that I am in the Father, and the Father in me: or else believe me for the very works\u2019 sake.",pt:"Crede-me que eu estou no Pai, e que o Pai est\xe1 em mim; crede ao menos por causa das mesmas obras."},{verse:12,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that believeth on me, the works that I do shall he do also; and greater works than these shall he do; because I go unto my Father.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Aquele que cr\xea em mim, esse tamb\xe9m far\xe1 as obras que eu fa\xe7o, e as far\xe1 maiores do que estas; porque eu vou para o Pai;"},{verse:13,en:"And whatsoever ye shall ask in my name, that will I do, that the Father may be glorified in the Son.",pt:"e tudo quanto pedirdes em meu nome, eu o farei, para que o Pai seja glorificado no Filho."},{verse:14,en:"If ye shall ask any thing in my name, I will do it.",pt:"Se me pedirdes alguma coisa em meu nome, eu a farei."},{verse:15,en:"If ye love me, keep my commandments.",pt:"Se me amardes, guardareis os meus mandamentos."},{verse:16,en:"And I will pray the Father, and he shall give you another Comforter, that he may abide with you for ever;",pt:"E eu rogarei ao Pai, e ele vos dar\xe1 outro Ajudador, para que fique convosco para sempre."},{verse:17,en:"Even the Spirit of truth; whom the world cannot receive, because it seeth him not, neither knoweth him: but ye know him; for he dwelleth with you, and shall be in you.",pt:"a saber, o Esp\xedrito da verdade, o qual o mundo n\xe3o pode receber; porque n\xe3o o v\xea nem o conhece; mas v\xf3s o conheceis, porque ele habita convosco, e estar\xe1 em v\xf3s."},{verse:18,en:"I will not leave you comfortless: I will come to you.",pt:"N\xe3o vos deixarei \xf3rf\xe3os; voltarei a v\xf3s."},{verse:19,en:"Yet a little while, and the world seeth me no more; but ye see me: because I live, ye shall live also.",pt:"Ainda um pouco, e o mundo n\xe3o me ver\xe1 mais; mas v\xf3s me vereis, porque eu vivo, e v\xf3s vivereis."},{verse:20,en:"At that day ye shall know that I am in my Father, and ye in me, and I in you.",pt:"Naquele dia conhecereis que estou em meu Pai, e v\xf3s em mim, e eu em v\xf3s."},{verse:21,en:"He that hath my commandments, and keepeth them, he it is that loveth me: and he that loveth me shall be loved of my Father, and I will love him, and will manifest myself to him.",pt:"Aquele que tem os meus mandamentos e os guarda, esse \xe9 o que me ama; e aquele que me ama ser\xe1 amado de meu Pai, e eu o amarei, e me manifestarei a ele."},{verse:22,en:"Judas saith unto him, not Iscariot, Lord, how is it that thou wilt manifest thyself unto us, and not unto the world?",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Judas (n\xe3o o Iscariotes): O que houve, Senhor, que te h\xe1s de manifestar a n\xf3s, e n\xe3o ao mundo?"},{verse:23,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, If a man love me, he will keep my words: and my Father will love him, and we will come unto him, and make our abode with him.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Se algu\xe9m me amar, guardar\xe1 a minha palavra; e meu Pai o amar\xe1, e viremos a ele, e faremos nele morada."},{verse:24,en:"He that loveth me not keepeth not my sayings: and the word which ye hear is not mine, but the Father\u2019s which sent me.",pt:"Quem n\xe3o me ama, n\xe3o guarda as minhas palavras; ora, a palavra que estais ouvindo n\xe3o \xe9 minha, mas do Pai que me enviou."},{verse:25,en:"These things have I spoken unto you, being yet present with you.",pt:"Estas coisas vos tenho falado, estando ainda convosco."},{verse:26,en:"But the Comforter, which is the Holy Ghost, whom the Father will send in my name, he shall teach you all things, and bring all things to your remembrance, whatsoever I have said unto you.",pt:"Mas o Ajudador, o Esp\xedrito Santo a quem o Pai enviar\xe1 em meu nome, esse vos ensinar\xe1 todas as coisas, e vos far\xe1 lembrar de tudo quanto eu vos tenho dito."},{verse:27,en:"Peace I leave with you, my peace I give unto you: not as the world giveth, give I unto you. Let not your heart be troubled, neither let it be afraid.",pt:"Deixo-vos a paz, a minha paz vos dou; eu n\xe3o vo-la dou como o mundo a d\xe1. N\xe3o se turbe o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o, nem se atemorize."},{verse:28,en:"Ye have heard how I said unto you, I go away, and come again unto you. If ye loved me, ye would rejoice, because I said, I go unto the Father: for my Father is greater than I.",pt:"Ouvistes que eu vos disse: Vou, e voltarei a v\xf3s. Se me am\xe1sseis, alegrar-vos-\xedeis de que eu v\xe1 para o Pai; porque o Pai \xe9 maior do que eu."},{verse:29,en:"And now I have told you before it come to pass, that, when it is come to pass, ye might believe.",pt:"Eu vo-lo disse agora, antes que aconte\xe7a, para que, quando acontecer, v\xf3s creiais."},{verse:30,en:"Hereafter I will not talk much with you: for the prince of this world cometh, and hath nothing in me.",pt:"J\xe1 n\xe3o falarei muito convosco, porque vem o pr\xedncipe deste mundo, e ele nada tem em mim;"},{verse:31,en:"But that the world may know that I love the Father; and as the Father gave me commandment, even so I do. Arise, let us go hence.",pt:"mas, assim como o Pai me ordenou, assim mesmo fa\xe7o, para que o mundo saiba que eu amo o Pai. Levantai-vos, vamo-nos daqui."}]}}),677,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I am the true vine, and my Father is the husbandman.",pt:"Eu sou a videira verdadeira, e meu Pai \xe9 o viticultor."},{verse:2,en:"Every branch in me that beareth not fruit he taketh away: and every branch that beareth fruit, he purgeth it, that it may bring forth more fruit.",pt:"Toda vara em mim que n\xe3o d\xe1 fruto, ele a corta; e toda vara que d\xe1 fruto, ele a limpa, para que d\xea mais fruto."},{verse:3,en:"Now ye are clean through the word which I have spoken unto you.",pt:"V\xf3s j\xe1 estais limpos pela palavra que vos tenho falado."},{verse:4,en:"Abide in me, and I in you. As the branch cannot bear fruit of itself, except it abide in the vine; no more can ye, except ye abide in me.",pt:"Permanecei em mim, e eu permanecerei em v\xf3s; como a vara de si mesma n\xe3o pode dar fruto, se n\xe3o permanecer na videira, assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s, se n\xe3o permanecerdes em mim."},{verse:5,en:"I am the vine, ye are the branches: He that abideth in me, and I in him, the same bringeth forth much fruit: for without me ye can do nothing.",pt:"Eu sou a videira; v\xf3s sois as varas. Quem permanece em mim e eu nele, esse d\xe1 muito fruto; porque sem mim nada podeis fazer."},{verse:6,en:"If a man abide not in me, he is cast forth as a branch, and is withered; and men gather them, and cast them into the fire, and they are burned.",pt:"Quem n\xe3o permanece em mim \xe9 lan\xe7ado fora, como a vara, e seca; tais varas s\xe3o recolhidas, lan\xe7adas no fogo e queimadas."},{verse:7,en:"If ye abide in me, and my words abide in you, ye shall ask what ye will, and it shall be done unto you.",pt:"Se v\xf3s permanecerdes em mim, e as minhas palavras permanecerem em v\xf3s, pedi o que quiserdes, e vos ser\xe1 feito."},{verse:8,en:"Herein is my Father glorified, that ye bear much fruit; so shall ye be my disciples.",pt:"Nisto \xe9 glorificado meu Pai, que deis muito fruto; e assim sereis meus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:9,en:"As the Father hath loved me, so have I loved you: continue ye in my love.",pt:"Como o Pai me amou, assim tamb\xe9m eu vos amei; permanecei no meu amor."},{verse:10,en:"If ye keep my commandments, ye shall abide in my love; even as I have kept my Father\u2019s commandments, and abide in his love.",pt:"Se guardardes os meus mandamentos, permanecereis no meu amor; do mesmo modo que eu tenho guardado os mandamentos de meu Pai, e permane\xe7o no seu amor."},{verse:11,en:"These things have I spoken unto you, that my joy might remain in you, and that your joy might be full.",pt:"Estas coisas vos tenho dito, para que o meu gozo permane\xe7a em v\xf3s, e o vosso gozo seja completo."},{verse:12,en:"This is my commandment, That ye love one another, as I have loved you.",pt:"O meu mandamento \xe9 este: Que vos ameis uns aos outros, assim como eu vos amei."},{verse:13,en:"Greater love hath no man than this, that a man lay down his life for his friends.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m tem maior amor do que este, de dar algu\xe9m a sua vida pelos seus amigos."},{verse:14,en:"Ye are my friends, if ye do whatsoever I command you.",pt:"V\xf3s sois meus amigos, se fizerdes o que eu vos mando."},{verse:15,en:"Henceforth I call you not servants; for the servant knoweth not what his lord doeth: but I have called you friends; for all things that I have heard of my Father I have made known unto you.",pt:"J\xe1 n\xe3o vos chamo servos, porque o servo n\xe3o sabe o que faz o seu senhor; mas chamei-vos amigos, porque tudo quanto ouvi de meu Pai vos dei a conhecer."},{verse:16,en:"Ye have not chosen me, but I have chosen you, and ordained you, that ye should go and bring forth fruit, and that your fruit should remain: that whatsoever ye shall ask of the Father in my name, he may give it you.",pt:"V\xf3s n\xe3o me escolhestes a mim mas eu vos escolhi a v\xf3s, e vos designei, para que vades e deis frutos, e o vosso fruto permane\xe7a, a fim de que tudo quanto pedirdes ao Pai em meu nome, ele vo-lo conceda."},{verse:17,en:"These things I command you, that ye love one another.",pt:"Isto vos mando: que vos ameis uns aos outros."},{verse:18,en:"If the world hate you, ye know that it hated me before it hated you.",pt:"Se o mundo vos odeia, sabei que, primeiro do que a v\xf3s, me odiou a mim."},{verse:19,en:"If ye were of the world, the world would love his own: but because ye are not of the world, but I have chosen you out of the world, therefore the world hateth you.",pt:"Se f\xf4sseis do mundo, o mundo amaria o que era seu; mas, porque n\xe3o sois do mundo, antes eu vos escolhi do mundo, por isso \xe9 que o mundo vos odeia."},{verse:20,en:"Remember the word that I said unto you, The servant is not greater than his lord. If they have persecuted me, they will also persecute you; if they have kept my saying, they will keep yours also.",pt:"Lembrai-vos da palavra que eu vos disse: N\xe3o \xe9 o servo maior do que o seu senhor. Se a mim me perseguiram, tamb\xe9m vos perseguir\xe3o a v\xf3s; se guardaram a minha palavra, guardar\xe3o tamb\xe9m a vossa."},{verse:21,en:"But all these things will they do unto you for my name\u2019s sake, because they know not him that sent me.",pt:"Mas tudo isto vos far\xe3o por causa do meu nome, porque n\xe3o conhecem aquele que me enviou."},{verse:22,en:"If I had not come and spoken unto them, they had not had sin: but now they have no cloke for their sin.",pt:"Se eu n\xe3o viera e n\xe3o lhes falara, n\xe3o teriam pecado; agora, por\xe9m, n\xe3o t\xeam desculpa do seu pecado."},{verse:23,en:"He that hateth me hateth my Father also.",pt:"Aquele que me odeia a mim, odeia tamb\xe9m a meu Pai."},{verse:24,en:"If I had not done among them the works which none other man did, they had not had sin: but now have they both seen and hated both me and my Father.",pt:"Se eu entre eles n\xe3o tivesse feito tais obras, quais nenhum outro fez, n\xe3o teriam pecado; mas agora, n\xe3o somente viram, mas tamb\xe9m odiaram tanto a mim como a meu Pai."},{verse:25,en:"But this cometh to pass, that the word might be fulfilled that is written in their law, They hated me without a cause.",pt:"Mas isto \xe9 para que se cumpra a palavra que est\xe1 escrita na sua lei: Odiaram-me sem causa."},{verse:26,en:"But when the Comforter is come, whom I will send unto you from the Father, even the Spirit of truth, which proceedeth from the Father, he shall testify of me:",pt:"Quando vier o Ajudador, que eu vos enviarei da parte do Pai, o Esp\xedrito da verdade, que do Pai procede, esse dar\xe1 testemunho de mim;"},{verse:27,en:"And ye also shall bear witness, because ye have been with me from the beginning.",pt:"e tamb\xe9m v\xf3s dareis testemunho, porque estais comigo desde o princ\xedpio."}]}}),678,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"These things have I spoken unto you, that ye should not be offended.",pt:"Tenho-vos dito estas coisas para que n\xe3o vos escandalizeis."},{verse:2,en:"They shall put you out of the synagogues: yea, the time cometh, that whosoever killeth you will think that he doeth God service.",pt:"Expulsar-vos-\xe3o das sinagogas; ainda mais, vem a hora em que qualquer que vos matar julgar\xe1 prestar um servi\xe7o a Deus."},{verse:3,en:"And these things will they do unto you, because they have not known the Father, nor me.",pt:"E isto vos far\xe3o, porque n\xe3o conheceram ao Pai nem a mim."},{verse:4,en:"But these things have I told you, that when the time shall come, ye may remember that I told you of them. And these things I said not unto you at the beginning, because I was with you.",pt:"Mas tenho-vos dito estas coisas, a fim de que, quando chegar aquela hora, vos lembreis de que eu vo-las tinha dito. N\xe3o vo-las disse desde o princ\xedpio, porque estava convosco."},{verse:5,en:"But now I go my way to him that sent me; and none of you asketh me, Whither goest thou?",pt:"Agora, por\xe9m, vou para aquele que me enviou; e nenhum de v\xf3s me pergunta: Para onde vais?"},{verse:6,en:"But because I have said these things unto you, sorrow hath filled your heart.",pt:"Antes, porque vos disse isto, o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o se encheu de tristeza."},{verse:7,en:"Nevertheless I tell you the truth; It is expedient for you that I go away: for if I go not away, the Comforter will not come unto you; but if I depart, I will send him unto you.",pt:"Todavia, digo-vos a verdade, conv\xe9m-vos que eu v\xe1; pois se eu n\xe3o for, o Ajudador n\xe3o vir\xe1 a v\xf3s; mas, se eu for, vo-lo enviarei."},{verse:8,en:"And when he is come, he will reprove the world of sin, and of righteousness, and of judgment:",pt:"E quando ele vier, convencer\xe1 o mundo do pecado, da justi\xe7a e do ju\xedzo:"},{verse:9,en:"Of sin, because they believe not on me;",pt:"do pecado, porque n\xe3o cr\xeaem em mim;"},{verse:10,en:"Of righteousness, because I go to my Father, and ye see me no more;",pt:"da justi\xe7a, porque vou para meu Pai, e n\xe3o me vereis mais,"},{verse:11,en:"Of judgment, because the prince of this world is judged.",pt:"e do ju\xedzo, porque o pr\xedncipe deste mundo j\xe1 est\xe1 julgado."},{verse:12,en:"I have yet many things to say unto you, but ye cannot bear them now.",pt:"Ainda tenho muito que vos dizer; mas v\xf3s n\xe3o o podeis suportar agora."},{verse:13,en:"Howbeit when he, the Spirit of truth, is come, he will guide you into all truth: for he shall not speak of himself; but whatsoever he shall hear, that shall he speak: and he will shew you things to come.",pt:"Quando vier, por\xe9m, aquele, o Esp\xedrito da verdade, ele vos guiar\xe1 a toda a verdade; porque n\xe3o falar\xe1 por si mesmo, mas dir\xe1 o que tiver ouvido, e vos anunciar\xe1 as coisas vindouras."},{verse:14,en:"He shall glorify me: for he shall receive of mine, and shall shew it unto you.",pt:"Ele me glorificar\xe1, porque receber\xe1 do que \xe9 meu, e vo-lo anunciar\xe1."},{verse:15,en:"All things that the Father hath are mine: therefore said I, that he shall take of mine, and shall shew it unto you.",pt:"Tudo quanto o Pai tem \xe9 meu; por isso eu vos disse que ele, recebendo do que \xe9 meu, vo-lo anunciar\xe1."},{verse:16,en:"A little while, and ye shall not see me: and again, a little while, and ye shall see me, because I go to the Father.",pt:"Um pouco, e j\xe1 n\xe3o me vereis; e outra vez um pouco, e ver-me-eis."},{verse:17,en:"Then said some of his disciples among themselves, What is this that he saith unto us, A little while, and ye shall not see me: and again, a little while, and ye shall see me: and, Because I go to the Father?",pt:"Ent\xe3o alguns dos seus disc\xedpulos perguntaram uns para os outros: Que \xe9 isto que nos diz? Um pouco, e n\xe3o me vereis; e outra vez um pouco, e ver-me-eis; e: Porquanto vou para o Pai?"},{verse:18,en:"They said therefore, What is this that he saith, A little while? we cannot tell what he saith.",pt:"Diziam pois: Que quer dizer isto: Um pouco? N\xe3o compreendemos o que ele est\xe1 dizendo."},{verse:19,en:"Now Jesus knew that they were desirous to ask him, and said unto them, Do ye enquire among yourselves of that I said, A little while, and ye shall not see me: and again, a little while, and ye shall see me?",pt:"Percebeu Jesus que o queriam interrogar, e disse-lhes: Indagais entre v\xf3s acerca disto que disse: Um pouco, e n\xe3o me vereis; e outra vez um pouco, e ver-me-eis?"},{verse:20,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, That ye shall weep and lament, but the world shall rejoice: and ye shall be sorrowful, but your sorrow shall be turned into joy.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade, vos digo que v\xf3s chorareis e vos lamentareis, mas o mundo se alegrar\xe1; v\xf3s estareis tristes, por\xe9m a vossa tristeza se converter\xe1 em alegria."},{verse:21,en:"A woman when she is in travail hath sorrow, because her hour is come: but as soon as she is delivered of the child, she remembereth no more the anguish, for joy that a man is born into the world.",pt:"A mulher, quando est\xe1 para dar \xe0 luz, sente tristeza porque \xe9 chegada a sua hora; mas, depois de ter dado \xe0 luz a crian\xe7a, j\xe1 n\xe3o se lembra da afli\xe7\xe3o, pelo gozo de haver um homem nascido ao mundo."},{verse:22,en:"And ye now therefore have sorrow: but I will see you again, and your heart shall rejoice, and your joy no man taketh from you.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s agora, na verdade, tendes tristeza; mas eu vos tornarei a ver, e alegrar-se-\xe1 o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o, e a vossa alegria ningu\xe9m vo-la tirar\xe1."},{verse:23,en:"And in that day ye shall ask me nothing. Verily, verily, I say unto you, Whatsoever ye shall ask the Father in my name, he will give it you.",pt:"Naquele dia nada me perguntareis. Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que tudo quanto pedirdes ao Pai, ele vo-lo conceder\xe1 em meu nome."},{verse:24,en:"Hitherto have ye asked nothing in my name: ask, and ye shall receive, that your joy may be full.",pt:"At\xe9 agora nada pedistes em meu nome; pedi, e recebereis, para que o vosso gozo seja completo."},{verse:25,en:"These things have I spoken unto you in proverbs: but the time cometh, when I shall no more speak unto you in proverbs, but I shall shew you plainly of the Father.",pt:"Disse-vos estas coisas por figuras; chega, por\xe9m, a hora em que vos n\xe3o falarei mais por figuras, mas abertamente vos falarei acerca do Pai."},{verse:26,en:"At that day ye shall ask in my name: and I say not unto you, that I will pray the Father for you:",pt:"Naquele dia pedireis em meu nome, e n\xe3o vos digo que eu rogarei por v\xf3s ao Pai;"},{verse:27,en:"For the Father himself loveth you, because ye have loved me, and have believed that I came out from God.",pt:"pois o Pai mesmo vos ama; visto que v\xf3s me amastes e crestes que eu sa\xed de Deus."},{verse:28,en:"I came forth from the Father, and am come into the world: again, I leave the world, and go to the Father.",pt:"Sa\xed do Pai, e vim ao mundo; outra vez deixo o mundo, e vou para o Pai."},{verse:29,en:"His disciples said unto him, Lo, now speakest thou plainly, and speakest no proverb.",pt:"Disseram os seus disc\xedpulos: Eis que agora falas abertamente, e n\xe3o por figura alguma."},{verse:30,en:"Now are we sure that thou knowest all things, and needest not that any man should ask thee: by this we believe that thou camest forth from God.",pt:"Agora conhecemos que sabes todas as coisas, e n\xe3o necessitas de que algu\xe9m te interrogue. Por isso cremos que sa\xedste de Deus."},{verse:31,en:"Jesus answered them, Do ye now believe?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Credes agora?"},{verse:32,en:"Behold, the hour cometh, yea, is now come, that ye shall be scattered, every man to his own, and shall leave me alone: and yet I am not alone, because the Father is with me.",pt:"Eis que vem a hora, e j\xe1 \xe9 chegada, em que v\xf3s sereis dispersos cada um para o seu lado, e me deixareis s\xf3; mas n\xe3o estou s\xf3, porque o Pai est\xe1 comigo."},{verse:33,en:"These things I have spoken unto you, that in me ye might have peace. In the world ye shall have tribulation: but be of good cheer; I have overcome the world.",pt:"Tenho-vos dito estas coisas, para que em mim tenhais paz. No mundo tereis tribula\xe7\xf5es; mas tende bom \xe2nimo, eu venci o mundo."}]}}),679,[]);
__d((function(e,t,a,o,s,h,n){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:17,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"These words spake Jesus, and lifted up his eyes to heaven, and said, Father, the hour is come; glorify thy Son, that thy Son also may glorify thee:",pt:"Depois de assim falar, Jesus, levantando os olhos ao c\xe9u, disse: Pai, \xe9 chegada a hora; glorifica a teu Filho, para que tamb\xe9m o Filho te glorifique;"},{verse:2,en:"As thou hast given him power over all flesh, that he should give eternal life to as many as thou hast given him.",pt:"assim como lhe deste autoridade sobre toda a carne, para que d\xea a vida eterna a todos aqueles que lhe tens dado."},{verse:3,en:"And this is life eternal, that they might know thee the only true God, and Jesus Christ, whom thou hast sent.",pt:"E a vida eterna \xe9 esta: que te conhe\xe7am a ti, como o \xfanico Deus verdadeiro, e a Jesus Cristo, aquele que tu enviaste."},{verse:4,en:"I have glorified thee on the earth: I have finished the work which thou gavest me to do.",pt:"Eu te glorifiquei na terra, completando a obra que me deste para fazer."},{verse:5,en:"And now, O Father, glorify thou me with thine own self with the glory which I had with thee before the world was.",pt:"Agora, pois, glorifica-me tu, \xf3 Pai, junto de ti mesmo, com aquela gl\xf3ria que eu tinha contigo antes que o mundo existisse."},{verse:6,en:"I have manifested thy name unto the men which thou gavest me out of the world: thine they were, and thou gavest them me; and they have kept thy word.",pt:"Manifestei o teu nome aos homens que do mundo me deste. Eram teus, e tu mos deste; e guardaram a tua palavra."},{verse:7,en:"Now they have known that all things whatsoever thou hast given me are of thee.",pt:"Agora sabem que tudo quanto me deste prov\xe9m de ti;"},{verse:8,en:"For I have given unto them the words which thou gavest me; and they have received them, and have known surely that I came out from thee, and they have believed that thou didst send me.",pt:"porque eu lhes dei as palavras que tu me deste, e eles as receberam, e verdadeiramente conheceram que sa\xed de ti, e creram que tu me enviaste."},{verse:9,en:"I pray for them: I pray not for the world, but for them which thou hast given me; for they are thine.",pt:"Eu rogo por eles; n\xe3o rogo pelo mundo, mas por aqueles que me tens dado, porque s\xe3o teus;"},{verse:10,en:"And all mine are thine, and thine are mine; and I am glorified in them.",pt:"todas as minhas coisas s\xe3o tuas, e as tuas coisas s\xe3o minhas; e neles sou glorificado."},{verse:11,en:"And now I am no more in the world, but these are in the world, and I come to thee. Holy Father, keep through thine own name those whom thou hast given me, that they may be one, as we are.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o estou mais no mundo; mas eles est\xe3o no mundo, e eu vou para ti. Pai santo, guarda-os no teu nome, o qual me deste, para que eles sejam um, assim como n\xf3s."},{verse:12,en:"While I was with them in the world, I kept them in thy name: those that thou gavest me I have kept, and none of them is lost, but the son of perdition; that the scripture might be fulfilled.",pt:"Enquanto eu estava com eles, eu os guardava no teu nome que me deste; e os conservei, e nenhum deles se perdeu, sen\xe3o o filho da perdi\xe7\xe3o, para que se cumprisse a Escritura."},{verse:13,en:"And now come I to thee; and these things I speak in the world, that they might have my joy fulfilled in themselves.",pt:"Mas agora vou para ti; e isto falo no mundo, para que eles tenham a minha alegria completa em si mesmos."},{verse:14,en:"I have given them thy word; and the world hath hated them, because they are not of the world, even as I am not of the world.",pt:"Eu lhes dei a tua palavra; e o mundo os odiou, porque n\xe3o s\xe3o do mundo, assim como eu n\xe3o sou do mundo."},{verse:15,en:"I pray not that thou shouldest take them out of the world, but that thou shouldest keep them from the evil.",pt:"N\xe3o rogo que os tires do mundo, mas que os guardes do Maligno."},{verse:16,en:"They are not of the world, even as I am not of the world.",pt:"Eles n\xe3o s\xe3o do mundo, assim como eu n\xe3o sou do mundo."},{verse:17,en:"Sanctify them through thy truth: thy word is truth.",pt:"Santifica-os na verdade, a tua palavra \xe9 a verdade."},{verse:18,en:"As thou hast sent me into the world, even so have I also sent them into the world.",pt:"Assim como tu me enviaste ao mundo, tamb\xe9m eu os enviarei ao mundo."},{verse:19,en:"And for their sakes I sanctify myself, that they also might be sanctified through the truth.",pt:"E por eles eu me santifico, para que tamb\xe9m eles sejam santificados na verdade."},{verse:20,en:"Neither pray I for these alone, but for them also which shall believe on me through their word;",pt:"E rogo n\xe3o somente por estes, mas tamb\xe9m por aqueles que pela sua palavra h\xe3o de crer em mim;"},{verse:21,en:"That they all may be one; as thou, Father, art in me, and I in thee, that they also may be one in us: that the world may believe that thou hast sent me.",pt:"para que todos sejam um; assim como tu, \xf3 Pai, \xe9s em mim, e eu em ti, que tamb\xe9m eles sejam um em n\xf3s; para que o mundo creia que tu me enviaste."},{verse:22,en:"And the glory which thou gavest me I have given them; that they may be one, even as we are one:",pt:"E eu lhes dei a gl\xf3ria que a mim me deste, para que sejam um, como n\xf3s somos um;"},{verse:23,en:"I in them, and thou in me, that they may be made perfect in one; and that the world may know that thou hast sent me, and hast loved them, as thou hast loved me.",pt:"eu neles, e tu em mim, para que eles sejam perfeitos em unidade, a fim de que o mundo conhe\xe7a que tu me enviaste, e que os amaste a eles, assim como me amaste a mim."},{verse:24,en:"Father, I will that they also, whom thou hast given me, be with me where I am; that they may behold my glory, which thou hast given me: for thou lovedst me before the foundation of the world.",pt:"Pai, desejo que onde eu estou, estejam comigo tamb\xe9m aqueles que me tens dado, para verem a minha gl\xf3ria, a qual me deste; pois que me amaste antes da funda\xe7\xe3o do mundo."},{verse:25,en:"O righteous Father, the world hath not known thee: but I have known thee, and these have known that thou hast sent me.",pt:"Pai justo, o mundo n\xe3o te conheceu, mas eu te conhe\xe7o; conheceram que tu me enviaste;"},{verse:26,en:"And I have declared unto them thy name, and will declare it: that the love wherewith thou hast loved me may be in them, and I in them.",pt:"e eu lhes fiz conhecer o teu nome, e lho farei conhecer ainda; para que haja neles aquele amor com que me amaste, e tamb\xe9m eu neles esteja."}]}}),680,[]);
__d((function(e,s,a,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:18,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"When Jesus had spoken these words, he went forth with his disciples over the brook Cedron, where was a garden, into the which he entered, and his disciples.",pt:"Tendo Jesus dito isto, saiu com seus disc\xedpulos para o outro lado do ribeiro de Cedrom, onde havia um jardim, e com eles ali entrou."},{verse:2,en:"And Judas also, which betrayed him, knew the place: for Jesus ofttimes resorted thither with his disciples.",pt:"Ora, Judas, que o tra\xeda, tamb\xe9m conhecia aquele lugar, porque muitas vezes Jesus se reunira ali com os disc\xedpulos."},{verse:3,en:"Judas then, having received a band of men and officers from the chief priests and Pharisees, cometh thither with lanterns and torches and weapons.",pt:"Tendo, pois, Judas tomado a coorte e uns guardas da parte dos principais sacerdotes e fariseus, chegou ali com lanternas archotes e armas."},{verse:4,en:"Jesus therefore, knowing all things that should come upon him, went forth, and said unto them, Whom seek ye?",pt:"Sabendo, pois, Jesus tudo o que lhe havia de suceder, adiantou-se e perguntou-lhes: A quem buscais?"},{verse:5,en:"They answered him, Jesus of Nazareth. Jesus saith unto them, I amhe. And Judas also, which betrayed him, stood with them.",pt:"Responderam-lhe: A Jesus, o nazareno. Disse-lhes Jesus: Sou eu. E Judas, que o tra\xeda, tamb\xe9m estava com eles."},{verse:6,en:"As soon then as he had said unto them, I am he, they went backward, and fell to the ground.",pt:"Quando Jesus lhes disse: Sou eu, recuaram, e cairam por terra."},{verse:7,en:"Then asked he them again, Whom seek ye? And they said, Jesus of Nazareth.",pt:"Tornou-lhes ent\xe3o a perguntar: A quem buscais? e responderam: A Jesus, o nazareno."},{verse:8,en:"Jesus answered, I have told you that I am he: if therefore ye seek me, let these go their way:",pt:"Replicou-lhes Jesus: J\xe1 vos disse que sou eu; se, pois, \xe9 a mim que buscais, deixai ir estes;"},{verse:9,en:"That the saying might be fulfilled, which he spake, Of them which thou gavest me have I lost none.",pt:"para que se cumprisse a palavra que dissera: Dos que me tens dado, nenhum deles perdi."},{verse:10,en:"Then Simon Peter having a sword drew it, and smote the high priest\u2019s servant, and cut off his right ear. The servant\u2019s name was Malchus.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Sim\xe3o Pedro, que tinha uma espada, desembainhou-a e feriu o servo do sumo sacerdote, cortando-lhe a orelha direita. O nome do servo era Malco."},{verse:11,en:"Then said Jesus unto Peter, Put up thy sword into the sheath: the cup which my Father hath given me, shall I not drink it?",pt:"Disse, pois, Jesus a Pedro: Mete a tua espada na bainha; n\xe3o hei de beber o c\xe1lice que o Pai me deu?"},{verse:12,en:"Then the band and the captain and officers of the Jews took Jesus, and bound him,",pt:"Ent\xe3o a coorte, e o comandante, e os guardas dos judeus prenderam a Jesus, e o maniataram."},{verse:13,en:"And led him away to Annas first; for he was father in law to Caiaphas, which was the high priest that same year.",pt:"E conduziram-no primeiramente a An\xe1s; pois era sogro de Caif\xe1s, sumo sacerdote naquele ano."},{verse:14,en:"Now Caiaphas was he, which gave counsel to the Jews, that it was expedient that one man should die for the people.",pt:"Ora, Caif\xe1s era quem aconselhara aos judeus que convinha morrer um homem pelo povo."},{verse:15,en:"And Simon Peter followed Jesus, and so did another disciple: that disciple was known unto the high priest, and went in with Jesus into the palace of the high priest.",pt:"Sim\xe3o Pedro e outro disc\xedpulo seguiam a Jesus. Este disc\xedpulo era conhecido do sumo sacerdote, e entrou com Jesus no p\xe1tio do sumo sacerdote,"},{verse:16,en:"But Peter stood at the door without. Then went out that other disciple, which was known unto the high priest, and spake unto her that kept the door, and brought in Peter.",pt:"enquanto Pedro ficava da parte de fora, \xe0 porta. Saiu, ent\xe3o, o outro disc\xedpulo que era conhecido do sumo sacerdote, falou \xe0 porteira, e levou Pedro para dentro."},{verse:17,en:"Then saith the damsel that kept the door unto Peter, Art not thou also one of this man\u2019s disciples? He saith, I am not.",pt:"Ent\xe3o a porteira perguntou a Pedro: N\xe3o \xe9s tu tamb\xe9m um dos disc\xedpulos deste homem? Respondeu ele: N\xe3o sou."},{verse:18,en:"And the servants and officers stood there, who had made a fire of coals; for it was cold: and they warmed themselves: and Peter stood with them, and warmed himself.",pt:"Ora, estavam ali os servos e os guardas, que tinham acendido um braseiro e se aquentavam, porque fazia frio; e tamb\xe9m Pedro estava ali em p\xe9 no meio deles, aquentando-se."},{verse:19,en:"The high priest then asked Jesus of his disciples, and of his doctrine.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o sumo sacerdote interrogou Jesus acerca dos seus disc\xedpulos e da sua doutrina."},{verse:20,en:"Jesus answered him, I spake openly to the world; I ever taught in the synagogue, and in the temple, whither the Jews always resort; and in secret have I said nothing.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Eu tenho falado abertamente ao mundo; eu sempre ensinei nas sinagogas e no templo, onde todos os judeus se congregam, e nada falei em oculto."},{verse:21,en:"Why askest thou me? ask them which heard me, what I have said unto them: behold, they know what I said.",pt:"Por que me perguntas a mim? pergunta aos que me ouviram o que \xe9 que lhes falei; eis que eles sabem o que eu disse."},{verse:22,en:"And when he had thus spoken, one of the officers which stood by struck Jesus with the palm of his hand, saying, Answerest thou the high priest so?",pt:"E, havendo ele dito isso, um dos guardas que ali estavam deu uma bofetada em Jesus, dizendo: \xc9 assim que respondes ao sumo sacerdote?"},{verse:23,en:"Jesus answered him, If I have spoken evil, bear witness of the evil: but if well, why smitest thou me?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Se falei mal, d\xe1 testemunho do mal; mas, se bem, por que me feres?"},{verse:24,en:"Now Annas had sent him bound unto Caiaphas the high priest.",pt:"Ent\xe3o An\xe1s o enviou, maniatado, a Caif\xe1s, o sumo sacerdote."},{verse:25,en:"And Simon Peter stood and warmed himself. They said therefore unto him, Art not thou also one of his disciples? He denied it, and said, I am not.",pt:"E Sim\xe3o Pedro ainda estava ali, aquentando-se. Perguntaram- lhe, pois: N\xe3o \xe9s tamb\xe9m tu um dos seus disc\xedpulos? Ele negou, e disse: N\xe3o sou."},{verse:26,en:"One of the servants of the high priest, being his kinsman whose ear Peter cut off, saith, Did not I see thee in the garden with him?",pt:"Um dos servos do sumo sacerdote, parente daquele a quem Pedro cortara a orelha, disse: N\xe3o te vi eu no jardim com ele?"},{verse:27,en:"Peter then denied again: and immediately the cock crew.",pt:"Pedro negou outra vez, e imediatamente o galo cantou."},{verse:28,en:"Then led they Jesus from Caiaphas unto the hall of judgment: and it was early; and they themselves went not into the judgment hall, lest they should be defiled; but that they might eat the passover.",pt:"Depois conduziram Jesus da presen\xe7a de Caif\xe1s para o pret\xf3rio; era de manh\xe3 cedo; e eles n\xe3o entraram no pret\xf3rio, para n\xe3o se contaminarem, mas poderem comer a p\xe1scoa."},{verse:29,en:"Pilate then went out unto them, and said, What accusation bring ye against this man?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pilatos saiu a ter com eles, e perguntou: Que acusa\xe7\xe3o trazeis contra este homem?"},{verse:30,en:"They answered and said unto him, If he were not a malefactor, we would not have delivered him up unto thee.",pt:"Responderam-lhe: Se ele n\xe3o fosse malfeitor, n\xe3o to entregar\xedamos."},{verse:31,en:"Then said Pilate unto them, Take ye him, and judge him according to your law. The Jews therefore said unto him, It is not lawful for us to put any man to death:",pt:"Disse-lhes, ent\xe3o, Pilatos: Tomai-o v\xf3s, e julgai-o segundo a vossa lei. Disseram-lhe os judeus: A n\xf3s n\xe3o nos \xe9 l\xedcito tirar a vida a ningu\xe9m."},{verse:32,en:"That the saying of Jesus might be fulfilled, which he spake, signifying what death he should die.",pt:"Isso foi para que se cumprisse a palavra que dissera Jesus, significando de que morte havia de morrer."},{verse:33,en:"Then Pilate entered into the judgment hall again, and called Jesus, and said unto him, Art thou the King of the Jews?",pt:"Pilatos, pois, tornou a entrar no pret\xf3rio, chamou a Jesus e perguntou-lhe: \xc9s tu o rei dos judeus?"},{verse:34,en:"Jesus answered him, Sayest thou this thing of thyself, or did others tell it thee of me?",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Dizes isso de ti mesmo, ou foram outros que to disseram de mim?"},{verse:35,en:"Pilate answered, Am I a Jew? Thine own nation and the chief priests have delivered thee unto me: what hast thou done?",pt:"Replicou Pilatos: Porventura sou eu judeu? O teu povo e os principais sacerdotes entregaram-te a mim; que fizeste?"},{verse:36,en:"Jesus answered, My kingdom is not of this world: if my kingdom were of this world, then would my servants fight, that I should not be delivered to the Jews: but now is my kingdom not from hence.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: O meu reino n\xe3o \xe9 deste mundo; se o meu reino fosse deste mundo, pelejariam os meus servos, para que eu n\xe3o fosse entregue aos judeus; entretanto o meu reino n\xe3o \xe9 daqui."},{verse:37,en:"Pilate therefore said unto him, Art thou a king then? Jesus answered, Thou sayest that I am a king. To this end was I born, and for this cause came I into the world, that I should bear witness unto the truth. Every one that is of the truth heareth my voice.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe, pois, Pilatos: Logo tu \xe9s rei? Respondeu Jesus: Tu dizes que eu sou rei. Eu para isso nasci, e para isso vim ao mundo, a fim de dar testemunho da verdade. Todo aquele que \xe9 da verdade ouve a minha voz."},{verse:38,en:"Pilate saith unto him, What is truth? And when he had said this, he went out again unto the Jews, and saith unto them, I find in him no fault at all.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Pilatos: Que \xe9 a verdade? E dito isto, de novo saiu a ter com os judeus, e disse-lhes: N\xe3o acho nele crime algum."},{verse:39,en:"But ye have a custom, that I should release unto you one at the passover: will ye therefore that I release unto you the King of the Jews?",pt:"Tendes, por\xe9m, por costume que eu vos solte algu\xe9m por ocasi\xe3o da p\xe1scoa; quereis, pois, que vos solte o rei dos judeus?"},{verse:40,en:"Then cried they all again, saying, Not this man, but Barabbas. Now Barabbas was a robber.",pt:"Ent\xe3o todos tornaram a clamar dizendo: Este n\xe3o, mas Barrab\xe1s. Ora, Barrab\xe1s era salteador."}]}}),681,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:19,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then Pilate therefore took Jesus, and scourged him.",pt:"Nisso, pois, Pilatos tomou a Jesus, e mandou a\xe7oit\xe1-lo."},{verse:2,en:"And the soldiers platted a crown of thorns, and put it on his head, and they put on him a purple robe,",pt:"E os soldados, tecendo uma coroa de espinhos, puseram-lha sobre a cabe\xe7a, e lhe vestiram um manto de p\xfarpura;"},{verse:3,en:"And said, Hail, King of the Jews! and they smote him with their hands.",pt:"e chegando-se a ele, diziam: Salve, rei dos judeus! e e davam-lhe bofetadas."},{verse:4,en:"Pilate therefore went forth again, and saith unto them, Behold, I bring him forth to you, that ye may know that I find no fault in him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pilatos saiu outra vez, e disse-lhes: Eis aqui vo-lo trago fora, para que saibais que n\xe3o acho nele crime algum."},{verse:5,en:"Then came Jesus forth, wearing the crown of thorns, and the purple robe. And Pilate saith unto them, Behold the man!",pt:"Saiu, pois, Jesus, trazendo a coroa de espinhos e o manto de p\xfarpura. E disse-lhes Pilatos: Eis o homem!"},{verse:6,en:"When the chief priests therefore and officers saw him, they cried out, saying, Crucify him, crucify him. Pilate saith unto them, Take ye him, and crucify him: for I find no fault in him.",pt:"Quando o viram os principais sacerdotes e os guardas, clamaram, dizendo: Crucifica-o! Crucifica-o! Disse-lhes Pilatos: Tomai-o v\xf3s, e crucificai-o; porque nenhum crime acho nele."},{verse:7,en:"The Jews answered him, We have a law, and by our law he ought to die, because he made himself the Son of God.",pt:"Responderam-lhe os judeus: N\xf3s temos uma lei, e segundo esta lei ele deve morrer, porque se fez Filho de Deus."},{verse:8,en:"When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he was the more afraid;",pt:"Ora, Pilatos, quando ouviu esta palavra, mais atemorizado ficou;"},{verse:9,en:"And went again into the judgment hall, and saith unto Jesus, Whence art thou? But Jesus gave him no answer.",pt:"e entrando outra vez no pret\xf3rio, perguntou a Jesus: Donde \xe9s tu? Mas Jesus n\xe3o lhe deu resposta."},{verse:10,en:"Then saith Pilate unto him, Speakest thou not unto me? knowest thou not that I have power to crucify thee, and have power to release thee?",pt:"Disse-lhe, ent\xe3o, Pilatos: N\xe3o me respondes? n\xe3o sabes que tenho autoridade para te soltar, e autoridade para te crucificar?"},{verse:11,en:"Jesus answered, Thou couldest have no power at all against me, except it were given thee from above: therefore he that delivered me unto thee hath the greater sin.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Nenhuma autoridade terias sobre mim, se de cima n\xe3o te fora dado; por isso aquele que me entregou a ti, maior pecado tem."},{verse:12,en:"And from thenceforth Pilate sought to release him: but the Jews cried out, saying, If thou let this man go, thou art not Caesar\u2019s friend: whosoever maketh himself a king speaketh against Caesar.",pt:"Da\xed em diante Pilatos procurava solt\xe1-lo; mas os judeus clamaram: Se soltares a este, n\xe3o \xe9s amigo de C\xe9sar; todo aquele que se faz rei \xe9 contra C\xe9sar."},{verse:13,en:"When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he brought Jesus forth, and sat down in the judgment seat in a place that is called the Pavement, but in the Hebrew, Gabbatha.",pt:"Pilatos, pois, quando ouviu isto, trouxe Jesus para fora e sentou-se no tribunal, no lugar chamado Pavimento, e em hebraico Gabat\xe1."},{verse:14,en:"And it was the preparation of the passover, and about the sixth hour: and he saith unto the Jews, Behold your King!",pt:"Ora, era a prepara\xe7\xe3o da p\xe1scoa, e cerca da hora sexta. E disse aos judeus: Eis o vosso rei."},{verse:15,en:"But they cried out, Away with him, away with him, crucify him. Pilate saith unto them, Shall I crucify your King? The chief priests answered, We have no king but Caesar.",pt:"Mas eles clamaram: Tira-o! tira-o! crucifica-o! Disse-lhes Pilatos: Hei de crucificar o vosso rei? responderam, os principais sacerdotes: N\xe3o temos rei, sen\xe3o C\xe9sar."},{verse:16,en:"Then delivered he him therefore unto them to be crucified. And they took Jesus, and led him away.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lho entregou para ser crucificado."},{verse:17,en:"And he bearing his cross went forth into a place called the place of a skull, which is called in the Hebrew Golgotha:",pt:"Tomaram, pois, a Jesus; e ele, carregando a sua pr\xf3pria cruz, saiu para o lugar chamado Caveira, que em hebraico se chama G\xf3lgota,"},{verse:18,en:"Where they crucified him, and two others with him, on either side one, and Jesus in the midst.",pt:"onde o crucificaram, e com ele outros dois, um de cada lado, e Jesus no meio."},{verse:19,en:"And Pilate wrote a title, and put it on the cross. And the writing was, JESUS OF NAZARETH THE KING OF THE JEWS.",pt:"E Pilatos escreveu tamb\xe9m um t\xedtulo, e o colocou sobre a cruz; e nele estava escrito: JESUS O NAZARENO, O REI DOS JUDEUS."},{verse:20,en:"This title then read many of the Jews: for the place where Jesus was crucified was nigh to the city: and it was written in Hebrew, and Greek, and Latin.",pt:"Muitos dos judeus, pois, leram este t\xedtulo; porque o lugar onde Jesus foi crucificado era pr\xf3ximo da cidade; e estava escrito em hebraico, latim e grego."},{verse:21,en:"Then said the chief priests of the Jews to Pilate, Write not, The King of the Jews; but that he said, I am King of the Jews.",pt:"Diziam ent\xe3o a Pilatos os principais sacerdotes dos judeus: N\xe3o escrevas: O rei dos judeus; mas que ele disse: Sou rei dos judeus."},{verse:22,en:"Pilate answered, What I have written I have written.",pt:"Respondeu Pilatos: O que escrevi, escrevi."},{verse:23,en:"Then the soldiers, when they had crucified Jesus, took his garments, and made four parts, to every soldier a part; and also his coat: now the coat was without seam, woven from the top throughout.",pt:"Tendo, pois, os soldados crucificado a Jesus, tomaram as suas vestes, e fizeram delas quatro partes, para cada soldado uma parte. Tomaram tamb\xe9m a t\xfanica; ora a t\xfanica n\xe3o tinha costura, sendo toda tecida de alto a baixo."},{verse:24,en:"They said therefore among themselves, Let us not rend it, but cast lots for it, whose it shall be: that the scripture might be fulfilled, which saith, They parted my raiment among them, and for my vesture they did cast lots. These things therefore the soldiers did.",pt:"Pelo que disseram uns aos outros: N\xe3o a rasguemos, mas lancemos sortes sobre ela, para ver de quem ser\xe1 (para que se cumprisse a escritura que diz: Repartiram entre si as minhas vestes, e lan\xe7aram sortes). E, de fato, os soldados assim fizeram."},{verse:25,en:"Now there stood by the cross of Jesus his mother, and his mother\u2019s sister, Mary the wife of Cleophas, and Mary Magdalene.",pt:"Estavam em p\xe9, junto \xe0 cruz de Jesus, sua m\xe3e, e a irm\xe3 de sua m\xe3e, e Maria, mulher de Cl\xf4pas, e Maria Madalena."},{verse:26,en:"When Jesus therefore saw his mother, and the disciple standing by, whom he loved, he saith unto his mother, Woman, behold thy son!",pt:"Ora, Jesus, vendo ali sua m\xe3e, e ao lado dela o disc\xedpulo a quem ele amava, disse a sua m\xe3e: Mulher, eis a\xed o teu filho."},{verse:27,en:"Then saith he to the disciple, Behold thy mother! And from that hour that disciple took her unto his own home.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse ao disc\xedpulo: Eis a\xed tua m\xe3e. E desde aquela hora o disc\xedpulo a recebeu em sua casa."},{verse:28,en:"After this, Jesus knowing that all things were now accomplished, that the scripture might be fulfilled, saith, I thirst.",pt:"Depois, sabendo Jesus que todas as coisas j\xe1 estavam consumadas, para que se cumprisse a Escritura, disse: Tenho sede."},{verse:29,en:"Now there was set a vessel full of vinegar: and they filled a spunge with vinegar, and put it upon hyssop, and put it to his mouth.",pt:"Estava ali um vaso cheio de vinagre. Puseram, pois, numa cana de hissopo uma esponja ensopada de vinagre, e lha chegaram \xe0 boca."},{verse:30,en:"When Jesus therefore had received the vinegar, he said, It is finished: and he bowed his head, and gave up the ghost.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus, depois de ter tomado o vinagre, disse: est\xe1 consumado. E, inclinando a cabe\xe7a, entregou o esp\xedrito."},{verse:31,en:"The Jews therefore, because it was the preparation, that the bodies should not remain upon the cross on the sabbath day, (for that sabbath day was an high day,) besought Pilate that their legs might be broken, and that they might be taken away.",pt:"Ora, os judeus, como era a prepara\xe7\xe3o, e para que no s\xe1bado n\xe3o ficassem os corpos na cruz, pois era grande aquele dia de s\xe1bado, rogaram a Pilatos que se lhes quebrassem as pernas, e fossem tirados dali."},{verse:32,en:"Then came the soldiers, and brake the legs of the first, and of the other which was crucified with him.",pt:"Foram ent\xe3o os soldados e, na verdade, quebraram as pernas ao primeiro e ao outro que com ele fora crucificado;"},{verse:33,en:"But when they came to Jesus, and saw that he was dead already, they brake not his legs:",pt:"mas vindo a Jesus, e vendo que j\xe1 estava morto, n\xe3o lhe quebraram as pernas;"},{verse:34,en:"But one of the soldiers with a spear pierced his side, and forthwith came there out blood and water.",pt:"contudo um dos soldados lhe furou o lado com uma lan\xe7a, e logo saiu sangue e \xe1gua."},{verse:35,en:"And he that saw it bare record, and his record is true: and he knoweth that he saith true, that ye might believe.",pt:"E \xe9 quem viu isso que d\xe1 testemunho, e o seu testemunho \xe9 verdadeiro; e sabe que diz a verdade, para que tamb\xe9m v\xf3s creiais."},{verse:36,en:"For these things were done, that the scripture should be fulfilled, A bone of him shall not be broken.",pt:"Porque isto aconteceu para que se cumprisse a escritura: Nenhum dos seus ossos ser\xe1 quebrado."},{verse:37,en:"And again another scripture saith, They shall look on him whom they pierced.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m h\xe1 outra escritura que diz: Olhar\xe3o para aquele que traspassaram."},{verse:38,en:"And after this Joseph of Arimathaea, being a disciple of Jesus, but secretly for fear of the Jews, besought Pilate that he might take away the body of Jesus: and Pilate gave him leave. He came therefore, and took the body of Jesus.",pt:"Depois disto, Jos\xe9 de Arimat\xe9ia, que era disc\xedpulo de Jesus, embora oculto por medo dos judeus, rogou a Pilatos que lhe permitisse tirar o corpo de Jesus; e Pilatos lho permitiu. Ent\xe3o foi e o tirou."},{verse:39,en:"And there came also Nicodemus, which at the first came to Jesus by night, and brought a mixture of myrrh and aloes, about an hundred pound weight.",pt:"E Nicodemos, aquele que anteriormente viera ter com Jesus de noite, foi tamb\xe9m, levando cerca de cem libras duma mistura de mirra e alo\xe9s."},{verse:40,en:"Then took they the body of Jesus, and wound it in linen clothes with the spices, as the manner of the Jews is to bury.",pt:"Tomaram, pois, o corpo de Jesus, e o envolveram em panos de linho com as especiarias, como os judeus costumavam fazer na prepara\xe7\xe3o para a sepultura."},{verse:41,en:"Now in the place where he was crucified there was a garden; and in the garden a new sepulchre, wherein was never man yet laid.",pt:"No lugar onde Jesus foi crucificado havia um jardim, e nesse jardim um sepulcro novo, em que ningu\xe9m ainda havia sido posto."},{verse:42,en:"There laid they Jesus therefore because of the Jews\u2019 preparation day; for the sepulchre was nigh at hand.",pt:"Ali, pois, por ser a vespera do s\xe1bado dos judeus, e por estar perto aquele sepulcro, puseram a Jesus."}]}}),682,[]);
__d((function(e,s,o,a,t,n,h){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:20,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The first day of the week cometh Mary Magdalene early, when it was yet dark, unto the sepulchre, and seeth the stone taken away from the sepulchre.",pt:"No primeiro dia da semana Maria Madalena foi ao sepulcro de madrugada, sendo ainda escuro, e viu que a pedra fora removida do sepulcro."},{verse:2,en:"Then she runneth, and cometh to Simon Peter, and to the other disciple, whom Jesus loved, and saith unto them, They have taken away the Lord out of the sepulchre, and we know not where they have laid him.",pt:"Correu, pois, e foi ter com Sim\xe3o Pedro, e o outro disc\xedpulo, a quem Jesus amava, e disse-lhes: Tiraram do sepulcro o Senhor, e n\xe3o sabemos onde o puseram."},{verse:3,en:"Peter therefore went forth, and that other disciple, and came to the sepulchre.",pt:"Sa\xedram ent\xe3o Pedro e o outro disc\xedpulo e foram ao sepulcro."},{verse:4,en:"So they ran both together: and the other disciple did outrun Peter, and came first to the sepulchre.",pt:"Corriam os dois juntos, mas o outro disc\xedpulo correu mais ligeiro do que Pedro, e chegou primeiro ao sepulcro;"},{verse:5,en:"And he stooping down, and looking in, saw the linen clothes lying; yet went he not in.",pt:"e, abaixando-se viu os panos de linho ali deixados, todavia n\xe3o entrou."},{verse:6,en:"Then cometh Simon Peter following him, and went into the sepulchre, and seeth the linen clothes lie,",pt:"Chegou, pois, Sim\xe3o Pedro, que o seguia, e entrou no sepulcro e viu os panos de linho ali deixados,"},{verse:7,en:"And the napkin, that was about his head, not lying with the linen clothes, but wrapped together in a place by itself.",pt:"e que o len\xe7o, que estivera sobre a cabe\xe7a de Jesus, n\xe3o estava com os panos, mas enrolado num lugar \xe0 parte."},{verse:8,en:"Then went in also that other disciple, which came first to the sepulchre, and he saw, and believed.",pt:"Ent\xe3o entrou tamb\xe9m o outro disc\xedpulo, que chegara primeiro ao sepulcro, e viu e creu."},{verse:9,en:"For as yet they knew not the scripture, that he must rise again from the dead.",pt:"Porque ainda n\xe3o entendiam a escritura, que era necess\xe1rio que ele ressurgisse dentre os mortos."},{verse:10,en:"Then the disciples went away again unto their own home.",pt:"Tornaram, pois, os disc\xedpulos para casa."},{verse:11,en:"But Mary stood without at the sepulchre weeping: and as she wept, she stooped down, and looked into the sepulchre,",pt:"Maria, por\xe9m, estava em p\xe9, diante do sepulcro, a chorar. Enquanto chorava, abaixou-se a olhar para dentro do sepulcro,"},{verse:12,en:"And seeth two angels in white sitting, the one at the head, and the other at the feet, where the body of Jesus had lain.",pt:"e viu dois anjos vestidos de branco sentados onde jazera o corpo de Jesus, um \xe0 cabeceira e outro aos p\xe9s."},{verse:13,en:"And they say unto her, Woman, why weepest thou? She saith unto them, Because they have taken away my Lord, and I know not where they have laid him.",pt:"E perguntaram-lhe eles: Mulher, por que choras? Respondeu- lhes: Porque tiraram o meu Senhor, e n\xe3o sei onde o puseram."},{verse:14,en:"And when she had thus said, she turned herself back, and saw Jesus standing, and knew not that it was Jesus.",pt:"Ao dizer isso, voltou-se para tr\xe1s, e viu a Jesus ali em p\xe9, mas n\xe3o sabia que era Jesus."},{verse:15,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Woman, why weepest thou? whom seekest thou? She, supposing him to be the gardener, saith unto him, Sir, if thou have borne him hence, tell me where thou hast laid him, and I will take him away.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Jesus: Mulher, por que choras? A quem procuras? Ela, julgando que fosse o jardineiro, respondeu-lhe: Senhor, se tu o levaste, dize-me onde o puseste, e eu o levarei."},{verse:16,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Mary. She turned herself, and saith unto him, Rabboni; which is to say, Master.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Maria! Ela, virando-se, disse-lhe em hebraico: Raboni! - que quer dizer, Mestre."},{verse:17,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Touch me not; for I am not yet ascended to my Father: but go to my brethren, and say unto them, I ascend unto my Father, and your Father; and to my God, and your God.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Deixa de me tocar, porque ainda n\xe3o subi ao Pai; mas vai a meus irm\xe3os e dize-lhes que eu subo para meu Pai e vosso Pai, meu Deus e vosso Deus."},{verse:18,en:"Mary Magdalene came and told the disciples that she had seen the Lord, and that he had spoken these things unto her.",pt:"E foi Maria Madalena anunciar aos disc\xedpulos: Vi o Senhor! - e que ele lhe dissera estas coisas."},{verse:19,en:"Then the same day at evening, being the first day of the week, when the doors were shut where the disciples were assembled for fear of the Jews, came Jesus and stood in the midst, and saith unto them, Peace be unto you.",pt:"Chegada, pois, a tarde, naquele dia, o primeiro da semana, e estando os disc\xedpulos reunidos com as portas cerradas por medo dos judeus, chegou Jesus, p\xf4s-se no meio e disse-lhes: Paz seja convosco."},{verse:20,en:"And when he had so said, he shewed unto them his hands and his side. Then were the disciples glad, when they saw the Lord.",pt:"Dito isto, mostrou-lhes as m\xe3os e o lado. Alegraram-se, pois, os disc\xedpulos ao verem o Senhor."},{verse:21,en:"Then said Jesus to them again, Peace be unto you: as my Father hath sent me, even so send I you.",pt:"Disse-lhes, ent\xe3o, Jesus segunda vez: Paz seja convosco; assim como o Pai me enviou, tamb\xe9m eu vos envio a v\xf3s."},{verse:22,en:"And when he had said this, he breathed on them, and saith unto them, Receive ye the Holy Ghost:",pt:"E havendo dito isso, assoprou sobre eles, e disse-lhes: Recebei o Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:23,en:"Whose soever sins ye remit, they are remitted unto them; and whose soever sins ye retain, they are retained.",pt:"\xc2queles a quem perdoardes os pecados, s\xe3o-lhes perdoados; e \xe0queles a quem os retiverdes, s\xe3o-lhes retidos."},{verse:24,en:"But Thomas, one of the twelve, called Didymus, was not with them when Jesus came.",pt:"Ora, Tom\xe9, um dos doze, chamado D\xeddimo, n\xe3o estava com eles quando veio Jesus."},{verse:25,en:"The other disciples therefore said unto him, We have seen the Lord. But he said unto them, Except I shall see in his hands the print of the nails, and put my finger into the print of the nails, and thrust my hand into his side, I will not believe.",pt:"Diziam-lhe, pois, ou outros disc\xedpulos: Vimos o Senhor. Ele, por\xe9m, lhes respondeu: Se eu n\xe3o vir o sinal dos cravos nas m\xe3os, e n\xe3o meter a m\xe3o no seu lado, de maneira nenhuma crerei."},{verse:26,en:"And after eight days again his disciples were within, and Thomas with them: then came Jesus, the doors being shut, and stood in the midst, and said, Peace be unto you.",pt:"Oito dias depois estavam os disc\xedpulos outra vez ali reunidos, e Tom\xe9 com eles. Chegou Jesus, estando as portas fechadas, p\xf4s-se no meio deles e disse: Paz seja convosco."},{verse:27,en:"Then saith he to Thomas, reach hither thy finger, and behold my hands; and reach hither thy hand, and thrust it into my side: and be not faithless, but believing.",pt:"Depois disse a Tom\xe9: Chega aqui o teu dedo, e v\xea as minhas m\xe3os; chega a tua m\xe3o, e mete-a no meu lado; e n\xe3o mais sejas incr\xe9dulo, mas crente."},{verse:28,en:"And Thomas answered and said unto him, My Lord and my God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Tom\xe9: Senhor meu, e Deus meu!"},{verse:29,en:"Jesus saith unto him, Thomas, because thou hast seen me, thou hast believed: blessed are they that have not seen, and yet have believed.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Porque me viste, creste? Bem-aventurados os que n\xe3o viram e creram."},{verse:30,en:"And many other signs truly did Jesus in the presence of his disciples, which are not written in this book:",pt:"Jesus, na verdade, operou na presen\xe7a de seus disc\xedpulos ainda muitos outros sinais que n\xe3o est\xe3o escritos neste livro;"},{verse:31,en:"But these are written, that ye might believe that Jesus is the Christ, the Son of God; and that believing ye might have life through his name.",pt:"estes, por\xe9m, est\xe3o escritos para que creiais que Jesus \xe9 o Cristo, o Filho de Deus, e para que, crendo, tenhais vida em seu nome."}]}}),683,[]);
__d((function(e,s,t,o,a,i,h){a.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:21,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After these things Jesus shewed himself again to the disciples at the sea of Tiberias; and on this wise shewed he himself.",pt:"Depois disto manifestou-se Jesus outra vez aos disc\xedpulos junto do mar de Tiber\xedades; e manifestou-se deste modo:"},{verse:2,en:"There were together Simon Peter, and Thomas called Didymus, and Nathanael of Cana in Galilee, and the sons of Zebedee, and two other of his disciples.",pt:"Estavam juntos Sim\xe3o Pedro, Tom\xe9, chamado D\xeddimo, Natanael, que era de Can\xe1 da Galil\xe9ia, os filhos de Zebedeu, e outros dois dos seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:3,en:"Simon Peter saith unto them, I go a fishing. They say unto him, We also go with thee. They went forth, and entered into a ship immediately; and that night they caught nothing.",pt:"Disse-lhes Sim\xe3o Pedro: Vou pescar. Responderam-lhe: N\xf3s tamb\xe9m vamos contigo. Sa\xedram e entraram no barco; e naquela noite nada apanharam."},{verse:4,en:"But when the morning was now come, Jesus stood on the shore: but the disciples knew not that it was Jesus.",pt:"Mas ao romper da manh\xe3, Jesus se apresentou na praia; todavia os disc\xedpulos n\xe3o sabiam que era ele."},{verse:5,en:"Then Jesus saith unto them, Children, have ye any meat? They answered him, No.",pt:"Disse-lhes, pois, Jesus: Filhos, n\xe3o tendes nada que comer? Responderam-lhe: N\xe3o."},{verse:6,en:"And he said unto them, Cast the net on the right side of the ship, and ye shall find. They cast therefore, and now they were not able to draw it for the multitude of fishes.",pt:"Disse-lhes ele: Lan\xe7ai a rede \xe0 direita do barco, e achareis. Lan\xe7aram-na, pois, e j\xe1 n\xe3o a podiam puxar por causa da grande quantidade de peixes."},{verse:7,en:"Therefore that disciple whom Jesus loved saith unto Peter, It is the Lord. Now when Simon Peter heard that it was the Lord, he girt his fisher\u2019s coat unto him, (for he was naked,) and did cast himself into the sea.",pt:"Ent\xe3o aquele disc\xedpulo a quem Jesus amava disse a Pedro: Senhor. Quando, pois, Sim\xe3o Pedro ouviu que era o Senhor, cingiu-se com a t\xfanica, porque estava despido, e lan\xe7ou-se ao mar;"},{verse:8,en:"And the other disciples came in a little ship; (for they were not far from land, but as it were two hundred cubits,) dragging the net with fishes.",pt:"mas os outros disc\xedpulos vieram no barquinho, puxando a rede com os peixes, porque n\xe3o estavam distantes da terra sen\xe3o cerca de duzentos c\xf4vados."},{verse:9,en:"As soon then as they were come to land, they saw a fire of coals there, and fish laid thereon, and bread.",pt:"Ora, ao saltarem em terra, viram ali brasas, e um peixe posto em cima delas, e p\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"Jesus saith unto them, Bring of the fish which ye have now caught.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Trazei alguns dos peixes que agora apanhastes."},{verse:11,en:"Simon Peter went up, and drew the net to land full of great fishes, and hundred and fifty and three: and for all there were so many, yet was not the net broken.",pt:"Entrou Sim\xe3o Pedro no barco e puxou a rede para terra, cheia de cento e cinquenta e tr\xeas grandes peixes; e, apesar de serem tantos, n\xe3o se rompeu a rede."},{verse:12,en:"Jesus saith unto them, Come and dine. And none of the disciples durst ask him, Who art thou? knowing that it was the Lord.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Vinde, comei. Nenhum dos disc\xedpulos ousava perguntar-lhe: Quem \xe9s tu? sabendo que era o Senhor."},{verse:13,en:"Jesus then cometh, and taketh bread, and giveth them, and fish likewise.",pt:"Chegou Jesus, tomou o p\xe3o e deu-lho, e semelhantemente o peixe."},{verse:14,en:"This is now the third time that Jesus shewed himself to his disciples, after that he was risen from the dead.",pt:"Foi esta a terceira vez que Jesus se manifestou aos seus disc\xedpulos, depois de ter ressurgido dentre os mortos."},{verse:15,en:"So when they had dined, Jesus saith to Simon Peter, Simon, son of Jonas, lovest thou me more than these? He saith unto him, Yea, Lord; thou knowest that I love thee. He saith unto him, Feed my lambs.",pt:"Depois de terem comido, perguntou Jesus a Sim\xe3o Pedro: Sim\xe3o Pedro: Sim\xe3o, filho de Jo\xe3o, amas-me mais do que estes? Respondeu- lhe: Sim, Senhor; tu sabes que te amo. Disse-lhe: Apascenta os meus cordeirinhos."},{verse:16,en:"He saith to him again the second time, Simon, son of Jonas, lovest thou me? He saith unto him, Yea, Lord; thou knowest that I love thee. He saith unto him, Feed my sheep.",pt:"Tornou a perguntar-lhe: Sim\xe3o, filho de Jo\xe3o, amas-me? Respondeu-lhe: Sim, Senhor; tu sabes que te amo. Disse-lhe: Pastoreia as minhas ovelhas."},{verse:17,en:"He saith unto him the third time, Simon, son of Jonas, lovest thou me? Peter was grieved because he said unto him the third time, Lovest thou me? And he said unto him, Lord, thou knowest all things; thou knowest that I love thee. Jesus saith unto him, Feed my sheep.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe terceira vez: Sim\xe3o, filho de Jo\xe3o, amas-me? Entristeceu-se Pedro por lhe ter perguntado pela terceira vez: Amas- me? E respondeu-lhe: Senhor, tu sabes todas as coisas; tu sabes que te amo. Disse-lhe Jesus: Apascenta as minhas ovelhas."},{verse:18,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto thee, When thou wast young, thou girdedst thyself, and walkedst whither thou wouldest: but when thou shalt be old, thou shalt stretch forth thy hands, and another shall gird thee, and carry thee whither thou wouldest not.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade te digo que, quando eras mais mo\xe7o, te cingias a ti mesmo, e andavas por onde querias; mas, quando fores velho, estender\xe1s as m\xe3os e outro te cingir\xe1, e te levar\xe1 para onde tu n\xe3o queres."},{verse:19,en:"This spake he, signifying by what death he should glorify God. And when he had spoken this, he saith unto him, Follow me.",pt:"Ora, isto ele disse, significando com que morte havia Pedro de glorificar a Deus. E, havendo dito isto, ordenou-lhe: Segue-me."},{verse:20,en:"Then Peter, turning about, seeth the disciple whom Jesus loved following; which also leaned on his breast at supper, and said, Lord, which is he that betrayeth thee?",pt:"E Pedro, virando-se, viu que o seguia aquele disc\xedpulo a quem Jesus amava, o mesmo que na ceia se recostara sobre o peito de Jesus e perguntara: Senhor, quem \xe9 o que te trai?"},{verse:21,en:"Peter seeing him saith to Jesus, Lord, and what shall this man do?",pt:"Ora, vendo Pedro a este, perguntou a Jesus: Senhor, e deste que ser\xe1?"},{verse:22,en:"Jesus saith unto him, If I will that he tarry till I come, what is that to thee? follow thou me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Se eu quiser que ele fique at\xe9 que eu venha, que tens tu com isso? Segue-me tu."},{verse:23,en:"Then went this saying abroad among the brethren, that that disciple should not die: yet Jesus said not unto him, He shall not die; but, If I will that he tarry till I come, what is that to thee?",pt:"Divulgou-se, pois, entre os irm\xe3os este dito, que aquele disc\xedpulo n\xe3o havia de morrer. Jesus, por\xe9m, n\xe3o disse que n\xe3o morreria, mas: se eu quiser que ele fique at\xe9 que eu venha, que tens tu com isso?"},{verse:24,en:"This is the disciple which testifieth of these things, and wrote these things: and we know that his testimony is true.",pt:"Este \xe9 o disc\xedpulo que d\xe1 testemunho destas coisas e as escreveu; e sabemos que o seu testemunho \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:25,en:"And there are also many other things which Jesus did, the which, if they should be written every one, I suppose that even the world itself could not contain the books that should be written. Amen.",pt:"E ainda muitas outras coisas h\xe1 que Jesus fez; as quais, se fossem escritas uma por uma, creio que nem ainda no mundo inteiro caberiam os livros que se escrevessem."}]}}),684,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,r,t,n){r.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The proverbs of Solomon the son of David, king of Israel;",pt:"Prov\xe9rbios de Salom\xe3o, filho de Davi, rei de Israel:"},{verse:2,en:"To know wisdom and instruction; to perceive the words of understanding;",pt:"Para se conhecer a sabedoria e a instru\xe7\xe3o; para se entenderem as palavras de intelig\xeancia;"},{verse:3,en:"To receive the instruction of wisdom, justice, and judgment, and equity;",pt:"para se instruir em s\xe1bio procedimento, em retid\xe3o, justi\xe7a e eq\xfcidade;"},{verse:4,en:"To give subtilty to the simple, to the young man knowledge and discretion.",pt:"para se dar aos simples prud\xeancia, e aos jovens conhecimento e bom siso."},{verse:5,en:"A wise man will hear, and will increase learning; and a man of understanding shall attain unto wise counsels:",pt:"Ou\xe7a tamb\xe9m, o s\xe1bio e cres\xe7a em ci\xeancia, e o entendido adquira habilidade,"},{verse:6,en:"To understand a proverb, and the interpretation; the words of the wise, and their dark sayings.",pt:"para entender prov\xe9rbios e par\xe1bolas, as palavras dos s\xe1bios, e seus enigmas."},{verse:7,en:"The fear of the LORD is the beginning of knowledge: but fools despise wisdom and instruction.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 o princ\xedpio do conhecimento; mas os insensatos desprezam a sabedoria e a instru\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:8,en:"My son, hear the instruction of thy father, and forsake not the law of thy mother:",pt:"Filho meu, ouve a instru\xe7\xe3o de teu pai, e n\xe3o deixes o ensino de tua m\xe3e."},{verse:9,en:"For they shall be an ornament of grace unto thy head, and chains about thy neck.",pt:"Porque eles ser\xe3o uma grinalda de gra\xe7a para a tua cabe\xe7a, e colares para o teu pesco\xe7o."},{verse:10,en:"My son, if sinners entice thee, consent thou not.",pt:"Filho meu, se os pecadores te quiserem seduzir, n\xe3o consintas."},{verse:11,en:"If they say, Come with us, let us lay wait for blood, let us lurk privily for the innocent without cause:",pt:"Se disserem: Vem conosco; embosquemo-nos para derramar sangue; espreitemos sem raz\xe3o o inocente;"},{verse:12,en:"Let us swallow them up alive as the grave; and whole, as those that go down into the pit:",pt:"traguemo-los vivos, como o Seol, e inteiros como os que descem \xe0 cova;"},{verse:13,en:"We shall find all precious substance, we shall fill our houses with spoil:",pt:"acharemos toda sorte de bens preciosos; encheremos as nossas casas de despojos;"},{verse:14,en:"Cast in thy lot among us; let us all have one purse:",pt:"lan\xe7ar\xe1s a tua sorte entre n\xf3s; teremos todos uma s\xf3 bolsa;"},{verse:15,en:"My son, walk not thou in the way with them; refrain thy foot from their path:",pt:"filho meu, n\xe3o andes no caminho com eles; guarda da sua vereda o teu p\xe9,"},{verse:16,en:"For their feet run to evil, and make haste to shed blood.",pt:"porque os seus p\xe9s correm para o mal, e eles se apressam a derramar sangue."},{verse:17,en:"Surely in vain the net is spread in the sight of any bird.",pt:"Pois debalde se estende a rede \xe0 vista de qualquer ave."},{verse:18,en:"And they lay wait for their own blood; they lurk privily for their own lives.",pt:"Mas estes se p\xf5em em emboscadas contra o seu pr\xf3prio sangue, e as suas pr\xf3prias vidas espreitam."},{verse:19,en:"So are the ways of every one that is greedy of gain; which taketh away the life of the owners thereof.",pt:"Tais s\xe3o as veredas de todo aquele que se entrega \xe0 cobi\xe7a; ela tira a vida dos que a possuem."},{verse:20,en:"Wisdom crieth without; she uttereth her voice in the streets:",pt:"A suprema sabedoria altissonantemente clama nas ruas; nas pra\xe7as levanta a sua voz."},{verse:21,en:"She crieth in the chief place of concourse, in the openings of the gates: in the city she uttereth her words, saying,",pt:"Do alto dos muros clama; \xe0s entradas das portas e na cidade profere as suas palavras:"},{verse:22,en:"How long, ye simple ones, will ye love simplicity? and the scorners delight in their scorning, and fools hate knowledge?",pt:"At\xe9 quando, \xf3 est\xfapidos, amareis a estupidez? e at\xe9 quando se deleitar\xe3o no esc\xe1rnio os escarnecedores, e odiar\xe3o os insensatos o conhecimento?"},{verse:23,en:"Turn you at my reproof: behold, I will pour out my spirit unto you, I will make known my words unto you.",pt:"Convertei-vos pela minha repreens\xe3o; eis que derramarei sobre v\xf3s o meu; esp\xedrito e vos farei saber as minhas palavras."},{verse:24,en:"Because I have called, and ye refused; I have stretched out my hand, and no man regarded;",pt:"Mas, porque clamei, e v\xf3s recusastes; porque estendi a minha m\xe3o, e nao houve quem desse aten\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:25,en:"But ye have set at nought all my counsel, and would none of my reproof:",pt:"antes desprezastes todo o meu conselho, e n\xe3o fizestes caso da minha repreens\xe3o;"},{verse:26,en:"I also will laugh at your calamity; I will mock when your fear cometh;",pt:"tamb\xe9m eu me rirei no dia da vossa calamidade; zombarei, quando sobrevier o vosso terror,"},{verse:27,en:"When your fear cometh as desolation, and your destruction cometh as a whirlwind; when distress and anguish cometh upon you.",pt:"quando o terror vos sobrevier como tempestade, e a vossa calamidade passar como redemoinho, e quando vos sobrevierem aperto e ang\xfastia."},{verse:28,en:"Then shall they call upon me, but I will not answer; they shall seek me early, but they shall not find me:",pt:"Ent\xe3o a mim clamar\xe3o, mas eu n\xe3o responderei; diligentemente me buscar\xe3o, mas n\xe3o me achar\xe3o."},{verse:29,en:"For that they hated knowledge, and did not choose the fear of the LORD:",pt:"Porquanto aborreceram o conhecimento, e n\xe3o preferiram o temor do Senhor;"},{verse:30,en:"They would none of my counsel: they despised all my reproof.",pt:"n\xe3o quiseram o meu conselho e desprezaram toda a minha repreens\xe3o;"},{verse:31,en:"Therefore shall they eat of the fruit of their own way, and be filled with their own devices.",pt:"portanto comer\xe3o do fruto do seu caminho e se fartar\xe3o dos seus pr\xf3prios conselhos."},{verse:32,en:"For the turning away of the simple shall slay them, and the prosperity of fools shall destroy them.",pt:"Porque o desvio dos n\xe9scios os matar\xe1, e a prosperidade dos loucos os destruir\xe1."},{verse:33,en:"But whoso hearkeneth unto me shall dwell safely, and shall be quiet from fear of evil.",pt:"Mas o que me der ouvidos habitar\xe1 em seguran\xe7a, e estar\xe1 tranq\xfcilo, sem receio do mal."}]}}),685,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, if thou wilt receive my words, and hide my commandments with thee;",pt:"Filho meu, se aceitares as minhas palavras, e entesourares contigo os meus mandamentos,"},{verse:2,en:"So that thou incline thine ear unto wisdom, and apply thine heart to understanding;",pt:"para fazeres atento \xe0 sabedoria o teu ouvido, e para inclinares o teu cora\xe7\xe3o ao entendimento;"},{verse:3,en:"Yea, if thou criest after knowledge, and liftest up thy voice for understanding;",pt:"sim, se clamares por discernimento, e por entendimento al\xe7ares a tua voz;"},{verse:4,en:"If thou seekest her as silver, and searchest for her as for hid treasures;",pt:"se o buscares como a prata e o procurares como a tesouros escondidos;"},{verse:5,en:"Then shalt thou understand the fear of the LORD, and find the knowledge of God.",pt:"ent\xe3o entender\xe1s o temor do Senhor, e achar\xe1s o conhecimento de Deus."},{verse:6,en:"For the LORD giveth wisdom: out of his mouth cometh knowledge and understanding.",pt:"Porque o Senhor d\xe1 a sabedoria; da sua boca procedem o conhecimento e o entendimento;"},{verse:7,en:"He layeth up sound wisdom for the righteous: he is a buckler to them that walk uprightly.",pt:"ele reserva a verdadeira sabedoria para os retos; e escudo para os que caminham em integridade,"},{verse:8,en:"He keepeth the paths of judgment, and preserveth the way of his saints.",pt:"guardando-lhes as veredas da justi\xe7a, e preservando o caminho dos seus santos."},{verse:9,en:"Then shalt thou understand righteousness, and judgment, and equity; yea, every good path.",pt:"Ent\xe3o entender\xe1s a retid\xe3o, a justi\xe7a, a eq\xfcidade, e todas as boas veredas."},{verse:10,en:"When wisdom entereth into thine heart, and knowledge is pleasant unto thy soul;",pt:"Pois a sabedoria entrar\xe1 no teu cora\xe7\xe3o, e o conhecimento ser\xe1 apraz\xedvel \xe0 tua alma;"},{verse:11,en:"Discretion shall preserve thee, understanding shall keep thee:",pt:"o bom siso te proteger\xe1, e o discernimento e guardar\xe1;"},{verse:12,en:"To deliver thee from the way of the evil man, from the man that speaketh froward things;",pt:"para te livrar do mau caminho, e do homem que diz coisas perversas;"},{verse:13,en:"Who leave the paths of uprightness, to walk in the ways of darkness;",pt:"dos que deixam as veredas da retid\xe3o, para andarem pelos caminhos das trevas;"},{verse:14,en:"Who rejoice to do evil, and delight in the frowardness of the wicked;",pt:"que se alegram de fazer o mal, e se deleitam nas perversidades dos maus;"},{verse:15,en:"Whose ways are crooked, and they froward in their paths:",pt:"dos que s\xe3o tortuosos nas suas veredas; e in\xedquos nas suas carreiras;"},{verse:16,en:"To deliver thee from the strange woman, even from the stranger which flattereth with her words;",pt:"e para te livrar da mulher estranha, da estrangeira que lisonjeia com suas palavras;"},{verse:17,en:"Which forsaketh the guide of her youth, and forgetteth the covenant of her God.",pt:"a qual abandona o companheiro da sua mocidade e se esquece do concerto do seu Deus;"},{verse:18,en:"For her house inclineth unto death, and her paths unto the dead.",pt:"pois a sua casa se inclina para a morte, e as suas veredas para as sombras."},{verse:19,en:"None that go unto her return again, neither take they hold of the paths of life.",pt:"Nenhum dos que se dirigirem a ela, tornara a sair, nem retomar\xe1 as veredas da vida."},{verse:20,en:"That thou mayest walk in the way of good men, and keep the paths of the righteous.",pt:"Assim andar\xe1s pelo caminho dos bons, e guardar\xe1s as veredas dos justos."},{verse:21,en:"For the upright shall dwell in the land, and the perfect shall remain in it.",pt:"Porque os retos habitar\xe3o a terra, e os \xedntegros permanecer\xe3o nela."},{verse:22,en:"But the wicked shall be cut off from the earth, and the transgressors shall be rooted out of it.",pt:"Mas os \xedmpios ser\xe3o exterminados da terra, e dela os aleivosos ser\xe3o desarraigados."}]}}),686,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, forget not my law; but let thine heart keep my commandments:",pt:"Filho meu, n\xe3o te esque\xe7as da minha instru\xe7\xe3o, e o teu cora\xe7\xe3o guarde os meus mandamentos;"},{verse:2,en:"For length of days, and long life, and peace, shall they add to thee.",pt:"porque eles te dar\xe3o longura de dias, e anos de vida e paz."},{verse:3,en:"Let not mercy and truth forsake thee: bind them about thy neck; write them upon the table of thine heart:",pt:"N\xe3o se afastem de ti a benignidade e a fidelidade; ata-as ao teu pesco\xe7o, escreve-as na t\xe1bua do teu cora\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:4,en:"So shalt thou find favour and good understanding in the sight of God and man.",pt:"assim achar\xe1s favor e bom entendimento \xe0 vista de Deus e dos homens."},{verse:5,en:"Trust in the LORD with all thine heart; and lean not unto thine own understanding.",pt:"Confia no Senhor de todo o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, e n\xe3o te estribes no teu pr\xf3prio entendimento."},{verse:6,en:"In all thy ways acknowledge him, and he shall direct thy paths.",pt:"Reconhece-o em todos os teus caminhos, e ele endireitar\xe1 as tuas veredas."},{verse:7,en:"Be not wise in thine own eyes: fear the LORD, and depart from evil.",pt:"N\xe3o sejas s\xe1bio a teus pr\xf3prios olhos; teme ao Senhor e aparta-te do mal."},{verse:8,en:"It shall be health to thy navel, and marrow to thy bones.",pt:"Isso ser\xe1 sa\xfade para a tua carne; e refrig\xe9rio para os teus ossos."},{verse:9,en:"Honour the LORD with thy substance, and with the firstfruits of all thine increase:",pt:"Honra ao Senhor com os teus bens, e com as prim\xedcias de toda a tua renda;"},{verse:10,en:"So shall thy barns be filled with plenty, and thy presses shall burst out with new wine.",pt:"assim se encher\xe3o de fartura os teus celeiros, e trasbordar\xe3o de mosto os teus lagares."},{verse:11,en:"My son, despise not the chastening of the LORD; neither be weary of his correction:",pt:"Filho meu, n\xe3o rejeites a disciplina do Senhor, nem te enojes da sua repreens\xe3o;"},{verse:12,en:"For whom the LORD loveth he correcteth; even as a father the son in whom he delighteth.",pt:"porque o Senhor repreende aquele a quem ama, assim como o pai ao filho a quem quer bem."},{verse:13,en:"Happy is the man that findeth wisdom, and the man that getteth understanding.",pt:"Feliz \xe9 o homem que acha sabedoria, e o homem que adquire entendimento;"},{verse:14,en:"For the merchandise of it is better than the merchandise of silver, and the gain thereof than fine gold.",pt:"pois melhor \xe9 o lucro que ela d\xe1 do que o lucro da prata, e a sua renda do que o ouro."},{verse:15,en:"She is more precious than rubies: and all the things thou canst desire are not to be compared unto her.",pt:"Mais preciosa \xe9 do que as j\xf3ias, e nada do que possas desejar \xe9 compar\xe1vel a ela."},{verse:16,en:"Length of days is in her right hand; and in her left hand riches and honour.",pt:"Longura de dias h\xe1 na sua m\xe3o direita; na sua esquerda riquezas e honra."},{verse:17,en:"Her ways are ways of pleasantness, and all her paths are peace.",pt:"Os seus caminhos s\xe3o caminhos de del\xedcias, e todas as suas veredas s\xe3o paz."},{verse:18,en:"She is a tree of life to them that lay hold upon her: and happy is every one that retaineth her.",pt:"\xc9 \xe1rvore da vida para os que dela lan\xe7am m\xe3o, e bem-aventurado \xe9 todo aquele que a ret\xe9m."},{verse:19,en:"The LORD by wisdom hath founded the earth; by understanding hath he established the heavens.",pt:"O Senhor pela sabedoria fundou a terra; pelo entendimento estabeleceu o c\xe9u."},{verse:20,en:"By his knowledge the depths are broken up, and the clouds drop down the dew.",pt:"Pelo seu conhecimento se fendem os abismos, e as nuvens destilam o orvalho."},{verse:21,en:"My son, let not them depart from thine eyes: keep sound wisdom and discretion:",pt:"Filho meu, n\xe3o se apartem estas coisas dos teus olhos: guarda a verdadeira sabedoria e o bom siso;"},{verse:22,en:"So shall they be life unto thy soul, and grace to thy neck.",pt:"assim ser\xe3o elas vida para a tua alma, e adorno para o teu pesco\xe7o."},{verse:23,en:"Then shalt thou walk in thy way safely, and thy foot shall not stumble.",pt:"Ent\xe3o andar\xe1s seguro pelo teu caminho, e n\xe3o trope\xe7ar\xe1 o teu p\xe9."},{verse:24,en:"When thou liest down, thou shalt not be afraid: yea, thou shalt lie down, and thy sleep shall be sweet.",pt:"Quando te deitares, n\xe3o temer\xe1s; sim, tu te deitar\xe1s e o teu sono ser\xe1 suave."},{verse:25,en:"Be not afraid of sudden fear, neither of the desolation of the wicked, when it cometh.",pt:"N\xe3o temas o pavor repentino, nem a assola\xe7\xe3o dos \xedmpios quando vier."},{verse:26,en:"For the LORD shall be thy confidence, and shall keep thy foot from being taken.",pt:"Porque o Senhor ser\xe1 a tua confian\xe7a, e guardar\xe1 os teus p\xe9s de serem presos."},{verse:27,en:"Withhold not good from them to whom it is due, when it is in the power of thine hand to do it.",pt:"N\xe3o negues o bem a quem de direito, estando no teu poder faz\xea-lo."},{verse:28,en:"Say not unto thy neighbour, Go, and come again, and to morrow I will give; when thou hast it by thee.",pt:"N\xe3o digas ao teu pr\xf3ximo: Vai, e volta, amanh\xe3 to darei; tendo-o tu contigo."},{verse:29,en:"Devise not evil against thy neighbour, seeing he dwelleth securely by thee.",pt:"N\xe3o maquines o mal contra o teu pr\xf3ximo, que habita contigo confiadamente."},{verse:30,en:"Strive not with a man without cause, if he have done thee no harm.",pt:"N\xe3o contendas com um homem, sem motivo, n\xe3o te havendo ele feito o mal."},{verse:31,en:"Envy thou not the oppressor, and choose none of his ways.",pt:"N\xe3o tenhas inveja do homem violento, nem escolhas nenhum de seus caminhos."},{verse:32,en:"For the froward is abomination to the LORD: but his secret is with the righteous.",pt:"Porque o perverso \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o para o Senhor, mas com os retos est\xe1 o seu segredo."},{verse:33,en:"The curse of the LORD is in the house of the wicked: but he blesseth the habitation of the just.",pt:"A maldi\xe7\xe3o do Senhor habita na casa do \xedmpio, mas ele aben\xe7oa a habita\xe7\xe3o dos justos."},{verse:34,en:"Surely he scorneth the scorners: but he giveth grace unto the lowly.",pt:"Ele escarnece dos escarnecedores, mas d\xe1 gra\xe7a aos humildes."},{verse:35,en:"The wise shall inherit glory: but shame shall be the promotion of fools.",pt:"Os s\xe1bios herdar\xe3o honra, mas a exalta\xe7\xe3o dos loucos se converte em ignom\xednia."}]}}),687,[]);
__d((function(e,a,t,o,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Hear, ye children, the instruction of a father, and attend to know understanding.",pt:"Ouvi, filhos, a instru\xe7\xe3o do pai, e estai atentos para conhecerdes o entendimento."},{verse:2,en:"For I give you good doctrine, forsake ye not my law.",pt:"Pois eu vos dou boa doutrina; n\xe3o abandoneis o meu ensino."},{verse:3,en:"For I was my father\u2019s son, tender and only beloved in the sight of my mother.",pt:"Quando eu era filho aos p\xe9s de meu, pai, tenro e \xfanico em estima diante de minha m\xe3e,"},{verse:4,en:"He taught me also, and said unto me, Let thine heart retain my words: keep my commandments, and live.",pt:"ele me ensinava, e me dizia: Retenha o teu cora\xe7\xe3o as minhas palavras; guarda os meus mandamentos, e vive."},{verse:5,en:"Get wisdom, get understanding: forget it not; neither decline from the words of my mouth.",pt:"Adquire a sabedoria, adquire o entendimento; n\xe3o te esque\xe7as nem te desvies das palavras da minha boca."},{verse:6,en:"Forsake her not, and she shall preserve thee: love her, and she shall keep thee.",pt:"N\xe3o a abandones, e ela te guardar\xe1; ama-a, e ela te preservar\xe1."},{verse:7,en:"Wisdom is the principal thing; therefore get wisdom: and with all thy getting get understanding.",pt:"A sabedoria \xe9 a coisa principal; adquire, pois, a sabedoria; sim, com tudo o que possuis adquire o entendimento."},{verse:8,en:"Exalt her, and she shall promote thee: she shall bring thee to honour, when thou dost embrace her.",pt:"Estima-a, e ela te exaltar\xe1; se a abra\xe7ares, ela te honrar\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"She shall give to thine head an ornament of grace: a crown of glory shall she deliver to thee.",pt:"Ela dar\xe1 \xe0 tua cabe\xe7a uma grinalda de gra\xe7a; e uma coroa de gl\xf3ria te entregar\xe1."},{verse:10,en:"Hear, O my son, and receive my sayings; and the years of thy life shall be many.",pt:"Ouve, filho meu, e aceita as minhas palavras, para que se multipliquem os anos da tua vida."},{verse:11,en:"I have taught thee in the way of wisdom; I have led thee in right paths.",pt:"Eu te ensinei o caminho da sabedoria; guiei-te pelas veredas da retid\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"When thou goest, thy steps shall not be straitened; and when thou runnest, thou shalt not stumble.",pt:"Quando andares, n\xe3o se embara\xe7ar\xe3o os teus passos; e se correres, n\xe3o trope\xe7ar\xe1s."},{verse:13,en:"Take fast hold of instruction; let her not go: keep her; for she is thy life.",pt:"Apega-te \xe0 instru\xe7\xe3o e n\xe3o a largues; guarda-a, porque ela \xe9 a tua vida."},{verse:14,en:"Enter not into the path of the wicked, and go not in the way of evil men.",pt:"N\xe3o entres na vereda dos \xedmpios, nem andes pelo caminho dos maus."},{verse:15,en:"Avoid it, pass not by it, turn from it, and pass away.",pt:"Evita-o, n\xe3o passes por ele; desvia-te dele e passa de largo."},{verse:16,en:"For they sleep not, except they have done mischief; and their sleep is taken away, unless they cause some to fall.",pt:"Pois n\xe3o dormem, se n\xe3o fizerem o mal, e foge deles o sono se n\xe3o fizerem trope\xe7ar algu\xe9m."},{verse:17,en:"For they eat the bread of wickedness, and drink the wine of violence.",pt:"Porque comem o p\xe3o da impiedade, e bebem o vinho da viol\xeancia."},{verse:18,en:"But the path of the just is as the shining light, that shineth more and more unto the perfect day.",pt:"Mas a vereda dos justos \xe9 como a luz da aurora que vai brilhando mais e mais at\xe9 ser dia perfeito."},{verse:19,en:"The way of the wicked is as darkness: they know not at what they stumble.",pt:"O caminho dos \xedmpios \xe9 como a escurid\xe3o: n\xe3o sabem eles em que trope\xe7am."},{verse:20,en:"My son, attend to my words; incline thine ear unto my sayings.",pt:"Filho meu, atenta para as minhas palavras; inclina o teu ouvido \xe0s minhas instro\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:21,en:"Let them not depart from thine eyes; keep them in the midst of thine heart.",pt:"N\xe3o se apartem elas de diante dos teus olhos; guarda-as dentro do teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"For they are life unto those that find them, and health to all their flesh.",pt:"Porque s\xe3o vida para os que as encontram, e sa\xfade para todo o seu corpo."},{verse:23,en:"Keep thy heart with all diligence; for out of it are the issues of life.",pt:"Guarda com toda a dilig\xeancia o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, porque dele procedem as fontes da vida."},{verse:24,en:"Put away from thee a froward mouth, and perverse lips put far from thee.",pt:"Desvia de ti a malignidade da boca, e alonga de ti a perversidade dos l\xe1bios."},{verse:25,en:"Let thine eyes look right on, and let thine eyelids look straight before thee.",pt:"Dirijam-se os teus olhos para a frente, e olhem as tuas p\xe1lpebras diretamente diante de ti."},{verse:26,en:"Ponder the path of thy feet, and let all thy ways be established.",pt:"Pondera a vereda de teus p\xe9s, e ser\xe3o seguros todos os teus caminhos."},{verse:27,en:"Turn not to the right hand nor to the left: remove thy foot from evil.",pt:"N\xe3o declines nem para a direita nem para a esquerda; retira o teu p\xe9 do mal."}]}}),688,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, attend unto my wisdom, and bow thine ear to my understanding:",pt:"Filho meu, atende \xe0 minha sabedoria; inclin\xe3o teu ouvido \xe0 minha prud\xeancia;"},{verse:2,en:"That thou mayest regard discretion, and that thy lips may keep knowledge.",pt:"para que observes a discri\xe7\xe3o, e os teus l\xe1bios guardem o conhecimento."},{verse:3,en:"For the lips of a strange woman drop as an honeycomb, and her mouth is smoother than oil:",pt:"Porque os l\xe1bios da mulher licenciosa destilam mel, e a sua boca e mais macia do que o azeite;"},{verse:4,en:"But her end is bitter as wormwood, sharp as a twoedged sword.",pt:"mas o seu fim \xe9 amargoso como o absinto, agudo como a espada de dois gumes."},{verse:5,en:"Her feet go down to death; her steps take hold on hell.",pt:"Os seus p\xe9s descem \xe0 morte; os seus passos seguem no caminho do Seol."},{verse:6,en:"Lest thou shouldest ponder the path of life, her ways are moveable, that thou canst not know them.",pt:"Ela n\xe3o pondera a vereda da vida; incertos s\xe3o os seus caminhos, e ela o ignora."},{verse:7,en:"Hear me now therefore, O ye children, and depart not from the words of my mouth.",pt:"Agora, pois, filhos, dai-me ouvidos, e n\xe3o vos desvieis das palavras da minha boca."},{verse:8,en:"Remove thy way far from her, and come not nigh the door of her house:",pt:"Afasta para longe dela o teu caminho, e n\xe3o te aproximes da porta da sua casa;"},{verse:9,en:"Lest thou give thine honour unto others, and thy years unto the cruel:",pt:"para que n\xe3o d\xeas a outros a tua honra, nem os teus anos a cru\xe9is;"},{verse:10,en:"Lest strangers be filled with thy wealth; and thy labours be in the house of a stranger;",pt:"para que n\xe3o se fartem os estranhos dos teus bens, e n\xe3o entrem os teus trabalhos na casa do estrangeiro,"},{verse:11,en:"And thou mourn at the last, when thy flesh and thy body are consumed,",pt:"e gemas no teu fim, quando se consumirem a tua carne e o teu corpo,"},{verse:12,en:"And say, How have I hated instruction, and my heart despised reproof;",pt:"e digas: Como detestei a disciplina! e desprezou o meu cora\xe7\xe3o a repreens\xe3o!"},{verse:13,en:"And have not obeyed the voice of my teachers, nor inclined mine ear to them that instructed me!",pt:"e n\xe3o escutei a voz dos que me ensinavam, nem aos que me instru\xedam inclinei o meu ouvido!"},{verse:14,en:"I was almost in all evil in the midst of the congregation and assembly.",pt:"Quase cheguei \xe0 ru\xedna completa, no meio da congrega\xe7\xe3o e da assembl\xe9ia."},{verse:15,en:"Drink waters out of thine own cistern, and running waters out of thine own well.",pt:"Bebe a \xe1gua da tua pr\xf3pria cisterna, e das correntes do teu po\xe7o."},{verse:16,en:"Let thy fountains be dispersed abroad, and rivers of waters in the streets.",pt:"Derramar-se-iam as tuas fontes para fora, e pelas ruas os ribeiros de \xe1guas?"},{verse:17,en:"Let them be only thine own, and not strangers\u2019 with thee.",pt:"Sejam para ti s\xf3, e n\xe3o para os estranhos juntamente contigo."},{verse:18,en:"Let thy fountain be blessed: and rejoice with the wife of thy youth.",pt:"Seja bendito o teu manancial; e regozija-te na mulher da tua mocidade."},{verse:19,en:"Let her be as the loving hind and pleasant roe; let her breasts satisfy thee at all times; and be thou ravished always with her love.",pt:"Como cor\xe7a amorosa, e graciosa cabra montesa saciem-te os seus seios em todo o tempo; e pelo seu amor s\xea encantado perpetuamente."},{verse:20,en:"And why wilt thou, my son, be ravished with a strange woman, and embrace the bosom of a stranger?",pt:"E por que, filho meu, andarias atra\xeddo pela mulher licenciosa, e abra\xc7arias o seio da ad\xfaltera?"},{verse:21,en:"For the ways of man are before the eyes of the LORD, and he pondereth all his goings.",pt:"Porque os caminhos do homem est\xe3o diante dos olhos do Senhor, o qual observa todas as suas veredas."},{verse:22,en:"His own iniquities shall take the wicked himself, and he shall be holden with the cords of his sins.",pt:"Quanto ao \xedmpio, as suas pr\xf3prias iniq\xfcidades o prender\xe3o, e pelas cordas do seu pecado ser\xe1 detido."},{verse:23,en:"He shall die without instruction; and in the greatness of his folly he shall go astray.",pt:"Ele morre pela falta de disciplina; e pelo excesso da sua loucura anda errado."}]}}),689,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, if thou be surety for thy friend, if thou hast stricken thy hand with a stranger,",pt:"Filho meu, se ficaste por fiador do teu pr\xf3ximo, se te empenhaste por um estranho,"},{verse:2,en:"Thou art snared with the words of thy mouth, thou art taken with the words of thy mouth.",pt:"est\xe1s enredado pelos teus l\xe1bios; est\xe1s preso pelas palavras da tua boca."},{verse:3,en:"Do this now, my son, deliver thyself, when thou art come into the hand of thy friend; go, humble thyself, and make sure thy friend.",pt:"Faze pois isto agora, filho meu, e livra-te, pois j\xe1 ca\xedste nas m\xe3os do teu pr\xf3ximo; vai, humilha-te, e importuna o teu pr\xf3ximo;"},{verse:4,en:"Give not sleep to thine eyes, nor slumber to thine eyelids.",pt:"n\xe3o d\xeas sono aos teus olhos, nem adormecimento \xe0s tuas p\xe1lpebras;"},{verse:5,en:"Deliver thyself as a roe from the hand of the hunter, and as a bird from the hand of the fowler.",pt:"livra-te como a gazela da m\xe3o do ca\xe7ador, e como a ave da m\xe3o do passarinheiro."},{verse:6,en:"Go to the ant, thou sluggard; consider her ways, and be wise:",pt:"Vai ter com a formiga, \xf3 pregui\xe7oso, considera os seus caminhos, e s\xea s\xe1bio;"},{verse:7,en:"Which having no guide, overseer, or ruler,",pt:"a qual, n\xe3o tendo chefe, nem superintendente, nem governador,"},{verse:8,en:"Provideth her meat in the summer, and gathereth her food in the harvest.",pt:"no ver\xe3o faz a provis\xe3o do seu mantimento, e ajunta o seu alimento no tempo da ceifa."},{verse:9,en:"How long wilt thou sleep, O sluggard? when wilt thou arise out of thy sleep?",pt:"o pregui\xe7oso, at\xe9 quando ficar\xe1s deitador? quando te levantar\xe1s do teu sono?"},{verse:10,en:"Yet a little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to sleep:",pt:"um pouco para dormir, um pouco para toscanejar, um pouco para cruzar as m\xe3os em repouso;"},{verse:11,en:"So shall thy poverty come as one that travelleth, and thy want as an armed man.",pt:"assim te sobrevir\xe1 a tua pobreza como um ladr\xe3o, e a tua necessidade como um homem armado."},{verse:12,en:"A naughty person, a wicked man, walketh with a froward mouth.",pt:"O homem vil, o homem in\xedquo, anda com a perversidade na boca,"},{verse:13,en:"He winketh with his eyes, he speaketh with his feet, he teacheth with his fingers;",pt:"pisca os olhos, faz sinais com os p\xe9s, e acena com os dedos;"},{verse:14,en:"Frowardness is in his heart, he deviseth mischief continually; he soweth discord.",pt:"perversidade h\xe1 no seu cora\xe7\xe3o; todo o tempo maquina o mal; anda semeando contendas."},{verse:15,en:"Therefore shall his calamity come suddenly; suddenly shall he be broken without remedy.",pt:"Pelo que a sua destrui\xe7\xe3o vir\xe1 repentinamente; subitamente ser\xe1 quebrantado, sem que haja cura."},{verse:16,en:"These six things doth the LORD hate: yea, seven are an abomination unto him:",pt:"H\xe1 seis coisas que o Senhor detesta; sim, h\xe1 sete que ele abomina:"},{verse:17,en:"A proud look, a lying tongue, and hands that shed innocent blood,",pt:"olhos altivos, l\xedngua mentirosa, e m\xe3os que derramam sangue inocente;"},{verse:18,en:"An heart that deviseth wicked imaginations, feet that be swift in running to mischief,",pt:"cora\xe7\xe3o que maquina projetos in\xedquos, p\xe9s que se apressam a correr para o mal;"},{verse:19,en:"A false witness that speaketh lies, and he that soweth discord among brethren.",pt:"testemunha falsa que profere mentiras, e o que semeia contendas entre irm\xe3os."},{verse:20,en:"My son, keep thy father\u2019s commandment, and forsake not the law of thy mother:",pt:"Filho meu, guarda o mandamento de, teu pai, e n\xe3o abandones a instru\xe7\xe3o de tua m\xe3e;"},{verse:21,en:"Bind them continually upon thine heart, and tie them about thy neck.",pt:"ata-os perpetuamente ao teu cora\xe7\xe3o, e pendura-os ao teu pesco\xe7o."},{verse:22,en:"When thou goest, it shall lead thee; when thou sleepest, it shall keep thee; and when thou awakest, it shall talk with thee.",pt:"Quando caminhares, isso te guiar\xe1; quando te deitares, te guardar\xe1; quando acordares, falar\xe1 contigo."},{verse:23,en:"For the commandment is a lamp; and the law is light; and reproofs of instruction are the way of life:",pt:"Porque o mandamento \xe9 uma l\xe2mpada, e a instru\xe7\xe3o uma luz; e as repreens\xf5es da disciplina s\xe3o o caminho da vida,"},{verse:24,en:"To keep thee from the evil woman, from the flattery of the tongue of a strange woman.",pt:"para te guardarem da mulher m\xe1, e das lisonjas da l\xedngua da ad\xfaltera."},{verse:25,en:"Lust not after her beauty in thine heart; neither let her take thee with her eyelids.",pt:"N\xe3o cobices no teu cora\xe7\xe3o a sua formosura, nem te deixes prender pelos seus olhares."},{verse:26,en:"For by means of a whorish woman a man is brought to a piece of bread: and the adulteress will hunt for the precious life.",pt:"Porque o pre\xe7o da prostituta \xe9 apenas um bocado de p\xe3o, mas a ad\xfaltera anda \xe0 ca\xe7a da pr\xf3pria vida do homem."},{verse:27,en:"Can a man take fire in his bosom, and his clothes not be burned?",pt:"Pode algu\xe9m tomar fogo no seu seio, sem que os seus vestidos se queimem?"},{verse:28,en:"Can one go upon hot coals, and his feet not be burned?",pt:"Ou andar\xe1 sobre as brasas sem que se queimem os seus p\xe9s?"},{verse:29,en:"So he that goeth in to his neighbour\u2019s wife; whosoever toucheth her shall not be innocent.",pt:"Assim ser\xe1 o que entrar \xe0 mulher do seu proximo; n\xe3o ficar\xe1 inocente quem a tocar."},{verse:30,en:"Men do not despise a thief, if he steal to satisfy his soul when he is hungry;",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 desprezado o ladr\xe3o, mesmo quando furta para saciar a fome?"},{verse:31,en:"But if he be found, he shall restore sevenfold; he shall give all the substance of his house.",pt:"E, se for apanhado, pagar\xe1 sete vezes tanto, dando at\xe9 todos os bens de sua casa."},{verse:32,en:"But whoso committeth adultery with a woman lacketh understanding: he that doeth it destroyeth his own soul.",pt:"O que adultera com uma mulher \xe9 falto de entendimento; destr\xf3i-se a si mesmo, quem assim procede."},{verse:33,en:"A wound and dishonour shall he get; and his reproach shall not be wiped away.",pt:"Receber\xe1 feridas e ignom\xednia, e o seu opr\xf3brio nunca se apagar\xe1;"},{verse:34,en:"For jealousy is the rage of a man: therefore he will not spare in the day of vengeance.",pt:"porque o ci\xfame enfurece ao marido, que de maneira nenhuma poupar\xe1 no dia da vingan\xe7a."},{verse:35,en:"He will not regard any ransom; neither will he rest content, though thou givest many gifts.",pt:"N\xe3o aceitar\xe1 resgate algum, nem se aplacar\xe1, ainda que multipliques os presentes."}]}}),690,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, keep my words, and lay up my commandments with thee.",pt:"Filho meu, guarda as minhas palavras, e entesoura contigo os meus mandamentos."},{verse:2,en:"Keep my commandments, and live; and my law as the apple of thine eye.",pt:"Observa os meus mandamentos e vive; guarda a minha lei, como a menina dos teus olhos."},{verse:3,en:"Bind them upon thy fingers, write them upon the table of thine heart.",pt:"Ata-os aos teus dedos, escreve-os na t\xe1bua do teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:4,en:"Say unto wisdom, Thou art my sister; and call understanding thy kinswoman:",pt:"Dize \xe0 sabedoria: Tu \xe9s minha irm\xe3; e chama ao entendimento teu amigo \xedntimo,"},{verse:5,en:"That they may keep thee from the strange woman, from the stranger which flattereth with her words.",pt:"para te guardarem da mulher alheia, da ad\xfaltera, que lisonjeia com as suas palavras."},{verse:6,en:"For at the window of my house I looked through my casement,",pt:"Porque da janela da minha casa, por minhas grades olhando eu,"},{verse:7,en:"And beheld among the simple ones, I discerned among the youths, a young man void of understanding,",pt:"vi entre os simples, divisei entre os jovens, um mancebo falto de ju\xedzo,"},{verse:8,en:"Passing through the street near her corner; and he went the way to her house,",pt:"que passava pela rua junto \xe0 esquina da mulher ad\xfaltera e que seguia o caminho da sua casa,"},{verse:9,en:"In the twilight, in the evening, in the black and dark night:",pt:"no crep\xfasculo, \xe0 tarde do dia, \xe0 noite fechada e na escurid\xe3o;"},{verse:10,en:"And, behold, there met him a woman with the attire of an harlot, and subtil of heart.",pt:"e eis que uma mulher lhe saiu ao encontro, ornada \xe0 moda das prostitutas, e astuta de cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"(She is loud and stubborn; her feet abide not in her house:",pt:"Ela \xe9 turbulenta e obstinada; n\xe3o param em casa os seus p\xe9s;"},{verse:12,en:"Now is she without, now in the streets, and lieth in wait at every corner.)",pt:"ora est\xe1 ela pelas ruas, ora pelas pra\xe7as, espreitando por todos os cantos."},{verse:13,en:"So she caught him, and kissed him, and with an impudent face said unto him,",pt:"Pegou dele, pois, e o beijou; e com semblante impudico lhe disse:"},{verse:14,en:"I have peace offerings with me; this day have I payed my vows.",pt:"Sacrif\xedcios pac\xedficos tenho comigo; hoje paguei os meus votos."},{verse:15,en:"Therefore came I forth to meet thee, diligently to seek thy face, and I have found thee.",pt:"Por isso sa\xed ao teu encontro a buscar-te diligentemente, e te achei."},{verse:16,en:"I have decked my bed with coverings of tapestry, with carved works, with fine linen of Egypt.",pt:"J\xe1 cobri a minha cama de cobertas, de colchas de linho do Egito."},{verse:17,en:"I have perfumed my bed with myrrh, aloes, and cinnamon.",pt:"J\xe1 perfumei o meu leito com mirra, alo\xe9s e cinamomo."},{verse:18,en:"Come, let us take our fill of love until the morning: let us solace ourselves with loves.",pt:"Vem, saciemo-nos de amores at\xe9 pela manh\xe3; alegremo-nos com amores."},{verse:19,en:"For the goodman is not at home, he is gone a long journey:",pt:"Porque meu marido n\xe3o est\xe1 em casa; foi fazer uma jornada ao longe;"},{verse:20,en:"He hath taken a bag of money with him, and will come home at the day appointed.",pt:"um saquitel de dinheiro levou na m\xe3o; s\xf3 l\xe1 para o dia da lua cheia voltar\xe1 para casa."},{verse:21,en:"With her much fair speech she caused him to yield, with the flattering of her lips she forced him.",pt:"Ela o faz ceder com a multid\xe3o das suas palavras sedutoras, com as lisonjas dos seus l\xe1bios o arrasta."},{verse:22,en:"He goeth after her straightway, as an ox goeth to the slaughter, or as a fool to the correction of the stocks;",pt:"Ele a segue logo, como boi que vai ao matadouro, e como o louco ao castigo das pris\xf5es;"},{verse:23,en:"Till a dart strike through his liver; as a bird hasteth to the snare, and knoweth not that it is for his life.",pt:"at\xe9 que uma flecha lhe atravesse o f\xedgado, como a ave que se apressa para o la\xe7o, sem saber que est\xe1 armado contra a sua vida."},{verse:24,en:"Hearken unto me now therefore, O ye children, and attend to the words of my mouth.",pt:"Agora, pois, filhos, ouvi-me, e estai atentos \xe0s palavras da minha boca."},{verse:25,en:"Let not thine heart decline to her ways, go not astray in her paths.",pt:"N\xe3o se desvie para os seus caminhos o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, e n\xe3o andes perdido nas suas veredas."},{verse:26,en:"For she hath cast down many wounded: yea, many strong men have been slain by her.",pt:"Porque ela a muitos tem feito cair feridos; e s\xe3o muit\xedssimos os que por ela foram mortos."},{verse:27,en:"Her house is the way to hell, going down to the chambers of death.",pt:"Caminho de Seol \xe9 a sua casa, o qual desce \xe0s c\xe2maras da morte."}]}}),691,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Doth not wisdom cry? and understanding put forth her voice?",pt:"N\xe3o clama porventura a sabedoria, e n\xe3o faz o entendimento soar a sua voz?"},{verse:2,en:"She standeth in the top of high places, by the way in the places of the paths.",pt:"No cume das alturas, junto ao caminho, nas encruzilhadas das veredas ela se coloca."},{verse:3,en:"She crieth at the gates, at the entry of the city, at the coming in at the doors.",pt:"Junto \xe0s portas, \xe0 entrada da cidade, e \xe0 entrada das portas est\xe1 clamando:"},{verse:4,en:"Unto you, O men, I call; and my voice is to the sons of man.",pt:"A v\xf3s, \xf3 homens, clamo; e a minha voz se dirige aos filhos dos homens."},{verse:5,en:"O ye simple, understand wisdom: and, ye fools, be ye of an understanding heart.",pt:"Aprendei, \xf3 simples, a prud\xeancia; entendei, \xf3 loucos, a sabedoria."},{verse:6,en:"Hear; for I will speak of excellent things; and the opening of my lips shall be right things.",pt:"Ouvi v\xf3s, porque profiro coisas excelentes; os meus l\xe1bios se abrem para a eq\xfcidade."},{verse:7,en:"For my mouth shall speak truth; and wickedness is an abomination to my lips.",pt:"Porque a minha boca profere a verdade, os meus l\xe1bios abominam a impiedade."},{verse:8,en:"All the words of my mouth are in righteousness; there is nothing froward or perverse in them.",pt:"Justas s\xe3o todas as palavras da minha boca; n\xe3o h\xe1 nelas nenhuma coisa tortuosa nem perversa."},{verse:9,en:"They are all plain to him that understandeth, and right to them that find knowledge.",pt:"Todas elas s\xe3o retas para o que bem as entende, e justas para os que acham o conhecimento."},{verse:10,en:"Receive my instruction, and not silver; and knowledge rather than choice gold.",pt:"Aceitai antes a minha corre\xe7\xe3o, e n\xe3o a prata; e o conhecimento, antes do que o ouro escolhido."},{verse:11,en:"For wisdom is better than rubies; and all the things that may be desired are not to be compared to it.",pt:"Porque melhor \xe9 a sabedoria do que as j\xf3ias; e de tudo o que se deseja nada se pode comparar com ela."},{verse:12,en:"I wisdom dwell with prudence, and find out knowledge of witty inventions.",pt:"Eu, a sabedoria, habito com a prud\xeancia, e possuo o conhecimento e a discri\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:13,en:"The fear of the LORD is to hate evil: pride, and arrogancy, and the evil way, and the froward mouth, do I hate.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 odiar o mal; a soberba, e a arrog\xe2ncia, e o mau caminho, e a boca perversa, eu os odeio."},{verse:14,en:"Counsel is mine, and sound wisdom: I am understanding; I have strength.",pt:"Meu \xe9 o conselho, e a verdadeira sabedoria; eu sou o entendimento; minha \xe9 a fortaleza."},{verse:15,en:"By me kings reign, and princes decree justice.",pt:"Por mim reinam os reis, e os pr\xedncipes decretam o que justo."},{verse:16,en:"By me princes rule, and nobles, even all the judges of the earth.",pt:"Por mim governam os pr\xedncipes e os nobres, sim, todos os ju\xedzes da terra."},{verse:17,en:"I love them that love me; and those that seek me early shall find me.",pt:"Eu amo aos que me amam, e os que diligentemente me buscam me achar\xe3o."},{verse:18,en:"Riches and honour are with me; yea, durable riches and righteousness.",pt:"Riquezas e honra est\xe3o comigo; sim, riquezas dur\xe1veis e justi\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"My fruit is better than gold, yea, than fine gold; and my revenue than choice silver.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o meu fruto do que o ouro, sim, do que o ouro refinado; e a minha renda melhor do que a prata escolhida."},{verse:20,en:"I lead in the way of righteousness, in the midst of the paths of judgment:",pt:"Ando pelo caminho da retid\xe3o, no meio das veredas da justi\xe7a,"},{verse:21,en:"That I may cause those that love me to inherit substance; and I will fill their treasures.",pt:"dotando de bens permanentes os que me amam, e enchendo os seus tesouros."},{verse:22,en:"The LORD possessed me in the beginning of his way, before his works of old.",pt:"O Senhor me criou como a primeira das suas obras, o princ\xedpio dos seus feitos mais antigos."},{verse:23,en:"I was set up from everlasting, from the beginning, or ever the earth was.",pt:"Desde a eternidade fui constitu\xedda, desde o princ\xedpio, antes de existir a terra."},{verse:24,en:"When there were no depths, I was brought forth; when there were no fountains abounding with water.",pt:"Antes de haver abismos, fui gerada, e antes ainda de haver fontes cheias d'\xe1gua."},{verse:25,en:"Before the mountains were settled, before the hills was I brought forth:",pt:"Antes que os montes fossem firmados, antes dos outeiros eu nasci,"},{verse:26,en:"While as yet he had not made the earth, nor the fields, nor the highest part of the dust of the world.",pt:"quando ele ainda n\xe3o tinha feito a terra com seus campos, nem sequer o princ\xedpio do p\xf3 do mundo."},{verse:27,en:"When he prepared the heavens, I was there: when he set a compass upon the face of the depth:",pt:"Quando ele preparava os c\xe9us, a\xed estava eu; quando tra\xe7ava um c\xedrculo sobre a face do abismo,"},{verse:28,en:"When he established the clouds above: when he strengthened the fountains of the deep:",pt:"quando estabelecia o firmamento em cima, quando se firmavam as fontes do abismo,"},{verse:29,en:"When he gave to the sea his decree, that the waters should not pass his commandment: when he appointed the foundations of the earth:",pt:"quando ele fixava ao mar o seu termo, para que as \xe1guas n\xe3o traspassassem o seu mando, quando tra\xe7ava os fundamentos da terra,"},{verse:30,en:"Then I was by him, as one brought up with him: and I was daily his delight, rejoicing always before him;",pt:"ent\xe3o eu estava ao seu lado como arquiteto; e era cada dia as suas del\xedcias, alegrando-me perante ele em todo o tempo;"},{verse:31,en:"Rejoicing in the habitable part of his earth; and my delights were with the sons of men.",pt:"folgando no seu mundo habit\xe1vel, e achando as minhas del\xedcias com os filhos dos homens."},{verse:32,en:"Now therefore hearken unto me, O ye children: for blessed are they that keep my ways.",pt:"Agora, pois, filhos, ouvi-me; porque felizes s\xe3o os que guardam os meus caminhos."},{verse:33,en:"Hear instruction, and be wise, and refuse it not.",pt:"Ouvi a corre\xe7\xe3o, e sede s\xe1bios; e n\xe3o a rejeiteis."},{verse:34,en:"Blessed is the man that heareth me, watching daily at my gates, waiting at the posts of my doors.",pt:"Feliz \xe9 o homem que me d\xe1 ouvidos, velando cada dia \xe0s minhas entradas, esperando junto \xe0s ombreiras da minha porta."},{verse:35,en:"For whoso findeth me findeth life, and shall obtain favour of the LORD.",pt:"Porque o que me achar achar\xe1 a vida, e alcan\xe7ar\xe1 o favor do Senhor."},{verse:36,en:"But he that sinneth against me wrongeth his own soul: all they that hate me love death.",pt:"Mas o que pecar contra mim far\xe1 mal \xe0 sua pr\xf3pria alma; todos os que me odeiam amam a morte."}]}}),692,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Wisdom hath builded her house, she hath hewn out her seven pillars:",pt:"A sabedoria j\xe1 edificou a sua casa, j\xe1 lavrou as suas sete colunas;"},{verse:2,en:"She hath killed her beasts; she hath mingled her wine; she hath also furnished her table.",pt:"j\xe1 imolou as suas v\xedtimas, misturou o seu vinho, e preparou a sua mesa."},{verse:3,en:"She hath sent forth her maidens: she crieth upon the highest places of the city,",pt:"J\xe1 enviou as suas criadas a clamar sobre as alturas da cidade, dizendo:"},{verse:4,en:"Whoso is simple, let him turn in hither: as for him that wanteth understanding, she saith to him,",pt:"Quem \xe9 simples, volte-se para c\xe1. Aos faltos de entendimento diz:"},{verse:5,en:"Come, eat of my bread, and drink of the wine which I have mingled.",pt:"Vinde, comei do meu p\xe3o, e bebei do vinho que tenho misturado."},{verse:6,en:"Forsake the foolish, and live; and go in the way of understanding.",pt:"Deixai a insensatez, e vivei; e andai pelo caminho do entendimento."},{verse:7,en:"He that reproveth a scorner getteth to himself shame: and he that rebuketh a wicked man getteth himself a blot.",pt:"O que repreende ao escarnecedor, traz afronta sobre si; e o que censura ao \xedmpio, recebe a sua mancha."},{verse:8,en:"Reprove not a scorner, lest he hate thee: rebuke a wise man, and he will love thee.",pt:"N\xe3o repreendas ao escarnecedor, para que n\xe3o te odeie; repreende ao s\xe1bio, e amar-te-\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"Give instruction to a wise man, and he will be yet wiser: teach a just man, and he will increase in learning.",pt:"Instrui ao s\xe1bio, e ele se far\xe1 mais, s\xe1bio; ensina ao justo, e ele crescer\xe1 em entendimento."},{verse:10,en:"The fear of the LORD is the beginning of wisdom: and the knowledge of the holy is understanding.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 o princ\xedpio sabedoria; e o conhecimento do Santo \xe9 o entendimento."},{verse:11,en:"For by me thy days shall be multiplied, and the years of thy life shall be increased.",pt:"Porque por mim se multiplicam os teus dias, e anos de vida se te acrescentar\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"If thou be wise, thou shalt be wise for thyself: but if thou scornest, thou alone shalt bear it.",pt:"Se fores s\xe1bio, para ti mesmo o ser\xe1s; e, se fores escarnecedor, tu s\xf3 o suportar\xe1s."},{verse:13,en:"A foolish woman is clamorous: she is simple, and knoweth nothing.",pt:"A mulher tola \xe9 alvoro\xe7adora; \xe9 insensata, e n\xe3o conhece o pudor."},{verse:14,en:"For she sitteth at the door of her house, on a seat in the high places of the city,",pt:"Senta-se \xe0 porta da sua casa ou numa cadeira, nas alturas da cidade,"},{verse:15,en:"To call passengers who go right on their ways:",pt:"chamando aos que passam e seguem direitos o seu caminho:"},{verse:16,en:"Whoso is simple, let him turn in hither: and as for him that wanteth understanding, she saith to him,",pt:"Quem \xe9 simples, volte-se para c\xe1! E aos faltos de entendimento diz:"},{verse:17,en:"Stolen waters are sweet, and bread eaten in secret is pleasant.",pt:"As \xe1guas roubadas s\xe3o doces, e o p\xe3o comido \xe0s ocultas \xe9 agrad\xe1vel."},{verse:18,en:"But he knoweth not that the dead are there; and that her guests are in the depths of hell.",pt:"Mas ele n\xe3o sabe que ali est\xe3o os mortos; que os seus convidados est\xe3o nas profundezas do Seol."}]}}),693,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The proverbs of Solomon. A wise son maketh a glad father: but a foolish son is the heaviness of his mother.",pt:"Prov\xe9rbios de Salom\xe3o. Um filho s\xe1bio alegra a seu pai; mas um filho insensato \xe9 a tristeza de sua mae."},{verse:2,en:"Treasures of wickedness profit nothing: but righteousness delivereth from death.",pt:"Os tesouros da impiedade de nada aproveitam; mas a justi\xe7a livra da morte."},{verse:3,en:"The LORD will not suffer the soul of the righteous to famish: but he casteth away the substance of the wicked.",pt:"O Senhor n\xe3o deixa o justo passar fome; mas o desejo dos \xedmpios ele recha\xe7a."},{verse:4,en:"He becometh poor that dealeth with a slack hand: but the hand of the diligent maketh rich.",pt:"O que trabalha com m\xe3o remissa empobrece; mas a m\xe3o do diligente enriquece."},{verse:5,en:"He that gathereth in summer is a wise son: but he that sleepeth in harvest is a son that causeth shame.",pt:"O que ajunta no ver\xe3o \xe9 filho prudente; mas o que dorme na sega \xe9 filho que envergonha."},{verse:6,en:"Blessings are upon the head of the just: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.",pt:"B\xean\xe7\xe3os caem sobre a cabe\xe7a do justo; por\xe9m a boca dos \xedmpios esconde a viol\xeancia."},{verse:7,en:"The memory of the just is blessed: but the name of the wicked shall rot.",pt:"A mem\xf3ria do justo \xe9 aben\xe7oada; mas o nome dos \xedmpios apodrecer\xe1."},{verse:8,en:"The wise in heart will receive commandments: but a prating fool shall fall.",pt:"O s\xe1bio de cora\xe7\xe3o aceita os mandamentos; mas o insensato palra dor cair\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"He that walketh uprightly walketh surely: but he that perverteth his ways shall be known.",pt:"Quem anda em integridade anda seguro; mas o que perverte os seus caminhos ser\xe1 conhecido."},{verse:10,en:"He that winketh with the eye causeth sorrow: but a prating fool shall fall.",pt:"O que acena com os olhos d\xe1 dores; e o insensato palrador cair\xe1."},{verse:11,en:"The mouth of a righteous man is a well of life: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.",pt:"A boca do justo \xe9 manancial de vida, por\xe9m a boca dos \xedmpios esconde a viol\xeancia."},{verse:12,en:"Hatred stirreth up strifes: but love covereth all sins.",pt:"O \xf3dio excita contendas; mas o amor cobre todas as transgress\xf5es."},{verse:13,en:"In the lips of him that hath understanding wisdom is found: but a rod is for the back of him that is void of understanding.",pt:"Nos l\xe1bios do entendido se acha a sabedoria; mas a vara \xe9 para as costas do que \xe9 falto de entendimento."},{verse:14,en:"Wise men lay up knowledge: but the mouth of the foolish is near destruction.",pt:"Os s\xe1bios entesouram o conhecimento; por\xe9m a boca do insensato \xe9 uma destrui\xe7\xe3o iminente."},{verse:15,en:"The rich man\u2019s wealth is his strong city: the destruction of the poor is their poverty.",pt:"Os bens do rico s\xe3o a sua cidade forte; a ru\xedna dos pobres \xe9 a sua pobreza."},{verse:16,en:"The labour of the righteous tendeth to life: the fruit of the wicked to sin.",pt:"O trabalho do justo conduz \xe0 vida; a renda do \xedmpio, para o pecado."},{verse:17,en:"He is in the way of life that keepeth instruction: but he that refuseth reproof erreth.",pt:"O que atende \xe0 instru\xe7\xe3o est\xe1 na vereda da vida; mas o que rejeita a repreens\xe3o anda errado."},{verse:18,en:"He that hideth hatred with lying lips, and he that uttereth a slander, is a fool.",pt:"O que encobre o \xf3dio tem l\xe1bios falsos; e o que espalha a cal\xfania \xe9 um insensato."},{verse:19,en:"In the multitude of words there wanteth not sin: but he that refraineth his lips is wise.",pt:"Na multid\xe3o de palavras n\xe3o falta transgress\xe3o; mas o que refreia os seus l\xe1bios \xe9 prudente."},{verse:20,en:"The tongue of the just is as choice silver: the heart of the wicked is little worth.",pt:"A l\xedngua do justo \xe9 prata escolhida; o cora\xe7\xe3o dos \xedmpios \xe9 de pouco valor."},{verse:21,en:"The lips of the righteous feed many: but fools die for want of wisdom.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios do justo apascentam a muitos; mas os insensatos, por falta de entendimento, morrem."},{verse:22,en:"The blessing of the LORD, it maketh rich, and he addeth no sorrow with it.",pt:"A b\xean\xe7\xe3o do Senhor \xe9 que enriquece; e ele n\xe3o a faz seguir de dor alguma."},{verse:23,en:"It is as sport to a fool to do mischief: but a man of understanding hath wisdom.",pt:"E um divertimento para o insensato o praticar a iniq\xfcidade; mas a conduta s\xe1bia \xe9 o prazer do homem entendido."},{verse:24,en:"The fear of the wicked, it shall come upon him: but the desire of the righteous shall be granted.",pt:"O que o \xedmpio teme, isso vir\xe1 sobre ele; mas aos justos se lhes conceder\xe1 o seu desejo."},{verse:25,en:"As the whirlwind passeth, so is the wicked no more: but the righteous is an everlasting foundation.",pt:"Como passa a tempestade, assim desaparece o impio; mas o justo tem fundamentos eternos."},{verse:26,en:"As vinegar to the teeth, and as smoke to the eyes, so is the sluggard to them that send him.",pt:"Como vinagre para os dentes, como fuma\xe7a para os olhos, assim \xe9 o pregui\xe7oso para aqueles que o mandam."},{verse:27,en:"The fear of the LORD prolongeth days: but the years of the wicked shall be shortened.",pt:"O temor do Senhor aumenta os dias; mas os anos os impios ser\xe3o abreviados."},{verse:28,en:"The hope of the righteous shall be gladness: but the expectation of the wicked shall perish.",pt:"A esperan\xe7a dos justos \xe9 alegria; mas a expecta\xe7\xe3o dos \xedmpios perecer\xe1."},{verse:29,en:"The way of the LORD is strength to the upright: but destruction shall be to the workers of iniquity.",pt:"O caminho do Senhor \xe9 fortaleza para os retos; mas \xe9 destrui\xe7\xe3o para os que praticam a iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:30,en:"The righteous shall never be removed: but the wicked shall not inhabit the earth.",pt:"O justo nunca ser\xe1 abalado; mas os \xedmpios n\xe3o habitar\xe3o a terra."},{verse:31,en:"The mouth of the just bringeth forth wisdom: but the froward tongue shall be cut out.",pt:"A boca do justo produz sabedoria; por\xe9m a l\xedngua perversa ser\xe1 desarraigada."},{verse:32,en:"The lips of the righteous know what is acceptable: but the mouth of the wicked speaketh frowardness.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios do justo sabem o que agrada; por\xe9m a boca dos \xedmpios fala perversidades."}]}}),694,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,t,a,r,i){a.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"A false balance is abomination to the LORD: but a just weight is his delight.",pt:"A balan\xe7a enganosa \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o para o Senhor; mas o peso justo \xe9 o seu prazer."},{verse:2,en:"When pride cometh, then cometh shame: but with the lowly is wisdom.",pt:"Quando vem a soberba, ent\xe3o vem a desonra; mas com os humildes est\xe1 a sabedoria."},{verse:3,en:"The integrity of the upright shall guide them: but the perverseness of transgressors shall destroy them.",pt:"A integridade dos retos os guia; por\xe9m a perversidade dos desleais os destr\xf3i."},{verse:4,en:"Riches profit not in the day of wrath: but righteousness delivereth from death.",pt:"De nada aproveitam as riquezas no dia da ira; por\xe9m a justi\xe7a livra da morte."},{verse:5,en:"The righteousness of the perfect shall direct his way: but the wicked shall fall by his own wickedness.",pt:"A justi\xe7a dos perfeitos endireita o seu caminho; mas o \xedmpio cai pela sua impiedade."},{verse:6,en:"The righteousness of the upright shall deliver them: but transgressors shall be taken in their own naughtiness.",pt:"A justi\xe7a dos retos os livra; mas os trai\xe7oeiros s\xe3o apanhados nas, suas pr\xf3prias cobi\xe7as."},{verse:7,en:"When a wicked man dieth, his expectation shall perish: and the hope of unjust men perisheth.",pt:"Morrendo o \xedmpio, perece a sua esperan\xe7a; e a expectativa da iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:8,en:"The righteous is delivered out of trouble, and the wicked cometh in his stead.",pt:"O justo \xe9 libertado da ang\xfastia; e o \xedmpio fica em seu lugar."},{verse:9,en:"An hypocrite with his mouth destroyeth his neighbour: but through knowledge shall the just be delivered.",pt:"O hip\xf3crita com a boca arru\xedna o seu proximo; mas os justos s\xe3o libertados pelo conhecimento."},{verse:10,en:"When it goeth well with the righteous, the city rejoiceth: and when the wicked perish, there is shouting.",pt:"Quando os justos prosperam, exulta a cidade; e quando perecem os \xedmpios, h\xe1 j\xfabilo."},{verse:11,en:"By the blessing of the upright the city is exalted: but it is overthrown by the mouth of the wicked.",pt:"Pela b\xean\xe7\xe3o dos retos se exalta a cidade; mas pela boca dos \xedmpios \xe9 derrubada."},{verse:12,en:"He that is void of wisdom despiseth his neighbour: but a man of understanding holdeth his peace.",pt:"Quem despreza o seu pr\xf3ximo \xe9 falto de senso; mas o homem de entendimento se cala."},{verse:13,en:"A talebearer revealeth secrets: but he that is of a faithful spirit concealeth the matter.",pt:"O que anda mexericando revela segredos; mas o fiel de esp\xedrito encobre o neg\xf3cio."},{verse:14,en:"Where no counsel is, the people fall: but in the multitude of counsellors there is safety.",pt:"Quando n\xe3o h\xe1 s\xe1bia dire\xe7\xe3o, o povo cai; mas na multid\xe3o de conselheiros h\xe1 seguran\xe7a."},{verse:15,en:"He that is surety for a stranger shall smart for it: and he that hateth suretiship is sure.",pt:"Decerto sofrer\xe1 preju\xedzo aquele que fica por fiador do estranho; mas o que aborrece a fian\xe7a estar\xe1 seguro."},{verse:16,en:"A gracious woman retaineth honour: and strong men retain riches.",pt:"A mulher apraz\xedvel obt\xe9m honra, e os homens violentos obt\xeam riquezas."},{verse:17,en:"The merciful man doeth good to his own soul: but he that is cruel troubleth his own flesh.",pt:"O homem bondoso faz bem \xe0 sua, pr\xf3pria alma; mas o cruel faz mal a si mesmo."},{verse:18,en:"The wicked worketh a deceitful work: but to him that soweth righteousness shall be a sure reward.",pt:"O \xedmpio recebe um sal\xe1rio ilus\xf3rio; mas o que semeia justi\xe7a recebe galard\xe3o seguro."},{verse:19,en:"As righteousness tendeth to life: so he that pursueth evil pursueth it to his own death.",pt:"Quem \xe9 fiel na retid\xe3o encaminha, para a vida, e aquele que segue o mal encontra a morte."},{verse:20,en:"They that are of a froward heart are abomination to the LORD: but such as are upright in their way are his delight.",pt:"Abomina\xe7\xe3o para o Senhor s\xe3o os perversos de cora\xe7\xe3o; mas os que s\xe3o perfeitos em seu caminho s\xe3o o seu deleite."},{verse:21,en:"Though hand join in hand, the wicked shall not be unpunished: but the seed of the righteous shall be delivered.",pt:"Decerto o homem mau n\xe3o ficar\xe1 sem castigo; por\xe9m a descend\xeancia dos justos ser\xe1 livre."},{verse:22,en:"As a jewel of gold in a swine\u2019s snout, so is a fair woman which is without discretion.",pt:"Como j\xf3ia de ouro em focinho de porca, assim \xe9 a mulher formosa que se aparta da discri\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:23,en:"The desire of the righteous is only good: but the expectation of the wicked is wrath.",pt:"O desejo dos justos \xe9 somente o bem; por\xe9m a expectativa dos \xedmpios \xe9 a ira."},{verse:24,en:"There is that scattereth, and yet increaseth; and there is that withholdeth more than is meet, but it tendeth to poverty.",pt:"Um d\xe1 liberalmente, e se torna mais rico; outro ret\xe9m mais do que \xe9 justo, e se empobrece."},{verse:25,en:"The liberal soul shall be made fat: and he that watereth shall be watered also himself.",pt:"A alma generosa prosperar\xe1, e o que regar tamb\xe9m ser\xe1 regado."},{verse:26,en:"He that withholdeth corn, the people shall curse him: but blessing shall be upon the head of him that selleth it.",pt:"Ao que ret\xe9m o trigo o povo o amaldi\xe7oa; mas b\xean\xe7\xe3o haver\xe1 sobre a cabe\xe7a do que o vende."},{verse:27,en:"He that diligently seeketh good procureth favour: but he that seeketh mischief, it shall come unto him.",pt:"O que busca diligentemente o bem, busca favor; mas ao que procura o mal, este lhe sobrevir\xe1."},{verse:28,en:"He that trusteth in his riches shall fall: but the righteous shall flourish as a branch.",pt:"Aquele que confia nas suas riquezas, cair\xe1; mas os justos reverdecer\xe3o como a folhagem."},{verse:29,en:"He that troubleth his own house shall inherit the wind: and the fool shall be servant to the wise of heart.",pt:"O que perturba a sua casa herdar\xe1 o vento; e o insensato ser\xe1 servo do entendido de cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:30,en:"The fruit of the righteous is a tree of life; and he that winneth souls is wise.",pt:"O fruto do justo \xe9 \xe1rvore de vida; e o que ganha almas s\xe1bio \xe9."},{verse:31,en:"Behold, the righteous shall be recompensed in the earth: much more the wicked and the sinner.",pt:"Eis que o justo \xe9 castigado na terra; quanto mais o \xedmpio e o pecador!"}]}}),695,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Whoso loveth instruction loveth knowledge: but he that hateth reproof is brutish.",pt:"O que ama a corre\xe7\xe3o ama o conhecimento; mas o que aborrece a repreens\xe3o \xe9 insensato."},{verse:2,en:"A good man obtaineth favour of the LORD: but a man of wicked devices will he condemn.",pt:"O homem de bem alcan\xe7ar\xe1 o favor do Senhor; mas ao homem de perversos des\xedgnios ele condenar\xe1."},{verse:3,en:"A man shall not be established by wickedness: but the root of the righteous shall not be moved.",pt:"O homem n\xe3o se estabelece pela impiedade; a raiz dos justos, por\xe9m, nunca ser\xe1, removida."},{verse:4,en:"A virtuous woman is a crown to her husband: but she that maketh ashamed is as rottenness in his bones.",pt:"A mulher virtuosa \xe9 a coroa do seu marido; por\xe9m a que procede vergonhosamente \xe9 como apodrecimento nos seus ossos."},{verse:5,en:"The thoughts of the righteous are right: but the counsels of the wicked are deceit.",pt:"Os pensamentos do justo s\xe3o retos; mas os conselhos do \xedmpio s\xe3o falsos."},{verse:6,en:"The words of the wicked are to lie in wait for blood: but the mouth of the upright shall deliver them.",pt:"As palavras dos \xedmpios s\xe3o emboscadas para derramarem sangue; a boca dos retos, por\xe9m, os livrar\xe1."},{verse:7,en:"The wicked are overthrown, and are not: but the house of the righteous shall stand.",pt:"Transtornados ser\xe3o os \xedmpios, e n\xe3o ser\xe3o mais; por\xe9m a casa dos justos permanecer\xe1."},{verse:8,en:"A man shall be commended according to his wisdom: but he that is of a perverse heart shall be despised.",pt:"Segundo o seu entendimento \xe9 louvado o homem; mas o perverso decora\xe7\xe3o \xe9 desprezado."},{verse:9,en:"He that is despised, and hath a servant, is better than he that honoureth himself, and lacketh bread.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o que \xe9 estimado em pouco e tem servo, do que quem se honra a si mesmo e tem falta de p\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"A righteous man regardeth the life of his beast: but the tender mercies of the wicked are cruel.",pt:"O justo olha pela vida dos seus animais; por\xe9m as entranhas dos \xedmpios s\xe3o crueis."},{verse:11,en:"He that tilleth his land shall be satisfied with bread: but he that followeth vain persons is void of understanding.",pt:"O que lavra a sua terra se fartar\xe1 de p\xe3o; mas o que segue os ociosos \xe9 falto de entendimento."},{verse:12,en:"The wicked desireth the net of evil men: but the root of the righteous yieldeth fruit.",pt:"Deseja o \xedmpio o despojo dos maus; por\xe9m a raiz dos justos produz o seu pr\xf3prio fruto."},{verse:13,en:"The wicked is snared by the transgression of his lips: but the just shall come out of trouble.",pt:"Pela transgress\xe3o dos l\xe1bios se enla\xe7a o mau; mas o justo escapa da ang\xfastia."},{verse:14,en:"A man shall be satisfied with good by the fruit of his mouth: and the recompense of a man\u2019s hands shall be rendered unto him.",pt:"Do fruto das suas palavras o homem se farta de bem; e das obras das suas m\xe3os se lhe retribui."},{verse:15,en:"The way of a fool is right in his own eyes: but he that hearkeneth unto counsel is wise.",pt:"O caminho do insensato \xe9 reto aos seus olhos; mas o que d\xe1 ouvidos ao conselho \xe9 s\xe1bio."},{verse:16,en:"A fool\u2019s wrath is presently known: but a prudent man covereth shame.",pt:"A ira do insensato logo se revela; mas o prudente encobre a afronta."},{verse:17,en:"He that speaketh truth sheweth forth righteousness: but a false witness deceit.",pt:"Quem fala a verdade manifesta a justi\xe7a; por\xe9m a testemunha falsa produz a fraude."},{verse:18,en:"There is that speaketh like the piercings of a sword: but the tongue of the wise is health.",pt:"H\xe1 palrador cujas palavras ferem como espada; por\xe9m a l\xedngua dos s\xe1bios traz sa\xfade."},{verse:19,en:"The lip of truth shall be established for ever: but a lying tongue is but for a moment.",pt:"O l\xe1bio veraz permanece para sempre; mas a l\xedngua mentirosa dura s\xf3 um momento."},{verse:20,en:"Deceit is in the heart of them that imagine evil: but to the counsellors of peace is joy.",pt:"Engano h\xe1 no cora\xe7\xe3o dos que maquinam o mal; mas h\xe1 gozo para os que aconselham a paz."},{verse:21,en:"There shall no evil happen to the just: but the wicked shall be filled with mischief.",pt:"Nenhuma desgra\xe7a sobrev\xe9m ao justo; mas os \xedmpios ficam cheios de males."},{verse:22,en:"Lying lips are abomination to the LORD: but they that deal truly are his delight.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios mentirosos s\xe3o abomin\xe1veis ao Senhor; mas os que praticam a verdade s\xe3o o seu deleite."},{verse:23,en:"A prudent man concealeth knowledge: but the heart of fools proclaimeth foolishness.",pt:"O homem prudente encobre o conhecimento; mas o cora\xe7\xe3o dos tolos proclama a estult\xedcia."},{verse:24,en:"The hand of the diligent shall bear rule: but the slothful shall be under tribute.",pt:"A m\xe3o dos diligentes dominar\xe1; mas o indolente ser\xe1 tribut\xe1rio servil."},{verse:25,en:"Heaviness in the heart of man maketh it stoop: but a good word maketh it glad.",pt:"A ansiedade no cora\xe7\xe3o do homem o abate; mas uma boa palavra o alegra."},{verse:26,en:"The righteous is more excellent than his neighbour: but the way of the wicked seduceth them.",pt:"O justo \xe9 um guia para o seu pr\xf3ximo; mas o caminho dos \xedmpios os faz errar."},{verse:27,en:"The slothful man roasteth not that which he took in hunting: but the substance of a diligent man is precious.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso n\xe3o apanha a sua ca\xe7a; mas o bem precioso do homem \xe9 para o diligente."},{verse:28,en:"In the way of righteousness is life; and in the pathway thereof there is no death.",pt:"Na vereda da justi\xe7a est\xe1 a vida; e no seu caminho n\xe3o h\xe1 morte."}]}}),696,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"A wise son heareth his father\u2019s instruction: but a scorner heareth not rebuke.",pt:"O filho s\xe1bio ouve a instru\xe7\xe3o do pai; mas o escarnecedor n\xe3o escuta a repreens\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"A man shall eat good by the fruit of his mouth: but the soul of the transgressors shall eat violence.",pt:"Do fruto da boca o homem come o bem; mas o apetite dos prevaricadores alimenta-se da viol\xeancia."},{verse:3,en:"He that keepeth his mouth keepeth his life: but he that openeth wide his lips shall have destruction.",pt:"O que guarda a sua boca preserva a sua vida; mas o que muito abre os seus l\xe1bios traz sobre si a ru\xedna."},{verse:4,en:"The soul of the sluggard desireth, and hath nothing: but the soul of the diligent shall be made fat.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso deseja, e coisa nenhuma alcan\xe7a; mas o desejo do diligente ser\xe1 satisfeito."},{verse:5,en:"A righteous man hateth lying: but a wicked man is loathsome, and cometh to shame.",pt:"O justo odeia a palavra mentirosa, mas o \xedmpio se faz odioso e se cobre de vergonha."},{verse:6,en:"Righteousness keepeth him that is upright in the way: but wickedness overthroweth the sinner.",pt:"A justi\xe7a guarda ao que \xe9 reto no seu caminho; mas a perversidade transtorna o pecador."},{verse:7,en:"There is that maketh himself rich, yet hath nothing: there is that maketh himself poor, yet hath great riches.",pt:"H\xe1 quem se fa\xe7a rico, n\xe3o tendo coisa alguma; e quem se fa\xe7a pobre, tendo grande riqueza."},{verse:8,en:"The ransom of a man\u2019s life are his riches: but the poor heareth not rebuke.",pt:"O resgate da vida do homem s\xe3o as suas riquezas; mas o pobre n\xe3o tem meio de se resgatar."},{verse:9,en:"The light of the righteous rejoiceth: but the lamp of the wicked shall be put out.",pt:"A luz dos justos alegra; porem a l\xe2mpada dos impios se apagar\xe1."},{verse:10,en:"Only by pride cometh contention: but with the well advised is wisdom.",pt:"Da soberba s\xf3 prov\xe9m a contenda; mas com os que se aconselham se acha a sabedoria."},{verse:11,en:"Wealth gotten by vanity shall be diminished: but he that gathereth by labour shall increase.",pt:"A riqueza adquirida \xe0s pressas diminuira; mas quem a ajunta pouco a pouco ter\xe1 aumento."},{verse:12,en:"Hope deferred maketh the heart sick: but when the desire cometh, it is a tree of life.",pt:"A esperan\xe7a adiada entristece o cora\xe7\xe3o; mas o desejo cumprido \xe9 \xe1rvore devida."},{verse:13,en:"Whoso despiseth the word shall be destroyed: but he that feareth the commandment shall be rewarded.",pt:"O que despreza a palavra traz sobre si a destrui\xe7\xe3o; mas o que teme o mandamento ser\xe1 galardoado."},{verse:14,en:"The law of the wise is a fountain of life, to depart from the snares of death.",pt:"O ensino do s\xe1bio \xe9 uma fonte devida para desviar dos la\xe7os da morte."},{verse:15,en:"Good understanding giveth favour: but the way of transgressors is hard.",pt:"O bom senso alcan\xe7a favor; mas o caminho dos prevaricadores \xe9 aspero:"},{verse:16,en:"Every prudent man dealeth with knowledge: but a fool layeth open his folly.",pt:"Em tudo o homem prudente procede com conhecimento; mas o tolo espraia a sua insensatez."},{verse:17,en:"A wicked messenger falleth into mischief: but a faithful ambassador is health.",pt:"O mensageiro perverso faz cair no mal; mas o embaixador fiel traz sa\xfade."},{verse:18,en:"Poverty and shame shall be to him that refuseth instruction: but he that regardeth reproof shall be honoured.",pt:"Pobreza e afronta vir\xe3o ao que rejeita a corre\xe7\xe3o; mas o que guarda a repreens\xe3o ser\xe1 honrado."},{verse:19,en:"The desire accomplished is sweet to the soul: but it is abomination to fools to depart from evil.",pt:"O desejo que se cumpre deleita a alma; mas apartar-se do ma e abomina\xe7\xe3o para os tolos."},{verse:20,en:"He that walketh with wise men shall be wise: but a companion of fools shall be destroyed.",pt:"Quem anda com os s\xe1bios ser\xe1 s\xe1bio; mas o companheiro dos tolos sofre afli\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:21,en:"Evil pursueth sinners: but to the righteous good shall be repaid.",pt:"O mal persegue os pecadores; mas os justos s\xe3o galardoados com o bem."},{verse:22,en:"A good man leaveth an inheritance to his children\u2019s children: and the wealth of the sinner is laid up for the just.",pt:"O homem de bem deixa uma heran\xe7a aos filhos de seus filhos; a riqueza do pecador, por\xe9m, \xe9 reservada para o justo."},{verse:23,en:"Much food is in the tillage of the poor: but there is that is destroyed for want of judgment.",pt:"Abund\xe2ncia de mantimento h\xe1, na lavoura do pobre; mas se perde por falta de ju\xedzo."},{verse:24,en:"He that spareth his rod hateth his son: but he that loveth him chasteneth him betimes.",pt:"Aquele que poupa a vara aborrece a seu filho; mas quem o ama, a seu tempo o castiga."},{verse:25,en:"The righteous eateth to the satisfying of his soul: but the belly of the wicked shall want.",pt:"O justo come e fica satisfeito; mas o apetite dos \xedmpios nunca se satisfaz."}]}}),697,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Every wise woman buildeth her house: but the foolish plucketh it down with her hands.",pt:"Toda mulher s\xe1bia edifica a sua casa; a insensata, por\xe9m, derruba-a com as suas m\xe3os."},{verse:2,en:"He that walketh in his uprightness feareth the LORD: but he that is perverse in his ways despiseth him.",pt:"Quem anda na sua retid\xe3o teme ao Senhor; mas aquele que \xe9 perverso nos seus caminhos despreza-o."},{verse:3,en:"In the mouth of the foolish is a rod of pride: but the lips of the wise shall preserve them.",pt:"Na boca do tolo est\xe1 a vara da soberba, mas os l\xe1bios do s\xe1bio preserv\xe1-lo-\xe3o."},{verse:4,en:"Where no oxen are, the crib is clean: but much increase is by the strength of the ox.",pt:"Onde n\xe3o h\xe1 bois, a manjedoura est\xe1 vazia; mas pela for\xe7a do boi h\xe1 abund\xe2ncia de colheitas."},{verse:5,en:"A faithful witness will not lie: but a false witness will utter lies.",pt:"A testemunha verdadeira n\xe3o mentir\xe1; a testemunha falsa, por\xe9m, se desboca em mentiras."},{verse:6,en:"A scorner seeketh wisdom, and findeth it not: but knowledge is easy unto him that understandeth.",pt:"O escarnecedor busca sabedoria, e n\xe3o a encontra; mas para o prudente o conhecimento \xe9 f\xe1cil."},{verse:7,en:"Go from the presence of a foolish man, when thou perceivest not in him the lips of knowledge.",pt:"Vai-te da presen\xe7a do homem insensato, pois nele n\xe3o achar\xe1s palavras de ci\xeancia."},{verse:8,en:"The wisdom of the prudent is to understand his way: but the folly of fools is deceit.",pt:"A sabedoria do prudente \xe9 entender o seu caminho; por\xe9m a estult\xedcia dos tolos \xe9 enganar."},{verse:9,en:"Fools make a mock at sin: but among the righteous there is favour.",pt:"A culpa zomba dos insensatos; mas os retos t\xeam o favor de Deus."},{verse:10,en:"The heart knoweth his own bitterness; and a stranger doth not intermeddle with his joy.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o conhece a sua pr\xf3pria amargura; e o estranho n\xe3o participa da sua alegria."},{verse:11,en:"The house of the wicked shall be overthrown: but the tabernacle of the upright shall flourish.",pt:"A casa dos \xedmpios se desfar\xe1; por\xe9m a tenda dos retos florescer\xe1."},{verse:12,en:"There is a way which seemeth right unto a man, but the end thereof are the ways of death.",pt:"H\xe1 um caminho que ao homem parece direito, mas o fim dele conduz \xe0 morte."},{verse:13,en:"Even in laughter the heart is sorrowful; and the end of that mirth is heaviness.",pt:"At\xe9 no riso ter\xe1 dor o cora\xe7\xe3o; e o fim da alegria \xe9 tristeza."},{verse:14,en:"The backslider in heart shall be filled with his own ways: and a good man shall be satisfied from himself.",pt:"Dos seus pr\xf3prios caminhos se fartar\xe1 o infiel de cora\xe7\xe3o, como tamb\xe9m o homem bom se contentar\xe1 dos seus."},{verse:15,en:"The simple believeth every word: but the prudent man looketh well to his going.",pt:"O simples d\xe1 cr\xe9dito a tudo; mas o prudente atenta para os seus passos."},{verse:16,en:"A wise man feareth, and departeth from evil: but the fool rageth, and is confident.",pt:"O s\xe1bio teme e desvia-se do mal, mas o tolo \xe9 arrogante e d\xe1-se por seguro."},{verse:17,en:"He that is soon angry dealeth foolishly: and a man of wicked devices is hated.",pt:"Quem facilmente se ira far\xe1 doidices; mas o homem discreto \xe9 paciente;"},{verse:18,en:"The simple inherit folly: but the prudent are crowned with knowledge.",pt:"Os simples herdam a estult\xedcia; mas os prudentes se coroam de conhecimento."},{verse:19,en:"The evil bow before the good; and the wicked at the gates of the righteous.",pt:"Os maus inclinam-se perante os bons; e os \xedmpios diante das portas dos justos."},{verse:20,en:"The poor is hated even of his own neighbour: but the rich hath many friends.",pt:"O pobre \xe9 odiado at\xe9 pelo seu vizinho; mas os amigos dos ricos s\xe3o muitos."},{verse:21,en:"He that despiseth his neighbour sinneth: but he that hath mercy on the poor, happy is he.",pt:"O que despreza ao seu vizinho peca; mas feliz \xe9 aquele que se compadece dos pobres."},{verse:22,en:"Do they not err that devise evil? but mercy and truth shall be to them that devise good.",pt:"Porventura n\xe3o erram os que maquinam o mal? mas h\xe1 benefic\xeancia e fidelidade para os que planejam o bem."},{verse:23,en:"In all labour there is profit: but the talk of the lips tendeth only to penury.",pt:"Em todo trabalho h\xe1 proveito; meras palavras, por\xe9m, s\xf3 encaminham para a pen\xfaria."},{verse:24,en:"The crown of the wise is their riches: but the foolishness of fools is folly.",pt:"A coroa dos s\xe1bios \xe9 a sua riqueza; por\xe9m a estult\xedcia dos tolos n\xe3o passa de estult\xedcia."},{verse:25,en:"A true witness delivereth souls: but a deceitful witness speaketh lies.",pt:"A testemunha verdadeira livra as almas; mas o que fala mentiras \xe9 traidor."},{verse:26,en:"In the fear of the LORD is strong confidence: and his children shall have a place of refuge.",pt:"No temor do Senhor h\xe1 firme confian\xe7a; e os seus filhos ter\xe3o um lugar de ref\xfagio."},{verse:27,en:"The fear of the LORD is a fountain of life, to depart from the snares of death.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 uma fonte de vida, para o homem se desviar dos la\xe7os da morte."},{verse:28,en:"In the multitude of people is the king\u2019s honour: but in the want of people is the destruction of the prince.",pt:"Na multid\xe3o do povo est\xe1 a gl\xf3ria do rei; mas na falta de povo est\xe1 a ru\xedna do pr\xedncipe."},{verse:29,en:"He that is slow to wrath is of great understanding: but he that is hasty of spirit exalteth folly.",pt:"Quem \xe9 tardio em irar-se \xe9 grande em entendimento; mas o que \xe9 de \xe2nimo precipitado exalta a loucura."},{verse:30,en:"A sound heart is the life of the flesh: but envy the rottenness of the bones.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o tranq\xfcilo \xe9 a vida da carne; a inveja, por\xe9m, \xe9 a podrid\xe3o dos ossos."},{verse:31,en:"He that oppresseth the poor reproacheth his Maker: but he that honoureth him hath mercy on the poor.",pt:"O que oprime ao pobre insulta ao seu Criador; mas honra-o aquele que se compadece do necessitado."},{verse:32,en:"The wicked is driven away in his wickedness: but the righteous hath hope in his death.",pt:"O \xedmpio \xe9 derrubado pela sua mal\xedcia; mas o justo at\xe9 na sua morte acha ref\xfagio."},{verse:33,en:"Wisdom resteth in the heart of him that hath understanding: but that which is in the midst of fools is made known.",pt:"No cora\xe7\xe3o do prudente repousa a sabedoria; mas no cora\xe7\xe3o dos tolos n\xe3o \xe9 conhecida."},{verse:34,en:"Righteousness exalteth a nation: but sin is a reproach to any people.",pt:"A justi\xe7a exalta as na\xe7\xf5es; mas o pecado \xe9 o opr\xf3brio dos povos."},{verse:35,en:"The king\u2019s favour is toward a wise servant: but his wrath is against him that causeth shame.",pt:"O favor do rei \xe9 concedido ao servo que procede sabiamente; mas sobre o que procede indignamente cair\xe1 o seu furor."}]}}),698,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,h){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"A soft answer turneth away wrath: but grievous words stir up anger.",pt:"A resposta branda desvia o furor, mas a palavra dura suscita a ira."},{verse:2,en:"The tongue of the wise useth knowledge aright: but the mouth of fools poureth out foolishness.",pt:"A l\xedngua dos s\xe1bios destila o conhecimento; por\xe9m a boca dos tolos derrama a estult\xedcia."},{verse:3,en:"The eyes of the LORD are in every place, beholding the evil and the good.",pt:"Os olhos do Senhor est\xe3o em todo lugar, vigiando os maus e os bons."},{verse:4,en:"A wholesome tongue is a tree of life: but perverseness therein is a breach in the spirit.",pt:"Uma l\xedngua suave \xe9 \xe1rvore de vida; mas a l\xedngua perversa quebranta o esp\xedrito."},{verse:5,en:"A fool despiseth his father\u2019s instruction: but he that regardeth reproof is prudent.",pt:"O insensato despreza a corre\xe7\xe3o e seu pai; mas o que atende \xe0 admoesta\xe7\xe3o prudentemente se haver\xe1."},{verse:6,en:"In the house of the righteous is much treasure: but in the revenues of the wicked is trouble.",pt:"Na casa do justo h\xe1 um grande tesouro; mas nos lucros do \xedmpio h\xe1 perturba\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:7,en:"The lips of the wise disperse knowledge: but the heart of the foolish doeth not so.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios dos s\xe1bios difundem conhecimento; mas n\xe3o o faz o cora\xe7\xe3o dos tolos."},{verse:8,en:"The sacrifice of the wicked is an abomination to the LORD: but the prayer of the upright is his delight.",pt:"O sacrif\xedcio dos \xedmpios \xe9 abomin\xe1vel ao Senhor; mas a ora\xe7\xe3o dos retos lhe \xe9 agrad\xe1vel."},{verse:9,en:"The way of the wicked is an abomination unto the LORD: but he loveth him that followeth after righteousness.",pt:"O caminho do \xedmpio \xe9 abomin\xe1vel ao Senhor; mas ele ama ao que segue a justi\xe7a."},{verse:10,en:"Correction is grievous unto him that forsaketh the way: and he that hateth reproof shall die.",pt:"H\xe1 disciplina severa para o que abandona a vereda; e o que aborrece a repreens\xe3o morrer\xe1."},{verse:11,en:"Hell and destruction are before the LORD: how much more then the hearts of the children of men?",pt:"O Seol e o Abadom est\xe3o abertos perante o Senhor; quanto mais o cora\xe7\xe3o dos filhos dos homens!"},{verse:12,en:"A scorner loveth not one that reproveth him: neither will he go unto the wise.",pt:"O escarnecedor n\xe3o gosta daquele que o repreende; n\xe3o ir\xe1 ter com os s\xe1bios."},{verse:13,en:"A merry heart maketh a cheerful countenance: but by sorrow of the heart the spirit is broken.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o alegre aformoseia o rosto; mas pela dor do cora\xe7\xe3o o esp\xedrito se abate."},{verse:14,en:"The heart of him that hath understanding seeketh knowledge: but the mouth of fools feedeth on foolishness.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do inteligente busca o conhecimento; mas a boca dos tolos se apascenta de estult\xedcia."},{verse:15,en:"All the days of the afflicted are evil: but he that is of a merry heart hath a continual feast.",pt:"Todos os dias do aflito s\xe3o maus; mas o cora\xe7\xe3o contente tem um banquete cont\xednuo."},{verse:16,en:"Better is little with the fear of the LORD than great treasure and trouble therewith.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o pouco com o temor do Senhor, do que um grande tesouro, e com ele a inquieta\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:17,en:"Better is a dinner of herbs where love is, than a stalled ox and hatred therewith.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 um prato de hortali\xe7a, onde h\xe1 amor, do que o boi gordo, e com ele o \xf3dio."},{verse:18,en:"A wrathful man stirreth up strife: but he that is slow to anger appeaseth strife.",pt:"O homem iracundo suscita contendas; mas o long\xe2nimo apazigua a luta."},{verse:19,en:"The way of the slothful man is as an hedge of thorns: but the way of the righteous is made plain.",pt:"O caminho do pregui\xe7oso \xe9 como a sebe de espinhos; por\xe9m a vereda dos justos \xe9 uma estrada real."},{verse:20,en:"A wise son maketh a glad father: but a foolish man despiseth his mother.",pt:"O filho s\xe1bio alegra a seu pai; mas o homem insensato despreza a sua m\xe3e."},{verse:21,en:"Folly is joy to him that is destitute of wisdom: but a man of understanding walketh uprightly.",pt:"A estult\xedcia \xe9 alegria para o insensato; mas o homem de entendimento anda retamente."},{verse:22,en:"Without counsel purposes are disappointed: but in the multitude of counsellors they are established.",pt:"Onde n\xe3o h\xe1 conselho, frustram-se os projetos; mas com a multid\xe3o de conselheiros se estabelecem."},{verse:23,en:"A man hath joy by the answer of his mouth: and a word spoken in due season, how good is it!",pt:"O homem alegra-se em dar uma resposta adequada; e a palavra a seu tempo qu\xe3o boa \xe9!"},{verse:24,en:"The way of life is above to the wise, that he may depart from hell beneath.",pt:"Para o s\xe1bio o caminho da vida \xe9 para cima, a fim de que ele se desvie do Seol que \xe9 em baixo."},{verse:25,en:"The LORD will destroy the house of the proud: but he will establish the border of the widow.",pt:"O Senhor desarraiga a casa dos soberbos, mas estabelece a heran\xe7a da vi\xfava."},{verse:26,en:"The thoughts of the wicked are an abomination to the LORD: but the words of the pure are pleasant words.",pt:"Os des\xedgnios dos maus s\xe3o abomina\xe7\xe3o para o Senhor; mas as palavras dos limpos lhe s\xe3o apraz\xedveis."},{verse:27,en:"He that is greedy of gain troubleth his own house; but he that hateth gifts shall live.",pt:"O que se d\xe1 \xe0 cobi\xe7a perturba a sua pr\xf3pria casa; mas o que aborrece a peita viver\xe1."},{verse:28,en:"The heart of the righteous studieth to answer: but the mouth of the wicked poureth out evil things.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do justo medita no que h\xe1 de responder; mas a boca dos \xedmpios derrama coisas m\xe1s."},{verse:29,en:"The LORD is far from the wicked: but he heareth the prayer of the righteous.",pt:"Longe est\xe1 o Senhor dos \xedmpios, mas ouve a ora\xe7\xe3o dos justos."},{verse:30,en:"The light of the eyes rejoiceth the heart: and a good report maketh the bones fat.",pt:"A luz dos olhos alegra o cora\xe7\xe3o, e boas-novas engordam os ossos."},{verse:31,en:"The ear that heareth the reproof of life abideth among the wise.",pt:"O ouvido que escuta a advert\xeancia da vida ter\xe1 a sua morada entre os s\xe1bios."},{verse:32,en:"He that refuseth instruction despiseth his own soul: but he that heareth reproof getteth understanding.",pt:"Quem rejeita a corre\xe7\xe3o menospreza a sua alma; mas aquele que escuta a advert\xeancia adquire entendimento."},{verse:33,en:"The fear of the LORD is the instruction of wisdom; and before honour is humility.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 a instru\xe7\xe3o da sabedoria; e adiante da honra vai a humildade."}]}}),699,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,i,r){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The preparations of the heart in man, and the answer of the tongue, is from the LORD.",pt:"Ao homem pertencem os planos do cora\xe7\xe3o; mas a resposta da l\xedngua \xe9 do Senhor."},{verse:2,en:"All the ways of a man are clean in his own eyes; but the LORD weigheth the spirits.",pt:"Todos os caminhos do homem s\xe3o limpos aos seus olhos; mas o Senhor pesa os esp\xedritos."},{verse:3,en:"Commit thy works unto the LORD, and thy thoughts shall be established.",pt:"Entrega ao Senhor as tuas obras, e teus des\xedgnios ser\xe3o estabelecidos."},{verse:4,en:"The LORD hath made all things for himself: yea, even the wicked for the day of evil.",pt:"O Senhor fez tudo para um fim; sim, at\xe9 o \xedmpio para o dia do mal."},{verse:5,en:"Every one that is proud in heart is an abomination to the LORD: though hand join in hand, he shall not be unpunished.",pt:"Todo homem arrogante \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o ao Senhor; certamente n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune."},{verse:6,en:"By mercy and truth iniquity is purged: and by the fear of the LORD men depart from evil.",pt:"Pela miseric\xf3rdia e pela verdade expia-se a iniq\xfcidade; e pelo temor do Senhor os homens se desviam do mal."},{verse:7,en:"When a man\u2019s ways please the LORD, he maketh even his enemies to be at peace with him.",pt:"Quando os caminhos do homem agradam ao Senhor, faz que at\xe9 os seus inimigos tenham paz com ele."},{verse:8,en:"Better is a little with righteousness than great revenues without right.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o pouco com justi\xe7a, do que grandes rendas com injusti\xe7a."},{verse:9,en:"A man\u2019s heart deviseth his way: but the LORD directeth his steps.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do homem prop\xf5e o seu caminho; mas o Senhor lhe dirige os passos."},{verse:10,en:"A divine sentence is in the lips of the king: his mouth transgresseth not in judgment.",pt:"Nos l\xe1bios do rei acham-se or\xe1culos; em ju\xedzo a sua boca n\xe3o prevarica."},{verse:11,en:"A just weight and balance are the LORD\u2019S: all the weights of the bag are his work.",pt:"O peso e a balan\xe7a justos s\xe3o do Senhor; obra sua s\xe3o todos os pesos da bolsa."},{verse:12,en:"It is an abomination to kings to commit wickedness: for the throne is established by righteousness.",pt:"Abomina\xe7\xe3o \xe9 para os reis o praticarem a impiedade; porque com justi\xe7a se estabelece o trono."},{verse:13,en:"Righteous lips are the delight of kings; and they love him that speaketh right.",pt:"L\xe1bios justos s\xe3o o prazer dos reis; e eles amam aquele que fala coisas retas."},{verse:14,en:"The wrath of a king is as messengers of death: but a wise man will pacify it.",pt:"O furor do rei \xe9 mensageiro da morte; mas o homem s\xe1bio o aplacar\xe1."},{verse:15,en:"In the light of the king\u2019s countenance is life; and his favour is as a cloud of the latter rain.",pt:"Na luz do semblante do rei est\xe1 a vida; e o seu favor \xe9 como a nuvem de chuva ser\xf4dia."},{verse:16,en:"How much better is it to get wisdom than gold! and to get understanding rather to be chosen than silver!",pt:"Quanto melhor \xe9 adquirir a sabedoria do que o ouro! e quanto mais excelente \xe9 escolher o entendimento do que a prata!"},{verse:17,en:"The highway of the upright is to depart from evil: he that keepeth his way preserveth his soul.",pt:"A estrada dos retos desvia-se do mal; o que guarda o seu caminho preserva a sua vida."},{verse:18,en:"Pride goeth before destruction, and an haughty spirit before a fall.",pt:"A soberba precede a destrui\xe7\xe3o, e a altivez do esp\xedrito precede a queda."},{verse:19,en:"Better it is to be of an humble spirit with the lowly, than to divide the spoil with the proud.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 ser humilde de esp\xedrito com os mansos, do que repartir o despojo com os soberbos."},{verse:20,en:"He that handleth a matter wisely shall find good: and whoso trusteth in the LORD, happy is he.",pt:"O que atenta prudentemente para a palavra prosperar\xe1; e feliz \xe9 aquele que confia no Senhor."},{verse:21,en:"The wise in heart shall be called prudent: and the sweetness of the lips increaseth learning.",pt:"O s\xe1bio de cora\xe7\xe3o ser\xe1 chamado prudente; e a do\xe7ura dos l\xe1bios aumenta o saber."},{verse:22,en:"Understanding is a wellspring of life unto him that hath it: but the instruction of fools is folly.",pt:"O entendimento, para aquele que o possui, \xe9 uma fonte de vida, por\xe9m a estult\xedcia \xe9 o castigo dos insensatos."},{verse:23,en:"The heart of the wise teacheth his mouth, and addeth learning to his lips.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do s\xe1bio instrui a sua boca, e aumenta o saber nos seus l\xe1bios."},{verse:24,en:"Pleasant words are as an honeycomb, sweet to the soul, and health to the bones.",pt:"Palavras suaves s\xe3o como favos de mel, do\xe7ura para a alma e sa\xfade para o corpo."},{verse:25,en:"There is a way that seemeth right unto a man, but the end thereof are the ways of death.",pt:"H\xe1 um caminho que ao homem parece direito, mas o fim dele conduz \xe0 morte."},{verse:26,en:"He that laboureth laboureth for himself; for his mouth craveth it of him.",pt:"O apetite do trabalhador trabalha por ele, porque a sua fome o incita a isso."},{verse:27,en:"An ungodly man diggeth up evil: and in his lips there is as a burning fire.",pt:"O homem vil suscita o mal; e nos seus l\xe1bios h\xe1 como que um fogo ardente."},{verse:28,en:"A froward man soweth strife: and a whisperer separateth chief friends.",pt:"O homem perverso espalha contendas; e o difamador separa amigos \xedntimos."},{verse:29,en:"A violent man enticeth his neighbour, and leadeth him into the way that is not good.",pt:"O homem violento alicia o seu vizinho, e guia-o por um caminho que n\xe3o \xe9 bom."},{verse:30,en:"He shutteth his eyes to devise froward things: moving his lips he bringeth evil to pass.",pt:"Quando fecha os olhos f\xe1-lo para maquinar perversidades; quando morde os l\xe1bios, efetua o mal."},{verse:31,en:"The hoary head is a crown of glory, if it be found in the way of righteousness.",pt:"Coroa de honra s\xe3o as c\xe3s, a qual se obt\xe9m no caminho da justi\xe7a."},{verse:32,en:"He that is slow to anger is better than the mighty; and he that ruleth his spirit than he that taketh a city.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o long\xe2nimo do que o valente; e o que domina o seu esp\xedrito do que o que toma uma cidade."},{verse:33,en:"The lot is cast into the lap; but the whole disposing thereof is of the LORD.",pt:"A sorte se lan\xe7a no rega\xe7o; mas do Senhor procede toda a disposi\xe7\xe3o dela."}]}}),700,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,r,s,n){r.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:17,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Better is a dry morsel, and quietness therewith, than an house full of sacrifices with strife.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 um bocado seco, e com ele a tranq\xfcilidade, do que a casa cheia de festins, com rixas."},{verse:2,en:"A wise servant shall have rule over a son that causeth shame, and shall have part of the inheritance among the brethren.",pt:"O servo prudente dominar\xe1 sobre o filho que procede indignamente; e entre os irm\xe3os receber\xe1 da heran\xe7a."},{verse:3,en:"The fining pot is for silver, and the furnace for gold: but the LORD trieth the hearts.",pt:"O crisol \xe9 para a prata, e o forno para o ouro; mas o Senhor \xe9 que prova os cora\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:4,en:"A wicked doer giveth heed to false lips; and a liar giveth ear to a naughty tongue.",pt:"O malfazejo atenta para o l\xe1bio in\xedquo; o mentiroso inclina os ouvidos para a l\xedngua maligna."},{verse:5,en:"Whoso mocketh the poor reproacheth his Maker: and he that is glad at calamities shall not be unpunished.",pt:"O que escarnece do pobre insulta ao seu Criador; o que se alegra da calamidade n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune."},{verse:6,en:"Children\u2019s children are the crown of old men; and the glory of children are their fathers.",pt:"Coroa dos velhos s\xe3o os filhos dos filhos; e a gl\xf3ria dos filhos s\xe3o seus pais."},{verse:7,en:"Excellent speech becometh not a fool: much less do lying lips a prince.",pt:"N\xe3o conv\xe9m ao tolo a fala excelente; quanto menos ao pr\xedncipe o l\xe1bio mentiroso!"},{verse:8,en:"A gift is as a precious stone in the eyes of him that hath it: whithersoever it turneth, it prospereth.",pt:"Pedra preciosa \xe9 a peita aos olhos de quem a oferece; para onde quer que ele se volte, serve-lhe de proveito."},{verse:9,en:"He that covereth a transgression seeketh love; but he that repeateth a matter separateth very friends.",pt:"O que perdoa a transgress\xe3o busca a amizade; mas o que renova a quest\xe3o, afastam amigos \xedntimos."},{verse:10,en:"A reproof entereth more into a wise man than an hundred stripes into a fool.",pt:"Mais profundamente entra a repreens\xe3o no prudente, do que cem a\xe7oites no insensato."},{verse:11,en:"An evil man seeketh only rebellion: therefore a cruel messenger shall be sent against him.",pt:"O rebelde n\xe3o busca sen\xe3o o mal; portanto um mensageiro cruel ser\xe1 enviado contra ele."},{verse:12,en:"Let a bear robbed of her whelps meet a man, rather than a fool in his folly.",pt:"Encontre-se o homem com a ursa roubada dos filhotes, mas n\xe3o com o insensato na sua estult\xedcia."},{verse:13,en:"Whoso rewardeth evil for good, evil shall not depart from his house.",pt:"Quanto \xe0quele que torna mal por bem, n\xe3o se apartar\xe1 o mal da sua casa."},{verse:14,en:"The beginning of strife is as when one letteth out water: therefore leave off contention, before it be meddled with.",pt:"O princ\xedpio da contenda \xe9 como o soltar de \xe1guas represadas; deixa por isso a porfia, antes que haja rixas."},{verse:15,en:"He that justifieth the wicked, and he that condemneth the just, even they both are abomination to the LORD.",pt:"O que justifica o \xedmpio, e o que condena o justo, s\xe3o abomin\xe1veis ao Senhor, tanto um como o outro."},{verse:16,en:"Wherefore is there a price in the hand of a fool to get wisdom, seeing he hath no heart to it?",pt:"De que serve o pre\xe7o na m\xe3o do tolo para comprar a sabedoria, visto que ele n\xe3o tem entendimento?"},{verse:17,en:"A friend loveth at all times, and a brother is born for adversity.",pt:"O amigo ama em todo o tempo; e para a ang\xfastia nasce o irm\xe3o."},{verse:18,en:"A man void of understanding striketh hands, and becometh surety in the presence of his friend.",pt:"O homem falto de entendimento compromete-se, tornando-se fiador na presen\xe7a do seu vizinho."},{verse:19,en:"He loveth transgression that loveth strife: and he that exalteth his gate seeketh destruction.",pt:"O que ama a contenda ama a transgressao; o que faz alta a sua porta busca a ru\xedna."},{verse:20,en:"He that hath a froward heart findeth no good: and he that hath a perverse tongue falleth into mischief.",pt:"O perverso de cora\xe7\xe3o nunca achar\xe1 o bem; e o que tem a l\xedngua dobre vir\xe1 a cair no mal."},{verse:21,en:"He that begetteth a fool doeth it to his sorrow: and the father of a fool hath no joy.",pt:"O que gera um tolo, para sua tristeza o faz; e o pai do insensato n\xe3o se alegrar\xe1."},{verse:22,en:"A merry heart doeth good like a medicine: but a broken spirit drieth the bones.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o alegre serve de bom rem\xe9dio; mas o esp\xedrito abatido seca os ossos."},{verse:23,en:"A wicked man taketh a gift out of the bosom to pervert the ways of judgment.",pt:"O \xedmpio recebe do rega\xe7o a peita, para perverter as veredas da justi\xe7a."},{verse:24,en:"Wisdom is before him that hath understanding; but the eyes of a fool are in the ends of the earth.",pt:"O alvo do inteligente \xe9 a sabedoria; mas os olhos do insensato est\xe3o nas extremidades da terra."},{verse:25,en:"A foolish son is a grief to his father, and bitterness to her that bare him.",pt:"O filho insensato \xe9 tristeza para seu, pai, e amargura para quem o deu \xe0 luz."},{verse:26,en:"Also to punish the just is not good, nor to strike princes for equity.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 bom punir ao justo, nem ferir aos nobres por causa da sua retid\xe3o."},{verse:27,en:"He that hath knowledge spareth his words: and a man of understanding is of an excellent spirit.",pt:"Refreia as suas palavras aquele que possui o conhecimento; e o homem de entendimento \xe9 de esp\xedrito sereno."},{verse:28,en:"Even a fool, when he holdeth his peace, is counted wise: and he that shutteth his lips is esteemed a man of understanding.",pt:"At\xe9 o tolo, estando calado, \xe9 tido por s\xe1bio; e o que cerra os seus l\xe1bios, por entendido."}]}}),701,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:18,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Through desire a man, having separated himself, seeketh and intermeddleth with all wisdom.",pt:"Aquele que vive isolado busca seu pr\xf3prio desejo; insurge-se contra a verdadeira sabedoria."},{verse:2,en:"A fool hath no delight in understanding, but that his heart may discover itself.",pt:"O tolo n\xe3o toma prazer no entendimento, mas t\xe3o somente em revelar a sua opini\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"When the wicked cometh, then cometh also contempt, and with ignominy reproach.",pt:"Quando vem o \xedmpio, vem tamb\xe9m o desprezo; e com a desonra vem o opr\xf3brio."},{verse:4,en:"The words of a man\u2019s mouth are as deep waters, and the wellspring of wisdom as a flowing brook.",pt:"Aguas profundas s\xe3o as palavras da boca do homem; e a fonte da sabedoria \xe9 um ribeiro que corre."},{verse:5,en:"It is not good to accept the person of the wicked, to overthrow the righteous in judgment.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 bom ter respeito \xe0 pessoa do impio, nem privar o justo do seu direito."},{verse:6,en:"A fool\u2019s lips enter into contention, and his mouth calleth for strokes.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios do tolo entram em contendas, e a sua boca clama por a\xe7oites."},{verse:7,en:"A fool\u2019s mouth is his destruction, and his lips are the snare of his soul.",pt:"A boca do tolo \xe9 a sua pr\xf3pria destrui\xe7\xe3o, e os seus l\xe1bios um la\xe7o para a sua alma."},{verse:8,en:"The words of a talebearer are as wounds, and they go down into the innermost parts of the belly.",pt:"As palavras do difamador s\xe3o como bocados doces, que penetram at\xe9 o \xedntimo das entranhas."},{verse:9,en:"He also that is slothful in his work is brother to him that is a great waster.",pt:"Aquele que \xe9 remisso na sua obra \xe9 irm\xe3o do que \xe9 destruidor."},{verse:10,en:"The name of the LORD is a strong tower: the righteous runneth into it, and is safe.",pt:"Torre forte \xe9 o nome do Senhor; para ela corre o justo, e est\xe1 seguro."},{verse:11,en:"The rich man\u2019s wealth is his strong city, and as an high wall in his own conceit.",pt:"Os bens do rico s\xe3o a sua cidade forte, e como um muro alto na sua imagina\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"Before destruction the heart of man is haughty, and before honour is humility.",pt:"Antes da ru\xedna eleva-se o cora\xe7\xe3o do homem; e adiante da honra vai a humildade."},{verse:13,en:"He that answereth a matter before he heareth it, it is folly and shame unto him.",pt:"Responder antes de ouvir, \xe9 estult\xedcia e vergonha."},{verse:14,en:"The spirit of a man will sustain his infirmity; but a wounded spirit who can bear?",pt:"O esp\xedrito do homem o sustentar\xe1 na sua enfermidade; mas ao esp\xedrito abatido quem o levantar\xe1?"},{verse:15,en:"The heart of the prudent getteth knowledge; and the ear of the wise seeketh knowledge.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do entendido adquire conhecimento; e o ouvido dos s\xe1bios busca conhecimento;"},{verse:16,en:"A man\u2019s gift maketh room for him, and bringeth him before great men.",pt:"O presente do homem alarga-lhe o caminho, e leva-o \xe0 presen\xe7a dos grandes."},{verse:17,en:"He that is first in his own cause seemeth just; but his neighbour cometh and searcheth him.",pt:"O que primeiro come\xe7a o seu pleito parece justo; at\xe9 que vem o outro e o examina."},{verse:18,en:"The lot causeth contentions to cease, and parteth between the mighty.",pt:"A sorte faz cessar os pleitos, e decide entre os poderosos."},{verse:19,en:"A brother offended is harder to be won than a strong city: and their contentions are like the bars of a castle.",pt:"um irm\xe3o ajudado pelo irm\xe3o \xe9 como uma cidade fortificada; \xe9 forte como os ferrolhos dum castelo."},{verse:20,en:"A man\u2019s belly shall be satisfied with the fruit of his mouth; and with the increase of his lips shall he be filled.",pt:"O homem se fartar\xe1 do fruto da sua boca; dos renovos dos seus l\xe1bios se fartar\xe1."},{verse:21,en:"Death and life are in the power of the tongue: and they that love it shall eat the fruit thereof.",pt:"A morte e a vida est\xe3o no poder da l\xedngua; e aquele que a ama comer\xe1 do seu fruto."},{verse:22,en:"Whoso findeth a wife findeth a good thing, and obtaineth favour of the LORD.",pt:"Quem encontra uma esposa acha uma coisa boa; e alcan\xe7a o favor do Senhor."},{verse:23,en:"The poor useth intreaties; but the rich answereth roughly.",pt:"O pobre fala com rogos; mas o rico responde com durezas."},{verse:24,en:"A man that hath friends must shew himself friendly: and there is a friend that sticketh closer than a brother.",pt:"O homem que tem muitos amigos, tem-nos para a sua ru\xedna; mas h\xe1 um amigo que \xe9 mais chegado do que um irm\xe3o."}]}}),702,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:19,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Better is the poor that walketh in his integrity, than he that is perverse in his lips, and is a fool.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o pobre que anda na sua integridade, do que aquele que \xe9 perverso de l\xe1bios e tolo."},{verse:2,en:"Also, that the soul be without knowledge, it is not good; and he that hasteth with his feet sinneth.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 bom agir sem refletir; e o que se apressa com seus p\xe9s erra o caminho."},{verse:3,en:"The foolishness of man perverteth his way: and his heart fretteth against the LORD.",pt:"A estult\xedcia do homem perverte o seu caminho, e o seu cora\xe7\xe3o se irrita contra o Senhor."},{verse:4,en:"Wealth maketh many friends; but the poor is separated from his neighbour.",pt:"As riquezas granjeiam muitos amigos; mas do pobre o seu pr\xf3prio amigo se separa."},{verse:5,en:"A false witness shall not be unpunished, and he that speaketh lies shall not escape.",pt:"A testemunha falsa n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune; e o que profere mentiras n\xe3o escapar\xe1."},{verse:6,en:"Many will intreat the favour of the prince: and every man is a friend to him that giveth gifts.",pt:"Muitos procurar\xe3o o favor do liberal; e cada um \xe9 amigo daquele que d\xe1 presentes."},{verse:7,en:"All the brethren of the poor do hate him: how much more do his friends go far from him? he pursueth them with words, yet they are wanting to him.",pt:"Todos os irm\xe3os do pobre o aborrecem; quanto mais se afastam dele os seus amigos! persegue-os com s\xfaplicas, mas eles j\xe1 se foram."},{verse:8,en:"He that getteth wisdom loveth his own soul: he that keepeth understanding shall find good.",pt:"O que adquire a sabedoria \xe9 amigo de si mesmo; o que guarda o entendimento prosperar\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"A false witness shall not be unpunished, and he that speaketh lies shall perish.",pt:"A testemunha falsa n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune, e o que profere mentiras perecer\xe1."},{verse:10,en:"Delight is not seemly for a fool; much less for a servant to have rule over princes.",pt:"Ao tolo n\xe3o conv\xe9m o luxo; quanto menos ao servo dominar os pr\xedncipes!"},{verse:11,en:"The discretion of a man deferreth his anger; and it is his glory to pass over a transgression.",pt:"A discri\xe7\xe3o do homem f\xe1-lo tardio em irar-se; e sua gl\xf3ria est\xe1 em esquecer ofensas."},{verse:12,en:"The king\u2019s wrath is as the roaring of a lion; but his favour is as dew upon the grass.",pt:"A ira do rei \xe9 como o bramido o le\xe3o; mas o seu favor \xe9 como o orvalho sobre a erva."},{verse:13,en:"A foolish son is the calamity of his father: and the contentions of a wife are a continual dropping.",pt:"O filho insensato \xe9 a calamidade do pai; e as rixas da mulher s\xe3o uma goteira cont\xednua."},{verse:14,en:"House and riches are the inheritance of fathers and a prudent wife is from the LORD.",pt:"Casa e riquezas s\xe3o herdadas dos pais; mas a mulher prudente vem do Senhor."},{verse:15,en:"Slothfulness casteth into a deep sleep; and an idle soul shall suffer hunger.",pt:"A pregui\xe7a faz cair em profundo sono; e o ocioso padecer\xe1 fome."},{verse:16,en:"He that keepeth the commandment keepeth his own soul; but he that despiseth his ways shall die.",pt:"Quem guarda o mandamento guarda a sua alma; mas aquele que n\xe3o faz caso dos seus caminhos morrer\xe1."},{verse:17,en:"He that hath pity upon the poor lendeth unto the LORD; and that which he hath given will he pay him again.",pt:"O que se compadece do pobre empresta ao Senhor, que lhe retribuir\xe1 o seu benef\xedcio."},{verse:18,en:"Chasten thy son while there is hope, and let not thy soul spare for his crying.",pt:"Corrige a teu filho enquanto h\xe1 esperan\xe7a; mas n\xe3o te incites a destru\xed-lo."},{verse:19,en:"A man of great wrath shall suffer punishment: for if thou deliver him, yet thou must do it again.",pt:"Homem de grande ira tem de sofrer o castigo; porque se o livrares, ter\xe1s de o fazer de novo."},{verse:20,en:"Hear counsel, and receive instruction, that thou mayest be wise in thy latter end.",pt:"Ouve o conselho, e recebe a corre\xe7\xe3o, para que sejas s\xe1bio nos teus \xfaltimos dias."},{verse:21,en:"There are many devices in a man\u2019s heart; nevertheless the counsel of the LORD, that shall stand.",pt:"Muitos s\xe3o os planos no cora\xe7\xe3o do homem; mas o des\xedgnio do Senhor, esse prevalecer\xe1."},{verse:22,en:"The desire of a man is his kindness: and a poor man is better than a liar.",pt:"O que faz um homem desej\xe1vel \xe9 a sua benignidade; e o pobre \xe9 melhor do que o mentiroso."},{verse:23,en:"The fear of the LORD tendeth to life: and he that hath it shall abide satisfied; he shall not be visited with evil.",pt:"O temor do Senhor encaminha para a vida; aquele que o tem ficar\xe1 satisfeito, e mal nenhum o visitar\xe1."},{verse:24,en:"A slothful man hideth his hand in his bosom, and will not so much as bring it to his mouth again.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso esconde a sua m\xe3o no prato, e nem ao menos quer lev\xe1-la de novo \xe0 boca."},{verse:25,en:"Smite a scorner, and the simple will beware: and reprove one that hath understanding, and he will understand knowledge.",pt:"Fere ao escarnecedor, e o simples aprender\xe1 a prud\xeancia; repreende ao que tem entendimento, e ele crescer\xe1 na ciencia."},{verse:26,en:"He that wasteth his father, and chaseth away his mother, is a son that causeth shame, and bringeth reproach.",pt:"O que aflige a seu pai, e faz fugir a sua m\xe3e, \xe9 filho que envergonha e desonra."},{verse:27,en:"Cease, my son, to hear the instruction that causeth to err from the words of knowledge.",pt:"Cessa, filho meu, de ouvir a instru\xe7\xe3o, e logo te desviar\xe1s das palavras do conhecimento."},{verse:28,en:"An ungodly witness scorneth judgment: and the mouth of the wicked devoureth iniquity.",pt:"A testemunha vil escarnece da justi\xe7a; e a boca dos \xedmpios engole a iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:29,en:"Judgments are prepared for scorners, and stripes for the back of fools.",pt:"A condena\xe7\xe3o est\xe1 preparada para os escarnecedores, e os a\xe7oites para as costas dos tolos."}]}}),703,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,r,t,n){r.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:20,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Wine is a mocker, strong drink is raging: and whosoever is deceived thereby is not wise.",pt:"O vinho \xe9 escarnecedor, e a bebida forte alvoro\xe7adora; e todo aquele que neles errar n\xe3o e s\xe1bio."},{verse:2,en:"The fear of a king is as the roaring of a lion: whoso provoketh him to anger sinneth against his own soul.",pt:"Como o bramido do le\xe3o \xe9 o terror do rei; quem o provoca a ira peca contra a sua pr\xf3pria vida."},{verse:3,en:"It is an honour for a man to cease from strife: but every fool will be meddling.",pt:"Honroso \xe9 para o homem o desviar-se de quest\xf5es; mas todo insensato se entremete nelas."},{verse:4,en:"The sluggard will not plow by reason of the cold; therefore shall he beg in harvest, and have nothing.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso n\xe3o lavra no outono; pelo que mendigar\xe1 na sega, e nada receber\xe1."},{verse:5,en:"Counsel in the heart of man is like deep water; but a man of understanding will draw it out.",pt:"Como \xe1guas profundas \xe9 o prop\xf3sito no cora\xe7\xe3o do homem; mas o homem inteligente o descobrir\xe1."},{verse:6,en:"Most men will proclaim every one his own goodness: but a faithful man who can find?",pt:"Muitos h\xe1 que proclamam a sua pr\xf3pria bondade; mas o homem fiel, quem o achar\xe1?"},{verse:7,en:"The just man walketh in his integrity: his children are blessed after him.",pt:"O justo anda na sua integridade; bem-aventurados ser\xe3o os seus filhos depois dele."},{verse:8,en:"A king that sitteth in the throne of judgment scattereth away all evil with his eyes.",pt:"Assentando-se o rei no trono do ju\xedzo, com os seus olhos joeira a todo malfeitor."},{verse:9,en:"Who can say, I have made my heart clean, I am pure from my sin?",pt:"Quem pode dizer: Purifiquei o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, limpo estou de meu pecado?"},{verse:10,en:"Divers weights, and divers measures, both of them are alike abomination to the LORD.",pt:"O peso fraudulento e a medida falsa s\xe3o abomina\xe7\xe3o ao Senhor, tanto uma como outra coisa."},{verse:11,en:"Even a child is known by his doings, whether his work be pure, and whether it be right.",pt:"At\xe9 a crian\xe7a se d\xe1 a conhecer pelas suas a\xe7\xf5es, se a sua conduta \xe9 pura e reta."},{verse:12,en:"The hearing ear, and the seeing eye, the LORD hath made even both of them.",pt:"O ouvido que ouve, e o olho que v\xea, o Senhor os fez a ambos."},{verse:13,en:"Love not sleep, lest thou come to poverty; open thine eyes, and thou shalt be satisfied with bread.",pt:"N\xe3o ames o sono, para que n\xe3o empobre\xe7as; abre os teus olhos, e te fartar\xe1s de p\xe3o."},{verse:14,en:"It is naught, it is naught, saith the buyer: but when he is gone his way, then he boasteth.",pt:"Nada vale, nada vale, diz o comprador; mas, depois de retirar-se, ent\xe3o se gaba."},{verse:15,en:"There is gold, and a multitude of rubies: but the lips of knowledge are a precious jewel.",pt:"H\xe1 ouro e abund\xe2ncia de pedras preciosas; mas os l\xe1bios do conhecimento s\xe3o j\xf3ia de grande valor."},{verse:16,en:"Take his garment that is surety for a stranger: and take a pledge of him for a strange woman.",pt:"Tira a roupa \xe0quele que fica por fiador do estranho; e toma penhor daquele que se obriga por estrangeiros."},{verse:17,en:"Bread of deceit is sweet to a man; but afterwards his mouth shall be filled with gravel.",pt:"Suave \xe9 ao homem o p\xe3o da mentira; mas depois a sua boca se enche de pedrinhas."},{verse:18,en:"Every purpose is established by counsel: and with good advice make war.",pt:"Os projetos se confirmam pelos conselhos; assim, pois, com prudencia faze a guerra."},{verse:19,en:"He that goeth about as a talebearer revealeth secrets: therefore meddle not with him that flattereth with his lips.",pt:"O que anda mexericando revela segredos; pelo que n\xe3o te metas com quem muito abre os seus l\xe1bios."},{verse:20,en:"Whoso curseth his father or his mother, his lamp shall be put out in obscure darkness.",pt:"O que amaldi\xe7oa a seu pai ou a sua m\xe3e, apagar-se-lhe-\xe1 a sua l\xe2mpada nas, mais densas trevas."},{verse:21,en:"An inheritance may be gotten hastily at the beginning; but the end thereof shall not be blessed.",pt:"A heran\xe7a que no princ\xedpio \xe9 adquirida \xe0s pressas, n\xe3o ser\xe1 aben\xe7oada no seu fim."},{verse:22,en:"Say not thou, I will recompense evil; but wait on the LORD, and he shall save thee.",pt:"N\xe3o digas: vingar-me-ei do mal; espera pelo Senhor e ele te livrar\xe1."},{verse:23,en:"Divers weights are an abomination unto the LORD; and a false balance is not good.",pt:"Pesos fraudulentos s\xe3o abomin\xe1veis ao Senhor; e balan\xe7as enganosas n\xe3o s\xe3o boas."},{verse:24,en:"Man\u2019s goings are of the LORD; how can a man then understand his own way?",pt:"Os passos do homem s\xe3o dirigidos pelo Senhor; como, pois, poder\xe1 o homem entender o seu caminho?"},{verse:25,en:"It is a snare to the man who devoureth that which is holy, and after vows to make enquiry.",pt:"La\xe7o \xe9 para o homem dizer precipitadamente: \xc9 santo; e, feitos os votos, ent\xe3o refletir."},{verse:26,en:"A wise king scattereth the wicked, and bringeth the wheel over them.",pt:"O rei s\xe1bio joeira os \xedmpios e faz girar sobre eles a roda."},{verse:27,en:"The spirit of man is the candle of the LORD, searching all the inward parts of the belly.",pt:"O esp\xedrito do homem \xe9 a l\xe2mpada do Senhor, a qual esquadrinha todo o mais \xedntimo do cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:28,en:"Mercy and truth preserve the king: and his throne is upholden by mercy.",pt:"A benignidade e a verdade guardam o rei; e com a benignidade sust\xe9m ele o seu trono."},{verse:29,en:"The glory of young men is their strength: and the beauty of old men is the grey head.",pt:"A gl\xf3ria dos jovens \xe9 a sua for\xe7a; e a beleza dos velhos s\xe3o as c\xe3s."},{verse:30,en:"The blueness of a wound cleanseth away evil: so do stripes the inward parts of the belly.",pt:"Os a\xe7oites que ferem purificam do mal; e as feridas penetram at\xe9 o mais \xedntimo do corpo."}]}}),704,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:21,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The king\u2019s heart is in the hand of the LORD, as the rivers of water: he turneth it whithersoever he will.",pt:"Como corrente de \xe1guas \xe9 o cora\xe7\xe3o do rei na m\xe3o do Senhor; ele o inclina para onde quer."},{verse:2,en:"Every way of a man is right in his own eyes: but the LORD pondereth the hearts.",pt:"Todo caminho do homem \xe9 reto aos seus olhos; mas o Senhor pesa os cora\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:3,en:"To do justice and judgment is more acceptable to the LORD than sacrifice.",pt:"Fazer justi\xe7a e julgar com retid\xe3o \xe9 mais aceit\xe1vel ao Senhor do que oferecer-lhe sacrif\xedcio."},{verse:4,en:"An high look, and a proud heart, and the plowing of the wicked, is sin.",pt:"Olhar altivo e cora\xe7\xe3o orgulhoso, tal l\xe2mpada dos \xedmpios \xe9 pecado."},{verse:5,en:"The thoughts of the diligent tend only to plenteousness; but of every one that is hasty only to want.",pt:"Os planos do diligente conduzem \xe0 abund\xe2ncia; mas todo precipitado apressa-se para a pen\xfaria."},{verse:6,en:"The getting of treasures by a lying tongue is a vanity tossed to and fro of them that seek death.",pt:"Ajuntar tesouros com l\xedngua falsa \xe9 uma vaidade fugitiva; aqueles que os buscam, buscam a morte."},{verse:7,en:"The robbery of the wicked shall destroy them; because they refuse to do judgment.",pt:"A viol\xeancia dos \xedmpios arrebat\xe1-los-\xe1, porquanto recusam praticar a justi\xe7a."},{verse:8,en:"The way of man is froward and strange: but as for the pure, his work is right.",pt:"O caminho do homem perverso \xe9 tortuoso; mas o proceder do puro \xe9 reto."},{verse:9,en:"It is better to dwell in a corner of the housetop, than with a brawling woman in a wide house.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 morar num canto do eirado, do que com a mulher rixosa numa casa ampla."},{verse:10,en:"The soul of the wicked desireth evil: his neighbour findeth no favour in his eyes.",pt:"A alma do \xedmpio deseja o mal; o seu pr\xf3ximo n\xe3o agrada aos seus olhos."},{verse:11,en:"When the scorner is punished, the simple is made wise: and when the wise is instructed, he receiveth knowledge.",pt:"Quando o escarnecedor \xe9 castigado, o simples torna-se s\xe1bio; e, quando o s\xe1bio \xe9 instru\xeddo, recebe o conhecimento."},{verse:12,en:"The righteous man wisely considereth the house of the wicked: but God overthroweth the wicked for their wickedness.",pt:"O justo observa a casa do \xedmpio; precipitam-se os \xedmpios na ru\xedna."},{verse:13,en:"Whoso stoppeth his ears at the cry of the poor, he also shall cry himself, but shall not be heard.",pt:"Quem tapa o seu ouvido ao clamor do pobre, tamb\xe9m clamar\xe1 e n\xe3o ser\xe1 ouvido."},{verse:14,en:"A gift in secret pacifieth anger: and a reward in the bosom strong wrath.",pt:"O presente que se d\xe1 em segredo aplaca a ira; e a d\xe1diva \xe0s escondidas, a forte indigna\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:15,en:"It is joy to the just to do judgment: but destruction shall be to the workers of iniquity.",pt:"A execu\xe7\xe3o da justi\xe7a \xe9 motivo de alegria para o justo; mas \xe9 espanto para os que praticam a iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:16,en:"The man that wandereth out of the way of understanding shall remain in the congregation of the dead.",pt:"O homem que anda desviado do caminho do entendimento repousar\xe1 na congrega\xe7\xe3o dos mortos."},{verse:17,en:"He that loveth pleasure shall be a poor man: he that loveth wine and oil shall not be rich.",pt:"Quem ama os prazeres empobrecer\xe1; quem ama o vinho e o azeite nunca enriquecera."},{verse:18,en:"The wicked shall be a ransom for the righteous, and the transgressor for the upright.",pt:"Resgate para o justo \xe9 o \xedmpio; e em lugar do reto ficar\xe1 o prevaricador."},{verse:19,en:"It is better to dwell in the wilderness, than with a contentious and an angry woman.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 morar numa terra deserta do que com a mulher rixosa e iracunda."},{verse:20,en:"There is treasure to be desired and oil in the dwelling of the wise; but a foolish man spendeth it up.",pt:"H\xe1 tesouro precioso e azeite na casa do s\xe1bio; mas o homem insensato os devora."},{verse:21,en:"He that followeth after righteousness and mercy findeth life, righteousness, and honour.",pt:"Aquele que segue a justi\xe7a e a bondade achar\xe1 a vida, a justi\xe7a e a honra."},{verse:22,en:"A wise man scaleth the city of the mighty, and casteth down the strength of the confidence thereof.",pt:"O s\xe1bio escala a cidade dos valentes, e derriba a fortaleza em que ela confia."},{verse:23,en:"Whoso keepeth his mouth and his tongue keepeth his soul from troubles.",pt:"O que guarda a sua boca e a sua l\xedngua, guarda das ang\xfastias a sua alma."},{verse:24,en:"Proud and haughty scorner is his name, who dealeth in proud wrath.",pt:"Quanto ao soberbo e presumido, zombador \xe9 seu nome; ele procede com insolente orgulho."},{verse:25,en:"The desire of the slothful killeth him; for his hands refuse to labour.",pt:"O desejo do pregui\xe7oso o mata; porque as suas m\xe3os recusam-se a trabalhar."},{verse:26,en:"He coveteth greedily all the day long: but the righteous giveth and spareth not.",pt:"Todo o dia o \xedmpio cobi\xe7a; mas o justo d\xe1, e n\xe3o ret\xe9m."},{verse:27,en:"The sacrifice of the wicked is abomination: how much more, when he bringeth it with a wicked mind?",pt:"O sacrif\xedcio dos \xedmpios \xe9 abomina\xe7ao; quanto mais oferecendo-o com inten\xe7\xe3o maligna!"},{verse:28,en:"A false witness shall perish: but the man that heareth speaketh constantly.",pt:"A testemunha mentirosa perecer\xe1; mas o homem que ouve falar\xe1 sem ser contestado."},{verse:29,en:"A wicked man hardeneth his face: but as for the upright, he directeth his way.",pt:"O homem \xedmpio endurece o seu rosto; mas o reto considera os seus caminhos."},{verse:30,en:"There is no wisdom nor understanding nor counsel against the LORD.",pt:"N\xe3o h\xe1 sabedoria, nem entendimento, nem conselho contra o Senhor."},{verse:31,en:"The horse is prepared against the day of battle: but safety is of the LORD.",pt:"O cavalo prepara-se para o dia da batalha; mas do Senhor vem a vit\xf3ria."}]}}),705,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:22,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"A good name is rather to be chosen than great riches, and loving favour rather than silver and gold.",pt:"Mais digno de ser escolhido \xe9 o bom nome do que as muitas riquezas; e o favor \xe9 melhor do que a prata e o ouro."},{verse:2,en:"The rich and poor meet together: the LORD is the maker of them all.",pt:"O rico e o pobre se encontram; quem os faz a ambos \xe9 o Senhor."},{verse:3,en:"A prudent man foreseeth the evil, and hideth himself: but the simple pass on, and are punished.",pt:"O prudente v\xea o perigo e esconde-se; mas os simples passam adiante e sofrem a pena."},{verse:4,en:"By humility and the fear of the LORD are riches, and honour, and life.",pt:"O galard\xe3o da humildade e do temor do Senhor \xe9 riquezas, e honra e vida."},{verse:5,en:"Thorns and snares are in the way of the froward: he that doth keep his soul shall be far from them.",pt:"Espinhos e la\xe7os h\xe1 no caminho do perverso; o que guarda a sua alma retira-se para longe deles."},{verse:6,en:"Train up a child in the way he should go: and when he is old, he will not depart from it.",pt:"Instrui o menino no caminho em que deve andar, e at\xe9 quando envelhecer n\xe3o se desviar\xe1 dele."},{verse:7,en:"The rich ruleth over the poor, and the borrower is servant to the lender.",pt:"O rico domina sobre os pobres; e o que toma emprestado \xe9 servo do que empresta."},{verse:8,en:"He that soweth iniquity shall reap vanity: and the rod of his anger shall fail.",pt:"O que semear a perversidade segar\xe1 males; e a vara da sua indigna\xe7\xe3o falhar\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"He that hath a bountiful eye shall be blessed; for he giveth of his bread to the poor.",pt:"Quem v\xea com olhos bondosos ser\xe1 aben\xe7oado; porque d\xe1 do seu p\xe3o ao pobre."},{verse:10,en:"Cast out the scorner, and contention shall go out; yea, strife and reproach shall cease.",pt:"Lan\xe7a fora ao escarnecedor, e a contenda se ir\xe1; cessarao a rixa e a inj\xfaria."},{verse:11,en:"He that loveth pureness of heart, for the grace of his lips the king shall be his friend.",pt:"O que ama a pureza do cora\xe7\xe3o, e que tem gra\xe7a nos seus l\xe1bios, ter\xe1 por seu amigo o rei."},{verse:12,en:"The eyes of the LORD preserve knowledge, and he overthroweth the words of the transgressor.",pt:"Os olhos do Senhor preservam o que tem conhecimento; mas ele transtorna as palavras do prevaricador."},{verse:13,en:"The slothful man saith, There is a lion without, I shall be slain in the streets.",pt:"Diz o pregui\xe7oso: um le\xe3o est\xe1 l\xe1 fora; serei morto no meio das ruas."},{verse:14,en:"The mouth of strange women is a deep pit: he that is abhorred of the LORD shall fall therein.",pt:"Cova profunda \xe9 a boca da ad\xfaltera; aquele contra quem o Senhor est\xe1 irado cair\xe1 nela."},{verse:15,en:"Foolishness is bound in the heart of a child; but the rod of correction shall drive it far from him.",pt:"A estult\xedcia est\xe1 ligada ao cora\xe7\xe3o do menino; mas a vara da corre\xe7\xe3o a afugentar\xe1 dele."},{verse:16,en:"He that oppresseth the poor to increase his riches, and he that giveth to the rich, shall surely come to want.",pt:"O que para aumentar o seu lucro oprime o pobre, e d\xe1 ao rico, certamente chegar\xe1 \xe0: penuria."},{verse:17,en:"Bow down thine ear, and hear the words of the wise, and apply thine heart unto my knowledge.",pt:"Inclina o teu ouvido e ouve as palavras dos s\xe1bios, e aplica o teu cora\xe7\xe3o ao meu conhecimento."},{verse:18,en:"For it is a pleasant thing if thou keep them within thee; they shall withal be fitted in thy lips.",pt:"Porque ser\xe1 coisa suave, se os guardares no teu peito, se estiverem todos eles prontos nos teus l\xe1bios."},{verse:19,en:"That thy trust may be in the LORD, I have made known to thee this day, even to thee.",pt:"Para que a tua confian\xe7a esteja no senhor, a ti tos fiz saber hoje, sim, a ti mesmo."},{verse:20,en:"Have not I written to thee excellent things in counsels and knowledge,",pt:"Porventura n\xe3o te escrevi excelentes coisas acerca dos conselhos e do conhecimento,"},{verse:21,en:"That I might make thee know the certainty of the words of truth; that thou mightest answer the words of truth to them that send unto thee?",pt:"para te fazer saber a certeza das palavras de verdade, para que possas responder com palavras de verdade aos que te enviarem?"},{verse:22,en:"Rob not the poor, because he is poor: neither oppress the afflicted in the gate:",pt:"N\xe3o roubes ao pobre, porque \xe9 pobre; nem oprimas ao aflito na porta;"},{verse:23,en:"For the LORD will plead their cause, and spoil the soul of those that spoiled them.",pt:"porque o Senhor defender\xe1 a sua causa em ju\xedzo, e aos que os roubam lhes tirar\xe1 a vida."},{verse:24,en:"Make no friendship with an angry man; and with a furious man thou shalt not go:",pt:"N\xe3o fa\xe7as amizade com o iracundo; nem andes com o homem col\xe9rico;"},{verse:25,en:"Lest thou learn his ways, and get a snare to thy soul.",pt:"para que n\xe3o aprendas as suas veredas, e tomes um la\xe7o para a tua alma."},{verse:26,en:"Be not thou one of them that strike hands, or of them that are sureties for debts.",pt:"N\xe3o estejas entre os que se comprometem, que ficam por fiadores de d\xedvidas."},{verse:27,en:"If thou hast nothing to pay, why should he take away thy bed from under thee?",pt:"Se n\xe3o tens com que pagar, por que tirariam a tua cama de debaixo de ti?"},{verse:28,en:"Remove not the ancient landmark, which thy fathers have set.",pt:"N\xe3o removas os limites antigos que teus pais fixaram."},{verse:29,en:"Seest thou a man diligent in his business? he shall stand before kings; he shall not stand before mean men.",pt:"V\xeas um homem h\xe1bil na sua obrar? esse perante reis assistir\xe1; e n\xe3o assistir\xe1 perante homens obscuros."}]}}),706,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:23,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"When thou sittest to eat with a ruler, consider diligently what is before thee:",pt:"Quando te assentares a comer com um governador, atenta bem para aquele que est\xe1 diante de ti;"},{verse:2,en:"And put a knife to thy throat, if thou be a man given to appetite.",pt:"e p\xf5e uma faca \xe0 tua garganta, se fores homem de grande apetite."},{verse:3,en:"Be not desirous of his dainties: for they are deceitful meat.",pt:"N\xe3o cobices os seus manjares gostosos, porque \xe9 comida enganadora."},{verse:4,en:"Labour not to be rich: cease from thine own wisdom.",pt:"N\xe3o te fatigues para seres rico; d\xe1 de m\xe3o \xe0 tua pr\xf3pria sabedoria:"},{verse:5,en:"Wilt thou set thine eyes upon that which is not? for riches certainly make themselves wings; they fly away as an eagle toward heaven.",pt:"Fitando tu os olhos nas riquezas, elas se v\xe3o; pois fazem para si asas, como a \xe1guia, voam para o c\xe9u."},{verse:6,en:"Eat thou not the bread of him that hath an evil eye, neither desire thou his dainty meats:",pt:"N\xe3o comas o p\xe3o do avarento, nem cobices os seus manjares gostosos."},{verse:7,en:"For as he thinketh in his heart, so is he: Eat and drink, saith he to thee; but his heart is not with thee.",pt:"Porque, como ele pensa consigo mesmo, assim \xe9; ele te diz: Come e bebe; mas o seu cora\xe7\xe3o n\xe3o est\xe1 contigo."},{verse:8,en:"The morsel which thou hast eaten shalt thou vomit up, and lose thy sweet words.",pt:"Vomitar\xe1s o bocado que comeste, e perder\xe1s as tuas suaves palavras."},{verse:9,en:"Speak not in the ears of a fool: for he will despise the wisdom of thy words.",pt:"N\xe3o fales aos ouvidos do tolo; porque desprezar\xe1 a sabedoria das tuas palavras."},{verse:10,en:"Remove not the old landmark; and enter not into the fields of the fatherless:",pt:"N\xe3o removas os limites antigos; nem entres nos campos dos \xf3rf\xe3os,"},{verse:11,en:"For their redeemer is mighty; he shall plead their cause with thee.",pt:"porque o seu redentor \xe9 forte; ele lhes pleitear\xe1 a causa contra ti."},{verse:12,en:"Apply thine heart unto instruction, and thine ears to the words of knowledge.",pt:"Aplica o teu cora\xe7\xe3o \xe0 instru\xe7\xe3o, e os teus ouvidos \xe0s palavras do conhecimento."},{verse:13,en:"Withhold not correction from the child: for if thou beatest him with the rod, he shall not die.",pt:"N\xe3o retires da crian\xe7a a disciplina; porque, fustigando-a tu com a vara, nem por isso morrer\xe1."},{verse:14,en:"Thou shalt beat him with the rod, and shalt deliver his soul from hell.",pt:"Tu a fustigar\xe1s com a vara e livrar\xe1s a sua alma do Seol."},{verse:15,en:"My son, if thine heart be wise, my heart shall rejoice, even mine.",pt:"Filho meu, se o teu cora\xe7\xe3o for s\xe1bio, alegrar-se-\xe1 o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, sim, \xf3, meu pr\xf3prio;"},{verse:16,en:"Yea, my reins shall rejoice, when thy lips speak right things.",pt:"e exultar\xe1 o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, quando os teus l\xe1bios falarem coisas retas."},{verse:17,en:"Let not thine heart envy sinners: but be thou in the fear of the LORD all the day long.",pt:"N\xe3o tenhas inveja dos pecadores; antes conserva-te no temor do Senhor todo o dia."},{verse:18,en:"For surely there is an end; and thine expectation shall not be cut off.",pt:"Porque deveras ter\xe1s uma recompensa; n\xe3o ser\xe1 malograda a tua esperan\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"Hear thou, my son, and be wise, and guide thine heart in the way.",pt:"Ouve tu, filho meu, e s\xea s\xe1bio; e dirige no caminho o teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"Be not among winebibbers; among riotous eaters of flesh:",pt:"N\xe3o estejas entre os beberr\xf5es de vinho, nem entre os comil\xf5es de carne."},{verse:21,en:"For the drunkard and the glutton shall come to poverty: and drowsiness shall clothe a man with rags.",pt:"Porque o beberr\xe3o e o comil\xe3o caem em pobreza; e a sonol\xeancia cobrir\xe1 de trapos o homem."},{verse:22,en:"Hearken unto thy father that begat thee, and despise not thy mother when she is old.",pt:"Ouve a teu pai, que te gerou; e n\xe3o desprezes a tua m\xe3e, quando ela envelhecer."},{verse:23,en:"Buy the truth, and sell it not; also wisdom, and instruction, and understanding.",pt:"Compra a verdade, e n\xe3o a vendas; sim, a sabedoria, a disciplina, e o entendimento."},{verse:24,en:"The father of the righteous shall greatly rejoice: and he that begetteth a wise child shall have joy of him.",pt:"Grandemente se regozijar\xe1 o pai do justo; e quem gerar um filho s\xe1bio, nele se alegrar\xe1."},{verse:25,en:"Thy father and thy mother shall be glad, and she that bare thee shall rejoice.",pt:"Alegrem-se teu pai e tua m\xe3e, e regozije-se aquela que te deu \xe0 luz."},{verse:26,en:"My son, give me thine heart, and let thine eyes observe my ways.",pt:"Filho meu, d\xe1-me o teu cora\xe7\xe3o; e deleitem-se os teus olhos nos meus caminhos."},{verse:27,en:"For a whore is a deep ditch; and a strange woman is a narrow pit.",pt:"Porque cova profunda \xe9 a prostituta; e po\xe7o estreito \xe9 a aventureira."},{verse:28,en:"She also lieth in wait as for a prey, and increaseth the transgressors among men.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m ela, como o salteador, se p\xf5e a espreitar; e multiplica entre os homens os prevaricadores."},{verse:29,en:"Who hath woe? who hath sorrow? who hath contentions? who hath babbling? who hath wounds without cause? who hath redness of eyes?",pt:"Para quem s\xe3o os ais? para quem os pesares? para quem as pelejas, para quem as queixas? para quem as feridas sem causa? e para quem os olhos vermelhos?"},{verse:30,en:"They that tarry long at the wine; they that go to seek mixed wine.",pt:"Para os que se demoram perto do vinho, para os que andam buscando bebida misturada."},{verse:31,en:"Look not thou upon the wine when it is red, when it giveth his colour in the cup, when it moveth itself aright.",pt:"N\xe3o olhes para o vinho quando se mostra vermelho, quando resplandece no copo e se escoa suavemente."},{verse:32,en:"At the last it biteth like a serpent, and stingeth like an adder.",pt:"No seu fim morder\xe1 como a cobra, e como o basilisco picar\xe1."},{verse:33,en:"Thine eyes shall behold strange women, and thine heart shall utter perverse things.",pt:"Os teus olhos ver\xe3o coisas estranhas, e tu falar\xe1s perversidades."},{verse:34,en:"Yea, thou shalt be as he that lieth down in the midst of the sea, or as he that lieth upon the top of a mast.",pt:"o ser\xe1s como o que se deita no meio do mar, e como o que dorme no topo do mastro."},{verse:35,en:"They have stricken me, shalt thou say, and I was not sick; they have beaten me, and I felt it not: when shall I awake? I will seek it yet again.",pt:"E dir\xe0s: Espancaram-me, e n\xe3o me doeu; bateram-me, e n\xe3o o senti; quando virei a despertar? ainda tornarei a busc\xe1-lo outra vez."}]}}),707,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:24,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Be not thou envious against evil men, neither desire to be with them.",pt:"N\xe3o tenhas inveja dos homens malignos; nem desejes estar com eles;"},{verse:2,en:"For their heart studieth destruction, and their lips talk of mischief.",pt:"porque o seu cora\xe7\xe3o medita a viol\xeancia; e os seus l\xe1bios falam maliciosamente."},{verse:3,en:"Through wisdom is an house builded; and by understanding it is established:",pt:"Com a sabedoria se edifica a casa, e com o entendimento ela se estabelece;"},{verse:4,en:"And by knowledge shall the chambers be filled with all precious and pleasant riches.",pt:"e pelo conhecimento se encher\xe3o as c\xe2maras de todas as riquezas preciosas e deleit\xe1veis."},{verse:5,en:"A wise man is strong; yea, a man of knowledge increaseth strength.",pt:"O s\xe1bio \xe9 mais poderoso do que o forte; e o inteligente do que o que possui a for\xe7a."},{verse:6,en:"For by wise counsel thou shalt make thy war: and in multitude of counsellors there is safety.",pt:"Porque com conselhos prudentes tu podes fazer a guerra; e h\xe1 vit\xf3ria na multid\xe3o dos conselheiros."},{verse:7,en:"Wisdom is too high for a fool: he openeth not his mouth in the gate.",pt:"A sabedoria \xe9 alta demais para o insensato; ele n\xe3o abre a sua boca na porta."},{verse:8,en:"He that deviseth to do evil shall be called a mischievous person.",pt:"Aquele que cuida em fazer o mal, mestre de maus intentos o chamar\xe3o."},{verse:9,en:"The thought of foolishness is sin: and the scorner is an abomination to men.",pt:"O des\xedgnio do insensato \xe9 pecado; e abomin\xe1vel aos homens \xe9 o escarnecedor."},{verse:10,en:"If thou faint in the day of adversity, thy strength is small.",pt:"Se enfraqueces no dia da ang\xfastia, a tua for\xe7a \xe9 pequena."},{verse:11,en:"If thou forbear to deliver them that are drawn unto death, and those that are ready to be slain;",pt:"Livra os que est\xe3o sendo levados \xe0 morte, det\xe9m os que v\xe3o trope\xe7ando para a matan\xe7a."},{verse:12,en:"If thou sayest, Behold, we knew it not; doth not he that pondereth the heart consider it? and he that keepeth thy soul, doth not he know it? and shall not he render to every man according to his works?",pt:"Se disseres: Eis que n\xe3o o sabemos; porventura aquele que pesa os cora\xe7\xf5es n\xe3o o percebe? e aquele que guarda a tua vida n\xe3o o sabe? e n\xe3o retribuir\xe1 a cada um conforme a sua obra?"},{verse:13,en:"My son, eat thou honey, because it is good; and the honeycomb, which is sweet to thy taste:",pt:"Come mel, filho meu, porque \xe9 bom, e do favo de mel, que \xe9 doce ao teu paladar."},{verse:14,en:"So shall the knowledge of wisdom be unto thy soul: when thou hast found it, then there shall be a reward, and thy expectation shall not be cut off.",pt:"Sabe que \xe9 assim a sabedoria para a tua alma: se a achares, haver\xe1 para ti recompensa, e n\xe3o ser\xe1 malograda a tua esperan\xe7a."},{verse:15,en:"Lay not wait, O wicked man, against the dwelling of the righteous; spoil not his resting place:",pt:"N\xe3o te ponhas de emboscada, \xf3 \xedmpio, contra a habita\xe7\xe3o do justo; nem assoles a sua pousada."},{verse:16,en:"For a just man falleth seven times, and riseth up again: but the wicked shall fall into mischief.",pt:"Porque sete vezes cai o justo, e se levanta; mas os \xedmpios s\xe3o derribados pela calamidade."},{verse:17,en:"Rejoice not when thine enemy falleth, and let not thine heart be glad when he stumbleth:",pt:"Quando cair o teu inimigo, n\xe3o te alegres, e quando trope\xe7ar, n\xe3o se regozije o teu cora\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:18,en:"Lest the LORD see it, and it displease him, and he turn away his wrath from him.",pt:"para que o Senhor n\xe3o o veja, e isso seja mau aos seus olhos, e desvie dele, a sua ira."},{verse:19,en:"Fret not thyself because of evil men, neither be thou envious at the wicked;",pt:"N\xe3o te aflijas por causa dos malfeitores; nem tenhas inveja dos \xedmpios;"},{verse:20,en:"For there shall be no reward to the evil man; the candle of the wicked shall be put out.",pt:"porque o maligno n\xe3o tem futuro; e a l\xe2mpada dos \xedmpios se apagar\xe1."},{verse:21,en:"My son, fear thou the LORD and the king: and meddle not with them that are given to change:",pt:"Filho meu, teme ao Senhor, e ao rei; e n\xe3o te entremetas com os que gostam de mudan\xe7as."},{verse:22,en:"For their calamity shall rise suddenly; and who knoweth the ruin of them both?",pt:"Porque de repente se levantar\xe1 a sua calamidade; e a ru\xedna deles, quem a conhecer\xe1?"},{verse:23,en:"These things also belong to the wise. It is not good to have respect of persons in judgment.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m estes s\xe3o prov\xe9rbios dos s\xe1bios: Fazer acep\xe7\xe3o de pessoas no ju\xedzo n\xe3o \xe9 bom."},{verse:24,en:"He that saith unto the wicked, Thou art righteous; him shall the people curse, nations shall abhor him:",pt:"Aquele que disser ao \xedmpio: Justo \xe9s; os povos o amaldi\xe7oar\xe3o, as na\xe7\xf5es o detestar\xe3o;"},{verse:25,en:"But to them that rebuke him shall be delight, and a good blessing shall come upon them.",pt:"mas para os que julgam retamente haver\xe1 del\xedcias, e sobre eles vir\xe1 copiosa b\xean\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"Every man shall kiss his lips that giveth a right answer.",pt:"O que responde com palavras retas beija os l\xe1bios."},{verse:27,en:"Prepare thy work without, and make it fit for thyself in the field; and afterwards build thine house.",pt:"Prepara os teus trabalhos de fora, apronta bem o teu campo; e depois edifica a tua casa."},{verse:28,en:"Be not a witness against thy neighbour without cause; and deceive not with thy lips.",pt:"N\xe3o sejas testemunha sem causa contra o teu pr\xf3ximo; e n\xe3o enganes com os teus l\xe1bios."},{verse:29,en:"Say not, I will do so to him as he hath done to me: I will render to the man according to his work.",pt:"N\xe3o digas: Como ele me fez a mim, assim lhe farei a ele; pagarei a cada um segundo a sua obra."},{verse:30,en:"I went by the field of the slothful, and by the vineyard of the man void of understanding;",pt:"Passei junto ao campo do pregui\xe7oso, e junto \xe0 vinha do homem falto de entendimento;"},{verse:31,en:"And, lo, it was all grown over with thorns, and nettles had covered the face thereof, and the stone wall thereof was broken down.",pt:"e eis que tudo estava cheio de cardos, e a sua superf\xedcie coberta de urtigas, e o seu muro de pedra estava derrubado."},{verse:32,en:"Then I saw, and considered it well: I looked upon it, and received instruction.",pt:"O que tendo eu visto, o considerei; e, vendo-o, recebi instru\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:33,en:"Yet a little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to sleep:",pt:"Um pouco para dormir, um pouco para toscanejar, um pouco para cruzar os bra\xe7os em repouso;"},{verse:34,en:"So shall thy poverty come as one that travelleth; and thy want as an armed man.",pt:"assim sobrevir\xe1 a tua pobreza como um salteador, e a tua necessidade como um homem armado."}]}}),708,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:25,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"These are also proverbs of Solomon, which the men of Hezekiah king of Judah copied out.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m estes s\xe3o prov\xe9rbios de Salom\xe3o, os quais transcreveram os homens de Ezequias, rei de Jud\xe1."},{verse:2,en:"It is the glory of God to conceal a thing: but the honour of kings is to search out a matter.",pt:"A gl\xf3ria de Deus \xe9 encobrir as coisas; mas a gl\xf3ria dos reis \xe9 esquadrinh\xe1-las."},{verse:3,en:"The heaven for height, and the earth for depth, and the heart of kings is unsearchable.",pt:"Como o c\xe9u na sua altura, e como a terra na sua profundidade, assim o cora\xe7\xe3o dos reis \xe9 inescrut\xe1vel."},{verse:4,en:"Take away the dross from the silver, and there shall come forth a vessel for the finer.",pt:"Tira da prata a esc\xf3ria, e sair\xe1 um vaso para o fundidor."},{verse:5,en:"Take away the wicked from before the king, and his throne shall be established in righteousness.",pt:"Tira o \xedmpio da presen\xe7a do rei, e o seu trono se firmar\xe1 na justi\xe7a."},{verse:6,en:"Put not forth thyself in the presence of the king, and stand not in the place of great men:",pt:"N\xe3o reclames para ti honra na presen\xe7a do rei, nem te ponhas no lugar dos grandes;"},{verse:7,en:"For better it is that it be said unto thee, Come up hither; than that thou shouldest be put lower in the presence of the prince whom thine eyes have seen.",pt:"porque melhor \xe9 que te digam: Sobe, para aqui; do que seres humilhado perante o pr\xedncipe."},{verse:8,en:"Go not forth hastily to strive, lest thou know not what to do in the end thereof, when thy neighbour hath put thee to shame.",pt:"O que os teus olhos viram, n\xe3o te apresses a revelar, para depois, ao fim, n\xe3o saberes o que h\xe1s de fazer, podendo-te confundir o teu pr\xf3ximo."},{verse:9,en:"Debate thy cause with thy neighbour himself; and discover not a secret to another:",pt:"Pleiteia a tua causa com o teu pr\xf3ximo mesmo; e n\xe3o reveles o segredo de outrem;"},{verse:10,en:"Lest he that heareth it put thee to shame, and thine infamy turn not away.",pt:"para que n\xe3o te desonre aquele que o ouvir, n\xe3o se apartando de ti a inf\xe2mia."},{verse:11,en:"A word fitly spoken is like apples of gold in pictures of silver.",pt:"Como ma\xe7\xe3s de ouro em salvas de prata, assim \xe9 a palavra dita a seu tempo."},{verse:12,en:"As an earring of gold, and an ornament of fine gold, so is a wise reprover upon an obedient ear.",pt:"Como pendentes de ouro e gargantilhas de ouro puro, assim \xe9 o s\xe1bio repreensor para o ouvido obediente."},{verse:13,en:"As the cold of snow in the time of harvest, so is a faithful messenger to them that send him: for he refresheth the soul of his masters.",pt:"Como o frescor de neve no tempo da sega, assim \xe9 o mensageiro fiel para com os que o enviam, porque refrigera o esp\xedrito dos seus senhores."},{verse:14,en:"Whoso boasteth himself of a false gift is like clouds and wind without rain.",pt:"como nuvens e ventos que n\xe3o trazem chuva, assim \xe9 o homem que se gaba de d\xe1divas que n\xe3o fez."},{verse:15,en:"By long forbearing is a prince persuaded, and a soft tongue breaketh the bone.",pt:"Pela longanimidade se persuade o pr\xedncipe, e a l\xedngua branda quebranta os ossos."},{verse:16,en:"Hast thou found honey? eat so much as is sufficient for thee, lest thou be filled therewith, and vomit it.",pt:"Se achaste mel, come somente o que te basta, para que porventura n\xe3o te fartes dele, e o venhas a vomitar."},{verse:17,en:"Withdraw thy foot from thy neighbour\u2019s house; lest he be weary of thee, and so hate thee.",pt:"P\xf5e raramente o teu p\xe9 na casa do teu pr\xf3ximo, para que n\xe3o se enfade de ti, e te aborre\xe7a."},{verse:18,en:"A man that beareth false witness against his neighbour is a maul, and a sword, and a sharp arrow.",pt:"Malho, e espada, e flecha aguda \xe9 o homem que levanta falso testemunho contra o seu pr\xf3ximo."},{verse:19,en:"Confidence in an unfaithful man in time of trouble is like a broken tooth, and a foot out of joint.",pt:"Como dente quebrado, e p\xe9 deslocado, \xe9 a confian\xe7a no homem desleal, no dia da ang\xfastia."},{verse:20,en:"As he that taketh away a garment in cold weather, and as vinegar upon nitre, so is he that singeth songs to an heavy heart.",pt:"O que entoa can\xe7\xf5es ao cora\xe7\xe3o aflito \xe9 como aquele que despe uma pe\xe7a de roupa num dia de frio, e como vinagre sobre a chaga."},{verse:21,en:"If thine enemy be hungry, give him bread to eat; and if he be thirsty, give him water to drink:",pt:"Se o teu inimigo tiver fome, d\xe1-lhe p\xe3o para comer, e se tiver sede, d\xe1-lhe \xe1gua para beber;"},{verse:22,en:"For thou shalt heap coals of fire upon his head, and the LORD shall reward thee.",pt:"porque assim lhe amontoar\xe1s brasas sobre a cabe\xe7a, e o Senhor te recompensar\xe1."},{verse:23,en:"The north wind driveth away rain: so doth an angry countenance a backbiting tongue.",pt:"O vento norte traz chuva, e a l\xedngua caluniadora, o rosto irado."},{verse:24,en:"It is better to dwell in the corner of the housetop, than with a brawling woman and in a wide house.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 morar num canto do eirado, do que com a mulher rixosa numa casa ampla."},{verse:25,en:"As cold waters to a thirsty soul, so is good news from a far country.",pt:"Como \xe1gua fresca para o homem sedento, tais s\xe3o as boas-novas de terra remota."},{verse:26,en:"A righteous man falling down before the wicked is as a troubled fountain, and a corrupt spring.",pt:"Como fonte turva, e manancial polu\xeddo, assim \xe9 o justo que cede lugar diante do \xedmpio."},{verse:27,en:"It is not good to eat much honey: so for men to search their own glory is not glory.",pt:"comer muito mel n\xe3o \xe9 bom; n\xe3o multipliques, pois, as palavras de lisonja."},{verse:28,en:"He that hath no rule over his own spirit is like a city that is broken down, and without walls.",pt:"Como a cidade derribada, que n\xe3o tem muros, assim \xe9 o homem que n\xe3o pode conter o seu esp\xedrito."}]}}),709,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:26,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"As snow in summer, and as rain in harvest, so honour is not seemly for a fool.",pt:"Como a neve no ver\xe3o, e como a chuva no tempo da ceifa, assim n\xe3o conv\xe9m ao tolo a honra."},{verse:2,en:"As the bird by wandering, as the swallow by flying, so the curse causeless shall not come.",pt:"Como o p\xe1ssaro no seu vaguear, como a andorinha no seu voar, assim a maldi\xe7\xe3o sem causa n\xe3o encontra pouso."},{verse:3,en:"A whip for the horse, a bridle for the ass, and a rod for the fool\u2019s back.",pt:"O a\xe7oite \xe9 para o cavalo, o freio para o jumento, e a vara para as costas dos tolos."},{verse:4,en:"Answer not a fool according to his folly, lest thou also be like unto him.",pt:"N\xe3o respondas ao tolo segundo a sua estult\xedcia, para que tamb\xe9m n\xe3o te fa\xe7as semelhante a ele."},{verse:5,en:"Answer a fool according to his folly, lest he be wise in his own conceit.",pt:"Responde ao tolo segundo a sua estult\xedcia, para que ele n\xe3o seja s\xe1bio aos seus pr\xf3prios olhos."},{verse:6,en:"He that sendeth a message by the hand of a fool cutteth off the feet, and drinketh damage.",pt:"Os p\xe9s decepa, e o dano bebe, quem manda mensagens pela m\xe3o dum tolo."},{verse:7,en:"The legs of the lame are not equal: so is a parable in the mouth of fools.",pt:"As pernas do coxo pendem frouxas; assim \xe9 o prov\xe9rbio na boca dos tolos."},{verse:8,en:"As he that bindeth a stone in a sling, so is he that giveth honour to a fool.",pt:"Como o que ata a pedra na funda, assim \xe9 aquele que d\xe1 honra ao tolo."},{verse:9,en:"As a thorn goeth up into the hand of a drunkard, so is a parable in the mouth of fools.",pt:"Como o espinho que entra na m\xe3o do \xe9brio, assim \xe9 o prov\xe9rbio na m\xe3o dos tolos."},{verse:10,en:"The great God that formed all things both rewardeth the fool, and rewardeth transgressors.",pt:"Como o flecheiro que fere a todos, assim \xe9 aquele que assalaria ao transeunte tolo, ou ao \xe9brio."},{verse:11,en:"As a dog returneth to his vomit, so a fool returneth to his folly.",pt:"Como o c\xe3o que torna ao seu v\xf4mito, assim \xe9 o tolo que reitera a sua estult\xedcia."},{verse:12,en:"Seest thou a man wise in his own conceit? there is more hope of a fool than of him.",pt:"V\xeas um homem que \xe9 s\xe1bio a seus pr\xf3prios olhos? Maior esperan\xe7a h\xe1 para o tolo do que para ele."},{verse:13,en:"The slothful man saith, There is a lion in the way; a lion is in the streets.",pt:"Diz o pregui\xe7oso: Um le\xe3o est\xe1 no caminho; um le\xe3o est\xe1 nas ruas."},{verse:14,en:"As the door turneth upon his hinges, so doth the slothful upon his bed.",pt:"Como a porta se revolve nos seus gonzos, assim o faz o pregui\xe7oso na sua cama."},{verse:15,en:"The slothful hideth his hand in his bosom; it grieveth him to bring it again to his mouth.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso esconde a sua m\xe3o no prato, e nem ao menos quer lev\xe1-la de novo \xe0 boca."},{verse:16,en:"The sluggard is wiser in his own conceit than seven men that can render a reason.",pt:"Mais s\xe1bio \xe9 o pregui\xe7oso a seus olhos do que sete homens que sabem responder bem."},{verse:17,en:"He that passeth by, and meddleth with strife belonging not to him, is like one that taketh a dog by the ears.",pt:"O que, passando, se mete em quest\xe3o alheia \xe9 como aquele que toma um c\xe3o pelas orelhas."},{verse:18,en:"As a mad man who casteth firebrands, arrows, and death,",pt:"Como o louco que atira ti\xe7\xf5es, flechas, e morte,"},{verse:19,en:"So is the man that deceiveth his neighbour, and saith, Am not I in sport?",pt:"assim \xe9 o homem que engana o seu pr\xf3ximo, e diz: Fiz isso por brincadeira."},{verse:20,en:"Where no wood is, there the fire goeth out: so where there is no talebearer, the strife ceaseth.",pt:"Faltando lenha, apaga-se o fogo; e n\xe3o havendo difamador, cessa a contenda."},{verse:21,en:"As coals are to burning coals, and wood to fire; so is a contentious man to kindle strife.",pt:"Como o carv\xe3o para as brasas, e a lenha para o fogo, assim \xe9 o homem contencioso para acender rixas."},{verse:22,en:"The words of a talebearer are as wounds, and they go down into the innermost parts of the belly.",pt:"As palavras do difamador s\xe3o como bocados deliciosos, que descem ao \xedntimo do ventre."},{verse:23,en:"Burning lips and a wicked heart are like a potsherd covered with silver dross.",pt:"Como o vaso de barro coberto de esc\xf3ria de prata, assim s\xe3o os l\xe1bios ardentes e o cora\xe7\xe3o maligno."},{verse:24,en:"He that hateth dissembleth with his lips, and layeth up deceit within him;",pt:"Aquele que odeia dissimula com os seus l\xe1bios; mas no seu interior entesoura o engano."},{verse:25,en:"When he speaketh fair, believe him not: for there are seven abominations in his heart.",pt:"Quando te suplicar com voz suave, n\xe3o o creias; porque sete abomina\xe7\xf5es h\xe1 no teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"Whose hatred is covered by deceit, his wickedness shall be shewed before the whole congregation.",pt:"Ainda que o seu \xf3dio se encubra com dissimula\xe7\xe3o, na congrega\xe7\xe3o ser\xe1 revelada a sua mal\xedcia."},{verse:27,en:"Whoso diggeth a pit shall fall therein: and he that rolleth a stone, it will return upon him.",pt:"O que faz uma cova cair\xe1 nela; e a pedra voltar\xe1 sobre aquele que a revolve."},{verse:28,en:"A lying tongue hateth those that are afflicted by it; and a flattering mouth worketh ruin.",pt:"A l\xedngua falsa odeia aqueles a quem ela tenha ferido; e a boca lisonjeira opera a ru\xedna."}]}}),710,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,r,s,n){r.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:27,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Boast not thyself of to morrow; for thou knowest not what a day may bring forth.",pt:"N\xe3o te glories do dia de amanh\xe3; porque n\xe3o sabes o que produzir\xe1 o dia."},{verse:2,en:"Let another man praise thee, and not thine own mouth; a stranger, and not thine own lips.",pt:"Seja outro o que te louve, e n\xe3o a tua boca; o estranho, e n\xe3o os teus l\xe1bios."},{verse:3,en:"A stone is heavy, and the sand weighty; but a fool\u2019s wrath is heavier than them both.",pt:"Pesada \xe9 a pedra, e a areia tamb\xe9m; mas a ira do insensato \xe9 mais pesada do que elas ambas."},{verse:4,en:"Wrath is cruel, and anger is outrageous; but who is able to stand before envy?",pt:"Cruel \xe9 o furor, e impetuosa \xe9 a ira; mas quem pode resistir \xe0 inveja?"},{verse:5,en:"Open rebuke is better than secret love.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 a repreens\xe3o aberta do que o amor encoberto."},{verse:6,en:"Faithful are the wounds of a friend; but the kisses of an enemy are deceitful.",pt:"Fi\xe9is s\xe3o as feridas dum amigo; mas os beijos dum inimigo s\xe3o enganosos."},{verse:7,en:"The full soul loatheth an honeycomb; but to the hungry soul every bitter thing is sweet.",pt:"O que est\xe1 farto despreza o favo de mel; mas para o faminto todo amargo \xe9 doce."},{verse:8,en:"As a bird that wandereth from her nest, so is a man that wandereth from his place.",pt:"Qual a ave que vagueia longe do seu ninho, tal \xe9 o homem que anda vagueando longe do seu lugar."},{verse:9,en:"Ointment and perfume rejoice the heart: so doth the sweetness of a man\u2019s friend by hearty counsel.",pt:"O \xf3leo e o perfume alegram o cora\xe7\xe3o; assim \xe9 o doce conselho do homem para o seu amigo."},{verse:10,en:"Thine own friend, and thy father\u2019s friend, forsake not; neither go into thy brother\u2019s house in the day of thy calamity: for better is a neighbour that is near than a brother far off.",pt:"N\xe3o abandones o teu amigo, nem o amigo de teu pai; nem entres na casa de teu irm\xe3o no dia de tua adversidade. Mais vale um vizinho que est\xe1 perto do que um irm\xe3o que est\xe1 longe."},{verse:11,en:"My son, be wise, and make my heart glad, that I may answer him that reproacheth me.",pt:"S\xea s\xe1bio, filho meu, e alegra o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, para que eu tenha o que responder \xe0quele que me vituperar."},{verse:12,en:"A prudent man foreseeth the evil, and hideth himself; but the simple pass on, and are punished.",pt:"O prudente v\xea o mal e se esconde; mas os insensatos passam adiante e sofrem a pena."},{verse:13,en:"Take his garment that is surety for a stranger, and take a pledge of him for a strange woman.",pt:"Tira a roupa \xe0quele que fica por fiador do estranho, e toma penhor daquele que se obriga por uma estrangeira."},{verse:14,en:"He that blesseth his friend with a loud voice, rising early in the morning, it shall be counted a curse to him.",pt:"O que bendiz ao seu amigo em alta voz, levantando-se de madrugada, isso lhe ser\xe1 contado como maldi\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:15,en:"A continual dropping in a very rainy day and a contentious woman are alike.",pt:"A goteira cont\xednua num dia chuvoso e a mulher rixosa s\xe3o semelhantes;"},{verse:16,en:"Whosoever hideth her hideth the wind, and the ointment of his right hand, which bewrayeth itself.",pt:"ret\xea-la \xe9 reter o vento, ou segurar o \xf3leo com a destra."},{verse:17,en:"Iron sharpeneth iron; so a man sharpeneth the countenance of his friend.",pt:"Afia-se o ferro com o ferro; assim o homem afia o rosto do seu amigo."},{verse:18,en:"Whoso keepeth the fig tree shall eat the fruit thereof: so he that waiteth on his master shall be honoured.",pt:"O que cuida da figueira comer\xe1 do fruto dela; e o que vela pelo seu senhor ser\xe1 honrado."},{verse:19,en:"As in water face answereth to face, so the heart of man to man.",pt:"Como na \xe1gua o rosto corresponde ao rosto, assim o cora\xe7\xe3o do homem ao homem."},{verse:20,en:"Hell and destruction are never full; so the eyes of man are never satisfied.",pt:"O Seol e o Abadom nunca se fartam, e os olhos do homem nunca se satisfazem."},{verse:21,en:"As the fining pot for silver, and the furnace for gold; so is a man to his praise.",pt:"O crisol \xe9 para a prata, e o forno para o ouro, e o homem \xe9 provado pelos louvores que recebe."},{verse:22,en:"Though thou shouldest bray a fool in a mortar among wheat with a pestle, yet will not his foolishness depart from him.",pt:"Ainda que pisasses o insensato no gral entre gr\xe3os pilados, contudo n\xe3o se apartaria dele a sua estult\xedcia."},{verse:23,en:"Be thou diligent to know the state of thy flocks, and look well to thy herds.",pt:"Procura conhecer o estado das tuas ovelhas; cuida bem dos teus rebanhos;"},{verse:24,en:"For riches are not for ever: and doth the crown endure to every generation?",pt:"porque as riquezas n\xe3o duram para sempre; e duraria a coroa de gera\xe7\xe3o em gera\xe7\xe3o?"},{verse:25,en:"The hay appeareth, and the tender grass sheweth itself, and herbs of the mountains are gathered.",pt:"Quando o feno \xe9 removido, e aparece a erva verde, e recolhem-se as ervas dos montes,"},{verse:26,en:"The lambs are for thy clothing, and the goats are the price of the field.",pt:"os cordeiros te prover\xe3o de vestes, e os bodes, do pre\xe7o do campo."},{verse:27,en:"And thou shalt have goats\u2019 milk enough for thy food, for the food of thy household, and for the maintenance for thy maidens.",pt:"E haver\xe1 bastante leite de cabras para o teu sustento, para o sustento da tua casa e das tuas criadas."}]}}),711,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:28,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The wicked flee when no man pursueth: but the righteous are bold as a lion.",pt:"Fogem os \xedmpios, sem que ningu\xe9m os persiga; mas os justos s\xe3o ousados como o le\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"For the transgression of a land many are the princes thereof: but by a man of understanding and knowledge the state thereof shall be prolonged.",pt:"Por causa da transgress\xe3o duma terra s\xe3o muitos os seus pr\xedncipes; mas por virtude de homens prudentes e entendidos, ela subsistir\xe1 por longo tempo."},{verse:3,en:"A poor man that oppresseth the poor is like a sweeping rain which leaveth no food.",pt:"O homem pobre que oprime os pobres, \xe9 como chuva impetuosa, que n\xe3o deixa trigo nenhum."},{verse:4,en:"They that forsake the law praise the wicked: but such as keep the law contend with them.",pt:"Os que abandonam a lei louvam os \xedmpios; mas os que guardam a lei pelejam contra eles."},{verse:5,en:"Evil men understand not judgment: but they that seek the LORD understand all things.",pt:"Os homens maus n\xe3o entendem a justi\xe7a; mas os que buscam ao Senhor a entendem plenamente."},{verse:6,en:"Better is the poor that walketh in his uprightness, than he that is perverse in his ways, though he be rich.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o pobre que anda na sua integridade, do que o rico perverso nos seus caminhos."},{verse:7,en:"Whoso keepeth the law is a wise son: but he that is a companion of riotous men shameth his father.",pt:"O que guarda a lei \xe9 filho s\xe1bio; mas o companheiro dos comil\xf5es envergonha a seu pai."},{verse:8,en:"He that by usury and unjust gain increaseth his substance, he shall gather it for him that will pity the poor.",pt:"O que aumenta a sua riqueza com juros e usura, ajunta-a para o que se compadece do pobre."},{verse:9,en:"He that turneth away his ear from hearing the law, even his prayer shall be abomination.",pt:"O que desvia os seus ouvidos de ouvir a lei, at\xe9 a sua ora\xe7\xe3o \xe9 abomin\xe1vel."},{verse:10,en:"Whoso causeth the righteous to go astray in an evil way, he shall fall himself into his own pit: but the upright shall have good things in possession.",pt:"O que faz com que os retos se desviem para um mau caminho, ele mesmo cair\xe1 na cova que abriu; mas os inocentes herdar\xe3o o bem."},{verse:11,en:"The rich man is wise in his own conceit; but the poor that hath understanding searcheth him out.",pt:"O homem rico \xe9 s\xe1bio aos seus pr\xf3prios olhos; mas o pobre que tem entendimento o esquadrinha."},{verse:12,en:"When righteous men do rejoice, there is great glory: but when the wicked rise, a man is hidden.",pt:"Quando os justos triunfam h\xe1 grande, gl\xf3ria; mas quando os \xedmpios sobem, escondem-se os homens."},{verse:13,en:"He that covereth his sins shall not prosper: but whoso confesseth and forsaketh them shall have mercy.",pt:"O que encobre as suas transgress\xf5es nunca prosperar\xe1; mas o que as confessa e deixa, alcan\xe7ar\xe1 miseric\xf3rdia."},{verse:14,en:"Happy is the man that feareth alway: but he that hardeneth his heart shall fall into mischief.",pt:"Feliz \xe9 o homem que teme ao Senhor continuamente; mas o que endurece o seu cora\xe7\xe3o vir\xe1 a cair no mal."},{verse:15,en:"As a roaring lion, and a ranging bear; so is a wicked ruler over the poor people.",pt:"Como le\xe3o bramidor, e urso faminto, assim \xe9 o \xedmpio que domina sobre um povo pobre."},{verse:16,en:"The prince that wanteth understanding is also a great oppressor: but he that hateth covetousness shall prolong his days.",pt:"O pr\xedncipe falto de entendimento \xe9 tamb\xe9m opressor cruel; mas o que aborrece a avareza prolongar\xe1 os seus dias."},{verse:17,en:"A man that doeth violence to the blood of any person shall flee to the pit; let no man stay him.",pt:"O homem culpado do sangue de qualquer pessoa ser\xe1 fugitivo at\xe9 a morte; ningu\xe9m o ajude."},{verse:18,en:"Whoso walketh uprightly shall be saved: but he that is perverse in his ways shall fall at once.",pt:"O que anda retamente salvar-se-\xe1; mas o perverso em seus caminhos cair\xe1 de repente."},{verse:19,en:"He that tilleth his land shall have plenty of bread: but he that followeth after vain persons shall have poverty enough.",pt:"O que lavra a sua terra se fartar\xe1 de p\xe3o; mas o que segue os ociosos se encher\xe1 de pobreza."},{verse:20,en:"A faithful man shall abound with blessings: but he that maketh haste to be rich shall not be innocent.",pt:"O homem fiel gozar\xe1 de abundantes b\xean\xe7\xe3os; mas o que se apressa a enriquecer n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune."},{verse:21,en:"To have respect of persons is not good: for for a piece of bread that man will transgress.",pt:"Fazer acep\xe7\xe3o de pessoas n\xe3o \xe9 bom; mas at\xe9 por um bocado de p\xe3o prevaricar\xe1 o homem."},{verse:22,en:"He that hasteth to be rich hath an evil eye, and considereth not that poverty shall come upon him.",pt:"Aquele que \xe9 cobi\xe7oso corre atr\xe1s das riquezas; e n\xe3o sabe que h\xe1 de vir sobre ele a pen\xfaria."},{verse:23,en:"He that rebuketh a man afterwards shall find more favour than he that flattereth with the tongue.",pt:"O que repreende a um homem achar\xe1 depois mais favor do que aquele que lisonjeia com a l\xedngua."},{verse:24,en:"Whoso robbeth his father or his mother, and saith, It is no transgression; the same is the companion of a destroyer.",pt:"O que rouba a seu pai, ou a sua m\xe3e, e diz: Isso n\xe3o \xe9 transgress\xe3o; esse \xe9 companheiro do destruidor."},{verse:25,en:"He that is of a proud heart stirreth up strife: but he that putteth his trust in the LORD shall be made fat.",pt:"O cobi\xe7oso levanta contendas; mas o que confia no senhor prosperar\xe1."},{verse:26,en:"He that trusteth in his own heart is a fool: but whoso walketh wisely, he shall be delivered.",pt:"O que confia no seu pr\xf3prio cora\xe7\xe3o \xe9 insensato; mas o que anda sabiamente ser\xe1 livre."},{verse:27,en:"He that giveth unto the poor shall not lack: but he that hideth his eyes shall have many a curse.",pt:"O que d\xe1 ao pobre n\xe3o ter\xe1 falta; mas o que esconde os seus olhos ter\xe1 muitas maldi\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:28,en:"When the wicked rise, men hide themselves: but when they perish, the righteous increase.",pt:"Quando os \xedmpios sobem, escondem-se os homens; mas quando eles perecem, multiplicam-se os justos."}]}}),712,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:29,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"He, that being often reproved hardeneth his neck, shall suddenly be destroyed, and that without remedy.",pt:"Aquele que, sendo muitas vezes repreendido, endurece a cerviz, ser\xe1 quebrantado de repente sem que haja cura."},{verse:2,en:"When the righteous are in authority, the people rejoice: but when the wicked beareth rule, the people mourn.",pt:"Quando os justos governam, alegra-se o povo; mas quando o \xedmpio domina, o povo geme."},{verse:3,en:"Whoso loveth wisdom rejoiceth his father: but he that keepeth company with harlots spendeth his substance.",pt:"O que ama a sabedoria alegra a seu pai; mas o companheiro de prostitutas desperdi\xe7a a sua riqueza."},{verse:4,en:"The king by judgment establisheth the land: but he that receiveth gifts overthroweth it.",pt:"O rei pela justi\xe7a estabelece a terra; mas o que exige presentes a transtorna."},{verse:5,en:"A man that flattereth his neighbour spreadeth a net for his feet.",pt:"O homem que lisonjeia a seu pr\xf3ximo arma-lhe uma rede aos passos."},{verse:6,en:"In the transgression of an evil man there is a snare: but the righteous doth sing and rejoice.",pt:"Na transgress\xe3o do homem mau h\xe1 la\xe7o; mas o justo canta e se regozija."},{verse:7,en:"The righteous considereth the cause of the poor: but the wicked regardeth not to know it.",pt:"O justo toma conhecimento da causa dos pobres; mas o \xedmpio n\xe3o tem entendimento para a conhecer."},{verse:8,en:"Scornful men bring a city into a snare: but wise men turn away wrath.",pt:"Os escarnecedores abrasam a cidade; mas os s\xe1bios desviam a ira."},{verse:9,en:"If a wise man contendeth with a foolish man, whether he rage or laugh, there is no rest.",pt:"O s\xe1bio que pleiteia com o insensato, quer este se agaste quer se ria, n\xe3o ter\xe1 descanso."},{verse:10,en:"The bloodthirsty hate the upright: but the just seek his soul.",pt:"Os homens sanguin\xe1rios odeiam o \xedntegro; mas os retos procuram o seu bem."},{verse:11,en:"A fool uttereth all his mind: but a wise man keepeth it in till afterwards.",pt:"O tolo derrama toda a sua ira; mas o s\xe1bio a reprime e aplaca."},{verse:12,en:"If a ruler hearken to lies, all his servants are wicked.",pt:"O governador que d\xe1 aten\xe7\xe3o \xe0s palavras mentirosas achar\xe1 que todos os seus servos s\xe3o \xedmpios."},{verse:13,en:"The poor and the deceitful man meet together: the LORD lighteneth both their eyes.",pt:"O pobre e o opressor se encontram; o Senhor alumia os olhos de ambos."},{verse:14,en:"The king that faithfully judgeth the poor, his throne shall be established for ever.",pt:"Se o rei julgar os pobres com eq\xfcidade, o seu trono ser\xe1 estabelecido para sempre."},{verse:15,en:"The rod and reproof give wisdom: but a child left to himself bringeth his mother to shame.",pt:"A vara e a repreens\xe3o d\xe3o sabedoria; mas a crian\xe7a entregue a si mesma envergonha a sua m\xe3e."},{verse:16,en:"When the wicked are multiplied, transgression increaseth: but the righteous shall see their fall.",pt:"Quando os \xedmpios se multiplicam, multiplicam-se as transgress\xf5es; mas os justos ver\xe3o a queda deles."},{verse:17,en:"Correct thy son, and he shall give thee rest; yea, he shall give delight unto thy soul.",pt:"Corrige a teu filho, e ele te dar\xe1 descanso; sim, deleitar\xe1 o teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:18,en:"Where there is no vision, the people perish: but he that keepeth the law, happy is he.",pt:"Onde n\xe3o h\xe1 profecia, o povo se corrompe; mas o que guarda a lei esse \xe9 bem-aventurado."},{verse:19,en:"A servant will not be corrected by words: for though he understand he will not answer.",pt:"O servo n\xe3o se emendar\xe1 com palavras; porque, ainda que entenda, n\xe3o atender\xe1."},{verse:20,en:"Seest thou a man that is hasty in his words? there is more hope of a fool than of him.",pt:"V\xeas um homem precipitado nas suas palavras? Maior esperan\xe7a h\xe1 para o tolo do que para ele."},{verse:21,en:"He that delicately bringeth up his servant from a child shall have him become his son at the length.",pt:"Aquele que cria delicadamente o seu servo desde a meninice, no fim t\xea-lo-\xe1 por herdeiro."},{verse:22,en:"An angry man stirreth up strife, and a furious man aboundeth in transgression.",pt:"O homem iracundo levanta contendas, e o furioso multiplica as transgress\xf5es."},{verse:23,en:"A man\u2019s pride shall bring him low: but honour shall uphold the humble in spirit.",pt:"A soberba do homem o abater\xe1; mas o humilde de esp\xedrito obter\xe1 honra."},{verse:24,en:"Whoso is partner with a thief hateth his own soul: he heareth cursing, and bewrayeth it not.",pt:"O que \xe9 s\xf3cio do ladr\xe3o odeia a sua pr\xf3pria alma; sendo ajuramentado, nada denuncia."},{verse:25,en:"The fear of man bringeth a snare: but whoso putteth his trust in the LORD shall be safe.",pt:"O receio do homem lhe arma la\xe7os; mas o que confia no Senhor est\xe1 seguro."},{verse:26,en:"Many seek the ruler\u2019s favour; but every man\u2019s judgment cometh from the LORD.",pt:"Muitos buscam o favor do pr\xedncipe; mas \xe9 do Senhor que o homem recebe a justi\xe7a."},{verse:27,en:"An unjust man is an abomination to the just: and he that is upright in the way is abomination to the wicked.",pt:"O \xedmpio \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o para os justos; e o que \xe9 reto no seu caminho \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o para o \xedmpio."}]}}),713,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:30,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The words of Agur the son of Jakeh, even the prophecy: the man spake unto Ithiel, even unto Ithiel and Ucal,",pt:"Palavras de Agur, filho de Jaqu\xe9 de Mass\xe1. Diz o homem a Itiel, e a Ucal:"},{verse:2,en:"Surely I am more brutish than any man, and have not the understanding of a man.",pt:"Na verdade que eu sou mais est\xfapido do que ningu\xe9m; n\xe3o tenho o entendimento do homem;"},{verse:3,en:"I neither learned wisdom, nor have the knowledge of the holy.",pt:"n\xe3o aprendi a sabedoria, nem tenho o conhecimento do Santo."},{verse:4,en:"Who hath ascended up into heaven, or descended? who hath gathered the wind in his fists? who hath bound the waters in a garment? who hath established all the ends of the earth? what is his name, and what is his son\u2019s name, if thou canst tell?",pt:"Quem subiu ao c\xe9u e desceu? quem encerrou os ventos nos seus punhos? mas amarrou as \xe1guas no seu manto? quem estabeleceu todas as extremidades da terra? qual \xe9 o seu nome, e qual \xe9 o nome de seu filho? Certamente o sabes!"},{verse:5,en:"Every word of God is pure: he is a shield unto them that put their trust in him.",pt:"Toda palavra de Deus \xe9 pura; ele \xe9 um escudo para os que nele confiam."},{verse:6,en:"Add thou not unto his words, lest he reprove thee, and thou be found a liar.",pt:"Nada acrescentes \xe0s suas palavras, para que ele n\xe3o te repreenda e tu sejas achado mentiroso."},{verse:7,en:"Two things have I required of thee; deny me them not before I die:",pt:"Duas coisas te pe\xe7o; n\xe3o mas negues, antes que morra:"},{verse:8,en:"Remove far from me vanity and lies: give me neither poverty nor riches; feed me with food convenient for me:",pt:"Alonga de mim a falsidade e a mentira; n\xe3o me d\xeas nem a pobreza nem a riqueza: d\xe1-me s\xf3 o p\xe3o que me \xe9 necess\xe1rio;"},{verse:9,en:"Lest I be full, and deny thee, and say, Who is the LORD? or lest I be poor, and steal, and take the name of my God in vain.",pt:"para que eu de farto n\xe3o te negue, e diga: Quem \xe9 o Senhor? ou, empobrecendo, n\xe3o venha a furtar, e profane o nome de Deus."},{verse:10,en:"Accuse not a servant unto his master, lest he curse thee, and thou be found guilty.",pt:"N\xe3o calunies o servo diante de seu senhor, para que ele n\xe3o te amaldi\xe7oe e fiques tu culpado."},{verse:11,en:"There is a generation that curseth their father, and doth not bless their mother.",pt:"H\xe1 gente que amaldi\xe7oa a seu pai, e que n\xe3o bendiz a sua m\xe3e."},{verse:12,en:"There is a generation that are pure in their own eyes, and yet is not washed from their filthiness.",pt:"H\xe1 gente que \xe9 pura aos seus olhos, e contudo nunca foi lavada da sua imund\xedcia."},{verse:13,en:"There is a generation, O how lofty are their eyes! and their eyelids are lifted up.",pt:"H\xe1 gente cujos olhos s\xe3o altivos, e cujas p\xe1lpebras s\xe3o levantadas para cima."},{verse:14,en:"There is a generation, whose teeth are as swords, and their jaw teeth as knives, to devour the poor from off the earth, and the needy from among men.",pt:"H\xe1 gente cujos dentes s\xe3o como espadas; e cujos queixais sao como facas, para devorarem da terra os aflitos, e os necessitados dentre os homens."},{verse:15,en:"The horseleach hath two daughters, crying, Give, give. There are three things that are never satisfied, yea, four things say not, It is enough:",pt:"A sanguessuga tem duas filhas, a saber: D\xe1, D\xe1. H\xe1 tr\xeas coisas que nunca se fartam; sim, quatro que nunca dizem: Basta;"},{verse:16,en:"The grave; and the barren womb; the earth that is not filled with water; and the fire that saith not, It is enough.",pt:"o Seol, a madre est\xe9ril, a terra que n\xe3o se farta d'\xe1gua, e o fogo que nunca diz: Basta."},{verse:17,en:"The eye that mocketh at his father, and despiseth to obey his mother, the ravens of the valley shall pick it out, and the young eagles shall eat it.",pt:"Os olhos que zombam do pai, ou desprezam a obedi\xeancia \xe0 m\xe3e, ser\xe3o arrancados pelos corvos do vale e devorados pelos filhos da \xe1guia."},{verse:18,en:"There be three things which are too wonderful for me, yea, four which I know not:",pt:"H\xe1 tr\xeas coisas que s\xe3o maravilhosas demais para mim, sim, h\xe1 quatro que n\xe3o conhe\xe7o:"},{verse:19,en:"The way of an eagle in the air; the way of a serpent upon a rock; the way of a ship in the midst of the sea; and the way of a man with a maid.",pt:"o caminho da \xe1guia no ar, o caminho da cobra na penha, o caminho do navio no meio do mar, e o caminho do homem com uma virgem."},{verse:20,en:"Such is the way of an adulterous woman; she eateth, and wipeth her mouth, and saith, I have done no wickedness.",pt:"Tal \xe9 o caminho da mulher ad\xfaltera: ela come, e limpa a sua boca, e diz: n\xe3o pratiquei iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:21,en:"For three things the earth is disquieted, and for four which it cannot bear:",pt:"Por tr\xeas coisas estremece a terra, sim, h\xe1 quatro que n\xe3o pode suportar:"},{verse:22,en:"For a servant when he reigneth; and a fool when he is filled with meat;",pt:"o escravo quando reina; o tolo quando se farta de comer;"},{verse:23,en:"For an odious woman when she is married; and an handmaid that is heir to her mistress.",pt:"a mulher desdenhada quando se casa; e a serva quando fica herdeira da sua senhora."},{verse:24,en:"There be four things which are little upon the earth, but they are exceeding wise:",pt:"Quatro coisas h\xe1 na terra que s\xe3o pequenas, entretanto s\xe3o extremamente s\xe1bias;"},{verse:25,en:"The ants are a people not strong, yet they prepare their meat in the summer;",pt:"as formigas s\xe3o um povo sem for\xe7a, todavia no ver\xe3o preparam a sua comida;"},{verse:26,en:"The conies are but a feeble folk, yet make they their houses in the rocks;",pt:"os querogrilos s\xe3o um povo d\xe9bil, contudo fazem a sua casa nas rochas;"},{verse:27,en:"The locusts have no king, yet go they forth all of them by bands;",pt:"os gafanhotos n\xe3o t\xeam rei, contudo marcham todos enfileirados;"},{verse:28,en:"The spider taketh hold with her hands, and is in kings\u2019 palaces.",pt:"a lagartixa apanha-se com as m\xe3os, contudo anda nos pal\xe1cios dos reis."},{verse:29,en:"There be three things which go well, yea, four are comely in going:",pt:"H\xe1 tr\xeas que andam com eleg\xe2ncia, sim, quatro que se movem airosamente:"},{verse:30,en:"A lion which is strongest among beasts, and turneth not away for any;",pt:"o le\xe3o, que \xe9 o mais forte entre os animais, e que n\xe3o se desvia diante de ningu\xe9m;"},{verse:31,en:"A greyhound; an he goat also; and a king, against whom there is no rising up.",pt:"o galo emproado, o bode, e o rei \xe0 frente do seu povo."},{verse:32,en:"If thou hast done foolishly in lifting up thyself, or if thou hast thought evil, lay thine hand upon thy mouth.",pt:"Se procedeste loucamente em te elevares, ou se maquinaste o mal, p\xf5e a m\xe3o sobre a boca."},{verse:33,en:"Surely the churning of milk bringeth forth butter, and the wringing of the nose bringeth forth blood: so the forcing of wrath bringeth forth strife.",pt:"Como o espremer do leite produz queijo verde, e o espremer do nariz produz sangue, assim o espremer da ira produz contenda."}]}}),714,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:31,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The words of king Lemuel, the prophecy that his mother taught him.",pt:"As palavras do rei Lemuel, rei de Mass\xe1, que lhe ensinou sua m\xe3e."},{verse:2,en:"What, my son? and what, the son of my womb? and what, the son of my vows?",pt:"Que te direi, filho meu? e que te direi, \xf3 filho do meu ventre? e que te direi, \xf3 filho dos meus votos?"},{verse:3,en:"Give not thy strength unto women, nor thy ways to that which destroyeth kings.",pt:"N\xe3o d\xeas \xe0s mulheres a tua for\xe7a, nem os teus caminhos \xe0s que destroem os reis."},{verse:4,en:"It is not for kings, O Lemuel, it is not for kings to drink wine; nor for princes strong drink:",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 dos reis, \xf3 Lemuel, n\xe3o \xe9 dos reis beber vinho, nem dos pr\xedncipes desejar bebida forte;"},{verse:5,en:"Lest they drink, and forget the law, and pervert the judgment of any of the afflicted.",pt:"para que n\xe3o bebam, e se esque\xe7am da lei, e pervertam o direito de quem anda aflito."},{verse:6,en:"Give strong drink unto him that is ready to perish, and wine unto those that be of heavy hearts.",pt:"Dai bebida forte ao que est\xe1 para perecer, e o vinho ao que est\xe1 em amargura de esp\xedrito."},{verse:7,en:"Let him drink, and forget his poverty, and remember his misery no more.",pt:"Bebam e se esque\xe7am da sua pobreza, e da sua mis\xe9ria n\xe3o se lembrem mais."},{verse:8,en:"Open thy mouth for the dumb in the cause of all such as are appointed to destruction.",pt:"Abre a tua boca a favor do mudo, a favor do direito de todos os desamparados."},{verse:9,en:"Open thy mouth, judge righteously, and plead the cause of the poor and needy.",pt:"Abre a tua boca; julga retamente, e faze justi\xe7a aos pobres e aos necessitados."},{verse:10,en:"Who can find a virtuous woman? for her price is far above rubies.",pt:"\xc1lefe. Mulher virtuosa, quem a pode achar? Pois o seu valor muito excede ao de j\xf3ias preciosas."},{verse:11,en:"The heart of her husband doth safely trust in her, so that he shall have no need of spoil.",pt:"Bete. O cora\xe7\xe3o do seu marido confia nela, e n\xe3o lhe haver\xe1 falta de lucro."},{verse:12,en:"She will do him good and not evil all the days of her life.",pt:"Gu\xedmel. Ela lhe faz bem, e n\xe3o mal, todos os dias da sua vida."},{verse:13,en:"She seeketh wool, and flax, and worketh willingly with her hands.",pt:"D\xe1lete. Ela busca l\xe3 e linho, e trabalha de boa vontade com as m\xe3os."},{verse:14,en:"She is like the merchants\u2019 ships; she bringeth her food from afar.",pt:"H\xea. \xc9 como os navios do negociante; de longe traz o seu p\xe3o."},{verse:15,en:"She riseth also while it is yet night, and giveth meat to her household, and a portion to her maidens.",pt:"Vave. E quando ainda est\xe1 escuro, ela se levanta, e d\xe1 mantimento \xe0 sua casa, e a tarefa \xe0s suas servas."},{verse:16,en:"She considereth a field, and buyeth it: with the fruit of her hands she planteth a vineyard.",pt:"Zaine. Considera um campo, e compra-o; planta uma vinha com o fruto de suas maos."},{verse:17,en:"She girdeth her loins with strength, and strengtheneth her arms.",pt:"Hete. Cinge os seus lombos de for\xe7a, e fortalece os seus bra\xe7os."},{verse:18,en:"She perceiveth that her merchandise is good: her candle goeth not out by night.",pt:"Tete. Prova e v\xea que \xe9 boa a sua mercadoria; e a sua l\xe2mpada n\xe3o se apaga de noite."},{verse:19,en:"She layeth her hands to the spindle, and her hands hold the distaff.",pt:"Iode. Estende as m\xe3os ao fuso, e as suas m\xe3os pegam na roca."},{verse:20,en:"She stretcheth out her hand to the poor; yea, she reacheth forth her hands to the needy.",pt:"Cafe. Abre a m\xe3o para o pobre; sim, ao necessitado estende as suas m\xe3os."},{verse:21,en:"She is not afraid of the snow for her household: for all her household are clothed with scarlet.",pt:"L\xe2mede. N\xe3o tem medo da neve pela sua fam\xedlia; pois todos os da sua casa est\xe3o vestidos de escarlate."},{verse:22,en:"She maketh herself coverings of tapestry; her clothing is silk and purple.",pt:"Meme. Faz para si cobertas; de linho fino e de p\xfarpura \xe9 o seu vestido."},{verse:23,en:"Her husband is known in the gates, when he sitteth among the elders of the land.",pt:"Nune. Conhece-se o seu marido nas portas, quando se assenta entre os anci\xe3os da terra."},{verse:24,en:"She maketh fine linen, and selleth it; and delivereth girdles unto the merchant.",pt:"S\xe2merue. Faz vestidos de linho, e vende-os, e entrega cintas aos mercadores."},{verse:25,en:"Strength and honour are her clothing; and she shall rejoice in time to come.",pt:"Aine. A for\xe7a e a dignidade s\xe3o os seus vestidos; e ri-se do tempo vindouro."},{verse:26,en:"She openeth her mouth with wisdom; and in her tongue is the law of kindness.",pt:"P\xea. Abre a sua boca com sabedoria, e o ensino da benevol\xeancia est\xe1 na sua l\xedngua."},{verse:27,en:"She looketh well to the ways of her household, and eateth not the bread of idleness.",pt:"Tsad\xea. Olha pelo governo de sua casa, e n\xe3o come o p\xe3o da pregui\xe7a."},{verse:28,en:"Her children arise up, and call her blessed; her husband also, and he praiseth her.",pt:"C\xf4fe. Levantam-se seus filhos, e lhe chamam bem-aventurada, como tamb\xe9m seu marido, que a louva, dizendo:"},{verse:29,en:"Many daughters have done virtuously, but thou excellest them all.",pt:"Reche. Muitas mulheres t\xeam procedido virtuosamente, mas tu a todas sobrepujas."},{verse:30,en:"Favour is deceitful, and beauty is vain: but a woman that feareth the LORD, she shall be praised.",pt:"Chine. Enganosa \xe9 a gra\xe7a, e v\xe3 \xe9 a formosura; mas a mulher que teme ao Senhor, essa ser\xe1 louvada."},{verse:31,en:"Give her of the fruit of her hands; and let her own works praise her in the gates.",pt:"Tau. Dai-lhe do fruto das suas m\xe3os, e louvem-na nas portas as suas obras."}]}}),715,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Paul, a servant of Jesus Christ, called to be an apostle, separated unto the gospel of God,",pt:"Paulo, servo de Jesus Cristo, chamado para ser ap\xf3stolo, separado para o evangelho de Deus,"},{verse:2,en:"(Which he had promised afore by his prophets in the holy scriptures,)",pt:"que ele antes havia prometido pelos seus profetas nas santas Escrituras,"},{verse:3,en:"Concerning his Son Jesus Christ our Lord, which was made of the seed of David according to the flesh;",pt:"acerca de seu Filho, que nasceu da descend\xeancia de Davi segundo a carne,"},{verse:4,en:"And declared to be the Son of God with power, according to the spirit of holiness, by the resurrection from the dead:",pt:"e que com poder foi declarado Filho de Deus segundo o esp\xedrito de santidade, pela ressurrei\xe7\xe3o dentre os mortos - Jesus Cristo nosso Senhor,"},{verse:5,en:"By whom we have received grace and apostleship, for obedience to the faith among all nations, for his name:",pt:"pelo qual recebemos a gra\xe7a e o apostolado, por amor do seu nome, para a obedi\xeancia da f\xe9 entre todos os gentios,"},{verse:6,en:"Among whom are ye also the called of Jesus Christ:",pt:"entre os quais sois tamb\xe9m v\xf3s chamados para serdes de Jesus Cristo;"},{verse:7,en:"To all that be in Rome, beloved of God, called to be saints: Grace to you and peace from God our Father, and the Lord Jesus Christ.",pt:"a todos os que estais em Roma, amados de Deus, chamados para serdes santos: Gra\xe7a a v\xf3s, e paz da parte de Deus nosso Pai, e do Senhor Jesus Cristo."},{verse:8,en:"First, I thank my God through Jesus Christ for you all, that your faith is spoken of throughout the whole world.",pt:"Primeiramente dou gra\xe7as ao meu Deus, mediante Jesus Cristo, por todos v\xf3s, porque em todo o mundo \xe9 anunciada a vossa f\xe9."},{verse:9,en:"For God is my witness, whom I serve with my spirit in the gospel of his Son, that without ceasing I make mention of you always in my prayers;",pt:"Pois Deus, a quem sirvo em meu esp\xedrito, no evangelho de seu Filho, me \xe9 testemunha de como incessantemente fa\xe7o men\xe7\xe3o de v\xf3s,"},{verse:10,en:"Making request, if by any means now at length I might have a prosperous journey by the will of God to come unto you.",pt:"pedindo sempre em minhas ora\xe7\xf5es que, afinal, pela vontade de Deus, se me ofere\xe7a boa ocasi\xe3o para ir ter convosco."},{verse:11,en:"For I long to see you, that I may impart unto you some spiritual gift, to the end ye may be established;",pt:"Porque desejo muito ver-vos, para vos comunicar algum dom espiritual, a fim de que sejais fortalecidos;"},{verse:12,en:"That is, that I may be comforted together with you by the mutual faith both of you and me.",pt:"isto \xe9, para que juntamente convosco eu seja consolado em v\xf3s pela f\xe9 m\xfatua, vossa e minha."},{verse:13,en:"Now I would not have you ignorant, brethren, that oftentimes I purposed to come unto you, (but was let hitherto,) that I might have some fruit among you also, even as among other Gentiles.",pt:"E n\xe3o quero que ignoreis, irm\xe3os, que muitas vezes propus visitar-vos (mas at\xe9 agora tenho sido impedido), para conseguir algum fruto entre v\xf3s, como tamb\xe9m entre os demais gentios."},{verse:14,en:"I am debtor both to the Greeks, and to the Barbarians; both to the wise, and to the unwise.",pt:"Eu sou devedor, tanto a gregos como a b\xe1rbaros, tanto a s\xe1bios como a ignorantes."},{verse:15,en:"So, as much as in me is, I am ready to preach the gospel to you that are at Rome also.",pt:"De modo que, quanto est\xe1 em mim, estou pronto para anunciar o evangelho tamb\xe9m a v\xf3s que estais em Roma."},{verse:16,en:"For I am not ashamed of the gospel of Christ: for it is the power of God unto salvation to every one that believeth; to the Jew first, and also to the Greek.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o me envergonho do evangelho, pois \xe9 o poder de Deus para salva\xe7\xe3o de todo aquele que cr\xea; primeiro do judeu, e tamb\xe9m do grego."},{verse:17,en:"For therein is the righteousness of God revealed from faith to faith: as it is written, The just shall live by faith.",pt:"Porque no evangelho \xe9 revelada, de f\xe9 em f\xe9, a justi\xe7a de Deus, como est\xe1 escrito: Mas o justo viver\xe1 da f\xe9."},{verse:18,en:"For the wrath of God is revealed from heaven against all ungodliness and unrighteousness of men, who hold the truth in unrighteousness;",pt:"Pois do c\xe9u \xe9 revelada a ira de Deus contra toda a impiedade e injusti\xe7a dos homens que det\xeam a verdade em injusti\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"Because that which may be known of God is manifest in them; for God hath shewed it unto them.",pt:"Porquanto, o que de Deus se pode conhecer, neles se manifesta, porque Deus lho manifestou."},{verse:20,en:"For the invisible things of him from the creation of the world are clearly seen, being understood by the things that are made, even his eternal power and Godhead; so that they are without excuse:",pt:"Pois os seus atributos invis\xedveis, o seu eterno poder e divindade, s\xe3o claramente vistos desde a cria\xe7\xe3o do mundo, sendo percebidos mediante as coisas criadas, de modo que eles s\xe3o inescus\xe1veis;"},{verse:21,en:"Because that, when they knew God, they glorified him not as God, neither were thankful; but became vain in their imaginations, and their foolish heart was darkened.",pt:"porquanto, tendo conhecido a Deus, contudo n\xe3o o glorificaram como Deus, nem lhe deram gra\xe7as, antes nas suas especula\xe7\xf5es se desvaneceram, e o seu cora\xe7\xe3o insensato se obscureceu."},{verse:22,en:"Professing themselves to be wise, they became fools,",pt:"Dizendo-se s\xe1bios, tornaram-se estultos,"},{verse:23,en:"And changed the glory of the uncorruptible God into an image made like to corruptible man, and to birds, and fourfooted beasts, and creeping things.",pt:"e mudaram a gl\xf3ria do Deus incorrupt\xedvel em semelhan\xe7a da imagem de homem corrupt\xedvel, e de aves, e de quadr\xfapedes, e de r\xe9pteis."},{verse:24,en:"Wherefore God also gave them up to uncleanness through the lusts of their own hearts, to dishonour their own bodies between themselves:",pt:"Por isso Deus os entregou, nas concupisc\xeancias de seus cora\xe7\xf5es, \xe0 imund\xedcia, para serem os seus corpos desonrados entre si;"},{verse:25,en:"Who changed the truth of God into a lie, and worshipped and served the creature more than the Creator, who is blessed for ever. Amen.",pt:"pois trocaram a verdade de Deus pela mentira, e adoraram e serviram \xe0 criatura antes que ao Criador, que \xe9 bendito eternamente. Am\xe9m."},{verse:26,en:"For this cause God gave them up unto vile affections: for even their women did change the natural use into that which is against nature:",pt:"Pelo que Deus os entregou a paix\xf5es infames. Porque at\xe9 as suas mulheres mudaram o uso natural no que \xe9 contr\xe1rio \xe0 natureza;"},{verse:27,en:"And likewise also the men, leaving the natural use of the woman, burned in their lust one toward another; men with men working that which is unseemly, and receiving in themselves that recompence of their error which was meet.",pt:"semelhantemente, tamb\xe9m os var\xf5es, deixando o uso natural da mulher, se inflamaram em sua sensualidade uns para como os outros, var\xe3o com var\xe3o, cometendo torpeza e recebendo em si mesmos a devida recompensa do seu erro."},{verse:28,en:"And even as they did not like to retain God in their knowledge, God gave them over to a reprobate mind, to do those things which are not convenient;",pt:"E assim como eles rejeitaram o conhecimento de Deus, Deus, por sua vez, os entregou a um sentimento depravado, para fazerem coisas que n\xe3o conv\xeam;"},{verse:29,en:"Being filled with all unrighteousness, fornication, wickedness, covetousness, maliciousness; full of envy, murder, debate, deceit, malignity; whisperers,",pt:"estando cheios de toda a injusti\xe7a, mal\xedcia, cobi\xe7a, maldade; cheios de inveja, homic\xeddio, contenda, dolo, malignidade;"},{verse:30,en:"Backbiters, haters of God, despiteful, proud, boasters, inventors of evil things, disobedient to parents,",pt:"sendo murmuradores, detratores, aborrecedores de Deus, injuriadores, soberbos, presun\xe7osos, inventores de males, desobedientes ao pais;"},{verse:31,en:"Without understanding, covenantbreakers, without natural affection, implacable, unmerciful:",pt:"n\xe9scios, infi\xe9is nos contratos, sem afei\xe7\xe3o natural, sem miseric\xf3rdia;"},{verse:32,en:"Who knowing the judgment of God, that they which commit such things are worthy of death, not only do the same, but have pleasure in them that do them.",pt:"os quais, conhecendo bem o decreto de Deus, que declara dignos de morte os que tais coisas praticam, n\xe3o somente as fazem, mas tamb\xe9m aprovam os que as praticam."}]}}),716,[]);
__d((function(e,o,t,a,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Therefore thou art inexcusable, O man, whosoever thou art that judgest: for wherein thou judgest another, thou condemnest thyself; for thou that judgest doest the same things.",pt:"Portanto, \xe9s inescus\xe1vel, \xf3 homem, qualquer que sejas, quando julgas, porque te condenas a ti mesmo naquilo em que julgas a outro; pois tu que julgas, praticas o mesmo."},{verse:2,en:"But we are sure that the judgment of God is according to truth against them which commit such things.",pt:"E bem sabemos que o ju\xedzo de Deus \xe9 segundo a verdade, contra os que tais coisas praticam."},{verse:3,en:"And thinkest thou this, O man, that judgest them which do such things, and doest the same, that thou shalt escape the judgment of God?",pt:"E tu, \xf3 homem, que julgas os que praticam tais coisas, cuidas que, fazendo-as tu, escapar\xe1s ao ju\xedzo de Deus?"},{verse:4,en:"Or despisest thou the riches of his goodness and forbearance and longsuffering; not knowing that the goodness of God leadeth thee to repentance?",pt:"Ou desprezas tu as riquezas da sua benignidade, e paci\xeancia e longanimidade, ignorando que a benignidade de Deus te conduz ao arrependimento?"},{verse:5,en:"But after thy hardness and impenitent heart treasurest up unto thyself wrath against the day of wrath and revelation of the righteous judgment of God;",pt:"Mas, segundo a tua dureza e teu cora\xe7\xe3o impenitente, entesouras ira para ti no dia da ira e da revela\xe7\xe3o do justo ju\xedzo de Deus,"},{verse:6,en:"Who will render to every man according to his deeds:",pt:"que retribuir\xe1 a cada um segundo as suas obras;"},{verse:7,en:"To them who by patient continuance in well doing seek for glory and honour and immortality, eternal life:",pt:"a saber: a vida eterna aos que, com perseveran\xe7a em favor o bem, procuram gl\xf3ria, e honra e incorrup\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:8,en:"But unto them that are contentious, and do not obey the truth, but obey unrighteousness, indignation and wrath,",pt:"mas ira e indigna\xe7\xe3o aos que s\xe3o contenciosos, e desobedientes \xe0 iniq\xfcidade;"},{verse:9,en:"Tribulation and anguish, upon every soul of man that doeth evil, of the Jew first, and also of the Gentile;",pt:"tribula\xe7\xe3o e ang\xfastia sobre a alma de todo homem que pratica o mal, primeiramente do judeu, e tamb\xe9m do grego;"},{verse:10,en:"But glory, honour, and peace, to every man that worketh good, to the Jew first, and also to the Gentile:",pt:"gl\xf3ria, por\xe9m, e honra e paz a todo aquele que pratica o bem, primeiramente ao judeu, e tamb\xe9m ao grego;"},{verse:11,en:"For there is no respect of persons with God.",pt:"pois para com Deus n\xe3o h\xe1 acep\xe7\xe3o de pessoas."},{verse:12,en:"For as many as have sinned without law shall also perish without law: and as many as have sinned in the law shall be judged by the law;",pt:"Porque todos os que sem lei pecaram, sem lei tamb\xe9m perecer\xe3o; e todos os que sob a lei pecaram, pela lei ser\xe3o julgados."},{verse:13,en:"(For not the hearers of the law are just before God, but the doers of the law shall be justified.",pt:"Pois n\xe3o s\xe3o justos diante de Deus os que s\xf3 ouvem a lei; mas ser\xe3o justificados os que praticam a lei"},{verse:14,en:"For when the Gentiles, which have not the law, do by nature the things contained in the law, these, having not the law, are a law unto themselves:",pt:"(porque, quando os gentios, que n\xe3o t\xeam lei, fazem por natureza as coisas da lei, eles, embora n\xe3o tendo lei, para si mesmos s\xe3o lei."},{verse:15,en:"Which shew the work of the law written in their hearts, their conscience also bearing witness, and their thoughts the mean while accusing or else excusing one another;)",pt:"pois mostram a obra da lei escrita em seus cora\xe7\xf5es, testificando juntamente a sua consci\xeancia e os seus pensamentos, quer acusando-os, quer defendendo-os),"},{verse:16,en:"In the day when God shall judge the secrets of men by Jesus Christ according to my gospel.",pt:"no dia em que Deus h\xe1 de julgar os segredos dos homens, por Cristo Jesus, segundo o meu evangelho."},{verse:17,en:"Behold, thou art called a Jew, and restest in the law, and makest thy boast of God,",pt:"Mas se tu \xe9s chamado judeu, e repousas na lei, e te glorias em Deus;"},{verse:18,en:"And knowest his will, and approvest the things that are more excellent, being instructed out of the law;",pt:"e conheces a sua vontade e aprovas as coisas excelentes, sendo instru\xeddo na lei;"},{verse:19,en:"And art confident that thou thyself art a guide of the blind, a light of them which are in darkness,",pt:"e confias que \xe9s guia dos cegos, luz dos que est\xe3o em trevas,"},{verse:20,en:"An instructor of the foolish, a teacher of babes, which hast the form of knowledge and of the truth in the law.",pt:"instruidor dos n\xe9scios, mestre de crian\xe7as, que tens na lei a forma da ci\xeancia e da verdade;"},{verse:21,en:"Thou therefore which teachest another, teachest thou not thyself? thou that preachest a man should not steal, dost thou steal?",pt:"tu, pois, que ensinas a outrem, n\xe3o te ensinas a ti mesmo? Tu, que pregas que n\xe3o se deve furtar, furtas?"},{verse:22,en:"Thou that sayest a man should not commit adultery, dost thou commit adultery? thou that abhorrest idols, dost thou commit sacrilege?",pt:"Tu, que dizes que n\xe3o se deve cometer adult\xe9rio, adult\xe9ras? Tu, que abominas os \xeddolos, roubas os templos?"},{verse:23,en:"Thou that makest thy boast of the law, through breaking the law dishonourest thou God?",pt:"Tu, que te glorias na lei, desonras a Deus pela transgress\xe3o da lei?"},{verse:24,en:"For the name of God is blasphemed among the Gentiles through you, as it is written.",pt:"Assim pois, por vossa causa, o nome de Deus \xe9 blasfemado entre os gentios, como est\xe1 escrito."},{verse:25,en:"For circumcision verily profiteth, if thou keep the law: but if thou be a breaker of the law, thy circumcision is made uncircumcision.",pt:"Porque a circuncis\xe3o \xe9, na verdade, proveitosa, se guardares a lei; mas se tu \xe9s transgressor da lei, a tua circuncis\xe3o tem-se tornado em incircuncis\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"Therefore if the uncircumcision keep the righteousness of the law, shall not his uncircumcision be counted for circumcision?",pt:"Se, pois, a incircuncis\xe3o guardar os preceitos da lei, porventura a incircuncis\xe3o n\xe3o ser\xe1 reputada como circuncis\xe3o?"},{verse:27,en:"And shall not uncircumcision which is by nature, if it fulfil the law, judge thee, who by the letter and circumcision dost transgress the law?",pt:"E a incircuncis\xe3o que por natureza o \xe9, se cumpre a lei, julgar\xe1 a ti, que com a letra e a circuncis\xe3o \xe9s transgressor da lei."},{verse:28,en:"For he is not a Jew, which is one outwardly; neither is that circumcision, which is outward in the flesh:",pt:"Porque n\xe3o \xe9 judeu o que o \xe9 exteriormente, nem \xe9 circuncis\xe3o a que o \xe9 exteriormente na carne."},{verse:29,en:"But he is a Jew, which is one inwardly; and circumcision is that of the heart, in the spirit, and not in the letter; whose praise is not of men, but of God.",pt:"Mas \xe9 judeu aquele que o \xe9 interiormente, e circuncis\xe3o \xe9 a do cora\xe7\xe3o, no esp\xedrito, e n\xe3o na letra; cujo louvor n\xe3o prov\xe9m dos homens, mas de Deus."}]}}),717,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,i,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"What advantage then hath the Jew? or what profit is there of circumcision?",pt:"Que vantagem, pois, tem o judeu? ou qual a utilidade da circuncis\xe3o?"},{verse:2,en:"Much every way: chiefly, because that unto them were committed the oracles of God.",pt:"Muita, em todo sentido; primeiramente, porque lhe foram confiados os or\xe1culos de Deus."},{verse:3,en:"For what if some did not believe? shall their unbelief make the faith of God without effect?",pt:"Pois qu\xea? Se alguns foram infi\xe9is, porventura a sua infidelidade anular\xe1 a fidelidade de Deus?"},{verse:4,en:"God forbid: yea, let God be true, but every man a liar; as it is written, That thou mightest be justified in thy sayings, and mightest overcome when thou art judged.",pt:"De modo nenhum; antes seja Deus verdadeiro, e todo homem mentiroso; como est\xe1 escrito: Para que sejas justificado em tuas palavras, e ven\xe7as quando fores julgado."},{verse:5,en:"But if our unrighteousness commend the righteousness of God, what shall we say? Is God unrighteous who taketh vengeance? (I speak as a man)",pt:"E, se a nossa injusti\xe7a prova a justi\xe7a de Deus, que diremos? Acaso Deus, que castiga com ira, \xe9 injusto? (Falo como homem.)"},{verse:6,en:"God forbid: for then how shall God judge the world?",pt:"De modo nenhum; do contr\xe1rio, como julgar\xe1 Deus o mundo?"},{verse:7,en:"For if the truth of God hath more abounded through my lie unto his glory; why yet am I also judged as a sinner?",pt:"Mas, se pela minha mentira abundou mais a verdade de Deus para sua gl\xf3ria, por que sou eu ainda julgado como pecador?"},{verse:8,en:"And not rather, (as we be slanderously reported, and as some affirm that we say,) Let us do evil, that good may come? whose damnation is just.",pt:"E por que n\xe3o dizemos: Fa\xe7amos o mal para que venha o bem? - como alguns caluniosamente afirmam que dizemos; a condena\xe7\xe3o dos quais \xe9 justa."},{verse:9,en:"What then? are we better than they? No, in no wise: for we have before proved both Jews and Gentiles, that they are all under sin;",pt:"Pois qu\xea? Somos melhores do que eles? De maneira nenhuma, pois j\xe1 demonstramos que, tanto judeus como gregos, todos est\xe3o debaixo do pecado;"},{verse:10,en:"As it is written, There is none righteous, no, not one:",pt:"como est\xe1 escrito: N\xe3o h\xe1 justo, nem sequer um."},{verse:11,en:"There is none that understandeth, there is none that seeketh after God.",pt:"N\xe3o h\xe1 quem entenda; n\xe3o h\xe1 quem busque a Deus."},{verse:12,en:"They are all gone out of the way, they are together become unprofitable; there is none that doeth good, no, not one.",pt:"Todos se extraviaram; juntamente se fizeram in\xfateis. N\xe3o h\xe1 quem fa\xe7a o bem, n\xe3o h\xe1 nem um s\xf3."},{verse:13,en:"Their throat is an open sepulchre; with their tongues they have used deceit; the poison of asps is under their lips:",pt:"A sua garganta \xe9 um sepulcro aberto; com as suas l\xednguas tratam enganosamente; pe\xe7onha de \xe1spides est\xe1 debaixo dos seus l\xe1bios;"},{verse:14,en:"Whose mouth is full of cursing and bitterness:",pt:"a sua boca est\xe1 cheia de maldi\xe7\xe3o e amargura."},{verse:15,en:"Their feet are swift to shed blood:",pt:"Os seus p\xe9s s\xe3o ligeiros para derramar sangue."},{verse:16,en:"Destruction and misery are in their ways:",pt:"Nos seus caminhos h\xe1 destrui\xe7\xe3o e mis\xe9ria;"},{verse:17,en:"And the way of peace have they not known:",pt:"e n\xe3o conheceram o caminho da paz."},{verse:18,en:"There is no fear of God before their eyes.",pt:"N\xe3o h\xe1 temor de Deus diante dos seus olhos."},{verse:19,en:"Now we know that what things soever the law saith, it saith to them who are under the law: that every mouth may be stopped, and all the world may become guilty before God.",pt:"Ora, n\xf3s sabemos que tudo o que a lei diz, aos que est\xe3o debaixo da lei o diz, para que se cale toda boca e todo o mundo fique sujeito ao ju\xedzo de Deus;"},{verse:20,en:"Therefore by the deeds of the law there shall no flesh be justified in his sight: for by the law is the knowledge of sin.",pt:"porquanto pelas obras da lei nenhum homem ser\xe1 justificado diante dele; pois o que vem pela lei \xe9 o pleno conhecimento do pecado."},{verse:21,en:"But now the righteousness of God without the law is manifested, being witnessed by the law and the prophets;",pt:"Mas agora, sem lei, tem-se manifestado a justi\xe7a de Deus, que \xe9 atestada pela lei e pelos profetas;"},{verse:22,en:"Even the righteousness of God which is by faith of Jesus Christ unto all and upon all them that believe: for there is no difference:",pt:"isto \xe9, a justi\xe7a de Deus pela f\xe9 em Jesus Cristo para todos os que cr\xeaem; pois n\xe3o h\xe1 distin\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:23,en:"For all have sinned, and come short of the glory of God;",pt:"Porque todos pecaram e destitu\xeddos est\xe3o da gl\xf3ria de Deus;"},{verse:24,en:"Being justified freely by his grace through the redemption that is in Christ Jesus:",pt:"sendo justificados gratuitamente pela sua gra\xe7a, mediante a reden\xe7\xe3o que h\xe1 em Cristo Jesus,"},{verse:25,en:"Whom God hath set forth to be a propitiation through faith in his blood, to declare his righteousness for the remission of sins that are past, through the forbearance of God;",pt:"ao qual Deus prop\xf4s como propicia\xe7\xe3o, pela f\xe9, no seu sangue, para demonstra\xe7\xe3o da sua justi\xe7a por ter ele na sua paci\xeancia, deixado de lado os delitos outrora cometidos;"},{verse:26,en:"To declare, I say, at this time his righteousness: that he might be just, and the justifier of him which believeth in Jesus.",pt:"para demonstra\xe7\xe3o da sua justi\xe7a neste tempo presente, para que ele seja justo e tamb\xe9m justificador daquele que tem f\xe9 em Jesus."},{verse:27,en:"Where is boasting then? It is excluded. By what law? of works? Nay: but by the law of faith.",pt:"Onde est\xe1 logo a jact\xe2ncia? Foi exclu\xedda. Por que lei? Das obras? N\xe3o; mas pela lei da f\xe9."},{verse:28,en:"Therefore we conclude that a man is justified by faith without the deeds of the law.",pt:"conclu\xedmos pois que o homem \xe9 justificado pela f\xe9 sem as obras da lei."},{verse:29,en:"Is he the God of the Jews only? is he not also of the Gentiles? Yes, of the Gentiles also:",pt:"\xc9 porventura Deus somente dos judeus? N\xe3o \xe9 tamb\xe9m dos gentios? Tamb\xe9m dos gentios, certamente,"},{verse:30,en:"Seeing it is one God, which shall justify the circumcision by faith, and uncircumcision through faith.",pt:"se \xe9 que Deus \xe9 um s\xf3, que pela f\xe9 h\xe1 de justificar a circuncis\xe3o, e tamb\xe9m por meio da f\xe9 a incircuncis\xe3o."},{verse:31,en:"Do we then make void the law through faith? God forbid: yea, we establish the law.",pt:"Anulamos, pois, a lei pela f\xe9? De modo nenhum; antes estabelecemos a lei."}]}}),718,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,i,r){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"What shall we say then that Abraham our father, as pertaining to the flesh, hath found?",pt:"Que diremos, pois, ter alcan\xe7ado Abra\xe3o, nosso pai segundo a carne?"},{verse:2,en:"For if Abraham were justified by works, he hath whereof to glory; but not before God.",pt:"Porque, se Abra\xe3o foi justificado pelas obras, tem de que se gloriar, mas n\xe3o diante de Deus."},{verse:3,en:"For what saith the scripture? Abraham believed God, and it was counted unto him for righteousness.",pt:"Pois, que diz a Escritura? Creu Abra\xe3o a Deus, e isso lhe foi imputado como justi\xe7a."},{verse:4,en:"Now to him that worketh is the reward not reckoned of grace, but of debt.",pt:"Ora, ao que trabalha n\xe3o se lhe conta a recompensa como d\xe1diva, mas sim como d\xedvida;"},{verse:5,en:"But to him that worketh not, but believeth on him that justifieth the ungodly, his faith is counted for righteousness.",pt:"por\xe9m ao que n\xe3o trabalha, mas cr\xea naquele que justifica o \xedmpio, a sua f\xe9 lhe \xe9 contada como justi\xe7a;"},{verse:6,en:"Even as David also describeth the blessedness of the man, unto whom God imputeth righteousness without works,",pt:"assim tamb\xe9m Davi declara bem-aventurado o homem a quem Deus atribui a justi\xe7a sem as obras, dizendo:"},{verse:7,en:"Saying, Blessed are they whose iniquities are forgiven, and whose sins are covered.",pt:"Bem-aventurados aqueles cujas iniq\xfcidades s\xe3o perdoadas, e cujos pecados s\xe3o cobertos."},{verse:8,en:"Blessed is the man to whom the Lord will not impute sin.",pt:"Bem-aventurado o homem a quem o Senhor n\xe3o imputar\xe1 o pecado."},{verse:9,en:"Cometh this blessedness then upon the circumcision only, or upon the uncircumcision also? for we say that faith was reckoned to Abraham for righteousness.",pt:"Vem, pois, esta bem-aventuran\xe7a sobre a circuncis\xe3o somente, ou tamb\xe9m sobre a incircuncis\xe3o? Porque dizemos: A Abra\xe3o foi imputada a f\xe9 como justi\xe7a."},{verse:10,en:"How was it then reckoned? when he was in circumcision, or in uncircumcision? Not in circumcision, but in uncircumcision.",pt:"Como, pois, lhe foi imputada? Estando na circuncis\xe3o, ou na incircuncis\xe3o? N\xe3o na circuncis\xe3o, mas sim na incircuncis\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"And he received the sign of circumcision, a seal of the righteousness of the faith which he had yet being uncircumcised: that he might be the father of all them that believe, though they be not circumcised; that righteousness might be imputed unto them also:",pt:"E recebeu o sinal da circuncis\xe3o, selo da justi\xe7a da f\xe9 que teve quando ainda n\xe3o era circuncidado, para que fosse pai de todos os que cr\xeaem, estando eles na incircuncis\xe3o, a fim de que a justi\xe7a lhes seja imputada,"},{verse:12,en:"And the father of circumcision to them who are not of the circumcision only, but who also walk in the steps of that faith of our father Abraham, which he had being yet uncircumcised.",pt:"bem como fosse pai dos circuncisos, dos que n\xe3o somente s\xe3o da circuncis\xe3o, mas tamb\xe9m andam nas pisadas daquela f\xe9 que teve nosso pai Abra\xe3o, antes de ser circuncidado."},{verse:13,en:"For the promise, that he should be the heir of the world, was not to Abraham, or to his seed, through the law, but through the righteousness of faith.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o foi pela lei que veio a Abra\xe3o, ou \xe0 sua descend\xeancia, a promessa de que havia de ser herdeiro do mundo, mas pela justi\xe7a da f\xe9."},{verse:14,en:"For if they which are of the law be heirs, faith is made void, and the promise made of none effect:",pt:"Pois, se os que s\xe3o da lei s\xe3o herdeiros, logo a f\xe9 \xe9 v\xe3 e a promessa \xe9 anulada."},{verse:15,en:"Because the law worketh wrath: for where no law is, there is no transgression.",pt:"Porque a lei opera a ira; mas onde n\xe3o h\xe1 lei tamb\xe9m n\xe3o h\xe1 transgress\xe3o."},{verse:16,en:"Therefore it is of faith, that it might be by grace; to the end the promise might be sure to all the seed; not to that only which is of the law, but to that also which is of the faith of Abraham; who is the father of us all,",pt:"Porquanto procede da f\xe9 o ser herdeiro, para que seja segundo a gra\xe7a, a fim de que a promessa seja firme a toda a descend\xeancia, n\xe3o somente \xe0 que \xe9 da lei, mas tamb\xe9m \xe0 que \xe9 da f\xe9 que teve Abra\xe3o, o qual \xe9 pai de todos n\xf3s."},{verse:17,en:"(As it is written, I have made thee a father of many nations,) before him whom he believed, even God, who quickeneth the dead, and calleth those things which be not as though they were.",pt:"(como est\xe1 escrito: Por pai de muitas na\xe7\xf5es te constitu\xed) perante aquele no qual creu, a saber, Deus, que vivifica os mortos, e chama as coisas que n\xe3o s\xe3o, como se j\xe1 fossem."},{verse:18,en:"Who against hope believed in hope, that he might become the father of many nations, according to that which was spoken, So shall thy seed be.",pt:"O qual, em esperan\xe7a, creu contra a esperan\xe7a, para que se tornasse pai de muitas na\xe7\xf5es, conforme o que lhe fora dito: Assim ser\xe1 a tua descend\xeancia;"},{verse:19,en:"And being not weak in faith, he considered not his own body now dead, when he was about an hundred years old, neither yet the deadness of Sarah\u2019s womb:",pt:"e sem se enfraquecer na f\xe9, considerou o seu pr\xf3prio corpo j\xe1 amortecido (pois tinha quase cem anos), e o amortecimento do ventre de Sara;"},{verse:20,en:"He staggered not at the promise of God through unbelief; but was strong in faith, giving glory to God;",pt:"contudo, \xe0 vista da promessa de Deus, n\xe3o vacilou por incredulidade, antes foi fortalecido na f\xe9, dando gl\xf3ria a Deus,"},{verse:21,en:"And being fully persuaded that, what he had promised, he was able also to perform.",pt:"e estando cert\xedssimo de que o que Deus tinha prometido, tamb\xe9m era poderoso para o fazer."},{verse:22,en:"And therefore it was imputed to him for righteousness.",pt:"Pelo que tamb\xe9m isso lhe foi imputado como justi\xe7a."},{verse:23,en:"Now it was not written for his sake alone, that it was imputed to him;",pt:"Ora, n\xe3o \xe9 s\xf3 por causa dele que est\xe1 escrito que lhe foi imputado;"},{verse:24,en:"But for us also, to whom it shall be imputed, if we believe on him that raised up Jesus our Lord from the dead;",pt:"mas tamb\xe9m por causa de n\xf3s a quem h\xe1 de ser imputado, a n\xf3s os que cremos naquele que dos mortos ressuscitou a Jesus nosso Senhor;"},{verse:25,en:"Who was delivered for our offences, and was raised again for our justification.",pt:"o qual foi entregue por causa das nossas transgress\xf5es, e ressuscitado para a nossa justifica\xe7\xe3o."}]}}),719,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,n,r,t){n.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Therefore being justified by faith, we have peace with God through our Lord Jesus Christ:",pt:"Justificados, pois, pela f\xe9, tenhamos paz com Deus, por nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo,"},{verse:2,en:"By whom also we have access by faith into this grace wherein we stand, and rejoice in hope of the glory of God.",pt:"por quem obtivemos tamb\xe9m nosso acesso pela f\xe9 a esta gra\xe7a, na qual estamos firmes, e gloriemo-nos na esperan\xe7a da gl\xf3ria de Deus."},{verse:3,en:"And not only so, but we glory in tribulations also: knowing that tribulation worketh patience;",pt:"E n\xe3o somente isso, mas tamb\xe9m gloriemo-nos nas tribula\xe7\xf5es; sabendo que a tribula\xe7\xe3o produz a perseveran\xe7a,"},{verse:4,en:"And patience, experience; and experience, hope:",pt:"e a perseveran\xe7a a experi\xeancia, e a experi\xeancia a esperan\xe7a;"},{verse:5,en:"And hope maketh not ashamed; because the love of God is shed abroad in our hearts by the Holy Ghost which is given unto us.",pt:"e a esperan\xe7a n\xe3o desaponta, porquanto o amor de Deus est\xe1 derramado em nossos cora\xe7\xf5es pelo Esp\xedrito Santo que nos foi dado."},{verse:6,en:"For when we were yet without strength, in due time Christ died for the ungodly.",pt:"Pois, quando ainda \xe9ramos fracos, Cristo morreu a seu tempo pelos \xedmpios."},{verse:7,en:"For scarcely for a righteous man will one die: yet peradventure for a good man some would even dare to die.",pt:"Porque dificilmente haver\xe1 quem morra por um justo; pois poder\xe1 ser que pelo homem bondoso algu\xe9m ouse morrer."},{verse:8,en:"But God commendeth his love toward us, in that, while we were yet sinners, Christ died for us.",pt:"Mas Deus d\xe1 prova do seu amor para conosco, em que, quando \xe9ramos ainda pecadores, Cristo morreu por n\xf3s."},{verse:9,en:"Much more then, being now justified by his blood, we shall be saved from wrath through him.",pt:"Logo muito mais, sendo agora justificados pelo seu sangue, seremos por ele salvos da ira."},{verse:10,en:"For if, when we were enemies, we were reconciled to God by the death of his Son, much more, being reconciled, we shall be saved by his life.",pt:"Porque se n\xf3s, quando \xe9ramos inimigos, fomos reconciliados com Deus pela morte de seu Filho, muito mais, estando j\xe1 reconciliados, seremos salvos pela sua vida."},{verse:11,en:"And not only so, but we also joy in God through our Lord Jesus Christ, by whom we have now received the atonement.",pt:"E n\xe3o somente isso, mas tamb\xe9m nos gloriamos em Deus por nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo, pelo qual agora temos recebido a reconcilia\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"Wherefore, as by one man sin entered into the world, and death by sin; and so death passed upon all men, for that all have sinned:",pt:"Portanto, assim como por um s\xf3 homem entrou o pecado no mundo, e pelo pecado a morte, assim tamb\xe9m a morte passou a todos os homens, porquanto todos pecaram."},{verse:13,en:"(For until the law sin was in the world: but sin is not imputed when there is no law.",pt:"Porque antes da lei j\xe1 estava o pecado no mundo, mas onde n\xe3o h\xe1 lei o pecado n\xe3o \xe9 levado em conta."},{verse:14,en:"Nevertheless death reigned from Adam to Moses, even over them that had not sinned after the similitude of Adam\u2019s transgression, who is the figure of him that was to come.",pt:"No entanto a morte reinou desde Ad\xe3o at\xe9 Mois\xe9s, mesmo sobre aqueles que n\xe3o pecaram \xe0 semelhan\xe7a da transgress\xe3o de Ad\xe3o o qual \xe9 figura daquele que havia de vir."},{verse:15,en:"But not as the offence, so also is the free gift. For if through the offence of one many be dead, much more the grace of God, and the gift by grace, which is by one man, Jesus Christ, hath abounded unto many.",pt:"Mas n\xe3o \xe9 assim o dom gratuito como a ofensa; porque, se pela ofensa de um morreram muitos, muito mais a gra\xe7a de Deus, e o dom pela gra\xe7a de um s\xf3 homem, Jesus Cristo, abund muitos."},{verse:16,en:"And not as it was by one that sinned, so is the gift: for the judgment was by one to condemnation, but the free gift is of many offences unto justification.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m n\xe3o \xe9 assim o dom como a ofensa, que veio por um s\xf3 que pecou; porque o ju\xedzo veio, na verdade, de uma s\xf3 ofensa para condena\xe7\xe3o, mas o dom gratuito veio de muitas ofensas para justifica\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:17,en:"For if by one man\u2019s offence death reigned by one; much more they which receive abundance of grace and of the gift of righteousness shall reign in life by one, Jesus Christ.)",pt:"Porque, se pela ofensa de um s\xf3, a morte veio a reinar por esse, muito mais os que recebem a abund\xe2ncia da gra\xe7a, e do dom da justi\xe7a, reinar\xe3o em vida por um s\xf3, Jesus Cristo."},{verse:18,en:"Therefore as by the offence of one judgment came upon all men to condemnation; even so by the righteousness of one the free gift came upon all men unto justification of life.",pt:"Portanto, assim como por uma s\xf3 ofensa veio o ju\xedzo sobre todos os homens para condena\xe7\xe3o, assim tamb\xe9m por um s\xf3 ato de justi\xe7a veio a gra\xe7a sobre todos os homens para justifica\xe7\xe3o e vida."},{verse:19,en:"For as by one man\u2019s disobedience many were made sinners, so by the obedience of one shall many be made righteous.",pt:"Porque, assim como pela desobedi\xeancia de um s\xf3 homem muitos foram constitu\xeddos pecadores, assim tamb\xe9m pela obedi\xeancia de um muitos ser\xe3o constitu\xeddos justos."},{verse:20,en:"Moreover the law entered, that the offence might abound. But where sin abounded, grace did much more abound:",pt:"Sobreveio, por\xe9m, a lei para que a ofensa abundasse; mas, onde o pecado abundou, superabundou a gra\xe7a;"},{verse:21,en:"That as sin hath reigned unto death, even so might grace reign through righteousness unto eternal life by Jesus Christ our Lord.",pt:"para que, assim como o pecado veio a reinar na morte, assim tamb\xe9m viesse a reinar a gra\xe7a pela justi\xe7a para a vida eterna, por Jesus Cristo nosso Senhor."}]}}),720,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"What shall we say then? Shall we continue in sin, that grace may abound?",pt:"Que diremos, pois? Permaneceremos no pecado, para que abunde a gra\xe7a?"},{verse:2,en:"God forbid. How shall we, that are dead to sin, live any longer therein?",pt:"De modo nenhum. N\xf3s, que j\xe1 morremos para o pecado, como viveremos ainda nele?"},{verse:3,en:"Know ye not, that so many of us as were baptized into Jesus Christ were baptized into his death?",pt:"Ou, porventura, ignorais que todos quantos fomos batizados em Cristo Jesus fomos batizados na sua morte?"},{verse:4,en:"Therefore we are buried with him by baptism into death: that like as Christ was raised up from the dead by the glory of the Father, even so we also should walk in newness of life.",pt:"Fomos, pois, sepultados com ele pelo batismo na morte, para que, como Cristo foi ressuscitado dentre os mortos pela gl\xf3ria do Pai, assim andemos n\xf3s tamb\xe9m em novidade de vida."},{verse:5,en:"For if we have been planted together in the likeness of his death, we shall be also in the likeness of his resurrection:",pt:"Porque, se temos sido unidos a ele na semelhan\xe7a da sua morte, certamente tamb\xe9m o seremos na semelhan\xe7a da sua ressurrei\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:6,en:"Knowing this, that our old man is crucified with him, that the body of sin might be destroyed, that henceforth we should not serve sin.",pt:"sabendo isto, que o nosso homem velho foi crucificado com ele, para que o corpo do pecado fosse desfeito, a fim de n\xe3o servirmos mais ao pecado."},{verse:7,en:"For he that is dead is freed from sin.",pt:"Pois quem est\xe1 morto est\xe1 justificado do pecado."},{verse:8,en:"Now if we be dead with Christ, we believe that we shall also live with him:",pt:"Ora, se j\xe1 morremos com Cristo, cremos que tamb\xe9m com ele viveremos,"},{verse:9,en:"Knowing that Christ being raised from the dead dieth no more; death hath no more dominion over him.",pt:"sabendo que, tendo Cristo ressurgido dentre os mortos, j\xe1 n\xe3o morre mais; a morte n\xe3o mais tem dom\xednio sobre ele."},{verse:10,en:"For in that he died, he died unto sin once: but in that he liveth, he liveth unto God.",pt:"Pois quanto a ter morrido, de uma vez por todas morreu para o pecado, mas quanto a viver, vive para Deus."},{verse:11,en:"Likewise reckon ye also yourselves to be dead indeed unto sin, but alive unto God through Jesus Christ our Lord.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s considerai-vos como mortos para o pecado, mas vivos para Deus, em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:12,en:"Let not sin therefore reign in your mortal body, that ye should obey it in the lusts thereof.",pt:"N\xe3o reine, portanto, o pecado em vosso corpo mortal, para obedecerdes \xe0s suas concupisc\xeancias;"},{verse:13,en:"Neither yield ye your members as instruments of unrighteousness unto sin: but yield yourselves unto God, as those that are alive from the dead, and your members as instruments of righteousness unto God.",pt:"nem tampouco apresenteis os vossos membros ao pecado como instrumentos de iniq\xfcidade; mas apresentai-vos a Deus, como redivivos dentre os mortos, e os vossos membros a Deus, como instrumentos de justi\xe7a."},{verse:14,en:"For sin shall not have dominion over you: for ye are not under the law, but under grace.",pt:"Pois o pecado n\xe3o ter\xe1 dom\xednio sobre v\xf3s, porquanto n\xe3o estais debaixo da lei, mas debaixo da gra\xe7a."},{verse:15,en:"What then? shall we sin, because we are not under the law, but under grace? God forbid.",pt:"Pois qu\xea? Havemos de pecar porque n\xe3o estamos debaixo da lei, mas debaixo da gra\xe7a? De modo nenhum."},{verse:16,en:"Know ye not, that to whom ye yield yourselves servants to obey, his servants ye are to whom ye obey; whether of sin unto death, or of obedience unto righteousness?",pt:"N\xe3o sabeis que daquele a quem vos apresentais como servos para lhe obedecer, sois servos desse mesmo a quem obedeceis, seja do pecado para a morte, ou da obedi\xeancia para a justi\xe7a?"},{verse:17,en:"But God be thanked, that ye were the servants of sin, but ye have obeyed from the heart that form of doctrine which was delivered you.",pt:"Mas gra\xe7as a Deus que, embora tendo sido servos do pecado, obedecestes de cora\xe7\xe3o \xe0 forma de doutrina a que fostes entregues;"},{verse:18,en:"Being then made free from sin, ye became the servants of righteousness.",pt:"e libertos do pecado, fostes feitos servos da justi\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"I speak after the manner of men because of the infirmity of your flesh: for as ye have yielded your members servants to uncleanness and to iniquity unto iniquity; even so now yield your members servants to righteousness unto holiness.",pt:"Falo como homem, por causa da fraqueza da vossa carne. Pois assim como apresentastes os vossos membros como servos da impureza e da iniq\xfcidade para iniq\xfcidade, assim apresentai agora os vossos membros como servos da justi\xe7a para santifica\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"For when ye were the servants of sin, ye were free from righteousness.",pt:"Porque, quando \xe9reis servos do pecado, est\xe1veis livres em rela\xe7\xe3o \xe0 justi\xe7a."},{verse:21,en:"What fruit had ye then in those things whereof ye are now ashamed? for the end of those things is death.",pt:"E que fruto t\xednheis ent\xe3o das coisas de que agora vos envergonhais? pois o fim delas \xe9 a morte."},{verse:22,en:"But now being made free from sin, and become servants to God, ye have your fruit unto holiness, and the end everlasting life.",pt:"Mas agora, libertos do pecado, e feitos servos de Deus, tendes o vosso fruto para santifica\xe7\xe3o, e por fim a vida eterna."},{verse:23,en:"For the wages of sin is death; but the gift of God is eternal life through Jesus Christ our Lord.",pt:"Porque o sal\xe1rio do pecado \xe9 a morte, mas o dom gratuito de Deus \xe9 a vida eterna em Cristo Jesus nosso Senhor."}]}}),721,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Know ye not, brethren, (for I speak to them that know the law,) how that the law hath dominion over a man as long as he liveth?",pt:"Ou ignorais, irm\xe3os (pois falo aos que conhecem a lei), que a lei tem dom\xednio sobre o homem por todo o tempo que ele vive?"},{verse:2,en:"For the woman which hath an husband is bound by the law to her husband so long as he liveth; but if the husband be dead, she is loosed from the law of her husband.",pt:"Porque a mulher casada est\xe1 ligada pela lei a seu marido enquanto ele viver; mas, se ele morrer, ela est\xe1 livre da lei do marido."},{verse:3,en:"So then if, while her husband liveth, she be married to another man, she shall be called an adulteress: but if her husband be dead, she is free from that law; so that she is no adulteress, though she be married to another man.",pt:"De sorte que, enquanto viver o marido, ser\xe1 chamado ad\xfaltera, se for de outro homem; mas, se ele morrer, ela est\xe1 livre da lei, e assim n\xe3o ser\xe1 ad\xfaltera se for de outro marido."},{verse:4,en:"Wherefore, my brethren, ye also are become dead to the law by the body of Christ; that ye should be married to another, even to him who is raised from the dead, that we should bring forth fruit unto God.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s, meus irm\xe3os, fostes mortos quanto \xe0 lei mediante o corpo de Cristo, para pertencerdes a outro, \xe0quele que ressurgiu dentre os mortos a fim de que demos fruto para Deus."},{verse:5,en:"For when we were in the flesh, the motions of sins, which were by the law, did work in our members to bring forth fruit unto death.",pt:"Pois, quando est\xe1vamos na carne, as paix\xf5es dos pecados, suscitadas pela lei, operavam em nossos membros para darem fruto para a morte."},{verse:6,en:"But now we are delivered from the law, that being dead wherein we were held; that we should serve in newness of spirit, and not in the oldness of the letter.",pt:"Mas agora fomos libertos da lei, havendo morrido para aquilo em que est\xe1vamos retidos, para servirmos em novidade de esp\xedrito, e n\xe3o na velhice da letra."},{verse:7,en:"What shall we say then? Is the law sin? God forbid. Nay, I had not known sin, but by the law: for I had not known lust, except the law had said, Thou shalt not covet.",pt:"Que diremos pois? \xc9 a lei pecado? De modo nenhum. Contudo, eu n\xe3o conheci o pecado sen\xe3o pela lei; porque eu n\xe3o conheceria a concupisc\xeancia, se a lei n\xe3o dissesse: N\xe3o cobi\xe7ar\xe1s."},{verse:8,en:"But sin, taking occasion by the commandment, wrought in me all manner of concupiscence. For without the law sin was dead.",pt:"Mas o pecado, tomando ocasi\xe3o, pelo mandamento operou em mim toda esp\xe9cie de concupisc\xeancia; porquanto onde n\xe3o h\xe1 lei est\xe1 morto o pecado."},{verse:9,en:"For I was alive without the law once: but when the commandment came, sin revived, and I died.",pt:"E outrora eu vivia sem a lei; mas assim que veio o mandamento, reviveu o pecado, e eu morri;"},{verse:10,en:"And the commandment, which was ordained to life, I found to be unto death.",pt:"e o mandamento que era para vida, esse achei que me era para morte."},{verse:11,en:"For sin, taking occasion by the commandment, deceived me, and by it slew me.",pt:"Porque o pecado, tomando ocasi\xe3o, pelo mandamento me enganou, e por ele me matou."},{verse:12,en:"Wherefore the law is holy, and the commandment holy, and just, and good.",pt:"De modo que a lei \xe9 santa, e o mandamento santo, justo e bom."},{verse:13,en:"Was then that which is good made death unto me? God forbid. But sin, that it might appear sin, working death in me by that which is good; that sin by the commandment might become exceeding sinful.",pt:"Logo o bom tornou-se morte para mim? De modo nenhum; mas o pecado, para que se mostrasse pecado, operou em mim a morte por meio do bem; a fim de que pelo mandamento o pecado se manifestasse excessivamente maligno."},{verse:14,en:"For we know that the law is spiritual: but I am carnal, sold under sin.",pt:"Porque bem sabemos que a lei \xe9 espiritual; mas eu sou carnal, vendido sob o pecado."},{verse:15,en:"For that which I do I allow not: for what I would, that do I not; but what I hate, that do I.",pt:"Pois o que fa\xe7o, n\xe3o o entendo; porque o que quero, isso n\xe3o pratico; mas o que aborre\xe7o, isso fa\xe7o."},{verse:16,en:"If then I do that which I would not, I consent unto the law that it is good.",pt:"E, se fa\xe7o o que n\xe3o quero, consinto com a lei, que \xe9 boa."},{verse:17,en:"Now then it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me.",pt:"Agora, por\xe9m, n\xe3o sou mais eu que fa\xe7o isto, mas o pecado que habita em mim."},{verse:18,en:"For I know that in me (that is, in my flesh,) dwelleth no good thing: for to will is present with me; but how to perform that which is good I find not.",pt:"Porque eu sei que em mim, isto \xe9, na minha carne, n\xe3o habita bem algum; com efeito o querer o bem est\xe1 em mim, mas o efetu\xe1-lo n\xe3o est\xe1."},{verse:19,en:"For the good that I would I do not: but the evil which I would not, that I do.",pt:"Pois n\xe3o fa\xe7o o bem que quero, mas o mal que n\xe3o quero, esse pratico."},{verse:20,en:"Now if I do that I would not, it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me.",pt:"Ora, se eu fa\xe7o o que n\xe3o quero, j\xe1 o n\xe3o fa\xe7o eu, mas o pecado que habita em mim."},{verse:21,en:"I find then a law, that, when I would do good, evil is present with me.",pt:"Acho ent\xe3o esta lei em mim, que, mesmo querendo eu fazer o bem, o mal est\xe1 comigo."},{verse:22,en:"For I delight in the law of God after the inward man:",pt:"Porque, segundo o homem interior, tenho prazer na lei de Deus;"},{verse:23,en:"But I see another law in my members, warring against the law of my mind, and bringing me into captivity to the law of sin which is in my members.",pt:"mas vejo nos meus membros outra lei guerreando contra a lei do meu entendimento, e me levando cativo \xe0 lei do pecado, que est\xe1 nos meus membros."},{verse:24,en:"O wretched man that I am! who shall deliver me from the body of this death?",pt:"Miser\xe1vel homem que eu sou! quem me livrar\xe1 do corpo desta morte?"},{verse:25,en:"I thank God through Jesus Christ our Lord. So then with the mind I myself serve the law of God; but with the flesh the law of sin.",pt:"Gra\xe7as a Deus, por Jesus Cristo nosso Senhor! De modo que eu mesmo com o entendimento sirvo \xe0 lei de Deus, mas com a carne \xe0 lei do pecado."}]}}),722,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"There is therefore now no condemnation to them which are in Christ Jesus, who walk not after the flesh, but after the Spirit.",pt:"Portanto, agora nenhuma condena\xe7\xe3o h\xe1 para os que est\xe3o em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:2,en:"For the law of the Spirit of life in Christ Jesus hath made me free from the law of sin and death.",pt:"Porque a lei do Esp\xedrito da vida, em Cristo Jesus, te livrou da lei do pecado e da morte."},{verse:3,en:"For what the law could not do, in that it was weak through the flesh, God sending his own Son in the likeness of sinful flesh, and for sin, condemned sin in the flesh:",pt:"Porquanto o que era imposs\xedvel \xe0 lei, visto que se achava fraca pela carne, Deus enviando o seu pr\xf3prio Filho em semelhan\xe7a da carne do pecado, e por causa do pecado, na carne condenou o pecado."},{verse:4,en:"That the righteousness of the law might be fulfilled in us, who walk not after the flesh, but after the Spirit.",pt:"para que a justa exig\xeancia da lei se cumprisse em n\xf3s, que n\xe3o andamos segundo a carne, mas segundo o Esp\xedrito."},{verse:5,en:"For they that are after the flesh do mind the things of the flesh; but they that are after the Spirit the things of the Spirit.",pt:"Pois os que s\xe3o segundo a carne inclinam-se para as coisas da carne; mas os que s\xe3o segundo o Esp\xedrito para as coisas do Esp\xedrito."},{verse:6,en:"For to be carnally minded is death; but to be spiritually minded is life and peace.",pt:"Porque a inclina\xe7\xe3o da carne \xe9 morte; mas a inclina\xe7\xe3o do Esp\xedrito \xe9 vida e paz."},{verse:7,en:"Because the carnal mind is enmity against God: for it is not subject to the law of God, neither indeed can be.",pt:"Porquanto a inclina\xe7\xe3o da carne \xe9 inimizade contra Deus, pois n\xe3o \xe9 sujeita \xe0 lei de Deus, nem em verdade o pode ser;"},{verse:8,en:"So then they that are in the flesh cannot please God.",pt:"e os que est\xe3o na carne n\xe3o podem agradar a Deus."},{verse:9,en:"But ye are not in the flesh, but in the Spirit, if so be that the Spirit of God dwell in you. Now if any man have not the Spirit of Christ, he is none of his.",pt:"V\xf3s, por\xe9m, n\xe3o estais na carne, mas no Esp\xedrito, se \xe9 que o Esp\xedrito de Deus habita em v\xf3s. Mas, se algu\xe9m n\xe3o tem o Esp\xedrito de Cristo, esse tal n\xe3o \xe9 dele."},{verse:10,en:"And if Christ be in you, the body is dead because of sin; but the Spirit is life because of righteousness.",pt:"Ora, se Cristo est\xe1 em v\xf3s, o corpo, na verdade, est\xe1 morto por causa do pecado, mas o esp\xedrito vive por causa da justi\xe7a."},{verse:11,en:"But if the Spirit of him that raised up Jesus from the dead dwell in you, he that raised up Christ from the dead shall also quicken your mortal bodies by his Spirit that dwelleth in you.",pt:"E, se o Esp\xedrito daquele que dos mortos ressuscitou a Jesus habita em v\xf3s, aquele que dos mortos ressuscitou a Cristo Jesus h\xe1 de vivificar tamb\xe9m os vossos corpos mortais, pelo seu Esp\xedrito que em v\xf3s habita."},{verse:12,en:"Therefore, brethren, we are debtors, not to the flesh, to live after the flesh.",pt:"Portanto, irm\xe3os, somos devedores, n\xe3o \xe0 carne para vivermos segundo a carne;"},{verse:13,en:"For if ye live after the flesh, ye shall die: but if ye through the Spirit do mortify the deeds of the body, ye shall live.",pt:"porque se viverdes segundo a carne, haveis de morrer; mas, se pelo Esp\xedrito mortificardes as obras do corpo, vivereis."},{verse:14,en:"For as many as are led by the Spirit of God, they are the sons of God.",pt:"Pois todos os que s\xe3o guiados pelo Esp\xedrito de Deus, esses s\xe3o filhos de Deus."},{verse:15,en:"For ye have not received the spirit of bondage again to fear; but ye have received the Spirit of adoption, whereby we cry, Abba, Father.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o recebestes o esp\xedrito de escravid\xe3o, para outra vez estardes com temor, mas recebestes o esp\xedrito de ado\xe7\xe3o, pelo qual clamamos: Aba, Pai!"},{verse:16,en:"The Spirit itself beareth witness with our spirit, that we are the children of God:",pt:"O Esp\xedrito mesmo testifica com o nosso esp\xedrito que somos filhos de Deus;"},{verse:17,en:"And if children, then heirs; heirs of God, and joint-heirs with Christ; if so be that we suffer with him, that we may be also glorified together.",pt:"e, se filhos, tamb\xe9m herdeiros, herdeiros de Deus e co-herdeiros de Cristo; se \xe9 certo que com ele padecemos, para que tamb\xe9m com ele sejamos glorificados."},{verse:18,en:"For I reckon that the sufferings of this present time are not worthy to be compared with the glory which shall be revealed in us.",pt:"Pois tenho para mim que as afli\xe7\xf5es deste tempo presente n\xe3o se podem comparar com a gl\xf3ria que em n\xf3s h\xe1 de ser revelada."},{verse:19,en:"For the earnest expectation of the creature waiteth for the manifestation of the sons of God.",pt:"Porque a cria\xe7\xe3o aguarda com ardente expectativa a revela\xe7\xe3o dos filhos de Deus."},{verse:20,en:"For the creature was made subject to vanity, not willingly, but by reason of him who hath subjected the same in hope,",pt:"Porquanto a cria\xe7\xe3o ficou sujeita \xe0 vaidade, n\xe3o por sua vontade, mas por causa daquele que a sujeitou,"},{verse:21,en:"Because the creature itself also shall be delivered from the bondage of corruption into the glorious liberty of the children of God.",pt:"na esperan\xe7a de que tamb\xe9m a pr\xf3pria cria\xe7\xe3o h\xe1 de ser liberta do cativeiro da corrup\xe7\xe3o, para a liberdade da gl\xf3ria dos filhos de Deus."},{verse:22,en:"For we know that the whole creation groaneth and travaileth in pain together until now.",pt:"Porque sabemos que toda a cria\xe7\xe3o, conjuntamente, geme e est\xe1 com dores de parto at\xe9 agora;"},{verse:23,en:"And not only they, but ourselves also, which have the firstfruits of the Spirit, even we ourselves groan within ourselves, waiting for the adoption, to wit, the redemption of our body.",pt:"e n\xe3o s\xf3 ela, mas at\xe9 n\xf3s, que temos as prim\xedcias do Esp\xedrito, tamb\xe9m gememos em n\xf3s mesmos, aguardando a nossa adora\xe7\xe3o, a saber, a reden\xe7\xe3o do nosso corpo."},{verse:24,en:"For we are saved by hope: but hope that is seen is not hope: for what a man seeth, why doth he yet hope for?",pt:"Porque na esperan\xe7a fomos salvos. Ora, a esperan\xe7a que se v\xea n\xe3o \xe9 esperan\xe7a; pois o que algu\xe9m v\xea, como o espera?"},{verse:25,en:"But if we hope for that we see not, then do we with patience wait for it.",pt:"Mas, se esperamos o que n\xe3o vemos, com paci\xeancia o aguardamos."},{verse:26,en:"Likewise the Spirit also helpeth our infirmities: for we know not what we should pray for as we ought: but the Spirit itself maketh intercession for us with groanings which cannot be uttered.",pt:"Do mesmo modo tamb\xe9m o Esp\xedrito nos ajuda na fraqueza; porque n\xe3o sabemos o que havemos de pedir como conv\xe9m, mas o Esp\xedrito mesmo intercede por n\xf3s com gemidos inexprim\xedveis."},{verse:27,en:"And he that searcheth the hearts knoweth what is the mind of the Spirit, because he maketh intercession for the saints according to the will of God.",pt:"E aquele que esquadrinha os cora\xe7\xf5es sabe qual \xe9 a inten\xe7\xe3o do Esp\xedrito: que ele, segundo a vontade de Deus, intercede pelos santos."},{verse:28,en:"And we know that all things work together for good to them that love God, to them who are the called according to his purpose.",pt:"E sabemos que todas as coisas concorrem para o bem daqueles que amam a Deus, daqueles que s\xe3o chamados segundo o seu prop\xf3sito."},{verse:29,en:"For whom he did foreknow, he also did predestinate to be conformed to the image of his Son, that he might be the firstborn among many brethren.",pt:"Porque os que dantes conheceu, tamb\xe9m os predestinou para serem conformes \xe0 imagem de seu Filho, a fim de que ele seja o primog\xeanito entre muitos irm\xe3os;"},{verse:30,en:"Moreover whom he did predestinate, them he also called: and whom he called, them he also justified: and whom he justified, them he also glorified.",pt:"e aos que predestinou, a estes tamb\xe9m chamou; e aos que chamou, a estes tamb\xe9m justificou; e aos que justificou, a estes tamb\xe9m glorificou."},{verse:31,en:"What shall we then say to these things? If God be for us, who can be against us?",pt:"Que diremos, pois, a estas coisas? Se Deus \xe9 por n\xf3s, quem ser\xe1 contra n\xf3s?"},{verse:32,en:"He that spared not his own Son, but delivered him up for us all, how shall he not with him also freely give us all things?",pt:"Aquele que nem mesmo a seu pr\xf3prio Filho poupou, antes o entregou por todos n\xf3s, como n\xe3o nos dar\xe1 tamb\xe9m com ele todas as coisas?"},{verse:33,en:"Who shall lay any thing to the charge of God\u2019s elect? It is God that justifieth.",pt:"Quem intentar\xe1 acusa\xe7\xe3o contra os escolhidos de Deus? \xc9 Deus quem os justifica;"},{verse:34,en:"Who is he that condemneth? It is Christ that died, yea rather, that is risen again, who is even at the right hand of God, who also maketh intercession for us.",pt:"Quem os condenar\xe1? Cristo Jesus \xe9 quem morreu, ou antes quem ressurgiu dentre os mortos, o qual est\xe1 \xe0 direita de Deus, e tamb\xe9m intercede por n\xf3s;"},{verse:35,en:"Who shall separate us from the love of Christ? shall tribulation, or distress, or persecution, or famine, or nakedness, or peril, or sword?",pt:"quem nos separar\xe1 do amor de Cristo? a tribula\xe7\xe3o, ou a ang\xfastia, ou a persegui\xe7\xe3o, ou a fome, ou a nudez, ou o perigo, ou a espada?"},{verse:36,en:"As it is written, For thy sake we are killed all the day long; we are accounted as sheep for the slaughter.",pt:"Como est\xe1 escrito: Por amor de ti somos entregues \xe0 morte o dia todo; fomos considerados como ovelhas para o matadouro."},{verse:37,en:"Nay, in all these things we are more than conquerors through him that loved us.",pt:"Mas em todas estas coisas somos mais que vencedores, por aquele que nos amou."},{verse:38,en:"For I am persuaded, that neither death, nor life, nor angels, nor principalities, nor powers, nor things present, nor things to come,",pt:"Porque estou certo de que, nem a morte, nem a vida, nem anjos, nem principados, nem coisas presentes, nem futuras, nem potestades,"},{verse:39,en:"Nor height, nor depth, nor any other creature, shall be able to separate us from the love of God, which is in Christ Jesus our Lord.",pt:"nem a altura, nem a profundidade, nem qualquer outra criatura nos poder\xe1 separar do amor de Deus, que est\xe1 em Cristo Jesus nosso Senhor."}]}}),723,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I say the truth in Christ, I lie not, my conscience also bearing me witness in the Holy Ghost,",pt:"Digo a verdade em Cristo, n\xe3o minto, dando testemunho comigo a minha consci\xeancia no Esp\xedrito Santo,"},{verse:2,en:"That I have great heaviness and continual sorrow in my heart.",pt:"que tenho grande tristeza e incessante dor no meu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"For I could wish that myself were accursed from Christ for my brethren, my kinsmen according to the flesh:",pt:"Porque eu mesmo desejaria ser separado de Cristo, por amor de meus irm\xe3os, que s\xe3o meus parentes segundo a carne;"},{verse:4,en:"Who are Israelites; to whom pertaineth the adoption, and the glory, and the covenants, and the giving of the law, and the service of God, and the promises;",pt:"os quais s\xe3o israelitas, de quem \xe9 a ado\xe7\xe3o, e a gl\xf3ria, e os pactos, e a promulga\xe7\xe3o da lei, e o culto, e as promessas;"},{verse:5,en:"Whose are the fathers, and of whom as concerning the flesh Christ came, who is over all, God blessed for ever. Amen.",pt:"de quem s\xe3o os patriarcas; e de quem descende o Cristo segundo a carne, o qual \xe9 sobre todas as coisas, Deus bendito eternamente. Am\xe9m."},{verse:6,en:"Not as though the word of God hath taken none effect. For they are not all Israel, which are of Israel:",pt:"N\xe3o que a palavra de Deus haja falhado. Porque nem todos os que s\xe3o de Israel s\xe3o israelitas;"},{verse:7,en:"Neither, because they are the seed of Abraham, are they all children: but, In Isaac shall thy seed be called.",pt:"nem por serem descend\xeancia de Abra\xe3o s\xe3o todos filhos; mas: Em Isaque ser\xe1 chamada a tua descend\xeancia."},{verse:8,en:"That is, They which are the children of the flesh, these are not the children of God: but the children of the promise are counted for the seed.",pt:"Isto \xe9, n\xe3o s\xe3o os filhos da carne que s\xe3o filhos de Deus; mas os filhos da promessa s\xe3o contados como descend\xeancia."},{verse:9,en:"For this is the word of promise, At this time will I come, and Sarah shall have a son.",pt:"Porque a palavra da promessa \xe9 esta: Por este tempo virei, e Sara ter\xe1 um filho."},{verse:10,en:"And not only this; but when Rebecca also had conceived by one, even by our father Isaac;",pt:"E n\xe3o somente isso, mas tamb\xe9m a Rebeca, que havia concebido de um, de Isaque, nosso pai"},{verse:11,en:"(For the children being not yet born, neither having done any good or evil, that the purpose of God according to election might stand, not of works, but of him that calleth;)",pt:"(pois n\xe3o tendo os g\xeameos ainda nascido, nem tendo praticado bem ou mal, para que o prop\xf3sito de Deus segundo a elei\xe7\xe3o permanecesse firme, n\xe3o por causa das obras, mas por aquele que chama),"},{verse:12,en:"It was said unto her, The elder shall serve the younger.",pt:"foi-lhe dito: O maior servir\xe1 o menor."},{verse:13,en:"As it is written, Jacob have I loved, but Esau have I hated.",pt:"Como est\xe1 escrito: Amei a Jac\xf3, e aborreci a Esa\xfa."},{verse:14,en:"What shall we say then? Is there unrighteousness with God? God forbid.",pt:"Que diremos, pois? H\xe1 injusti\xe7a da parte de Deus? De modo nenhum."},{verse:15,en:"For he saith to Moses, I will have mercy on whom I will have mercy, and I will have compassion on whom I will have compassion.",pt:"Porque diz a Mois\xe9s: Terei miseric\xf3rdia de quem me aprouver ter misericordia, e terei compaix\xe3o de quem me aprouver ter compaix\xe3o."},{verse:16,en:"So then it is not of him that willeth, nor of him that runneth, but of God that sheweth mercy.",pt:"Assim, pois, isto n\xe3o depende do que quer, nem do que corre, mas de Deus que usa de miseric\xf3rdia."},{verse:17,en:"For the scripture saith unto Pharaoh, Even for this same purpose have I raised thee up, that I might shew my power in thee, and that my name might be declared throughout all the earth.",pt:"Pois diz a Escritura a Fara\xf3: Para isto mesmo te levantei: para em ti mostrar o meu poder, e para que seja anunciado o meu nome em toda a terra."},{verse:18,en:"Therefore hath he mercy on whom he will have mercy, and whom he will he hardeneth.",pt:"Portanto, tem miseric\xf3rdia de quem quer, e a quem quer endurece."},{verse:19,en:"Thou wilt say then unto me, Why doth he yet find fault? For who hath resisted his will?",pt:"Dir-me-\xe1s ent\xe3o. Por que se queixa ele ainda? Pois, quem resiste \xe0 sua vontade?"},{verse:20,en:"Nay but, O man, who art thou that repliest against God? Shall the thing formed say to him that formed it, Why hast thou made me thus?",pt:"Mas, \xf3 homem, quem \xe9s tu, que a Deus replicas? Porventura a coisa formada dir\xe1 ao que a formou: Por que me fizeste assim?"},{verse:21,en:"Hath not the potter power over the clay, of the same lump to make one vessel unto honour, and another unto dishonour?",pt:"Ou n\xe3o tem o oleiro poder sobre o barro, para da mesma massa fazer um vaso para uso honroso e outro para uso desonroso?"},{verse:22,en:"What if God, willing to shew his wrath, and to make his power known, endured with much longsuffering the vessels of wrath fitted to destruction:",pt:"E que direis, se Deus, querendo mostrar a sua ira, e dar a conhecer o seu poder, suportou com muita paci\xeancia os vasos da ira, preparados para a perdi\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:23,en:"And that he might make known the riches of his glory on the vessels of mercy, which he had afore prepared unto glory,",pt:"para que tamb\xe9m desse a conhecer as riquezas da sua gl\xf3ria nos vasos de miseric\xf3rdia, que de antem\xe3o preparou para a gl\xf3ria,"},{verse:24,en:"Even us, whom he hath called, not of the Jews only, but also of the Gentiles?",pt:"os quais somos n\xf3s, a quem tamb\xe9m chamou, n\xe3o s\xf3 dentre os judeus, mas tamb\xe9m dentre os gentios?"},{verse:25,en:"As he saith also in Osee, I will call them my people, which were not my people; and her beloved, which was not beloved.",pt:"Como diz ele tamb\xe9m em Os\xe9ias: Chamarei meu povo ao que n\xe3o era meu povo; e amada \xe0 que n\xe3o era amada."},{verse:26,en:"And it shall come to pass, that in the place where it was said unto them, Ye are not my people; there shall they be called the children of the living God.",pt:"E suceder\xe1 que no lugar em que lhes foi dito: V\xf3s n\xe3o sois meu povo; a\xed ser\xe3o chamados filhos do Deus vivo."},{verse:27,en:"Esaias also crieth concerning Israel, Though the number of the children of Israel be as the sand of the sea, a remnant shall be saved:",pt:"Tamb\xe9m Isa\xedas exclama acerca de Israel: Ainda que o n\xfamero dos filhos de Israel seja como a areia do mar, o remanescente \xe9 que ser\xe1 salvo."},{verse:28,en:"For he will finish the work, and cut it short in righteousness: because a short work will the Lord make upon the earth.",pt:"Porque o Senhor executar\xe1 a sua palavra sobre a terra, consumando-a e abreviando-a."},{verse:29,en:"And as Esaias said before, Except the Lord of Sabaoth had left us a seed, we had been as Sodoma, and been made like unto Gomorrha.",pt:"E como antes dissera Isa\xedas: Se o Senhor dos Ex\xe9rcitos n\xe3o nos tivesse deixado descend\xeancia, ter\xedamos sido feitos como Sodoma, e ser\xedamos semelhantes a Gomorra."},{verse:30,en:"What shall we say then? That the Gentiles, which followed not after righteousness, have attained to righteousness, even the righteousness which is of faith.",pt:"Que diremos pois? Que os gentios, que n\xe3o buscavam a justi\xe7a, alcan\xe7aram a justi\xe7a, mas a justi\xe7a que vem da f\xe9."},{verse:31,en:"But Israel, which followed after the law of righteousness, hath not attained to the law of righteousness.",pt:"Mas Israel, buscando a lei da justi\xe7a, n\xe3o atingiu esta lei."},{verse:32,en:"Wherefore? Because they sought it not by faith, but as it were by the works of the law. For they stumbled at that stumblingstone;",pt:"Por que? Porque n\xe3o a buscavam pela f\xe9, mas como que pelas obras; e trope\xe7aram na pedra de trope\xe7o;"},{verse:33,en:"As it is written, Behold, I lay in Sion a stumblingstone and rock of offence: and whosoever believeth on him shall not be ashamed.",pt:"como est\xe1 escrito: Eis que eu ponho em Si\xe3o uma pedra de trope\xe7o; e uma rocha de esc\xe2ndalo; e quem nela crer n\xe3o ser\xe1 confundido."}]}}),724,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Brethren, my heart\u2019s desire and prayer to God for Israel is, that they might be saved.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, o bom desejo do meu cora\xe7\xe3o e a minha s\xfaplica a Deus por Israel \xe9 para sua salva\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"For I bear them record that they have a zeal of God, but not according to knowledge.",pt:"Porque lhes dou testemunho de que t\xeam zelo por Deus, mas n\xe3o com entendimento."},{verse:3,en:"For they being ignorant of God\u2019s righteousness, and going about to establish their own righteousness, have not submitted themselves unto the righteousness of God.",pt:"Porquanto, n\xe3o conhecendo a justi\xe7a de Deus, e procurando estabelecer a sua pr\xf3pria, n\xe3o se sujeitaram \xe0 justi\xe7a de Deus."},{verse:4,en:"For Christ is the end of the law for righteousness to every one that believeth.",pt:"Pois Cristo \xe9 o fim da lei para justificar a todo aquele que cr\xea."},{verse:5,en:"For Moses describeth the righteousness which is of the law, That the man which doeth those things shall live by them.",pt:"Porque Mois\xe9s escreve que o homem que pratica a justi\xe7a que vem da lei viver\xe1 por ela."},{verse:6,en:"But the righteousness which is of faith speaketh on this wise, Say not in thine heart, Who shall ascend into heaven? (that is, to bring Christ down from above:)",pt:"Mas a justi\xe7a que vem da f\xe9 diz assim: N\xe3o digas em teu cora\xe7\xe3o: Quem subir\xe1 ao c\xe9u? (isto \xe9, a trazer do alto a Cristo;)"},{verse:7,en:"Or, Who shall descend into the deep? (that is, to bring up Christ again from the dead.)",pt:"ou: Quem descer\xe1 ao abismo? (isto \xe9, a fazer subir a Cristo dentre os mortos)."},{verse:8,en:"But what saith it? The word is nigh thee, even in thy mouth, and in thy heart: that is, the word of faith, which we preach;",pt:"Mas que diz? A palavra est\xe1 perto de ti, na tua boca e no teu cora\xe7\xe3o; isto \xe9, a palavra da f\xe9, que pregamos."},{verse:9,en:"That if thou shalt confess with thy mouth the Lord Jesus, and shalt believe in thine heart that God hath raised him from the dead, thou shalt be saved.",pt:"Porque, se com a tua boca confessares a Jesus como Senhor, e em teu cora\xe7\xe3o creres que Deus o ressuscitou dentre os mortos, ser\xe1 salvo;"},{verse:10,en:"For with the heart man believeth unto righteousness; and with the mouth confession is made unto salvation.",pt:"pois \xe9 com o cora\xe7\xe3o que se cr\xea para a justi\xe7a, e com a boca se faz confiss\xe3o para a salva\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"For the scripture saith, Whosoever believeth on him shall not be ashamed.",pt:"Porque a Escritura diz: Ningu\xe9m que nele cr\xea ser\xe1 confundido."},{verse:12,en:"For there is no difference between the Jew and the Greek: for the same Lord over all is rich unto all that call upon him.",pt:"Porquanto n\xe3o h\xe1 distin\xe7\xe3o entre judeu e grego; porque o mesmo Senhor o \xe9 de todos, rico para com todos os que o invocam."},{verse:13,en:"For whosoever shall call upon the name of the Lord shall be saved.",pt:"Porque: Todo aquele que invocar o nome do Senhor ser\xe1 salvo."},{verse:14,en:"How then shall they call on him in whom they have not believed? and how shall they believe in him of whom they have not heard? and how shall they hear without a preacher?",pt:"Como pois invocar\xe3o aquele em quem n\xe3o creram? e como crer\xe3o naquele de quem n\xe3o ouviram falar? e como ouvir\xe3o, se n\xe3o h\xe1 quem pregue?"},{verse:15,en:"And how shall they preach, except they be sent? as it is written, How beautiful are the feet of them that preach the gospel of peace, and bring glad tidings of good things!",pt:"E como pregar\xe3o, se n\xe3o forem enviados? assim como est\xe1 escrito: Qu\xe3o formosos os p\xe9s dos que anunciam coisas boas!"},{verse:16,en:"But they have not all obeyed the gospel. For Esaias saith, Lord, who hath believed our report?",pt:"Mas nem todos deram ouvidos ao evangelho; pois Isa\xedas diz: Senhor, quem deu cr\xe9dito \xe0 nossa mensagem?"},{verse:17,en:"So then faith cometh by hearing, and hearing by the word of God.",pt:"Logo a f\xe9 \xe9 pelo ouvir, e o ouvir pela palavra de Cristo."},{verse:18,en:"But I say, Have they not heard? Yes verily, their sound went into all the earth, and their words unto the ends of the world.",pt:"Mas pergunto: Porventura n\xe3o ouviram? Sim, por certo: Por toda a terra saiu a voz deles, e as suas palavras at\xe9 os confins do mundo."},{verse:19,en:"But I say, Did not Israel know? First Moses saith, I will provoke you to jealousy by them that are no people, and by a foolish nation I will anger you.",pt:"Mas pergunto ainda: Porventura Israel n\xe3o o soube? Primeiro diz Mois\xe9s: Eu vos porei em ci\xfames com aqueles que n\xe3o s\xe3o povo, com um povo insensato vos provocarei \xe0 ira."},{verse:20,en:"But Esaias is very bold, and saith, I was found of them that sought me not; I was made manifest unto them that asked not after me.",pt:"E Isa\xedas ousou dizer: Fui achado pelos que n\xe3o me buscavam, manifestei-me aos que por mim n\xe3o perguntavam."},{verse:21,en:"But to Israel he saith, All day long I have stretched forth my hands unto a disobedient and gainsaying people.",pt:"Quanto a Israel, por\xe9m, diz: Todo o dia estendi as minhas m\xe3os a um povo rebelde e contradizente."}]}}),725,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I say then, Hath God cast away his people? God forbid. For I also am an Israelite, of the seed of Abraham, of the tribe of Benjamin.",pt:"Pergunto, pois: Acaso rejeitou Deus ao seu povo? De modo nenhum; por que eu tamb\xe9m sou israelita, da descend\xeancia de Abra\xe3o, da tribo de Benjamim."},{verse:2,en:"God hath not cast away his people which he foreknew. Wot ye not what the scripture saith of Elias? how he maketh intercession to God against Israel, saying,",pt:"Deus n\xe3o rejeitou ao seu povo que antes conheceu. Ou n\xe3o sabeis o que a Escritura diz de Elias, como ele fala a Deus contra Israel, dizendo:"},{verse:3,en:"Lord, they have killed thy prophets, and digged down thine altars; and I am left alone, and they seek my life.",pt:"Senhor, mataram os teus profetas, e derribaram os teus altares; e s\xf3 eu fiquei, e procuraram tirar-me a vida?"},{verse:4,en:"But what saith the answer of God unto him? I have reserved to myself seven thousand men, who have not bowed the knee to the image of Baal.",pt:"Mas que lhe diz a resposta divina? Reservei para mim sete mil var\xf5es que n\xe3o dobraram os joelhos diante de Baal."},{verse:5,en:"Even so then at this present time also there is a remnant according to the election of grace.",pt:"Assim, pois, tamb\xe9m no tempo presente ficou um remanescente segundo a elei\xe7\xe3o da gra\xe7a."},{verse:6,en:"And if by grace, then is it no more of works: otherwise grace is no more grace. But if it be of works, then is it no more grace: otherwise work is no more work.",pt:"Mas se \xe9 pela gra\xe7a, j\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9 pelas obras; de outra maneira, a gra\xe7a j\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9 gra\xe7a."},{verse:7,en:"What then? Israel hath not obtained that which he seeketh for; but the election hath obtained it, and the rest were blinded",pt:"Pois qu\xea? O que Israel busca, isso n\xe3o o alcan\xe7ou; mas os eleitos alcan\xe7aram; e os outros foram endurecidos,"},{verse:8,en:"(According as it is written, God hath given them the spirit of slumber, eyes that they should not see, and ears that they should not hear;) unto this day.",pt:"como est\xe1 escrito: Deus lhes deu um esp\xedrito entorpecido, olhos para n\xe3o verem, e ouvidos para n\xe3o ouvirem, at\xe9 o dia de hoje."},{verse:9,en:"And David saith, Let their table be made a snare, and a trap, and a stumblingblock, and a recompence unto them:",pt:"E Davi diz: Torne-se-lhes a sua mesa em la\xe7o, e em armadilha, e em trope\xe7o, e em retribui\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:10,en:"Let their eyes be darkened, that they may not see, and bow down their back alway.",pt:"escure\xe7am-se-lhes os olhos para n\xe3o verem, e tu encurva-lhes sempre as costas."},{verse:11,en:"I say then, Have they stumbled that they should fall? God forbid: but rather through their fall salvation is come unto the Gentiles, for to provoke them to jealousy.",pt:"Logo, pergunto: Porventura trope\xe7aram de modo que ca\xedssem? De maneira nenhuma, antes pelo seu trope\xe7o veio a salva\xe7\xe3o aos gentios, para os incitar \xe0 emula\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"Now if the fall of them be the riches of the world, and the diminishing of them the riches of the Gentiles; how much more their fulness?",pt:"Ora se o trope\xe7o deles \xe9 a riqueza do mundo, e a sua diminui\xe7\xe3o a riqueza dos gentios, quanto mais a sua plenitude!"},{verse:13,en:"For I speak to you Gentiles, inasmuch as I am the apostle of the Gentiles, I magnify mine office:",pt:"Mas \xe9 a v\xf3s, gentios, que falo; e, porquanto sou ap\xf3stolo dos gentios, glorifico o meu minist\xe9rio,"},{verse:14,en:"If by any means I may provoke to emulation them which are my flesh, and might save some of them.",pt:"para ver se de algum modo posso incitar \xe0 emula\xe7\xe3o os da minha ra\xe7a e salvar alguns deles."},{verse:15,en:"For if the casting away of them be the reconciling of the world, what shall the receiving of them be, but life from the dead?",pt:"Porque, se a sua rejei\xe7\xe3o \xe9 a reconcilia\xe7\xe3o do mundo, qual ser\xe1 a sua admiss\xe3o, sen\xe3o a vida dentre os mortos?"},{verse:16,en:"For if the firstfruit be holy, the lump is also holy: and if the root be holy, so are the branches.",pt:"Se as prim\xedcias s\xe3o santas, tamb\xe9m a massa o \xe9; e se a raiz \xe9 santa, tamb\xe9m os ramos o s\xe3o."},{verse:17,en:"And if some of the branches be broken off, and thou, being a wild olive tree, wert graffed in among them, and with them partakest of the root and fatness of the olive tree;",pt:"E se alguns dos ramos foram quebrados, e tu, sendo zambujeiro, foste enxertado no lugar deles e feito participante da raiz e da seiva da oliveira,"},{verse:18,en:"Boast not against the branches. But if thou boast, thou bearest not the root, but the root thee.",pt:"n\xe3o te glories contra os ramos; e, se contra eles te gloriares, n\xe3o \xe9s tu que sustentas a raiz, mas a raiz a ti."},{verse:19,en:"Thou wilt say then, The branches were broken off, that I might be graffed in.",pt:"Dir\xe1s ent\xe3o: Os ramos foram quebrados, para que eu fosse enxertado."},{verse:20,en:"Well; because of unbelief they were broken off, and thou standest by faith. Be not highminded, but fear:",pt:"Est\xe1 bem; pela sua incredulidade foram quebrados, e tu pela tua f\xe9 est\xe1s firme. N\xe3o te ensoberbe\xe7as, mas teme;"},{verse:21,en:"For if God spared not the natural branches, take heed lest he also spare not thee.",pt:"porque, se Deus n\xe3o poupou os ramos naturais, n\xe3o te poupar\xe1 a ti."},{verse:22,en:"Behold therefore the goodness and severity of God: on them which fell, severity; but toward thee, goodness, if thou continue in his goodness: otherwise thou also shalt be cut off.",pt:"Considera pois a bondade e a severidade de Deus: para com os que ca\xedram, severidade; para contigo, a bondade de Deus, se permaneceres nessa bondade; do contr\xe1rio tamb\xe9m tu ser\xe1s cortado."},{verse:23,en:"And they also, if they abide not still in unbelief, shall be graffed in: for God is able to graff them in again.",pt:"E ainda eles, se n\xe3o permanecerem na incredulidade, ser\xe3o enxertados; porque poderoso \xe9 Deus para os enxertar novamente."},{verse:24,en:"For if thou wert cut out of the olive tree which is wild by nature, and wert graffed contrary to nature into a good olive tree: how much more shall these, which be the natural branches, be graffed into their own olive tree?",pt:"Pois se tu foste cortado do natural zambujeiro, e contra a natureza enxertado em oliveira leg\xedtima, quanto mais n\xe3o ser\xe3o enxertados na sua pr\xf3pria oliveira esses que s\xe3o ramos naturais!"},{verse:25,en:"For I would not, brethren, that ye should be ignorant of this mystery, lest ye should be wise in your own conceits; that blindness in part is happened to Israel, until the fulness of the Gentiles be come in.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o quero, irm\xe3os, que ignoreis este mist\xe9rio (para que n\xe3o presumais de v\xf3s mesmos): que o endurecimento veio em parte sobre Israel, at\xe9 que a plenitude dos gentios haja entrado;"},{verse:26,en:"And so all Israel shall be saved: as it is written, There shall come out of Sion the Deliverer, and shall turn away ungodliness from Jacob:",pt:"e assim todo o Israel ser\xe1 salvo, como est\xe1 escrito: Vir\xe1 de Si\xe3o o Libertador, e desviar\xe1 de Jac\xf3 as impiedades;"},{verse:27,en:"For this is my covenant unto them, when I shall take away their sins.",pt:"e este ser\xe1 o meu pacto com eles, quando eu tirar os seus pecados."},{verse:28,en:"As concerning the gospel, they are enemies for your sakes: but as touching the election, they are beloved for the fathers\u2019 sakes.",pt:"Quanto ao evangelho, eles na verdade, s\xe3o inimigos por causa de v\xf3s; mas, quanto \xe0 elei\xe7\xe3o, amados por causa dos pais."},{verse:29,en:"For the gifts and calling of God are without repentance.",pt:"Porque os dons e a voca\xe7\xe3o de Deus s\xe3o irretrat\xe1veis."},{verse:30,en:"For as ye in times past have not believed God, yet have now obtained mercy through their unbelief:",pt:"Pois, assim como v\xf3s outrora fostes desobedientes a Deus, mas agora alcan\xe7astes miseric\xf3rdia pela desobedi\xeancia deles,"},{verse:31,en:"Even so have these also now not believed, that through your mercy they also may obtain mercy.",pt:"assim tamb\xe9m estes agora foram desobedientes, para tamb\xe9m alcan\xe7arem miseric\xf3rdia pela miseric\xf3rdia a v\xf3s demonstrada."},{verse:32,en:"For God hath concluded them all in unbelief, that he might have mercy upon all.",pt:"Porque Deus encerrou a todos debaixo da desobedi\xeancia, a fim de usar de miseric\xf3rdia para com todos."},{verse:33,en:"O the depth of the riches both of the wisdom and knowledge of God! how unsearchable are his judgments, and his ways past finding out!",pt:"\xd3 profundidade das riquezas, tanto da sabedoria, como da ci\xeancia de Deus! Qu\xe3o insond\xe1veis s\xe3o os seus ju\xedzos, e qu\xe3o inescrut\xe1veis os seus caminhos!"},{verse:34,en:"For who hath known the mind of the Lord? or who hath been his counsellor?",pt:"Pois, quem jamais conheceu a mente do Senhor? ou quem se fez seu conselheiro?"},{verse:35,en:"Or who hath first given to him, and it shall be recompensed unto him again?",pt:"Ou quem lhe deu primeiro a ele, para que lhe seja recompensado?"},{verse:36,en:"For of him, and through him, and to him, are all things: to whom be glory for ever. Amen.",pt:"Porque dele, e por ele, e para ele, s\xe3o todas as coisas; gl\xf3ria, pois, a ele eternamente. Am\xe9m."}]}}),726,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,i,t,n){i.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I beseech you therefore, brethren, by the mercies of God, that ye present your bodies a living sacrifice, holy, acceptable unto God, which is your reasonable service.",pt:"Rogo-vos pois, irm\xe3os, pela compaix\xe3o de Deus, que apresenteis os vossos corpos como um sacrif\xedcio vivo, santo e agrad\xe1vel a Deus, que \xe9 o vosso culto racional."},{verse:2,en:"And be not conformed to this world: but be ye transformed by the renewing of your mind, that ye may prove what is that good, and acceptable, and perfect, will of God.",pt:"E n\xe3o vos conformeis a este mundo, mas transformai-vos pela renova\xe7\xe3o da vossa mente, para que experimenteis qual seja a boa, agrad\xe1vel, e perfeita vontade de Deus."},{verse:3,en:"For I say, through the grace given unto me, to every man that is among you, not to think of himself more highly than he ought to think; but to think soberly, according as God hath dealt to every man the measure of faith.",pt:"Porque pela gra\xe7a que me foi dada, digo a cada um dentre v\xf3s que n\xe3o tenha de si mesmo mais alto conceito do que conv\xe9m; mas que pense de si sobriamente, conforme a medida da f\xe9 que Deus, repartiu a cada um."},{verse:4,en:"For as we have many members in one body, and all members have not the same office:",pt:"Pois assim como em um corpo temos muitos membros, e nem todos os membros t\xeam a mesma fun\xe7\xe3o,"},{verse:5,en:"So we, being many, are one body in Christ, and every one members one of another.",pt:"assim n\xf3s, embora muitos, somos um s\xf3 corpo em Cristo, e individualmente uns dos outros."},{verse:6,en:"Having then gifts differing according to the grace that is given to us, whether prophecy, let us prophesy according to the proportion of faith;",pt:"De modo que, tendo diferentes dons segundo a gra\xe7a que nos foi dada, se \xe9 profecia, seja ela segundo a medida da f\xe9;"},{verse:7,en:"Or ministry, let us wait on our ministering: or he that teacheth, on teaching;",pt:"se \xe9 minist\xe9rio, seja em ministrar; se \xe9 ensinar, haja dedica\xe7\xe3o ao ensino;"},{verse:8,en:"Or he that exhorteth, on exhortation: he that giveth, let him do it with simplicity; he that ruleth, with diligence; he that sheweth mercy, with cheerfulness.",pt:"ou que exorta, use esse dom em exortar; o que reparte, fa\xe7a-o com liberalidade; o que preside, com zelo; o que usa de miseric\xf3rdia, com alegria."},{verse:9,en:"Let love be without dissimulation. Abhor that which is evil; cleave to that which is good.",pt:"O amor seja n\xe3o fingido. Aborrecei o mal e apegai-vos ao bem."},{verse:10,en:"Be kindly affectioned one to another with brotherly love; in honour preferring one another;",pt:"Amai-vos cordialmente uns aos outros com amor fraternal, preferindo-vos em honra uns aos outros;"},{verse:11,en:"Not slothful in business; fervent in spirit; serving the Lord;",pt:"n\xe3o sejais vagarosos no cuidado; sede fervorosos no esp\xedrito, servindo ao Senhor;"},{verse:12,en:"Rejoicing in hope; patient in tribulation; continuing instant in prayer;",pt:"alegrai-vos na esperan\xe7a, sede pacientes na tribula\xe7\xe3o, perseverai na ora\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:13,en:"Distributing to the necessity of saints; given to hospitality.",pt:"acudi aos santos nas suas necessidades, exercei a hospitalidade;"},{verse:14,en:"Bless them which persecute you: bless, and curse not.",pt:"aben\xe7oai aos que vos perseguem; aben\xe7oai, e n\xe3o amaldi\xe7oeis;"},{verse:15,en:"Rejoice with them that do rejoice, and weep with them that weep.",pt:"alegrai-vos com os que se alegram; chorai com os que choram;"},{verse:16,en:"Be of the same mind one toward another. Mind not high things, but condescend to men of low estate. Be not wise in your own conceits.",pt:"sede un\xe2nimes entre v\xf3s; n\xe3o ambicioneis coisas altivas mas acomodai-vos \xe0s humildes; n\xe3o sejais s\xe1bios aos vossos olhos;"},{verse:17,en:"Recompense to no man evil for evil. Provide things honest in the sight of all men.",pt:"a ningu\xe9m torneis mal por mal; procurai as coisas dignas, perante todos os homens."},{verse:18,en:"If it be possible, as much as lieth in you, live peaceably with all men.",pt:"Se for poss\xedvel, quanto depender de v\xf3s, tende paz com todos os homens."},{verse:19,en:"Dearly beloved, avenge not yourselves, but rather give place unto wrath: for it is written, Vengeance is mine; I will repay, saith the Lord.",pt:"N\xe3o vos vingueis a v\xf3s mesmos, amados, mas dai lugar \xe0 ira de Deus, porque est\xe1 escrito: Minha \xe9 a vingan\xe7a, eu retribuirei, diz o Senhor."},{verse:20,en:"Therefore if thine enemy hunger, feed him; if he thirst, give him drink: for in so doing thou shalt heap coals of fire on his head.",pt:"Antes, se o teu inimigo tiver fome, d\xe1-lhe de comer; se tiver sede, d\xe1-lhe de beber; porque, fazendo isto amontoar\xe1s brasas de fogo sobre a sua cabe\xe7a."},{verse:21,en:"Be not overcome of evil, but overcome evil with good.",pt:"N\xe3o te deixes vencer do mal, mas vence o mal com o bem."}]}}),727,[]);
__d((function(e,o,t,a,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Let every soul be subject unto the higher powers. For there is no power but of God: the powers that be are ordained of God.",pt:"Toda alma esteja sujeita \xe0s autoridades superiores; porque n\xe3o h\xe1 autoridade que n\xe3o venha de Deus; e as que existem foram ordenadas por Deus."},{verse:2,en:"Whosoever therefore resisteth the power, resisteth the ordinance of God: and they that resist shall receive to themselves damnation.",pt:"Por isso quem resiste \xe0 autoridade resiste \xe0 ordena\xe7\xe3o de Deus; e os que resistem trar\xe3o sobre si mesmos a condena\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"For rulers are not a terror to good works, but to the evil. Wilt thou then not be afraid of the power? do that which is good, and thou shalt have praise of the same:",pt:"Porque os magistrados n\xe3o s\xe3o motivo de temor para os que fazem o bem, mas para os que fazem o mal. Queres tu, pois, n\xe3o temer a autoridade? Faze o bem, e ter\xe1s louvor dela;"},{verse:4,en:"For he is the minister of God to thee for good. But if thou do that which is evil, be afraid; for he beareth not the sword in vain: for he is the minister of God, a revenger to execute wrath upon him that doeth evil.",pt:"porquanto ela \xe9 ministro de Deus para teu bem. Mas, se fizeres o mal, teme, pois n\xe3o traz debalde a espada; porque \xe9 ministro de Deus, e vingador em ira contra aquele que pratica o mal."},{verse:5,en:"Wherefore ye must needs be subject, not only for wrath, but also for conscience sake.",pt:"Pelo que \xe9 necess\xe1rio que lhe estejais sujeitos, n\xe3o somente por causa da ira, mas tamb\xe9m por causa da consci\xeancia."},{verse:6,en:"For for this cause pay ye tribute also: for they are God\u2019s ministers, attending continually upon this very thing.",pt:"Por esta raz\xe3o tamb\xe9m pagais tributo; porque s\xe3o ministros de Deus, para atenderem a isso mesmo."},{verse:7,en:"Render therefore to all their dues: tribute to whom tribute is due; custom to whom custom; fear to whom fear; honour to whom honour.",pt:"Dai a cada um o que lhe \xe9 devido: a quem tributo, tributo; a quem imposto, imposto; a quem temor, temor; a quem honra, honra."},{verse:8,en:"Owe no man any thing, but to love one another: for he that loveth another hath fulfilled the law.",pt:"A ningu\xe9m devais coisa alguma, sen\xe3o o amor rec\xedproco; pois quem ama ao pr\xf3ximo tem cumprido a lei."},{verse:9,en:"For this, Thou shalt not commit adultery, Thou shalt not kill, Thou shalt not steal, Thou shalt not bear false witness, Thou shalt not covet; and if there be any other commandment, it is briefly comprehended in this saying, namely, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself.",pt:"Com efeito: N\xe3o adulterar\xe1s; n\xe3o matar\xe1s; n\xe3o furtar\xe1s; n\xe3o cobi\xe7ar\xe1s; e se h\xe1 algum outro mandamento, tudo nesta palavra se resume: Amar\xe1s ao teu pr\xf3ximo como a ti mesmo."},{verse:10,en:"Love worketh no ill to his neighbour: therefore love is the fulfilling of the law.",pt:"O amor n\xe3o faz mal ao pr\xf3ximo. De modo que o amor \xe9 o cumprimento da lei."},{verse:11,en:"And that, knowing the time, that now it is high time to awake out of sleep: for now is our salvation nearer than when we believed.",pt:"E isso fazei, conhecendo o tempo, que j\xe1 \xe9 hora de despertardes do sono; porque a nossa salva\xe7\xe3o est\xe1 agora mais perto de n\xf3s do que quando nos tornamos crentes."},{verse:12,en:"The night is far spent, the day is at hand: let us therefore cast off the works of darkness, and let us put on the armour of light.",pt:"A noite \xe9 passada, e o dia \xe9 chegado; dispamo-nos, pois, das obras das trevas, e vistamo-nos das armas da luz."},{verse:13,en:"Let us walk honestly, as in the day; not in rioting and drunkenness, not in chambering and wantonness, not in strife and envying.",pt:"Andemos honestamente, como de dia: n\xe3o em glutonarias e bebedeiras, n\xe3o em impudic\xedcias e dissolu\xe7\xf5es, n\xe3o em contendas e inveja."},{verse:14,en:"But put ye on the Lord Jesus Christ, and make not provision for the flesh, to fulfil the lusts thereof.",pt:"Mas revesti-vos do Senhor Jesus Cristo; e n\xe3o tenhais cuidado da carne em suas concupisc\xeancias."}]}}),728,[]);
__d((function(e,o,t,a,r,s,n){r.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Him that is weak in the faith receive ye, but not to doubtful disputations.",pt:"Ora, ao que \xe9 fraco na f\xe9, acolhei-o, mas n\xe3o para condenar-lhe os escr\xfapulos."},{verse:2,en:"For one believeth that he may eat all things: another, who is weak, eateth herbs.",pt:"Um cr\xea que de tudo se pode comer, e outro, que \xe9 fraco, come s\xf3 legumes."},{verse:3,en:"Let not him that eateth despise him that eateth not; and let not him which eateth not judge him that eateth: for God hath received him.",pt:"Quem come n\xe3o despreze a quem n\xe3o come; e quem n\xe3o come n\xe3o julgue a quem come; pois Deus o acolheu."},{verse:4,en:"Who art thou that judgest another man\u2019s servant? to his own master he standeth or falleth. Yea, he shall be holden up: for God is able to make him stand.",pt:"Quem \xe9s tu, que julgas o servo alheio? Para seu pr\xf3prio senhor ele est\xe1 em p\xe9 ou cai; mas estar\xe1 firme, porque poderoso \xe9 o Senhor para o firmar."},{verse:5,en:"One man esteemeth one day above another: another esteemeth every day alike. Let every man be fully persuaded in his own mind.",pt:"Um faz diferen\xe7a entre dia e dia, mas outro julga iguais todos os dias. Cada um esteja inteiramente convicto em sua pr\xf3pria mente."},{verse:6,en:"He that regardeth the day, regardeth it unto the Lord; and he that regardeth not the day, to the Lord he doth not regard it. He that eateth, eateth to the Lord, for he giveth God thanks; and he that eateth not, to the Lord he eateth not, and giveth God thanks.",pt:"Aquele que faz caso do dia, para o Senhor o faz. E quem come, para o Senhor come, porque d\xe1 gra\xe7as a Deus; e quem n\xe3o come, para o Senhor n\xe3o come, e d\xe1 gra\xe7as a Deus."},{verse:7,en:"For none of us liveth to himself, and no man dieth to himself.",pt:"Porque nenhum de n\xf3s vive para si, e nenhum morre para si."},{verse:8,en:"For whether we live, we live unto the Lord; and whether we die, we die unto the Lord: whether we live therefore, or die, we are the Lord\u2019s.",pt:"Pois, se vivemos, para o Senhor vivemos; se morremos, para o Senhor morremos. De sorte que, quer vivamos quer morramos, somos do Senhor."},{verse:9,en:"For to this end Christ both died, and rose, and revived, that he might be Lord both of the dead and living.",pt:"Porque foi para isto mesmo que Cristo morreu e tornou a viver, para ser Senhor tanto de mortos como de vivos."},{verse:10,en:"But why dost thou judge thy brother? or why dost thou set at nought thy brother? for we shall all stand before the judgment seat of Christ.",pt:"Mas tu, por que julgas teu irm\xe3o? Ou tu, tamb\xe9m, por que desprezas teu irm\xe3o? Pois todos havemos de comparecer ante o tribunal de Deus."},{verse:11,en:"For it is written, As I live, saith the Lord, every knee shall bow to me, and every tongue shall confess to God.",pt:"Porque est\xe1 escrito: Por minha vida, diz o Senhor, diante de mim se dobrar\xe1 todo joelho, e toda l\xedngua louvar\xe1 a Deus."},{verse:12,en:"So then every one of us shall give account of himself to God.",pt:"Assim, pois, cada um de n\xf3s dar\xe1 conta de si mesmo a Deus."},{verse:13,en:"Let us not therefore judge one another any more: but judge this rather, that no man put a stumblingblock or an occasion to fall in his brother\u2019s way.",pt:"Portanto n\xe3o nos julguemos mais uns aos outros; antes o seja o vosso prop\xf3sito n\xe3o p\xf4r trope\xe7o ou esc\xe2ndalo ao vosso irm\xe3o."},{verse:14,en:"I know, and am persuaded by the Lord Jesus, that there is nothing unclean of itself: but to him that esteemeth any thing to be unclean, to him it is unclean.",pt:"Eu sei, e estou certo no Senhor Jesus, que nada \xe9 de si mesmo imundo a n\xe3o ser para aquele que assim o considera; para esse \xe9 imundo."},{verse:15,en:"But if thy brother be grieved with thy meat, now walkest thou not charitably. Destroy not him with thy meat, for whom Christ died.",pt:"Pois, se pela tua comida se entristece teu irm\xe3o, j\xe1 n\xe3o andas segundo o amor. N\xe3o fa\xe7as perecer por causa da tua comida aquele por quem Cristo morreu."},{verse:16,en:"Let not then your good be evil spoken of:",pt:"N\xe3o seja pois censurado o vosso bem;"},{verse:17,en:"For the kingdom of God is not meat and drink; but righteousness, and peace, and joy in the Holy Ghost.",pt:"porque o reino de Deus n\xe3o consiste no comer e no beber, mas na justi\xe7a, na paz, e na alegria no Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:18,en:"For he that in these things serveth Christ is acceptable to God, and approved of men.",pt:"Pois quem nisso serve a Cristo agrad\xe1vel \xe9 a Deus e aceito aos homens."},{verse:19,en:"Let us therefore follow after the things which make for peace, and things wherewith one may edify another.",pt:"Assim, pois, sigamos as coisas que servem para a paz e as que contribuem para a edifica\xe7\xe3o m\xfatua."},{verse:20,en:"For meat destroy not the work of God. All things indeed are pure; but it is evil for that man who eateth with offence.",pt:"N\xe3o destruas por causa da comida a obra de Deus. Na verdade tudo \xe9 limpo, mas \xe9 um mal para o homem dar motivo de trope\xe7o pelo comer."},{verse:21,en:"It is good neither to eat flesh, nor to drink wine, nor any thing whereby thy brother stumbleth, or is offended, or is made weak.",pt:"Bom \xe9 n\xe3o comer carne, nem beber vinho, nem fazer outra coisa em que teu irm\xe3o tropece."},{verse:22,en:"Hast thou faith? have it to thyself before God. Happy is he that condemneth not himself in that thing which he alloweth.",pt:"A f\xe9 que tens, guarda-a contigo mesmo diante de Deus. Bem-aventurado aquele que n\xe3o se condena a si mesmo naquilo que aprova."},{verse:23,en:"And he that doubteth is damned if he eat, because he eateth not of faith: for whatsoever is not of faith is sin.",pt:"Mas aquele que tem d\xfavidas, se come est\xe1 condenado, porque o que faz n\xe3o prov\xe9m da f\xe9; e tudo o que n\xe3o prov\xe9m da f\xe9 \xe9 pecado."}]}}),729,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"We then that are strong ought to bear the infirmities of the weak, and not to please ourselves.",pt:"Ora n\xf3s, que somos fortes, devemos suportar as fraquezas dos fracos, e n\xe0o agradar a n\xf3s mesmos."},{verse:2,en:"Let every one of us please his neighbour for his good to edification.",pt:"Portanto cada um de n\xf3s agrade ao seu pr\xf3ximo, visando o que \xe9 bom para edifica\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"For even Christ pleased not himself; but, as it is written, The reproaches of them that reproached thee fell on me.",pt:"Porque tamb\xe9m Cristo n\xe3o se agradou a si mesmo, mas como est\xe1 escrito: Sobre mim ca\xedram as inj\xfarias dos que te injuriavam."},{verse:4,en:"For whatsoever things were written aforetime were written for our learning, that we through patience and comfort of the scriptures might have hope.",pt:"Porquanto, tudo que dantes foi escrito, para nosso ensino foi escrito, para que, pela const\xe2ncia e pela consola\xe7\xe3o provenientes das Escrituras, tenhamos esperan\xe7a."},{verse:5,en:"Now the God of patience and consolation grant you to be likeminded one toward another according to Christ Jesus:",pt:"Ora, o Deus de const\xe2ncia e de consola\xe7\xe3o vos d\xea o mesmo sentimento uns para com os outros, segundo Cristo Jesus."},{verse:6,en:"That ye may with one mind and one mouth glorify God, even the Father of our Lord Jesus Christ.",pt:"Para que un\xe2nimes, e a uma boca, glorifiqueis ao Deus e Pai de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo."},{verse:7,en:"Wherefore receive ye one another, as Christ also received us to the glory of God.",pt:"Portanto recebei-vos uns aos outros, como tamb\xe9m Cristo nos recebeu, para gl\xf3ria de Deus."},{verse:8,en:"Now I say that Jesus Christ was a minister of the circumcision for the truth of God, to confirm the promises made unto the fathers:",pt:"Digo pois que Cristo foi feito ministro da circuncis\xe3o, por causa da verdade de Deus, para confirmar as promessas feitas aos pais;"},{verse:9,en:"And that the Gentiles might glorify God for his mercy; as it is written, For this cause I will confess to thee among the Gentiles, and sing unto thy name.",pt:"e para que os gentios glorifiquem a Deus pela sua miseric\xf3rdia, como est\xe1 escrito: Portanto eu te louvarei entre os gentios, e cantarei ao teu nome."},{verse:10,en:"And again he saith, Rejoice, ye Gentiles, with his people.",pt:"E outra vez diz: Alegrai-vos, gentios, juntamente com o povo."},{verse:11,en:"And again, Praise the Lord, all ye Gentiles; and laud him, all ye people.",pt:"E ainda: Louvai ao Senhor, todos os gentios, e louvem-no, todos os povos."},{verse:12,en:"And again, Esaias saith, There shall be a root of Jesse, and he that shall rise to reign over the Gentiles; in him shall the Gentiles trust.",pt:"E outra vez, diz tamb\xe9m Isa\xedas: Haver\xe1 a raiz de Jess\xe9, aquele que se levanta para reger os gentios; nele os gentios esperar\xe3o."},{verse:13,en:"Now the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace in believing, that ye may abound in hope, through the power of the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Ora, o Deus de esperan\xe7a vos encha de todo o gozo e paz na vossa f\xe9, para que abundeis na esperan\xe7a pelo poder do Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:14,en:"And I myself also am persuaded of you, my brethren, that ye also are full of goodness, filled with all knowledge, able also to admonish one another.",pt:"Eu, da minha parte, irm\xe3os meus, estou persuadido a vosso respeito, que v\xf3s j\xe1 estais cheios de bondade, cheios de todo o conhecimento e capazes, v\xf3s mesmos, de admoestar-vos uns aos outros."},{verse:15,en:"Nevertheless, brethren, I have written the more boldly unto you in some sort, as putting you in mind, because of the grace that is given to me of God,",pt:"Mas em parte vos escrevo mais ousadamente, como para vos trazer outra vez isto \xe0 mem\xf3ria, por causa da gra\xe7a que por Deus me foi dada,"},{verse:16,en:"That I should be the minister of Jesus Christ to the Gentiles, ministering the gospel of God, that the offering up of the Gentiles might be acceptable, being sanctified by the Holy Ghost.",pt:"para ser ministro de Cristo Jesus entre os gentios, ministrando o evangelho de Deus, para que sejam aceit\xe1veis os gentios como oferta, santificada pelo Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:17,en:"I have therefore whereof I may glory through Jesus Christ in those things which pertain to God.",pt:"Tenho, portanto, motivo para me gloriar em Cristo Jesus, nas coisas concernentes a Deus;"},{verse:18,en:"For I will not dare to speak of any of those things which Christ hath not wrought by me, to make the Gentiles obedient, by word and deed,",pt:"porque n\xe3o ousarei falar de coisa alguma sen\xe3o daquilo que Cristo por meu interm\xe9dio tem feito, para obedi\xeancia da parte dos gentios, por palavra e por obras,"},{verse:19,en:"Through mighty signs and wonders, by the power of the Spirit of God; so that from Jerusalem, and round about unto Illyricum, I have fully preached the gospel of Christ.",pt:"pelo poder de sinais e prod\xedgios, no poder do Esp\xedrito Santo; de modo que desde Jerusal\xe9m e arredores, at\xe9 a Il\xedria, tenho divulgado o evangelho de Cristo;"},{verse:20,en:"Yea, so have I strived to preach the gospel, not where Christ was named, lest I should build upon another man\u2019s foundation:",pt:"deste modo esfor\xe7ando-me por anunciar o evangelho, n\xe3o onde Cristo houvera sido nomeado, para n\xe3o edificar sobre fundamento alheio;"},{verse:21,en:"But as it is written, To whom he was not spoken of, they shall see: and they that have not heard shall understand.",pt:"antes, como est\xe1 escrito: Aqueles a quem n\xe3o foi anunciado, o ver\xe3o; e os que n\xe3o ouviram, entender\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"For which cause also I have been much hindered from coming to you.",pt:"Pelo que tamb\xe9m muitas vezes tenho sido impedido de ir ter convosco;"},{verse:23,en:"But now having no more place in these parts, and having a great desire these many years to come unto you;",pt:"mas agora, n\xe3o tendo mais o que me detenha nestas regi\xf5es, e tendo j\xe1 h\xe1 muitos anos grande desejo de ir visitar-vos,"},{verse:24,en:"Whensoever I take my journey into Spain, I will come to you: for I trust to see you in my journey, and to be brought on my way thitherward by you, if first I be somewhat filled with your company.",pt:"eu o farei quando for \xe0 Espanha; pois espero ver-vos de passagem e por v\xf3s ser encaminhado para l\xe1, depois de ter gozado um pouco da vossa companhia."},{verse:25,en:"But now I go unto Jerusalem to minister unto the saints.",pt:"Mas agora vou a Jerusal\xe9m para ministrar aos santos."},{verse:26,en:"For it hath pleased them of Macedonia and Achaia to make a certain contribution for the poor saints which are at Jerusalem.",pt:"Porque pareceu bem \xe0 Maced\xf4nia e \xe0 Acaia levantar uma oferta fraternal para os pobres dentre os santos que est\xe3o em Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:27,en:"It hath pleased them verily; and their debtors they are. For if the Gentiles have been made partakers of their spiritual things, their duty is also to minister unto them in carnal things.",pt:"Isto pois lhes pareceu bem, como devedores que s\xe3o para com eles. Porque, se os gentios foram participantes das b\xean\xe7\xe3os espirituais dos judeus, devem tamb\xe9m servir a estes com as materiais."},{verse:28,en:"When therefore I have performed this, and have sealed to them this fruit, I will come by you into Spain.",pt:"Tendo, pois, conclu\xeddo isto, e havendo-lhes consignado este fruto, de l\xe1, passando por v\xf3s, irei \xe0 Espanha."},{verse:29,en:"And I am sure that, when I come unto you, I shall come in the fulness of the blessing of the gospel of Christ.",pt:"E bem sei que, quando for visitar-vos, chegarei na plenitude da b\xean\xe7\xe3o de Cristo."},{verse:30,en:"Now I beseech you, brethren, for the Lord Jesus Christ\u2019s sake, and for the love of the Spirit, that ye strive together with me in your prayers to God for me;",pt:"Rogo-vos, irm\xe3os, por nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo e pelo amor do Esp\xedrito, que luteis juntamente comigo nas vossas ora\xe7\xf5es por mim a Deus,"},{verse:31,en:"That I may be delivered from them that do not believe in Judaea; and that my service which I have for Jerusalem may be accepted of the saints;",pt:"para que eu seja livre dos rebeldes que est\xe3o na Jud\xe9ia, e que este meu minist\xe9rio em Jerusal\xe9m seja aceit\xe1vel aos santos;"},{verse:32,en:"That I may come unto you with joy by the will of God, and may with you be refreshed.",pt:"a fim de que, pela vontade de Deus, eu chegue at\xe9 v\xf3s com alegria, e possa entre v\xf3s recobrar as for\xe7as."},{verse:33,en:"Now the God of peace be with you all. Amen.",pt:"E o Deus de paz seja com todos v\xf3s. Am\xe9m."}]}}),730,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,r,t,i){r.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I commend unto you Phebe our sister, which is a servant of the church which is at Cenchrea:",pt:"Recomendo-vos a nossa irm\xe3 Febe, que \xe9 serva da igreja que est\xe1 em Cencr\xe9ia;"},{verse:2,en:"That ye receive her in the Lord, as becometh saints, and that ye assist her in whatsoever business she hath need of you: for she hath been a succourer of many, and of myself also.",pt:"para que a recebais no Senhor, de um modo digno dos santos, e a ajudeis em qualquer coisa que de v\xf3s necessitar; porque ela tem sido o amparo de muitos, e de mim em particular."},{verse:3,en:"Greet Priscilla and Aquila my helpers in Christ Jesus:",pt:"Saudai a Prisca e a \xc1q\xfcila, meus cooperadores em Cristo Jesus,"},{verse:4,en:"Who have for my life laid down their own necks: unto whom not only I give thanks, but also all the churches of the Gentiles.",pt:"os quais pela minha vida expuseram as suas cabe\xe7as; o que n\xe3o s\xf3 eu lhes agrade\xe7o, mas tamb\xe9m todas as igrejas dos gentios."},{verse:5,en:"Likewise greet the church that is in their house. Salute my wellbeloved Epaenetus, who is the firstfruits of Achaia unto Christ.",pt:"Saudai tamb\xe9m a igreja que est\xe1 na casa deles. Saudai a Ep\xeaneto, meu amado, que \xe9 as prim\xedcias da \xc1sia para Cristo."},{verse:6,en:"Greet Mary, who bestowed much labour on us.",pt:"Saudai a Maria, que muito trabalhou por v\xf3s."},{verse:7,en:"Salute Andronicus and Junia, my kinsmen, and my fellowprisoners, who are of note among the apostles, who also were in Christ before me.",pt:"Saudai a Andr\xf4nico e a J\xfanias, meus parentes e meus companheiros de pris\xe3o, os quais s\xe3o bem conceituados entre os ap\xf3stolos, e que estavam em Cristo antes de mim."},{verse:8,en:"Greet Amplias my beloved in the Lord.",pt:"Saudai a Ampliato, meu amado no Senhor."},{verse:9,en:"Salute Urbane, our helper in Christ, and Stachys my beloved.",pt:"Saudai a Urbano, nosso cooperador em Cristo, e a Est\xe1quis, meu amado."},{verse:10,en:"Salute Apelles approved in Christ. Salute them which are of Aristobulus\u2019 household.",pt:"Saudai a Apeles, aprovado em Cristo. Saudai aos da casa de Arist\xf3bulo."},{verse:11,en:"Salute Herodion my kinsman. Greet them that be of the household of Narcissus, which are in the Lord.",pt:"Saudai a Herodi\xe3o, meu parente. Saudai aos da casa de Narciso que est\xe3o no Senhor."},{verse:12,en:"Salute Tryphena and Tryphosa, who labour in the Lord. Salute the beloved Persis, which laboured much in the Lord.",pt:"Saudai a Trifena e a Trifosa, que trabalham no Senhor. Saudai a amada P\xe9rside, que muito trabalhou no Senhor."},{verse:13,en:"Salute Rufus chosen in the Lord, and his mother and mine.",pt:"Saudai a Rufo, eleito no Senhor, e a sua m\xe3e e minha."},{verse:14,en:"Salute Asyncritus, Phlegon, Hermas, Patrobas, Hermes, and the brethren which are with them.",pt:"Saudai a As\xedncrito, a Flegonte, a Hermes, a P\xe1trobas, a Hermes, e aos irm\xe3os que est\xe3o com eles."},{verse:15,en:"Salute Philologus, and Julia, Nereus, and his sister, and Olympas, and all the saints which are with them.",pt:"Saudai a Fil\xf3logo e a J\xfalia, a Nereu e a sua irm\xe3, e a Olimpas, e a todos os santos que com eles est\xe3o."},{verse:16,en:"Salute one another with an holy kiss. The churches of Christ salute you.",pt:"Saudai-vos uns aos outros com \xf3sculo santo. Todas as igrejas de Cristo vos sa\xfadam."},{verse:17,en:"Now I beseech you, brethren, mark them which cause divisions and offences contrary to the doctrine which ye have learned; and avoid them.",pt:"Rogo-vos, irm\xe3os, que noteis os que promovem dissens\xf5es e esc\xe2ndalos contra a doutrina que aprendestes; desviai-vos deles."},{verse:18,en:"For they that are such serve not our Lord Jesus Christ, but their own belly; and by good words and fair speeches deceive the hearts of the simple.",pt:"Porque os tais n\xe3o servem a Cristo nosso Senhor, mas ao seu ventre; e com palavras suaves e lisonjas enganam os cora\xe7\xf5es dos inocentes."},{verse:19,en:"For your obedience is come abroad unto all men. I am glad therefore on your behalf: but yet I would have you wise unto that which is good, and simple concerning evil.",pt:"Pois a vossa obedi\xeancia \xe9 conhecida de todos. Comprazo-me, portanto, em v\xf3s; e quero que sejais s\xe1bios para o bem, mas simples para o mal."},{verse:20,en:"And the God of peace shall bruise Satan under your feet shortly. The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you. Amen.",pt:"E o Deus de paz em breve esmagar\xe1 a Satan\xe1s debaixo dos vossos p\xe9s. A gra\xe7a de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo seja convosco."},{verse:21,en:"Timotheus my workfellow, and Lucius, and Jason, and Sosipater, my kinsmen, salute you.",pt:"Sa\xfadam-vos Tim\xf3teo, meu cooperador, e L\xfacio, e J\xe1son, e Sos\xedpatro, meus parentes."},{verse:22,en:"I Tertius, who wrote this epistle, salute you in the Lord.",pt:"Eu, T\xe9rcio, que escrevo esta carta, vos sa\xfado no Senhor."},{verse:23,en:"Gaius mine host, and of the whole church, saluteth you. Erastus the chamberlain of the city saluteth you, and Quartus a brother.",pt:"Sa\xfada-vos Gaio, hospedeiro meu e de toda a igreja. Sa\xfada-vos Erasto, tesoureiro da cidade, e tamb\xe9m o irm\xe3o Quarto."},{verse:24,en:"The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you all. Amen.",pt:"[A gra\xe7a de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo seja com todos v\xf3s. Am\xe9m.]"},{verse:25,en:"Now to him that is of power to stablish you according to my gospel, and the preaching of Jesus Christ, according to the revelation of the mystery, which was kept secret since the world began,",pt:"Ora, \xe0quele que \xe9 poderoso para vos confirmar, segundo o meu evangelho e a prega\xe7\xe3o de Jesus Cristo, conforme a revela\xe7\xe3o do mist\xe9rio guardado em sil\xeancio desde os tempos eternos,"},{verse:26,en:"But now is made manifest, and by the scriptures of the prophets, according to the commandment of the everlasting God, made known to all nations for the obedience of faith:",pt:"mas agora manifesto e, por meio das Escrituras prof\xe9ticas, segundo o mandamento do Deus, eterno, dado a conhecer a todas as na\xe7\xf5es para obedi\xeancia da f\xe9;"},{verse:27,en:"To God only wise, be glory through Jesus Christ for ever. Amen.",pt:"ao \xfanico Deus s\xe1bio seja dada gl\xf3ria por Jesus Cristo para todo o sempre. Am\xe9m."}]}}),731,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,r,t,n){r.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Paul, an apostle, (not of men, neither by man, but by Jesus Christ, and God the Father, who raised him from the dead;)",pt:"Paulo, ap\xf3stolo (n\xe3o da parte dos homens, nem por interm\xe9dio de homem algum, mas sim por Jesus Cristo, e por Deus Pai, que o ressuscitou dentre os mortos),"},{verse:2,en:"And all the brethren which are with me, unto the churches of Galatia:",pt:"e todos os irm\xe3os que est\xe3o comigo, \xe0s igrejas da Gal\xe1cia:"},{verse:3,en:"Grace be to you and peace from God the Father, and from our Lord Jesus Christ,",pt:"Gra\xe7a a v\xf3s, e paz da parte de Deus nosso Pai, e do Senhor Jesus Cristo,"},{verse:4,en:"Who gave himself for our sins, that he might deliver us from this present evil world, according to the will of God and our Father:",pt:"o qual se deu a si mesmo por nossos pecados, para nos livrar do presente s\xe9culo mau, segundo a vontade de nosso Deus e Pai,"},{verse:5,en:"To whom be glory for ever and ever. Amen.",pt:"a quem seja a gl\xf3ria para todo o sempre. Am\xe9m."},{verse:6,en:"I marvel that ye are so soon removed from him that called you into the grace of Christ unto another gospel:",pt:"Estou admirado de que t\xe3o depressa estejais desertando daquele que vos chamou na gra\xe7a de Cristo, para outro evangelho,"},{verse:7,en:"Which is not another; but there be some that trouble you, and would pervert the gospel of Christ.",pt:"o qual n\xe3o \xe9 outro; sen\xe3o que h\xe1 alguns que vos perturbam e querem perverter o evangelho de Cristo."},{verse:8,en:"But though we, or an angel from heaven, preach any other gospel unto you than that which we have preached unto you, let him be accursed.",pt:"Mas, ainda que n\xf3s mesmos ou um anjo do c\xe9u vos pregasse outro evangelho al\xe9m do que j\xe1 vos pregamos, seja an\xe1tema."},{verse:9,en:"As we said before, so say I now again, If any man preach any other gospel unto you than that ye have received, let him be accursed.",pt:"Como antes temos dito, assim agora novamente o digo: Se algu\xe9m vos pregar outro evangelho al\xe9m do que j\xe1 recebestes, seja an\xe1tema."},{verse:10,en:"For do I now persuade men, or God? or do I seek to please men? for if I yet pleased men, I should not be the servant of Christ.",pt:"Pois busco eu agora o favor dos homens, ou o favor de Deus? ou procuro agradar aos homens? se estivesse ainda agradando aos homens, n\xe3o seria servo de Cristo."},{verse:11,en:"But I certify you, brethren, that the gospel which was preached of me is not after man.",pt:"Mas fa\xe7o-vos saber, irm\xe3os, que o evangelho que por mim foi anunciado n\xe3o \xe9 segundo os homens;"},{verse:12,en:"For I neither received it of man, neither was I taught it, but by the revelation of Jesus Christ.",pt:"porque n\xe3o o recebi de homem algum, nem me foi ensinado; mas o recebi por revela\xe7\xe3o de Jesus Cristo."},{verse:13,en:"For ye have heard of my conversation in time past in the Jews\u2019 religion, how that beyond measure I persecuted the church of God, and wasted it:",pt:"Pois j\xe1 ouvistes qual foi outrora o meu procedimento no juda\xedsmo, como sobremaneira perseguia a igreja de Deus e a assolava,"},{verse:14,en:"And profited in the Jews\u2019 religion above many my equals in mine own nation, being more exceedingly zealous of the traditions of my fathers.",pt:"e na minha na\xe7\xe3o excedia em juda\xedsmo a muitos da minha idade, sendo extremamente zeloso das tradi\xe7\xf5es de meus pais."},{verse:15,en:"But when it pleased God, who separated me from my mother\u2019s womb, and called me by his grace,",pt:"Mas, quando aprouve a Deus, que desde o ventre de minha m\xe3e me separou, e me chamou pela sua gra\xe7a,"},{verse:16,en:"To reveal his Son in me, that I might preach him among the heathen; immediately I conferred not with flesh and blood:",pt:"revelar seu Filho em mim, para que eu o pregasse entre os gentios, n\xe3o consultei carne e sangue,"},{verse:17,en:"Neither went I up to Jerusalem to them which were apostles before me; but I went into Arabia, and returned again unto Damascus.",pt:"nem subi a Jerusal\xe9m para estar com os que j\xe1 antes de mim eram ap\xf3stolos, mas parti para a Ar\xe1bia, e voltei outra vez a Damasco."},{verse:18,en:"Then after three years I went up to Jerusalem to see Peter, and abode with him fifteen days.",pt:"Depois, passados tr\xeas anos, subi a Jerusal\xe9m para visitar a Cefas, e demorei com ele quinze dias."},{verse:19,en:"But other of the apostles saw I none, save James the Lord\u2019s brother.",pt:"Mas n\xe3o vi a nenhum outro dos ap\xf3stolos, sen\xe3o a Tiago, irm\xe3o do Senhor."},{verse:20,en:"Now the things which I write unto you, behold, before God, I lie not.",pt:"Ora, acerca do que vos escrevo, eis que diante de Deus testifico que n\xe3o minto."},{verse:21,en:"Afterwards I came into the regions of Syria and Cilicia;",pt:"Depois fui para as regi\xf5es da S\xedria e da Cil\xedcia."},{verse:22,en:"And was unknown by face unto the churches of Judaea which were in Christ:",pt:"N\xe3o era conhecido de vista das igrejas de Cristo na Jud\xe9ia;"},{verse:23,en:"But they had heard only, That he which persecuted us in times past now preacheth the faith which once he destroyed.",pt:"mas somente tinham ouvido dizer: Aquele que outrora nos perseguia agora prega a f\xe9 que antes procurava destruir;"},{verse:24,en:"And they glorified God in me.",pt:"e glorificavam a Deus a respeito de mim."}]}}),732,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,i,r){t.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then fourteen years after I went up again to Jerusalem with Barnabas, and took Titus with me also.",pt:"Depois, passados catorze anos, subi outra vez a Jerusal\xe9m com Barnab\xe9, levando tamb\xe9m comigo a Tito."},{verse:2,en:"And I went up by revelation, and communicated unto them that gospel which I preach among the Gentiles, but privately to them which were of reputation, lest by any means I should run, or had run, in vain.",pt:"E subi devido a uma revela\xe7\xe3o, e lhes expus o evangelho que prego entre os gentios, mas em particular aos que eram de destaque, para que de algum modo n\xe3o estivesse correndo ou n\xe3o tivesse corrido em v\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"But neither Titus, who was with me, being a Greek, was compelled to be circumcised:",pt:"Mas nem mesmo Tito, que estava comigo, embora sendo grego, foi constrangido a circuncidar-se;"},{verse:4,en:"And that because of false brethren unawares brought in, who came in privily to spy out our liberty which we have in Christ Jesus, that they might bring us into bondage:",pt:"e isto por causa dos falsos irm\xe3os intrusos, os quais furtivamente entraram a espiar a nossa liberdade, que temos em Cristo Jesus, para nos escravizar;"},{verse:5,en:"To whom we gave place by subjection, no, not for an hour; that the truth of the gospel might continue with you.",pt:"aos quais nem ainda por uma hora cedemos em sujei\xe7\xe3o, para que a verdade do evangelho permanecesse entre v\xf3s."},{verse:6,en:"But of these who seemed to be somewhat, (whatsoever they were, it maketh no matter to me: God accepteth no man\u2019s person:) for they who seemed to be somewhat in conference added nothing to me:",pt:"Ora, daqueles que pareciam ser alguma coisa (quais outrora tenham sido, nada me importa; Deus n\xe3o aceita a apar\xeancia do homem), esses, digo, que pareciam ser alguma coisa, nada me acrescentaram;"},{verse:7,en:"But contrariwise, when they saw that the gospel of the uncircumcision was committed unto me, as the gospel of the circumcision was unto Peter;",pt:"antes, pelo contr\xe1rio, quando viram que o evangelho da incircuncis\xe3o me fora confiado, como a Pedro o da circuncis\xe3o"},{verse:8,en:"(For he that wrought effectually in Peter to the apostleship of the circumcision, the same was mighty in me toward the Gentiles:)",pt:"(porque aquele que operou a favor de Pedro para o apostolado da circuncis\xe3o, operou tamb\xe9m a meu favor para com os gentios),"},{verse:9,en:"And when James, Cephas, and John, who seemed to be pillars, perceived the grace that was given unto me, they gave to me and Barnabas the right hands of fellowship; that we should go unto the heathen, and they unto the circumcision.",pt:"e quando conheceram a gra\xe7a que me fora dada, Tiago, Cefas e Jo\xe3o, que pareciam ser as colunas, deram a mim e a Barnab\xe9 as destras de comunh\xe3o, para que n\xf3s f\xf4ssemos aos gentios, e eles \xe0 circuncis\xe3o;"},{verse:10,en:"Only they would that we should remember the poor; the same which I also was forward to do.",pt:"recomendando-nos somente que nos lembr\xe1ssemos dos pobres; o que tamb\xe9m procurei fazer com dilig\xeancia."},{verse:11,en:"But when Peter was come to Antioch, I withstood him to the face, because he was to be blamed.",pt:"Quando, por\xe9m, Cefas veio a Antioquia, resisti-lhe na cara, porque era repreens\xedvel."},{verse:12,en:"For before that certain came from James, he did eat with the Gentiles: but when they were come, he withdrew and separated himself, fearing them which were of the circumcision.",pt:"Pois antes de chegarem alguns da parte de Tiago, ele comia com os gentios; mas quando eles chegaram, se foi retirando e se apartava deles, temendo os que eram da circuncis\xe3o."},{verse:13,en:"And the other Jews dissembled likewise with him; insomuch that Barnabas also was carried away with their dissimulation.",pt:"E os outros judeus tamb\xe9m dissimularam com ele, de modo que at\xe9 Barnab\xe9 se deixou levar pela sua dissimula\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:14,en:"But when I saw that they walked not uprightly according to the truth of the gospel, I said unto Peter before them all, If thou, being a Jew, livest after the manner of Gentiles, and not as do the Jews, why compellest thou the Gentiles to live as do the Jews?",pt:"Mas, quando vi que n\xe3o andavam retamente conforme a verdade do evangelho, disse a Cefas perante todos: Se tu, sendo judeu, vives como os gentios, e n\xe3o como os judeus, como \xe9 que obrigas os gentios a viverem como judeus?"},{verse:15,en:"We who are Jews by nature, and not sinners of the Gentiles,",pt:"N\xf3s, judeus por natureza e n\xe3o pecadores dentre os gentios,"},{verse:16,en:"Knowing that a man is not justified by the works of the law, but by the faith of Jesus Christ, even we have believed in Jesus Christ, that we might be justified by the faith of Christ, and not by the works of the law: for by the works of the law shall no flesh be justified.",pt:"sabendo, contudo, que o homem n\xe3o \xe9 justificado por obras da lei, mas sim, pela f\xe9 em Cristo Jesus, temos tamb\xe9m crido em Cristo Jesus para sermos justificados pela f\xe9 em Cristo, e n\xe3o por obras da lei; pois por obras da lei nenhuma carne ser\xe1 justificada."},{verse:17,en:"But if, while we seek to be justified by Christ, we ourselves also are found sinners, is therefore Christ the minister of sin? God forbid.",pt:"Mas se, procurando ser justificados em Cristo, fomos n\xf3s mesmos tamb\xe9m achados pecadores, \xe9 porventura Cristo ministro do pecado? De modo nenhum."},{verse:18,en:"For if I build again the things which I destroyed, I make myself a transgressor.",pt:"Porque, se torno a edificar aquilo que destru\xed, constituo-me a mim mesmo transgressor."},{verse:19,en:"For I through the law am dead to the law, that I might live unto God.",pt:"Pois eu pela lei morri para a lei, a fim de viver para Deus."},{verse:20,en:"I am crucified with Christ: nevertheless I live; yet not I, but Christ liveth in me: and the life which I now live in the flesh I live by the faith of the Son of God, who loved me, and gave himself for me.",pt:"J\xe1 estou crucificado com Cristo; e vivo, n\xe3o mais eu, mas Cristo vive em mim; e a vida que agora vivo na carne, vivo-a na f\xe9 no filho de Deus, o qual me amou, e se entregou a si mesmo por mim."},{verse:21,en:"I do not frustrate the grace of God: for if righteousness come by the law, then Christ is dead in vain.",pt:"N\xe3o fa\xe7o nula a gra\xe7a de Deus; porque, se a justi\xe7a vem mediante a lei, logo Cristo morreu em v\xe3o."}]}}),733,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"O foolish Galatians, who hath bewitched you, that ye should not obey the truth, before whose eyes Jesus Christ hath been evidently set forth, crucified among you?",pt:"\xf3 insensatos g\xe1latas! quem vos fascinou a v\xf3s, ante cujos olhos foi representado Jesus Cristo como crucificado?"},{verse:2,en:"This only would I learn of you, Received ye the Spirit by the works of the law, or by the hearing of faith?",pt:"S\xf3 isto quero saber de v\xf3s: Foi por obras da lei que recebestes o Esp\xedrito, ou pelo ouvir com f\xe9?"},{verse:3,en:"Are ye so foolish? having begun in the Spirit, are ye now made perfect by the flesh?",pt:"Sois v\xf3s t\xe3o insensatos? tendo come\xe7ado pelo Esp\xedrito, \xe9 pela carne que agora acabareis?"},{verse:4,en:"Have ye suffered so many things in vain? if it be yet in vain.",pt:"Ser\xe1 que padecestes tantas coisas em v\xe3o? Se \xe9 que isso foi em v\xe3o."},{verse:5,en:"He therefore that ministereth to you the Spirit, and worketh miracles among you, doeth he it by the works of the law, or by the hearing of faith?",pt:"Aquele pois que vos d\xe1 o Esp\xedrito, e que opera milagres entre v\xf3s, acaso o faz pelas obras da lei, ou pelo ouvir com f\xe9?"},{verse:6,en:"Even as Abraham believed God, and it was accounted to him for righteousness.",pt:"Assim como Abra\xe3o creu a Deus, e isso lhe foi imputado como justi\xe7a."},{verse:7,en:"Know ye therefore that they which are of faith, the same are the children of Abraham.",pt:"Sabei, pois, que os que s\xe3o da f\xe9, esses s\xe3o filhos de Abra\xe3o."},{verse:8,en:"And the scripture, foreseeing that God would justify the heathen through faith, preached before the gospel unto Abraham, saying, In thee shall all nations be blessed.",pt:"Ora, a Escritura, prevendo que Deus havia de justificar pela f\xe9 os gentios, anunciou previamente a boa nova a Abra\xe3o, dizendo: Em ti ser\xe3o aben\xe7oadas todas as na\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:9,en:"So then they which be of faith are blessed with faithful Abraham.",pt:"De modo que os que s\xe3o da f\xe9 s\xe3o aben\xe7oados com o crente Abra\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"For as many as are of the works of the law are under the curse: for it is written, Cursed is every one that continueth not in all things which are written in the book of the law to do them.",pt:"Pois todos quantos s\xe3o das obras da lei est\xe3o debaixo da maldi\xe7\xe3o; porque escrito est\xe1: Maldito todo aquele que n\xe3o permanece em todas as coisas que est\xe3o escritas no livro da lei, para faz\xea-las."},{verse:11,en:"But that no man is justified by the law in the sight of God, it is evident: for, The just shall live by faith.",pt:"\xc9 evidente que pela lei ningu\xe9m \xe9 justificado diante de Deus, porque: O justo viver\xe1 da f\xe9;"},{verse:12,en:"And the law is not of faith: but, The man that doeth them shall live in them.",pt:"ora, a lei n\xe3o \xe9 da f\xe9, mas: O que fizer estas coisas, por elas viver\xe1."},{verse:13,en:"Christ hath redeemed us from the curse of the law, being made a curse for us: for it is written, Cursed is every one that hangeth on a tree:",pt:"Cristo nos resgatou da maldi\xe7\xe3o da lei, fazendo-se maldi\xe7\xe3o por n\xf3s; porque est\xe1 escrito: Maldito todo aquele que for pendurado no madeiro;"},{verse:14,en:"That the blessing of Abraham might come on the Gentiles through Jesus Christ; that we might receive the promise of the Spirit through faith.",pt:"para que aos gentios viesse a b\xean\xe7\xe3o de Abra\xe3o em Jesus Cristo, a fim de que n\xf3s receb\xeassemos pela f\xe9 a promessa do Esp\xedrito."},{verse:15,en:"Brethren, I speak after the manner of men; Though it be but a man\u2019s covenant, yet if it be confirmed, no man disannulleth, or addeth thereto.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, como homem falo. Um testamento, embora de homem, uma vez confirmado, ningu\xe9m o anula, nem lhe acrescenta coisa alguma."},{verse:16,en:"Now to Abraham and his seed were the promises made. He saith not, And to seeds, as of many; but as of one, And to thy seed, which is Christ.",pt:"Ora, a Abra\xe3o e a seu descendente foram feitas as promessas; n\xe3o diz: E a seus descendentes, como falando de muitos, mas como de um s\xf3: E a teu descendente, que \xe9 Cristo."},{verse:17,en:"And this I say, that the covenant, that was confirmed before of God in Christ, the law, which was four hundred and thirty years after, cannot disannul, that it should make the promise of none effect.",pt:"E digo isto: Ao testamento anteriormente confirmado por Deus, a lei, que veio quatrocentos e trinta anos depois, n\xe3o invalida, de forma a tornar inoperante a promessa."},{verse:18,en:"For if the inheritance be of the law, it is no more of promise: but God gave it to Abraham by promise.",pt:"Pois se da lei prov\xe9m a heran\xe7a, j\xe1 n\xe3o prov\xe9m mais da promessa; mas Deus, pela promessa, a deu gratuitamente a Abra\xe3o."},{verse:19,en:"Wherefore then serveth the law? It was added because of transgressions, till the seed should come to whom the promise was made; and it was ordained by angels in the hand of a mediator.",pt:"Logo, para que \xe9 a lei? Foi acrescentada por causa das transgress\xf5es, at\xe9 que viesse o descendente a quem a promessa tinha sido feita; e foi ordenada por meio de anjos, pela m\xe3o de um mediador."},{verse:20,en:"Now a mediator is not a mediator of one, but God is one.",pt:"Ora, o mediador n\xe3o o \xe9 de um s\xf3, mas Deus \xe9 um s\xf3."},{verse:21,en:"Is the law then against the promises of God? God forbid: for if there had been a law given which could have given life, verily righteousness should have been by the law.",pt:"\xc9 a lei, ent\xe3o, contra as promessas de Deus? De modo nenhum; porque, se fosse dada uma lei que pudesse vivificar, a justi\xe7a, na verdade, teria sido pela lei."},{verse:22,en:"But the scripture hath concluded all under sin, that the promise by faith of Jesus Christ might be given to them that believe.",pt:"Mas a Escritura encerrou tudo debaixo do pecado, para que a promessa pela f\xe9 em Jesus Cristo fosse dada aos que cr\xeaem."},{verse:23,en:"But before faith came, we were kept under the law, shut up unto the faith which should afterwards be revealed.",pt:"Mas, antes que viesse a f\xe9, est\xe1vamos guardados debaixo da lei, encerrados para aquela f\xe9 que se havia de revelar."},{verse:24,en:"Wherefore the law was our schoolmaster to bring us unto Christ, that we might be justified by faith.",pt:"De modo que a lei se tornou nosso aio, para nos conduzir a Cristo, a fim de que pela f\xe9 f\xf4ssemos justificados."},{verse:25,en:"But after that faith is come, we are no longer under a schoolmaster.",pt:"Mas, depois que veio a f\xe9, j\xe1 n\xe3o estamos debaixo de aio."},{verse:26,en:"For ye are all the children of God by faith in Christ Jesus.",pt:"Pois todos sois filhos de Deus pela f\xe9 em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:27,en:"For as many of you as have been baptized into Christ have put on Christ.",pt:"Porque todos quantos fostes batizados em Cristo vos revestistes de Cristo."},{verse:28,en:"There is neither Jew nor Greek, there is neither bond nor free, there is neither male nor female: for ye are all one in Christ Jesus.",pt:"N\xe3o h\xe1 judeu nem grego; n\xe3o h\xe1 escravo nem livre; n\xe3o h\xe1 homem nem mulher; porque todos v\xf3s sois um em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:29,en:"And if ye be Christ\u2019s, then are ye Abraham\u2019s seed, and heirs according to the promise.",pt:"E, se sois de Cristo, ent\xe3o sois descend\xeancia de Abra\xe3o, e herdeiros conforme a promessa."}]}}),734,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now I say, That the heir, as long as he is a child, differeth nothing from a servant, though he be lord of all;",pt:"Ora, digo que por todo o tempo em que o herdeiro \xe9 menino, em nada difere de um servo, ainda que seja senhor de tudo;"},{verse:2,en:"But is under tutors and governors until the time appointed of the father.",pt:"mas est\xe1 debaixo de tutores e curadores at\xe9 o tempo determinado pelo pai."},{verse:3,en:"Even so we, when we were children, were in bondage under the elements of the world:",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m n\xf3s, quando \xe9ramos meninos, est\xe1vamos reduzidos \xe0 servid\xe3o debaixo dos rudimentos do mundo;"},{verse:4,en:"But when the fulness of the time was come, God sent forth his Son, made of a woman, made under the law,",pt:"mas, vindo a plenitude dos tempos, Deus enviou seu Filho, nascido de mulher, nascido debaixo de lei,"},{verse:5,en:"To redeem them that were under the law, that we might receive the adoption of sons.",pt:"para resgatar os que estavam debaixo de lei, a fim de recebermos a ado\xe7\xe3o de filhos."},{verse:6,en:"And because ye are sons, God hath sent forth the Spirit of his Son into your hearts, crying, Abba, Father.",pt:"E, porque sois filhos, Deus enviou aos nossos cora\xe7\xf5es o Esp\xedrito de seu Filho, que clama: Aba, Pai."},{verse:7,en:"Wherefore thou art no more a servant, but a son; and if a son, then an heir of God through Christ.",pt:"Portanto j\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9s mais servo, mas filho; e se \xe9s filho, \xe9s tamb\xe9m herdeiro por Deus."},{verse:8,en:"Howbeit then, when ye knew not God, ye did service unto them which by nature are no gods.",pt:"Outrora, quando n\xe3o conhec\xedeis a Deus, serv\xedeis aos que por natureza n\xe3o s\xe3o deuses;"},{verse:9,en:"But now, after that ye have known God, or rather are known of God, how turn ye again to the weak and beggarly elements, whereunto ye desire again to be in bondage?",pt:"agora, por\xe9m, que j\xe1 conheceis a Deus, ou, melhor, sendo conhecidos por Deus, como tornais outra vez a esses rudimentos fracos e pobres, aos quais de novo quereis servir?"},{verse:10,en:"Ye observe days, and months, and times, and years.",pt:"Guardais dias, e meses, e tempos, e anos."},{verse:11,en:"I am afraid of you, lest I have bestowed upon you labour in vain.",pt:"Temo a vosso respeito n\xe3o haja eu trabalhado em v\xe3o entre v\xf3s."},{verse:12,en:"Brethren, I beseech you, be as I am; for I am as ye are: ye have not injured me at all.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, rogo-vos que vos torneis como eu, porque tamb\xe9m eu me tornei como v\xf3s. Nenhum mal me fizestes;"},{verse:13,en:"Ye know how through infirmity of the flesh I preached the gospel unto you at the first.",pt:"e v\xf3s sabeis que por causa de uma enfermidade da carne vos anunciei o evangelho a primeira vez,"},{verse:14,en:"And my temptation which was in my flesh ye despised not, nor rejected; but received me as an angel of God, even as Christ Jesus.",pt:"e aquilo que na minha carne era para v\xf3s uma tenta\xe7\xe3o, n\xe3o o desprezastes nem o repelistes, antes me recebestes como a um anjo de Deus, mesmo como a Cristo Jesus."},{verse:15,en:"Where is then the blessedness ye spake of? for I bear you record, that, if it had been possible, ye would have plucked out your own eyes, and have given them to me.",pt:"Onde est\xe1, pois, aquela vossa satisfa\xe7\xe3o? Porque vos dou testemunho de que, se poss\xedvel fora, ter\xedeis arrancado os vossos olhos, e mos ter\xedeis dado."},{verse:16,en:"Am I therefore become your enemy, because I tell you the truth?",pt:"Tornei-me acaso vosso inimigo, porque vos disse a verdade?"},{verse:17,en:"They zealously affect you, but not well; yea, they would exclude you, that ye might affect them.",pt:"Eles vos procuram zelosamente n\xe3o com bons motivos, mas querem vos excluir, para que zelosamente os procureis a eles."},{verse:18,en:"But it is good to be zealously affected always in a good thing, and not only when I am present with you.",pt:"No que \xe9 bom, \xe9 bom serdes sempre procurados, e n\xe3o s\xf3 quando estou presente convosco."},{verse:19,en:"My little children, of whom I travail in birth again until Christ be formed in you,",pt:"Meus filhinhos, por quem de novo sinto as dores de parto, at\xe9 que Cristo seja formado em v\xf3s;"},{verse:20,en:"I desire to be present with you now, and to change my voice; for I stand in doubt of you.",pt:"eu bem quisera estar presente convosco agora, e mudar o tom da minha voz; porque estou perplexo a vosso respeito."},{verse:21,en:"Tell me, ye that desire to be under the law, do ye not hear the law?",pt:"Dizei-me, os que quereis estar debaixo da lei, n\xe3o ouvis v\xf3s a lei?"},{verse:22,en:"For it is written, that Abraham had two sons, the one by a bondmaid, the other by a freewoman.",pt:"Porque est\xe1 escrito que Abra\xe3o teve dois filhos, um da escrava, e outro da livre."},{verse:23,en:"But he who was of the bondwoman was born after the flesh; but he of the freewoman was by promise.",pt:"Todavia o que era da escrava nasceu segundo a carne, mas, o que era da livre, por promessa."},{verse:24,en:"Which things are an allegory: for these are the two covenants; the one from the mount Sinai, which gendereth to bondage, which is Agar.",pt:"O que se entende por alegoria: pois essas mulheres s\xe3o dois pactos; um do monte Sinai, que d\xe1 \xe0 luz filhos para a servid\xe3o, e que \xe9 Agar."},{verse:25,en:"For this Agar is mount Sinai in Arabia, and answereth to Jerusalem which now is, and is in bondage with her children.",pt:"Ora, esta Agar \xe9 o monte Sinai na Ar\xe1bia e corresponde \xe0 Jerusal\xe9m atual, pois \xe9 escrava com seus filhos."},{verse:26,en:"But Jerusalem which is above is free, which is the mother of us all.",pt:"Mas a Jerusal\xe9m que \xe9 de cima \xe9 livre; a qual \xe9 nossa m\xe3e."},{verse:27,en:"For it is written, Rejoice, thou barren that bearest not; break forth and cry, thou that travailest not: for the desolate hath many more children than she which hath an husband.",pt:"Pois est\xe1 escrito: Alegra-te, est\xe9ril, que n\xe3o d\xe1s \xe0 luz; esfor\xe7a-te e clama, tu que n\xe3o est\xe1s de parto; porque mais s\xe3o os filhos da desolada do que os da que tem marido."},{verse:28,en:"Now we, brethren, as Isaac was, are the children of promise.",pt:"Ora v\xf3s, irm\xe3os, sois filhos da promessa, como Isaque."},{verse:29,en:"But as then he that was born after the flesh persecuted him that was born after the Spirit, even so it is now.",pt:"Mas, como naquele tempo o que nasceu segundo a carne perseguia ao que nasceu segundo o Esp\xedrito, assim \xe9 tamb\xe9m agora."},{verse:30,en:"Nevertheless what saith the scripture? Cast out the bondwoman and her son: for the son of the bondwoman shall not be heir with the son of the free woman.",pt:"Que diz, por\xe9m, a Escritura? Lan\xe7a fora a escrava e seu filho, porque de modo algum o filho da escrava herdar\xe1 com o filho da livre."},{verse:31,en:"So then, brethren, we are not children of the bondwoman, but of the free.",pt:"Pelo que, irm\xe3os, n\xe3o somos filhos da escrava, mas da livre."}]}}),735,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,i,r){t.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Stand fast therefore in the liberty wherewith Christ hath made us free, and be not entangled again with the yoke of bondage.",pt:"Para a liberdade Cristo nos libertou; permanecei, pois, firmes e n\xe3o vos dobreis novamente a um jogo de escravid\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"Behold, I Paul say unto you, that if ye be circumcised, Christ shall profit you nothing.",pt:"Eis que eu, Paulo, vos digo que, se vos deixardes circuncidar, Cristo de nada vos aproveitar\xe1."},{verse:3,en:"For I testify again to every man that is circumcised, that he is a debtor to do the whole law.",pt:"E de novo testifico a todo homem que se deixa circuncidar, que est\xe1 obrigado a guardar toda a lei."},{verse:4,en:"Christ is become of no effect unto you, whosoever of you are justified by the law; ye are fallen from grace.",pt:"Separados estais de Cristo, v\xf3s os que vos justificais pela lei; da gra\xe7a deca\xedstes."},{verse:5,en:"For we through the Spirit wait for the hope of righteousness by faith.",pt:"N\xf3s, entretanto, pelo Esp\xedrito aguardamos a esperan\xe7a da justi\xe7a que prov\xe9m da f\xe9."},{verse:6,en:"For in Jesus Christ neither circumcision availeth any thing, nor uncircumcision; but faith which worketh by love.",pt:"Porque em Cristo Jesus nem a circuncis\xe3o nem a incircuncis\xe3o vale coisa alguma; mas sim a f\xe9 que opera pelo amor."},{verse:7,en:"Ye did run well; who did hinder you that ye should not obey the truth?",pt:"Corr\xedeis bem; quem vos impediu de obedecer \xe0 verdade?"},{verse:8,en:"This persuasion cometh not of him that calleth you.",pt:"Esta persuas\xe3o n\xe3o vem daquele que vos chama."},{verse:9,en:"A little leaven leaveneth the whole lump.",pt:"Um pouco de fermento leveda a massa toda."},{verse:10,en:"I have confidence in you through the Lord, that ye will be none otherwise minded: but he that troubleth you shall bear his judgment, whosoever he be.",pt:"Confio de v\xf3s, no Senhor, que de outro modo n\xe3o haveis de pensar; mas aquele que vos perturba, seja quem for, sofrer\xe1 a condena\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"And I, brethren, if I yet preach circumcision, why do I yet suffer persecution? then is the offence of the cross ceased.",pt:"Eu, por\xe9m, irm\xe3os, se \xe9 que prego ainda a circuncis\xe3o, por que ainda sou perseguido? Nesse caso o esc\xe2ndalo da cruz estaria aniquilado."},{verse:12,en:"I would they were even cut off which trouble you.",pt:"Oxal\xe1 se mutilassem aqueles que vos andam inquietando."},{verse:13,en:"For, brethren, ye have been called unto liberty; only use not liberty for an occasion to the flesh, but by love serve one another.",pt:"Porque v\xf3s, irm\xe3os, fostes chamados \xe0 liberdade. Mas n\xe3o useis da liberdade para dar ocasi\xe3o \xe0 carne, antes pelo amor servi-vos uns aos outros."},{verse:14,en:"For all the law is fulfilled in one word, even in this; Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself.",pt:"Pois toda a lei se cumpre numa s\xf3 palavra, a saber: Amar\xe1s ao teu pr\xf3ximo como a ti mesmo."},{verse:15,en:"But if ye bite and devour one another, take heed that ye be not consumed one of another.",pt:"Se v\xf3s, por\xe9m, vos mordeis e devorais uns aos outros, vede n\xe3o vos consumais uns aos outros."},{verse:16,en:"This I say then, Walk in the Spirit, and ye shall not fulfil the lust of the flesh.",pt:"Digo, por\xe9m: Andai pelo Esp\xedrito, e n\xe3o haveis de cumprir a cobi\xe7a da carne."},{verse:17,en:"For the flesh lusteth against the Spirit, and the Spirit against the flesh: and these are contrary the one to the other: so that ye cannot do the things that ye would.",pt:"Porque a carne luta contra o Esp\xedrito, e o Esp\xedrito contra a carne; e estes se op\xf5em um ao outro, para que n\xe3o fa\xe7ais o que quereis."},{verse:18,en:"But if ye be led of the Spirit, ye are not under the law.",pt:"Mas, se sois guiados pelo Esp\xedrito, n\xe3o estais debaixo da lei."},{verse:19,en:"Now the works of the flesh are manifest, which are these; Adultery, fornication, uncleanness, lasciviousness,",pt:"Ora, as obras da carne s\xe3o manifestas, as quais s\xe3o: a prostitui\xe7\xe3o, a impureza, a lasc\xedvia,"},{verse:20,en:"Idolatry, witchcraft, hatred, variance, emulations, wrath, strife, seditions, heresies,",pt:"a idolatria, a feiti\xe7aria, as inimizades, as contendas, os ci\xfames, as iras, as fac\xe7\xf5es, as dissens\xf5es, os partidos,"},{verse:21,en:"Envyings, murders, drunkenness, revellings, and such like: of the which I tell you before, as I have also told you in time past, that they which do such things shall not inherit the kingdom of God.",pt:"as invejas, as bebedices, as orgias, e coisas semelhantes a estas, contra as quais vos previno, como j\xe1 antes vos preveni, que os que tais coisas praticam n\xe3o herdar\xe3o o reino de Deus."},{verse:22,en:"But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, longsuffering, gentleness, goodness, faith,",pt:"Mas o fruto do Esp\xedrito \xe9: o amor, o gozo, a paz, a longanimidade, a benignidade, a bondade, a fidelidade."},{verse:23,en:"Meekness, temperance: against such there is no law.",pt:"a mansid\xe3o, o dom\xednio pr\xf3prio; contra estas coisas n\xe3o h\xe1 lei."},{verse:24,en:"And they that are Christ\u2019s have crucified the flesh with the affections and lusts.",pt:"E os que s\xe3o de Cristo Jesus crucificaram a carne com as suas paix\xf5es e concupisc\xeancias."},{verse:25,en:"If we live in the Spirit, let us also walk in the Spirit.",pt:"Se vivemos pelo Esp\xedrito, andemos tamb\xe9m pelo Esp\xedrito."},{verse:26,en:"Let us not be desirous of vain glory, provoking one another, envying one another.",pt:"N\xe3o nos tornemos vangloriosos, provocando-nos uns aos outros, invejando-nos uns aos outros."}]}}),736,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,r,t,n){r.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Brethren, if a man be overtaken in a fault, ye which are spiritual, restore such an one in the spirit of meekness; considering thyself, lest thou also be tempted.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, se um homem chegar a ser surpreendido em algum delito, v\xf3s que sois espirituais corrigi o tal com esp\xedrito de mansid\xe3o; e olha por ti mesmo, para que tamb\xe9m tu n\xe3o sejas tentado."},{verse:2,en:"Bear ye one another\u2019s burdens, and so fulfil the law of Christ.",pt:"Levai as cargas uns dos outros, e assim cumprireis a lei de Cristo."},{verse:3,en:"For if a man think himself to be something, when he is nothing, he deceiveth himself.",pt:"Pois, se algu\xe9m pensa ser alguma coisa, n\xe3o sendo nada, engana-se a si mesmo."},{verse:4,en:"But let every man prove his own work, and then shall he have rejoicing in himself alone, and not in another.",pt:"Mas prove cada um a sua pr\xf3pria obra, e ent\xe3o ter\xe1 motivo de gl\xf3ria somente em si mesmo, e n\xe3o em outrem;"},{verse:5,en:"For every man shall bear his own burden.",pt:"porque cada qual levar\xe1 o seu pr\xf3prio fardo."},{verse:6,en:"Let him that is taught in the word communicate unto him that teacheth in all good things.",pt:"E o que est\xe1 sendo instru\xeddo na palavra, fa\xe7a participante em todas as boas coisas aquele que o instrui."},{verse:7,en:"Be not deceived; God is not mocked: for whatsoever a man soweth, that shall he also reap.",pt:"N\xe3o vos enganeis; Deus n\xe3o se deixa escarnecer; pois tudo o que o homem semear, isso tamb\xe9m ceifar\xe1."},{verse:8,en:"For he that soweth to his flesh shall of the flesh reap corruption; but he that soweth to the Spirit shall of the Spirit reap life everlasting.",pt:"Porque quem semeia na sua carne, da carne ceifar\xe1 a corrup\xe7\xe3o; mas quem semeia no Esp\xedrito, do Esp\xedrito ceifar\xe1 a vida eterna."},{verse:9,en:"And let us not be weary in well doing: for in due season we shall reap, if we faint not.",pt:"E n\xe3o nos cansemos de fazer o bem, porque a seu tempo ceifaremos, se n\xe3o houvermos desfalecido."},{verse:10,en:"As we have therefore opportunity, let us do good unto all men, especially unto them who are of the household of faith.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, enquanto temos oportunidade, fa\xe7amos bem a todos, mas principamente aos dom\xe9sticos da f\xe9."},{verse:11,en:"Ye see how large a letter I have written unto you with mine own hand.",pt:"Vede com que grandes letras vos escrevo com minha pr\xf3pria m\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"As many as desire to make a fair shew in the flesh, they constrain you to be circumcised; only lest they should suffer persecution for the cross of Christ.",pt:"Todos os que querem ostentar boa apar\xeancia na carne, esses vos obrigam a circuncidar-vos, somente para n\xe3o serem perseguidos por causa da cruz de Cristo."},{verse:13,en:"For neither they themselves who are circumcised keep the law; but desire to have you circumcised, that they may glory in your flesh.",pt:"Porque nem ainda esses mesmos que se circuncidam guardam a lei, mas querem que vos circuncideis, para se gloriarem na vossa carne."},{verse:14,en:"But God forbid that I should glory, save in the cross of our Lord Jesus Christ, by whom the world is crucified unto me, and I unto the world.",pt:"Mas longe esteja de mim gloriar-me, a n\xe3o ser na cruz de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo, pela qual o mundo est\xe1 crucificado para mim e eu para o mundo."},{verse:15,en:"For in Christ Jesus neither circumcision availeth any thing, nor uncircumcision, but a new creature.",pt:"Pois nem a circuncis\xe3o nem a incircuncis\xe3o \xe9 coisa alguma, mas sim o ser uma nova criatura."},{verse:16,en:"And as many as walk according to this rule, peace be on them, and mercy, and upon the Israel of God.",pt:"E a todos quantos andarem conforme esta norma, paz e miseric\xf3rdia sejam sobre eles e sobre o Israel de Deus."},{verse:17,en:"From henceforth let no man trouble me: for I bear in my body the marks of the Lord Jesus.",pt:"Daqui em diante ningu\xe9m me moleste; porque eu trago no meu corpo as marcas de Jesus."},{verse:18,en:"Brethren, the grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit. Amen.",pt:"A gra\xe7a de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo seja, irm\xe3os, com o vosso esp\xedrito. Am\xe9m."}]}}),737,[]);
__d((function(a,e,o,s,n,t,r){n.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The book of the generation of Jesus Christ, the son of David, the son of Abraham.",pt:"Livro da genealogia de Jesus Cristo, filho de Davi, filho de Abra\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"Abraham begat Isaac; and Isaac begat Jacob; and Jacob begat Judas and his brethren;",pt:"A Abra\xe3o nasceu Isaque; a Isaque nasceu Jac\xf3; a Jac\xf3 nasceram Jud\xe1 e seus irm\xe3os;"},{verse:3,en:"And Judas begat Phares and Zara of Thamar; and Phares begat Esrom; and Esrom begat Aram;",pt:"a Jud\xe1 nasceram, de Tamar, Far\xe9s e Zar\xe1; a Far\xe9s nasceu Esrom; a Esrom nasceu Ar\xe3o;"},{verse:4,en:"And Aram begat Aminadab; and Aminadab begat Naasson; and Naasson begat Salmon;",pt:"a Ar\xe3o nasceu Aminadabe; a Aminadabe nasceu Nasom; a Nasom nasceu Salmom;"},{verse:5,en:"And Salmon begat Booz of Rachab; and Booz begat Obed of Ruth; and Obed begat Jesse;",pt:"a Salmom nasceu, de Raabe, Booz; a Booz nasceu, de Rute, Obede; a Obede nasceu Jess\xe9;"},{verse:6,en:"And Jesse begat David the king; and David the king begat Solomon of her that had been the wife of Urias;",pt:"e a Jess\xe9 nasceu o rei Davi. A Davi nasceu Salom\xe3o da que fora mulher de Urias;"},{verse:7,en:"And Solomon begat Roboam; and Roboam begat Abia; and Abia begat Asa;",pt:"a Salom\xe3o nasceu Robo\xe3o; a Robo\xe3o nasceu Abias; a Abias nasceu Asafe;"},{verse:8,en:"And Asa begat Josaphat; and Josaphat begat Joram; and Joram begat Ozias;",pt:"a Asafe nasceu Josaf\xe1; a Josaf\xe1 nasceu Jor\xe3o; a Jor\xe3o nasceu Ozias;"},{verse:9,en:"And Ozias begat Joatham; and Joatham begat Achaz; and Achaz begat Ezekias;",pt:"a Ozias nasceu Joat\xe3o; a Joat\xe3o nasceu Acaz; a Acaz nasceu Ezequias;"},{verse:10,en:"And Ezekias begat Manasses; and Manasses begat Amon; and Amon begat Josias;",pt:"a Ezequias nasceu Manass\xe9s; a Manass\xe9s nasceu Amom; a Amom nasceu Josias;"},{verse:11,en:"And Josias begat Jechonias and his brethren, about the time they were carried away to Babylon:",pt:"a Josias nasceram Jeconias e seus irm\xe3os, no tempo da deporta\xe7\xe3o para Babil\xf4nia."},{verse:12,en:"And after they were brought to Babylon, Jechonias begat Salathiel; and Salathiel begat Zorobabel;",pt:"Depois da deporta\xe7\xe3o para Babil\xf4nia nasceu a Jeconias, Salatiel; a Salatiel nasceu Zorobabel;"},{verse:13,en:"And Zorobabel begat Abiud; and Abiud begat Eliakim; and Eliakim begat Azor;",pt:"a Zorobabel nasceu Abi\xfade; a Abi\xfade nasceu Eliaquim; a Eliaquim nasceu Azor;"},{verse:14,en:"And Azor begat Sadoc; and Sadoc begat Achim; and Achim begat Eliud;",pt:"a Azor nasceu Sadoque; a Sadoque nasceu Aquim; a Aquim nasceu Eli\xfade;"},{verse:15,en:"And Eliud begat Eleazar; and Eleazar begat Matthan; and Matthan begat Jacob;",pt:"a Eli\xfade nasceu Eleazar; a Eleazar nasceu Mat\xe3; a Mat\xe3 nasceu Jac\xf3;"},{verse:16,en:"And Jacob begat Joseph the husband of Mary, of whom was born Jesus, who is called Christ.",pt:"e a Jac\xf3 nasceu Jos\xe9, marido de Maria, da qual nasceu JESUS, que se chama Cristo."},{verse:17,en:"So all the generations from Abraham to David are fourteen generations; and from David until the carrying away into Babylon are fourteen generations; and from the carrying away into Babylon unto Christ are fourteen generations.",pt:"De sorte que todas as gera\xe7\xf5es, desde Abra\xe3o at\xe9 Davi, s\xe3o catorze gera\xe7\xf5es; e desde Davi at\xe9 a deporta\xe7\xe3o para Babil\xf4nia, catorze gera\xe7\xf5es; e desde a deporta\xe7\xe3o para Babil\xf4nia at\xe9 o Cristo, catorze gera\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:18,en:"Now the birth of Jesus Christ was on this wise: When as his mother Mary was espoused to Joseph, before they came together, she was found with child of the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Ora, o nascimento de Jesus Cristo foi assim: Estando Maria, sua m\xe3e, desposada com Jos\xe9, antes de se ajuntarem, ela se achou ter concebido do Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:19,en:"Then Joseph her husband, being a just man, and not willing to make her a publick example, was minded to put her away privily.",pt:"E como Jos\xe9, seu esposo, era justo, e n\xe3o a queria infamar, intentou deix\xe1-la secretamente."},{verse:20,en:"But while he thought on these things, behold, the angel of the Lord appeared unto him in a dream, saying, Joseph, thou son of David, fear not to take unto thee Mary thy wife: for that which is conceived in her is of the Holy Ghost.",pt:"E, projetando ele isso, eis que em sonho lhe apareceu um anjo do Senhor, dizendo: Jos\xe9, filho de Davi, n\xe3o temas receber a Maria, tua mulher, pois o que nela se gerou \xe9 do Esp\xedrito Santo;"},{verse:21,en:"And she shall bring forth a son, and thou shalt call his name JESUS: for he shall save his people from their sins.",pt:"ela dar\xe1 \xe0 luz um filho, a quem chamar\xe1s JESUS; porque ele salvar\xe1 o seu povo dos seus pecados."},{verse:22,en:"Now all this was done, that it might be fulfilled which was spoken of the Lord by the prophet, saying,",pt:"Ora, tudo isso aconteceu para que se cumprisse o que fora dito da parte do Senhor pelo profeta:"},{verse:23,en:"Behold, a virgin shall be with child, and shall bring forth a son, and they shall call his name Emmanuel, which being interpreted is, God with us.",pt:"Eis que a virgem conceber\xe1 e dar\xe1 \xe0 luz um filho, o qual ser\xe1 chamado EMANUEL, que traduzido \xe9: Deus conosco."},{verse:24,en:"Then Joseph being raised from sleep did as the angel of the Lord had bidden him, and took unto him his wife:",pt:"E Jos\xe9, tendo despertado do sono, fez como o anjo do Senhor lhe ordenara, e recebeu sua mulher;"},{verse:25,en:"And knew her not till she had brought forth her firstborn son: and he called his name JESUS.",pt:"e n\xe3o a conheceu enquanto ela n\xe3o deu \xe0 luz um filho; e p\xf4s-lhe o nome de JESUS."}]}}),738,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,r,n,s){r.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now when Jesus was born in Bethlehem of Judaea in the days of Herod the king, behold, there came wise men from the east to Jerusalem,",pt:"Tendo, pois, nascido Jesus em Bel\xe9m da Jud\xe9ia, no tempo do rei Herodes, eis que vieram do oriente a Jerusal\xe9m uns magos que perguntavam:"},{verse:2,en:"Saying, Where is he that is born King of the Jews? for we have seen his star in the east, and are come to worship him.",pt:"Onde est\xe1 aquele que \xe9 nascido rei dos judeus? pois do oriente vimos a sua estrela e viemos ador\xe1-lo."},{verse:3,en:"When Herod the king had heard these things, he was troubled, and all Jerusalem with him.",pt:"O rei Herodes, ouvindo isso, perturbou-se, e com ele toda a Jerusal\xe9m;"},{verse:4,en:"And when he had gathered all the chief priests and scribes of the people together, he demanded of them where Christ should be born.",pt:"e, reunindo todos os principais sacerdotes e os escribas do povo, perguntava-lhes onde havia de nascer o Cristo."},{verse:5,en:"And they said unto him, In Bethlehem of Judaea: for thus it is written by the prophet,",pt:"Responderam-lhe eles: Em Bel\xe9m da Jud\xe9ia; pois assim est\xe1 escrito pelo profeta:"},{verse:6,en:"And thou Bethlehem, in the land of Juda, art not the least among the princes of Juda: for out of thee shall come a Governor, that shall rule my people Israel.",pt:"E tu, Bel\xe9m, terra de Jud\xe1, de modo nenhum \xe9s a menor entre as principais cidades de Jud\xe1; porque de ti sair\xe1 o Guia que h\xe1 de apascentar o meu povo de Israel."},{verse:7,en:"Then Herod, when he had privily called the wise men, enquired of them diligently what time the star appeared.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Herodes chamou secretamente os magos, e deles inquiriu com precis\xe3o acerca do tempo em que a estrela aparecera;"},{verse:8,en:"And he sent them to Bethlehem, and said, Go and search diligently for the young child; and when ye have found him, bring me word again, that I may come and worship him also.",pt:"e enviando-os a Bel\xe9m, disse-lhes: Ide, e perguntai diligentemente pelo menino; e, quando o achardes, participai-mo, para que tamb\xe9m eu v\xe1 e o adore."},{verse:9,en:"When they had heard the king, they departed; and, lo, the star, which they saw in the east, went before them, till it came and stood over where the young child was.",pt:"Tendo eles, pois, ouvido o rei, partiram; e eis que a estrela que tinham visto quando no oriente ia adiante deles, at\xe9 que, chegando, se deteve sobre o lugar onde estava o menino."},{verse:10,en:"When they saw the star, they rejoiced with exceeding great joy.",pt:"Ao verem eles a estrela, regozijaram-se com grande alegria."},{verse:11,en:"And when they were come into the house, they saw the young child with Mary his mother, and fell down, and worshipped him: and when they had opened their treasures, they presented unto him gifts; gold, and frankincense, and myrrh.",pt:"E entrando na casa, viram o menino com Maria sua m\xe3e e, prostrando-se, o adoraram; e abrindo os seus tesouros, ofertaram-lhe d\xe1divas: ouro incenso e mirra."},{verse:12,en:"And being warned of God in a dream that they should not return to Herod, they departed into their own country another way.",pt:"Ora, sendo por divina revela\xe7\xe3o avisados em sonhos para n\xe3o voltarem a Herodes, regressaram \xe0 sua terra por outro caminho."},{verse:13,en:"And when they were departed, behold, the angel of the Lord appeareth to Joseph in a dream, saying, Arise, and take the young child and his mother, and flee into Egypt, and be thou there until I bring thee word: for Herod will seek the young child to destroy him.",pt:"E, havendo eles se retirado, eis que um anjo do Senhor apareceu a Jos\xe9 em sonho, dizendo: Levanta-te, toma o menino e sua m\xe3e, foge para o Egito, e ali fica at\xe9 que eu te fale; porque Herodes h\xe1 de procurar o menino para o matar."},{verse:14,en:"When he arose, he took the young child and his mother by night, and departed into Egypt:",pt:"Levantou-se, pois, tomou de noite o menino e sua m\xe3e, e partiu para o Egito."},{verse:15,en:"And was there until the death of Herod: that it might be fulfilled which was spoken of the Lord by the prophet, saying, Out of Egypt have I called my son.",pt:"e l\xe1 ficou at\xe9 a morte de Herodes, para que se cumprisse o que fora dito da parte do Senhor pelo profeta: Do Egito chamei o meu Filho."},{verse:16,en:"Then Herod, when he saw that he was mocked of the wise men, was exceeding wroth, and sent forth, and slew all the children that were in Bethlehem, and in all the coasts thereof, from two years old and under, according to the time which he had diligently enquired of the wise men.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Herodes, vendo que fora iludido pelos magos, irou-se grandemente e mandou matar todos os meninos de dois anos para baixo que havia em Bel\xe9m, e em todos os seus arredores, segundo o tempo que com precis\xe3o inquirira dos magos."},{verse:17,en:"Then was fulfilled that which was spoken by Jeremy the prophet, saying,",pt:"Cumpriu-se ent\xe3o o que fora dito pelo profeta Jeremias:"},{verse:18,en:"In Rama was there a voice heard, lamentation, and weeping, and great mourning, Rachel weeping for her children, and would not be comforted, because they are not.",pt:"Em Ram\xe1 se ouviu uma voz, lamenta\xe7\xe3o e grande pranto: Raquel chorando os seus filhos, e n\xe3o querendo ser consolada, porque eles j\xe1 n\xe3o existem."},{verse:19,en:"But when Herod was dead, behold, an angel of the Lord appeareth in a dream to Joseph in Egypt,",pt:"Mas tendo morrido Herodes, eis que um anjo do Senhor apareceu em sonho a Jos\xe9 no Egito,"},{verse:20,en:"Saying, Arise, and take the young child and his mother, and go into the land of Israel: for they are dead which sought the young child\u2019s life.",pt:"dizendo: Levanta-te, toma o menino e sua m\xe3e e vai para a terra de Israel; porque j\xe1 morreram os que procuravam a morte do menino."},{verse:21,en:"And he arose, and took the young child and his mother, and came into the land of Israel.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele se levantou, tomou o menino e sua m\xe3e e foi para a terra de Israel."},{verse:22,en:"But when he heard that Archelaus did reign in Judaea in the room of his father Herod, he was afraid to go thither: notwithstanding, being warned of God in a dream, he turned aside into the parts of Galilee:",pt:"Ouvindo, por\xe9m, que Arquelau reinava na Jud\xe9ia em lugar de seu pai Herodes, temeu ir para l\xe1; mas avisado em sonho por divina revela\xe7\xe3o, retirou-se para as regi\xf5es da Galil\xe9ia,"},{verse:23,en:"And he came and dwelt in a city called Nazareth: that it might be fulfilled which was spoken by the prophets, He shall be called a Nazarene.",pt:"e foi habitar numa cidade chamada Nazar\xe9; para que se cumprisse o que fora dito pelos profetas: Ele ser\xe1 chamado nazareno."}]}}),739,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"In those days came John the Baptist, preaching in the wilderness of Judaea,",pt:"Naqueles dias apareceu Jo\xe3o, o Batista, pregando no deserto da Jud\xe9ia,"},{verse:2,en:"And saying, Repent ye: for the kingdom of heaven is at hand.",pt:"dizendo: Arrependei-vos, porque \xe9 chegado o reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:3,en:"For this is he that was spoken of by the prophet Esaias, saying, The voice of one crying in the wilderness, Prepare ye the way of the Lord, make his paths straight.",pt:"Porque este \xe9 o anunciado pelo profeta Isa\xedas, que diz: Voz do que clama no deserto; Preparai o caminho do Senhor, endireitai as suas veredas."},{verse:4,en:"And the same John had his raiment of camel\u2019s hair, and a leathern girdle about his loins; and his meat was locusts and wild honey.",pt:"Ora, Jo\xe3o usava uma veste de pelos de camelo, e um cinto de couro em torno de seus lombos; e alimentava-se de gafanhotos e mel silvestre."},{verse:5,en:"Then went out to him Jerusalem, and all Judaea, and all the region round about Jordan,",pt:"Ent\xe3o iam ter com ele os de Jerusal\xe9m, de toda a Jud\xe9ia, e de toda a circunvizinhan\xe7a do Jord\xe3o,"},{verse:6,en:"And were baptized of him in Jordan, confessing their sins.",pt:"e eram por ele batizados no rio Jord\xe3o, confessando os seus pecados."},{verse:7,en:"But when he saw many of the Pharisees and Sadducees come to his baptism, he said unto them, O generation of vipers, who hath warned you to flee from the wrath to come?",pt:"Mas, vendo ele muitos dos fariseus e dos saduceus que vinham ao seu batismo, disse-lhes: Ra\xe7a de v\xedboras, quem vos ensinou a fugir da ira vindoura?"},{verse:8,en:"Bring forth therefore fruits meet for repentance:",pt:"Produzi, pois, frutos dignos de arrependimento,"},{verse:9,en:"And think not to say within yourselves, We have Abraham to our father: for I say unto you, that God is able of these stones to raise up children unto Abraham.",pt:"e n\xe3o queirais dizer dentro de v\xf3s mesmos: Temos por pai a Abra\xe3o; porque eu vos digo que mesmo destas pedras Deus pode suscitar filhos a Abra\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"And now also the axe is laid unto the root of the trees: therefore every tree which bringeth not forth good fruit is hewn down, and cast into the fire.",pt:"E j\xe1 est\xe1 posto o machado \xe1 raiz das \xe1rvores; toda \xe1rvore, pois que n\xe3o produz bom fruto, \xe9 cortada e lan\xe7ada no fogo."},{verse:11,en:"I indeed baptize you with water unto repentance: but he that cometh after me is mightier than I, whose shoes I am not worthy to bear: he shall baptize you with the Holy Ghost, and with fire:",pt:"Eu, na verdade, vos batizo em \xe1gua, na base do arrependimento; mas aquele que vem ap\xf3s mim \xe9 mais poderoso do que eu, que nem sou digno de levar-lhe as alparcas; ele vos batizar\xe1 no Esp\xedrito Santo, e em fogo."},{verse:12,en:"Whose fan is in his hand, and he will throughly purge his floor, and gather his wheat into the garner; but he will burn up the chaff with unquenchable fire.",pt:"A sua p\xe1 ele tem na m\xe3o, e limpar\xe1 bem a sua eira; recolher\xe1 o seu trigo ao celeiro, mas queimar\xe1 a palha em fogo inextingu\xedvel."},{verse:13,en:"Then cometh Jesus from Galilee to Jordan unto John, to be baptized of him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o veio Jesus da Galil\xe9ia ter com Jo\xe3o, junto do Jord\xe3o, para ser batizado por ele."},{verse:14,en:"But John forbad him, saying, I have need to be baptized of thee, and comest thou to me?",pt:"Mas Jo\xe3o o impedia, dizendo: Eu \xe9 que preciso ser batizado por ti, e tu vens a mim?"},{verse:15,en:"And Jesus answering said unto him, Suffer it to be so now: for thus it becometh us to fulfil all righteousness. Then he suffered him.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, lhe respondeu: Consente agora; porque assim nos conv\xe9m cumprir toda a justi\xe7a. Ent\xe3o ele consentiu."},{verse:16,en:"And Jesus, when he was baptized, went up straightway out of the water: and, lo, the heavens were opened unto him, and he saw the Spirit of God descending like a dove, and lighting upon him:",pt:"Batizado que foi Jesus, saiu logo da \xe1gua; e eis que se lhe abriram os c\xe9us, e viu o Esp\xedrito Santo de Deus descendo como uma pomba e vindo sobre ele;"},{verse:17,en:"And lo a voice from heaven, saying, This is my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased.",pt:"e eis que uma voz dos c\xe9us dizia: Este \xe9 o meu Filho amado, em quem me comprazo."}]}}),740,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then was Jesus led up of the Spirit into the wilderness to be tempted of the devil.",pt:"Ent\xe3o foi conduzido Jesus pelo Esp\xedrito ao deserto, para ser tentado pelo Diabo."},{verse:2,en:"And when he had fasted forty days and forty nights, he was afterward an hungred.",pt:"E, tendo jejuado quarenta dias e quarenta noites, depois teve fome."},{verse:3,en:"And when the tempter came to him, he said, If thou be the Son of God, command that these stones be made bread.",pt:"Chegando, ent\xe3o, o tentador, disse-lhe: Se tu \xe9s Filho de Deus manda que estas pedras se tornem em p\xe3es."},{verse:4,en:"But he answered and said, It is written, Man shall not live by bread alone, but by every word that proceedeth out of the mouth of God.",pt:"Mas Jesus lhe respondeu: Est\xe1 escrito: Nem s\xf3 de p\xe3o viver\xe1 o homem, mas de toda palavra que sai da boca de Deus."},{verse:5,en:"Then the devil taketh him up into the holy city, and setteth him on a pinnacle of the temple,",pt:"Ent\xe3o o Diabo o levou \xe0 cidade santa, colocou-o sobre o pin\xe1culo do templo,"},{verse:6,en:"And saith unto him, If thou be the Son of God, cast thyself down: for it is written, He shall give his angels charge concerning thee: and in their hands they shall bear thee up, lest at any time thou dash thy foot against a stone.",pt:"e disse-lhe: Se tu \xe9s Filho de Deus, lan\xe7a-te daqui abaixo; porque est\xe1 escrito: Aos seus anjos dar\xe1 ordens a teu respeito; e: eles te suster\xe3o nas m\xe3os, para que nunca tropeces em alguma pedra."},{verse:7,en:"Jesus said unto him, It is written again, Thou shalt not tempt the Lord thy God.",pt:"Replicou-lhe Jesus: Tamb\xe9m est\xe1 escrito: N\xe3o tentar\xe1s o Senhor teu Deus."},{verse:8,en:"Again, the devil taketh him up into an exceeding high mountain, and sheweth him all the kingdoms of the world, and the glory of them;",pt:"Novamente o Diabo o levou a um monte muito alto; e mostrou-lhe todos os reinos do mundo, e a gl\xf3ria deles;"},{verse:9,en:"And saith unto him, All these things will I give thee, if thou wilt fall down and worship me.",pt:"e disse-lhe: Tudo isto te darei, se, prostrado, me adorares."},{verse:10,en:"Then saith Jesus unto him, Get thee hence, Satan: for it is written, Thou shalt worship the Lord thy God, and him only shalt thou serve.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ordenou-lhe Jesus: Vai-te, Satan\xe1s; porque est\xe1 escrito: Ao Senhor teu Deus adorar\xe1s, e s\xf3 a ele servir\xe1s."},{verse:11,en:"Then the devil leaveth him, and, behold, angels came and ministered unto him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o Diabo o deixou; e eis que vieram os anjos e o serviram."},{verse:12,en:"Now when Jesus had heard that John was cast into prison, he departed into Galilee;",pt:"Ora, ouvindo Jesus que Jo\xe3o fora entregue, retirou-se para a Galil\xe9ia;"},{verse:13,en:"And leaving Nazareth, he came and dwelt in Capernaum, which is upon the sea coast, in the borders of Zabulon and Nephthalim:",pt:"e, deixando Nazar\xe9, foi habitar em Cafarnaum, cidade mar\xedtima, nos confins de Zabulom e Naftali;"},{verse:14,en:"That it might be fulfilled which was spoken by Esaias the prophet, saying,",pt:"para que se cumprisse o que fora dito pelo profeta Isa\xedas:"},{verse:15,en:"The land of Zabulon, and the land of Nephthalim, by the way of the sea, beyond Jordan, Galilee of the Gentiles;",pt:"A terra de Zabulom e a terra de Naftali, o caminho do mar, al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o, a Galil\xe9ia dos gentios,"},{verse:16,en:"The people which sat in darkness saw great light; and to them which sat in the region and shadow of death light is sprung up.",pt:"o povo que estava sentado em trevas viu uma grande luz; sim, aos que estavam sentados na regi\xe3o da sombra da morte, a estes a luz raiou."},{verse:17,en:"From that time Jesus began to preach, and to say, Repent: for the kingdom of heaven is at hand.",pt:"Desde ent\xe3o come\xe7ou Jesus a pregar, e a dizer: Arrependei- vos, porque \xe9 chegado o reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:18,en:"And Jesus, walking by the sea of Galilee, saw two brethren, Simon called Peter, and Andrew his brother, casting a net into the sea: for they were fishers.",pt:"E Jesus, andando ao longo do mar da Galil\xe9ia, viu dois irm\xe3os - Sim\xe3o, chamado Pedro, e seu irm\xe3o Andr\xe9, os quais lan\xe7avam a rede ao mar, porque eram pescadores."},{verse:19,en:"And he saith unto them, Follow me, and I will make you fishers of men.",pt:"Disse-lhes: Vinde ap\xf3s mim, e eu vos farei pescadores de homens."},{verse:20,en:"And they straightway left their nets, and followed him.",pt:"Eles, pois, deixando imediatamente as redes, o seguiram."},{verse:21,en:"And going on from thence, he saw other two brethren, James the son of Zebedee, and John his brother, in a ship with Zebedee their father, mending their nets; and he called them.",pt:"E, passando mais adiante, viu outros dois irm\xe3os - Tiago, filho de Zebedeu, e seu irm\xe3o Jo\xe3o, no barco com seu pai Zebedeu, consertando as redes; e os chamou."},{verse:22,en:"And they immediately left the ship and their father, and followed him.",pt:"Estes, deixando imediatamente o barco e seu pai, seguiram- no."},{verse:23,en:"And Jesus went about all Galilee, teaching in their synagogues, and preaching the gospel of the kingdom, and healing all manner of sickness and all manner of disease among the people.",pt:"E percorria Jesus toda a Galil\xe9ia, ensinando nas sinagogas, pregando o evangelho do reino, e curando todas as doen\xe7as e enfermidades entre o povo."},{verse:24,en:"And his fame went throughout all Syria: and they brought unto him all sick people that were taken with divers diseases and torments, and those which were possessed with devils, and those which were lunatick, and those that had the palsy; and he healed them.",pt:"Assim a sua fama correu por toda a S\xedria; e trouxeram-lhe todos os que padeciam, acometidos de v\xe1rias doen\xe7as e tormentos, os endemoninhados, os lun\xe1ticos, e os paral\xedticos; e ele os curou."},{verse:25,en:"And there followed him great multitudes of people from Galilee, and from Decapolis, and from Jerusalem, and from Judaea, and from beyond Jordan.",pt:"De sorte que o seguiam grandes multid\xf5es da Galil\xe9ia, de Dec\xe1polis, de Jerusal\xe9m, da Jud\xe9ia, e dal\xe9m do Jord\xe3o."}]}}),741,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,i){s.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And seeing the multitudes, he went up into a mountain: and when he was set, his disciples came unto him:",pt:"Jesus, pois, vendo as multid\xf5es, subiu ao monte; e, tendo se assentado, aproximaram-se os seus disc\xedpulos,"},{verse:2,en:"And he opened his mouth, and taught them, saying,",pt:"e ele se p\xf4s a ensin\xe1-los, dizendo:"},{verse:3,en:"Blessed are the poor in spirit: for theirs is the kingdom of heaven.",pt:"Bem-aventurados os humildes de esp\xedrito, porque deles \xe9 o reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:4,en:"Blessed are they that mourn: for they shall be comforted.",pt:"Bem-aventurados os que choram, porque eles ser\xe3o consolados."},{verse:5,en:"Blessed are the meek: for they shall inherit the earth.",pt:"Bem-aventurados os mansos, porque eles herdar\xe3o a terra."},{verse:6,en:"Blessed are they which do hunger and thirst after righteousness: for they shall be filled.",pt:"Bem-aventurados os que t\xeam fome e sede de justi\xe7a porque eles ser\xe3o fartos."},{verse:7,en:"Blessed are the merciful: for they shall obtain mercy.",pt:"Bem-aventurados os misericordiosos, porque eles alcan\xe7ar\xe3o miseric\xf3rdia."},{verse:8,en:"Blessed are the pure in heart: for they shall see God.",pt:"Bem-aventurados os limpos de cora\xe7\xe3o, porque eles ver\xe3o a Deus."},{verse:9,en:"Blessed are the peacemakers: for they shall be called the children of God.",pt:"Bem-aventurados os pacificadores, porque eles ser\xe3o chamados filhos de Deus."},{verse:10,en:"Blessed are they which are persecuted for righteousness sake: for theirs is the kingdom of heaven.",pt:"Bem-aventurados os que s\xe3o perseguidos por causa da justi\xe7a, porque deles \xe9 o reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:11,en:"Blessed are ye, when men shall revile you, and persecute you, and shall say all manner of evil against you falsely, for my sake.",pt:"Bem-aventurados sois v\xf3s, quando vos injuriarem e perseguiram e, mentindo, disserem todo mal contra v\xf3s por minha causa."},{verse:12,en:"Rejoice, and be exceeding glad: for great is your reward in heaven: for so persecuted they the prophets which were before you.",pt:"Alegrai-vos e exultai, porque \xe9 grande o vosso galard\xe3o nos c\xe9us; porque assim perseguiram aos profetas que foram antes de v\xf3s."},{verse:13,en:"Ye are the salt of the earth: but if the salt have lost his savour, wherewith shall it be salted? it is thenceforth good for nothing, but to be cast out, and to be trodden under foot of men.",pt:"V\xf3s sois o sal da terra; mas se o sal se tornar ins\xedpido, com que se h\xe1 de restaurar-lhe o sabor? para nada mais presta, sen\xe3o para ser lan\xe7ado fora, e ser pisado pelos homens."},{verse:14,en:"Ye are the light of the world. A city that is set on an hill cannot be hid.",pt:"V\xf3s sois a luz do mundo. N\xe3o se pode esconder uma cidade situada sobre um monte;"},{verse:15,en:"Neither do men light a candle, and put it under a bushel, but on a candlestick; and it giveth light unto all that are in the house.",pt:"nem os que acendem uma candeia a colocam debaixo do alqueire, mas no velador, e assim ilumina a todos que est\xe3o na casa."},{verse:16,en:"Let your light so shine before men, that they may see your good works, and glorify your Father which is in heaven.",pt:"Assim resplande\xe7a a vossa luz diante dos homens, para que vejam as vossas boas obras, e glorifiquem a vosso Pai, que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us."},{verse:17,en:"Think not that I am come to destroy the law, or the prophets: I am not come to destroy, but to fulfil.",pt:"N\xe3o penseis que vim destruir a lei ou os profetas; n\xe3o vim destruir, mas cumprir."},{verse:18,en:"For verily I say unto you, Till heaven and earth pass, one jot or one tittle shall in no wise pass from the law, till all be fulfilled.",pt:"Porque em verdade vos digo que, at\xe9 que o c\xe9u e a terra passem, de modo nenhum passar\xe1 da lei um s\xf3 i ou um s\xf3 til, at\xe9 que tudo seja cumprido."},{verse:19,en:"Whosoever therefore shall break one of these least commandments, and shall teach men so, he shall be called the least in the kingdom of heaven: but whosoever shall do and teach them, the same shall be called great in the kingdom of heaven.",pt:"Qualquer, pois, que violar um destes mandamentos, por menor que seja, e assim ensinar aos homens, ser\xe1 chamado o menor no reino dos c\xe9us; aquele, por\xe9m, que os cumprir e ensinar ser\xe1 chamado grande no reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:20,en:"For I say unto you, That except your righteousness shall exceed the righteousness of the scribes and Pharisees, ye shall in no case enter into the kingdom of heaven.",pt:"Pois eu vos digo que, se a vossa justi\xe7a n\xe3o exceder a dos escribas e fariseus, de modo nenhum entrareis no reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:21,en:"Ye have heard that it was said by them of old time, Thou shalt not kill; and whosoever shall kill shall be in danger of the judgment:",pt:"Ouvistes que foi dito aos antigos: N\xe3o matar\xe1s; e, Quem matar ser\xe1 r\xe9u de ju\xedzo."},{verse:22,en:"But I say unto you, That whosoever is angry with his brother without a cause shall be in danger of the judgment: and whosoever shall say to his brother, Raca, shall be in danger of the council: but whosoever shall say, Thou fool, shall be in danger of hell fire.",pt:"Eu, por\xe9m, vos digo que todo aquele que se encolerizar contra seu irm\xe3o, ser\xe1 r\xe9u de ju\xedzo; e quem disser a seu irm\xe3o: Raca, ser\xe1 r\xe9u diante do sin\xe9drio; e quem lhe disser: Tolo, ser\xe1 r\xe9u do fogo do inferno."},{verse:23,en:"Therefore if thou bring thy gift to the altar, and there rememberest that thy brother hath ought against thee;",pt:"Portanto, se estiveres apresentando a tua oferta no altar, e a\xed te lembrares de que teu irm\xe3o tem alguma coisa contra ti,"},{verse:24,en:"Leave there thy gift before the altar, and go thy way; first be reconciled to thy brother, and then come and offer thy gift.",pt:"deixa ali diante do altar a tua oferta, e vai conciliar-te primeiro com teu irm\xe3o, e depois vem apresentar a tua oferta."},{verse:25,en:"Agree with thine adversary quickly, whiles thou art in the way with him; lest at any time the adversary deliver thee to the judge, and the judge deliver thee to the officer, and thou be cast into prison.",pt:"Concilia-te depressa com o teu advers\xe1rio, enquanto est\xe1s no caminho com ele; para que n\xe3o aconte\xe7a que o advers\xe1rio te entregue ao guarda, e sejas lan\xe7ado na pris\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"Verily I say unto thee, Thou shalt by no means come out thence, till thou hast paid the uttermost farthing.",pt:"Em verdade te digo que de maneira nenhuma sair\xe1s dali enquanto n\xe3o pagares o \xfaltimo ceitil."},{verse:27,en:"Ye have heard that it was said by them of old time, Thou shalt not commit adultery:",pt:"Ouvistes que foi dito: N\xe3o adulterar\xe1s."},{verse:28,en:"But I say unto you, That whosoever looketh on a woman to lust after her hath committed adultery with her already in his heart.",pt:"Eu, por\xe9m, vos digo que todo aquele que olhar para uma mulher para a cobi\xe7ar, j\xe1 em seu cora\xe7\xe3o cometeu adult\xe9rio com ela."},{verse:29,en:"And if thy right eye offend thee, pluck it out, and cast it from thee: for it is profitable for thee that one of thy members should perish, and not that thy whole body should be cast into hell.",pt:"Se o teu olho direito te faz trope\xe7ar, arranca-o e lan\xe7a-o de ti; pois te \xe9 melhor que se perca um dos teus membros do que seja todo o teu corpo lan\xe7ado no inferno."},{verse:30,en:"And if thy right hand offend thee, cut if off, and cast it from thee: for it is profitable for thee that one of thy members should perish, and not that thy whole body should be cast into hell.",pt:"E, se a tua m\xe3o direita te faz trope\xe7ar, corta-a e lan\xe7a-a de ti; pois te \xe9 melhor que se perca um dos teus membros do que v\xe1 todo o teu corpo para o inferno."},{verse:31,en:"It hath been said, Whosoever shall put away his wife, let him give her a writing of divorcement:",pt:"Tamb\xe9m foi dito: Quem repudiar sua mulher, d\xea-lhe carta de div\xf3rcio."},{verse:32,en:"But I say unto you, That whosoever shall put away his wife, saving for the cause of fornication, causeth her to commit adultery: and whosoever shall marry her that is divorced committeth adultery.",pt:"Eu, por\xe9m, vos digo que todo aquele que repudia sua mulher, a n\xe3o ser por causa de infidelidade, a faz ad\xfaltera; e quem casar com a repudiada, comete adult\xe9rio."},{verse:33,en:"Again, ye have heard that it hath been said by them of old time, Thou shalt not forswear thyself, but shalt perform unto the Lord thine oaths:",pt:"Outrossim, ouvistes que foi dito aos antigos: N\xe3o jurar\xe1s falso, mas cumprir\xe1s para com o Senhor os teus juramentos."},{verse:34,en:"But I say unto you, Swear not at all; neither by heaven; for it is God\u2019s throne:",pt:"Eu, por\xe9m, vos digo que de maneira nenhuma jureis; nem pelo c\xe9u, porque \xe9 o trono de Deus;"},{verse:35,en:"Nor by the earth; for it is his footstool: neither by Jerusalem; for it is the city of the great King.",pt:"nem pela terra, porque \xe9 o escabelo de seus p\xe9s; nem por Jerusal\xe9m, porque \xe9 a cidade do grande Rei;"},{verse:36,en:"Neither shalt thou swear by thy head, because thou canst not make one hair white or black.",pt:"nem jures pela tua cabe\xe7a, porque n\xe3o podes tornar um s\xf3 cabelo branco ou preto."},{verse:37,en:"But let your communication be, Yea, yea; Nay, nay: for whatsoever is more than these cometh of evil.",pt:"Seja, por\xe9m, o vosso falar: Sim, sim; n\xe3o, n\xe3o; pois o que passa da\xed, vem do Maligno."},{verse:38,en:"Ye have heard that it hath been said, An eye for an eye, and a tooth for a tooth:",pt:"Ouvistes que foi dito: Olho por olho, e dente por dente."},{verse:39,en:"But I say unto you, That ye resist not evil: but whosoever shall smite thee on thy right cheek, turn to him the other also.",pt:"Eu, por\xe9m, vos digo que n\xe3o resistais ao homem mau; mas a qualquer que te bater na face direita, oferece-lhe tamb\xe9m a outra;"},{verse:40,en:"And if any man will sue thee at the law, and take away thy coat, let him have thy cloke also.",pt:"e ao que quiser pleitear contigo, e tirar-te a t\xfanica, larga-lhe tamb\xe9m a capa;"},{verse:41,en:"And whosoever shall compel thee to go a mile, go with him twain.",pt:"e, se qualquer te obrigar a caminhar mil passos, vai com ele dois mil."},{verse:42,en:"Give to him that asketh thee, and from him that would borrow of thee turn not thou away.",pt:"D\xe1 a quem te pedir, e n\xe3o voltes as costas ao que quiser que lhe emprestes."},{verse:43,en:"Ye have heard that it hath been said, Thou shalt love thy neighbour, and hate thine enemy.",pt:"Ouvistes que foi dito: Amar\xe1s ao teu pr\xf3ximo, e odiar\xe1s ao teu inimigo."},{verse:44,en:"But I say unto you, Love your enemies, bless them that curse you, do good to them that hate you, and pray for them which despitefully use you, and persecute you;",pt:"Eu, por\xe9m, vos digo: Amai aos vossos inimigos, e orai pelos que vos perseguem;"},{verse:45,en:"That ye may be the children of your Father which is in heaven: for he maketh his sun to rise on the evil and on the good, and sendeth rain on the just and on the unjust.",pt:"para que vos torneis filhos do vosso Pai que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us; porque ele faz nascer o seu sol sobre maus e bons, e faz chover sobre justos e injustos."},{verse:46,en:"For if ye love them which love you, what reward have ye? do not even the publicans the same?",pt:"Pois, se amardes aos que vos amam, que recompensa tereis? n\xe3o fazem os publicanos tamb\xe9m o mesmo?"},{verse:47,en:"And if ye salute your brethren only, what do ye more than others? do not even the publicans so?",pt:"E, se saudardes somente os vossos irm\xe3os, que fazeis demais? n\xe3o fazem os gentios tamb\xe9m o mesmo?"},{verse:48,en:"Be ye therefore perfect, even as your Father which is in heaven is perfect.",pt:"Sede v\xf3s, pois, perfeitos, como \xe9 perfeito o vosso Pai celestial."}]}}),742,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Take heed that ye do not your alms before men, to be seen of them: otherwise ye have no reward of your Father which is in heaven.",pt:"Guardai-vos de fazer as vossas boas obras diante dos homens, para serdes vistos por eles; de outra sorte n\xe3o tereis recompensa junto de vosso Pai, que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us."},{verse:2,en:"Therefore when thou doest thine alms, do not sound a trumpet before thee, as the hypocrites do in the synagogues and in the streets, that they may have glory of men. Verily I say unto you, They have their reward.",pt:"Quando, pois, deres esmola, n\xe3o fa\xe7as tocar trombeta diante de ti, como fazem os hip\xf3critas nas sinagogas e nas ruas, para serem glorificados pelos homens. Em verdade vos digo que j\xe1 receberam a sua recompensa."},{verse:3,en:"But when thou doest alms, let not thy left hand know what thy right hand doeth:",pt:"Mas, quando tu deres esmola, n\xe3o saiba a tua m\xe3o esquerda o que faz a direita;"},{verse:4,en:"That thine alms may be in secret: and thy Father which seeth in secret himself shall reward thee openly.",pt:"para que a tua esmola fique em secreto; e teu Pai, que v\xea em secreto, te recompensar\xe1."},{verse:5,en:"And when thou prayest, thou shalt not be as the hypocrites are: for they love to pray standing in the synagogues and in the corners of the streets, that they may be seen of men. Verily I say unto you, They have their reward.",pt:"E, quando orardes, n\xe3o sejais como os hip\xf3critas; pois gostam de orar em p\xe9 nas sinagogas, e \xe0s esquinas das ruas, para serem vistos pelos homens. Em verdade vos digo que j\xe1 receberam a sua recompensa."},{verse:6,en:"But thou, when thou prayest, enter into thy closet, and when thou hast shut thy door, pray to thy Father which is in secret; and thy Father which seeth in secret shall reward thee openly.",pt:"Mas tu, quando orares, entra no teu quarto e, fechando a porta, ora a teu Pai que est\xe1 em secreto; e teu Pai, que v\xea em secreto, te recompensar\xe1."},{verse:7,en:"But when ye pray, use not vain repetitions, as the heathen do: for they think that they shall be heard for their much speaking.",pt:"E, orando, n\xe3o useis de v\xe3s repeti\xe7\xf5es, como os gentios; porque pensam que pelo seu muito falar ser\xe3o ouvidos."},{verse:8,en:"Be not ye therefore like unto them: for your Father knoweth what things ye have need of, before ye ask him.",pt:"N\xe3o vos assemelheis, pois, a eles; porque vosso Pai sabe o que vos \xe9 necess\xe1rio, antes de v\xf3s lho pedirdes."},{verse:9,en:"After this manner therefore pray ye: Our Father which art in heaven, Hallowed be thy name.",pt:"Portanto, orai v\xf3s deste modo: Pai nosso que est\xe1s nos c\xe9us, santificado seja o teu nome;"},{verse:10,en:"Thy kingdom come. Thy will be done in earth, as it is in heaven.",pt:"venha o teu reino, seja feita a tua vontade, assim na terra como no c\xe9u;"},{verse:11,en:"Give us this day our daily bread.",pt:"o p\xe3o nosso de cada dia nos d\xe1 hoje;"},{verse:12,en:"And forgive us our debts, as we forgive our debtors.",pt:"e perdoa-nos as nossas d\xedvidas, assim como n\xf3s tamb\xe9m temos perdoado aos nossos devedores;"},{verse:13,en:"And lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from evil: For thine is the kingdom, and the power, and the glory, for ever. Amen.",pt:"e n\xe3o nos deixes entrar em tenta\xe7\xe3o; mas livra-nos do mal. [Porque teu \xe9 o reino e o poder, e a gl\xf3ria, para sempre, Am\xe9m.]"},{verse:14,en:"For if ye forgive men their trespasses, your heavenly Father will also forgive you:",pt:"Porque, se perdoardes aos homens as suas ofensas, tamb\xe9m vosso Pai celestial vos perdoar\xe1 a v\xf3s;"},{verse:15,en:"But if ye forgive not men their trespasses, neither will your Father forgive your trespasses.",pt:"se, por\xe9m, n\xe3o perdoardes aos homens, tampouco vosso Pai perdoar\xe1 vossas ofensas."},{verse:16,en:"Moreover when ye fast, be not, as the hypocrites, of a sad countenance: for they disfigure their faces, that they may appear unto men to fast. Verily I say unto you, They have their reward.",pt:"Quando jejuardes, n\xe3o vos mostreis contristrados como os hip\xf3critas; porque eles desfiguram os seus rostos, para que os homens vejam que est\xe3o jejuando. Em verdade vos digo que j\xe1 receberam a sua recompensa."},{verse:17,en:"But thou, when thou fastest, anoint thine head, and wash thy face;",pt:"Tu, por\xe9m, quando jejuares, unge a tua cabe\xe7a, e lava o teu rosto,"},{verse:18,en:"That thou appear not unto men to fast, but unto thy Father which is in secret: and thy Father, which seeth in secret, shall reward thee openly.",pt:"para n\xe3o mostrar aos homens que est\xe1s jejuando, mas a teu Pai, que est\xe1 em secreto; e teu Pai, que v\xea em secreto, te recompensar\xe1."},{verse:19,en:"Lay not up for yourselves treasures upon earth, where moth and rust doth corrupt, and where thieves break through and steal:",pt:"N\xe3o ajunteis para v\xf3s tesouros na terra; onde a tra\xe7a e a ferrugem os consomem, e onde os ladr\xf5es minam e roubam;"},{verse:20,en:"But lay up for yourselves treasures in heaven, where neither moth nor rust doth corrupt, and where thieves do not break through nor steal:",pt:"mas ajuntai para v\xf3s tesouros no c\xe9u, onde nem a tra\xe7a nem a ferrugem os consumem, e onde os ladr\xf5es n\xe3o minam nem roubam."},{verse:21,en:"For where your treasure is, there will your heart be also.",pt:"Porque onde estiver o teu tesouro, a\xed estar\xe1 tamb\xe9m o teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"The light of the body is the eye: if therefore thine eye be single, thy whole body shall be full of light.",pt:"A candeia do corpo s\xe3o os olhos; de sorte que, se os teus olhos forem bons, todo teu corpo ter\xe1 luz;"},{verse:23,en:"But if thine eye be evil, thy whole body shall be full of darkness. If therefore the light that is in thee be darkness, how great is that darkness!",pt:"se, por\xe9m, os teus olhos forem maus, o teu corpo ser\xe1 tenebroso. Se, portanto, a luz que em ti h\xe1 s\xe3o trevas, qu\xe3o grandes s\xe3o tais trevas!"},{verse:24,en:"No man can serve two masters: for either he will hate the one, and love the other; or else he will hold to the one, and despise the other. Ye cannot serve God and mammon.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m pode servir a dois senhores; porque ou h\xe1 de odiar a um e amar o outro, ou h\xe1 de dedicar-se a um e desprezar o outro. N\xe3o podeis servir a Deus e \xe0s riquezas."},{verse:25,en:"Therefore I say unto you, Take no thought for your life, what ye shall eat, or what ye shall drink; nor yet for your body, what ye shall put on. Is not the life more than meat, and the body than raiment?",pt:"Por isso vos digo: N\xe3o estejais ansiosos quanto \xe0 vossa vida, pelo que haveis de comer, ou pelo que haveis de beber; nem, quanto ao vosso corpo, pelo que haveis de vestir. N\xe3o \xe9 a vida mais do que o alimento, e o corpo mais do que o vestu\xe1rio?"},{verse:26,en:"Behold the fowls of the air: for they sow not, neither do they reap, nor gather into barns; yet your heavenly Father feedeth them. Are ye not much better than they?",pt:"Olhai para as aves do c\xe9u, que n\xe3o semeiam, nem ceifam, nem ajuntam em celeiros; e vosso Pai celestial as alimenta. N\xe3o valeis v\xf3s muito mais do que elas?"},{verse:27,en:"Which of you by taking thought can add one cubit unto his stature?",pt:"Ora, qual de v\xf3s, por mais ansioso que esteja, pode acrescentar um c\xf4vado \xe0 sua estatura?"},{verse:28,en:"And why take ye thought for raiment? Consider the lilies of the field, how they grow; they toil not, neither do they spin:",pt:"E pelo que haveis de vestir, por que andais ansiosos? Olhai para os l\xedrios do campo, como crescem; n\xe3o trabalham nem fiam;"},{verse:29,en:"And yet I say unto you, That even Solomon in all his glory was not arrayed like one of these.",pt:"contudo vos digo que nem mesmo Salom\xe3o em toda a sua gl\xf3ria se vestiu como um deles."},{verse:30,en:"Wherefore, if God so clothe the grass of the field, which to day is, and to morrow is cast into the oven, shall he not much more clothe you, O ye of little faith?",pt:"Pois, se Deus assim veste a erva do campo, que hoje existe e amanh\xe3 \xe9 lan\xe7ada no forno, quanto mais a v\xf3s, homens de pouca f\xe9?"},{verse:31,en:"Therefore take no thought, saying, What shall we eat? or, What shall we drink? or, Wherewithal shall we be clothed?",pt:"Portanto, n\xe3o vos inquieteis, dizendo: Que havemos de comer? ou: Que havemos de beber? ou: Com que nos havemos de vestir?"},{verse:32,en:"(For after all these things do the Gentiles seek:) for your heavenly Father knoweth that ye have need of all these things.",pt:"(Pois a todas estas coisas os gentios procuram.) Porque vosso Pai celestial sabe que precisais de tudo isso."},{verse:33,en:"But seek ye first the kingdom of God, and his righteousness; and all these things shall be added unto you.",pt:"Mas buscai primeiro o seu reino e a sua justi\xe7a, e todas estas coisas vos ser\xe3o acrescentadas."},{verse:34,en:"Take therefore no thought for the morrow: for the morrow shall take thought for the things of itself. Sufficient unto the day is the evil thereof.",pt:"N\xe3o vos inquieteis, pois, pelo dia de amanh\xe3; porque o dia de amanh\xe3 cuidar\xe1 de si mesmo. Basta a cada dia o seu mal."}]}}),743,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Judge not, that ye be not judged.",pt:"N\xe3o julgueis, para que n\xe3o sejais julgados."},{verse:2,en:"For with what judgment ye judge, ye shall be judged: and with what measure ye mete, it shall be measured to you again.",pt:"Porque com o ju\xedzo com que julgais, sereis julgados; e com a medida com que medis vos medir\xe3o a v\xf3s."},{verse:3,en:"And why beholdest thou the mote that is in thy brother\u2019s eye, but considerest not the beam that is in thine own eye?",pt:"E por que v\xeas o argueiro no olho do teu irm\xe3o, e n\xe3o reparas na trave que est\xe1 no teu olho?"},{verse:4,en:"Or how wilt thou say to thy brother, Let me pull out the mote out of thine eye; and, behold, a beam is in thine own eye?",pt:"Ou como dir\xe1s a teu irm\xe3o: Deixa-me tirar o argueiro do teu olho, quando tens a trave no teu?"},{verse:5,en:"Thou hypocrite, first cast out the beam out of thine own eye; and then shalt thou see clearly to cast out the mote out of thy brother\u2019s eye.",pt:"Hip\xf3crita! tira primeiro a trave do teu olho; e ent\xe3o ver\xe1s bem para tirar o argueiro do olho do teu irm\xe3o."},{verse:6,en:"Give not that which is holy unto the dogs, neither cast ye your pearls before swine, lest they trample them under their feet, and turn again and rend you.",pt:"N\xe3o deis aos c\xe3es o que \xe9 santo, nem lanceis aos porcos as vossas p\xe9rolas, para n\xe3o acontecer que as calquem aos p\xe9s e, voltando-se, vos despedacem."},{verse:7,en:"Ask, and it shall be given you; seek, and ye shall find; knock, and it shall be opened unto you:",pt:"Ped\xed, e dar-se-vos-\xe1; buscai, e achareis; batei e abrir-se-vos-\xe1."},{verse:8,en:"For every one that asketh receiveth; and he that seeketh findeth; and to him that knocketh it shall be opened.",pt:"Pois todo o que pede, recebe; e quem busca, acha; e ao que bate, abrir-se-lhe-\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"Or what man is there of you, whom if his son ask bread, will he give him a stone?",pt:"Ou qual dentre v\xf3s \xe9 o homem que, se seu filho lhe pedir p\xe3o, lhe dar\xe1 uma pedra?"},{verse:10,en:"Or if he ask a fish, will he give him a serpent?",pt:"Ou, se lhe pedir peixe, lhe dar\xe1 uma serpente?"},{verse:11,en:"If ye then, being evil, know how to give good gifts unto your children, how much more shall your Father which is in heaven give good things to them that ask him?",pt:"Se v\xf3s, pois, sendo maus, sabeis dar boas d\xe1divas a vossos filhos, quanto mais vosso Pai, que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us, dar\xe1 boas coisas aos que lhas pedirem?"},{verse:12,en:"Therefore all things whatsoever ye would that men should do to you, do ye even so to them: for this is the law and the prophets.",pt:"Portanto, tudo o que v\xf3s quereis que os homens vos fa\xe7am, fazei-lho tamb\xe9m v\xf3s a eles; porque esta \xe9 a lei e os profetas."},{verse:13,en:"Enter ye in at the strait gate: for wide is the gate, and broad is the way, that leadeth to destruction, and many there be which go in thereat:",pt:"Entrai pela porta estreita; porque larga \xe9 a porta, e espa\xe7oso o caminho que conduz \xe0 perdi\xe7\xe3o, e muitos s\xe3o os que entram por ela;"},{verse:14,en:"Because strait is the gate, and narrow is the way, which leadeth unto life, and few there be that find it.",pt:"e porque estreita \xe9 a porta, e apertado o caminho que conduz \xe0 vida, e poucos s\xe3o os que a encontram."},{verse:15,en:"Beware of false prophets, which come to you in sheep\u2019s clothing, but inwardly they are ravening wolves.",pt:"Guardai-vos dos falsos profetas, que v\xeam a v\xf3s disfar\xe7ados em ovelhas, mas interiormente s\xe3o lobos devoradores."},{verse:16,en:"Ye shall know them by their fruits. Do men gather grapes of thorns, or figs of thistles?",pt:"Pelos seus frutos os conhecereis. Colhem-se, porventura, uvas dos espinheiros, ou figos dos abrolhos?"},{verse:17,en:"Even so every good tree bringeth forth good fruit; but a corrupt tree bringeth forth evil fruit.",pt:"Assim, toda \xe1rvore boa produz bons frutos; por\xe9m a \xe1rvore m\xe1 produz frutos maus."},{verse:18,en:"A good tree cannot bring forth evil fruit, neither can a corrupt tree bring forth good fruit.",pt:"Uma \xe1rvore boa n\xe3o pode dar maus frutos; nem uma \xe1rvore m\xe1 dar frutos bons."},{verse:19,en:"Every tree that bringeth not forth good fruit is hewn down, and cast into the fire.",pt:"Toda \xe1rvore que n\xe3o produz bom fruto \xe9 cortada e lan\xe7ada no fogo."},{verse:20,en:"Wherefore by their fruits ye shall know them.",pt:"Portanto, pelos seus frutos os conhecereis."},{verse:21,en:"Not every one that saith unto me, Lord, Lord, shall enter into the kingdom of heaven; but he that doeth the will of my Father which is in heaven.",pt:"Nem todo o que me diz: Senhor, Senhor! entrar\xe1 no reino dos c\xe9us, mas aquele que faz a vontade de meu Pai, que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us."},{verse:22,en:"Many will say to me in that day, Lord, Lord, have we not prophesied in thy name? and in thy name have cast out devils? and in thy name done many wonderful works?",pt:"Muitos me dir\xe3o naquele dia: Senhor, Senhor, n\xe3o profetizamos n\xf3s em teu nome? e em teu nome n\xe3o expulsamos dem\xf4nios? e em teu nome n\xe3o fizemos muitos milagres?"},{verse:23,en:"And then will I profess unto them, I never knew you: depart from me, ye that work iniquity.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes direi claramemnte: Nunca vos conheci; apartai-vos de mim, v\xf3s que praticais a iniquidade."},{verse:24,en:"Therefore whosoever heareth these sayings of mine, and doeth them, I will liken him unto a wise man, which built his house upon a rock:",pt:"Todo aquele, pois, que ouve estas minhas palavras e as p\xf5e em pr\xe1tica, ser\xe1 comparado a um homem prudente, que edificou a casa sobre a rocha."},{verse:25,en:"And the rain descended, and the floods came, and the winds blew, and beat upon that house; and it fell not: for it was founded upon a rock.",pt:"E desceu a chuva, correram as torrentes, sopraram os ventos, e bateram com \xedmpeto contra aquela casa; contudo n\xe3o caiu, porque estava fundada sobre a rocha."},{verse:26,en:"And every one that heareth these sayings of mine, and doeth them not, shall be likened unto a foolish man, which built his house upon the sand:",pt:"Mas todo aquele que ouve estas minhas palavras, e n\xe3o as p\xf5e em pr\xe1tica, ser\xe1 comparado a um homem insensato, que edificou a sua casa sobre a areia."},{verse:27,en:"And the rain descended, and the floods came, and the winds blew, and beat upon that house; and it fell: and great was the fall of it.",pt:"E desceu a chuva, correram as torrentes, sopraram os ventos, e bateram com \xedmpeto contra aquela casa, e ela caiu; e grande foi a sua queda."},{verse:28,en:"And it came to pass, when Jesus had ended these sayings, the people were astonished at his doctrine:",pt:"Ao concluir Jesus este discurso, as multid\xf5es se maravilhavam da sua doutrina;"},{verse:29,en:"For he taught them as one having authority, and not as the scribes.",pt:"porque as ensinava como tendo autoridade, e n\xe3o como os escribas."}]}}),744,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"When he was come down from the mountain, great multitudes followed him.",pt:"Quando Jesus desceu do monte, grandes multid\xf5es o seguiam."},{verse:2,en:"And, behold, there came a leper and worshipped him, saying, Lord, if thou wilt, thou canst make me clean.",pt:"E eis que veio um leproso e o adorava, dizendo: Senhor, se quiseres, podes tornar-me limpo."},{verse:3,en:"And Jesus put forth his hand, and touched him, saying, I will; be thou clean. And immediately his leprosy was cleansed.",pt:"Jesus, pois, estendendo a m\xe3o, tocou-o, dizendo: Quero; s\xea limpo. No mesmo instante ficou purificado da sua lepra."},{verse:4,en:"And Jesus saith unto him, See thou tell no man; but go thy way, shew thyself to the priest, and offer the gift that Moses commanded, for a testimony unto them.",pt:"Disse-lhe ent\xe3o Jesus: Olha, n\xe3o contes isto a ningu\xe9m; mas vai, mostra-te ao sacerdote, e apresenta a oferta que Mois\xe9s determinou, para lhes servir de testemunho."},{verse:5,en:"And when Jesus was entered into Capernaum, there came unto him a centurion, beseeching him,",pt:"Tendo Jesus entrado em Cafarnaum, chegou-se a ele um centuri\xe3o que lhe rogava, dizendo:"},{verse:6,en:"And saying, Lord, my servant lieth at home sick of the palsy, grievously tormented.",pt:"Senhor, o meu criado jaz em casa paral\xedtico, e horrivelmente atormentado."},{verse:7,en:"And Jesus saith unto him, I will come and heal him.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Eu irei, e o curarei."},{verse:8,en:"The centurion answered and said, Lord, I am not worthy that thou shouldest come under my roof: but speak the word only, and my servant shall be healed.",pt:"O centuri\xe3o, por\xe9m, replicou-lhe: Senhor, n\xe3o sou digno de que entres debaixo do meu telhado; mas somente dize uma palavra, e o meu criado h\xe1 de sarar."},{verse:9,en:"For I am a man under authority, having soldiers under me: and I say to this man, Go, and he goeth; and to another, Come, and he cometh; and to my servant, Do this, and he doeth it.",pt:"Pois tamb\xe9m eu sou homem sujeito \xe0 autoridade, e tenho soldados \xe0s minhas ordens; e digo a este: Vai, e ele vai; e a outro: Vem, e ele vem; e ao meu servo: Faze isto, e ele o faz."},{verse:10,en:"When Jesus heard it, he marvelled, and said to them that followed, Verily I say unto you, I have not found so great faith, no, not in Israel.",pt:"Jesus, ouvindo isso, admirou-se, e disse aos que o seguiam: Em verdade vos digo que a ningu\xe9m encontrei em Israel com tamanha f\xe9."},{verse:11,en:"And I say unto you, That many shall come from the east and west, and shall sit down with Abraham, and Isaac, and Jacob, in the kingdom of heaven.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m vos digo que muitos vir\xe3o do oriente e do ocidente, e reclinar-se-\xe3o \xe0 mesa de Abra\xe3o, Isaque e Jac\xf3, no reino dos c\xe9us;"},{verse:12,en:"But the children of the kingdom shall be cast out into outer darkness: there shall be weeping and gnashing of teeth.",pt:"mas os filhos do reino ser\xe3o lan\xe7ados nas trevas exteriores; ali haver\xe1 choro e ranger de dentes."},{verse:13,en:"And Jesus said unto the centurion, Go thy way; and as thou hast believed, so be it done unto thee. And his servant was healed in the selfsame hour.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse Jesus ao centuri\xe3o: Vai-te, e te seja feito assim como creste. E naquela mesma hora o seu criado sarou."},{verse:14,en:"And when Jesus was come into Peter\u2019s house, he saw his wife\u2019s mother laid, and sick of a fever.",pt:"Ora, tendo Jesus entrado na casa de Pedro, viu a sogra deste de cama; e com febre."},{verse:15,en:"And he touched her hand, and the fever left her: and she arose, and ministered unto them.",pt:"E tocou-lhe a m\xe3o, e a febre a deixou; ent\xe3o ela se levantou, e o servia."},{verse:16,en:"When the even was come, they brought unto him many that were possessed with devils: and he cast out the spirits with his word, and healed all that were sick:",pt:"Ca\xedda a tarde, trouxeram-lhe muitos endemoninhados; e ele com a sua palavra expulsou os esp\xedritos, e curou todos os enfermos;"},{verse:17,en:"That it might be fulfilled which was spoken by Esaias the prophet, saying, Himself took our infirmities, and bare our sicknesses.",pt:"para que se cumprisse o que fora dito pelo profeta Isa\xedas: Ele tomou sobre si as nossas enfermidades, e levou as nossas doen\xe7as."},{verse:18,en:"Now when Jesus saw great multitudes about him, he gave commandment to depart unto the other side.",pt:"Vendo Jesus uma multid\xe3o ao redor de si, deu ordem de partir para o outro lado do mar."},{verse:19,en:"And a certain scribe came, and said unto him, Master, I will follow thee whithersoever thou goest.",pt:"E, aproximando-se um escriba, disse-lhe: Mestre, seguir-te- ei para onde quer que fores."},{verse:20,en:"And Jesus saith unto him, The foxes have holes, and the birds of the air have nests; but the Son of man hath not where to lay his head.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: As raposas t\xeam covis, e as aves do c\xe9u t\xeam ninhos; mas o Filho do homem n\xe3o tem onde reclinar a cabe\xe7a."},{verse:21,en:"And another of his disciples said unto him, Lord, suffer me first to go and bury my father.",pt:"E outro de seus disc\xedpulos lhe disse: Senhor, permite-me ir primeiro sepultar meu pai."},{verse:22,en:"But Jesus said unto him, Follow me; and let the dead bury their dead.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, respondeu-lhe: Segue-me, e deixa os mortos sepultar os seus pr\xf3prios mortos."},{verse:23,en:"And when he was entered into a ship, his disciples followed him.",pt:"E, entrando ele no barco, seus disc\xedpulos o seguiram."},{verse:24,en:"And, behold, there arose a great tempest in the sea, insomuch that the ship was covered with the waves: but he was asleep.",pt:"E eis que se levantou no mar t\xe3o grande tempestade que o barco era coberto pelas ondas; ele, por\xe9m, estava dormindo."},{verse:25,en:"And his disciples came to him, and awoke him, saying, Lord, save us: we perish.",pt:"Os disc\xedpulos, pois, aproximando-se, o despertaram, dizendo: Salva-nos, Senhor, que estamos perecendo."},{verse:26,en:"And he saith unto them, Why are ye fearful, O ye of little faith? Then he arose, and rebuked the winds and the sea; and there was a great calm.",pt:"Ele lhes respondeu: Por que temeis, homens de pouca f\xe9? Ent\xe3o, levantando-se repreendeu os ventos e o mar, e seguiu-se grande bonan\xe7a."},{verse:27,en:"But the men marvelled, saying, What manner of man is this, that even the winds and the sea obey him!",pt:"E aqueles homens se maravilharam, dizendo: Que homem \xe9 este, que at\xe9 os ventos e o mar lhe obedecem?"},{verse:28,en:"And when he was come to the other side into the country of the Gergesenes, there met him two possessed with devils, coming out of the tombs, exceeding fierce, so that no man might pass by that way.",pt:"Tendo ele chegado ao outro lado, \xe0 terra dos gadarenos, sa\xedram-lhe ao encontro dois endemoninhados, vindos dos sepulcros; t\xe3o ferozes eram que ningu\xe9m podia passar por aquele caminho."},{verse:29,en:"And, behold, they cried out, saying, What have we to do with thee, Jesus, thou Son of God? art thou come hither to torment us before the time?",pt:"E eis que gritaram, dizendo: Que temos n\xf3s contigo, Filho de Deus? Vieste aqui atormentar-nos antes do tempo?"},{verse:30,en:"And there was a good way off from them an herd of many swine feeding.",pt:"Ora, a alguma dist\xe2ncia deles, andava pastando uma grande manada de porcos."},{verse:31,en:"So the devils besought him, saying, If thou cast us out, suffer us to go away into the herd of swine.",pt:"E os dem\xf4nios rogavam-lhe, dizendo: Se nos expulsas, manda- nos entrar naquela manada de porcos."},{verse:32,en:"And he said unto them, Go. And when they were come out, they went into the herd of swine: and, behold, the whole herd of swine ran violently down a steep place into the sea, and perished in the waters.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Ide. Ent\xe3o sa\xedram, e entraram nos porcos; e eis que toda a manada se precipitou pelo despenhadeiro no mar, perecendo nas \xe1guas."},{verse:33,en:"And they that kept them fled, and went their ways into the city, and told every thing, and what was befallen to the possessed of the devils.",pt:"Os pastores fugiram e, chegando \xe0 cidade, divulgaram todas estas coisas, e o que acontecera aos endemoninhados."},{verse:34,en:"And, behold, the whole city came out to meet Jesus: and when they saw him, they besought him that he would depart out of their coasts.",pt:"E eis que toda a cidade saiu ao encontro de Jesus; e vendo- o, rogaram-lhe que se retirasse dos seus termos."}]}}),745,[]);
__d((function(e,s,a,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he entered into a ship, and passed over, and came into his own city.",pt:"E entrando Jesus num barco, passou para o outro lado, e chegou \xe0 sua pr\xf3pria cidade."},{verse:2,en:"And, behold, they brought to him a man sick of the palsy, lying on a bed: and Jesus seeing their faith said unto the sick of the palsy; Son, be of good cheer; thy sins be forgiven thee.",pt:"E eis que lhe trouxeram um paral\xedtico deitado num leito. Jesus, pois, vendo-lhes a f\xe9, disse ao paral\xedtico: Tem \xe2nimo, filho; perdoados s\xe3o os teus pecados."},{verse:3,en:"And, behold, certain of the scribes said within themselves, This man blasphemeth.",pt:"E alguns dos escribas disseram consigo: Este homem blasfema."},{verse:4,en:"And Jesus knowing their thoughts said, Wherefore think ye evil in your hearts?",pt:"Mas Jesus, conhecendo-lhes os pensamentos, disse: Por que pensais o mal em vossos cora\xe7\xf5es?"},{verse:5,en:"For whether is easier, to say, Thy sins be forgiven thee; or to say, Arise, and walk?",pt:"Pois qual \xe9 mais f\xe1cil? dizer: Perdoados s\xe3o os teus pecados, ou dizer: Levanta-te e anda?"},{verse:6,en:"But that ye may know that the Son of man hath power on earth to forgive sins, (then saith he to the sick of the palsy,) Arise, take up thy bed, and go unto thine house.",pt:"Ora, para que saibais que o Filho do homem tem sobre a terra autoridade para perdoar pecados (disse ent\xe3o ao paral\xedtico): Levanta- te, toma o teu leito, e vai para tua casa."},{verse:7,en:"And he arose, and departed to his house.",pt:"E este, levantando-se, foi para sua casa."},{verse:8,en:"But when the multitudes saw it, they marvelled, and glorified God, which had given such power unto men.",pt:"E as multid\xf5es, vendo isso, temeram, e glorificaram a Deus, que dera tal autoridade aos homens."},{verse:9,en:"And as Jesus passed forth from thence, he saw a man, named Matthew, sitting at the receipt of custom: and he saith unto him, Follow me. And he arose, and followed him.",pt:"Partindo Jesus dali, viu sentado na coletoria um homem chamado Mateus, e disse-lhe: Segue-me. E ele, levantando-se, o seguiu."},{verse:10,en:"And it came to pass, as Jesus sat at meat in the house, behold, many publicans and sinners came and sat down with him and his disciples.",pt:"Ora, estando ele \xe0 mesa em casa, eis que chegaram muitos publicanos e pecadores, e se reclinaram \xe0 mesa juntamente com Jesus e seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:11,en:"And when the Pharisees saw it, they said unto his disciples, Why eateth your Master with publicans and sinners?",pt:"E os fariseus, vendo isso, perguntavam aos disc\xedpulos: Por que come o vosso Mestre com publicanos e pecadores?"},{verse:12,en:"But when Jesus heard that, he said unto them, They that be whole need not a physician, but they that are sick.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, ouvindo isso, respondeu: N\xe3o necessitam de m\xe9dico os s\xe3os, mas sim os enfermos."},{verse:13,en:"But go ye and learn what that meaneth, I will have mercy, and not sacrifice: for I am not come to call the righteous, but sinners to repentance.",pt:"Ide, pois, e aprendei o que significa: Miseric\xf3rdia quero, e n\xe3o sacrif\xedcios. Porque eu n\xe3o vim chamar justos, mas pecadores."},{verse:14,en:"Then came to him the disciples of John, saying, Why do we and the Pharisees fast oft, but thy disciples fast not?",pt:"Ent\xe3o vieram ter com ele os disc\xedpulos de Jo\xe3o, perguntando: Por que \xe9 que n\xf3s e os fariseus jejuamos, mas os teus disc\xedpulos n\xe3o jejuam?"},{verse:15,en:"And Jesus said unto them, Can the children of the bridechamber mourn, as long as the bridegroom is with them? but the days will come, when the bridegroom shall be taken from them, and then shall they fast.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Podem porventura ficar tristes os convidados \xe0s n\xfapcias, enquanto o noivo est\xe1 com eles? Dias vir\xe3o, por\xe9m, em que lhes ser\xe1 tirado o noivo, e ent\xe3o h\xe3o de jejuar."},{verse:16,en:"No man putteth a piece of new cloth unto an old garment, for that which is put in to fill it up taketh from the garment, and the rent is made worse.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m p\xf5e remendo de pano novo em vestido velho; porque semelhante remendo tira parte do vestido, e faz-se maior a rotura."},{verse:17,en:"Neither do men put new wine into old bottles: else the bottles break, and the wine runneth out, and the bottles perish: but they put new wine into new bottles, and both are preserved.",pt:"Nem se deita vinho novo em odres velhos; do contr\xe1rio se rebentam, derrama-se o vinho, e os odres se perdem; mas deita-se vinho novo em odres novos, e assim ambos se conservam."},{verse:18,en:"While he spake these things unto them, behold, there came a certain ruler, and worshipped him, saying, My daughter is even now dead: but come and lay thy hand upon her, and she shall live.",pt:"Enquanto ainda lhes dizia essas coisas, eis que chegou um chefe da sinagoga e o adorou, dizendo: Minha filha acaba de falecer; mas vem, imp\xf5e-lhe a tua m\xe3o, e ela viver\xe1."},{verse:19,en:"And Jesus arose, and followed him, and so did his disciples.",pt:"Levantou-se, pois, Jesus, e o foi seguindo, ele e os seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:20,en:"And, behold, a woman, which was diseased with an issue of blood twelve years, came behind him, and touched the hem of his garment:",pt:"E eis que certa mulher, que havia doze anos padecia de uma hemorragia, chegou por detr\xe1s dele e tocou-lhe a orla do manto;"},{verse:21,en:"For she said within herself, If I may but touch his garment, I shall be whole.",pt:"porque dizia consigo: Se eu t\xe3o-somente tocar-lhe o manto, ficarei s\xe3."},{verse:22,en:"But Jesus turned him about, and when he saw her, he said, Daughter, be of good comfort; thy faith hath made thee whole. And the woman was made whole from that hour.",pt:"Mas Jesus, voltando-se e vendo-a, disse: Tem \xe2nimo, filha, a tua f\xe9 te salvou. E desde aquela hora a mulher ficou s\xe3."},{verse:23,en:"And when Jesus came into the ruler\u2019s house, and saw the minstrels and the people making a noise,",pt:"Quando Jesus chegou \xe0 casa daquele chefe, e viu os tocadores de flauta e a multid\xe3o em alvoro\xe7o,"},{verse:24,en:"He said unto them, Give place: for the maid is not dead, but sleepeth. And they laughed him to scorn.",pt:"disse; Retirai-vos; porque a menina n\xe3o est\xe1 morta, mas dorme. E riam-se dele."},{verse:25,en:"But when the people were put forth, he went in, and took her by the hand, and the maid arose.",pt:"Tendo-se feito sair o povo, entrou Jesus, tomou a menina pela m\xe3o, e ela se levantou."},{verse:26,en:"And the fame hereof went abroad into all that land.",pt:"E espalhou-se a not\xedcia disso por toda aquela terra."},{verse:27,en:"And when Jesus departed thence, two blind men followed him, crying, and saying, Thou Son of David, have mercy on us.",pt:"Partindo Jesus dali, seguiram-no dois cegos, que clamavam, dizendo: Tem compaix\xe3o de n\xf3s, Filho de Davi."},{verse:28,en:"And when he was come into the house, the blind men came to him: and Jesus saith unto them, Believe ye that I am able to do this? They said unto him, Yea, Lord.",pt:"E, tendo ele entrado em casa, os cegos se aproximaram dele; e Jesus perguntou-lhes: Credes que eu posso fazer isto? Responderam- lhe eles: Sim, Senhor."},{verse:29,en:"Then touched he their eyes, saying, According to your faith be it unto you.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes tocou os olhos, dizendo: Seja-vos feito segundo a vossa f\xe9."},{verse:30,en:"And their eyes were opened; and Jesus straitly charged them, saying, See that no man know it.",pt:"E os olhos se lhes abriram. Jesus ordenou-lhes terminantemente, dizendo: Vede que ningu\xe9m o saiba."},{verse:31,en:"But they, when they were departed, spread abroad his fame in all that country.",pt:"Eles, por\xe9m, sa\xedram, e divulgaram a sua fama por toda aquela terra."},{verse:32,en:"As they went out, behold, they brought to him a dumb man possessed with a devil.",pt:"Enquanto esses se retiravam, eis que lhe trouxeram um homem mudo e endemoninhado."},{verse:33,en:"And when the devil was cast out, the dumb spake: and the multitudes marvelled, saying, It was never so seen in Israel.",pt:"E, expulso o dem\xf4nio, falou o mudo e as multid\xf5es se admiraram, dizendo: Nunca tal se viu em Israel."},{verse:34,en:"But the Pharisees said, He casteth out devils through the prince of the devils.",pt:"Os fariseus, por\xe9m, diziam: \xc9 pelo pr\xedncipe dos dem\xf4nios que ele expulsa os dem\xf4nios."},{verse:35,en:"And Jesus went about all the cities and villages, teaching in their synagogues, and preaching the gospel of the kingdom, and healing every sickness and every disease among the people.",pt:"E percorria Jesus todas as cidades e aldeias, ensinando nas sinagogas, pregando o evangelho do reino, e curando toda sorte de doen\xe7as e enfermidades."},{verse:36,en:"But when he saw the multitudes, he was moved with compassion on them, because they fainted, and were scattered abroad, as sheep having no shepherd.",pt:"Vendo ele as multid\xf5es, compadeceu-se delas, porque andavam desgarradas e errantes, como ovelhas que n\xe3o t\xeam pastor."},{verse:37,en:"Then saith he unto his disciples, The harvest truly is plenteous, but the labourers are few;",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse a seus disc\xedpulos: Na verdade, a seara \xe9 grande, mas os trabalhadores s\xe3o poucos."},{verse:38,en:"Pray ye therefore the Lord of the harvest, that he will send forth labourers into his harvest.",pt:"Rogai, pois, ao Senhor da seara que mande trabalhadores para a sua seara."}]}}),746,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And when he had called unto him his twelve disciples, he gave them power against unclean spirits, to cast them out, and to heal all manner of sickness and all manner of disease.",pt:"E, chamando a si os seus doze disc\xedpulos, deu-lhes autoridade sobre os esp\xedritos imundos, para expulsarem, e para curarem toda sorte de doen\xe7as e enfermidades."},{verse:2,en:"Now the names of the twelve apostles are these; The first, Simon, who is called Peter, and Andrew his brother; James the son of Zebedee, and John his brother;",pt:"Ora, os nomes dos doze ap\xf3stolos s\xe3o estes: primeiro, Sim\xe3o, chamado Pedro, e Andr\xe9, seu irm\xe3o; Tiago, filho de Zebedeu, e Jo\xe3o, seu irm\xe3o;"},{verse:3,en:"Philip, and Bartholomew; Thomas, and Matthew the publican; James the son of Alphaeus, and Lebbaeus, whose surname was Thaddaeus;",pt:"Felipe e Bartolomeu; Tom\xe9 e Mateus, o publicano; Tiago, filho de Alfeu, e Tadeu;"},{verse:4,en:"Simon the Canaanite, and Judas Iscariot, who also betrayed him.",pt:"Sim\xe3o Cananeu, e Judas Iscariotes, aquele que o traiu."},{verse:5,en:"These twelve Jesus sent forth, and commanded them, saying, Go not into the way of the Gentiles, and into any city of the Samaritans enter ye not:",pt:"A estes doze enviou Jesus, e ordenou-lhes, dizendo: N\xe3o ireis aos gentios, nem entrareis em cidade de samaritanos;"},{verse:6,en:"But go rather to the lost sheep of the house of Israel.",pt:"mas ide antes \xe0s ovelhas perdidas da casa de Israel;"},{verse:7,en:"And as ye go, preach, saying, The kingdom of heaven is at hand.",pt:"e indo, pregai, dizendo: \xc9 chegado o reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:8,en:"Heal the sick, cleanse the lepers, raise the dead, cast out devils: freely ye have received, freely give.",pt:"Curai os enfermos, ressuscitai os mortos, limpai os leprosos, expulsai os dem\xf4nios; de gra\xe7a recebestes, de gra\xe7a dai."},{verse:9,en:"Provide neither gold, nor silver, nor brass in your purses,",pt:"N\xe3o vos provereis de ouro, nem de prata, nem de cobre, em vossos cintos;"},{verse:10,en:"Nor scrip for your journey, neither two coats, neither shoes, nor yet staves: for the workman is worthy of his meat.",pt:"nem de alforje para o caminho, nem de duas t\xfanicas, nem de alparcas, nem de bord\xe3o; porque digno \xe9 o trabalhador do seu alimento."},{verse:11,en:"And into whatsoever city or town ye shall enter, enquire who in it is worthy; and there abide till ye go thence.",pt:"Em qualquer cidade ou aldeia em que entrardes, procurai saber quem nela \xe9 digno, e hospedai-vos a\xed at\xe9 que vos retireis."},{verse:12,en:"And when ye come into an house, salute it.",pt:"E, ao entrardes na casa, saudai-a;"},{verse:13,en:"And if the house be worthy, let your peace come upon it: but if it be not worthy, let your peace return to you.",pt:"se a casa for digna, des\xe7a sobre ela a vossa paz; mas, se n\xe3o for digna, torne para v\xf3s a vossa paz."},{verse:14,en:"And whosoever shall not receive you, nor hear your words, when ye depart out of that house or city, shake off the dust of your feet.",pt:"E, se ningu\xe9m vos receber, nem ouvir as vossas palavras, saindo daquela casa ou daquela cidade, sacudi o p\xf3 dos vossos p\xe9s."},{verse:15,en:"Verily I say unto you, It shall be more tolerable for the land of Sodom and Gomorrha in the day of judgment, than for that city.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que, no dia do ju\xedzo, haver\xe1 menos rigor para a terra de Sodoma e Gomorra do que para aquela cidade."},{verse:16,en:"Behold, I send you forth as sheep in the midst of wolves: be ye therefore wise as serpents, and harmless as doves.",pt:"Eis que vos envio como ovelhas ao meio de lobos; portanto, sede prudentes como as serpentes e simples como as pombas."},{verse:17,en:"But beware of men: for they will deliver you up to the councils, and they will scourge you in their synagogues;",pt:"Acautelai-vos dos homens; porque eles vos entregar\xe3o aos sin\xe9drios, e vos a\xe7oitar\xe3o nas suas sinagogas;"},{verse:18,en:"And ye shall be brought before governors and kings for my sake, for a testimony against them and the Gentiles.",pt:"e por minha causa sereis levados \xe0 presen\xe7a dos governadores e dos reis, para lhes servir de testemunho, a eles e aos gentios."},{verse:19,en:"But when they deliver you up, take no thought how or what ye shall speak: for it shall be given you in that same hour what ye shall speak.",pt:"Mas, quando vos entregarem, n\xe3o cuideis de como, ou o que haveis de falar; porque naquela hora vos ser\xe1 dado o que haveis de dizer."},{verse:20,en:"For it is not ye that speak, but the Spirit of your Father which speaketh in you.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o sois v\xf3s que falais, mas o Esp\xedrito de vosso Pai \xe9 que fala em v\xf3s."},{verse:21,en:"And the brother shall deliver up the brother to death, and the father the child: and the children shall rise up against their parents, and cause them to be put to death.",pt:"Um irm\xe3o entregar\xe1 \xe0 morte a seu irm\xe3o, e um pai a seu filho; e filhos se levantar\xe3o contra os pais e os matar\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"And ye shall be hated of all men for my name\u2019s sake: but he that endureth to the end shall be saved.",pt:"E sereis odiados de todos por causa do meu nome, mas aquele que perseverar at\xe9 o fim, esse ser\xe1 salvo."},{verse:23,en:"But when they persecute you in this city, flee ye into another: for verily I say unto you, Ye shall not have gone over the cities of Israel, till the Son of man be come.",pt:"Quando, por\xe9m, vos perseguirem numa cidade, fugi para outra; porque em verdade vos digo que n\xe3o acabareis de percorrer as cidades de Israel antes que venha o Filho do homem."},{verse:24,en:"The disciple is not above his master, nor the servant above his lord.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 o disc\xedpulo mais do que o seu mestre, nem o servo mais do que o seu senhor."},{verse:25,en:"It is enough for the disciple that he be as his master, and the servant as his lord. If they have called the master of the house Beelzebub, how much more shall they call them of his household?",pt:"Basta ao disc\xedpulo ser como seu mestre, e ao servo como seu senhor. Se chamaram Belzebu ao dono da casa, quanto mais aos seus dom\xe9sticos?"},{verse:26,en:"Fear them not therefore: for there is nothing covered, that shall not be revealed; and hid, that shall not be known.",pt:"Portanto, n\xe3o os temais; porque nada h\xe1 encoberto que n\xe3o haja de ser descoberto, nem oculto que n\xe3o haja de ser conhecido."},{verse:27,en:"What I tell you in darkness, that speak ye in light: and what ye hear in the ear, that preach ye upon the housetops.",pt:"O que vos digo \xe0s escuras, dizei-o \xe0s claras; e o que escutais ao ouvido, dos eirados pregai-o."},{verse:28,en:"And fear not them which kill the body, but are not able to kill the soul: but rather fear him which is able to destroy both soul and body in hell.",pt:"E n\xe3o temais os que matam o corpo, e n\xe3o podem matar a alma; temei antes aquele que pode fazer perecer no inferno tanto a alma como o corpo."},{verse:29,en:"Are not two sparrows sold for a farthing? and one of them shall not fall on the ground without your Father.",pt:"N\xe3o se vendem dois passarinhos por um asse? e nenhum deles cair\xe1 em terra sem a vontade de vosso Pai."},{verse:30,en:"But the very hairs of your head are all numbered.",pt:"E at\xe9 mesmo os cabelos da vossa cabe\xe7a est\xe3o todos contados."},{verse:31,en:"Fear ye not therefore, ye are of more value than many sparrows.",pt:"N\xe3o temais, pois; mais valeis v\xf3s do que muitos passarinhos."},{verse:32,en:"Whosoever therefore shall confess me before men, him will I confess also before my Father which is in heaven.",pt:"Portanto, todo aquele que me confessar diante dos homens, tamb\xe9m eu o confessarei diante de meu Pai, que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us."},{verse:33,en:"But whosoever shall deny me before men, him will I also deny before my Father which is in heaven.",pt:"Mas qualquer que me negar diante dos homens, tamb\xe9m eu o negarei diante de meu Pai, que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us."},{verse:34,en:"Think not that I am come to send peace on earth: I came not to send peace, but a sword.",pt:"N\xe3o penseis que vim trazer paz \xe0 terra; n\xe3o vim trazer paz, mas espada."},{verse:35,en:"For I am come to set a man at variance against his father, and the daughter against her mother, and the daughter in law against her mother in law.",pt:"Porque eu vim p\xf4r em dissens\xe3o o homem contra seu pai, a filha contra sua m\xe3e, e a nora contra sua sogra;"},{verse:36,en:"And a man\u2019s foes shall be they of his own household.",pt:"e assim os inimigos do homem ser\xe3o os da sua pr\xf3pria casa."},{verse:37,en:"He that loveth father or mother more than me is not worthy of me: and he that loveth son or daughter more than me is not worthy of me.",pt:"Quem ama o pai ou a m\xe3e mais do que a mim n\xe3o \xe9 digno de mim; e quem ama o filho ou a filha mais do que a mim n\xe3o \xe9 digno de mim."},{verse:38,en:"And he that taketh not his cross, and followeth after me, is not worthy of me.",pt:"E quem n\xe3o toma a sua cruz, e n\xe3o segue ap\xf3s mim, n\xe3o \xe9 digno de mim."},{verse:39,en:"He that findeth his life shall lose it: and he that loseth his life for my sake shall find it.",pt:"Quem achar a sua vida perd\xea-la-\xe1, e quem perder a sua vida por amor de mim ach\xe1-la-\xe1."},{verse:40,en:"He that receiveth you receiveth me, and he that receiveth me receiveth him that sent me.",pt:"Quem vos recebe, a mim me recebe; e quem me recebe a mim, recebe aquele que me enviou."},{verse:41,en:"He that receiveth a prophet in the name of a prophet shall receive a prophet\u2019s reward; and he that receiveth a righteous man in the name of a righteous man shall receive a righteous man\u2019s reward.",pt:"Quem recebe um profeta na qualidade de profeta, receber\xe1 a recompensa de profeta; e quem recebe um justo na qualidade de justo, receber\xe1 a recompensa de justo."},{verse:42,en:"And whosoever shall give to drink unto one of these little ones a cup of cold water only in the name of a disciple, verily I say unto you, he shall in no wise lose his reward.",pt:"E aquele que der at\xe9 mesmo um copo de \xe1gua fresca a um destes pequeninos, na qualidade de disc\xedpulo, em verdade vos digo que de modo algum perder\xe1 a sua recompensa."}]}}),747,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass, when Jesus had made an end of commanding his twelve disciples, he departed thence to teach and to preach in their cities.",pt:"Tendo acabado Jesus de dar instru\xe7\xf5es aos seus doze disc\xedpulos, partiu dali a ensinar e a pregar nas cidades da regi\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"Now when John had heard in the prison the works of Christ, he sent two of his disciples,",pt:"Ora, quando Jo\xe3o no c\xe1rcere ouviu falar das obras do Cristo, mandou pelos seus disc\xedpulos perguntar-lhe:"},{verse:3,en:"And said unto him, Art thou he that should come, or do we look for another?",pt:"\xc9s tu aquele que havia de vir, ou havemos de esperar outro?"},{verse:4,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, Go and shew John again those things which ye do hear and see:",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Ide contar a Jo\xe3o as coisas que ouvis e vedes:"},{verse:5,en:"The blind receive their sight, and the lame walk, the lepers are cleansed, and the deaf hear, the dead are raised up, and the poor have the gospel preached to them.",pt:"os cegos v\xeaem, e os coxos andam; os leprosos s\xe3o purificados, e os surdos ouvem; os mortos s\xe3o ressuscitados, e aos pobres \xe9 anunciado o evangelho."},{verse:6,en:"And blessed is he, whosoever shall not be offended in me.",pt:"E bem-aventurado \xe9 aquele que n\xe3o se escandalizar de mim."},{verse:7,en:"And as they departed, Jesus began to say unto the multitudes concerning John, What went ye out into the wilderness to see? A reed shaken with the wind?",pt:"Ao partirem eles, come\xe7ou Jesus a dizer \xe0s multid\xf5es a respeito de Jo\xe3o: que sa\xedstes a ver no deserto? um cani\xe7o agitado pelo vento?"},{verse:8,en:"But what went ye out for to see? A man clothed in soft raiment? behold, they that wear soft clothing are in kings\u2019 houses.",pt:"Mas que sa\xedstes a ver? um homem trajado de vestes luxuosas? Eis que aqueles que trajam vestes luxuosas est\xe3o nas casas dos reis."},{verse:9,en:"But what went ye out for to see? A prophet? yea, I say unto you, and more than a prophet.",pt:"Mas por que sa\xedstes? para ver um profeta? Sim, vos digo, e muito mais do que profeta."},{verse:10,en:"For this is he, of whom it is written, Behold, I send my messenger before thy face, which shall prepare thy way before thee.",pt:"Este \xe9 aquele de quem est\xe1 escrito: Eis a\xed envio eu ante a tua face o meu mensageiro, que h\xe1 de preparar adiante de ti o teu caminho."},{verse:11,en:"Verily I say unto you, Among them that are born of women there hath not risen a greater than John the Baptist: notwithstanding he that is least in the kingdom of heaven is greater than he.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que, entre os nascidos de mulher, n\xe3o surgiu outro maior do que Jo\xe3o, o Batista; mas aquele que \xe9 o menor no reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 maior do que ele."},{verse:12,en:"And from the days of John the Baptist until now the kingdom of heaven suffereth violence, and the violent take it by force.",pt:"E desde os dias de Jo\xe3o, o Batista, at\xe9 agora, o reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 tomado a for\xe7a, e os violentos o tomam de assalto."},{verse:13,en:"For all the prophets and the law prophesied until John.",pt:"Pois todos os profetas e a lei profetizaram at\xe9 Jo\xe3o."},{verse:14,en:"And if ye will receive it, this is Elias, which was for to come.",pt:"E, se quereis dar cr\xe9dito, \xe9 este o Elias que havia de vir."},{verse:15,en:"He that hath ears to hear, let him hear.",pt:"Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a."},{verse:16,en:"But whereunto shall I liken this generation? It is like unto children sitting in the markets, and calling unto their fellows,",pt:"Mas, a quem compararei esta gera\xe7\xe3o? \xc9 semelhante aos meninos que, sentados nas pra\xe7as, clamam aos seus companheiros:"},{verse:17,en:"And saying, We have piped unto you, and ye have not danced; we have mourned unto you, and ye have not lamented.",pt:"Tocamo-vos flauta, e n\xe3o dan\xe7astes; cantamos lamenta\xe7\xf5es, e n\xe3o pranteastes."},{verse:18,en:"For John came neither eating nor drinking, and they say, He hath a devil.",pt:"Porquanto veio Jo\xe3o, n\xe3o comendo nem bebendo, e dizem: Tem dem\xf4nio."},{verse:19,en:"The Son of man came eating and drinking, and they say, Behold a man gluttonous, and a winebibber, a friend of publicans and sinners. But wisdom is justified of her children.",pt:"Veio o Filho do homem, comendo e bebendo, e dizem: Eis a\xed um comil\xe3o e bebedor de vinho, amigo de publicanos e pecadores. Entretanto a sabedoria \xe9 justificada pelas suas obras."},{verse:20,en:"Then began he to upbraid the cities wherein most of his mighty works were done, because they repented not:",pt:"Ent\xe3o come\xe7ou ele a lan\xe7ar em rosto \xe0s cidades onde se operara a maior parte dos seus milagres, o n\xe3o se haverem arrependido, dizendo:"},{verse:21,en:"Woe unto thee, Chorazin! woe unto thee, Bethsaida! for if the mighty works, which were done in you, had been done in Tyre and Sidon, they would have repented long ago in sackcloth and ashes.",pt:"Ai de ti, Corazin! ai de ti, Betsaida! porque, se em Tiro e em Sidom, se tivessem operado os milagres que em v\xf3s se operaram, h\xe1 muito elas se teriam arrependido em cil\xedcio e em cinza."},{verse:22,en:"But I say unto you, It shall be more tolerable for Tyre and Sidon at the day of judgment, than for you.",pt:"Contudo, eu vos digo que para Tiro e Sidom haver\xe1 menos rigor, no dia do ju\xedzo, do que para v\xf3s."},{verse:23,en:"And thou, Capernaum, which art exalted unto heaven, shalt be brought down to hell: for if the mighty works, which have been done in thee, had been done in Sodom, it would have remained until this day.",pt:"E tu, Cafarnaum, porventura ser\xe1s elevada at\xe9 o c\xe9u? at\xe9 o hades descer\xe1s; porque, se em Sodoma se tivessem operado os milagres que em ti se operaram, teria ela permanecido at\xe9 hoje."},{verse:24,en:"But I say unto you, That it shall be more tolerable for the land of Sodom in the day of judgment, than for thee.",pt:"Contudo, eu vos digo que no dia do ju\xedzo haver\xe1 menos rigor para a terra de Sodoma do que para ti."},{verse:25,en:"At that time Jesus answered and said, I thank thee, O Father, Lord of heaven and earth, because thou hast hid these things from the wise and prudent, and hast revealed them unto babes.",pt:"Naquele tempo falou Jesus, dizendo: Gra\xe7as te dou, \xf3 Pai, Senhor do c\xe9u e da terra, porque ocultaste estas coisas aos s\xe1bios e entendidos, e as revelaste aos pequeninos."},{verse:26,en:"Even so, Father: for so it seemed good in thy sight.",pt:"Sim, \xf3 Pai, porque assim foi do teu agrado."},{verse:27,en:"All things are delivered unto me of my Father: and no man knoweth the Son, but the Father; neither knoweth any man the Father, save the Son, and he to whomsoever the Son will reveal him.",pt:"Todas as coisas me foram entregues por meu Pai; e ningu\xe9m conhece plenamente o Filho, sen\xe3o o Pai; e ningu\xe9m conhece plenamente o Pai, sen\xe3o o Filho, e aquele a quem o Filho o quiser revelar."},{verse:28,en:"Come unto me, all ye that labour and are heavy laden, and I will give you rest.",pt:"Vinde a mim, todos os que estai cansados e oprimidos, e eu vos aliviarei."},{verse:29,en:"Take my yoke upon you, and learn of me; for I am meek and lowly in heart: and ye shall find rest unto your souls.",pt:"Tomai sobre v\xf3s o meu jugo, e aprendei de mim, que sou manso e humilde de cora\xe7\xe3o; e achareis descanso para as vossas almas."},{verse:30,en:"For my yoke is easy, and my burden is light.",pt:"Porque o meu jugo \xe9 suave, e o meu fardo e leve."}]}}),748,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"At that time Jesus went on the sabbath day through the corn; and his disciples were an hungred, and began to pluck the ears of corn, and to eat.",pt:"Naquele tempo passou Jesus pelas searas num dia de s\xe1bado; e os seus disc\xedpulos, sentindo fome, come\xe7aram a colher espigas, e a comer."},{verse:2,en:"But when the Pharisees saw it, they said unto him, Behold, thy disciples do that which is not lawful to do upon the sabbath day.",pt:"Os fariseus, vendo isso, disseram-lhe: Eis que os teus disc\xedpulos est\xe3o fazendo o que n\xe3o \xe9 l\xedcito fazer no s\xe1bado."},{verse:3,en:"But he said unto them, Have ye not read what David did, when he was an hungred, and they that were with him;",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhes disse: Acaso n\xe3o lestes o que fez Davi, quando teve fome, ele e seus companheiros?"},{verse:4,en:"How he entered into the house of God, and did eat the shewbread, which was not lawful for him to eat, neither for them which were with him, but only for the priests?",pt:"Como entrou na casa de Deus, e como eles comeram os p\xe3es da proposi\xe7\xe3o, que n\xe3o lhe era l\xedcito comer, nem a seus companheiros, mas somente aos sacerdotes?"},{verse:5,en:"Or have ye not read in the law, how that on the sabbath days the priests in the temple profane the sabbath, and are blameless?",pt:"Ou n\xe3o lestes na lei que, aos s\xe1bados, os sacerdotes no templo violam o s\xe1bado, e ficam sem culpa?"},{verse:6,en:"But I say unto you, That in this place is one greater than the temple.",pt:"Digo-vos, por\xe9m, que aqui est\xe1 o que \xe9 maior do que o templo."},{verse:7,en:"But if ye had known what this meaneth, I will have mercy, and not sacrifice, ye would not have condemned the guiltless.",pt:"Mas, se v\xf3s soub\xe9sseis o que significa: Miseric\xf3rdia quero, e n\xe3o sacrif\xedcios, n\xe3o condenar\xedeis os inocentes."},{verse:8,en:"For the Son of man is Lord even of the sabbath day.",pt:"Porque o Filho do homem at\xe9 do s\xe1bado \xe9 o Senhor."},{verse:9,en:"And when he was departed thence, he went into their synagogue:",pt:"Partindo dali, entrou Jesus na sinagoga deles."},{verse:10,en:"And, behold, there was a man which had his hand withered. And they asked him, saying, Is it lawful to heal on the sabbath days? that they might accuse him.",pt:"E eis que estava ali um homem que tinha uma das m\xe3os atrofiadas; e eles, para poderem acusar a Jesus, o interrogaram, dizendo: \xc9 l\xedcito curar nos s\xe1bados?"},{verse:11,en:"And he said unto them, What man shall there be among you, that shall have one sheep, and if it fall into a pit on the sabbath day, will he not lay hold on it, and lift it out?",pt:"E ele lhes disse: Qual dentre v\xf3s ser\xe1 o homem que, tendo uma s\xf3 ovelha, se num s\xe1bado ela cair numa cova, n\xe3o h\xe1 de lan\xe7ar m\xe3o dela, e tir\xe1-la?"},{verse:12,en:"How much then is a man better than a sheep? Wherefore it is lawful to do well on the sabbath days.",pt:"Ora, quanto mais vale um homem do que uma ovelha! Portanto, \xe9 l\xedcito fazer bem nos s\xe1bados."},{verse:13,en:"Then saith he to the man, Stretch forth thine hand. And he stretched it forth; and it was restored whole, like as the other.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse \xe0quele homem: estende a tua m\xe3o. E ele a estendeu, e lhe foi restitu\xedda s\xe3 como a outra."},{verse:14,en:"Then the Pharisees went out, and held a council against him, how they might destroy him.",pt:"Os fariseus, por\xe9m, saindo dali, tomaram conselho contra ele, para o matarem."},{verse:15,en:"But when Jesus knew it, he withdrew himself from thence: and great multitudes followed him, and he healed them all;",pt:"Jesus, percebendo isso, retirou-se dali. Acompanharam-no muitos; e ele curou a todos,"},{verse:16,en:"And charged them that they should not make him known:",pt:"e advertiu-lhes que n\xe3o o dessem a conhecer;"},{verse:17,en:"That it might be fulfilled which was spoken by Esaias the prophet, saying,",pt:"para que se cumprisse o que foi dito pelo profeta Isa\xedas:"},{verse:18,en:"Behold my servant, whom I have chosen; my beloved, in whom my soul is well pleased: I will put my spirit upon him, and he shall shew judgment to the Gentiles.",pt:"Eis aqui o meu servo que escolhi, o meu amado em quem a minha alma se compraz; porei sobre ele o meu esp\xedrito, e ele anunciar\xe1 aos gentios o ju\xedzo."},{verse:19,en:"He shall not strive, nor cry; neither shall any man hear his voice in the streets.",pt:"N\xe3o contender\xe1, nem clamar\xe1, nem se ouvir\xe1 pelas ruas a sua voz."},{verse:20,en:"A bruised reed shall he not break, and smoking flax shall he not quench, till he send forth judgment unto victory.",pt:"N\xe3o esmagar\xe1 a cana quebrada, e n\xe3o apagar\xe1 o morr\xe3o que fumega, at\xe9 que fa\xe7a triunfar o ju\xedzo;"},{verse:21,en:"And in his name shall the Gentiles trust.",pt:"e no seu nome os gentios esperar\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"Then was brought unto him one possessed with a devil, blind, and dumb: and he healed him, insomuch that the blind and dumb both spake and saw.",pt:"Trouxeram-lhe ent\xe3o um endemoninhado cego e mudo; e ele o curou, de modo que o mudo falava e via."},{verse:23,en:"And all the people were amazed, and said, Is not this the son of David?",pt:"E toda a multid\xe3o, maravilhada, dizia: \xc9 este, porventura, o Filho de Davi?"},{verse:24,en:"But when the Pharisees heard it, they said, This fellow doth not cast out devils, but by Beelzebub the prince of the devils.",pt:"Mas os fariseus, ouvindo isto, disseram: Este n\xe3o expulsa os dem\xf4nios sen\xe3o por Belzebu, pr\xedncipe dos dem\xf4nios."},{verse:25,en:"And Jesus knew their thoughts, and said unto them, Every kingdom divided against itself is brought to desolation; and every city or house divided against itself shall not stand:",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, conhecendo-lhes os pensamentos, disse-lhes: Todo reino dividido contra si mesmo \xe9 devastado; e toda cidade, ou casa, dividida contra si mesma n\xe3o subsistir\xe1."},{verse:26,en:"And if Satan cast out Satan, he is divided against himself; how shall then his kingdom stand?",pt:"Ora, se Satan\xe1s expulsa a Satan\xe1s, est\xe1 dividido contra si mesmo; como subsistir\xe1, pois, o seus reino?"},{verse:27,en:"And if I by Beelzebub cast out devils, by whom do your children cast them out? therefore they shall be your judges.",pt:"E, se eu expulso os dem\xf4nios por Belzebu, por quem os expulsam os vossos filhos? Por isso, eles mesmos ser\xe3o os vossos ju\xedzes."},{verse:28,en:"But if I cast out devils by the Spirit of God, then the kingdom of God is come unto you.",pt:"Mas, se \xe9 pelo Esp\xedrito de Deus que eu expulso os dem\xf4nios, logo \xe9 chegado a v\xf3s o reino de Deus."},{verse:29,en:"Or else how can one enter into a strong man\u2019s house, and spoil his goods, except he first bind the strong man? and then he will spoil his house.",pt:"Ou, como pode algu\xe9m entrar na casa do valente, e roubar-lhe os bens, se primeiro n\xe3o amarrar o valente? e ent\xe3o lhe saquear a casa."},{verse:30,en:"He that is not with me is against me; and he that gathereth not with me scattereth abroad.",pt:"Quem n\xe3o \xe9 comigo \xe9 contra mim; e quem comigo n\xe3o ajunta, espalha."},{verse:31,en:"Wherefore I say unto you, All manner of sin and blasphemy shall be forgiven unto men: but the blasphemy against the Holy Ghost shall not be forgiven unto men.",pt:"Portanto vos digo: Todo pecado e blasf\xeamia se perdoar\xe1 aos homens; mas a blasf\xeamia contra o Esp\xedrito n\xe3o ser\xe1 perdoada."},{verse:32,en:"And whosoever speaketh a word against the Son of man, it shall be forgiven him: but whosoever speaketh against the Holy Ghost, it shall not be forgiven him, neither in this world, neither in the world to come.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m disser alguma palavra contra o Filho do homem, isso lhe ser\xe1 perdoado; mas se algu\xe9m falar contra o Esp\xedrito Santo, n\xe3o lhe ser\xe1 perdoado, nem neste mundo, nem no vindouro."},{verse:33,en:"Either make the tree good, and his fruit good; or else make the tree corrupt, and his fruit corrupt: for the tree is known by his fruit.",pt:"Ou fazei a \xe1rvore boa, e o seu fruto bom; ou fazei a \xe1rvore m\xe1, e o seu fruto mau; porque pelo fruto se conhece a \xe1rvore."},{verse:34,en:"O generation of vipers, how can ye, being evil, speak good things? for out of the abundance of the heart the mouth speaketh.",pt:"Ra\xe7a de v\xedboras! como podeis v\xf3s falar coisas boas, sendo maus? pois do que h\xe1 em abund\xe2ncia no cora\xe7\xe3o, disso fala a boca."},{verse:35,en:"A good man out of the good treasure of the heart bringeth forth good things: and an evil man out of the evil treasure bringeth forth evil things.",pt:"O homem bom, do seu bom tesouro tira coisas boas, e o homem mau do mau tesouro tira coisas m\xe1s."},{verse:36,en:"But I say unto you, That every idle word that men shall speak, they shall give account thereof in the day of judgment.",pt:"Digo-vos, pois, que de toda palavra f\xfatil que os homens disserem, h\xe3o de dar conta no dia do ju\xedzo."},{verse:37,en:"For by thy words thou shalt be justified, and by thy words thou shalt be condemned.",pt:"Porque pelas tuas palavras ser\xe1s justificado, e pelas tuas palavras ser\xe1s condenado."},{verse:38,en:"Then certain of the scribes and of the Pharisees answered, saying, Master, we would see a sign from thee.",pt:"Ent\xe3o alguns dos escribas e dos fariseus, tomando a palavra, disseram: Mestre, queremos ver da tua parte algum sinal."},{verse:39,en:"But he answered and said unto them, An evil and adulterous generation seeketh after a sign; and there shall no sign be given to it, but the sign of the prophet Jonas:",pt:"Mas ele lhes respondeu: Uma gera\xe7\xe3o m\xe1 e ad\xfaltera pede um sinal; e nenhum sinal se lhe dar\xe1, sen\xe3o o do profeta Jonas;"},{verse:40,en:"For as Jonas was three days and three nights in the whale\u2019s belly; so shall the Son of man be three days and three nights in the heart of the earth.",pt:"pois, como Jonas esteve tr\xeas dias e tr\xeas noites no ventre do grande peixe, assim estar\xe1 o Filho do homem tr\xeas dias e tr\xeas noites no seio da terra."},{verse:41,en:"The men of Nineveh shall rise in judgment with this generation, and shall condemn it: because they repented at the preaching of Jonas; and, behold, a greater than Jonas is here.",pt:"Os ninivitas se levantar\xe3o no ju\xedzo com esta gera\xe7\xe3o, e a condenar\xe3o; porque se arrependeram com a prega\xe7\xe3o de Jonas. E eis aqui quem \xe9 maior do que Jonas."},{verse:42,en:"The queen of the south shall rise up in the judgment with this generation, and shall condemn it: for she came from the uttermost parts of the earth to hear the wisdom of Solomon; and, behold, a greater than Solomon is here.",pt:"A rainha do sul se levantar\xe1 no ju\xedzo com esta gera\xe7\xe3o, e a condenar\xe1; porque veio dos confins da terra para ouvir a sabedoria de Salom\xe3o. E eis aqui quem \xe9 maior do que Salom\xe3o."},{verse:43,en:"When the unclean spirit is gone out of a man, he walketh through dry places, seeking rest, and findeth none.",pt:"Ora, havendo o esp\xedrito imundo saido do homem, anda por lugares \xe1ridos, buscando repouso, e n\xe3o o encontra."},{verse:44,en:"Then he saith, I will return into my house from whence I came out; and when he is come, he findeth it empty, swept, and garnished.",pt:"Ent\xe3o diz: Voltarei para minha casa, donde sa\xed. E, chegando, acha-a desocupada, varrida e adornada."},{verse:45,en:"Then goeth he, and taketh with himself seven other spirits more wicked than himself, and they enter in and dwell there: and the last state of that man is worse than the first. Even so shall it be also unto this wicked generation.",pt:"Ent\xe3o vai e leva consigo outros sete esp\xedritos piores do que ele e, entretanto, habitam ali; e o \xfaltimo estado desse homem vem a ser pior do que o primeiro. Assim h\xe1 de acontecer tamb\xe9m a esta gera\xe7\xe3o perversa."},{verse:46,en:"While he yet talked to the people, behold, his mother and his brethren stood without, desiring to speak with him.",pt:"Enquanto ele ainda falava \xe0s multid\xf5es, estavam do lado de fora sua m\xe3e e seus irm\xe3os, procurando falar-lhe."},{verse:47,en:"Then one said unto him, Behold, thy mother and thy brethren stand without, desiring to speak with thee.",pt:"Disse-lhe algu\xe9m: Eis que est\xe3o ali fora tua m\xe3e e teus irm\xe3os, e procuram falar contigo."},{verse:48,en:"But he answered and said unto him that told him, Who is my mother? and who are my brethren?",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, respondeu ao que lhe falava: Quem \xe9 minha m\xe3e? e quem s\xe3o meus irm\xe3os?"},{verse:49,en:"And he stretched forth his hand toward his disciples, and said, Behold my mother and my brethren!",pt:"E, estendendo a m\xe3o para os seus disc\xedpulos disse: Eis aqui minha m\xe3e e meus irm\xe3os."},{verse:50,en:"For whosoever shall do the will of my Father which is in heaven, the same is my brother, and sister, and mother.",pt:"Pois qualquer que fizer a vontade de meu Pai que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us, esse \xe9 meu irm\xe3o, irm\xe3 e m\xe3e."}]}}),749,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,h){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The same day went Jesus out of the house, and sat by the sea side.",pt:"No mesmo dia, tendo Jesus sa\xeddo de casa, sentou-se \xe0 beira do mar;"},{verse:2,en:"And great multitudes were gathered together unto him, so that he went into a ship, and sat; and the whole multitude stood on the shore.",pt:"e reuniram-se a ele grandes multid\xf5es, de modo que entrou num barco, e se sentou; e todo o povo estava em p\xe9 na praia."},{verse:3,en:"And he spake many things unto them in parables, saying, Behold, a sower went forth to sow;",pt:"E falou-lhes muitas coisas por par\xe1bolas, dizendo: Eis que o semeador saiu a semear."},{verse:4,en:"And when he sowed, some seeds fell by the way side, and the fowls came and devoured them up:",pt:"e quando semeava, uma parte da semente caiu \xe0 beira do caminho, e vieram as aves e comeram."},{verse:5,en:"Some fell upon stony places, where they had not much earth: and forthwith they sprung up, because they had no deepness of earth:",pt:"E outra parte caiu em lugares pedregosos, onde n\xe3o havia muita terra: e logo nasceu, porque n\xe3o tinha terra profunda;"},{verse:6,en:"And when the sun was up, they were scorched; and because they had no root, they withered away.",pt:"mas, saindo o sol, queimou-se e, por n\xe3o ter raiz, secou-se."},{verse:7,en:"And some fell among thorns; and the thorns sprung up, and choked them:",pt:"E outra caiu entre espinhos; e os espinhos cresceram e a sufocaram."},{verse:8,en:"But other fell into good ground, and brought forth fruit, some an hundredfold, some sixtyfold, some thirtyfold.",pt:"Mas outra caiu em boa terra, e dava fruto, um a cem, outro a sessenta e outro a trinta por um."},{verse:9,en:"Who hath ears to hear, let him hear.",pt:"Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a."},{verse:10,en:"And the disciples came, and said unto him, Why speakest thou unto them in parables?",pt:"E chegando-se a ele os disc\xedpulos, perguntaram-lhe: Por que lhes falas por par\xe1bolas?"},{verse:11,en:"He answered and said unto them, Because it is given unto you to know the mysteries of the kingdom of heaven, but to them it is not given.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Porque a v\xf3s \xe9 dado conhecer os mist\xe9rios do reino dos c\xe9us, mas a eles n\xe3o lhes \xe9 dado;"},{verse:12,en:"For whosoever hath, to him shall be given, and he shall have more abundance: but whosoever hath not, from him shall be taken away even that he hath.",pt:"pois ao que tem, dar-se-lhe-\xe1, e ter\xe1 em abund\xe2ncia; mas ao que n\xe3o tem, at\xe9 aquilo que tem lhe ser\xe1 tirado."},{verse:13,en:"Therefore speak I to them in parables: because they seeing see not; and hearing they hear not, neither do they understand.",pt:"Por isso lhes falo por par\xe1bolas; porque eles, vendo, n\xe3o v\xeaem; e ouvindo, n\xe3o ouvem nem entendem."},{verse:14,en:"And in them is fulfilled the prophecy of Esaias, which saith, By hearing ye shall hear, and shall not understand; and seeing ye shall see, and shall not perceive:",pt:"E neles se cumpre a profecia de Isa\xedas, que diz: Ouvindo, ouvireis, e de maneira alguma entendereis; e, vendo, vereis, e de maneira alguma percebereis."},{verse:15,en:"For this people\u2019s heart is waxed gross, and their ears are dull of hearing, and their eyes they have closed; lest at any time they should see with their eyes, and hear with their ears, and should understand with their heart, and should be converted, and I should heal them.",pt:"Porque o cora\xe7\xe3o deste povo se endureceu, e com os ouvidos ouviram tardamente, e fecharam os olhos, para que n\xe3o vejam com os olhos, nem ou\xe7am com os ouvidos, nem entendam com o cora\xe7\xe3o, nem se convertam, e eu os cure."},{verse:16,en:"But blessed are your eyes, for they see: and your ears, for they hear.",pt:"Mas bem-aventurados os vossos olhos, porque v\xeaem, e os vossos ouvidos, porque ouvem."},{verse:17,en:"For verily I say unto you, That many prophets and righteous men have desired to see those things which ye see, and have not seen them; and to hear those things which ye hear, and have not heard them.",pt:"Pois, em verdade vos digo que muitos profetas e justos desejaram ver o que vedes, e n\xe3o o viram; e ouvir o que ouvis, e n\xe3o o ouviram."},{verse:18,en:"Hear ye therefore the parable of the sower.",pt:"Ouvi, pois, v\xf3s a par\xe1bola do semeador."},{verse:19,en:"When any one heareth the word of the kingdom, and understandeth it not, then cometh the wicked one, and catcheth away that which was sown in his heart. This is he which received seed by the way side.",pt:"A todo o que ouve a palavra do reino e n\xe3o a entende, vem o Maligno e arrebata o que lhe foi semeado no cora\xe7\xe3o; este \xe9 o que foi semeado \xe0 beira do caminho."},{verse:20,en:"But he that received the seed into stony places, the same is he that heareth the word, and anon with joy receiveth it;",pt:"E o que foi semeado nos lugares pedregosos, este \xe9 o que ouve a palavra, e logo a recebe com alegria;"},{verse:21,en:"Yet hath he not root in himself, but dureth for a while: for when tribulation or persecution ariseth because of the word, by and by he is offended.",pt:"mas n\xe3o tem raiz em si mesmo, antes \xe9 de pouca dura\xe7\xe3o; e sobrevindo a ang\xfastia e a persegui\xe7\xe3o por causa da palavra, logo se escandaliza."},{verse:22,en:"He also that received seed among the thorns is he that heareth the word; and the care of this world, and the deceitfulness of riches, choke the word, and he becometh unfruitful.",pt:"E o que foi semeado entre os espinhos, este \xe9 o que ouve a palavra; mas os cuidados deste mundo e a sedu\xe7\xe3o das riquezas sufocam a palavra, e ela fica infrut\xedfera."},{verse:23,en:"But he that received seed into the good ground is he that heareth the word, and understandeth it; which also beareth fruit, and bringeth forth, some an hundredfold, some sixty, some thirty.",pt:"Mas o que foi semeado em boa terra, este \xe9 o que ouve a palavra, e a entende; e d\xe1 fruto, e um produz cem, outro sessenta, e outro trinta."},{verse:24,en:"Another parable put he forth unto them, saying, The kingdom of heaven is likened unto a man which sowed good seed in his field:",pt:"Prop\xf4s-lhes outra par\xe1bola, dizendo: O reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 semelhante ao homem que semeou boa semente no seu campo;"},{verse:25,en:"But while men slept, his enemy came and sowed tares among the wheat, and went his way.",pt:"mas, enquanto os homens dormiam, veio o inimigo dele, semeou joio no meio do trigo, e retirou-se."},{verse:26,en:"But when the blade was sprung up, and brought forth fruit, then appeared the tares also.",pt:"Quando, por\xe9m, a erva cresceu e come\xe7ou a espigar, ent\xe3o apareceu tamb\xe9m o joio."},{verse:27,en:"So the servants of the householder came and said unto him, Sir, didst not thou sow good seed in thy field? from whence then hath it tares?",pt:"Chegaram, pois, os servos do propriet\xe1rio, e disseram-lhe: Senhor, n\xe3o semeaste no teu campo boa semente? Donde, pois, vem o joio?"},{verse:28,en:"He said unto them, An enemy hath done this. The servants said unto him, Wilt thou then that we go and gather them up?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: Algum inimigo \xe9 quem fez isso. E os servos lhe disseram: Queres, pois, que vamos arranc\xe1-lo?"},{verse:29,en:"But he said, Nay; lest while ye gather up the tares, ye root up also the wheat with them.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, disse: N\xe3o; para que, ao colher o joio, n\xe3o arranqueis com ele tamb\xe9m o trigo."},{verse:30,en:"Let both grow together until the harvest: and in the time of harvest I will say to the reapers, Gather ye together first the tares, and bind them in bundles to burn them: but gather the wheat into my barn.",pt:"Deixai crescer ambos juntos at\xe9 a ceifa; e, por ocasi\xe3o da ceifa, direi aos ceifeiros: Ajuntai primeiro o joio, e atai-o em molhos para o queimar; o trigo, por\xe9m, recolhei-o no meu celeiro."},{verse:31,en:"Another parable put he forth unto them, saying, The kingdom of heaven is like to a grain of mustard seed, which a man took, and sowed in his field:",pt:"Prop\xf4s-lhes outra par\xe1bola, dizendo: O reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 semelhante a um gr\xe3o de mostarda que um homem tomou, e semeou no seu campo;"},{verse:32,en:"Which indeed is the least of all seeds: but when it is grown, it is the greatest among herbs, and becometh a tree, so that the birds of the air come and lodge in the branches thereof.",pt:"o qual \xe9 realmente a menor de todas as sementes; mas, depois de ter crescido, \xe9 a maior das hortali\xe7as, e faz-se \xe1rvore, de sorte que v\xeam as aves do c\xe9u, e se aninham nos seus ramos."},{verse:33,en:"Another parable spake he unto them; The kingdom of heaven is like unto leaven, which a woman took, and hid in three measures of meal, till the whole was leavened.",pt:"Outra par\xe1bola lhes disse: O reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 semelhante ao fermento que uma mulher tomou e misturou com tr\xeas medidas de farinha, at\xe9 ficar tudo levedado."},{verse:34,en:"All these things spake Jesus unto the multitude in parables; and without a parable spake he not unto them:",pt:"Todas estas coisas falou Jesus \xe0s multid\xf5es por par\xe1bolas, e sem par\xe1bolas nada lhes falava;"},{verse:35,en:"That it might be fulfilled which was spoken by the prophet, saying, I will open my mouth in parables; I will utter things which have been kept secret from the foundation of the world.",pt:"para que se cumprisse o que foi dito pelo profeta: Abrirei em par\xe1bolas a minha boca; publicarei coisas ocultas desde a funda\xe7\xe3o do mundo."},{verse:36,en:"Then Jesus sent the multitude away, and went into the house: and his disciples came unto him, saying, Declare unto us the parable of the tares of the field.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus, deixando as multid\xf5es, entrou em casa. E chegaram-se a ele os seus disc\xedpulos, dizendo: Explica-nos a par\xe1bola do joio do campo."},{verse:37,en:"He answered and said unto them, He that soweth the good seed is the Son of man;",pt:"E ele, respondendo, disse: O que semeia a boa semente \xe9 o Filho do homem;"},{verse:38,en:"The field is the world; the good seed are the children of the kingdom; but the tares are the children of the wicked one;",pt:"o campo \xe9 o mundo; a boa semente s\xe3o os filhos do reino; o o joio s\xe3o os filhos do maligno;"},{verse:39,en:"The enemy that sowed them is the devil; the harvest is the end of the world; and the reapers are the angels.",pt:"o inimigo que o semeou \xe9 o Diabo; a ceifa \xe9 o fim do mundo, e os celeiros s\xe3o os anjos."},{verse:40,en:"As therefore the tares are gathered and burned in the fire; so shall it be in the end of this world.",pt:"Pois assim como o joio \xe9 colhido e queimado no fogo, assim ser\xe1 no fim do mundo."},{verse:41,en:"The Son of man shall send forth his angels, and they shall gather out of his kingdom all things that offend, and them which do iniquity;",pt:"Mandar\xe1 o Filho do homem os seus anjos, e eles ajuntar\xe3o do seu reino todos os que servem de trope\xe7o, e os que praticam a iniquidade,"},{verse:42,en:"And shall cast them into a furnace of fire: there shall be wailing and gnashing of teeth.",pt:"e lan\xe7\xe1-los-\xe3o na fornalha de fogo; ali haver\xe1 choro e ranger de dentes."},{verse:43,en:"Then shall the righteous shine forth as the sun in the kingdom of their Father. Who hath ears to hear, let him hear.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os justos resplandecer\xe3o como o sol, no reino de seu Pai. Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a."},{verse:44,en:"Again, the kingdom of heaven is like unto treasure hid in a field; the which when a man hath found, he hideth, and for joy thereof goeth and selleth all that he hath, and buyeth that field.",pt:"O reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 semelhante a um tesouro escondido no campo, que um homem, ao descobr\xed-lo, esconde; ent\xe3o, movido de gozo, vai, vende tudo quanto tem, e compra aquele campo."},{verse:45,en:"Again, the kingdom of heaven is like unto a merchant man, seeking goodly pearls:",pt:"Outrossim, o reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 semelhante a um negociante que buscava boas p\xe9rolas;"},{verse:46,en:"Who, when he had found one pearl of great price, went and sold all that he had, and bought it.",pt:"e encontrando uma p\xe9rola de grande valor, foi, vendeu tudo quanto tinha, e a comprou."},{verse:47,en:"Again, the kingdom of heaven is like unto a net, that was cast into the sea, and gathered of every kind:",pt:"Igualmente, o reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 semelhante a uma rede lan\xe7ada ao mar, e que apanhou toda esp\xe9cie de peixes."},{verse:48,en:"Which, when it was full, they drew to shore, and sat down, and gathered the good into vessels, but cast the bad away.",pt:"E, quando cheia, puxaram-na para a praia; e, sentando-se, puseram os bons em cestos; os ruins, por\xe9m, lan\xe7aram fora."},{verse:49,en:"So shall it be at the end of the world: the angels shall come forth, and sever the wicked from among the just,",pt:"Assim ser\xe1 no fim do mundo: sair\xe3o os anjos, e separar\xe3o os maus dentre os justos,"},{verse:50,en:"And shall cast them into the furnace of fire: there shall be wailing and gnashing of teeth.",pt:"e lan\xe7\xe1-los-\xe3o na fornalha de fogo; ali haver\xe1 choro e ranger de dentes."},{verse:51,en:"Jesus saith unto them, Have ye understood all these things? They say unto him, Yea, Lord.",pt:"Entendestes todas estas coisas? Disseram-lhe eles: Entendemos."},{verse:52,en:"Then said he unto them, Therefore every scribe which is instructed unto the kingdom of heaven is like unto a man that is an householder, which bringeth forth out of his treasure things new and old.",pt:"E disse-lhes: Por isso, todo escriba que se fez disc\xedpulo do reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 semelhante a um homem, propriet\xe1rio, que tira do seu tesouro coisas novas e velhas."},{verse:53,en:"And it came to pass, that when Jesus had finished these parables, he departed thence.",pt:"E Jesus, tendo concluido estas par\xe1bolas, se retirou dali."},{verse:54,en:"And when he was come into his own country, he taught them in their synagogue, insomuch that they were astonished, and said, Whence hath this man this wisdom, and these mighty works?",pt:"E, chegando \xe0 sua terra, ensinava o povo na sinagoga, de modo que este se maravilhava e dizia: Donde lhe vem esta sabedoria, e estes poderes milagrosos?"},{verse:55,en:"Is not this the carpenter\u2019s son? is not his mother called Mary? and his brethren, James, and Joses, and Simon, and Judas?",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 este o filho do carpinteiro? e n\xe3o se chama sua m\xe3e Maria, e seus irm\xe3os Tiago, Jos\xe9, Sim\xe3o, e Judas?"},{verse:56,en:"And his sisters, are they not all with us? Whence then hath this man all these things?",pt:"E n\xe3o est\xe3o entre n\xf3s todas as suas irm\xe3s? Donde lhe vem, pois, tudo isto?"},{verse:57,en:"And they were offended in him. But Jesus said unto them, A prophet is not without honour, save in his own country, and in his own house.",pt:"E escandalizavam-se dele. Jesus, por\xe9m, lhes disse: Um profeta n\xe3o fica sem honra sen\xe3o na sua terra e na sua pr\xf3pria casa."},{verse:58,en:"And he did not many mighty works there because of their unbelief.",pt:"E n\xe3o fez ali muitos milagres, por causa da incredulidade deles."}]}}),750,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,d){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"At that time Herod the tetrarch heard of the fame of Jesus,",pt:"Naquele tempo Herodes, o tetrarca, ouviu a fama de Jesus,"},{verse:2,en:"And said unto his servants, This is John the Baptist; he is risen from the dead; and therefore mighty works do shew forth themselves in him.",pt:"e disse aos seus cortes\xe3os: Este \xe9 Jo\xe3o, o Batista; ele ressuscitou dentre os mortos, e por isso estes poderes milagrosos operam nele."},{verse:3,en:"For Herod had laid hold on John, and bound him, and put him in prison for Herodias\u2019 sake, his brother Philip\u2019s wife.",pt:"Pois Herodes havia prendido a Jo\xe3o, e, maniatando-o, o guardara no c\xe1rcere, por causa de Herodias, mulher de seu irm\xe3o Felipe;"},{verse:4,en:"For John said unto him, It is not lawful for thee to have her.",pt:"porque Jo\xe3o lhe dizia: N\xe3o te \xe9 l\xedcito possu\xed-la."},{verse:5,en:"And when he would have put him to death, he feared the multitude, because they counted him as a prophet.",pt:"E queria mat\xe1-lo, mas temia o povo; porque o tinham como profeta."},{verse:6,en:"But when Herod\u2019s birthday was kept, the daughter of Herodias danced before them, and pleased Herod.",pt:"Festejando-se, por\xe9m, o dia natal\xedcio de Herodes, a filha de Herodias dan\xe7ou no meio dos convivas, e agradou a Herodes,"},{verse:7,en:"Whereupon he promised with an oath to give her whatsoever she would ask.",pt:"pelo que este prometeu com juramento dar-lhe tudo o que pedisse."},{verse:8,en:"And she, being before instructed of her mother, said, Give me here John Baptist\u2019s head in a charger.",pt:"E instigada por sua m\xe3e, disse ela: D\xe1-me aqui num prato a cabe\xe7a de Jo\xe3o, o Batista."},{verse:9,en:"And the king was sorry: nevertheless for the oath\u2019s sake, and them which sat with him at meat, he commanded it to be given her.",pt:"Entristeceu-se, ent\xe3o, o rei; mas, por causa do juramento, e dos que estavam \xe0 mesa com ele, ordenou que se lhe desse,"},{verse:10,en:"And he sent, and beheaded John in the prison.",pt:"e mandou degolar a Jo\xe3o no c\xe1rcere;"},{verse:11,en:"And his head was brought in a charger, and given to the damsel: and she brought it to her mother.",pt:"e a cabe\xe7a foi trazida num prato, e dada \xe0 jovem, e ela a levou para a sua m\xe3e."},{verse:12,en:"And his disciples came, and took up the body, and buried it, and went and told Jesus.",pt:"Ent\xe3o vieram os seus disc\xedpulos, levaram o corpo e o sepultaram; e foram anunci\xe1-lo a Jesus."},{verse:13,en:"When Jesus heard of it, he departed thence by ship into a desert place apart: and when the people had heard thereof, they followed him on foot out of the cities.",pt:"Jesus, ouvindo isto, retirou-se dali num barco, para um, lugar deserto, \xe0 parte; e quando as multid\xf5es o souberam, seguiram-no a p\xe9 desde as cidades."},{verse:14,en:"And Jesus went forth, and saw a great multitude, and was moved with compassion toward them, and he healed their sick.",pt:"E ele, ao desembarcar, viu uma grande multid\xe3o; e, compadecendo-se dela, curou os seus enfermos."},{verse:15,en:"And when it was evening, his disciples came to him, saying, This is a desert place, and the time is now past; send the multitude away, that they may go into the villages, and buy themselves victuals.",pt:"Chegada a tarde, aproximaram-se dele os disc\xedpulos, dizendo: O lugar \xe9 deserto, e a hora \xe9 j\xe1 passada; despede as multid\xf5es, para que v\xe3o \xe0s aldeias, e comprem o que comer."},{verse:16,en:"But Jesus said unto them, They need not depart; give ye them to eat.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, lhes disse: N\xe3o precisam ir embora; dai-lhes v\xf3s de comer."},{verse:17,en:"And they say unto him, We have here but five loaves, and two fishes.",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles lhe disseram: N\xe3o temos aqui sen\xe3o cinco p\xe3es e dois peixes."},{verse:18,en:"He said, Bring them hither to me.",pt:"E ele disse: trazei-mos aqui."},{verse:19,en:"And he commanded the multitude to sit down on the grass, and took the five loaves, and the two fishes, and looking up to heaven, he blessed, and brake, and gave the loaves to his disciples, and the disciples to the multitude.",pt:"Tendo mandado \xe0s multid\xf5es que se reclinassem sobre a relva, tomou os cinco p\xe3es e os dois peixes e, erguendo os olhos ao c\xe9u, os aben\xe7oou; e partindo os p\xe3es, deu-os aos disc\xedpulos, e os disc\xedpulos \xe0s multid\xf5es."},{verse:20,en:"And they did all eat, and were filled: and they took up of the fragments that remained twelve baskets full.",pt:"Todos comeram e se fartaram; e dos peda\xe7os que sobejaram levantaram doze cestos cheios."},{verse:21,en:"And they that had eaten were about five thousand men, beside women and children.",pt:"Ora, os que comeram foram cerca de cinco mil homens, al\xe9m de mulheres e crian\xe7as."},{verse:22,en:"And straightway Jesus constrained his disciples to get into a ship, and to go before him unto the other side, while he sent the multitudes away.",pt:"Logo em seguida obrigou os seus disc\xedpulos a entrar no barco, e passar adiante dele para o outro lado, enquanto ele despedia as multid\xf5es."},{verse:23,en:"And when he had sent the multitudes away, he went up into a mountain apart to pray: and when the evening was come, he was there alone.",pt:"Tendo-as despedido, subiu ao monte para orar \xe0 parte. Ao anoitecer, estava ali sozinho."},{verse:24,en:"But the ship was now in the midst of the sea, tossed with waves: for the wind was contrary.",pt:"Entrementes, o barco j\xe1 estava a muitos est\xe1dios da terra, a\xe7oitado pelas ondas; porque o vento era contr\xe1rio."},{verse:25,en:"And in the fourth watch of the night Jesus went unto them, walking on the sea.",pt:"\xc2 quarta vig\xedlia da noite, foi Jesus ter com eles, andando sobre o mar."},{verse:26,en:"And when the disciples saw him walking on the sea, they were troubled, saying, It is a spirit; and they cried out for fear.",pt:"Os disc\xedpulos, por\xe9m, ao v\xea-lo andando sobre o mar, assustaram-se e disseram: \xc9 um fantasma. E gritaram de medo."},{verse:27,en:"But straightway Jesus spake unto them, saying, Be of good cheer; it is I; be not afraid.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, imediatamente lhes falou, dizendo: Tende \xe2nimo; sou eu; n\xe3o temais."},{verse:28,en:"And Peter answered him and said, Lord, if it be thou, bid me come unto thee on the water.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Pedro: Senhor! se \xe9s tu, manda-me ir ter contigo sobre as \xe1guas."},{verse:29,en:"And he said, Come. And when Peter was come down out of the ship, he walked on the water, to go to Jesus.",pt:"Disse-lhe ele: Vem. Pedro, descendo do barco, e andando sobre as \xe1guas, foi ao encontro de Jesus."},{verse:30,en:"But when he saw the wind boisterous, he was afraid; and beginning to sink, he cried, saying, Lord, save me.",pt:"Mas, sentindo o vento, teve medo; e, come\xe7ando a submergir, clamou: Senhor, salva-me."},{verse:31,en:"And immediately Jesus stretched forth his hand, and caught him, and said unto him, O thou of little faith, wherefore didst thou doubt?",pt:"Imediatamente estendeu Jesus a m\xe3o, segurou-o, e disse-lhe: Homem de pouca f\xe9, por que duvidaste?"},{verse:32,en:"And when they were come into the ship, the wind ceased.",pt:"E logo que subiram para o barco, o vento cessou."},{verse:33,en:"Then they that were in the ship came and worshipped him, saying, Of a truth thou art the Son of God.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os que estavam no barco adoraram-no, dizendo: Verdadeiramente tu \xe9s Filho de Deus."},{verse:34,en:"And when they were gone over, they came into the land of Gennesaret.",pt:"Ora, terminada a travessia, chegaram \xe0 terra em Genezar\xe9."},{verse:35,en:"And when the men of that place had knowledge of him, they sent out into all that country round about, and brought unto him all that were diseased;",pt:"Quando os homens daquele lugar o reconheceram, mandaram por toda aquela circunvizinhan\xe7a, e trouxeram-lhe todos os enfermos;"},{verse:36,en:"And besought him that they might only touch the hem of his garment: and as many as touched were made perfectly whole.",pt:"e rogaram-lhe que apenas os deixasse tocar a orla do seu manto; e todos os que a tocaram ficaram curados."}]}}),751,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,d){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then came to Jesus scribes and Pharisees, which were of Jerusalem, saying,",pt:"Ent\xe3o chegaram a Jesus uns fariseus e escribas vindos de Jerusal\xe9m, e lhe perguntaram:"},{verse:2,en:"Why do thy disciples transgress the tradition of the elders? for they wash not their hands when they eat bread.",pt:"Por que transgridem os teus disc\xedpulos a tradi\xe7\xe3o dos anci\xe3os? pois n\xe3o lavam as m\xe3os, quando comem."},{verse:3,en:"But he answered and said unto them, Why do ye also transgress the commandment of God by your tradition?",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, respondendo, disse-lhes: E v\xf3s, por que transgredis o mandamento de Deus por causa da vossa tradi\xe7\xe3o?"},{verse:4,en:"For God commanded, saying, Honour thy father and mother: and, He that curseth father or mother, let him die the death.",pt:"Pois Deus ordenou: Honra a teu pai e a tua m\xe3e; e, Quem maldisser a seu pai ou a sua m\xe3e, certamente morrer\xe1."},{verse:5,en:"But ye say, Whosoever shall say to his father or his mother, It is a gift, by whatsoever thou mightest be profited by me;",pt:"Mas v\xf3s dizeis: Qualquer que disser a seu pai ou a sua m\xe3e: O que poderias aproveitar de mim \xe9 oferta ao Senhor; esse de modo algum ter\xe1 de honrar a seu pai."},{verse:6,en:"And honour not his father or his mother, he shall be free. Thus have ye made the commandment of God of none effect by your tradition.",pt:"E assim por causa da vossa tradi\xe7\xe3o invalidastes a palavra de Deus."},{verse:7,en:"Ye hypocrites, well did Esaias prophesy of you, saying,",pt:"Hip\xf3critas! bem profetizou Isaias a vosso respeito, dizendo:"},{verse:8,en:"This people draweth nigh unto me with their mouth, and honoureth me with their lips; but their heart is far from me.",pt:"Este povo honra-me com os l\xe1bios; o seu cora\xe7\xe3o, por\xe9m, est\xe1 longe de mim."},{verse:9,en:"But in vain they do worship me, teaching for doctrines the commandments of men.",pt:"Mas em v\xe3o me adoram, ensinando doutrinas que s\xe3o preceitos de homem."},{verse:10,en:"And he called the multitude, and said unto them, Hear, and understand:",pt:"E, clamando a si a multid\xe3o, disse-lhes: Ouvi, e entendei:"},{verse:11,en:"Not that which goeth into the mouth defileth a man; but that which cometh out of the mouth, this defileth a man.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 o que entra pela boca que contamina o homem; mas o que sai da boca, isso \xe9 o que o contamina."},{verse:12,en:"Then came his disciples, and said unto him, Knowest thou that the Pharisees were offended, after they heard this saying?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os disc\xedpulos, aproximando-se dele, perguntaram-lhe: Sabes que os fariseus, ouvindo essas palavras, se escandalizaram?"},{verse:13,en:"But he answered and said, Every plant, which my heavenly Father hath not planted, shall be rooted up.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes ele: Toda planta que meu Pai celestial n\xe3o plantou ser\xe1 arrancada."},{verse:14,en:"Let them alone: they be blind leaders of the blind. And if the blind lead the blind, both shall fall into the ditch.",pt:"Deixai-os; s\xe3o guias cegos; ora, se um cego guiar outro cego, ambos cair\xe3o no barranco."},{verse:15,en:"Then answered Peter and said unto him, Declare unto us this parable.",pt:"E Pedro, tomando a palavra, disse-lhe: Explica-nos essa par\xe1bola."},{verse:16,en:"And Jesus said, Are ye also yet without understanding?",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Estai v\xf3s tamb\xe9m ainda sem entender?"},{verse:17,en:"Do not ye yet understand, that whatsoever entereth in at the mouth goeth into the belly, and is cast out into the draught?",pt:"N\xe3o compreendeis que tudo o que entra pela boca desce pelo ventre, e \xe9 lan\xe7ado fora?"},{verse:18,en:"But those things which proceed out of the mouth come forth from the heart; and they defile the man.",pt:"Mas o que sai da boca procede do cora\xe7\xe3o; e \xe9 isso o que contamina o homem."},{verse:19,en:"For out of the heart proceed evil thoughts, murders, adulteries, fornications, thefts, false witness, blasphemies:",pt:"Porque do cora\xe7\xe3o procedem os maus pensamentos, homic\xeddios, adult\xe9rios, prostitui\xe7\xe3o, furtos, falsos testemunhos e blasf\xeamias."},{verse:20,en:"These are the things which defile a man: but to eat with unwashen hands defileth not a man.",pt:"S\xe3o estas as coisas que contaminam o homem; mas o comer sem lavar as m\xe3os, isso n\xe3o o contamina."},{verse:21,en:"Then Jesus went thence, and departed into the coasts of Tyre and Sidon.",pt:"Ora, partindo Jesus dali, retirou-se para as regi\xf5es de Tiro e Sidom."},{verse:22,en:"And, behold, a woman of Canaan came out of the same coasts, and cried unto him, saying, Have mercy on me, O Lord, thou Son of David; my daughter is grievously vexed with a devil.",pt:"E eis que uma mulher canan\xe9ia, provinda daquelas cercania, clamava, dizendo: Senhor, Filho de Davi, tem compaix\xe3o de mim, que minha filha est\xe1 horrivelmente endemoninhada."},{verse:23,en:"But he answered her not a word. And his disciples came and besought him, saying, Send her away; for she crieth after us.",pt:"Contudo ele n\xe3o lhe respondeu palavra. Chegando-se, pois, a ele os seus disc\xedpulos, rogavam-lhe, dizendo: Despede-a, porque vem clamando atr\xe1s de n\xf3s."},{verse:24,en:"But he answered and said, I am not sent but unto the lost sheep of the house of Israel.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes ele: N\xe3o fui enviado sen\xe3o \xe0s ovelhas perdidas da casa de Israel."},{verse:25,en:"Then came she and worshipped him, saying, Lord, help me.",pt:"Ent\xe3o veio ela e, adorando-o, disse: Senhor, socorre-me."},{verse:26,en:"But he answered and said, It is not meet to take the children\u2019s bread, and to cast it to dogs.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, respondeu: N\xe3o \xe9 bom tomar o p\xe3o dos filhos e lan\xe7\xe1-lo aos cachorrinhos."},{verse:27,en:"And she said, Truth, Lord: yet the dogs eat of the crumbs which fall from their masters\u2019 table.",pt:"Ao que ela disse: Sim, Senhor, mas at\xe9 os cachorrinhos comem das migalhas que caem da mesa dos seus donos."},{verse:28,en:"Then Jesus answered and said unto her, O woman, great is thy faith: be it unto thee even as thou wilt. And her daughter was made whole from that very hour.",pt:"Ent\xe3o respondeu Jesus, e disse-lhe: \xe7 mulher, grande \xe9 a tua f\xe9! seja-te feito como queres. E desde aquela hora sua filha ficou s\xe3."},{verse:29,en:"And Jesus departed from thence, and came nigh unto the sea of Galilee; and went up into a mountain, and sat down there.",pt:"Partindo Jesus dali, chegou ao p\xe9 do mar da Galil\xe9ia; e, subindo ao monte, sentou-se ali."},{verse:30,en:"And great multitudes came unto him, having with them those that were lame, blind, dumb, maimed, and many others, and cast them down at Jesus\u2019 feet; and he healed them:",pt:"E vieram a ele grandes multid\xf5es, trazendo consigo coxos, aleijados, cegos, mudos, e outros muitos, e lhos puseram aos p\xe9s; e ele os curou;"},{verse:31,en:"Insomuch that the multitude wondered, when they saw the dumb to speak, the maimed to be whole, the lame to walk, and the blind to see: and they glorified the God of Israel.",pt:"de modo que a multid\xe3o se admirou, vendo mudos a falar, aleijados a ficar s\xe3os, coxos a andar, cegos a ver; e glorificaram ao Deus de Israel."},{verse:32,en:"Then Jesus called his disciples unto him, and said, I have compassion on the multitude, because they continue with me now three days, and have nothing to eat: and I will not send them away fasting, lest they faint in the way.",pt:"Jesus chamou os seus disc\xedpulos, e disse: Tenho compaix\xe3o da multid\xe3o, porque j\xe1 faz tr\xeas dias que eles est\xe3o comigo, e n\xe3o t\xeam o que comer; e n\xe3o quero despedi-los em jejum, para que n\xe3o desfale\xe7am no caminho."},{verse:33,en:"And his disciples say unto him, Whence should we have so much bread in the wilderness, as to fill so great a multitude?",pt:"Disseram-lhe os disc\xedpulos: Donde nos viriam num deserto tantos p\xe3es, para fartar tamanha multid\xe3o?"},{verse:34,en:"And Jesus saith unto them, How many loaves have ye? And they said, Seven, and a few little fishes.",pt:"Perguntou-lhes Jesus: Quantos p\xe3es tendes? E responderam: Sete, e alguns peixinhos."},{verse:35,en:"And he commanded the multitude to sit down on the ground.",pt:"E tendo ele ordenado ao povo que se sentasse no ch\xe3o,"},{verse:36,en:"And he took the seven loaves and the fishes, and gave thanks, and brake them, and gave to his disciples, and the disciples to the multitude.",pt:"tomou os sete p\xe3es e os peixes, e havendo dado gra\xe7as, partiu-os, e os entregava aos disc\xedpulos, e os disc\xedpulos \xe1 multid\xe3o."},{verse:37,en:"And they did all eat, and were filled: and they took up of the broken meat that was left seven baskets full.",pt:"Assim todos comeram, e se fartaram; e do que sobejou dos peda\xe7os levantaram sete alcofas cheias."},{verse:38,en:"And they that did eat were four thousand men, beside women and children.",pt:"Ora, os que tinham comido eram quatro mil homens al\xe9m de mulheres e crian\xe7as."},{verse:39,en:"And he sent away the multitude, and took ship, and came into the coasts of Magdala,",pt:"E havendo Jesus despedido a multid\xe3o, entrou no barco, e foi para os confins de Magad\xe3."}]}}),752,[]);
__d((function(e,s,o,a,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The Pharisees also with the Sadducees came, and tempting desired him that he would shew them a sign from heaven.",pt:"Ent\xe3o chegaram a ele os fariseus e os saduceus e, para o experimentarem, pediram-lhe que lhes mostrasse algum sinal do c\xe9u."},{verse:2,en:"He answered and said unto them, When it is evening, ye say, It will be fair weather: for the sky is red.",pt:"Mas ele respondeu, e disse-lhes: Ao cair da tarde, dizeis: Haver\xe1 bom tempo, porque o c\xe9u est\xe1 rubro."},{verse:3,en:"And in the morning, It will be foul weather to day: for the sky is red and lowring. O ye hypocrites, ye can discern the face of the sky; but can ye not discern the signs of the times?",pt:"E pela manh\xe3: Hoje haver\xe1 tempestade, porque o c\xe9u est\xe1 de um vermelho sombrio. Ora, sabeis discernir o aspecto do c\xe9u, e n\xe3o podeis discernir os sinais dos tempos?"},{verse:4,en:"A wicked and adulterous generation seeketh after a sign; and there shall no sign be given unto it, but the sign of the prophet Jonas. And he left them, and departed.",pt:"Uma gera\xe7\xe3o m\xe1 e ad\xfaltera pede um sinal, e nenhum sinal lhe ser\xe1 dado, sen\xe3o o de Jonas. E, deixando-os, retirou-se."},{verse:5,en:"And when his disciples were come to the other side, they had forgotten to take bread.",pt:"Quando os disc\xedpulos passaram para o outro lado, esqueceram- se de levar p\xe3o."},{verse:6,en:"Then Jesus said unto them, Take heed and beware of the leaven of the Pharisees and of the Sadducees.",pt:"E Jesus lhes disse: Olhai, e acautelai-vos do fermento dos fariseus e dos saduceus."},{verse:7,en:"And they reasoned among themselves, saying, It is because we have taken no bread.",pt:"Pelo que eles arrazoavam entre si, dizendo: \xc9 porque n\xe3o trouxemos p\xe3o."},{verse:8,en:"Which when Jesus perceived, he said unto them, O ye of little faith, why reason ye among yourselves, because ye have brought no bread?",pt:"E Jesus, percebendo isso, disse: Por que arrazoais entre v\xf3s por n\xe3o terdes p\xe3o, homens de pouca f\xe9?"},{verse:9,en:"Do ye not yet understand, neither remember the five loaves of the five thousand, and how many baskets ye took up?",pt:"N\xe3o compreendeis ainda, nem vos lembrais dos cinco p\xe3es para os cinco mil, e de quantos cestos levantastes?"},{verse:10,en:"Neither the seven loaves of the four thousand, and how many baskets ye took up?",pt:"Nem dos sete p\xe3es para os quatro mil, e de quantas alcofas levantastes?"},{verse:11,en:"How is it that ye do not understand that I spake it not to you concerning bread, that ye should beware of the leaven of the Pharisees and of the Sadducees?",pt:"Como n\xe3o compreendeis que n\xe3o nos falei a respeito de p\xe3es? Mas guardai-vos do fermento dos fariseus e dos saduceus."},{verse:12,en:"Then understood they how that he bade them not beware of the leaven of bread, but of the doctrine of the Pharisees and of the Sadducees.",pt:"Ent\xe3o entenderam que n\xe3o dissera que se guardassem, do fermento dos p\xe3es, mas da doutrina dos fariseus e dos saduceus."},{verse:13,en:"When Jesus came into the coasts of Caesarea Philippi, he asked his disciples, saying, Whom do men say that I the Son of man am?",pt:"Tendo Jesus chegado \xe0s regi\xf5es de Cesar\xe9ia de Felipe, interrogou os seus disc\xedpulos, dizendo: Quem dizem os homens ser o Filho do homem?"},{verse:14,en:"And they said, Some say that thou art John the Baptist: some, Elias; and others, Jeremias, or one of the prophets.",pt:"Responderam eles: Uns dizem que \xe9 Jo\xe3o, o Batista; outros, Elias; outros, Jeremias, ou algum dos profetas."},{verse:15,en:"He saith unto them, But whom say ye that I am?",pt:"Mas v\xf3s, perguntou-lhes Jesus, quem dizeis que eu sou?"},{verse:16,en:"And Simon Peter answered and said, Thou art the Christ, the Son of the living God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Sim\xe3o Pedro: Tu \xe9s o Cristo, o Filho do Deus vivo."},{verse:17,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto him, Blessed art thou, Simon Barjona: for flesh and blood hath not revealed it unto thee, but my Father which is in heaven.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Bem-aventurado \xe9s tu, Sim\xe3o Barjonas, porque n\xe3o foi carne e sangue que to revelou, mas meu Pai, que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us."},{verse:18,en:"And I say also unto thee, That thou art Peter, and upon this rock I will build my church; and the gates of hell shall not prevail against it.",pt:"Pois tamb\xe9m eu te digo que tu \xe9s Pedro, e sobre esta pedra edificarei a minha igreja, e as portas do hades n\xe3o prevalecer\xe3o contra ela;"},{verse:19,en:"And I will give unto thee the keys of the kingdom of heaven: and whatsoever thou shalt bind on earth shall be bound in heaven: and whatsoever thou shalt loose on earth shall be loosed in heaven.",pt:"dar-te-ei as chaves do reino dos c\xe9us; o que ligares, pois, na terra ser\xe1 ligado nos c\xe9us, e o que desligares na terra ser\xe1 desligado nos c\xe9us."},{verse:20,en:"Then charged he his disciples that they should tell no man that he was Jesus the Christ.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ordenou aos disc\xedpulos que a ningu\xe9m dissessem que ele era o Cristo."},{verse:21,en:"From that time forth began Jesus to shew unto his disciples, how that he must go unto Jerusalem, and suffer many things of the elders and chief priests and scribes, and be killed, and be raised again the third day.",pt:"Desde ent\xe3o come\xe7ou Jesus Cristo a mostrar aos seus disc\xedpulos que era necess\xe1rio que ele fosse a Jerusal\xe9m, que padecesse muitas coisas dos anci\xe3os, dos principais sacerdotes, e dos escribas, que fosse morto, e que ao terceiro dia ressuscitasse."},{verse:22,en:"Then Peter took him, and began to rebuke him, saying, Be it far from thee, Lord: this shall not be unto thee.",pt:"E Pedro, tomando-o \xe0 parte, come\xe7ou a repreend\xea-lo, dizendo: Tenha Deus compaix\xe3o de ti, Senhor; isso de modo nenhum te acontecer\xe1."},{verse:23,en:"But he turned, and said unto Peter, Get thee behind me, Satan: thou art an offence unto me: for thou savourest not the things that be of God, but those that be of men.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, voltando-se, disse a Pedro: Para tr\xe1s de mim, Satan\xe1s, que me serves de esc\xe2ndalo; porque n\xe3o est\xe1s pensando nas coisas que s\xe3o de Deus, mas sim nas que s\xe3o dos homens."},{verse:24,en:"Then said Jesus unto his disciples, If any man will come after me, let him deny himself, and take up his cross, and follow me.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse Jesus aos seus disc\xedpulos: Se algu\xe9m quer vir ap\xf3s mim, negue-se a si mesmo, tome a sua cruz, e siga-me;"},{verse:25,en:"For whosoever will save his life shall lose it: and whosoever will lose his life for my sake shall find it.",pt:"pois, quem quiser salvar a sua vida perd\xea-la-\xe1; mas quem perder a sua vida por amor de mim, ach\xe1-la-\xe1."},{verse:26,en:"For what is a man profited, if he shall gain the whole world, and lose his own soul? or what shall a man give in exchange for his soul?",pt:"Pois que aproveita ao homem se ganhar o mundo inteiro e perder a sua vida? ou que dar\xe1 o homem em troca da sua vida?"},{verse:27,en:"For the Son of man shall come in the glory of his Father with his angels; and then he shall reward every man according to his works.",pt:"Porque o Filho do homem h\xe1 de vir na gl\xf3ria de seu Pai, com os seus anjos; e ent\xe3o retribuir\xe1 a cada um segundo as suas obras."},{verse:28,en:"Verily I say unto you, There be some standing here, which shall not taste of death, till they see the Son of man coming in his kingdom.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo, alguns dos que aqui est\xe3o de modo nenhum provar\xe3o a morte at\xe9 que vejam vir o Filho do homem no seu reino."}]}}),753,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:17,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And after six days Jesus taketh Peter, James, and John his brother, and bringeth them up into an high mountain apart,",pt:"Seis dias depois, tomou Jesus consigo a Pedro, a Tiago e a Jo\xe3o, irm\xe3o deste, e os conduziu \xe0 parte a um alto monte;"},{verse:2,en:"And was transfigured before them: and his face did shine as the sun, and his raiment was white as the light.",pt:"e foi transfigurado diante deles; o seu rosto resplandeceu como o sol, e as suas vestes tornaram-se brancas como a luz."},{verse:3,en:"And, behold, there appeared unto them Moses and Elias talking with him.",pt:"E eis que lhes apareceram Mois\xe9s e Elias, falando com ele."},{verse:4,en:"Then answered Peter, and said unto Jesus, Lord, it is good for us to be here: if thou wilt, let us make here three tabernacles; one for thee, and one for Moses, and one for Elias.",pt:"Pedro, tomando a palavra, disse a Jesus: Senhor, bom \xe9 estarmos aqui; se queres, farei aqui tr\xeas cabanas, uma para ti, outra para Mois\xe9s, e outra para Elias."},{verse:5,en:"While he yet spake, behold, a bright cloud overshadowed them: and behold a voice out of the cloud, which said, This is my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased; hear ye him.",pt:"Estando ele ainda a falar, eis que uma nuvem luminosa os cobriu; e dela saiu uma voz que dizia: Este \xe9 o meu Filho amado, em quem me comprazo; a ele ouvi."},{verse:6,en:"And when the disciples heard it, they fell on their face, and were sore afraid.",pt:"Os disc\xedpulos, ouvindo isso, cairam com o rosto em terra, e ficaram grandemente atemorizados."},{verse:7,en:"And Jesus came and touched them, and said, Arise, and be not afraid.",pt:"Chegou-se, pois, Jesus e, tocando-os, disse: Levantai-vos e n\xe3o temais."},{verse:8,en:"And when they had lifted up their eyes, they saw no man, save Jesus only.",pt:"E, erguendo eles os olhos, n\xe3o viram a ningu\xe9m sen\xe3o a Jesus somente."},{verse:9,en:"And as they came down from the mountain, Jesus charged them, saying, Tell the vision to no man, until the Son of man be risen again from the dead.",pt:"Enquanto desciam do monte, Jesus lhes ordenou: A ningu\xe9m conteis a vis\xe3o, at\xe9 que o Filho do homem seja levantado dentre os mortos."},{verse:10,en:"And his disciples asked him, saying, Why then say the scribes that Elias must first come?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe os disc\xedpulos: Por que dizem ent\xe3o os escribas que \xe9 necess\xe1rio que Elias venha primeiro?"},{verse:11,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto them, Elias truly shall first come, and restore all things.",pt:"Respondeu ele: Na verdade Elias havia de vir e restaurar todas as coisas;"},{verse:12,en:"But I say unto you, That Elias is come already, and they knew him not, but have done unto him whatsoever they listed. Likewise shall also the Son of man suffer of them.",pt:"digo-vos, por\xe9m, que Elias j\xe1 veio, e n\xe3o o reconheceram; mas fizeram-lhe tudo o que quiseram. Assim tamb\xe9m o Filho do homem h\xe1 de padecer \xe0s m\xe3os deles."},{verse:13,en:"Then the disciples understood that he spake unto them of John the Baptist.",pt:"Ent\xe3o entenderam os disc\xedpulos que lhes falava a respeito de Jo\xe3o, o Batista."},{verse:14,en:"And when they were come to the multitude, there came to him a certain man, kneeling down to him, and saying,",pt:"Quando chegaram \xe0 multid\xe3o, aproximou-se de Jesus um homem que, ajoelhando-se diante dele, disse:"},{verse:15,en:"Lord, have mercy on my son: for he is lunatick, and sore vexed: for ofttimes he falleth into the fire, and oft into the water.",pt:"Senhor, tem compaix\xe3o de meu filho, porque \xe9 epil\xe9ptico e sofre muito; pois muitas vezes cai no fogo, e muitas vezes na \xe1gua."},{verse:16,en:"And I brought him to thy disciples, and they could not cure him.",pt:"Eu o trouxe aos teus disc\xedpulos, e n\xe3o o puderam curar."},{verse:17,en:"Then Jesus answered and said, O faithless and perverse generation, how long shall I be with you? how long shall I suffer you? bring him hither to me.",pt:"E Jesus, respondendo, disse: \xd3 gera\xe7\xe3o incr\xe9dula e perversa! at\xe9 quando estarei convosco? at\xe9 quando vos sofrerei? Trazei-mo aqui."},{verse:18,en:"And Jesus rebuked the devil; and he departed out of him: and the child was cured from that very hour.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus repreendeu ao dem\xf4nio, o qual saiu de menino, que desde aquela hora ficou curado."},{verse:19,en:"Then came the disciples to Jesus apart, and said, Why could not we cast him out?",pt:"Depois os disc\xedpulos, aproximando-se de Jesus em particular, perguntaram-lhe: Por que n\xe3o pudemos n\xf3s expuls\xe1-lo?"},{verse:20,en:"And Jesus said unto them, Because of your unbelief: for verily I say unto you, If ye have faith as a grain of mustard seed, ye shall say unto this mountain, Remove hence to yonder place; and it shall remove; and nothing shall be impossible unto you.",pt:"Disse-lhes ele: Por causa da vossa pouca f\xe9; pois em verdade vos digo que, se tiverdes f\xe9 como um gr\xe3o de mostarda direis a este monte: Passa daqui para acol\xe1, e ele h\xe1 de passar; e nada vos ser\xe1 imposs\xedvel."},{verse:21,en:"Howbeit this kind goeth not out but by prayer and fasting.",pt:"[mas esta casta de dem\xf4nios n\xe3o se expulsa sen\xe3o \xe0 for\xe7a de ora\xe7\xe3o e de jejum.]"},{verse:22,en:"And while they abode in Galilee, Jesus said unto them, The Son of man shall be betrayed into the hands of men:",pt:"Ora, achando-se eles na Galil\xe9ia, disse-lhes Jesus: O Filho do homem est\xe1 para ser entregue nas m\xe3os dos homens;"},{verse:23,en:"And they shall kill him, and the third day he shall be raised again. And they were exceeding sorry.",pt:"e mat\xe1-lo-\xe3o, e ao terceiro dia ressurgir\xe1. E eles se entristeceram grandemente."},{verse:24,en:"And when they were come to Capernaum, they that received tribute money came to Peter, and said, Doth not your master pay tribute?",pt:"Tendo eles chegado a Cafarnaum, aproximaram-se de Pedro os que cobravam as didracmas, e lhe perguntaram: O vosso mestre n\xe3o paga as didracmas?"},{verse:25,en:"He saith, Yes. And when he was come into the house, Jesus prevented him, saying, What thinkest thou, Simon? of whom do the kings of the earth take custom or tribute? of their own children, or of strangers?",pt:"Disse ele: Sim. Ao entrar Pedro em casa, Jesus se lhe antecipou, perguntando: Que te parece, Sim\xe3o? De quem cobram os reis da terra imposto ou tributo? dos seus filhos, ou dos alheios?"},{verse:26,en:"Peter saith unto him, Of strangers. Jesus saith unto him, Then are the children free.",pt:"Quando ele respondeu: Dos alheios, disse-lhe Jesus: Logo, s\xe3o isentos os filhos."},{verse:27,en:"Notwithstanding, lest we should offend them, go thou to the sea, and cast an hook, and take up the fish that first cometh up; and when thou hast opened his mouth, thou shalt find a piece of money: that take, and give unto them for me and thee.",pt:"Mas, para que n\xe3o os escandalizemos, vai ao mar, lan\xe7a o anzol, tira o primeiro peixe que subir e, abrindo-lhe a boca, encontrar\xe1s um est\xe1ter; toma-o, e d\xe1-lho por mim e por ti."}]}}),754,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:18,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"At the same time came the disciples unto Jesus, saying, Who is the greatest in the kingdom of heaven?",pt:"Naquela hora chegaram-se a Jesus os disc\xedpulos e perguntaram: Quem \xe9 o maior no reino dos c\xe9us?"},{verse:2,en:"And Jesus called a little child unto him, and set him in the midst of them,",pt:"Jesus, chamando uma crian\xe7a, colocou-a no meio deles,"},{verse:3,en:"And said, Verily I say unto you, Except ye be converted, and become as little children, ye shall not enter into the kingdom of heaven.",pt:"e disse: Em verdade vos digo que se n\xe3o vos converterdes e n\xe3o vos fizerdes como crian\xe7as, de modo algum entrareis no reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:4,en:"Whosoever therefore shall humble himself as this little child, the same is greatest in the kingdom of heaven.",pt:"Portanto, quem se tornar humilde como esta crian\xe7a, esse \xe9 o maior no reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:5,en:"And whoso shall receive one such little child in my name receiveth me.",pt:"E qualquer que receber em meu nome uma crian\xe7a tal como esta, a mim me recebe."},{verse:6,en:"But whoso shall offend one of these little ones which believe in me, it were better for him that a millstone were hanged about his neck, and that he were drowned in the depth of the sea.",pt:"Mas qualquer que fizer trope\xe7ar um destes pequeninos que creem em mim, melhor lhe fora que se lhe pendurasse ao pesco\xe7o uma pedra de moinho, e se submergisse na profundeza do mar."},{verse:7,en:"Woe unto the world because of offences! for it must needs be that offences come; but woe to that man by whom the offence cometh!",pt:"Ai do mundo, por causa dos trope\xe7os! pois \xe9 inevit\xe1vel que venham; mas ai do homem por quem o trope\xe7o vier!"},{verse:8,en:"Wherefore if thy hand or thy foot offend thee, cut them off, and cast them from thee: it is better for thee to enter into life halt or maimed, rather than having two hands or two feet to be cast into everlasting fire.",pt:"Se, pois, a tua m\xe3o ou o teu p\xe9 te fizer trope\xe7ar, corta-o, lan\xe7a-o de ti; melhor te \xe9 entrar na vida aleijado, ou coxo, do que, tendo duas m\xe3os ou dois p\xe9s, ser lan\xe7ado no fogo eterno."},{verse:9,en:"And if thine eye offend thee, pluck it out, and cast it from thee: it is better for thee to enter into life with one eye, rather than having two eyes to be cast into hell fire.",pt:"E, se teu olho te fizer trope\xe7ar, arranca-o, e lan\xe7a-o de ti; melhor te \xe9 entrar na vida com um s\xf3 olho, do que tendo dois olhos, ser lan\xe7ado no inferno de fogo."},{verse:10,en:"Take heed that ye despise not one of these little ones; for I say unto you, That in heaven their angels do always behold the face of my Father which is in heaven.",pt:"Vede, n\xe3o desprezeis a nenhum destes pequeninos; pois eu vos digo que os seus anjos nos c\xe9us sempre v\xeam a face de meu Pai, que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us."},{verse:11,en:"For the Son of man is come to save that which was lost.",pt:"[Porque o Filho do homem veio salvar o que se havia perdido.]"},{verse:12,en:"How think ye? if a man have an hundred sheep, and one of them be gone astray, doth he not leave the ninety and nine, and goeth into the mountains, and seeketh that which is gone astray?",pt:"Que vos parece? Se algu\xe9m tiver cem ovelhas, e uma delas se extraviar, n\xe3o deixar\xe1 as noventa e nove nos montes para ir buscar a que se extraviou?"},{verse:13,en:"And if so be that he find it, verily I say unto you, he rejoiceth more of that sheep, than of the ninety and nine which went not astray.",pt:"E, se acontecer ach\xe1-la, em verdade vos digo que maior prazer tem por esta do que pelas noventa e nove que n\xe3o se extraviaram."},{verse:14,en:"Even so it is not the will of your Father which is in heaven, that one of these little ones should perish.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m n\xe3o \xe9 da vontade de vosso Pai que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us, que venha a perecer um s\xf3 destes pequeninos."},{verse:15,en:"Moreover if thy brother shall trespass against thee, go and tell him his fault between thee and him alone: if he shall hear thee, thou hast gained thy brother.",pt:"Ora, se teu irm\xe3o pecar, vai, e repreende-o entre ti e ele s\xf3; se te ouvir, ter\xe1s ganho teu irm\xe3o;"},{verse:16,en:"But if he will not hear thee, then take with thee one or two more, that in the mouth of two or three witnesses every word may be established.",pt:"mas se n\xe3o te ouvir, leva ainda contigo um ou dois, para que pela boca de duas ou tr\xeas testemunhas toda palavra seja confirmada."},{verse:17,en:"And if he shall neglect to hear them, tell it unto the church: but if he neglect to hear the church, let him be unto thee as an heathen man and a publican.",pt:"Se recusar ouvi-los, dize-o \xe0 igreja; e, se tamb\xe9m recusar ouvir a igreja, considera-o como gentio e publicano."},{verse:18,en:"Verily I say unto you, Whatsoever ye shall bind on earth shall be bound in heaven: and whatsoever ye shall loose on earth shall be loosed in heaven.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo: Tudo quanto ligardes na terra ser\xe1 ligado no c\xe9u; e tudo quanto desligardes na terra ser\xe1 desligado no c\xe9u."},{verse:19,en:"Again I say unto you, That if two of you shall agree on earth as touching any thing that they shall ask, it shall be done for them of my Father which is in heaven.",pt:"Ainda vos digo mais: Se dois de v\xf3s na terra concordarem acerca de qualquer coisa que pedirem, isso lhes ser\xe1 feito por meu Pai, que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us."},{verse:20,en:"For where two or three are gathered together in my name, there am I in the midst of them.",pt:"Pois onde se acham dois ou tr\xeas reunidos em meu nome, a\xed estou eu no meio deles."},{verse:21,en:"Then came Peter to him, and said, Lord, how oft shall my brother sin against me, and I forgive him? till seven times?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pedro, aproximando-se dele, lhe perguntou: Senhor, at\xe9 quantas vezes pecar\xe1 meu irm\xe3o contra mim, e eu hei de perdoar? At\xe9 sete?"},{verse:22,en:"Jesus saith unto him, I say not unto thee, Until seven times: but, Until seventy times seven.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: N\xe3o te digo que at\xe9 sete; mas at\xe9 setenta vezes sete."},{verse:23,en:"Therefore is the kingdom of heaven likened unto a certain king, which would take account of his servants.",pt:"Por isso o reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 comparado a um rei que quis tomar contas a seus servos;"},{verse:24,en:"And when he had begun to reckon, one was brought unto him, which owed him ten thousand talents.",pt:"e, tendo come\xe7ado a tom\xe1-las, foi-lhe apresentado um que lhe devia dez mil talentos;"},{verse:25,en:"But forasmuch as he had not to pay, his lord commanded him to be sold, and his wife, and children, and all that he had, and payment to be made.",pt:"mas n\xe3o tendo ele com que pagar, ordenou seu senhor que fossem vendidos, ele, sua mulher, seus filhos, e tudo o que tinha, e que se pagasse a d\xedvida."},{verse:26,en:"The servant therefore fell down, and worshipped him, saying, Lord, have patience with me, and I will pay thee all.",pt:"Ent\xe3o aquele servo, prostrando-se, o reverenciava, dizendo: Senhor, tem paci\xeancia comigo, que tudo te pagarei."},{verse:27,en:"Then the lord of that servant was moved with compassion, and loosed him, and forgave him the debt.",pt:"O senhor daquele servo, pois, movido de compaix\xe3o, soltou-o, e perdoou-lhe a d\xedvida."},{verse:28,en:"But the same servant went out, and found one of his fellowservants, which owed him an hundred pence: and he laid hands on him, and took him by the throat, saying, Pay me that thou owest.",pt:"Saindo, por\xe9m, aquele servo, encontrou um dos seus conservos, que lhe devia cem den\xe1rios; e, segurando-o, o sufocava, dizendo: Paga o que me deves."},{verse:29,en:"And his fellowservant fell down at his feet, and besought him, saying, Have patience with me, and I will pay thee all.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o seu companheiro, caindo-lhe aos p\xe9s, rogava-lhe, dizendo: Tem paci\xeancia comigo, que te pagarei."},{verse:30,en:"And he would not: but went and cast him into prison, till he should pay the debt.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, n\xe3o quis; antes foi encerr\xe1-lo na pris\xe3o, at\xe9 que pagasse a d\xedvida."},{verse:31,en:"So when his fellowservants saw what was done, they were very sorry, and came and told unto their lord all that was done.",pt:"Vendo, pois, os seus conservos o que acontecera, contristaram-se grandemente, e foram revelar tudo isso ao seu senhor."},{verse:32,en:"Then his lord, after that he had called him, said unto him, O thou wicked servant, I forgave thee all that debt, because thou desiredst me:",pt:"Ent\xe3o o seu senhor, chamando-o \xe1 sua presen\xe7a, disse-lhe: Servo malvado, perdoei-te toda aquela d\xedvida, porque me suplicaste;"},{verse:33,en:"Shouldest not thou also have had compassion on thy fellowservant, even as I had pity on thee?",pt:"n\xe3o devias tu tamb\xe9m ter compaix\xe3o do teu companheiro, assim como eu tive compaix\xe3o de ti?"},{verse:34,en:"And his lord was wroth, and delivered him to the tormentors, till he should pay all that was due unto him.",pt:"E, indignado, o seu senhor o entregou aos verdugos, at\xe9 que pagasse tudo o que lhe devia."},{verse:35,en:"So likewise shall my heavenly Father do also unto you, if ye from your hearts forgive not every one his brother their trespasses.",pt:"Assim vos far\xe1 meu Pai celestial, se de cora\xe7\xe3o n\xe3o perdoardes, cada um a seu irm\xe3o."}]}}),755,[]);
__d((function(e,s,o,a,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:19,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass, that when Jesus had finished these sayings, he departed from Galilee, and came into the coasts of Judaea beyond Jordan;",pt:"Tendo Jesus conclu\xeddo estas palavras, partiu da Galil\xe9ia, e foi para os confins da Jud\xe9ia, al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o;"},{verse:2,en:"And great multitudes followed him; and he healed them there.",pt:"e seguiram-no grandes multid\xf5es, e curou-os ali."},{verse:3,en:"The Pharisees also came unto him, tempting him, and saying unto him, Is it lawful for a man to put away his wife for every cause?",pt:"Aproximaram-se dele alguns fariseus que o experimentavam, dizendo: \xc9 l\xedcito ao homem repudiar sua mulher por qualquer motivo?"},{verse:4,en:"And he answered and said unto them, Have ye not read, that he which made them at the beginning made them male and female,",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: N\xe3o tendes lido que o Criador os fez desde o princ\xedpio homem e mulher,"},{verse:5,en:"And said, For this cause shall a man leave father and mother, and shall cleave to his wife: and they twain shall be one flesh?",pt:"e que ordenou: Por isso deixar\xe1 o homem pai e m\xe3e, e unir-se-\xe1 a sua mulher; e ser\xe3o os dois uma s\xf3 carne?"},{verse:6,en:"Wherefore they are no more twain, but one flesh. What therefore God hath joined together, let not man put asunder.",pt:"Assim j\xe1 n\xe3o s\xe3o mais dois, mas um s\xf3 carne. Portanto o que Deus ajuntou, n\xe3o o separe o homem."},{verse:7,en:"They say unto him, Why did Moses then command to give a writing of divorcement, and to put her away?",pt:"Responderam-lhe: Ent\xe3o por que mandou Mois\xe9s dar-lhe carta de div\xf3rcio e repudi\xe1-la?"},{verse:8,en:"He saith unto them, Moses because of the hardness of your hearts suffered you to put away your wives: but from the beginning it was not so.",pt:"Disse-lhes ele: Pela dureza de vossos cora\xe7\xf5es Mois\xe9s vos permitiu repudiar vossas mulheres; mas n\xe3o foi assim desde o princ\xedpio."},{verse:9,en:"And I say unto you, Whosoever shall put away his wife, except it be for fornication, and shall marry another, committeth adultery: and whoso marrieth her which is put away doth commit adultery.",pt:"Eu vos digo por\xe9m, que qualquer que repudiar sua mulher, a n\xe3o ser por causa de infidelidade, e casar com outra, comete adult\xe9rio; [e o que casar com a repudiada tamb\xe9m comete adult\xe9rio.]"},{verse:10,en:"His disciples say unto him, If the case of the man be so with his wife, it is not good to marry.",pt:"Disseram-lhe os disc\xedpulos: Se tal \xe9 a condi\xe7\xe3o do homem relativamente \xe0 mulher, n\xe3o conv\xe9m casar."},{verse:11,en:"But he said unto them, All men cannot receive this saying, save they to whom it is given.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhes disse: Nem todos podem aceitar esta palavra, mas somente aqueles a quem \xe9 dado."},{verse:12,en:"For there are some eunuchs, which were so born from their mother\u2019s womb: and there are some eunuchs, which were made eunuchs of men: and there be eunuchs, which have made themselves eunuchs for the kingdom of heaven\u2019s sake. He that is able to receive it, let him receive it.",pt:"Porque h\xe1 eunucos que nasceram assim; e h\xe1 eunucos que pelos homens foram feitos tais; e outros h\xe1 que a si mesmos se fizeram eunucos por causa do reino dos c\xe9us. Quem pode aceitar isso, aceite-o."},{verse:13,en:"Then were there brought unto him little children, that he should put his hands on them, and pray: and the disciples rebuked them.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhe trouxeram algumas crian\xe7as para que lhes impusesse as m\xe3os, e orasse; mas os disc\xedpulos os repreenderam."},{verse:14,en:"But Jesus said, Suffer little children, and forbid them not, to come unto me: for of such is the kingdom of heaven.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, disse: Deixai as crian\xe7as e n\xe3o as impe\xe7ais de virem a mim, porque de tais \xe9 o reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:15,en:"And he laid his hands on them, and departed thence.",pt:"E, depois de lhes impor as m\xe3os, partiu dali."},{verse:16,en:"And, behold, one came and said unto him, Good Master, what good thing shall I do, that I may have eternal life?",pt:"E eis que se aproximou dele um jovem, e lhe disse: Mestre, que bem farei para conseguir a vida eterna?"},{verse:17,en:"And he said unto him, Why callest thou me good? there is none good but one, that is, God: but if thou wilt enter into life, keep the commandments.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe ele: Por que me perguntas sobre o que \xe9 bom? Um s\xf3 \xe9 bom; mas se \xe9 que queres entrar na vida, guarda os mandamentos."},{verse:18,en:"He saith unto him, Which? Jesus said, Thou shalt do no murder, Thou shalt not commit adultery, Thou shalt not steal, Thou shalt not bear false witness,",pt:"Perguntou-lhe ele: Quais? Respondeu Jesus: N\xe3o matar\xe1s; n\xe3o adulterar\xe1s; n\xe3o furtar\xe1s; n\xe3o dir\xe1s falso testemunho;"},{verse:19,en:"Honour thy father and thy mother: and, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself.",pt:"honra a teu pai e a tua m\xe3e; e amar\xe1s o teu pr\xf3ximo como a ti mesmo."},{verse:20,en:"The young man saith unto him, All these things have I kept from my youth up: what lack I yet?",pt:"Disse-lhe o jovem: Tudo isso tenho guardado; que me falta ainda?"},{verse:21,en:"Jesus said unto him, If thou wilt be perfect, go and sell that thou hast, and give to the poor, and thou shalt have treasure in heaven: and come and follow me.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Se queres ser perfeito, vai, vende tudo o que tens e d\xe1-o aos pobres, e ter\xe1s um tesouro no c\xe9u; e vem, segue- me."},{verse:22,en:"But when the young man heard that saying, he went away sorrowful: for he had great possessions.",pt:"Mas o jovem, ouvindo essa palavra, retirou-se triste; porque possu\xeda muitos bens."},{verse:23,en:"Then said Jesus unto his disciples, Verily I say unto you, That a rich man shall hardly enter into the kingdom of heaven.",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o Jesus aos seus disc\xedpulos: Em verdade vos digo que um rico dificilmente entrar\xe1 no reino dos c\xe9us."},{verse:24,en:"And again I say unto you, It is easier for a camel to go through the eye of a needle, than for a rich man to enter into the kingdom of God.",pt:"E outra vez vos digo que \xe9 mais f\xe1cil um camelo passar pelo fundo duma agulha, do que entrar um rico no reino de Deus."},{verse:25,en:"When his disciples heard it, they were exceedingly amazed, saying, Who then can be saved?",pt:"Quando os seus disc\xedpulos ouviram isso, ficaram grandemente maravilhados, e perguntaram: Quem pode, ent\xe3o, ser salvo?"},{verse:26,en:"But Jesus beheld them, and said unto them, With men this is impossible; but with God all things are possible.",pt:"Jesus, fixando neles o olhar, respondeu: Aos homens \xe9 isso imposs\xedvel, mas a Deus tudo \xe9 poss\xedvel."},{verse:27,en:"Then answered Peter and said unto him, Behold, we have forsaken all, and followed thee; what shall we have therefore?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pedro, tomando a palavra, disse-lhe: Eis que n\xf3s deixamos tudo, e te seguimos; que recompensa, pois, teremos n\xf3s?"},{verse:28,en:"And Jesus said unto them, Verily I say unto you, That ye which have followed me, in the regeneration when the Son of man shall sit in the throne of his glory, ye also shall sit upon twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes of Israel.",pt:"Ao que lhe disse Jesus: Em verdade vos digo a v\xf3s que me seguistes, que na regenera\xe7\xe3o, quando o Filho do homem se assentar no trono da sua gl\xf3ria, sentar-vos-eis tamb\xe9m v\xf3s sobre doze tronos, para julgar as doze tribos de Israel."},{verse:29,en:"And every one that hath forsaken houses, or brethren, or sisters, or father, or mother, or wife, or children, or lands, for my name\u2019s sake, shall receive an hundredfold, and shall inherit everlasting life.",pt:"E todo o que tiver deixado casas, ou irm\xe3os, ou irm\xe3s, ou pai, ou m\xe3e, ou filhos, ou terras, por amor do meu nome, receber\xe1 cem vezes tanto, e herdar\xe1 a vida eterna."},{verse:30,en:"But many that are first shall be last; and the last shall be first.",pt:"Entretanto, muitos que s\xe3o primeiros ser\xe3o \xfaltimos; e muitos que s\xe3o \xfaltimos ser\xe3o primeiros."}]}}),756,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:20,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"For the kingdom of heaven is like unto a man that is an householder, which went out early in the morning to hire labourers into his vineyard.",pt:"Porque o reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 semelhante a um homem, propriet\xe1rio, que saiu de madrugada a contratar trabalhadores para a sua vinha."},{verse:2,en:"And when he had agreed with the labourers for a penny a day, he sent them into his vineyard.",pt:"Ajustou com os trabalhadores o sal\xe1rio de um den\xe1rio por dia, e mandou-os para a sua vinha."},{verse:3,en:"And he went out about the third hour, and saw others standing idle in the marketplace,",pt:"Cerca da hora terceira saiu, e viu que estavam outros, ociosos, na pra\xe7a,"},{verse:4,en:"And said unto them; Go ye also into the vineyard, and whatsoever is right I will give you. And they went their way.",pt:"e disse-lhes: Ide tamb\xe9m v\xf3s para a vinha, e dar-vos-ei o que for justo. E eles foram."},{verse:5,en:"Again he went out about the sixth and ninth hour, and did likewise.",pt:"Outra vez saiu, cerca da hora sexta e da nona, e fez o mesmo."},{verse:6,en:"And about the eleventh hour he went out, and found others standing idle, and saith unto them, Why stand ye here all the day idle?",pt:"Igualmente, cerca da hora und\xe9cima, saiu e achou outros que l\xe1 estavam, e perguntou-lhes: Por que estais aqui ociosos o dia todo?"},{verse:7,en:"They say unto him, Because no man hath hired us. He saith unto them, Go ye also into the vineyard; and whatsoever is right, that shall ye receive.",pt:"Responderam-lhe eles: Porque ningu\xe9m nos contratou. Disse- lhes ele: Ide tamb\xe9m v\xf3s para a vinha."},{verse:8,en:"So when even was come, the lord of the vineyard saith unto his steward, Call the labourers, and give them their hire, beginning from the last unto the first.",pt:"Ao anoitecer, disse o senhor da vinha ao seu mordomo: Chama os trabalhadores, e paga-lhes o sal\xe1rio, come\xe7ando pelos \xfaltimos at\xe9 os primeiros."},{verse:9,en:"And when they came that were hired about the eleventh hour, they received every man a penny.",pt:"Chegando, pois, os que tinham ido cerca da hora und\xe9cima, receberam um den\xe1rio cada um."},{verse:10,en:"But when the first came, they supposed that they should have received more; and they likewise received every man a penny.",pt:"Vindo, ent\xe3o, os primeiros, pensaram que haviam de receber mais; mas do mesmo modo receberam um den\xe1rio cada um."},{verse:11,en:"And when they had received it, they murmured against the goodman of the house,",pt:"E ao receb\xea-lo, murmuravam contra o propriet\xe1rio, dizendo:"},{verse:12,en:"Saying, These last have wrought but one hour, and thou hast made them equal unto us, which have borne the burden and heat of the day.",pt:"Estes \xfaltimos trabalharam somente uma hora, e os igualastes a n\xf3s, que suportamos a fadiga do dia inteiro e o forte calor."},{verse:13,en:"But he answered one of them, and said, Friend, I do thee no wrong: didst not thou agree with me for a penny?",pt:"Mas ele, respondendo, disse a um deles: Amigo, n\xe3o te fa\xe7o injusti\xe7a; n\xe3o ajustaste comigo um den\xe1rio?"},{verse:14,en:"Take that thine is, and go thy way: I will give unto this last, even as unto thee.",pt:"Toma o que \xe9 teu, e vai-te; eu quero dar a este \xfaltimo tanto como a ti."},{verse:15,en:"Is it not lawful for me to do what I will with mine own? Is thine eye evil, because I am good?",pt:"N\xe3o me \xe9 l\xedcito fazer o que quero do que \xe9 meu? Ou \xe9 mau o teu olho porque eu sou bom?"},{verse:16,en:"So the last shall be first, and the first last: for many be called, but few chosen.",pt:"Assim os \xfaltimos ser\xe3o primeiros, e os primeiros ser\xe3o \xfaltimos."},{verse:17,en:"And Jesus going up to Jerusalem took the twelve disciples apart in the way, and said unto them,",pt:"Estando Jesus para subir a Jerusal\xe9m, chamou \xe0 parte os doze e no caminho lhes disse:"},{verse:18,en:"Behold, we go up to Jerusalem; and the Son of man shall be betrayed unto the chief priests and unto the scribes, and they shall condemn him to death,",pt:"Eis que subimos a Jerusal\xe9m, e o Filho do homem ser\xe1 entregue aos principais sacerdotes e aos escribas, e eles o condenar\xe3o \xe0 morte,"},{verse:19,en:"And shall deliver him to the Gentiles to mock, and to scourge, and to crucify him: and the third day he shall rise again.",pt:"e o entregar\xe3o aos gentios para que dele escarne\xe7am, e o a\xe7oitem e crucifiquem; e ao terceiro dia ressuscitar\xe1."},{verse:20,en:"Then came to him the mother of Zebedee\u2019s children with her sons, worshipping him, and desiring a certain thing of him.",pt:"Aproximou-se dele, ent\xe3o, a m\xe3e dos filhos de Zebedeu, com seus filhos, ajoelhando-se e fazendo-lhe um pedido."},{verse:21,en:"And he said unto her, What wilt thou? She saith unto him, Grant that these my two sons may sit, the one on thy right hand, and the other on the left, in thy kingdom.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Jesus: Que queres? Ela lhe respondeu: Concede que estes meus dois filhos se sentem, um \xe0 tua direita e outro \xe0 tua esquerda, no teu reino."},{verse:22,en:"But Jesus answered and said, Ye know not what ye ask. Are ye able to drink of the cup that I shall drink of, and to be baptized with the baptism that I am baptized with? They say unto him, We are able.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, replicou: N\xe3o sabeis o que pedis; podeis beber o c\xe1lice que eu estou para beber? Responderam-lhe: Podemos."},{verse:23,en:"And he saith unto them, Ye shall drink indeed of my cup, and be baptized with the baptism that I am baptized with: but to sit on my right hand, and on my left, is not mine to give, but it shall be given to them for whom it is prepared of my Father.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes disse: O meu c\xe1lice certamente haveis de beber; mas o sentar-se \xe0 minha direita e \xe0 minha esquerda, n\xe3o me pertence conced\xea-lo; mas isso \xe9 para aqueles para quem est\xe1 preparado por meu Pai."},{verse:24,en:"And when the ten heard it, they were moved with indignation against the two brethren.",pt:"E ouvindo isso os dez, indignaram-se contra os dois irm\xe3os."},{verse:25,en:"But Jesus called them unto him, and said, Ye know that the princes of the Gentiles exercise dominion over them, and they that are great exercise authority upon them.",pt:"Jesus, pois, chamou-os para junto de si e lhes disse: Sabeis que os governadores dos gentios os dominam, e os seus grandes exercem autoridades sobre eles."},{verse:26,en:"But it shall not be so among you: but whosoever will be great among you, let him be your minister;",pt:"N\xe3o ser\xe1 assim entre v\xf3s; antes, qualquer que entre v\xf3s quiser tornar-se grande, ser\xe1 esse o que vos sirva;"},{verse:27,en:"And whosoever will be chief among you, let him be your servant:",pt:"e qualquer que entre v\xf3s quiser ser o primeiro, ser\xe1 vosso servo;"},{verse:28,en:"Even as the Son of man came not to be ministered unto, but to minister, and to give his life a ransom for many.",pt:"assim como o Filho do homem n\xe3o veio para ser servido, mas para servir, e para dar a sua vida em resgate de muitos."},{verse:29,en:"And as they departed from Jericho, a great multitude followed him.",pt:"Saindo eles de Jeric\xf3, seguiu-o uma grande multid\xe3o;"},{verse:30,en:"And, behold, two blind men sitting by the way side, when they heard that Jesus passed by, cried out, saying, Have mercy on us, O Lord, thou Son of David.",pt:"e eis que dois cegos, sentados junto do caminho, ouvindo que Jesus passava, clamaram, dizendo: Senhor, Filho de Davi, tem compaix\xe3o de n\xf3s."},{verse:31,en:"And the multitude rebuked them, because they should hold their peace: but they cried the more, saying, Have mercy on us, O Lord, thou Son of David.",pt:"E a multid\xe3o os repreendeu, para que se calassem; eles, por\xe9m, clamaram ainda mais alto, dizendo: Senhor, Filho de Davi, tem compaix\xe3o de n\xf3s."},{verse:32,en:"And Jesus stood still, and called them, and said, What will ye that I shall do unto you?",pt:"E Jesus, parando, chamou-os e perguntou: Que quereis que vos fa\xe7a?"},{verse:33,en:"They say unto him, Lord, that our eyes may be opened.",pt:"Disseram-lhe eles: Senhor, que se nos abram os olhos."},{verse:34,en:"So Jesus had compassion on them, and touched their eyes: and immediately their eyes received sight, and they followed him.",pt:"E Jesus, movido de compaix\xe3o, tocou-lhes os olhos, e imediatamente recuperaram a vista, e o seguiram."}]}}),757,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:21,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And when they drew nigh unto Jerusalem, and were come to Bethphage, unto the mount of Olives, then sent Jesus two disciples,",pt:"Quando se aproximaram de Jerusal\xe9m, e chegaram a Betfag\xe9, ao Monte das Oliveiras, enviou Jesus dois disc\xedpulos, dizendo-lhes:"},{verse:2,en:"Saying unto them, Go into the village over against you, and straightway ye shall find an ass tied, and a colt with her: loose them, and bring them unto me.",pt:"Ide \xe0 aldeia que est\xe1 defronte de v\xf3s, e logo encontrareis uma jumenta presa, e um jumentinho com ela; desprendei-a, e trazei- mos."},{verse:3,en:"And if any man say ought unto you, ye shall say, The Lord hath need of them; and straightway he will send them.",pt:"E, se algu\xe9m vos disser alguma coisa, respondei: O Senhor precisa deles; e logo os enviar\xe1."},{verse:4,en:"All this was done, that it might be fulfilled which was spoken by the prophet, saying,",pt:"Ora, isso aconteceu para que se cumprisse o que foi dito pelo profeta:"},{verse:5,en:"Tell ye the daughter of Sion, Behold, thy King cometh unto thee, meek, and sitting upon an ass, and a colt the foal of an ass.",pt:"Dizei \xe0 filha de Si\xe3o: Eis que a\xed te vem o teu Rei, manso e montado em um jumento, em um jumentinho, cria de animal de carga."},{verse:6,en:"And the disciples went, and did as Jesus commanded them,",pt:"Indo, pois, os disc\xedpulos e fazendo como Jesus lhes ordenara,"},{verse:7,en:"And brought the ass, and the colt, and put on them their clothes, and they set him thereon.",pt:"trouxeram a jumenta e o jumentinho, e sobre eles puseram os seus mantos, e Jesus montou."},{verse:8,en:"And a very great multitude spread their garments in the way; others cut down branches from the trees, and strawed them in the way.",pt:"E a maior parte da multid\xe3o estendeu os seus mantos pelo caminho; e outros cortavam ramos de \xe1rvores, e os espalhavam pelo caminho."},{verse:9,en:"And the multitudes that went before, and that followed, cried, saying, Hosanna to the Son of David: Blessed is he that cometh in the name of the Lord; Hosanna in the highest.",pt:"E as multid\xf5es, tanto as que o precediam como as que o seguiam, clamavam, dizendo: Hosana ao Filho de Davi! bendito o que vem em nome do Senhor! Hosana nas alturas!"},{verse:10,en:"And when he was come into Jerusalem, all the city was moved, saying, Who is this?",pt:"Ao entrar ele em Jerusal\xe9m, agitou-se a cidade toda e perguntava: Quem \xe9 este?"},{verse:11,en:"And the multitude said, This is Jesus the prophet of Nazareth of Galilee.",pt:"E as multid\xf5es respondiam: Este \xe9 o profeta Jesus, de Nazar\xe9 da Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:12,en:"And Jesus went into the temple of God, and cast out all them that sold and bought in the temple, and overthrew the tables of the moneychangers, and the seats of them that sold doves,",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus entrou no templo, expulsou todos os que ali vendiam e compravam, e derribou as mesas dos cambistas e as cadeiras dos que vendiam pombas;"},{verse:13,en:"And said unto them, It is written, My house shall be called the house of prayer; but ye have made it a den of thieves.",pt:"e disse-lhes: Est\xe1 escrito: A minha casa ser\xe1 chamada casa de ora\xe7\xe3o; v\xf3s, por\xe9m, a fazeis covil de salteadores."},{verse:14,en:"And the blind and the lame came to him in the temple; and he healed them.",pt:"E chegaram-se a ele no templo cegos e coxos, e ele os curou."},{verse:15,en:"And when the chief priests and scribes saw the wonderful things that he did, and the children crying in the temple, and saying, Hosanna to the Son of David; they were sore displeased,",pt:"Vendo, por\xe9m, os principais sacerdotes e os escribas as maravilhas que ele fizera, e os meninos que clamavam no templo: Hosana ao Filho de Davi, indignaram-se,"},{verse:16,en:"And said unto him, Hearest thou what these say? And Jesus saith unto them, Yea; have ye never read, Out of the mouth of babes and sucklings thou hast perfected praise?",pt:"e perguntaram-lhe: Ouves o que estes est\xe3o dizendo? Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Sim; nunca lestes: Da boca de pequeninos e de criancinhas de peito tiraste perfeito louvor?"},{verse:17,en:"And he left them, and went out of the city into Bethany; and he lodged there.",pt:"E deixando-os, saiu da cidade para Bet\xe2nia, e ali passou a noite."},{verse:18,en:"Now in the morning as he returned into the city, he hungered.",pt:"Ora, de manh\xe3, ao voltar \xe0 cidade, teve fome;"},{verse:19,en:"And when he saw a fig tree in the way, he came to it, and found nothing thereon, but leaves only, and said unto it, Let no fruit grow on thee henceforward for ever. And presently the fig tree withered away.",pt:"e, avistando uma figueira \xe0 beira do caminho, dela se aproximou, e n\xe3o achou nela sen\xe3o folhas somente; e disse-lhe: Nunca mais nas\xe7a fruto de ti. E a figueira secou imediatamente."},{verse:20,en:"And when the disciples saw it, they marvelled, saying, How soon is the fig tree withered away!",pt:"Quando os disc\xedpulos viram isso, perguntaram admirados: Como \xe9 que imediatamente secou a figueira?"},{verse:21,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, Verily I say unto you, If ye have faith, and doubt not, ye shall not only do this which is done to the fig tree, but also if ye shall say unto this mountain, Be thou removed, and be thou cast into the sea; it shall be done.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, respondeu-lhes: Em verdade vos digo que, se tiverdes f\xe9 e n\xe3o duvidardes, n\xe3o s\xf3 fareis o que foi feito \xe0 figueira, mas at\xe9, se a este monte disserdes: Ergue-te e lan\xe7a-te no mar, isso ser\xe1 feito;"},{verse:22,en:"And all things, whatsoever ye shall ask in prayer, believing, ye shall receive.",pt:"e tudo o que pedirdes na ora\xe7\xe3o, crendo, recebereis."},{verse:23,en:"And when he was come into the temple, the chief priests and the elders of the people came unto him as he was teaching, and said, By what authority doest thou these things? and who gave thee this authority?",pt:"Tendo Jesus entrado no templo, e estando a ensinar, aproximaram-se dele os principais sacerdotes e os anci\xe3os do povo, e perguntaram: Com que autoridade fazes tu estas coisas? e quem te deu tal autoridade?"},{verse:24,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto them, I also will ask you one thing, which if ye tell me, I in like wise will tell you by what authority I do these things.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Eu tamb\xe9m vos perguntarei uma coisa; se ma disserdes, eu de igual modo vos direi com que autoridade fa\xe7o estas coisas."},{verse:25,en:"The baptism of John, whence was it? from heaven, or of men? And they reasoned with themselves, saying, If we shall say, From heaven; he will say unto us, Why did ye not then believe him?",pt:"O batismo de Jo\xe3o, donde era? do c\xe9u ou dos homens? Ao que eles arrazoavam entre si: Se dissermos: Do c\xe9u, ele nos dir\xe1: Ent\xe3o por que n\xe3o o crestes?"},{verse:26,en:"But if we shall say, Of men; we fear the people; for all hold John as a prophet.",pt:"Mas, se dissermos: Dos homens, tememos o povo; porque todos consideram Jo\xe3o como profeta."},{verse:27,en:"And they answered Jesus, and said, We cannot tell. And he said unto them, Neither tell I you by what authority I do these things.",pt:"Responderam, pois, a Jesus: N\xe3o sabemos. Disse-lhe ele: Nem eu vos digo com que autoridade fa\xe7o estas coisas."},{verse:28,en:"But what think ye? A certain man had two sons; and he came to the first, and said, Son, go work to day in my vineyard.",pt:"Mas que vos parece? Um homem tinha dois filhos, e, chegando- se ao primeiro, disse: Filho, vai trabalhar hoje na vinha."},{verse:29,en:"He answered and said, I will not: but afterward he repented, and went.",pt:"Ele respondeu: Sim, senhor; mas n\xe3o foi."},{verse:30,en:"And he came to the second, and said likewise. And he answered and said, I go, sir: and went not.",pt:"Chegando-se, ent\xe3o, ao segundo, falou-lhe de igual modo; respondeu-lhe este: N\xe3o quero; mas depois, arrependendo-se, foi."},{verse:31,en:"Whether of them twain did the will of his father? They say unto him, The first. Jesus saith unto them, Verily I say unto you, That the publicans and the harlots go into the kingdom of God before you.",pt:"Qual dos dois fez a vontade do pai? Disseram eles: O segundo. Disse-lhes Jesus: Em verdade vos digo que os publicanos e as meretrizes entram adiante de v\xf3s no reino de Deus."},{verse:32,en:"For John came unto you in the way of righteousness, and ye believed him not: but the publicans and the harlots believed him: and ye, when ye had seen it, repented not afterward, that ye might believe him.",pt:"Pois Jo\xe3o veio a v\xf3s no caminho da justi\xe7a, e n\xe3o lhe deste cr\xe9dito, mas os publicanos e as meretrizes lho deram; v\xf3s, por\xe9m, vendo isto, nem depois vos arrependestes para crerdes nele."},{verse:33,en:"Hear another parable: There was a certain householder, which planted a vineyard, and hedged it round about, and digged a winepress in it, and built a tower, and let it out to husbandmen, and went into a far country:",pt:"Ouvi ainda outra par\xe1bola: Havia um homem, propriet\xe1rio, que plantou uma vinha, cercou-a com uma sebe, cavou nela um lagar, e edificou uma torre; depois arrendou-a a uns lavradores e ausentou-se do pa\xeds."},{verse:34,en:"And when the time of the fruit drew near, he sent his servants to the husbandmen, that they might receive the fruits of it.",pt:"E quando chegou o tempo dos frutos, enviou os seus servos aos lavradores, para receber os seus frutos."},{verse:35,en:"And the husbandmen took his servants, and beat one, and killed another, and stoned another.",pt:"E os lavradores, apoderando-se dos servos, espancaram um, mataram outro, e a outro apedrejaram."},{verse:36,en:"Again, he sent other servants more than the first: and they did unto them likewise.",pt:"Depois enviou ainda outros servos, em maior n\xfamero do que os primeiros; e fizeram-lhes o mesmo."},{verse:37,en:"But last of all he sent unto them his son, saying, They will reverence my son.",pt:"Por \xfaltimo enviou-lhes seu filho, dizendo: A meu filho ter\xe3o respeito."},{verse:38,en:"But when the husbandmen saw the son, they said among themselves, This is the heir; come, let us kill him, and let us seize on his inheritance.",pt:"Mas os lavradores, vendo o filho, disseram entre si: Este \xe9 o herdeiro; vinde, matemo-lo, e apoderemo-nos da sua heran\xe7a."},{verse:39,en:"And they caught him, and cast him out of the vineyard, and slew him.",pt:"E, agarrando-o, lan\xe7aram-no fora da vinha e o mataram."},{verse:40,en:"When the lord therefore of the vineyard cometh, what will he do unto those husbandmen?",pt:"Quando, pois, vier o senhor da vinha, que far\xe1 \xe0queles lavradores?"},{verse:41,en:"They say unto him, He will miserably destroy those wicked men, and will let out his vineyard unto other husbandmen, which shall render him the fruits in their seasons.",pt:"Responderam-lhe eles: Far\xe1 perecer miseravelmente a esses maus, e arrendar\xe1 a vinha a outros lavradores, que a seu tempo lhe entreguem os frutos."},{verse:42,en:"Jesus saith unto them, Did ye never read in the scriptures, The stone which the builders rejected, the same is become the head of the corner: this is the Lord\u2019s doing, and it is marvellous in our eyes?",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Nunca lestes nas Escrituras: A pedra que os edificadores rejeitaram, essa foi posta como pedra angular; pelo Senhor foi feito isso, e \xe9 maravilhoso aos nossos olhos?"},{verse:43,en:"Therefore say I unto you, The kingdom of God shall be taken from you, and given to a nation bringing forth the fruits thereof.",pt:"Portanto eu vos digo que vos ser\xe1 tirado o reino de Deus, e ser\xe1 dado a um povo que d\xea os seus frutos."},{verse:44,en:"And whosoever shall fall on this stone shall be broken: but on whomsoever it shall fall, it will grind him to powder.",pt:"E quem cair sobre esta pedra ser\xe1 despeda\xe7ado; mas aquele sobre quem ela cair ser\xe1 reduzido a p\xf3."},{verse:45,en:"And when the chief priests and Pharisees had heard his parables, they perceived that he spake of them.",pt:"Os principais sacerdotes e os fariseus, ouvindo essas par\xe1bolas, entenderam que era deles que Jesus falava."},{verse:46,en:"But when they sought to lay hands on him, they feared the multitude, because they took him for a prophet.",pt:"E procuravam prend\xea-lo, mas temeram o povo, porquanto este o tinha por profeta."}]}}),758,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:22,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And Jesus answered and spake unto them again by parables, and said,",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus tornou a falar-lhes por par\xe1bolas, dizendo:"},{verse:2,en:"The kingdom of heaven is like unto a certain king, which made a marriage for his son,",pt:"O reino dos c\xe9us \xe9 semelhante a um rei que celebrou as bodas de seu filho."},{verse:3,en:"And sent forth his servants to call them that were bidden to the wedding: and they would not come.",pt:"Enviou os seus servos a chamar os convidados para as bodas, e estes n\xe3o quiseram vir."},{verse:4,en:"Again, he sent forth other servants, saying, Tell them which are bidden, Behold, I have prepared my dinner: my oxen and my fatlings are killed, and all things are ready: come unto the marriage.",pt:"Depois enviou outros servos, ordenando: Dizei aos convidados: Eis que tenho o meu jantar preparado; os meus bois e cevados j\xe1 est\xe3o mortos, e tudo est\xe1 pronto; vinde \xe0s bodas."},{verse:5,en:"But they made light of it, and went their ways, one to his farm, another to his merchandise:",pt:"Eles, por\xe9m, n\xe3o fazendo caso, foram, um para o seu campo, outro para o seu neg\xf3cio;"},{verse:6,en:"And the remnant took his servants, and entreated them spitefully, and slew them.",pt:"e os outros, apoderando-se dos servos, os ultrajaram e mataram."},{verse:7,en:"But when the king heard thereof, he was wroth: and he sent forth his armies, and destroyed those murderers, and burned up their city.",pt:"Mas o rei encolerizou-se; e enviando os seus ex\xe9rcitos, destruiu aqueles homicidas, e incendiou a sua cidade."},{verse:8,en:"Then saith he to his servants, The wedding is ready, but they which were bidden were not worthy.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse aos seus servos: As bodas, na verdade, est\xe3o preparadas, mas os convidados n\xe3o eram dignos."},{verse:9,en:"Go ye therefore into the highways, and as many as ye shall find, bid to the marriage.",pt:"Ide, pois, pelas encruzilhadas dos caminhos, e a quantos encontrardes, convidai-os para as bodas."},{verse:10,en:"So those servants went out into the highways, and gathered together all as many as they found, both bad and good: and the wedding was furnished with guests.",pt:"E sa\xedram aqueles servos pelos caminhos, e ajuntaram todos quantos encontraram, tanto maus como bons; e encheu-se de convivas a sala nupcial."},{verse:11,en:"And when the king came in to see the guests, he saw there a man which had not on a wedding garment:",pt:"Mas, quando o rei entrou para ver os convivas, viu ali um homem que n\xe3o trajava veste nupcial;"},{verse:12,en:"And he saith unto him, Friend, how camest thou in hither not having a wedding garment? And he was speechless.",pt:"e perguntou-lhe: Amigo, como entraste aqui, sem teres veste nupcial? Ele, por\xe9m, emudeceu."},{verse:13,en:"Then said the king to the servants, Bind him hand and foot, and take him away, and cast him into outer darkness; there shall be weeping and gnashing of teeth.",pt:"Ordenou ent\xe3o o rei aos servos: Amarrai-o de p\xe9s e m\xe3os, e lan\xe7ai-o nas trevas exteriores; ali haver\xe1 choro e ranger de dentes."},{verse:14,en:"For many are called, but few are chosen.",pt:"Porque muitos s\xe3o chamados, mas poucos escolhidos."},{verse:15,en:"Then went the Pharisees, and took counsel how they might entangle him in his talk.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os fariseus se retiraram e consultaram entre si como o apanhariam em alguma palavra;"},{verse:16,en:"And they sent out unto him their disciples with the Herodians, saying, Master, we know that thou art true, and teachest the way of God in truth, neither carest thou for any man: for thou regardest not the person of men.",pt:"e enviaram-lhe os seus disc\xedpulos, juntamente com os herodianos, a dizer; Mestre, sabemos que \xe9s verdadeiro, e que ensinas segundo a verdade o caminho de Deus, e de ningu\xe9m se te d\xe1, porque n\xe3o olhas a apar\xeancia dos homens."},{verse:17,en:"Tell us therefore, What thinkest thou? Is it lawful to give tribute unto Caesar, or not?",pt:"Dize-nos, pois, que te parece? \xc9 l\xedcito pagar tributo a C\xe9sar, ou n\xe3o?"},{verse:18,en:"But Jesus perceived their wickedness, and said, Why tempt ye me, ye hypocrites?",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, percebendo a sua mal\xedcia, respondeu: Por que me experimentais, hip\xf3critas?"},{verse:19,en:"Shew me the tribute money. And they brought unto him a penny.",pt:"Mostrai-me a moeda do tributo. E eles lhe apresentaram um den\xe1rio."},{verse:20,en:"And he saith unto them, Whose is this image and superscription?",pt:"Perguntou-lhes ele: De quem \xe9 esta imagem e inscri\xe7\xe3o?"},{verse:21,en:"They say unto him, Caesar\u2019s. Then saith he unto them, Render therefore unto Caesar the things which are Caesar\u2019s; and unto God the things that are God\u2019s.",pt:"Responderam: De C\xe9sar. Ent\xe3o lhes disse: Dai, pois, a C\xe9sar o que \xe9 de C\xe9sar, e a Deus o que \xe9 de Deus."},{verse:22,en:"When they had heard these words, they marvelled, and left him, and went their way.",pt:"Ao ouvirem isso, ficaram admirados; e, deixando-o, se retiraram."},{verse:23,en:"The same day came to him the Sadducees, which say that there is no resurrection, and asked him,",pt:"No mesmo dia vieram alguns saduceus, que dizem n\xe3o haver ressurrei\xe7\xe3o, e o interrogaram, dizendo:"},{verse:24,en:"Saying, Master, Moses said, If a man die, having no children, his brother shall marry his wife, and raise up seed unto his brother.",pt:"Mestre, Mois\xe9s disse: Se morrer algu\xe9m, n\xe3o tendo filhos, seu irm\xe3o casar\xe1 com a mulher dele, e suscitar\xe1 descend\xeancia a seu irm\xe3o."},{verse:25,en:"Now there were with us seven brethren: and the first, when he had married a wife, deceased, and, having no issue, left his wife unto his brother:",pt:"Ora, havia entre n\xf3s sete irm\xe3os: o primeiro, tendo casado, morreu: e, n\xe3o tendo descend\xeancia, deixou sua mulher a seu irm\xe3o;"},{verse:26,en:"Likewise the second also, and the third, unto the seventh.",pt:"da mesma sorte tamb\xe9m o segundo, o terceiro, at\xe9 o s\xe9timo."},{verse:27,en:"And last of all the woman died also.",pt:"depois de todos, morreu tamb\xe9m a mulher."},{verse:28,en:"Therefore in the resurrection whose wife shall she be of the seven? for they all had her.",pt:"Portanto, na ressurrei\xe7\xe3o, de qual dos sete ser\xe1 ela esposa, pois todos a tiveram?"},{verse:29,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, Ye do err, not knowing the scriptures, nor the power of God.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, lhes respondeu: Errais, n\xe3o compreendendo as Escrituras nem o poder de Deus;"},{verse:30,en:"For in the resurrection they neither marry, nor are given in marriage, but are as the angels of God in heaven.",pt:"pois na ressurrei\xe7\xe3o nem se casam nem se d\xe3o em casamento; mas ser\xe3o como os anjos no c\xe9u."},{verse:31,en:"But as touching the resurrection of the dead, have ye not read that which was spoken unto you by God, saying,",pt:"E, quanto \xe0 ressurrei\xe7\xe3o dos mortos, n\xe3o lestes o que foi dito por Deus:"},{verse:32,en:"I am the God of Abraham, and the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob? God is not the God of the dead, but of the living.",pt:"Eu sou o Deus de Abra\xe3o, o Deus de Isaque, e o Deus de Jac\xf3? Ora, ele n\xe3o \xe9 Deus de mortos, mas de vivos."},{verse:33,en:"And when the multitude heard this, they were astonished at his doctrine.",pt:"E as multid\xf5es, ouvindo isso, se maravilhavam da sua doutrina."},{verse:34,en:"But when the Pharisees had heard that he had put the Sadducees to silence, they were gathered together.",pt:"Os fariseus, quando souberam, que ele fizera emudecer os saduceus, reuniram-se todos;"},{verse:35,en:"Then one of them, which was a lawyer, asked him a question, tempting him, and saying,",pt:"e um deles, doutor da lei, para o experimentar, interrogou- o, dizendo:"},{verse:36,en:"Master, which is the great commandment in the law?",pt:"Mestre, qual \xe9 o grande mandamento na lei?"},{verse:37,en:"Jesus said unto him, Thou shalt love the Lord thy God with all thy heart, and with all thy soul, and with all thy mind.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Amar\xe1s ao Senhor teu Deus de todo o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, de toda a tua alma, e de todo o teu entendimento."},{verse:38,en:"This is the first and great commandment.",pt:"Este \xe9 o grande e primeiro mandamento."},{verse:39,en:"And the second is like unto it, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself.",pt:"E o segundo, semelhante a este, \xe9: Amar\xe1s ao teu pr\xf3ximo como a ti mesmo."},{verse:40,en:"On these two commandments hang all the law and the prophets.",pt:"Destes dois mandamentos dependem toda a lei e os profetas."},{verse:41,en:"While the Pharisees were gathered together, Jesus asked them,",pt:"Ora, enquanto os fariseus estavam reunidos, interrogou-os Jesus, dizendo:"},{verse:42,en:"Saying, What think ye of Christ? whose son is he? They say unto him, The Son of David.",pt:"Que pensais v\xf3s do Cristo? De quem \xe9 filho? Responderam-lhe: De Davi."},{verse:43,en:"He saith unto them, How then doth David in spirit call him Lord, saying,",pt:"Replicou-lhes ele: Como \xe9 ent\xe3o que Davi, no Esp\xedrito, lhe chama Senhor, dizendo:"},{verse:44,en:"The LORD said unto my Lord, Sit thou on my right hand, till I make thine enemies thy footstool?",pt:"Disse o Senhor ao meu Senhor: Assenta-te \xe0 minha direita, at\xe9 que eu ponha os teus inimigos de baixo dos teus p\xe9s?"},{verse:45,en:"If David then call him Lord, how is he his son?",pt:"Se Davi, pois, lhe chama Senhor, como \xe9 ele seu filho?"},{verse:46,en:"And no man was able to answer him a word, neither durst any man from that day forth ask him any more questions.",pt:"E ningu\xe9m podia responder-lhe palavra; nem desde aquele dia jamais ousou algu\xe9m interrog\xe1-lo."}]}}),759,[]);
__d((function(e,s,o,a,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:23,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then spake Jesus to the multitude, and to his disciples,",pt:"Ent\xe3o falou Jesus \xe0s multid\xf5es e aos seus disc\xedpulos, dizendo:"},{verse:2,en:"Saying, The scribes and the Pharisees sit in Moses\u2019 seat:",pt:"Na cadeira de Mois\xe9s se assentam os escribas e fariseus."},{verse:3,en:"All therefore whatsoever they bid you observe, that observe and do; but do not ye after their works: for they say, and do not.",pt:"Portanto, tudo o que vos disserem, isso fazei e observai; mas n\xe3o fa\xe7ais conforme as suas obras; porque dizem e n\xe3o praticam."},{verse:4,en:"For they bind heavy burdens and grievous to be borne, and lay them on men\u2019s shoulders; but they themselves will not move them with one of their fingers.",pt:"Pois atam fardos pesados e dif\xedceis de suportar, e os p\xf5em aos ombros dos homens; mas eles mesmos nem com o dedo querem mov\xea-los."},{verse:5,en:"But all their works they do for to be seen of men: they make broad their phylacteries, and enlarge the borders of their garments,",pt:"Todas as suas obras eles fazem a fim de serem vistos pelos homens; pois alargam os seus filact\xe9rios, e aumentam as franjas dos seus mantos;"},{verse:6,en:"And love the uppermost rooms at feasts, and the chief seats in the synagogues,",pt:"gostam do primeiro lugar nos banquetes, das primeiras cadeiras nas sinagogas,"},{verse:7,en:"And greetings in the markets, and to be called of men, Rabbi, Rabbi.",pt:"das sauda\xe7\xf5es nas pra\xe7as, e de serem chamados pelos homens: Rabi."},{verse:8,en:"But be not ye called Rabbi: for one is your Master, even Christ; and all ye are brethren.",pt:"V\xf3s, por\xe9m, n\xe3o queirais ser chamados Rabi; porque um s\xf3 \xe9 o vosso Mestre, e todos v\xf3s sois irm\xe3os."},{verse:9,en:"And call no man your father upon the earth: for one is your Father, which is in heaven.",pt:"E a ningu\xe9m sobre a terra chameis vosso pai; porque um s\xf3 \xe9 o vosso Pai, aquele que est\xe1 nos c\xe9us."},{verse:10,en:"Neither be ye called masters: for one is your Master, even Christ.",pt:"Nem queirais ser chamados guias; porque um s\xf3 \xe9 o vosso Guia, que \xe9 o Cristo."},{verse:11,en:"But he that is greatest among you shall be your servant.",pt:"Mas o maior dentre v\xf3s h\xe1 de ser vosso servo."},{verse:12,en:"And whosoever shall exalt himself shall be abased; and he that shall humble himself shall be exalted.",pt:"Qualquer, pois, que a si mesmo se exaltar, ser\xe1 humilhado; e qualquer que a si mesmo se humilhar, ser\xe1 exaltado."},{verse:13,en:"But woe unto you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! for ye shut up the kingdom of heaven against men: for ye neither go in yourselves, neither suffer ye them that are entering to go in.",pt:"Mas ai de v\xf3s, escribas e fariseus, hip\xf3critas! porque fechais aos homens o reino dos c\xe9us; pois nem v\xf3s entrais, nem aos que entrariam permitis entrar."},{verse:14,en:"Woe unto you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! for ye devour widows\u2019 houses, and for a pretence make long prayer: therefore ye shall receive the greater damnation.",pt:"[Ai de v\xf3s, escribas e fariseus, hip\xf3critas! porque devorais as casas das vi\xfavas e sob pretexto fazeis longas ora\xe7\xf5es; por isso recebereis maior condena\xe7\xe3o.]"},{verse:15,en:"Woe unto you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! for ye compass sea and land to make one proselyte, and when he is made, ye make him twofold more the child of hell than yourselves.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, escribas e fariseus, hip\xf3critas! porque percorreis o mar e a terra para fazer um pros\xe9lito; e, depois de o terdes feito, o tornais duas vezes mais filho do inferno do que v\xf3s."},{verse:16,en:"Woe unto you, ye blind guides, which say, Whosoever shall swear by the temple, it is nothing; but whosoever shall swear by the gold of the temple, he is a debtor!",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, guias cegos! que dizeis: Quem jurar pelo ouro do santu\xe1rio, esse fica obrigado ao que jurou."},{verse:17,en:"Ye fools and blind: for whether is greater, the gold, or the temple that sanctifieth the gold?",pt:"Insensatos e cegos! Pois qual \xe9 o maior; o ouro, ou o santu\xe1rio que santifica o ouro?"},{verse:18,en:"And, Whosoever shall swear by the altar, it is nothing; but whosoever sweareth by the gift that is upon it, he is guilty.",pt:"E: Quem jurar pelo altar, isso nada \xe9; mas quem jurar pela oferta que est\xe1 sobre o altar, esse fica obrigado ao que jurou."},{verse:19,en:"Ye fools and blind: for whether is greater, the gift, or the altar that sanctifieth the gift?",pt:"Cegos! Pois qual \xe9 maior: a oferta, ou o altar que santifica a oferta?"},{verse:20,en:"Whoso therefore shall swear by the altar, sweareth by it, and by all things thereon.",pt:"Portanto, quem jurar pelo altar jura por ele e por tudo quanto sobre ele est\xe1;"},{verse:21,en:"And whoso shall swear by the temple, sweareth by it, and by him that dwelleth therein.",pt:"e quem jurar pelo santu\xe1rio jura por ele e por aquele que nele habita;"},{verse:22,en:"And he that shall swear by heaven, sweareth by the throne of God, and by him that sitteth thereon.",pt:"e quem jurar pelo c\xe9u jura pelo trono de Deus e por aquele que nele est\xe1 assentado."},{verse:23,en:"Woe unto you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! for ye pay tithe of mint and anise and cummin, and have omitted the weightier matters of the law, judgment, mercy, and faith: these ought ye to have done, and not to leave the other undone.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, escribas e fariseus, hip\xf3critas! porque dais o d\xedzimo da hortel\xe3, do endro e do cominho, e tendes omitido o que h\xe1 de mais importante na lei, a saber, a justi\xe7a, a miseric\xf3rdia e a f\xe9; estas coisas, por\xe9m, dev\xedeis fazer, sem omitir aquelas."},{verse:24,en:"Ye blind guides, which strain at a gnat, and swallow a camel.",pt:"Guias cegos! que coais um mosquito, e engulis um camelo."},{verse:25,en:"Woe unto you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! for ye make clean the outside of the cup and of the platter, but within they are full of extortion and excess.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, escribas e fariseus, hip\xf3critas! porque limpais o exterior do copo e do prato, mas por dentro est\xe3o cheios de rapina e de intemperan\xe7a."},{verse:26,en:"Thou blind Pharisee, cleanse first that which is within the cup and platter, that the outside of them may be clean also.",pt:"Fariseu cego! limpa primeiro o interior do copo, para que tamb\xe9m o exterior se torne limpo."},{verse:27,en:"Woe unto you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! for ye are like unto whited sepulchres, which indeed appear beautiful outward, but are within full of dead men\u2019s bones, and of all uncleanness.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, escribas e fariseus, hip\xf3critas! porque sois semelhantes aos sepulcros caiados, que por fora realmente parecem formosos, mas por dentro est\xe3o cheios de ossos e de toda imund\xedcia."},{verse:28,en:"Even so ye also outwardly appear righteous unto men, but within ye are full of hypocrisy and iniquity.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s exteriormente pareceis justos aos homens, mas por dentro estais cheios de hipocrisia e de iniquidade."},{verse:29,en:"Woe unto you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! because ye build the tombs of the prophets, and garnish the sepulchres of the righteous,",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, escribas e fariseus, hip\xf3critas! porque edificais os sepulcros dos profetas e adornais os monumentos dos justos,"},{verse:30,en:"And say, If we had been in the days of our fathers, we would not have been partakers with them in the blood of the prophets.",pt:"e dizeis: Se tiv\xe9ssemos vivido nos dias de nossos pais, n\xe3o ter\xedamos sido c\xfamplices no derramar o sangue dos profetas."},{verse:31,en:"Wherefore ye be witnesses unto yourselves, that ye are the children of them which killed the prophets.",pt:"Assim, v\xf3s testemunhais contra v\xf3s mesmos que sois filhos daqueles que mataram os profetas."},{verse:32,en:"Fill ye up then the measure of your fathers.",pt:"Enchei v\xf3s, pois, a medida de vossos pais."},{verse:33,en:"Ye serpents, ye generation of vipers, how can ye escape the damnation of hell?",pt:"Serpentes, ra\xe7a de v\xedboras! como escapareis da condena\xe7\xe3o do inferno?"},{verse:34,en:"Wherefore, behold, I send unto you prophets, and wise men, and scribes: and some of them ye shall kill and crucify; and some of them shall ye scourge in your synagogues, and persecute them from city to city:",pt:"Portanto, eis que eu vos envio profetas, s\xe1bios e escribas: e a uns deles matareis e crucificareis; e a outros os perseguireis de cidade em cidade;"},{verse:35,en:"That upon you may come all the righteous blood shed upon the earth, from the blood of righteous Abel unto the blood of Zacharias son of Barachias, whom ye slew between the temple and the altar.",pt:"para que sobre v\xf3s caia todo o sangue justo, que foi derramado sobre a terra, desde o sangue de Abel, o justo, at\xe9 o sangue de Zacarias, filho de Baraquias, que mataste entre o santu\xe1rio e o altar."},{verse:36,en:"Verily I say unto you, All these things shall come upon this generation.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que todas essas coisas h\xe3o de vir sobre esta gera\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:37,en:"O Jerusalem, Jerusalem, thou that killest the prophets, and stonest them which are sent unto thee, how often would I have gathered thy children together, even as a hen gathereth her chickens under her wings, and ye would not!",pt:"Jerusal\xe9m, Jerusal\xe9m, que matas os profetas, apedrejas os que a ti s\xe3o enviados! quantas vezes quis eu ajuntar os teus filhos, como a galinha ajunta os seus pintos debaixo das asas, e n\xe3o o quiseste!"},{verse:38,en:"Behold, your house is left unto you desolate.",pt:"Eis a\xed abandonada vos \xe9 a vossa casa."},{verse:39,en:"For I say unto you, Ye shall not see me henceforth, till ye shall say, Blessed is he that cometh in the name of the Lord.",pt:"Pois eu vos declaro que desde agora de modo nenhum me vereis, at\xe9 que digais: Bendito aquele que vem em nome do Senhor."}]}}),760,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:24,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And Jesus went out, and departed from the temple: and his disciples came to him for to shew him the buildings of the temple.",pt:"Ora, Jesus, tendo sa\xeddo do templo, ia-se retirando, quando se aproximaram dele os seus disc\xedpulos, para lhe mostrarem os edif\xedcios do templo."},{verse:2,en:"And Jesus said unto them, See ye not all these things? verily I say unto you, There shall not be left here one stone upon another, that shall not be thrown down.",pt:"Mas ele lhes disse: N\xe3o vedes tudo isto? Em verdade vos digo que n\xe3o se deixar\xe1 aqui pedra sobre pedra que n\xe3o seja derribada."},{verse:3,en:"And as he sat upon the mount of Olives, the disciples came unto him privately, saying, Tell us, when shall these things be? and what shall be the sign of thy coming, and of the end of the world?",pt:"E estando ele sentado no Monte das Oliveiras, chegaram-se a ele os seus disc\xedpulos em particular, dizendo: Declara-nos quando ser\xe3o essas coisas, e que sinal haver\xe1 da tua vinda e do fim do mundo."},{verse:4,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto them, Take heed that no man deceive you.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Acautelai-vos, que ningu\xe9m vos engane."},{verse:5,en:"For many shall come in my name, saying, I am Christ; and shall deceive many.",pt:"Porque muitos vir\xe3o em meu nome, dizendo: Eu sou o Cristo; a muitos enganar\xe3o."},{verse:6,en:"And ye shall hear of wars and rumours of wars: see that ye be not troubled: for all these things must come to pass, but the end is not yet.",pt:"E ouvireis falar de guerras e rumores de guerras; olhai n\xe3o vos perturbeis; porque for\xe7oso \xe9 que assim aconte\xe7a; mas ainda n\xe3o \xe9 o fim."},{verse:7,en:"For nation shall rise against nation, and kingdom against kingdom: and there shall be famines, and pestilences, and earthquakes, in divers places.",pt:"Porquanto se levantar\xe1 na\xe7\xe3o contra na\xe7\xe3o, e reino contra reino; e haver\xe1 fomes e terremotos em v\xe1rios lugares."},{verse:8,en:"All these are the beginning of sorrows.",pt:"Mas todas essas coisas s\xe3o o princ\xedpio das dores."},{verse:9,en:"Then shall they deliver you up to be afflicted, and shall kill you: and ye shall be hated of all nations for my name\u2019s sake.",pt:"Ent\xe3o sereis entregues \xe0 tortura, e vos matar\xe3o; e sereis odiados de todas as na\xe7\xf5es por causa do meu nome."},{verse:10,en:"And then shall many be offended, and shall betray one another, and shall hate one another.",pt:"Nesse tempo muitos h\xe3o de se escandalizar, e trair-se uns aos outros, e mutuamente se odiar\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"And many false prophets shall rise, and shall deceive many.",pt:"Igualmente h\xe3o de surgir muitos falsos profetas, e enganar\xe3o a muitos;"},{verse:12,en:"And because iniquity shall abound, the love of many shall wax cold.",pt:"e, por se multiplicar a iniquidade, o amor de muitos esfriar\xe1."},{verse:13,en:"But he that shall endure unto the end, the same shall be saved.",pt:"Mas quem perseverar at\xe9 o fim, esse ser\xe1 salvo."},{verse:14,en:"And this gospel of the kingdom shall be preached in all the world for a witness unto all nations; and then shall the end come.",pt:"E este evangelho do reino ser\xe1 pregado no mundo inteiro, em testemunho a todas as na\xe7\xf5es, e ent\xe3o vir\xe1 o fim."},{verse:15,en:"When ye therefore shall see the abomination of desolation, spoken of by Daniel the prophet, stand in the holy place, (whoso readeth, let him understand:)",pt:"Quando, pois, virdes estar no lugar santo a abomina\xe7\xe3o de desola\xe7\xe3o, predita pelo profeta Daniel (quem l\xea, entenda),"},{verse:16,en:"Then let them which be in Judaea flee into the mountains:",pt:"ent\xe3o os que estiverem na Jud\xe9ia fujam para os montes;"},{verse:17,en:"Let him which is on the housetop not come down to take any thing out of his house:",pt:"quem estiver no eirado n\xe3o des\xe7a para tirar as coisas de sua casa,"},{verse:18,en:"Neither let him which is in the field return back to take his clothes.",pt:"e quem estiver no campo n\xe3o volte atr\xe1s para apanhar a sua capa."},{verse:19,en:"And woe unto them that are with child, and to them that give suck in those days!",pt:"Mas ai das que estiverem gr\xe1vidas, e das que amamentarem naqueles dias!"},{verse:20,en:"But pray ye that your flight be not in the winter, neither on the sabbath day:",pt:"Orai para que a vossa fuga n\xe3o suceda no inverno nem no s\xe1bado;"},{verse:21,en:"For then shall be great tribulation, such as was not since the beginning of the world to this time, no, nor ever shall be.",pt:"porque haver\xe1 ent\xe3o uma tribula\xe7\xe3o t\xe3o grande, como nunca houve desde o princ\xedpio do mundo at\xe9 agora, nem jamais haver\xe1."},{verse:22,en:"And except those days should be shortened, there should no flesh be saved: but for the elect\u2019s sake those days shall be shortened.",pt:"E se aqueles dias n\xe3o fossem abreviados, ningu\xe9m se salvaria; mas por causa dos escolhidos ser\xe3o abreviados aqueles dias."},{verse:23,en:"Then if any man shall say unto you, Lo, here is Christ, or there; believe it not.",pt:"Se, pois, algu\xe9m vos disser: Eis aqui o Cristo! ou: Ei-lo a\xed! n\xe3o acrediteis;"},{verse:24,en:"For there shall arise false Christs, and false prophets, and shall shew great signs and wonders; insomuch that, if it were possible, they shall deceive the very elect.",pt:"porque h\xe3o de surgir falsos cristos e falsos profetas, e far\xe3o grandes sinais e prod\xedgios; de modo que, se poss\xedvel fora, enganariam at\xe9 os escolhidos."},{verse:25,en:"Behold, I have told you before.",pt:"Eis que de antem\xe3o vo-lo tenho dito."},{verse:26,en:"Wherefore if they shall say unto you, Behold, he is in the desert; go not forth: behold, he is in the secret chambers; believe it not.",pt:"Portanto, se vos disserem: Eis que ele est\xe1 no deserto; n\xe3o saiais; ou: Eis que ele est\xe1 no interior da casa; n\xe3o acrediteis."},{verse:27,en:"For as the lightning cometh out of the east, and shineth even unto the west; so shall also the coming of the Son of man be.",pt:"Porque, assim como o rel\xe2mpago sai do oriente e se mostra at\xe9 o ocidente, assim ser\xe1 tamb\xe9m a vinda do filho do homem."},{verse:28,en:"For wheresoever the carcase is, there will the eagles be gathered together.",pt:"Pois onde estiver o cad\xe1ver, a\xed se ajuntar\xe3o os abutres."},{verse:29,en:"Immediately after the tribulation of those days shall the sun be darkened, and the moon shall not give her light, and the stars shall fall from heaven, and the powers of the heavens shall be shaken:",pt:"Logo depois da tribula\xe7\xe3o daqueles dias, escurecer\xe1 o sol, e a lua n\xe3o dar\xe1 a sua luz; as estrelas cair\xe3o do c\xe9u e os poderes dos c\xe9us ser\xe3o abalados."},{verse:30,en:"And then shall appear the sign of the Son of man in heaven: and then shall all the tribes of the earth mourn, and they shall see the Son of man coming in the clouds of heaven with power and great glory.",pt:"Ent\xe3o aparecer\xe1 no c\xe9u o sinal do Filho do homem, e todas as tribos da terra se lamentar\xe3o, e ver\xe3o vir o Filho do homem sobre as nuvens do c\xe9u, com poder e grande gl\xf3ria."},{verse:31,en:"And he shall send his angels with a great sound of a trumpet, and they shall gather together his elect from the four winds, from one end of heaven to the other.",pt:"E ele enviar\xe1 os seus anjos com grande clangor de trombeta, os quais lhe ajuntar\xe3o os escolhidos desde os quatro ventos, de uma \xe0 outra extremidade dos c\xe9us."},{verse:32,en:"Now learn a parable of the fig tree; When his branch is yet tender, and putteth forth leaves, ye know that summer is nigh:",pt:"Aprendei, pois, da figueira a sua par\xe1bola: Quando j\xe1 o seu ramo se torna tenro e brota folhas, sabeis que est\xe1 pr\xf3ximo o ver\xe3o."},{verse:33,en:"So likewise ye, when ye shall see all these things, know that it is near, even at the doors.",pt:"Igualmente, quando virdes todas essas coisas, sabei que ele est\xe1 pr\xf3ximo, mesmo \xe0s portas."},{verse:34,en:"Verily I say unto you, This generation shall not pass, till all these things be fulfilled.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que n\xe3o passar\xe1 esta gera\xe7\xe3o sem que todas essas coisas se cumpram."},{verse:35,en:"Heaven and earth shall pass away, but my words shall not pass away.",pt:"Passar\xe1 o c\xe9u e a terra, mas as minhas palavras jamais passar\xe3o."},{verse:36,en:"But of that day and hour knoweth no man, no, not the angels of heaven, but my Father only.",pt:"Daquele dia e hora, por\xe9m, ningu\xe9m sabe, nem os anjos do c\xe9u, nem o Filho, sen\xe3o s\xf3 o Pai."},{verse:37,en:"But as the days of Noe were, so shall also the coming of the Son of man be.",pt:"Pois como foi dito nos dias de No\xe9, assim ser\xe1 tamb\xe9m a vinda do Filho do homem."},{verse:38,en:"For as in the days that were before the flood they were eating and drinking, marrying and giving in marriage, until the day that Noe entered into the ark,",pt:"Porquanto, assim como nos dias anteriores ao dil\xfavio, comiam, bebiam, casavam e davam-se em casamento, at\xe9 o dia em que No\xe9 entrou na arca,"},{verse:39,en:"And knew not until the flood came, and took them all away; so shall also the coming of the Son of man be.",pt:"e n\xe3o o perceberam, at\xe9 que veio o dil\xfavio, e os levou a todos; assim ser\xe1 tamb\xe9m a vinda do Filho do homem."},{verse:40,en:"Then shall two be in the field; the one shall be taken, and the other left.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, estando dois homens no campo, ser\xe1 levado um e deixado outro;"},{verse:41,en:"Two women shall be grinding at the mill; the one shall be taken, and the other left.",pt:"estando duas mulheres a trabalhar no moinho, ser\xe1 levada uma e deixada a outra."},{verse:42,en:"Watch therefore: for ye know not what hour your Lord doth come.",pt:"Vigiai, pois, porque n\xe3o sabeis em que dia vem o vosso Senhor;"},{verse:43,en:"But know this, that if the goodman of the house had known in what watch the thief would come, he would have watched, and would not have suffered his house to be broken up.",pt:"sabei, por\xe9m, isto: se o dono da casa soubesse a que vig\xedlia da noite havia de vir o ladr\xe3o, vigiaria e n\xe3o deixaria minar a sua casa."},{verse:44,en:"Therefore be ye also ready: for in such an hour as ye think not the Son of man cometh.",pt:"Por isso ficai tamb\xe9m v\xf3s apercebidos; porque numa hora em que n\xe3o penseis, vir\xe1 o Filho do homem."},{verse:45,en:"Who then is a faithful and wise servant, whom his lord hath made ruler over his household, to give them meat in due season?",pt:"Quem \xe9, pois, o servo fiel e prudente, que o senhor p\xf4s sobre os seus servi\xe7ais, para a tempo dar-lhes o sustento?"},{verse:46,en:"Blessed is that servant, whom his lord when he cometh shall find so doing.",pt:"Bem-aventurado aquele servo a quem o seu senhor, quando vier, achar assim fazendo."},{verse:47,en:"Verily I say unto you, That he shall make him ruler over all his goods.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que o por\xe1 sobre todos os seus bens."},{verse:48,en:"But and if that evil servant shall say in his heart, My lord delayeth his coming;",pt:"Mas se aquele outro, o mau servo, disser no seu cora\xe7\xe3o: Meu senhor tarda em vir,"},{verse:49,en:"And shall begin to smite his fellowservants, and to eat and drink with the drunken;",pt:"e come\xe7ar a espancar os seus conservos, e a comer e beber com os \xe9brios,"},{verse:50,en:"The lord of that servant shall come in a day when he looketh not for him, and in an hour that he is not aware of,",pt:"vir\xe1 o senhor daquele servo, num dia em que n\xe3o o espera, e numa hora de que n\xe3o sabe,"},{verse:51,en:"And shall cut him asunder, and appoint him his portion with the hypocrites: there shall be weeping and gnashing of teeth.",pt:"e cort\xe1-lo-\xe1 pelo meio, e lhe dar\xe1 a sua parte com os hip\xf3critas; ali haver\xe1 choro e ranger de dentes."}]}}),761,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:25,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then shall the kingdom of heaven be likened unto ten virgins, which took their lamps, and went forth to meet the bridegroom.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o reino dos c\xe9us ser\xe1 semelhante a dez virgens que, tomando as suas l\xe2mpadas, sa\xedram ao encontro do noivo."},{verse:2,en:"And five of them were wise, and five were foolish.",pt:"Cinco delas eram insensatas, e cinco prudentes."},{verse:3,en:"They that were foolish took their lamps, and took no oil with them:",pt:"Ora, as insensatas, tomando as l\xe2mpadas, n\xe3o levaram azeite consigo."},{verse:4,en:"But the wise took oil in their vessels with their lamps.",pt:"As prudentes, por\xe9m, levaram azeite em suas vasilhas, juntamente com as l\xe2mpadas."},{verse:5,en:"While the bridegroom tarried, they all slumbered and slept.",pt:"E tardando o noivo, cochilaram todas, e dormiram."},{verse:6,en:"And at midnight there was a cry made, Behold, the bridegroom cometh; go ye out to meet him.",pt:"Mas \xe0 meia-noite ouviu-se um grito: Eis o noivo! sa\xed-lhe ao encontro!"},{verse:7,en:"Then all those virgins arose, and trimmed their lamps.",pt:"Ent\xe3o todas aquelas virgens se levantaram, e prepararam as suas l\xe2mpadas."},{verse:8,en:"And the foolish said unto the wise, Give us of your oil; for our lamps are gone out.",pt:"E as insensatas disseram \xe0s prudentes: Dai-nos do vosso azeite, porque as nossas l\xe2mpadas est\xe3o se apagando."},{verse:9,en:"But the wise answered, saying, Not so; lest there be not enough for us and you: but go ye rather to them that sell, and buy for yourselves.",pt:"Mas as prudentes responderam: n\xe3o; pois de certo n\xe3o chegaria para n\xf3s e para v\xf3s; ide antes aos que o vendem, e comprai-o para v\xf3s."},{verse:10,en:"And while they went to buy, the bridegroom came; and they that were ready went in with him to the marriage: and the door was shut.",pt:"E, tendo elas ido compr\xe1-lo, chegou o noivo; e as que estavam preparadas entraram com ele para as bodas, e fechou-se a porta."},{verse:11,en:"Afterward came also the other virgins, saying, Lord, Lord, open to us.",pt:"Depois vieram tamb\xe9m as outras virgens, e disseram: Senhor, Senhor, abre-nos a porta."},{verse:12,en:"But he answered and said, Verily I say unto you, I know you not.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, respondeu: Em verdade vos digo, n\xe3o vos conhe\xe7o."},{verse:13,en:"Watch therefore, for ye know neither the day nor the hour wherein the Son of man cometh.",pt:"Vigiai pois, porque n\xe3o sabeis nem o dia nem a hora."},{verse:14,en:"For the kingdom of heaven is as a man travelling into a far country, who called his own servants, and delivered unto them his goods.",pt:"Porque \xe9 assim como um homem que, ausentando-se do pa\xeds, chamou os seus servos e lhes entregou os seus bens:"},{verse:15,en:"And unto one he gave five talents, to another two, and to another one; to every man according to his several ability; and straightway took his journey.",pt:"a um deu cinco talentos, a outro dois, e a outro um, a cada um segundo a sua capacidade; e seguiu viagem."},{verse:16,en:"Then he that had received the five talents went and traded with the same, and made them other five talents.",pt:"O que recebera cinco talentos foi imediatamente negociar com eles, e ganhou outros cinco;"},{verse:17,en:"And likewise he that had received two, he also gained other two.",pt:"da mesma sorte, o que recebera dois ganhou outros dois;"},{verse:18,en:"But he that had received one went and digged in the earth, and hid his lord\u2019s money.",pt:"mas o que recebera um foi e cavou na terra e escondeu o dinheiro do seu senhor."},{verse:19,en:"After a long time the lord of those servants cometh, and reckoneth with them.",pt:"Ora, depois de muito tempo veio o senhor daqueles servos, e fez contas com eles."},{verse:20,en:"And so he that had received five talents came and brought other five talents, saying, Lord, thou deliveredst unto me five talents: behold, I have gained beside them five talents more.",pt:"Ent\xe3o chegando o que recebera cinco talentos, apresentou-lhe outros cinco talentos, dizendo: Senhor, entregaste-me cinco talentos; eis aqui outros cinco que ganhei."},{verse:21,en:"His lord said unto him, Well done, thou good and faithful servant: thou hast been faithful over a few things, I will make thee ruler over many things: enter thou into the joy of thy lord.",pt:"Disse-lhe o seu senhor: Muito bem, servo bom e fiel; sobre o pouco foste fiel, sobre muito te colocarei; entra no gozo do teu senhor."},{verse:22,en:"He also that had received two talents came and said, Lord, thou deliveredst unto me two talents: behold, I have gained two other talents beside them.",pt:"Chegando tamb\xe9m o que recebera dois talentos, disse: Senhor, entregaste-me dois talentos; eis aqui outros dois que ganhei."},{verse:23,en:"His lord said unto him, Well done, good and faithful servant; thou hast been faithful over a few things, I will make thee ruler over many things: enter thou into the joy of thy lord.",pt:"Disse-lhe o seu senhor: Muito bem, servo bom e fiel; sobre o pouco foste fiel, sobre muito te colocarei; entra no gozo do teu senhor."},{verse:24,en:"Then he which had received the one talent came and said, Lord, I knew thee that thou art an hard man, reaping where thou hast not sown, and gathering where thou hast not strawed:",pt:"Chegando por fim o que recebera um talento, disse: Senhor, eu te conhecia, que \xe9s um homem duro, que ceifas onde n\xe3o semeaste, e recolhes onde n\xe3o joeiraste;"},{verse:25,en:"And I was afraid, and went and hid thy talent in the earth: lo, there thou hast that is thine.",pt:"e, atemorizado, fui esconder na terra o teu talento; eis aqui tens o que \xe9 teu."},{verse:26,en:"His lord answered and said unto him, Thou wicked and slothful servant, thou knewest that I reap where I sowed not, and gather where I have not strawed:",pt:"Ao que lhe respondeu o seu senhor: Servo mau e pregui\xe7oso, sabias que ceifo onde n\xe3o semeei, e recolho onde n\xe3o joeirei?"},{verse:27,en:"Thou oughtest therefore to have put my money to the exchangers, and then at my coming I should have received mine own with usury.",pt:"Devias ent\xe3o entregar o meu dinheiro aos banqueiros e, vindo eu, t\xea-lo-ia recebido com juros."},{verse:28,en:"Take therefore the talent from him, and give it unto him which hath ten talents.",pt:"Tirai-lhe, pois, o talento e dai ao que tem os dez talentos."},{verse:29,en:"For unto every one that hath shall be given, and he shall have abundance: but from him that hath not shall be taken away even that which he hath.",pt:"Porque a todo o que tem, dar-se-lhe-\xe1, e ter\xe1 em abund\xe2ncia; mas ao que n\xe3o tem, at\xe9 aquilo que tem ser-lhe-\xe1 tirado."},{verse:30,en:"And cast ye the unprofitable servant into outer darkness: there shall be weeping and gnashing of teeth.",pt:"E lan\xe7ai o servo in\xfatil nas trevas exteriores; ali haver\xe1 choro e ranger de dentes."},{verse:31,en:"When the Son of man shall come in his glory, and all the holy angels with him, then shall he sit upon the throne of his glory:",pt:"Quando, pois vier o Filho do homem na sua gl\xf3ria, e todos os anjos com ele, ent\xe3o se assentar\xe1 no trono da sua gl\xf3ria;"},{verse:32,en:"And before him shall be gathered all nations: and he shall separate them one from another, as a shepherd divideth his sheep from the goats:",pt:"e diante dele ser\xe3o reunidas todas as na\xe7\xf5es; e ele separar\xe1 uns dos outros, como o pastor separa as ovelhas dos cabritos;"},{verse:33,en:"And he shall set the sheep on his right hand, but the goats on the left.",pt:"e por\xe1 as ovelhas \xe0 sua direita, mas os cabritos \xe0 esquerda."},{verse:34,en:"Then shall the King say unto them on his right hand, Come, ye blessed of my Father, inherit the kingdom prepared for you from the foundation of the world:",pt:"Ent\xe3o dir\xe1 o Rei aos que estiverem \xe0 sua direita: Vinde, benditos de meu Pai. Possu\xed por heran\xe7a o reino que vos est\xe1 preparado desde a funda\xe7\xe3o do mundo;"},{verse:35,en:"For I was an hungred, and ye gave me meat: I was thirsty, and ye gave me drink: I was a stranger, and ye took me in:",pt:"porque tive fome, e me destes de comer; tive sede, e me destes de beber; era forasteiro, e me acolhestes;"},{verse:36,en:"Naked, and ye clothed me: I was sick, and ye visited me: I was in prison, and ye came unto me.",pt:"estava nu, e me vestistes; adoeci, e me visitastes; estava na pris\xe3o e fostes ver-me."},{verse:37,en:"Then shall the righteous answer him, saying, Lord, when saw we thee an hungred, and fed thee? or thirsty, and gave thee drink?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os justos lhe perguntar\xe3o: Senhor, quando te vimos com fome, e te demos de comer? ou com sede, e te demos de beber?"},{verse:38,en:"When saw we thee a stranger, and took thee in? or naked, and clothed thee?",pt:"Quando te vimos forasteiro, e te acolhemos? ou nu, e te vestimos?"},{verse:39,en:"Or when saw we thee sick, or in prison, and came unto thee?",pt:"Quando te vimos enfermo, ou na pris\xe3o, e fomos visitar-te?"},{verse:40,en:"And the King shall answer and say unto them, Verily I say unto you, Inasmuch as ye have done it unto one of the least of these my brethren, ye have done it unto me.",pt:"E responder-lhes-\xe1 o Rei: Em verdade vos digo que, sempre que o fizestes a um destes meus irm\xe3os, mesmo dos mais pequeninos, a mim o fizestes."},{verse:41,en:"Then shall he say also unto them on the left hand, Depart from me, ye cursed, into everlasting fire, prepared for the devil and his angels:",pt:"Ent\xe3o dir\xe1 tamb\xe9m aos que estiverem \xe0 sua esquerda: Apartai- vos de mim, malditos, para o fogo eterno, preparado para o Diabo e seus anjos;"},{verse:42,en:"For I was an hungred, and ye gave me no meat: I was thirsty, and ye gave me no drink:",pt:"porque tive fome, e n\xe3o me destes de comer; tive sede, e n\xe3o me destes de beber;"},{verse:43,en:"I was a stranger, and ye took me not in: naked, and ye clothed me not: sick, and in prison, and ye visited me not.",pt:"era forasteiro, e n\xe3o me acolhestes; estava nu, e n\xe3o me vestistes; enfermo, e na pris\xe3o, e n\xe3o me visitastes."},{verse:44,en:"Then shall they also answer him, saying, Lord, when saw we thee an hungred, or athirst, or a stranger, or naked, or sick, or in prison, and did not minister unto thee?",pt:"Ent\xe3o tamb\xe9m estes perguntar\xe3o: Senhor, quando te vimos com fome, ou com sede, ou forasteiro, ou nu, ou enfermo, ou na pris\xe3o, e n\xe3o te servimos?"},{verse:45,en:"Then shall he answer them, saying, Verily I say unto you, Inasmuch as ye did it not to one of the least of these, ye did it not to me.",pt:"Ao que lhes responder\xe1: Em verdade vos digo que, sempre que o deixaste de fazer a um destes mais pequeninos, deixastes de o fazer a mim."},{verse:46,en:"And these shall go away into everlasting punishment: but the righteous into life eternal.",pt:"E ir\xe3o eles para o castigo eterno, mas os justos para a vida eterna."}]}}),762,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,i,n){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:26,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass, when Jesus had finished all these sayings, he said unto his disciples,",pt:"E havendo Jesus conclu\xeddo todas estas palavras, disse aos seus disc\xedpulos:"},{verse:2,en:"Ye know that after two days is the feast of the passover, and the Son of man is betrayed to be crucified.",pt:"Sabeis que daqui a dois dias \xe9 a p\xe1scoa; e o Filho do homem ser\xe1 entregue para ser crucificado."},{verse:3,en:"Then assembled together the chief priests, and the scribes, and the elders of the people, unto the palace of the high priest, who was called Caiaphas,",pt:"Ent\xe3o os principais sacerdotes e os anci\xe3os do povo se reuniram no p\xe1tio da casa do sumo sacerdote, o qual se chamava Caif\xe1s;"},{verse:4,en:"And consulted that they might take Jesus by subtilty, and kill him.",pt:"e deliberaram como prender Jesus a trai\xe7\xe3o, e o matar."},{verse:5,en:"But they said, Not on the feast day, lest there be an uproar among the people.",pt:"Mas diziam: N\xe3o durante a festa, para que n\xe3o haja tumulto entre o povo."},{verse:6,en:"Now when Jesus was in Bethany, in the house of Simon the leper,",pt:"Estando Jesus em Bet\xe2nia, em casa de Sim\xe3o, o leproso,"},{verse:7,en:"There came unto him a woman having an alabaster box of very precious ointment, and poured it on his head, as he sat at meat.",pt:"aproximou-se dele uma mulher que trazia um vaso de alabastro cheio de b\xe1lsamo precioso, e lho derramou sobre a cabe\xe7a, estando ele reclinado \xe0 mesa."},{verse:8,en:"But when his disciples saw it, they had indignation, saying, To what purpose is this waste?",pt:"Quando os disc\xedpulos viram isso, indignaram-se, e disseram: Para que este disperd\xedcio?"},{verse:9,en:"For this ointment might have been sold for much, and given to the poor.",pt:"Pois este b\xe1lsamo podia ser vendido por muito dinheiro, que se daria aos pobres."},{verse:10,en:"When Jesus understood it, he said unto them, Why trouble ye the woman? for she hath wrought a good work upon me.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, percebendo isso, disse-lhes: Por que molestais esta mulher? pois praticou uma boa a\xe7\xe3o para comigo."},{verse:11,en:"For ye have the poor always with you; but me ye have not always.",pt:"Porquanto os pobres sempre os tendes convosco; a mim, por\xe9m, nem sempre me tendes."},{verse:12,en:"For in that she hath poured this ointment on my body, she did it for my burial.",pt:"Ora, derramando ela este b\xe1lsamo sobre o meu corpo, f\xea-lo a fim de preparar-me para a minha sepultura."},{verse:13,en:"Verily I say unto you, Wheresoever this gospel shall be preached in the whole world, there shall also this, that this woman hath done, be told for a memorial of her.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que onde quer que for pregado em todo o mundo este evangelho, tamb\xe9m o que ela fez ser\xe1 contado para mem\xf3ria sua."},{verse:14,en:"Then one of the twelve, called Judas Iscariot, went unto the chief priests,",pt:"Ent\xe3o um dos doze, chamado Judas Iscariotes, foi ter com os principais sacerdotes,"},{verse:15,en:"And said unto them, What will ye give me, and I will deliver him unto you? And they covenanted with him for thirty pieces of silver.",pt:"e disse: Que me quereis dar, e eu vo-lo entregarei? E eles lhe pesaram trinta moedas de prata."},{verse:16,en:"And from that time he sought opportunity to betray him.",pt:"E desde ent\xe3o buscava ele oportunidade para o entregar."},{verse:17,en:"Now the first day of the feast of unleavened bread the disciples came to Jesus, saying unto him, Where wilt thou that we prepare for thee to eat the passover?",pt:"Ora, no primeiro dia dos p\xe3es \xe1zimos, vieram os disc\xedpulos a Jesus, e perguntaram: Onde queres que fa\xe7amos os preparativos para comeres a p\xe1scoa?"},{verse:18,en:"And he said, Go into the city to such a man, and say unto him, The Master saith, My time is at hand; I will keep the passover at thy house with my disciples.",pt:"Respondeu ele: Ide \xe0 cidade a um certo homem, e dizei-lhe: O Mestre diz: O meu tempo est\xe1 pr\xf3ximo; em tua casa celebrarei a p\xe1scoa com os meus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:19,en:"And the disciples did as Jesus had appointed them; and they made ready the passover.",pt:"E os disc\xedpulos fizeram como Jesus lhes ordenara, e prepararam a p\xe1scoa."},{verse:20,en:"Now when the even was come, he sat down with the twelve.",pt:"Ao anoitecer reclinou-se \xe0 mesa com os doze disc\xedpulos;"},{verse:21,en:"And as they did eat, he said, Verily I say unto you, that one of you shall betray me.",pt:"e, enquanto comiam, disse: Em verdade vos digo que um de v\xf3s me trair\xe1."},{verse:22,en:"And they were exceeding sorrowful, and began every one of them to say unto him, Lord, is it I?",pt:"E eles, profundamente contristados, come\xe7aram cada um a perguntar-lhe: Porventura sou eu, Senhor?"},{verse:23,en:"And he answered and said, He that dippeth his hand with me in the dish, the same shall betray me.",pt:"Respondeu ele: O que mete comigo a m\xe3o no prato, esse me trair\xe1."},{verse:24,en:"The Son of man goeth as it is written of him: but woe unto that man by whom the Son of man is betrayed! it had been good for that man if he had not been born.",pt:"Em verdade o Filho do homem vai, conforme est\xe1 escrito a seu respeito; mas ai daquele por quem o Filho do homem \xe9 traido! bom seria para esse homem se n\xe3o houvera nascido."},{verse:25,en:"Then Judas, which betrayed him, answered and said, Master, is it I? He said unto him, Thou hast said.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m Judas, que o tra\xeda, perguntou: Porventura sou eu, Rab\xed? Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Tu o disseste."},{verse:26,en:"And as they were eating, Jesus took bread, and blessed it, and brake it, and gave it to the disciples, and said, Take, eat; this is my body.",pt:"Enquanto comiam, Jesus tomou o p\xe3o e, aben\xe7oando-o, o partiu e o deu aos disc\xedpulos, dizendo: Tomai, comei; isto \xe9 o meu corpo."},{verse:27,en:"And he took the cup, and gave thanks, and gave it to them, saying, Drink ye all of it;",pt:"E tomando um c\xe1lice, rendeu gra\xe7as e deu-lho, dizendo: Bebei dele todos;"},{verse:28,en:"For this is my blood of the new testament, which is shed for many for the remission of sins.",pt:"pois isto \xe9 o meu sangue, o sangue do pacto, o qual \xe9 derramado por muitos para remiss\xe3o dos pecados."},{verse:29,en:"But I say unto you, I will not drink henceforth of this fruit of the vine, until that day when I drink it new with you in my Father\u2019s kingdom.",pt:"Mas digo-vos que desde agora n\xe3o mais beberei deste fruto da videira at\xe9 aquele dia em que convosco o beba novo, no reino de meu Pai."},{verse:30,en:"And when they had sung an hymn, they went out into the mount of Olives.",pt:"E tendo cantado um hino, sa\xedram para o Monte das Oliveiras."},{verse:31,en:"Then saith Jesus unto them, All ye shall be offended because of me this night: for it is written, I will smite the shepherd, and the sheep of the flock shall be scattered abroad.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus lhes disse: Todos v\xf3s esta noite vos escandalizareis de mim; pois est\xe1 escrito: Ferirei o pastor, e as ovelhas do rebanho se dispersar\xe3o."},{verse:32,en:"But after I am risen again, I will go before you into Galilee.",pt:"Todavia, depois que eu ressurgir, irei adiante de v\xf3s para a Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:33,en:"Peter answered and said unto him, Though all men shall be offended because of thee, yet will I never be offended.",pt:"Mas Pedro, respondendo, disse-lhe: Ainda que todos se escandalizem de ti, eu nunca me escandalizarei."},{verse:34,en:"Jesus said unto him, Verily I say unto thee, That this night, before the cock crow, thou shalt deny me thrice.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Em verdade te digo que esta noite, antes que o galo cante tr\xeas vezes me negar\xe1s."},{verse:35,en:"Peter said unto him, Though I should die with thee, yet will I not deny thee. Likewise also said all the disciples.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Pedro: Ainda que me seja necess\xe1rio morrer contigo, de modo algum te negarei. E o mesmo disseram todos os disc\xedpulos."},{verse:36,en:"Then cometh Jesus with them unto a place called Gethsemane, and saith unto the disciples, Sit ye here, while I go and pray yonder.",pt:"Ent\xe3o foi Jesus com eles a um lugar chamado Gets\xeamane, e disse aos disc\xedpulos: Sentai-vos aqui, enquanto eu vou ali orar."},{verse:37,en:"And he took with him Peter and the two sons of Zebedee, and began to be sorrowful and very heavy.",pt:"E levando consigo Pedro e os dois filhos de Zebedeu, come\xe7ou a entristecer-se e a angustiar-se."},{verse:38,en:"Then saith he unto them, My soul is exceeding sorrowful, even unto death: tarry ye here, and watch with me.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes disse: A minha alma est\xe1 triste at\xe9 a morte; ficai aqui e vigiai comigo."},{verse:39,en:"And he went a little farther, and fell on his face, and prayed, saying, O my Father, if it be possible, let this cup pass from me: nevertheless not as I will, but as thou wilt.",pt:"E adiantando-se um pouco, prostrou-se com o rosto em terra e orou, dizendo: Meu Pai, se \xe9 poss\xedvel, passa de mim este c\xe1lice; todavia, n\xe3o seja como eu quero, mas como tu queres."},{verse:40,en:"And he cometh unto the disciples, and findeth them asleep, and saith unto Peter, What, could ye not watch with me one hour?",pt:"Voltando para os disc\xedpulos, achou-os dormindo; e disse a Pedro: Assim nem uma hora pudestes vigiar comigo?"},{verse:41,en:"Watch and pray, that ye enter not into temptation: the spirit indeed is willing, but the flesh is weak.",pt:"Vigiai e orai, para que n\xe3o entreis em tenta\xe7\xe3o; o esp\xedrito, na verdade, est\xe1 pronto, mas a carne \xe9 fraca."},{verse:42,en:"He went away again the second time, and prayed, saying, O my Father, if this cup may not pass away from me, except I drink it, thy will be done.",pt:"Retirando-se mais uma vez, orou, dizendo: Pai meu, se este c\xe1lice n\xe3o pode passar sem que eu o beba, fa\xe7a-se a tua vontade."},{verse:43,en:"And he came and found them asleep again: for their eyes were heavy.",pt:"E, voltando outra vez, achou-os dormindo, porque seus olhos estavam carregados."},{verse:44,en:"And he left them, and went away again, and prayed the third time, saying the same words.",pt:"Deixando-os novamente, foi orar terceira vez, repetindo as mesmas palavras."},{verse:45,en:"Then cometh he to his disciples, and saith unto them, Sleep on now, and take your rest: behold, the hour is at hand, and the Son of man is betrayed into the hands of sinners.",pt:"Ent\xe3o voltou para os disc\xedpulos e disse-lhes: Dormi agora e descansai. Eis que \xe9 chegada a hora, e o Filho do homem est\xe1 sendo entregue nas m\xe3os dos pecadores."},{verse:46,en:"Rise, let us be going: behold, he is at hand that doth betray me.",pt:"Levantai-vos, vamo-nos; eis que \xe9 chegado aquele que me trai."},{verse:47,en:"And while he yet spake, lo, Judas, one of the twelve, came, and with him a great multitude with swords and staves, from the chief priests and elders of the people.",pt:"E estando ele ainda a falar, eis que veio Judas, um dos doze, e com ele grande multid\xe3o com espadas e varapaus, vinda da parte dos principais sacerdotes e dos anci\xe3os do povo."},{verse:48,en:"Now he that betrayed him gave them a sign, saying, Whomsoever I shall kiss, that same is he: hold him fast.",pt:"Ora, o que o tra\xeda lhes havia dado um sinal, dizendo: Aquele que eu beijar, esse \xe9: prendei-o."},{verse:49,en:"And forthwith he came to Jesus, and said, Hail, master; and kissed him.",pt:"E logo, aproximando-se de Jesus disse: Salve, Rabi. E o beijou."},{verse:50,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Friend, wherefore art thou come? Then came they, and laid hands on Jesus, and took him.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, lhe disse: Amigo, a que vieste? Nisto, aproximando-se eles, lan\xe7aram m\xe3o de Jesus, e o prenderam."},{verse:51,en:"And, behold, one of them which were with Jesus stretched out his hand, and drew his sword, and struck a servant of the high priest\u2019s, and smote off his ear.",pt:"E eis que um dos que estavam com Jesus, estendendo a m\xe3o, puxou da espada e, ferindo o servo do sumo sacerdote, cortou-lhe uma orelha."},{verse:52,en:"Then said Jesus unto him, Put up again thy sword into his place: for all they that take the sword shall perish with the sword.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus lhe disse: Mete a tua espada no seu lugar; porque todos os que lan\xe7arem m\xe3o da espada, \xe0 espada morrer\xe3o."},{verse:53,en:"Thinkest thou that I cannot now pray to my Father, and he shall presently give me more than twelve legions of angels?",pt:"Ou pensas tu que eu n\xe3o poderia rogar a meu Pai, e que ele n\xe3o me mandaria agora mesmo mais de doze legi\xf5es de anjos?"},{verse:54,en:"But how then shall the scriptures be fulfilled, that thus it must be?",pt:"Como, pois, se cumpririam as Escrituras, que dizem que assim conv\xe9m que aconte\xe7a?"},{verse:55,en:"In that same hour said Jesus to the multitudes, Are ye come out as against a thief with swords and staves for to take me? I sat daily with you teaching in the temple, and ye laid no hold on me.",pt:"Disse Jesus \xe0 multid\xe3o naquela hora: Sa\xedstes com espadas e varapaus para me prender, como a um salteador? Todos os dias estava eu sentado no templo ensinando, e n\xe3o me prendestes."},{verse:56,en:"But all this was done, that the scriptures of the prophets might be fulfilled. Then all the disciples forsook him, and fled.",pt:"Mas tudo isso aconteceu para que se cumprissem as Escrituras dos profetas. Ent\xe3o todos os disc\xedpulos, deixando-o fugiram."},{verse:57,en:"And they that had laid hold on Jesus led him away to Caiaphas the high priest, where the scribes and the elders were assembled.",pt:"Aqueles que prenderam a Jesus levaram-no \xe0 presen\xe7a do sumo sacerdote Caif\xe1s, onde os escribas e os anci\xe3os estavam reunidos."},{verse:58,en:"But Peter followed him afar off unto the high priest\u2019s palace, and went in, and sat with the servants, to see the end.",pt:"E Pedro o seguia de longe at\xe9 o p\xe1tio do sumo sacerdote; e entrando, sentou-se entre os guardas, para ver o fim."},{verse:59,en:"Now the chief priests, and elders, and all the council, sought false witness against Jesus, to put him to death;",pt:"Ora, os principais sacerdotes e todo o sin\xe9drio buscavam falso testemunho contra Jesus, para poderem entreg\xe1-lo \xe0 morte;"},{verse:60,en:"But found none: yea, though many false witnesses came, yet found they none. At the last came two false witnesses,",pt:"e n\xe3o achavam, apesar de se apresentarem muitas testemunhas falsas. Mas por fim compareceram duas,"},{verse:61,en:"And said, This fellow said, I am able to destroy the temple of God, and to build it in three days.",pt:"e disseram: Este disse: Posso destruir o santu\xe1rio de Deus, e reedific\xe1-lo em tr\xeas dias."},{verse:62,en:"And the high priest arose, and said unto him, Answerest thou nothing? what is it which these witness against thee?",pt:"Levantou-se ent\xe3o o sumo sacerdote e perguntou-lhe: Nada respondes? Que \xe9 que estes dep\xf5em contra ti?"},{verse:63,en:"But Jesus held his peace. And the high priest answered and said unto him, I adjure thee by the living God, that thou tell us whether thou be the Christ, the Son of God.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, guardava sil\xeancio. E o sumo sacerdote disse- lhe: Conjuro-te pelo Deus vivo que nos digas se tu \xe9s o Cristo, o Filho do Deus."},{verse:64,en:"Jesus saith unto him, Thou hast said: nevertheless I say unto you, Hereafter shall ye see the Son of man sitting on the right hand of power, and coming in the clouds of heaven.",pt:"Repondeu-lhe Jesus: \xc9 como disseste; contudo vos digo que vereis em breve o Filho do homem assentado \xe0 direita do Poder, e vindo sobre as nuvens do c\xe9u."},{verse:65,en:"Then the high priest rent his clothes, saying, He hath spoken blasphemy; what further need have we of witnesses? behold, now ye have heard his blasphemy.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o sumo sacerdote rasgou as suas vestes, dizendo: Blasfemou; para que precisamos ainda de testemunhas? Eis que agora acabais de ouvir a sua blasf\xeamia."},{verse:66,en:"What think ye? They answered and said, He is guilty of death.",pt:"Que vos parece? Responderam eles: \xc9 r\xe9u de morte."},{verse:67,en:"Then did they spit in his face, and buffeted him; and others smote him with the palms of their hands,",pt:"Ent\xe3o uns lhe cuspiram no rosto e lhe deram socos;"},{verse:68,en:"Saying, Prophesy unto us, thou Christ, Who is he that smote thee?",pt:"e outros o esbofetearam, dizendo: Profetiza-nos, \xf3 Cristo, quem foi que te bateu?"},{verse:69,en:"Now Peter sat without in the palace: and a damsel came unto him, saying, Thou also wast with Jesus of Galilee.",pt:"Ora, Pedro estava sentado fora, no p\xe1tio; e aproximou-se dele uma criada, que disse: Tu tamb\xe9m estavas com Jesus, o galileu."},{verse:70,en:"But he denied before them all, saying, I know not what thou sayest.",pt:"Mas ele negou diante de todos, dizendo: N\xe3o sei o que dizes."},{verse:71,en:"And when he was gone out into the porch, another maid saw him, and said unto them that were there, This fellow was also with Jesus of Nazareth.",pt:"E saindo ele para o vest\xedbulo, outra criada o viu, e disse aos que ali estavam: Este tamb\xe9m estava com Jesus, o nazareno."},{verse:72,en:"And again he denied with an oath, I do not know the man.",pt:"E ele negou outra vez, e com juramento: N\xe3o conhe\xe7o tal homem."},{verse:73,en:"And after a while came unto him they that stood by, and said to Peter, Surely thou also art one of them; for thy speech bewrayeth thee.",pt:"E da\xed a pouco, aproximando-se os que ali estavam, disseram a Pedro: Certamente tu tamb\xe9m \xe9s um deles pois a tua fala te denuncia."},{verse:74,en:"Then began he to curse and to swear, saying, I know not the man. And immediately the cock crew.",pt:"Ent\xe3o come\xe7ou ele a praguejar e a jurar, dizendo: N\xe3o conhe\xe7o esse homem. E imediatamente o galo cantou."},{verse:75,en:"And Peter remembered the word of Jesus, which said unto him, Before the cock crow, thou shalt deny me thrice. And he went out, and wept bitterly.",pt:"E Pedro lembrou-se do que dissera Jesus: Antes que o galo cante, tr\xeas vezes me negar\xe1s. E, saindo dali, chorou amargamente."}]}}),763,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:27,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"When the morning was come, all the chief priests and elders of the people took counsel against Jesus to put him to death:",pt:"Ora, chegada a manh\xe3, todos os principais sacerdotes e os anci\xe3os do povo entraram em conselho contra Jesus, para o matarem;"},{verse:2,en:"And when they had bound him, they led him away, and delivered him to Pontius Pilate the governor.",pt:"e, maniatando-o, levaram-no e o entregaram a Pilatos, o governador."},{verse:3,en:"Then Judas, which had betrayed him, when he saw that he was condemned, repented himself, and brought again the thirty pieces of silver to the chief priests and elders,",pt:"Ent\xe3o Judas, aquele que o tra\xedra, vendo que Jesus fora condenado, devolveu, compungido, as trinta moedas de prata aos anci\xe3os, dizendo:"},{verse:4,en:"Saying, I have sinned in that I have betrayed the innocent blood. And they said, What is that to us? see thou to that.",pt:"Pequei, traindo o sangue inocente. Responderam eles: Que nos importa? Seja isto l\xe1 contigo."},{verse:5,en:"And he cast down the pieces of silver in the temple, and departed, and went and hanged himself.",pt:"E tendo ele atirado para dentro do santu\xe1rio as moedas de prata, retirou-se, e foi enforcar-se."},{verse:6,en:"And the chief priests took the silver pieces, and said, It is not lawful for to put them into the treasury, because it is the price of blood.",pt:"Os principais sacerdotes, pois, tomaram as moedas de prata, e disseram: N\xe3o \xe9 l\xedcito met\xea-las no cofre das ofertas, porque \xe9 pre\xe7o de sangue."},{verse:7,en:"And they took counsel, and bought with them the potter\u2019s field, to bury strangers in.",pt:"E, tendo deliberado em conselho, compraram com elas o campo do oleiro, para servir de cemit\xe9rio para os estrangeiros."},{verse:8,en:"Wherefore that field was called, The field of blood, unto this day.",pt:"Por isso tem sido chamado aquele campo, at\xe9 o dia de hoje, Campo de Sangue."},{verse:9,en:"Then was fulfilled that which was spoken by Jeremy the prophet, saying, And they took the thirty pieces of silver, the price of him that was valued, whom they of the children of Israel did value;",pt:"Cumpriu-se, ent\xe3o, o que foi dito pelo profeta Jeremias: Tomaram as trinta moedas de prata, pre\xe7o do que foi avaliado, a quem certos filhos de Israel avaliaram,"},{verse:10,en:"And gave them for the potter\u2019s field, as the Lord appointed me.",pt:"e deram-nas pelo campo do oleiro, assim como me ordenou o Senhor."},{verse:11,en:"And Jesus stood before the governor: and the governor asked him, saying, Art thou the King of the Jews? And Jesus said unto him, Thou sayest.",pt:"Jesus, pois, ficou em p\xe9 diante do governador; e este lhe perguntou: \xc9s tu o rei dos judeus? Respondeu-lhe Jesus: \xc9 como dizes."},{verse:12,en:"And when he was accused of the chief priests and elders, he answered nothing.",pt:"Mas ao ser acusado pelos principais sacerdotes e pelos anci\xe3os, nada respondeu."},{verse:13,en:"Then said Pilate unto him, Hearest thou not how many things they witness against thee?",pt:"Perguntou-lhe ent\xe3o Pilatos: N\xe3o ouves quantas coisas testificam contra ti?"},{verse:14,en:"And he answered him to never a word; insomuch that the governor marvelled greatly.",pt:"E Jesus n\xe3o lhe respondeu a uma pergunta sequer; de modo que o governador muito se admirava."},{verse:15,en:"Now at that feast the governor was wont to release unto the people a prisoner, whom they would.",pt:"Ora, por ocasi\xe3o da festa costumava o governador soltar um preso, escolhendo o povo aquele que quisesse."},{verse:16,en:"And they had then a notable prisoner, called Barabbas.",pt:"Nesse tempo tinham um preso not\xf3rio, chamado Barrab\xe1s."},{verse:17,en:"Therefore when they were gathered together, Pilate said unto them, Whom will ye that I release unto you? Barabbas, or Jesus which is called Christ?",pt:"Portanto, estando o povo reunido, perguntou-lhe Pilatos: Qual quereis que vos solte? Barrab\xe1s, ou Jesus, chamado o Cristo?"},{verse:18,en:"For he knew that for envy they had delivered him.",pt:"Pois sabia que por inveja o haviam entregado."},{verse:19,en:"When he was set down on the judgment seat, his wife sent unto him, saying, Have thou nothing to do with that just man: for I have suffered many things this day in a dream because of him.",pt:"E estando ele assentado no tribunal, sua mulher mandou dizer-lhe: N\xe3o te envolvas na quest\xe3o desse justo, porque muito sofri hoje em sonho por causa dele."},{verse:20,en:"But the chief priests and elders persuaded the multitude that they should ask Barabbas, and destroy Jesus.",pt:"Mas os principais sacerdotes e os anci\xe3os persuadiram as multid\xf5es a que pedissem Barrab\xe1s e fizessem morrer Jesus."},{verse:21,en:"The governor answered and said unto them, Whether of the twain will ye that I release unto you? They said, Barabbas.",pt:"O governador, pois, perguntou-lhes: Qual dos dois quereis que eu vos solte? E disseram: Barrab\xe1s."},{verse:22,en:"Pilate saith unto them, What shall I do then with Jesus which is called Christ? They all say unto him, Let him be crucified.",pt:"Tornou-lhes Pilatos: Que farei ent\xe3o de Jesus, que se chama Cristo? Disseram todos: Seja crucificado."},{verse:23,en:"And the governor said, Why, what evil hath he done? But they cried out the more, saying, Let him be crucified.",pt:"Pilatos, por\xe9m, disse: Pois que mal fez ele? Mas eles clamavam ainda mais: Seja crucificado."},{verse:24,en:"When Pilate saw that he could prevail nothing, but that rather a tumult was made, he took water, and washed his hands before the multitude, saying, I am innocent of the blood of this just person: see ye to it.",pt:"Ao ver Pilatos que nada conseguia, mas pelo contr\xe1rio que o tumulto aumentava, mandando trazer \xe1gua, lavou as m\xe3os diante da multid\xe3o, dizendo: Sou inocente do sangue deste homem; seja isso l\xe1 convosco."},{verse:25,en:"Then answered all the people, and said, His blood be on us, and on our children.",pt:"E todo o povo respondeu: O seu sangue caia sobre n\xf3s e sobre nossos filhos."},{verse:26,en:"Then released he Barabbas unto them: and when he had scourged Jesus, he delivered him to be crucified.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes soltou Barrab\xe1s; mas a Jesus mandou a\xe7oitar, e o entregou para ser crucificado."},{verse:27,en:"Then the soldiers of the governor took Jesus into the common hall, and gathered unto him the whole band of soldiers.",pt:"Nisso os soldados do governador levaram Jesus ao pret\xf3rio, e reuniram em torno dele toda a coorte."},{verse:28,en:"And they stripped him, and put on him a scarlet robe.",pt:"E, despindo-o, vestiram-lhe um manto escarlate;"},{verse:29,en:"And when they had platted a crown of thorns, they put it upon his head, and a reed in his right hand: and they bowed the knee before him, and mocked him, saying, Hail, King of the Jews!",pt:"e tecendo uma coroa de espinhos, puseram-lha na cabe\xe7a, e na m\xe3o direita uma cana, e ajoelhando-se diante dele, o escarneciam, dizendo: Salve, rei dos judeus!"},{verse:30,en:"And they spit upon him, and took the reed, and smote him on the head.",pt:"E, cuspindo nele, tiraram-lhe a cana, e davam-lhe com ela na cabe\xe7a."},{verse:31,en:"And after that they had mocked him, they took the robe off from him, and put his own raiment on him, and led him away to crucify him.",pt:"Depois de o terem escarnecido, despiram-lhe o manto, puseram-lhe as suas vestes, e levaram-no para ser crucificado."},{verse:32,en:"And as they came out, they found a man of Cyrene, Simon by name: him they compelled to bear his cross.",pt:"Ao sa\xedrem, encontraram um homem cireneu, chamado Sim\xe3o, a quem obrigaram a levar a cruz de Jesus."},{verse:33,en:"And when they were come unto a place called Golgotha, that is to say, a place of a skull,",pt:"Quando chegaram ao lugar chamado G\xf3lgota, que quer dizer, lugar da Caveira,"},{verse:34,en:"They gave him vinegar to drink mingled with gall: and when he had tasted thereof, he would not drink.",pt:"deram-lhe a beber vinho misturado com fel; mas ele, provando-o, n\xe3o quis beber."},{verse:35,en:"And they crucified him, and parted his garments, casting lots: that it might be fulfilled which was spoken by the prophet, They parted my garments among them, and upon my vesture did they cast lots.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, depois de o crucificarem, repartiram as vestes dele, lan\xe7ando sortes, [para que se cumprisse o que foi dito pelo profeta: Repartiram entre si as minhas vestes, e sobre a minha t\xfanica deitaram sortes.]"},{verse:36,en:"And sitting down they watched him there;",pt:"E, sentados, ali o guardavam."},{verse:37,en:"And set up over his head his accusation written, THIS IS JESUS THE KING OF THE JEWS.",pt:"Puseram-lhe por cima da cabe\xe7a a sua acusa\xe7\xe3o escrita: ESTE \xc9 JESUS, O REI DOS JUDEUS."},{verse:38,en:"Then were there two thieves crucified with him, one on the right hand, and another on the left.",pt:"Ent\xe3o foram crucificados com ele dois salteadores, um \xe0 direita, e outro \xe0 esquerda."},{verse:39,en:"And they that passed by reviled him, wagging their heads,",pt:"E os que iam passando blasfemavam dele, meneando a cabe\xe7a"},{verse:40,en:"And saying, Thou that destroyest the temple, and buildest it in three days, save thyself. If thou be the Son of God, come down from the cross.",pt:"e dizendo: Tu, que destr\xf3is o santu\xe1rio e em tr\xeas dias o reedificas, salva-te a ti mesmo; se \xe9s Filho de Deus, desce da cruz."},{verse:41,en:"Likewise also the chief priests mocking him, with the scribes and elders, said,",pt:"De igual modo tamb\xe9m os principais sacerdotes, com os escribas e anci\xe3os, escarnecendo, diziam:"},{verse:42,en:"He saved others; himself he cannot save. If he be the King of Israel, let him now come down from the cross, and we will believe him.",pt:"A outros salvou; a si mesmo n\xe3o pode salvar. Rei de Israel \xe9 ele; des\xe7a agora da cruz, e creremos nele;"},{verse:43,en:"He trusted in God; let him deliver him now, if he will have him: for he said, I am the Son of God.",pt:"confiou em Deus, livre-o ele agora, se lhe quer bem; porque disse: Sou Filho de Deus."},{verse:44,en:"The thieves also, which were crucified with him, cast the same in his teeth.",pt:"O mesmo lhe lan\xe7aram em rosto tamb\xe9m os salteadores que com ele foram crucificados."},{verse:45,en:"Now from the sixth hour there was darkness over all the land unto the ninth hour.",pt:"E, desde a hora sexta, houve trevas sobre toda a terra, at\xe9 a hora nona."},{verse:46,en:"And about the ninth hour Jesus cried with a loud voice, saying, Eli, Eli, lama sabachthani? that is to say, My God, my God, why hast thou forsaken me?",pt:"Cerca da hora nona, bradou Jesus em alta voz, dizendo: Eli, Eli, lam\xe1 sabactani; isto \xe9, Deus meu, Deus meu, por que me desamparaste?"},{verse:47,en:"Some of them that stood there, when they heard that, said, This man calleth for Elias.",pt:"Alguns dos que ali estavam, ouvindo isso, diziam: Ele chama por Elias."},{verse:48,en:"And straightway one of them ran, and took a spunge, and filled it with vinegar, and put it on a reed, and gave him to drink.",pt:"E logo correu um deles, tomou uma esponja, ensopou-a em vinagre e, pondo-a numa cana, dava-lhe de beber."},{verse:49,en:"The rest said, Let be, let us see whether Elias will come to save him.",pt:"Os outros, por\xe9m, disseram: Deixa, vejamos se Elias vem salv\xe1-lo."},{verse:50,en:"Jesus, when he had cried again with a loud voice, yielded up the ghost.",pt:"De novo bradou Jesus com grande voz, e entregou o esp\xedrito."},{verse:51,en:"And, behold, the veil of the temple was rent in twain from the top to the bottom; and the earth did quake, and the rocks rent;",pt:"E eis que o v\xe9u do santu\xe1rio se rasgou em dois, de alto a baixo; a terra tremeu, as pedras se fenderam,"},{verse:52,en:"And the graves were opened; and many bodies of the saints which slept arose,",pt:"os sepulcros se abriram, e muitos corpos de santos que tinham dormido foram ressuscitados;"},{verse:53,en:"And came out of the graves after his resurrection, and went into the holy city, and appeared unto many.",pt:"e, saindo dos sepulcros, depois da ressurrei\xe7\xe3o dele, entraram na cidade santa, e apareceram a muitos."},{verse:54,en:"Now when the centurion, and they that were with him, watching Jesus, saw the earthquake, and those things that were done, they feared greatly, saying, Truly this was the Son of God.",pt:"ora, o centuri\xe3o e os que com ele guardavam Jesus, vendo o terremoto e as coisas que aconteciam, tiveram grande temor, e disseram: Verdadeiramente este era filho de Deus."},{verse:55,en:"And many women were there beholding afar off, which followed Jesus from Galilee, ministering unto him:",pt:"Tamb\xe9m estavam ali, olhando de longe, muitas mulheres que tinham seguido Jesus desde a Galil\xe9ia para o ouvir;"},{verse:56,en:"Among which was Mary Magdalene, and Mary the mother of James and Joses, and the mother of Zebedee\u2019s children.",pt:"entre as quais se achavam Maria Madalena, Maria, m\xe3e de Tiago e de Jos\xe9, e a m\xe3e dos filhos de Zebedeu."},{verse:57,en:"When the even was come, there came a rich man of Arimathaea, named Joseph, who also himself was Jesus\u2019 disciple:",pt:"Ao cair da tarde, veio um homem rico de Arimat\xe9ia, chamado Jos\xe9, que tamb\xe9m era disc\xedpulo de Jesus."},{verse:58,en:"He went to Pilate, and begged the body of Jesus. Then Pilate commanded the body to be delivered.",pt:"Esse foi a Pilatos e pediu o corpo de Jesus. Ent\xe3o Pilatos mandou que lhe fosse entregue."},{verse:59,en:"And when Joseph had taken the body, he wrapped it in a clean linen cloth,",pt:"E Jos\xe9, tomando o corpo, envolveu-o num pano limpo, de linho,"},{verse:60,en:"And laid it in his own new tomb, which he had hewn out in the rock: and he rolled a great stone to the door of the sepulchre, and departed.",pt:"e depositou-o no seu sepulcro novo, que havia aberto em rocha; e, rodando uma grande pedra para a porta do sepulcro, retirou- se."},{verse:61,en:"And there was Mary Magdalene, and the other Mary, sitting over against the sepulchre.",pt:"Mas achavam-se ali Maria Madalena e a outra Maria, sentadas defronte do sepulcro."},{verse:62,en:"Now the next day, that followed the day of the preparation, the chief priests and Pharisees came together unto Pilate,",pt:"No dia seguinte, isto \xe9, o dia depois da prepara\xe7\xe3o, reuniram-se os principais sacerdotes e os fariseus perante Pilatos,"},{verse:63,en:"Saying, Sir, we remember that that deceiver said, while he was yet alive, After three days I will rise again.",pt:"e disseram: Senhor, lembramo-nos de que aquele embusteiro, quando ainda vivo, afirmou: Depois de tr\xeas dias ressurgirei."},{verse:64,en:"Command therefore that the sepulchre be made sure until the third day, lest his disciples come by night, and steal him away, and say unto the people, He is risen from the dead: so the last error shall be worse than the first.",pt:"Manda, pois, que o sepulcro seja guardado com seguran\xe7a at\xe9 o terceiro dia; para n\xe3o suceder que, vindo os disc\xedpulos, o furtem e digam ao povo: Ressurgiu dos mortos; e assim o \xfaltimo embuste ser\xe1 pior do que o primeiro."},{verse:65,en:"Pilate said unto them, Ye have a watch: go your way, make it as sure as ye can.",pt:"Disse-lhes Pilatos: Tendes uma guarda; ide, tornai-o seguro, como entendeis."},{verse:66,en:"So they went, and made the sepulchre sure, sealing the stone, and setting a watch.",pt:"Foram, pois, e tornaram seguro o sepulcro, selando a pedra, e deixando ali a guarda."}]}}),764,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,d){t.exports={book:"Matthew",bookPt:"Mateus",chapter:28,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"In the end of the sabbath, as it began to dawn toward the first day of the week, came Mary Magdalene and the other Mary to see the sepulchre.",pt:"No fim do s\xe1bado, quando j\xe1 despontava o primeiro dia da semana, Maria Madalena e a outra Maria foram ver o sepulcro."},{verse:2,en:"And, behold, there was a great earthquake: for the angel of the Lord descended from heaven, and came and rolled back the stone from the door, and sat upon it.",pt:"E eis que houvera um grande terremoto; pois um anjo do Senhor descera do c\xe9u e, chegando-se, removera a pedra e estava sentado sobre ela."},{verse:3,en:"His countenance was like lightning, and his raiment white as snow:",pt:"o seu aspecto era como um rel\xe2mpago, e as suas vestes brancas como a neve."},{verse:4,en:"And for fear of him the keepers did shake, and became as dead men.",pt:"E de medo dele tremeram os guardas, e ficaram como mortos."},{verse:5,en:"And the angel answered and said unto the women, Fear not ye: for I know that ye seek Jesus, which was crucified.",pt:"Mas o anjo disse \xe0s mulheres: N\xe3o temais v\xf3s; pois eu sei que buscais a Jesus, que foi crucificado."},{verse:6,en:"He is not here: for he is risen, as he said. Come, see the place where the Lord lay.",pt:"N\xe3o est\xe1 aqui, porque ressurgiu, como ele disse. Vinde, vede o lugar onde jazia;"},{verse:7,en:"And go quickly, and tell his disciples that he is risen from the dead; and, behold, he goeth before you into Galilee; there shall ye see him: lo, I have told you.",pt:"e ide depressa, e dizei aos seus disc\xedpulos que ressurgiu dos mortos; e eis que vai adiante de v\xf3s para a Galil\xe9ia; ali o vereis. Eis que vo-lo tenho dito."},{verse:8,en:"And they departed quickly from the sepulchre with fear and great joy; and did run to bring his disciples word.",pt:"E, partindo elas pressurosamente do sepulcro, com temor e grande alegria, correram a anunci\xe1-lo aos disc\xedpulos."},{verse:9,en:"And as they went to tell his disciples, behold, Jesus met them, saying, All hail. And they came and held him by the feet, and worshipped him.",pt:"E eis que Jesus lhes veio ao encontro, dizendo: Salve. E elas, aproximando-se, abra\xe7aram-lhe os p\xe9s, e o adoraram."},{verse:10,en:"Then said Jesus unto them, Be not afraid: go tell my brethren that they go into Galilee, and there shall they see me.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes disse Jesus: N\xe3o temais; ide dizer a meus irm\xe3os que v\xe3o para a Galil\xe9ia; ali me ver\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"Now when they were going, behold, some of the watch came into the city, and shewed unto the chief priests all the things that were done.",pt:"Ora, enquanto elas iam, eis que alguns da guarda foram \xe0 cidade, e contaram aos principais sacerdotes tudo quanto havia acontecido."},{verse:12,en:"And when they were assembled with the elders, and had taken counsel, they gave large money unto the soldiers,",pt:"E congregados eles com os anci\xe3os e tendo consultado entre si, deram muito dinheiro aos soldados,"},{verse:13,en:"Saying, Say ye, His disciples came by night, and stole him away while we slept.",pt:"e ordenaram-lhes que dissessem: Vieram de noite os seus disc\xedpulos e, estando n\xf3s dormindo, furtaram-no."},{verse:14,en:"And if this come to the governor\u2019s ears, we will persuade him, and secure you.",pt:"E, se isto chegar aos ouvidos do governador, n\xf3s o persuadiremos, e vos livraremos de cuidado."},{verse:15,en:"So they took the money, and did as they were taught: and this saying is commonly reported among the Jews until this day.",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles, tendo recebido o dinheiro, fizeram como foram instru\xeddos. E essa hist\xf3ria tem-se divulgado entre os judeus at\xe9 o dia de hoje."},{verse:16,en:"Then the eleven disciples went away into Galilee, into a mountain where Jesus had appointed them.",pt:"Partiram, pois, os onze disc\xedpulos para a Galil\xe9ia, para o monte onde Jesus lhes designara."},{verse:17,en:"And when they saw him, they worshipped him: but some doubted.",pt:"Quando o viram, o adoraram; mas alguns duvidaram."},{verse:18,en:"And Jesus came and spake unto them, saying, All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.",pt:"E, aproximando-se Jesus, falou-lhes, dizendo: Foi-me dada toda a autoridade no c\xe9u e na terra."},{verse:19,en:"Go ye therefore, and teach all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Ghost:",pt:"Portanto ide, fazei disc\xedpulos de todas as na\xe7\xf5es, batizando-os em nome do Pai, e do Filho, e do Esp\xedrito Santo;"},{verse:20,en:"Teaching them to observe all things whatsoever I have commanded you: and, lo, I am with you alway, even unto the end of the world. Amen.",pt:"ensinando-os a observar todas as coisas que eu vos tenho mandado; e eis que eu estou convosco todos os dias, at\xe9 a consuma\xe7\xe3o dos s\xe9culos."}]}}),765,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The beginning of the gospel of Jesus Christ, the Son of God;",pt:"Princ\xedpio do evangelho de Jesus Cristo, Filho de Deus."},{verse:2,en:"As it is written in the prophets, Behold, I send my messenger before thy face, which shall prepare thy way before thee.",pt:"Conforme est\xe1 escrito no profeta Isa\xedas: Eis que envio ante a tua face o meu mensageiro, que h\xe1 de preparar o teu caminho;"},{verse:3,en:"The voice of one crying in the wilderness, Prepare ye the way of the Lord, make his paths straight.",pt:"voz do que clama no deserto: Preparai o caminho do Senhor, endireitai as suas veredas;"},{verse:4,en:"John did baptize in the wilderness, and preach the baptism of repentance for the remission of sins.",pt:"assim apareceu Jo\xe3o, o Batista, no deserto, pregando o batismo de arrependimento para remiss\xe3o dos pecados."},{verse:5,en:"And there went out unto him all the land of Judaea, and they of Jerusalem, and were all baptized of him in the river of Jordan, confessing their sins.",pt:"E sa\xedam a ter com ele toda a terra da Jud\xe9ia, e todos os moradores de Jerusal\xe9m; e eram por ele batizados no rio Jord\xe3o, confessando os seus pecados."},{verse:6,en:"And John was clothed with camel\u2019s hair, and with a girdle of a skin about his loins; and he did eat locusts and wild honey;",pt:"Ora, Jo\xe3o usava uma veste de p\xealos de camelo, e um cinto de couro em torno de seus lombos, e comia gafanhotos e mel silvestre."},{verse:7,en:"And preached, saying, There cometh one mightier than I after me, the latchet of whose shoes I am not worthy to stoop down and unloose.",pt:"E pregava, dizendo: Ap\xf3s mim vem aquele que \xe9 mais poderoso do que eu, de quem n\xe3o sou digno de, inclinando-me, desatar a correia das alparcas."},{verse:8,en:"I indeed have baptized you with water: but he shall baptize you with the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Eu vos batizei em \xe1gua; ele, por\xe9m, vos batizar\xe1 no Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:9,en:"And it came to pass in those days, that Jesus came from Nazareth of Galilee, and was baptized of John in Jordan.",pt:"E aconteceu naqueles dias que veio Jesus de Nazar\xe9 da Galil\xe9ia, e foi batizado por Jo\xe3o no Jord\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"And straightway coming up out of the water, he saw the heavens opened, and the Spirit like a dove descending upon him:",pt:"E logo, quando sa\xeda da \xe1gua, viu os c\xe9us se abrirem, e o Esp\xedrito, qual pomba, a descer sobre ele;"},{verse:11,en:"And there came a voice from heaven, saying, Thou art my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased.",pt:"e ouviu-se dos c\xe9us esta voz: Tu \xe9s meu Filho amado; em ti me comprazo."},{verse:12,en:"And immediately the Spirit driveth him into the wilderness.",pt:"Imediatamente o Esp\xedrito o impeliu para o deserto."},{verse:13,en:"And he was there in the wilderness forty days, tempted of Satan; and was with the wild beasts; and the angels ministered unto him.",pt:"E esteve no deserto quarenta dias sentado tentado por Satan\xe1s; estava entre as feras, e os anjos o serviam."},{verse:14,en:"Now after that John was put in prison, Jesus came into Galilee, preaching the gospel of the kingdom of God,",pt:"Ora, depois que Jo\xe3o foi entregue, veio Jesus para a Galil\xe9ia pregando o evangelho de Deus"},{verse:15,en:"And saying, The time is fulfilled, and the kingdom of God is at hand: repent ye, and believe the gospel.",pt:"e dizendo: O tempo est\xe1 cumprido, e \xe9 chegado o reino de Deus. Arrependei-vos, e crede no evangelho."},{verse:16,en:"Now as he walked by the sea of Galilee, he saw Simon and Andrew his brother casting a net into the sea: for they were fishers.",pt:"E, andando junto do mar da Galil\xe9ia, viu a Sim\xe3o, e a Andr\xe9, irm\xe3o de Sim\xe3o, os quais lan\xe7avam a rede ao mar, pois eram pescadores."},{verse:17,en:"And Jesus said unto them, Come ye after me, and I will make you to become fishers of men.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Vinde ap\xf3s mim, e eu farei que vos torneis pescadores de homens."},{verse:18,en:"And straightway they forsook their nets, and followed him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles, deixando imediatamente as suas redes, o seguiram."},{verse:19,en:"And when he had gone a little farther thence, he saw James the son of Zebedee, and John his brother, who also were in the ship mending their nets.",pt:"E ele, passando um pouco adiante, viu Tiago, filho de Zebedeu, e Jo\xe3o, seu irm\xe3o, que estavam no barco, consertando as redes,"},{verse:20,en:"And straightway he called them: and they left their father Zebedee in the ship with the hired servants, and went after him.",pt:"e logo os chamou; eles, deixando seu pai Zebedeu no barco com os empregados, o seguiram."},{verse:21,en:"And they went into Capernaum; and straightway on the sabbath day he entered into the synagogue, and taught.",pt:"Entraram em Cafarnaum; e, logo no s\xe1bado, indo ele \xe0 sinagoga, p\xf4s-se a ensinar."},{verse:22,en:"And they were astonished at his doctrine: for he taught them as one that had authority, and not as the scribes.",pt:"E maravilhavam-se da sua doutrina, porque os ensinava como tendo autoridade, e n\xe3o como os escribas."},{verse:23,en:"And there was in their synagogue a man with an unclean spirit; and he cried out,",pt:"Ora, estava na sinagoga um homem possesso dum esp\xedrito imundo, o qual gritou:"},{verse:24,en:"Saying, Let us alone; what have we to do with thee, thou Jesus of Nazareth? art thou come to destroy us? I know thee who thou art, the Holy One of God.",pt:"Que temos n\xf3s contigo, Jesus, nazareno? Vieste destruir-nos? Bem sei quem \xe9s: o Santo de Deus."},{verse:25,en:"And Jesus rebuked him, saying, Hold thy peace, and come out of him.",pt:"Mas Jesus o repreendeu, dizendo: Cala-te, e sai dele."},{verse:26,en:"And when the unclean spirit had torn him, and cried with a loud voice, he came out of him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o esp\xedrito imundo, convulsionando-o e clamando com grande voz, saiu dele."},{verse:27,en:"And they were all amazed, insomuch that they questioned among themselves, saying, What thing is this? what new doctrine is this? for with authority commandeth he even the unclean spirits, and they do obey him.",pt:"E todos se maravilharam a ponto de perguntarem entre si, dizendo: Que \xe9 isto? Uma nova doutrina com autoridade! Pois ele ordena aos esp\xedritos imundos, e eles lhe obedecem!"},{verse:28,en:"And immediately his fame spread abroad throughout all the region round about Galilee.",pt:"E logo correu a sua fama por toda a regi\xe3o da Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:29,en:"And forthwith, when they were come out of the synagogue, they entered into the house of Simon and Andrew, with James and John.",pt:"Em seguida, saiu da sinagoga e foi a casa de Sim\xe3o e Andr\xe9 com Tiago e Jo\xe3o."},{verse:30,en:"But Simon\u2019s wife\u2019s mother lay sick of a fever, and anon they tell him of her.",pt:"A sogra de Sim\xe3o estava de cama com febre, e logo lhe falaram a respeito dela."},{verse:31,en:"And he came and took her by the hand, and lifted her up; and immediately the fever left her, and she ministered unto them.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus, chegando-se e tomando-a pela m\xe3o, a levantou; e a febre a deixou, e ela os servia."},{verse:32,en:"And at even, when the sun did set, they brought unto him all that were diseased, and them that were possessed with devils.",pt:"Sendo j\xe1 tarde, tendo-se posto o sol, traziam-lhe todos os enfermos, e os endemoninhados;"},{verse:33,en:"And all the city was gathered together at the door.",pt:"e toda a cidade estava reunida \xe0 porta;"},{verse:34,en:"And he healed many that were sick of divers diseases, and cast out many devils; and suffered not the devils to speak, because they knew him.",pt:"e ele curou muitos doentes atacados de diversas mol\xe9stias, e expulsou muitos dem\xf4nios; mas n\xe3o permitia que os dem\xf4nios falassem, porque o conheciam."},{verse:35,en:"And in the morning, rising up a great while before day, he went out, and departed into a solitary place, and there prayed.",pt:"De madrugada, ainda bem escuro, levantou-se, saiu e foi a um lugar deserto, e ali orava."},{verse:36,en:"And Simon and they that were with him followed after him.",pt:"Foram, pois, Sim\xe3o e seus companheiros procur\xe1-lo;"},{verse:37,en:"And when they had found him, they said unto him, All men seek for thee.",pt:"quando o encontraram, disseram-lhe: Todos te buscam."},{verse:38,en:"And he said unto them, Let us go into the next towns, that I may preach there also: for therefore came I forth.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Vamos a outras partes, \xe0s povoa\xe7\xf5es vizinhas, para que eu pregue ali tamb\xe9m; pois para isso \xe9 que vim."},{verse:39,en:"And he preached in their synagogues throughout all Galilee, and cast out devils.",pt:"Foi, ent\xe3o, por toda a Galil\xe9ia, pregando nas sinagogas deles e expulsando os dem\xf4nios."},{verse:40,en:"And there came a leper to him, beseeching him, and kneeling down to him, and saying unto him, If thou wilt, thou canst make me clean.",pt:"E veio a ele um leproso que, de joelhos, lhe rogava, dizendo: Se quiseres, bem podes tornar-me limpo."},{verse:41,en:"And Jesus, moved with compassion, put forth his hand, and touched him, and saith unto him, I will; be thou clean.",pt:"Jesus, pois, compadecido dele, estendendo a m\xe3o, tocou-o e disse-lhe: Quero; s\xea limpo."},{verse:42,en:"And as soon as he had spoken, immediately the leprosy departed from him, and he was cleansed.",pt:"Imediatamente desapareceu dele a lepra e ficou limpo."},{verse:43,en:"And he straitly charged him, and forthwith sent him away;",pt:"E Jesus, advertindo-o secretamente, logo o despediu,"},{verse:44,en:"And saith unto him, See thou say nothing to any man: but go thy way, shew thyself to the priest, and offer for thy cleansing those things which Moses commanded, for a testimony unto them.",pt:"dizendo-lhe: Olha, n\xe3o digas nada a ningu\xe9m; mas vai, mostra-te ao sacerdote e oferece pela tua purifica\xe7\xe3o o que Mois\xe9s determinou, para lhes servir de testemunho."},{verse:45,en:"But he went out, and began to publish it much, and to blaze abroad the matter, insomuch that Jesus could no more openly enter into the city, but was without in desert places: and they came to him from every quarter.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, saindo dali, come\xe7ou a publicar o caso por toda parte e a divulg\xe1-lo, de modo que Jesus j\xe1 n\xe3o podia entrar abertamente numa cidade, mas conservava-se fora em lugares desertos; e de todos os lados iam ter com ele."}]}}),766,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And again he entered into Capernaum, after some days; and it was noised that he was in the house.",pt:"Alguns dias depois entrou Jesus outra vez em Cafarnaum, e soube-se que ele estava em casa."},{verse:2,en:"And straightway many were gathered together, insomuch that there was no room to receive them, no, not so much as about the door: and he preached the word unto them.",pt:"Ajuntaram-se, pois, muitos, a ponta de n\xe3o caberem nem mesmo diante da porta; e ele lhes anunciava a palavra."},{verse:3,en:"And they come unto him, bringing one sick of the palsy, which was borne of four.",pt:"Nisso vieram alguns a trazer-lhe um paral\xedtico, carregado por quatro;"},{verse:4,en:"And when they could not come nigh unto him for the press, they uncovered the roof where he was: and when they had broken it up, they let down the bed wherein the sick of the palsy lay.",pt:"e n\xe3o podendo aproximar-se dele, por causa da multid\xe3o, descobriram o telhado onde estava e, fazendo uma abertura, baixaram o leito em que jazia o paral\xedtico."},{verse:5,en:"When Jesus saw their faith, he said unto the sick of the palsy, Son, thy sins be forgiven thee.",pt:"E Jesus, vendo-lhes a f\xe9, disse ao paral\xedtico: Filho, perdoados s\xe3o os teus pecados."},{verse:6,en:"But there were certain of the scribes sitting there, and reasoning in their hearts,",pt:"Ora, estavam ali sentados alguns dos escribas, que arrazoavam em seus cora\xe7\xf5es, dizendo:"},{verse:7,en:"Why doth this man thus speak blasphemies? who can forgive sins but God only?",pt:"Por que fala assim este homem? Ele blasfema. Quem pode perdoar pecados sen\xe3o um s\xf3, que \xe9 Deus?"},{verse:8,en:"And immediately when Jesus perceived in his spirit that they so reasoned within themselves, he said unto them, Why reason ye these things in your hearts?",pt:"Mas Jesus logo percebeu em seu esp\xedrito que eles assim arrazoavam dentro de si, e perguntou-lhes: Por que arrazoais desse modo em vossos cora\xe7\xf5es?"},{verse:9,en:"Whether is it easier to say to the sick of the palsy, Thy sins be forgiven thee; or to say, Arise, and take up thy bed, and walk?",pt:"Qual \xe9 mais f\xe1cil? dizer ao paral\xedtico: Perdoados s\xe3o os teus pecados; ou dizer: Levanta-te, toma o teu leito, e anda?"},{verse:10,en:"But that ye may know that the Son of man hath power on earth to forgive sins, (he saith to the sick of the palsy,)",pt:"Ora, para que saibais que o Filho do homem tem sobre a terra autoridade para perdoar pecados ( disse ao paral\xedtico ),"},{verse:11,en:"I say unto thee, Arise, and take up thy bed, and go thy way into thine house.",pt:"a ti te digo, levanta-te, toma o teu leito, e vai para tua casa."},{verse:12,en:"And immediately he arose, took up the bed, and went forth before them all; insomuch that they were all amazed, and glorified God, saying, We never saw it on this fashion.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele se levantou e, tomando logo o leito, saiu \xe0 vista de todos; de modo que todos pasmavam e glorificavam a Deus, dizendo: Nunca vimos coisa semelhante."},{verse:13,en:"And he went forth again by the sea side; and all the multitude resorted unto him, and he taught them.",pt:"Outra vez saiu Jesus para a beira do mar; e toda a multid\xe3o ia ter com ele, e ele os ensinava."},{verse:14,en:"And as he passed by, he saw Levi the son of Alphaeus sitting at the receipt of custom, and said unto him, Follow me. And he arose and followed him.",pt:"Quando ia passando, viu a Levi, filho de Alfeu, sentado na coletoria, e disse-lhe: Segue-me. E ele, levantando-se, o seguiu."},{verse:15,en:"And it came to pass, that, as Jesus sat at meat in his house, many publicans and sinners sat also together with Jesus and his disciples: for there were many, and they followed him.",pt:"Ora, estando Jesus \xe0 mesa em casa de Levi, estavam tamb\xe9m ali reclinados com ele e seus disc\xedpulos muitos publicanos e pecadores; pois eram em grande n\xfamero e o seguiam."},{verse:16,en:"And when the scribes and Pharisees saw him eat with publicans and sinners, they said unto his disciples, How is it that he eateth and drinketh with publicans and sinners?",pt:"Vendo os escribas dos fariseus que comia com os publicanos e pecadores, perguntavam aos disc\xedpulos: Por que \xe9 que ele como com os publicanos e pecadores?"},{verse:17,en:"When Jesus heard it, he saith unto them, They that are whole have no need of the physician, but they that are sick: I came not to call the righteous, but sinners to repentance.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, ouvindo isso, disse-lhes: N\xe3o necessitam de m\xe9dico os s\xe3os, mas sim os enfermos; eu n\xe3o vim chamar justos, mas pecadores."},{verse:18,en:"And the disciples of John and of the Pharisees used to fast: and they come and say unto him, Why do the disciples of John and of the Pharisees fast, but thy disciples fast not?",pt:"Ora, os disc\xedpulos de Jo\xe3o e os fariseus estavam jejuando; e foram perguntar-lhe: Por que jejuam os disc\xedpulos de Jo\xe3o e os dos fariseus, mas os teus disc\xedpulos n\xe3o jejuam?"},{verse:19,en:"And Jesus said unto them, Can the children of the bridechamber fast, while the bridegroom is with them? as long as they have the bridegroom with them, they cannot fast.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Podem, porventura, jejuar os convidados \xe0s n\xfapcias, enquanto est\xe1 com eles o noivo? Enquanto t\xeam consigo o noivo n\xe3o podem jejuar;"},{verse:20,en:"But the days will come, when the bridegroom shall be taken away from them, and then shall they fast in those days.",pt:"dias vir\xe3o, por\xe9m, em que lhes ser\xe1 tirado o noivo; nesses dias, sim h\xe3o de jejuar."},{verse:21,en:"No man also seweth a piece of new cloth on an old garment: else the new piece that filled it up taketh away from the old, and the rent is made worse.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m cose remendo de pano novo em vestido velho; do contr\xe1rio o remendo novo tira parte do velho, e torna-se maior a rotura."},{verse:22,en:"And no man putteth new wine into old bottles: else the new wine doth burst the bottles, and the wine is spilled, and the bottles will be marred: but new wine must be put into new bottles.",pt:"E ningu\xe9m deita vinho novo em odres velhos; do contr\xe1rio, o vinho novo romper\xe1 os odres, e perder-se-\xe1 o vinho e tamb\xe9m os odres; mas deita-se vinho novo em odres novos."},{verse:23,en:"And it came to pass, that he went through the corn fields on the sabbath day; and his disciples began, as they went, to pluck the ears of corn.",pt:"E sucedeu passar ele num dia de s\xe1bado pelas searas; e os seus disc\xedpulos, caminhando, come\xe7aram a colher espigas."},{verse:24,en:"And the Pharisees said unto him, Behold, why do they on the sabbath day that which is not lawful?",pt:"E os fariseus lhe perguntaram: Olha, por que est\xe3o fazendo no s\xe1bado o que n\xe3o \xe9 l\xedcito?"},{verse:25,en:"And he said unto them, Have ye never read what David did, when he had need, and was an hungred, he, and they that were with him?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes ele: Acaso nunca lestes o que fez Davi quando se viu em necessidade e teve fome, ele e seus companheiros?"},{verse:26,en:"How he went into the house of God in the days of Abiathar the high priest, and did eat the shewbread, which is not lawful to eat but for the priests, and gave also to them which were with him?",pt:"Como entrou na casa de Deus, no tempo do sumo sacerdote Abiatar, e comeu dos p\xe3es da proposi\xe7\xe3o, dos quais n\xe3o era l\xedcito comer sen\xe3o aos sacerdotes, e deu tamb\xe9m aos companheiros?"},{verse:27,en:"And he said unto them, The sabbath was made for man, and not man for the sabbath:",pt:"E prosseguiu: O s\xe1bado foi feito por causa do homem, e n\xe3o o homem por causa do s\xe1bado."},{verse:28,en:"Therefore the Son of man is Lord also of the sabbath.",pt:"Pelo que o Filho do homem at\xe9 do s\xe1bado \xe9 Senhor."}]}}),767,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,d){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he entered again into the synagogue; and there was a man there which had a withered hand.",pt:"Outra vez entrou numa sinagoga, e estava ali um homem que tinha uma das m\xe3os atrofiada."},{verse:2,en:"And they watched him, whether he would heal him on the sabbath day; that they might accuse him.",pt:"E observavam-no para ver se no s\xe1bado curaria o homem, a fim de o acusarem."},{verse:3,en:"And he saith unto the man which had the withered hand, Stand forth.",pt:"E disse Jesus ao homem que tinha a m\xe3o atrofiada: Levanta-te e vem para o meio."},{verse:4,en:"And he saith unto them, Is it lawful to do good on the sabbath days, or to do evil? to save life, or to kill? But they held their peace.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes perguntou: \xc9 l\xedcito no s\xe1bado fazer bem, ou fazer mal? salvar a vida ou matar? Eles, por\xe9m, se calaram."},{verse:5,en:"And when he had looked round about on them with anger, being grieved for the hardness of their hearts, he saith unto the man, Stretch forth thine hand. And he stretched it out: and his hand was restored whole as the other.",pt:"E olhando em redor para eles com indigna\xe7\xe3o, condoendo-se da dureza dos seus cora\xe7\xf5es, disse ao homem: Estende a tua m\xe3o. Ele estendeu, e lhe foi restabelecida."},{verse:6,en:"And the Pharisees went forth, and straightway took counsel with the Herodians against him, how they might destroy him.",pt:"E os fariseus, saindo dali, entraram logo em conselho com os herodianos contra ele, para o matarem."},{verse:7,en:"But Jesus withdrew himself with his disciples to the sea: and a great multitude from Galilee followed him, and from Judaea,",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, se retirou com os seus disc\xedpulos para a beira do mar; e uma grande multid\xe3o dos da Galil\xe9ia o seguiu; tamb\xe9m da Jud\xe9ia,"},{verse:8,en:"And from Jerusalem, and from Idumaea, and from beyond Jordan; and they about Tyre and Sidon, a great multitude, when they had heard what great things he did, came unto him.",pt:"e de Jerusal\xe9m, da Idum\xe9ia e de al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o, e das regi\xf5es de Tiro e de Sidom, grandes multid\xf5es, ouvindo falar de tudo quanto fazia, vieram ter com ele."},{verse:9,en:"And he spake to his disciples, that a small ship should wait on him because of the multitude, lest they should throng him.",pt:"Recomendou, pois, a seus disc\xedpulos que se lhe preparasse um barquinho, por causa da multid\xe3o, para que n\xe3o o apertasse;"},{verse:10,en:"For he had healed many; insomuch that they pressed upon him for to touch him, as many as had plagues.",pt:"porque tinha curado a muitos, de modo que todos quantos tinham algum mal arrojavam-se a ele para lhe tocarem."},{verse:11,en:"And unclean spirits, when they saw him, fell down before him, and cried, saying, Thou art the Son of God.",pt:"E os esp\xedritos imundos, quando o viam, prostravam-se diante dele e clamavam, dizendo: Tu \xe9s o Filho de Deus."},{verse:12,en:"And he straitly charged them that they should not make him known.",pt:"E ele lhes advertia com insist\xeancia que n\xe3o o dessem a conhecer."},{verse:13,en:"And he goeth up into a mountain, and calleth unto him whom he would: and they came unto him.",pt:"Depois subiu ao monte, e chamou a si os que ele mesmo queria; e vieram a ele."},{verse:14,en:"And he ordained twelve, that they should be with him, and that he might send them forth to preach,",pt:"Ent\xe3o designou doze para que estivessem com ele, e os mandasse a pregar;"},{verse:15,en:"And to have power to heal sicknesses, and to cast out devils:",pt:"e para que tivessem autoridade de expulsar os dem\xf4nios."},{verse:16,en:"And Simon he surnamed Peter;",pt:"Designou, pois, os doze, a saber: Sim\xe3o, a quem p\xf4s o nome de Pedro;"},{verse:17,en:"And James the son of Zebedee, and John the brother of James; and he surnamed them Boanerges, which is, The sons of thunder:",pt:"Tiago, filho de Zebedeu, e Jo\xe3o, irm\xe3o de Tiago, aos quais p\xf4s o nome de Boanerges, que significa: Filhos do trov\xe3o;"},{verse:18,en:"And Andrew, and Philip, and Bartholomew, and Matthew, and Thomas, and James the son of Alphaeus, and Thaddaeus, and Simon the Canaanite,",pt:"Andr\xe9, Filipe, Bartolomeu, Mateus, Tom\xe9, Tiago, filho de Alfeu, Tadeu, Sim\xe3o, o cananeu,"},{verse:19,en:"And Judas Iscariot, which also betrayed him: and they went into an house.",pt:"e Judas Iscariotes, aquele que o traiu."},{verse:20,en:"And the multitude cometh together again, so that they could not so much as eat bread.",pt:"Depois entrou numa casa. E afluiu outra vez a multid\xe3o, de tal modo que nem podiam comer."},{verse:21,en:"And when his friends heard of it, they went out to lay hold on him: for they said, He is beside himself.",pt:"Quando os seus ouviram isso, sa\xedram para o prender; porque diziam: Ele est\xe1 fora de si."},{verse:22,en:"And the scribes which came down from Jerusalem said, He hath Beelzebub, and by the prince of the devils casteth he out devils.",pt:"E os escribas que tinham descido de Jerusal\xe9m diziam: Ele est\xe1 possesso de Belzebu; e: \xc9 pelo pr\xedncipe dos dem\xf4nios que expulsa os dem\xf4nios."},{verse:23,en:"And he called them unto him, and said unto them in parables, How can Satan cast out Satan?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus os chamou e lhes disse por par\xe1bolas: Como pode Satan\xe1s expulsar Satan\xe1s?"},{verse:24,en:"And if a kingdom be divided against itself, that kingdom cannot stand.",pt:"Pois, se um reino se dividir contra si mesmo, tal reino n\xe3o pode subsistir;"},{verse:25,en:"And if a house be divided against itself, that house cannot stand.",pt:"ou, se uma casa se dividir contra si mesma, tal casa n\xe3o poder\xe1 subsistir;"},{verse:26,en:"And if Satan rise up against himself, and be divided, he cannot stand, but hath an end.",pt:"e se Satan\xe1s se tem levantado contra si mesmo, e est\xe1 dividido, tampouco pode ele subsistir; antes tem fim."},{verse:27,en:"No man can enter into a strong man\u2019s house, and spoil his goods, except he will first bind the strong man; and then he will spoil his house.",pt:"Pois ningu\xe9m pode entrar na casa do valente e roubar-lhe os bens, se primeiro n\xe3o amarrar o valente; e ent\xe3o lhe saquear\xe1 a casa."},{verse:28,en:"Verily I say unto you, All sins shall be forgiven unto the sons of men, and blasphemies wherewith soever they shall blaspheme:",pt:"Em verdade vos digo: Todos os pecados ser\xe3o perdoados aos filhos dos homens, bem como todas as blasf\xeamias que proferirem;"},{verse:29,en:"But he that shall blaspheme against the Holy Ghost hath never forgiveness, but is in danger of eternal damnation:",pt:"mas aquele que blasfemar contra o Esp\xedrito Santo, nunca mais ter\xe1 perd\xe3o, mas ser\xe1 r\xe9u de pecado eterno."},{verse:30,en:"Because they said, He hath an unclean spirit.",pt:"Porquanto eles diziam: Est\xe1 possesso de um esp\xedrito imundo."},{verse:31,en:"There came then his brethren and his mother, and, standing without, sent unto him, calling him.",pt:"Chegaram ent\xe3o sua m\xe3e e seus irm\xe3os e, ficando da parte de fora, mandaram cham\xe1-lo."},{verse:32,en:"And the multitude sat about him, and they said unto him, Behold, thy mother and thy brethren without seek for thee.",pt:"E a multid\xe3o estava sentada ao redor dele, e disseram-lhe: Eis que tua m\xe3e e teus irm\xe3os est\xe3o l\xe1 fora e te procuram."},{verse:33,en:"And he answered them, saying, Who is my mother, or my brethren?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus, dizendo: Quem \xe9 minha m\xe3e e meus irm\xe3os!"},{verse:34,en:"And he looked round about on them which sat about him, and said, Behold my mother and my brethren!",pt:"E olhando em redor para os que estavam sentados \xe0 roda de si, disse: Eis aqui minha m\xe3e e meus irm\xe3os!"},{verse:35,en:"For whosoever shall do the will of God, the same is my brother, and my sister, and mother.",pt:"Pois aquele que fizer a vontade de Deus, esse \xe9 meu irm\xe3o, irm\xe3 e m\xe3e."}]}}),768,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he began again to teach by the sea side: and there was gathered unto him a great multitude, so that he entered into a ship, and sat in the sea; and the whole multitude was by the sea on the land.",pt:"Outra vez come\xe7ou a ensinar \xe0 beira do mar. E reuniu-se a ele t\xe3o grande multid\xe3o que ele entrou num barco e sentou-se nele, sobre o mar; e todo o povo estava em terra junto do mar."},{verse:2,en:"And he taught them many things by parables, and said unto them in his doctrine,",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes ensinava muitas coisas por par\xe1bolas, e lhes dizia no seu ensino:"},{verse:3,en:"Hearken; Behold, there went out a sower to sow:",pt:"Ouvi: Eis que o semeador saiu a semear;"},{verse:4,en:"And it came to pass, as he sowed, some fell by the way side, and the fowls of the air came and devoured it up.",pt:"e aconteceu que, quando semeava, uma parte da semente caiu \xe0 beira do caminho, e vieram as aves e a comeram."},{verse:5,en:"And some fell on stony ground, where it had not much earth; and immediately it sprang up, because it had no depth of earth:",pt:"Outra caiu no solo pedregoso, onde n\xe3o havia muita terra: e logo nasceu, porque n\xe3o tinha terra profunda;"},{verse:6,en:"But when the sun was up, it was scorched; and because it had no root, it withered away.",pt:"mas, saindo o sol, queimou-se; e, porque n\xe3o tinha raiz, secou-se."},{verse:7,en:"And some fell among thorns, and the thorns grew up, and choked it, and it yielded no fruit.",pt:"E outra caiu entre espinhos; e cresceram os espinhos, e a sufocaram; e n\xe3o deu fruto."},{verse:8,en:"And other fell on good ground, and did yield fruit that sprang up and increased; and brought forth, some thirty, and some sixty, and some an hundred.",pt:"Mas outras ca\xedram em boa terra e, vingando e crescendo, davam fruto; e um gr\xe3o produzia trinta, outro sessenta, e outro cem."},{verse:9,en:"And he said unto them, He that hath ears to hear, let him hear.",pt:"E disse-lhes: Quem tem ouvidos para ouvir, ou\xe7a."},{verse:10,en:"And when he was alone, they that were about him with the twelve asked of him the parable.",pt:"Quando se achou s\xf3, os que estavam ao redor dele, com os doze, interrogaram-no acerca da par\xe1bola."},{verse:11,en:"And he said unto them, Unto you it is given to know the mystery of the kingdom of God: but unto them that are without, all these things are done in parables:",pt:"E ele lhes disse: A v\xf3s \xe9 confiado o mist\xe9rio do reino de Deus, mas aos de fora tudo se lhes diz por par\xe1bolas;"},{verse:12,en:"That seeing they may see, and not perceive; and hearing they may hear, and not understand; lest at any time they should be converted, and their sins should be forgiven them.",pt:"para que vendo, vejam, e n\xe3o percebam; e ouvindo, ou\xe7am, e n\xe3o entendam; para que n\xe3o se convertam e sejam perdoados."},{verse:13,en:"And he said unto them, Know ye not this parable? and how then will ye know all parables?",pt:"Disse-lhes ainda: N\xe3o percebeis esta par\xe1bola? como pois entendereis todas as par\xe1bolas?"},{verse:14,en:"The sower soweth the word.",pt:"O semeador semeia a palavra."},{verse:15,en:"And these are they by the way side, where the word is sown; but when they have heard, Satan cometh immediately, and taketh away the word that was sown in their hearts.",pt:"E os que est\xe3o junto do caminho s\xe3o aqueles em quem a palavra \xe9 semeada; mas, tendo-a eles ouvido, vem logo Satan\xe1s e tira a palavra que neles foi semeada."},{verse:16,en:"And these are they likewise which are sown on stony ground; who, when they have heard the word, immediately receive it with gladness;",pt:"Do mesmo modo, aqueles que foram semeados nos lugares pedregosos s\xe3o os que, ouvindo a palavra, imediatamente com alegria a recebem;"},{verse:17,en:"And have no root in themselves, and so endure but for a time: afterward, when affliction or persecution ariseth for the word\u2019s sake, immediately they are offended.",pt:"mas n\xe3o t\xeam raiz em si mesmos, antes s\xe3o de pouca dura\xe7\xe3o; depois, sobrevindo tribula\xe7\xe3o ou persegui\xe7\xe3o por causa da palavra, logo se escandalizam."},{verse:18,en:"And these are they which are sown among thorns; such as hear the word,",pt:"Outros ainda s\xe3o aqueles que foram semeados entre os espinhos; estes s\xe3o os que ouvem a palavra;"},{verse:19,en:"And the cares of this world, and the deceitfulness of riches, and the lusts of other things entering in, choke the word, and it becometh unfruitful.",pt:"mas os cuidados do mundo, a sedu\xe7\xe3o das riquezas e a cobi\xe7a doutras coisas, entrando, sufocam a palavra, e ela fica infrut\xedfera."},{verse:20,en:"And these are they which are sown on good ground; such as hear the word, and receive it, and bring forth fruit, some thirtyfold, some sixty, and some an hundred.",pt:"Aqueles outros que foram semeados em boa terra s\xe3o os que ouvem a palavra e a recebem, e d\xe3o fruto, a trinta, a sessenta, e a cem, por um."},{verse:21,en:"And he said unto them, Is a candle brought to be put under a bushel, or under a bed? and not to be set on a candlestick?",pt:"Disse-lhes mais: Vem porventura a candeia para se meter debaixo do alqueire, ou debaixo da cama? n\xe3o \xe9 antes para se colocar no velador?"},{verse:22,en:"For there is nothing hid, which shall not be manifested; neither was any thing kept secret, but that it should come abroad.",pt:"Porque nada est\xe1 encoberto sen\xe3o para ser manifesto; e nada foi escondido sen\xe3o para vir \xe0 luz."},{verse:23,en:"If any man have ears to hear, let him hear.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m tem ouvidos para ouvir, ou\xe7a."},{verse:24,en:"And he said unto them, Take heed what ye hear: with what measure ye mete, it shall be measured to you: and unto you that hear shall more be given.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m lhes disse: Atendei ao que ouvis. Com a medida com que medis vos medir\xe3o a v\xf3s, e ainda se vos acrescentar\xe1."},{verse:25,en:"For he that hath, to him shall be given: and he that hath not, from him shall be taken even that which he hath.",pt:"Pois ao que tem, ser-lhe-\xe1 dado; e ao que n\xe3o tem, at\xe9 aquilo que tem ser-lhe-\xe1 tirado."},{verse:26,en:"And he said, So is the kingdom of God, as if a man should cast seed into the ground;",pt:"Disse tamb\xe9m: O reino de Deus \xe9 assim como se um homem lan\xe7asse semente \xe0 terra,"},{verse:27,en:"And should sleep, and rise night and day, and the seed should spring and grow up, he knoweth not how.",pt:"e dormisse e se levantasse de noite e de dia, e a semente brotasse e crescesse, sem ele saber como."},{verse:28,en:"For the earth bringeth forth fruit of herself; first the blade, then the ear, after that the full corn in the ear.",pt:"A terra por si mesma produz fruto, primeiro a erva, depois a espiga, e por \xfaltimo o gr\xe3o cheio na espiga."},{verse:29,en:"But when the fruit is brought forth, immediately he putteth in the sickle, because the harvest is come.",pt:"Mas assim que o fruto amadurecer, logo lhe mete a foice, porque \xe9 chegada a ceifa."},{verse:30,en:"And he said, Whereunto shall we liken the kingdom of God? or with what comparison shall we compare it?",pt:"Disse ainda: A que assemelharemos o reino de Deus? ou com que par\xe1bola o representaremos?"},{verse:31,en:"It is like a grain of mustard seed, which, when it is sown in the earth, is less than all the seeds that be in the earth:",pt:"\xc9 como um gr\xe3o de mostarda que, quando se semeia, \xe9 a menor de todas as sementes que h\xe1 na terra;"},{verse:32,en:"But when it is sown, it groweth up, and becometh greater than all herbs, and shooteth out great branches; so that the fowls of the air may lodge under the shadow of it.",pt:"mas, tendo sido semeado, cresce e faz-se a maior de todas as hortali\xe7as e cria grandes ramos, de tal modo que as aves do c\xe9u podem aninhar-se \xe0 sua sombra."},{verse:33,en:"And with many such parables spake he the word unto them, as they were able to hear it.",pt:"E com muitas par\xe1bolas tais lhes dirigia a palavra, conforme podiam compreender."},{verse:34,en:"But without a parable spake he not unto them: and when they were alone, he expounded all things to his disciples.",pt:"E sem par\xe1bola n\xe3o lhes falava; mas em particular explicava tudo a seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:35,en:"And the same day, when the even was come, he saith unto them, Let us pass over unto the other side.",pt:"Naquele dia, quando j\xe1 era tarde, disse-lhes: Passemos para o outro lado."},{verse:36,en:"And when they had sent away the multitude, they took him even as he was in the ship. And there were also with him other little ships.",pt:"E eles, deixando a multid\xe3o, o levaram consigo, assim como estava, no barco; e havia com ele tamb\xe9m outros barcos."},{verse:37,en:"And there arose a great storm of wind, and the waves beat into the ship, so that it was now full.",pt:"E se levantou grande tempestade de vento, e as ondas batiam dentro do barco, de modo que j\xe1 se enchia."},{verse:38,en:"And he was in the hinder part of the ship, asleep on a pillow: and they awake him, and say unto him, Master, carest thou not that we perish?",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, estava na popa dormindo sobre a almofada; e despertaram-no, e lhe perguntaram: Mestre, n\xe3o se te d\xe1 que pere\xe7amos?"},{verse:39,en:"And he arose, and rebuked the wind, and said unto the sea, Peace, be still. And the wind ceased, and there was a great calm.",pt:"E ele, levantando-se, repreendeu o vento, e disse ao mar: Cala-te, aquieta-te. E cessou o vento, e fez-se grande bonan\xe7a."},{verse:40,en:"And he said unto them, Why are ye so fearful? how is it that ye have no faith?",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes perguntou: Por que sois assim t\xedmidos? Ainda n\xe3o tendes f\xe9?"},{verse:41,en:"And they feared exceedingly, and said one to another, What manner of man is this, that even the wind and the sea obey him?",pt:"Encheram-se de grande temor, e diziam uns aos outros: Quem, porventura, \xe9 este, que at\xe9 o vento e o mar lhe obedecem?"}]}}),769,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,h){s.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And they came over unto the other side of the sea, into the country of the Gadarenes.",pt:"Chegaram ent\xe3o ao outro lado do mar, \xe0 terra dos gerasenos."},{verse:2,en:"And when he was come out of the ship, immediately there met him out of the tombs a man with an unclean spirit,",pt:"E, logo que Jesus sa\xedra do barco, lhe veio ao encontro, dos sepulcros, um homem com esp\xedrito imundo,"},{verse:3,en:"Who had his dwelling among the tombs; and no man could bind him, no, not with chains:",pt:"o qual tinha a sua morada nos sepulcros; e nem ainda com cadeias podia algu\xe9m prend\xea-lo;"},{verse:4,en:"Because that he had been often bound with fetters and chains, and the chains had been plucked asunder by him, and the fetters broken in pieces: neither could any man tame him.",pt:"porque, tendo sido muitas vezes preso com grilh\xf5es e cadeias, as cadeias foram por ele feitas em peda\xe7os, e os grilh\xf5es em migalhas; e ningu\xe9m o podia domar;"},{verse:5,en:"And always, night and day, he was in the mountains, and in the tombs, crying, and cutting himself with stones.",pt:"e sempre, de dia e de noite, andava pelos sepulcros e pelos montes, gritando, e ferindo-se com pedras,"},{verse:6,en:"But when he saw Jesus afar off, he ran and worshipped him,",pt:"Vendo, pois, de longe a Jesus, correu e adorou-o;"},{verse:7,en:"And cried with a loud voice, and said, What have I to do with thee, Jesus, thou Son of the most high God? I adjure thee by God, that thou torment me not.",pt:"e, clamando com grande voz, disse: Que tenho eu contigo, Jesus, Filho do Deus Alt\xedssimo? conjuro-te por Deus que n\xe3o me atormentes."},{verse:8,en:"For he said unto him, Come out of the man, thou unclean spirit.",pt:"Pois Jesus lhe dizia: Sai desse homem, esp\xedrito imundo."},{verse:9,en:"And he asked him, What is thy name? And he answered, saying, My name is Legion: for we are many.",pt:"E perguntou-lhe: Qual \xe9 o teu nome? Respondeu-lhe ele: Legi\xe3o \xe9 o meu nome, porque somos muitos."},{verse:10,en:"And he besought him much that he would not send them away out of the country.",pt:"E rogava-lhe muito que n\xe3o os enviasse para fora da regi\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"Now there was there nigh unto the mountains a great herd of swine feeding.",pt:"Ora, andava ali pastando no monte uma grande manada de porcos."},{verse:12,en:"And all the devils besought him, saying, Send us into the swine, that we may enter into them.",pt:"Rogaram-lhe, pois, os dem\xf4nios, dizendo: Manda-nos para aqueles porcos, para que entremos neles."},{verse:13,en:"And forthwith Jesus gave them leave. And the unclean spirits went out, and entered into the swine: and the herd ran violently down a steep place into the sea, (they were about two thousand;) and were choked in the sea.",pt:"E ele lho permitiu. Saindo, ent\xe3o, os esp\xedritos imundos, entraram nos porcos; e precipitou-se a manada, que era de uns dois mil, pelo despenhadeiro no mar, onde todos se afogaram."},{verse:14,en:"And they that fed the swine fled, and told it in the city, and in the country. And they went out to see what it was that was done.",pt:"Nisso fugiram aqueles que os apascentavam, e o anunciaram na cidade e nos campos; e muitos foram ver o que era aquilo que tinha acontecido."},{verse:15,en:"And they come to Jesus, and see him that was possessed with the devil, and had the legion, sitting, and clothed, and in his right mind: and they were afraid.",pt:"Chegando-se a Jesus, viram o endemoninhado, o que tivera a legi\xe3o, sentado, vestido, e em perfeito ju\xedzo; e temeram."},{verse:16,en:"And they that saw it told them how it befell to him that was possessed with the devil, and also concerning the swine.",pt:"E os que tinham visto aquilo contaram-lhes como havia acontecido ao endemoninhado, e acerca dos porcos."},{verse:17,en:"And they began to pray him to depart out of their coasts.",pt:"Ent\xe3o come\xe7aram a rogar-lhe que se retirasse dos seus termos."},{verse:18,en:"And when he was come into the ship, he that had been possessed with the devil prayed him that he might be with him.",pt:"E, entrando ele no barco, rogava-lhe o que fora endemoninhado que o deixasse estar com ele."},{verse:19,en:"Howbeit Jesus suffered him not, but saith unto him, Go home to thy friends, and tell them how great things the Lord hath done for thee, and hath had compassion on thee.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, n\xe3o lho permitiu, mas disse-lhe: Vai para tua casa, para os teus, e anuncia-lhes o quanto o Senhor te fez, e como teve miseric\xf3rdia de ti."},{verse:20,en:"And he departed, and began to publish in Decapolis how great things Jesus had done for him: and all men did marvel.",pt:"Ele se retirou, pois, e come\xe7ou a publicar em Dec\xe1polis tudo quanto lhe fizera Jesus; e todos se admiravam."},{verse:21,en:"And when Jesus was passed over again by ship unto the other side, much people gathered unto him: and he was nigh unto the sea.",pt:"Tendo Jesus passado de novo no barco para o outro lado, ajuntou-se a ele uma grande multid\xe3o; e ele estava \xe0 beira do mar."},{verse:22,en:"And, behold, there cometh one of the rulers of the synagogue, Jairus by name; and when he saw him, he fell at his feet,",pt:"Chegou um dos chefes da sinagoga, chamado Jairo e, logo que viu a Jesus, lan\xe7ou-se-lhe aos p\xe9s."},{verse:23,en:"And besought him greatly, saying, My little daughter lieth at the point of death: I pray thee, come and lay thy hands on her, that she may be healed; and she shall live.",pt:"e lhe rogava com inst\xe2ncia, dizendo: Minha filhinha est\xe1 nas \xfaltimas; rogo-te que venhas e lhe imponhas as m\xe3os para que sare e viva."},{verse:24,en:"And Jesus went with him; and much people followed him, and thronged him.",pt:"Jesus foi com ele, e seguia-o uma grande multid\xe3o, que o apertava."},{verse:25,en:"And a certain woman, which had an issue of blood twelve years,",pt:"Ora, certa mulher, que havia doze anos padecia de uma hemorragia,"},{verse:26,en:"And had suffered many things of many physicians, and had spent all that she had, and was nothing bettered, but rather grew worse,",pt:"e que tinha sofrido bastante \xe0s m\xe3os de muitos m\xe9dicos, e despendido tudo quanto possu\xeda sem nada aproveitar, antes indo a pior,"},{verse:27,en:"When she had heard of Jesus, came in the press behind, and touched his garment.",pt:"tendo ouvido falar a respeito de Jesus, veio por detr\xe1s, entre a multid\xe3o, e tocou-lhe o manto;"},{verse:28,en:"For she said, If I may touch but his clothes, I shall be whole.",pt:"porque dizia: Se t\xe3o-somente tocar-lhe as vestes, ficaria curada."},{verse:29,en:"And straightway the fountain of her blood was dried up; and she felt in her body that she was healed of that plague.",pt:"E imediatamente cessou a sua hemorragia; e sentiu no corpo estar j\xe1 curada do seu mal."},{verse:30,en:"And Jesus, immediately knowing in himself that virtue had gone out of him, turned him about in the press, and said, Who touched my clothes?",pt:"E logo Jesus, percebendo em si mesmo que sa\xedra dele poder, virou-se no meio da multid\xe3o e perguntou: Quem me tocou as vestes?"},{verse:31,en:"And his disciples said unto him, Thou seest the multitude thronging thee, and sayest thou, Who touched me?",pt:"Responderam-lhe os seus disc\xedpulos: V\xeas que a multid\xe3o te aperta, e perguntas: Quem me tocou?"},{verse:32,en:"And he looked round about to see her that had done this thing.",pt:"Mas ele olhava em redor para ver a que isto fizera."},{verse:33,en:"But the woman fearing and trembling, knowing what was done in her, came and fell down before him, and told him all the truth.",pt:"Ent\xe3o a mulher, atemorizada e tr\xeamula, c\xf4nscia do que nela se havia operado, veio e prostrou-se diante dele, e declarou-lhe toda a verdade."},{verse:34,en:"And he said unto her, Daughter, thy faith hath made thee whole; go in peace, and be whole of thy plague.",pt:"Disse-lhe ele: Filha, a tua f\xe9 te salvou; vai-te em paz, e fica livre desse teu mal."},{verse:35,en:"While he yet spake, there came from the ruler of the synagogue\u2019s house certain which said, Thy daughter is dead: why troublest thou the Master any further?",pt:"Enquanto ele ainda falava, chegaram pessoas da casa do chefe da sinagoga, a quem disseram: A tua filha j\xe1 morreu; por que ainda incomodas o Mestre?"},{verse:36,en:"As soon as Jesus heard the word that was spoken, he saith unto the ruler of the synagogue, Be not afraid, only believe.",pt:"O que percebendo Jesus, disse ao chefe da sinagoga: N\xe3o temas, cr\xea somente."},{verse:37,en:"And he suffered no man to follow him, save Peter, and James, and John the brother of James.",pt:"E n\xe3o permitiu que ningu\xe9m o acompanhasse, sen\xe3o Pedro, Tiago, e Jo\xe3o, irm\xe3o de Tiago."},{verse:38,en:"And he cometh to the house of the ruler of the synagogue, and seeth the tumult, and them that wept and wailed greatly.",pt:"Quando chegaram a casa do chefe da sinagoga, viu Jesus um alvoro\xe7o, e os que choravam e faziam grande pranto."},{verse:39,en:"And when he was come in, he saith unto them, Why make ye this ado, and weep? the damsel is not dead, but sleepeth.",pt:"E, entrando, disse-lhes: Por que fazeis alvoro\xe7o e chorais? a menina n\xe3o morreu, mas dorme."},{verse:40,en:"And they laughed him to scorn. But when he had put them all out, he taketh the father and the mother of the damsel, and them that were with him, and entereth in where the damsel was lying.",pt:"E riam-se dele; por\xe9m ele, tendo feito sair a todos, tomou consigo o pai e a m\xe3e da menina, e os que com ele vieram, e entrou onde a menina estava."},{verse:41,en:"And he took the damsel by the hand, and said unto her, Talitha cumi; which is, being interpreted, Damsel, I say unto thee, arise.",pt:"E, tomando a m\xe3o da menina, disse-lhe: Talita cumi, que, traduzido, \xe9: Menina, a ti te digo, levanta-te."},{verse:42,en:"And straightway the damsel arose, and walked; for she was of the age of twelve years. And they were astonished with a great astonishment.",pt:"Imediatamente a menina se levantou, e p\xf4s-se a andar, pois tinha doze anos. E logo foram tomados de grande espanto."},{verse:43,en:"And he charged them straitly that no man should know it; and commanded that something should be given her to eat.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ordenou-lhes expressamente que ningu\xe9m o soubesse; e mandou que lhe dessem de comer."}]}}),770,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he went out from thence, and came into his own country; and his disciples follow him.",pt:"Saiu Jesus dali, e foi para a sua terra, e os seus disc\xedpulos o seguiam."},{verse:2,en:"And when the sabbath day was come, he began to teach in the synagogue: and many hearing him were astonished, saying, From whence hath this man these things? and what wisdom is this which is given unto him, that even such mighty works are wrought by his hands?",pt:"Ora, chegando o s\xe1bado, come\xe7ou a ensinar na sinagoga; e muitos, ao ouv\xed-lo, se maravilhavam, dizendo: Donde lhe v\xeam estas coisas? e que sabedoria \xe9 esta que lhe \xe9 dada? e como se fazem tais milagres por suas m\xe3os?"},{verse:3,en:"Is not this the carpenter, the son of Mary, the brother of James, and Joses, and of Juda, and Simon? and are not his sisters here with us? And they were offended at him.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 este o carpinteiro, filho de Maria, irm\xe3o de Tiago, de Jos\xe9, de Judas e de Sim\xe3o? e n\xe3o est\xe3o aqui entre n\xf3s suas irm\xe3s? E escandalizavam-se dele."},{verse:4,en:"But Jesus said unto them, A prophet is not without honour, but in his own country, and among his own kin, and in his own house.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus lhes dizia: Um profeta n\xe3o fica sem honra sen\xe3o na sua terra, entre os seus parentes, e na sua pr\xf3pria casa."},{verse:5,en:"And he could there do no mighty work, save that he laid his hands upon a few sick folk, and healed them.",pt:"E n\xe3o podia fazer ali nenhum milagre, a n\xe3o ser curar alguns poucos enfermos, impondo-lhes as m\xe3os."},{verse:6,en:"And he marvelled because of their unbelief. And he went round about the villages, teaching.",pt:"E admirou-se da incredulidade deles. Em seguida percorria as aldeias circunvizinhas, ensinando."},{verse:7,en:"And he called unto him the twelve, and began to send them forth by two and two; and gave them power over unclean spirits;",pt:"E chamou a si os doze, e come\xe7ou a envi\xe1-los a dois e dois, e dava-lhes poder sobre os esp\xedritos imundos;"},{verse:8,en:"And commanded them that they should take nothing for their journey, save a staff only; no scrip, no bread, no money in their purse:",pt:"ordenou-lhes que nada levassem para o caminho, sen\xe3o apenas um bord\xe3o; nem p\xe3o, nem alforje, nem dinheiro no cinto;"},{verse:9,en:"But be shod with sandals; and not put on two coats.",pt:"mas que fossem cal\xe7ados de sand\xe1lias, e que n\xe3o vestissem duas t\xfanicas."},{verse:10,en:"And he said unto them, In what place soever ye enter into an house, there abide till ye depart from that place.",pt:"Dizia-lhes mais: Onde quer que entrardes numa casa, ficai nela at\xe9 sairdes daquele lugar."},{verse:11,en:"And whosoever shall not receive you, nor hear you, when ye depart thence, shake off the dust under your feet for a testimony against them. Verily I say unto you, It shall be more tolerable for Sodom and Gomorrha in the day of judgment, than for that city.",pt:"E se qualquer lugar n\xe3o vos receber, nem os homens vos ouvirem, saindo dali, sacudi o p\xf3 que estiver debaixo dos vossos p\xe9s, em testemunho contra eles."},{verse:12,en:"And they went out, and preached that men should repent.",pt:"Ent\xe3o sa\xedram e pregaram que todos se arrependessem;"},{verse:13,en:"And they cast out many devils, and anointed with oil many that were sick, and healed them.",pt:"e expulsavam muitos dem\xf4nios, e ungiam muitos enfermos com \xf3leo, e os curavam."},{verse:14,en:"And king Herod heard of him; (for his name was spread abroad:) and he said, That John the Baptist was risen from the dead, and therefore mighty works do shew forth themselves in him.",pt:"E soube disso o rei Herodes (porque o nome de Jesus se tornara c\xe9lebre), e disse: Jo\xe3o, o Batista, ressuscitou dos mortos; e por isso estes poderes milagrosos operam nele."},{verse:15,en:"Others said, That it is Elias. And others said, That it is a prophet, or as one of the prophets.",pt:"Mas outros diziam: \xc9 Elias. E ainda outros diziam: \xc9 profeta como um dos profetas."},{verse:16,en:"But when Herod heard thereof, he said, It is John, whom I beheaded: he is risen from the dead.",pt:"Herodes, por\xe9m, ouvindo isso, dizia: \xc9 Jo\xe3o, aquele a quem eu mandei degolar: ele ressuscitou."},{verse:17,en:"For Herod himself had sent forth and laid hold upon John, and bound him in prison for Herodias\u2019 sake, his brother Philip\u2019s wife: for he had married her.",pt:"Porquanto o pr\xf3prio Herodes mandara prender a Jo\xe3o, e encerr\xe1-lo maniatado no c\xe1rcere, por causa de Herodias, mulher de seu irm\xe3o Filipe; porque ele se havia casado com ela."},{verse:18,en:"For John had said unto Herod, It is not lawful for thee to have thy brother\u2019s wife.",pt:"Pois Jo\xe3o dizia a Herodes: N\xe3o te \xe9 l\xedcito ter a mulher de teu irm\xe3o."},{verse:19,en:"Therefore Herodias had a quarrel against him, and would have killed him; but she could not:",pt:"Por isso Herodias lhe guardava rancor e queria mat\xe1-lo, mas n\xe3o podia;"},{verse:20,en:"For Herod feared John, knowing that he was a just man and an holy, and observed him; and when he heard him, he did many things, and heard him gladly.",pt:"porque Herodes temia a Jo\xe3o, sabendo que era var\xe3o justo e santo, e o guardava em seguran\xe7a; e, ao ouvi-lo, ficava muito perplexo, contudo de boa mente o escutava."},{verse:21,en:"And when a convenient day was come, that Herod on his birthday made a supper to his lords, high captains, and chief estates of Galilee;",pt:"Chegado, por\xe9m, um dia oportuno quando Herodes no seu anivers\xe1rio natal\xedcio ofereceu um banquete aos grandes da sua corte, aos principais da Galil\xe9ia,"},{verse:22,en:"And when the daughter of the said Herodias came in, and danced, and pleased Herod and them that sat with him, the king said unto the damsel, Ask of me whatsoever thou wilt, and I will give it thee.",pt:"entrou a filha da mesma Herodias e, dan\xe7ando, agradou a Herodes e aos convivas. Ent\xe3o o rei disse \xe0 jovem: Pede-me o que quiseres, e eu to darei."},{verse:23,en:"And he sware unto her, Whatsoever thou shalt ask of me, I will give it thee, unto the half of my kingdom.",pt:"E jurou-lhe, dizendo: Tudo o que me pedires te darei, ainda que seja metade do meu reino."},{verse:24,en:"And she went forth, and said unto her mother, What shall I ask? And she said, The head of John the Baptist.",pt:"Tendo ela sa\xeddo, perguntou a sua m\xe3e: Que pedirei? Ela respondeu: A cabe\xe7a de Jo\xe3o, o Batista."},{verse:25,en:"And she came in straightway with haste unto the king, and asked, saying, I will that thou give me by and by in a charger the head of John the Baptist.",pt:"E tornando logo com pressa \xe0 presen\xe7a do rei, pediu, dizendo: Quero que imediatamente me d\xeas num prato a cabe\xe7a de Jo\xe3o, o Batista."},{verse:26,en:"And the king was exceeding sorry; yet for his oath\u2019s sake, and for their sakes which sat with him, he would not reject her.",pt:"Ora, entristeceu-se muito o rei; todavia, por causa dos seus juramentos e por causa dos que estavam \xe0 mesa, n\xe3o lha quis negar."},{verse:27,en:"And immediately the king sent an executioner, and commanded his head to be brought: and he went and beheaded him in the prison,",pt:"O rei, pois, enviou logo um soldado da sua guarda com ordem de trazer a cabe\xe7a de Jo\xe3o. Ent\xe3o ele foi e o degolou no c\xe1rcere,"},{verse:28,en:"And brought his head in a charger, and gave it to the damsel: and the damsel gave it to her mother.",pt:"e trouxe a cabe\xe7a num prato e a deu \xe0 jovem, e a jovem a deu \xe0 sua m\xe3e."},{verse:29,en:"And when his disciples heard of it, they came and took up his corpse, and laid it in a tomb.",pt:"Quando os seus disc\xedpulos ouviram isso, vieram, tomaram o seu corpo e o puseram num sepulcro."},{verse:30,en:"And the apostles gathered themselves together unto Jesus, and told him all things, both what they had done, and what they had taught.",pt:"Reuniram-se os ap\xf3stolos com Jesus e contaram-lhe tudo o que tinham feito e ensinado."},{verse:31,en:"And he said unto them, Come ye yourselves apart into a desert place, and rest a while: for there were many coming and going, and they had no leisure so much as to eat.",pt:"Ao que ele lhes disse: Vinde v\xf3s, \xe0 parte, para um lugar deserto, e descansai um pouco. Porque eram muitos os que vinham e iam, e n\xe3o tinham tempo nem para comer."},{verse:32,en:"And they departed into a desert place by ship privately.",pt:"Retiraram-se, pois, no barco para um lugar deserto, \xe0 parte."},{verse:33,en:"And the people saw them departing, and many knew him, and ran afoot thither out of all cities, and outwent them, and came together unto him.",pt:"Muitos, por\xe9m, os viram partir, e os reconheceram; e para l\xe1 correram a p\xe9 de todas as cidades, e ali chegaram primeiro do que eles."},{verse:34,en:"And Jesus, when he came out, saw much people, and was moved with compassion toward them, because they were as sheep not having a shepherd: and he began to teach them many things.",pt:"E Jesus, ao desembarcar, viu uma grande multid\xe3o e compadeceu-se deles, porque eram como ovelhas que n\xe3o t\xeam pastor; e come\xe7ou a ensinar-lhes muitas coisas."},{verse:35,en:"And when the day was now far spent, his disciples came unto him, and said, This is a desert place, and now the time is far passed:",pt:"Estando a hora j\xe1 muito adiantada, aproximaram-se dele seus disc\xedpulos e disseram: O lugar \xe9 deserto, e a hora j\xe1 est\xe1 muito adiantada;"},{verse:36,en:"Send them away, that they may go into the country round about, and into the villages, and buy themselves bread: for they have nothing to eat.",pt:"despede-os, para que v\xe3o aos s\xedtios e \xe0s aldeias, em redor, e comprem para si o que comer."},{verse:37,en:"He answered and said unto them, Give ye them to eat. And they say unto him, Shall we go and buy two hundred pennyworth of bread, and give them to eat?",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhes respondeu: Dai-lhes v\xf3s de comer. Ent\xe3o eles lhe perguntaram: Havemos de ir comprar duzentos den\xe1rios de p\xe3o e dar-lhes de comer?"},{verse:38,en:"He saith unto them, How many loaves have ye? go and see. And when they knew, they say, Five, and two fishes.",pt:"Ao que ele lhes disse: Quantos p\xe3es tendes? Ide ver. E, tendo-se informado, responderam: Cinco p\xe3es e dois peixes."},{verse:39,en:"And he commanded them to make all sit down by companies upon the green grass.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes ordenou que a todos fizessem reclinar-se, em grupos, sobre a relva verde."},{verse:40,en:"And they sat down in ranks, by hundreds, and by fifties.",pt:"E reclinaram-se em grupos de cem e de cinquenta."},{verse:41,en:"And when he had taken the five loaves and the two fishes, he looked up to heaven, and blessed, and brake the loaves, and gave them to his disciples to set before them; and the two fishes divided he among them all.",pt:"E tomando os cinco p\xe3es e os dois peixes, e erguendo os olhos ao c\xe9u, os aben\xe7oou; partiu os p\xe3es e os entregava a seus disc\xedpulos para lhos servirem; tamb\xe9m repartiu os dois peixes por todos."},{verse:42,en:"And they did all eat, and were filled.",pt:"E todos comeram e se fartaram."},{verse:43,en:"And they took up twelve baskets full of the fragments, and of the fishes.",pt:"Em seguida, recolheram doze cestos cheios dos peda\xe7os de p\xe3o e de peixe."},{verse:44,en:"And they that did eat of the loaves were about five thousand men.",pt:"Ora, os que comeram os p\xe3es eram cinco mil homens."},{verse:45,en:"And straightway he constrained his disciples to get into the ship, and to go to the other side before unto Bethsaida, while he sent away the people.",pt:"Logo em seguida obrigou os seus disc\xedpulos a entrar no barco e passar adiante, para o outro lado, a Betsaida, enquanto ele despedia a multid\xe3o."},{verse:46,en:"And when he had sent them away, he departed into a mountain to pray.",pt:"E, tendo-a despedido, foi ao monte para orar."},{verse:47,en:"And when even was come, the ship was in the midst of the sea, and he alone on the land.",pt:"Chegada a tardinha, estava o barco no meio do mar, e ele sozinho em terra."},{verse:48,en:"And he saw them toiling in rowing; for the wind was contrary unto them: and about the fourth watch of the night he cometh unto them, walking upon the sea, and would have passed by them.",pt:"E, vendo-os fatigados a remar, porque o vento lhes era contr\xe1rio, pela quarta vig\xedlia da noite, foi ter com eles, andando sobre o mar; e queria passar-lhes adiante;"},{verse:49,en:"But when they saw him walking upon the sea, they supposed it had been a spirit, and cried out:",pt:"eles, por\xe9m, ao v\xea-lo andando sobre o mar, pensaram que era um fantasma e gritaram;"},{verse:50,en:"For they all saw him, and were troubled. And immediately he talked with them, and saith unto them, Be of good cheer: it is I; be not afraid.",pt:"porque todos o viram e se assustaram; mas ele imediatamente falou com eles e disse-lhes: Tende \xe2nimo; sou eu; n\xe3o temais."},{verse:51,en:"And he went up unto them into the ship; and the wind ceased: and they were sore amazed in themselves beyond measure, and wondered.",pt:"E subiu para junto deles no barco, e o vento cessou; e ficaram, no seu \xedntimo, grandemente pasmados;"},{verse:52,en:"For they considered not the miracle of the loaves: for their heart was hardened.",pt:"pois n\xe3o tinham compreendido o milagre dos p\xe3es, antes o seu cora\xe7\xe3o estava endurecido."},{verse:53,en:"And when they had passed over, they came into the land of Gennesaret, and drew to the shore.",pt:"E, terminada a travessia, chegaram \xe0 terra em Genezar\xe9, e ali atracaram."},{verse:54,en:"And when they were come out of the ship, straightway they knew him,",pt:"Logo que desembarcaram, o povo reconheceu a Jesus;"},{verse:55,en:"And ran through that whole region round about, and began to carry about in beds those that were sick, where they heard he was.",pt:"e correndo eles por toda aquela regi\xe3o, come\xe7aram a levar nos leitos os que se achavam enfermos, para onde ouviam dizer que ele estava."},{verse:56,en:"And whithersoever he entered, into villages, or cities, or country, they laid the sick in the streets, and besought him that they might touch if it were but the border of his garment: and as many as touched him were made whole.",pt:"Onde quer, pois, que entrava, fosse nas aldeias, nas cidades ou nos campos, apresentavam os enfermos nas pra\xe7as, e rogavam-lhe que os deixasse tocar ao menos a orla do seu manto; e todos os que a tocavam ficavam curados."}]}}),771,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then came together unto him the Pharisees, and certain of the scribes, which came from Jerusalem.",pt:"Foram ter com Jesus os fariseus, e alguns dos escribas vindos de Jerusal\xe9m,"},{verse:2,en:"And when they saw some of his disciples eat bread with defiled, that is to say, with unwashen, hands, they found fault.",pt:"e repararam que alguns dos seus disc\xedpulos comiam p\xe3o com as m\xe3os impuras, isto \xe9, por lavar."},{verse:3,en:"For the Pharisees, and all the Jews, except they wash their hands oft, eat not, holding the tradition of the elders.",pt:"Pois os fariseus, e todos os judeus, guardando a tradi\xe7\xe3o dos anci\xe3os, n\xe3o comem sem lavar as m\xe3os cuidadosamente;"},{verse:4,en:"And when they come from the market, except they wash, they eat not. And many other things there be, which they have received to hold, as the washing of cups, and pots, brasen vessels, and of tables.",pt:"e quando voltam do mercado, se n\xe3o se purificarem, n\xe3o comem. E muitas outras coisas h\xe1 que receberam para observar, como a lavagem de copos, de jarros e de vasos de bronze."},{verse:5,en:"Then the Pharisees and scribes asked him, Why walk not thy disciples according to the tradition of the elders, but eat bread with unwashen hands?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe, pois, os fariseus e os escribas: Por que n\xe3o andam os teus disc\xedpulos conforme a tradi\xe7\xe3o dos anci\xe3os, mas comem o p\xe3o com as m\xe3os por lavar?"},{verse:6,en:"He answered and said unto them, Well hath Esaias prophesied of you hypocrites, as it is written, This people honoureth me with their lips, but their heart is far from me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: Bem profetizou Isa\xedas acerca de v\xf3s, hip\xf3critas, como est\xe1 escrito: Este povo honra-me com os l\xe1bios; o seu cora\xe7\xe3o, por\xe9m, est\xe1 longe de mim;"},{verse:7,en:"Howbeit in vain do they worship me, teaching for doctrines the commandments of men.",pt:"mas em v\xe3o me adoram, ensinando doutrinas que s\xe3o preceitos de homens."},{verse:8,en:"For laying aside the commandment of God, ye hold the tradition of men, as the washing of pots and cups: and many other such like things ye do.",pt:"V\xf3s deixais o mandamento de Deus, e vos apegais \xe0 tradi\xe7\xe3o dos homens."},{verse:9,en:"And he said unto them, Full well ye reject the commandment of God, that ye may keep your own tradition.",pt:"Disse-lhes ainda: Bem sabeis rejeitar o mandamento de deus, para guardardes a vossa tradi\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"For Moses said, Honour thy father and thy mother; and, Whoso curseth father or mother, let him die the death:",pt:"Pois Mois\xe9s disse: Honra a teu pai e a tua m\xe3e; e: Quem maldisser ao pai ou \xe0 m\xe3e, certamente morrer\xe1."},{verse:11,en:"But ye say, If a man shall say to his father or mother, It is Corban, that is to say, a gift, by whatsoever thou mightest be profited by me; he shall be free.",pt:"Mas v\xf3s dizeis: Se um homem disser a seu pai ou a sua m\xe3e: Aquilo que poder\xedas aproveitar de mim \xe9 Corb\xe3, isto \xe9, oferta ao Senhor,"},{verse:12,en:"And ye suffer him no more to do ought for his father or his mother;",pt:"n\xe3o mais lhe permitis fazer coisa alguma por seu pai ou por sua m\xe3e,"},{verse:13,en:"Making the word of God of none effect through your tradition, which ye have delivered: and many such like things do ye.",pt:"invalidando assim a palavra de Deus pela vossa tradi\xe7\xe3o que v\xf3s transmitistes; tamb\xe9m muitas outras coisas semelhantes fazeis."},{verse:14,en:"And when he had called all the people unto him, he said unto them, Hearken unto me every one of you, and understand:",pt:"E chamando a si outra vez a multid\xe3o, disse-lhes: Ouvi-me v\xf3s todos, e entendei."},{verse:15,en:"There is nothing from without a man, that entering into him can defile him: but the things which come out of him, those are they that defile the man.",pt:"Nada h\xe1 fora do homem que, entrando nele, possa contamin\xe1-lo; mas o que sai do homem, isso \xe9 que o contamina."},{verse:16,en:"If any man have ears to hear, let him hear.",pt:"[Se algu\xe9m tem ouvidos para ouvir, ou\xe7a.]"},{verse:17,en:"And when he was entered into the house from the people, his disciples asked him concerning the parable.",pt:"Depois, quando deixou a multid\xe3o e entrou em casa, os seus disc\xedpulos o interrogaram acerca da par\xe1bola."},{verse:18,en:"And he saith unto them, Are ye so without understanding also? Do ye not perceive, that whatsoever thing from without entereth into the man, it cannot defile him;",pt:"Respondeu-lhes ele: Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s estais sem entender? N\xe3o compreendeis que tudo o que de fora entra no homem n\xe3o o pode contaminar,"},{verse:19,en:"Because it entereth not into his heart, but into the belly, and goeth out into the draught, purging all meats?",pt:"porque n\xe3o lhe entra no cora\xe7\xe3o, mas no ventre, e \xe9 lan\xe7ado fora? Assim declarou puros todos os alimentos."},{verse:20,en:"And he said, That which cometh out of the man, that defileth the man.",pt:"E prosseguiu: O que sai do homem , isso \xe9 que o contamina."},{verse:21,en:"For from within, out of the heart of men, proceed evil thoughts, adulteries, fornications, murders,",pt:"Pois \xe9 do interior, do cora\xe7\xe3o dos homens, que procedem os maus pensamentos, as prostitui\xe7\xf5es, os furtos, os homic\xeddios, os adult\xe9rios,"},{verse:22,en:"Thefts, covetousness, wickedness, deceit, lasciviousness, an evil eye, blasphemy, pride, foolishness:",pt:"a cobi\xe7a, as maldades, o dolo, a libertinagem, a inveja, a blasf\xeamia, a soberba, a insensatez;"},{verse:23,en:"All these evil things come from within, and defile the man.",pt:"todas estas m\xe1s coisas procedem de dentro e contaminam o homem."},{verse:24,en:"And from thence he arose, and went into the borders of Tyre and Sidon, and entered into an house, and would have no man know it: but he could not be hid.",pt:"Levantando-se dali, foi para as regi\xf5es de Tiro e Sidom. E entrando numa casa, n\xe3o queria que ningu\xe9m o soubesse, mas n\xe3o pode ocultar-se;"},{verse:25,en:"For a certain woman, whose young daughter had an unclean spirit, heard of him, and came and fell at his feet:",pt:"porque logo, certa mulher, cuja filha estava possessa de um esp\xedrito imundo, ouvindo falar dele, veio e prostrou-se-lhe aos p\xe9s;"},{verse:26,en:"The woman was a Greek, a Syrophenician by nation; and she besought him that he would cast forth the devil out of her daughter.",pt:"(ora, a mulher era grega, de origem siro-fen\xedcia) e rogava-lhe que expulsasse de sua filha o dem\xf4nio."},{verse:27,en:"But Jesus said unto her, Let the children first be filled: for it is not meet to take the children\u2019s bread, and to cast it unto the dogs.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Deixa que primeiro se fartem os filhos; porque n\xe3o \xe9 bom tomar o p\xe3o dos filhos e lan\xe7a-lo aos cachorrinhos."},{verse:28,en:"And she answered and said unto him, Yes, Lord: yet the dogs under the table eat of the children\u2019s crumbs.",pt:"Ela, por\xe9m, replicou, e disse-lhe: Sim, Senhor; mas tamb\xe9m os cachorrinhos debaixo da mesa comem das migalhas dos filhos."},{verse:29,en:"And he said unto her, For this saying go thy way; the devil is gone out of thy daughter.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele lhe disse: Por essa palavra, vai; o dem\xf4nio j\xe1 saiu de tua filha."},{verse:30,en:"And when she was come to her house, she found the devil gone out, and her daughter laid upon the bed.",pt:"E, voltando ela para casa, achou a menina deitada sobre a cama, e que o dem\xf4nio j\xe1 havia sa\xeddo."},{verse:31,en:"And again, departing from the coasts of Tyre and Sidon, he came unto the sea of Galilee, through the midst of the coasts of Decapolis.",pt:"Tendo Jesus partido das regi\xf5es de Tiro, foi por Sidom at\xe9 o mar da Galil\xe9ia, passando pelas regi\xf5es de Dec\xe1polis."},{verse:32,en:"And they bring unto him one that was deaf, and had an impediment in his speech; and they beseech him to put his hand upon him.",pt:"E trouxeram-lhe um surdo, que falava dificilmente; e rogaram-lhe que pusesse a m\xe3o sobre ele."},{verse:33,en:"And he took him aside from the multitude, and put his fingers into his ears, and he spit, and touched his tongue;",pt:"Jesus, pois, tirou-o de entre a multid\xe3o, \xe0 parte, meteu-lhe os dedos nos ouvidos e, cuspindo, tocou-lhe na l\xedngua;"},{verse:34,en:"And looking up to heaven, he sighed, and saith unto him, Ephphatha, that is, Be opened.",pt:"e erguendo os olhos ao c\xe9u, suspirou e disse-lhe: Efat\xe1; isto \xe9 Abre-te."},{verse:35,en:"And straightway his ears were opened, and the string of his tongue was loosed, and he spake plain.",pt:"E abriram-se-lhe os ouvidos, a pris\xe3o da l\xedngua se desfez, e falava perfeitamente."},{verse:36,en:"And he charged them that they should tell no man: but the more he charged them, so much the more a great deal they published it;",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes ordenou Jesus que a ningu\xe9m o dissessem; mas, quando mais lho proibia, tanto mais o divulgavam."},{verse:37,en:"And were beyond measure astonished, saying, He hath done all things well: he maketh both the deaf to hear, and the dumb to speak.",pt:"E se maravilhavam sobremaneira, dizendo: Tudo tem feito bem; faz at\xe9 os surdos ouvir e os mudos falar."}]}}),772,[]);
__d((function(e,s,a,o,n,t,i){n.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"In those days the multitude being very great, and having nothing to eat, Jesus called his disciples unto him, and saith unto them,",pt:"Naqueles dias, havendo de novo uma grande multid\xe3o, e n\xe3o tendo o que comer, chamou Jesus os disc\xedpulos e disse-lhes:"},{verse:2,en:"I have compassion on the multitude, because they have now been with me three days, and have nothing to eat:",pt:"Tenho compaix\xe3o da multid\xe3o, porque j\xe1 faz tr\xeas dias que eles est\xe3o comigo, e n\xe3o t\xeam o que comer."},{verse:3,en:"And if I send them away fasting to their own houses, they will faint by the way: for divers of them came from far.",pt:"Se eu os mandar em jejum para suas casas, desfalecer\xe3o no caminho; e alguns deles vieram de longe."},{verse:4,en:"And his disciples answered him, From whence can a man satisfy these men with bread here in the wilderness?",pt:"E seus disc\xedpulos lhe responderam: Donde poder\xe1 algu\xe9m satisfaz\xea-los de p\xe3o aqui no deserto?"},{verse:5,en:"And he asked them, How many loaves have ye? And they said, Seven.",pt:"Perguntou-lhes Jesus: Quantos p\xe3es tendes? Responderam: Sete."},{verse:6,en:"And he commanded the people to sit down on the ground: and he took the seven loaves, and gave thanks, and brake, and gave to his disciples to set before them; and they did set them before the people.",pt:"Logo mandou ao povo que se sentasse no ch\xe3o; e tomando os sete p\xe3es e havendo dado gra\xe7as, partiu-os e os entregava a seus disc\xedpulos para que os distribu\xedssem; e eles os distribu\xedram pela multid\xe3o."},{verse:7,en:"And they had a few small fishes: and he blessed, and commanded to set them also before them.",pt:"Tinham tamb\xe9m alguns peixinhos, os quais ele aben\xe7oou, e mandou que estes tamb\xe9m fossem distribu\xeddos."},{verse:8,en:"So they did eat, and were filled: and they took up of the broken meat that was left seven baskets.",pt:"Comeram, pois, e se fartaram; e dos peda\xe7os que sobejavam levantaram sete alcofas."},{verse:9,en:"And they that had eaten were about four thousand: and he sent them away.",pt:"Ora, eram cerca de quatro mil homens. E Jesus os despediu."},{verse:10,en:"And straightway he entered into a ship with his disciples, and came into the parts of Dalmanutha.",pt:"E, entrando logo no barco com seus disc\xedpulos, foi para as regi\xf5es de Dalmanuta."},{verse:11,en:"And the Pharisees came forth, and began to question with him, seeking of him a sign from heaven, tempting him.",pt:"Sa\xedram os fariseus e come\xe7aram a discutir com ele, pedindo-lhe um sinal do c\xe9u, para o experimentarem."},{verse:12,en:"And he sighed deeply in his spirit, and saith, Why doth this generation seek after a sign? verily I say unto you, There shall no sign be given unto this generation.",pt:"Ele, suspirando profundamente em seu esp\xedrito, disse: Por que pede esta gera\xe7\xe3o um sinal? Em verdade vos digo que a esta gera\xe7\xe3o n\xe3o ser\xe1 dado sinal algum."},{verse:13,en:"And he left them, and entering into the ship again departed to the other side.",pt:"E, deixando-os, tornou a embarcar e foi para o outro lado."},{verse:14,en:"Now the disciples had forgotten to take bread, neither had they in the ship with them more than one loaf.",pt:"Ora, eles se esqueceram de levar p\xe3o, e no barco n\xe3o tinham consigo sen\xe3o um p\xe3o."},{verse:15,en:"And he charged them, saying, Take heed, beware of the leaven of the Pharisees, and of the leaven of Herod.",pt:"E Jesus ordenou-lhes, dizendo: Olhai, guardai-vos do fermento dos fariseus e do fermento de Herodes."},{verse:16,en:"And they reasoned among themselves, saying, It is because we have no bread.",pt:"Pelo que eles arrazoavam entre si porque n\xe3o tinham p\xe3o."},{verse:17,en:"And when Jesus knew it, he saith unto them, Why reason ye, because ye have no bread? perceive ye not yet, neither understand? have ye your heart yet hardened?",pt:"E Jesus, percebendo isso, disse-lhes: Por que arrazoais por n\xe3o terdes p\xe3o? n\xe3o compreendeis ainda, nem entendeis? tendes o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o endurecido?"},{verse:18,en:"Having eyes, see ye not? and having ears, hear ye not? and do ye not remember?",pt:"Tendo olhos, n\xe3o vedes? e tendo ouvidos, n\xe3o ouvis? e n\xe3o vos lembrais?"},{verse:19,en:"When I brake the five loaves among five thousand, how many baskets full of fragments took ye up? They say unto him, Twelve.",pt:"Quando parti os cinco p\xe3es para os cinco mil, quantos cestos cheios de peda\xe7os levantastes? Responderam-lhe: Doze."},{verse:20,en:"And when the seven among four thousand, how many baskets full of fragments took ye up? And they said, Seven.",pt:"E quando parti os sete para os quatro mil, quantas alcofas cheias de peda\xe7os levantastes? Responderam-lhe: Sete."},{verse:21,en:"And he said unto them, How is it that ye do not understand?",pt:"E ele lhes disse: N\xe3o entendeis ainda?"},{verse:22,en:"And he cometh to Bethsaida; and they bring a blind man unto him, and besought him to touch him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o chegaram a Betsa\xedda. E trouxeram-lhe um cego, e rogaram-lhe que o tocasse."},{verse:23,en:"And he took the blind man by the hand, and led him out of the town; and when he had spit on his eyes, and put his hands upon him, he asked him if he saw ought.",pt:"Jesus, pois, tomou o cego pela m\xe3o, e o levou para fora da aldeia; e cuspindo-lhe nos olhos, e impondo-lhe as m\xe3os, perguntou-lhe: V\xeas alguma coisa?"},{verse:24,en:"And he looked up, and said, I see men as trees, walking.",pt:"E, levantando ele os olhos, disse: Estou vendo os homens; porque como \xe1rvores os vejo andando."},{verse:25,en:"After that he put his hands again upon his eyes, and made him look up: and he was restored, and saw every man clearly.",pt:"Ent\xe3o tornou a p\xf4r-lhe as m\xe3os sobre os olhos; e ele, olhando atentamente, ficou restabelecido, pois j\xe1 via nitidamente todas as coisas."},{verse:26,en:"And he sent him away to his house, saying, Neither go into the town, nor tell it to any in the town.",pt:"Depois o mandou para casa, dizendo: Mas n\xe3o entres na aldeia."},{verse:27,en:"And Jesus went out, and his disciples, into the towns of Caesarea Philippi: and by the way he asked his disciples, saying unto them, Whom do men say that I am?",pt:"E saiu Jesus com os seus disc\xedpulos para as aldeias de Cesar\xe9ia de Filipe, e no caminho interrogou os disc\xedpulos, dizendo: Quem dizem os homens que eu sou?"},{verse:28,en:"And they answered, John the Baptist: but some say, Elias; and others, One of the prophets.",pt:"Responderam-lhe eles: Uns dizem: Jo\xe3o, o Batista; outros: Elias; e ainda outros: Algum dos profetas."},{verse:29,en:"And he saith unto them, But whom say ye that I am? And Peter answereth and saith unto him, Thou art the Christ.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes perguntou: Mas v\xf3s, quem dizeis que eu sou? Respondendo, Pedro lhe disse: Tu \xe9s o Cristo."},{verse:30,en:"And he charged them that they should tell no man of him.",pt:"E ordenou-lhes Jesus que a ningu\xe9m dissessem aquilo a respeito dele."},{verse:31,en:"And he began to teach them, that the Son of man must suffer many things, and be rejected of the elders, and of the chief priests, and scribes, and be killed, and after three days rise again.",pt:"Come\xe7ou ent\xe3o a ensinar-lhes que era necess\xe1rio que o Filho do homem padecesse muitas coisas, que fosse rejeitado pelos anci\xe3os e principais sacerdotes e pelos escribas, que fosse morto, e que depois de tr\xeas dias ressurgisse."},{verse:32,en:"And he spake that saying openly. And Peter took him, and began to rebuke him.",pt:"E isso dizia abertamente. Ao que Pedro, tomando-o \xe0 parte, come\xe7ou a repreend\xea-lo."},{verse:33,en:"But when he had turned about and looked on his disciples, he rebuked Peter, saying, Get thee behind me, Satan: for thou savourest not the things that be of God, but the things that be of men.",pt:"Mas ele, virando-se olhando para seus disc\xedpulos, repreendeu a Pedro, dizendo: Para tr\xe1s de mim, Satan\xe1s; porque n\xe3o cuidas das coisas que s\xe3o de Deus, mas sim das que s\xe3o dos homens."},{verse:34,en:"And when he had called the people unto him with his disciples also, he said unto them, Whosoever will come after me, let him deny himself, and take up his cross, and follow me.",pt:"E chamando a si a multid\xe3o com os disc\xedpulos, disse-lhes: Se algu\xe9m quer vir ap\xf3s mim, negue-se a si mesmo, tome a sua cruz, e siga-me."},{verse:35,en:"For whosoever will save his life shall lose it; but whosoever shall lose his life for my sake and the gospel\u2019s, the same shall save it.",pt:"Pois quem quiser salvar a sua vida, perd\xea-la-\xe1; mas quem perder a sua vida por amor de mim e do evangelho, salv\xe1-la-\xe1."},{verse:36,en:"For what shall it profit a man, if he shall gain the whole world, and lose his own soul?",pt:"Pois que aproveita ao homem ganhar o mundo inteiro e perder a sua vida?"},{verse:37,en:"Or what shall a man give in exchange for his soul?",pt:"Ou que diria o homem em troca da sua vida?"},{verse:38,en:"Whosoever therefore shall be ashamed of me and of my words in this adulterous and sinful generation; of him also shall the Son of man be ashamed, when he cometh in the glory of his Father with the holy angels.",pt:"Porquanto, qualquer que, entre esta gera\xe7\xe3o ad\xfaltera e pecadora, se envergonhar de mim e das minhas palavras, tamb\xe9m dele se envergonhar\xe1 o Filho do homem quando vier na gl\xf3ria de seu Pai com os santos anjos."}]}}),773,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he said unto them, Verily I say unto you, That there be some of them that stand here, which shall not taste of death, till they have seen the kingdom of God come with power.",pt:"Disse-lhes mais: Em verdade vos digo que, dos que aqui est\xe3o, alguns h\xe1 que de modo nenhum provar\xe3o a morte at\xe9 que vejam o reino de Deus j\xe1 chegando com poder."},{verse:2,en:"And after six days Jesus taketh with him Peter, and James, and John, and leadeth them up into an high mountain apart by themselves: and he was transfigured before them.",pt:"Seis dias depois tomou Jesus consigo a Pedro, a Tiago, e a Jo\xe3o, e os levou \xe0 parte s\xf3s, a um alto monte; e foi transfigurado diante deles;"},{verse:3,en:"And his raiment became shining, exceeding white as snow; so as no fuller on earth can white them.",pt:"as suas vestes tornaram-se resplandecentes, extremamente brancas, tais como nenhum lavandeiro sobre a terra as poderia branquear."},{verse:4,en:"And there appeared unto them Elias with Moses: and they were talking with Jesus.",pt:"E apareceu-lhes Elias com Mois\xe9s, e falavam com Jesus."},{verse:5,en:"And Peter answered and said to Jesus, Master, it is good for us to be here: and let us make three tabernacles; one for thee, and one for Moses, and one for Elias.",pt:"Pedro, tomando a palavra, disse a Jesus: Mestre, bom \xe9 estarmos aqui; fa\xe7a-mos, pois, tr\xeas cabanas, uma para ti, outra para Mois\xe9s, e outra para Elias."},{verse:6,en:"For he wist not what to say; for they were sore afraid.",pt:"Pois n\xe3o sabia o que havia de dizer, porque ficaram atemorizados."},{verse:7,en:"And there was a cloud that overshadowed them: and a voice came out of the cloud, saying, This is my beloved Son: hear him.",pt:"Nisto veio uma nuvem que os cobriu, e dela saiu uma voz que dizia: Este \xe9 o meu Filho amado; a ele ouvi."},{verse:8,en:"And suddenly, when they had looked round about, they saw no man any more, save Jesus only with themselves.",pt:"De repente, tendo olhado em redor, n\xe3o viram mais a ningu\xe9m consigo, sen\xe3o s\xf3 a Jesus."},{verse:9,en:"And as they came down from the mountain, he charged them that they should tell no man what things they had seen, till the Son of man were risen from the dead.",pt:"Enquanto desciam do monte, ordenou-lhes que a ningu\xe9m contassem o que tinham visto, at\xe9 que o Filho do homem ressurgisse dentre os mortos."},{verse:10,en:"And they kept that saying with themselves, questioning one with another what the rising from the dead should mean.",pt:"E eles guardaram o caso em segredo, indagando entre si o que seria o ressurgir dentre os mortos."},{verse:11,en:"And they asked him, saying, Why say the scribes that Elias must first come?",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhe perguntaram: Por que dizem os escribas que \xe9 necess\xe1rio que Elias venha primeiro?"},{verse:12,en:"And he answered and told them, Elias verily cometh first, and restoreth all things; and how it is written of the Son of man, that he must suffer many things, and be set at nought.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Na verdade Elias havia de vir primeiro, a restaurar todas as coisas; e como \xe9 que est\xe1 escrito acerca do Filho do homem que ele deva padecer muito a ser aviltado?"},{verse:13,en:"But I say unto you, That Elias is indeed come, and they have done unto him whatsoever they listed, as it is written of him.",pt:"Digo-vos, por\xe9m, que Elias j\xe1 veio, e fizeram-lhe tudo quanto quiseram, como dele est\xe1 escrito."},{verse:14,en:"And when he came to his disciples, he saw a great multitude about them, and the scribes questioning with them.",pt:"Quando chegaram aonde estavam os disc\xedpulos, viram ao redor deles uma grande multid\xe3o, e alguns escribas a discutirem com eles."},{verse:15,en:"And straightway all the people, when they beheld him, were greatly amazed, and running to him saluted him.",pt:"E logo toda a multid\xe3o, vendo a Jesus, ficou grandemente surpreendida; e correndo todos para ele, o saudavam."},{verse:16,en:"And he asked the scribes, What question ye with them?",pt:"Perguntou ele aos escribas: Que \xe9 que discutis com eles?"},{verse:17,en:"And one of the multitude answered and said, Master, I have brought unto thee my son, which hath a dumb spirit;",pt:"Respondeu-lhe um dentre a multid\xe3o: Mestre, eu te trouxe meu filho, que tem um esp\xedrito mudo;"},{verse:18,en:"And wheresoever he taketh him, he teareth him: and he foameth, and gnasheth with his teeth, and pineth away: and I spake to thy disciples that they should cast him out; and they could not.",pt:"e este, onde quer que o apanha, convulsiona-o, de modo que ele espuma, range os dentes, e vai definhando; e eu pedi aos teus disc\xedpulos que o expulsassem, e n\xe3o puderam."},{verse:19,en:"He answereth him, and saith, O faithless generation, how long shall I be with you? how long shall I suffer you? bring him unto me.",pt:"Ao que Jesus lhes respondeu: \xd3 gera\xe7\xe3o incr\xe9dula! at\xe9 quando estarei convosco? at\xe9 quando vos hei de suportar? Trazei-mo."},{verse:20,en:"And they brought him unto him: and when he saw him, straightway the spirit tare him; and he fell on the ground, and wallowed foaming.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lho trouxeram; e quando ele viu a Jesus, o esp\xedrito imediatamente o convulsionou; e o endemoninhado, caindo por terra, revolvia-se espumando."},{verse:21,en:"And he asked his father, How long is it ago since this came unto him? And he said, Of a child.",pt:"E perguntou Jesus ao pai dele: H\xe1 quanto tempo sucede-lhe isto? Respondeu ele: Desde a inf\xe2ncia;"},{verse:22,en:"And ofttimes it hath cast him into the fire, and into the waters, to destroy him: but if thou canst do any thing, have compassion on us, and help us.",pt:"e muitas vezes o tem lan\xe7ado no fogo, e na \xe1gua, para o destruir; mas se podes fazer alguma coisa, tem compaix\xe3o de n\xf3s e ajuda-nos."},{verse:23,en:"Jesus said unto him, If thou canst believe, all things are possible to him that believeth.",pt:"Ao que lhe disse Jesus: Se podes! - tudo \xe9 poss\xedvel ao que cr\xea."},{verse:24,en:"And straightway the father of the child cried out, and said with tears, Lord, I believe; help thou mine unbelief.",pt:"Imediatamente o pai do menino, clamando, [com l\xe1grimas] disse: Creio! Ajuda a minha incredulidade."},{verse:25,en:"When Jesus saw that the people came running together, he rebuked the foul spirit, saying unto him, Thou dumb and deaf spirit, I charge thee, come out of him, and enter no more into him.",pt:"E Jesus, vendo que a multid\xe3o, correndo, se aglomerava, repreendeu o esp\xedrito imundo, dizendo: Esp\xedrito mudo e surdo, eu te ordeno: Sai dele, e nunca mais entres nele."},{verse:26,en:"And the spirit cried, and rent him sore, and came out of him: and he was as one dead; insomuch that many said, He is dead.",pt:"E ele, gritando, e agitando-o muito, saiu; e ficou o menino como morto, de modo que a maior parte dizia: Morreu."},{verse:27,en:"But Jesus took him by the hand, and lifted him up; and he arose.",pt:"Mas Jesus, tomando-o pela m\xe3o, o ergueu; e ele ficou em p\xe9."},{verse:28,en:"And when he was come into the house, his disciples asked him privately, Why could not we cast him out?",pt:"E quando entrou em casa, seus disc\xedpulos lhe perguntaram \xe0 parte: Por que n\xe3o pudemos n\xf3s expuls\xe1-lo?"},{verse:29,en:"And he said unto them, This kind can come forth by nothing, but by prayer and fasting.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: Esta casta n\xe3o sai de modo algum, salvo \xe0 for\xe7a de ora\xe7\xe3o [e jejum.]"},{verse:30,en:"And they departed thence, and passed through Galilee; and he would not that any man should know it.",pt:"Depois, tendo partido dali, passavam pela Galil\xe9ia, e ele n\xe3o queria que ningu\xe9m o soubesse;"},{verse:31,en:"For he taught his disciples, and said unto them, The Son of man is delivered into the hands of men, and they shall kill him; and after that he is killed, he shall rise the third day.",pt:"porque ensinava a seus disc\xedpulos, e lhes dizia: O Filho do homem ser\xe1 entregue nas m\xe3os dos homens, que o matar\xe3o; e morto ele, depois de tr\xeas dias ressurgir\xe1."},{verse:32,en:"But they understood not that saying, and were afraid to ask him.",pt:"Mas eles n\xe3o entendiam esta palavra, e temiam interrog\xe1-lo."},{verse:33,en:"And he came to Capernaum: and being in the house he asked them, What was it that ye disputed among yourselves by the way?",pt:"Chegaram a Cafarnaum. E estando ele em casa, perguntou-lhes: Que est\xe1veis discutindo pelo caminho?"},{verse:34,en:"But they held their peace: for by the way they had disputed among themselves, who should be the greatest.",pt:"Mas eles se calaram, porque pelo caminho haviam discutido entre si qual deles era o maior."},{verse:35,en:"And he sat down, and called the twelve, and saith unto them, If any man desire to be first, the same shall be last of all, and servant of all.",pt:"E ele, sentando-se, chamou os doze e lhes disse: se algu\xe9m quiser ser o primeiro, ser\xe1 o derradeiro de todos e o servo de todos."},{verse:36,en:"And he took a child, and set him in the midst of them: and when he had taken him in his arms, he said unto them,",pt:"Ent\xe3o tomou uma crian\xe7a, p\xf4-la no meio deles e, abra\xe7ando-a, disse-lhes:"},{verse:37,en:"Whosoever shall receive one of such children in my name, receiveth me: and whosoever shall receive me, receiveth not me, but him that sent me.",pt:"Qualquer que em meu nome receber uma destas crian\xe7as, a mim me recebe; e qualquer que me recebe a mim, recebe n\xe3o a mim mas \xe0quele que me enviou."},{verse:38,en:"And John answered him, saying, Master, we saw one casting out devils in thy name, and he followeth not us: and we forbad him, because he followeth not us.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jo\xe3o: Mestre, vimos um homem que em teu nome expulsava dem\xf4nios, e n\xf3s lho proibimos, porque n\xe3o nos seguia."},{verse:39,en:"But Jesus said, Forbid him not: for there is no man which shall do a miracle in my name, that can lightly speak evil of me.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, respondeu: N\xe3o lho proibais; porque ningu\xe9m h\xe1 que fa\xe7a milagre em meu nome e possa logo depois falar mal de mim;"},{verse:40,en:"For he that is not against us is on our part.",pt:"pois quem n\xe3o \xe9 contra n\xf3s, \xe9 por n\xf3s."},{verse:41,en:"For whosoever shall give you a cup of water to drink in my name, because ye belong to Christ, verily I say unto you, he shall not lose his reward.",pt:"Porquanto qualquer que vos der a beber um copo de \xe1gua em meu nome, porque sois de Cristo, em verdade vos digo que de modo algum perder\xe1 a sua recompensa."},{verse:42,en:"And whosoever shall offend one of these little ones that believe in me, it is better for him that a millstone were hanged about his neck, and he were cast into the sea.",pt:"Mas qualquer que fizer trope\xe7ar um destes pequeninos que cr\xeaem em mim, melhor lhe fora que se lhe pendurasse ao pesco\xe7o uma pedra de moinho, e que fosse lan\xe7ado no mar."},{verse:43,en:"And if thy hand offend thee, cut it off: it is better for thee to enter into life maimed, than having two hands to go into hell, into the fire that never shall be quenched:",pt:"E se a tua m\xe3o te fizer trope\xe7ar, corta-a; melhor \xe9 entrares na vida aleijado, do que, tendo duas m\xe3os, ires para o inferno, para o fogo que nunca se apaga."},{verse:44,en:"Where their worm dieth not, and the fire is not quenched.",pt:"[onde o seu verme n\xe3o morre, e o fogo n\xe3o se apaga.]"},{verse:45,en:"And if thy foot offend thee, cut it off: it is better for thee to enter halt into life, than having two feet to be cast into hell, into the fire that never shall be quenched:",pt:"Ou, se o teu p\xe9 te fizer trope\xe7ar, corta-o; melhor \xe9 entrares coxo na vida, do que, tendo dois p\xe9s, seres lan\xe7ado no inferno."},{verse:46,en:"Where their worm dieth not, and the fire is not quenched.",pt:"[onde o seu verme n\xe3o morre, e o fogo n\xe3o se apaga.]"},{verse:47,en:"And if thine eye offend thee, pluck it out: it is better for thee to enter into the kingdom of God with one eye, than having two eyes to be cast into hell fire:",pt:"Ou, se o teu olho te fizer trope\xe7ar, lan\xe7a-o fora; melhor \xe9 entrares no reino de Deus com um s\xf3 olho, do que, tendo dois olhos, seres lan\xe7ado no inferno."},{verse:48,en:"Where their worm dieth not, and the fire is not quenched.",pt:"onde o seu verme n\xe3o morre, e o fogo n\xe3o se apaga."},{verse:49,en:"For every one shall be salted with fire, and every sacrifice shall be salted with salt.",pt:"Porque cada um ser\xe1 salgado com fogo."},{verse:50,en:"Salt is good: but if the salt have lost his saltness, wherewith will ye season it? Have salt in yourselves, and have peace one with another.",pt:"Bom \xe9 o sal; mas, se o sal se tornar ins\xedpido, com que o haveis de temperar? Tende sal em v\xf3s mesmos, e guardai a paz uns com os outros."}]}}),774,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he arose from thence, and cometh into the coasts of Judaea by the farther side of Jordan: and the people resort unto him again; and, as he was wont, he taught them again.",pt:"Levantando-se Jesus, partiu dali para os termos da Jud\xe9ia, e para al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o; e do novo as multid\xf5es se reuniram em torno dele; e tornou a ensin\xe1-las, como tinha por costume."},{verse:2,en:"And the Pharisees came to him, and asked him, Is it lawful for a man to put away his wife? tempting him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o se aproximaram dele alguns fariseus e, para o experimentarem, lhe perguntaram: \xc9 l\xedcito ao homem repudiar sua mulher?"},{verse:3,en:"And he answered and said unto them, What did Moses command you?",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, respondeu-lhes: Que vos ordenou Mois\xe9s?"},{verse:4,en:"And they said, Moses suffered to write a bill of divorcement, and to put her away.",pt:"Replicaram eles: Mois\xe9s permitiu escrever carta de div\xf3rcio, e repudiar a mulher."},{verse:5,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto them, For the hardness of your heart he wrote you this precept.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Pela dureza dos vossos cora\xe7\xf5es ele vos deixou escrito esse mandamento."},{verse:6,en:"But from the beginning of the creation God made them male and female.",pt:"Mas desde o princ\xedpio da cria\xe7\xe3o, Deus os fez homem e mulher."},{verse:7,en:"For this cause shall a man leave his father and mother, and cleave to his wife;",pt:"Por isso deixar\xe1 o homem a seu pai e a sua m\xe3e, [e unir-se-\xe1 \xe0 sua mulher,]"},{verse:8,en:"And they twain shall be one flesh: so then they are no more twain, but one flesh.",pt:"e ser\xe3o os dois uma s\xf3 carne; assim j\xe1 n\xe3o s\xe3o mais dois, mas uma s\xf3 carne."},{verse:9,en:"What therefore God hath joined together, let not man put asunder.",pt:"Porquanto o que Deus ajuntou, n\xe3o o separe o homem."},{verse:10,en:"And in the house his disciples asked him again of the same matter.",pt:"Em casa os disc\xedpulos interrogaram-no de novo sobre isso."},{verse:11,en:"And he saith unto them, Whosoever shall put away his wife, and marry another, committeth adultery against her.",pt:"Ao que lhes respondeu: Qualquer que repudiar sua mulher e casar com outra comete adult\xe9rio contra ela;"},{verse:12,en:"And if a woman shall put away her husband, and be married to another, she committeth adultery.",pt:"e se ela repudiar seu marido e casar com outro, comete adult\xe9rio."},{verse:13,en:"And they brought young children to him, that he should touch them: and his disciples rebuked those that brought them.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhe traziam algumas crian\xe7as para que as tocasse; mas os disc\xedpulos o repreenderam."},{verse:14,en:"But when Jesus saw it, he was much displeased, and said unto them, Suffer the little children to come unto me, and forbid them not: for of such is the kingdom of God.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, vendo isto, indignou-se e disse-lhes: Deixai vir a mim as crian\xe7as, e n\xe3o as impe\xe7ais, porque de tais \xe9 o reino de Deus."},{verse:15,en:"Verily I say unto you, Whosoever shall not receive the kingdom of God as a little child, he shall not enter therein.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que qualquer que n\xe3o receber o reino de Deus como crian\xe7a, de maneira nenhuma entrar\xe1 nele."},{verse:16,en:"And he took them up in his arms, put his hands upon them, and blessed them.",pt:"E, tomando-as nos seus bra\xe7os, as aben\xe7oou, pondo as m\xe3os sobre elas."},{verse:17,en:"And when he was gone forth into the way, there came one running, and kneeled to him, and asked him, Good Master, what shall I do that I may inherit eternal life?",pt:"Ora, ao sair para se p\xf4r a caminho, correu para ele um homem, o qual se ajoelhou diante dele e lhe perguntou: Bom Mestre, que hei de fazer para herdar a vida eterna?"},{verse:18,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Why callest thou me good? there is none good but one, that is, God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Por que me chamas bom? ningu\xe9m \xe9 bom, sen\xe3o um que \xe9 Deus."},{verse:19,en:"Thou knowest the commandments, Do not commit adultery, Do not kill, Do not steal, Do not bear false witness, Defraud not, Honour thy father and mother.",pt:"Sabes os mandamentos: N\xe3o matar\xe1s; n\xe3o adulterar\xe1s; n\xe3o furtar\xe1s; n\xe3o dir\xe1s falso testemunho; a ningu\xe9m defraudar\xe1s; honra a teu pai e a tua m\xe3e."},{verse:20,en:"And he answered and said unto him, Master, all these have I observed from my youth.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhe replicou: Mestre, tudo isso tenho guardado desde a minha juventude."},{verse:21,en:"Then Jesus beholding him loved him, and said unto him, One thing thou lackest: go thy way, sell whatsoever thou hast, and give to the poor, and thou shalt have treasure in heaven: and come, take up the cross, and follow me.",pt:"E Jesus, olhando para ele, o amou e lhe disse: Uma coisa te falta; vai vende tudo quanto tens e d\xe1-o aos pobres, e ter\xe1s um tesouro no c\xe9u; e vem, segue-me."},{verse:22,en:"And he was sad at that saying, and went away grieved: for he had great possessions.",pt:"Mas ele, pesaroso desta palavra, retirou-se triste, porque possu\xeda muitos bens."},{verse:23,en:"And Jesus looked round about, and saith unto his disciples, How hardly shall they that have riches enter into the kingdom of God!",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus, olhando em redor, disse aos seus disc\xedpulos: Qu\xe3o dificilmente entrar\xe3o no reino de Deus os que t\xeam riquezas!"},{verse:24,en:"And the disciples were astonished at his words. But Jesus answereth again, and saith unto them, Children, how hard is it for them that trust in riches to enter into the kingdom of God!",pt:"E os disc\xedpulos se maravilharam destas suas palavras; mas Jesus, tornando a falar, disse-lhes: Filhos, qu\xe3o dif\xedcil \xe9 [para os que confiam nas riquezas] entrar no reino de Deus!"},{verse:25,en:"It is easier for a camel to go through the eye of a needle, than for a rich man to enter into the kingdom of God.",pt:"\xc9 mais f\xe1cil um camelo passar pelo fundo de uma agulha, do que entrar um rico no reino de Deus."},{verse:26,en:"And they were astonished out of measure, saying among themselves, Who then can be saved?",pt:"Com isso eles ficaram sobremaneira maravilhados, dizendo entre si: Quem pode, ent\xe3o, ser salvo?"},{verse:27,en:"And Jesus looking upon them saith, With men it is impossible, but not with God: for with God all things are possible.",pt:"Jesus, fixando os olhos neles, respondeu: Para os homens \xe9 imposs\xedvel, mas n\xe3o para Deus; porque para Deus tudo \xe9 poss\xedvel."},{verse:28,en:"Then Peter began to say unto him, Lo, we have left all, and have followed thee.",pt:"Pedro come\xe7ou a dizer-lhe: Eis que n\xf3s deixamos tudo e te seguimos."},{verse:29,en:"And Jesus answered and said, Verily I say unto you, There is no man that hath left house, or brethren, or sisters, or father, or mother, or wife, or children, or lands, for my sake, and the gospel\u2019s,",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Em verdade vos digo que ningu\xe9m h\xe1, que tenha deixado casa, ou irm\xe3os, ou irm\xe3s, ou m\xe3e, ou pai, ou filhos, ou campos, por amor de mim e do evangelho,"},{verse:30,en:"But he shall receive an hundredfold now in this time, houses, and brethren, and sisters, and mothers, and children, and lands, with persecutions; and in the world to come eternal life.",pt:"que n\xe3o receba cem vezes tanto, j\xe1 neste tempo, em casas, e irm\xe3os, e irm\xe3s, e m\xe3es, e filhos, e campos, com persegui\xe7\xf5es; e no mundo vindouro a vida eterna."},{verse:31,en:"But many that are first shall be last; and the last first.",pt:"Mas muitos que s\xe3o primeiros ser\xe3o \xfaltimos; e muitos que s\xe3o \xfaltimos ser\xe3o primeiros."},{verse:32,en:"And they were in the way going up to Jerusalem; and Jesus went before them: and they were amazed; and as they followed, they were afraid. And he took again the twelve, and began to tell them what things should happen unto him,",pt:"Ora, estavam a caminho, subindo para Jerusal\xe9m; e Jesus ia adiante deles, e eles se maravilhavam e o seguiam atemorizados. De novo tomou consigo os doze e come\xe7ou a contar-lhes as coisas que lhe haviam de sobrevir,"},{verse:33,en:"Saying,Behold, we go up to Jerusalem; and the Son of man shall be delivered unto the chief priests, and unto the scribes; and they shall condemn him to death, and shall deliver him to the Gentiles:",pt:"dizendo: Eis que subimos a Jerusal\xe9m, e o Filho do homem ser\xe1 entregue aos principais sacerdotes e aos escribas; e eles o condenar\xe3o \xe0 morte, e o entregar\xe3o aos gentios;"},{verse:34,en:"And they shall mock him, and shall scourge him, and shall spit upon him, and shall kill him: and the third day he shall rise again.",pt:"e h\xe3o de escarnec\xea-lo e cuspir nele, e a\xe7oit\xe1-lo, e mat\xe1-lo; e depois de tr\xeas dias ressurgir\xe1."},{verse:35,en:"And James and John, the sons of Zebedee, come unto him, saying, Master, we would that thou shouldest do for us whatsoever we shall desire.",pt:"Nisso aproximaram-se dele Tiago e Jo\xe3o, filhos de Zebedeu, dizendo-lhe: Mestre, queremos que nos fa\xe7as o que te pedirmos."},{verse:36,en:"And he said unto them, What would ye that I should do for you?",pt:"Ele, pois, lhes perguntou: Que quereis que eu vos fa\xe7a?"},{verse:37,en:"They said unto him, Grant unto us that we may sit, one on thy right hand, and the other on thy left hand, in thy glory.",pt:"Responderam-lhe: Concede-nos que na tua gl\xf3ria nos sentemos, um \xe0 tua direita, e outro \xe0 tua esquerda."},{verse:38,en:"But Jesus said unto them, Ye know not what ye ask: can ye drink of the cup that I drink of? and be baptized with the baptism that I am baptized with?",pt:"Mas Jesus lhes disse: N\xe3o sabeis o que pedis; podeis beber o c\xe1lice que eu bebo, e ser batizados no batismo em que eu sou batizado?"},{verse:39,en:"And they said unto him, We can. And Jesus said unto them, Ye shall indeed drink of the cup that I drink of; and with the baptism that I am baptized withal shall ye be baptized:",pt:"E lhe responderam: Podemos. Mas Jesus lhes disse: O c\xe1lice que eu bebo, haveis de beb\xea-lo, e no batismo em que eu sou batizado, haveis de ser batizados;"},{verse:40,en:"But to sit on my right hand and on my left hand is not mine to give; but it shall be given to them for whom it is prepared.",pt:"mas o sentar-se \xe0 minha direita, ou \xe0 minha esquerda, n\xe3o me pertence conced\xea-lo; mas isso \xe9 para aqueles a quem est\xe1 reservado."},{verse:41,en:"And when the ten heard it, they began to be much displeased with James and John.",pt:"E ouvindo isso os dez, come\xe7aram a indignar-se contra Tiago e Jo\xe3o."},{verse:42,en:"But Jesus called them to him, and saith unto them, Ye know that they which are accounted to rule over the Gentiles exercise lordship over them; and their great ones exercise authority upon them.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus chamou-os para junto de si e lhes disse: Sabeis que os que s\xe3o reconhecidos como governadores dos gentios, deles se assenhoreiam, e que sobre eles os seus grandes exercem autoridade."},{verse:43,en:"But so shall it not be among you: but whosoever will be great among you, shall be your minister:",pt:"Mas entre v\xf3s n\xe3o ser\xe1 assim; antes, qualquer que entre v\xf3s quiser tornar-se grande, ser\xe1 esse o que vos sirva;"},{verse:44,en:"And whosoever of you will be the chiefest, shall be servant of all.",pt:"e qualquer que entre v\xf3s quiser ser o primeiro, ser\xe1 servo de todos."},{verse:45,en:"For even the Son of man came not to be ministered unto, but to minister, and to give his life a ransom for many.",pt:"Pois tamb\xe9m o Filho do homem n\xe3o veio para ser servido, mas para servir, e para dar a sua vida em resgate de muitos."},{verse:46,en:"And they came to Jericho: and as he went out of Jericho with his disciples and a great number of people, blind Bartimaeus, the son of Timaeus, sat by the highway side begging.",pt:"Depois chegaram a Jeric\xf3. E, ao sair ele de Jeric\xf3 com seus disc\xedpulos e uma grande multid\xe3o, estava sentado junto do caminho um mendigo cego, Bartimeu filho de Timeu."},{verse:47,en:"And when he heard that it was Jesus of Nazareth, he began to cry out, and say, Jesus, thou Son of David, have mercy on me.",pt:"Este, quando ouviu que era Jesus, o nazareno, come\xe7ou a clamar, dizendo: Jesus, Filho de Davi, tem compaix\xe3o de mim!"},{verse:48,en:"And many charged him that he should hold his peace: but he cried the more a great deal, Thou Son of David, have mercy on me.",pt:"E muitos o repreendiam, para que se calasse; mas ele clamava ainda mais: Filho de Davi, tem compaix\xe3o de mim."},{verse:49,en:"And Jesus stood still, and commanded him to be called. And they call the blind man, saying unto him, Be of good comfort, rise; he calleth thee.",pt:"Parou, pois, Jesus e disse: Chamai-o. E chamaram o cego, dizendo-lhe: Tem bom \xe2nimo; levanta-te, ele te chama."},{verse:50,en:"And he, casting away his garment, rose, and came to Jesus.",pt:"Nisto, lan\xe7ando de si a sua capa, de um salto se levantou e foi ter com Jesus."},{verse:51,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto him, What wilt thou that I should do unto thee? The blind man said unto him, Lord, that I might receive my sight.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe o cego: Que queres que te fa\xe7a? Respondeu-lhe o cego: Mestre, que eu veja."},{verse:52,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Go thy way; thy faith hath made thee whole. And immediately he received his sight, and followed Jesus in the way.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Vai, a tua f\xe9 te salvou. E imediatamente recuperou a vista, e foi seguindo pelo caminho."}]}}),775,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And when they came nigh to Jerusalem, unto Bethphage and Bethany, at the mount of Olives, he sendeth forth two of his disciples,",pt:"Ora, quando se aproximavam de Jerusal\xe9m, de Betfag\xe9 e de Bet\xe2nia, junto do Monte das Oliveiras, enviou Jesus dois dos seus disc\xedpulos"},{verse:2,en:"And saith unto them, Go your way into the village over against you: and as soon as ye be entered into it, ye shall find a colt tied, whereon never man sat; loose him, and bring him.",pt:"e disse-lhes: Ide \xe0 aldeia que est\xe1 defronte de v\xf3s; e logo que nela entrardes, encontrareis preso um jumentinho, em que ainda ningu\xe9m montou; desprendei-o e trazei-o."},{verse:3,en:"And if any man say unto you, Why do ye this? say ye that the Lord hath need of him; and straightway he will send him hither.",pt:"E se algu\xe9m vos perguntar: Por que fazeis isso? respondei: O Senhor precisa dele, e logo tornar\xe1 a envi\xe1-lo para aqui."},{verse:4,en:"And they went their way, and found the colt tied by the door without in a place where two ways met; and they loose him.",pt:"Foram, pois, e acharam o jumentinho preso ao port\xe3o do lado de fora na rua, e o desprenderam."},{verse:5,en:"And certain of them that stood there said unto them, What do ye, loosing the colt?",pt:"E alguns dos que ali estavam lhes perguntaram: Que fazeis, desprendendo o jumentinho?"},{verse:6,en:"And they said unto them even as Jesus had commanded: and they let them go.",pt:"Responderam como Jesus lhes tinha mandado; e lho deixaram levar."},{verse:7,en:"And they brought the colt to Jesus, and cast their garments on him; and he sat upon him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o trouxeram a Jesus o jumentinho e lan\xe7aram sobre ele os seus mantos; e Jesus montou nele."},{verse:8,en:"And many spread their garments in the way: and others cut down branches off the trees, and strawed them in the way.",pt:"Muitos tamb\xe9m estenderam pelo caminho os seus mantos, e outros, ramagens que tinham cortado nos campos."},{verse:9,en:"And they that went before, and they that followed, cried, saying, Hosanna; Blessed is he that cometh in the name of the Lord:",pt:"E tanto os que o precediam como os que o seguiam, clamavam: Hosana! bendito o que vem em nome do Senhor!"},{verse:10,en:"Blessed be the kingdom of our father David, that cometh in the name of the Lord: Hosanna in the highest.",pt:"Bendito o reino que vem, o reino de nosso pai Davi! Hosana nas alturas!"},{verse:11,en:"And Jesus entered into Jerusalem, and into the temple: and when he had looked round about upon all things, and now the eventide was come, he went out unto Bethany with the twelve.",pt:"Tendo Jesus entrado em Jerusal\xe9m, foi ao templo; e tendo observado tudo em redor, como j\xe1 fosse tarde, saiu para Bet\xe2nia com os doze."},{verse:12,en:"And on the morrow, when they were come from Bethany, he was hungry:",pt:"No dia seguinte, depois de sa\xedrem de Bet\xe2nia teve fome,"},{verse:13,en:"And seeing a fig tree afar off having leaves, he came, if haply he might find any thing thereon: and when he came to it, he found nothing but leaves; for the time of figs was not yet.",pt:"e avistando de longe uma figueira que tinha folhas, foi ver se, porventura, acharia nela alguma coisa; e chegando a ela, nada achou sen\xe3o folhas, porque n\xe3o era tempo de figos."},{verse:14,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto it, No man eat fruit of thee hereafter for ever. And his disciples heard it.",pt:"E Jesus, falando, disse \xe0 figueira: Nunca mais coma algu\xe9m fruto de ti. E seus disc\xedpulos ouviram isso."},{verse:15,en:"And they come to Jerusalem: and Jesus went into the temple, and began to cast out them that sold and bought in the temple, and overthrew the tables of the moneychangers, and the seats of them that sold doves;",pt:"Chegaram, pois, a Jerusal\xe9m. E entrando ele no templo, come\xe7ou a expulsar os que ali vendiam e compravam; e derribou as mesas dos cambistas, e as cadeiras dos que vendiam pombas;"},{verse:16,en:"And would not suffer that any man should carry any vessel through the temple.",pt:"e n\xe3o consentia que ningu\xe9m atravessasse o templo levando qualquer utens\xedlio;"},{verse:17,en:"And he taught, saying unto them, Is it not written, My house shall be called of all nations the house of prayer? but ye have made it a den of thieves.",pt:"e ensinava, dizendo-lhes: N\xe3o est\xe1 escrito: A minha casa ser\xe1 chamada casa de ora\xe7\xe3o para todas as na\xe7\xf5es? V\xf3s, por\xe9m, a tendes feito covil de salteadores."},{verse:18,en:"And the scribes and chief priests heard it, and sought how they might destroy him: for they feared him, because all the people was astonished at his doctrine.",pt:"Ora, os principais sacerdotes e os escribas ouviram isto, e procuravam um modo de o matar; pois o temiam, porque toda a multid\xe3o se maravilhava da sua doutrina."},{verse:19,en:"And when even was come, he went out of the city.",pt:"Ao cair da tarde, sa\xedam da cidade."},{verse:20,en:"And in the morning, as they passed by, they saw the fig tree dried up from the roots.",pt:"Quando passavam na manh\xe3 seguinte, viram que a figueira tinha secado desde as ra\xedzes."},{verse:21,en:"And Peter calling to remembrance saith unto him, Master, behold, the fig tree which thou cursedst is withered away.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pedro, lembrando-se, disse-lhe: Olha, Mestre, secou-se a figueira que amaldi\xe7oaste."},{verse:22,en:"And Jesus answering saith unto them, Have faith in God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Tende f\xe9 em Deus."},{verse:23,en:"For verily I say unto you, That whosoever shall say unto this mountain, Be thou removed, and be thou cast into the sea; and shall not doubt in his heart, but shall believe that those things which he saith shall come to pass; he shall have whatsoever he saith.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que qualquer que disser a este monte: Ergue-te e lan\xe7a-te no mar; e n\xe3o duvidar em seu cora\xe7\xe3o, mas crer que se far\xe1 aquilo que diz, assim lhe ser\xe1 feito."},{verse:24,en:"Therefore I say unto you, What things soever ye desire, when ye pray, believe that ye receive them, and ye shall havethem.",pt:"Por isso vos digo que tudo o que pedirdes em ora\xe7\xe3o, crede que o recebereis, e t\xea-lo-eis."},{verse:25,en:"And when ye stand praying, forgive, if ye have ought against any: that your Father also which is in heaven may forgive you your trespasses.",pt:"Quando estiverdes orando, perdoai, se tendes alguma coisa contra algu\xe9m, para que tamb\xe9m vosso Pai que est\xe1 no c\xe9u, vos perdoe as vossas ofensas."},{verse:26,en:"But if ye do not forgive, neither will your Father which is in heaven forgive your trespasses.",pt:"[Mas, se v\xf3s n\xe3o perdoardes, tamb\xe9m vosso Pai, que est\xe1 no c\xe9u, n\xe3o vos perdoar\xe1 as vossas ofensas.]"},{verse:27,en:"And they come again to Jerusalem: and as he was walking in the temple, there come to him the chief priests, and the scribes, and the elders,",pt:"Vieram de novo a Jerusal\xe9m. E andando Jesus pelo templo, aproximaram-se dele os principais sacerdotes, os escribas e os anci\xe3os,"},{verse:28,en:"And say unto him, By what authority doest thou these things? and who gave thee this authority to do these things?",pt:"que lhe perguntaram: Com que autoridade fazes tu estas coisas? ou quem te deu autoridade para faz\xea-las?"},{verse:29,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto them, I will also ask of you one question, and answer me, and I will tell you by what authority I do these things.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Eu vos perguntarei uma coisa; respondei-me, pois, e eu vos direi com que autoridade fa\xe7o estas coisas."},{verse:30,en:"The baptism of John, was it from heaven, or of men? answer me.",pt:"O batismo de Jo\xe3o era do c\xe9u, ou dos homens? respondei-me."},{verse:31,en:"And they reasoned with themselves, saying, If we shall say, From heaven; he will say, Why then did ye not believe him?",pt:"Ao que eles arrazoavam entre si: Se dissermos: Do c\xe9u, ele dir\xe1: Ent\xe3o por que n\xe3o o crestes?"},{verse:32,en:"But if we shall say, Of men; they feared the people: for all men counted John, that he was a prophet indeed.",pt:"Mas diremos, porventura: Dos homens? - \xc9 que temiam o povo; porque todos verdadeiramente tinham a Jo\xe3o como profeta."},{verse:33,en:"And they answered and said unto Jesus, We cannot tell. And Jesus answering saith unto them, Neither do I tell you by what authority I do these things.",pt:"Responderam, pois, a Jesus: N\xe3o sabemos. Replicou-lhes ele: Nem eu vos digo com que autoridade fa\xe7o estas coisas."}]}}),776,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he began to speak unto them by parables. A certain man planted a vineyard, and set an hedge about it, and digged a place for the winefat, and built a tower, and let it out to husbandmen, and went into a far country.",pt:"Ent\xe3o come\xe7ou Jesus a falar-lhes por par\xe1bolas. Um homem plantou uma vinha, cercou-a com uma sebe, cavou um lagar, e edificou uma torre; depois arrendou-a a uns lavradores e ausentou-se do pa\xeds."},{verse:2,en:"And at the season he sent to the husbandmen a servant, that he might receive from the husbandmen of the fruit of the vineyard.",pt:"No tempo pr\xf3prio, enviou um servo aos lavradores para que deles recebesse do fruto da vinha."},{verse:3,en:"And they caught him, and beat him, and sent him away empty.",pt:"Mas estes, apoderando-se dele, o espancaram e o mandaram embora de m\xe3os vazias."},{verse:4,en:"And again he sent unto them another servant; and at him they cast stones, and wounded him in the head, and sent him away shamefully handled.",pt:"E tornou a enviar-lhes outro servo; e a este feriram na cabe\xe7a e o ultrajaram."},{verse:5,en:"And again he sent another; and him they killed, and many others; beating some, and killing some.",pt:"Ent\xe3o enviou ainda outro, e a este mataram; e a outros muitos, dos quais a uns espancaram e a outros mataram."},{verse:6,en:"Having yet therefore one son, his wellbeloved, he sent him also last unto them, saying, They will reverence my son.",pt:"Ora, tinha ele ainda um, o seu filho amado; a este lhes enviou por \xfaltimo, dizendo: A meu filho ter\xe3o respeito."},{verse:7,en:"But those husbandmen said among themselves, This is the heir; come, let us kill him, and the inheritance shall be ours.",pt:"Mas aqueles lavradores disseram entre si: Este \xe9 o herdeiro; vinde, matemo-lo, e a heran\xe7a ser\xe1 nossa."},{verse:8,en:"And they took him, and killed him, and cast him out of the vineyard.",pt:"E, agarrando-o, o mataram, e o lan\xe7aram fora da vinha."},{verse:9,en:"What shall therefore the lord of the vineyard do? he will come and destroy the husbandmen, and will give the vineyard unto others.",pt:"Que far\xe1, pois, o senhor da vinha? Vir\xe1 e destruir\xe1 os lavradores, e dar\xe1 a vinha a outros."},{verse:10,en:"And have ye not read this scripture; The stone which the builders rejected is become the head of the corner:",pt:"Nunca lestes esta escritura: A pedra que os edificadores rejeitaram, essa foi posta como pedra angular;"},{verse:11,en:"This was the Lord\u2019s doing, and it is marvellous in our eyes?",pt:"pelo Senhor foi feito isso, e \xe9 maravilhoso aos nossos olhos?"},{verse:12,en:"And they sought to lay hold on him, but feared the people: for they knew that he had spoken the parable against them: and they left him, and went their way.",pt:"Procuravam ent\xe3o prend\xea-lo, mas temeram a multid\xe3o, pois perceberam que contra eles proferira essa par\xe1bola; e, deixando-o, se retiraram."},{verse:13,en:"And they send unto him certain of the Pharisees and of the Herodians, to catch him in his words.",pt:"Enviaram-lhe ent\xe3o alguns dos fariseus e dos herodianos, para que o apanhassem em alguma palavra."},{verse:14,en:"And when they were come, they say unto him, Master, we know that thou art true, and carest for no man: for thou regardest not the person of men, but teachest the way of God in truth: Is it lawful to give tribute to Caesar, or not?",pt:"Aproximando-se, pois, disseram-lhe: Mestre, sabemos que \xe9s verdadeiro, e de ningu\xe9m se te d\xe1; porque n\xe3o olhas \xe0 apar\xeancia dos homens, mas ensinas segundo a verdade o caminho de Deus; \xe9 l\xedcito dar tributo a C\xe9sar, ou n\xe3o? Daremos, ou n\xe3o daremos?"},{verse:15,en:"Shall we give, or shall we not give? But he, knowing their hypocrisy, said unto them, Why tempt ye me? bring me a penny, that I may seeit.",pt:"Mas Jesus, percebendo a hipocrisia deles, respondeu-lhes: Por que me experimentais? trazei-me um den\xe1rio para que eu o veja."},{verse:16,en:"And they brought it. And he saith unto them, Whose is this image and superscription? And they said unto him, Caesar\u2019s.",pt:"E eles lho trouxeram. Perguntou-lhes Jesus: De quem \xe9 esta imagem e inscri\xe7\xe3o? Responderam-lhe: De C\xe9sar."},{verse:17,en:"And Jesus answering said unto them, Render to Caesar the things that are Caesar\u2019s, and to God the things that are God\u2019s. And they marvelled at him.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Dai, pois, a C\xe9sar o que \xe9 de C\xe9sar, e a Deus o que \xe9 de Deus. E admiravam-se dele."},{verse:18,en:"Then come unto him the Sadducees, which say there is no resurrection; and they asked him, saying,",pt:"Ent\xe3o se aproximaram dele alguns dos saduceus, que dizem n\xe3o haver ressurrei\xe7\xe3o, e lhe perguntaram, dizendo:"},{verse:19,en:"Master, Moses wrote unto us, If a man\u2019s brother die, and leave his wife behind him, and leave no children, that his brother should take his wife, and raise up seed unto his brother.",pt:"Mestre, Mois\xe9s nos deixou escrito que se morrer algu\xe9m, deixando mulher sem deixar filhos, o irm\xe3o dele case com a mulher, e suscite descend\xeancia ao irm\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"Now there were seven brethren: and the first took a wife, and dying left no seed.",pt:"Ora, havia sete irm\xe3os; o primeiro casou-se e morreu sem deixar descend\xeancia;"},{verse:21,en:"And the second took her, and died, neither left he any seed: and the third likewise.",pt:"o segundo casou-se com a vi\xfava, e morreu, n\xe3o deixando descend\xeancia; e da mesma forma, o terceiro; e assim os sete, e n\xe3o deixaram descend\xeancia."},{verse:22,en:"And the seven had her, and left no seed: last of all the woman died also.",pt:"Depois de todos, morreu tamb\xe9m a mulher."},{verse:23,en:"In the resurrection therefore, when they shall rise, whose wife shall she be of them? for the seven had her to wife.",pt:"Na ressurrei\xe7\xe3o, de qual deles ser\xe1 ela esposa, pois os sete por esposa a tiveram?"},{verse:24,en:"And Jesus answering said unto them, Do ye not therefore err, because ye know not the scriptures, neither the power of God?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Porventura n\xe3o errais v\xf3s em raz\xe3o de n\xe3o compreenderdes as Escrituras nem o poder de Deus?"},{verse:25,en:"For when they shall rise from the dead, they neither marry, nor are given in marriage; but are as the angels which are in heaven.",pt:"Porquanto, ao ressuscitarem dos mortos, nem se casam, nem se d\xe3o em casamento; pelo contr\xe1rio, s\xe3o como os anjos nos c\xe9us."},{verse:26,en:"And as touching the dead, that they rise: have ye not read in the book of Moses, how in the bush God spake unto him, saying, I am the God of Abraham, and the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob?",pt:"Quanto aos mortos, por\xe9m, serem ressuscitados, n\xe3o lestes no livro de Mois\xe9s, onde se fala da sar\xe7a, como Deus lhe disse: Eu sou o Deus de Abra\xe3o, o Deus de Isaque e o Deus de Jac\xf3?"},{verse:27,en:"He is not the God of the dead, but the God of the living: ye therefore do greatly err.",pt:"Ora, ele n\xe3o \xe9 Deus de mortos, mas de vivos. Estais em grande erro."},{verse:28,en:"And one of the scribes came, and having heard them reasoning together, and perceiving that he had answered them well, asked him, Which is the first commandment of all?",pt:"Aproximou-se dele um dos escribas que os ouvira discutir e, percebendo que lhes havia respondido bem, perguntou-lhe: Qual \xe9 o primeiro de todos os mandamentos?"},{verse:29,en:"And Jesus answered him, The first of all the commandments is, Hear, O Israel; The Lord our God is one Lord:",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: O primeiro \xe9: Ouve, Israel, o Senhor nosso Deus \xe9 o \xfanico Senhor."},{verse:30,en:"And thou shalt love the Lord thy God with all thy heart, and with all thy soul, and with all thy mind, and with all thy strength: this is the first commandment.",pt:"Amar\xe1s, pois, ao Senhor teu Deus de todo o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, de toda a tua alma, de todo o teu entendimento e de todas as tuas for\xe7as."},{verse:31,en:"And the second is like, namely this, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself. There is none other commandment greater than these.",pt:"E o segundo \xe9 este: Amar\xe1s ao teu pr\xf3ximo como a ti mesmo. N\xe3o h\xe1 outro mandamento maior do que esses."},{verse:32,en:"And the scribe said unto him, Well, Master, thou hast said the truth: for there is one God; and there is none other but he:",pt:"Ao que lhe disse o escriba: Muito bem, Mestre; com verdade disseste que ele \xe9 um, e fora dele n\xe3o h\xe1 outro;"},{verse:33,en:"And to love him with all the heart, and with all the understanding, and with all the soul, and with all the strength, and to love his neighbour as himself, is more than all whole burnt offerings and sacrifices.",pt:"e que am\xe1-lo de todo o cora\xe7\xe3o, de todo o entendimento e de todas as for\xe7as, e amar o pr\xf3ximo como a si mesmo, \xe9 mais do que todos os holocaustos e sacrif\xedcios."},{verse:34,en:"And when Jesus saw that he answered discreetly, he said unto him, Thou art not far from the kingdom of God. And no man after that durst ask him any question.",pt:"E Jesus, vendo que havia respondido sabiamente, disse-lhe: N\xe3o est\xe1s longe do reino de Deus. E ningu\xe9m ousava mais interrog\xe1-lo."},{verse:35,en:"And Jesus answered and said, while he taught in the temple, How say the scribes that Christ is the Son of David?",pt:"Por sua vez, Jesus, enquanto ensinava no templo, perguntou: Como \xe9 que os escribas dizem que o Cristo \xe9 filho de Davi?"},{verse:36,en:"For David himself said by the Holy Ghost, The Lord said to my Lord, Sit thou on my right hand, till I make thine enemies thy footstool.",pt:"O pr\xf3prio Davi falou, movido pelo Esp\xedrito Santo: Disse o Senhor ao meu Senhor: Assenta-te \xe0 minha direita, at\xe9 que eu ponha os teus inimigos debaixo dos teus p\xe9s."},{verse:37,en:"David therefore himself calleth him Lord; and whence is he then his son? And the common people heard him gladly.",pt:"Davi mesmo lhe chama Senhor; como \xe9 ele seu filho? E a grande multid\xe3o o ouvia com prazer."},{verse:38,en:"And he said unto them in his doctrine, Beware of the scribes, which love to go in long clothing, and love salutations in the marketplaces,",pt:"E prosseguindo ele no seu ensino, disse: Guardai-vos dos escribas, que gostam de andar com vestes compridas, e das sauda\xe7\xf5es nas pra\xe7as,"},{verse:39,en:"And the chief seats in the synagogues, and the uppermost rooms at feasts:",pt:"e dos primeiros assentos nas sinagogas, e dos primeiros lugares nos banquetes,"},{verse:40,en:"Which devour widows\u2019 houses, and for a pretence make long prayers: these shall receive greater damnation.",pt:"que devoram as casas das vi\xfavas, e por pretexto fazem longas ora\xe7\xf5es; estes h\xe3o de receber muito maior condena\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:41,en:"And Jesus sat over against the treasury, and beheld how the people cast money into the treasury: and many that were rich cast in much.",pt:"E sentando-se Jesus defronte do cofre das ofertas, observava como a multid\xe3o lan\xe7ava dinheiro no cofre; e muitos ricos deitavam muito."},{verse:42,en:"And there came a certain poor widow, and she threw in two mites, which make a farthing.",pt:"Vindo, por\xe9m, uma pobre vi\xfava, lan\xe7ou dois leptos, que valiam um quadrante."},{verse:43,en:"And he called unto him his disciples, and saith unto them, Verily I say unto you, That this poor widow hath cast more in, than all they which have cast into the treasury:",pt:"E chamando ele os seus disc\xedpulos, disse-lhes: Em verdade vos digo que esta pobre vi\xfava deu mais do que todos os que deitavam ofertas no cofre;"},{verse:44,en:"For all they did cast in of their abundance; but she of her want did cast in all that she had, even all her living.",pt:"porque todos deram daquilo que lhes sobrava; mas esta, da sua pobreza, deu tudo o que tinha, mesmo todo o seu sustento."}]}}),777,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And as he went out of the temple, one of his disciples saith unto him, Master, see what manner of stones and what buildings are here!",pt:"Quando sa\xeda do templo, disse-lhe um dos seus disc\xedpulos: Mestre, olha que pedras e que edif\xedcios!"},{verse:2,en:"And Jesus answering said unto him, Seest thou these great buildings? there shall not be left one stone upon another, that shall not be thrown down.",pt:"Ao que Jesus lhe disse: V\xeas estes grandes edif\xedcios? N\xe3o se deixar\xe1 aqui pedra sobre pedra que n\xe3o seja derribada."},{verse:3,en:"And as he sat upon the mount of Olives over against the temple, Peter and James and John and Andrew asked him privately,",pt:"Depois estando ele sentado no Monte das Oliveiras, defronte do templo, Pedro, Tiago, Jo\xe3o e Andr\xe9 perguntaram-lhe em particular:"},{verse:4,en:"Tell us, when shall these things be? and what shall be the sign when all these things shall be fulfilled?",pt:"Dize-nos, quando suceder\xe3o essas coisas, e que sinal haver\xe1 quando todas elas estiverem para se cumprir?"},{verse:5,en:"And Jesus answering them began to say, Take heed lest any man deceive you:",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus come\xe7ou a dizer-lhes: Acautelai-vos; ningu\xe9m vos engane;"},{verse:6,en:"For many shall come in my name, saying, I am Christ; and shall deceive many.",pt:"muitos vir\xe3o em meu nome, dizendo: Sou eu; e a muitos enganar\xe3o."},{verse:7,en:"And when ye shall hear of wars and rumours of wars, be ye not troubled: for such things must needs be; but the end shall not be yet.",pt:"Quando, por\xe9m, ouvirdes falar em guerras e rumores de guerras, n\xe3o vos perturbeis; for\xe7oso \xe9 que assim aconte\xe7a: mas ainda n\xe3o \xe9 o fim."},{verse:8,en:"For nation shall rise against nation, and kingdom against kingdom: and there shall be earthquakes in divers places, and there shall be famines and troubles: these are the beginnings of sorrows.",pt:"Pois se levantar\xe1 na\xe7\xe3o contra na\xe7\xe3o, e reino contra reino; e haver\xe1 terremotos em diversos lugares, e haver\xe1 fomes. Isso ser\xe1 o princ\xedpio das dores."},{verse:9,en:"But take heed to yourselves: for they shall deliver you up to councils; and in the synagogues ye shall be beaten: and ye shall be brought before rulers and kings for my sake, for a testimony against them.",pt:"Mas olhai por v\xf3s mesmos; pois por minha causa vos h\xe3o de entregar aos sin\xe9drios e \xe0s sinagogas, e sereis a\xe7oitados; tamb\xe9m sereis levados perante governadores e reis, para lhes servir de testemunho."},{verse:10,en:"And the gospel must first be published among all nations.",pt:"Mas importa que primeiro o evangelho seja pregado entre todas as na\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:11,en:"But when they shall lead you, and deliver you up, take no thought beforehand what ye shall speak, neither do ye premeditate: but whatsoever shall be given you in that hour, that speak ye: for it is not ye that speak, but the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Quando, pois, vos conduzirem para vos entregar, n\xe3o vos preocupeis com o que haveis de dizer; mas, o que vos for dado naquela hora, isso falai; porque n\xe3o sois v\xf3s que falais, mas sim o Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:12,en:"Now the brother shall betray the brother to death, and the father the son; and children shall rise up against their parents, and shall cause them to be put to death.",pt:"Um irm\xe3o entregar\xe1 \xe0 morte a seu irm\xe3o, e um pai a seu filho; e filhos se levantar\xe3o contra os pais e os matar\xe3o."},{verse:13,en:"And ye shall be hated of all men for my name\u2019s sake: but he that shall endure unto the end, the same shall be saved.",pt:"E sereis odiados de todos por causa do meu nome; mas aquele que perseverar at\xe9 o fim, esse ser\xe1 salvo."},{verse:14,en:"But when ye shall see the abomination of desolation, spoken of by Daniel the prophet, standing where it ought not, (let him that readeth understand,) then let them that be in Judaea flee to the mountains:",pt:"Ora, quando v\xf3s virdes a abomina\xe7\xe3o da desola\xe7\xe3o estar onde n\xe3o deve estar (quem l\xea, entenda), ent\xe3o os que estiverem na Jud\xe9ia fujam para os montes;"},{verse:15,en:"And let him that is on the housetop not go down into the house, neither enter therein, to take any thing out of his house:",pt:"quem estiver no eirado n\xe3o des\xe7a, nem entre para tirar alguma coisa da sua casa;"},{verse:16,en:"And let him that is in the field not turn back again for to take up his garment.",pt:"e quem estiver no campo n\xe3o volte atr\xe1s para buscar a sua capa."},{verse:17,en:"But woe to them that are with child, and to them that give suck in those days!",pt:"Mas ai das que estiverem gr\xe1vidas, e das que amamentarem naqueles dias!"},{verse:18,en:"And pray ye that your flight be not in the winter.",pt:"Orai, pois, para que isto n\xe3o suceda no inverno;"},{verse:19,en:"For in those days shall be affliction, such as was not from the beginning of the creation which God created unto this time, neither shall be.",pt:"porque naqueles dias haver\xe1 uma tribula\xe7\xe3o tal, qual nunca houve desde o princ\xedpio da cria\xe7\xe3o, que Deus criou, at\xe9 agora, nem jamais haver\xe1."},{verse:20,en:"And except that the Lord had shortened those days, no flesh should be saved: but for the elect\u2019s sake, whom he hath chosen, he hath shortened the days.",pt:"Se o Senhor n\xe3o abreviasse aqueles dias, ningu\xe9m se salvaria mas ele, por causa dos eleitos que escolheu, abreviou aqueles dias."},{verse:21,en:"And then if any man shall say to you, Lo, here is Christ; or, lo, he is there; believe him not:",pt:"Ent\xe3o, se algu\xe9m vos disser: Eis aqui o Cristo! ou: Ei-lo ali! n\xe3o acrediteis."},{verse:22,en:"For false Christs and false prophets shall rise, and shall shew signs and wonders, to seduce, if it were possible, even the elect.",pt:"Porque h\xe3o de surgir falsos cristos e falsos profetas, e far\xe3o sinais e prod\xedgios para enganar, se poss\xedvel, at\xe9 os escolhidos."},{verse:23,en:"But take ye heed: behold, I have foretold you all things.",pt:"Ficai v\xf3s, pois, de sobreaviso; eis que de antem\xe3o vos tenho dito tudo."},{verse:24,en:"But in those days, after that tribulation, the sun shall be darkened, and the moon shall not give her light,",pt:"Mas naqueles dias, depois daquela tribula\xe7\xe3o, o sol escurecer\xe1, e a lua n\xe3o dar\xe1 a sua luz;"},{verse:25,en:"And the stars of heaven shall fall, and the powers that are in heaven shall be shaken.",pt:"as estrelas cair\xe3o do c\xe9u, e os poderes que est\xe3o nos c\xe9us, ser\xe3o abalados."},{verse:26,en:"And then shall they see the Son of man coming in the clouds with great power and glory.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ver\xe3o vir o Filho do homem nas nuvens, com grande poder e gl\xf3ria."},{verse:27,en:"And then shall he send his angels, and shall gather together his elect from the four winds, from the uttermost part of the earth to the uttermost part of heaven.",pt:"E logo enviar\xe1 os seus anjos, e ajuntar\xe1 os seus eleitos, desde os quatro ventos, desde a extremidade da terra at\xe9 a extremidade do c\xe9u."},{verse:28,en:"Now learn a parable of the fig tree; When her branch is yet tender, and putteth forth leaves, ye know that summer is near:",pt:"Da figueira, pois, aprendei a par\xe1bola: Quando j\xe1 o seu ramo se torna tenro e brota folhas, sabeis que est\xe1 pr\xf3ximo o ver\xe3o."},{verse:29,en:"So ye in like manner, when ye shall see these things come to pass, know that it is nigh, even at the doors.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s, quando virdes sucederem essas coisas, sabei que ele est\xe1 pr\xf3ximo, mesmo \xe0s portas."},{verse:30,en:"Verily I say unto you, that this generation shall not pass, till all these things be done.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que n\xe3o passar\xe1 esta gera\xe7\xe3o, at\xe9 que todas essas coisas aconte\xe7am."},{verse:31,en:"Heaven and earth shall pass away: but my words shall not pass away.",pt:"Passar\xe1 o c\xe9u e a terra, mas as minhas palavras n\xe3o passar\xe3o."},{verse:32,en:"But of that day and that hour knoweth no man, no, not the angels which are in heaven, neither the Son, but the Father.",pt:"Quanto, por\xe9m, ao dia e \xe0 hora, ningu\xe9m sabe, nem os anjos no c\xe9u nem o Filho, sen\xe3o o Pai."},{verse:33,en:"Take ye heed, watch and pray: for ye know not when the time is.",pt:"Olhai! vigiai! porque n\xe3o sabeis quando chegar\xe1 o tempo."},{verse:34,en:"For the Son of man is as a man taking a far journey, who left his house, and gave authority to his servants, and to every man his work, and commanded the porter to watch.",pt:"\xc9 como se um homem, devendo viajar, ao deixar a sua casa, desse autoridade aos seus servos, a cada um o seu trabalho, e ordenasse tamb\xe9m ao porteiro que vigiasse."},{verse:35,en:"Watch ye therefore: for ye know not when the master of the house cometh, at even, or at midnight, or at the cockcrowing, or in the morning:",pt:"Vigiai, pois; porque n\xe3o sabeis quando vir\xe1 o senhor da casa; se \xe0 tarde, se \xe0 meia-noite, se ao cantar do galo, se pela manh\xe3;"},{verse:36,en:"Lest coming suddenly he find you sleeping.",pt:"para que, vindo de improviso, n\xe3o vos ache dormindo."},{verse:37,en:"And what I say unto you I say unto all, Watch.",pt:"O que vos digo a v\xf3s, a todos o digo: Vigiai."}]}}),778,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After two days was the feast of the passover, and of unleavened bread: and the chief priests and the scribes sought how they might take him by craft, and put him to death.",pt:"Ora, dali a dois dias era a p\xe1scoa e a festa dos p\xe3es \xe1zimos; e os principais sacerdotes e os escribas andavam buscando como prender Jesus a trai\xe7\xe3o, para o matarem."},{verse:2,en:"But they said, Not on the feast day, lest there be an uproar of the people.",pt:"Pois eles diziam: N\xe3o durante a festa, para que n\xe3o haja tumulto entre o povo."},{verse:3,en:"And being in Bethany in the house of Simon the leper, as he sat at meat, there came a woman having an alabaster box of ointment of spikenard very precious; and she brake the box, and poured it on his head.",pt:"Estando ele em Bet\xe2nia, reclinado \xe0 mesa em casa de Sim\xe3o, o leproso, veio uma mulher que trazia um vaso de alabastro cheio de b\xe1lsamo de nardo puro, de grande pre\xe7o; e, quebrando o vaso, derramou-lhe sobre a cabe\xe7a o b\xe1lsamo."},{verse:4,en:"And there were some that had indignation within themselves, and said, Why was this waste of the ointment made?",pt:"Mas alguns houve que em si mesmos se indignaram e disseram: Para que se fez este desperd\xedcio do b\xe1lsamo?"},{verse:5,en:"For it might have been sold for more than three hundred pence, and have been given to the poor. And they murmured against her.",pt:"Pois podia ser vendido por mais de trezentos den\xe1rios que se dariam aos pobres. E bramavam contra ela."},{verse:6,en:"And Jesus said, Let her alone; why trouble ye her? she hath wrought a good work on me.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, disse: Deixai-a; por que a molestais? Ela praticou uma boa a\xe7\xe3o para comigo."},{verse:7,en:"For ye have the poor with you always, and whensoever ye will ye may do them good: but me ye have not always.",pt:"Porquanto os pobres sempre os tendes convosco e, quando quiserdes, podeis fazer-lhes bem; a mim, por\xe9m, nem sempre me tendes."},{verse:8,en:"She hath done what she could: she is come aforehand to anoint my body to the burying.",pt:"ela fez o que pode; antecipou-se a ungir o meu corpo para a sepultura."},{verse:9,en:"Verily I say unto you, Wheresoever this gospel shall be preached throughout the whole world, this also that she hath done shall be spoken of for a memorial of her.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que, em todo o mundo, onde quer que for pregado o evangelho, tamb\xe9m o que ela fez ser\xe1 contado para mem\xf3ria sua."},{verse:10,en:"And Judas Iscariot, one of the twelve, went unto the chief priests, to betray him unto them.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Judas Iscariotes, um dos doze, foi ter com os principais sacerdotes para lhes entregar Jesus."},{verse:11,en:"And when they heard it, they were glad, and promised to give him money. And he sought how he might conveniently betray him.",pt:"Ouvindo-o eles, alegraram-se, e prometeram dar-lhe dinheiro. E buscava como o entregaria em ocasi\xe3o oportuna."},{verse:12,en:"And the first day of unleavened bread, when they killed the passover, his disciples said unto him, Where wilt thou that we go and prepare that thou mayest eat the passover?",pt:"Ora, no primeiro dia dos p\xe3es \xe1zimos, quando imolavam a p\xe1scoa, disseram-lhe seus disc\xedpulos: Aonde queres que vamos fazer os preparativos para comeres a p\xe1scoa?"},{verse:13,en:"And he sendeth forth two of his disciples, and saith unto them, Go ye into the city, and there shall meet you a man bearing a pitcher of water: follow him.",pt:"Enviou, pois, dois dos seus disc\xedpulos, e disse-lhes: Ide \xe0 cidade, e vos sair\xe1 ao encontro um homem levando um c\xe2ntaro de \xe1gua; segu\xed-o;"},{verse:14,en:"And wheresoever he shall go in, say ye to the goodman of the house, The Master saith, Where is the guestchamber, where I shall eat the passover with my disciples?",pt:"e, onde ele entrar, dizei ao dono da casa: O Mestre manda perguntar: Onde est\xe1 o meu aposento em que hei de comer a p\xe1scoa com os meus disc\xedpulos?"},{verse:15,en:"And he will shew you a large upper room furnished and prepared: there make ready for us.",pt:"E ele vos mostrar\xe1 um grande cen\xe1culo mobiliado e pronto; a\xed fazei-nos os preparativos."},{verse:16,en:"And his disciples went forth, and came into the city, and found as he had said unto them: and they made ready the passover.",pt:"Partindo, pois, os disc\xedpulos, foram \xe0 cidade, onde acharam tudo como ele lhes dissera, e prepararam a p\xe1scoa."},{verse:17,en:"And in the evening he cometh with the twelve.",pt:"Ao anoitecer chegou ele com os doze."},{verse:18,en:"And as they sat and did eat, Jesus said, Verily I say unto you, One of you which eateth with me shall betray me.",pt:"E, quando estavam reclinados \xe0 mesa e comiam, disse Jesus: Em verdade vos digo que um de v\xf3s, que comigo come, h\xe1 de trair-me."},{verse:19,en:"And they began to be sorrowful, and to say unto him one by one, Is it I? and another said, Is it I?",pt:"Ao que eles come\xe7aram a entristecer-se e a perguntar-lhe um ap\xf3s outro: Porventura sou eu?"},{verse:20,en:"And he answered and said unto them, It is one of the twelve, that dippeth with me in the dish.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: \xc9 um dos doze, que mete comigo a m\xe3o no prato."},{verse:21,en:"The Son of man indeed goeth, as it is written of him: but woe to that man by whom the Son of man is betrayed! good were it for that man if he had never been born.",pt:"Pois o Filho do homem vai, conforme est\xe1 escrito a seu respeito; mas ai daquele por quem o Filho do homem \xe9 tra\xeddo! bom seria para esse homem se n\xe3o houvera nascido."},{verse:22,en:"And as they did eat, Jesus took bread, and blessed, and brake it, and gave to them, and said, Take, eat: this is my body.",pt:"Enquanto comiam, Jesus tomou p\xe3o e, aben\xe7oando-o, o partiu e deu-lho, dizendo: Tomai; isto \xe9 o meu corpo."},{verse:23,en:"And he took the cup, and when he had given thanks, he gave it to them: and they all drank of it.",pt:"E tomando um c\xe1lice, rendeu gra\xe7as e deu-lho; e todos beberam dele."},{verse:24,en:"And he said unto them, This is my blood of the new testament, which is shed for many.",pt:"E disse-lhes: Isto \xe9 o meu sangue, o sangue do pacto, que por muitos \xe9 derramado."},{verse:25,en:"Verily I say unto you, I will drink no more of the fruit of the vine, until that day that I drink it new in the kingdom of God.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que n\xe3o beberei mais do fruto da videira, at\xe9 aquele dia em que o beber, novo, no reino de Deus."},{verse:26,en:"And when they had sung an hymn, they went out into the mount of Olives.",pt:"E, tendo cantado um hino, sa\xedram para o Monte das Oliveiras."},{verse:27,en:"And Jesus saith unto them, All ye shall be offended because of me this night: for it is written, I will smite the shepherd, and the sheep shall be scattered.",pt:"Disse-lhes ent\xe3o Jesus: Todos v\xf3s vos escandalizareis; porque escrito est\xe1: Ferirei o pastor, e as ovelhas se dispersar\xe3o."},{verse:28,en:"But after that I am risen, I will go before you into Galilee.",pt:"Todavia, depois que eu ressurgir, irei adiante de v\xf3s para a Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:29,en:"But Peter said unto him, Although all shall be offended, yet will not I.",pt:"Ao que Pedro lhe disse: Ainda que todos se escandalizem, nunca, por\xe9m, eu."},{verse:30,en:"And Jesus saith unto him, Verily I say unto thee, That this day, even in this night, before the cock crow twice, thou shalt deny me thrice.",pt:"Replicou-lhe Jesus: Em verdade te digo que hoje, nesta noite, antes que o galo cante duas vezes, tr\xeas vezes tu me negar\xe1s."},{verse:31,en:"But he spake the more vehemently, If I should die with thee, I will not deny thee in any wise. Likewise also said they all.",pt:"Mas ele repetia com veem\xeancia: Ainda que me seja necess\xe1rio morrer contigo, de modo nenhum te negarei. Assim tamb\xe9m diziam todos."},{verse:32,en:"And they came to a place which was named Gethsemane: and he saith to his disciples, Sit ye here, while I shall pray.",pt:"Ent\xe3o chegaram a um lugar chamado Gets\xeamane, e disse Jesus a seus disc\xedpulos: Sentai-vos aqui, enquanto eu oro."},{verse:33,en:"And he taketh with him Peter and James and John, and began to be sore amazed, and to be very heavy;",pt:"E levou consigo a Pedro, a Tiago e a Jo\xe3o, e come\xe7ou a ter pavor e a angustiar-se;"},{verse:34,en:"And saith unto them, My soul is exceeding sorrowful unto death: tarry ye here, and watch.",pt:"e disse-lhes: A minha alma est\xe1 triste at\xe9 a morte; ficai aqui e vigiai."},{verse:35,en:"And he went forward a little, and fell on the ground, and prayed that, if it were possible, the hour might pass from him.",pt:"E adiantando-se um pouco, prostrou-se em terra; e orava para que, se fosse poss\xedvel, passasse dele aquela hora."},{verse:36,en:"And he said, Abba, Father, all things are possible unto thee; take away this cup from me: nevertheless not what I will, but what thou wilt.",pt:"E dizia: Aba, Pai, tudo te \xe9 poss\xedvel; afasta de mim este c\xe1lice; todavia n\xe3o seja o que eu quero, mas o que tu queres."},{verse:37,en:"And he cometh, and findeth them sleeping, and saith unto Peter, Simon, sleepest thou? couldest not thou watch one hour?",pt:"Voltando, achou-os dormindo; e disse a Pedro: Sim\xe3o, dormes? n\xe3o pudeste vigiar uma hora?"},{verse:38,en:"Watch ye and pray, lest ye enter into temptation. The spirit truly is ready, but the flesh is weak.",pt:"Vigiai e orai, para que n\xe3o entreis em tenta\xe7\xe3o; o esp\xedrito, na verdade, est\xe1 pronto, mas a carne \xe9 fraca."},{verse:39,en:"And again he went away, and prayed, and spake the same words.",pt:"Retirou-se de novo e orou, dizendo as mesmas palavras."},{verse:40,en:"And when he returned, he found them asleep again, (for their eyes were heavy,) neither wist they what to answer him.",pt:"E voltando outra vez, achou-os dormindo, porque seus olhos estavam carregados; e n\xe3o sabiam o que lhe responder."},{verse:41,en:"And he cometh the third time, and saith unto them, Sleep on now, and take your rest: it is enough, the hour is come; behold, the Son of man is betrayed into the hands of sinners.",pt:"Ao voltar pela terceira vez, disse-lhes: Dormi agora e descansai. - Basta; \xe9 chegada a hora. Eis que o Filho do homem est\xe1 sendo entregue nas m\xe3os dos pecadores."},{verse:42,en:"Rise up, let us go; lo, he that betrayeth me is at hand.",pt:"Levantai-vos, vamo-nos; eis que \xe9 chegado aquele que me trai."},{verse:43,en:"And immediately, while he yet spake, cometh Judas, one of the twelve, and with him a great multitude with swords and staves, from the chief priest and the scribes and the elders.",pt:"E logo, enquanto ele ainda falava, chegou Judas, um dos doze, e com ele uma multid\xe3o com espadas e varapaus, vinda da parte dos principais sacerdotes, dos escribas e dos anci\xe3os."},{verse:44,en:"And he that betrayed him had given them a token, saying, Whomsoever I shall kiss, that same is he; take him, and lead him away safely.",pt:"Ora, o que o tra\xeda lhes havia dado um sinal, dizendo: Aquele que eu beijar, esse \xe9; prendei-o e levai-o com seguran\xe7a."},{verse:45,en:"And as soon as he was come, he goeth straightway to him, and saith, Master, master; and kissed him.",pt:"E, logo que chegou, aproximando-se de Jesus, disse: Rabi! E o beijou."},{verse:46,en:"And they laid their hands on him, and took him.",pt:"Ao que eles lhes lan\xe7aram as m\xe3os, e o prenderam."},{verse:47,en:"And one of them that stood by drew a sword, and smote a servant of the high priest, and cut off his ear.",pt:"Mas um dos que ali estavam, puxando da espada, feriu o servo do sumo sacerdote e cortou-lhe uma orelha."},{verse:48,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto them, Are ye come out, as against a thief, with swords and with staves to take me?",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Sa\xedstes com espadas e varapaus para me prender, como a um salteador?"},{verse:49,en:"I was daily with you in the temple teaching, and ye took me not: but the scriptures must be fulfilled.",pt:"Todos os dias estava convosco no templo, a ensinar, e n\xe3o me prendestes; mas isto \xe9 para que se cumpram as Escrituras."},{verse:50,en:"And they all forsook him, and fled.",pt:"Nisto, todos o deixaram e fugiram."},{verse:51,en:"And there followed him a certain young man, having a linen cloth cast about his naked body; and the young men laid hold on him:",pt:"Ora, seguia-o certo jovem envolto em um len\xe7ol sobre o corpo nu; e o agarraram."},{verse:52,en:"And he left the linen cloth, and fled from them naked.",pt:"Mas ele, largando o len\xe7ol, fugiu despido."},{verse:53,en:"And they led Jesus away to the high priest: and with him were assembled all the chief priests and the elders and the scribes.",pt:"Levaram Jesus ao sumo sacerdote, e ajuntaram-se todos os principais sacerdotes, os anci\xe3os e os escribas."},{verse:54,en:"And Peter followed him afar off, even into the palace of the high priest: and he sat with the servants, and warmed himself at the fire.",pt:"E Pedro o seguiu de longe at\xe9 dentro do p\xe1tio do sumo sacerdote, e estava sentado com os guardas, aquentando-se ao fogo."},{verse:55,en:"And the chief priests and all the council sought for witness against Jesus to put him to death; and found none.",pt:"Os principais sacerdotes testemunho contra Jesus para o matar, e n\xe3o o achavam."},{verse:56,en:"For many bare false witness against him, but their witness agreed not together.",pt:"Porque contra ele muitos depunham falsamente, mas os testemunhos n\xe3o concordavam."},{verse:57,en:"And there arose certain, and bare false witness against him, saying,",pt:"Levantaram-se por fim alguns que depunham falsamente contra ele, dizendo:"},{verse:58,en:"We heard him say, I will destroy this temple that is made with hands, and within three days I will build another made without hands.",pt:"N\xf3s o ouvimos dizer: Eu destruirei este santu\xe1rio, constru\xeddo por m\xe3os de homens, e em tr\xeas dias edificarei outro, n\xe3o feito por m\xe3os de homens."},{verse:59,en:"But neither so did their witness agree together.",pt:"E nem assim concordava o seu testemunho."},{verse:60,en:"And the high priest stood up in the midst, and asked Jesus, saying, Answerest thou nothing? what is it which these witness against thee?",pt:"Levantou-se ent\xe3o o sumo sacerdote no meio e perguntou a Jesus: N\xe3o respondes coisa alguma? Que \xe9 que estes dep\xf5em conta ti?"},{verse:61,en:"But he held his peace, and answered nothing. Again the high priest asked him, and said unto him, Art thou the Christ, the Son of the Blessed?",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, permaneceu calado, e nada respondeu. Tornou o sumo sacerdote a interrog\xe1-lo, perguntando-lhe: \xc9s tu o Cristo, o Filho do Deus bendito?"},{verse:62,en:"And Jesus said, I am: and ye shall see the Son of man sitting on the right hand of power, and coming in the clouds of heaven.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Eu o sou; e vereis o Filho do homem assentado \xe0 direita do Poder e vindo com as nuvens do c\xe9u."},{verse:63,en:"Then the high priest rent his clothes, and saith, What need we any further witnesses?",pt:"Ent\xe3o o sumo sacerdote, rasgando as suas vestes, disse: Para que precisamos ainda de testemunhas?"},{verse:64,en:"Ye have heard the blasphemy: what think ye? And they all condemned him to be guilty of death.",pt:"Acabais de ouvir a blasf\xeamia; que vos parece? E todos o condenaram como r\xe9u de morte."},{verse:65,en:"And some began to spit on him, and to cover his face, and to buffet him, and to say unto him, Prophesy: and the servants did strike him with the palms of their hands.",pt:"E alguns come\xe7aram a cuspir nele, e a cobrir-lhe o rosto, e a dar-lhe socos, e a dizer-lhe: Profetiza. E os guardas receberam-no a bofetadas."},{verse:66,en:"And as Peter was beneath in the palace, there cometh one of the maids of the high priest:",pt:"Ora, estando Pedro em baixo, no \xe1trio, chegou uma das criadas do sumo sacerdote"},{verse:67,en:"And when she saw Peter warming himself, she looked upon him, and said, And thou also wast with Jesus of Nazareth.",pt:"e, vendo a Pedro, que se estava aquentando, encarou-o e disse: Tu tamb\xe9m estavas com o nazareno, esse Jesus."},{verse:68,en:"But he denied, saying, I know not, neither understand I what thou sayest. And he went out into the porch; and the cock crew.",pt:"Mas ele o negou, dizendo: N\xe3o sei nem compreendo o que dizes. E saiu para o alpendre."},{verse:69,en:"And a maid saw him again, and began to say to them that stood by, This is one of them.",pt:"E a criada, vendo-o, come\xe7ou de novo a dizer aos que ali estavam: Esse \xe9 um deles."},{verse:70,en:"And he denied it again. And a little after, they that stood by said again to Peter, Surely thou art one of them: for thou art a Galilaean, and thy speech agreeth thereto.",pt:"Mas ele o negou outra vez. E pouco depois os que ali estavam disseram novamente a Pedro: Certamente tu \xe9s um deles; pois \xe9s tamb\xe9m galileu."},{verse:71,en:"But he began to curse and to swear, saying, I know not this man of whom ye speak.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, come\xe7ou a praguejar e a jurar: N\xe3o conhe\xe7o esse homem de quem falais."},{verse:72,en:"And the second time the cock crew. And Peter called to mind the word that Jesus said unto him, Before the cock crow twice, thou shalt deny me thrice. And when he thought thereon, he wept.",pt:"Nesse instante o galo cantou pela segunda vez. E Pedro lembrou-se da palavra que lhe dissera Jesus: Antes que o galo cante duas vezes, tr\xeas vezes me negar\xe1s. E caindo em si, come\xe7ou a chorar."}]}}),779,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,i,r){t.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And straightway in the morning the chief priests held a consultation with the elders and scribes and the whole council, and bound Jesus, and carried him away, and delivered him to Pilate.",pt:"Logo de manh\xe3 tiveram conselho os principais sacerdotes com os anci\xe3os, os escribas e todo o sin\xe9drio; e maniatando a Jesus, o levaram e o entregaram a Pilatos."},{verse:2,en:"And Pilate asked him, Art thou the King of the Jews? And he answering said unto him, Thou sayest it.",pt:"Pilatos lhe perguntou: \xc9s tu o rei dos judeus? Respondeu-lhe Jesus: \xc9 como dizes."},{verse:3,en:"And the chief priests accused him of many things: but he answered nothing.",pt:"e os principais dos sacerdotes o acusavam de muitas coisas."},{verse:4,en:"And Pilate asked him again, saying, Answerest thou nothing? behold how many things they witness against thee.",pt:"Tornou Pilatos a interrog\xe1-lo, dizendo: N\xe3o respondes nada? V\xea quantas acusa\xe7\xf5es te fazem."},{verse:5,en:"But Jesus yet answered nothing; so that Pilate marvelled.",pt:"Mas Jesus nada mais respondeu, de maneira que Pilatos se admirava."},{verse:6,en:"Now at that feast he released unto them one prisoner, whomsoever they desired.",pt:"Ora, por ocasi\xe3o da festa costumava soltar-lhes um preso qualquer que eles pedissem."},{verse:7,en:"And there was one named Barabbas, which lay bound with them that had made insurrection with him, who had committed murder in the insurrection.",pt:"E havia um, chamado Barrab\xe1s, preso com outros sediciosos, os quais num motim haviam cometido um homic\xeddio."},{verse:8,en:"And the multitude crying aloud began to desire him to do as he had ever done unto them.",pt:"E a multid\xe3o subiu e come\xe7ou a pedir o que lhe costumava fazer."},{verse:9,en:"But Pilate answered them, saying, Will ye that I release unto you the King of the Jews?",pt:"Ao que Pilatos lhes perguntou: Quereis que vos solte o rei dos judeus?"},{verse:10,en:"For he knew that the chief priests had delivered him for envy.",pt:"Pois ele sabia que por inveja os principais sacerdotes lho haviam entregado."},{verse:11,en:"But the chief priests moved the people, that he should rather release Barabbas unto them.",pt:"Mas os principais sacerdotes incitaram a multid\xe3o a pedir que lhes soltasse antes a Barrab\xe1s."},{verse:12,en:"And Pilate answered and said again unto them, What will ye then that I shall do unto him whom ye call the King of the Jews?",pt:"E Pilatos, tornando a falar, perguntou-lhes: Que farei ent\xe3o daquele a quem chamais reis dos judeus?"},{verse:13,en:"And they cried out again, Crucify him.",pt:"Novamente clamaram eles: Crucifica-o!"},{verse:14,en:"Then Pilate said unto them, Why, what evil hath he done? And they cried out the more exceedingly, Crucify him.",pt:"Disse-lhes Pilatos: Mas que mal fez ele? Ao que eles clamaram ainda mais: Crucifica-o!"},{verse:15,en:"And so Pilate, willing to content the people, released Barabbas unto them, and delivered Jesus, when he had scourged him, to be crucified.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pilatos, querendo satisfazer a multid\xe3o, soltou-lhe Barrab\xe1s; e tendo mandado a\xe7oitar a Jesus, o entregou para ser crucificado."},{verse:16,en:"And the soldiers led him away into the hall, called Praetorium; and they call together the whole band.",pt:"Os soldados, pois, levaram-no para dentro, ao p\xe1tio, que \xe9 o pret\xf3rio, e convocaram toda a coorte;"},{verse:17,en:"And they clothed him with purple, and platted a crown of thorns, and put it about his head,",pt:"vestiram-no de p\xfarpura e puseram-lhe na cabe\xe7a uma coroa de espinhos que haviam tecido;"},{verse:18,en:"And began to salute him, Hail, King of the Jews!",pt:"e come\xe7aram a saud\xe1-lo: Salve, rei dos judeus!"},{verse:19,en:"And they smote him on the head with a reed, and did spit upon him, and bowing their knees worshipped him.",pt:"Davam-lhe com uma cana na cabe\xe7a, cuspiam nele e, postos de joelhos, o adoravam."},{verse:20,en:"And when they had mocked him, they took off the purple from him, and put his own clothes on him, and led him out to crucify him.",pt:"Depois de o terem assim escarnecido, despiram-lhe a p\xfarpura, e lhe puseram as vestes. Ent\xe3o o levaram para fora, a fim de o crucificarem."},{verse:21,en:"And they compel one Simon a Cyrenian, who passed by, coming out of the country, the father of Alexander and Rufus, to bear his cross.",pt:"E obrigaram certo Sim\xe3o, cireneu, pai de Alexandre e de Rufo, que por ali passava, vindo do campo, a carregar-lhe a cruz."},{verse:22,en:"And they bring him unto the place Golgotha, which is, being interpreted, The place of a skull.",pt:"Levaram-no, pois, ao lugar do G\xf3lgota, que quer dizer, lugar da Caveira."},{verse:23,en:"And they gave him to drink wine mingled with myrrh: but he received it not.",pt:"E ofereciam-lhe vinho misturado com mirra; mas ele n\xe3o o tomou."},{verse:24,en:"And when they had crucified him, they parted his garments, casting lots upon them, what every man should take.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o crucificaram, e repartiram entre si as vestes dele, lan\xe7ando sortes sobre elas para ver o que cada um levaria."},{verse:25,en:"And it was the third hour, and they crucified him.",pt:"E era a hora terceira quando o crucificaram."},{verse:26,en:"And the superscription of his accusation was written over, THE KING OF THE JEWS.",pt:"Por cima dele estava escrito o t\xedtulo da sua acusa\xe7\xe3o: O REI DOS JUDEUS."},{verse:27,en:"And with him they crucify two thieves; the one on his right hand, and the other on his left.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m, com ele, crucificaram dois salteadores, um \xe0 sua direita, e outro \xe0 esquerda."},{verse:28,en:"And the scripture was fulfilled, which saith, And he was numbered with the transgressors.",pt:"[E cumpriu-se a escritura que diz: E com os malfeitores foi contado.]"},{verse:29,en:"And they that passed by railed on him, wagging their heads, and saying, Ah, thou that destroyest the temple, and buildest it in three days,",pt:"E os que iam passando blasfemavam dele, meneando a cabe\xe7a e dizendo: Ah! tu que destr\xf3is o santu\xe1rio e em tr\xeas dias o reedificas."},{verse:30,en:"Save thyself, and come down from the cross.",pt:"salva-te a ti mesmo, descendo da cruz."},{verse:31,en:"Likewise also the chief priests mocking said among themselves with the scribes, He saved others; himself he cannot save.",pt:"De igual modo tamb\xe9m os principais sacerdotes, com os escribas, escarnecendo-o, diziam entre si: A outros salvou; a si mesmo n\xe3o pode salvar;"},{verse:32,en:"Let Christ the King of Israel descend now from the cross, that we may see and believe. And they that were crucified with him reviled him.",pt:"des\xe7a agora da cruz o Cristo, o rei de Israel, para que vejamos e creiamos, Tamb\xe9m os que com ele foram crucificados o injuriavam."},{verse:33,en:"And when the sixth hour was come, there was darkness over the whole land until the ninth hour.",pt:"E, chegada a hora sexta, houve trevas sobre a terra, at\xe9 a hora nona."},{verse:34,en:"And at the ninth hour Jesus cried with a loud voice, saying, Eloi, Eloi, lama sabachthani? which is, being interpreted, My God, my God, why hast thou forsaken me?",pt:"E, \xe0 hora nona, bradou Jesus em alta voz: Elo\xed, Elo\xed, lam\xe1, sabactani? que, traduzido, \xe9: Deus meu, Deus meu, por que me desamparaste?"},{verse:35,en:"And some of them that stood by, when they heard it, said, Behold, he calleth Elias.",pt:"Alguns dos que ali estavam, ouvindo isso, diziam: Eis que chama por Elias."},{verse:36,en:"And one ran and filled a spunge full of vinegar, and put it on a reed, and gave him to drink, saying, Let alone; let us see whether Elias will come to take him down.",pt:"Correu um deles, ensopou uma esponja em vinagre e, pondo-a numa cana, dava-lhe de beber, dizendo: Deixai, vejamos se Elias vir\xe1 tir\xe1-lo."},{verse:37,en:"And Jesus cried with a loud voice, and gave up the ghost.",pt:"Mas Jesus, dando um grande brado, expirou."},{verse:38,en:"And the veil of the temple was rent in twain from the top to the bottom.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o v\xe9u do santu\xe1rio se rasgou em dois, de alto a baixo."},{verse:39,en:"And when the centurion, which stood over against him, saw that he so cried out, and gave up the ghost, he said, Truly this man was the Son of God.",pt:"Ora, o centuri\xe3o, que estava defronte dele, vendo-o assim expirar, disse: Verdadeiramente este homem era filho de Deus."},{verse:40,en:"There were also women looking on afar off: among whom was Mary Magdalene, and Mary the mother of James the less and of Joses, and Salome;",pt:"Tamb\xe9m ali estavam algumas mulheres olhando de longe, entre elas Maria Madalena, Maria, m\xe3e de Tiago o Menor e de Jos\xe9, e Salom\xe9;"},{verse:41,en:"(Who also, when he was in Galilee, followed him, and ministered unto him;) and many other women which came up with him unto Jerusalem.",pt:"as quais o seguiam e o serviam quando ele estava na Galil\xe9ia; e muitas outras que tinham subido com ele a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:42,en:"And now when the even was come, because it was the preparation, that is, the day before the sabbath,",pt:"Ao cair da tarde, como era o dia da prepara\xe7\xe3o, isto \xe9, a v\xe9spera do s\xe1bado,"},{verse:43,en:"Joseph of Arimathaea, an honourable counsellor, which also waited for the kingdom of God, came, and went in boldly unto Pilate, and craved the body of Jesus.",pt:"Jos\xe9 de Arimat\xe9ia, ilustre membro do sin\xe9drio, que tamb\xe9m esperava o reino de Deus, cobrando \xe2nimo foi Pilatos e pediu o corpo de Jesus."},{verse:44,en:"And Pilate marvelled if he were already dead: and calling unto him the centurion, he asked him whether he had been any while dead.",pt:"Admirou-se Pilatos de que j\xe1 tivesse morrido; e chamando o centuri\xe3o, perguntou-lhe se, de fato, havia morrido."},{verse:45,en:"And when he knew it of the centurion, he gave the body to Joseph.",pt:"E, depois que o soube do centuri\xe3o, cedeu o cad\xe1ver a Jos\xe9;"},{verse:46,en:"And he bought fine linen, and took him down, and wrapped him in the linen, and laid him in a sepulchre which was hewn out of a rock, and rolled a stone unto the door of the sepulchre.",pt:"o qual, tendo comprado um pano de linho, tirou da cruz o corpo, envolveu-o no pano e o depositou num sepulcro aberto em rocha; e rolou uma pedra para a porta do sepulcro."},{verse:47,en:"And Mary Magdalene and Mary the mother of Joses beheld where he was laid.",pt:"E Maria Madalena e Maria, m\xe3e de Jos\xe9, observavam onde fora posto."}]}}),780,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Mark",bookPt:"Marcos",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And when the sabbath was past, Mary Magdalene, and Mary the mother of James, and Salome, had bought sweet spices, that they might come and anoint him.",pt:"Ora, passado o s\xe1bado, Maria Madalena, Maria, m\xe3e de Tiago, e Salom\xe9, compraram aromas para irem ungi-lo."},{verse:2,en:"And very early in the morning the first day of the week, they came unto the sepulchre at the rising of the sun.",pt:"E, no primeiro dia da semana, foram ao sepulcro muito cedo, ao levantar do sol."},{verse:3,en:"And they said among themselves, Who shall roll us away the stone from the door of the sepulchre?",pt:"E diziam umas \xe0s outras: Quem nos revolver\xe1 a pedra da porta do sepulcro?"},{verse:4,en:"And when they looked, they saw that the stone was rolled away: for it was very great.",pt:"Mas, levantando os olhos, notaram que a pedra, que era muito grande, j\xe1 estava revolvida;"},{verse:5,en:"And entering into the sepulchre, they saw a young man sitting on the right side, clothed in a long white garment; and they were affrighted.",pt:"e entrando no sepulcro, viram um mo\xe7o sentado \xe0 direita, vestido de alvo manto; e ficaram atemorizadas."},{verse:6,en:"And he saith unto them, Be not affrighted: Ye seek Jesus of Nazareth, which was crucified: he is risen; he is not here: behold the place where they laid him.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhes disse: N\xe3o vos atemorizeis; buscais a Jesus, o nazareno, que foi crucificado; ele ressurgiu; n\xe3o est\xe1 aqui; eis o lugar onde o puseram."},{verse:7,en:"But go your way, tell his disciples and Peter that he goeth before you into Galilee: there shall ye see him, as he said unto you.",pt:"Mas ide, dizei a seus disc\xedpulos, e a Pedro, que ele vai adiante de v\xf3s para a Galil\xe9ia; ali o vereis, como ele vos disse."},{verse:8,en:"And they went out quickly, and fled from the sepulchre; for they trembled and were amazed: neither said they any thing to any man; for they were afraid.",pt:"E, saindo elas, fugiram do sepulcro, porque estavam possu\xeddas de medo e assombro; e n\xe3o disseram nada a ningu\xe9m, porque temiam."},{verse:9,en:"Now when Jesus was risen early the first day of the week, he appeared first to Mary Magdalene, out of whom he had cast seven devils.",pt:"[Ora, havendo Jesus ressurgido cedo no primeiro dia da semana, apareceu primeiramente a Maria Madalena, da qual tinha expulsado sete dem\xf4nios."},{verse:10,en:"And she went and told them that had been with him, as they mourned and wept.",pt:"Foi ela anunci\xe1-lo aos que haviam andado com ele, os quais estavam tristes e chorando;"},{verse:11,en:"And they, when they had heard that he was alive, and had been seen of her, believed not.",pt:"e ouvindo eles que vivia, e que tinha sido visto por ela, n\xe3o o creram."},{verse:12,en:"After that he appeared in another form unto two of them, as they walked, and went into the country.",pt:"Depois disso manifestou-se sob outra forma a dois deles que iam de caminho para o campo,"},{verse:13,en:"And they went and told it unto the residue: neither believed they them.",pt:"os quais foram anunci\xe1-lo aos outros; mas nem a estes deram cr\xe9dito."},{verse:14,en:"Afterward he appeared unto the eleven as they sat at meat, and upbraided them with their unbelief and hardness of heart, because they believed not them which had seen him after he was risen.",pt:"Por \xfaltimo, ent\xe3o, apareceu aos onze, estando eles reclinados \xe0 mesa, e lan\xe7ou-lhes em rosto a sua incredulidade e dureza de cora\xe7\xe3o, por n\xe3o haverem dado cr\xe9dito aos que o tinham visto j\xe1 ressurgido."},{verse:15,en:"And he said unto them, Go ye into all the world, and preach the gospel to every creature.",pt:"E disse-lhes: Ide por todo o mundo, e pregai o evangelho a toda criatura."},{verse:16,en:"He that believeth and is baptized shall be saved; but he that believeth not shall be damned.",pt:"Quem crer e for batizado ser\xe1 salvo; mas quem n\xe3o crer ser\xe1 condenado."},{verse:17,en:"And these signs shall follow them that believe; In my name shall they cast out devils; they shall speak with new tongues;",pt:"E estes sinais acompanhar\xe3o aos que crerem: em meu nome expulsar\xe3o dem\xf4nios; falar\xe3o novas l\xednguas;"},{verse:18,en:"They shall take up serpents; and if they drink any deadly thing, it shall not hurt them; they shall lay hands on the sick, and they shall recover.",pt:"pegar\xe3o em serpentes; e se beberem alguma coisa mort\xedfera, n\xe3o lhes far\xe1 dano algum; e por\xe3o as m\xe3os sobre os enfermos, e estes ser\xe3o curados."},{verse:19,en:"So then after the Lord had spoken unto them, he was received up into heaven, and sat on the right hand of God.",pt:"Ora, o Senhor, depois de lhes ter falado, foi recebido no c\xe9u, e assentou-se \xe0 direita de Deus."},{verse:20,en:"And they went forth, and preached every where, the Lord working with them, and confirming the word with signs following. Amen.",pt:"Eles, pois, saindo, pregaram por toda parte, cooperando com eles o Senhor, e confirmando a palavra com os sinais que os acompanhavam.]"}]}}),781,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Forasmuch as many have taken in hand to set forth in order a declaration of those things which are most surely believed among us,",pt:"Visto que muitos t\xeam empreendido fazer uma narra\xe7\xe3o coordenada dos fatos que entre n\xf3s se realizaram,"},{verse:2,en:"Even as they delivered them unto us, which from the beginning were eyewitnesses, and ministers of the word;",pt:"segundo no-los transmitiram os que desde o princ\xedpio foram testemunhas oculares e ministros da palavra,"},{verse:3,en:"It seemed good to me also, having had perfect understanding of all things from the very first, to write unto thee in order, most excellent Theophilus,",pt:"tamb\xe9m a mim, depois de haver investido tudo cuidadosamente desde o come\xe7o, pareceu-me bem, \xf3 excelent\xedssimo Te\xf3filo, escrever-te uma narra\xe7\xe3o em ordem."},{verse:4,en:"That thou mightest know the certainty of those things, wherein thou hast been instructed.",pt:"para que conhe\xe7as plenamente a verdade das coisas em que foste instru\xeddo."},{verse:5,en:"There was in the days of Herod, the king of Judaea, a certain priest named Zacharias, of the course of Abia: and his wife was of the daughters of Aaron, and her name was Elisabeth.",pt:"Houve nos dias do Rei Herodes, rei da Jud\xe9ia, um sacerdote chamado Zacarias, da turma de Abias; e sua mulher era descendente de Ar\xe3o, e chamava-se Isabel."},{verse:6,en:"And they were both righteous before God, walking in all the commandments and ordinances of the Lord blameless.",pt:"Ambos eram justos diante de Deus, andando irrepreens\xedveis em todos os mandamentos e preceitos do Senhor."},{verse:7,en:"And they had no child, because that Elisabeth was barren, and they both were now well stricken in years.",pt:"Mas n\xe3o tinham filhos, porque Isabel era est\xe9ril, e ambos avan\xe7ados em idade."},{verse:8,en:"And it came to pass, that while he executed the priest\u2019s office before God in the order of his course,",pt:"Ora, estando ele a exercer as fun\xe7\xf5es sacerdotais perante Deus, na ordem da sua turma,"},{verse:9,en:"According to the custom of the priest\u2019s office, his lot was to burn incense when he went into the temple of the Lord.",pt:"segundo o costume do sacerd\xf3cio, coube-lhe por sorte entrar no santu\xe1rio do Senhor, para oferecer o incenso;"},{verse:10,en:"And the whole multitude of the people were praying without at the time of incense.",pt:"e toda a multid\xe3o do povo orava da parte de fora, \xe0 hora do incenso."},{verse:11,en:"And there appeared unto him an angel of the Lord standing on the right side of the altar of incense.",pt:"Apareceu-lhe, ent\xe3o, um anjo do Senhor, em p\xe9 \xe0 direita do altar do incenso."},{verse:12,en:"And when Zacharias saw him, he was troubled, and fear fell upon him.",pt:"E Zacarias, vendo-o, ficou turbado, e o temor o assaltou."},{verse:13,en:"But the angel said unto him, Fear not, Zacharias: for thy prayer is heard; and thy wife Elisabeth shall bear thee a son, and thou shalt call his name John.",pt:"Mas o anjo lhe disse: N\xe3o temais, Zacarias; porque a tua ora\xe7\xe3o foi ouvida, e Isabel, tua mulher, te dar\xe1 \xe0 luz um filho, e lhe por\xe1s o nome de Jo\xe3o;"},{verse:14,en:"And thou shalt have joy and gladness; and many shall rejoice at his birth.",pt:"e ter\xe1s alegria e regozijo, e muitos se alegrar\xe3o com o seu nascimento;"},{verse:15,en:"For he shall be great in the sight of the Lord, and shall drink neither wine nor strong drink; and he shall be filled with the Holy Ghost, even from his mother\u2019s womb.",pt:"porque ele ser\xe1 grande diante do Senhor; n\xe3o beber\xe1 vinho, nem bebida forte; e ser\xe1 cheio do Esp\xedrito Santo j\xe1 desde o ventre de sua m\xe3e;"},{verse:16,en:"And many of the children of Israel shall he turn to the Lord their God.",pt:"converter\xe1 muitos dos filhos de Israel ao Senhor seu Deus;"},{verse:17,en:"And he shall go before him in the spirit and power of Elias, to turn the hearts of the fathers to the children, and the disobedient to the wisdom of the just; to make ready a people prepared for the Lord.",pt:"ir\xe1 adiante dele no esp\xedrito e poder de Elias, para converter os cora\xe7\xf5es dos pais aos filhos, e os rebeldes \xe0 prud\xeancia dos justos, a fim de preparar para o Senhor um povo apercebido."},{verse:18,en:"And Zacharias said unto the angel, Whereby shall I know this? for I am an old man, and my wife well stricken in years.",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o Zacarias ao anjo: Como terei certeza disso? pois eu sou velho, e minha mulher tamb\xe9m est\xe1 avan\xe7ada em idade."},{verse:19,en:"And the angel answering said unto him, I am Gabriel, that stand in the presence of God; and am sent to speak unto thee, and to shew thee these glad tidings.",pt:"Ao que lhe respondeu o anjo: Eu sou Gabriel, que assisto diante de Deus, e fui enviado para te falar e te dar estas boas novas;"},{verse:20,en:"And, behold, thou shalt be dumb, and not able to speak, until the day that these things shall be performed, because thou believest not my words, which shall be fulfilled in their season.",pt:"e eis que ficar\xe1s mudo, e n\xe3o poder\xe1s falar at\xe9 o dia em que estas coisas aconte\xe7am; porquanto n\xe3o creste nas minhas palavras, que a seu tempo h\xe3o de cumprir-se."},{verse:21,en:"And the people waited for Zacharias, and marvelled that he tarried so long in the temple.",pt:"O povo estava esperando Zacarias, e se admirava da sua demora no santu\xe1rio."},{verse:22,en:"And when he came out, he could not speak unto them: and they perceived that he had seen a vision in the temple: for he beckoned unto them, and remained speechless.",pt:"Quando saiu, por\xe9m, n\xe3o lhes podia falar, e perceberam que tivera uma vis\xe3o no santu\xe1rio. E falava-lhes por acenos, mas permanecia mudo."},{verse:23,en:"And it came to pass, that, as soon as the days of his ministration were accomplished, he departed to his own house.",pt:"E, terminados os dias do seu minist\xe9rio, voltou para casa."},{verse:24,en:"And after those days his wife Elisabeth conceived, and hid herself five months, saying,",pt:"Depois desses dias Isabel, sua mulher, concebeu, e por cinco meses se ocultou, dizendo:"},{verse:25,en:"Thus hath the Lord dealt with me in the days wherein he looked on me, to take away my reproach among men.",pt:"Assim me fez o Senhor nos dias em que atentou para mim, a fim de acabar com o meu opr\xf3brio diante dos homens."},{verse:26,en:"And in the sixth month the angel Gabriel was sent from God unto a city of Galilee, named Nazareth,",pt:"Ora, no sexto m\xeas, foi o anjo Gabriel enviado por Deus a uma cidade da Galil\xe9ia, chamada Nazar\xe9,"},{verse:27,en:"To a virgin espoused to a man whose name was Joseph, of the house of David; and the virgin\u2019s name was Mary.",pt:"a uma virgem desposada com um var\xe3o cujo nome era Jos\xe9, da casa de Davi; e o nome da virgem era Maria."},{verse:28,en:"And the angel came in unto her, and said, Hail, thou that art highly favoured, the Lord is with thee: blessed art thou among women.",pt:"E, entrando o anjo onde ela estava disse: Salve, agraciada; o Senhor \xe9 contigo."},{verse:29,en:"And when she saw him, she was troubled at his saying, and cast in her mind what manner of salutation this should be.",pt:"Ela, por\xe9m, ao ouvir estas palavras, turbou-se muito e p\xf4s-se a pensar que sauda\xe7\xe3o seria essa."},{verse:30,en:"And the angel said unto her, Fear not, Mary: for thou hast found favour with God.",pt:"Disse-lhe ent\xe3o o anjo: N\xe3o temas, Maria; pois achaste gra\xe7a diante de Deus."},{verse:31,en:"And, behold, thou shalt conceive in thy womb, and bring forth a son, and shalt call his name JESUS.",pt:"Eis que conceber\xe1s e dar\xe1s \xe0 luz um filho, ao qual por\xe1s o nome de Jesus."},{verse:32,en:"He shall be great, and shall be called the Son of the Highest: and the Lord God shall give unto him the throne of his father David:",pt:"Este ser\xe1 grande e ser\xe1 chamado filho do Alt\xedssimo; o Senhor Deus lhe dar\xe1 o trono de Davi seu pai;"},{verse:33,en:"And he shall reign over the house of Jacob for ever; and of his kingdom there shall be no end.",pt:"e reinar\xe1 eternamente sobre a casa de Jac\xf3, e o seu reino n\xe3o ter\xe1 fim."},{verse:34,en:"Then said Mary unto the angel, How shall this be, seeing I know not a man?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Maria perguntou ao anjo: Como se far\xe1 isso, uma vez que n\xe3o conhe\xe7o var\xe3o?"},{verse:35,en:"And the angel answered and said unto her, The Holy Ghost shall come upon thee, and the power of the Highest shall overshadow thee: therefore also that holy thing which shall be born of thee shall be called the Son of God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe o anjo: Vir\xe1 sobre ti o Esp\xedrito Santo, e o poder do Alt\xedssimo te cobrir\xe1 com a sua sombra; por isso o que h\xe1 de nascer ser\xe1 chamado santo, Filho de Deus."},{verse:36,en:"And, behold, thy cousin Elisabeth, she hath also conceived a son in her old age: and this is the sixth month with her, who was called barren.",pt:"Eis que tamb\xe9m Isabel, tua parenta concebeu um filho em sua velhice; e \xe9 este o sexto m\xeas para aquela que era chamada est\xe9ril;"},{verse:37,en:"For with God nothing shall be impossible.",pt:"porque para Deus nada ser\xe1 imposs\xedvel."},{verse:38,en:"And Mary said, Behold the handmaid of the Lord; be it unto me according to thy word. And the angel departed from her.",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o Maria. Eis aqui a serva do Senhor; cumpra-se em mim segundo a tua palavra. E o anjo ausentou-se dela."},{verse:39,en:"And Mary arose in those days, and went into the hill country with haste, into a city of Juda;",pt:"Naqueles dias levantou-se Maria, foi apressadamente \xe0 regi\xe3o montanhosa, a uma cidade de Jud\xe1,"},{verse:40,en:"And entered into the house of Zacharias, and saluted Elisabeth.",pt:"entrou em casa de Zacarias e saudou a Isabel."},{verse:41,en:"And it came to pass, that, when Elisabeth heard the salutation of Mary, the babe leaped in her womb; and Elisabeth was filled with the Holy Ghost:",pt:"Ao ouvir Isabel a sauda\xe7\xe3o de Maria, saltou a criancinha no seu ventre, e Isabel ficou cheia do Esp\xedrito Santo,"},{verse:42,en:"And she spake out with a loud voice, and said, Blessed art thou among women, and blessed is the fruit of thy womb.",pt:"e exclamou em alta voz: Bendita \xe9s tu entre as mulheres, e bendito \xe9 o fruto do teu ventre!"},{verse:43,en:"And whence is this to me, that the mother of my Lord should come to me?",pt:"E donde me prov\xe9m isto, que venha visitar-me a m\xe3e do meu Senhor?"},{verse:44,en:"For, lo, as soon as the voice of thy salutation sounded in mine ears, the babe leaped in my womb for joy.",pt:"Pois logo que me soou aos ouvidos a voz da tua sauda\xe7\xe3o, a criancinha saltou de alegria dentro de mim."},{verse:45,en:"And blessed is she that believed: for there shall be a performance of those things which were told her from the Lord.",pt:"Bem-aventurada aquela que creu que se h\xe3o de cumprir as coisas que da parte do Senhor lhe foram ditas."},{verse:46,en:"And Mary said, My soul doth magnify the Lord,",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o Maria: A minha alma engrandece ao Senhor,"},{verse:47,en:"And my spirit hath rejoiced in God my Saviour.",pt:"e o meu esp\xedrito exulta em Deus meu Salvador;"},{verse:48,en:"For he hath regarded the low estate of his handmaiden: for, behold, from henceforth all generations shall call me blessed.",pt:"porque atentou na condi\xe7\xe3o humilde de sua serva. Desde agora, pois, todas as gera\xe7\xf5es me chamar\xe3o bem-aventurada,"},{verse:49,en:"For he that is mighty hath done to me great things; and holy is his name.",pt:"porque o Poderoso me fez grandes coisas; e santo \xe9 o seu nome."},{verse:50,en:"And his mercy is on them that fear him from generation to generation.",pt:"E a sua miseric\xf3rdia vai de gera\xe7\xe3o em gera\xe7\xe3o sobre os que o temem."},{verse:51,en:"He hath shewed strength with his arm; he hath scattered the proud in the imagination of their hearts.",pt:"Com o seu bra\xe7o manifestou poder; dissipou os que eram soberbos nos pensamentos de seus cora\xe7\xf5es;"},{verse:52,en:"He hath put down the mighty from their seats, and exalted them of low degree.",pt:"dep\xf4s dos tronos os poderosos, e elevou os humildes."},{verse:53,en:"He hath filled the hungry with good things; and the rich he hath sent empty away.",pt:"Aos famintos encheu de bens, e vazios despediu os ricos."},{verse:54,en:"He hath holpen his servant Israel, in remembrance of his mercy;",pt:"Auxiliou a Isabel, seu servo, lembrando-se de miseric\xf3rdia"},{verse:55,en:"As he spake to our fathers, to Abraham, and to his seed for ever.",pt:"(como falou a nossos pais) para com Abra\xe3o e a sua descend\xeancia para sempre."},{verse:56,en:"And Mary abode with her about three months, and returned to her own house.",pt:"E Maria ficou com ela cerca de tr\xeas meses; e depois voltou para sua casa."},{verse:57,en:"Now Elisabeth\u2019s full time came that she should be delivered; and she brought forth a son.",pt:"Ora, completou-se para Isabel o tempo de dar \xe0 luz, e teve um filho."},{verse:58,en:"And her neighbours and her cousins heard how the Lord had shewed great mercy upon her; and they rejoiced with her.",pt:"Ouviram seus vizinhos e parentes que o Senhor lhe multiplicara a sua miseric\xf3rdia, e se alegravam com ela."},{verse:59,en:"And it came to pass, that on the eighth day they came to circumcise the child; and they called him Zacharias, after the name of his father.",pt:"Sucedeu, pois, no oitavo dia, que vieram circuncidar o menino; e queriam dar-lhe o nome de seu pai, Zacarias."},{verse:60,en:"And his mother answered and said, Not so; but he shall be called John.",pt:"Respondeu, por\xe9m, sua m\xe3e: De modo nenhum, mas ser\xe1 chamado Jo\xe3o."},{verse:61,en:"And they said unto her, There is none of thy kindred that is called by this name.",pt:"Ao que lhe disseram: Ningu\xe9m h\xe1 na tua parentela que se chame por este nome."},{verse:62,en:"And they made signs to his father, how he would have him called.",pt:"E perguntaram por acenos ao pai como queria que se chamasse."},{verse:63,en:"And he asked for a writing table, and wrote, saying, His name is John. And they marvelled all.",pt:"E pedindo ele uma tabuinha, escreveu: Seu nome \xe9 Jo\xe3o. E todos se admiraram."},{verse:64,en:"And his mouth was opened immediately, and his tongue loosed, and he spake, and praised God.",pt:"Imediatamente a boca se lhe abriu, e a l\xedngua se lhe soltou; louvando a Deus."},{verse:65,en:"And fear came on all that dwelt round about them: and all these sayings were noised abroad throughout all the hill country of Judaea.",pt:"Ent\xe3o veio temor sobre todos os seus vizinhos; e em toda a regi\xe3o montanhosa da Jud\xe9ia foram divulgadas todas estas coisas."},{verse:66,en:"And all they that heard them laid them up in their hearts, saying, What manner of child shall this be! And the hand of the Lord was with him.",pt:"E todos os que delas souberam as guardavam no cora\xe7\xe3o, dizendo: Que vir\xe1 a ser, ent\xe3o, este menino? Pois a m\xe3o do Senhor estava com ele."},{verse:67,en:"And his father Zacharias was filled with the Holy Ghost, and prophesied, saying,",pt:"Zacarias, seu pai, ficou cheio do Esp\xedrito Santo e profetizou, dizendo:"},{verse:68,en:"Blessed be the Lord God of Israel; for he hath visited and redeemed his people,",pt:"Bendito, seja o Senhor Deus de Israel, porque visitou e remiu o seu povo,"},{verse:69,en:"And hath raised up an horn of salvation for us in the house of his servant David;",pt:"e para n\xf3s fez surgir uma salva\xe7\xe3o poderosa na casa de Davi, seu servo;"},{verse:70,en:"As he spake by the mouth of his holy prophets, which have been since the world began:",pt:"assim como desde os tempos antigos tem anunciado pela boca dos seus santos profetas;"},{verse:71,en:"That we should be saved from our enemies, and from the hand of all that hate us;",pt:"para nos livrar dos nossos inimigos e da m\xe3o de todos os que nos odeiam;"},{verse:72,en:"To perform the mercy promised to our fathers, and to remember his holy covenant;",pt:"para usar de miseric\xf3rdia com nossos pais, e lembrar-se do seu santo pacto"},{verse:73,en:"The oath which he sware to our father Abraham,",pt:"e do juramento que fez a Abr\xe3o, nosso pai,"},{verse:74,en:"That he would grant unto us, that we being delivered out of the hand of our enemies might serve him without fear,",pt:"de conceder-nos que, libertados da m\xe3o de nossos inimigos, o serv\xedssemos sem temor,"},{verse:75,en:"In holiness and righteousness before him, all the days of our life.",pt:"em santidade e justi\xe7a perante ele, todos os dias da nossa vida."},{verse:76,en:"And thou, child, shalt be called the prophet of the Highest: for thou shalt go before the face of the Lord to prepare his ways;",pt:"E tu, menino, ser\xe1s chamado profeta do Alt\xedssimo, porque ir\xe1s ante a face do Senhor, a preparar os seus caminhos;"},{verse:77,en:"To give knowledge of salvation unto his people by the remission of their sins,",pt:"para dar ao seu povo conhecimento da salva\xe7\xe3o, na remiss\xe3o dos seus pecados,"},{verse:78,en:"Through the tender mercy of our God; whereby the dayspring from on high hath visited us,",pt:"gra\xe7as \xe0 entrenh\xe1vel miseric\xf3rdia do nosso Deus, pela qual nos h\xe1 de visitar a aurora l\xe1 do alto,"},{verse:79,en:"To give light to them that sit in darkness and in the shadow of death, to guide our feet into the way of peace.",pt:"para alumiar aos que jazem nas trevas e na sombra da morte, a fim de dirigir os nossos p\xe9s no caminho da paz."},{verse:80,en:"And the child grew, and waxed strong in spirit, and was in the deserts till the day of his shewing unto Israel.",pt:"Ora, o menino crescia, e se robustecia em esp\xedrito; e habitava nos desertos at\xe9 o dia da sua manifesta\xe7\xe3o a Israel."}]}}),782,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass in those days, that there went out a decree from Caesar Augustus, that all the world should be taxed.",pt:"Naqueles dias saiu um decreto da parte de C\xe9sar Augusto, para que todo o mundo fosse recenseado."},{verse:2,en:"(And this taxing was first made when Cyrenius was governor of Syria.)",pt:"Este primeiro recenseamento foi feito quando Quir\xednio era governador da S\xedria."},{verse:3,en:"And all went to be taxed, every one into his own city.",pt:"E todos iam alistar-se, cada um \xe0 sua pr\xf3pria cidade."},{verse:4,en:"And Joseph also went up from Galilee, out of the city of Nazareth, into Judaea, unto the city of David, which is called Bethlehem; (because he was of the house and lineage of David:)",pt:"Subiu tamb\xe9m Jos\xe9, da Galil\xe9ia, da cidade de Nazar\xe9, \xe0 cidade de Davi, chamada Bel\xe9m, porque era da casa e fam\xedlia de Davi,"},{verse:5,en:"To be taxed with Mary his espoused wife, being great with child.",pt:"a fim de alistar-se com Maria, sua esposa, que estava gr\xe1vida."},{verse:6,en:"And so it was, that, while they were there, the days were accomplished that she should be delivered.",pt:"Enquanto estavam ali, chegou o tempo em que ela havia de dar \xe0 luz,"},{verse:7,en:"And she brought forth her firstborn son, and wrapped him in swaddling clothes, and laid him in a manger; because there was no room for them in the inn.",pt:"e teve a seu filho primog\xeanito; envolveu-o em faixas e o deitou em uma manjedoura, porque n\xe3o havia lugar para eles na estalagem."},{verse:8,en:"And there were in the same country shepherds abiding in the field, keeping watch over their flock by night.",pt:"Ora, havia naquela mesma regi\xe3o pastores que estavam no campo, e guardavam durante as vig\xedlias da noite o seu rebanho."},{verse:9,en:"And, lo, the angel of the Lord came upon them, and the glory of the Lord shone round about them: and they were sore afraid.",pt:"E um anjo do Senhor apareceu-lhes, e a gl\xf3ria do Senhor os cercou de resplendor; pelo que se encheram de grande temor."},{verse:10,en:"And the angel said unto them, Fear not: for, behold, I bring you good tidings of great joy, which shall be to all people.",pt:"O anjo, por\xe9m, lhes disse: N\xe3o temais, porquanto vos trago novas de grande alegria que o ser\xe1 para todo o povo:"},{verse:11,en:"For unto you is born this day in the city of David a Saviour, which is Christ the Lord.",pt:"\xc9 que vos nasceu hoje, na cidade de Davi, o Salvador, que \xe9 Cristo, o Senhor."},{verse:12,en:"And this shall be a sign unto you; Ye shall find the babe wrapped in swaddling clothes, lying in a manger.",pt:"E isto vos ser\xe1 por sinal: Achareis um menino envolto em faixas, e deitado em uma manjedoura."},{verse:13,en:"And suddenly there was with the angel a multitude of the heavenly host praising God, and saying,",pt:"Ent\xe3o, de repente, apareceu junto ao anjo grande multid\xe3o da mil\xedcia celestial, louvando a Deus e dizendo:"},{verse:14,en:"Glory to God in the highest, and on earth peace, good will toward men.",pt:"Gl\xf3ria a Deus nas maiores alturas, e paz na terra entre os homens de boa vontade."},{verse:15,en:"And it came to pass, as the angels were gone away from them into heaven, the shepherds said one to another, Let us now go even unto Bethlehem, and see this thing which is come to pass, which the Lord hath made known unto us.",pt:"E logo que os anjos se retiraram deles para o c\xe9u, diziam os pastores uns aos outros: Vamos j\xe1 at\xe9 Bel\xe9m, e vejamos isso que aconteceu e que o Senhor nos deu a conhecer."},{verse:16,en:"And they came with haste, and found Mary, and Joseph, and the babe lying in a manger.",pt:"Foram, pois, a toda a pressa, e acharam Maria e Jos\xe9, e o menino deitado na manjedoura;"},{verse:17,en:"And when they had seen it, they made known abroad the saying which was told them concerning this child.",pt:"e, vendo-o, divulgaram a palavra que acerca do menino lhes fora dita;"},{verse:18,en:"And all they that heard it wondered at those things which were told them by the shepherds.",pt:"e todos os que a ouviram se admiravam do que os pastores lhes diziam."},{verse:19,en:"But Mary kept all these things, and pondered them in her heart.",pt:"Maria, por\xe9m, guardava todas estas coisas, meditando-as em seu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"And the shepherds returned, glorifying and praising God for all the things that they had heard and seen, as it was told unto them.",pt:"E voltaram os pastores, glorificando e louvando a Deus por tudo o que tinham ouvido e visto, como lhes fora dito."},{verse:21,en:"And when eight days were accomplished for the circumcising of the child, his name was called JESUS, which was so named of the angel before he was conceived in the womb.",pt:"Quando se completaram os oito dias para ser circuncidado o menino, foi-lhe dado o nome de Jesus, que pelo anjo lhe fora posto antes de ser concebido."},{verse:22,en:"And when the days of her purification according to the law of Moses were accomplished, they brought him to Jerusalem, to present him to the Lord;",pt:"Terminados os dias da purifica\xe7\xe3o, segundo a lei de Mois\xe9s, levaram-no a Jerusal\xe9m, para apresent\xe1-lo ao Senhor"},{verse:23,en:"(As it is written in the law of the Lord, Every male that openeth the womb shall be called holy to the Lord;)",pt:"(conforme est\xe1 escrito na lei do Senhor: Todo primog\xeanito ser\xe1 consagrado ao Senhor),"},{verse:24,en:"And to offer a sacrifice according to that which is said in the law of the Lord, A pair of turtledoves, or two young pigeons.",pt:"e para oferecerem um sacrif\xedcio segundo o disposto na lei do Senhor: um par de rolas, ou dois pombinhos."},{verse:25,en:"And, behold, there was a man in Jerusalem, whose name was Simeon; and the same man was just and devout, waiting for the consolation of Israel: and the Holy Ghost was upon him.",pt:"Ora, havia em Jerusal\xe9m um homem cujo nome era Sime\xe3o; e este homem, justo e temente a Deus, esperava a consola\xe7\xe3o de Israel; e o Esp\xedrito Santo estava sobre ele."},{verse:26,en:"And it was revealed unto him by the Holy Ghost, that he should not see death, before he had seen the Lord\u2019s Christ.",pt:"E lhe fora revelado pelo Esp\xedrito Santo que ele n\xe3o morreria antes de ver o Cristo do Senhor."},{verse:27,en:"And he came by the Spirit into the temple: and when the parents brought in the child Jesus, to do for him after the custom of the law,",pt:"Assim pelo Esp\xedrito foi ao templo; e quando os pais trouxeram o menino Jesus, para fazerem por ele segundo o costume da lei,"},{verse:28,en:"Then took he him up in his arms, and blessed God, and said,",pt:"Sime\xe3o o tomou em seus bra\xe7os, e louvou a Deus, e disse:"},{verse:29,en:"Lord, now lettest thou thy servant depart in peace, according to thy word:",pt:"Agora, Senhor, despedes em paz o teu servo, segundo a tua palavra;"},{verse:30,en:"For mine eyes have seen thy salvation,",pt:"pois os meus olhos j\xe1 viram a tua salva\xe7\xe3o,"},{verse:31,en:"Which thou hast prepared before the face of all people;",pt:"a qual tu preparaste ante a face de todos os povos;"},{verse:32,en:"A light to lighten the Gentiles, and the glory of thy people Israel.",pt:"luz para revela\xe7\xe3o aos gentios, e para gl\xf3ria do teu povo Israel."},{verse:33,en:"And Joseph and his mother marvelled at those things which were spoken of him.",pt:"Enquanto isso, seu pai e sua m\xe3e se admiravam das coisas que deles se diziam."},{verse:34,en:"And Simeon blessed them, and said unto Mary his mother, Behold, this child is set for the fall and rising again of many in Israel; and for a sign which shall be spoken against;",pt:"E Sime\xe3o os aben\xe7oou, e disse a Maria, m\xe3e do menino: Eis que este \xe9 posto para queda e para levantamento de muitos em Israel, e para ser alvo de contradi\xe7\xe3o,"},{verse:35,en:"(Yea, a sword shall pierce through thy own soul also,) that the thoughts of many hearts may be revealed.",pt:"sim, e uma espada traspassar\xe1 a tua pr\xf3pria alma, para que se manifestem os pensamentos de muitos cora\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:36,en:"And there was one Anna, a prophetess, the daughter of Phanuel, of the tribe of Aser: she was of a great age, and had lived with an husband seven years from her virginity;",pt:"Havia tamb\xe9m uma profetisa, Ana, filha de Fanuel, da tribo de Aser. Era j\xe1 avan\xe7ada em idade, tendo vivido com o marido sete anos desde a sua virgindade;"},{verse:37,en:"And she was a widow of about fourscore and four years, which departed not from the temple, but served God with fastings and prayers night and day.",pt:"e era vi\xfava, de quase oitenta e quatro anos. N\xe3o se afastava do templo, servindo a Deus noite e dia em jejuns e ora\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:38,en:"And she coming in that instant gave thanks likewise unto the Lord, and spake of him to all them that looked for redemption in Jerusalem.",pt:"Chegando ela na mesma hora, deu gra\xe7as a Deus, e falou a respeito do menino a todos os que esperavam a reden\xe7\xe3o de Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:39,en:"And when they had performed all things according to the law of the Lord, they returned into Galilee, to their own city Nazareth.",pt:"Assim que cumpriram tudo segundo a lei do Senhor, voltaram \xe0 Galil\xe9ia, para sua cidade de Nazar\xe9."},{verse:40,en:"And the child grew, and waxed strong in spirit, filled with wisdom: and the grace of God was upon him.",pt:"E o menino ia crescendo e fortalecendo-se, ficando cheio de sabedoria; e a gra\xe7a de Deus estava sobre ele."},{verse:41,en:"Now his parents went to Jerusalem every year at the feast of the passover.",pt:"Ora, seus pais iam todos os anos a Jerusal\xe9m, \xe0 festa da p\xe1scoa."},{verse:42,en:"And when he was twelve years old, they went up to Jerusalem after the custom of the feast.",pt:"Quando Jesus completou doze anos, subiram eles segundo o costume da festa;"},{verse:43,en:"And when they had fulfilled the days, as they returned, the child Jesus tarried behind in Jerusalem; and Joseph and his mother knew not of it.",pt:"e, terminados aqueles dias, ao regressarem, ficou o menino Jesus em Jerusal\xe9m sem o saberem seus pais;"},{verse:44,en:"But they, supposing him to have been in the company, went a day\u2019s journey; and they sought him among their kinsfolk and acquaintance.",pt:"julgando, por\xe9m, que estivesse entre os companheiros de viagem, andaram caminho de um dia, e o procuravam entre os parentes e conhecidos;"},{verse:45,en:"And when they found him not, they turned back again to Jerusalem, seeking him.",pt:"e n\xe3o o achando, voltaram a Jerusal\xe9m em busca dele."},{verse:46,en:"And it came to pass, that after three days they found him in the temple, sitting in the midst of the doctors, both hearing them, and asking them questions.",pt:"E aconteceu que, passados tr\xeas dias, o acharam no templo, sentado no meio dos doutores, ouvindo-os, e interrogando-os."},{verse:47,en:"And all that heard him were astonished at his understanding and answers.",pt:"E todos os que o ouviam se admiravam da sua intelig\xeancia e das suas respostas."},{verse:48,en:"And when they saw him, they were amazed: and his mother said unto him, Son, why hast thou thus dealt with us? behold, thy father and I have sought thee sorrowing.",pt:"Quando o viram, ficaram maravilhados, e disse-lhe sua m\xe3e: Filho, por que procedeste assim para conosco? Eis que teu pai e eu ansiosos te procur\xe1vamos."},{verse:49,en:"And he said unto them, How is it that ye sought me? wist ye not that I must be about my Father\u2019s business?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes ele: Por que me procur\xe1veis? N\xe3o sab\xedeis que eu devia estar na casa de meu Pai?"},{verse:50,en:"And they understood not the saying which he spake unto them.",pt:"Eles, por\xe9m, n\xe3o entenderam as palavras que lhes dissera."},{verse:51,en:"And he went down with them, and came to Nazareth, and was subject unto them: but his mother kept all these sayings in her heart.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, descendo com eles, foi para Nazar\xe9, e era-lhes sujeito. E sua m\xe3e guardava todas estas coisas em seu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:52,en:"And Jesus increased in wisdom and stature, and in favour with God and man.",pt:"E crescia Jesus em sabedoria, em estatura e em gra\xe7a diante de Deus e dos homens."}]}}),783,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,h,i){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now in the fifteenth year of the reign of Tiberius Caesar, Pontius Pilate being governor of Judaea, and Herod being tetrarch of Galilee, and his brother Philip tetrarch of Ituraea and of the region of Trachonitis, and Lysanias the tetrarch of Abilene,",pt:"No d\xe9cimo quinto ano do reinado de Tib\xe9rio C\xe9sar, sendo P\xf4ncio Pilatos governador da Jud\xe9ia, Herodes tetrarca da Galil\xe9ia, seu irm\xe3o Filipe tetrarca da regi\xe3o da Itur\xe9ia e de Traconites, e Lis\xe2nias tetrarca de Abilene,"},{verse:2,en:"Annas and Caiaphas being the high priests, the word of God came unto John the son of Zacharias in the wilderness.",pt:"sendo An\xe1s e Caif\xe1s sumos sacerdotes, veio a palavra de Deus a Jo\xe3o, filho de Zacarias, no deserto."},{verse:3,en:"And he came into all the country about Jordan, preaching the baptism of repentance for the remission of sins;",pt:"E ele percorreu toda a circunvizinhan\xe7a do Jord\xe3o, pregando o batismo de arrependimento para remiss\xe3o de pecados;"},{verse:4,en:"As it is written in the book of the words of Esaias the prophet, saying, The voice of one crying in the wilderness, Prepare ye the way of the Lord, make his paths straight.",pt:"como est\xe1 escrito no livro das palavras do profeta Isa\xedas: Voz do que clama no deserto: Preparai o caminho do Senhor; endireitai as suas veredas."},{verse:5,en:"Every valley shall be filled, and every mountain and hill shall be brought low; and the crooked shall be made straight, and the rough ways shall be made smooth;",pt:"Todo vale se encher\xe1, e se abaixar\xe1 todo monte e outeiro; o que \xe9 tortuoso se endireitar\xe1, e os caminhos escabrosos se aplanar\xe3o;"},{verse:6,en:"And all flesh shall see the salvation of God.",pt:"e toda a carne ver\xe1 a salva\xe7\xe3o de Deus."},{verse:7,en:"Then said he to the multitude that came forth to be baptized of him, O generation of vipers, who hath warned you to flee from the wrath to come?",pt:"Jo\xe3o dizia, pois, \xe0s multid\xf5es que sa\xedam para ser batizadas por ele: Ra\xe7a de v\xedboras, quem vos ensina a fugir da ira vindoura?"},{verse:8,en:"Bring forth therefore fruits worthy of repentance, and begin not to say within yourselves, We have Abraham to our father: for I say unto you, That God is able of these stones to raise up children unto Abraham.",pt:"Produzi, pois, frutos dignos de arrependimento; e n\xe3o comeceis a dizer em v\xf3s mesmos: Temos por pai a Abr\xe3o; porque eu vos digo que at\xe9 destas pedras Deus pode suscitar filhos a Abr\xe3o."},{verse:9,en:"And now also the axe is laid unto the root of the trees: every tree therefore which bringeth not forth good fruit is hewn down, and cast into the fire.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m j\xe1 est\xe1 posto o machado \xe0 raiz das \xe1rvores; toda \xe1rvore, pois, que n\xe3o produz bom fruto, \xe9 cortada e lan\xe7ada no fogo."},{verse:10,en:"And the people asked him, saying, What shall we do then?",pt:"Ao que lhe perguntavam as multid\xf5es: Que faremos, pois?"},{verse:11,en:"He answereth and saith unto them, He that hath two coats, let him impart to him that hath none; and he that hath meat, let him do likewise.",pt:"Respondia-lhes ent\xe3o: Aquele que tem duas t\xfanicas, reparta com o que n\xe3o tem nenhuma, e aquele que tem alimentos, fa\xe7a o mesmo."},{verse:12,en:"Then came also publicans to be baptized, and said unto him, Master, what shall we do?",pt:"Chegaram tamb\xe9m uns publicanos para serem batizados, e perguntaram-lhe: Mestre, que havemos n\xf3s de fazer?"},{verse:13,en:"And he said unto them, Exact no more than that which is appointed you.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes ele: N\xe3o cobreis al\xe9m daquilo que vos foi prescrito."},{verse:14,en:"And the soldiers likewise demanded of him, saying, And what shall we do? And he said unto them, Do violence to no man, neither accuse any falsely; and be content with your wages.",pt:"Interrogaram-no tamb\xe9m uns soldados: E n\xf3s, que faremos? Disse-lhes: A ningu\xe9m queirais extorquir coisa alguma; nem deis den\xfancia falsa; e contentai-vos com o vosso soldo."},{verse:15,en:"And as the people were in expectation, and all men mused in their hearts of John, whether he were the Christ, or not;",pt:"Ora, estando o povo em expectativa e arrazoando todos em seus cora\xe7\xf5es a respeito de Jo\xe3o, se porventura seria ele o Cristo,"},{verse:16,en:"John answered, saying unto them all, I indeed baptize you with water; but one mightier than I cometh, the latchet of whose shoes I am not worthy to unloose: he shall baptize you with the Holy Ghost and with fire:",pt:"respondeu Jo\xe3o a todos, dizendo: Eu, na verdade, vos batizo em \xe1gua, mas vem aquele que \xe9 mais poderoso do que eu, de quem n\xe3o sou digno de desatar a correia das alparcas; ele vos batizar\xe1 no Esp\xedrito Santo e em fogo."},{verse:17,en:"Whose fan is in his hand, and he will throughly purge his floor, and will gather the wheat into his garner; but the chaff he will burn with fire unquenchable.",pt:"A sua p\xe1 ele tem na m\xe3o para limpar bem a sua eira, e recolher o trigo ao seu celeiro; mas queimar\xe1 a palha em fogo inextingu\xedvel."},{verse:18,en:"And many other things in his exhortation preached he unto the people.",pt:"Assim pois, com muitas outras exorta\xe7\xf5es ainda, anunciava o evangelho ao povo."},{verse:19,en:"But Herod the tetrarch, being reproved by him for Herodias his brother Philip\u2019s wife, and for all the evils which Herod had done,",pt:"Mas o tetrarca Herodes, sendo repreendido por ele por causa de Herodias, mulher de seu irm\xe3o, e por todas as maldades que havia feito,"},{verse:20,en:"Added yet this above all, that he shut up John in prison.",pt:"acrescentou a todas elas ainda esta, a de encerrar Jo\xe3o no c\xe1rcere."},{verse:21,en:"Now when all the people were baptized, it came to pass, that Jesus also being baptized, and praying, the heaven was opened,",pt:"Quando todo o povo fora batizado, tendo sido Jesus tamb\xe9m batizado, e estando ele a orar, o c\xe9u se abriu;"},{verse:22,en:"And the Holy Ghost descended in a bodily shape like a dove upon him, and a voice came from heaven, which said, Thou art my beloved Son; in thee I am well pleased.",pt:"e o Esp\xedrito Santo desceu sobre ele em forma corp\xf3rea, como uma pomba; e ouviu-se do c\xe9u esta voz: Tu \xe9s o meu Filho amado; em ti me comprazo."},{verse:23,en:"And Jesus himself began to be about thirty years of age, being (as was supposed) the son of Joseph, which was the son of Heli,",pt:"Ora, Jesus, ao come\xe7ar o seu minist\xe9rio, tinha cerca de trinta anos; sendo (como se cuidava) filho de Jos\xe9, filho de Eli;"},{verse:24,en:"Which was the son of Matthat, which was the son of Levi, which was the son of Melchi, which was the son of Janna, which was the son of Joseph,",pt:"Eli de Matate, Matate de Levi, Levi de Melqui, Melqui de Janai, Janai de Jos\xe9,"},{verse:25,en:"Which was the son of Mattathias, which was the son of Amos, which was the son of Naum, which was the son of Esli, which was the son of Nagge,",pt:"Jos\xe9 de Matatias, Matatias de Am\xf3s, Am\xf3s de Naum, Naum de Esli, Esli de Nagai,"},{verse:26,en:"Which was the son of Maath, which was the son of Mattathias, which was the son of Semei, which was the son of Joseph, which was the son of Juda,",pt:"Nagai de Maate, Maate de Matatias, Matatias de Semei, Semei de Joseque, Joseque de Jod\xe1,"},{verse:27,en:"Which was the son of Joanna, which was the son of Rhesa, which was the son of Zorobabel, which was the son of Salathiel, which was the son of Neri,",pt:"Jod\xe1 de Joan\xe3, Joan\xe3 de Resa, Resa de Zorobabel, Zorobabel de Salatiel, Salatiel de Neri,"},{verse:28,en:"Which was the son of Melchi, which was the son of Addi, which was the son of Cosam, which was the son of Elmodam, which was the son of Er,",pt:"Neri de Melqui, Melqui de Adi, Adi de Cos\xe3o, Cos\xe3o de Elmod\xe3, Elmod\xe3o de Er,"},{verse:29,en:"Which was the son of Jose, which was the son of Eliezer, which was the son of Jorim, which was the son of Matthat, which was the son of Levi,",pt:"Er de Josu\xe9, Josu\xe9 de Eli\xe9zer, Eli\xe9zer de Jorim, Jorim de Matate, Matate de Levi,"},{verse:30,en:"Which was the son of Simeon, which was the son of Juda, which was the son of Joseph, which was the son of Jonan, which was the son of Eliakim,",pt:"Levi de Sime\xe3o, Sime\xe3o de Jud\xe1, Jud\xe1 de Jos\xe9, Jos\xe9 de Jon\xe3, Jon\xe3 de Eliaquim,"},{verse:31,en:"Which was the son of Melea, which was the son of Menan, which was the son of Mattatha, which was the son of Nathan, which was the son of David,",pt:"Eliaquim de Mele\xe1, Mele\xe1 de Men\xe1, Men\xe1 de Matat\xe1, Matat\xe1 de Nat\xe3, Nat\xe3 de Davi,"},{verse:32,en:"Which was the son of Jesse, which was the son of Obed, which was the son of Booz, which was the son of Salmon, which was the son of Naasson,",pt:"Davi de Jess\xe9, Jess\xe9 de Obede, Obede de Boaz, Boaz de Sal\xe1, Sal\xe1 de Nasom,"},{verse:33,en:"Which was the son of Aminadab, which was the son of Aram, which was the son of Esrom, which was the son of Phares, which was the son of Juda,",pt:"Nasom de Aminadabe, Aminadabe de Admim, Admim de Arni, Arni de Esrom, Esrom de Far\xe9s, Far\xe9s de Jud\xe1,"},{verse:34,en:"Which was the son of Jacob, which was the son of Isaac, which was the son of Abraham, which was the son of Thara, which was the son of Nachor,",pt:"Jud\xe1 de Jac\xf3, Jac\xf3 de Isaque, Isaque de Abra\xe3o, Abra\xe3o de Tar\xe1, Tar\xe1 de Naor,"},{verse:35,en:"Which was the son of Saruch, which was the son of Ragau, which was the son of Phalec, which was the son of Heber, which was the son of Sala,",pt:"Naor de Seruque, Seruque de Raga\xfa, Raga\xfa de Faleque, Faleque de Eber, Eber de Sal\xe1,"},{verse:36,en:"Which was the son of Cainan, which was the son of Arphaxad, which was the son of Sem, which was the son of Noe, which was the son of Lamech,",pt:"Sal\xe1 de Cain\xe3, Cain\xe3 de Arfaxade, Arfaxade de Sem, Sem de No\xe9, No\xe9 de Lameque,"},{verse:37,en:"Which was the son of Mathusala, which was the son of Enoch, which was the son of Jared, which was the son of Maleleel, which was the son of Cainan,",pt:"Lameque de Matusal\xe9m, Matusal\xe9m de Enoque, Enoque de Jarede, Jarede de Maleleel, Maleleel de Cain\xe3,"},{verse:38,en:"Which was the son of Enos, which was the son of Seth, which was the son of Adam, which was the son of God.",pt:"Cain\xe3 de Enos, Enos de Sete, Sete de Ad\xe3o, e Ad\xe3o de Deus."}]}}),784,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And Jesus being full of the Holy Ghost returned from Jordan, and was led by the Spirit into the wilderness,",pt:"Jesus, pois, cheio do Esp\xedrito Santo, voltou do Jord\xe3o; e era levado pelo Esp\xedrito no deserto,"},{verse:2,en:"Being forty days tempted of the devil. And in those days he did eat nothing: and when they were ended, he afterward hungered.",pt:"durante quarenta dias, sendo tentado pelo Diabo. E naqueles dias n\xe3o comeu coisa alguma; e terminados eles, teve fome."},{verse:3,en:"And the devil said unto him, If thou be the Son of God, command this stone that it be made bread.",pt:"Disse-lhe ent\xe3o o Diabo: Se tu \xe9s Filho de Deus, manda a esta pedra que se torne em p\xe3o."},{verse:4,en:"And Jesus answered him, saying, It is written, That man shall not live by bread alone, but by every word of God.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, lhe respondeu: Est\xe1 escrito: Nem s\xf3 de p\xe3o viver\xe1 o homem."},{verse:5,en:"And the devil, taking him up into an high mountain, shewed unto him all the kingdoms of the world in a moment of time.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o Diabo, levando-o a um lugar elevado, mostrou-lhe num relance todos os reinos do mundo."},{verse:6,en:"And the devil said unto him, All this power will I give thee, and the glory of them: for that is delivered unto me; and to whomsoever I will I give it.",pt:"E disse-lhe: Dar-te-ei toda a autoridade e gl\xf3ria destes reinos, porque me foi entregue, e a dou a quem eu quiser;"},{verse:7,en:"If thou therefore wilt worship me, all shall be thine.",pt:"se tu, me adorares, ser\xe1 toda tua."},{verse:8,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto him, Get thee behind me, Satan: for it is written, Thou shalt worship the Lord thy God, and him only shalt thou serve.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Est\xe1 escrito: Ao Senhor teu Deus adorar\xe1s, e s\xf3 a ele servir\xe1s."},{verse:9,en:"And he brought him to Jerusalem, and set him on a pinnacle of the temple, and said unto him, If thou be the Son of God, cast thyself down from hence:",pt:"Ent\xe3o o levou a Jerusal\xe9m e o colocou sobre o pin\xe1culo do templo e lhe disse: Se tu \xe9s Filho de Deus, lan\xe7a-te daqui abaixo;"},{verse:10,en:"For it is written, He shall give his angels charge over thee, to keep thee:",pt:"porque est\xe1 escrito: Aos seus anjos ordenar\xe1 a teu respeito, que te guardem;"},{verse:11,en:"And in their hands they shall bear thee up, lest at any time thou dash thy foot against a stone.",pt:"e: eles te suster\xe3o nas m\xe3os, para que nunca tropeces em alguma pedra."},{verse:12,en:"And Jesus answering said unto him, It is said, Thou shalt not tempt the Lord thy God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Dito est\xe1: N\xe3o tentar\xe1s o Senhor teu Deus."},{verse:13,en:"And when the devil had ended all the temptation, he departed from him for a season.",pt:"Assim, tendo o Diabo acabado toda sorte de tenta\xe7\xe3o, retirou-se dele at\xe9 ocasi\xe3o oportuna."},{verse:14,en:"And Jesus returned in the power of the Spirit into Galilee: and there went out a fame of him through all the region round about.",pt:"Ent\xe3o voltou Jesus para a Galil\xe9ia no poder do Esp\xedrito; e a sua fama correu por toda a circunvizinhan\xe7a."},{verse:15,en:"And he taught in their synagogues, being glorified of all.",pt:"Ensinava nas sinagogas deles, e por todos era louvado."},{verse:16,en:"And he came to Nazareth, where he had been brought up: and, as his custom was, he went into the synagogue on the sabbath day, and stood up for to read.",pt:"Chegando a Nazar\xe9, onde fora criado; entrou na sinagoga no dia de s\xe1bado, segundo o seu costume, e levantou-se para ler."},{verse:17,en:"And there was delivered unto him the book of the prophet Esaias. And when he had opened the book, he found the place where it was written,",pt:"Foi-lhe entregue o livro do profeta Isa\xedas; e abrindo-o, achou o lugar em que estava escrito:"},{verse:18,en:"The Spirit of the Lord is upon me, because he hath anointed me to preach the gospel to the poor; he hath sent me to heal the brokenhearted, to preach deliverance to the captives, and recovering of sight to the blind, to set at liberty them that are bruised,",pt:"O Esp\xedrito do Senhor est\xe1 sobre mim, porquanto me ungiu para anunciar boas novas aos pobres; enviou-me para proclamar liberta\xe7\xe3o aos cativos, e restaura\xe7\xe3o da vista aos cegos, para p\xf4r em liberdade os oprimidos,"},{verse:19,en:"To preach the acceptable year of the Lord.",pt:"e para proclamar o ano aceit\xe1vel do Senhor."},{verse:20,en:"And he closed the book, and he gave it again to the minister, and sat down. And the eyes of all them that were in the synagogue were fastened on him.",pt:"E fechando o livro, devolveu-o ao assistente e sentou-se; e os olhos de todos na sinagoga estavam fitos nele."},{verse:21,en:"And he began to say unto them, This day is this scripture fulfilled in your ears.",pt:"Ent\xe3o come\xe7ou a dizer-lhes: Hoje se cumpriu esta escritura aos vossos ouvidos."},{verse:22,en:"And all bare him witness, and wondered at the gracious words which proceeded out of his mouth. And they said, Is not this Joseph\u2019s son?",pt:"E todos lhe davam testemunho, e se admiravam das palavras de gra\xe7a que sa\xedam da sua boca; e diziam: Este n\xe3o \xe9 filho de Jos\xe9?"},{verse:23,en:"And he said unto them, Ye will surely say unto me this proverb, Physician, heal thyself: whatsoever we have heard done in Capernaum, do also here in thy country.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Sem d\xfavida me direis este prov\xe9rbio: M\xe9dico, cura-te a ti mesmo; Tudo o que ouvimos teres feito em Cafarnaum, faze-o tamb\xe9m aqui na tua terra."},{verse:24,en:"And he said, Verily I say unto you, No prophet is accepted in his own country.",pt:"E prosseguiu: Em verdade vos digo que nenhum profeta \xe9 aceito na sua terra."},{verse:25,en:"But I tell you of a truth, many widows were in Israel in the days of Elias, when the heaven was shut up three years and six months, when great famine was throughout all the land;",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que muitas vi\xfavas havia em Israel nos dias de Elias, quando c\xe9u se fechou por tr\xeas anos e seis meses, de sorte que houve grande fome por toda a terra;"},{verse:26,en:"But unto none of them was Elias sent, save unto Sarepta, a city of Sidon, unto a woman that was a widow.",pt:"e a nenhuma delas foi enviado Elias, sen\xe3o a uma vi\xfava em Serepta de Sidom."},{verse:27,en:"And many lepers were in Israel in the time of Eliseus the prophet; and none of them was cleansed, saving Naaman the Syrian.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m muitos leprosos havia em Israel no tempo do profeta Elizeu, mas nenhum deles foi purificado sen\xe3o Naam\xe3, o s\xedrio."},{verse:28,en:"And all they in the synagogue, when they heard these things, were filled with wrath,",pt:"Todos os que estavam na sinagoga, ao ouvirem estas coisas, ficaram cheios de ira."},{verse:29,en:"And rose up, and thrust him out of the city, and led him unto the brow of the hill whereon their city was built, that they might cast him down headlong.",pt:"e, levantando-se, expulsaram-no da cidade e o levaram at\xe9 o despenhadeiro do monte em que a sua cidade estava edificada, para dali o precipitarem."},{verse:30,en:"But he passing through the midst of them went his way,",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, passando pelo meio deles, seguiu o seu caminho."},{verse:31,en:"And came down to Capernaum, a city of Galilee, and taught them on the sabbath days.",pt:"Ent\xe3o desceu a Cafarnaum, cidade da Galil\xe9ia, e os ensinava no s\xe1bado."},{verse:32,en:"And they were astonished at his doctrine: for his word was with power.",pt:"e maravilharam-se da sua doutrina, porque a sua palavra era com autoridade."},{verse:33,en:"And in the synagogue there was a man, which had a spirit of an unclean devil, and cried out with a loud voice,",pt:"Havia na sinagoga um homem que tinha o esp\xedrito de um dem\xf4nio imundo; e gritou em alta voz:"},{verse:34,en:"Saying, Let us alone; what have we to do with thee, thou Jesus of Nazareth? art thou come to destroy us? I know thee who thou art; the Holy One of God.",pt:"Ah! que temos n\xf3s contigo, Jesus, nazareno? vieste destruir-nos? Bem sei quem \xe9: o Santo de Deus."},{verse:35,en:"And Jesus rebuked him, saying, Hold thy peace, and come out of him. And when the devil had thrown him in the midst, he came out of him, and hurt him not.",pt:"Mas Jesus o repreendeu, dizendo: Cala-te, e sai dele. E o dem\xf4nio, tendo-o lan\xe7ado por terra no meio do povo, saiu dele sem lhe fazer mal algum."},{verse:36,en:"And they were all amazed, and spake among themselves, saying, What a word is this! for with authority and power he commandeth the unclean spirits, and they come out.",pt:"E veio espanto sobre todos, e falavam entre si, perguntando uns aos outros: Que palavra \xe9 esta, pois com autoridade e poder ordena aos esp\xedritos imundos, e eles saem?"},{verse:37,en:"And the fame of him went out into every place of the country round about.",pt:"E se divulgava a sua fama por todos os lugares da circunvizinhan\xe7a."},{verse:38,en:"And he arose out of the synagogue, and entered into Simon\u2019s house. And Simon\u2019s wife\u2019s mother was taken with a great fever; and they besought him for her.",pt:"Ora, levantando-se Jesus, saiu da sinagoga e entrou em casa de Sim\xe3o; e estando a sogra de Sim\xe3o enferma com muita febre, rogaram-lhe por ela."},{verse:39,en:"And he stood over her, and rebuked the fever; and it left her: and immediately she arose and ministered unto them.",pt:"E ele, inclinando-se para ela, repreendeu a febre, e esta a deixou. Imediatamente ela se levantou e os servia."},{verse:40,en:"Now when the sun was setting, all they that had any sick with divers diseases brought them unto him; and he laid his hands on every one of them, and healed them.",pt:"Ao p\xf4r do sol, todos os que tinham enfermos de v\xe1rias doen\xe7as lhos traziam; e ele punha as m\xe3os sobre cada um deles e os curava."},{verse:41,en:"And devils also came out of many, crying out, and saying, Thou art Christ the Son of God. And he rebuking them suffered them not to speak: for they knew that he was Christ.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m de muitos sa\xedam dem\xf4nios, gritando e dizendo: Tu \xe9s o Filho de Deus. Ele, por\xe9m, os repreendia, e n\xe3o os deixava falar; pois sabiam que ele era o Cristo."},{verse:42,en:"And when it was day, he departed and went into a desert place: and the people sought him, and came unto him, and stayed him, that he should not depart from them.",pt:"Ao romper do dia saiu, e foi a um lugar deserto; e as multid\xf5es procuravam-no e, vindo a ele, queriam det\xea-lo, para que n\xe3o se ausentasse delas."},{verse:43,en:"And he said unto them, I must preach the kingdom of God to other cities also: for therefore am I sent.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhes disse: \xc9 necess\xe1rio que tamb\xe9m \xe0s outras cidades eu anuncie o evangelho do reino de Deus; porque para isso \xe9 que fui enviado."},{verse:44,en:"And he preached in the synagogues of Galilee.",pt:"E pregava nas sinagogas da Jud\xe9ia."}]}}),785,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass, that, as the people pressed upon him to hear the word of God, he stood by the lake of Gennesaret,",pt:"Certa vez, quando a multid\xe3o apertava Jesus para ouvir a palavra de Deus, ele estava junto ao lago de Genezar\xe9;"},{verse:2,en:"And saw two ships standing by the lake: but the fishermen were gone out of them, and were washing their nets.",pt:"e viu dois barcos junto \xe0 praia do lago; mas os pescadores haviam descido deles, e estavam lavando as redes."},{verse:3,en:"And he entered into one of the ships, which was Simon\u2019s, and prayed him that he would thrust out a little from the land. And he sat down, and taught the people out of the ship.",pt:"Entrando ele num dos barcos, que era o de Sim\xe3o, pediu-lhe que o afastasse um pouco da terra; e, sentando-se, ensinava do barco as multid\xf5es."},{verse:4,en:"Now when he had left speaking, he said unto Simon, Launch out into the deep, and let down your nets for a draught.",pt:"Quando acabou de falar, disse a Sim\xe3o: Faze-te ao largo e lan\xe7ai as vossas redes para a pesca."},{verse:5,en:"And Simon answering said unto him, Master, we have toiled all the night, and have taken nothing: nevertheless at thy word I will let down the net.",pt:"Ao que disse Sim\xe3o: Mestre, trabalhamos a noite toda, e nada apanhamos; mas, sobre tua palavra, lan\xe7arei as redes."},{verse:6,en:"And when they had this done, they inclosed a great multitude of fishes: and their net brake.",pt:"Feito isto, apanharam uma grande quantidade de peixes, de modo que as redes se rompiam."},{verse:7,en:"And they beckoned unto their partners, which were in the other ship, that they should come and help them. And they came, and filled both the ships, so that they began to sink.",pt:"Acenaram ent\xe3o aos companheiros que estavam no outro barco, para virem ajud\xe1-los. Eles, pois, vieram, e encheram ambos os barcos, de maneira tal que quase iam a pique."},{verse:8,en:"When Simon Peter saw it, he fell down at Jesus\u2019 knees, saying, Depart from me; for I am a sinful man, O Lord.",pt:"Vendo isso Sim\xe3o Pedro, prostrou-se aos p\xe9s de Jesus, dizendo: Retira-te de mim, Senhor, porque sou um homem pecador."},{verse:9,en:"For he was astonished, and all that were with him, at the draught of the fishes which they had taken:",pt:"Pois, \xe0 vista da pesca que haviam feito, o espanto se apoderara dele e de todos os que com ele estavam,"},{verse:10,en:"And so was also James, and John, the sons of Zebedee, which were partners with Simon. And Jesus said unto Simon, Fear not; from henceforth thou shalt catch men.",pt:"bem como de Tiago e Jo\xe3o, filhos de Zebedeu, que eram s\xf3cios de Sim\xe3o. Disse Jesus a Sim\xe3o: N\xe3o temas; de agora em diante ser\xe1s pescador de homens."},{verse:11,en:"And when they had brought their ships to land, they forsook all, and followed him.",pt:"E, levando eles os barcos para a terra, deixaram tudo e o seguiram."},{verse:12,en:"And it came to pass, when he was in a certain city, behold a man full of leprosy: who seeing Jesus fell on his face, and besought him, saying, Lord, if thou wilt, thou canst make me clean.",pt:"Estando ele numa das cidades, apareceu um homem cheio de lepra que, vendo a Jesus, prostrou-se com o rosto em terra e suplicou-lhe: Senhor, se quiseres, bem podes tornar-me limpo."},{verse:13,en:"And he put forth his hand, and touched him, saying, I will: be thou clean. And immediately the leprosy departed from him.",pt:"Jesus, pois, estendendo a m\xe3o, tocou-lhe, dizendo: Quero; s\xea limpo. No mesmo instante desapareceu dele a lepra."},{verse:14,en:"And he charged him to tell no man: but go, and shew thyself to the priest, and offer for thy cleansing, according as Moses commanded, for a testimony unto them.",pt:"Ordenou-lhe, ent\xe3o, que a ningu\xe9m contasse isto. Mas vai, disse ele, mostra-te ao sacerdote e faze a oferta pela tua purifica\xe7\xe3o, conforme Mois\xe9s determinou, para lhes servir de testemunho."},{verse:15,en:"But so much the more went there a fame abroad of him: and great multitudes came together to hear, and to be healed by him of their infirmities.",pt:"A sua fama, por\xe9m, se divulgava cada vez mais, e grandes multid\xf5es se ajuntavam para ouvi-lo e serem curadas das suas enfermidades."},{verse:16,en:"And he withdrew himself into the wilderness, and prayed.",pt:"Mas ele se retirava para os desertos, e ali orava."},{verse:17,en:"And it came to pass on a certain day, as he was teaching, that there were Pharisees and doctors of the law sitting by, which were come out of every town of Galilee, and Judaea, and Jerusalem: and the power of the Lord was present to heal them.",pt:"Um dia, quando ele estava ensinando, achavam-se ali sentados fariseus e doutores da lei, que tinham vindo de todas as aldeias da Galil\xe9ia e da Jud\xe9ia, e de Jerusal\xe9m; e o poder do Senhor estava com ele para curar."},{verse:18,en:"And, behold, men brought in a bed a man which was taken with a palsy: and they sought means to bring him in, and to lay him before him.",pt:"E eis que uns homens, trazendo num leito um paral\xedtico, procuravam introduz\xed-lo e p\xf4-lo diante dele."},{verse:19,en:"And when they could not find by what way they might bring him in because of the multitude, they went upon the housetop, and let him down through the tiling with his couch into the midst before Jesus.",pt:"Mas, n\xe3o achando por onde o pudessem introduzir por causa da multid\xe3o, subiram ao eirado e, por entre as telhas, o baixaram com o leito, para o meio de todos, diante de Jesus."},{verse:20,en:"And when he saw their faith, he said unto him, Man, thy sins are forgiven thee.",pt:"E vendo-lhes a f\xe9, disse ele: Homem, s\xe3o-te perdoados os teus pecados."},{verse:21,en:"And the scribes and the Pharisees began to reason, saying, Who is this which speaketh blasphemies? Who can forgive sins, but God alone?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os escribas e os fariseus come\xe7aram a arrazoar, dizendo: Quem \xe9 este que profere blasf\xeamias? Quem \xe9 este que profere blasf\xeamias? Quem pode perdoar pecados, sen\xe3o s\xf3 Deus?"},{verse:22,en:"But when Jesus perceived their thoughts, he answering said unto them, What reason ye in your hearts?",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, percebendo os seus pensamentos, respondeu, e disse-lhes: Por que arrazoais em vossos cora\xe7\xf5es?"},{verse:23,en:"Whether is easier, to say, Thy sins be forgiven thee; or to say, Rise up and walk?",pt:"Qual \xe9 mais f\xe1cil? dizer: S\xe3o-te perdoados os teus pecados; ou dizer: Levanta-te, e anda?"},{verse:24,en:"But that ye may know that the Son of man hath power upon earth to forgive sins, (he said unto the sick of the palsy,) I say unto thee, Arise, and take up thy couch, and go into thine house.",pt:"Ora, para que saibais que o Filho do homem tem sobre a terra autoridade para perdoar pecados (disse ao paral\xedtico), a ti te digo: Levanta-te, toma o teu leito e vai para tua casa."},{verse:25,en:"And immediately he rose up before them, and took up that whereon he lay, and departed to his own house, glorifying God.",pt:"Imediatamente se levantou diante deles, tomou o leito em que estivera deitado e foi para sua casa, glorificando a Deus."},{verse:26,en:"And they were all amazed, and they glorified God, and were filled with fear, saying, We have seen strange things to day.",pt:"E, tomados de pasmo, todos glorificavam a Deus; e diziam, cheios de temor: Hoje vimos coisas extraordin\xe1rias."},{verse:27,en:"And after these things he went forth, and saw a publican, named Levi, sitting at the receipt of custom: and he said unto him, Follow me.",pt:"Depois disso saiu e, vendo um publicano chamado Levi, sentado na coletoria, disse-lhe: Segue-me."},{verse:28,en:"And he left all, rose up, and followed him.",pt:"Este, deixando tudo, levantou-se e o seguiu."},{verse:29,en:"And Levi made him a great feast in his own house: and there was a great company of publicans and of others that sat down with them.",pt:"Deu-lhe ent\xe3o Levi um lauto banquete em sua casa; havia ali grande n\xfamero de publicanos e outros que estavam com eles \xe0 mesa."},{verse:30,en:"But their scribes and Pharisees murmured against his disciples, saying, Why do ye eat and drink with publicans and sinners?",pt:"Murmuravam, pois, os fariseus e seus escribas contra os disc\xedpulos, perguntando: Por que comeis e bebeis com publicanos e pecadores?"},{verse:31,en:"And Jesus answering said unto them, They that are whole need not a physician; but they that are sick.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: N\xe3o necessitam de m\xe9dico os s\xe3os, mas sim os enfermos;"},{verse:32,en:"I came not to call the righteous, but sinners to repentance.",pt:"eu n\xe3o vim chamar justos, mas pecadores, ao arrependimento."},{verse:33,en:"And they said unto him, Why do the disciples of John fast often, and make prayers, and likewise the disciples of the Pharisees; but thine eat and drink?",pt:"Disseram-lhe eles: Os disc\xedpulos de Jo\xe3o jejuam frequentemente e fazem ora\xe7\xf5es, como tamb\xe9m os dos fariseus, mas os teus comem e bebem."},{verse:34,en:"And he said unto them, Can ye make the children of the bridechamber fast, while the bridegroom is with them?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Podeis, porventura, fazer jejuar os convidados \xe0s n\xfapcias enquanto o noivo est\xe1 com eles?"},{verse:35,en:"But the days will come, when the bridegroom shall be taken away from them, and then shall they fast in those days.",pt:"Dias vir\xe3o, por\xe9m, em que lhes ser\xe1 tirado o noivo; naqueles dias, sim h\xe3o de jejuar."},{verse:36,en:"And he spake also a parable unto them; No man putteth a piece of a new garment upon an old; if otherwise, then both the new maketh a rent, and the piece that was taken out of the new agreeth not with the old.",pt:"Prop\xf4s-lhes tamb\xe9m uma par\xe1bola: Ningu\xe9m tira um peda\xe7o de um vestido novo para o coser em vestido velho; do contr\xe1rio, n\xe3o somente rasgar\xe1 o novo, mas tamb\xe9m o peda\xe7o do novo n\xe3o condir\xe1 com o velho."},{verse:37,en:"And no man putteth new wine into old bottles; else the new wine will burst the bottles, and be spilled, and the bottles shall perish.",pt:"E ningu\xe9m deita vinho novo em odres velhos; do contr\xe1rio, o vinho novo romper\xe1 os odres e se derramar\xe1, e os odres se perder\xe3o;"},{verse:38,en:"But new wine must be put into new bottles; and both are preserved.",pt:"mas vinho novo deve ser deitado em odres novos."},{verse:39,en:"No man also having drunk old wine straightway desireth new: for he saith, The old is better.",pt:"E ningu\xe9m, tendo bebido o velho, quer o novo; porque diz: O velho \xe9 bom."}]}}),786,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass on the second sabbath after the first, that he went through the corn fields; and his disciples plucked the ears of corn, and did eat, rubbing them in their hands.",pt:"E sucedeu que, num dia de s\xe1bado, passava Jesus pelas searas; e seus disc\xedpulos iam colhendo espigas e, debulhando-as com as m\xe3os, as comiam."},{verse:2,en:"And certain of the Pharisees said unto them, Why do ye that which is not lawful to do on the sabbath days?",pt:"Alguns dos fariseus, por\xe9m, perguntaram; Por que estais fazendo o que n\xe3o \xe9 l\xedcito fazer nos s\xe1bados?"},{verse:3,en:"And Jesus answering them said, Have ye not read so much as this, what David did, when himself was an hungred, and they which were with him;",pt:"E Jesus, respondendo-lhes, disse: Nem ao menos tendes lido o que fez Davi quando teve fome, ele e seus companheiros?"},{verse:4,en:"How he went into the house of God, and did take and eat the shewbread, and gave also to them that were with him; which it is not lawful to eat but for the priests alone?",pt:"Como entrou na casa de Deus, tomou os p\xe3es da proposi\xe7\xe3o, dos quais n\xe3o era l\xedcito comer sen\xe3o s\xf3 aos sacerdotes, e deles comeu e deu tamb\xe9m aos companheiros?"},{verse:5,en:"And he said unto them, That the Son of man is Lord also of the sabbath.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m lhes disse: O Filho do homem \xe9 Senhor do s\xe1bado."},{verse:6,en:"And it came to pass also on another sabbath, that he entered into the synagogue and taught: and there was a man whose right hand was withered.",pt:"Ainda em outro s\xe1bado entrou na sinagoga, e p\xf4s-se a ensinar. Estava ali um homem que tinha a m\xe3o direita atrofiada."},{verse:7,en:"And the scribes and Pharisees watched him, whether he would heal on the sabbath day; that they might find an accusation against him.",pt:"E os escribas e os fariseus observavam-no, para ver se curaria em dia de s\xe1bado, para acharem de que o acusar."},{verse:8,en:"But he knew their thoughts, and said to the man which had the withered hand, Rise up, and stand forth in the midst. And he arose and stood forth.",pt:"Mas ele, conhecendo-lhes os pensamentos, disse ao homem que tinha a m\xe3o atrofiada: Levanta-te, e fica em p\xe9 aqui no maio. E ele, levantando-se, ficou em p\xe9."},{verse:9,en:"Then said Jesus unto them, I will ask you one thing; Is it lawful on the sabbath days to do good, or to do evil? to save life, or to destroy it?",pt:"Disse-lhes, ent\xe3o, Jesus: Eu vos pergunto: \xc9 l\xedcito no s\xe1bado fazer bem, ou fazer mal? salvar a vida, ou tir\xe1-la?"},{verse:10,en:"And looking round about upon them all, he said unto the man, Stretch forth thy hand. And he did so: and his hand was restored whole as the other.",pt:"E olhando para todos em redor, disse ao homem: Estende a tua m\xe3o. Ele assim o fez, e a m\xe3o lhe foi restabelecida."},{verse:11,en:"And they were filled with madness; and communed one with another what they might do to Jesus.",pt:"Mas eles se encheram de furor; e uns com os outros conferenciam sobre o que fariam a Jesus."},{verse:12,en:"And it came to pass in those days, that he went out into a mountain to pray, and continued all night in prayer to God.",pt:"Naqueles dias retirou-se para o monte a fim de orar; e passou a noite toda em ora\xe7\xe3o a Deus."},{verse:13,en:"And when it was day, he called unto him his disciples: and of them he chose twelve, whom also he named apostles;",pt:"Depois do amanhecer, chamou seus disc\xedpulos, e escolheu doze dentre eles, aos quais deu tamb\xe9m o nome de ap\xf3stolos:"},{verse:14,en:"Simon, (whom he also named Peter,) and Andrew his brother, James and John, Philip and Bartholomew,",pt:"Sim\xe3o, ao qual tamb\xe9m chamou Pedro, e Andr\xe9, seu irm\xe3o; Tiago e Jo\xe3o; Filipe e Bartolomeu;"},{verse:15,en:"Matthew and Thomas, James the son of Alphaeus, and Simon called Zelotes,",pt:"Mateus e Tom\xe9; Tiago, filho de Alfeu, e Sim\xe3o, chamado Zelote;"},{verse:16,en:"And Judas the brother of James, and Judas Iscariot, which also was the traitor.",pt:"Judas, filho de Tiago; e Judas Iscariotes, que veio a ser o traidor."},{verse:17,en:"And he came down with them, and stood in the plain, and the company of his disciples, and a great multitude of people out of all Judaea and Jerusalem, and from the sea coast of Tyre and Sidon, which came to hear him, and to be healed of their diseases;",pt:"E Jesus, descendo com eles, parou num lugar plano, onde havia n\xe3o s\xf3 grande n\xfamero de seus disc\xedpulos, mas tamb\xe9m grande multid\xe3o do povo, de toda a Jud\xe9ia e Jerusal\xe9m, e do litoral de Tiro e de Sidom, que tinham vindo para ouv\xed-lo e serem curados das suas doen\xe7as;"},{verse:18,en:"And they that were vexed with unclean spirits: and they were healed.",pt:"e os que eram atormentados por esp\xedritos imundos ficavam curados."},{verse:19,en:"And the whole multitude sought to touch him: for there went virtue out of him, and healed them all.",pt:"E toda a multid\xe3o procurava tocar-lhe; porque sa\xeda dele poder que curava a todos."},{verse:20,en:"And he lifted up his eyes on his disciples, and said, Blessed be ye poor: for yours is the kingdom of God.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, levantando ele os olhos para os seus disc\xedpulos, dizia: Bem-aventurados v\xf3s, os pobres, porque vosso \xe9 o reino de Deus."},{verse:21,en:"Blessed are ye that hunger now: for ye shall be filled. Blessed are ye that weep now: for ye shall laugh.",pt:"Bem-aventurados v\xf3s, que agora tendes fome, porque sereis fartos. Bem-aventurados v\xf3s, que agora chorais, porque haveis de rir."},{verse:22,en:"Blessed are ye, when men shall hate you, and when they shall separate you from their company, and shall reproach you, and cast out your name as evil, for the Son of man\u2019s sake.",pt:"Bem-aventurados sereis quando os homens vos odiarem, e quando vos expulsarem da sua companhia, e vos injuriarem, e rejeitarem o vosso nome como indigno, por causa do Filho do homem."},{verse:23,en:"Rejoice ye in that day, and leap for joy: for, behold, your reward is great in heaven: for in the like manner did their fathers unto the prophets.",pt:"Regozijai-vos nesse dia e exultai, porque eis que \xe9 grande o vosso galard\xe3o no c\xe9u; pois assim faziam os seus pais aos profetas."},{verse:24,en:"But woe unto you that are rich! for ye have received your consolation.",pt:"Mas ai de v\xf3s que sois ricos! porque j\xe1 recebestes a vossa consola\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:25,en:"Woe unto you that are full! for ye shall hunger. Woe unto you that laugh now! for ye shall mourn and weep.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, os que agora estais fartos! porque tereis fome. Ai de v\xf3s, os que agora rides! porque vos lamentareis e chorareis."},{verse:26,en:"Woe unto you, when all men shall speak well of you! for so did their fathers to the false prophets.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, quando todos os homens vos louvarem! porque assim faziam os seus pais aos falsos profetas."},{verse:27,en:"But I say unto you which hear, Love your enemies, do good to them which hate you,",pt:"Mas a v\xf3s que ouvis, digo: Amai a vossos inimigos, fazei bem aos que vos odeiam,"},{verse:28,en:"Bless them that curse you, and pray for them which despitefully use you.",pt:"bendizei aos que vos maldizem, e orai pelos que vos caluniam."},{verse:29,en:"And unto him that smiteth thee on the one cheek offer also the other; and him that taketh away thy cloke forbid not to take thy coat also.",pt:"Ao que te ferir numa face, oferece-lhe tamb\xe9m a outra; e ao que te houver tirado a capa, n\xe3o lhe negues tamb\xe9m a t\xfanica."},{verse:30,en:"Give to every man that asketh of thee; and of him that taketh away thy goods ask them not again.",pt:"D\xe1 a todo o que te pedir; e ao que tomar o que \xe9 teu, n\xe3o lho reclames."},{verse:31,en:"And as ye would that men should do to you, do ye also to them likewise.",pt:"Assim como quereis que os homens vos fa\xe7am, do mesmo modo lhes fazei v\xf3s tamb\xe9m."},{verse:32,en:"For if ye love them which love you, what thank have ye? for sinners also love those that love them.",pt:"Se amardes aos que vos amam, que m\xe9rito h\xe1 nisso? Pois tamb\xe9m os pecadores amam aos que os amam."},{verse:33,en:"And if ye do good to them which do good to you, what thank have ye? for sinners also do even the same.",pt:"E se fizerdes bem aos que vos fazem bem, que m\xe9rito h\xe1 nisso? Tamb\xe9m os pecadores fazem o mesmo."},{verse:34,en:"And if ye lend to them of whom ye hope to receive, what thank have ye? for sinners also lend to sinners, to receive as much again.",pt:"E se emprestardes \xe0queles de quem esperais receber, que m\xe9rito h\xe1 nisso? Tamb\xe9m os pecadores emprestam aos pecadores, para receberem outro tanto."},{verse:35,en:"But love ye your enemies, and do good, and lend, hoping for nothing again; and your reward shall be great, and ye shall be the children of the Highest: for he is kind unto the unthankful and to the evil.",pt:"Amai, por\xe9m a vossos inimigos, fazei bem e emprestai, nunca desanimado; e grande ser\xe1 a vossa recompensa, e sereis filhos do Alt\xedssimo; porque ele \xe9 benigno at\xe9 para com os integrantes e maus."},{verse:36,en:"Be ye therefore merciful, as your Father also is merciful.",pt:"Sede misericordiosos, como tamb\xe9m vosso Pai \xe9 misericordioso."},{verse:37,en:"Judge not, and ye shall not be judged: condemn not, and ye shall not be condemned: forgive, and ye shall be forgiven:",pt:"N\xe3o julgueis, e n\xe3o sereis julgados; n\xe3o condeneis, e n\xe3o sereis condenados; perdoai, e sereis perdoados."},{verse:38,en:"Give, and it shall be given unto you; good measure, pressed down, and shaken together, and running over, shall men give into your bosom. For with the same measure that ye mete withal it shall be measured to you again.",pt:"Dai, e ser-vos-\xe1 dado; boa medida, recalcada, sacudida e transbordando vos deitar\xe3o no rega\xe7o; porque com a mesma medida com que medis, vos medir\xe3o a v\xf3s."},{verse:39,en:"And he spake a parable unto them, Can the blind lead the blind? shall they not both fall into the ditch?",pt:"E prop\xf4s-lhes tamb\xe9m uma par\xe1bola: Pode porventura um cego guiar outro cego? n\xe3o cair\xe3o ambos no barranco?"},{verse:40,en:"The disciple is not above his master: but every one that is perfect shall be as his master.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 o disc\xedpulo mais do que o seu mestre; mas todo o que for bem instru\xeddo ser\xe1 como o seu mestre."},{verse:41,en:"And why beholdest thou the mote that is in thy brother\u2019s eye, but perceivest not the beam that is in thine own eye?",pt:"Por que v\xeas o argueiro no olho de teu irm\xe3o, e n\xe3o reparas na trave que est\xe1 no teu pr\xf3prio olho?"},{verse:42,en:"Either how canst thou say to thy brother, Brother, let me pull out the mote that is in thine eye, when thou thyself beholdest not the beam that is in thine own eye? Thou hypocrite, cast out first the beam out of thine own eye, and then shalt thou see clearly to pull out the mote that is in thy brother\u2019s eye.",pt:"Ou como podes dizer a teu irm\xe3o: Irm\xe3o, deixa-me tirar o argueiro que est\xe1 no teu olho, n\xe3o vendo tu mesmo a trave que est\xe1 no teu? Hip\xf3crita! tira primeiro a trave do teu olho; e ent\xe3o ver\xe1s bem para tirar o argueiro que est\xe1 no olho de teu irm\xe3o."},{verse:43,en:"For a good tree bringeth not forth corrupt fruit; neither doth a corrupt tree bring forth good fruit.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o h\xe1 \xe1rvore boa que d\xea mau fruto nem tampouco \xe1rvore m\xe1 que d\xea bom fruto."},{verse:44,en:"For every tree is known by his own fruit. For of thorns men do not gather figs, nor of a bramble bush gather they grapes.",pt:"Porque cada \xe1rvore se conhece pelo seu pr\xf3prio fruto; pois dos espinheiros n\xe3o se colhem figos, nem dos abrolhos se vindimam uvas."},{verse:45,en:"A good man out of the good treasure of his heart bringeth forth that which is good; and an evil man out of the evil treasure of his heart bringeth forth that which is evil: for of the abundance of the heart his mouth speaketh.",pt:"O homem bom, do bom tesouro do seu cora\xe7\xe3o tira o bem; e o homem mau, do seu mau tesouro tira o mal; pois do que h\xe1 em abund\xe2ncia no cora\xe7\xe3o, disso fala a boca."},{verse:46,en:"And why call ye me, Lord, Lord, and do not the things which I say?",pt:"E por que me chamais: Senhor, Senhor, e n\xe3o fazeis o que eu vos digo?"},{verse:47,en:"Whosoever cometh to me, and heareth my sayings, and doeth them, I will shew you to whom he is like:",pt:"Todo aquele que vem a mim, e ouve as minhas palavras, e as pratica, eu vos mostrarei a quem \xe9 semelhante:"},{verse:48,en:"He is like a man which built an house, and digged deep, and laid the foundation on a rock: and when the flood arose, the stream beat vehemently upon that house, and could not shake it: for it was founded upon a rock.",pt:"\xc9 semelhante ao homem que, edificando uma casa, cavou, abriu profunda vala, e p\xf4s os alicerces sobre a rocha; e vindo a enchente, bateu com \xedmpeto a torrente naquela casa, e n\xe3o a p\xf4de abalar, porque tinha sido bem edificada."},{verse:49,en:"But he that heareth, and doeth not, is like a man that without a foundation built an house upon the earth; against which the stream did beat vehemently, and immediately it fell; and the ruin of that house was great.",pt:"Mas o que ouve e n\xe3o pratica \xe9 semelhante a um homem que edificou uma casa sobre terra, sem alicerces, na qual bateu com \xedmpeto a torrente, e logo caiu; e foi grande a ru\xedna daquela casa."}]}}),787,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now when he had ended all his sayings in the audience of the people, he entered into Capernaum.",pt:"Quando acabou de proferir todas estas palavras aos ouvidos do povo, entrou em Cafarnaum."},{verse:2,en:"And a certain centurion\u2019s servant, who was dear unto him, was sick, and ready to die.",pt:"E um servo de certo centuri\xe3o, de quem era muito estimado, estava doente, quase \xe0 morte."},{verse:3,en:"And when he heard of Jesus, he sent unto him the elders of the Jews, beseeching him that he would come and heal his servant.",pt:"O centuri\xe3o, pois, ouvindo falar de Jesus, enviou-lhes uns anci\xe3os dos judeus, a pedir-lhe que viesse curar o seu servo."},{verse:4,en:"And when they came to Jesus, they besought him instantly, saying, That he was worthy for whom he should do this:",pt:"E chegando eles junto de Jesus, rogavam-lhe com inst\xe2ncia, dizendo: \xc9 digno de que lhe concedas isto;"},{verse:5,en:"For he loveth our nation, and he hath built us a synagogue.",pt:"porque ama \xe0 nossa na\xe7\xe3o, e ele mesmo nos edificou a sinagoga."},{verse:6,en:"Then Jesus went with them. And when he was now not far from the house, the centurion sent friends to him, saying unto him, Lord, trouble not thyself: for I am not worthy that thou shouldest enter under my roof:",pt:"Ia, pois, Jesus com eles; mas, quando j\xe1 estava perto da casa, enviou o centuri\xe3o uns amigos a dizer-lhe: Senhor, n\xe3o te incomodes; porque n\xe3o sou digno de que entres debaixo do meu telhado;"},{verse:7,en:"Wherefore neither thought I myself worthy to come unto thee: but say in a word, and my servant shall be healed.",pt:"por isso nem ainda me julguei digno de ir \xe0 tua presen\xe7a; dize, por\xe9m, uma palavra, e seja o meu servo curado."},{verse:8,en:"For I also am a man set under authority, having under me soldiers, and I say unto one, Go, and he goeth; and to another, Come, and he cometh; and to my servant, Do this, and he doeth it.",pt:"Pois tamb\xe9m eu sou homem sujeito \xe0 autoridade, e tenho soldados \xe0s minhas ordens; e digo a este: Vai, e ele vai; e a outro: Vem, e ele vem; e ao meu servo: Faze isto, e ele o faz."},{verse:9,en:"When Jesus heard these things, he marvelled at him, and turned him about, and said unto the people that followed him, I say unto you, I have not found so great faith, no, not in Israel.",pt:"Jesus, ouvindo isso, admirou-se dele e, voltando-se para a multid\xe3o que o seguia, disse: Eu vos afirmo que nem mesmo em Israel encontrei tamanha f\xe9."},{verse:10,en:"And they that were sent, returning to the house, found the servant whole that had been sick.",pt:"E voltando para casa os que haviam sido enviados, encontraram o servo com sa\xfade."},{verse:11,en:"And it came to pass the day after, that he went into a city called Nain; and many of his disciples went with him, and much people.",pt:"Pouco depois seguiu ele viagem para uma cidade chamada Naim; e iam com ele seus disc\xedpulos e uma grande multid\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"Now when he came nigh to the gate of the city, behold, there was a dead man carried out, the only son of his mother, and she was a widow: and much people of the city was with her.",pt:"Quando chegou perto da porta da cidade, eis que levavam para fora um defunto, filho \xfanico de sua m\xe3e, que era vi\xfava; e com ela ia uma grande multid\xe3o da cidade."},{verse:13,en:"And when the Lord saw her, he had compassion on her, and said unto her, Weep not.",pt:"Logo que o Senhor a viu, encheu-se de compaix\xe3o por ela, e disse-lhe: N\xe3o chores."},{verse:14,en:"And he came and touched the bier: and they that bare him stood still. And he said, Young man, I say unto thee, Arise.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, chegando-se, tocou no esquife e, quando pararam os que o levavam, disse: Mo\xe7o, a ti te digo: Levanta-te."},{verse:15,en:"And he that was dead sat up, and began to speak. And he delivered him to his mother.",pt:"O que estivera morto sentou-se e come\xe7ou a falar. Ent\xe3o Jesus o entregou \xe0 sua m\xe3e."},{verse:16,en:"And there came a fear on all: and they glorified God, saying, That a great prophet is risen up among us; and, That God hath visited his people.",pt:"O medo se apoderou de todos, e glorificavam a Deus, dizendo: Um grande profeta se levantou entre n\xf3s; e: Deus visitou o seu povo."},{verse:17,en:"And this rumour of him went forth throughout all Judaea, and throughout all the region round about.",pt:"E correu a not\xedcia disto por toda a Jud\xe9ia e por toda a regi\xe3o circunvizinha."},{verse:18,en:"And the disciples of John shewed him of all these things.",pt:"Ora, os disc\xedpulos de Jo\xe3o anunciaram-lhe todas estas coisas."},{verse:19,en:"And John calling unto him two of his disciples sent them to Jesus, saying, Art thou he that should come? or look we for another?",pt:"E Jo\xe3o, chamando a dois deles, enviou-os ao Senhor para perguntar-lhe: \xc9s tu aquele que havia de vir, ou havemos de esperar outro?"},{verse:20,en:"When the men were come unto him, they said, John Baptist hath sent us unto thee, saying, Art thou he that should come? or look we for another?",pt:"Quando aqueles homens chegaram junto dele, disseram: Jo\xe3o, o Batista, enviou-nos a perguntar-te: \xc9s tu aquele que havia de vir, ou havemos de esperar outro?"},{verse:21,en:"And in that same hour he cured many of their infirmities and plagues, and of evil spirits; and unto many that were blind he gave sight.",pt:"Naquela mesma hora, curou a muitos de doen\xe7as, de mol\xe9stias e de esp\xedritos malignos; e deu vista a muitos cegos."},{verse:22,en:"Then Jesus answering said unto them, Go your way, and tell John what things ye have seen and heard; how that the blind see, the lame walk, the lepers are cleansed, the deaf hear, the dead are raised, to the poor the gospel is preached.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes respondeu: Ide, e contai a Jo\xe3o o que tens visto e ouvido: os cegos v\xeaem, os coxos andam, os leprosos s\xe3o purificados, e os surdos ouvem; os mortos s\xe3o ressuscitados, e aos pobres \xe9 anunciado o evangelho."},{verse:23,en:"And blessed is he, whosoever shall not be offended in me.",pt:"E bem-aventurado aquele que n\xe3o se escandalizar de mim."},{verse:24,en:"And when the messengers of John were departed, he began to speak unto the people concerning John, What went ye out into the wilderness for to see? A reed shaken with the wind?",pt:"E, tendo-se retirado os mensageiros de Jo\xe3o, Jesus come\xe7ou a dizer \xe0s multid\xf5es a respeito de Jo\xe3o: Que sa\xedstes a ver no deserto? um cani\xe7o agitado pelo vento?"},{verse:25,en:"But what went ye out for to see? A man clothed in soft raiment? Behold, they which are gorgeously apparelled, and live delicately, are in kings courts.",pt:"Mas que sa\xedstes a ver? um homem trajado de vestes luxuosas? Eis que aqueles que trajam roupas preciosas, e vivem em del\xedcias, est\xe3o nos pa\xe7os reais."},{verse:26,en:"But what went ye out for to see? A prophet? Yea, I say unto you, and much more than a prophet.",pt:"Mas que sa\xedstes a ver? um profeta? Sim, vos digo, e muito mais do que profeta."},{verse:27,en:"This is he, of whom it is written, Behold, I send my messenger before thy face, which shall prepare thy way before thee.",pt:"Este \xe9 aquele de quem est\xe1 escrito: Eis a\xed envio ante a tua face o meu mensageiro, que h\xe1 de preparar adiante de ti o teu caminho."},{verse:28,en:"For I say unto you, Among those that are born of women there is not a greater prophet than John the Baptist: but he that is least in the kingdom of God is greater than he.",pt:"Pois eu vos digo que, entre os nascidos de mulher, n\xe3o h\xe1 nenhum maior do que Jo\xe3o; mas aquele que \xe9 o menor no re medida com \xe9 maior do que ele."},{verse:29,en:"And all the people that heard him, and the publicans, justified God, being baptized with the baptism of John.",pt:"E todo o povo que o ouviu, e at\xe9 os publicanos, reconheceram a justi\xe7a de Deus, recebendo o batismo de Jo\xe3o."},{verse:30,en:"But the Pharisees and lawyers rejected the counsel of God against themselves, being not baptized of him.",pt:"Mas os fariseus e os doutores da lei rejeitaram o conselho de Deus quando a si mesmos, n\xe3o sendo batizados por ele."},{verse:31,en:"And the Lord said, Whereunto then shall I liken the men of this generation? and to what are they like?",pt:"A que, pois, compararei os homens desta gera\xe7\xe3o, e a que s\xe3o semelhantes?"},{verse:32,en:"They are like unto children sitting in the marketplace, and calling one to another, and saying, We have piped unto you, and ye have not danced; we have mourned to you, and ye have not wept.",pt:"S\xe3o semelhantes aos meninos que, sentados nas pra\xe7as, gritam uns para os outros: Tocamo-vos flauta, e n\xe3o dan\xe7astes; cantamos lamenta\xe7\xf5es, e n\xe3o chorastes."},{verse:33,en:"For John the Baptist came neither eating bread nor drinking wine; and ye say, He hath a devil.",pt:"Porquanto veio Jo\xe3o, o Batista, n\xe3o comendo p\xe3o nem bebendo vinho, e dizeis: Tem dem\xf4nio;"},{verse:34,en:"The Son of man is come eating and drinking; and ye say, Behold a gluttonous man, and a winebibber, a friend of publicans and sinners!",pt:"veio o Filho do homem, comendo e bebendo, e dizeis: Eis a\xed um comil\xe3o e bebedor de vinho, amigo de publicanos e pecadores."},{verse:35,en:"But wisdom is justified of all her children.",pt:"Mas a sabedoria \xe9 justificada por todos os seus filhos."},{verse:36,en:"And one of the Pharisees desired him that he would eat with him. And he went into the Pharisee\u2019s house, and sat down to meat.",pt:"Um dos fariseus convidou-o para comer com ele; e entrando em casa do fariseu, reclinou-se \xe0 mesa."},{verse:37,en:"And, behold, a woman in the city, which was a sinner, when she knew that Jesus sat at meat in the Pharisee\u2019s house, brought an alabaster box of ointment,",pt:"E eis que uma mulher pecadora que havia na cidade, quando soube que ele estava \xe0 mesa em casa do fariseu, trouxe um vaso de alabastro com b\xe1lsamo;"},{verse:38,en:"And stood at his feet behind him weeping, and began to wash his feet with tears, and did wipe them with the hairs of her head, and kissed his feet, and anointed them with the ointment.",pt:"e estando por detr\xe1s, aos seus p\xe9s, chorando, come\xe7ou a regar-lhe os p\xe9s com l\xe1grimas e os enxugava com os cabelos da sua cabe\xe7a; e beijava-lhe os p\xe9s e ungia-os com o b\xe1lsamo."},{verse:39,en:"Now when the Pharisee which had bidden him saw it, he spake within himself, saying, This man, if he were a prophet, would have known who and what manner of woman this is that toucheth him: for she is a sinner.",pt:"Mas, ao ver isso, o fariseu que o convidara falava consigo, dizendo: Se este homem fosse profeta, saberia quem e de que qualidade \xe9 essa mulher que o toca, pois \xe9 uma pecadora."},{verse:40,en:"And Jesus answering said unto him, Simon, I have somewhat to say unto thee. And he saith, Master, say on.",pt:"E respondendo Jesus, disse-lhe: Sim\xe3o, tenho uma coisa a dizer-te. Respondeu ele: Dize-a, Mestre."},{verse:41,en:"There was a certain creditor which had two debtors: the one owed five hundred pence, and the other fifty.",pt:"Certo credor tinha dois devedores; um lhe devia quinhentos den\xe1rios, e outro cinquenta."},{verse:42,en:"And when they had nothing to pay, he frankly forgave them both. Tell me therefore, which of them will love him most?",pt:"N\xe3o tendo eles com que pagar, perdoou a ambos. Qual deles, pois, o amar\xe1 mais?"},{verse:43,en:"Simon answered and said, I suppose that he, to whom he forgave most. And he said unto him, Thou hast rightly judged.",pt:"Respondeu Sim\xe3o: Suponho que \xe9 aquele a quem mais perdoou. Replicou-lhe Jesus: Julgaste bem."},{verse:44,en:"And he turned to the woman, and said unto Simon, Seest thou this woman? I entered into thine house, thou gavest me no water for my feet: but she hath washed my feet with tears, and wiped them with the hairs of her head.",pt:"E, voltando-se para a mulher, disse a Sim\xe3o: V\xeas tu esta mulher? Entrei em tua casa, e n\xe3o me deste \xe1gua para os p\xe9s; mas esta com suas l\xe1grimas os regou e com seus cabelos os enxugou."},{verse:45,en:"Thou gavest me no kiss: but this woman since the time I came in hath not ceased to kiss my feet.",pt:"N\xe3o me deste \xf3sculo; ela, por\xe9m, desde que entrei, n\xe3o tem cessado de beijar-me os p\xe9s."},{verse:46,en:"My head with oil thou didst not anoint: but this woman hath anointed my feet with ointment.",pt:"N\xe3o me ungiste a cabe\xe7a com \xf3leo; mas esta com b\xe1lsamo ungiu-me os p\xe9s."},{verse:47,en:"Wherefore I say unto thee, Her sins, which are many, are forgiven; for she loved much: but to whom little is forgiven, the same loveth little.",pt:"Por isso te digo: Perdoados lhe s\xe3o os pecados, que s\xe3o muitos; porque ela muito amou; mas aquele a quem pouco se perdoa, pouco ama."},{verse:48,en:"And he said unto her, Thy sins are forgiven.",pt:"E disse a ela: Perdoados s\xe3o os teus pecados."},{verse:49,en:"And they that sat at meat with him began to say within themselves, Who is this that forgiveth sins also?",pt:"Mas os que estavam com ele \xe0 mesa come\xe7aram a dizer entre si: Quem \xe9 este que at\xe9 perdoa pecados?"},{verse:50,en:"And he said to the woman, Thy faith hath saved thee; go in peace.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, disse \xe0 mulher: A tua f\xe9 te salvou; vai-te em paz."}]}}),788,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,h){s.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass afterward, that he went throughout every city and village, preaching and shewing the glad tidings of the kingdom of God: and the twelve were with him,",pt:"Logo depois disso, andava Jesus de cidade em cidade, e de aldeia em aldeia, pregando e anunciando o evangelho do reino de Deus; e iam com ele os doze,"},{verse:2,en:"And certain women, which had been healed of evil spirits and infirmities, Mary called Magdalene, out of whom went seven devils,",pt:"bem como algumas mulheres que haviam sido curadas de esp\xedritos malignos e de enfermidades: Maria, chamada Madalena, da qual tinham sa\xeddo sete dem\xf4nios."},{verse:3,en:"And Joanna the wife of Chuza Herod\u2019s steward, and Susanna, and many others, which ministered unto him of their substance.",pt:"Joana, mulher de Cuza, procurador de Herodes, Susana, e muitas outras que os serviam com os seus bens."},{verse:4,en:"And when much people were gathered together, and were come to him out of every city, he spake by a parable:",pt:"Ora, ajuntando-se uma grande multid\xe3o, e vindo ter com ele gente de todas as cidades, disse Jesus por par\xe1bola:"},{verse:5,en:"A sower went out to sow his seed: and as he sowed, some fell by the way side; and it was trodden down, and the fowls of the air devoured it.",pt:"Saiu o semeador a semear a sua semente. E quando semeava, uma parte da semente caiu \xe0 beira do caminho; e foi pisada, e as aves do c\xe9u a comeram."},{verse:6,en:"And some fell upon a rock; and as soon as it was sprung up, it withered away, because it lacked moisture.",pt:"Outra caiu sobre pedra; e, nascida, secou-se porque n\xe3o havia umidade."},{verse:7,en:"And some fell among thorns; and the thorns sprang up with it, and choked it.",pt:"E outra caiu no meio dos espinhos; e crescendo com ela os espinhos, sufocaram-na."},{verse:8,en:"And other fell on good ground, and sprang up, and bare fruit an hundredfold. And when he had said these things, he cried, He that hath ears to hear, let him hear.",pt:"Mas outra caiu em boa terra; e, nascida, produziu fruto, cem por um. Dizendo ele estas coisas, clamava: Quem tem ouvidos para ouvir, ou\xe7a."},{verse:9,en:"And his disciples asked him, saying, What might this parable be?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe ent\xe3o seus disc\xedpulos o que significava essa par\xe1bola."},{verse:10,en:"And he said, Unto you it is given to know the mysteries of the kingdom of God: but to others in parables; that seeing they might not see, and hearing they might not understand.",pt:"Respondeu ele: A v\xf3s \xe9 dado conhecer os mist\xe9rios do reino de Deus; mas aos outros se fala por par\xe1bolas; para que vendo, n\xe3o vejam, e ouvindo, n\xe3o entendam."},{verse:11,en:"Now the parable is this: The seed is the word of God.",pt:"\xc9, pois, esta a par\xe1bola: A semente \xe9 a palavra de Deus."},{verse:12,en:"Those by the way side are they that hear; then cometh the devil, and taketh away the word out of their hearts, lest they should believe and be saved.",pt:"Os que est\xe3o \xe0 beira do caminho s\xe3o os que ouvem; mas logo vem o Diabo e tira-lhe do cora\xe7\xe3o a palavra, para que n\xe3o suceda que, crendo, sejam salvos."},{verse:13,en:"They on the rock are they, which, when they hear, receive the word with joy; and these have no root, which for a while believe, and in time of temptation fall away.",pt:"Os que est\xe3o sobre a pedra s\xe3o os que, ouvindo a palavra, a recebem com alegria; mas estes n\xe3o t\xeam raiz, apenas cr\xeaem por algum tempo, mas na hora da prova\xe7\xe3o se desviam."},{verse:14,en:"And that which fell among thorns are they, which, when they have heard, go forth, and are choked with cares and riches and pleasures of this life, and bring no fruit to perfection.",pt:"A parte que caiu entre os espinhos s\xe3o os que ouviram e, indo seu caminho, s\xe3o sufocados pelos cuidados, riquezas, e deleites desta vida e n\xe3o d\xe3o fruto com perfei\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:15,en:"But that on the good ground are they, which in an honest and good heart, having heard the word, keep it, and bring forth fruit with patience.",pt:"Mas a que caiu em boa terra s\xe3o os que, ouvindo a palavra com cora\xe7\xe3o reto e bom, a ret\xeam e d\xe3o fruto com perseveran\xe7a."},{verse:16,en:"No man, when he hath lighted a candle, covereth it with a vessel, or putteth it under a bed; but setteth it on a candlestick, that they which enter in may see the light.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m, pois, acende uma candeia e a cobre com algum vaso, ou a p\xf5e debaixo da cama; mas p\xf5e-na no velador, para que os que entram vejam a luz."},{verse:17,en:"For nothing is secret, that shall not be made manifest; neither any thing hid, that shall not be known and come abroad.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o h\xe1 coisa encoberta que n\xe3o haja de manifestar-se, nem coisa secreta que n\xe3o haja de saber-se e vir \xe0 luz."},{verse:18,en:"Take heed therefore how ye hear: for whosoever hath, to him shall be given; and whosoever hath not, from him shall be taken even that which he seemeth to have.",pt:"Vede, pois, como ouvis; porque a qualquer que tiver lhe ser\xe1 dado, e a qualquer que n\xe3o tiver, at\xe9 o que parece ter lhe ser\xe1 tirado."},{verse:19,en:"Then came to him his mother and his brethren, and could not come at him for the press.",pt:"Vieram, ent\xe3o, ter com ele sua m\xe3e e seus irm\xe3os, e n\xe3o podiam aproximar-se dele por causa da multid\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"And it was told him by certain which said, Thy mother and thy brethren stand without, desiring to see thee.",pt:"Foi-lhe dito: Tua m\xe3e e teus irm\xe3os est\xe3o l\xe1 fora, e querem ver-te."},{verse:21,en:"And he answered and said unto them, My mother and my brethren are these which hear the word of God, and do it.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhes respondeu: Minha m\xe3e e meus irm\xe3os s\xe3o estes que ouvem a palavra de Deus e a observam."},{verse:22,en:"Now it came to pass on a certain day, that he went into a ship with his disciples: and he said unto them, Let us go over unto the other side of the lake. And they launched forth.",pt:"Ora, aconteceu certo dia que entrou num barco com seus disc\xedpulos, e disse-lhes: Passemos \xe0 outra margem do lago. E partiram."},{verse:23,en:"But as they sailed he fell asleep: and there came down a storm of wind on the lake; and they were filled with water, and were in jeopardy.",pt:"Enquanto navegavam, ele adormeceu; e desceu uma tempestade de vento sobre o lago; e o barco se enchia de \xe1gua, de sorte que perigavam."},{verse:24,en:"And they came to him, and awoke him, saying, Master, master, we perish. Then he arose, and rebuked the wind and the raging of the water: and they ceased, and there was a calm.",pt:"Chegando-se a ele, o despertaram, dizendo: Mestre, Mestre, estamos perecendo. E ele, levantando-se, repreendeu o vento e a f\xfaria da \xe1gua; e cessaram, e fez-se bonan\xe7a."},{verse:25,en:"And he said unto them, Where is your faith? And they being afraid wondered, saying one to another, What manner of man is this! for he commandeth even the winds and water, and they obey him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes perguntou: Onde est\xe1 a vossa f\xe9? Eles, atemorizados, admiraram-se, dizendo uns aos outros: Quem, pois, \xe9 este, que at\xe9 aos ventos e \xe0 \xe1gua manda, e lhe obedecem?"},{verse:26,en:"And they arrived at the country of the Gadarenes, which is over against Galilee.",pt:"Apontaram \xe0 terra dos gerasenos, que est\xe1 defronte da Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:27,en:"And when he went forth to land, there met him out of the city a certain man, which had devils long time, and ware no clothes, neither abode in any house, but in the tombs.",pt:"Logo que saltou em terra, saiu-lhe ao encontro um homem da cidade, possesso de dem\xf4nios, que havia muito tempo n\xe3o vestia roupa, nem morava em casa, mas nos sepulcros."},{verse:28,en:"When he saw Jesus, he cried out, and fell down before him, and with a loud voice said, What have I to do with thee, Jesus, thou Son of God most high? I beseech thee, torment me not.",pt:"Quando ele viu a Jesus, gritou, prostrou-se diante dele, e com grande voz exclamou: Que tenho eu contigo, Jesus, Filho do Deus Alt\xedssimo? Rogo-te que n\xe3o me atormentes."},{verse:29,en:"(For he had commanded the unclean spirit to come out of the man. For oftentimes it had caught him: and he was kept bound with chains and in fetters; and he brake the bands, and was driven of the devil into the wilderness.)",pt:"Porque Jesus ordenara ao esp\xedrito imundo que sa\xedsse do homem. Pois j\xe1 havia muito tempo que se apoderara dele; e guardavam-no preso com grilh\xf5es e cadeias; mas ele, quebrando as pris\xf5es, era impelido pelo dem\xf4nio para os desertos."},{verse:30,en:"And Jesus asked him, saying, What is thy name? And he said, Legion: because many devils were entered into him.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Jesus: Qual \xe9 o teu nome? Respondeu ele: Legi\xe3o; porque tinham entrado nele muitos dem\xf4nios."},{verse:31,en:"And they besought him that he would not command them to go out into the deep.",pt:"E rogavam-lhe que n\xe3o os mandasse para o abismo."},{verse:32,en:"And there was there an herd of many swine feeding on the mountain: and they besought him that he would suffer them to enter into them. And he suffered them.",pt:"Ora, andava ali pastando no monte uma grande manada de porcos; rogaram-lhe, pois que lhes permitisse entrar neles, e lho permitiu."},{verse:33,en:"Then went the devils out of the man, and entered into the swine: and the herd ran violently down a steep place into the lake, and were choked.",pt:"E tendo os dem\xf4nios sa\xeddo do homem, entraram nos porcos; e a manada precipitou-se pelo despenhadeiro no lago, e afogou-se."},{verse:34,en:"When they that fed them saw what was done, they fled, and went and told it in the city and in the country.",pt:"Quando os pastores viram o que acontecera, fugiram, e foram anunci\xe1-lo na cidade e nos campos."},{verse:35,en:"Then they went out to see what was done; and came to Jesus, and found the man, out of whom the devils were departed, sitting at the feet of Jesus, clothed, and in his right mind: and they were afraid.",pt:"Sa\xedram, pois, a ver o que tinha acontecido, e foram ter com Jesus, a cujos p\xe9s acharam sentado, vestido e em perfeito ju\xedzo, o homem de quem havia sa\xeddo os dem\xf4nios; e se atemorizaram."},{verse:36,en:"They also which saw it told them by what means he that was possessed of the devils was healed.",pt:"Os que tinham visto aquilo contaram-lhes como fora curado o endemoninhado."},{verse:37,en:"Then the whole multitude of the country of the Gadarenes round about besought him to depart from them; for they were taken with great fear: and he went up into the ship, and returned back again.",pt:"Ent\xe3o todo o povo da regi\xe3o dos gerasenos rogou-lhe que se retirasse deles; porque estavam possu\xeddos de grande medo. Pelo que ele entrou no barco, e voltou."},{verse:38,en:"Now the man out of whom the devils were departed besought him that he might be with him: but Jesus sent him away, saying,",pt:"Pedia-lhe, por\xe9m, o homem de quem haviam sa\xeddo os dem\xf4nios que o deixasse estar com ele; mas Jesus o despediu, dizendo:"},{verse:39,en:"Return to thine own house, and shew how great things God hath done unto thee. And he went his way, and published throughout the whole city how great things Jesus had done unto him.",pt:"Volta para tua casa, e conta tudo quanto Deus te fez. E ele se retirou, publicando por toda a cidade tudo quanto Jesus lhe fizera."},{verse:40,en:"And it came to pass, that, when Jesus was returned, the people gladly received him: for they were all waiting for him.",pt:"Quando Jesus voltou, a multid\xe3o o recebeu; porque todos o estavam esperando."},{verse:41,en:"And, behold, there came a man named Jairus, and he was a ruler of the synagogue: and he fell down at Jesus\u2019 feet, and besought him that he would come into his house:",pt:"E eis que veio um homem chamado Jairo, que era chefe da sinagoga; e prostrando-se aos p\xe9s de Jesus, rogava-lhe que fosse a sua casa;"},{verse:42,en:"For he had one only daughter, about twelve years of age, and she lay a dying. But as he went the people thronged him.",pt:"porque tinha uma filha \xfanica, de cerca de doze anos, que estava \xe0 morte. Enquanto, pois, ele ia, apertavam-no as multid\xf5es."},{verse:43,en:"And a woman having an issue of blood twelve years, which had spent all her living upon physicians, neither could be healed of any,",pt:"E certa mulher, que tinha uma hemorragia havia doze anos [e gastara com os m\xe9dicos todos os seus haveres] e por ningu\xe9m pudera ser curada,"},{verse:44,en:"Came behind him, and touched the border of his garment: and immediately her issue of blood stanched.",pt:"chegando-se por detr\xe1s, tocou-lhe a orla do manto, e imediatamente cessou a sua hemorragia."},{verse:45,en:"And Jesus said, Who touched me? When all denied, Peter and they that were with him said, Master, the multitude throng thee and press thee, and sayest thou, Who touched me?",pt:"Perguntou Jesus: Quem \xe9 que me tocou? Como todos negassem, disse-lhe Pedro: Mestre, as multid\xf5es te apertam e te oprimem."},{verse:46,en:"And Jesus said, Somebody hath touched me: for I perceive that virtue is gone out of me.",pt:"Mas disse Jesus: Algu\xe9m me tocou; pois percebi que de mim saiu poder."},{verse:47,en:"And when the woman saw that she was not hid, she came trembling, and falling down before him, she declared unto him before all the people for what cause she had touched him and how she was healed immediately.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, vendo a mulher que n\xe3o passara despercebida, aproximou-se tremendo e, prostrando-se diante dele, declarou-lhe perante todo o povo a causa por que lhe havia tocado, e como fora imediatamente curada."},{verse:48,en:"And he said unto her, Daughter, be of good comfort: thy faith hath made thee whole; go in peace.",pt:"Disse-lhe ele: Filha, a tua f\xe9 te salvou; vai-te em paz."},{verse:49,en:"While he yet spake, there cometh one from the ruler of the synagogue\u2019s house, saying to him, Thy daughter is dead; trouble not the Master.",pt:"Enquanto ainda falava, veio algu\xe9m da casa do chefe da sinagoga dizendo: A tua filha j\xe1 est\xe1 morta; n\xe3o incomodes mais o Mestre."},{verse:50,en:"But when Jesus heard it, he answered him, saying, Fear not: believe only, and she shall be made whole.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, ouvindo-o, respondeu-lhe: N\xe3o temas: cr\xea somente, e ser\xe1 salva."},{verse:51,en:"And when he came into the house, he suffered no man to go in, save Peter, and James, and John, and the father and the mother of the maiden.",pt:"Tendo chegado \xe0 casa, a ningu\xe9m deixou entrar com ele, sen\xe3o a Pedro, Jo\xe3o, Tiago, e o pai e a m\xe3e da menina."},{verse:52,en:"And all wept, and bewailed her: but he said, Weep not; she is not dead, but sleepeth.",pt:"E todos choravam e pranteavam; ele, por\xe9m, disse: N\xe3o choreis; ela n\xe3o est\xe1 morta, mas dorme."},{verse:53,en:"And they laughed him to scorn, knowing that she was dead.",pt:"E riam-se dele, sabendo que ela estava morta."},{verse:54,en:"And he put them all out, and took her by the hand, and called, saying, Maid, arise.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele, tomando-lhe a m\xe3o, exclamou: Menina, levanta-te."},{verse:55,en:"And her spirit came again, and she arose straightway: and he commanded to give her meat.",pt:"E o seu esp\xedrito voltou, e ela se levantou imediatamente; e Jesus mandou que lhe desse de comer."},{verse:56,en:"And her parents were astonished: but he charged them that they should tell no man what was done.",pt:"E seus pais ficaram maravilhados; e ele mandou-lhes que a ningu\xe9m contassem o que havia sucedido."}]}}),789,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then he called his twelve disciples together, and gave them power and authority over all devils, and to cure diseases.",pt:"Reunindo os doze, deu-lhes poder e autoridade sobre todos os dem\xf4nios, e para curarem doen\xe7as;"},{verse:2,en:"And he sent them to preach the kingdom of God, and to heal the sick.",pt:"e enviou-os a pregar o reino de Deus, e fazer curas,"},{verse:3,en:"And he said unto them, Take nothing for your journey, neither staves, nor scrip, neither bread, neither money; neither have two coats apiece.",pt:"dizendo-lhes: Nada leveis para o caminho, nem bord\xe3o, nem alforje, nem p\xe3o, nem dinheiro; nem tenhais duas t\xfanicas."},{verse:4,en:"And whatsoever house ye enter into, there abide, and thence depart.",pt:"Em qualquer casa em que entrardes, nela ficai, e dali partireis."},{verse:5,en:"And whosoever will not receive you, when ye go out of that city, shake off the very dust from your feet for a testimony against them.",pt:"Mas, onde quer que n\xe3o vos receberem, saindo daquela cidade, sacudi o p\xf3 dos vossos p\xe9s, em testemunho contra eles."},{verse:6,en:"And they departed, and went through the towns, preaching the gospel, and healing every where.",pt:"Saindo, pois, os disc\xedpulos percorreram as aldeias, anunciando o evangelho e fazendo curas por toda parte."},{verse:7,en:"Now Herod the tetrarch heard of all that was done by him: and he was perplexed, because that it was said of some, that John was risen from the dead;",pt:"Ora, o tetrarca Herodes soube de tudo o que se passava, e ficou muito perplexo, porque diziam uns: Jo\xe3o ressuscitou dos mortos;"},{verse:8,en:"And of some, that Elias had appeared; and of others, that one of the old prophets was risen again.",pt:"outros: Elias apareceu; e outros: Um dos antigos profetas se levantou."},{verse:9,en:"And Herod said, John have I beheaded: but who is this, of whom I hear such things? And he desired to see him.",pt:"Herodes, por\xe9m, disse: A Jo\xe3o eu mandei degolar; quem \xe9, pois, este a respeito de quem ou\xe7o tais coisas? E procurava v\xea-lo."},{verse:10,en:"And the apostles, when they were returned, told him all that they had done. And he took them, and went aside privately into a desert place belonging to the city called Bethsaida.",pt:"Quando os ap\xf3stolos voltaram, contaram-lhe tudo o que havia feito. E ele, levando-os consigo, retirou-se \xe0 parte para uma cidade chamada Betsaida."},{verse:11,en:"And the people, when they knew it, followed him: and he received them, and spake unto them of the kingdom of God, and healed them that had need of healing.",pt:"Mas as multid\xf5es, percebendo isto, seguiram-no; e ele as recebeu, e falava-lhes do reino de Deus, e sarava os que necessitavam de cura."},{verse:12,en:"And when the day began to wear away, then came the twelve, and said unto him, Send the multitude away, that they may go into the towns and country round about, and lodge, and get victuals: for we are here in a desert place.",pt:"Ora, quando o dia come\xe7ava a declinar, aproximando-se os doze, disseram-lhe: Despede a multid\xe3o, para que, indo \xe0s aldeias e aos s\xedtios em redor, se hospedem, e achem o que comer; porque aqui estamos em lugar deserto."},{verse:13,en:"But he said unto them, Give ye them to eat. And they said, We have no more but five loaves and two fishes; except we should go and buy meat for all this people.",pt:"Mas ele lhes disse: Dai-lhes v\xf3s de comer. Responderam eles: N\xe3o temos sen\xe3o cinco p\xe3es e dois peixes; salvo se n\xf3s formos comprar comida para todo este povo."},{verse:14,en:"For they were about five thousand men. And he said to his disciples, Make them sit down by fifties in a company.",pt:"Pois eram cerca de cinco mil homens. Ent\xe3o disse a seus disc\xedpulos: Fazei-os reclinar-se em grupos de cerca de cinquenta cada um."},{verse:15,en:"And they did so, and made them all sit down.",pt:"Assim o fizeram, mandando que todos se reclinassem."},{verse:16,en:"Then he took the five loaves and the two fishes, and looking up to heaven, he blessed them, and brake, and gave to the disciples to set before the multitude.",pt:"E tomando Jesus os cinco p\xe3es e os dois peixes, e olhando para o c\xe9u, os aben\xe7oou e partiu, e os entregava aos seus disc\xedpulos para os porem diante da multid\xe3o."},{verse:17,en:"And they did eat, and were all filled: and there was taken up of fragments that remained to them twelve baskets.",pt:"Todos, pois, comeram e se fartaram; e foram levantados, do que lhes sobejou, doze cestos de peda\xe7os."},{verse:18,en:"And it came to pass, as he was alone praying, his disciples were with him: and he asked them, saying, Whom say the people that I am?",pt:"Enquanto ele estava orando \xe0 parte achavam-se com ele somente seus disc\xedpulos; e perguntou-lhes: Quem dizem as multid\xf5es que eu sou?"},{verse:19,en:"They answering said, John the Baptist; but some say, Elias; and others say, that one of the old prophets is risen again.",pt:"Responderam eles: Uns dizem: Jo\xe3o, o Batista; outros: Elias; e ainda outros, que um dos antigos profetas se levantou."},{verse:20,en:"He said unto them, But whom say ye that I am? Peter answering said, The Christ of God.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes perguntou: Mas v\xf3s, quem dizeis que eu sou? Respondendo Pedro, disse: O Cristo de Deus."},{verse:21,en:"And he straitly charged them, and commanded them to tell no man that thing;",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, advertindo-os, mandou que n\xe3o contassem isso a ningu\xe9m;"},{verse:22,en:"Saying, The Son of man must suffer many things, and be rejected of the elders and chief priests and scribes, and be slain, and be raised the third day.",pt:"e disse-lhes: \xc9 necess\xe1rio que o Filho do homem pade\xe7a muitas coisas, que seja rejeitado pelos anci\xe3os, pelos principais sacerdotes e escribas, que seja morto, e que ao terceiro dia ressuscite."},{verse:23,en:"And he said to them all, If any man will come after me, let him deny himself, and take up his cross daily, and follow me.",pt:"Em seguida dizia a todos: Se algu\xe9m quer vir ap\xf3s mim, negue-se a si mesmo, tome cada dia a sua cruz, e siga-me."},{verse:24,en:"For whosoever will save his life shall lose it: but whosoever will lose his life for my sake, the same shall save it.",pt:"Pois quem quiser salvar a sua vida, perd\xea-la-\xe1; mas quem perder a sua vida por amor de mim, esse a salvar\xe1."},{verse:25,en:"For what is a man advantaged, if he gain the whole world, and lose himself, or be cast away?",pt:"Pois, que aproveita ao homem ganhar o mundo inteiro, e perder-se, ou prejudicar-se a si mesmo?"},{verse:26,en:"For whosoever shall be ashamed of me and of my words, of him shall the Son of man be ashamed, when he shall come in his own glory, and in his Father\u2019s, and of the holy angels.",pt:"Porque, quem se envergonhar de mim e das minhas palavras, dele se envergonhar\xe1 o Filho do homem, quando vier na sua gl\xf3ria, e na do Pai e dos santos anjos."},{verse:27,en:"But I tell you of a truth, there be some standing here, which shall not taste of death, till they see the kingdom of God.",pt:"Mas em verdade vos digo: Alguns h\xe1, dos que est\xe3o aqui, que de modo nenhum provar\xe3o a morte at\xe9 que vejam o reino de Deus."},{verse:28,en:"And it came to pass about an eight days after these sayings, he took Peter and John and James, and went up into a mountain to pray.",pt:"Cerca de oito dias depois de ter proferido essas palavras, tomou Jesus consigo a Pedro, a Jo\xe3o e a Tiago, e subiu ao monte para orar."},{verse:29,en:"And as he prayed, the fashion of his countenance was altered, and his raiment was white and glistering.",pt:"Enquanto ele orava, mudou-se a apar\xeancia do seu rosto, e a sua roupa tornou-se branca e resplandecente."},{verse:30,en:"And, behold, there talked with him two men, which were Moses and Elias:",pt:"E eis que estavam falando com ele dois var\xf5es, que eram Mois\xe9s e Elias,"},{verse:31,en:"Who appeared in glory, and spake of his decease which he should accomplish at Jerusalem.",pt:"os quais apareceram com gl\xf3ria, e falavam da sua partida que estava para cumprir-se em Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:32,en:"But Peter and they that were with him were heavy with sleep: and when they were awake, they saw his glory, and the two men that stood with him.",pt:"Ora, Pedro e os que estavam com ele se haviam deixado vencer pelo sono; despertando, por\xe9m, viram a sua gl\xf3ria e os dois var\xf5es que estavam com ele."},{verse:33,en:"And it came to pass, as they departed from him, Peter said unto Jesus, Master, it is good for us to be here: and let us make three tabernacles; one for thee, and one for Moses, and one for Elias: not knowing what he said.",pt:"E, quando estes se apartavam dele, disse Pedro a Jesus: Mestre, bom \xe9 estarmos n\xf3s aqui: fa\xe7amos, pois, tr\xeas cabanas, uma para ti, uma para Mois\xe9s, e uma para Elias, n\xe3o sabendo o que dizia."},{verse:34,en:"While he thus spake, there came a cloud, and overshadowed them: and they feared as they entered into the cloud.",pt:"Enquanto ele ainda falava, veio uma nuvem que os cobriu; e se atemorizaram ao entrarem na nuvem."},{verse:35,en:"And there came a voice out of the cloud, saying, This is my beloved Son: hear him.",pt:"E da nuvem saiu uma voz que dizia: Este \xe9 o meu Filho, o meu eleito; a ele ouvi."},{verse:36,en:"And when the voice was past, Jesus was found alone. And they kept it close, and told no man in those days any of those things which they had seen.",pt:"Ao soar esta voz, Jesus foi achado sozinho; e eles calaram-se, e por aqueles dias n\xe3o contaram a ningu\xe9m nada do que tinham visto."},{verse:37,en:"And it came to pass, that on the next day, when they were come down from the hill, much people met him.",pt:"No dia seguinte, quando desceram do monte, veio-lhe ao encontro uma grande multid\xe3o."},{verse:38,en:"And, behold, a man of the company cried out, saying, Master, I beseech thee, look upon my son: for he is mine only child.",pt:"E eis que um homem dentre a multid\xe3o clamou, dizendo: Mestre, pe\xe7o-te que olhes para meu filho, porque \xe9 o \xfanico que tenho;"},{verse:39,en:"And, lo, a spirit taketh him, and he suddenly crieth out; and it teareth him that he foameth again, and bruising him hardly departeth from him.",pt:"pois um esp\xedrito se apodera dele, fazendo-o gritar subitamente, convulsiona-o at\xe9 escumar e, mesmo depois de o ter quebrantado, dificilmente o larga."},{verse:40,en:"And I besought thy disciples to cast him out; and they could not.",pt:"E roguei aos teus disc\xedpulos que o expulsassem, mas n\xe3o puderam."},{verse:41,en:"And Jesus answering said, O faithless and perverse generation, how long shall I be with you, and suffer you? Bring thy son hither.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: \xd3 gera\xe7\xe3o incr\xe9dula e perversa! at\xe9 quando estarei convosco e vos sofrerei? Traze-me c\xe1 o teu filho."},{verse:42,en:"And as he was yet a coming, the devil threw him down, and tare him. And Jesus rebuked the unclean spirit, and healed the child, and delivered him again to his father.",pt:"Ainda quando ele vinha chegando, o dem\xf4nio o derribou e o convulsionou; mas Jesus repreendeu o esp\xedrito imundo, curou o menino e o entregou a seu pai."},{verse:43,en:"And they were all amazed at the mighty power of God. But while they wondered every one at all things which Jesus did, he said unto his disciples,",pt:"E todos se maravilhavam da majestade de Deus. E admirando-se todos de tudo o que Jesus fazia, disse ele a seus disc\xedpulos:"},{verse:44,en:"Let these sayings sink down into your ears: for the Son of man shall be delivered into the hands of men.",pt:"Ponde v\xf3s estas palavras em vossos ouvidos; pois o Filho do homem est\xe1 para ser entregue nas m\xe3os dos homens."},{verse:45,en:"But they understood not this saying, and it was hid from them, that they perceived it not: and they feared to ask him of that saying.",pt:"Eles, por\xe9m, n\xe3o entendiam essa palavra, cujo sentido lhes era encoberto para que n\xe3o o compreendessem; e temiam interrog\xe1-lo a esse respeito."},{verse:46,en:"Then there arose a reasoning among them, which of them should be greatest.",pt:"E suscitou-se entre eles uma discuss\xe3o sobre qual deles seria o maior."},{verse:47,en:"And Jesus, perceiving the thought of their heart, took a child, and set him by him,",pt:"Mas Jesus, percebendo o pensamento de seus cora\xe7\xf5es, tomou uma crian\xe7a, p\xf4-la junto de si,"},{verse:48,en:"And said unto them, Whosoever shall receive this child in my name receiveth me: and whosoever shall receive me receiveth him that sent me: for he that is least among you all, the same shall be great.",pt:"e disse-lhes: Qualquer que receber esta crian\xe7a em meu nome, a mim me recebe; e qualquer que me receber a mim, recebe aquele que me enviou; pois aquele que entre v\xf3s todos \xe9 o menor, esse \xe9 grande."},{verse:49,en:"And John answered and said, Master, we saw one casting out devils in thy name; and we forbad him, because he followeth not with us.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jo\xe3o: Mestre, vimos um homem que em teu nome expulsava dem\xf4nios; e lho proibimos, porque n\xe3o segue conosco."},{verse:50,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Forbid him not: for he that is not against us is for us.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: N\xe3o lho proibais; porque quem n\xe3o \xe9 contra v\xf3s \xe9 por v\xf3s."},{verse:51,en:"And it came to pass, when the time was come that he should be received up, he stedfastly set his face to go to Jerusalem,",pt:"Ora, quando se completavam os dias para a sua assun\xe7\xe3o, manifestou o firme prop\xf3sito de ir a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:52,en:"And sent messengers before his face: and they went, and entered into a village of the Samaritans, to make ready for him.",pt:"Enviou, pois, mensageiros adiante de si. Indo eles, entraram numa aldeia de samaritanos para lhe prepararem pousada."},{verse:53,en:"And they did not receive him, because his face was as though he would go to Jerusalem.",pt:"Mas n\xe3o o receberam, porque viajava em dire\xe7\xe3o a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:54,en:"And when his disciples James and John saw this, they said, Lord, wilt thou that we command fire to come down from heaven, and consume them, even as Elias did?",pt:"Vendo isto os disc\xedpulos Tiago e Jo\xe3o, disseram: Senhor, queres que mandemos descer fogo do c\xe9u para os consumir [como Elias tamb\xe9m fez?]"},{verse:55,en:"But he turned, and rebuked them, and said, Ye know not what manner of spirit ye are of.",pt:"Ele por\xe9m, voltando-se, repreendeu-os, [e disse: V\xf3s n\xe3o sabeis de que esp\xedrito sois.]"},{verse:56,en:"For the Son of man is not come to destroy men\u2019s lives, but to save them. And they went to another village.",pt:"[Pois o Filho do Homem n\xe3o veio para destruir as vidas dos homens, mas para salv\xe1-las.] E foram para outra aldeia."},{verse:57,en:"And it came to pass, that, as they went in the way, a certain man said unto him, Lord, I will follow thee whithersoever thou goest.",pt:"Quando iam pelo caminho, disse-lhe um homem: Seguir-te-ei para onde quer que fores."},{verse:58,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Foxes have holes, and birds of the air have nests; but the Son of man hath not where to lay his head.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: As raposas t\xeam covis, e as aves do c\xe9u t\xeam ninhos; mas o Filho do homem n\xe3o tem onde reclinar a cabe\xe7a."},{verse:59,en:"And he said unto another, Follow me. But he said, Lord, suffer me first to go and bury my father.",pt:"E a outro disse: Segue-me. Ao que este respondeu: Permite-me ir primeiro sepultar meu pai."},{verse:60,en:"Jesus said unto him, Let the dead bury their dead: but go thou and preach the kingdom of God.",pt:"Replicou-lhe Jesus: Deixa os mortos sepultar os seus pr\xf3prios mortos; tu, por\xe9m, vai e anuncia o reino de Deus."},{verse:61,en:"And another also said, Lord, I will follow thee; but let me first go bid them farewell, which are at home at my house.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, lhe respondeu: Ningu\xe9m que lan\xe7a m\xe3o do arado e olha para tr\xe1s \xe9 apto para o reino de Deus."},{verse:62,en:"And Jesus said unto him, No man, having put his hand to the plough, and looking back, is fit for the kingdom of God.",pt:""}]}}),790,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After these things the Lord appointed other seventy also, and sent them two and two before his face into every city and place, whither he himself would come.",pt:"Depois disso designou o Senhor outros setenta, e os enviou adiante de si, de dois em dois, a todas as cidades e lugares aonde ele havia de ir."},{verse:2,en:"Therefore said he unto them, The harvest truly is great, but the labourers are few: pray ye therefore the Lord of the harvest, that he would send forth labourers into his harvest.",pt:"E dizia-lhes: Na verdade, a seara \xe9 grande, mas os trabalhadores s\xe3o poucos; rogai, pois, ao Senhor da seara que mande trabalhadores para a sua seara."},{verse:3,en:"Go your ways: behold, I send you forth as lambs among wolves.",pt:"Ide; eis que vos envio como cordeiros ao meio de lobos."},{verse:4,en:"Carry neither purse, nor scrip, nor shoes: and salute no man by the way.",pt:"N\xe3o leveis bolsa, nem alforge, nem alparcas; e a ningu\xe9m saudeis pelo caminho."},{verse:5,en:"And into whatsoever house ye enter, first say, Peace be to this house.",pt:"Em qualquer casa em que entrardes, dizei primeiro: Paz seja com esta casa."},{verse:6,en:"And if the son of peace be there, your peace shall rest upon it: if not, it shall turn to you again.",pt:"E se ali houver um filho da paz, repousar\xe1 sobre ele a vossa paz; e se n\xe3o, voltar\xe1 para v\xf3s."},{verse:7,en:"And in the same house remain, eating and drinking such things as they give: for the labourer is worthy of his hire. Go not from house to house.",pt:"Ficai nessa casa, comendo e bebendo do que eles tiverem; pois digno \xe9 o trabalhador do seu sal\xe1rio. N\xe3o andeis de casa em casa."},{verse:8,en:"And into whatsoever city ye enter, and they receive you, eat such things as are set before you:",pt:"Tamb\xe9m, em qualquer cidade em que entrardes, e vos receberem, comei do que puserem diante de v\xf3s."},{verse:9,en:"And heal the sick that are therein, and say unto them, The kingdom of God is come nigh unto you.",pt:"Curai os enfermos que nela houver, e dizer-lhes: \xc9 chegado a v\xf3s o reino de Deus."},{verse:10,en:"But into whatsoever city ye enter, and they receive you not, go your ways out into the streets of the same, and say,",pt:"Mas em qualquer cidade em que entrardes, e vos n\xe3o receberem, sa\xedndo pelas ruas, dizei:"},{verse:11,en:"Even the very dust of your city, which cleaveth on us, we do wipe off against you: notwithstanding be ye sure of this, that the kingdom of God is come nigh unto you.",pt:"At\xe9 o p\xf3 da vossa cidade, que se nos pegou aos p\xe9s, sacudimos contra v\xf3s. Contudo, sabei isto: que o reino de Deus \xe9 chegado."},{verse:12,en:"But I say unto you, that it shall be more tolerable in that day for Sodom, than for that city.",pt:"Digo-vos que naquele dia haver\xe1 menos rigor para Sodoma, do que para aquela cidade."},{verse:13,en:"Woe unto thee, Chorazin! woe unto thee, Bethsaida! for if the mighty works had been done in Tyre and Sidon, which have been done in you, they had a great while ago repented, sitting in sackcloth and ashes.",pt:"Ai de ti, Corazim! ai de ti, Betsaida! Porque, se em Tiro e em Sidom se tivessem operado os milagres que em v\xf3s se operaram, h\xe1 muito, sentadas em cil\xedcio e cinza, elas se teriam arrependido."},{verse:14,en:"But it shall be more tolerable for Tyre and Sidon at the judgment, than for you.",pt:"Contudo, para Tiro e Sidom haver\xe1 menos rigor no ju\xedzo do que para v\xf3s."},{verse:15,en:"And thou, Capernaum, which art exalted to heaven, shalt be thrust down to hell.",pt:"E tu, Cafarnaum, porventura ser\xe1s elevada at\xe9 o c\xe9u? at\xe9 o hades descer\xe1s."},{verse:16,en:"He that heareth you heareth me; and he that despiseth you despiseth me; and he that despiseth me despiseth him that sent me.",pt:"Quem vos ouve, a mim me ouve; e quem vos rejeita, a mim me rejeita; e quem a mim me rejeita, rejeita aquele que me enviou."},{verse:17,en:"And the seventy returned again with joy, saying, Lord, even the devils are subject unto us through thy name.",pt:"Voltaram depois os setenta com alegria, dizendo: Senhor, em teu nome, at\xe9 os dem\xf4nios se nos submetem."},{verse:18,en:"And he said unto them, I beheld Satan as lightning fall from heaven.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes ele: Eu via Satan\xe1s, como raio, cair do c\xe9u."},{verse:19,en:"Behold, I give unto you power to tread on serpents and scorpions, and over all the power of the enemy: and nothing shall by any means hurt you.",pt:"Eis que vos dei autoridade para pisar serpentes e escorpi\xf5es, e sobre todo o poder do inimigo; e nada vos far\xe1 dano algum."},{verse:20,en:"Notwithstanding in this rejoice not, that the spirits are subject unto you; but rather rejoice, because your names are written in heaven.",pt:"Contudo, n\xe3o vos alegreis porque se vos submetem os esp\xedritos; alegrai-vos antes por estarem os vossos nomes escritos nos c\xe9us."},{verse:21,en:"In that hour Jesus rejoiced in spirit, and said, I thank thee, O Father, Lord of heaven and earth, that thou hast hid these things from the wise and prudent, and hast revealed them unto babes: even so, Father; for so it seemed good in thy sight.",pt:"Naquela mesma hora exultou Jesus no Esp\xedrito Santo, e disse: Gra\xe7as te dou, \xf3 Pai, Senhor do c\xe9u e da terra, porque ocultaste estas coisas aos s\xe1bios e entendidos, e as revelaste aos pequeninos; sim, \xf3 Pai, porque assim foi do teu agrado."},{verse:22,en:"All things are delivered to me of my Father: and no man knoweth who the Son is, but the Father; and who the Father is, but the Son, and he to whom the Son will reveal him.",pt:"Todas as coisas me foram entregues por meu Pai; e ningu\xe9m conhece quem \xe9 o Filho sen\xe3o o Pai, nem quem \xe9 o Pai sen\xe3o o Filho, e aquele a quem o Filho o quiser revelar."},{verse:23,en:"And he turned him unto his disciples, and said privately, Blessed are the eyes which see the things that ye see:",pt:"E voltando-se para os disc\xedpulos, disse-lhes em particular: Bem-aventurados os olhos que v\xeaem o que v\xf3s vedes."},{verse:24,en:"For I tell you, that many prophets and kings have desired to see those things which ye see, and have not seen them; and to hear those things which ye hear, and have not heard them.",pt:"Pois vos digo que muitos profetas e reis desejaram ver o que v\xf3s vedes, e n\xe3o o viram; e ouvir o que ouvis, e n\xe3o o ouviram."},{verse:25,en:"And, behold, a certain lawyer stood up, and tempted him, saying, Master, what shall I do to inherit eternal life?",pt:"E eis que se levantou certo doutor da lei e, para o experimentar, disse: Mestre, que farei para herdar a vida eterna?"},{verse:26,en:"He said unto him, What is written in the law? how readest thou?",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Jesus: Que est\xe1 escrito na lei? Como l\xeas tu?"},{verse:27,en:"And he answering said, Thou shalt love the Lord thy God with all thy heart, and with all thy soul, and with all thy strength, and with all thy mind; and thy neighbour as thyself.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe ele: Amar\xe1s ao Senhor teu Deus de todo o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, de toda a tua alma, de todas as tuas for\xe7as e de todo o teu entendimento, e ao teu pr\xf3ximo como a ti mesmo."},{verse:28,en:"And he said unto him, Thou hast answered right: this do, and thou shalt live.",pt:"Tornou-lhe Jesus: Respondeste bem; faze isso, e viver\xe1s."},{verse:29,en:"But he, willing to justify himself, said unto Jesus, And who is my neighbour?",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, querendo justificar-se, perguntou a Jesus: E quem \xe9 o meu pr\xf3ximo?"},{verse:30,en:"And Jesus answering said, A certain man went down from Jerusalem to Jericho, and fell among thieves, which stripped him of his raiment, and wounded him, and departed, leaving him half dead.",pt:"Jesus, prosseguindo, disse: Um homem descia de Jerusal\xe9m a Jeric\xf3, e caiu nas m\xe3os de salteadores, os quais o despojaram e espancando-o, se retiraram, deixando-o meio morto."},{verse:31,en:"And by chance there came down a certain priest that way: and when he saw him, he passed by on the other side.",pt:"Casualmente, descia pelo mesmo caminho certo sacerdote; e vendo-o, passou de largo."},{verse:32,en:"And likewise a Levite, when he was at the place, came and looked on him, and passed by on the other side.",pt:"De igual modo tamb\xe9m um levita chegou \xe0quele lugar, viu-o, e passou de largo."},{verse:33,en:"But a certain Samaritan, as he journeyed, came where he was: and when he saw him, he had compassion on him,",pt:"Mas um samaritano, que ia de viagem, chegou perto dele e, vendo-o, encheu-se de compaix\xe3o;"},{verse:34,en:"And went to him, and bound up his wounds, pouring in oil and wine, and set him on his own beast, and brought him to an inn, and took care of him.",pt:"e aproximando-se, atou-lhe as feridas, deitando nelas azeite e vinho; e pondo-o sobre a sua cavalgadura, levou-o para uma estalagem e cuidou dele."},{verse:35,en:"And on the morrow when he departed, he took out two pence, and gave them to the host, and said unto him, Take care of him; and whatsoever thou spendest more, when I come again, I will repay thee.",pt:"No dia seguinte tirou dois den\xe1rios, deu-os ao hospedeiro e disse-lhe: Cuida dele; e tudo o que gastares a mais, eu to pagarei quando voltar."},{verse:36,en:"Which now of these three, thinkest thou, was neighbour unto him that fell among the thieves?",pt:"Qual, pois, destes tr\xeas te parece ter sido o pr\xf3ximo daquele que caiu nas m\xe3os dos salteadores?"},{verse:37,en:"And he said, He that shewed mercy on him. Then said Jesus unto him, Go, and do thou likewise.",pt:"Respondeu o doutor da lei: Aquele que usou de miseric\xf3rdia para com ele. Disse-lhe, pois, Jesus: Vai, e faze tu o mesmo."},{verse:38,en:"Now it came to pass, as they went, that he entered into a certain village: and a certain woman named Martha received him into her house.",pt:"Ora, quando iam de caminho, entrou Jesus numa aldeia; e certa mulher, por nome Marta, o recebeu em sua casa."},{verse:39,en:"And she had a sister called Mary, which also sat at Jesus\u2019 feet, and heard his word.",pt:"Tinha esta uma irm\xe3 chamada Maria, a qual, sentando-se aos p\xe9s do Senhor, ouvia a sua palavra."},{verse:40,en:"But Martha was cumbered about much serving, and came to him, and said, Lord, dost thou not care that my sister hath left me to serve alone? bid her therefore that she help me.",pt:"Marta, por\xe9m, andava preocupada com muito servi\xe7o; e aproximando-se, disse: Senhor, n\xe3o se te d\xe1 que minha irm\xe3 me tenha deixado a servir sozinha? Dize-lhe, pois, que me ajude."},{verse:41,en:"And Jesus answered and said unto her, Martha, Martha, thou art careful and troubled about many things:",pt:"Respondeu-lhe o Senhor: Marta, Marta, est\xe1s ansiosa e perturbada com muitas coisas;"},{verse:42,en:"But one thing is needful: and Mary hath chosen that good part, which shall not be taken away from her.",pt:"entretanto poucas s\xe3o necess\xe1rias, ou mesmo uma s\xf3; e Maria escolheu a boa parte, a qual n\xe3o lhe ser\xe1 tirada."}]}}),791,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass, that, as he was praying in a certain place, when he ceased, one of his disciples said unto him, Lord, teach us to pray, as John also taught his disciples.",pt:"Estava Jesus em certo lugar orando e, quando acabou, disse-lhe um dos seus disc\xedpulos: Senhor, ensina-nos a orar, como tamb\xe9m Jo\xe3o ensinou aos seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:2,en:"And he said unto them, When ye pray, say, Our Father which art in heaven, Hallowed be thy name. Thy kingdom come. Thy will be done, as in heaven, so in earth.",pt:"Ao que ele lhes disse: Quando orardes, dizei: Pai, santificado seja o teu nome; venha o teu reino;"},{verse:3,en:"Give us day by day our daily bread.",pt:"d\xe1-nos cada dia o nosso p\xe3o cotidiano;"},{verse:4,en:"And forgive us our sins; for we also forgive every one that is indebted to us. And lead us not into temptation; but deliver us from evil.",pt:"e perdoa-nos os nossos pecados, pois tamb\xe9m n\xf3s perdoamos a todo aquele que nos deve; e n\xe3o nos deixes entrar em tenta\xe7\xe3o, [mas livra-nos do mal.]"},{verse:5,en:"And he said unto them, Which of you shall have a friend, and shall go unto him at midnight, and say unto him, Friend, lend me three loaves;",pt:"Disse-lhes tamb\xe9m: Se um de v\xf3s tiver um amigo, e se for procur\xe1-lo \xe0 meia-noite e lhe disser: Amigo, empresta-me tr\xeas p\xe3es,"},{verse:6,en:"For a friend of mine in his journey is come to me, and I have nothing to set before him?",pt:"pois que um amigo meu, estando em viagem, chegou a minha casa, e n\xe3o tenho o que lhe oferecer;"},{verse:7,en:"And he from within shall answer and say, Trouble me not: the door is now shut, and my children are with me in bed; I cannot rise and give thee.",pt:"e se ele, de dentro, responder: N\xe3o me incomodes; j\xe1 est\xe1 a porta fechada, e os meus filhos est\xe3o comigo na cama; n\xe3o posso levantar-me para te atender;"},{verse:8,en:"I say unto you, Though he will not rise and give him, because he is his friend, yet because of his importunity he will rise and give him as many as he needeth.",pt:"digo-vos que, ainda que se levante para lhos dar por ser seu amigo, todavia, por causa da sua importuna\xe7\xe3o, se levantar\xe1 e lhe dar\xe1 quantos p\xe3es ele precisar."},{verse:9,en:"And I say unto you, Ask, and it shall be given you; seek, and ye shall find; knock, and it shall be opened unto you.",pt:"Pelo que eu vos digo: Pedi, e dar-se-vos-\xe1; buscai e achareis; batei, e abrir-se-vos-\xe1;"},{verse:10,en:"For every one that asketh receiveth; and he that seeketh findeth; and to him that knocketh it shall be opened.",pt:"pois todo o que pede, recebe; e quem busca acha; e ao que bate, abrir-se-lhe-\xe1."},{verse:11,en:"If a son shall ask bread of any of you that is a father, will he give him a stone? or if he ask a fish, will he for a fish give him a serpent?",pt:"E qual o pai dentre v\xf3s que, se o filho lhe pedir p\xe3o, lhe dar\xe1 uma pedra? Ou, se lhe pedir peixe, lhe dar\xe1 por peixe uma serpente?"},{verse:12,en:"Or if he shall ask an egg, will he offer him a scorpion?",pt:"Ou, se pedir um ovo, lhe dar\xe1 um escorpi\xe3o?"},{verse:13,en:"If ye then, being evil, know how to give good gifts unto your children: how much more shall your heavenly Father give the Holy Spirit to them that ask him?",pt:"Se v\xf3s, pois, sendo maus, sabeis dar boas d\xe1divas aos vossos filhos, quanto mais dar\xe1 o Pai celestial o Esp\xedrito Santo \xe0queles que lho pedirem?"},{verse:14,en:"And he was casting out a devil, and it was dumb. And it came to pass, when the devil was gone out, the dumb spake; and the people wondered.",pt:"Estava Jesus expulsando um dem\xf4nio, que era mudo; e aconteceu que, saindo o dem\xf4nio, o mudo falou; e as multid\xf5es se admiraram."},{verse:15,en:"But some of them said, He casteth out devils through Beelzebub the chief of the devils.",pt:"Mas alguns deles disseram: \xc9 por Belzebu, o pr\xedncipe dos dem\xf4nios, que ele expulsa os dem\xf4nios."},{verse:16,en:"And others, tempting him, sought of him a sign from heaven.",pt:"E outros, experimentando-o, lhe pediam um sinal do c\xe9u."},{verse:17,en:"But he, knowing their thoughts, said unto them, Every kingdom divided against itself is brought to desolation; and a house divided against a house falleth.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, conhecendo-lhes os pensamentos, disse-lhes: Todo reino dividido contra si mesmo ser\xe1 assolado, e casa sobre casa cair\xe1."},{verse:18,en:"If Satan also be divided against himself, how shall his kingdom stand? because ye say that I cast out devils through Beelzebub.",pt:"Ora, pois, se Satan\xe1s est\xe1 dividido contra si mesmo, como subsistir\xe1 o seu reino? Pois dizeis que eu expulso dos dem\xf4nios por Belzebu."},{verse:19,en:"And if I by Beelzebub cast out devils, by whom do your sons cast them out? therefore shall they be your judges.",pt:"E, se eu expulso os dem\xf4nios por Belzebu, por quem os expulsam os vossos filhos? Por isso eles mesmos ser\xe3o os vossos juizes."},{verse:20,en:"But if I with the finger of God cast out devils, no doubt the kingdom of God is come upon you.",pt:"Mas, se \xe9 pelo dedo de Deus que eu expulso os dem\xf4nios, logo \xe9 chegado a v\xf3s o reino de Deus."},{verse:21,en:"When a strong man armed keepeth his palace, his goods are in peace:",pt:"Quando o valente guarda, armado, a sua casa, em seguran\xe7a est\xe3o os seus bens;"},{verse:22,en:"But when a stronger than he shall come upon him, and overcome him, he taketh from him all his armour wherein he trusted, and divideth his spoils.",pt:"mas, sobrevindo outro mais valente do que ele, e vencendo-o, tira-lhe toda a armadura em que confiava, e reparte os seus despojos."},{verse:23,en:"He that is not with me is against me: and he that gathereth not with me scattereth.",pt:"Quem n\xe3o \xe9 comigo, \xe9 contra mim; e quem comigo n\xe3o ajunta, espalha."},{verse:24,en:"When the unclean spirit is gone out of a man, he walketh through dry places, seeking rest; and finding none, he saith, I will return unto my house whence I came out.",pt:"Ora, havendo o esp\xedrito imundo sa\xedndo do homem, anda por lugares \xe1ridos, buscando repouso; e n\xe3o o encontrando, diz: Voltarei para minha casa, donde sa\xed."},{verse:25,en:"And when he cometh, he findeth it swept and garnished.",pt:"E chegando, acha-a varrida e adornada."},{verse:26,en:"Then goeth he, and taketh to him seven other spirits more wicked than himself; and they enter in, and dwell there: and the last state of that man is worse than the first.",pt:"Ent\xe3o vai, e leva consigo outros sete esp\xedritos piores do que ele e, entrando, habitam ali; e o \xfaltimo estado desse homem vem a ser pior do que o primeiro."},{verse:27,en:"And it came to pass, as he spake these things, a certain woman of the company lifted up her voice, and said unto him, Blessed is the womb that bare thee, and the paps which thou hast sucked.",pt:"Ora, enquanto ele dizia estas coisas, certa mulher dentre a multid\xe3o levantou a voz e lhe disse: Bem-aventurado o ventre que te trouxe e os peitos em que te amamentaste."},{verse:28,en:"But he said, Yea rather, blessed are they that hear the word of God, and keep it.",pt:"Mas ele respondeu: Antes bem-aventurados os que ouvem a palavra de Deus, e a observam."},{verse:29,en:"And when the people were gathered thick together, he began to say, This is an evil generation: they seek a sign; and there shall no sign be given it, but the sign of Jonas the prophet.",pt:"Como aflu\xedssem as multid\xf5es, come\xe7ou ele a dizer: Gera\xe7\xe3o perversa \xe9 esta; ela pede um sinal; e nenhum sinal se lhe dar\xe1, sen\xe3o o de Jonas;"},{verse:30,en:"For as Jonas was a sign unto the Ninevites, so shall also the Son of man be to this generation.",pt:"porquanto, assim como Jonas foi sinal para os ninivitas, tamb\xe9m o Filho do homem o ser\xe1 para esta gera\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:31,en:"The queen of the south shall rise up in the judgment with the men of this generation, and condemn them: for she came from the utmost parts of the earth to hear the wisdom of Solomon; and, behold, a greater than Solomon is here.",pt:"A rainha do sul se levantar\xe1 no ju\xedzo com os homens desta gera\xe7\xe3o, e os condenar\xe1; porque veio dos confins da terra para ouvir a sabedoria de Salom\xe3o; e eis, aqui quem \xe9 maior do que Salom\xe3o."},{verse:32,en:"The men of Nineve shall rise up in the judgment with this generation, and shall condemn it: for they repented at the preaching of Jonas; and, behold, a greater than Jonas is here.",pt:"Os homens de N\xednive se levantar\xe3o no ju\xedzo com esta gera\xe7\xe3o, e a condenar\xe3o; porque se arrependeram com a prega\xe7\xe3o de Jonas; e eis aqui quem \xe9 maior do que Jonas."},{verse:33,en:"No man, when he hath lighted a candle, putteth it in a secret place, neither under a bushel, but on a candlestick, that they which come in may see the light.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m, depois de acender uma candeia, a p\xf5e em lugar oculto, nem debaixo do alqueire, mas no velador, para que os que entram vejam a luz."},{verse:34,en:"The light of the body is the eye: therefore when thine eye is single, thy whole body also is full of light; but when thine eye is evil, thy body also is full of darkness.",pt:"A candeia do corpo s\xe3o os olhos. Quando, pois, os teus olhos forem bons, todo o teu corpo ser\xe1 luminoso; mas, quando forem maus, o teu corpo ser\xe1 tenebroso."},{verse:35,en:"Take heed therefore that the light which is in thee be not darkness.",pt:"V\xea, ent\xe3o, que a luz que h\xe1 em ti n\xe3o sejam trevas."},{verse:36,en:"If thy whole body therefore be full of light, having no part dark, the whole shall be full of light, as when the bright shining of a candle doth give thee light.",pt:"Se, pois, todo o teu corpo estiver iluminado, sem ter parte alguma em trevas, ser\xe1 inteiramente luminoso, como quando a candeia te alumia com o seu resplendor."},{verse:37,en:"And as he spake, a certain Pharisee besought him to dine with him: and he went in, and sat down to meat.",pt:"Acabando Jesus de falar, um fariseu o convidou para almo\xe7ar com ele; e havendo Jesus entrado, reclinou-se \xe0 mesa."},{verse:38,en:"And when the Pharisee saw it, he marvelled that he had not first washed before dinner.",pt:"O fariseu admirou-se, vendo que ele n\xe3o se lavara antes de almo\xe7ar."},{verse:39,en:"And the Lord said unto him, Now do ye Pharisees make clean the outside of the cup and the platter; but your inward part is full of ravening and wickedness.",pt:"Ao que o Senhor lhe disse: Ora v\xf3s, os fariseus, limpais o exterior do corpo e do prato; mas o vosso interior do copo e do prato; mas o vosso interior est\xe1 cheio de rapina e maldade."},{verse:40,en:"Ye fools, did not he that made that which is without make that which is within also?",pt:"Loucos! quem fez o exterior, n\xe3o fez tamb\xe9m o inferior?"},{verse:41,en:"But rather give alms of such things as ye have; and, behold, all things are clean unto you.",pt:"Dai, por\xe9m, de esmola o que est\xe1 dentro do copo e do prato, e eis que todas as coisas vos ser\xe3o limpas."},{verse:42,en:"But woe unto you, Pharisees! for ye tithe mint and rue and all manner of herbs, and pass over judgment and the love of God: these ought ye to have done, and not to leave the other undone.",pt:"Mas ai de v\xf3s, fariseus! porque dais o d\xedzimo da hortel\xe3, e da arruda, e de toda hortali\xe7a, e desprezais a justi\xe7a e o amor de Deus. Ora, estas coisas importava fazer, sem deixar aquelas."},{verse:43,en:"Woe unto you, Pharisees! for ye love the uppermost seats in the synagogues, and greetings in the markets.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, fariseus! porque gostais dos primeiros assentos nas sinagogas, e das sauda\xe7\xf5es nas pra\xe7as."},{verse:44,en:"Woe unto you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! for ye are as graves which appear not, and the men that walk over them are not aware of them.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s! porque sois como as sepulturas que n\xe3o aparecem, sobre as quais andam os homens sem o saberem."},{verse:45,en:"Then answered one of the lawyers, and said unto him, Master, thus saying thou reproachest us also.",pt:"Disse-lhe, ent\xe3o, um dos doutores da lei: Mestre, quando dizes isso, tamb\xe9m nos afrontas a n\xf3s."},{verse:46,en:"And he said, Woe unto you also, ye lawyers! for ye lade men with burdens grievous to be borne, and ye yourselves touch not the burdens with one of your fingers.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, respondeu: Ai de v\xf3s tamb\xe9m, doutores da lei! porque carregais os homens com fardos dif\xedceis de suportar, e v\xf3s mesmos nem ainda com um dos vossos dedos tocais nesses fardos."},{verse:47,en:"Woe unto you! for ye build the sepulchres of the prophets, and your fathers killed them.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s! porque edificais os t\xfamulos dos profetas, e vossos pais os mataram."},{verse:48,en:"Truly ye bear witness that ye allow the deeds of your fathers: for they indeed killed them, and ye build their sepulchres.",pt:"Assim sois testemunhas e aprovais as obras de vossos pais; porquanto eles os mataram, e v\xf3s lhes edificais os t\xfamulos."},{verse:49,en:"Therefore also said the wisdom of God, I will send them prophets and apostles, and some of them they shall slay and persecute:",pt:"Por isso diz tamb\xe9m a sabedoria de Deus: Profetas e ap\xf3stolos lhes mandarei; e eles matar\xe3o uns, e perseguir\xe3o outros;"},{verse:50,en:"That the blood of all the prophets, which was shed from the foundation of the world, may be required of this generation;",pt:"para que a esta gera\xe7\xe3o se pe\xe7am contas do sangue de todos os profetas que, desde a funda\xe7\xe3o do mundo, foi derramado;"},{verse:51,en:"From the blood of Abel unto the blood of Zacharias, which perished between the altar and the temple: verily I say unto you, It shall be required of this generation.",pt:"desde o sangue de Abel, at\xe9 o sangue de Zacarias, que foi morto entre o altar e o santu\xe1rio; sim, eu vos digo, a esta gera\xe7\xe3o se pedir\xe3o contas."},{verse:52,en:"Woe unto you, lawyers! for ye have taken away the key of knowledge: ye entered not in yourselves, and them that were entering in ye hindered.",pt:"Ai de v\xf3s, doutores da lei! porque tirastes a chave da ci\xeancia; v\xf3s mesmos n\xe3o entrastes, e impedistes aos que entravam."},{verse:53,en:"And as he said these things unto them, the scribes and the Pharisees began to urge him vehemently, and to provoke him to speak of many things:",pt:"Ao sair ele dali, come\xe7aram os escribas e os fariseus a apert\xe1-lo fortemente, e a interrog\xe1-lo acerca de muitas coisas,"},{verse:54,en:"Laying wait for him, and seeking to catch something out of his mouth, that they might accuse him.",pt:"armando-lhe ciladas, a fim de o apanharem em alguma coisa que dissesse."}]}}),792,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"In the mean time, when there were gathered together an innumerable multitude of people, insomuch that they trode one upon another, he began to say unto his disciples first of all, Beware ye of the leaven of the Pharisees, which is hypocrisy.",pt:"Ajuntando-se entretanto muitos milhares de pessoas, de sorte que se atropelavam uns aos outros, come\xe7ou Jesus a dizer primeiro aos seus disc\xedpulos: Acautelai-vos do fermento dos fariseus, que \xe9 a hipocrisia."},{verse:2,en:"For there is nothing covered, that shall not be revealed; neither hid, that shall not be known.",pt:"Mas nada h\xe1 encoberto, que n\xe3o haja de ser descoberto; nem oculto, que n\xe3o haja de ser conhecido."},{verse:3,en:"Therefore whatsoever ye have spoken in darkness shall be heard in the light; and that which ye have spoken in the ear in closets shall be proclaimed upon the housetops.",pt:"Porquanto tudo o que em trevas dissestes, \xe0 luz ser\xe1 ouvido; e o que falaste ao ouvido no gabinete, dos eirados ser\xe1 apregoado."},{verse:4,en:"And I say unto you my friends, Be not afraid of them that kill the body, and after that have no more that they can do.",pt:"Digo-vos, amigos meus: N\xe3o temais os que matam o corpo, e depois disso nada mais podem fazer."},{verse:5,en:"But I will forewarn you whom ye shall fear: Fear him, which after he hath killed hath power to cast into hell; yea, I say unto you, Fear him.",pt:"Mas eu vos mostrarei a quem \xe9 que deveis temer; temei aquele que, depois de matar, tem poder para lan\xe7ar no inferno; sim, digo, a esse temei."},{verse:6,en:"Are not five sparrows sold for two farthings, and not one of them is forgotten before God?",pt:"N\xe3o se vendem cinco passarinhos por dois asses? E nenhum deles est\xe1 esquecido diante de Deus."},{verse:7,en:"But even the very hairs of your head are all numbered. Fear not therefore: ye are of more value than many sparrows.",pt:"Mas at\xe9 os cabelos da vossa cabe\xe7a est\xe3o todos contados. N\xe3o temais, pois mais valeis v\xf3s do que muitos passarinhos."},{verse:8,en:"Also I say unto you, Whosoever shall confess me before men, him shall the Son of man also confess before the angels of God:",pt:"E digo-vos que todo aquele que me confessar diante dos homens, tamb\xe9m o Filho do homem o confessar\xe1 diante dos anjos de Deus;"},{verse:9,en:"But he that denieth me before men shall be denied before the angels of God.",pt:"mas quem me negar diante dos homens, ser\xe1 negado diante dos anjos de Deus."},{verse:10,en:"And whosoever shall speak a word against the Son of man, it shall be forgiven him: but unto him that blasphemeth against the Holy Ghost it shall not be forgiven.",pt:"E a todo aquele que proferir uma palavra contra o Filho do homem, isso lhe ser\xe1 perdoado; mas ao que blasfemar contra o Esp\xedrito Santo, n\xe3o lhe ser\xe1 perdoado."},{verse:11,en:"And when they bring you unto the synagogues, and unto magistrates, and powers, take ye no thought how or what thing ye shall answer, or what ye shall say:",pt:"Quando, pois, vos levarem \xe0s sinagogas, aos magistrados e \xe0s autoridades, n\xe3o estejais sol\xedcitos de como ou do que haveis de responder, nem do que haveis de dizer."},{verse:12,en:"For the Holy Ghost shall teach you in the same hour what ye ought to say.",pt:"Porque o Esp\xedrito Santo vos ensinar\xe1 na mesma hora o que deveis dizer."},{verse:13,en:"And one of the company said unto him, Master, speak to my brother, that he divide the inheritance with me.",pt:"Disse-lhe algu\xe9m dentre a multid\xe3o: Mestre, dize a meu irm\xe3o que reparte comigo a heran\xe7a."},{verse:14,en:"And he said unto him, Man, who made me a judge or a divider over you?",pt:"Mas ele lhe respondeu: Homem, quem me constituiu a mim juiz ou repartidor entre v\xf3s?"},{verse:15,en:"And he said unto them, Take heed, and beware of covetousness: for a man\u2019s life consisteth not in the abundance of the things which he possesseth.",pt:"E disse ao povo: Acautelai-vos e guardai-vos de toda esp\xe9cie de cobi\xe7a; porque a vida do homem n\xe3o consiste na abund\xe2ncia das coisas que possui."},{verse:16,en:"And he spake a parable unto them, saying, The ground of a certain rich man brought forth plentifully:",pt:"Prop\xf4s-lhes ent\xe3o uma par\xe1bola, dizendo: O campo de um homem rico produzira com abund\xe2ncia;"},{verse:17,en:"And he thought within himself, saying, What shall I do, because I have no room where to bestow my fruits?",pt:"e ele arrazoava consigo, dizendo: Que farei? Pois n\xe3o tenho onde recolher os meus frutos."},{verse:18,en:"And he said, This will I do: I will pull down my barns, and build greater; and there will I bestow all my fruits and my goods.",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o: Farei isto: derribarei os meus celeiros e edificarei outros maiores, e ali recolherei todos os meus cereais e os meus bens;"},{verse:19,en:"And I will say to my soul, Soul, thou hast much goods laid up for many years; take thine ease, eat, drink, and be merry.",pt:"e direi \xe0 minha alma: Alma, tens em dep\xf3sito muitos bens para muitos anos; descansa, come, bebe, regala-te."},{verse:20,en:"But God said unto him, Thou fool, this night thy soul shall be required of thee: then whose shall those things be, which thou hast provided?",pt:"Mas Deus lhe disse: Insensato, esta noite te pedir\xe3o a tua alma; e o que tens preparado, para quem ser\xe1?"},{verse:21,en:"So is he that layeth up treasure for himself, and is not rich toward God.",pt:"Assim \xe9 aquele que para si ajunta tesouros, e n\xe3o \xe9 rico para com Deus."},{verse:22,en:"And he said unto his disciples, Therefore I say unto you, Take no thought for your life, what ye shall eat; neither for the body, what ye shall put on.",pt:"E disse aos seus disc\xedpulos: Por isso vos digo: N\xe3o estejais ansiosos quanto \xe0 vossa vida, pelo que haveis de comer, nem quanto ao corpo, pelo que haveis de vestir."},{verse:23,en:"The life is more than meat, and the body is more than raiment.",pt:"Pois a vida \xe9 mais do que o alimento, e o corpo mais do que o vestu\xe1rio."},{verse:24,en:"Consider the ravens: for they neither sow nor reap; which neither have storehouse nor barn; and God feedeth them: how much more are ye better than the fowls?",pt:"Considerai os corvos, que n\xe3o semeiam nem ceifam; n\xe3o t\xeam despensa nem celeiro; contudo, Deus os alimenta. Quanto mais n\xe3o valeis v\xf3s do que as aves!"},{verse:25,en:"And which of you with taking thought can add to his stature one cubit?",pt:"Ora, qual de v\xf3s, por mais ansioso que esteja, pode acrescentar um c\xf4vado \xe0 sua estatura?"},{verse:26,en:"If ye then be not able to do that thing which is least, why take ye thought for the rest?",pt:"Porquanto, se n\xe3o podeis fazer nem as coisas m\xednimas, por que estais ansiosos pelas outras?"},{verse:27,en:"Consider the lilies how they grow: they toil not, they spin not; and yet I say unto you, that Solomon in all his glory was not arrayed like one of these.",pt:"Considerai os l\xedrios, como crescem; n\xe3o trabalham, nem fiam; contudo vos digo que nem mesmo Salom\xe3o, em toda a sua gl\xf3ria, se vestiu como um deles."},{verse:28,en:"If then God so clothe the grass, which is to day in the field, and to morrow is cast into the oven; how much more will he clothe you, O ye of little faith?",pt:"Se, pois, Deus assim veste a erva que hoje est\xe1 no campo e amanh\xe3 \xe9 lan\xe7ada no forno, quanto mais v\xf3s, homens de pouca f\xe9?"},{verse:29,en:"And seek not ye what ye shall eat, or what ye shall drink, neither be ye of doubtful mind.",pt:"N\xe3o procureis, pois, o que haveis de comer, ou o que haveis de beber, e n\xe3o andeis preocupados."},{verse:30,en:"For all these things do the nations of the world seek after: and your Father knoweth that ye have need of these things.",pt:"Porque a todas estas coisas os povos do mundo procuram; mas vosso Pai sabe que precisais delas."},{verse:31,en:"But rather seek ye the kingdom of God; and all these things shall be added unto you.",pt:"Buscai antes o seu reino, e estas coisas vos ser\xe3o acrescentadas."},{verse:32,en:"Fear not, little flock; for it is your Father\u2019s good pleasure to give you the kingdom.",pt:"N\xe3o temas, \xf3 pequeno rebanho! porque a vosso Pai agradou dar-vos o reino."},{verse:33,en:"Sell that ye have, and give alms; provide yourselves bags which wax not old, a treasure in the heavens that faileth not, where no thief approacheth, neither moth corrupteth.",pt:"Vendei o que possu\xeds, e dai esmolas. Fazei para v\xf3s bolsas que n\xe3o envelhe\xe7am; tesouro nos c\xe9us que jamais acabe, aonde n\xe3o chega ladr\xe3o e a tra\xe7a n\xe3o r\xf3i."},{verse:34,en:"For where your treasure is, there will your heart be also.",pt:"Porque, onde estiver o vosso tesouro, a\xed estar\xe1 tamb\xe9m o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:35,en:"Let your loins be girded about, and your lights burning;",pt:"Estejam cingidos os vossos lombos e acesas as vossas candeias;"},{verse:36,en:"And ye yourselves like unto men that wait for their lord, when he will return from the wedding; that when he cometh and knocketh, they may open unto him immediately.",pt:"e sede semelhantes a homens que esperam o seu senhor, quando houver de voltar das bodas, para que, quando vier e bater, logo possam abrir-lhe."},{verse:37,en:"Blessed are those servants, whom the lord when he cometh shall find watching: verily I say unto you, that he shall gird himself, and make them to sit down to meat, and will come forth and serve them.",pt:"Bem-aventurados aqueles servos, aos quais o senhor, quando vier, achar vigiando! Em verdade vos digo que se cingir\xe1, e os far\xe1 reclinar-se \xe0 mesa e, chegando-se, os servir\xe1."},{verse:38,en:"And if he shall come in the second watch, or come in the third watch, and find them so, blessed are those servants.",pt:"Quer venha na segunda vig\xedlia, quer na terceira, bem-aventurados ser\xe3o eles, se assim os achar."},{verse:39,en:"And this know, that if the goodman of the house had known what hour the thief would come, he would have watched, and not have suffered his house to be broken through.",pt:"Sabei, por\xe9m, isto: se o dono da casa soubesse a que hora havia de vir o ladr\xe3o, vigiaria e n\xe3o deixaria minar a sua casa."},{verse:40,en:"Be ye therefore ready also: for the Son of man cometh at an hour when ye think not.",pt:"Estai v\xf3s tamb\xe9m apercebidos; porque, numa hora em que n\xe3o penseis, vir\xe1 o Filho do homem."},{verse:41,en:"Then Peter said unto him, Lord, speakest thou this parable unto us, or even to all?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pedro perguntou: Senhor, dizes essa par\xe1bola a n\xf3s, ou tamb\xe9m a todos?"},{verse:42,en:"And the Lord said, Who then is that faithful and wise steward, whom his lord shall make ruler over his household, to give them their portion of meat in due season?",pt:"Respondeu o Senhor: Qual \xe9, pois, o mordomo fiel e prudente, que o Senhor por\xe1 sobre os seus servos, para lhes dar a tempo a ra\xe7\xe3o?"},{verse:43,en:"Blessed is that servant, whom his lord when he cometh shall find so doing.",pt:"Bem-aventurado aquele servo a quem o seu senhor, quando vier, achar fazendo assim."},{verse:44,en:"Of a truth I say unto you, that he will make him ruler over all that he hath.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que o por\xe1 sobre todos os seus bens."},{verse:45,en:"But and if that servant say in his heart, My lord delayeth his coming; and shall begin to beat the menservants and maidens, and to eat and drink, and to be drunken;",pt:"Mas, se aquele servo disser em teu cora\xe7\xe3o: O meu senhor tarda em vir; e come\xe7ar a espancar os criados e as criadas, e a comer, a beber e a embriagar-se,"},{verse:46,en:"The lord of that servant will come in a day when he looketh not for him, and at an hour when he is not aware, and will cut him in sunder, and will appoint him his portion with the unbelievers.",pt:"vir\xe1 o senhor desse servo num dia em que n\xe3o o espera, e numa hora de que n\xe3o sabe, e cort\xe1-lo-\xe1 pelo meio, e lhe dar\xe1 a sua parte com os infi\xe9is."},{verse:47,en:"And that servant, which knew his lord\u2019s will, and prepared not himself, neither did according to his will, shall be beaten with many stripes.",pt:"O servo que soube a vontade do seu senhor, e n\xe3o se aprontou, nem fez conforme a sua vontade, ser\xe1 castigado com muitos a\xe7oites;"},{verse:48,en:"But he that knew not, and did commit things worthy of stripes, shall be beaten with few stripes. For unto whomsoever much is given, of him shall be much required: and to whom men have committed much, of him they will ask the more.",pt:"mas o que n\xe3o a soube, e fez coisas que mereciam castigo, com poucos a\xe7oites ser\xe1 castigado. Daquele a quem muito \xe9 dado, muito se lhe requerer\xe1; e a quem muito \xe9 confiado, mais ainda se lhe pedir\xe1."},{verse:49,en:"I am come to send fire on the earth; and what will I if it be already kindled?",pt:"Vim lan\xe7ar fogo \xe0 terra; e que mais quero, se j\xe1 est\xe1 aceso?"},{verse:50,en:"But I have a baptism to be baptized with; and how am I straitened till it be accomplished!",pt:"H\xe1 um batismo em que hei de ser batizado; e como me angustio at\xe9 que venha a cumprir-se!"},{verse:51,en:"Suppose ye that I am come to give peace on earth? I tell you, Nay; but rather division:",pt:"Cuidais v\xf3s que vim trazer paz \xe0 terra? N\xe3o, eu vos digo, mas antes dissens\xe3o:"},{verse:52,en:"For from henceforth there shall be five in one house divided, three against two, and two against three.",pt:"pois daqui em diante estar\xe3o cinco pessoas numa casa divididas, tr\xeas contra duas, e duas contra tr\xeas;"},{verse:53,en:"The father shall be divided against the son, and the son against the father; the mother against the daughter, and the daughter against the mother; the mother in law against her daughter in law, and the daughter in law against her mother in law.",pt:"estar\xe3o divididos: pai contra filho, e filho contra pai; m\xe3e contra filha, e filha contra m\xe3e; sogra contra nora, e nora contra sogra."},{verse:54,en:"And he said also to the people, When ye see a cloud rise out of the west, straightway ye say, There cometh a shower; and so it is.",pt:"Dizia tamb\xe9m \xe0s multid\xf5es: Quando vedes subir uma nuvem do ocidente, logo dizeis: L\xe1 vem chuva; e assim sucede;"},{verse:55,en:"And when ye see the south wind blow, ye say, There will be heat; and it cometh to pass.",pt:"e quando vedes soprar o vento sul dizeis; Haver\xe1 calor; e assim sucede."},{verse:56,en:"Ye hypocrites, ye can discern the face of the sky and of the earth; but how is it that ye do not discern this time?",pt:"Hip\xf3critas, sabeis discernir a face da terra e do c\xe9u; como n\xe3o sabeis ent\xe3o discernir este tempo?"},{verse:57,en:"Yea, and why even of yourselves judge ye not what is right?",pt:"E por que n\xe3o julgais tamb\xe9m por v\xf3s mesmos o que \xe9 justo?"},{verse:58,en:"When thou goest with thine adversary to the magistrate, as thou art in the way, give diligence that thou mayest be delivered from him; lest he hale thee to the judge, and the judge deliver thee to the officer, and the officer cast thee into prison.",pt:"Quando, pois, vais com o teu advers\xe1rio ao magistrado, procura fazer as pazes com ele no caminho; para que n\xe3o suceda que ele te arraste ao juiz, e o juiz te entregue ao meirinho, e o meirinho te lance na pris\xe3o"},{verse:59,en:"I tell thee, thou shalt not depart thence, till thou hast paid the very last mite.",pt:"Digo-te que n\xe3o sair\xe1s dali enquanto n\xe3o pagares o derradeiro lepto."}]}}),793,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"There were present at that season some that told him of the Galilaeans, whose blood Pilate had mingled with their sacrifices.",pt:"Ora, naquele mesmo tempo estavam presentes alguns que lhe falavam dos galileus cujo sangue Pilatos misturara com os sacrif\xedcios deles."},{verse:2,en:"And Jesus answering said unto them, Suppose ye that these Galilaeans were sinners above all the Galilaeans, because they suffered such things?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Pensais v\xf3s que esses foram maiores pecadores do que todos os galileus, por terem padecido tais coisas?"},{verse:3,en:"I tell you, Nay: but, except ye repent, ye shall all likewise perish.",pt:"N\xe3o, eu vos digo; antes, se n\xe3o vos arrependerdes, todos de igual modo perecereis."},{verse:4,en:"Or those eighteen, upon whom the tower in Siloam fell, and slew them, think ye that they were sinners above all men that dwelt in Jerusalem?",pt:"Ou pensais que aqueles dezoito, sobre os quais caiu a torre de Silo\xe9 e os matou, foram mais culpados do que todos os outros habitantes de Jerusal\xe9m?"},{verse:5,en:"I tell you, Nay: but, except ye repent, ye shall all likewise perish.",pt:"N\xe3o, eu vos digo; antes, se n\xe3o vos arrependerdes, todos de igual modo perecereis."},{verse:6,en:"He spake also this parable; A certain man had a fig tree planted in his vineyard; and he came and sought fruit thereon, and found none.",pt:"E passou a narrar esta par\xe1bola: Certo homem tinha uma figueira plantada na sua vinha; e indo procurar fruto nela, e n\xe3o o achou."},{verse:7,en:"Then said he unto the dresser of his vineyard, Behold, these three years I come seeking fruit on this fig tree, and find none: cut it down; why cumbereth it the ground?",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o ao viticultor: Eis que h\xe1 tr\xeas anos venho procurar fruto nesta figueira, e n\xe3o o acho; corta-a; para que ocupa ela ainda a terra inutilmente?"},{verse:8,en:"And he answering said unto him, Lord, let it alone this year also, till I shall dig about it, and dung it:",pt:"Respondeu-lhe ele: Senhor, deixa-a este ano ainda, at\xe9 que eu cave em derredor, e lhe deite estrume;"},{verse:9,en:"And if it bear fruit, well: and if not, then after that thou shalt cut it down.",pt:"e se no futuro der fruto, bem; mas, se n\xe3o, cort\xe1-la-\xe1s."},{verse:10,en:"And he was teaching in one of the synagogues on the sabbath.",pt:"Jesus estava ensinando numa das sinagogas no s\xe1bado."},{verse:11,en:"And, behold, there was a woman which had a spirit of infirmity eighteen years, and was bowed together, and could in no wise lift up herself.",pt:"E estava ali uma mulher que tinha um esp\xedrito de enfermidade havia j\xe1 dezoito anos; e andava encurvada, e n\xe3o podia de modo algum endireitar-se."},{verse:12,en:"And when Jesus saw her, he called her to him, and said unto her, Woman, thou art loosed from thine infirmity.",pt:"Vendo-a Jesus, chamou-a, e disse-lhe: Mulher, est\xe1s livre da tua enfermidade;"},{verse:13,en:"And he laid his hands on her: and immediately she was made straight, and glorified God.",pt:"e imp\xf4s-lhe as m\xe3os e imediatamente ela se endireitou, e glorificava a Deus."},{verse:14,en:"And the ruler of the synagogue answered with indignation, because that Jesus had healed on the sabbath day, and said unto the people, There are six days in which men ought to work: in them therefore come and be healed, and not on the sabbath day.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o chefe da sinagoga, indignado porque Jesus curara no s\xe1bado, tomando a palavra disse \xe0 multid\xe3o: Seis dias h\xe1 em que se deve trabalhar; vinde, pois, neles para serdes curados, e n\xe3o no dia de s\xe1bado."},{verse:15,en:"The Lord then answered him, and said, Thou hypocrite, doth not each one of you on the sabbath loose his ox or his ass from the stall, and lead him away to watering?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe, por\xe9m, o Senhor: Hip\xf3critas, no s\xe1bado n\xe3o desprende da manjedoura cada um de v\xf3s o seu boi, ou jumento, para o levar a beber?"},{verse:16,en:"And ought not this woman, being a daughter of Abraham, whom Satan hath bound, lo, these eighteen years, be loosed from this bond on the sabbath day?",pt:"E n\xe3o devia ser solta desta pris\xe3o, no dia de s\xe1bado, esta que \xe9 filha de Abra\xe3o, a qual h\xe1 dezoito anos Satan\xe1s tinha presa?"},{verse:17,en:"And when he had said these things, all his adversaries were ashamed: and all the people rejoiced for all the glorious things that were done by him.",pt:"E dizendo ele essas coisas, todos os seus advers\xe1rio ficavam envergonhados; e todo o povo se alegrava por todas as coisas gloriosas que eram feitas por ele."},{verse:18,en:"Then said he, Unto what is the kingdom of God like? and whereunto shall I resemble it?",pt:"Ele, pois, dizia: A que \xe9 semelhante o reino de Deus, e a que o compararei?"},{verse:19,en:"It is like a grain of mustard seed, which a man took, and cast into his garden; and it grew, and waxed a great tree; and the fowls of the air lodged in the branches of it.",pt:"\xc9 semelhante a um gr\xe3o de mostarda que um homem tomou e lan\xe7ou na sua horta; cresceu, e fez-se \xe1rvore, e em seus ramos se aninharam as aves do c\xe9u."},{verse:20,en:"And again he said, Whereunto shall I liken the kingdom of God?",pt:"E disse outra vez: A que compararei o reino de Deus?"},{verse:21,en:"It is like leaven, which a woman took and hid in three measures of meal, till the whole was leavened.",pt:"\xc9 semelhante ao fermento que uma mulher tomou e misturou com tr\xeas medidas de farinha, at\xe9 ficar toda ela levedada."},{verse:22,en:"And he went through the cities and villages, teaching, and journeying toward Jerusalem.",pt:"Assim percorria Jesus as cidades e as aldeias, ensinando, e caminhando para Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:23,en:"Then said one unto him, Lord, are there few that be saved? And he said unto them,",pt:"E algu\xe9m lhe perguntou: Senhor, s\xe3o poucos os que se salvam? Ao que ele lhes respondeu:"},{verse:24,en:"Strive to enter in at the strait gate: for many, I say unto you, will seek to enter in, and shall not be able.",pt:"Porfiai por entrar pela porta estreita; porque eu vos digo que muitos procurar\xe3o entrar, e n\xe3o poder\xe3o."},{verse:25,en:"When once the master of the house is risen up, and hath shut to the door, and ye begin to stand without, and to knock at the door, saying, Lord, Lord, open unto us; and he shall answer and say unto you, I know you not whence ye are:",pt:"Quando o dono da casa se tiver levantado e cerrado a porta, e v\xf3s come\xe7ardes, de fora, a bater \xe0 porta, dizendo: Senhor, abre-nos; e ele vos responder: N\xe3o sei donde v\xf3s sois;"},{verse:26,en:"Then shall ye begin to say, We have eaten and drunk in thy presence, and thou hast taught in our streets.",pt:"ent\xe3o come\xe7areis a dizer: Comemos e bebemos na tua presen\xe7a, e tu ensinaste nas nossas ruas;"},{verse:27,en:"But he shall say, I tell you, I know you not whence ye are; depart from me, all ye workers of iniquity.",pt:"e ele vos responder\xe1: N\xe3o sei donde sois; apartaivos de mim, v\xf3s todos os que praticais a iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:28,en:"There shall be weeping and gnashing of teeth, when ye shall see Abraham, and Isaac, and Jacob, and all the prophets, in the kingdom of God, and you yourselves thrust out.",pt:"Ali haver\xe1 choro e ranger de dentes quando virdes Abra\xe3o, Isaque, Jac\xf3 e todos os profetas no reino de Deus, e v\xf3s lan\xe7ados fora."},{verse:29,en:"And they shall come from the east, and from the west, and from the north, and from the south, and shall sit down in the kingdom of God.",pt:"Muitos vir\xe3o do oriente e do ocidente, do norte e do sul, e reclinar-se-\xe3o \xe0 mesa no reino de Deus."},{verse:30,en:"And, behold, there are last which shall be first, and there are first which shall be last.",pt:"Pois h\xe1 \xfaltimos que ser\xe3o primeiros, e primeiros que ser\xe3o \xfaltimos."},{verse:31,en:"The same day there came certain of the Pharisees, saying unto him, Get thee out, and depart hence: for Herod will kill thee.",pt:"Naquela mesma hora chegaram alguns fariseus que lhe disseram: Sai, e retira-te daqui, porque Herodes quer matar-te."},{verse:32,en:"And he said unto them, Go ye, and tell that fox, Behold, I cast out devils, and I do cures to day and to morrow, and the third day I shall be perfected.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Ide e dizei a essa raposa: Eis que vou expulsando dem\xf4nios e fazendo curas, hoje e amanh\xe3, e no terceiro dia serei consumado."},{verse:33,en:"Nevertheless I must walk to day, and to morrow, and the day following: for it cannot be that a prophet perish out of Jerusalem.",pt:"Importa, contudo, caminhar hoje, amanh\xe3, e no dia seguinte; porque n\xe3o conv\xe9m que morra um profeta fora de Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:34,en:"O Jerusalem, Jerusalem, which killest the prophets, and stonest them that are sent unto thee; how often would I have gathered thy children together, as a hen doth gather her brood under her wings, and ye would not!",pt:"Jerusal\xe9m, Jerusal\xe9m, que matas os profetas, e apedrejas os que a ti s\xe3o enviados! Quantas vezes quis eu ajuntar os teus filhos, como a galinha ajunta a sua ninhada debaixo das asas, e n\xe3o quiseste!"},{verse:35,en:"Behold, your house is left unto you desolate: and verily I say unto you, Ye shall not see me, until the time come when ye shall say, Blessed is he that cometh in the name of the Lord.",pt:"Eis a\xed, abandonada vos \xe9 a vossa casa. E eu vos digo que n\xe3o me vereis at\xe9 que venha o tempo em que digais: Bendito aquele que vem em nome do Senhor."}]}}),794,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass, as he went into the house of one of the chief Pharisees to eat bread on the sabbath day, that they watched him.",pt:"Tendo Jesus entrado, num s\xe1bado, em casa de um dos chefes dos fariseus para comer p\xe3o, eles o estavam observando."},{verse:2,en:"And, behold, there was a certain man before him which had the dropsy.",pt:"Achava-se ali diante dele certo homem hidr\xf3pico."},{verse:3,en:"And Jesus answering spake unto the lawyers and Pharisees, saying, Is it lawful to heal on the sabbath day?",pt:"E Jesus, tomando a palavra, falou aos doutores da lei e aos fariseus, e perguntou: \xc9 l\xedcito curar no s\xe1bado, ou n\xe3o?"},{verse:4,en:"And they held their peace. And he took him, and healed him, and let him go;",pt:"Eles, por\xe9m, ficaram calados. E Jesus, pegando no homem, o curou, e o despediu."},{verse:5,en:"And answered them, saying, Which of you shall have an ass or an ox fallen into a pit, and will not straightway pull him out on the sabbath day?",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes perguntou: Qual de v\xf3s, se lhe cair num po\xe7o um filho, ou um boi, n\xe3o o tirar\xe1 logo, mesmo em dia de s\xe1bado?"},{verse:6,en:"And they could not answer him again to these things.",pt:"A isto nada puderam responder."},{verse:7,en:"And he put forth a parable to those which were bidden, when he marked how they chose out the chief rooms; saying unto them,",pt:"Ao notar como os convidados escolhiam os primeiros lugares, prop\xf4s-lhes esta par\xe1bola:"},{verse:8,en:"When thou art bidden of any man to a wedding, sit not down in the highest room; lest a more honourable man than thou be bidden of him;",pt:"Quando por algu\xe9m fores convidado \xe0s bodas, n\xe3o te reclines no primeiro lugar; n\xe3o aconte\xe7a que esteja convidado outro mais digno do que tu;"},{verse:9,en:"And he that bade thee and him come and say to thee, Give this man place; and thou begin with shame to take the lowest room.",pt:"e vindo o que te convidou a ti e a ele, te diga: D\xe1 o lugar a este; e ent\xe3o, com vergonha, tenhas de tomar o \xfaltimo lugar."},{verse:10,en:"But when thou art bidden, go and sit down in the lowest room; that when he that bade thee cometh, he may say unto thee, Friend, go up higher: then shalt thou have worship in the presence of them that sit at meat with thee.",pt:"Mas, quando fores convidado, vai e reclina-te no \xfaltimo lugar, para que, quando vier o que te convidou, te diga: Amigo, sobe mais para cima. Ent\xe3o ter\xe1s honra diante de todos os que estiverem contigo \xe0 mesa."},{verse:11,en:"For whosoever exalteth himself shall be abased; and he that humbleth himself shall be exalted.",pt:"Porque todo o que a si mesmo se exaltar ser\xe1 humilhado, e aquele que a si mesmo se humilhar ser\xe1 exaltado."},{verse:12,en:"Then said he also to him that bade him, When thou makest a dinner or a supper, call not thy friends, nor thy brethren, neither thy kinsmen, nor thy rich neighbours; lest they also bid thee again, and a recompence be made thee.",pt:"Disse tamb\xe9m ao que o havia convidado: Quando deres um jantar, ou uma ceia, n\xe3o convides teus amigos, nem teus irm\xe3os, nem teus parentes, nem os vizinhos ricos, para que n\xe3o suceda que tamb\xe9m eles te tornem a convidar, e te seja isso retribu\xeddo."},{verse:13,en:"But when thou makest a feast, call the poor, the maimed, the lame, the blind:",pt:"Mas quando deres um banquete, convida os pobres, os aleijados, os mancos e os cegos;"},{verse:14,en:"And thou shalt be blessed; for they cannot recompense thee: for thou shalt be recompensed at the resurrection of the just.",pt:"e ser\xe1s bem-aventurado; porque eles n\xe3o t\xeam com que te retribuir; pois retribu\xeddo te ser\xe1 na ressurrei\xe7\xe3o dos justos."},{verse:15,en:"And when one of them that sat at meat with him heard these things, he said unto him, Blessed is he that shall eat bread in the kingdom of God.",pt:"Ao ouvir isso um dos que estavam com ele \xe0 mesa, disse-lhe: Bem-aventurado aquele que comer p\xe3o no reino de Deus."},{verse:16,en:"Then said he unto him, A certain man made a great supper, and bade many:",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, lhe disse: Certo homem dava uma grande ceia, e convidou a muitos."},{verse:17,en:"And sent his servant at supper time to say to them that were bidden, Come; for all things are now ready.",pt:"E \xe0 hora da ceia mandou o seu servo dizer aos convidados: vinde, porque tudo j\xe1 est\xe1 preparado."},{verse:18,en:"And they all with one consent began to make excuse. The first said unto him, I have bought a piece of ground, and I must needs go and see it: I pray thee have me excused.",pt:"Mas todos \xe0 uma come\xe7aram a escusar-se. Disse-lhe o primeiro: Comprei um campo, e preciso ir v\xea-lo; rogo-te que me d\xeas por escusado."},{verse:19,en:"And another said, I have bought five yoke of oxen, and I go to prove them: I pray thee have me excused.",pt:"Outro disse: Comprei cinco juntas de bois, e vou experiment\xe1-los; rogo-te que me d\xeas por escusado."},{verse:20,en:"And another said, I have married a wife, and therefore I cannot come.",pt:"Ainda outro disse: Casei-me e portanto n\xe3o posso ir."},{verse:21,en:"So that servant came, and shewed his lord these things. Then the master of the house being angry said to his servant, Go out quickly into the streets and lanes of the city, and bring in hither the poor, and the maimed, and the halt, and the blind.",pt:"Voltou o servo e contou tudo isto a seu senhor: Ent\xe3o o dono da casa, indignado, disse a seu servo: Sai depressa para as ruas e becos da cidade e traze aqui os pobres, os aleijados, os cegos e os coxos."},{verse:22,en:"And the servant said, Lord, it is done as thou hast commanded, and yet there is room.",pt:"Depois disse o servo: Senhor, feito est\xe1 como o ordenaste, e ainda h\xe1 lugar."},{verse:23,en:"And the lord said unto the servant, Go out into the highways and hedges, and compel them to come in, that my house may be filled.",pt:"Respondeu o senhor ao servo: Sai pelos caminhos e valados, e obriga-os a entrar, para que a minha casa se encha."},{verse:24,en:"For I say unto you, That none of those men which were bidden shall taste of my supper.",pt:"Pois eu vos digo que nenhum daqueles homens que foram convidados provar\xe1 a minha ceia."},{verse:25,en:"And there went great multitudes with him: and he turned, and said unto them,",pt:"Ora, iam com ele grandes multid\xf5es; e, voltando-se, disse-lhes:"},{verse:26,en:"If any man come to me, and hate not his father, and mother, and wife, and children, and brethren, and sisters, yea, and his own life also, he cannot be my disciple.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m vier a mim, e n\xe3o aborrecer a pai e m\xe3e, a mulher e filhos, a irm\xe3os e irm\xe3s, e ainda tamb\xe9m \xe0 pr\xf3pria vida, n\xe3o pode ser meu disc\xedpulo."},{verse:27,en:"And whosoever doth not bear his cross, and come after me, cannot be my disciple.",pt:"Quem n\xe3o leva a sua cruz e n\xe3o me segue, n\xe3o pode ser meu disc\xedpulo."},{verse:28,en:"For which of you, intending to build a tower, sitteth not down first, and counteth the cost, whether he have sufficient to finish it?",pt:"Pois qual de v\xf3s, querendo edificar uma torre, n\xe3o se senta primeiro a calcular as despesas, para ver se tem com que a acabar?"},{verse:29,en:"Lest haply, after he hath laid the foundation, and is not able to finish it, all that behold it begin to mock him,",pt:"Para n\xe3o acontecer que, depois de haver posto os alicerces, e n\xe3o a podendo acabar, todos os que a virem comecem a zombar dele,"},{verse:30,en:"Saying, This man began to build, and was not able to finish.",pt:"dizendo: Este homem come\xe7ou a edificar e n\xe3o pode acabar."},{verse:31,en:"Or what king, going to make war against another king, sitteth not down first, and consulteth whether he be able with ten thousand to meet him that cometh against him with twenty thousand?",pt:"Ou qual \xe9 o rei que, indo entrar em guerra contra outro rei, n\xe3o se senta primeiro a consultar se com dez mil pode sair ao encontro do que vem contra ele com vinte mil?"},{verse:32,en:"Or else, while the other is yet a great way off, he sendeth an ambassage, and desireth conditions of peace.",pt:"No caso contr\xe1rio, enquanto o outro ainda est\xe1 longe, manda embaixadores, e pede condi\xe7\xf5es de paz."},{verse:33,en:"So likewise, whosoever he be of you that forsaketh not all that he hath, he cannot be my disciple.",pt:"Assim, pois, todo aquele dentre v\xf3s que n\xe3o renuncia a tudo quanto possui, n\xe3o pode ser meu disc\xedpulo."},{verse:34,en:"Salt is good: but if the salt have lost his savour, wherewith shall it be seasoned?",pt:"Bom \xe9 o sal; mas se o sal se tornar ins\xedpido, com que se h\xe1 de restaurar-lhe o sabor?"},{verse:35,en:"It is neither fit for the land, nor yet for the dunghill; but men cast it out. He that hath ears to hear, let him hear.",pt:"N\xe3o presta nem para terra, nem para adubo; lan\xe7am-no fora. Quem tem ouvidos para ouvir, ou\xe7a."}]}}),795,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,n,s,t,i){s.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then drew near unto him all the publicans and sinners for to hear him.",pt:"Ora, chegavam-se a ele todos os publicanos e pecadores para o ouvir."},{verse:2,en:"And the Pharisees and scribes murmured, saying, This man receiveth sinners, and eateth with them.",pt:"E os fariseus e os escribas murmuravam, dizendo: Este recebe pecadores, e come com eles."},{verse:3,en:"And he spake this parable unto them, saying,",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele lhes prop\xf4s esta par\xe1bola:"},{verse:4,en:"What man of you, having an hundred sheep, if he lose one of them, doth not leave the ninety and nine in the wilderness, and go after that which is lost, until he find it?",pt:"Qual de v\xf3s \xe9 o homem que, possuindo cem ovelhas, e perdendo uma delas, n\xe3o deixa as noventa e nove no deserto, e n\xe3o vai ap\xf3s a perdida at\xe9 que a encontre?"},{verse:5,en:"And when he hath found it, he layeth it on his shoulders, rejoicing.",pt:"E achando-a, p\xf5e-na sobre os ombros, cheio de j\xfabilo;"},{verse:6,en:"And when he cometh home, he calleth together his friends and neighbours, saying unto them, Rejoice with me; for I have found my sheep which was lost.",pt:"e chegando a casa, re\xfane os amigos e vizinhos e lhes diz: Alegrai-vos comigo, porque achei a minha ovelha que se havia perdido."},{verse:7,en:"I say unto you, that likewise joy shall be in heaven over one sinner that repenteth, more than over ninety and nine just persons, which need no repentance.",pt:"Digo-vos que assim haver\xe1 maior alegria no c\xe9u por um pecador que se arrepende, do que por noventa e nove justos que n\xe3o necessitam de arrependimento."},{verse:8,en:"Either what woman having ten pieces of silver, if she lose one piece, doth not light a candle, and sweep the house, and seek diligently till she find it?",pt:"Ou qual \xe9 a mulher que, tendo dez dracmas e perdendo uma dracma, n\xe3o acende a candeia, e n\xe3o varre a casa, buscando com dilig\xeancia at\xe9 encontr\xe1-la?"},{verse:9,en:"And when she hath found it, she calleth her friends and her neighbours together, saying, Rejoice with me; for I have found the piece which I had lost.",pt:"E achando-a, re\xfane as amigas e vizinhas, dizendo: Alegrai-vos comigo, porque achei a dracma que eu havia perdido."},{verse:10,en:"Likewise, I say unto you, there is joy in the presence of the angels of God over one sinner that repenteth.",pt:"Assim, digo-vos, h\xe1 alegria na presen\xe7a dos anjos de Deus por um s\xf3 pecador que se arrepende."},{verse:11,en:"And he said, A certain man had two sons:",pt:"Disse-lhe mais: Certo homem tinha dois filhos."},{verse:12,en:"And the younger of them said to his father, Father, give me the portion of goods that falleth to me. And he divided unto them his living.",pt:"O mais mo\xe7o deles disse ao pai: Pai, d\xe1-me a parte dos bens que me toca. Repartiu-lhes, pois, os seus haveres."},{verse:13,en:"And not many days after the younger son gathered all together, and took his journey into a far country, and there wasted his substance with riotous living.",pt:"Poucos dias depois, o filho mais mo\xe7o ajuntando tudo, partiu para um pa\xeds distante, e ali desperdi\xe7ou os seus bens, vivendo dissolutamente."},{verse:14,en:"And when he had spent all, there arose a mighty famine in that land; and he began to be in want.",pt:"E, havendo ele dissipado tudo, houve naquela terra uma grande fome, e come\xe7ou a passar necessidades."},{verse:15,en:"And he went and joined himself to a citizen of that country; and he sent him into his fields to feed swine.",pt:"Ent\xe3o foi encontrar-se a um dos cidad\xe3os daquele pa\xeds, o qual o mandou para os seus campos a apascentar porcos."},{verse:16,en:"And he would fain have filled his belly with the husks that the swine did eat: and no man gave unto him.",pt:"E desejava encher o est\xf4mago com as alfarrobas que os porcos comiam; e ningu\xe9m lhe dava nada."},{verse:17,en:"And when he came to himself, he said, How many hired servants of my father\u2019s have bread enough and to spare, and I perish with hunger!",pt:"Caindo, por\xe9m, em si, disse: Quantos empregados de meu pai t\xeam abund\xe2ncia de p\xe3o, e eu aqui pere\xe7o de fome!"},{verse:18,en:"I will arise and go to my father, and will say unto him, Father, I have sinned against heaven, and before thee,",pt:"Levantar-me-ei, irei ter com meu pai e dir-lhe-ei: Pai, pequei contra o c\xe9u e diante de ti;"},{verse:19,en:"And am no more worthy to be called thy son: make me as one of thy hired servants.",pt:"j\xe1 n\xe3o sou digno de ser chamado teu filho; trata-me como um dos teus empregados."},{verse:20,en:"And he arose, and came to his father. But when he was yet a great way off, his father saw him, and had compassion, and ran, and fell on his neck, and kissed him.",pt:"Levantou-se, pois, e foi para seu pai. Estando ele ainda longe, seu pai o viu, encheu-se de compaix\xe3o e, correndo, lan\xe7ou-se-lhe ao pesco\xe7o e o beijou."},{verse:21,en:"And the son said unto him, Father, I have sinned against heaven, and in thy sight, and am no more worthy to be called thy son.",pt:"Disse-lhe o filho: Pai, pequei conta o c\xe9u e diante de ti; j\xe1 n\xe3o sou digno de ser chamado teu filho."},{verse:22,en:"But the father said to his servants, Bring forth the best robe, and put it on him; and put a ring on his hand, and shoes on his feet:",pt:"Mas o pai disse aos seus servos: Trazei depressa a melhor roupa, e vesti-lha, e ponde-lhe um anel no dedo e alparcas nos p\xe9s;"},{verse:23,en:"And bring hither the fatted calf, and kill it; and let us eat, and be merry:",pt:"trazei tamb\xe9m o bezerro, cevado e matai-o; comamos, e regozijemo-nos,"},{verse:24,en:"For this my son was dead, and is alive again; he was lost, and is found. And they began to be merry.",pt:"porque este meu filho estava morto, e reviveu; tinha-se perdido, e foi achado. E come\xe7aram a regozijar-se."},{verse:25,en:"Now his elder son was in the field: and as he came and drew nigh to the house, he heard musick and dancing.",pt:"Ora, o seu filho mais velho estava no campo; e quando voltava, ao aproximar-se de casa, ouviu a m\xfasica e as dan\xe7as;"},{verse:26,en:"And he called one of the servants, and asked what these things meant.",pt:"e chegando um dos servos, perguntou-lhe que era aquilo."},{verse:27,en:"And he said unto him, Thy brother is come; and thy father hath killed the fatted calf, because he hath received him safe and sound.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe este: Chegou teu irm\xe3o; e teu pai matou o bezerro cevado, porque o recebeu s\xe3o e salvo."},{verse:28,en:"And he was angry, and would not go in: therefore came his father out, and intreated him.",pt:"Mas ele se indignou e n\xe3o queria entrar. Saiu ent\xe3o o pai e instava com ele."},{verse:29,en:"And he answering said to his father, Lo, these many years do I serve thee, neither transgressed I at any time thy commandment: and yet thou never gavest me a kid, that I might make merry with my friends:",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, respondeu ao pai: Eis que h\xe1 tantos anos te sirvo, e nunca transgredi um mandamento teu; contudo nunca me deste um cabrito para eu me regozijar com os meus amigos;"},{verse:30,en:"But as soon as this thy son was come, which hath devoured thy living with harlots, thou hast killed for him the fatted calf.",pt:"vindo, por\xe9m, este teu filho, que desperdi\xe7ou os teus bens com as meretrizes, mataste-lhe o bezerro cevado."},{verse:31,en:"And he said unto him, Son, thou art ever with me, and all that I have is thine.",pt:"Replicou-lhe o pai: Filho, tu sempre est\xe1s comigo, e tudo o que \xe9 meu \xe9 teu;"},{verse:32,en:"It was meet that we should make merry, and be glad: for this thy brother was dead, and is alive again; and was lost, and is found.",pt:"era justo, por\xe9m, regozijarmo-nos e alegramo-nos, porque este teu irm\xe3o estava morto, e reviveu; tinha-se perdido, e foi achado."}]}}),796,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he said also unto his disciples, There was a certain rich man, which had a steward; and the same was accused unto him that he had wasted his goods.",pt:"Dizia Jesus tamb\xe9m aos seus disc\xedpulos: Havia certo homem rico, que tinha um mordomo; e este foi acusado perante ele de estar dissipando os seus bens."},{verse:2,en:"And he called him, and said unto him, How is it that I hear this of thee? give an account of thy stewardship; for thou mayest be no longer steward.",pt:"Chamou-o, ent\xe3o, e lhe disse: Que \xe9 isso que ou\xe7o dizer de ti? Presta contas da tua mordomia; porque j\xe1 n\xe3o podes mais ser meu mordomo."},{verse:3,en:"Then the steward said within himself, What shall I do? for my lord taketh away from me the stewardship: I cannot dig; to beg I am ashamed.",pt:"Disse, pois, o mordomo consigo: Que hei de fazer, j\xe1 que o meu senhor me tira a mordomia? Para cavar, n\xe3o tenho for\xe7as; de mendigar, tenho vergonha."},{verse:4,en:"I am resolved what to do, that, when I am put out of the stewardship, they may receive me into their houses.",pt:"Agora sei o que vou fazer, para que, quando for desapossado da mordomia, me recebam em suas casas."},{verse:5,en:"So he called every one of his lord\u2019s debtors unto him, and said unto the first, How much owest thou unto my lord?",pt:"E chamando a si cada um dos devedores do seu senhor, perguntou ao primeiro: Quanto deves ao meu senhor?"},{verse:6,en:"And he said, An hundred measures of oil. And he said unto him, Take thy bill, and sit down quickly, and write fifty.",pt:"Respondeu ele: Cem cados de azeite. Disse-lhe ent\xe3o: Toma a tua conta, senta-te depressa e escreve cinquenta."},{verse:7,en:"Then said he to another, And how much owest thou? And he said, An hundred measures of wheat. And he said unto him, Take thy bill, and write fourscore.",pt:"Perguntou depois a outro: E tu, quanto deves? Respondeu ele: Cem coros de trigo. E disse-lhe: Toma a tua conta e escreve oitenta."},{verse:8,en:"And the lord commended the unjust steward, because he had done wisely: for the children of this world are in their generation wiser than the children of light.",pt:"E louvou aquele senhor ao injusto mordomo por haver procedido com sagacidade; porque os filhos deste mundo s\xe3o mais sagazes para com a sua gera\xe7\xe3o do que os filhos da luz."},{verse:9,en:"And I say unto you, Make to yourselves friends of the mammon of unrighteousness; that, when ye fail, they may receive you into everlasting habitations.",pt:"Eu vos digo ainda: Granjeai amigos por meio das riquezas da injusti\xe7a; para que, quando estas vos faltarem, vos recebam eles nos tabern\xe1culos eternos."},{verse:10,en:"He that is faithful in that which is least is faithful also in much: and he that is unjust in the least is unjust also in much.",pt:"Quem \xe9 fiel no pouco, tamb\xe9m \xe9 fiel no muito; quem \xe9 injusto no pouco, tamb\xe9m \xe9 injusto no muito."},{verse:11,en:"If therefore ye have not been faithful in the unrighteous mammon, who will commit to your trust the true riches?",pt:"Se, pois, nas riquezas injustas n\xe3o fostes fi\xe9is, quem vos confiar\xe1 as verdadeiras?"},{verse:12,en:"And if ye have not been faithful in that which is another man\u2019s, who shall give you that which is your own?",pt:"E se no alheio n\xe3o fostes fi\xe9is, quem vos dar\xe1 o que \xe9 vosso?"},{verse:13,en:"No servant can serve two masters: for either he will hate the one, and love the other; or else he will hold to the one, and despise the other. Ye cannot serve God and mammon.",pt:"Nenhum servo pode servir dois senhores; porque ou h\xe1 de odiar a um e amar ao outro, o h\xe1 de odiar a um e amar ao outro, o h\xe1 de dedicar-se a um e desprezar o outro. N\xe3o podeis servir a Deus e \xe0s riquezas."},{verse:14,en:"And the Pharisees also, who were covetous, heard all these things: and they derided him.",pt:"Os fariseus, que eram gananciosos, ouviam todas essas coisas e zombavam dele."},{verse:15,en:"And he said unto them, Ye are they which justify yourselves before men; but God knoweth your hearts: for that which is highly esteemed among men is abomination in the sight of God.",pt:"E ele lhes disse: V\xf3s sois os que vos justificais a v\xf3s mesmos diante dos homens, mas Deus conhece os vossos cora\xe7\xf5es; porque o que entre os homens \xe9 elevado, perante Deus \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:16,en:"The law and the prophets were until John: since that time the kingdom of God is preached, and every man presseth into it.",pt:"A lei e os profetas vigoraram at\xe9 Jo\xe3o; desde ent\xe3o \xe9 anunciado o evangelho do reino de Deus, e todo homem forceja por entrar nele."},{verse:17,en:"And it is easier for heaven and earth to pass, than one tittle of the law to fail.",pt:"\xc9, por\xe9m, mais f\xe1cil passar o c\xe9u e a terra do que cair um til da lei."},{verse:18,en:"Whosoever putteth away his wife, and marrieth another, committeth adultery: and whosoever marrieth her that is put away from her husband committeth adultery.",pt:"Todo aquele que repudia sua mulher e casa com outra, comete adult\xe9rio; e quem casa com a que foi repudiada pelo marido, tamb\xe9m comete adult\xe9rio."},{verse:19,en:"There was a certain rich man, which was clothed in purple and fine linen, and fared sumptuously every day:",pt:"Ora, havia um homem rico que se vestia de p\xfarpura e de linho fin\xedssimo, e todos os dias se regalava esplendidamente."},{verse:20,en:"And there was a certain beggar named Lazarus, which was laid at his gate, full of sores,",pt:"Ao seu port\xe3o fora deitado um mendigo, chamado L\xe1zaro, todo coberto de \xfalceras;"},{verse:21,en:"And desiring to be fed with the crumbs which fell from the rich man\u2019s table: moreover the dogs came and licked his sores.",pt:"o qual desejava alimentar-se com as migalhas que ca\xedam da mesa do rico; e os pr\xf3prios c\xe3es vinham lamber-lhe as \xfalceras."},{verse:22,en:"And it came to pass, that the beggar died, and was carried by the angels into Abraham\u2019s bosom: the rich man also died, and was buried;",pt:"Veio a morrer o mendigo, e foi levado pelos anjos para o seio de Abra\xe3o; morreu tamb\xe9m o rico, e foi sepultado."},{verse:23,en:"And in hell he lift up his eyes, being in torments, and seeth Abraham afar off, and Lazarus in his bosom.",pt:"No hades, ergueu os olhos, estando em tormentos, e viu ao longe a Abra\xe3o, e a L\xe1zaro no seu seio."},{verse:24,en:"And he cried and said, Father Abraham, have mercy on me, and send Lazarus, that he may dip the tip of his finger in water, and cool my tongue; for I am tormented in this flame.",pt:"E, clamando, disse: Pai Abra\xe3o, tem miseric\xf3rdia de mim, e envia-me L\xe1zaro, para que molhe na \xe1gua a ponta do dedo e me refresque a l\xedngua, porque estou atormentado nesta chama."},{verse:25,en:"But Abraham said, Son, remember that thou in thy lifetime receivedst thy good things, and likewise Lazarus evil things: but now he is comforted, and thou art tormented.",pt:"Disse, por\xe9m, Abra\xe3o: Filho, lembra-te de que em tua vida recebeste os teus bens, e L\xe1zaro de igual modo os males; agora, por\xe9m, ele aqui \xe9 consolado, e tu atormentado."},{verse:26,en:"And beside all this, between us and you there is a great gulf fixed: so that they which would pass from hence to you cannot; neither can they pass to us, that would come from thence.",pt:"E al\xe9m disso, entre n\xf3s e v\xf3s est\xe1 posto um grande abismo, de sorte que os que quisessem passar daqui para v\xf3s n\xe3o poderiam, nem os de l\xe1 passar para n\xf3s."},{verse:27,en:"Then he said, I pray thee therefore, father, that thou wouldest send him to my father\u2019s house:",pt:"Disse ele ent\xe3o: Rogo-te, pois, \xf3 pai, que o mandes \xe0 casa de meu pai,"},{verse:28,en:"For I have five brethren; that he may testify unto them, lest they also come into this place of torment.",pt:"porque tenho cinco irm\xe3os; para que lhes d\xea testemunho, a fim de que n\xe3o venham eles tamb\xe9m para este lugar de tormento."},{verse:29,en:"Abraham saith unto him, They have Moses and the prophets; let them hear them.",pt:"Disse-lhe Abra\xe3o: T\xeam Mois\xe9s e os profetas; ou\xe7am-nos."},{verse:30,en:"And he said, Nay, father Abraham: but if one went unto them from the dead, they will repent.",pt:"Respondeu ele: N\xe3o! pai Abra\xe3o; mas, se algu\xe9m dentre os mortos for ter com eles, h\xe3o de se arrepender."},{verse:31,en:"And he said unto him, If they hear not Moses and the prophets, neither will they be persuaded, though one rose from the dead.",pt:"Abra\xe3o, por\xe9m, lhe disse: Se n\xe3o ouvem a Mois\xe9s e aos profetas, tampouco acreditar\xe3o, ainda que ressuscite algu\xe9m dentre os mortos."}]}}),797,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:17,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then said he unto the disciples, It is impossible but that offences will come: but woe unto him, through whom they come!",pt:"Disse Jesus a seus disc\xedpulos: \xc9 imposs\xedvel que n\xe3o venham trope\xe7os, mas ai daquele por quem vierem!"},{verse:2,en:"It were better for him that a millstone were hanged about his neck, and he cast into the sea, than that he should offend one of these little ones.",pt:"Melhor lhe fora que se lhe pendurasse ao pesco\xe7o uma pedra de moinho e fosse lan\xe7ado ao mar, do que fazer trope\xe7ar um destes pequeninos."},{verse:3,en:"Take heed to yourselves: If thy brother trespass against thee, rebuke him; and if he repent, forgive him.",pt:"Tende cuidado de v\xf3s mesmos; se teu irm\xe3o pecar, repreende-o; e se ele se arrepender, perdoa-lhe."},{verse:4,en:"And if he trespass against thee seven times in a day, and seven times in a day turn again to thee, saying, I repent; thou shalt forgive him.",pt:"Mesmo se pecar contra ti sete vezes no dia, e sete vezes vier ter contigo, dizendo: Arrependo-me; tu lhe perdoar\xe1s."},{verse:5,en:"And the apostles said unto the Lord, Increase our faith.",pt:"Disseram ent\xe3o os ap\xf3stolos ao Senhor: Aumenta-nos a f\xe9."},{verse:6,en:"And the Lord said, If ye had faith as a grain of mustard seed, ye might say unto this sycamine tree, Be thou plucked up by the root, and be thou planted in the sea; and it should obey you.",pt:"Respondeu o Senhor: Se tiv\xe9sseis f\xe9 como um gr\xe3o de mostarda, dir\xedeis a esta amoreira: Desarraiga-te, e planta-te no mar; e ela vos obedeceria."},{verse:7,en:"But which of you, having a servant plowing or feeding cattle, will say unto him by and by, when he is come from the field, Go and sit down to meat?",pt:"Qual de v\xf3s, tendo um servo a lavrar ou a apascentar gado, lhe dir\xe1, ao voltar ele do campo: chega-te j\xe1, e reclina-te \xe0 mesa?"},{verse:8,en:"And will not rather say unto him, Make ready wherewith I may sup, and gird thyself, and serve me, till I have eaten and drunken; and afterward thou shalt eat and drink?",pt:"N\xe3o lhe dir\xe1 antes: Prepara-me a ceia, e cinge-te, e serve-me, at\xe9 que eu tenha comido e bebido, e depois comer\xe1s tu e beber\xe1s?"},{verse:9,en:"Doth he thank that servant because he did the things that were commanded him? I trow not.",pt:"Porventura agradecer\xe1 ao servo, porque este fez o que lhe foi mandado?"},{verse:10,en:"So likewise ye, when ye shall have done all those things which are commanded you, say, We are unprofitable servants: we have done that which was our duty to do.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s, quando fizerdes tudo o que vos for mandado, dizei: Somos servos in\xfateis; fizemos somente o que dev\xedamos fazer."},{verse:11,en:"And it came to pass, as he went to Jerusalem, that he passed through the midst of Samaria and Galilee.",pt:"E aconteceu que, indo ele a Jerusal\xe9m, passava pela divisa entre a Sam\xe1ria e a Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:12,en:"And as he entered into a certain village, there met him ten men that were lepers, which stood afar off:",pt:"Ao entrar em certa aldeia, sa\xedram-lhe ao encontro dez leprosos, os quais pararam de longe,"},{verse:13,en:"And they lifted up their voices, and said, Jesus, Master, have mercy on us.",pt:"e levantaram a voz, dizendo: Jesus, Mestre, tem compaix\xe3o de n\xf3s!"},{verse:14,en:"And when he saw them, he said unto them, Go shew yourselves unto the priests. And it came to pass, that, as they went, they were cleansed.",pt:"Ele, logo que os viu, disse-lhes: Ide, e mostrai-vos aos sacerdotes. E aconteceu que, enquanto iam, ficaram limpos."},{verse:15,en:"And one of them, when he saw that he was healed, turned back, and with a loud voice glorified God,",pt:"Um deles, vendo que fora curado, voltou glorificando a Deus em alta voz;"},{verse:16,en:"And fell down on his face at his feet, giving him thanks: and he was a Samaritan.",pt:"e prostrou-se com o rosto em terra aos p\xe9s de Jesus, dando-lhe gra\xe7as; e este era samaritano."},{verse:17,en:"And Jesus answering said, Were there not ten cleansed? but where are the nine?",pt:"Perguntou, pois, Jesus: N\xe3o foram limpos os dez? E os nove, onde est\xe3o?"},{verse:18,en:"There are not found that returned to give glory to God, save this stranger.",pt:"N\xe3o se achou quem voltasse para dar gl\xf3ria a Deus, sen\xe3o este estrangeiro?"},{verse:19,en:"And he said unto him, Arise, go thy way: thy faith hath made thee whole.",pt:"E disse-lhe: Levanta-te, e vai; a tua f\xe9 te salvou."},{verse:20,en:"And when he was demanded of the Pharisees, when the kingdom of God should come, he answered them and said, The kingdom of God cometh not with observation:",pt:"Sendo Jesus interrogado pelos fariseus sobre quando viria o reino de Deus, respondeu-lhes: O reino de Deus n\xe3o vem com apar\xeancia exterior;"},{verse:21,en:"Neither shall they say, Lo here! or, lo there! for, behold, the kingdom of God is within you.",pt:"nem dir\xe3o: Ei-lo aqui! ou: E\xed-lo ali! pois o reino de Deus est\xe1 dentro de v\xf3s."},{verse:22,en:"And he said unto the disciples, The days will come, when ye shall desire to see one of the days of the Son of man, and ye shall not seeit.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse aos disc\xedpulos: Dias vir\xe3o em que desejareis ver um dos dias do Filho do homem, e n\xe3o o vereis."},{verse:23,en:"And they shall say to you, See here; or, see there: go not after them, nor follow them.",pt:"Dir-vos-\xe3o: Ei-lo ali! ou: Ei-lo aqui! n\xe3o vades, nem os sigais;"},{verse:24,en:"For as the lightning, that lighteneth out of the one part under heaven, shineth unto the other part under heaven; so shall also the Son of man be in his day.",pt:"pois, assim como o rel\xe2mpago, fuzilando em uma extremidade do c\xe9u, ilumina at\xe9 a outra extremidade, assim ser\xe1 tamb\xe9m o Filho do homem no seu dia."},{verse:25,en:"But first must he suffer many things, and be rejected of this generation.",pt:"Mas primeiro \xe9 necess\xe1rio que ele pade\xe7a muitas coisas, e que seja rejeitado por esta gera\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"And as it was in the days of Noe, so shall it be also in the days of the Son of man.",pt:"Como aconteceu nos dias de No\xe9, assim tamb\xe9m ser\xe1 nos dias do Filho do homem."},{verse:27,en:"They did eat, they drank, they married wives, they were given in marriage, until the day that Noe entered into the ark, and the flood came, and destroyed them all.",pt:"Comiam, bebiam, casavam e davam-se em casamento, at\xe9 o dia em que No\xe9 entrou na arca, e veio o dil\xfavio e os destruiu a todos."},{verse:28,en:"Likewise also as it was in the days of Lot; they did eat, they drank, they bought, they sold, they planted, they builded;",pt:"Como tamb\xe9m da mesma forma aconteceu nos dias de L\xf3: comiam, bebiam, compravam, vendiam, plantavam e edificavam;"},{verse:29,en:"But the same day that Lot went out of Sodom it rained fire and brimstone from heaven, and destroyed them all.",pt:"mas no dia em que L\xf3 saiu de Sodoma choveu do c\xe9u fogo e enxofre, e os destruiu a todos;"},{verse:30,en:"Even thus shall it be in the day when the Son of man is revealed.",pt:"assim ser\xe1 no dia em que o Filho do homem se h\xe1 de manifestar."},{verse:31,en:"In that day, he which shall be upon the housetop, and his stuff in the house, let him not come down to take it away: and he that is in the field, let him likewise not return back.",pt:"Naquele dia, quem estiver no eirado, tendo os seus bens em casa, n\xe3o des\xe7a para tir\xe1-los; e, da mesma sorte, o que estiver no campo, n\xe3o volte para tr\xe1s."},{verse:32,en:"Remember Lot\u2019s wife.",pt:"Lembrai-vos da mulher de L\xf3."},{verse:33,en:"Whosoever shall seek to save his life shall lose it; and whosoever shall lose his life shall preserve it.",pt:"Qualquer que procurar preservar a sua vida, perd\xea-la-\xe1, e qualquer que a perder, conserv\xe1-la-\xe1."},{verse:34,en:"I tell you, in that night there shall be two men in one bed; the one shall be taken, and the other shall be left.",pt:"Digo-vos: Naquela noite estar\xe3o dois numa cama; um ser\xe1 tomado, e o outro ser\xe1 deixado."},{verse:35,en:"Two women shall be grinding together; the one shall be taken, and the other left.",pt:"Duas mulheres estar\xe3o juntas moendo; uma ser\xe1 tomada, e a outra ser\xe1 deixada."},{verse:36,en:"Two men shall be in the field; the one shall be taken, and the other left.",pt:"[Dois homens estar\xe3o no campo; um ser\xe1 tomado, e o outro ser\xe1 deixado.]"},{verse:37,en:"And they answered and said unto him, Where, Lord? And he said unto them, Wheresoever the body is, thither will the eagles be gathered together.",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe: Onde, Senhor? E respondeu-lhes: Onde estiver o corpo, a\xed se ajuntar\xe3o tamb\xe9m os abutres."}]}}),798,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:18,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he spake a parable unto them to this end, that men ought always to pray, and not to faint;",pt:"Contou-lhes tamb\xe9m uma par\xe1bola sobre o dever de orar sempre, e nunca desfalecer."},{verse:2,en:"Saying, There was in a city a judge, which feared not God, neither regarded man:",pt:"dizendo: Havia em certa cidade um juiz que n\xe3o temia a Deus, nem respeitava os homens."},{verse:3,en:"And there was a widow in that city; and she came unto him, saying, Avenge me of mine adversary.",pt:"Havia tamb\xe9m naquela mesma cidade uma vi\xfava que ia ter com ele, dizendo: Faze-me justi\xe7a contra o meu advers\xe1rio."},{verse:4,en:"And he would not for a while: but afterward he said within himself, Though I fear not God, nor regard man;",pt:"E por algum tempo n\xe3o quis atend\xea-la; mas depois disse consigo: Ainda que n\xe3o temo a Deus, nem respeito os homens,"},{verse:5,en:"Yet because this widow troubleth me, I will avenge her, lest by her continual coming she weary me.",pt:"todavia, como esta vi\xfava me incomoda, hei de fazer-lhe justi\xe7a, para que ela n\xe3o continue a vir molestar-me."},{verse:6,en:"And the Lord said, Hear what the unjust judge saith.",pt:"Prosseguiu o Senhor: Ouvi o que diz esse juiz injusto."},{verse:7,en:"And shall not God avenge his own elect, which cry day and night unto him, though he bear long with them?",pt:"E n\xe3o far\xe1 Deus justi\xe7a aos seus escolhidos, que dia e noite clamam a ele, j\xe1 que \xe9 long\xe2nimo para com eles?"},{verse:8,en:"I tell you that he will avenge them speedily. Nevertheless when the Son of man cometh, shall he find faith on the earth?",pt:"Digo-vos que depressa lhes far\xe1 justi\xe7a. Contudo quando vier o Filho do homem, porventura achar\xe1 f\xe9 na terra?"},{verse:9,en:"And he spake this parable unto certain which trusted in themselves that they were righteous, and despised others:",pt:"Prop\xf4s tamb\xe9m esta par\xe1bola a uns que confiavam em si mesmos, crendo que eram justos, e desprezavam os outros:"},{verse:10,en:"Two men went up into the temple to pray; the one a Pharisee, and the other a publican.",pt:"Dois homens subiram ao templo para orar; um fariseu, e o outro publicano."},{verse:11,en:"The Pharisee stood and prayed thus with himself, God, I thank thee, that I am not as other men are, extortioners, unjust, adulterers, or even as this publican.",pt:"O fariseu, de p\xe9, assim orava consigo mesmo: \xd3 Deus, gra\xe7as te dou que n\xe3o sou como os demais homens, roubadores, injustos, ad\xfalteros, nem ainda com este publicano."},{verse:12,en:"I fast twice in the week, I give tithes of all that I possess.",pt:"Jejuo duas vezes na semana, e dou o d\xedzimo de tudo quanto ganho."},{verse:13,en:"And the publican, standing afar off, would not lift up so much as his eyes unto heaven, but smote upon his breast, saying, God be merciful to me a sinner.",pt:"Mas o publicano, estando em p\xe9 de longe, nem ainda queria levantar os olhos ao c\xe9u, mas batia no peito, dizendo: \xd3 Deus, s\xea prop\xedcio a mim, o pecador!"},{verse:14,en:"I tell you, this man went down to his house justified rather than the other: for every one that exalteth himself shall be abased; and he that humbleth himself shall be exalted.",pt:"Digo-vos que este desceu justificado para sua casa, e n\xe3o aquele; porque todo o que a si mesmo se exaltar ser\xe1 humilhado; mas o que a si mesmo se humilhar ser\xe1 exaltado."},{verse:15,en:"And they brought unto him also infants, that he would touch them: but when his disciples saw it, they rebuked them.",pt:"Traziam-lhe tamb\xe9m as crian\xe7as, para que as tocasse; mas os disc\xedpulos, vendo isso, os repreendiam."},{verse:16,en:"But Jesus called them unto him, and said, Suffer little children to come unto me, and forbid them not: for of such is the kingdom of God.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, chamando-as para si, disse: Deixai vir a mim as crian\xe7as, e n\xe3o as impe\xe7ais, porque de tais \xe9 o reino de Deus."},{verse:17,en:"Verily I say unto you, Whosoever shall not receive the kingdom of God as a little child shall in no wise enter therein.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que, qualquer que n\xe3o receber o reino de Deus como crian\xe7a, de modo algum entrar\xe1 nele."},{verse:18,en:"And a certain ruler asked him, saying, Good Master, what shall I do to inherit eternal life?",pt:"E perguntou-lhe um dos principais: Bom Mestre, que hei de fazer para herdar a vida eterna?"},{verse:19,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Why callest thou me good? none is good, save one, that is, God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Por que me chamas bom? Ningu\xe9m \xe9 bom, sen\xe3o um, que \xe9 Deus."},{verse:20,en:"Thou knowest the commandments, Do not commit adultery, Do not kill, Do not steal, Do not bear false witness, Honour thy father and thy mother.",pt:"Sabes os mandamentos: N\xe3o adulterar\xe1s; n\xe3o matar\xe1s; n\xe3o furtar\xe1s; n\xe3o dir\xe1s falso testemunho; honra a teu pai e a tua m\xe3e."},{verse:21,en:"And he said, All these have I kept from my youth up.",pt:"Replicou o homem: Tudo isso tenho guardado desde a minha juventude."},{verse:22,en:"Now when Jesus heard these things, he said unto him, Yet lackest thou one thing: sell all that thou hast, and distribute unto the poor, and thou shalt have treasure in heaven: and come, follow me.",pt:"Quando Jesus ouviu isso, disse-lhe: Ainda te falta uma coisa; vende tudo quanto tens e reparte-o pelos pobres, e ter\xe1s um tesouro no c\xe9u; e vem, segue-me."},{verse:23,en:"And when he heard this, he was very sorrowful: for he was very rich.",pt:"Mas, ouvindo ele isso, encheu-se de tristeza; porque era muito rico."},{verse:24,en:"And when Jesus saw that he was very sorrowful, he said, How hardly shall they that have riches enter into the kingdom of God!",pt:"E Jesus, vendo-o assim, disse: Qu\xe3o dificilmente entrar\xe3o no reino de Deus os que t\xeam riquezas!"},{verse:25,en:"For it is easier for a camel to go through a needle\u2019s eye, than for a rich man to enter into the kingdom of God.",pt:"Pois \xe9 mais f\xe1cil um camelo passar pelo fundo duma agulha, do que entrar um rico no reino de Deus."},{verse:26,en:"And they that heard it said, Who then can be saved?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os que ouviram isso disseram: Quem pode, ent\xe3o, ser salvo?"},{verse:27,en:"And he said, The things which are impossible with men are possible with God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: As coisas que s\xe3o imposs\xedveis aos homens s\xe3o poss\xedveis a Deus."},{verse:28,en:"Then Peter said, Lo, we have left all, and followed thee.",pt:"Disse-lhe Pedro: Eis que n\xf3s deixamos tudo, e te seguimos."},{verse:29,en:"And he said unto them, Verily I say unto you, There is no man that hath left house, or parents, or brethren, or wife, or children, for the kingdom of God\u2019s sake,",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Em verdade vos digo que ningu\xe9m h\xe1 que tenha deixado casa, ou mulher, ou irm\xe3os, ou pais, ou filhos, por amor do reino de Deus,"},{verse:30,en:"Who shall not receive manifold more in this present time, and in the world to come life everlasting.",pt:"que n\xe3o haja de receber no presente muito mais, e no mundo vindouro a vida eterna."},{verse:31,en:"Then he took unto him the twelve, and said unto them, Behold, we go up to Jerusalem, and all things that are written by the prophets concerning the Son of man shall be accomplished.",pt:"Tomando Jesus consigo os doze, disse-lhes: Eis que subimos a Jerusal\xe9m e se cumprir\xe1 no filho do homem tudo o que pelos profetas foi escrito;"},{verse:32,en:"For he shall be delivered unto the Gentiles, and shall be mocked, and spitefully entreated, and spitted on:",pt:"pois ser\xe1 entregue aos gentios, e escarnecido, injuriado e cuspido;"},{verse:33,en:"And they shall scourge him, and put him to death: and the third day he shall rise again.",pt:"e depois de o a\xe7oitarem, o matar\xe3o; e ao terceiro dia ressurgir\xe1."},{verse:34,en:"And they understood none of these things: and this saying was hid from them, neither knew they the things which were spoken.",pt:"Mas eles n\xe3o entenderam nada disso; essas palavras lhes eram obscuras, e n\xe3o percebiam o que lhes dizia."},{verse:35,en:"And it came to pass, that as he was come nigh unto Jericho, a certain blind man sat by the way side begging:",pt:"Ora, quando ele ia chegando a Jeric\xf3, estava um cego sentado junto do caminho, mendigando."},{verse:36,en:"And hearing the multitude pass by, he asked what it meant.",pt:"Este, pois, ouvindo passar a multid\xe3o, perguntou que era aquilo."},{verse:37,en:"And they told him, that Jesus of Nazareth passeth by.",pt:"Disseram-lhe que Jesus, o nazareno, ia passando."},{verse:38,en:"And he cried, saying, Jesus, thou Son of David, have mercy on me.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele se p\xf4s a clamar, dizendo: Jesus, Filho de Davi, tem compaix\xe3o de mim!"},{verse:39,en:"And they which went before rebuked him, that he should hold his peace: but he cried so much the more, Thou Son of David, have mercy on me.",pt:"E os que iam \xe0 frente repreendiam-no, para que se calasse; ele, por\xe9m, clamava ainda mais: Filho de Davi, tem compaix\xe3o de mim!"},{verse:40,en:"And Jesus stood, and commanded him to be brought unto him: and when he was come near, he asked him,",pt:"Parou, pois, Jesus, e mandou que lho trouxessem. Tendo ele chegado, perguntou-lhe:"},{verse:41,en:"Saying, What wilt thou that I shall do unto thee? And he said, Lord, that I may receive my sight.",pt:"Que queres que te fa\xe7a? Respondeu ele: Senhor, que eu veja."},{verse:42,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Receive thy sight: thy faith hath saved thee.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: V\xea; a tua f\xe9 te salvou."},{verse:43,en:"And immediately he received his sight, and followed him, glorifying God: and all the people, when they saw it, gave praise unto God.",pt:"Imediatamente recuperou a vista, e o foi seguindo, gloficando a Deus. E todo o povo, vendo isso, dava louvores a Deus."}]}}),799,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:19,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And Jesus entered and passed through Jericho.",pt:"Tendo Jesus entrado em Jeric\xf3, ia atravessando a cidade."},{verse:2,en:"And, behold, there was a man named Zacchaeus, which was the chief among the publicans, and he was rich.",pt:"Havia ali um homem chamado Zaqueu, o qual era chefe de publicanos e era rico."},{verse:3,en:"And he sought to see Jesus who he was; and could not for the press, because he was little of stature.",pt:"Este procurava ver quem era Jesus, e n\xe3o podia, por causa da multid\xe3o, porque era de pequena estatura."},{verse:4,en:"And he ran before, and climbed up into a sycomore tree to see him: for he was to pass that way.",pt:"E correndo adiante, subiu a um sic\xf4moro a fim de v\xea-lo, porque havia de passar por ali."},{verse:5,en:"And when Jesus came to the place, he looked up, and saw him, and said unto him, Zacchaeus, make haste, and come down; for to day I must abide at thy house.",pt:"Quando Jesus chegou \xe0quele lugar, olhou para cima e disse-lhe: Zaqueu, desce depressa; porque importa que eu fique hoje em tua casa."},{verse:6,en:"And he made haste, and came down, and received him joyfully.",pt:"Desceu, pois, a toda a pressa, e o recebeu com alegria."},{verse:7,en:"And when they saw it, they all murmured, saying, That he was gone to be guest with a man that is a sinner.",pt:"Ao verem isso, todos murmuravam, dizendo: Entrou para ser h\xf3spede de um homem pecador."},{verse:8,en:"And Zacchaeus stood, and said unto the Lord; Behold, Lord, the half of my goods I give to the poor; and if I have taken any thing from any man by false accusation, I restore him fourfold.",pt:"Zaqueu, por\xe9m, levantando-se, disse ao Senhor: Eis aqui, Senhor, dou aos pobres metade dos meus bens; e se em alguma coisa tenho defraudado algu\xe9m, eu lho restituo quadruplicado."},{verse:9,en:"And Jesus said unto him, This day is salvation come to this house, forsomuch as he also is a son of Abraham.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Hoje veio a salva\xe7\xe3o a esta casa, porquanto tamb\xe9m este \xe9 filho de Abra\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"For the Son of man is come to seek and to save that which was lost.",pt:"Porque o Filho do homem veio buscar e salvar o que se havia perdido."},{verse:11,en:"And as they heard these things, he added and spake a parable, because he was nigh to Jerusalem, and because they thought that the kingdom of God should immediately appear.",pt:"Ouvindo eles isso, prosseguiu Jesus, e contou uma par\xe1bola, visto estar ele perto de Jerusal\xe9m, e pensarem eles que o reino de Deus se havia de manifestar imediatamente."},{verse:12,en:"He said therefore, A certain nobleman went into a far country to receive for himself a kingdom, and to return.",pt:"Disse pois: Certo homem nobre partiu para uma terra long\xednqua, a fim de tomar posse de um reino e depois voltar."},{verse:13,en:"And he called his ten servants, and delivered them ten pounds, and said unto them, Occupy till I come.",pt:"E chamando dez servos seus, deu-lhes dez minas, e disse-lhes: Negociai at\xe9 que eu venha."},{verse:14,en:"But his citizens hated him, and sent a message after him, saying, We will not have this man to reign over us.",pt:"Mas os seus concidad\xe3os odiavam-no, e enviaram ap\xf3s ele uma embaixada, dizendo: N\xe3o queremos que este homem reine sobre n\xf3s."},{verse:15,en:"And it came to pass, that when he was returned, having received the kingdom, then he commanded these servants to be called unto him, to whom he had given the money, that he might know how much every man had gained by trading.",pt:"E sucedeu que, ao voltar ele, depois de ter tomado posse do reino, mandou chamar aqueles servos a quem entregara o dinheiro, a fim de saber como cada um havia negociado."},{verse:16,en:"Then came the first, saying, Lord, thy pound hath gained ten pounds.",pt:"Apresentou-se, pois, o primeiro, e disse: Senhor, a tua mina rendeu dez minas."},{verse:17,en:"And he said unto him, Well, thou good servant: because thou hast been faithful in a very little, have thou authority over ten cities.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe o senhor: Bem est\xe1, servo bom! porque no m\xednimo foste fiel, sobre dez cidades ter\xe1s autoridade."},{verse:18,en:"And the second came, saying, Lord, thy pound hath gained five pounds.",pt:"Veio o segundo, dizendo: Senhor, a tua mina rendeu cinco minas."},{verse:19,en:"And he said likewise to him, Be thou also over five cities.",pt:"A este tamb\xe9m respondeu: S\xea tu tamb\xe9m sobre cinco cidades."},{verse:20,en:"And another came, saying, Lord, behold, here is thy pound, which I have kept laid up in a napkin:",pt:"E veio outro, dizendo: Senhor, eis aqui a tua mina, que guardei num len\xe7o;"},{verse:21,en:"For I feared thee, because thou art an austere man: thou takest up that thou layedst not down, and reapest that thou didst not sow.",pt:"pois tinha medo de ti, porque \xe9s homem severo; tomas o que n\xe3o puseste, e ceifas o que n\xe3o semeaste."},{verse:22,en:"And he saith unto him, Out of thine own mouth will I judge thee, thou wicked servant. Thou knewest that I was an austere man, taking up that I laid not down, and reaping that I did not sow:",pt:"Disse-lhe o Senhor: Servo mau! pela tua boca te julgarei; sabias que eu sou homem severo, que tomo o que n\xe3o pus, e ceifo o que n\xe3o semeei;"},{verse:23,en:"Wherefore then gavest not thou my money into the bank, that at my coming I might have required mine own with usury?",pt:"por que, pois, n\xe3o puseste o meu dinheiro no banco? ent\xe3o vindo eu, o teria retirado com os juros."},{verse:24,en:"And he said unto them that stood by, Take from him the pound, and give it to him that hath ten pounds.",pt:"E disse aos que estavam ali: Tirai-lhe a mina, e dai-a ao que tem as dez minas."},{verse:25,en:"(And they said unto him, Lord, he hath ten pounds.)",pt:"Responderam-lhe eles: Senhor, ele tem dez minas."},{verse:26,en:"For I say unto you, That unto every one which hath shall be given; and from him that hath not, even that he hath shall be taken away from him.",pt:"Pois eu vos digo que a todo o que tem, dar-se-lhe-\xe1; mas ao que n\xe3o tem, at\xe9 aquilo que tem ser-lhe-\xe1 tirado."},{verse:27,en:"But those mine enemies, which would not that I should reign over them, bring hither, and slay them before me.",pt:"Quanto, por\xe9m, \xe0queles meus inimigos que n\xe3o quiseram que eu reinasse sobre eles, trazei-os aqui, e matai-os diante de mim."},{verse:28,en:"And when he had thus spoken, he went before, ascending up to Jerusalem.",pt:"Tendo Jesus assim falado, ia caminhando adiante deles, subindo para Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:29,en:"And it came to pass, when he was come nigh to Bethphage and Bethany, at the mount called the mount of Olives, he sent two of his disciples,",pt:"Ao aproximar-se de Betfag\xe9 e de Bet\xe2nia, junto do monte que se chama das Oliveiras, enviou dois dos disc\xedpulos,"},{verse:30,en:"Saying, Go ye into the village over against you; in the which at your entering ye shall find a colt tied, whereon yet never man sat: loose him, and bring him hither.",pt:"dizendo-lhes: Ide \xe0 aldeia que est\xe1 defronte, e a\xed, ao entrar, achareis preso um jumentinho em que ningu\xe9m jamais montou; desprendei-o e trazei-o."},{verse:31,en:"And if any man ask you, Why do ye loose him? thus shall ye say unto him, Because the Lord hath need of him.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m vos perguntar: Por que o desprendeis? respondereis assim: O Senhor precisa dele."},{verse:32,en:"And they that were sent went their way, and found even as he had said unto them.",pt:"Partiram, pois, os que tinham sido enviados, e acharam conforme lhes dissera."},{verse:33,en:"And as they were loosing the colt, the owners thereof said unto them, Why loose ye the colt?",pt:"Enquanto desprendiam o jumentinho, os seus donos lhes perguntaram: Por que desprendeis o jumentinho?"},{verse:34,en:"And they said, The Lord hath need of him.",pt:"Responderam eles: O Senhor precisa dele."},{verse:35,en:"And they brought him to Jesus: and they cast their garments upon the colt, and they set Jesus thereon.",pt:"Trouxeram-no, pois, a Jesus e, lan\xe7ando os seus mantos sobre o jumentinho, fizeram que Jesus montasse."},{verse:36,en:"And as he went, they spread their clothes in the way.",pt:"E, enquanto ele ia passando, outros estendiam no caminho os seus mantos."},{verse:37,en:"And when he was come nigh, even now at the descent of the mount of Olives, the whole multitude of the disciples began to rejoice and praise God with a loud voice for all the mighty works that they had seen;",pt:"Quando j\xe1 ia chegando \xe0 descida do Monte das Oliveiras, toda a multid\xe3o dos disc\xedpulos, regozijando-se, come\xe7ou a louvar a Deus em alta voz, por todos os milagres que tinha visto,"},{verse:38,en:"Saying, Blessed be the King that cometh in the name of the Lord: peace in heaven, and glory in the highest.",pt:"dizendo: Bendito o Rei que vem em nome do Senhor; paz no c\xe9u, e gl\xf3ria nas alturas."},{verse:39,en:"And some of the Pharisees from among the multitude said unto him, Master, rebuke thy disciples.",pt:"Nisso, disseram-lhe alguns dos fariseus dentre a multid\xe3o: Mestre, repreende os teus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:40,en:"And he answered and said unto them, I tell you that, if these should hold their peace, the stones would immediately cry out.",pt:"Ao que ele respondeu: Digo-vos que, se estes se calarem, as pedras clamar\xe3o."},{verse:41,en:"And when he was come near, he beheld the city, and wept over it,",pt:"E quando chegou perto e viu a cidade, chorou sobre ela,"},{verse:42,en:"Saying, If thou hadst known, even thou, at least in this thy day, the things which belong unto thy peace! but now they are hid from thine eyes.",pt:"dizendo: Ah! se tu conhecesses, ao menos neste dia, o que te poderia trazer a paz! mas agora isso est\xe1 encoberto aos teus olhos."},{verse:43,en:"For the days shall come upon thee, that thine enemies shall cast a trench about thee, and compass thee round, and keep thee in on every side,",pt:"Porque dias vir\xe3o sobre ti em que os teus inimigos te cercar\xe3o de trincheiras, e te sitiar\xe3o, e te apertar\xe3o de todos os lados,"},{verse:44,en:"And shall lay thee even with the ground, and thy children within thee; and they shall not leave in thee one stone upon another; because thou knewest not the time of thy visitation.",pt:"e te derribar\xe3o, a ti e aos teus filhos que dentro de ti estiverem; e n\xe3o deixar\xe3o em ti pedra sobre pedra, porque n\xe3o conheceste o tempo da tua visita\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:45,en:"And he went into the temple, and began to cast out them that sold therein, and them that bought;",pt:"Ent\xe3o, entrando ele no templo, come\xe7ou a expulsar os que ali vendiam,"},{verse:46,en:"Saying unto them, It is written, My house is the house of prayer: but ye have made it a den of thieves.",pt:"dizendo-lhes: Est\xe1 escrito: A minha casa ser\xe1 casa de ora\xe7\xe3o; v\xf3s, por\xe9m, a fizestes covil de salteadores."},{verse:47,en:"And he taught daily in the temple. But the chief priests and the scribes and the chief of the people sought to destroy him,",pt:"E todos os dias ensinava no templo; mas os principais sacerdotes, os escribas, e os principais do povo procuravam mat\xe1-lo;"},{verse:48,en:"And could not find what they might do: for all the people were very attentive to hear him.",pt:"mas n\xe3o achavam meio de o fazer; porque todo o povo ficava enlevado ao ouvi-lo."}]}}),800,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:20,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass, that on one of those days, as he taught the people in the temple, and preached the gospel, the chief priests and the scribes came upon him with the elders,",pt:"Num desses dias, quando Jesus ensinava o povo no templo, e anunciava o evangelho, sobrevieram os principais sacerdotes e os escribas, com os anci\xe3os."},{verse:2,en:"And spake unto him, saying, Tell us, by what authority doest thou these things? or who is he that gave thee this authority?",pt:"e falaram-lhe deste modo: Dize-nos, com que autoridade fazes tu estas coisas? Ou, quem \xe9 o que te deu esta autoridade?"},{verse:3,en:"And he answered and said unto them, I will also ask you one thing; and answer me:",pt:"Respondeu-lhes ele: Eu tamb\xe9m vos farei uma pergunta; dizei-me, pois:"},{verse:4,en:"The baptism of John, was it from heaven, or of men?",pt:"O batismo de Jo\xe3o era do c\xe9u ou dos homens?"},{verse:5,en:"And they reasoned with themselves, saying, If we shall say, From heaven; he will say, Why then believed ye him not?",pt:"Ao que eles arrazoavam entre si: Se dissermos: do c\xe9u, ele dir\xe1: Por que n\xe3o crestes?"},{verse:6,en:"But and if we say, Of men; all the people will stone us: for they be persuaded that John was a prophet.",pt:"Mas, se dissermos: Dos homens, todo o povo nos apedrejar\xe1; pois est\xe1 convencido de que Jo\xe3o era profeta."},{verse:7,en:"And they answered, that they could not tell whence it was.",pt:"Responderam, pois, que n\xe3o sabiam donde era."},{verse:8,en:"And Jesus said unto them, Neither tell I you by what authority I do these things.",pt:"Replicou-lhes Jesus: Nem eu vos digo com que autoridade fa\xe7o estas coisas."},{verse:9,en:"Then began he to speak to the people this parable; A certain man planted a vineyard, and let it forth to husbandmen, and went into a far country for a long time.",pt:"Come\xe7ou ent\xe3o a dizer ao povo esta par\xe1bola: Um homem plantou uma vinha, arrendou-a a uns lavradores, e ausentou-se do pa\xeds por muito tempo."},{verse:10,en:"And at the season he sent a servant to the husbandmen, that they should give him of the fruit of the vineyard: but the husbandmen beat him, and sent him away empty.",pt:"No tempo pr\xf3prio mandou um servo aos lavradores, para que lhe dessem dos frutos da vinha; mas os lavradores, espancando-o, mandaram-no embora de m\xe3os vazias."},{verse:11,en:"And again he sent another servant: and they beat him also, and entreated him shamefully, and sent him away empty.",pt:"Tornou a mandar outro servo; mas eles espancaram tamb\xe9m a este e, afrontando-o, mandaram-no embora de m\xe3os vazias."},{verse:12,en:"And again he sent a third: and they wounded him also, and cast him out.",pt:"E mandou ainda um terceiro; mas feriram tamb\xe9m a este e lan\xe7aram-no fora."},{verse:13,en:"Then said the lord of the vineyard, What shall I do? I will send my beloved son: it may be they will reverence him when they see him.",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o o senhor da vinha: Que farei? Mandarei o meu filho amado; a ele talvez respeitar\xe3o."},{verse:14,en:"But when the husbandmen saw him, they reasoned among themselves, saying, This is the heir: come, let us kill him, that the inheritance may be ours.",pt:"Mas quando os lavradores o viram, arrazoaram entre si, dizendo: Este \xe9 o herdeiro; matemo-lo, para que a heran\xe7a seja nossa."},{verse:15,en:"So they cast him out of the vineyard, and killed him. What therefore shall the lord of the vineyard do unto them?",pt:"E lan\xe7ando-o fora da vinha, o mataram. Que lhes far\xe1, pois, o senhor da vinha?"},{verse:16,en:"He shall come and destroy these husbandmen, and shall give the vineyard to others. And when they heard it, they said, God forbid.",pt:"Vir\xe1 e destruir\xe1 esses lavradores, e dar\xe1 a vinha a outros. Ouvindo eles isso, disseram: Tal n\xe3o aconte\xe7a!"},{verse:17,en:"And he beheld them, and said, What is this then that is written, The stone which the builders rejected, the same is become the head of the corner?",pt:"Mas Jesus, olhando para eles, disse: Pois, que quer dizer isto que est\xe1 escrito: A pedra que os edificadores rejeitaram, essa foi posta como pedra angular?"},{verse:18,en:"Whosoever shall fall upon that stone shall be broken; but on whomsoever it shall fall, it will grind him to powder.",pt:"Todo o que cair sobre esta pedra ser\xe1 despeda\xe7ado; mas aquele sobre quem ela cair ser\xe1 reduzido a p\xf3."},{verse:19,en:"And the chief priests and the scribes the same hour sought to lay hands on him; and they feared the people: for they perceived that he had spoken this parable against them.",pt:"Ainda na mesma hora os escribas e os principais sacerdotes, percebendo que contra eles proferira essa par\xe1bola, procuraram deitar-lhe as m\xe3os, mas temeram o povo."},{verse:20,en:"And they watched him, and sent forth spies, which should feign themselves just men, that they might take hold of his words, that so they might deliver him unto the power and authority of the governor.",pt:"E, aguardando oportunidade, mandaram espias, os quais se fingiam justos, para o apanharem em alguma palavra, e o entregarem \xe0 jurisdi\xe7\xe3o e \xe0 autoridade do governador."},{verse:21,en:"And they asked him, saying, Master, we know that thou sayest and teachest rightly, neither acceptest thou the person of any, but teachest the way of God truly:",pt:"Estes, pois, o interrogaram, dizendo: Mestre, sabemos que falas e ensinas retamente, e que n\xe3o consideras a apar\xeancia da pessoa, mas ensinas segundo a verdade o caminho de Deus;"},{verse:22,en:"Is it lawful for us to give tribute unto Caesar, or no?",pt:"\xe9-nos l\xedcito dar tributo a C\xe9sar, ou n\xe3o?"},{verse:23,en:"But he perceived their craftiness, and said unto them, Why tempt ye me?",pt:"Mas Jesus, percebendo a ast\xfacia deles, disse-lhes:"},{verse:24,en:"Shew me a penny. Whose image and superscription hath it? They answered and said, Caesar\u2019s.",pt:"Mostrai-me um den\xe1rio. De quem \xe9 a imagem e a inscri\xe7\xe3o que ele tem? Responderam: De C\xe9sar."},{verse:25,en:"And he said unto them, Render therefore unto Caesar the things which be Caesar\u2019s, and unto God the things which be God\u2019s.",pt:"Disse-lhes ent\xe3o: Dai, pois, a C\xe9sar o que \xe9 de C\xe9sar, e a Deus o que \xe9 de Deus."},{verse:26,en:"And they could not take hold of his words before the people: and they marvelled at his answer, and held their peace.",pt:"E n\xe3o puderam apanh\xe1-lo em palavra alguma diante do povo; e admirados da sua resposta, calaram-se."},{verse:27,en:"Then came to him certain of the Sadducees, which deny that there is any resurrection; and they asked him,",pt:"Chegaram ent\xe3o alguns dos saduceus, que dizem n\xe3o haver ressurrei\xe7\xe3o, e perguntaram-lhe:"},{verse:28,en:"Saying, Master, Moses wrote unto us, If any man\u2019s brother die, having a wife, and he die without children, that his brother should take his wife, and raise up seed unto his brother.",pt:"Mestre, Mois\xe9s nos deixou escrito que se morrer algu\xe9m, tendo mulher mas n\xe3o tendo filhos, o irm\xe3o dele case com a vi\xfava, e suscite descend\xeancia ao irm\xe3o."},{verse:29,en:"There were therefore seven brethren: and the first took a wife, and died without children.",pt:"Havia, pois, sete irm\xe3os. O primeiro casou-se e morreu sem filhos;"},{verse:30,en:"And the second took her to wife, and he died childless.",pt:"ent\xe3o o segundo, e depois o terceiro, casaram com a vi\xfava;"},{verse:31,en:"And the third took her; and in like manner the seven also: and they left no children, and died.",pt:"e assim todos os sete, e morreram, sem deixar filhos."},{verse:32,en:"Last of all the woman died also.",pt:"Depois morreu tamb\xe9m a mulher."},{verse:33,en:"Therefore in the resurrection whose wife of them is she? for seven had her to wife.",pt:"Portanto, na ressurrei\xe7\xe3o, de qual deles ser\xe1 ela esposa, pois os sete por esposa a tiveram?"},{verse:34,en:"And Jesus answering said unto them, The children of this world marry, and are given in marriage:",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Os filhos deste mundo casaram-se e d\xe3o-se em casamento;"},{verse:35,en:"But they which shall be accounted worthy to obtain that world, and the resurrection from the dead, neither marry, nor are given in marriage:",pt:"mas os que s\xe3o julgados dignos de alcan\xe7ar o mundo vindouro, e a ressurrei\xe7\xe3o dentre os mortos, nem se casam nem se d\xe3o em casamento;"},{verse:36,en:"Neither can they die any more: for they are equal unto the angels; and are the children of God, being the children of the resurrection.",pt:"porque j\xe1 n\xe3o podem mais morrer; pois s\xe3o iguais aos anjos, e s\xe3o filhos de Deus, sendo filhos da ressurrei\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:37,en:"Now that the dead are raised, even Moses shewed at the bush, when he calleth the Lord the God of Abraham, and the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob.",pt:"Mas que os mortos h\xe3o de ressurgir, o pr\xf3prio Mois\xe9s o mostrou, na passagem a respeito da sar\xe7a, quando chama ao Senhor; Deus de Abra\xe3o, e Deus de Isaque, e Deus de Jac\xf3."},{verse:38,en:"For he is not a God of the dead, but of the living: for all live unto him.",pt:"Ora, ele n\xe3o \xe9 Deus de mortos, mas de vivos; porque para ele todos vivem."},{verse:39,en:"Then certain of the scribes answering said, Master, thou hast well said.",pt:"Responderam alguns dos escribas: Mestre, disseste bem."},{verse:40,en:"And after that they durst not ask him any question at all.",pt:"N\xe3o ousavam, pois, perguntar-lhe mais coisa alguma."},{verse:41,en:"And he said unto them, How say they that Christ is David\u2019s son?",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, lhes perguntou: Como dizem que o Cristo \xe9 filho de Davi?"},{verse:42,en:"And David himself saith in the book of Psalms, The LORD said unto my Lord, Sit thou on my right hand,",pt:"Pois o pr\xf3prio Davi diz no livro dos Salmos: Disse o Senhor ao meu Senhor: Assenta-te \xe0 minha direita,"},{verse:43,en:"Till I make thine enemies thy footstool.",pt:"at\xe9 que eu ponha os teus inimigos por escabelo dos teus p\xe9s."},{verse:44,en:"David therefore calleth him Lord, how is he then his son?",pt:"Logo Davi lhe chama Senhor como, pois, \xe9 ele seu filho?"},{verse:45,en:"Then in the audience of all the people he said unto his disciples,",pt:"Enquanto todo o povo o ouvia, disse Jesus aos seus disc\xedpulos:"},{verse:46,en:"Beware of the scribes, which desire to walk in long robes, and love greetings in the markets, and the highest seats in the synagogues, and the chief rooms at feasts;",pt:"Guardai-vos dos escribas, que querem andar com vestes compridas, e gostam das sauda\xe7\xf5es nas pra\xe7as, dos primeiros assentos nas sinagogas, e dos primeiros lugares nos banquetes;"},{verse:47,en:"Which devour widows\u2019 houses, and for a shew make long prayers: the same shall receive greater damnation.",pt:"que devoram as casas das vi\xfavas, fazendo, por pretexto, longas ora\xe7\xf5es; estes h\xe3o de receber maior condena\xe7\xe3o."}]}}),801,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:21,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he looked up, and saw the rich men casting their gifts into the treasury.",pt:"Jesus, levantando os olhos, viu os ricos deitarem as suas ofertas no cofre;"},{verse:2,en:"And he saw also a certain poor widow casting in thither two mites.",pt:"viu tamb\xe9m uma pobre vi\xfava lan\xe7ar ali dois leptos;"},{verse:3,en:"And he said, Of a truth I say unto you, that this poor widow hath cast in more than they all:",pt:"e disse: Em verdade vos digo que esta pobre vi\xfava deu mais do que todos;"},{verse:4,en:"For all these have of their abundance cast in unto the offerings of God: but she of her penury hath cast in all the living that she had.",pt:"porque todos aqueles deram daquilo que lhes sobrava; mas esta, da sua pobreza, deu tudo o que tinha para o seu sustento."},{verse:5,en:"And as some spake of the temple, how it was adorned with goodly stones and gifts, he said,",pt:"E falando-lhe alguns a respeito do templo, como estava ornado de formosas pedras e d\xe1divas, disse ele:"},{verse:6,en:"As for these things which ye behold, the days will come, in the which there shall not be left one stone upon another, that shall not be thrown down.",pt:"Quanto a isto que vedes, dias vir\xe3o em que n\xe3o se deixar\xe1 aqui pedra sobre pedra, que n\xe3o seja derribada."},{verse:7,en:"And they asked him, saying, Master, but when shall these things be? and what sign will there be when these things shall come to pass?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe ent\xe3o: Mestre, quando, pois, suceder\xe3o estas coisas? E que sinal haver\xe1, quando elas estiverem para se cumprir?"},{verse:8,en:"And he said, Take heed that ye be not deceived: for many shall come in my name, saying, I am Christ; and the time draweth near: go ye not therefore after them.",pt:"Respondeu ent\xe3o ele: Acautelai-vos; n\xe3o sejais enganados; porque vir\xe3o muitos em meu nome, dizendo: Sou eu; e: O tempo \xe9 chegado; n\xe3o vades ap\xf3s eles."},{verse:9,en:"But when ye shall hear of wars and commotions, be not terrified: for these things must first come to pass; but the end is not by and by.",pt:"Quando ouvirdes de guerras e tumultos, n\xe3o vos assusteis; pois \xe9 necess\xe1rio que primeiro aconte\xe7am essas coisas; mas o fim n\xe3o ser\xe1 logo."},{verse:10,en:"Then said he unto them, Nation shall rise against nation, and kingdom against kingdom:",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes disse: Levantar-se-\xe1 na\xe7\xe3o contra na\xe7\xe3o, e reino contra reino;"},{verse:11,en:"And great earthquakes shall be in divers places, and famines, and pestilences; and fearful sights and great signs shall there be from heaven.",pt:"e haver\xe1 em v\xe1rios lugares grandes terremotos, e pestes e fomes; haver\xe1 tamb\xe9m coisas espantosas, e grandes sinais do c\xe9u."},{verse:12,en:"But before all these, they shall lay their hands on you, and persecute you, delivering you up to the synagogues, and into prisons, being brought before kings and rulers for my name\u2019s sake.",pt:"Mas antes de todas essas coisas vos h\xe3o de prender e perseguir, entregando-vos \xe0s sinagogas e aos c\xe1rceres, e conduzindo-vos \xe0 presen\xe7a de reis e governadores, por causa do meu nome."},{verse:13,en:"And it shall turn to you for a testimony.",pt:"Isso vos acontecer\xe1 para que deis testemunho."},{verse:14,en:"Settle it therefore in your hearts, not to meditate before what ye shall answer:",pt:"Proponde, pois, em vossos cora\xe7\xf5es n\xe3o premeditar como haveis de fazer a vossa defesa;"},{verse:15,en:"For I will give you a mouth and wisdom, which all your adversaries shall not be able to gainsay nor resist.",pt:"porque eu vos darei boca e sabedoria, a que nenhum dos vossos advers\xe1rio poder\xe1 resistir nem contradizer."},{verse:16,en:"And ye shall be betrayed both by parents, and brethren, and kinsfolks, and friends; and some of you shall they cause to be put to death.",pt:"E at\xe9 pelos pais, e irm\xe3os, e parentes, e amigos sereis entregues; e matar\xe3o alguns de v\xf3s;"},{verse:17,en:"And ye shall be hated of all men for my name\u2019s sake.",pt:"e sereis odiados de todos por causa do meu nome."},{verse:18,en:"But there shall not an hair of your head perish.",pt:"Mas n\xe3o se perder\xe1 um \xfanico cabelo da vossa cabe\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"In your patience possess ye your souls.",pt:"Pela vossa perseveran\xe7a ganhareis as vossas almas."},{verse:20,en:"And when ye shall see Jerusalem compassed with armies, then know that the desolation thereof is nigh.",pt:"Mas, quando virdes Jerusal\xe9m cercada de ex\xe9rcitos, sabei ent\xe3o que \xe9 chegada a sua desola\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:21,en:"Then let them which are in Judaea flee to the mountains; and let them which are in the midst of it depart out; and let not them that are in the countries enter thereinto.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, os que estiverem na Jud\xe9ia fujam para os montes; os que estiverem dentro da cidade, saiam; e os que estiverem nos campos n\xe3o entrem nela."},{verse:22,en:"For these be the days of vengeance, that all things which are written may be fulfilled.",pt:"Porque dias de vingan\xe7a s\xe3o estes, para que se cumpram todas as coisas que est\xe3o escritas."},{verse:23,en:"But woe unto them that are with child, and to them that give suck, in those days! for there shall be great distress in the land, and wrath upon this people.",pt:"Ai das que estiverem gr\xe1vidas, e das que amamentarem naqueles dias! porque haver\xe1 grande ang\xfastia sobre a terra, e ira contra este povo."},{verse:24,en:"And they shall fall by the edge of the sword, and shall be led away captive into all nations: and Jerusalem shall be trodden down of the Gentiles, until the times of the Gentiles be fulfilled.",pt:"E cair\xe3o ao fio da espada, e para todas as na\xe7\xf5es ser\xe3o levados cativos; e Jerusal\xe9m ser\xe1 pisada pelos gentios, at\xe9 que os tempos destes se completem."},{verse:25,en:"And there shall be signs in the sun, and in the moon, and in the stars; and upon the earth distress of nations, with perplexity; the sea and the waves roaring;",pt:"E haver\xe1 sinais no sol, na lua e nas estrelas; e sobre a terra haver\xe1 ang\xfastia das na\xe7\xf5es em perplexidade pelo bramido do mar e das ondas."},{verse:26,en:"Men\u2019s hearts failing them for fear, and for looking after those things which are coming on the earth: for the powers of heaven shall be shaken.",pt:"os homens desfalecer\xe3o de terror, e pela expecta\xe7\xe3o das coisas que sobrevir\xe3o ao mundo; porquanto os poderes do c\xe9u ser\xe3o abalados."},{verse:27,en:"And then shall they see the Son of man coming in a cloud with power and great glory.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ver\xe3o vir o Filho do homem em uma nuvem, com poder e grande gl\xf3ria."},{verse:28,en:"And when these things begin to come to pass, then look up, and lift up your heads; for your redemption draweth nigh.",pt:"Ora, quando essas coisas come\xe7arem a acontecer, exultai e levantai as vossas cabe\xe7as, porque a vossa reden\xe7\xe3o se aproxima."},{verse:29,en:"And he spake to them a parable; Behold the fig tree, and all the trees;",pt:"Prop\xf4s-lhes ent\xe3o uma par\xe1bola: Olhai para a figueira, e para todas as \xe1rvores;"},{verse:30,en:"When they now shoot forth, ye see and know of your own selves that summer is now nigh at hand.",pt:"quando come\xe7am a brotar, sabeis por v\xf3s mesmos, ao v\xea-las, que j\xe1 est\xe1 pr\xf3ximo o ver\xe3o."},{verse:31,en:"So likewise ye, when ye see these things come to pass, know ye that the kingdom of God is nigh at hand.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s, quando virdes acontecerem estas coisas, sabei que o reino de Deus est\xe1 pr\xf3ximo."},{verse:32,en:"Verily I say unto you, This generation shall not pass away, till all be fulfilled.",pt:"Em verdade vos digo que n\xe3o passar\xe1 esta gera\xe7\xe3o at\xe9 que tudo isso se cumpra."},{verse:33,en:"Heaven and earth shall pass away: but my words shall not pass away.",pt:"Passar\xe1 o c\xe9u e a terra, mas as minhas palavras jamais passar\xe3o."},{verse:34,en:"And take heed to yourselves, lest at any time your hearts be overcharged with surfeiting, and drunkenness, and cares of this life, and so that day come upon you unawares.",pt:"Olhai por v\xf3s mesmos; n\xe3o aconte\xe7a que os vossos cora\xe7\xf5es se carreguem de glutonaria, de embriaguez, e dos cuidados da vida, e aquele dia vos sobrevenha de improviso como um la\xe7o."},{verse:35,en:"For as a snare shall it come on all them that dwell on the face of the whole earth.",pt:"Porque h\xe1 de vir sobre todos os que habitam na face da terra."},{verse:36,en:"Watch ye therefore, and pray always, that ye may be accounted worthy to escape all these things that shall come to pass, and to stand before the Son of man.",pt:"Vigiai, pois, em todo o tempo, orando, para que possais escapar de todas estas coisas que h\xe3o de acontecer, e estar em p\xe9 na presen\xe7a do Filho do homem."},{verse:37,en:"And in the day time he was teaching in the temple; and at night he went out, and abode in the mount that is called the mount of Olives.",pt:"Ora, de dia ensinava no templo, e \xe0 noite, saindo, pousava no monte chamado das Oliveiras."},{verse:38,en:"And all the people came early in the morning to him in the temple, for to hear him.",pt:"E todo o povo ia ter com ele no templo, de manh\xe3 cedo, para o ouvir."}]}}),802,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:22,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now the feast of unleavened bread drew nigh, which is called the Passover.",pt:"Aproximava-se a festa dos p\xe3es \xe1zimos, que se chama a p\xe1scoa."},{verse:2,en:"And the chief priests and scribes sought how they might kill him; for they feared the people.",pt:"E os principais sacerdotes e os escribas andavam procurando um modo de o matar; pois temiam o povo."},{verse:3,en:"Then entered Satan into Judas surnamed Iscariot, being of the number of the twelve.",pt:"Entrou ent\xe3o Satan\xe1s em Judas, que tinha por sobrenome Iscariotes, que era um dos doze;"},{verse:4,en:"And he went his way, and communed with the chief priests and captains, how he might betray him unto them.",pt:"e foi ele tratar com os principais sacerdotes e com os capit\xe3es de como lho entregaria."},{verse:5,en:"And they were glad, and covenanted to give him money.",pt:"Eles se alegraram com isso, e convieram em lhe dar dinheiro."},{verse:6,en:"And he promised, and sought opportunity to betray him unto them in the absence of the multitude.",pt:"E ele concordou, e buscava ocasi\xe3o para lho entregar sem alvoro\xe7o."},{verse:7,en:"Then came the day of unleavened bread, when the passover must be killed.",pt:"Ora, chegou o dia dos p\xe3es \xe1zimos, em que se devia imolar a p\xe1scoa;"},{verse:8,en:"And he sent Peter and John, saying, Go and prepare us the passover, that we may eat.",pt:"e Jesus enviou a Pedro e a Jo\xe3o, dizendo: Ide, preparai-nos a p\xe1scoa, para que a comamos."},{verse:9,en:"And they said unto him, Where wilt thou that we prepare?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe eles: Onde queres que a preparemos?"},{verse:10,en:"And he said unto them, Behold, when ye are entered into the city, there shall a man meet you, bearing a pitcher of water; follow him into the house where he entereth in.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: Quando entrardes na cidade, sair-vos-\xe1 ao encontro um homem, levando um c\xe2ntaro de \xe1gua; segui-o at\xe9 a casa em que ele entrar."},{verse:11,en:"And ye shall say unto the goodman of the house, The Master saith unto thee, Where is the guestchamber, where I shall eat the passover with my disciples?",pt:"E direis ao dono da casa: O Mestre manda perguntar-te: Onde est\xe1 o aposento em que hei de comer a p\xe1scoa com os meus disc\xedpulos?"},{verse:12,en:"And he shall shew you a large upper room furnished: there make ready.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele vos mostrar\xe1 um grande cen\xe1culo mobiliado; a\xed fazei os preparativos."},{verse:13,en:"And they went, and found as he had said unto them: and they made ready the passover.",pt:"Foram, pois, e acharam tudo como lhes dissera e prepararam a p\xe1scoa."},{verse:14,en:"And when the hour was come, he sat down, and the twelve apostles with him.",pt:"E, chegada a hora, p\xf4s-se Jesus \xe0 mesa, e com ele os ap\xf3stolos."},{verse:15,en:"And he said unto them, With desire I have desired to eat this passover with you before I suffer:",pt:"E disse-lhes: Tenho desejado ardentemente comer convosco esta p\xe1scoa, antes da minha paix\xe3o;"},{verse:16,en:"For I say unto you, I will not any more eat thereof, until it be fulfilled in the kingdom of God.",pt:"pois vos digo que n\xe3o a comerei mais at\xe9 que ela se cumpra no reino de Deus."},{verse:17,en:"And he took the cup, and gave thanks, and said, Take this, and divide it among yourselves:",pt:"Ent\xe3o havendo recebido um c\xe1lice, e tendo dado gra\xe7as, disse: Tomai-o, e reparti-o entre v\xf3s;"},{verse:18,en:"For I say unto you, I will not drink of the fruit of the vine, until the kingdom of God shall come.",pt:"porque vos digo que desde agora n\xe3o mais beberei do fruto da videira, at\xe9 que venha o reino de Deus."},{verse:19,en:"And he took bread, and gave thanks, and brake it, and gave unto them, saying, This is my body which is given for you: this do in remembrance of me.",pt:"E tomando p\xe3o, e havendo dado gra\xe7as, partiu-o e deu-lho, dizendo: Isto \xe9 o meu corpo, que \xe9 dado por v\xf3s; fazei isto em mem\xf3ria de mim."},{verse:20,en:"Likewise also the cup after supper, saying, This cup is the new testament in my blood, which is shed for you.",pt:"Semelhantemente, depois da ceia, tomou o c\xe1lice, dizendo: Este c\xe1lice \xe9 o novo pacto em meu sangue, que \xe9 derramado por v\xf3s."},{verse:21,en:"But, behold, the hand of him that betrayeth me is with me on the table.",pt:"Mas eis que a m\xe3o do que me trai est\xe1 comigo \xe0 mesa."},{verse:22,en:"And truly the Son of man goeth, as it was determined: but woe unto that man by whom he is betrayed!",pt:"Porque, na verdade, o Filho do homem vai segundo o que est\xe1 determinado; mas ai daquele homem por quem \xe9 tra\xeddo!"},{verse:23,en:"And they began to enquire among themselves, which of them it was that should do this thing.",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles come\xe7aram a perguntar entre si qual deles o que ia fazer isso."},{verse:24,en:"And there was also a strife among them, which of them should be accounted the greatest.",pt:"Levantou-se tamb\xe9m entre eles contenda, sobre qual deles parecia ser o maior."},{verse:25,en:"And he said unto them, The kings of the Gentiles exercise lordship over them; and they that exercise authority upon them are called benefactors.",pt:"Ao que Jesus lhes disse: Os reis dos gentios dominam sobre eles, e os que sobre eles exercem autoridade s\xe3o chamados benfeitores."},{verse:26,en:"But ye shall not be so: but he that is greatest among you, let him be as the younger; and he that is chief, as he that doth serve.",pt:"Mas v\xf3s n\xe3o sereis assim; antes o maior entre v\xf3s seja como o mais novo; e quem governa como quem serve."},{verse:27,en:"For whether is greater, he that sitteth at meat, or he that serveth? is not he that sitteth at meat? but I am among you as he that serveth.",pt:"Pois qual \xe9 maior, quem est\xe1 \xe0 mesa, ou quem serve? porventura n\xe3o \xe9 quem est\xe1 \xe0 mesa? Eu, por\xe9m, estou entre v\xf3s como quem serve."},{verse:28,en:"Ye are they which have continued with me in my temptations.",pt:"Mas v\xf3s sois os que tendes permanecido comigo nas minhas prova\xe7\xf5es;"},{verse:29,en:"And I appoint unto you a kingdom, as my Father hath appointed unto me;",pt:"e assim como meu Pai me conferiu dom\xednio, eu vo-lo confiro a v\xf3s;"},{verse:30,en:"That ye may eat and drink at my table in my kingdom, and sit on thrones judging the twelve tribes of Israel.",pt:"para que comais e bebais \xe0 minha mesa no meu reino, e vos senteis sobre tronos, julgando as doze tribos de Israel."},{verse:31,en:"And the Lord said, Simon, Simon, behold, Satan hath desired to have you, that he may sift you as wheat:",pt:"Sim\xe3o, Sim\xe3o, eis que Satan\xe1s vos pediu para vos cirandar como trigo;"},{verse:32,en:"But I have prayed for thee, that thy faith fail not: and when thou art converted, strengthen thy brethren.",pt:"mas eu roguei por ti, para que a tua f\xe9 n\xe3o desfale\xe7a; e tu, quando te converteres, fortalece teus irm\xe3os."},{verse:33,en:"And he said unto him, Lord, I am ready to go with thee, both into prison, and to death.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Pedro: Senhor, estou pronto a ir contigo tanto para a pris\xe3o como para a morte."},{verse:34,en:"And he said, I tell thee, Peter, the cock shall not crow this day, before that thou shalt thrice deny that thou knowest me.",pt:"Tornou-lhe Jesus: Digo-te, Pedro, que n\xe3o cantar\xe1 hoje o galo antes que tr\xeas vezes tenhas negado que me conheces."},{verse:35,en:"And he said unto them, When I sent you without purse, and scrip, and shoes, lacked ye any thing? And they said, Nothing.",pt:"E perguntou-lhes: Quando vos mandei sem bolsa, alforje, ou alparcas, faltou-vos porventura alguma coisa? Eles responderam: Nada."},{verse:36,en:"Then said he unto them, But now, he that hath a purse, let him take it, and likewise his scrip: and he that hath no sword, let him sell his garment, and buy one.",pt:"Disse-lhes pois: Mas agora, quem tiver bolsa, tome-a, como tamb\xe9m o alforje; e quem n\xe3o tiver espada, venda o seu manto e compre-a."},{verse:37,en:"For I say unto you, that this that is written must yet be accomplished in me, And he was reckoned among the transgressors: for the things concerning me have an end.",pt:"Porquanto vos digo que importa que se cumpra em mim isto que est\xe1 escrito: E com os malfeitores foi contado. Pois o que me diz respeito tem seu cumprimento."},{verse:38,en:"And they said, Lord, behold, here are two swords. And he said unto them, It is enough.",pt:"Disseram eles: Senhor, eis aqui duas espadas. Respondeu-lhes: Basta."},{verse:39,en:"And he came out, and went, as he was wont, to the mount of Olives; and his disciples also followed him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o saiu e, segundo o seu costume, foi para o Monte das Oliveiras; e os disc\xedpulos o seguiam."},{verse:40,en:"And when he was at the place, he said unto them, Pray that ye enter not into temptation.",pt:"Quando chegou \xe0quele lugar, disse-lhes: Orai, para que n\xe3o entreis em tenta\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:41,en:"And he was withdrawn from them about a stone\u2019s cast, and kneeled down, and prayed,",pt:"E apartou-se deles cerca de um tiro de pedra; e pondo-se de joelhos, orava,"},{verse:42,en:"Saying, Father, if thou be willing, remove this cup from me: nevertheless not my will, but thine, be done.",pt:"dizendo: Pai, se queres afasta de mim este c\xe1lice; todavia n\xe3o se fa\xe7a a minha vontade, mas a tua."},{verse:43,en:"And there appeared an angel unto him from heaven, strengthening him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhe apareceu um anjo do c\xe9u, que o confortava."},{verse:44,en:"And being in an agony he prayed more earnestly: and his sweat was as it were great drops of blood falling down to the ground.",pt:"E, posto em agonia, orava mais intensamente; e o seu suor tornou-se como grandes gotas de sangue, que ca\xedam sobre o ch\xe3o."},{verse:45,en:"And when he rose up from prayer, and was come to his disciples, he found them sleeping for sorrow,",pt:"Depois, levantando-se da ora\xe7\xe3o, veio para os seus disc\xedpulos, e achou-os dormindo de tristeza;"},{verse:46,en:"And said unto them, Why sleep ye? rise and pray, lest ye enter into temptation.",pt:"e disse-lhes: Por que estais dormindo? Lenvantai-vos, e orai, para que n\xe3o entreis em tenta\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:47,en:"And while he yet spake, behold a multitude, and he that was called Judas, one of the twelve, went before them, and drew near unto Jesus to kiss him.",pt:"E estando ele ainda a falar, eis que surgiu uma multid\xe3o; e aquele que se chamava Judas, um dos doze, ia adiante dela, e chegou-se a Jesus para o beijar."},{verse:48,en:"But Jesus said unto him, Judas, betrayest thou the Son of man with a kiss?",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, lhe disse: Judas, com um beijo trais o Filho do homem?"},{verse:49,en:"When they which were about him saw what would follow, they said unto him, Lord, shall we smite with the sword?",pt:"Quando os que estavam com ele viram o que ia suceder, disseram: Senhor, feri-los-emos a espada?"},{verse:50,en:"And one of them smote the servant of the high priest, and cut off his right ear.",pt:"Ent\xe3o um deles feriu o servo do sumo sacerdote, e cortou-lhe a orelha direita."},{verse:51,en:"And Jesus answered and said, Suffer ye thus far. And he touched his ear, and healed him.",pt:"Mas Jesus disse: Deixei-os; basta. E tocando-lhe a orelha, o curou."},{verse:52,en:"Then Jesus said unto the chief priests, and captains of the temple, and the elders, which were come to him, Be ye come out, as against a thief, with swords and staves?",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse Jesus aos principais sacerdotes, oficiais do templo e anci\xe3os, que tinham ido contra ele: Sa\xedstes, como a um salteador, com espadas e varapaus?"},{verse:53,en:"When I was daily with you in the temple, ye stretched forth no hands against me: but this is your hour, and the power of darkness.",pt:"Todos os dias estava eu convosco no templo, e n\xe3o estendestes as m\xe3os contra mim; mas esta \xe9 a vossa hora e o poder das trevas."},{verse:54,en:"Then took they him, and led him, and brought him into the high priest\u2019s house. And Peter followed afar off.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, prendendo-o, o levaram e o introduziram na casa do sumo sacerdote; e Pedro seguia-o de longe."},{verse:55,en:"And when they had kindled a fire in the midst of the hall, and were set down together, Peter sat down among them.",pt:"E tendo eles acendido fogo no meio do p\xe1tio e havendo-se sentado \xe0 roda, sentou-se Pedro entre eles."},{verse:56,en:"But a certain maid beheld him as he sat by the fire, and earnestly looked upon him, and said, This man was also with him.",pt:"Uma criada, vendo-o sentado ao lume, fixou os olhos nele e disse: Esse tamb\xe9m estava com ele."},{verse:57,en:"And he denied him, saying, Woman, I know him not.",pt:"Mas Pedro o negou, dizendo: Mulher, n\xe3o o conhe\xe7o."},{verse:58,en:"And after a little while another saw him, and said, Thou art also of them. And Peter said, Man, I am not.",pt:"Da\xed a pouco, outro o viu, e disse: Tu tamb\xe9m \xe9s um deles. Mas Pedro disse: Homem, n\xe3o sou."},{verse:59,en:"And about the space of one hour after another confidently affirmed, saying, Of a truth this fellow also was with him: for he is a Galilaean.",pt:"E, tendo passado quase uma hora, outro afirmava, dizendo: Certamente este tamb\xe9m estava com ele, pois \xe9 galileu."},{verse:60,en:"And Peter said, Man, I know not what thou sayest. And immediately, while he yet spake, the cock crew.",pt:"Mas Pedro respondeu: Homem, n\xe3o sei o que dizes. E imediatamente estando ele ainda a falar, cantou o galo."},{verse:61,en:"And the Lord turned, and looked upon Peter. And Peter remembered the word of the Lord, how he had said unto him, Before the cock crow, thou shalt deny me thrice.",pt:"Virando-se o Senhor, olhou para Pedro; e Pedro lembrou-se da palavra do Senhor, como lhe havia dito: Hoje, antes que o galo cante, tr\xeas vezes me negar\xe1s."},{verse:62,en:"And Peter went out, and wept bitterly.",pt:"E, havendo sa\xeddo, chorou amargamente."},{verse:63,en:"And the men that held Jesus mocked him, and smote him.",pt:"Os homens que detinham Jesus zombavam dele, e feriam-no;"},{verse:64,en:"And when they had blindfolded him, they struck him on the face, and asked him, saying, Prophesy, who is it that smote thee?",pt:"e, vendando-lhe os olhos, perguntavam, dizendo: Profetiza, quem foi que te bateu?"},{verse:65,en:"And many other things blasphemously spake they against him.",pt:"E, blasfemando, diziam muitas outras coisas contra ele."},{verse:66,en:"And as soon as it was day, the elders of the people and the chief priests and the scribes came together, and led him into their council, saying,",pt:"Logo que amanheceu reuniu-se a assembl\xe9ia dos anci\xe3os do povo, tanto os principais sacerdotes como os escribas, e o conduziam ao sin\xe9drio deles, onde lhe disseram:"},{verse:67,en:"Art thou the Christ? tell us. And he said unto them, If I tell you, ye will not believe:",pt:"Se tu \xe9s o Cristo, dize-no-lo. Replicou-lhes ele: Se eu vo-lo disser, n\xe3o o crereis;"},{verse:68,en:"And if I also ask you, ye will not answer me, nor let me go.",pt:"e se eu vos interrogar, de modo algum me respondereis."},{verse:69,en:"Hereafter shall the Son of man sit on the right hand of the power of God.",pt:"Mas desde agora estar\xe1 assentado o Filho do homem \xe0 m\xe3o direita do poder de Deus."},{verse:70,en:"Then said they all, Art thou then the Son of God? And he said unto them, Ye say that I am.",pt:"Ao que perguntaram todos: Logo, tu \xe9s o Filho de Deus? Respondeu-lhes: V\xf3s dizeis que eu sou."},{verse:71,en:"And they said, What need we any further witness? for we ourselves have heard of his own mouth.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disseram: Por que ainda temos necessidade de testemunho? pois n\xf3s mesmos o ouvimos da sua pr\xf3pria boca."}]}}),803,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:23,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And the whole multitude of them arose, and led him unto Pilate.",pt:"E levantando-se toda a multid\xe3o deles, conduziram Jesus a Pilatos."},{verse:2,en:"And they began to accuse him, saying, We found this fellow perverting the nation, and forbidding to give tribute to Caesar, saying that he himself is Christ a King.",pt:"E come\xe7aram a acus\xe1-lo, dizendo: Achamos este homem pervertendo a nossa na\xe7\xe3o, proibindo dar o tributo a C\xe9sar, e dizendo ser ele mesmo Cristo, rei."},{verse:3,en:"And Pilate asked him, saying, Art thou the King of the Jews? And he answered him and said, Thou sayest it.",pt:"Pilatos, pois, perguntou-lhe: \xc9s tu o rei dos judeus? Respondeu-lhe Jesus: \xc9 como dizes."},{verse:4,en:"Then said Pilate to the chief priests and to the people, I find no fault in this man.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse Pilatos aos principais sacerdotes, e \xe0s multid\xf5es: N\xe3o acho culpa alguma neste homem."},{verse:5,en:"And they were the more fierce, saying, He stirreth up the people, teaching throughout all Jewry, beginning from Galilee to this place.",pt:"Eles, por\xe9m, insistiam ainda mais, dizendo: Alvoro\xe7a o povo ensinando por toda a Jud\xe9ia, come\xe7ando desde a Galil\xe9ia at\xe9 aqui."},{verse:6,en:"When Pilate heard of Galilee, he asked whether the man were a Galilaean.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pilatos, ouvindo isso, perguntou se o homem era galileu;"},{verse:7,en:"And as soon as he knew that he belonged unto Herod\u2019s jurisdiction, he sent him to Herod, who himself also was at Jerusalem at that time.",pt:"e, quando soube que era da jurisdi\xe7\xe3o de Herodes, remeteu-o a Herodes, que tamb\xe9m naqueles dias estava em Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:8,en:"And when Herod saw Jesus, he was exceeding glad: for he was desirous to see him of a long season, because he had heard many things of him; and he hoped to have seen some miracle done by him.",pt:"Ora, quando Herodes viu a Jesus, alegrou-se muito; pois de longo tempo desejava v\xea-lo, por ter ouvido falar a seu respeito; e esperava ver algum sinal feito por ele;"},{verse:9,en:"Then he questioned with him in many words; but he answered him nothing.",pt:"e fazia-lhe muitas perguntas; mas ele nada lhe respondeu."},{verse:10,en:"And the chief priests and scribes stood and vehemently accused him.",pt:"Estavam ali os principais sacerdotes, e os escribas, acusando-o com grande veem\xeancia."},{verse:11,en:"And Herod with his men of war set him at nought, and mocked him, and arrayed him in a gorgeous robe, and sent him again to Pilate.",pt:"Herodes, por\xe9m, com os seus soldados, desprezou-o e, escarnecendo dele, vestiu-o com uma roupa resplandecente e tornou a envi\xe1-lo a Pilatos."},{verse:12,en:"And the same day Pilate and Herod were made friends together: for before they were at enmity between themselves.",pt:"Nesse mesmo dia Pilatos e Herodes tornaram-se amigos; pois antes andavam em inimizade um com o outro."},{verse:13,en:"And Pilate, when he had called together the chief priests and the rulers and the people,",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pilatos convocou os principais sacerdotes, as autoridades e o povo,"},{verse:14,en:"Said unto them, Ye have brought this man unto me, as one that perverteth the people: and, behold, I, having examined him before you, have found no fault in this man touching those things whereof ye accuse him:",pt:"e disse-lhes: Apresentastes-me este homem como pervertedor do povo; e eis que, interrogando-o diante de v\xf3s, n\xe3o achei nele nenhuma culpa, das de que o acusais;"},{verse:15,en:"No, nor yet Herod: for I sent you to him; and, lo, nothing worthy of death is done unto him.",pt:"nem tampouco Herodes, pois no-lo tornou a enviar; e eis que n\xe3o tem feito ele coisa alguma digna de morte."},{verse:16,en:"I will therefore chastise him, and release him.",pt:"Castig\xe1-lo-ei, pois, e o soltarei."},{verse:17,en:"(For of necessity he must release one unto them at the feast.)",pt:"[E era-lhe necess\xe1rio soltar-lhes um pela festa.]"},{verse:18,en:"And they cried out all at once, saying, Away with this man, and release unto us Barabbas:",pt:"Mas todos clamaram \xe0 uma, dizendo: Fora com este, e solta-nos Barrab\xe1s!"},{verse:19,en:"(Who for a certain sedition made in the city, and for murder, was cast into prison.)",pt:"Ora, Barrab\xe1s fora lan\xe7ado na pris\xe3o por causa de uma sedi\xe7\xe3o feita na cidade, e de um homic\xeddio."},{verse:20,en:"Pilate therefore, willing to release Jesus, spake again to them.",pt:"Mais uma vez, pois, falou-lhes Pilatos, querendo soltar a Jesus."},{verse:21,en:"But they cried, saying, Crucify him, crucify him.",pt:"Eles, por\xe9m, brandavam, dizendo: Crucifica-o! crucifica-o!"},{verse:22,en:"And he said unto them the third time, Why, what evil hath he done? I have found no cause of death in him: I will therefore chastise him, and let him go.",pt:"Falou-lhes, ent\xe3o, pela terceira vez: Pois, que mal fez ele? N\xe3o achei nele nenhuma culpa digna de morte. Castig\xe1-lo-ei, pois, e o soltarei."},{verse:23,en:"And they were instant with loud voices, requiring that he might be crucified. And the voices of them and of the chief priests prevailed.",pt:"Mas eles instavam com grandes brados, pedindo que fosse crucificado. E prevaleceram os seus clamores."},{verse:24,en:"And Pilate gave sentence that it should be as they required.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pilatos resolveu atender-lhes o pedido;"},{verse:25,en:"And he released unto them him that for sedition and murder was cast into prison, whom they had desired; but he delivered Jesus to their will.",pt:"e soltou-lhes o que fora lan\xe7ado na pris\xe3o por causa de sedi\xe7\xe3o e de homic\xeddio, que era o que eles pediam; mas entregou Jesus \xe0 vontade deles."},{verse:26,en:"And as they led him away, they laid hold upon one Simon, a Cyrenian, coming out of the country, and on him they laid the cross, that he might bear it after Jesus.",pt:"Quando o levaram dali tomaram um certo Sim\xe3o, cireneu, que vinha do campo, e puseram-lhe a cruz \xe0s costas, para que a levasse ap\xf3s Jesus."},{verse:27,en:"And there followed him a great company of people, and of women, which also bewailed and lamented him.",pt:"Seguia-o grande multid\xe3o de povo e de mulheres, as quais o pranteavam e lamentavam."},{verse:28,en:"But Jesus turning unto them said, Daughters of Jerusalem, weep not for me, but weep for yourselves, and for your children.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, voltando-se para elas, disse: Filhas de Jerusal\xe9m, n\xe3o choreis por mim; chorai antes por v\xf3s mesmas, e por vossos filhos."},{verse:29,en:"For, behold, the days are coming, in the which they shall say, Blessed are the barren, and the wombs that never bare, and the paps which never gave suck.",pt:"Porque dias h\xe3o de vir em que se dir\xe1: Bem-aventuradas as est\xe9reis, e os ventres que n\xe3o geraram, e os peitos que n\xe3o amamentaram!"},{verse:30,en:"Then shall they begin to say to the mountains, Fall on us; and to the hills, Cover us.",pt:"Ent\xe3o come\xe7ar\xe3o a dizer aos montes: Ca\xed sobre n\xf3s; e aos outeiros: Cobri-nos."},{verse:31,en:"For if they do these things in a green tree, what shall be done in the dry?",pt:"Porque, se isto se faz no lenho verde, que se far\xe1 no seco?"},{verse:32,en:"And there were also two others, malefactors, led with him to be put to death.",pt:"E levavam tamb\xe9m com ele outros dois, que eram malfeitores, para serem mortos."},{verse:33,en:"And when they were come to the place, which is called Calvary, there they crucified him, and the malefactors, one on the right hand, and the other on the left.",pt:"Quando chegaram ao lugar chamado Caveira, ali o crucificaram, a ele e tamb\xe9m aos malfeitores, um \xe0 direita e outro \xe0 esquerda."},{verse:34,en:"Then said Jesus, Father, forgive them; for they know not what they do. And they parted his raiment, and cast lots.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, dizia: Pai, perdoa-lhes; porque n\xe3o sabem o que fazem. Ent\xe3o repartiram as vestes dele, deitando sortes sobre elas."},{verse:35,en:"And the people stood beholding. And the rulers also with them derided him, saying, He saved others; let him save himself, if he be Christ, the chosen of God.",pt:"E o povo estava ali a olhar. E as pr\xf3prias autoridades zombavam dele, dizendo: Aos outros salvou; salve-se a si mesmo, se \xe9 o Cristo, o escolhido de Deus."},{verse:36,en:"And the soldiers also mocked him, coming to him, and offering him vinegar,",pt:"Os soldados tamb\xe9m o escarneciam, chegando-se a ele, oferecendo-lhe vinagre,"},{verse:37,en:"And saying, If thou be the king of the Jews, save thyself.",pt:"e dizendo: Se tu \xe9s o rei dos judeus, salva-te a ti mesmo."},{verse:38,en:"And a superscription also was written over him in letters of Greek, and Latin, and Hebrew, THIS IS THE KING OF THE JEWS.",pt:"Por cima dele estava esta inscri\xe7\xe3o [em letras gregas, romanas e hebraicas:] ESTE \xc9 O REI DOS JUDEUS."},{verse:39,en:"And one of the malefactors which were hanged railed on him, saying, If thou be Christ, save thyself and us.",pt:"Ent\xe3o um dos malfeitores que estavam pendurados, blasfemava dele, dizendo: N\xe3o \xe9s tu o Cristo? salva-te a ti mesmo e a n\xf3s."},{verse:40,en:"But the other answering rebuked him, saying, Dost not thou fear God, seeing thou art in the same condemnation?",pt:"Respondendo, por\xe9m, o outro, repreendia-o, dizendo: Nem ao menos temes a Deus, estando na mesma condena\xe7\xe3o?"},{verse:41,en:"And we indeed justly; for we receive the due reward of our deeds: but this man hath done nothing amiss.",pt:"E n\xf3s, na verdade, com justi\xe7a; porque recebemos o que os nossos feitos merecem; mas este nenhum mal fez."},{verse:42,en:"And he said unto Jesus, Lord, remember me when thou comest into thy kingdom.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse: Jesus, lembra-te de mim, quando entrares no teu reino."},{verse:43,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Verily I say unto thee, To day shalt thou be with me in paradise.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Em verdade te digo que hoje estar\xe1s comigo no para\xedso."},{verse:44,en:"And it was about the sixth hour, and there was a darkness over all the earth until the ninth hour.",pt:"Era j\xe1 quase a hora sexta, e houve trevas em toda a terra at\xe9 a hora nona, pois o sol se escurecera;"},{verse:45,en:"And the sun was darkened, and the veil of the temple was rent in the midst.",pt:"e rasgou-se ao meio o v\xe9u do santu\xe1rio."},{verse:46,en:"And when Jesus had cried with a loud voice, he said, Father, into thy hands I commend my spirit: and having said thus, he gave up the ghost.",pt:"Jesus, clamando com grande voz, disse: Pai, nas tuas m\xe3os entrego o meu esp\xedrito. E, havendo dito isso, expirou."},{verse:47,en:"Now when the centurion saw what was done, he glorified God, saying, Certainly this was a righteous man.",pt:"Quando o centuri\xe3o viu o que acontecera, deu gl\xf3ria a Deus, dizendo: Na verdade, este homem era justo."},{verse:48,en:"And all the people that came together to that sight, beholding the things which were done, smote their breasts, and returned.",pt:"E todas as multid\xf5es que presenciaram este espet\xe1culo, vendo o que havia acontecido, voltaram batendo no peito."},{verse:49,en:"And all his acquaintance, and the women that followed him from Galilee, stood afar off, beholding these things.",pt:"Entretanto, todos os conhecidos de Jesus, e as mulheres que o haviam seguido desde a Galil\xe9ia, estavam de longe vendo estas coisas."},{verse:50,en:"And, behold, there was a man named Joseph, a counsellor; and he was a good man, and a just:",pt:"Ent\xe3o um homem chamado Jos\xe9, natural de Arimat\xe9ia, cidade dos judeus, membro do sin\xe9drio, homem bom e justo,"},{verse:51,en:"(The same had not consented to the counsel and deed of them;) he was of Arimathaea, a city of the Jews: who also himself waited for the kingdom of God.",pt:"o qual n\xe3o tinha consentido no conselho e nos atos dos outros, e que esperava o reino de Deus,"},{verse:52,en:"This man went unto Pilate, and begged the body of Jesus.",pt:"chegando a Pilatos, pediu-lhe o corpo de Jesus;"},{verse:53,en:"And he took it down, and wrapped it in linen, and laid it in a sepulchre that was hewn in stone, wherein never man before was laid.",pt:"e tirando-o da cruz, envolveu-o num pano de linho, e p\xf4-lo num sepulcro escavado em rocha, onde ningu\xe9m ainda havia sido posto."},{verse:54,en:"And that day was the preparation, and the sabbath drew on.",pt:"Era o dia da prepara\xe7\xe3o, e ia come\xe7ar o s\xe1bado."},{verse:55,en:"And the women also, which came with him from Galilee, followed after, and beheld the sepulchre, and how his body was laid.",pt:"E as mulheres que tinham vindo com ele da Galil\xe9ia, seguindo a Jos\xe9, viram o sepulcro, e como o corpo foi ali depositado."},{verse:56,en:"And they returned, and prepared spices and ointments; and rested the sabbath day according to the commandment.",pt:"Ent\xe3o voltaram e prepararam especiarias e unguentos. E no s\xe1bado repousaram, conforme o mandamento."}]}}),804,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Luke",bookPt:"Lucas",chapter:24,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now upon the first day of the week, very early in the morning, they came unto the sepulchre, bringing the spices which they had prepared, and certain others with them.",pt:"Mas j\xe1 no primeiro dia da semana, bem de madrugada, foram elas ao sepulcro, levando as especiarias que tinham preparado."},{verse:2,en:"And they found the stone rolled away from the sepulchre.",pt:"E acharam a pedra revolvida do sepulcro."},{verse:3,en:"And they entered in, and found not the body of the Lord Jesus.",pt:"Entrando, por\xe9m, n\xe3o acharam o corpo do Senhor Jesus."},{verse:4,en:"And it came to pass, as they were much perplexed thereabout, behold, two men stood by them in shining garments:",pt:"E, estando elas perplexas a esse respeito, eis que lhes apareceram dois var\xf5es em vestes resplandecentes;"},{verse:5,en:"And as they were afraid, and bowed down their faces to the earth, they said unto them, Why seek ye the living among the dead?",pt:"e ficando elas atemorizadas e abaixando o rosto para o ch\xe3o, eles lhes disseram: Por que buscais entre os mortos aquele que vive?"},{verse:6,en:"He is not here, but is risen: remember how he spake unto you when he was yet in Galilee,",pt:"Ele n\xe3o est\xe1 aqui, mas ressurgiu. Lembrai-vos de como vos falou, estando ainda na Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:7,en:"Saying, The Son of man must be delivered into the hands of sinful men, and be crucified, and the third day rise again.",pt:"dizendo: Importa que o Filho do homem seja entregue nas m\xe3os de homens pecadores, e seja crucificado, e ao terceiro dia ressurja."},{verse:8,en:"And they remembered his words,",pt:"Lembraram-se, ent\xe3o, das suas palavras;"},{verse:9,en:"And returned from the sepulchre, and told all these things unto the eleven, and to all the rest.",pt:"e, voltando do sepulcro, anunciaram todas estas coisas aos onze e a todos os demais."},{verse:10,en:"It was Mary Magdalene, and Joanna, and Mary the mother of James, and other women that were with them, which told these things unto the apostles.",pt:"E eram Maria Madalena, e Joana, e Maria, m\xe3e de Tiago; tamb\xe9m as outras que estavam com elas relataram estas coisas aos ap\xf3stolos."},{verse:11,en:"And their words seemed to them as idle tales, and they believed them not.",pt:"E pareceram-lhes como um del\xedrio as palavras das mulheres e n\xe3o lhes deram cr\xe9dito."},{verse:12,en:"Then arose Peter, and ran unto the sepulchre; and stooping down, he beheld the linen clothes laid by themselves, and departed, wondering in himself at that which was come to pass.",pt:"Mas Pedro, levantando-se, correu ao sepulcro; e, abaixando-se, viu somente os panos de linho; e retirou-se, admirando consigo o que havia acontecido."},{verse:13,en:"And, behold, two of them went that same day to a village called Emmaus, which was from Jerusalem about threescore furlongs.",pt:"Nesse mesmo dia, iam dois deles para uma aldeia chamada Ema\xfas, que distava de Jerusal\xe9m sessenta est\xe1dios;"},{verse:14,en:"And they talked together of all these things which had happened.",pt:"e iam comentando entre si tudo aquilo que havia sucedido."},{verse:15,en:"And it came to pass, that, while they communed together and reasoned, Jesus himself drew near, and went with them.",pt:"Enquanto assim comentavam e discutiam, o pr\xf3prio Jesus se aproximou, e ia com eles;"},{verse:16,en:"But their eyes were holden that they should not know him.",pt:"mas os olhos deles estavam como que fechados, de sorte que n\xe3o o reconheceram."},{verse:17,en:"And he said unto them, What manner of communications are these that ye have one to another, as ye walk, and are sad?",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele lhes perguntou: Que palavras s\xe3o essas que, caminhando, trocais entre v\xf3s? Eles ent\xe3o pararam tristes."},{verse:18,en:"And the one of them, whose name was Cleopas, answering said unto him, Art thou only a stranger in Jerusalem, and hast not known the things which are come to pass there in these days?",pt:"E um deles, chamado Cleopas, respondeu-lhe: \xc9s tu o \xfanico peregrino em Jerusal\xe9m que n\xe3o soube das coisas que nela t\xeam sucedido nestes dias?"},{verse:19,en:"And he said unto them, What things? And they said unto him, Concerning Jesus of Nazareth, which was a prophet mighty in deed and word before God and all the people:",pt:"Ao que ele lhes perguntou: Quais? Disseram-lhe: As que dizem respeito a Jesus, o nazareno, que foi profeta, poderoso em obras e palavras diante de Deus e de todo o povo."},{verse:20,en:"And how the chief priests and our rulers delivered him to be condemned to death, and have crucified him.",pt:"e como os principais sacerdotes e as nossas autoridades e entregaram para ser condenado \xe0 morte, e o crucificaram."},{verse:21,en:"But we trusted that it had been he which should have redeemed Israel: and beside all this, to day is the third day since these things were done.",pt:"Ora, n\xf3s esper\xe1vamos que fosse ele quem havia de remir Israel; e, al\xe9m de tudo isso, \xe9 j\xe1 hoje o terceiro dia desde que essas coisas aconteceram."},{verse:22,en:"Yea, and certain women also of our company made us astonished, which were early at the sepulchre;",pt:"Verdade \xe9, tamb\xe9m, que algumas mulheres do nosso meio nos encheram de espanto; pois foram de madrugada ao sepulcro"},{verse:23,en:"And when they found not his body, they came, saying, that they had also seen a vision of angels, which said that he was alive.",pt:"e, n\xe3o achando o corpo dele voltaram, declarando que tinham tido uma vis\xe3o de anjos que diziam estar ele vivo."},{verse:24,en:"And certain of them which were with us went to the sepulchre, and found it even so as the women had said: but him they saw not.",pt:"Al\xe9m disso, alguns dos que estavam conosco foram ao sepulcro, e acharam ser assim como as mulheres haviam dito; a ele, por\xe9m, n\xe3o o viram."},{verse:25,en:"Then he said unto them, O fools, and slow of heart to believe all that the prophets have spoken:",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele lhes disse: \xd3 n\xe9scios, e tardos de cora\xe7\xe3o para crerdes tudo o que os profetas disseram!"},{verse:26,en:"Ought not Christ to have suffered these things, and to enter into his glory?",pt:"Porventura n\xe3o importa que o Cristo padecesse essas coisas e entrasse na sua gl\xf3ria?"},{verse:27,en:"And beginning at Moses and all the prophets, he expounded unto them in all the scriptures the things concerning himself.",pt:"E, come\xe7ando por Mois\xe9s, e por todos os profetas, explicou-lhes o que dele se achava em todas as Escrituras."},{verse:28,en:"And they drew nigh unto the village, whither they went: and he made as though he would have gone further.",pt:"Quando se aproximaram da aldeia para onde iam, ele fez como quem ia para mais longe."},{verse:29,en:"But they constrained him, saying, Abide with us: for it is toward evening, and the day is far spent. And he went in to tarry with them.",pt:"Eles, por\xe9m, o constrangeram, dizendo: Fica conosco; porque \xe9 tarde, e j\xe1 declinou o dia. E entrou para ficar com eles."},{verse:30,en:"And it came to pass, as he sat at meat with them, he took bread, and blessed it, and brake, and gave to them.",pt:"Estando com eles \xe0 mesa, tomou o p\xe3o e o aben\xe7oou; e, partindo-o, lho dava."},{verse:31,en:"And their eyes were opened, and they knew him; and he vanished out of their sight.",pt:"Abriram-se-lhes ent\xe3o os olhos, e o reconheceram; nisto ele desapareceu de diante deles."},{verse:32,en:"And they said one to another, Did not our heart burn within us, while he talked with us by the way, and while he opened to us the scriptures?",pt:"E disseram um para o outro: Porventura n\xe3o se nos abrasava o cora\xe7\xe3o, quando pelo caminho nos falava, e quando nos abria as Escrituras?"},{verse:33,en:"And they rose up the same hour, and returned to Jerusalem, and found the eleven gathered together, and them that were with them,",pt:"E na mesma hora levantaram-se e voltaram para Jerusal\xe9m, e encontraram reunidos os onze e os que estavam com eles,"},{verse:34,en:"Saying, The Lord is risen indeed, and hath appeared to Simon.",pt:"os quais diziam: Realmente o Senhor ressurgiu, e apareceu a Sim\xe3o."},{verse:35,en:"And they told what things were done in the way, and how he was known of them in breaking of bread.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os dois contaram o que acontecera no caminho, e como se lhes fizera conhecer no partir do p\xe3o."},{verse:36,en:"And as they thus spake, Jesus himself stood in the midst of them, and saith unto them, Peace be unto you.",pt:"Enquanto ainda falavam nisso, o pr\xf3prio Jesus se apresentou no meio deles, e disse-lhes: Paz seja convosco."},{verse:37,en:"But they were terrified and affrighted, and supposed that they had seen a spirit.",pt:"Mas eles, espantados e atemorizados, pensavam que viam algum esp\xedrito."},{verse:38,en:"And he said unto them, Why are ye troubled? and why do thoughts arise in your hearts?",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhes disse: Por que estais perturbados? e por que surgem d\xfavidas em vossos cora\xe7\xf5es?"},{verse:39,en:"Behold my hands and my feet, that it is I myself: handle me, and see; for a spirit hath not flesh and bones, as ye see me have.",pt:"Olhai as minhas m\xe3os e os meus p\xe9s, que sou eu mesmo; apalpai-me e vede; porque um esp\xedrito n\xe3o tem carne nem ossos, como percebeis que eu tenho."},{verse:40,en:"And when he had thus spoken, he shewed them his hands and his feet.",pt:"E, dizendo isso, mostrou-lhes as m\xe3os e os p\xe9s."},{verse:41,en:"And while they yet believed not for joy, and wondered, he said unto them, Have ye here any meat?",pt:"N\xe3o acreditando eles ainda por causa da alegria, e estando admirados, perguntou-lhes Jesus: Tendes aqui alguma coisa que comer?"},{verse:42,en:"And they gave him a piece of a broiled fish, and of an honeycomb.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhe deram um peda\xe7o de peixe assado,"},{verse:43,en:"And he took it, and did eat before them.",pt:"o qual ele tomou e comeu diante deles."},{verse:44,en:"And he said unto them, These are the words which I spake unto you, while I was yet with you, that all things must be fulfilled, which were written in the law of Moses, and in the prophets, and in the psalms, concerning me.",pt:"Depois lhe disse: S\xe3o estas as palavras que vos falei, estando ainda convosco, que importava que se cumprisse tudo o que de mim estava escrito na Lei de Mois\xe9s, nos Profetas e nos Salmos."},{verse:45,en:"Then opened he their understanding, that they might understand the scriptures,",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes abriu o entendimento para compreenderem as Escrituras;"},{verse:46,en:"And said unto them, Thus it is written, and thus it behoved Christ to suffer, and to rise from the dead the third day:",pt:"e disse-lhes: Assim est\xe1 escrito que o Cristo padecesse, e ao terceiro dia ressurgisse dentre os mortos;"},{verse:47,en:"And that repentance and remission of sins should be preached in his name among all nations, beginning at Jerusalem.",pt:"e que em seu nome se pregasse o arrependimento para remiss\xe3o dos pecados, a todas as na\xe7\xf5es, come\xe7ando por Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:48,en:"And ye are witnesses of these things.",pt:"V\xf3s sois testemunhas destas coisas."},{verse:49,en:"And, behold, I send the promise of my Father upon you: but tarry ye in the city of Jerusalem, until ye be endued with power from on high.",pt:"E eis que sobre v\xf3s envio a promessa de meu Pai; ficai por\xe9m, na cidade, at\xe9 que do alto sejais revestidos de poder."},{verse:50,en:"And he led them out as far as to Bethany, and he lifted up his hands, and blessed them.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os levou fora, at\xe9 Bet\xe2nia; e levantando as m\xe3os, os aben\xe7oou."},{verse:51,en:"And it came to pass, while he blessed them, he was parted from them, and carried up into heaven.",pt:"E aconteceu que, enquanto os aben\xe7oava, apartou-se deles; e foi elevado ao c\xe9u."},{verse:52,en:"And they worshipped him, and returned to Jerusalem with great joy:",pt:"E, depois de o adorarem, voltaram com grande j\xfabilo para Jerusal\xe9m;"},{verse:53,en:"And were continually in the temple, praising and blessing God. Amen.",pt:"e estavam continuamente no templo, bendizendo a Deus."}]}}),805,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The former treatise have I made, O Theophilus, of all that Jesus began both to do and teach,",pt:"Fiz o primeiro tratado, \xf3 Te\xf3filo, acerca de tudo quanto Jesus come\xe7ou a fazer e ensinar,"},{verse:2,en:"Until the day in which he was taken up, after that he through the Holy Ghost had given commandments unto the apostles whom he had chosen:",pt:"at\xe9 o dia em que foi levado para cima, depois de haver dado mandamento, pelo Esp\xedrito Santo, aos ap\xf3stolos que escolhera;"},{verse:3,en:"To whom also he shewed himself alive after his passion by many infallible proofs, being seen of them forty days, and speaking of the things pertaining to the kingdom of God:",pt:"aos quais tamb\xe9m, depois de haver padecido, se apresentou vivo, com muitas provas infal\xedveis, aparecendo-lhes por espa\xe7o de quarenta dias, e lhes falando das coisas concernentes ao reino de Deus."},{verse:4,en:"And, being assembled together with them, commanded them that they should not depart from Jerusalem, but wait for the promise of the Father, which, saith he, ye have heard of me.",pt:"Estando com eles, ordenou-lhes que n\xe3o se ausentassem de Jerusal\xe9m, mas que esperassem a promessa do Pai, a qual (disse ele) de mim ouvistes."},{verse:5,en:"For John truly baptized with water; but ye shall be baptized with the Holy Ghost not many days hence.",pt:"Porque, na verdade, Jo\xe3o batizou em \xe1gua, mas v\xf3s sereis batizados no Esp\xedrito Santo, dentro de poucos dias."},{verse:6,en:"When they therefore were come together, they asked of him, saying, Lord, wilt thou at this time restore again the kingdom to Israel?",pt:"Aqueles, pois, que se haviam reunido perguntavam-lhe, dizendo: Senhor, \xe9 nesse tempo que restauras o reino a Israel?"},{verse:7,en:"And he said unto them, It is not for you to know the times or the seasons, which the Father hath put in his own power.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: A v\xf3s n\xe3o vos compete saber os tempos ou as \xe9pocas, que o Pai reservou \xe0 sua pr\xf3pria autoridade."},{verse:8,en:"But ye shall receive power, after that the Holy Ghost is come upon you: and ye shall be witnesses unto me both in Jerusalem, and in all Judaea, and in Samaria, and unto the uttermost part of the earth.",pt:"Mas recebereis poder, ao descer sobre v\xf3s o Esp\xedrito Santo, e ser-me-eis testemunhas, tanto em Jerusal\xe9m, como em toda a Jud\xe9ia e Sam\xe1ria, e at\xe9 os confins da terra."},{verse:9,en:"And when he had spoken these things, while they beheld, he was taken up; and a cloud received him out of their sight.",pt:"Tendo ele dito estas coisas, foi levado para cima, enquanto eles olhavam, e uma nuvem o recebeu, ocultando-o a seus olhos."},{verse:10,en:"And while they looked stedfastly toward heaven as he went up, behold, two men stood by them in white apparel;",pt:"Estando eles com os olhos fitos no c\xe9u, enquanto ele subia, eis que junto deles apareceram dois var\xf5es vestidos de branco,"},{verse:11,en:"Which also said, Ye men of Galilee, why stand ye gazing up into heaven? this same Jesus, which is taken up from you into heaven, shall so come in like manner as ye have seen him go into heaven.",pt:"os quais lhes disseram: Var\xf5es galileus, por que ficais a\xed olhando para o c\xe9u? Esse Jesus, que dentre v\xf3s foi elevado para o c\xe9u, h\xe1 de vir assim como para o c\xe9u o vistes ir."},{verse:12,en:"Then returned they unto Jerusalem from the mount called Olivet, which is from Jerusalem a sabbath day\u2019s journey.",pt:"Ent\xe3o voltaram para Jerusal\xe9m, do monte chamado das Oliveiras, que est\xe1 perto de Jerusal\xe9m, \xe0 dist\xe2ncia da jornada de um s\xe1bado."},{verse:13,en:"And when they were come in, they went up into an upper room, where abode both Peter, and James, and John, and Andrew, Philip, and Thomas, Bartholomew, and Matthew, James the son of Alphaeus, and Simon Zelotes, and Judas the brother of James.",pt:"E, entrando, subiram ao cen\xe1culo, onde permaneciam Pedro e Jo\xe3o, Tiago e Andr\xe9, Felipe e Tom\xe9, Bartolomeu e Mateus; Tiago, filho de Alfeu, Sim\xe3o o Zelote, e Judas, filho de Tiago."},{verse:14,en:"These all continued with one accord in prayer and supplication, with the women, and Mary the mother of Jesus, and with his brethren.",pt:"Todos estes perseveravam unanimemente em ora\xe7\xe3o, com as mulheres, e Maria, m\xe3e de Jesus, e com os irm\xe3os dele."},{verse:15,en:"And in those days Peter stood up in the midst of the disciples, and said, (the number of names together were about an hundred and twenty,)",pt:"Naqueles dias levantou-se Pedro no meio dos irm\xe3os, sendo o n\xfamero de pessoas ali reunidas cerca de cento e vinte, e disse:"},{verse:16,en:"Men and brethren, this scripture must needs have been fulfilled, which the Holy Ghost by the mouth of David spake before concerning Judas, which was guide to them that took Jesus.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, convinha que se cumprisse a escritura que o Esp\xedrito Santo predisse pela boca de Davi, acerca de Judas, que foi o guia daqueles que prenderam a Jesus;"},{verse:17,en:"For he was numbered with us, and had obtained part of this ministry.",pt:"pois ele era contado entre n\xf3s e teve parte neste minist\xe9rio."},{verse:18,en:"Now this man purchased a field with the reward of iniquity; and falling headlong, he burst asunder in the midst, and all his bowels gushed out.",pt:"(Ora, ele adquiriu um campo com o sal\xe1rio da sua iniquidade; e precipitando-se, caiu prostrado e arrebentou pelo meio, e todas as suas entranhas se derramaram."},{verse:19,en:"And it was known unto all the dwellers at Jerusalem; insomuch as that field is called in their proper tongue, Aceldama, that is to say, The field of blood.",pt:"E tornou-se isto conhecido de todos os habitantes de Jerusal\xe9m; de maneira que na pr\xf3pria l\xedngua deles esse campo se chama Ac\xe9ldama, isto \xe9, Campo de Sangue.)"},{verse:20,en:"For it is written in the book of Psalms, Let his habitation be desolate, and let no man dwell therein: and his bishoprick let another take.",pt:"Porquanto no livro dos Salmos est\xe1 escrito: Fique deserta a sua habita\xe7\xe3o, e n\xe3o haja quem nela habite; e: Tome outro o seu minist\xe9rio."},{verse:21,en:"Wherefore of these men which have companied with us all the time that the Lord Jesus went in and out among us,",pt:"\xc9 necess\xe1rio, pois, que dos var\xf5es que conviveram conosco todo o tempo em que o Senhor Jesus andou entre n\xf3s,"},{verse:22,en:"Beginning from the baptism of John, unto that same day that he was taken up from us, must one be ordained to be a witness with us of his resurrection.",pt:"come\xe7ando desde o batismo de Jo\xe3o at\xe9 o dia em que dentre n\xf3s foi levado para cima, um deles se torne testemunha conosco da sua ressurrei\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:23,en:"And they appointed two, Joseph called Barsabas, who was surnamed Justus, and Matthias.",pt:"E apresentaram dois: Jos\xe9, chamado Barsab\xe1s, que tinha por sobrenome o Justo, e Matias."},{verse:24,en:"And they prayed, and said, Thou, Lord, which knowest the hearts of all men, shew whether of these two thou hast chosen,",pt:"E orando, disseram: Tu, Senhor, que conheces os cora\xe7\xf5es de todos, mostra qual destes dois tens escolhido"},{verse:25,en:"That he may take part of this ministry and apostleship, from which Judas by transgression fell, that he might go to his own place.",pt:"para tomar o lugar neste minist\xe9rio e apostolado, do qual Judas se desviou para ir ao seu pr\xf3prio lugar."},{verse:26,en:"And they gave forth their lots; and the lot fell upon Matthias; and he was numbered with the eleven apostles.",pt:"Ent\xe3o deitaram sortes a respeito deles e caiu a sorte sobre Matias, e por voto comum foi ele contado com os onze ap\xf3stolos."}]}}),806,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And when the day of Pentecost was fully come, they were all with one accord in one place.",pt:"Ao cumprir-se o dia de Pentecostes, estavam todos reunidos no mesmo lugar."},{verse:2,en:"And suddenly there came a sound from heaven as of a rushing mighty wind, and it filled all the house where they were sitting.",pt:"De repente veio do c\xe9u um ru\xeddo, como que de um vento impetuoso, e encheu toda a casa onde estavam sentados."},{verse:3,en:"And there appeared unto them cloven tongues like as of fire, and it sat upon each of them.",pt:"E lhes apareceram umas l\xednguas como que de fogo, que se distribu\xedam, e sobre cada um deles pousou uma."},{verse:4,en:"And they were all filled with the Holy Ghost, and began to speak with other tongues, as the Spirit gave them utterance.",pt:"E todos ficaram cheios do Esp\xedrito Santo, e come\xe7aram a falar noutras l\xednguas, conforme o Esp\xedrito lhes concedia que falassem."},{verse:5,en:"And there were dwelling at Jerusalem Jews, devout men, out of every nation under heaven.",pt:"Habitavam ent\xe3o em Jerusal\xe9m judeus, homens piedosos, de todas as na\xe7\xf5es que h\xe1 debaixo do c\xe9u."},{verse:6,en:"Now when this was noised abroad, the multitude came together, and were confounded, because that every man heard them speak in his own language.",pt:"Ouvindo-se, pois, aquele ru\xeddo, ajuntou-se a multid\xe3o; e estava confusa, porque cada um os ouvia falar na sua pr\xf3pria l\xedngua."},{verse:7,en:"And they were all amazed and marvelled, saying one to another, Behold, are not all these which speak Galilaeans?",pt:"E todos pasmavam e se admiravam, dizendo uns aos outros: Pois qu\xea! n\xe3o s\xe3o galileus todos esses que est\xe3o falando?"},{verse:8,en:"And how hear we every man in our own tongue, wherein we were born?",pt:"Como \xe9, pois, que os ouvimos falar cada um na pr\xf3pria l\xedngua em que nascemos?"},{verse:9,en:"Parthians, and Medes, and Elamites, and the dwellers in Mesopotamia, and in Judaea, and Cappadocia, in Pontus, and Asia,",pt:"N\xf3s, partos, medos, e elamitas; e os que habitamos a Mesopot\xe2mia, a Jud\xe9ia e a Capad\xf3cia, o Ponto e a \xc1sia,"},{verse:10,en:"Phrygia, and Pamphylia, in Egypt, and in the parts of Libya about Cyrene, and strangers of Rome, Jews and proselytes,",pt:"a Fr\xedgia e a Panf\xedlia, o Egito e as partes da L\xedbia pr\xf3ximas a Cirene, e forasteiros romanos, tanto judeus como pros\xe9litos,"},{verse:11,en:"Cretes and Arabians, we do hear them speak in our tongues the wonderful works of God.",pt:"cretenses e \xe1rabes - ouv\xedmo-los em nossas l\xednguas, falar das grandezas de Deus."},{verse:12,en:"And they were all amazed, and were in doubt, saying one to another, What meaneth this?",pt:"E todos pasmavam e estavam perplexos, dizendo uns aos outros: Que quer dizer isto?"},{verse:13,en:"Others mocking said, These men are full of new wine.",pt:"E outros, zombando, diziam: Est\xe3o cheios de mosto."},{verse:14,en:"But Peter, standing up with the eleven, lifted up his voice, and said unto them, Ye men of Judaea, and all ye that dwell at Jerusalem, be this known unto you, and hearken to my words:",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pedro, pondo-se em p\xe9 com os onze, levantou a voz e disse-lhes: Var\xf5es judeus e todos os que habitais em Jerusal\xe9m, seja- vos isto not\xf3rio, e escutai as minhas palavras."},{verse:15,en:"For these are not drunken, as ye suppose, seeing it is but the third hour of the day.",pt:"Pois estes homens n\xe3o est\xe3o embriagados, como v\xf3s pensais, visto que \xe9 apenas a terceira hora do dia."},{verse:16,en:"But this is that which was spoken by the prophet Joel;",pt:"Mas isto \xe9 o que foi dito pelo profeta Joel:"},{verse:17,en:"And it shall come to pass in the last days, saith God, I will pour out of my Spirit upon all flesh: and your sons and your daughters shall prophesy, and your young men shall see visions, and your old men shall dream dreams:",pt:"E acontecer\xe1 nos \xfaltimos dias, diz o Senhor, que derramarei do meu Esp\xedrito sobre toda a carne; e os vossos filhos e as vossas filhas profetizar\xe3o, os vossos mancebos ter\xe3o vis\xf5es, os vossos anci\xe3os ter\xe3o sonhos;"},{verse:18,en:"And on my servants and on my handmaidens I will pour out in those days of my Spirit; and they shall prophesy:",pt:"e sobre os meus servos e sobre as minhas servas derramarei do meu Esp\xedrito naqueles dias, e eles profetizar\xe3o."},{verse:19,en:"And I will shew wonders in heaven above, and signs in the earth beneath; blood, and fire, and vapour of smoke:",pt:"E mostrarei prod\xedgios em cima no c\xe9u; e sinais embaixo na terra, sangue, fogo e vapor de fuma\xe7a."},{verse:20,en:"The sun shall be turned into darkness, and the moon into blood, before that great and notable day of the Lord come:",pt:"O sol se converter\xe1 em trevas, e a lua em sangue, antes que venha o grande e glorioso dia do Senhor."},{verse:21,en:"And it shall come to pass, that whosoever shall call on the name of the Lord shall be saved.",pt:"e acontecer\xe1 que todo aquele que invocar o nome do Senhor ser\xe1 salvo."},{verse:22,en:"Ye men of Israel, hear these words; Jesus of Nazareth, a man approved of God among you by miracles and wonders and signs, which God did by him in the midst of you, as ye yourselves also know:",pt:"Var\xf5es israelitas, escutai estas palavras: A Jesus, o nazareno, var\xe3o aprovado por Deus entre v\xf3s com milagres, prod\xedgios e sinais, que Deus por ele fez no meio de v\xf3s, como v\xf3s mesmos bem sabeis;"},{verse:23,en:"Him, being delivered by the determinate counsel and foreknowledge of God, ye have taken, and by wicked hands have crucified and slain:",pt:"a este, que foi entregue pelo determinado conselho e presci\xeancia de Deus, v\xf3s matastes, crucificando-o pelas m\xe3os de in\xedquos;"},{verse:24,en:"Whom God hath raised up, having loosed the pains of death: because it was not possible that he should be holden of it.",pt:"ao qual Deus ressuscitou, rompendo os grilh\xf5es da morte, pois n\xe3o era poss\xedvel que fosse retido por ela."},{verse:25,en:"For David speaketh concerning him, I foresaw the Lord always before my face, for he is on my right hand, that I should not be moved:",pt:"Porque dele fala Davi: Sempre via diante de mim o Senhor, porque est\xe1 \xe0 minha direita, para que eu n\xe3o seja abalado;"},{verse:26,en:"Therefore did my heart rejoice, and my tongue was glad; moreover also my flesh shall rest in hope:",pt:"por isso se alegrou o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, e a minha l\xedngua exultou; e al\xe9m disso a minha carne h\xe1 de repousar em esperan\xe7a;"},{verse:27,en:"Because thou wilt not leave my soul in hell, neither wilt thou suffer thine Holy One to see corruption.",pt:"pois n\xe3o deixar\xe1s a minha alma no hades, nem permitir\xe1s que o teu Santo veja a corrup\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:28,en:"Thou hast made known to me the ways of life; thou shalt make me full of joy with thy countenance.",pt:"fizeste-me conhecer os caminhos da vida; encher-me-\xe1s de alegria na tua presen\xe7a."},{verse:29,en:"Men and brethren, let me freely speak unto you of the patriarch David, that he is both dead and buried, and his sepulchre is with us unto this day.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, seja-me permitido dizer-vos livremente acerca do patriarca Davi, que ele morreu e foi sepultado, e entre n\xf3s est\xe1 at\xe9 hoje a sua sepultura."},{verse:30,en:"Therefore being a prophet, and knowing that God had sworn with an oath to him, that of the fruit of his loins, according to the flesh, he would raise up Christ to sit on his throne;",pt:"Sendo, pois, ele profeta, e sabendo que Deus lhe havia prometido com juramento que faria sentar sobre o seu trono um dos seus descendentes -"},{verse:31,en:"He seeing this before spake of the resurrection of Christ, that his soul was not left in hell, neither his flesh did see corruption.",pt:"prevendo isto, Davi falou da ressurrei\xe7\xe3o de Cristo, que a sua alma n\xe3o foi deixada no hades, nem a sua carne viu a corrup\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:32,en:"This Jesus hath God raised up, whereof we all are witnesses.",pt:"Ora, a este Jesus, Deus ressuscitou, do que todos n\xf3s somos testemunhas."},{verse:33,en:"Therefore being by the right hand of God exalted, and having received of the Father the promise of the Holy Ghost, he hath shed forth this, which ye now see and hear.",pt:"De sorte que, exaltado pela dextra de Deus, e tendo recebido do Pai a promessa do Esp\xedrito Santo, derramou isto que v\xf3s agora vedes e ouvis."},{verse:34,en:"For David is not ascended into the heavens: but he saith himself, The LORD said unto my Lord, Sit thou on my right hand,",pt:"Porque Davi n\xe3o subiu aos c\xe9us, mas ele pr\xf3prio declara: Disse o Senhor ao meu Senhor: Assenta-te \xe0 minha direita,"},{verse:35,en:"Until I make thy foes thy footstool.",pt:"at\xe9 que eu ponha os teus inimigos por escabelo de teus p\xe9s."},{verse:36,en:"Therefore let all the house of Israel know assuredly, that God hath made that same Jesus, whom ye have crucified, both Lord and Christ.",pt:"Saiba pois com certeza toda a casa de Israel que a esse mesmo Jesus, a quem v\xf3s crucificastes, Deus o fez Senhor e Cristo."},{verse:37,en:"Now when they heard this, they were pricked in their heart, and said unto Peter and to the rest of the apostles, Men and brethren, what shall we do?",pt:"E, ouvindo eles isto, compungiram-se em seu cora\xe7\xe3o, e perguntaram a Pedro e aos demais ap\xf3stolos: Que faremos, irm\xe3os?"},{verse:38,en:"Then Peter said unto them, Repent, and be baptized every one of you in the name of Jesus Christ for the remission of sins, and ye shall receive the gift of the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Pedro ent\xe3o lhes respondeu: Arrependei-vos, e cada um de v\xf3s seja batizado em nome de Jesus Cristo, para remiss\xe3o de vossos pecados; e recebereis o dom do Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:39,en:"For the promise is unto you, and to your children, and to all that are afar off, even as many as the Lord our God shall call.",pt:"Porque a promessa vos pertence a v\xf3s, a vossos filhos, e a todos os que est\xe3o longe: a quantos o Senhor nosso Deus chamar."},{verse:40,en:"And with many other words did he testify and exhort, saying, Save yourselves from this untoward generation.",pt:"E com muitas outras palavras dava testemunho, e os exortava, dizendo: salvai-vos desta gera\xe7\xe3o perversa."},{verse:41,en:"Then they that gladly received his word were baptized: and the same day there were added unto them about three thousand souls.",pt:"De sorte que foram batizados os que receberam a sua palavra; e naquele dia agregaram-se quase tr\xeas mil almas;"},{verse:42,en:"And they continued stedfastly in the apostles\u2019 doctrine and fellowship, and in breaking of bread, and in prayers.",pt:"e perseveravam na doutrina dos ap\xf3stolos e na comunh\xe3o, no partir do p\xe3o e nas ora\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:43,en:"And fear came upon every soul: and many wonders and signs were done by the apostles.",pt:"Em cada alma havia temor, e muitos prod\xedgios e sinais eram feitos pelos ap\xf3stolos."},{verse:44,en:"And all that believed were together, and had all things common;",pt:"Todos os que criam estavam unidos e tinham tudo em comum."},{verse:45,en:"And sold their possessions and goods, and parted them to all men, as every man had need.",pt:"E vendiam suas propriedades e bens e os repartiam por todos, segundo a necessidade de cada um."},{verse:46,en:"And they, continuing daily with one accord in the temple, and breaking bread from house to house, did eat their meat with gladness and singleness of heart,",pt:"E, perseverando un\xe2nimes todos os dias no templo, e partindo o p\xe3o em casa, comiam com alegria e singeleza de cora\xe7\xe3o,"},{verse:47,en:"Praising God, and having favour with all the people. And the Lord added to the church daily such as should be saved.",pt:"louvando a Deus, e caindo na gra\xe7a de todo o povo. E cada dia acrescentava-lhes o Senhor os que iam sendo salvos."}]}}),807,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now Peter and John went up together into the temple at the hour of prayer, being the ninth hour.",pt:"Pedro e Jo\xe3o subiam ao templo \xe0 hora da ora\xe7\xe3o, a nona."},{verse:2,en:"And a certain man lame from his mother\u2019s womb was carried, whom they laid daily at the gate of the temple which is called Beautiful, to ask alms of them that entered into the temple;",pt:"E, era carregado um homem, coxo de nascen\xe7a, o qual todos os dias punham \xe0 porta do templo, chamada Formosa, para pedir esmolas aos que entravam."},{verse:3,en:"Who seeing Peter and John about to go into the temple asked an alms.",pt:"Ora, vendo ele a Pedro e Jo\xe3o, que iam entrando no templo, pediu que lhe dessem uma esmola."},{verse:4,en:"And Peter, fastening his eyes upon him with John, said, Look on us.",pt:"E Pedro, com Jo\xe3o, fitando os olhos nele, disse: Olha para n\xf3s."},{verse:5,en:"And he gave heed unto them, expecting to receive something of them.",pt:"E ele os olhava atentamente, esperando receber deles alguma coisa."},{verse:6,en:"Then Peter said, Silver and gold have I none; but such as I have give I thee: In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth rise up and walk.",pt:"Disse-lhe Pedro: N\xe3o tenho prata nem ouro; mas o que tenho, isso te dou; em nome de Jesus Cristo, o nazareno, anda."},{verse:7,en:"And he took him by the right hand, and lifted him up: and immediately his feet and ankle bones received strength.",pt:"Nisso, tomando-o pela m\xe3o direita, o levantou; imediatamente os seus p\xe9s e artelhos se firmaram"},{verse:8,en:"And he leaping up stood, and walked, and entered with them into the temple, walking, and leaping, and praising God.",pt:"e, dando ele um salto, p\xf4s-se em p\xe9. Come\xe7ou a andar e entrou com eles no templo, andando, saltando e louvando a Deus."},{verse:9,en:"And all the people saw him walking and praising God:",pt:"Todo o povo, ao v\xea-lo andar e louvar a Deus,"},{verse:10,en:"And they knew that it was he which sat for alms at the Beautiful gate of the temple: and they were filled with wonder and amazement at that which had happened unto him.",pt:"reconhecia-o como o mesmo que estivera sentado a pedir esmola \xe0 Porta Formosa do templo; e todos ficaram cheios de pasmo e assombro, pelo que lhe acontecera."},{verse:11,en:"And as the lame man which was healed held Peter and John, all the people ran together unto them in the porch that is called Solomon\u2019s, greatly wondering.",pt:"Apegando-se o homem a Pedro e Jo\xe3o, todo o povo correu at\xf4nito para junto deles, ao p\xf3rtico chamado de Salom\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"And when Peter saw it, he answered unto the people, Ye men of Israel, why marvel ye at this? or why look ye so earnestly on us, as though by our own power or holiness we had made this man to walk?",pt:"Pedro, vendo isto, disse ao povo: Var\xf5es israelitas, por que vos admirais deste homem? Ou, por que fitais os olhos em n\xf3s, como se por nosso pr\xf3prio poder ou piedade o tiv\xe9ssemos feito andar?"},{verse:13,en:"The God of Abraham, and of Isaac, and of Jacob, the God of our fathers, hath glorified his Son Jesus; whom ye delivered up, and denied him in the presence of Pilate, when he was determined to let him go.",pt:"O Deus de Abra\xe3o, de Isaque e de Jac\xf3, o Deus de nossos pais, glorificou a seu Servo Jesus, a quem v\xf3s entregastes e perante a face de Pilatos negastes, quando este havia resolvido solt\xe1-lo."},{verse:14,en:"But ye denied the Holy One and the Just, and desired a murderer to be granted unto you;",pt:"Mas v\xf3s negastes o Santo e Justo, e pedistes que se vos desse um homicida;"},{verse:15,en:"And killed the Prince of life, whom God hath raised from the dead; whereof we are witnesses.",pt:"e matastes o Autor da vida, a quem Deus ressuscitou dentre os mortos, do que n\xf3s somos testemunhas."},{verse:16,en:"And his name through faith in his name hath made this man strong, whom ye see and know: yea, the faith which is by him hath given him this perfect soundness in the presence of you all.",pt:"E pela f\xe9 em seu nome fez o seu nome fortalecer a este homem que vedes e conheceis; sim, a f\xe9, que vem por ele, deu a este, na presen\xe7a de todos v\xf3s, esta perfeita sa\xfade."},{verse:17,en:"And now, brethren, I wot that through ignorance ye did it, as did also your rulers.",pt:"Agora, irm\xe3os, eu sei que o fizestes por ignor\xe2ncia, como tamb\xe9m as vossas autoridades."},{verse:18,en:"But those things, which God before had shewed by the mouth of all his prophets, that Christ should suffer, he hath so fulfilled.",pt:"Mas Deus assim cumpriu o que j\xe1 dantes pela boca de todos os seus profetas havia anunciado que o seu Cristo havia de padecer."},{verse:19,en:"Repent ye therefore, and be converted, that your sins may be blotted out, when the times of refreshing shall come from the presence of the Lord;",pt:"Arrependei-vos, pois, e convertei-vos, para que sejam apagados os vossos pecados, de sorte que venham os tempos de refrig\xe9rio, da presen\xe7a do Senhor,"},{verse:20,en:"And he shall send Jesus Christ, which before was preached unto you:",pt:"e envie ele o Cristo, que j\xe1 dantes vos foi indicado, Jesus,"},{verse:21,en:"Whom the heaven must receive until the times of restitution of all things, which God hath spoken by the mouth of all his holy prophets since the world began.",pt:"ao qual conv\xe9m que o c\xe9u receba at\xe9 os tempos da restaura\xe7\xe3o de todas as coisas, das quais Deus falou pela boca dos seus santos profetas, desde o princ\xedpio."},{verse:22,en:"For Moses truly said unto the fathers, A prophet shall the Lord your God raise up unto you of your brethren, like unto me; him shall ye hear in all things whatsoever he shall say unto you.",pt:"Pois Mois\xe9s disse: Suscitar-vos-\xe1 o Senhor vosso Deus, dentre vossos irm\xe3os, um profeta semelhante a mim; a ele ouvireis em tudo quanto vos disser."},{verse:23,en:"And it shall come to pass, that every soul, which will not hear that prophet, shall be destroyed from among the people.",pt:"E acontecer\xe1 que toda alma que n\xe3o ouvir a esse profeta, ser\xe1 exterminada dentre o povo."},{verse:24,en:"Yea, and all the prophets from Samuel and those that follow after, as many as have spoken, have likewise foretold of these days.",pt:"E todos os profetas, desde Samuel e os que sucederam, quantos falaram, tamb\xe9m anunciaram estes dias."},{verse:25,en:"Ye are the children of the prophets, and of the covenant which God made with our fathers, saying unto Abraham, And in thy seed shall all the kindreds of the earth be blessed.",pt:"V\xf3s sois os filhos dos profetas e do pacto que Deus fez com vossos pais, dizendo a Abra\xe3o: Na tua descend\xeancia ser\xe3o aben\xe7oadas todas as fam\xedlias da terra."},{verse:26,en:"Unto you first God, having raised up his Son Jesus, sent him to bless you, in turning away every one of you from his iniquities.",pt:"Deus suscitou a seu Servo, e a v\xf3s primeiramente vo-lo enviou para que vos aben\xe7oasse, desviando-vos, a cada um, das vossas maldades."}]}}),808,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And as they spake unto the people, the priests, and the captain of the temple, and the Sadducees, came upon them,",pt:"Enquanto eles estavam falando ao povo, sobrevieram-lhes os sacerdotes, o capit\xe3o do templo e os saduceus,"},{verse:2,en:"Being grieved that they taught the people, and preached through Jesus the resurrection from the dead.",pt:"doendo-se muito de que eles ensinassem o povo, e anunciassem em Jesus a ressurrei\xe7\xe3o dentre os mortos,"},{verse:3,en:"And they laid hands on them, and put them in hold unto the next day: for it was now eventide.",pt:"deitaram m\xe3o neles, e os encerraram na pris\xe3o at\xe9 o dia seguinte; pois era j\xe1 tarde."},{verse:4,en:"Howbeit many of them which heard the word believed; and the number of the men was about five thousand.",pt:"Muitos, por\xe9m, dos que ouviram a palavra, creram, e se elevou o n\xfamero dos homens a quase cinco mil."},{verse:5,en:"And it came to pass on the morrow, that their rulers, and elders, and scribes,",pt:"No dia seguinte, reuniram-se em Jerusal\xe9m as autoridades, os anci\xe3os, os escribas,"},{verse:6,en:"And Annas the high priest, and Caiaphas, and John, and Alexander, and as many as were of the kindred of the high priest, were gathered together at Jerusalem.",pt:"e An\xe1s, o sumo sacerdote, e Caif\xe1s, Jo\xe3o, Alexandre, e todos quantos eram da linhagem do sumo sacerdote."},{verse:7,en:"And when they had set them in the midst, they asked, By what power, or by what name, have ye done this?",pt:"E, pondo-os no meio deles, perguntaram: Com que poder ou em nome de quem fizestes v\xf3s isto?"},{verse:8,en:"Then Peter, filled with the Holy Ghost, said unto them, Ye rulers of the people, and elders of Israel,",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pedro, cheio do Esp\xedrito Santo, lhes disse: Autoridades do povo e v\xf3s, anci\xe3os,"},{verse:9,en:"If we this day be examined of the good deed done to the impotent man, by what means he is made whole;",pt:"se n\xf3s hoje somos inquiridos acerca do benef\xedcio feito a um enfermo, e do modo como foi curado,"},{verse:10,en:"Be it known unto you all, and to all the people of Israel, that by the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth, whom ye crucified, whom God raised from the dead, even by him doth this man stand here before you whole.",pt:"seja conhecido de v\xf3s todos, e de todo o povo de Israel, que em nome de Jesus Cristo, o nazareno, aquele a quem v\xf3s crucificastes e a quem Deus ressuscitou dentre os mortos, nesse nome est\xe1 este aqui, s\xe3o diante de v\xf3s."},{verse:11,en:"This is the stone which was set at nought of you builders, which is become the head of the corner.",pt:"Ele \xe9 a pedra que foi rejeitada por v\xf3s, os edificadores, a qual foi posta como pedra angular."},{verse:12,en:"Neither is there salvation in any other: for there is none other name under heaven given among men, whereby we must be saved.",pt:"E em nenhum outro h\xe1 salva\xe7\xe3o; porque debaixo do c\xe9u nenhum outro nome h\xe1, dado entre os homens, em que devamos ser salvos."},{verse:13,en:"Now when they saw the boldness of Peter and John, and perceived that they were unlearned and ignorant men, they marvelled; and they took knowledge of them, that they had been with Jesus.",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles, vendo a intrepidez de Pedro e Jo\xe3o, e tendo percebido que eram homens iletrados e indoutos, se admiravam; e reconheciam que haviam estado com Jesus."},{verse:14,en:"And beholding the man which was healed standing with them, they could say nothing against it.",pt:"E vendo em p\xe9 com eles o homem que fora curado, nada tinham que dizer em contr\xe1rio."},{verse:15,en:"But when they had commanded them to go aside out of the council, they conferred among themselves,",pt:"Todavia, mandando-os sair do sin\xe9drio, conferenciaram entre si,"},{verse:16,en:"Saying, What shall we do to these men? for that indeed a notable miracle hath been done by them is manifest to all them that dwell in Jerusalem; and we cannot deny it.",pt:"dizendo: Que havemos de fazer a estes homens? porque a todos os que habitam em Jerusal\xe9m \xe9 manifesto que por eles foi feito um sinal not\xf3rio, e n\xe3o o podemos negar."},{verse:17,en:"But that it spread no further among the people, let us straitly threaten them, that they speak henceforth to no man in this name.",pt:"Mas, para que n\xe3o se divulgue mais entre o povo, ameacemo- los para que de ora em diante n\xe3o falem neste nome a homem algum."},{verse:18,en:"And they called them, and commanded them not to speak at all nor teach in the name of Jesus.",pt:"E, chamando-os, ordenaram-lhes que absolutamente n\xe3o falassem nem ensinassem em nome de Jesus."},{verse:19,en:"But Peter and John answered and said unto them, Whether it be right in the sight of God to hearken unto you more than unto God, judge ye.",pt:"Mas Pedro e Jo\xe3o, respondendo, lhes disseram: Julgai v\xf3s se \xe9 justo diante de Deus ouvir-nos antes a v\xf3s do que a Deus;"},{verse:20,en:"For we cannot but speak the things which we have seen and heard.",pt:"pois n\xf3s n\xe3o podemos deixar de falar das coisas que temos visto e ouvido."},{verse:21,en:"So when they had further threatened them, they let them go, finding nothing how they might punish them, because of the people: for all men glorified God for that which was done.",pt:"Mas eles ainda os amea\xe7aram mais, e, n\xe3o achando motivo para os castigar, soltaram-nos, por causa do povo; porque todos glorificavam a Deus pelo que acontecera;"},{verse:22,en:"For the man was above forty years old, on whom this miracle of healing was shewed.",pt:"pois tinha mais de quarenta anos o homem em quem se operara esta cura milagrosa."},{verse:23,en:"And being let go, they went to their own company, and reported all that the chief priests and elders had said unto them.",pt:"E soltos eles, foram para os seus, e contaram tudo o que lhes haviam dito os principais sacerdotes e os anci\xe3os."},{verse:24,en:"And when they heard that, they lifted up their voice to God with one accord, and said, Lord, thou art God, which hast made heaven, and earth, and the sea, and all that in them is:",pt:"Ao ouvirem isto, levantaram unanimemente a voz a Deus e disseram: Senhor, tu que fizeste o c\xe9u, a terra, o mar, e tudo o que neles h\xe1;"},{verse:25,en:"Who by the mouth of thy servant David hast said, Why did the heathen rage, and the people imagine vain things?",pt:"que pelo Esp\xedrito Santo, por boca de nosso pai Davi, teu servo, disseste: Por que se enfureceram os gentios, e os povos imaginaram coisas v\xe3s?"},{verse:26,en:"The kings of the earth stood up, and the rulers were gathered together against the Lord, and against his Christ.",pt:"Levantaram-se os reis da terra, e as autoridades ajuntaram- se \xe0 uma, contra o Senhor e contra o seu Ungido."},{verse:27,en:"For of a truth against thy holy child Jesus, whom thou hast anointed, both Herod, and Pontius Pilate, with the Gentiles, and the people of Israel, were gathered together,",pt:"Porque verdadeiramente se ajuntaram, nesta cidade, contra o teu santo Servo Jesus, ao qual ungiste, n\xe3o s\xf3 Herodes, mas tamb\xe9m P\xf4ncio Pilatos com os gentios e os povos de Israel;"},{verse:28,en:"For to do whatsoever thy hand and thy counsel determined before to be done.",pt:"para fazerem tudo o que a tua m\xe3o e o teu conselho predeterminaram que se fizesse."},{verse:29,en:"And now, Lord, behold their threatenings: and grant unto thy servants, that with all boldness they may speak thy word,",pt:"Agora pois, \xf3 Senhor, olha para as suas amea\xe7as, e concede aos teus servos que falam com toda a intrepidez a tua palavra,"},{verse:30,en:"By stretching forth thine hand to heal; and that signs and wonders may be done by the name of thy holy child Jesus.",pt:"enquanto estendes a m\xe3o para curar e para que se fa\xe7am sinais e prod\xedgios pelo nome de teu santo Servo Jesus."},{verse:31,en:"And when they had prayed, the place was shaken where they were assembled together; and they were all filled with the Holy Ghost, and they spake the word of God with boldness.",pt:"E, tendo eles orado, tremeu o lugar em que estavam reunidos; e todos foram cheios do Esp\xedrito Santo, e anunciavam com intrepidez a palavra de Deus."},{verse:32,en:"And the multitude of them that believed were of one heart and of one soul: neither said any of them that ought of the things which he possessed was his own; but they had all things common.",pt:"Da multid\xe3o dos que criam, era um s\xf3 o cora\xe7\xe3o e uma s\xf3 a alma, e ningu\xe9m dizia que coisa alguma das que possu\xeda era sua pr\xf3pria, mas todas as coisas lhes eram comuns."},{verse:33,en:"And with great power gave the apostles witness of the resurrection of the Lord Jesus: and great grace was upon them all.",pt:"Com grande poder os ap\xf3stolos davam testemunho da ressurrei\xe7\xe3o do Senhor Jesus, e em todos eles havia abundante gra\xe7a."},{verse:34,en:"Neither was there any among them that lacked: for as many as were possessors of lands or houses sold them, and brought the prices of the things that were sold,",pt:"Pois n\xe3o havia entre eles necessitado algum; porque todos os que possu\xedam terras ou casas, vendendo-as, traziam o pre\xe7o do que vendiam e o depositavam aos p\xe9s dos ap\xf3stolos."},{verse:35,en:"And laid them down at the apostles\u2019 feet: and distribution was made unto every man according as he had need.",pt:"E se repartia a qualquer um que tivesse necessidade."},{verse:36,en:"And Joses, who by the apostles was surnamed Barnabas, (which is, being interpreted, The son of consolation,) a Levite, and of the country of Cyprus,",pt:"ent\xe3o Jos\xe9, cognominado pelos ap\xf3stolos Barnab\xe9 (que quer dizer, filho de consola\xe7\xe3o), levita, natural de Chipre,"},{verse:37,en:"Having land, sold it, and brought the money, and laid it at the apostles\u2019 feet.",pt:"possuindo um campo, vendeu-o, trouxe o pre\xe7o e o depositou aos p\xe9s dos ap\xf3stolos."}]}}),809,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"But a certain man named Ananias, with Sapphira his wife, sold a possession,",pt:"Mas um certo homem chamado Ananias, com Safira, sua mulher, vendeu uma propriedade,"},{verse:2,en:"And kept back part of the price, his wife also being privy to it, and brought a certain part, and laid it at the apostles\u2019 feet.",pt:"e reteve parte do pre\xe7o, sabendo-o tamb\xe9m sua mulher; e levando a outra parte, a depositou aos p\xe9s dos ap\xf3stolos."},{verse:3,en:"But Peter said, Ananias, why hath Satan filled thine heart to lie to the Holy Ghost, and to keep back part of the price of the land?",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o Pedro: Ananias, por que encheu Satan\xe1s o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, para que mentisses ao Esp\xedrito Santo e retivesses parte do pre\xe7o do terreno?"},{verse:4,en:"Whiles it remained, was it not thine own? and after it was sold, was it not in thine own power? why hast thou conceived this thing in thine heart? thou hast not lied unto men, but unto God.",pt:"Enquanto o possu\xedas, n\xe3o era teu? e vendido, n\xe3o estava o pre\xe7o em teu poder? Como, pois, formaste este des\xedgnio em teu cora\xe7\xe3o? N\xe3o mentiste aos homens, mas a Deus."},{verse:5,en:"And Ananias hearing these words fell down, and gave up the ghost: and great fear came on all them that heard these things.",pt:"E Ananias, ouvindo estas palavras, caiu e expirou. E grande temor veio sobre todos os que souberam disto."},{verse:6,en:"And the young men arose, wound him up, and carried him out, and buried him.",pt:"Levantando-se os mo\xe7os, cobriram-no e, transportando-o para fora, o sepultaram."},{verse:7,en:"And it was about the space of three hours after, when his wife, not knowing what was done, came in.",pt:"Depois de um intervalo de cerca de tr\xeas horas, entrou tamb\xe9m sua mulher, sabendo o que havia acontecido."},{verse:8,en:"And Peter answered unto her, Tell me whether ye sold the land for so much? And she said, Yea, for so much.",pt:"E perguntou-lhe Pedro: Dize-me vendestes por tanto aquele terreno? E ela respondeu: Sim, por tanto."},{verse:9,en:"Then Peter said unto her, How is it that ye have agreed together to tempt the Spirit of the Lord? behold, the feet of them which have buried thy husband are at the door, and shall carry thee out.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pedro lhe disse: Por que \xe9 que combinastes entre v\xf3s provar o Esp\xedrito do Senhor? Eis a\xed \xe0 porta os p\xe9s dos que sepultaram o teu marido, e te levar\xe3o tamb\xe9m a ti."},{verse:10,en:"Then fell she down straightway at his feet, and yielded up the ghost: and the young men came in, and found her dead, and, carrying her forth, buried her by her husband.",pt:"Imediatamente ela caiu aos p\xe9s dele e expirou. E entrando os mo\xe7os, acharam-na morta e, levando-a para fora, sepultaram-na ao lado do marido."},{verse:11,en:"And great fear came upon all the church, and upon as many as heard these things.",pt:"Sobreveio grande temor a toda a igreja e a todos os que ouviram estas coisas."},{verse:12,en:"And by the hands of the apostles were many signs and wonders wrought among the people; (and they were all with one accord in Solomon\u2019s porch.",pt:"E muitos sinais e prod\xedgios eram feitos entre o povo pelas m\xe3os dos ap\xf3stolos. E estavam todos de comum acordo no p\xf3rtico de Salom\xe3o."},{verse:13,en:"And of the rest durst no man join himself to them: but the people magnified them.",pt:"Dos outros, por\xe9m, nenhum ousava ajuntar-se a eles; mas o povo os tinha em grande estima;"},{verse:14,en:"And believers were the more added to the Lord, multitudes both of men and women.)",pt:"e cada vez mais se agregavam crentes ao Senhor em grande n\xfamero tanto de homens como de mulheres;"},{verse:15,en:"Insomuch that they brought forth the sick into the streets, and laid them on beds and couches, that at the least the shadow of Peter passing by might overshadow some of them.",pt:"a ponto de transportarem os enfermos para as ruas, e os porem em leitos e macas, para que ao passar Pedro, ao menos sua sombra cobrisse alguns deles."},{verse:16,en:"There came also a multitude out of the cities round about unto Jerusalem, bringing sick folks, and them which were vexed with unclean spirits: and they were healed every one.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m das cidades circunvizinhas aflu\xeda muita gente a Jerusal\xe9m, conduzindo enfermos e atormentados de esp\xedritos imundos, os quais eram todos curados."},{verse:17,en:"Then the high priest rose up, and all they that were with him, (which is the sect of the Sadducees,) and were filled with indignation,",pt:"Levantando-se o sumo sacerdote e todos os que estavam com ele (isto \xe9, a seita dos saduceus), encheram-se de inveja,"},{verse:18,en:"And laid their hands on the apostles, and put them in the common prison.",pt:"deitaram m\xe3o nos ap\xf3stolos, e os puseram na pris\xe3o p\xfablica."},{verse:19,en:"But the angel of the Lord by night opened the prison doors, and brought them forth, and said,",pt:"Mas de noite um anjo do Senhor abriu as portas do c\xe1rcere e, tirando-os para fora, disse:"},{verse:20,en:"Go, stand and speak in the temple to the people all the words of this life.",pt:"Ide, apresentai-vos no templo, e falai ao povo todas as palavras desta vida."},{verse:21,en:"And when they heard that, they entered into the temple early in the morning, and taught. But the high priest came, and they that were with him, and called the council together, and all the senate of the children of Israel and sent to the prison to have them brought.",pt:"Ora, tendo eles ouvido isto, entraram de manh\xe3 cedo no templo e ensinavam. Chegando, por\xe9m o sumo sacerdote e os que estavam com ele, convocaram o sin\xe9drio, com todos os anci\xe3os dos filhos de Israel, e enviaram guardas ao c\xe1rcere para traz\xea-los."},{verse:22,en:"But when the officers came, and found them not in the prison, they returned, and told,",pt:"Mas os guardas, tendo l\xe1 ido, n\xe3o os acharam na pris\xe3o; e voltando, lho anunciaram,"},{verse:23,en:"Saying, The prison truly found we shut with all safety, and the keepers standing without before the doors: but when we had opened, we found no man within.",pt:"dizendo: Achamos realmente o c\xe1rcere fechado com toda a seguran\xe7a, e as sentinelas em p\xe9 \xe0s portas; mas, abrindo-as, a ningu\xe9m achamos dentro."},{verse:24,en:"Now when the high priest and the captain of the temple and the chief priests heard these things, they doubted of them whereunto this would grow.",pt:"E quando o capit\xe3o do templo e os principais sacerdotes ouviram estas palavras ficaram perplexos acerca deles e do que viria a ser isso."},{verse:25,en:"Then came one and told them, saying, Behold, the men whom ye put in prison are standing in the temple, and teaching the people.",pt:"Ent\xe3o chegou algu\xe9m e lhes anunciou: Eis que os homens que encerrastes na pris\xe3o est\xe3o no templo, em p\xe9, a ensinar o povo."},{verse:26,en:"Then went the captain with the officers, and brought them without violence: for they feared the people, lest they should have been stoned.",pt:"Nisso foi o capit\xe3o com os guardas e os trouxe, n\xe3o com viol\xeancia, porque temiam ser apedrejados pelo povo."},{verse:27,en:"And when they had brought them, they set them before the council: and the high priest asked them,",pt:"E tendo-os trazido, os apresentaram ao sin\xe9drio. E o sumo sacerdote os interrogou, dizendo:"},{verse:28,en:"Saying, Did not we straitly command you that ye should not teach in this name? and, behold, ye have filled Jerusalem with your doctrine, and intend to bring this man\u2019s blood upon us.",pt:"N\xe3o vos admoestamos expressamente que n\xe3o ensin\xe1sseis nesse nome? e eis que enchestes Jerusal\xe9m dessa vossa doutrina e quereis lan\xe7ar sobre n\xf3s o sangue desse homem."},{verse:29,en:"Then Peter and the other apostles answered and said, We ought to obey God rather than men.",pt:"Respondendo Pedro e os ap\xf3stolos, disseram: Importa antes obedecer a Deus que aos homens."},{verse:30,en:"The God of our fathers raised up Jesus, whom ye slew and hanged on a tree.",pt:"O Deus de nossos pais ressuscitou a Jesus, ao qual v\xf3s matastes, suspendendo-o no madeiro;"},{verse:31,en:"Him hath God exalted with his right hand to be a Prince and a Saviour, for to give repentance to Israel, and forgiveness of sins.",pt:"sim, Deus, com a sua destra, o elevou a Pr\xedncipe e Salvador, para dar a Israel o arrependimento e remiss\xe3o de pecados."},{verse:32,en:"And we are his witnesses of these things; and so is also the Holy Ghost, whom God hath given to them that obey him.",pt:"E n\xf3s somos testemunhas destas coisas, e bem assim o Esp\xedrito Santo, que Deus deu \xe0queles que lhe obedecem."},{verse:33,en:"When they heard that, they were cut to the heart, and took counsel to slay them.",pt:"Ora, ouvindo eles isto, se enfureceram e queriam mat\xe1-los."},{verse:34,en:"Then stood there up one in the council, a Pharisee, named Gamaliel, a doctor of the law, had in reputation among all the people, and commanded to put the apostles forth a little space;",pt:"Mas, levantando-se no sin\xe9drio certo fariseu chamado Gamaliel, doutor da lei, acatado por todo o povo, mandou que por um pouco sa\xedssem aqueles homens;"},{verse:35,en:"And said unto them, Ye men of Israel, take heed to yourselves what ye intend to do as touching these men.",pt:"e prosseguiu: Var\xf5es israelitas, acautelai-vos a respeito do que estai para fazer a estes homens."},{verse:36,en:"For before these days rose up Theudas, boasting himself to be somebody; to whom a number of men, about four hundred, joined themselves: who was slain; and all, as many as obeyed him, were scattered, and brought to nought.",pt:"Porque, h\xe1 algum tempo, levantou-se Teudas, dizendo ser algu\xe9m; ao qual se ajuntaram uns quatrocentos homens; mas ele foi morto, e todos quantos lhe obedeciam foram dispersos e reduzidos a nada."},{verse:37,en:"After this man rose up Judas of Galilee in the days of the taxing, and drew away much people after him: he also perished; and all, even as many as obeyed him, were dispersed.",pt:"Depois dele levantou-se Judas, o galileu, nos dias do recenseamento, e levou muitos ap\xf3s si; mas tamb\xe9m este pereceu, e todos quantos lhe obedeciam foram dispersos."},{verse:38,en:"And now I say unto you, Refrain from these men, and let them alone: for if this counsel or this work be of men, it will come to nought:",pt:"Agora vos digo: Dai de m\xe3o a estes homens, e deixai-os, porque este conselho ou esta obra, caso seja dos homens, se desfar\xe1;"},{verse:39,en:"But if it be of God, ye cannot overthrow it; lest haply ye be found even to fight against God.",pt:"mas, se \xe9 de Deus, n\xe3o podereis derrot\xe1-los; para que n\xe3o sejais, porventura, achados at\xe9 combatendo contra Deus."},{verse:40,en:"And to him they agreed: and when they had called the apostles, and beaten them, they commanded that they should not speak in the name of Jesus, and let them go.",pt:"Concordaram, pois, com ele, e tendo chamado os ap\xf3stolos, a\xe7oitaram-nos e mandaram que n\xe3o falassem em nome de Jesus, e os soltaram."},{verse:41,en:"And they departed from the presence of the council, rejoicing that they were counted worthy to suffer shame for his name.",pt:"Retiraram-se pois da presen\xe7a do sin\xe9drio, regozijando-se de terem sido julgados dignos de sofrer afronta pelo nome de Jesus."},{verse:42,en:"And daily in the temple, and in every house, they ceased not to teach and preach Jesus Christ.",pt:"E todos os dias, no templo e de casa em casa, n\xe3o cessavam de ensinar, e de anunciar a Jesus, o Cristo."}]}}),810,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And in those days, when the number of the disciples was multiplied, there arose a murmuring of the Grecians against the Hebrews, because their widows were neglected in the daily ministration.",pt:"Ora, naqueles dias, crescendo o n\xfamero dos disc\xedpulos, houve uma murmura\xe7\xe3o dos helenistas contra os hebreus, porque as vi\xfavas daqueles estavam sendo esquecidas na distribui\xe7\xe3o di\xe1ria."},{verse:2,en:"Then the twelve called the multitude of the disciples unto them, and said, It is not reason that we should leave the word of God, and serve tables.",pt:"E os doze, convocando a multid\xe3o dos disc\xedpulos, disseram: N\xe3o \xe9 razo\xe1vel que n\xf3s deixemos a palavra de Deus e sirvamos \xe0s mesas."},{verse:3,en:"Wherefore, brethren, look ye out among you seven men of honest report, full of the Holy Ghost and wisdom, whom we may appoint over this business.",pt:"Escolhei, pois, irm\xe3os, dentre v\xf3s, sete homens de boa reputa\xe7\xe3o, cheios do Esp\xedrito Santo e de sabedoria, aos quais encarreguemos deste servi\xe7o."},{verse:4,en:"But we will give ourselves continually to prayer, and to the ministry of the word.",pt:"Mas n\xf3s perseveraremos na ora\xe7\xe3o e no minist\xe9rio da palavra."},{verse:5,en:"And the saying pleased the whole multitude: and they chose Stephen, a man full of faith and of the Holy Ghost, and Philip, and Prochorus, and Nicanor, and Timon, and Parmenas, and Nicolas a proselyte of Antioch:",pt:"O parecer agradou a todos, e elegeram a Estev\xe3o, homem cheio de f\xe9 e do Esp\xedrito Santo, Filipe, Pr\xf3coro, Nicanor, Tim\xe3o, P\xe1rmenas, e Nicolau, pros\xe9lito de Antioquia,"},{verse:6,en:"Whom they set before the apostles: and when they had prayed, they laid their hands on them.",pt:"e os apresentaram perante os ap\xf3stolos; estes, tendo orado, lhes impuseram as m\xe3os."},{verse:7,en:"And the word of God increased; and the number of the disciples multiplied in Jerusalem greatly; and a great company of the priests were obedient to the faith.",pt:"E divulgava-se a palavra de Deus, de sorte que se multiplicava muito o n\xfamero dos disc\xedpulos em Jerusal\xe9m e muitos sacerdotes obedeciam \xe0 f\xe9."},{verse:8,en:"And Stephen, full of faith and power, did great wonders and miracles among the people.",pt:"Ora, Est\xeav\xe3o, cheio de gra\xe7a e poder, fazia prod\xedgios e grandes sinais entre o povo."},{verse:9,en:"Then there arose certain of the synagogue, which is called the synagogue of the Libertines, and Cyrenians, and Alexandrians, and of them of Cilicia and of Asia, disputing with Stephen.",pt:"Levantaram-se, por\xe9m, alguns que eram da sinagoga chamada dos libertos, dos cireneus, dos alexandrinos, dos da Cil\xedcia e da \xc1sia, e disputavam com Est\xeav\xe3o;"},{verse:10,en:"And they were not able to resist the wisdom and the spirit by which he spake.",pt:"e n\xe3o podiam resistir \xe0 sabedoria e ao Esp\xedrito com que falava."},{verse:11,en:"Then they suborned men, which said, We have heard him speak blasphemous words against Moses, and against God.",pt:"Ent\xe3o subornaram uns homens para que dissessem: Temo-lo ouvido proferir palavras blasfemas contra Mois\xe9s e contra Deus."},{verse:12,en:"And they stirred up the people, and the elders, and the scribes, and came upon him, and caught him, and brought him to the council,",pt:"Assim excitaram o povo, os anci\xe3os, e os escribas; e investindo contra ele, o arrebataram e o levaram ao sin\xe9drio;"},{verse:13,en:"And set up false witnesses, which said, This man ceaseth not to speak blasphemous words against this holy place, and the law:",pt:"e apresentaram falsas testemunhas que diziam: Este homem n\xe3o cessa de proferir palavras contra este santo lugar e contra a lei;"},{verse:14,en:"For we have heard him say, that this Jesus of Nazareth shall destroy this place, and shall change the customs which Moses delivered us.",pt:"porque n\xf3s o temos ouvido dizer que esse Jesus, o nazareno, h\xe1 de destruir este lugar e mudar os costumes que Mois\xe9s nos transmitiu."},{verse:15,en:"And all that sat in the council, looking stedfastly on him, saw his face as it had been the face of an angel.",pt:"Ent\xe3o todos os que estavam assentados no sin\xe9drio, fitando os olhos nele, viram o seu rosto como de um anjo."}]}}),811,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then said the high priest, Are these things so?",pt:"E disse o sumo sacerdote: Porventura s\xe3o assim estas coisas?"},{verse:2,en:"And he said, Men, brethren, and fathers, hearken; The God of glory appeared unto our father Abraham, when he was in Mesopotamia, before he dwelt in Charran,",pt:"Est\xeav\xe3o respondeu: Irm\xe3os e pais, ouvi. O Deus da gl\xf3ria apareceu a nosso pai Abra\xe3o, estando ele na Mesopot\xe2mia, antes de habitar em Har\xe3,"},{verse:3,en:"And said unto him, Get thee out of thy country, and from thy kindred, and come into the land which I shall shew thee.",pt:"e disse-lhe: Sai da tua terra e dentre a tua parentela, e dirige-te \xe0 terra que eu te mostrar."},{verse:4,en:"Then came he out of the land of the Chaldaeans, and dwelt in Charran: and from thence, when his father was dead, he removed him into this land, wherein ye now dwell.",pt:"Ent\xe3o saiu da terra dos caldeus e habitou em Har\xe3. Dali, depois que seu pai faleceu, Deus o trouxe para esta terra em que v\xf3s agora habitais."},{verse:5,en:"And he gave him none inheritance in it, no, not so much as to set his foot on: yet he promised that he would give it to him for a possession, and to his seed after him, when as yet he had no child.",pt:"E n\xe3o lhe deu nela heran\xe7a, nem sequer o espa\xe7o de um p\xe9; mas prometeu que lha daria em possess\xe3o, e depois dele \xe0 sua descend\xeancia, n\xe3o tendo ele ainda filho."},{verse:6,en:"And God spake on this wise, That his seed should sojourn in a strange land; and that they should bring them into bondage, and entreat them evil four hundred years.",pt:"Pois Deus disse que a sua descend\xeancia seria peregrina em terra estranha e que a escravizariam e maltratariam por quatrocentos anos."},{verse:7,en:"And the nation to whom they shall be in bondage will I judge, said God: and after that shall they come forth, and serve me in this place.",pt:"Mas eu julgarei a na\xe7\xe3o que os tiver escravizado, disse Deus; e depois disto sair\xe3o, e me servir\xe3o neste lugar."},{verse:8,en:"And he gave him the covenant of circumcision: and so Abraham begat Isaac, and circumcised him the eighth day; and Isaac begat Jacob; and Jacob begat the twelve patriarchs.",pt:"E deu-lhe o pacto da circuncis\xe3o; assim ent\xe3o gerou Abra\xe3o a Isaque, e o circuncidou ao oitavo dia; e Isaque gerou a Jac\xf3, e Jac\xf3 aos doze patriarcas."},{verse:9,en:"And the patriarchs, moved with envy, sold Joseph into Egypt: but God was with him,",pt:"Os patriarcas, movidos de inveja, venderam Jos\xe9 para o Egito; mas Deus era com ele,"},{verse:10,en:"And delivered him out of all his afflictions, and gave him favour and wisdom in the sight of Pharaoh king of Egypt; and he made him governor over Egypt and all his house.",pt:"e o livrou de todas as suas tribula\xe7\xf5es, e lhe deu gra\xe7a e sabedoria perante Fara\xf3, rei do Egito, que o constituiu governador sobre o Egito e toda a sua casa."},{verse:11,en:"Now there came a dearth over all the land of Egypt and Chanaan, and great affliction: and our fathers found no sustenance.",pt:"Sobreveio ent\xe3o uma fome a todo o Egito e Cana\xe3, e grande tribula\xe7\xe3o; e nossos pais n\xe3o achavam alimentos."},{verse:12,en:"But when Jacob heard that there was corn in Egypt, he sent out our fathers first.",pt:"Mas tendo ouvido Jac\xf3 que no Egito havia trigo, enviou ali nossos pais pela primeira vez."},{verse:13,en:"And at the second time Joseph was made known to his brethren; and Joseph\u2019s kindred was made known unto Pharaoh.",pt:"E na segunda vez deu-se Jos\xe9 a conhecer a seus irm\xe3os, e a sua linhagem tornou-se manifesta a Fara\xf3."},{verse:14,en:"Then sent Joseph, and called his father Jacob to him, and all his kindred, threescore and fifteen souls.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jos\xe9 mandou chamar a seu pai Jac\xf3, e a toda a sua parentela - setenta e cinco almas."},{verse:15,en:"So Jacob went down into Egypt, and died, he, and our fathers,",pt:"Jac\xf3, pois, desceu ao Egito, onde morreu, ele e nossos pais;"},{verse:16,en:"And were carried over into Sychem, and laid in the sepulchre that Abraham bought for a sum of money of the sons of Emmor the father of Sychem.",pt:"e foram transportados para Siqu\xe9m e depositados na sepultura que Abra\xe3o comprara por certo pre\xe7o em prata aos filhos de Emor, em Siqu\xe9m."},{verse:17,en:"But when the time of the promise drew nigh, which God had sworn to Abraham, the people grew and multiplied in Egypt,",pt:"Enquanto se aproximava o tempo da promessa que Deus tinha feito a Abra\xe3o, o povo crescia e se multiplicava no Egito;"},{verse:18,en:"Till another king arose, which knew not Joseph.",pt:"at\xe9 que se levantou ali outro rei, que n\xe3o tinha conhecido Jos\xe9."},{verse:19,en:"The same dealt subtilly with our kindred, and evil entreated our fathers, so that they cast out their young children, to the end they might not live.",pt:"Usando esse de ast\xfacia contra a nossa ra\xe7a, maltratou a nossos pais, ao ponto de faz\xea-los enjeitar seus filhos, para que n\xe3o vivessem."},{verse:20,en:"In which time Moses was born, and was exceeding fair, and nourished up in his father\u2019s house three months:",pt:"Nesse tempo nasceu Mois\xe9s, e era mui formoso, e foi criado tr\xeas meses em casa de seu pai."},{verse:21,en:"And when he was cast out, Pharaoh\u2019s daughter took him up, and nourished him for her own son.",pt:"Sendo ele enjeitado, a filha de Fara\xf3 o recolheu e o criou como seu pr\xf3prio filho."},{verse:22,en:"And Moses was learned in all the wisdom of the Egyptians, and was mighty in words and in deeds.",pt:"Assim Mois\xe9s foi instru\xeddo em toda a sabedoria dos eg\xedpcios, e era poderoso em palavras e obras."},{verse:23,en:"And when he was full forty years old, it came into his heart to visit his brethren the children of Israel.",pt:"Ora, quando ele completou quarenta anos, veio-lhe ao cora\xe7\xe3o visitar seus irm\xe3os, os filhos de Israel."},{verse:24,en:"And seeing one of them suffer wrong, he defended him, and avenged him that was oppressed, and smote the Egyptian:",pt:"E vendo um deles sofrer injustamente, defendeu-o, e vingou o oprimido, matando o eg\xedpcio."},{verse:25,en:"For he supposed his brethren would have understood how that God by his hand would deliver them: but they understood not.",pt:"Cuidava que seus irm\xe3os entenderiam que por m\xe3o dele Deus lhes havia de dar a liberdade; mas eles n\xe3o entenderam."},{verse:26,en:"And the next day he shewed himself unto them as they strove, and would have set them at one again, saying, Sirs, ye are brethren; why do ye wrong one to another?",pt:"No dia seguinte apareceu-lhes quando brigavam, e quis lev\xe1- los \xe0 paz, dizendo: Homens, sois irm\xe3os; por que vos maltratais um ao outro?"},{verse:27,en:"But he that did his neighbour wrong thrust him away, saying, Who made thee a ruler and a judge over us?",pt:"Mas o que fazia injusti\xe7a ao seu pr\xf3ximo o repeliu, dizendo: Quem te constituiu senhor e juiz sobre n\xf3s?"},{verse:28,en:"Wilt thou kill me, as thou diddest the Egyptian yesterday?",pt:"Acaso queres tu matar-me como ontem mataste o eg\xedpcio?"},{verse:29,en:"Then fled Moses at this saying, and was a stranger in the land of Madian, where he begat two sons.",pt:"A esta palavra fugiu Mois\xe9s, e tornou-se peregrino na terra de Madi\xe3, onde gerou dois filhos."},{verse:30,en:"And when forty years were expired, there appeared to him in the wilderness of mount Sina an angel of the Lord in a flame of fire in a bush.",pt:"E passados mais quarenta anos, apareceu-lhe um anjo no deserto do monte Sinai, numa chama de fogo no meio de uma sar\xe7a."},{verse:31,en:"When Moses saw it, he wondered at the sight: and as he drew near to behold it, the voice of the Lord came unto him,",pt:"Mois\xe9s, vendo isto, admirou-se da vis\xe3o; e, aproximando-se ele para observar, soou a voz do Senhor;"},{verse:32,en:"Saying, I am the God of thy fathers, the God of Abraham, and the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob. Then Moses trembled, and durst not behold.",pt:"Eu sou o deus de teus pais, o Deus de Abra\xe3o, de Isaque e de Jac\xf3. E Mois\xe9s ficou tr\xeamulo e n\xe3o ousava olhar."},{verse:33,en:"Then said the Lord to him, Put off thy shoes from thy feet: for the place where thou standest is holy ground.",pt:"Disse-lhe ent\xe3o o Senhor: Tira as alparcas dos teus p\xe9s, porque o lugar em que est\xe1s \xe9 terra santa."},{verse:34,en:"I have seen, I have seen the affliction of my people which is in Egypt, and I have heard their groaning, and am come down to deliver them. And now come, I will send thee into Egypt.",pt:"Vi, com efeito, a afli\xe7\xe3o do meu povo no Egito, ouvi os seus gemidos, e desci para livr\xe1-lo. Agora pois vem, e enviar-te-ei ao Egito."},{verse:35,en:"This Moses whom they refused, saying, Who made thee a ruler and a judge? the same did God send to be a ruler and a deliverer by the hand of the angel which appeared to him in the bush.",pt:"A este Mois\xe9s que eles haviam repelido, dizendo: Quem te constituiu senhor e juiz? a este enviou Deus como senhor e libertador, pela m\xe3o do anjo que lhe aparecera na sar\xe7a."},{verse:36,en:"He brought them out, after that he had shewed wonders and signs in the land of Egypt, and in the Red sea, and in the wilderness forty years.",pt:"Foi este que os conduziu para fora, fazendo prod\xedgios e sinais na terra do Egito, e no Mar Vermelho, e no deserto por quarenta anos."},{verse:37,en:"This is that Moses, which said unto the children of Israel, A prophet shall the Lord your God raise up unto you of your brethren, like unto me; him shall ye hear.",pt:"Este \xe9 o Mois\xe9s que disse aos filhos de Israel: Deus vos suscitar\xe1 dentre vossos irm\xe3os um profeta como eu."},{verse:38,en:"This is he, that was in the church in the wilderness with the angel which spake to him in the mount Sina, and with our fathers: who received the lively oracles to give unto us:",pt:"Este \xe9 o que esteve na congrega\xe7\xe3o no deserto, com o anjo que lhe falava no monte Sinai, e com nossos pais, o qual recebeu palavras de vida para vo-las dar;"},{verse:39,en:"To whom our fathers would not obey, but thrust him from them, and in their hearts turned back again into Egypt,",pt:"ao qual os nossos pais n\xe3o quiseram obedecer, antes o rejeitaram, e em seus cora\xe7\xf5es voltaram ao Egito,"},{verse:40,en:"Saying unto Aaron, Make us gods to go before us: for as for this Moses, which brought us out of the land of Egypt, we wot not what is become of him.",pt:"dizendo a ar\xe3o: Faze-nos deuses que v\xe3o adiante de n\xf3s; porque a esse Mois\xe9s que nos tirou da terra do Egito, n\xe3o sabemos o que lhe aconteceu."},{verse:41,en:"And they made a calf in those days, and offered sacrifice unto the idol, and rejoiced in the works of their own hands.",pt:"Fizeram, pois, naqueles dias o bezerro, e ofereceram sacrif\xedcio ao \xeddolo, e se alegravam nas obras das suas m\xe3os."},{verse:42,en:"Then God turned, and gave them up to worship the host of heaven; as it is written in the book of the prophets, O ye house of Israel, have ye offered to me slain beasts and sacrifices by the space of forty years in the wilderness?",pt:"Mas Deus se afastou, e os abandonou ao culto das hostes do c\xe9u, como est\xe1 escrito no livro dos profetas: Porventura me oferecestes v\xedtimas e sacrif\xedcios por quarenta anos no deserto, \xf3 casa de Israel?"},{verse:43,en:"Yea, ye took up the tabernacle of Moloch, and the star of your god Remphan, figures which ye made to worship them: and I will carry you away beyond Babylon.",pt:"Antes carregastes o tabern\xe1culo de Moloque e a estrela do deus Renf\xe3, figuras que v\xf3s fizestes para ador\xe1-las. Desterrar-vos-ei pois, para al\xe9m da Babil\xf4nia."},{verse:44,en:"Our fathers had the tabernacle of witness in the wilderness, as he had appointed, speaking unto Moses, that he should make it according to the fashion that he had seen.",pt:"Entre os nossos pais no deserto estava o tabern\xe1culo do testemunho, como ordenara aquele que disse a Mois\xe9s que o fizesse segundo o modelo que tinha visto;"},{verse:45,en:"Which also our fathers that came after brought in with Jesus into the possession of the Gentiles, whom God drave out before the face of our fathers, unto the days of David;",pt:"o qual nossos pais, tendo-o por sua vez recebido, o levaram sob a dire\xe7\xe3o de Josu\xe9, quando entraram na posse da terra das na\xe7\xf5es que Deus expulsou da presen\xe7a dos nossos pais, at\xe9 os dias de Davi,"},{verse:46,en:"Who found favour before God, and desired to find a tabernacle for the God of Jacob.",pt:"que achou gra\xe7a diante de Deus, e pediu que lhe fosse dado achar habita\xe7\xe3o para o Deus de Jac\xf3."},{verse:47,en:"But Solomon built him an house.",pt:"Entretanto foi Salom\xe3o quem lhe edificou uma casa;"},{verse:48,en:"Howbeit the most High dwelleth not in temples made with hands; as saith the prophet,",pt:"mas o Alt\xedssimo n\xe3o habita em templos feitos por m\xe3os de homens, como diz o profeta:"},{verse:49,en:"Heaven is my throne, and earth is my footstool: what house will ye build me? saith the Lord: or what is the place of my rest?",pt:"O c\xe9u \xe9 meu trono, e a terra o escabelo dos meus p\xe9s. Que casa me edificareis, diz o Senhor, ou qual o lugar do meu repouso?"},{verse:50,en:"Hath not my hand made all these things?",pt:"N\xe3o fez, porventura, a minha m\xe3o todas estas coisas?"},{verse:51,en:"Ye stiffnecked and uncircumcised in heart and ears, ye do always resist the Holy Ghost: as your fathers did, so do ye.",pt:"Homens de dura cerviz, e incircuncisos de cora\xe7\xe3o e ouvido, v\xf3s sempre resistis ao Esp\xedrito Santo; como o fizeram os vossos pais, assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s."},{verse:52,en:"Which of the prophets have not your fathers persecuted? and they have slain them which shewed before of the coming of the Just One; of whom ye have been now the betrayers and murderers:",pt:"A qual dos profetas n\xe3o perseguiram vossos pais? At\xe9 mataram os que dantes anunciaram a vinda do Justo, do qual v\xf3s agora vos tornastes traidores e homicidas,"},{verse:53,en:"Who have received the law by the disposition of angels, and have not kept it.",pt:"v\xf3s, que recebestes a lei por ordena\xe7\xe3o dos anjos, e n\xe3o a guardastes."},{verse:54,en:"When they heard these things, they were cut to the heart, and they gnashed on him with their teeth.",pt:"Ouvindo eles isto, enfureciam-se em seus cora\xe7\xf5es, e rangiam os dentes contra Est\xeav\xe3o."},{verse:55,en:"But he, being full of the Holy Ghost, looked up stedfastly into heaven, and saw the glory of God, and Jesus standing on the right hand of God,",pt:"Mas ele, cheio do Esp\xedrito Santo, fitando os olhos no c\xe9u, viu a gl\xf3ria de Deus, e Jesus em p\xe9 \xe0 direita de Deus,"},{verse:56,en:"And said, Behold, I see the heavens opened, and the Son of man standing on the right hand of God.",pt:"e disse: Eis que vejo os c\xe9us abertos, e o Filho do homem em p\xe9 \xe0 direita de Deus."},{verse:57,en:"Then they cried out with a loud voice, and stopped their ears, and ran upon him with one accord,",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles gritaram com grande voz, taparam os ouvidos, e arremeteram un\xe2nimes contra ele"},{verse:58,en:"And cast him out of the city, and stoned him: and the witnesses laid down their clothes at a young man\u2019s feet, whose name was Saul.",pt:"e, lan\xe7ando-o fora da cidade o apedrejavam. E as testemunhas depuseram as suas vestes aos p\xe9s de um mancebo chamado Saulo."},{verse:59,en:"And they stoned Stephen, calling upon God, and saying, Lord Jesus, receive my spirit.",pt:"Apedrejavam, pois, a Est\xeav\xe3o que orando, dizia: Senhor Jesus, recebe o meu esp\xedrito."},{verse:60,en:"And he kneeled down, and cried with a loud voice, Lord, lay not this sin to their charge. And when he had said this, he fell asleep.",pt:"E pondo-se de joelhos, clamou com grande voz: Senhor, n\xe3o lhes imputes este pecado. Tendo dito isto, adormeceu. E Saulo consentia na sua morte."}]}}),812,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,i,n){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And Saul was consenting unto his death. And at that time there was a great persecution against the church which was at Jerusalem; and they were all scattered abroad throughout the regions of Judaea and Samaria, except the apostles.",pt:"Naquele dia levantou-se grande persegui\xe7\xe3o contra a igreja que estava em Jerusal\xe9m; e todos exceto os ap\xf3stolos, foram dispersos pelas regi\xf5es da Jud\xe9ia e da Sam\xe1ria."},{verse:2,en:"And devout men carried Stephen to his burial, and made great lamentation over him.",pt:"E uns homens piedosos sepultaram a Est\xeav\xe3o, e fizeram grande pranto sobre ele."},{verse:3,en:"As for Saul, he made havock of the church, entering into every house, and haling men and women committed them to prison.",pt:"Saulo por\xe9m, assolava a igreja, entrando pelas casas e, arrastando homens e mulheres, os entregava \xe0 pris\xe3o."},{verse:4,en:"Therefore they that were scattered abroad went every where preaching the word.",pt:"No entanto os que foram dispersos iam por toda parte, anunciando a palavra."},{verse:5,en:"Then Philip went down to the city of Samaria, and preached Christ unto them.",pt:"E descendo Filipe \xe0 cidade de Sam\xe1ria, pregava-lhes a Cristo."},{verse:6,en:"And the people with one accord gave heed unto those things which Philip spake, hearing and seeing the miracles which he did.",pt:"As multid\xf5es escutavam, un\xe2nimes, as coisas que Filipe dizia, ouvindo-o e vendo os sinais que operava;"},{verse:7,en:"For unclean spirits, crying with loud voice, came out of many that were possessed with them: and many taken with palsies, and that were lame, were healed.",pt:"pois sa\xedam de muitos possessos os esp\xedritos imundos, clamando em alta voz; e muitos paral\xedticos e coxos foram curados;"},{verse:8,en:"And there was great joy in that city.",pt:"pelo que houve grande alegria naquela cidade."},{verse:9,en:"But there was a certain man, called Simon, which beforetime in the same city used sorcery, and bewitched the people of Samaria, giving out that himself was some great one:",pt:"Ora, estava ali certo homem chamado Sim\xe3o, que vinha exercendo naquela cidade a arte m\xe1gica, fazendo pasmar o povo da Sam\xe1ria, e dizendo ser ele uma grande personagem;"},{verse:10,en:"To whom they all gave heed, from the least to the greatest, saying, This man is the great power of God.",pt:"ao qual todos atendiam, desde o menor at\xe9 o maior, dizendo: Este \xe9 o Poder de Deus que se chama Grande."},{verse:11,en:"And to him they had regard, because that of long time he had bewitched them with sorceries.",pt:"Eles o atendiam porque j\xe1 desde muito tempo os vinha fazendo pasmar com suas artes m\xe1gicas."},{verse:12,en:"But when they believed Philip preaching the things concerning the kingdom of God, and the name of Jesus Christ, they were baptized, both men and women.",pt:"Mas, quando creram em Filipe, que lhes pregava acerca do reino de Deus e do nome de Jesus, batizavam-se homens e mulheres."},{verse:13,en:"Then Simon himself believed also: and when he was baptized, he continued with Philip, and wondered, beholding the miracles and signs which were done.",pt:"E creu at\xe9 o pr\xf3prio Sim\xe3o e, sendo batizado, ficou de cont\xednuo com Filipe; e admirava-se, vendo os sinais e os grandes milagres que se faziam."},{verse:14,en:"Now when the apostles which were at Jerusalem heard that Samaria had received the word of God, they sent unto them Peter and John:",pt:"Os ap\xf3stolos, pois, que estavam em Jerusal\xe9m, tendo ouvido que os da Sam\xe1ria haviam recebido a palavra de Deus, enviaram-lhes Pedro e Jo\xe3o;"},{verse:15,en:"Who, when they were come down, prayed for them, that they might receive the Holy Ghost:",pt:"os quais, tendo descido, oraram por eles, para que recebessem o Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:16,en:"(For as yet he was fallen upon none of them: only they were baptized in the name of the Lord Jesus.)",pt:"Porque sobre nenhum deles havia ele descido ainda; mas somente tinham sido batizados em nome do Senhor Jesus."},{verse:17,en:"Then laid they their hands on them, and they received the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes impuseram as m\xe3os, e eles receberam o Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:18,en:"And when Simon saw that through laying on of the apostles\u2019 hands the Holy Ghost was given, he offered them money,",pt:"Quando Sim\xe3o viu que pela imposi\xe7\xe3o das m\xe3os dos ap\xf3stolos se dava o Esp\xedrito Santo, ofereceu-lhes dinheiro,"},{verse:19,en:"Saying, Give me also this power, that on whomsoever I lay hands, he may receive the Holy Ghost.",pt:"dizendo: Dai-me tamb\xe9m a mim esse poder, para que aquele sobre quem eu impuser as m\xe3os, receba o Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:20,en:"But Peter said unto him, Thy money perish with thee, because thou hast thought that the gift of God may be purchased with money.",pt:"Mas disse-lhe Pedro: V\xe1 tua prata contigo \xe0 perdi\xe7\xe3o, pois cuidaste adquirir com dinheiro o dom de Deus."},{verse:21,en:"Thou hast neither part nor lot in this matter: for thy heart is not right in the sight of God.",pt:"Tu n\xe3o tens parte nem sorte neste minist\xe9rio, porque o teu cora\xe7\xe3o n\xe3o \xe9 reto diante de Deus."},{verse:22,en:"Repent therefore of this thy wickedness, and pray God, if perhaps the thought of thine heart may be forgiven thee.",pt:"Arrepende-te, pois, dessa tua maldade, e roga ao Senhor para que porventura te seja perdoado o pensamento do teu cora\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:23,en:"For I perceive that thou art in the gall of bitterness, and in the bond of iniquity.",pt:"pois vejo que est\xe1s em fel de amargura, e em la\xe7os de iniquidade."},{verse:24,en:"Then answered Simon, and said, Pray ye to the Lord for me, that none of these things which ye have spoken come upon me.",pt:"Respondendo, por\xe9m, Sim\xe3o, disse: Rogai v\xf3s por mim ao Senhor, para que nada do que haveis dito venha sobre mim."},{verse:25,en:"And they, when they had testified and preached the word of the Lord, returned to Jerusalem, and preached the gospel in many villages of the Samaritans.",pt:"Eles, pois, havendo testificado e falado a palavra do Senhor, voltando para Jerusal\xe9m, evangelizavam muitas aldeias dos samaritanos."},{verse:26,en:"And the angel of the Lord spake unto Philip, saying, Arise, and go toward the south unto the way that goeth down from Jerusalem unto Gaza, which is desert.",pt:"Mas um anjo do Senhor falou a Filipe, dizendo: Levanta-te, e vai em dire\xe7\xe3o do sul pelo caminho que desce de Jerusal\xe9m a Gaza, o qual est\xe1 deserto."},{verse:27,en:"And he arose and went: and, behold, a man of Ethiopia, an eunuch of great authority under Candace queen of the Ethiopians, who had the charge of all her treasure, and had come to Jerusalem for to worship,",pt:"E levantou-se e foi; e eis que um et\xedope, eunuco, mordomo- mor de Candace, rainha dos et\xedopes, o qual era superintendente de todos os seus tesouros e tinha ido a Jerusal\xe9m para adorar,"},{verse:28,en:"Was returning, and sitting in his chariot read Esaias the prophet.",pt:"regressava e, sentado no seu carro, lia o profeta Isa\xedas."},{verse:29,en:"Then the Spirit said unto Philip, Go near, and join thyself to this chariot.",pt:"Disse o Esp\xedrito a Filipe: Chega-te e ajunta-te a esse carro."},{verse:30,en:"And Philip ran thither to him, and heard him read the prophet Esaias, and said, Understandest thou what thou readest?",pt:"E correndo Filipe, ouviu que lia o profeta Isa\xedas, e disse: Entendes, porventura, o que est\xe1s lendo?"},{verse:31,en:"And he said, How can I, except some man should guide me? And he desired Philip that he would come up and sit with him.",pt:"Ele respondeu: Pois como poderei entender, se algu\xe9m n\xe3o me ensinar? e rogou a Filipe que subisse e com ele se sentasse."},{verse:32,en:"The place of the scripture which he read was this, He was led as a sheep to the slaughter; and like a lamb dumb before his shearer, so opened he not his mouth:",pt:"Ora, a passagem da Escritura que estava lendo era esta: Foi levado como a ovelha ao matadouro, e, como est\xe1 mudo o cordeiro diante do que o tosquia, assim ele n\xe3o abre a sua boca."},{verse:33,en:"In his humiliation his judgment was taken away: and who shall declare his generation? for his life is taken from the earth.",pt:"Na sua humilha\xe7\xe3o foi tirado o seu julgamento; quem contar\xe1 a sua gera\xe7\xe3o? porque a sua vida \xe9 tirada da terra."},{verse:34,en:"And the eunuch answered Philip, and said, I pray thee, of whom speaketh the prophet this? of himself, or of some other man?",pt:"Respondendo o eunuco a Filipe, disse: Rogo-te, de quem diz isto o profeta? de si mesmo, ou de algum outro?"},{verse:35,en:"Then Philip opened his mouth, and began at the same scripture, and preached unto him Jesus.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Filipe tomou a palavra e, come\xe7ando por esta escritura, anunciou-lhe a Jesus."},{verse:36,en:"And as they went on their way, they came unto a certain water: and the eunuch said, See, here is water; what doth hinder me to be baptized?",pt:"E indo eles caminhando, chegaram a um lugar onde havia \xe1gua, e disse o eunuco: Eis aqui \xe1gua; que impede que eu seja batizado?"},{verse:37,en:"And Philip said, If thou believest with all thine heart, thou mayest. And he answered and said, I believe that Jesus Christ is the Son of God.",pt:"[E disse Felipe: \xe9 l\xedcito, se cr\xeas de todo o cora\xe7\xe3o. E, respondendo ele, disse: Creio que Jesus Cristo \xe9 o Filho de Deus.]"},{verse:38,en:"And he commanded the chariot to stand still: and they went down both into the water, both Philip and the eunuch; and he baptized him.",pt:"mandou parar o carro, e desceram ambos \xe0 \xe1gua, tanto Filipe como o eunuco, e Filipe o batizou."},{verse:39,en:"And when they were come up out of the water, the Spirit of the Lord caught away Philip, that the eunuch saw him no more: and he went on his way rejoicing.",pt:"Quando sa\xedram da \xe1gua, o Esp\xedrito do Senhor arrebatou a Filipe, e n\xe3o o viu mais o eunuco, que jubiloso seguia o seu caminho."},{verse:40,en:"But Philip was found at Azotus: and passing through he preached in all the cities, till he came to Caesarea.",pt:"Mas Filipe achou-se em Azoto e, indo passando, evangelizava todas as cidades, at\xe9 que chegou a Cesar\xe9ia."}]}}),813,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And Saul, yet breathing out threatenings and slaughter against the disciples of the Lord, went unto the high priest,",pt:"Saulo, por\xe9m, respirando ainda amea\xe7as e mortes contra os disc\xedpulos do Senhor, dirigiu-se ao sumo sacerdote,"},{verse:2,en:"And desired of him letters to Damascus to the synagogues, that if he found any of this way, whether they were men or women, he might bring them bound unto Jerusalem.",pt:"e pediu-lhe cartas para Damasco, para as sinagogas, a fim de que, caso encontrasse alguns do Caminho, quer homens quer mulheres, os conduzisse presos a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:3,en:"And as he journeyed, he came near Damascus: and suddenly there shined round about him a light from heaven:",pt:"Mas, seguindo ele viagem e aproximando-se de Damasco, subitamente o cercou um resplendor de luz do c\xe9u;"},{verse:4,en:"And he fell to the earth, and heard a voice saying unto him, Saul, Saul, why persecutest thou me?",pt:"e, caindo por terra, ouviu uma voz que lhe dizia: Saulo, Saulo, por que me persegues?"},{verse:5,en:"And he said, Who art thou, Lord? And the Lord said, I am Jesus whom thou persecutest: it is hard for thee to kick against the pricks.",pt:"Ele perguntou: Quem \xe9s tu, Senhor? Respondeu o Senhor: Eu sou Jesus, a quem tu persegues;"},{verse:6,en:"And he trembling and astonished said, Lord, what wilt thou have me to do? And the Lord said unto him, Arise, and go into the city, and it shall be told thee what thou must do.",pt:"mas levanta-te e entra na cidade, e l\xe1 te ser\xe1 dito o que te cumpre fazer."},{verse:7,en:"And the men which journeyed with him stood speechless, hearing a voice, but seeing no man.",pt:"Os homens que viajavam com ele quedaram-se emudecidos, ouvindo, na verdade, a voz, mas n\xe3o vendo ningu\xe9m."},{verse:8,en:"And Saul arose from the earth; and when his eyes were opened, he saw no man: but they led him by the hand, and brought him into Damascus.",pt:"Saulo levantou-se da terra e, abrindo os olhos, n\xe3o via coisa alguma; e, guiando-o pela m\xe3o, conduziram-no a Damasco."},{verse:9,en:"And he was three days without sight, and neither did eat nor drink.",pt:"E esteve tr\xeas dias sem ver, e n\xe3o comeu nem bebeu."},{verse:10,en:"And there was a certain disciple at Damascus, named Ananias; and to him said the Lord in a vision, Ananias. And he said, Behold, I am here, Lord.",pt:"Ora, havia em Damasco certo disc\xedpulo chamado Ananias; e disse-lhe o Senhor em vis\xe3o: Ananias! Respondeu ele: Eis-me aqui, Senhor."},{verse:11,en:"And the Lord said unto him, Arise, and go into the street which is called Straight, and enquire in the house of Judas for one called Saul, of Tarsus: for, behold, he prayeth,",pt:"Ordenou-lhe o Senhor: Levanta-te, vai \xe0 rua chamada Direita e procura em casa de Judas um homem de Tarso chamado Saulo; pois eis que ele est\xe1 orando;"},{verse:12,en:"And hath seen in a vision a man named Ananias coming in, and putting his hand on him, that he might receive his sight.",pt:"e viu um homem chamado Ananias entrar e impor-lhe as m\xe3os, para que recuperasse a vista."},{verse:13,en:"Then Ananias answered, Lord, I have heard by many of this man, how much evil he hath done to thy saints at Jerusalem:",pt:"Respondeu Ananias: Senhor, a muitos ouvi acerca desse homem, quantos males tem feito aos teus santos em Jerusal\xe9m;"},{verse:14,en:"And here he hath authority from the chief priests to bind all that call on thy name.",pt:"e aqui tem poder dos principais sacerdotes para prender a todos os que invocam o teu nome."},{verse:15,en:"But the Lord said unto him, Go thy way: for he is a chosen vessel unto me, to bear my name before the Gentiles, and kings, and the children of Israel:",pt:"Disse-lhe, por\xe9m, o Senhor: Vai, porque este \xe9 para mim um vaso escolhido, para levar o meu nome perante os gentios, e os reis, e os filhos de Israel;"},{verse:16,en:"For I will shew him how great things he must suffer for my name\u2019s sake.",pt:"pois eu lhe mostrarei quanto lhe cumpre padecer pelo meu nome."},{verse:17,en:"And Ananias went his way, and entered into the house; and putting his hands on him said, Brother Saul, the Lord, even Jesus, that appeared unto thee in the way as thou camest, hath sent me, that thou mightest receive thy sight, and be filled with the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Partiu Ananias e entrou na casa e, impondo-lhe as m\xe3os, disse: Irm\xe3o Saulo, o Senhor Jesus, que te apareceu no caminho por onde vinhas, enviou-me para que tornes a ver e sejas cheio do Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:18,en:"And immediately there fell from his eyes as it had been scales: and he received sight forthwith, and arose, and was baptized.",pt:"Logo lhe ca\xedram dos olhos como que umas escamas, e recuperou a vista: ent\xe3o, levantando-se, foi batizado."},{verse:19,en:"And when he had received meat, he was strengthened. Then was Saul certain days with the disciples which were at Damascus.",pt:"E, tendo tomado alimento, ficou fortalecido. Depois demorou- se alguns dias com os disc!pulos que estavam em Damasco;"},{verse:20,en:"And straightway he preached Christ in the synagogues, that he is the Son of God.",pt:"e logo nas sinagogas pregava a Jesus, que este era o filho de Deus."},{verse:21,en:"But all that heard him were amazed, and said; Is not this he that destroyed them which called on this name in Jerusalem, and came hither for that intent, that he might bring them bound unto the chief priests?",pt:"Todos os seus ouvintes pasmavam e diziam: N\xe3o \xe9 este o que em Jerusal\xe9m perseguia os que invocavam esse nome, e para isso veio aqui, para os levar presos aos principais sacerdotes?"},{verse:22,en:"But Saul increased the more in strength, and confounded the Jews which dwelt at Damascus, proving that this is very Christ.",pt:"Saulo, por\xe9m, se fortalecia cada vez mais e confundia os judeus que habitavam em Damasco, provando que Jesus era o Cristo."},{verse:23,en:"And after that many days were fulfilled, the Jews took counsel to kill him:",pt:"Decorridos muitos dias, os judeus deliberaram entre si mat\xe1- lo."},{verse:24,en:"But their laying await was known of Saul. And they watched the gates day and night to kill him.",pt:"Mas as suas ciladas vieram ao conhecimento de Saulo. E como eles guardavam as portas de dia e de noite para tirar-lhe a vida,"},{verse:25,en:"Then the disciples took him by night, and let him down by the wall in a basket.",pt:"os disc\xedpulos, tomando-o de noite, desceram-no pelo muro, dentro de um cesto."},{verse:26,en:"And when Saul was come to Jerusalem, he assayed to join himself to the disciples: but they were all afraid of him, and believed not that he was a disciple.",pt:"Tendo Saulo chegado a Jerusal\xe9m, procurava juntar-se aos disc\xedpulos; mas todos o temiam, n\xe3o crendo que fosse disc\xedpulo."},{verse:27,en:"But Barnabas took him, and brought him to the apostles, and declared unto them how he had seen the Lord in the way, and that he had spoken to him, and how he had preached boldly at Damascus in the name of Jesus.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Barnab\xe9, tomando-o consigo, o levou aos ap\xf3stolos, e lhes contou como no caminho ele vira o Senhor e que este lhe falara, e como em Damasco pregara ousadamente em nome de Jesus."},{verse:28,en:"And he was with them coming in and going out at Jerusalem.",pt:"Assim andava com eles em Jerusal\xe9m, entrando e saindo,"},{verse:29,en:"And he spake boldly in the name of the Lord Jesus, and disputed against the Grecians: but they went about to slay him.",pt:"e pregando ousadamente em nome do Senhor. Falava e disputava tamb\xe9m com os helenistas; mas procuravam mat\xe1-lo."},{verse:30,en:"Which when the brethren knew, they brought him down to Caesarea, and sent him forth to Tarsus.",pt:"Os irm\xe3os, por\xe9m, quando o souberam, acompanharam-no at\xe9 Cesar\xe9ia e o enviaram a Tarso."},{verse:31,en:"Then had the churches rest throughout all Judaea and Galilee and Samaria, and were edified; and walking in the fear of the Lord, and in the comfort of the Holy Ghost, were multiplied.",pt:"Assim, pois, a igreja em toda a Jud\xe9ia, Galil\xe9ia e Sam\xe1ria, tinha paz, sendo edificada, e andando no temor do Senhor; e, pelo aux\xedlio do Esp\xedrito Santo, se multiplicava."},{verse:32,en:"And it came to pass, as Peter passed throughout all quarters, he came down also to the saints which dwelt at Lydda.",pt:"E aconteceu que, passando Pedro por toda parte, veio tamb\xe9m aos santos que habitavam em Lida."},{verse:33,en:"And there he found a certain man named Aeneas, which had kept his bed eight years, and was sick of the palsy.",pt:"Achou ali certo homem, chamado En\xe9ias, que havia oito anos jazia numa cama, porque era paral\xedtico."},{verse:34,en:"And Peter said unto him, Aeneas, Jesus Christ maketh thee whole: arise, and make thy bed. And he arose immediately.",pt:"Disse-lhe Pedro: En\xe9ias, Jesus Cristo te cura; levanta e faze a tua cama. E logo se levantou."},{verse:35,en:"And all that dwelt at Lydda and Saron saw him, and turned to the Lord.",pt:"E viram-no todos os que habitavam em Lida e Sarona, os quais se converteram ao Senhor."},{verse:36,en:"Now there was at Joppa a certain disciple named Tabitha, which by interpretation is called Dorcas: this woman was full of good works and almsdeeds which she did.",pt:"Havia em Jope uma disc\xedpula por nome Tabita, que traduzido quer dizer Dorcas, a qual estava cheia de boas obras e esmolas que fazia."},{verse:37,en:"And it came to pass in those days, that she was sick, and died: whom when they had washed, they laid her in an upper chamber.",pt:"Ora, aconteceu naqueles dias que ela, adoecendo, morreu; e, tendo-a lavado, a colocaram no cen\xe1culo."},{verse:38,en:"And forasmuch as Lydda was nigh to Joppa, and the disciples had heard that Peter was there, they sent unto him two men, desiring him that he would not delay to come to them.",pt:"Como Lida era perto de Jope, ouvindo os disc\xedpulos que Pedro estava ali, enviaram-lhe dois homens, rogando-lhe: N\xe3o te demores em vir ter conosco."},{verse:39,en:"Then Peter arose and went with them. When he was come, they brought him into the upper chamber: and all the widows stood by him weeping, and shewing the coats and garments which Dorcas made, while she was with them.",pt:"Pedro levantou-se e foi com eles; quando chegou, levaram-no ao cen\xe1ulo; e todas as vi\xfavas o cercaram, chorando e mostrando-lhe as t\xfanicas e vestidos que Dorcas fizera enquanto estava com elas."},{verse:40,en:"But Peter put them all forth, and kneeled down, and prayed; and turning him to the body said, Tabitha, arise. And she opened her eyes: and when she saw Peter, she sat up.",pt:"Mas Pedro, tendo feito sair a todos, p\xf4s-se de joelhos e orou; e voltando-se para o corpo, disse: Tabita, levanta-te. Ela abriu os olhos e, vendo a Pedro, sentou-se."},{verse:41,en:"And he gave her his hand, and lifted her up, and when he had called the saints and widows, presented her alive.",pt:"Ele, dando-lhe a m\xe3o, levantou-a e, chamando os santos e as vi\xfavas, apresentou-lha viva."},{verse:42,en:"And it was known throughout all Joppa; and many believed in the Lord.",pt:"Tornou-se isto not\xf3rio por toda a Jope, e muitos creram no Senhor."},{verse:43,en:"And it came to pass, that he tarried many days in Joppa with one Simon a tanner.",pt:"Pedro ficou muitos dias em Jope, em casa de um curtidor chamado Sim\xe3o."}]}}),814,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"There was a certain man in Caesarea called Cornelius, a centurion of the band called the Italian band,",pt:"Um homem em Cesar\xe9ia, por nome Corn\xe9lio, centuri\xe3o da coorte chamada italiana,"},{verse:2,en:"A devout man, and one that feared God with all his house, which gave much alms to the people, and prayed to God alway.",pt:"piedoso e temente a Deus com toda a sua casa, e que fazia muitas esmolas ao povo e de cont\xednuo orava a Deus,"},{verse:3,en:"He saw in a vision evidently about the ninth hour of the day an angel of God coming in to him, and saying unto him, Cornelius.",pt:"cerca da hora nona do dia, viu claramente em vis\xe3o um anjo de Deus, que se dirigia para ele e lhe dizia: Corn\xe9lio!"},{verse:4,en:"And when he looked on him, he was afraid, and said, What is it, Lord? And he said unto him, Thy prayers and thine alms are come up for a memorial before God.",pt:"Este, fitando nele os olhos e atemorizado, perguntou: Que \xe9, Senhor? O anjo respondeu-lhe: As tuas ora\xe7\xf5es e as tuas esmolas t\xeam subido para mem\xf3ria diante de Deus;"},{verse:5,en:"And now send men to Joppa, and call for one Simon, whose surname is Peter:",pt:"agora, pois, envia homens a Jope e manda chamar a Sim\xe3o, que tem por sobrenome Pedro;"},{verse:6,en:"He lodgeth with one Simon a tanner, whose house is by the sea side: he shall tell thee what thou oughtest to do.",pt:"este se acha hospedado com um certo Sim\xe3o, curtidor, cuja casa fica \xe0 beira-mar. [Ele te dir\xe1 o que deves fazer.]"},{verse:7,en:"And when the angel which spake unto Cornelius was departed, he called two of his household servants, and a devout soldier of them that waited on him continually;",pt:"Logo que se retirou o anjo que lhe falava, Corn\xe9lio chamou dois dos seus dom\xe9sticos e um piedoso soldado dos que estavam a seu servi\xe7o;"},{verse:8,en:"And when he had declared all these things unto them, he sent them to Joppa.",pt:"e, havendo contado tudo, os enviou a Jope."},{verse:9,en:"On the morrow, as they went on their journey, and drew nigh unto the city, Peter went up upon the housetop to pray about the sixth hour:",pt:"No dia seguinte, indo eles seu caminho e estando j\xe1 perto da cidade, subiu Pedro ao eirado para orar, cerca de hora sexta."},{verse:10,en:"And he became very hungry, and would have eaten: but while they made ready, he fell into a trance,",pt:"E tendo fome, quis comer; mas enquanto lhe preparavam a comida, sobreveio-lhe um \xeaxtase,"},{verse:11,en:"And saw heaven opened, and a certain vessel descending unto him, as it had been a great sheet knit at the four corners, and let down to the earth:",pt:"e via o c\xe9u aberto e um objeto descendo, como se fosse um grande len\xe7ol, sendo baixado pelas quatro pontas sobre a terra,"},{verse:12,en:"Wherein were all manner of fourfooted beasts of the earth, and wild beasts, and creeping things, and fowls of the air.",pt:"no qual havia de todos os quadr\xfapedes e r\xe9pteis da terra e aves do c\xe9u."},{verse:13,en:"And there came a voice to him, Rise, Peter; kill, and eat.",pt:"E uma voz lhe disse: Levanta-te, Pedro, mata e come."},{verse:14,en:"But Peter said, Not so, Lord; for I have never eaten any thing that is common or unclean.",pt:"Mas Pedro respondeu: De modo nenhum, Senhor, porque nunca comi coisa alguma comum e imunda."},{verse:15,en:"And the voice spake unto him again the second time, What God hath cleansed, that call not thou common.",pt:"Pela segunda vez lhe falou a voz: N\xe3o chames tu comum ao que Deus purificou."},{verse:16,en:"This was done thrice: and the vessel was received up again into heaven.",pt:"Sucedeu isto por tr\xeas vezes; e logo foi o objeto recolhido ao c\xe9u."},{verse:17,en:"Now while Peter doubted in himself what this vision which he had seen should mean, behold, the men which were sent from Cornelius had made enquiry for Simon\u2019s house, and stood before the gate,",pt:"Enquanto Pedro refletia, perplexo, sobre o que seria a vis\xe3o que tivera, eis que os homens enviados por Corn\xe9lio, tendo perguntado pela casa de Sim\xe3o, pararam \xe0 porta."},{verse:18,en:"And called, and asked whether Simon, which was surnamed Peter, were lodged there.",pt:"E, chamando, indagavam se ali estava hospedado Sim\xe3o, que tinha por sobrenome Pedro."},{verse:19,en:"While Peter thought on the vision, the Spirit said unto him, Behold, three men seek thee.",pt:"Estando Pedro ainda a meditar sobre a vis\xe3o, o Esp\xedrito lhe disse: Eis que dois homens te procuram."},{verse:20,en:"Arise therefore, and get thee down, and go with them, doubting nothing: for I have sent them.",pt:"Levanta-te, pois, desce e vai com eles, nada duvidando; porque eu tos enviei."},{verse:21,en:"Then Peter went down to the men which were sent unto him from Cornelius; and said, Behold, I am he whom ye seek: what is the cause wherefore ye are come?",pt:"E descendo Pedro ao encontro desses homens, disse: Sou eu a quem procurais; qual \xe9 a causa por que viestes?"},{verse:22,en:"And they said, Cornelius the centurion, a just man, and one that feareth God, and of good report among all the nation of the Jews, was warned from God by an holy angel to send for thee into his house, and to hear words of thee.",pt:"Eles responderam: O centuri\xe3o Corn\xe9lio, homem justo e temente a Deus e que tem bom testemunho de toda a na\xe7\xe3o judaica, foi avisado por um santo anjo para te chamar \xe0 sua casa e ouvir as tuas palavras."},{verse:23,en:"Then called he them in, and lodged them. And on the morrow Peter went away with them, and certain brethren from Joppa accompanied him.",pt:"Pedro, pois, convidando-os a entrar, os hospedou. No dia seguinte levantou-se e partiu com eles, e alguns irm\xe3os, dentre os de Jope, o acompanharam."},{verse:24,en:"And the morrow after they entered into Caesarea. And Cornelius waited for them, and had called together his kinsmen and near friends.",pt:"No outro dia entrou em Cesar\xe9ia. E Corn\xe9lio os esperava, tendo reunido os seus parentes e amigos mais \xedntimos."},{verse:25,en:"And as Peter was coming in, Cornelius met him, and fell down at his feet, and worshipped him.",pt:"Quando Pedro ia entrar, veio-lhe Corn\xe9lio ao encontro e, prostrando-se a seus p\xe9s, o adorou."},{verse:26,en:"But Peter took him up, saying, Stand up; I myself also am a man.",pt:"Mas Pedro o ergueu, dizendo: Levanta-te, que eu tamb\xe9m sou homem."},{verse:27,en:"And as he talked with him, he went in, and found many that were come together.",pt:"E conversando com ele, entrou e achou muitos reunidos,"},{verse:28,en:"And he said unto them, Ye know how that it is an unlawful thing for a man that is a Jew to keep company, or come unto one of another nation; but God hath shewed me that I should not call any man common or unclean.",pt:"e disse-lhes: V\xf3s bem sabeis que n\xe3o \xe9 l\xedcito a um judeu ajuntar-se ou chegar-se a estrangeiros; mas Deus mostrou-me que a nenhum homem devo chamar comum ou imundo;"},{verse:29,en:"Therefore came I unto you without gainsaying, as soon as I was sent for: I ask therefore for what intent ye have sent for me?",pt:"pelo que, sendo chamado, vim sem obje\xe7\xe3o. Pergunto pois: Por que raz\xe3o mandastes chamar-me?"},{verse:30,en:"And Cornelius said, Four days ago I was fasting until this hour; and at the ninth hour I prayed in my house, and, behold, a man stood before me in bright clothing,",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse Corn\xe9lio: Faz agora quatro dias que eu estava orando em minha casa \xe0 hora nona, e eis que diante de mim se apresentou um homem com vestiduras resplandescentes,"},{verse:31,en:"And said, Cornelius, thy prayer is heard, and thine alms are had in remembrance in the sight of God.",pt:"e disse: Corn\xe9lio, a tua ora\xe7\xe3o foi ouvida, e as tuas esmolas est\xe3o em mem\xf3ria diante de Deus."},{verse:32,en:"Send therefore to Joppa, and call hither Simon, whose surname is Peter; he is lodged in the house of one Simon a tanner by the sea side: who, when he cometh, shall speak unto thee.",pt:"Envia, pois, a Jope e manda chamar a Sim\xe3o, que tem por sobrenome Pedro; ele est\xe1 hospedado em casa de Sim\xe3o, curtidor, \xe0 beira-mar."},{verse:33,en:"Immediately therefore I sent to thee; and thou hast well done that thou art come. Now therefore are we all here present before God, to hear all things that are commanded thee of God.",pt:"Portanto mandei logo chamar-te, e bem fizeste em vir. Agora pois estamos todos aqui presentes diante de Deus, para ouvir tudo quanto te foi ordenado pelo Senhor."},{verse:34,en:"Then Peter opened his mouth, and said, Of a truth I perceive that God is no respecter of persons:",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pedro, tomando a palavra, disse: Na verdade reconhe\xe7o que Deus n\xe3o faz acep\xe7\xe3o de pessoas;"},{verse:35,en:"But in every nation he that feareth him, and worketh righteousness, is accepted with him.",pt:"mas que lhe \xe9 aceit\xe1vel aquele que, em qualquer na\xe7\xe3o, o teme e pratica o que \xe9 justo."},{verse:36,en:"The word which God sent unto the children of Israel, preaching peace by Jesus Christ: (he is Lord of all:)",pt:"A palavra que ele enviou aos filhos de Israel, anunciando a paz por Jesus Cristo (este \xe9 o Senhor de todos) -"},{verse:37,en:"That word, I say, ye know, which was published throughout all Judaea, and began from Galilee, after the baptism which John preached;",pt:"esta palavra, v\xf3s bem sabeis, foi proclamada por toda a Jud\xe9ia, come\xe7ando pela Galil\xe9ia, depois do batismo que Jo\xe3o pregou,"},{verse:38,en:"How God anointed Jesus of Nazareth with the Holy Ghost and with power: who went about doing good, and healing all that were oppressed of the devil; for God was with him.",pt:"concernente a Jesus de Nazar\xe9, como Deus o ungiu com o Esp\xedrito Santo e com poder; o qual andou por toda parte, fazendo o bem e curando a todos os oprimidos do Diabo, porque Deus era com ele."},{verse:39,en:"And we are witnesses of all things which he did both in the land of the Jews, and in Jerusalem; whom they slew and hanged on a tree:",pt:"N\xf3s somos testemunhas de tudo quanto fez, tanto na terra dos judeus como em Jerusal\xe9m; ao qual mataram, pendurando-o num madeiro."},{verse:40,en:"Him God raised up the third day, and shewed him openly;",pt:"A este ressuscitou Deus ao terceiro dia e lhe concedeu que se manifestasse,"},{verse:41,en:"Not to all the people, but unto witnesses chosen before of God, even to us, who did eat and drink with him after he rose from the dead.",pt:"n\xe3o a todo povo, mas \xe0s testemunhas predeterminadas por Deus, a n\xf3s, que comemos e bebemos juntamente com ele depois que ressurgiu dentre os mortos;"},{verse:42,en:"And he commanded us to preach unto the people, and to testify that it is he which was ordained of God to be the Judge of quick and dead.",pt:"este nos mandou pregar ao povo, e testificar que ele \xe9 o que por Deus foi constitu\xeddo juiz dos vivos e dos mortos."},{verse:43,en:"To him give all the prophets witness, that through his name whosoever believeth in him shall receive remission of sins.",pt:"A ele todos os profetas d\xe3o testemunho de que todo o que nele cr\xea receber\xe1 a remiss\xe3o dos pecados pelo seu nome."},{verse:44,en:"While Peter yet spake these words, the Holy Ghost fell on all them which heard the word.",pt:"Enquanto Pedro ainda dizia estas coisas, desceu o Esp\xedrito Santo sobre todos os que ouviam a palavra."},{verse:45,en:"And they of the circumcision which believed were astonished, as many as came with Peter, because that on the Gentiles also was poured out the gift of the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Os crentes que eram de circuncis\xe3o, todos quantos tinham vindo com Pedro, maravilharam-se de que tamb\xe9m sobre os gentios se derramasse o dom do Esp\xedrito Santo;"},{verse:46,en:"For they heard them speak with tongues, and magnify God. Then answered Peter,",pt:"porque os ouviam falar l\xednguas e magnificar a Deus."},{verse:47,en:"Can any man forbid water, that these should not be baptized, which have received the Holy Ghost as well as we?",pt:"Respondeu ent\xe3o Pedro: Pode algu\xe9m porventura recusar a \xe1gua para que n\xe3o sejam batizados estes que tamb\xe9m, como n\xf3s, receberam o Esp\xedrito Santo?"},{verse:48,en:"And he commanded them to be baptized in the name of the Lord. Then prayed they him to tarry certain days.",pt:"Mandou, pois, que fossem batizados em nome de Jesus Cristo. Ent\xe3o lhe rogaram que ficasse com eles por alguns dias."}]}}),815,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And the apostles and brethren that were in Judaea heard that the Gentiles had also received the word of God.",pt:"Ora, ouviram os ap\xf3stolos e os irm\xe3os que estavam na Jud\xe9ia que tamb\xe9m os gentios haviam recebido a palavra de Deus."},{verse:2,en:"And when Peter was come up to Jerusalem, they that were of the circumcision contended with him,",pt:"E quando Pedro subiu a Jerusal\xe9m, disputavam com ele os que eram da circuncis\xe3o,"},{verse:3,en:"Saying, Thou wentest in to men uncircumcised, and didst eat with them.",pt:"dizendo: Entraste em casa de homens incircuncisos e comeste com eles."},{verse:4,en:"But Peter rehearsed the matter from the beginning, and expounded it by order unto them, saying,",pt:"Pedro, por\xe9m, come\xe7ou a fazer-lhes uma exposi\xe7\xe3o por ordem, dizendo:"},{verse:5,en:"I was in the city of Joppa praying: and in a trance I saw a vision, A certain vessel descend, as it had been a great sheet, let down from heaven by four corners; and it came even to me:",pt:"Estava eu orando na cidade de Jope, e em \xeaxtase tive uma vis\xe3o; descia um objeto, como se fosse um grande len\xe7ol, sendo baixado do c\xe9u pelas quatro pontas, e chegou perto de mim."},{verse:6,en:"Upon the which when I had fastened mine eyes, I considered, and saw fourfooted beasts of the earth, and wild beasts, and creeping things, and fowls of the air.",pt:"E, fitando nele os olhos, o contemplava, e vi quadr\xfapedes da terra, feras, r\xe9pteis e aves do c\xe9u."},{verse:7,en:"And I heard a voice saying unto me, Arise, Peter; slay and eat.",pt:"Ouvi tamb\xe9m uma voz que me dizia: Levanta-te, Pedro, mata e come."},{verse:8,en:"But I said, Not so, Lord: for nothing common or unclean hath at any time entered into my mouth.",pt:"Mas eu respondi: De modo nenhum, Senhor, pois nunca em minha boca entrou coisa alguma comum e imunda."},{verse:9,en:"But the voice answered me again from heaven, What God hath cleansed, that call not thou common.",pt:"Mas a voz respondeu-me do c\xe9u segunda vez: N\xe3o chames tu comum ao que Deus purificou."},{verse:10,en:"And this was done three times: and all were drawn up again into heaven.",pt:"Sucedeu isto por tr\xeas vezes; e tudo tornou a recolher-se ao c\xe9u."},{verse:11,en:"And, behold, immediately there were three men already come unto the house where I was, sent from Caesarea unto me.",pt:"E eis que, nesse momento, pararam em frente \xe0 casa onde est\xe1vamos tr\xeas homens que me foram enviados de Cesar\xe9ia."},{verse:12,en:"And the spirit bade me go with them, nothing doubting. Moreover these six brethren accompanied me, and we entered into the man\u2019s house:",pt:"Disse-me o Esp\xedrito que eu fosse com eles, sem hesitar; e tamb\xe9m estes seis irm\xe3os foram comigo e entramos na casa daquele homem."},{verse:13,en:"And he shewed us how he had seen an angel in his house, which stood and said unto him, Send men to Joppa, and call for Simon, whose surname is Peter;",pt:"E ele nos contou como vira em p\xe9 em sua casa o anjo, que lhe dissera: Envia a Jope e manda chamar a Sim\xe3o, que tem por sobrenome Pedro,"},{verse:14,en:"Who shall tell thee words, whereby thou and all thy house shall be saved.",pt:"o qual te dir\xe1 palavras pelas quais ser\xe1s salvo, tu e toda a tua casa."},{verse:15,en:"And as I began to speak, the Holy Ghost fell on them, as on us at the beginning.",pt:"Logo que eu comecei a falar, desceu sobre eles o Esp\xedrito Santo, como tamb\xe9m sobre n\xf3s no princ\xedpio."},{verse:16,en:"Then remembered I the word of the Lord, how that he said, John indeed baptized with water; but ye shall be baptized with the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Lembrei-me ent\xe3o da palavra do Senhor, como disse: Jo\xe3o, na verdade, batizou com \xe1gua; mas v\xf3s sereis batizados no Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:17,en:"Forasmuch then as God gave them the like gift as he did unto us, who believed on the Lord Jesus Christ; what was I, that I could withstand God?",pt:"Portanto, se Deus lhes deu o mesmo dom que dera tamb\xe9m a n\xf3s, ao crermos no Senhor Jesus Cristo, quem era eu, para que pudesse resistir a Deus?"},{verse:18,en:"When they heard these things, they held their peace, and glorified God, saying, Then hath God also to the Gentiles granted repentance unto life.",pt:"Ouvindo eles estas coisas, apaziguaram-se e glorificaram a Deus, dizendo: Assim, pois, Deus concedeu tamb\xe9m aos gentios o arrependimento para a vida."},{verse:19,en:"Now they which were scattered abroad upon the persecution that arose about Stephen travelled as far as Phenice, and Cyprus, and Antioch, preaching the word to none but unto the Jews only.",pt:"Aqueles, pois, que foram dispersos pela tribula\xe7\xe3o suscitada por causa de Est\xeav\xe3o, passaram at\xe9 a Fen\xedcia, Chipre e Antioquia, n\xe3o anunciando a ningu\xe9m a palavra, sen\xe3o somente aos judeus."},{verse:20,en:"And some of them were men of Cyprus and Cyrene, which, when they were come to Antioch, spake unto the Grecians, preaching the Lord Jesus.",pt:"Havia, por\xe9m, entre eles alguns c\xedprios e cirenenses, os quais, entrando em Antioquia, falaram tamb\xe9m aos gregos, anunciando o Senhor Jesus."},{verse:21,en:"And the hand of the Lord was with them: and a great number believed, and turned unto the Lord.",pt:"E a m\xe3o do Senhor era com eles, e grande n\xfamero creu e se converteu ao Senhor."},{verse:22,en:"Then tidings of these things came unto the ears of the church which was in Jerusalem: and they sent forth Barnabas, that he should go as far as Antioch.",pt:"Chegou a not\xedcia destas coisas aos ouvidos da igreja em Jerusal\xe9m; e enviaram Barnab\xe9 a Antioquia;"},{verse:23,en:"Who, when he came, and had seen the grace of God, was glad, and exhorted them all, that with purpose of heart they would cleave unto the Lord.",pt:"o qual, quando chegou e viu a gra\xe7a de Deus, se alegrou, e exortava a todos a perseverarem no Senhor com firmeza de cora\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:24,en:"For he was a good man, and full of the Holy Ghost and of faith: and much people was added unto the Lord.",pt:"porque era homem de bem, e cheio do Esp\xedrito Santo e de f\xe9. E muita gente se uniu ao Senhor."},{verse:25,en:"Then departed Barnabas to Tarsus, for to seek Saul:",pt:"Partiu, pois, Barnab\xe9 para Tarso, em busca de Saulo;"},{verse:26,en:"And when he had found him, he brought him unto Antioch. And it came to pass, that a whole year they assembled themselves with the church, and taught much people. And the disciples were called Christians first in Antioch.",pt:"e tendo-o achado, o levou para Antioquia. E durante um ano inteiro reuniram-se naquela igreja e instru\xedram muita gente; e em Antioquia os disc\xedpulos pela primeira vez foram chamados crist\xe3os."},{verse:27,en:"And in these days came prophets from Jerusalem unto Antioch.",pt:"Naqueles dias desceram profetas de Jerusal\xe9m para Antioquia;"},{verse:28,en:"And there stood up one of them named Agabus, and signified by the spirit that there should be great dearth throughout all the world: which came to pass in the days of Claudius Caesar.",pt:"e levantando-se um deles, de nome \xc1gabo, dava a entender pelo Esp\xedrito, que haveria uma grande fome por todo o mundo, a qual ocorreu no tempo de Cl\xe1udio."},{verse:29,en:"Then the disciples, every man according to his ability, determined to send relief unto the brethren which dwelt in Judaea:",pt:"E os disc\xedpulos resolveram mandar, cada um conforme suas posses, socorro aos irm\xe3os que habitavam na Jud\xe9ia;"},{verse:30,en:"Which also they did, and sent it to the elders by the hands of Barnabas and Saul.",pt:"o que eles com efeito fizeram, enviando-o aos anci\xe3os por m\xe3o de Barnab\xe9 e Saulo."}]}}),816,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,d){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now about that time Herod the king stretched forth his hands to vex certain of the church.",pt:"Por aquele mesmo tempo o rei Herodes estendeu as m\xe3os sobre alguns da igreja, para os maltratar;"},{verse:2,en:"And he killed James the brother of John with the sword.",pt:"e matou \xe0 espada Tiago, irm\xe3o de Jo\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"And because he saw it pleased the Jews, he proceeded further to take Peter also. (Then were the days of unleavened bread.)",pt:"Vendo que isso agradava aos judeus, continuou, mandando prender tamb\xe9m a Pedro. (Eram ent\xe3o os dias dos p\xe3es \xe1zimos.)"},{verse:4,en:"And when he had apprehended him, he put him in prison, and delivered him to four quaternions of soldiers to keep him; intending after Easter to bring him forth to the people.",pt:"E, havendo-o prendido, lan\xe7ou-o na pris\xe3o, entregando-o a quatro grupos de quatro soldados cada um para o guardarem, tencionando apresent\xe1-lo ao povo depois da p\xe1scoa."},{verse:5,en:"Peter therefore was kept in prison: but prayer was made without ceasing of the church unto God for him.",pt:"Pedro, pois, estava guardado na pris\xe3o; mas a igreja orava com insist\xeancia a Deus por ele."},{verse:6,en:"And when Herod would have brought him forth, the same night Peter was sleeping between two soldiers, bound with two chains: and the keepers before the door kept the prison.",pt:"Ora quando Herodes estava para apresent\xe1-lo, nessa mesma noite estava Pedro dormindo entre dois soldados, acorrentado com duas cadeias e as sentinelas diante da porta guardavam a pris\xe3o."},{verse:7,en:"And, behold, the angel of the Lord came upon him, and a light shined in the prison: and he smote Peter on the side, and raised him up, saying, Arise up quickly. And his chains fell off from his hands.",pt:"E eis que sobreveio um anjo do Senhor, e uma luz resplandeceu na pris\xe3o; e ele, tocando no lado de Pedro, o despertou, dizendo: Levanta-te depressa. E ca\xedram-lhe das m\xe3os as cadeias."},{verse:8,en:"And the angel said unto him, Gird thyself, and bind on thy sandals. And so he did. And he saith unto him, Cast thy garment about thee, and follow me.",pt:"Disse-lhe ainda o anjo: Cinge-te e cal\xe7a as tuas sand\xe1lias. E ele o fez. Disse-lhe mais; Cobre-te com a tua capa e segue-me."},{verse:9,en:"And he went out, and followed him; and wist not that it was true which was done by the angel; but thought he saw a vision.",pt:"Pedro, saindo, o seguia, mesmo sem compreender que era real o que se fazia por interm\xe9dio de um anjo, julgando que era uma vis\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"When they were past the first and the second ward, they came unto the iron gate that leadeth unto the city; which opened to them of his own accord: and they went out, and passed on through one street; and forthwith the angel departed from him.",pt:"Depois de terem passado a primeira e a segunda sentinela, chegaram \xe0 porta de ferro, que d\xe1 para a cidade, a qual se lhes abriu por si mesma; e tendo sa\xeddo, passaram uma rua, e logo o anjo se apartou dele."},{verse:11,en:"And when Peter was come to himself, he said, Now I know of a surety, that the Lord hath sent his angel, and hath delivered me out of the hand of Herod, and from all the expectation of the people of the Jews.",pt:"Pedro ent\xe3o, tornando a si, disse: Agora sei verdadeiramente que o Senhor enviou o seu anjo, e me livrou da m\xe3o de Herodes e de toda a expectativa do povo dos judeus."},{verse:12,en:"And when he had considered the thing, he came to the house of Mary the mother of John, whose surname was Mark; where many were gathered together praying.",pt:"Depois de assim refletir foi \xe0 casa de Maria, m\xe3e de Jo\xe3o, que tem por sobrenome Marcos, onde muitas pessoas estavam reunidas e oravam."},{verse:13,en:"And as Peter knocked at the door of the gate, a damsel came to hearken, named Rhoda.",pt:"Quando ele bateu ao port\xe3o do p\xe1tio, uma criada chamada Rode saiu a escutar;"},{verse:14,en:"And when she knew Peter\u2019s voice, she opened not the gate for gladness, but ran in, and told how Peter stood before the gate.",pt:"e, reconhecendo a voz de Pedro, de gozo n\xe3o abriu o port\xe3o, mas, correndo para dentro, anunciou que Pedro estava l\xe1 fora."},{verse:15,en:"And they said unto her, Thou art mad. But she constantly affirmed that it was even so. Then said they, It is his angel.",pt:"Eles lhe disseram: Est\xe1s louca. Ela, por\xe9m, assegurava que assim era. Eles ent\xe3o diziam: \xc9 o seu anjo."},{verse:16,en:"But Peter continued knocking: and when they had opened the door, and saw him, they were astonished.",pt:"Mas Pedro continuava a bater, e, quando abriram, viram-no e pasmaram."},{verse:17,en:"But he, beckoning unto them with the hand to hold their peace, declared unto them how the Lord had brought him out of the prison. And he said, Go shew these things unto James, and to the brethren. And he departed, and went into another place.",pt:"Mas ele, acenando-lhes com a m\xe3o para que se calassem, contou-lhes como o Senhor o tirara da pris\xe3o, e disse: Anunciai isto a Tiago e aos irm\xe3os. E, saindo, partiu para outro lugar."},{verse:18,en:"Now as soon as it was day, there was no small stir among the soldiers, what was become of Peter.",pt:"Logo que amanheceu, houve grande alvoro\xe7o entre os soldados sobre o que teria sido feito de Pedro."},{verse:19,en:"And when Herod had sought for him, and found him not, he examined the keepers, and commanded that they should be put to death. And he went down from Judaea to Caesarea, and there abode.",pt:"E Herodes, tendo-o procurado e n\xe3o o achando, inquiriu as sentinelas e mandou que fossem justi\xe7adas; e descendo da Jud\xe9ia para Cesar\xe9ia, demorou-se ali."},{verse:20,en:"And Herod was highly displeased with them of Tyre and Sidon: but they came with one accord to him, and, having made Blastus the king\u2019s chamberlain their friend, desired peace; because their country was nourished by the king\u2019s country.",pt:"Ora, Herodes estava muito irritado contra os de Tiro e de Sidom; mas estes, vindo de comum acordo ter com ele e obtendo a amizade de Blasto, camareiro do rei, pediam paz, porquanto o seu pa\xeds se abastecia do pa\xeds do rei."},{verse:21,en:"And upon a set day Herod, arrayed in royal apparel, sat upon his throne, and made an oration unto them.",pt:"num dia designado, Herodes, vestido de trajes reais, sentou- se no trono e dirigia-lhes a palavra."},{verse:22,en:"And the people gave a shout, saying, It is the voice of a god, and not of a man.",pt:"E o povo exclamava: \xc9 a voz de um deus, e n\xe3o de um homem."},{verse:23,en:"And immediately the angel of the Lord smote him, because he gave not God the glory: and he was eaten of worms, and gave up the ghost.",pt:"No mesmo instante o anjo do Senhor o feriu, porque n\xe3o deu gl\xf3ria a Deus; e, comido de vermes, expirou."},{verse:24,en:"But the word of God grew and multiplied.",pt:"E a palavra de Deus crescia e se multiplicava."},{verse:25,en:"And Barnabas and Saul returned from Jerusalem, when they had fulfilled their ministry, and took with them John, whose surname was Mark.",pt:"Barnab\xe9 e Saulo, havendo terminando aquele servi\xe7o, voltaram de Jerusal\xe9m, levando consigo a Jo\xe3o, que tem por sobrenome Marcos."}]}}),817,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now there were in the church that was at Antioch certain prophets and teachers; as Barnabas, and Simeon that was called Niger, and Lucius of Cyrene, and Manaen, which had been brought up with Herod the tetrarch, and Saul.",pt:"Ora, na igreja em Antioquia havia profetas e mestres, a saber: Barnab\xe9, Sime\xe3o, chamado N\xedger, L\xfacio de Cirene, Mana\xe9m, cola\xe7o de Herodes o tetrarca, e Saulo."},{verse:2,en:"As they ministered to the Lord, and fasted, the Holy Ghost said, Separate me Barnabas and Saul for the work whereunto I have called them.",pt:"Enquanto eles ministravam perante o Senhor e jejuavam, disse o Esp\xedrito Santo: Separai-me a Barnab\xe9 e a Saulo para a obra a que os tenho chamado."},{verse:3,en:"And when they had fasted and prayed, and laid their hands on them, they sent them away.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, depois que jejuaram, oraram e lhes impuseram as m\xe3os, os despediram."},{verse:4,en:"So they, being sent forth by the Holy Ghost, departed unto Seleucia; and from thence they sailed to Cyprus.",pt:"Estes, pois, enviados pelo Esp\xedrito Santo, desceram a Sel\xeaucia e dali navegaram para Chipre."},{verse:5,en:"And when they were at Salamis, they preached the word of God in the synagogues of the Jews: and they had also John to their minister.",pt:"Chegados a Salamina, anunciavam a palavra de Deus nas sinagogas dos judeus, e tinham a Jo\xe3o como auxiliar."},{verse:6,en:"And when they had gone through the isle unto Paphos, they found a certain sorcerer, a false prophet, a Jew, whose name was Bar-jesus:",pt:"Havendo atravessado a ilha toda at\xe9 Pafos, acharam um certo mago, falso profeta, judeu, chamado Bar-Jesus,"},{verse:7,en:"Which was with the deputy of the country, Sergius Paulus, a prudent man; who called for Barnabas and Saul, and desired to hear the word of God.",pt:"que estava com o proc\xf4nsul S\xe9rgio Paulo, homem sensato. Este chamou a Barnab\xe9 e Saulo e mostrou desejo de ouvir a palavra de Deus."},{verse:8,en:"But Elymas the sorcerer (for so is his name by interpretation) withstood them, seeking to turn away the deputy from the faith.",pt:"Mas resistia-lhes Elimas, o encantador (porque assim se interpreta o seu nome), procurando desviar a f\xe9 do proc\xf4nsul."},{verse:9,en:"Then Saul, (who also is called Paul,) filled with the Holy Ghost, set his eyes on him,",pt:"Todavia Saulo, tamb\xe9m chamado Paulo, cheio do Esp\xedrito Santo, fitando os olhos nele,"},{verse:10,en:"And said, O full of all subtilty and all mischief, thou child of the devil, thou enemy of all righteousness, wilt thou not cease to pervert the right ways of the Lord?",pt:"disse: \xe7 filho do Diabo, cheio de todo o engano e de toda a mal\xedcia, inimigo de toda a justi\xe7a, n\xe3o cessar\xe1s de perverter os caminhos retos do Senhor?"},{verse:11,en:"And now, behold, the hand of the Lord is upon thee, and thou shalt be blind, not seeing the sun for a season. And immediately there fell on him a mist and a darkness; and he went about seeking some to lead him by the hand.",pt:"Agora eis a m\xe3o do Senhor sobre ti, e ficar\xe1s cego, sem ver o sol por algum tempo. Imediatamente caiu sobre ele uma n\xe9voa e trevas e, andando \xe0 roda, procurava quem o guiasse pela m\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"Then the deputy, when he saw what was done, believed, being astonished at the doctrine of the Lord.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o proc\xf4nsul, vendo o que havia acontecido, creu, maravilhando-se da doutrina do Senhor."},{verse:13,en:"Now when Paul and his company loosed from Paphos, they came to Perga in Pamphylia: and John departing from them returned to Jerusalem.",pt:"Tendo Paulo e seus companheiros navegado de Pafos, chegaram a Perge, na Panf\xedlia. Jo\xe3o, por\xe9m, apartando-se deles, voltou para Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:14,en:"But when they departed from Perga, they came to Antioch in Pisidia, and went into the synagogue on the sabbath day, and sat down.",pt:"Mas eles, passando de Perge, chegaram a Antioquia da Ps\xeddia; e entrando na sinagoga, no dia de s\xe1bado, sentaram-se."},{verse:15,en:"And after the reading of the law and the prophets the rulers of the synagogue sent unto them, saying, Ye men and brethren, if ye have any word of exhortation for the people, say on.",pt:"Depois da leitura da lei e dos profetas, os chefes da sinagoga mandaram dizer-lhes: Irm\xe3os, se tendes alguma palavra de exorta\xe7\xe3o ao povo, falai."},{verse:16,en:"Then Paul stood up, and beckoning with his hand said, Men of Israel, and ye that fear God, give audience.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Paulo se levantou e, pedindo sil\xeancio com a m\xe3o, disse: Var\xf5es israelitas, e os que temeis a Deus, ouvi:"},{verse:17,en:"The God of this people of Israel chose our fathers, and exalted the people when they dwelt as strangers in the land of Egypt, and with an high arm brought he them out of it.",pt:"O Deus deste povo de Israel escolheu a nossos pais, e exaltou o povo, sendo eles estrangeiros na terra do Egito, de onde os tirou com bra\xe7o poderoso,"},{verse:18,en:"And about the time of forty years suffered he their manners in the wilderness.",pt:"e suportou-lhes os maus costumes no deserto por espa\xe7o de quase quarenta anos;"},{verse:19,en:"And when he had destroyed seven nations in the land of Chanaan, he divided their land to them by lot.",pt:"e, havendo destru\xeddo as sete na\xe7\xf5es na terra de Cana\xe3, deu- lhes o territ\xf3rio delas por heran\xe7a durante cerca de quatrocentos e cinquenta anos."},{verse:20,en:"And after that he gave unto them judges about the space of four hundred and fifty years, until Samuel the prophet.",pt:"Depois disto, deu-lhes ju\xedzes at\xe9 o profeta Samuel."},{verse:21,en:"And afterward they desired a king: and God gave unto them Saul the son of Cis, a man of the tribe of Benjamin, by the space of forty years.",pt:"Ent\xe3o pediram um rei, e Deus lhes deu por quarenta anos a Saul, filho de Cis, var\xe3o da tribo de Benjamim."},{verse:22,en:"And when he had removed him, he raised up unto them David to be their king; to whom also he gave testimony, and said, I have found David the son of Jesse, a man after mine own heart, which shall fulfil all my will.",pt:"E tendo deposto a este, levantou-lhes como rei a Davi, ao qual tamb\xe9m, dando testemunho, disse: Achei a Davi, filho de Jess\xe9, homem segundo o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, que far\xe1 toda a minha vontade."},{verse:23,en:"Of this man\u2019s seed hath God according to his promise raised unto Israel a Saviour, Jesus:",pt:"Da descend\xeancia deste, conforme a promessa, trouxe Deus a Israel um Salvador, Jesus;"},{verse:24,en:"When John had first preached before his coming the baptism of repentance to all the people of Israel.",pt:"havendo Jo\xe3o, antes da aparecimento dele, pregado a todo o povo de Israel o batismo de arrependimento."},{verse:25,en:"And as John fulfilled his course, he said, Whom think ye that I am? I am not he. But, behold, there cometh one after me, whose shoes of his feet I am not worthy to loose.",pt:"Mas Jo\xe3o, quando completava a carreira, dizia: Quem pensais v\xf3s que su sou? Eu n\xe3o sou o Cristo, mas eis que ap\xf3s mim vem aquele a quem n\xe3o sou digno de desatar as alparcas dos p\xe9s."},{verse:26,en:"Men and brethren, children of the stock of Abraham, and whosoever among you feareth God, to you is the word of this salvation sent.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, filhos da estirpe de Abra\xe3o, e os que dentre v\xf3s temem a Deus, a n\xf3s \xe9 enviada a palavra desta salva\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:27,en:"For they that dwell at Jerusalem, and their rulers, because they knew him not, nor yet the voices of the prophets which are read every sabbath day, they have fulfilled them in condemning him.",pt:"Pois, os que habitam em Jerusal\xe9m e as suas autoridades, porquanto n\xe3o conheceram a este Jesus, condenando-o, cumpriram as mesmas palavras dos profetas que se ouvem ler todos os s\xe1bados."},{verse:28,en:"And though they found no cause of death in him, yet desired they Pilate that he should be slain.",pt:"E, se bem que n\xe3o achassem nele nenhuma causa de morte, pediram a Pilatos que ele fosse morto."},{verse:29,en:"And when they had fulfilled all that was written of him, they took him down from the tree, and laid him in a sepulchre.",pt:"Quando haviam cumprido todas as coisas que dele estavam escritas, tirando-o do madeiro, o puseram na sepultura;"},{verse:30,en:"But God raised him from the dead:",pt:"mas Deus o ressuscitou dentre os mortos;"},{verse:31,en:"And he was seen many days of them which came up with him from Galilee to Jerusalem, who are his witnesses unto the people.",pt:"e ele foi visto durante muitos dias por aqueles que com ele subiram da Galil\xe9ia a Jerusal\xe9m, os quais agora s\xe3o suas testemunhas para com o povo."},{verse:32,en:"And we declare unto you glad tidings, how that the promise which was made unto the fathers,",pt:"E n\xf3s vos anunciamos as boas novas da promessa, feita aos pais,"},{verse:33,en:"God hath fulfilled the same unto us their children, in that he hath raised up Jesus again; as it is also written in the second psalm, Thou art my Son, this day have I begotten thee.",pt:"a qual Deus nos tem cumprido, a n\xf3s, filhos deles, levantando a Jesus, como tamb\xe9m est\xe1 escrito no salmo segundo: Tu \xe9s meu Filho, hoje te gerei."},{verse:34,en:"And as concerning that he raised him up from the dead, now no more to return to corruption, he said on this wise, I will give you the sure mercies of David.",pt:"E no tocante a que o ressuscitou dentre os mortos para nunca mais tornar \xe0 corrup\xe7\xe3o, falou Deus assim: Dar-vos-ei as santas e fi\xe9is b\xean\xe7\xe3os de Davi;"},{verse:35,en:"Wherefore he saith also in another psalm, Thou shalt not suffer thine Holy One to see corruption.",pt:"pelo que ainda em outro salmo diz: N\xe3o permitir\xe1s que o teu Santo veja a corrup\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:36,en:"For David, after he had served his own generation by the will of God, fell on sleep, and was laid unto his fathers, and saw corruption:",pt:"Porque Davi, na verdade, havendo servido a sua pr\xf3pria gera\xe7\xe3o pela vontade de Deus, dormiu e foi depositado junto a seus pais e experimentou corrup\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:37,en:"But he, whom God raised again, saw no corruption.",pt:"Mas aquele a quem Deus ressuscitou nenhuma corrup\xe7\xe3o experimentou."},{verse:38,en:"Be it known unto you therefore, men and brethren, that through this man is preached unto you the forgiveness of sins:",pt:"Seja-vos pois not\xf3rio, var\xf5es, que por este se vos anuncia a remiss\xe3o dos pecados."},{verse:39,en:"And by him all that believe are justified from all things, from which ye could not be justified by the law of Moses.",pt:"E de todas as coisas de que n\xe3o pudestes ser justificados pela lei de Mois\xe9s, por ele \xe9 justificado todo o que cr\xea."},{verse:40,en:"Beware therefore, lest that come upon you, which is spoken of in the prophets;",pt:"Cuidai pois que n\xe3o venha sobre v\xf3s o que est\xe1 dito nos profetas:"},{verse:41,en:"Behold, ye despisers, and wonder, and perish: for I work a work in your days, a work which ye shall in no wise believe, though a man declare it unto you.",pt:"Vede, \xf3 desprezadores, admirai-vos e desaparecei; porque realizo uma obra em vossos dias, obra em que de modo algum crereis, se algu\xe9m vo-la contar."},{verse:42,en:"And when the Jews were gone out of the synagogue, the Gentiles besought that these words might be preached to them the next sabbath.",pt:"Quando iam saindo, rogavam que estas palavras lhes fossem repetidas no s\xe1bado seguinte."},{verse:43,en:"Now when the congregation was broken up, many of the Jews and religious proselytes followed Paul and Barnabas: who, speaking to them, persuaded them to continue in the grace of God.",pt:"E, despedida a sinagoga, muitos judeus e pros\xe9litos devotos seguiram a Paulo e Barnab\xe9, os quais, falando-lhes, os exortavam a perseverarem na gra\xe7a de Deus."},{verse:44,en:"And the next sabbath day came almost the whole city together to hear the word of God.",pt:"No s\xe1bado seguinte reuniu-se quase toda a cidade para ouvir a palavra de Deus."},{verse:45,en:"But when the Jews saw the multitudes, they were filled with envy, and spake against those things which were spoken by Paul, contradicting and blaspheming.",pt:"Mas os judeus, vendo as multid\xf5es, encheram-se de inveja e, blasfemando, contradiziam o que Paulo falava."},{verse:46,en:"Then Paul and Barnabas waxed bold, and said, It was necessary that the word of God should first have been spoken to you: but seeing ye put it from you, and judge yourselves unworthy of everlasting life, lo, we turn to the Gentiles.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Paulo e Barnab\xe9, falando ousadamente, disseram: Era mister que a v\xf3s se pregasse em primeiro lugar a palavra de Deus; mas, visto que a rejeitais, e n\xe3o vos julgais dignos da vida eterna, eis que nos viramos para os gentios;"},{verse:47,en:"For so hath the Lord commanded us, saying, I have set thee to be a light of the Gentiles, that thou shouldest be for salvation unto the ends of the earth.",pt:"porque assim nos ordenou o Senhor: Eu te pus para luz dos gentios, a fim de que sejas para salva\xe7\xe3o at\xe9 os confins da terra."},{verse:48,en:"And when the Gentiles heard this, they were glad, and glorified the word of the Lord: and as many as were ordained to eternal life believed.",pt:"Os gentios, ouvindo isto, alegravam-se e glorificavam a palavra do Senhor; e creram todos quantos haviam sido destinados para a vida eterna."},{verse:49,en:"And the word of the Lord was published throughout all the region.",pt:"E divulgava-se a palavra do Senhor por toda aquela regi\xe3o."},{verse:50,en:"But the Jews stirred up the devout and honourable women, and the chief men of the city, and raised persecution against Paul and Barnabas, and expelled them out of their coasts.",pt:"Mas os judeus incitaram as mulheres devotas de alta posi\xe7\xe3o e os principais da cidade, suscitaram uma persegui\xe7\xe3o contra Paulo e Barnab\xe9, e os lan\xe7aram fora dos seus termos."},{verse:51,en:"But they shook off the dust of their feet against them, and came unto Iconium.",pt:"Mas estes, sacudindo contra eles o p\xf3 dos seus p\xe9s, partiram para Ic\xf4nio."},{verse:52,en:"And the disciples were filled with joy, and with the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Os disc\xedpulos, por\xe9m, estavam cheios de alegria e do Esp\xedrito Santo."}]}}),818,[]);
__d((function(e,a,t,o,s,n,d){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass in Iconium, that they went both together into the synagogue of the Jews, and so spake, that a great multitude both of the Jews and also of the Greeks believed.",pt:"Em Ic\xf4nio entraram juntos na sinagoga dos judeus e falaram de tal modo que creu uma grande multid\xe3o tanto de judeus como de gregos."},{verse:2,en:"But the unbelieving Jews stirred up the Gentiles, and made their minds evil affected against the brethren.",pt:"Mas os judeus incr\xe9dulos excitaram e irritaram os \xe2nimos dos gentios contra os irm\xe3os."},{verse:3,en:"Long time therefore abode they speaking boldly in the Lord, which gave testimony unto the word of his grace, and granted signs and wonders to be done by their hands.",pt:"Eles, entretanto, se demoraram ali por muito tempo, falando ousadamente acerca do Senhor, o qual dava testemunho \xe0 palavra da sua gra\xe7a, concedendo que por suas m\xe3os se fizessem sinais e prod\xedgios."},{verse:4,en:"But the multitude of the city was divided: and part held with the Jews, and part with the apostles.",pt:"E se dividiu o povo da cidade; uns eram pelos judeus, e outros pelos ap\xf3stolos."},{verse:5,en:"And when there was an assault made both of the Gentiles, and also of the Jews with their rulers, to use them despitefully, and to stone them,",pt:"E, havendo um motim tanto dos gentios como dos judeus, juntamente com as suas autoridades, para os ultrajarem e apedrejarem,"},{verse:6,en:"They were ware of it, and fled unto Lystra and Derbe, cities of Lycaonia, and unto the region that lieth round about:",pt:"eles, sabendo-o, fugiram para Listra e Derbe, cidades da Lica\xf4nia, e a regi\xe3o circunvizinha;"},{verse:7,en:"And there they preached the gospel.",pt:"e ali pregavam o evangelho."},{verse:8,en:"And there sat a certain man at Lystra, impotent in his feet, being a cripple from his mother\u2019s womb, who never had walked:",pt:"Em Listra estava sentado um homem aleijado dos p\xe9s, coxo de nascen\xe7a e que nunca tinha andado."},{verse:9,en:"The same heard Paul speak: who stedfastly beholding him, and perceiving that he had faith to be healed,",pt:"Este ouvia falar Paulo, que, fitando nele os olhos e vendo que tinha f\xe9 para ser curado,"},{verse:10,en:"Said with a loud voice, Stand upright on thy feet. And he leaped and walked.",pt:"disse em alta voz: Levanta-te direito sobre os teus p\xe9s. E ele saltou, e andava."},{verse:11,en:"And when the people saw what Paul had done, they lifted up their voices, saying in the speech of Lycaonia, The gods are come down to us in the likeness of men.",pt:"As multid\xf5es, vendo o que Paulo fizera, levantaram a voz, dizendo em l\xedngua lica\xf4nica: Fizeram-se os deuses semelhantes aos homens e desceram at\xe9 n\xf3s."},{verse:12,en:"And they called Barnabas, Jupiter; and Paul, Mercurius, because he was the chief speaker.",pt:"A Barnab\xe9 chamavam J\xfapiter e a Paulo, Merc\xfario, porque era ele o que dirigia a palavra."},{verse:13,en:"Then the priest of Jupiter, which was before their city, brought oxen and garlands unto the gates, and would have done sacrifice with the people.",pt:"O sacerdote de J\xfapiter, cujo templo estava em frente da cidade, trouxe para as portas touros e grinaldas e, juntamente com as multid\xf5es, queria oferecer-lhes sacrif\xedcios."},{verse:14,en:"Which when the apostles, Barnabas and Paul, heard of, they rent their clothes, and ran in among the people, crying out,",pt:"Quando, por\xe9m, os ap\xf3stolos Barnab\xe9 e Paulo ouviram isto, rasgaram as suas vestes e saltaram para o meio da multid\xe3o, clamando"},{verse:15,en:"And saying, Sirs, why do ye these things? We also are men of like passions with you, and preach unto you that ye should turn from these vanities unto the living God, which made heaven, and earth, and the sea, and all things that are therein:",pt:"e dizendo: Senhores, por que fazeis estas coisas? N\xf3s tamb\xe9m somos homens, de natureza semelhante \xe0 vossa, e vos anunciamos o evangelho para que destas pr\xe1ticas v\xe3s vos convertais ao Deus vivo, que fez o c\xe9u, a terra, o mar, e tudo quanto h\xe1 neles;"},{verse:16,en:"Who in times past suffered all nations to walk in their own ways.",pt:"o qual nos tempos passados permitiu que todas as na\xe7\xf5es andassem nos seus pr\xf3prios caminhos."},{verse:17,en:"Nevertheless he left not himself without witness, in that he did good, and gave us rain from heaven, and fruitful seasons, filling our hearts with food and gladness.",pt:"Contudo n\xe3o deixou de dar testemunho de si mesmo, fazendo o bem, dando-vos chuvas do c\xe9u e esta\xe7\xf5es frut\xedferas, enchendo-vos de mantimento, e de alegria os vossos cora\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:18,en:"And with these sayings scarce restrained they the people, that they had not done sacrifice unto them.",pt:"E dizendo isto, com dificuldade impediram as multid\xf5es de lhes oferecerem sacrif\xedcios."},{verse:19,en:"And there came thither certain Jews from Antioch and Iconium, who persuaded the people, and, having stoned Paul, drew him out of the city, supposing he had been dead.",pt:"Sobrevieram, por\xe9m, judeus de Antioquia e de Ic\xf4nio e, havendo persuadido as multid\xf5es, apedrejaram a Paulo, e arrastaram-no para fora da cidade, cuidando que estava morto."},{verse:20,en:"Howbeit, as the disciples stood round about him, he rose up, and came into the city: and the next day he departed with Barnabas to Derbe.",pt:"Mas quando os disc\xedpulos o rodearam, ele se levantou e entrou na cidade. No dia seguinte partiu com Barnab\xe9 para Derbe."},{verse:21,en:"And when they had preached the gospel to that city, and had taught many, they returned again to Lystra, and to Iconium, and Antioch,",pt:"E, tendo anunciado o evangelho naquela cidade e feito muitos disc\xedpulos, voltaram para Listra, Ic\xf4nio e Antioquia,"},{verse:22,en:"Confirming the souls of the disciples, and exhorting them to continue in the faith, and that we must through much tribulation enter into the kingdom of God.",pt:"confirmando as almas dos disc\xedpulos, exortando-os a perseverarem na f\xe9, dizendo que por muitas tribula\xe7\xf5es nos \xe9 necess\xe1rio entrar no reino de Deus."},{verse:23,en:"And when they had ordained them elders in every church, and had prayed with fasting, they commended them to the Lord, on whom they believed.",pt:"E, havendo-lhes feito eleger anci\xe3os em cada igreja e orado com jejuns, os encomendaram ao Senhor em quem haviam crido."},{verse:24,en:"And after they had passed throughout Pisidia, they came to Pamphylia.",pt:"Atravessando ent\xe3o a Pis\xeddia, chegaram \xe0 Panf\xedlia."},{verse:25,en:"And when they had preached the word in Perga, they went down into Attalia:",pt:"E, tendo anunciado a palavra em Perge, desceram a At\xe1lia."},{verse:26,en:"And thence sailed to Antioch, from whence they had been recommended to the grace of God for the work which they fulfilled.",pt:"E dali navegaram para Antioquia, donde tinham sido encomendados \xe0 gra\xe7a de Deus para a obra que acabavam de cumprir."},{verse:27,en:"And when they were come, and had gathered the church together, they rehearsed all that God had done with them, and how he had opened the door of faith unto the Gentiles.",pt:"Quando chegaram e reuniram a igreja, relataram tudo quanto Deus fizera por meio deles, e como abrira aos gentios a porta da f\xe9."},{verse:28,en:"And there they abode long time with the disciples.",pt:"E ficaram ali n\xe3o pouco tempo, com os disc\xedpulos."}]}}),819,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And certain men which came down from Judaea taught the brethren, and said, Except ye be circumcised after the manner of Moses, ye cannot be saved.",pt:"Ent\xe3o alguns que tinham descido da Jud\xe9ia ensinavam aos irm\xe3os: Se n\xe3o vos circuncidardes, segundo o rito de Mois\xe9s, n\xe3o podeis ser salvos."},{verse:2,en:"When therefore Paul and Barnabas had no small dissension and disputation with them, they determined that Paul and Barnabas, and certain other of them, should go up to Jerusalem unto the apostles and elders about this question.",pt:"Tendo Paulo e Barnab\xe9 contenda e n\xe3o pequena discuss\xe3o com eles, os irm\xe3os resolveram que Paulo e Barnab\xe9 e mais alguns dentre eles subissem a Jerusal\xe9m, aos ap\xf3stolos e aos anci\xe3os, por causa desta quest\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"And being brought on their way by the church, they passed through Phenice and Samaria, declaring the conversion of the Gentiles: and they caused great joy unto all the brethren.",pt:"Eles, pois, sendo acompanhados pela igreja por um trecho do caminho, passavam pela Fen\xedcia e por Sam\xe1ria, contando a convers\xe3o dos gentios; e davam grande alegria a todos os irm\xe3os."},{verse:4,en:"And when they were come to Jerusalem, they were received of the church, and of the apostles and elders, and they declared all things that God had done with them.",pt:"E, quando chegaram a Jerusal\xe9m, foram recebidos pela igreja e pelos ap\xf3stolos e anci\xe3os, e relataram tudo quanto Deus fizera por meio deles."},{verse:5,en:"But there rose up certain of the sect of the Pharisees which believed, saying, That it was needful to circumcise them, and to command them to keep the law of Moses.",pt:"Mas alguns da seita dos fariseus, que tinham crido, levantaram-se dizendo que era necess\xe1rio circuncid\xe1-los e mandar-lhes observar a lei de Mois\xe9s."},{verse:6,en:"And the apostles and elders came together for to consider of this matter.",pt:"Congregaram-se pois os ap\xf3stolos e os anci\xe3os para considerar este assunto."},{verse:7,en:"And when there had been much disputing, Peter rose up, and said unto them, Men and brethren, ye know how that a good while ago God made choice among us, that the Gentiles by my mouth should hear the word of the gospel, and believe.",pt:"E, havendo grande discuss\xe3o, levantou-se Pedro e disse-lhes: Irm\xe3os, bem sabeis que j\xe1 h\xe1 muito tempo Deus me elegeu dentre v\xf3s, para que os gentios ouvissem da minha boca a palavra do evangelho e cressem."},{verse:8,en:"And God, which knoweth the hearts, bare them witness, giving them the Holy Ghost, even as he did unto us;",pt:"E Deus, que conhece os cora\xe7\xf5es, testemunhou a favor deles, dando-lhes o Esp\xedrito Santo, assim como a n\xf3s;"},{verse:9,en:"And put no difference between us and them, purifying their hearts by faith.",pt:"e n\xe3o fez distin\xe7\xe3o alguma entre eles e n\xf3s, purificando os seus cora\xe7\xf5es pela f\xe9."},{verse:10,en:"Now therefore why tempt ye God, to put a yoke upon the neck of the disciples, which neither our fathers nor we were able to bear?",pt:"Agora, pois, por que tentais a Deus, pondo sobre a cerviz dos disc\xedpulos um jugo que nem nossos pais nem n\xf3s pudemos suportar?"},{verse:11,en:"But we believe that through the grace of the Lord Jesus Christ we shall be saved, even as they.",pt:"Mas cremos que somos salvos pela gra\xe7a do Senhor Jesus, do mesmo modo que eles tamb\xe9m."},{verse:12,en:"Then all the multitude kept silence, and gave audience to Barnabas and Paul, declaring what miracles and wonders God had wrought among the Gentiles by them.",pt:"Ent\xe3o toda a multid\xe3o se calou e escutava a Barnab\xe9 e a Paulo, que contavam quantos sinais e prod\xedgios Deus havia feito por meio deles entre os gentios."},{verse:13,en:"And after they had held their peace, James answered, saying, Men and brethren, hearken unto me:",pt:"Depois que se calaram, Tiago, tomando a palavra, disse: Irm\xe3os, ouvi-me:"},{verse:14,en:"Simeon hath declared how God at the first did visit the Gentiles, to take out of them a people for his name.",pt:"Sim\xe3o relatou como primeiramente Deus visitou os gentios para tomar dentre eles um povo para o seu Nome."},{verse:15,en:"And to this agree the words of the prophets; as it is written,",pt:"E com isto concordam as palavras dos profetas; como est\xe1 escrito:"},{verse:16,en:"After this I will return, and will build again the tabernacle of David, which is fallen down; and I will build again the ruins thereof, and I will set it up:",pt:"Depois disto voltarei, e reedificarei o tabern\xe1culo de Davi, que est\xe1 ca\xeddo; reedificarei as suas ru\xednas, e tornarei a levant\xe1-lo;"},{verse:17,en:"That the residue of men might seek after the Lord, and all the Gentiles, upon whom my name is called, saith the Lord, who doeth all these things.",pt:"para que o resto dos homens busque ao Senhor, sim, todos os gentios, sobre os quais \xe9 invocado o meu nome,"},{verse:18,en:"Known unto God are all his works from the beginning of the world.",pt:"diz o Senhor que faz estas coisas, que s\xe3o conhecidas desde a antiguidade."},{verse:19,en:"Wherefore my sentence is, that we trouble not them, which from among the Gentiles are turned to God:",pt:"Por isso, julgo que n\xe3o se deve perturbar aqueles, dentre os gentios, que se convertem a Deus,"},{verse:20,en:"But that we write unto them, that they abstain from pollutions of idols, and from fornication, and from things strangled, and from blood.",pt:"mas escrever-lhes que se abstenham das contamina\xe7\xf5es dos \xeddolos, da prostitui\xe7\xe3o, do que \xe9 sufocado e do sangue."},{verse:21,en:"For Moses of old time hath in every city them that preach him, being read in the synagogues every sabbath day.",pt:"Porque Mois\xe9s, desde tempos antigos, tem em cada cidade homens que o preguem, e cada s\xe1bado \xe9 lido nas sinagogas."},{verse:22,en:"Then pleased it the apostles and elders, with the whole church, to send chosen men of their own company to Antioch with Paul and Barnabas; namely, Judas surnamed Barsabas, and Silas, chief men among the brethren:",pt:"Ent\xe3o pareceu bem aos ap\xf3stolos e aos anci\xe3os com toda a igreja escolher homens dentre eles e envi\xe1-los a Antioquia com Paulo e Barnab\xe9, a saber: Judas, chamado Barsab\xe1s, e Silas, homens influentes entre os irm\xe3os."},{verse:23,en:"And they wrote letters by them after this manner; The apostles and elders and brethren send greeting unto the brethren which are of the Gentiles in Antioch and Syria and Cilicia:",pt:"E por interm\xe9dio deles escreveram o seguinte: Os ap\xf3stolos e os anci\xe3os, irm\xe3os, aos irm\xe3os dentre os gentios em Antioquia, na S\xedria e na Cic\xedlia, sa\xfade."},{verse:24,en:"Forasmuch as we have heard, that certain which went out from us have troubled you with words, subverting your souls, saying, Ye must be circumcised, and keep the law: to whom we gave no such commandment:",pt:"Portanto ouvimos que alguns dentre n\xf3s, aos quais nada mandamos, vos t\xeam perturbado com palavras, confundindo as vossas almas,"},{verse:25,en:"It seemed good unto us, being assembled with one accord, to send chosen men unto you with our beloved Barnabas and Paul,",pt:"pareceu-nos bem, tendo chegado a um acordo, escolher alguns homens e envi\xe1-los com os nossos amados Barnab\xe9 e Paulo,"},{verse:26,en:"Men that have hazarded their lives for the name of our Lord Jesus Christ.",pt:"homens que t\xeam exposto as suas vidas pelo nome de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo."},{verse:27,en:"We have sent therefore Judas and Silas, who shall also tell you the same things by mouth.",pt:"Enviamos portanto Judas e Silas, os quais tamb\xe9m por palavra vos anunciar\xe3o as mesmas coisas."},{verse:28,en:"For it seemed good to the Holy Ghost, and to us, to lay upon you no greater burden than these necessary things;",pt:"Porque pareceu bem ao Esp\xedrito Santo e a n\xf3s n\xe3o vos impor maior encargo al\xe9m destas coisas necess\xe1rias:"},{verse:29,en:"That ye abstain from meats offered to idols, and from blood, and from things strangled, and from fornication: from which if ye keep yourselves, ye shall do well. Fare ye well.",pt:"Que vos abstenhais das coisas sacrificadas aos \xeddolos, e do sangue, e da carne sufocada, e da prostitui\xe7\xe3o; e destas coisas fareis bem de vos guardar. Bem vos v\xe1."},{verse:30,en:"So when they were dismissed, they came to Antioch: and when they had gathered the multitude together, they delivered the epistle:",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles, tendo-se despedido, desceram a Antioquia e, havendo reunido a assembl\xe9ia, entregaram a carta."},{verse:31,en:"Which when they had read, they rejoiced for the consolation.",pt:"E, quando a leram, alegraram-se pela consola\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:32,en:"And Judas and Silas, being prophets also themselves, exhorted the brethren with many words, and confirmed them.",pt:"Depois Judas e Silas, que tamb\xe9m eram profetas, exortaram os irm\xe3os com muitas palavras e os fortaleceram."},{verse:33,en:"And after they had tarried there a space, they were let go in peace from the brethren unto the apostles.",pt:"E, tendo-se demorado ali por algum tempo, foram pelos irm\xe3os despedidos em paz, de volta aos que os haviam mandado."},{verse:34,en:"Notwithstanding it pleased Silas to abide there still.",pt:"[Mas pareceu bem a Silas ficar ali.]"},{verse:35,en:"Paul also and Barnabas continued in Antioch, teaching and preaching the word of the Lord, with many others also.",pt:"Mas Paulo e Barnab\xe9 demoraram-se em Antioquia, ensinando e pregando com muitos outros a palavra do Senhor."},{verse:36,en:"And some days after Paul said unto Barnabas, Let us go again and visit our brethren in every city where we have preached the word of the Lord, and see how they do.",pt:"Decorridos alguns dias, disse Paulo a Barnab\xe9: Tornemos a visitar os irm\xe3os por todas as cidades em que temos anunciado a palavra do Senhor, para ver como v\xe3o."},{verse:37,en:"And Barnabas determined to take with them John, whose surname was Mark.",pt:"Ora, Barnab\xe9 queria que levassem tamb\xe9m a Jo\xe3o, chamado Marcos."},{verse:38,en:"But Paul thought not good to take him with them, who departed from them from Pamphylia, and went not with them to the work.",pt:"Mas a Paulo n\xe3o parecia razo\xe1vel que tomassem consigo aquele que desde a Panf\xedlia se tinha apartado deles e n\xe3o os tinha acompanhado no trabalho."},{verse:39,en:"And the contention was so sharp between them, that they departed asunder one from the other: and so Barnabas took Mark, and sailed unto Cyprus;",pt:"E houve entre eles tal desaven\xe7a que se separaram um do outro, e Barnab\xe9, levando consigo a Marcos, navegou para Chipre."},{verse:40,en:"And Paul chose Silas, and departed, being recommended by the brethren unto the grace of God.",pt:"Mas Paulo, tendo escolhido a Silas, partiu encomendado pelos irm\xe3os \xe0 gra\xe7a do Senhor."},{verse:41,en:"And he went through Syria and Cilicia, confirming the churches.",pt:"E passou pela S\xedria e Cil\xedcia, fortalecendo as igrejas."}]}}),820,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then came he to Derbe and Lystra: and, behold, a certain disciple was there, named Timotheus, the son of a certain woman, which was a Jewess, and believed; but his father was a Greek:",pt:"Chegou tamb\xe9m a Derbe e Listra. E eis que estava ali certo disc\xedpulo por nome Tim\xf3teo, filho de uma judia crente, mas de pai grego;"},{verse:2,en:"Which was well reported of by the brethren that were at Lystra and Iconium.",pt:"do qual davam bom testemunho os irm\xe3os em Listra e Ic\xf4nio."},{verse:3,en:"Him would Paul have to go forth with him; and took and circumcised him because of the Jews which were in those quarters: for they knew all that his father was a Greek.",pt:"Paulo quis que este fosse com ele e, tomando-o, o circuncidou por causa dos judeus que estavam naqueles lugares; porque todos sabiam que seu pai era grego."},{verse:4,en:"And as they went through the cities, they delivered them the decrees for to keep, that were ordained of the apostles and elders which were at Jerusalem.",pt:"Quando iam passando pelas cidades, entregavam aos irm\xe3os, para serem observadas, as decis\xf5es que haviam sido tomadas pelos ap\xf3stolos e anci\xe3os em Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:5,en:"And so were the churches established in the faith, and increased in number daily.",pt:"Assim as igrejas eram confirmadas na f\xe9, e dia a dia cresciam em n\xfamero."},{verse:6,en:"Now when they had gone throughout Phrygia and the region of Galatia, and were forbidden of the Holy Ghost to preach the word in Asia,",pt:"Atravessaram a regi\xe3o fr\xedgio-g\xe1lata, tendo sido impedidos pelo Esp\xedrito Santo de anunciar a palavra na \xc1sia;"},{verse:7,en:"After they were come to Mysia, they assayed to go into Bithynia: but the Spirit suffered them not.",pt:"e tendo chegado diante da M\xedsia, tentavam ir para Bit\xednia, mas o Esp\xedrito de Jesus n\xe3o lho permitiu."},{verse:8,en:"And they passing by Mysia came down to Troas.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, passando pela M\xedsia, desceram a Tr\xf4ade."},{verse:9,en:"And a vision appeared to Paul in the night; There stood a man of Macedonia, and prayed him, saying, Come over into Macedonia, and help us.",pt:"De noite apareceu a Paulo esta vis\xe3o: estava ali em p\xe9 um homem da Maced\xf4nia, que lhe rogava: Passa \xe0 Maced\xf4nia e ajuda-nos."},{verse:10,en:"And after he had seen the vision, immediately we endeavoured to go into Macedonia, assuredly gathering that the Lord had called us for to preach the gospel unto them.",pt:"E quando ele teve esta vis\xe3o, procuravamos logo partir para a Maced\xf4nia, concluindo que Deus nos havia chamado para lhes anunciarmos o evangelho."},{verse:11,en:"Therefore loosing from Troas, we came with a straight course to Samothracia, and the next day to Neapolis;",pt:"Navegando, pois, de Tr\xf4ade, fomos em direitura a Samotr\xe1cia, e no dia seguinte a Ne\xe1polis;"},{verse:12,en:"And from thence to Philippi, which is the chief city of that part of Macedonia, and a colony: and we were in that city abiding certain days.",pt:"e dali para Filipos, que \xe9 a primeira cidade desse distrito da Maced\xf4nia, e col\xf4nia romana; e estivemos alguns dias nessa cidade."},{verse:13,en:"And on the sabbath we went out of the city by a river side, where prayer was wont to be made; and we sat down, and spake unto the women which resorted thither.",pt:"No s\xe1bado sa\xedmos portas afora para a beira do rio, onde julg\xe1vamos haver um lugar de ora\xe7\xe3o e, sentados, fal\xe1vamos \xe0s mulheres ali reunidas."},{verse:14,en:"And a certain woman named Lydia, a seller of purple, of the city of Thyatira, which worshipped God, heard us: whose heart the Lord opened, that she attended unto the things which were spoken of Paul.",pt:"E certa mulher chamada L\xeddia, vendedora de p\xfarpura, da cidade de Tiatira, e que temia a Deus, nos escutava e o Senhor lhe abriu o cora\xe7\xe3o para atender \xe0s coisas que Paulo dizia."},{verse:15,en:"And when she was baptized, and her household, she besought us, saying, If ye have judged me to be faithful to the Lord, come into my house, and abide there. And she constrained us.",pt:"Depois que foi batizada, ela e a sua casa, rogou-nos, dizendo: Se haveis julgado que eu sou fiel ao Senhor, entrai em minha casa, e ficai ali. E nos constrangeu a isso."},{verse:16,en:"And it came to pass, as we went to prayer, a certain damsel possessed with a spirit of divination met us, which brought her masters much gain by soothsaying:",pt:"Ora, aconteceu que quando \xedamos ao lugar de ora\xe7\xe3o, nos veio ao encontro uma jovem que tinha um esp\xedrito adivinhador, e que, adivinhando, dava grande lucro a seus senhores."},{verse:17,en:"The same followed Paul and us, and cried, saying, These men are the servants of the most high God, which shew unto us the way of salvation.",pt:"Ela, seguindo a Paulo e a n\xf3s, clamava, dizendo: S\xe3o servos do Deus Alt\xedssimo estes homens que vos anunciam um caminho de salva\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:18,en:"And this did she many days. But Paul, being grieved, turned and said to the spirit, I command thee in the name of Jesus Christ to come out of her. And he came out the same hour.",pt:"E fazia isto por muitos dias. Mas Paulo, perturbado, voltou- se e disse ao esp\xedrito: Eu te ordeno em nome de Jesus Cristo que saias dela. E na mesma hora saiu."},{verse:19,en:"And when her masters saw that the hope of their gains was gone, they caught Paul and Silas, and drew them into the marketplace unto the rulers,",pt:"Ora, vendo seus senhores que a esperan\xe7a do seu lucro havia desaparecido, prenderam a Paulo e Silas, e os arrastaram para uma pra\xe7a \xe0 presen\xe7a dos magistrados."},{verse:20,en:"And brought them to the magistrates, saying, These men, being Jews, do exceedingly trouble our city,",pt:"E, apresentando-os aos magistrados, disseram: Estes homens, sendo judeus, est\xe3o perturbando muito a nossa cidade."},{verse:21,en:"And teach customs, which are not lawful for us to receive, neither to observe, being Romans.",pt:"e pregam costumes que n\xe3o nos \xe9 l\xedcito receber nem praticar, sendo n\xf3s romanos."},{verse:22,en:"And the multitude rose up together against them: and the magistrates rent off their clothes, and commanded to beat them.",pt:"A multid\xe3o levantou-se \xe0 uma contra eles, e os magistrados, rasgando-lhes os vestidos, mandaram a\xe7oit\xe1-los com varas."},{verse:23,en:"And when they had laid many stripes upon them, they cast them into prison, charging the jailer to keep them safely:",pt:"E, havendo-lhes dado muitos a\xe7oites, os lan\xe7aram na pris\xe3o, mandando ao carcereiro que os guardasse com seguran\xe7a."},{verse:24,en:"Who, having received such a charge, thrust them into the inner prison, and made their feet fast in the stocks.",pt:"Ele, tendo recebido tal ordem, os lan\xe7ou na pris\xe3o interior e lhes segurou os p\xe9s no tronco."},{verse:25,en:"And at midnight Paul and Silas prayed, and sang praises unto God: and the prisoners heard them.",pt:"Pela meia-noite Paulo e Silas oravam e cantavam hinos a Deus, enquanto os presos os escutavam."},{verse:26,en:"And suddenly there was a great earthquake, so that the foundations of the prison were shaken: and immediately all the doors were opened, and every one\u2019s bands were loosed.",pt:"De repente houve um t\xe3o grande terremoto que foram abalados os alicerces do c\xe1rcere, e logo se abriram todas as portas e foram soltos os grilh\xf5es de todos."},{verse:27,en:"And the keeper of the prison awaking out of his sleep, and seeing the prison doors open, he drew out his sword, and would have killed himself, supposing that the prisoners had been fled.",pt:"Ora, o carcereiro, tendo acordado e vendo abertas as portas da pris\xe3o, tirou a espada e ia suicidar-se, supondo que os presos tivessem fugido."},{verse:28,en:"But Paul cried with a loud voice, saying, Do thyself no harm: for we are all here.",pt:"Mas Paulo bradou em alta voz, dizendo: N\xe3o te fa\xe7as nenhum mal, porque todos aqui estamos."},{verse:29,en:"Then he called for a light, and sprang in, and came trembling, and fell down before Paul and Silas,",pt:"Tendo ele pedido luz, saltou dentro e, todo tr\xeamulo, se prostrou ante Paulo e Silas"},{verse:30,en:"And brought them out, and said, Sirs, what must I do to be saved?",pt:"e, tirando-os para fora, disse: Senhores, que me \xe9 necess\xe1rio fazer para me salvar?"},{verse:31,en:"And they said, Believe on the Lord Jesus Christ, and thou shalt be saved, and thy house.",pt:"Responderam eles: Cr\xea no Senhor Jesus e ser\xe1s salvo, tu e tua casa."},{verse:32,en:"And they spake unto him the word of the Lord, and to all that were in his house.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhe pregaram a palavra de Deus, e a todos os que estavam em sua casa."},{verse:33,en:"And he took them the same hour of the night, and washed their stripes; and was baptized, he and all his, straightway.",pt:"Tomando-os ele consigo naquela mesma hora da noite, lavou- lhes as feridas; e logo foi batizado, ele e todos os seus."},{verse:34,en:"And when he had brought them into his house, he set meat before them, and rejoiced, believing in God with all his house.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os fez subir para sua casa, p\xf4s-lhes a mesa e alegrou- se muito com toda a sua casa, por ter crido em Deus."},{verse:35,en:"And when it was day, the magistrates sent the serjeants, saying, Let those men go.",pt:"Quando amanheceu, os magistrados mandaram quadrilheiros a dizer: Soltai aqueles homens."},{verse:36,en:"And the keeper of the prison told this saying to Paul, The magistrates have sent to let you go: now therefore depart, and go in peace.",pt:"E o carcereiro transmitiu a Paulo estas palavras, dizendo: Os magistrados mandaram que fosseis soltos; agora, pois, sa\xed e ide em paz."},{verse:37,en:"But Paul said unto them, They have beaten us openly uncondemned, being Romans, and have cast us into prison; and now do they thrust us out privily? nay verily; but let them come themselves and fetch us out.",pt:"Mas Paulo respondeu-lhes: A\xe7oitaram-nos publicamente sem sermos condenados, sendo cidad\xe3os romanos, e nos lan\xe7aram na pris\xe3o, e agora encobertamente nos lan\xe7am fora? De modo nenhum ser\xe1 assim; mas venham eles mesmos e nos tirem."},{verse:38,en:"And the serjeants told these words unto the magistrates: and they feared, when they heard that they were Romans.",pt:"E os quadrilheiros foram dizer aos magistrados estas palavras, e estes temeram quando ouviram que eles eram romanos;"},{verse:39,en:"And they came and besought them, and brought them out, and desired them to depart out of the city.",pt:"vieram, pediram-lhes desculpas e, tirando-os para fora, rogavam que se retirassem da cidade."},{verse:40,en:"And they went out of the prison, and entered into the house of Lydia and when they had seen the brethren, they comforted them, and departed.",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles sa\xedram da pris\xe3o, entraram em casa de L\xeddia, e, vendo os irm\xe3os, os confortaram, e partiram."}]}}),821,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:17,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now when they had passed through Amphipolis and Apollonia, they came to Thessalonica, where was a synagogue of the Jews:",pt:"Tendo passado por Anf\xedpolis e Apol\xf4nia, chegaram a Tessal\xf4nica, onde havia uma sinagoga dos judeus."},{verse:2,en:"And Paul, as his manner was, went in unto them, and three sabbath days reasoned with them out of the scriptures,",pt:"Ora, Paulo, segundo o seu costume, foi ter com eles; e por tr\xeas s\xe1bados discutiu com eles as Escrituras,"},{verse:3,en:"Opening and alleging, that Christ must needs have suffered, and risen again from the dead; and that this Jesus, whom I preach unto you, is Christ.",pt:"expondo e demonstrando que era necess\xe1rio que o Cristo padecesse e ressuscitasse dentre os mortos; este Jesus que eu vos anuncio, dizia ele, \xe9 o Cristo."},{verse:4,en:"And some of them believed, and consorted with Paul and Silas; and of the devout Greeks a great multitude, and of the chief women not a few.",pt:"E alguns deles ficaram persuadidos e aderiram a Paulo e Silas, bem como grande multid\xe3o de gregos devotos e n\xe3o poucas mulheres de posi\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:5,en:"But the Jews which believed not, moved with envy, took unto them certain lewd fellows of the baser sort, and gathered a company, and set all the city on an uproar, and assaulted the house of Jason, and sought to bring them out to the people.",pt:"Mas os judeus, movidos de inveja, tomando consigo alguns homens maus dentre os vadios e ajuntando o povo, alvoro\xe7avam a cidade e, assaltando a casa de J\xe1son, os procuravam para entreg\xe1-los ao povo."},{verse:6,en:"And when they found them not, they drew Jason and certain brethren unto the rulers of the city, crying, These that have turned the world upside down are come hither also;",pt:"Por\xe9m, n\xe3o os achando, arrastaram J\xe1son e alguns irm\xe3os \xe0 presen\xe7a dos magistrados da cidade, clamando: Estes que t\xeam transtornado o mundo chegaram tamb\xe9m aqui,"},{verse:7,en:"Whom Jason hath received: and these all do contrary to the decrees of Caesar, saying that there is another king, one Jesus.",pt:"os quais J\xe1son acolheu; e todos eles procedem contra os decretos de C\xe9sar, dizendo haver outro rei, que \xe9 Jesus."},{verse:8,en:"And they troubled the people and the rulers of the city, when they heard these things.",pt:"Assim alvoro\xe7aram a multid\xe3o e os magistrados da cidade, que ouviram estas coisas."},{verse:9,en:"And when they had taken security of Jason, and of the other, they let them go.",pt:"Tendo, por\xe9m, recebido fian\xe7a de J\xe1son e dos demais, soltaram-nos."},{verse:10,en:"And the brethren immediately sent away Paul and Silas by night unto Berea: who coming thither went into the synagogue of the Jews.",pt:"E logo, de noite, os irm\xe3os enviaram Paulo e Silas para Ber\xe9ia; tendo eles ali chegado, foram \xe0 sinagoga dos judeus."},{verse:11,en:"These were more noble than those in Thessalonica, in that they received the word with all readiness of mind, and searched the scriptures daily, whether those things were so.",pt:"Ora, estes eram mais nobres do que os de Tessal\xf4nica, porque receberam a palavra com toda avidez, examinando diariamente as Escrituras para ver se estas coisas eram assim."},{verse:12,en:"Therefore many of them believed; also of honourable women which were Greeks, and of men, not a few.",pt:"De sorte que muitos deles creram, bem como bom n\xfamero de mulheres gregas de alta posi\xe7\xe3o e n\xe3o poucos homens."},{verse:13,en:"But when the Jews of Thessalonica had knowledge that the word of God was preached of Paul at Berea, they came thither also, and stirred up the people.",pt:"Mas, logo que os judeus de Tessal\xf4nica souberam que tamb\xe9m em Ber\xe9ia era anunciada por Paulo a palavra de Deus, foram l\xe1 agitar e sublevar as multid\xf5es."},{verse:14,en:"And then immediately the brethren sent away Paul to go as it were to the sea: but Silas and Timotheus abode there still.",pt:"Imediatamente os irm\xe3os fizeram sair a Paulo para que fosse at\xe9 o mar; mas Silas e Tim\xf3teo ficaram ali."},{verse:15,en:"And they that conducted Paul brought him unto Athens: and receiving a commandment unto Silas and Timotheus for to come to him with all speed, they departed.",pt:"E os que acompanhavam a Paulo levaram-no at\xe9 Atenas e, tendo recebido ordem para Silas e Tim\xf3teo a fim de que estes fossem ter com ele o mais depressa poss\xedvel, partiram."},{verse:16,en:"Now while Paul waited for them at Athens, his spirit was stirred in him, when he saw the city wholly given to idolatry.",pt:"Enquanto Paulo os esperava em Atenas, revoltava-se nele o seu esp\xedrito, vendo a cidade cheia de \xeddolos."},{verse:17,en:"Therefore disputed he in the synagogue with the Jews, and with the devout persons, and in the market daily with them that met with him.",pt:"Argumentava, portanto, na sinagoga com os judeus e os gregos devotos, e na pra\xe7a todos os dias com os que se encontravam ali."},{verse:18,en:"Then certain philosophers of the Epicureans, and of the Stoicks, encountered him. And some said, What will this babbler say? other some, He seemeth to be a setter forth of strange gods: because he preached unto them Jesus, and the resurrection.",pt:"Ora, alguns fil\xf3sofos epicureus e est\xf3icos disputavam com ele. Uns diziam: Que quer dizer este paroleiro? E outros: Parece ser pregador de deuses estranhos; pois anunciava a boa nova de Jesus e a ressurrei\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:19,en:"And they took him, and brought him unto Areopagus, saying, May we know what this new doctrine, whereof thou speakest, is?",pt:"E, tomando-o, o levaram ao Are\xf3pago, dizendo: Poderemos n\xf3s saber que nova doutrina \xe9 essa de que falas?"},{verse:20,en:"For thou bringest certain strange things to our ears: we would know therefore what these things mean.",pt:"Pois tu nos trazes aos ouvidos coisas estranhas; portanto queremos saber o que vem a ser isto."},{verse:21,en:"(For all the Athenians and strangers which were there spent their time in nothing else, but either to tell, or to hear some new thing.)",pt:"Ora, todos os atenienses, como tamb\xe9m os estrangeiros que ali residiam, de nenhuma outra coisa se ocupavam sen\xe3o de contar ou de ouvir a \xfaltima novidade."},{verse:22,en:"Then Paul stood in the midst of Mars\u2019 hill, and said, Ye men of Athens, I perceive that in all things ye are too superstitious.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Paulo, estando de p\xe9 no meio do Are\xf3pago, disse: Var\xf5es atenienses, em tudo vejo que sois excepcionalmente religiosos;"},{verse:23,en:"For as I passed by, and beheld your devotions, I found an altar with this inscription, TO THE UNKNOWN GOD. Whom therefore ye ignorantly worship, him declare I unto you.",pt:"Porque, passando eu e observando os objetos do vosso culto, encontrei tamb\xe9m um altar em que estava escrito: AO DEUS DESCONHECIDO. Esse, pois, que v\xf3s honrais sem o conhecer, \xe9 o que vos anuncio."},{verse:24,en:"God that made the world and all things therein, seeing that he is Lord of heaven and earth, dwelleth not in temples made with hands;",pt:"O Deus que fez o mundo e tudo o que nele h\xe1, sendo ele Senhor do c\xe9u e da terra, n\xe3o habita em templos feitos por m\xe3os de homens;"},{verse:25,en:"Neither is worshipped with men\u2019s hands, as though he needed any thing, seeing he giveth to all life, and breath, and all things;",pt:"nem tampouco \xe9 servido por m\xe3os humanas, como se necessitasse de alguma coisa; pois ele mesmo \xe9 quem d\xe1 a todos a vida, a respira\xe7\xe3o e todas as coisas;"},{verse:26,en:"And hath made of one blood all nations of men for to dwell on all the face of the earth, and hath determined the times before appointed, and the bounds of their habitation;",pt:"e de um s\xf3 fez todas as ra\xe7as dos homens, para habitarem sobre toda a face da terra, determinando-lhes os tempos j\xe1 dantes ordenados e os limites da sua habita\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:27,en:"That they should seek the Lord, if haply they might feel after him, and find him, though he be not far from every one of us:",pt:"para que buscassem a Deus, se porventura, tateando, o pudessem achar, o qual, todavia, n\xe3o est\xe1 longe de cada um de n\xf3s;"},{verse:28,en:"For in him we live, and move, and have our being; as certain also of your own poets have said, For we are also his offspring.",pt:"porque nele vivemos, e nos movemos, e existimos; como tamb\xe9m alguns dos vossos poetas disseram: Pois dele tamb\xe9m somos gera\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:29,en:"Forasmuch then as we are the offspring of God, we ought not to think that the Godhead is like unto gold, or silver, or stone, graven by art and man\u2019s device.",pt:"Sendo n\xf3s, pois, gera\xe7\xe3o de Deus, n\xe3o devemos pensar que a divindade seja semelhante ao ouro, ou \xe0 prata, ou \xe0 pedra esculpida pela arte e imagina\xe7\xe3o do homem."},{verse:30,en:"And the times of this ignorance God winked at; but now commandeth all men every where to repent:",pt:"Mas Deus, n\xe3o levando em conta os tempos da ignor\xe2ncia, manda agora que todos os homens em todo lugar se arrependam;"},{verse:31,en:"Because he hath appointed a day, in the which he will judge the world in righteousness by that man whom he hath ordained; whereof he hath given assurance unto all men, in that he hath raised him from the dead.",pt:"porquanto determinou um dia em que com justi\xe7a h\xe1 de julgar o mundo, por meio do var\xe3o que para isso ordenou; e disso tem dado certeza a todos, ressuscitando-o dentre os mortos."},{verse:32,en:"And when they heard of the resurrection of the dead, some mocked: and others said, We will hear thee again of this matter.",pt:"Mas quando ouviram falar em ressurrei\xe7\xe3o de mortos, uns escarneciam, e outros diziam: Acerca disso te ouviremos ainda outra vez."},{verse:33,en:"So Paul departed from among them.",pt:"Assim Paulo saiu do meio deles."},{verse:34,en:"Howbeit certain men clave unto him, and believed: among the which was Dionysius the Areopagite, and a woman named Damaris, and others with them.",pt:"Todavia, alguns homens aderiram a ele, e creram, entre os quais Dion\xedsio, o areopagita, e uma mulher por nome D\xe2maris, e com eles outros."}]}}),822,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:18,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After these things Paul departed from Athens, and came to Corinth;",pt:"Depois disto Paulo partiu para Atenas e chegou a Corinto."},{verse:2,en:"And found a certain Jew named Aquila, born in Pontus, lately come from Italy, with his wife Priscilla; (because that Claudius had commanded all Jews to depart from Rome:) and came unto them.",pt:"E encontrando um judeu por nome \xc1q\xfcila, natural do Ponto, que pouco antes viera da It\xe1lia, e Priscila, sua mulher (porque Cl\xe1udio tinha decretado que todos os judeus sa\xedssem de Roma), foi ter com eles,"},{verse:3,en:"And because he was of the same craft, he abode with them, and wrought: for by their occupation they were tentmakers.",pt:"e, por ser do mesmo of\xedcio, com eles morava, e juntos trabalhavam; pois eram, por of\xedcio, fabricantes de tendas."},{verse:4,en:"And he reasoned in the synagogue every sabbath, and persuaded the Jews and the Greeks.",pt:"Ele discutia todos os s\xe1bados na sinagoga, e persuadia a judeus e gregos."},{verse:5,en:"And when Silas and Timotheus were come from Macedonia, Paul was pressed in the spirit, and testified to the Jews that Jesus was Christ.",pt:"Quando Silas e Tim\xf3teo desceram da Maced\xf4nia, Paulo dedicou- se inteiramente \xe0 palavra, testificando aos judeus que Jesus era o Cristo."},{verse:6,en:"And when they opposed themselves, and blasphemed, he shook his raiment, and said unto them, Your blood be upon your own heads; I am clean: from henceforth I will go unto the Gentiles.",pt:"Como estes, por\xe9m, se opusessem e proferissem inj\xfarias, sacudiu ele as vestes e disse-lhes: O vosso sangue seja sobre a vossa cabe\xe7a; eu estou limpo, e desde agora vou para os gentios."},{verse:7,en:"And he departed thence, and entered into a certain man\u2019s house, named Justus, one that worshipped God, whose house joined hard to the synagogue.",pt:"E saindo dali, entrou em casa de um homem temente a Deus, chamado Tito Justo, cuja casa ficava junto da sinagoga."},{verse:8,en:"And Crispus, the chief ruler of the synagogue, believed on the Lord with all his house; and many of the Corinthians hearing believed, and were baptized.",pt:"Crispo, chefe da sinagoga, creu no Senhor com toda a sua casa; e muitos dos cor\xedntios, ouvindo, criam e eram batizados."},{verse:9,en:"Then spake the Lord to Paul in the night by a vision, Be not afraid, but speak, and hold not thy peace:",pt:"E de noite disse o Senhor em vis\xe3o a Paulo: N\xe3o temas, mas fala e n\xe3o te cales;"},{verse:10,en:"For I am with thee, and no man shall set on thee to hurt thee: for I have much people in this city.",pt:"porque eu estou contigo e ningu\xe9m te acometer\xe1 para te fazer mal, pois tenho muito povo nesta cidade."},{verse:11,en:"And he continued there a year and six months, teaching the word of God among them.",pt:"E ficou ali um ano e seis meses, ensinando entre eles a palavra de Deus."},{verse:12,en:"And when Gallio was the deputy of Achaia, the Jews made insurrection with one accord against Paul, and brought him to the judgment seat,",pt:"Sendo G\xe1lio proc\xf4nsul da Acaia, levantaram-se os judeus de comum acordo contra Paulo, e o levaram ao tribunal,"},{verse:13,en:"Saying, This fellow persuadeth men to worship God contrary to the law.",pt:"dizendo: Este persuade os homens a render culto a Deus de um modo contr\xe1rio \xe0 lei."},{verse:14,en:"And when Paul was now about to open his mouth, Gallio said unto the Jews, If it were a matter of wrong or wicked lewdness, O ye Jews, reason would that I should bear with you:",pt:"E, quando Paulo estava para abrir a boca, disse G\xe1lio aos judeus: Se de fato houvesse, \xf3 judeus, algum agravo ou crime perverso, com raz\xe3o eu vos sofreria;"},{verse:15,en:"But if it be a question of words and names, and of your law, look ye to it; for I will be no judge of such matters.",pt:"mas, se s\xe3o quest\xf5es de palavras, de nomes, e da vossa lei, disso cuidai v\xf3s mesmos; porque eu n\xe3o quero ser juiz destas coisas."},{verse:16,en:"And he drave them from the judgment seat.",pt:"E expulsou-os do tribunal."},{verse:17,en:"Then all the Greeks took Sosthenes, the chief ruler of the synagogue, and beat him before the judgment seat. And Gallio cared for none of those things.",pt:"Ent\xe3o todos agarraram S\xf3stenes, chefe da sinagoga, e o espancavam diante do tribunal; e G\xe1lio n\xe3o se importava com nenhuma dessas coisas."},{verse:18,en:"And Paul after this tarried there yet a good while, and then took his leave of the brethren, and sailed thence into Syria, and with him Priscilla and Aquila; having shorn his head in Cenchrea: for he had a vow.",pt:"Paulo, tendo ficado ali ainda muitos dias, despediu-se dos irm\xe3os e navegou para a S\xedria, e com ele Priscila e \xc1q\xfcila, havendo rapado a cabe\xe7a em Cencr\xe9ia, porque tinha voto."},{verse:19,en:"And he came to Ephesus, and left them there: but he himself entered into the synagogue, and reasoned with the Jews.",pt:"E eles chegaram a \xc9feso, onde Paulo os deixou; e tendo entrado na sinagoga, discutia com os judeus."},{verse:20,en:"When they desired him to tarry longer time with them, he consented not;",pt:"Estes rogavam que ficasse por mais algum tempo, mas ele n\xe3o anuiu,"},{verse:21,en:"But bade them farewell, saying, I must by all means keep this feast that cometh in Jerusalem: but I will return again unto you, if God will. And he sailed from Ephesus.",pt:"antes se despediu deles, dizendo: Se Deus quiser, de novo voltarei a v\xf3s; e navegou de \xc9feso."},{verse:22,en:"And when he had landed at Caesarea, and gone up, and saluted the church, he went down to Antioch.",pt:"Tendo chegado a Cesar\xe9ia, subiu a Jerusal\xe9m e saudou a igreja, e desceu a Antioquia."},{verse:23,en:"And after he had spent some time there, he departed, and went over all the country of Galatia and Phrygia in order, strengthening all the disciples.",pt:"E, tendo demorado ali algum tempo, partiu, passando sucessivamente pela regi\xe3o da Gal\xe1cia e da Fr\xedgia, fortalecendo a todos os disc\xedpulos."},{verse:24,en:"And a certain Jew named Apollos, born at Alexandria, an eloquent man, and mighty in the scriptures, came to Ephesus.",pt:"Ora, chegou a \xc9feso certo judeu chamado Apolo, natural de Alexandria, homem eloq\xfcente e poderoso nas Escrituras."},{verse:25,en:"This man was instructed in the way of the Lord; and being fervent in the spirit, he spake and taught diligently the things of the Lord, knowing only the baptism of John.",pt:"Era ele instru\xeddo no caminho do Senhor e, sendo fervoroso de esp\xedrito, falava e ensinava com precis\xe3o as coisas concernentes a Jesus, conhecendo entretanto somente o batismo de Jo\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"And he began to speak boldly in the synagogue: whom when Aquila and Priscilla had heard, they took him unto them, and expounded unto him the way of God more perfectly.",pt:"Ele come\xe7ou a falar ousadamente na sinagoga: mas quando Priscila e \xc1q\xfcila o ouviram, levaram-no consigo e lhe expuseram com mais precis\xe3o o caminho de Deus."},{verse:27,en:"And when he was disposed to pass into Achaia, the brethren wrote, exhorting the disciples to receive him: who, when he was come, helped them much which had believed through grace:",pt:"Querendo ele passar \xe0 Ac\xe1ia, os irm\xe3os o animaram e escreveram aos disc\xedpulos que o recebessem; e tendo ele chegado, auxiliou muito aos que pela gra\xe7a haviam crido."},{verse:28,en:"For he mightily convinced the Jews, and that publickly, shewing by the scriptures that Jesus was Christ.",pt:"Pois com grande poder refutava publicamente os judeus, demonstrando pelas escrituras que Jesus era o Cristo."}]}}),823,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:19,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass, that, while Apollos was at Corinth, Paul having passed through the upper coasts came to Ephesus: and finding certain disciples,",pt:"E sucedeu que, enquanto Apolo estava em Corinto, Paulo tendo atravessado as regi\xf5es mais altas, chegou a \xc9feso e, achando ali alguns disc\xedpulos,"},{verse:2,en:"He said unto them, Have ye received the Holy Ghost since ye believed? And they said unto him, We have not so much as heard whether there be any Holy Ghost.",pt:"perguntou-lhes: Recebestes v\xf3s o Esp\xedrito Santo quando crestes? Responderam-lhe eles: N\xe3o, nem sequer ouvimos que haja Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:3,en:"And he said unto them, Unto what then were ye baptized? And they said, Unto John\u2019s baptism.",pt:"Tornou-lhes ele: Em que fostes batizados ent\xe3o? E eles disseram: No batismo de Jo\xe3o."},{verse:4,en:"Then said Paul, John verily baptized with the baptism of repentance, saying unto the people, that they should believe on him which should come after him, that is, on Christ Jesus.",pt:"Mas Paulo respondeu: Jo\xe3o administrou o batismo do arrependimento, dizendo ao povo que cresse naquele que ap\xf3s ele havia de vir, isto \xe9, em Jesus."},{verse:5,en:"When they heard this, they were baptized in the name of the Lord Jesus.",pt:"Quando ouviram isso, foram batizados em nome do Senhor Jesus."},{verse:6,en:"And when Paul had laid his hands upon them, the Holy Ghost came on them; and they spake with tongues, and prophesied.",pt:"Havendo-lhes Paulo imposto as m\xe3os, veio sobre eles o Esp\xedrito Santo, e falavam em l\xednguas e profetizavam."},{verse:7,en:"And all the men were about twelve.",pt:"E eram ao todo uns doze homens."},{verse:8,en:"And he went into the synagogue, and spake boldly for the space of three months, disputing and persuading the things concerning the kingdom of God.",pt:"Paulo, entrando na sinagoga, falou ousadamente por espa\xe7o de tr\xeas meses, discutindo e persuadindo acerca do reino de Deus."},{verse:9,en:"But when divers were hardened, and believed not, but spake evil of that way before the multitude, he departed from them, and separated the disciples, disputing daily in the school of one Tyrannus.",pt:"Mas, como alguns deles se endurecessem e n\xe3o obedecessem, falando mal do Caminho diante da multid\xe3o, apartou-se deles e separou os disc\xedpulos, discutindo diariamente na escola de Tirano."},{verse:10,en:"And this continued by the space of two years; so that all they which dwelt in Asia heard the word of the Lord Jesus, both Jews and Greeks.",pt:"Durou isto por dois anos; de maneira que todos os que habitavam na \xc1sia, tanto judeus como gregos, ouviram a palavra do Senhor."},{verse:11,en:"And God wrought special miracles by the hands of Paul:",pt:"E Deus pelas m\xe3os de Paulo fazia milagres extraordin\xe1rios,"},{verse:12,en:"So that from his body were brought unto the sick handkerchiefs or aprons, and the diseases departed from them, and the evil spirits went out of them.",pt:"de sorte que len\xe7os e aventais eram levados do seu corpo aos enfermos, e as doen\xe7as os deixavam e sa\xedam deles os esp\xedritos malignos."},{verse:13,en:"Then certain of the vagabond Jews, exorcists, took upon them to call over them which had evil spirits the name of the Lord Jesus, saying, We adjure you by Jesus whom Paul preacheth.",pt:"Ora, tamb\xe9m alguns dos exorcistas judeus, ambulantes, tentavam invocar o nome de Jesus sobre os que tinham esp\xedritos malignos, dizendo: Esconjuro-vos por Jesus a quem Paulo prega."},{verse:14,en:"And there were seven sons of one Sceva, a Jew, and chief of the priests, which did so.",pt:"E os que faziam isto eram sete filhos de Ceva, judeu, um dos principais sacerdotes."},{verse:15,en:"And the evil spirit answered and said, Jesus I know, and Paul I know; but who are ye?",pt:"respondendo, por\xe9m, o esp\xedrito maligno, disse: A Jesus conhe\xe7o, e sei quem \xe9 Paulo; mas v\xf3s, quem sois?"},{verse:16,en:"And the man in whom the evil spirit was leaped on them, and overcame them, and prevailed against them, so that they fled out of that house naked and wounded.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o homem, no qual estava o esp\xedrito maligno, saltando sobre eles, apoderou-se de dois e prevaleceu contra eles, de modo que, nus e feridos, fugiram daquela casa."},{verse:17,en:"And this was known to all the Jews and Greeks also dwelling at Ephesus; and fear fell on them all, and the name of the Lord Jesus was magnified.",pt:"E isto tornou-se conhecido de todos os que moravam em \xc9feso, tanto judeus como gregos; e veio temor sobre todos eles, e o nome do Senhor Jesus era engrandecido."},{verse:18,en:"And many that believed came, and confessed, and shewed their deeds.",pt:"E muitos dos que haviam crido vinham, confessando e revelando os seus feitos."},{verse:19,en:"Many of them also which used curious arts brought their books together, and burned them before all men: and they counted the price of them, and found it fifty thousand pieces of silver.",pt:"Muitos tamb\xe9m dos que tinham praticado artes m\xe1gicas ajuntaram os seus livros e os queimaram na presen\xe7a de todos; e, calculando o valor deles, acharam que montava a cinq\xfcenta mil moedas de prata."},{verse:20,en:"So mightily grew the word of God and prevailed.",pt:"Assim a palavra do Senhor crescia poderosamente e prevalecia."},{verse:21,en:"After these things were ended, Paul purposed in the spirit, when he had passed through Macedonia and Achaia, to go to Jerusalem, saying, After I have been there, I must also see Rome.",pt:"Cumpridas estas coisas, Paulo prop\xf4s, em seu esp\xedrito, ir a Jerusal\xe9m, passando pela Maced\xf4nia e pela Acaia, porque dizia: Depois de haver estado ali, \xe9-me necess\xe1rio ver tamb\xe9m Roma."},{verse:22,en:"So he sent into Macedonia two of them that ministered unto him, Timotheus and Erastus; but he himself stayed in Asia for a season.",pt:"E, enviando \xe0 Maced\xf4nia dois dos que o auxiliavam, Tim\xf3teo e Erasto, ficou ele por algum tempo na \xc1sia."},{verse:23,en:"And the same time there arose no small stir about that way.",pt:"Por esse tempo houve um n\xe3o pequeno alvoro\xe7o acerca do Caminho."},{verse:24,en:"For a certain man named Demetrius, a silversmith, which made silver shrines for Diana, brought no small gain unto the craftsmen;",pt:"Porque certo ourives, por nome Dem\xe9trio, que fazia da prata miniaturas do templo de Diana, proporcionava n\xe3o pequeno neg\xf3cio aos art\xedfices,"},{verse:25,en:"Whom he called together with the workmen of like occupation, and said, Sirs, ye know that by this craft we have our wealth.",pt:"os quais ele ajuntou, bem como os oficiais de obras semelhantes, e disse: Senhores, v\xf3s bem sabeis que desta ind\xfastria nos vem a prosperidade,"},{verse:26,en:"Moreover ye see and hear, that not alone at Ephesus, but almost throughout all Asia, this Paul hath persuaded and turned away much people, saying that they be no gods, which are made with hands:",pt:"e estais vendo e ouvindo que n\xe3o \xe9 s\xf3 em \xc9feso, mas em quase toda a \xc1sia, este Paulo tem persuadido e desviado muita gente, dizendo n\xe3o serem deuses os que s\xe3o feitos por m\xe3os humanas."},{verse:27,en:"So that not only this our craft is in danger to be set at nought; but also that the temple of the great goddess Diana should be despised, and her magnificence should be destroyed, whom all Asia and the world worshippeth.",pt:"E n\xe3o somente h\xe1 perigo de que esta nossa profiss\xe3o caia em descr\xe9dito, mas tamb\xe9m que o templo da grande deusa Diana seja estimado em nada, vindo mesmo a ser destitu\xedda da sua majestade aquela a quem toda a \xc1sia e o mundo adoram."},{verse:28,en:"And when they heard these sayings, they were full of wrath, and cried out, saying, Great is Diana of the Ephesians.",pt:"Ao ouvirem isso, encheram-se de ira, e clamavam, dizendo: Grande \xe9 a Diana dos ef\xe9sios!"},{verse:29,en:"And the whole city was filled with confusion: and having caught Gaius and Aristarchus, men of Macedonia, Paul\u2019s companions in travel, they rushed with one accord into the theatre.",pt:"A cidade encheu-se de confus\xe3o, e todos \xe0 uma correram ao teatro, arrebatando a Gaio e a Aristarco, maced\xf4nios, companheiros de Paulo na viagem."},{verse:30,en:"And when Paul would have entered in unto the people, the disciples suffered him not.",pt:"Querendo Paulo apresentar-se ao povo, os disc\xedpulos n\xe3o lho permitiram."},{verse:31,en:"And certain of the chief of Asia, which were his friends, sent unto him, desiring him that he would not adventure himself into the theatre.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m alguns dos asiarcas, sendo amigos dele, mandaram rogar-lhe que n\xe3o se arriscasse a ir ao teatro."},{verse:32,en:"Some therefore cried one thing, and some another: for the assembly was confused; and the more part knew not wherefore they were come together.",pt:"Uns, pois, gritavam de um modo, outros de outro; porque a assembl\xe9ia estava em confus\xe3o, e a maior parte deles nem sabia por que causa se tinham ajuntado."},{verse:33,en:"And they drew Alexander out of the multitude, the Jews putting him forward. And Alexander beckoned with the hand, and would have made his defence unto the people.",pt:"Ent\xe3o tiraram dentre a turba a Alexandre, a quem os judeus impeliram para a frente; e Alexandre, acenando com a m\xe3o, queria apresentar uma defesa ao povo."},{verse:34,en:"But when they knew that he was a Jew, all with one voice about the space of two hours cried out, Great is Diana of the Ephesians.",pt:"Mas quando perceberam que ele era judeu, todos a uma voz gritaram por quase duas horas: Grande \xe9 a Diana dos ef\xe9sios!"},{verse:35,en:"And when the townclerk had appeased the people, he said, Ye men of Ephesus, what man is there that knoweth not how that the city of the Ephesians is a worshipper of the great goddess Diana, and of the image which fell down from Jupiter?",pt:"Havendo o escriv\xe3o conseguido apaziguar a turba, disse: Var\xf5es ef\xe9sios, que homem h\xe1 que n\xe3o saiba que a cidade dos ef\xe9sios \xe9 a guardadora do templo da grande deusa Diana, e da imagem que caiu de J\xfapiter?"},{verse:36,en:"Seeing then that these things cannot be spoken against, ye ought to be quiet, and to do nothing rashly.",pt:"Ora, visto que estas coisas n\xe3o podem ser contestadas, conv\xe9m que vos aquieteis e nada fa\xe7ais precipitadamente."},{verse:37,en:"For ye have brought hither these men, which are neither robbers of churches, nor yet blasphemers of your goddess.",pt:"Porque estes homens que aqui trouxestes, nem s\xe3o sacr\xedlegos nem blasfemadores da nossa deusa."},{verse:38,en:"Wherefore if Demetrius, and the craftsmen which are with him, have a matter against any man, the law is open, and there are deputies: let them implead one another.",pt:"Todavia, se Dem\xe9trio e os art\xedfices que est\xe3o com ele t\xeam alguma queixa contra algu\xe9m, os tribunais est\xe3o abertos e h\xe1 proc\xf4nsules: que se acusem uns aos outros."},{verse:39,en:"But if ye enquire any thing concerning other matters, it shall be determined in a lawful assembly.",pt:"E se demandais alguma outra coisa, averiguar-se-\xe1 em leg\xedtima assembl\xe9ia."},{verse:40,en:"For we are in danger to be called in question for this day\u2019s uproar, there being no cause whereby we may give an account of this concourse.",pt:"Pois at\xe9 corremos perigo de sermos acusados de sedi\xe7\xe3o pelos acontecimentos de hoje, n\xe3o havendo motivo algum com que possamos justificar este ajuntamento."},{verse:41,en:"And when he had thus spoken, he dismissed the assembly.",pt:"E, tendo dito isto, despediu a assembl\xe9ia."}]}}),824,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:20,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And after the uproar was ceased, Paul called unto him the disciples, and embraced them, and departed for to go into Macedonia.",pt:"Depois que cessou o alvoro\xe7o, Paulo mandou chamar os disc\xedpulos e, tendo-os exortado, despediu-se e partiu para a Maced\xf4nia."},{verse:2,en:"And when he had gone over those parts, and had given them much exhortation, he came into Greece,",pt:"E, havendo andado por aquelas regi\xf5es, exortando os disc\xedpulos com muitas palavras, veio \xe0 Gr\xe9cia."},{verse:3,en:"And there abode three months. And when the Jews laid wait for him, as he was about to sail into Syria, he purposed to return through Macedonia.",pt:"Depois de passar ali tr\xeas meses, visto terem os judeus armado uma cilada contra ele quando ia embarcar para a S\xedria, determinou voltar pela Maced\xf4nia."},{verse:4,en:"And there accompanied him into Asia Sopater of Berea; and of the Thessalonians, Aristarchus and Secundus; and Gaius of Derbe, and Timotheus; and of Asia, Tychicus and Trophimus.",pt:"Acompanhou-o S\xf3pater de Ber\xe9ia, filho de Pirro; bem como dos de Tessal\xf4nica, Aristarco e Segundo; Gaio de Derbe e Tim\xf3teo; e dos da \xc1sia, T\xedquico e Tr\xf3fimo."},{verse:5,en:"These going before tarried for us at Troas.",pt:"Estes por\xe9m, foram adiante e nos esperavam em Tr\xf4ade."},{verse:6,en:"And we sailed away from Philippi after the days of unleavened bread, and came unto them to Troas in five days; where we abode seven days.",pt:"E n\xf3s, depois dos dias dos p\xe3es \xe1zimos, navegamos de Filipos, e em cinco dias fomos ter com eles em Tr\xf4ade, onde nos detivemos sete dias."},{verse:7,en:"And upon the first day of the week, when the disciples came together to break bread, Paul preached unto them, ready to depart on the morrow; and continued his speech until midnight.",pt:"No primeiro dia da semana, tendo-nos reunido a fim de partir o p\xe3o, Paulo, que havia de sair no dia seguinte, falava com eles, e prolongou o seu discurso at\xe9 a meia-noite."},{verse:8,en:"And there were many lights in the upper chamber, where they were gathered together.",pt:"Ora, havia muitas luzes no cen\xe1culo onde est\xe1vamos reunidos."},{verse:9,en:"And there sat in a window a certain young man named Eutychus, being fallen into a deep sleep: and as Paul was long preaching, he sunk down with sleep, and fell down from the third loft, and was taken up dead.",pt:"E certo jovem, por nome \xe5utico, que estava sentado na janela, tomado de um sono profundo enquanto Paulo prolongava ainda mais o seu serm\xe3o, vencido pelo sono caiu do terceiro andar abaixo, e foi levantado morto."},{verse:10,en:"And Paul went down, and fell on him, and embracing him said, Trouble not yourselves; for his life is in him.",pt:"Tendo Paulo descido, debru\xe7ou-se sobre ele e, abra\xe7ando-o, disse: N\xe3o vos perturbeis, pois a sua alma est\xe1 nele."},{verse:11,en:"When he therefore was come up again, and had broken bread, and eaten, and talked a long while, even till break of day, so he departed.",pt:"Ent\xe3o subiu, e tendo partido o p\xe3o e comido, ainda lhes falou largamente at\xe9 o romper do dia; e assim partiu."},{verse:12,en:"And they brought the young man alive, and were not a little comforted.",pt:"E levaram vivo o jovem e ficaram muito consolados."},{verse:13,en:"And we went before to ship, and sailed unto Assos, there intending to take in Paul: for so had he appointed, minding himself to go afoot.",pt:"N\xf3s, por\xe9m, tomando a dianteira e embarcando, navegamos para Ass\xf4s, onde dev\xedamos receber a Paulo, porque ele, havendo de ir por terra, assim o ordenara."},{verse:14,en:"And when he met with us at Assos, we took him in, and came to Mitylene.",pt:"E, logo que nos alcan\xe7ou em Ass\xf4s, recebemo-lo a bordo e fomos a Mitilene;"},{verse:15,en:"And we sailed thence, and came the next day over against Chios; and the next day we arrived at Samos, and tarried at Trogyllium; and the next day we came to Miletus.",pt:"e navegando dali, chegamos no dia imediato defronte de Quios, no outro aportamos a Samos e [e tendo-nos demorado em Trog\xedlio, chegamos,] no dia seguinte a Mileto."},{verse:16,en:"For Paul had determined to sail by Ephesus, because he would not spend the time in Asia: for he hasted, if it were possible for him, to be at Jerusalem the day of Pentecost.",pt:"Porque Paulo havia determinado passar ao largo de \xc9feso, para n\xe3o se demorar na \xc1sia; pois se apressava para estar em Jerusal\xe9m no dia de Pentecostes, se lhe fosse poss\xedvel."},{verse:17,en:"And from Miletus he sent to Ephesus, and called the elders of the church.",pt:"De Mileto mandou a \xc9feso chamar os anci\xe3os da igreja."},{verse:18,en:"And when they were come to him, he said unto them, Ye know, from the first day that I came into Asia, after what manner I have been with you at all seasons,",pt:"E, tendo eles chegado, disse-lhes: V\xf3s bem sabeis de que modo me tenho portado entre v\xf3s sempre, desde o primeiro dia em que entrei na \xc1sia,"},{verse:19,en:"Serving the Lord with all humility of mind, and with many tears, and temptations, which befell me by the lying in wait of the Jews:",pt:"servindo ao Senhor com toda a humildade, e com l\xe1grimas e prova\xe7\xf5es que pelas ciladas dos judeus me sobrevieram;"},{verse:20,en:"And how I kept back nothing that was profitable unto you, but have shewed you, and have taught you publickly, and from house to house,",pt:"como n\xe3o me esquivei de vos anunciar coisa alguma que \xfatil seja, ensinando-vos publicamente e de casa em casa,"},{verse:21,en:"Testifying both to the Jews, and also to the Greeks, repentance toward God, and faith toward our Lord Jesus Christ.",pt:"testificando, tanto a judeus como a gregos, o arrependimento para com Deus e a f\xe9 em nosso Senhor Jesus."},{verse:22,en:"And now, behold, I go bound in the spirit unto Jerusalem, not knowing the things that shall befall me there:",pt:"Agora, eis que eu, constrangido no meu esp\xedrito, vou a Jerusal\xe9m, n\xe3o sabendo o que ali acontecer\xe1,"},{verse:23,en:"Save that the Holy Ghost witnesseth in every city, saying that bonds and afflictions abide me.",pt:"sen\xe3o o que o Esp\xedrito Santo me testifica, de cidade em cidade, dizendo que me esperam pris\xf5es e tribula\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:24,en:"But none of these things move me, neither count I my life dear unto myself, so that I might finish my course with joy, and the ministry, which I have received of the Lord Jesus, to testify the gospel of the grace of God.",pt:"mas em nada tenho a minha vida como preciosa para mim, contando que complete a minha carreira e o minist\xe9rio que recebi do Senhor Jesus, para dar testemunho do evangelho da gra\xe7a de Deus."},{verse:25,en:"And now, behold, I know that ye all, among whom I have gone preaching the kingdom of God, shall see my face no more.",pt:"E eis agora, sei que nenhum de v\xf3s, por entre os quais passei pregando o reino de Deus, jamais tornar\xe1 a ver o meu rosto."},{verse:26,en:"Wherefore I take you to record this day, that I am pure from the blood of all men.",pt:"Portanto, no dia de hoje, vos protesto que estou limpo do sangue de todos."},{verse:27,en:"For I have not shunned to declare unto you all the counsel of God.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o me esquivei de vos anunciar todo o conselho de Deus."},{verse:28,en:"Take heed therefore unto yourselves, and to all the flock, over the which the Holy Ghost hath made you overseers, to feed the church of God, which he hath purchased with his own blood.",pt:"Cuidai pois de v\xf3s mesmos e de todo o rebanho sobre o qual o Esp\xedrito Santo vos constituiu bispos, para apascentardes a igreja de Deus, que ele adquiriu com seu pr\xf3prio sangue."},{verse:29,en:"For I know this, that after my departing shall grievous wolves enter in among you, not sparing the flock.",pt:"Eu sei que depois da minha partida entrar\xe3o no meio de v\xf3s lobos cru\xe9is que n\xe3o poupar\xe3o rebanho,"},{verse:30,en:"Also of your own selves shall men arise, speaking perverse things, to draw away disciples after them.",pt:"e que dentre v\xf3s mesmos se levantar\xe3o homens, falando coisas perversas para atrair os disc\xedpulos ap\xf3s si."},{verse:31,en:"Therefore watch, and remember, that by the space of three years I ceased not to warn every one night and day with tears.",pt:"Portanto vigiai, lembrando-vos de que por tr\xeas anos n\xe3o cessei noite e dia de admoestar com l\xe1grimas a cada um de v\xf3s."},{verse:32,en:"And now, brethren, I commend you to God, and to the word of his grace, which is able to build you up, and to give you an inheritance among all them which are sanctified.",pt:"Agora pois, vos encomendo a Deus e \xe0 palavra da sua gra\xe7a, \xe0quele que \xe9 poderoso para vos edificar e dar heran\xe7a entre todos os que s\xe3o santificados."},{verse:33,en:"I have coveted no man\u2019s silver, or gold, or apparel.",pt:"De ningu\xe9m cobicei prata, nem ouro, nem vestes."},{verse:34,en:"Yea, ye yourselves know, that these hands have ministered unto my necessities, and to them that were with me.",pt:"V\xf3s mesmos sabeis que estas m\xe3os proveram as minhas necessidades e as dos que estavam comigo."},{verse:35,en:"I have shewed you all things, how that so labouring ye ought to support the weak, and to remember the words of the Lord Jesus, how he said, It is more blessed to give than to receive.",pt:"Em tudo vos dei o exemplo de que assim trabalhando, \xe9 necess\xe1rio socorrer os enfermos, recordando as palavras do Senhor Jesus, porquanto ele mesmo disse: Coisa mais bem-aventurada \xe9 dar do que receber."},{verse:36,en:"And when he had thus spoken, he kneeled down, and prayed with them all.",pt:"Havendo dito isto, p\xf4s-se de joelhos, e orou com todos eles."},{verse:37,en:"And they all wept sore, and fell on Paul\u2019s neck, and kissed him,",pt:"E levantou-se um grande pranto entre todos, e lan\xe7ando-se ao pesco\xe7o de Paulo, beijavam-no."},{verse:38,en:"Sorrowing most of all for the words which he spake, that they should see his face no more. And they accompanied him unto the ship.",pt:"entristecendo-se principalmente pela palavra que dissera, que n\xe3o veriam mais o seu rosto. E eles o acompanharam at\xe9 o navio."}]}}),825,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,d){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:21,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And it came to pass, that after we were gotten from them, and had launched, we came with a straight course unto Coos, and the day following unto Rhodes, and from thence unto Patara:",pt:"E assim aconteceu que, separando-nos deles, navegamos e, correndo em direitura, chegamos a C\xf3s, e no dia seguinte a Rodes, e dali a P\xe1tara."},{verse:2,en:"And finding a ship sailing over unto Phenicia, we went aboard, and set forth.",pt:"Achando um navio que seguia para a Fen\xedcia, embarcamos e partimos."},{verse:3,en:"Now when we had discovered Cyprus, we left it on the left hand, and sailed into Syria, and landed at Tyre: for there the ship was to unlade her burden.",pt:"E quando avistamos Chipre, deixando-a \xe1 esquerda, navegamos para a S\xedria e chegamos a Tiro, pois o navio havia de ser descarregado ali."},{verse:4,en:"And finding disciples, we tarried there seven days: who said to Paul through the Spirit, that he should not go up to Jerusalem.",pt:"Havendo achado os disc\xedpulos, demoramo-nos ali sete dias; e eles pelo Esp\xedrito diziam a Paulo que n\xe3o subisse a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:5,en:"And when we had accomplished those days, we departed and went our way; and they all brought us on our way, with wives and children, till we were out of the city: and we kneeled down on the shore, and prayed.",pt:"Depois de passarmos ali aqueles dias, sa\xedmos e seguimos a nossa viagem, acompanhando-nos todos, com suas mulheres e filhos, at\xe9 fora da cidade; e, postos de joelhos na praia, oramos,"},{verse:6,en:"And when we had taken our leave one of another, we took ship; and they returned home again.",pt:"e despedindo-nos uns dos outros, embarcamos, e eles voltaram para casa."},{verse:7,en:"And when we had finished our course from Tyre, we came to Ptolemais, and saluted the brethren, and abode with them one day.",pt:"Conclu\xedda a nossa viagem de Tiro, chegamos a Ptolemaida; e, havendo saudado os irm\xe3os, passamos um dia com eles."},{verse:8,en:"And the next day we that were of Paul\u2019s company departed, and came unto Caesarea: and we entered into the house of Philip the evangelist, which was one of the seven; and abode with him.",pt:"Partindo no dia seguinte, fomos a Cesar\xe9ia; e entrando em casa de Felipe, o evangelista, que era um dos sete, ficamos com ele."},{verse:9,en:"And the same man had four daughters, virgins, which did prophesy.",pt:"Tinha este quatro filhas virgens que profetizavam."},{verse:10,en:"And as we tarried there many days, there came down from Judaea a certain prophet, named Agabus.",pt:"Demorando-nos ali por muitos dias, desceu da Jud\xe9ia um profeta, de nome \xc1gabo;"},{verse:11,en:"And when he was come unto us, he took Paul\u2019s girdle, and bound his own hands and feet, and said, Thus saith the Holy Ghost, So shall the Jews at Jerusalem bind the man that owneth this girdle, and shall deliver him into the hands of the Gentiles.",pt:"e vindo ter conosco, tomou a cinta de Paulo e, ligando os seus pr\xf3prios p\xe9s e m\xe3os, disse: Isto diz o Esp\xedrito Santo: Assim os judeus ligar\xe3o em Jerusal\xe9m o homem a quem pertence esta cinta, e o entregar\xe3o nas m\xe3os dos gentios."},{verse:12,en:"And when we heard these things, both we, and they of that place, besought him not to go up to Jerusalem.",pt:"Quando ouvimos isto, rogamos-lhe, tanto n\xf3s como os daquele lugar, que n\xe3o subisse a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:13,en:"Then Paul answered, What mean ye to weep and to break mine heart? for I am ready not to be bound only, but also to die at Jerusalem for the name of the Lord Jesus.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Paulo resppondeu: Que fazeis chorando e magoando-me o cora\xe7\xe3o? Porque eu estou pronto n\xe3o s\xf3 a ser ligado, mas ainda a morrer em Jerusal\xe9m pelo nome do Senhor Jesus."},{verse:14,en:"And when he would not be persuaded, we ceased, saying, The will of the Lord be done.",pt:"E, como n\xe3o se deixasse persuadir, dissemos: Fa\xe7a-se a vontade do Senhor; e calamo-nos."},{verse:15,en:"And after those days we took up our carriages, and went up to Jerusalem.",pt:"Depois destes dias, havendo feito os preparativos, fomos subindo a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:16,en:"There went with us also certain of the disciples of Caesarea, and brought with them one Mnason of Cyprus, an old disciple, with whom we should lodge.",pt:"E foram tamb\xe9m conosco alguns disc\xedpulos de Cesar\xe9ia, levando consigo um certo Mn\xe1son, c\xedprio, disc\xedpulo antigo, com quem nos hav\xedamos de hospedar."},{verse:17,en:"And when we were come to Jerusalem, the brethren received us gladly.",pt:"E chegando n\xf3s a Jerusal\xe9m, os irm\xe3os nos receberam alegremente."},{verse:18,en:"And the day following Paul went in with us unto James; and all the elders were present.",pt:"No dia seguinte Paulo foi em nossa companhia ter com Tiago, e compareceram todos os anci\xe3os."},{verse:19,en:"And when he had saluted them, he declared particularly what things God had wrought among the Gentiles by his ministry.",pt:"E, havendo-os saudado, contou-lhes uma por uma as coisas que por seu minist\xe9rio Deus fizera entre os gentios."},{verse:20,en:"And when they heard it, they glorified the Lord, and said unto him, Thou seest, brother, how many thousands of Jews there are which believe; and they are all zealous of the law:",pt:"Ouvindo eles isto, glorificaram a Deus, e disseram-lhe: Bem v\xeas, irm\xe3os, quantos milhares h\xe1 entre os judeus que t\xeam crido, e todos s\xe3o zelosos da lei; gregos, ouviram a palavra do"},{verse:21,en:"And they are informed of thee, that thou teachest all the Jews which are among the Gentiles to forsake Moses, saying that they ought not to circumcise their children, neither to walk after the customs.",pt:"e t\xeam sido informados a teu respeito que ensinas todos os judeus que est\xe3o entre os gentios a se apartarem de Mois\xe9s, dizendo que n\xe3o circuncidem seus filhos, nem andem segundo os costumes da lei."},{verse:22,en:"What is it therefore? the multitude must needs come together: for they will hear that thou art come.",pt:"Que se h\xe1 de fazer, pois? Certamente saber\xe3o que \xe9s chegado."},{verse:23,en:"Do therefore this that we say to thee: We have four men which have a vow on them;",pt:"Faze, pois, o que te vamos dizer: Temos quatro homens que fizeram voto;"},{verse:24,en:"Them take, and purify thyself with them, and be at charges with them, that they may shave their heads: and all may know that those things, whereof they were informed concerning thee, are nothing; but that thou thyself also walkest orderly, and keepest the law.",pt:"toma estes contigo, e santifica-te com eles, e faze por eles as despesas para que rapem a cabe\xe7a; e saber\xe3o todos que \xe9 falso aquilo de que t\xeam sido informados a teu respeito, mas que tamb\xe9m tu mesmo andas corretamente, guardando a lei."},{verse:25,en:"As touching the Gentiles which believe, we have written and concluded that they observe no such thing, save only that they keep themselves from things offered to idols, and from blood, and from strangled, and from fornication.",pt:"Todavia, quanto aos gentios que t\xeam crido j\xe1 escrevemos, dando o parecer que se abstenham do que \xe9 sacrificado a os \xeddolos, do sangue, do sufocado e da prostitui\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"Then Paul took the men, and the next day purifying himself with them entered into the temple, to signify the accomplishment of the days of purification, until that an offering should be offered for every one of them.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Paulo, no dia seguinte, tomando consigo aqueles homens, purificou-se com eles e entrou no templo, notificando o cumprimento dos dias da purifica\xe7\xe3o, quando seria feita a favor de cada um deles a respectiva oferta."},{verse:27,en:"And when the seven days were almost ended, the Jews which were of Asia, when they saw him in the temple, stirred up all the people, and laid hands on him,",pt:"Mas quando os sete dias estavam quase a terminar, os judeus da \xc1sia, tendo-o visto no templo, alvoro\xe7aram todo o povo e agarraram-no,"},{verse:28,en:"Crying out, Men of Israel, help: This is the man, that teacheth all men every where against the people, and the law, and this place: and further brought Greeks also into the temple, and hath polluted this holy place.",pt:"clamando: Var\xf5es israelitas, acudi; este \xe9 o homem que por toda parte ensina a todos contra o povo, contra a lei, e contra este lugar; e ainda, al\xe9m disso, introduziu gregos no templo, e tem profanado este santo lugar."},{verse:29,en:"(For they had seen before with him in the city Trophimus an Ephesian, whom they supposed that Paul had brought into the temple.)",pt:"Porque tinham visto com ele na cidade a Tr\xf3fimo de \xc9feso, e pensavam que Paulo o introduzira no templo."},{verse:30,en:"And all the city was moved, and the people ran together: and they took Paul, and drew him out of the temple: and forthwith the doors were shut.",pt:"Alvoro\xe7ou-se toda a cidade, e houve ajuntamento do povo; e agarrando a Paulo, arrastaram-no para fora do templo, e logo as portas se fecharam."},{verse:31,en:"And as they went about to kill him, tidings came unto the chief captain of the band, that all Jerusalem was in an uproar.",pt:"E, procurando eles mat\xe1-lo, chegou ao comandante da coorte o aviso de que Jerusal\xe9m estava toda em confus\xe3o;"},{verse:32,en:"Who immediately took soldiers and centurions, and ran down unto them: and when they saw the chief captain and the soldiers, they left beating of Paul.",pt:"o qual, tomando logo consigo soldados e centuri\xf5es, correu para eles; e quando viram o comandante e os soldados, cessaram de espancar a Paulo."},{verse:33,en:"Then the chief captain came near, and took him, and commanded him to be bound with two chains; and demanded who he was, and what he had done.",pt:"Ent\xe3o aproximando-se o comandante, prendeu-o e mandou que fosse acorrentado com duas cadeias, e perguntou quem era e o que tinha feito."},{verse:34,en:"And some cried one thing, some another, among the multitude: and when he could not know the certainty for the tumult, he commanded him to be carried into the castle.",pt:"E na multid\xe3o uns gritavam de um modo, outros de outro; mas, n\xe3o podendo por causa do alvoro\xe7o saber a verdade, mandou conduz\xed-lo \xe0 fortaleza."},{verse:35,en:"And when he came upon the stairs, so it was, that he was borne of the soldiers for the violence of the people.",pt:"E sucedeu que, chegando \xe0s escadas, foi ele carregado pelos soldados por causa da viol\xeancia da turba."},{verse:36,en:"For the multitude of the people followed after, crying, Away with him.",pt:"Pois a multid\xe3o o seguia, gritando: Mata-o!"},{verse:37,en:"And as Paul was to be led into the castle, he said unto the chief captain, May I speak unto thee? Who said, Canst thou speak Greek?",pt:"Quando estava para ser introduzido na fortaleza, disse Paulo ao comandante: \xc9-me permitido dizer-te alguma coisa? Respondeu ele: Sabes o grego?"},{verse:38,en:"Art not thou that Egyptian, which before these days madest an uproar, and leddest out into the wilderness four thousand men that were murderers?",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9s porventura o eg\xedpcio que h\xe1 poucos dias fez uma sedi\xe7\xe3o e levou ao deserto os quatro mil sic\xe1rios?"},{verse:39,en:"But Paul said, I am a man which am a Jew of Tarsus, a city in Cilicia, a citizen of no mean city: and, I beseech thee, suffer me to speak unto the people.",pt:"Mas Paulo lhe disse: Eu sou judeu, natural de Tarso, cidade n\xe3o insignificante da Cil\xedcia; rogo-te que me permitas falar ao povo."},{verse:40,en:"And when he had given him licence, Paul stood on the stairs, and beckoned with the hand unto the people. And when there was made a great silence, he spake unto them in the Hebrew tongue, saying,",pt:"E, havendo-lho permitido o comandante, Paulo, em p\xe9 na escada, fez sinal ao povo com a m\xe3o; e, feito grande sil\xeancio, falou em l\xedngua hebraica, dizendo:"}]}}),826,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:22,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Men, brethren, and fathers, hear ye my defence which I make now unto you.",pt:"Irm\xe3os e pais, ouvi a minha defesa, que agora fa\xe7o perante v\xf3s."},{verse:2,en:"(And when they heard that he spake in the Hebrew tongue to them, they kept the more silence: and he saith,)",pt:"Ora, quando ouviram que lhes falava em l\xedngua hebraica, guardaram ainda maior sil\xeancio. E ele prosseguiu."},{verse:3,en:"I am verily a man which am a Jew, born in Tarsus, a city in Cilicia, yet brought up in this city at the feet of Gamaliel, and taught according to the perfect manner of the law of the fathers, and was zealous toward God, as ye all are this day.",pt:"Eu sou judeu, nascido em Tarso da Cil\xedcia, mas criado nesta cidade, instru\xeddo aos p\xe9s de Gamaliel, conforme a precis\xe3o da lei de nossos pais, sendo zeloso para com Deus, assim como o sois todos v\xf3s no dia de hoje."},{verse:4,en:"And I persecuted this way unto the death, binding and delivering into prisons both men and women.",pt:"E persegui este Caminho at\xe9 a morte, algemando e metendo em pris\xf5es tanto a homens como a mulheres,"},{verse:5,en:"As also the high priest doth bear me witness, and all the estate of the elders: from whom also I received letters unto the brethren, and went to Damascus, to bring them which were there bound unto Jerusalem, for to be punished.",pt:"do que tamb\xe9m o sumo sacerdote me \xe9 testemunha, e assim todo o conselho dos anci\xe3os; e, tendo recebido destes cartas para os irm\xe3os, seguia para Damasco, com o fim de trazer algemados a Jerusal\xe9m aqueles que ali estivessem, para que fossem castigados."},{verse:6,en:"And it came to pass, that, as I made my journey, and was come nigh unto Damascus about noon, suddenly there shone from heaven a great light round about me.",pt:"Aconteceu, por\xe9m, que, quando caminhava e ia chegando perto de Damasco, pelo meio-dia, de repente, do c\xe9u brilhou-me ao redor uma grande luz."},{verse:7,en:"And I fell unto the ground, and heard a voice saying unto me, Saul, Saul, why persecutest thou me?",pt:"Ca\xed por terra e ouvi uma voz que me dizia: Saulo, Saulo, por que me persegues?"},{verse:8,en:"And I answered, Who art thou, Lord? And he said unto me, I am Jesus of Nazareth, whom thou persecutest.",pt:"Eu respondi: Quem \xe9s tu, Senhor? Disse-me: Eu sou Jesus, o nazareno, a quem tu persegues."},{verse:9,en:"And they that were with me saw indeed the light, and were afraid; but they heard not the voice of him that spake to me.",pt:"E os que estavam comigo viram, em verdade, a luz, mas n\xe3o entenderam a voz daquele que falava comigo."},{verse:10,en:"And I said, What shall I do, Lord? And the Lord said unto me, Arise, and go into Damascus; and there it shall be told thee of all things which are appointed for thee to do.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse eu: Senhor que farei? E o Senhor me disse: Levanta-te, e vai a Damasco, onde se te dir\xe1 tudo o que te \xe9 ordenado fazer."},{verse:11,en:"And when I could not see for the glory of that light, being led by the hand of them that were with me, I came into Damascus.",pt:"Como eu nada visse por causa do esplendor daquela luz, guiado pela m\xe3o dos que estavam comigo cheguei a Damasco."},{verse:12,en:"And one Ananias, a devout man according to the law, having a good report of all the Jews which dwelt there,",pt:"um certo Ananias, var\xe3o piedoso conforme a lei, que tinha bom testemunho de todos os judeus que ali moravam,"},{verse:13,en:"Came unto me, and stood, and said unto me, Brother Saul, receive thy sight. And the same hour I looked up upon him.",pt:"vindo ter comigo, de p\xe9 ao meu lado, disse-me: Saulo, irm\xe3o, recobra a vista. Naquela mesma hora, recobrando a vista, eu o vi."},{verse:14,en:"And he said, The God of our fathers hath chosen thee, that thou shouldest know his will, and see that Just One, and shouldest hear the voice of his mouth.",pt:"Disse ele: O Deus de nossos pais de antem\xe3o te designou para conhecer a sua vontade, ver o Justo, e ouvir a voz da sua boca."},{verse:15,en:"For thou shalt be his witness unto all men of what thou hast seen and heard.",pt:"Porque h\xe1s de ser sua testemunha para com todos os homens do que tens visto e ouvido."},{verse:16,en:"And now why tarriest thou? arise, and be baptized, and wash away thy sins, calling on the name of the Lord.",pt:"Agora por que te demoras? Levanta-te, batiza-te e lava os teus pecados, invocando o seu nome."},{verse:17,en:"And it came to pass, that, when I was come again to Jerusalem, even while I prayed in the temple, I was in a trance;",pt:"Aconteceu que, tendo eu voltado para Jerusal\xe9m, enquanto orava no templo, achei-me em \xeaxtase,"},{verse:18,en:"And saw him saying unto me, Make haste, and get thee quickly out of Jerusalem: for they will not receive thy testimony concerning me.",pt:"e vi aquele que me dizia: Apressa-te e sai logo de Jerusal\xe9m; porque n\xe3o receber\xe3o o teu testemunho acerca de mim."},{verse:19,en:"And I said, Lord, they know that I imprisoned and beat in every synagogue them that believed on thee:",pt:"Disse eu: Senhor, eles bem sabem que eu encarcerava e a\xe7oitava pelas sinagogas os que criam em ti,"},{verse:20,en:"And when the blood of thy martyr Stephen was shed, I also was standing by, and consenting unto his death, and kept the raiment of them that slew him.",pt:"e quando se derramava o sangue de Est\xeav\xe3o, tua testemunha, eu tamb\xe9m estava presente, consentindo na sua morte e guardando as capas dos que o matavam."},{verse:21,en:"And he said unto me, Depart: for I will send thee far hence unto the Gentiles.",pt:"Disse-me ele: Vai, porque eu te enviarei para longe aos gentios."},{verse:22,en:"And they gave him audience unto this word, and then lifted up their voices, and said, Away with such a fellow from the earth: for it is not fit that he should live.",pt:"Ora, escutavam-no at\xe9 esta palavra, mas ent\xe3o levantaram a voz, dizendo: Tira do mundo tal homem, porque n\xe3o conv\xe9m que viva."},{verse:23,en:"And as they cried out, and cast off their clothes, and threw dust into the air,",pt:"Gritando eles e arrojando de si as capas e lan\xe7ando p\xf3 para o ar,"},{verse:24,en:"The chief captain commanded him to be brought into the castle, and bade that he should be examined by scourging; that he might know wherefore they cried so against him.",pt:"o comandante mandou que levassem Paulo para dentro da fortaleza, ordenando que fosse interrogado debaixo de a\xe7oites, para saber por que causa assim clamavam contra ele."},{verse:25,en:"And as they bound him with thongs, Paul said unto the centurion that stood by, Is it lawful for you to scourge a man that is a Roman, and uncondemned?",pt:"Quando o haviam atado com as correias, disse Paulo ao centuri\xe3o que ali estava: \xc9-vos l\xedcito a\xe7oitar um cidad\xe3o romano, sem ser ele condenado?"},{verse:26,en:"When the centurion heard that, he went and told the chief captain, saying, Take heed what thou doest: for this man is a Roman.",pt:"Ouvindo isto, foi o centuri\xe3o ter com o comandante e o avisou, dizendo: V\xea o que est\xe1s para fazer, pois este homem \xe9 romano."},{verse:27,en:"Then the chief captain came, and said unto him, Tell me, art thou a Roman? He said, Yea.",pt:"Vindo o comandante, perguntou-lhe: Dize-me: \xe9s tu romano? Respondeu ele: Sou."},{verse:28,en:"And the chief captain answered, With a great sum obtained I this freedom. And Paul said, But I was free born.",pt:"Tornou o comandante: Eu por grande soma de dinheiro adquiri este direito de cidad\xe3o. Paulo disse: Mas eu o sou de nascimento."},{verse:29,en:"Then straightway they departed from him which should have examined him: and the chief captain also was afraid, after he knew that he was a Roman, and because he had bound him.",pt:"Imediatamente, pois se apartaram dele aqueles que o iam interrogar; e at\xe9 o comandante, tendo sabido que Paulo era romano, atemorizou-se porque o havia ligado."},{verse:30,en:"On the morrow, because he would have known the certainty wherefore he was accused of the Jews, he loosed him from his bands, and commanded the chief priests and all their council to appear, and brought Paul down, and set him before them.",pt:"No dia seguinte, querendo saber ao certo a causa por que ele era acusado pelos judeus, soltou-o das pris\xf5es, e mandou que se reunissem os principais sacerdotes e todo o sin\xe9drio; e, trazendo Paulo, apresentou-o diante deles."}]}}),827,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:23,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And Paul, earnestly beholding the council, said, Men and brethren, I have lived in all good conscience before God until this day.",pt:"Fitando Paulo os olhos no sin\xe9drio, disse: Var\xf5es irm\xe3os, at\xe9 o dia de hoje tenho andado diante de Deus com toda a boa consci\xeancia."},{verse:2,en:"And the high priest Ananias commanded them that stood by him to smite him on the mouth.",pt:"Mas o sumo sacerdote, Ananias, mandou aos que estavam junto dele que o ferissem na boca."},{verse:3,en:"Then said Paul unto him, God shall smite thee, thou whited wall: for sittest thou to judge me after the law, and commandest me to be smitten contrary to the law?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Paulo lhe disse: Deus te ferir\xe1 a ti, parede branqueada; tu est\xe1s a\xed sentado para julgar-me segundo a lei, e contra a lei mandas que eu seja ferido?"},{verse:4,en:"And they that stood by said, Revilest thou God\u2019s high priest?",pt:"Os que estavam ali disseram: Injurias o sumo sacerdote de Deus?"},{verse:5,en:"Then said Paul, I wist not, brethren, that he was the high priest: for it is written, Thou shalt not speak evil of the ruler of thy people.",pt:"Disse Paulo: N\xe3o sabia, irm\xe3os, que era o sumo sacerdote; porque est\xe1 escrito: N\xe3o dir\xe1s mal do pr\xedncipe do teu povo."},{verse:6,en:"But when Paul perceived that the one part were Sadducees, and the other Pharisees, he cried out in the council, Men and brethren, I am a Pharisee, the son of a Pharisee: of the hope and resurrection of the dead I am called in question.",pt:"Sabendo Paulo que uma parte era de saduceus e outra de fariseus, clamou no sin\xe9drio: Var\xf5es irm\xe3os, eu sou fariseu, filho de fariseus; \xe9 por causa da esperan\xe7a da ressurrei\xe7\xe3o dos mortos que estou sendo julgado."},{verse:7,en:"And when he had so said, there arose a dissension between the Pharisees and the Sadducees: and the multitude was divided.",pt:"Ora, dizendo ele isto, surgiu dissens\xe3o entre os fariseus e saduceus; e a multid\xe3o se dividiu."},{verse:8,en:"For the Sadducees say that there is no resurrection, neither angel, nor spirit: but the Pharisees confess both.",pt:"Porque os saduceus dizem que n\xe3o h\xe1 ressurrei\xe7\xe3o, nem anjo, nem esp\xedrito; mas os fariseus reconhecem uma e outra coisa."},{verse:9,en:"And there arose a great cry: and the scribes that were of the Pharisees\u2019 part arose, and strove, saying, We find no evil in this man: but if a spirit or an angel hath spoken to him, let us not fight against God.",pt:"Da\xed procedeu grande clamor; e levantando-se alguns da parte dos fariseus, altercavam, dizendo: N\xe3o achamos nenhum mal neste homem; e, quem sabe se lhe falou algum esp\xedrito ou anjo?"},{verse:10,en:"And when there arose a great dissension, the chief captain, fearing lest Paul should have been pulled in pieces of them, commanded the soldiers to go down, and to take him by force from among them, and to bring him into the castle.",pt:"E avolumando-se a dissen\xe7\xe3o, o comandante, temendo que Paulo fosse por eles despeda\xe7ado, mandou que os soldados descessem e o tirassem do meio deles e o levassem para a fortaleza."},{verse:11,en:"And the night following the Lord stood by him, and said, Be of good cheer, Paul: for as thou hast testified of me in Jerusalem, so must thou bear witness also at Rome.",pt:"Na noite seguinte, apresentou-se-lhe o Senhor e disse: Tem bom \xe2nimo: porque, como deste testemunho de mim em Jerusal\xe9m, assim importa que o d\xeas tamb\xe9m em Roma."},{verse:12,en:"And when it was day, certain of the Jews banded together, and bound themselves under a curse, saying that they would neither eat nor drink till they had killed Paul.",pt:"Quando j\xe1 era dia, coligaram-se os judeus e juraram sob pena de maldi\xe7\xe3o que n\xe3o comeriam nem beberiam enquanto n\xe3o matassem a Paulo."},{verse:13,en:"And they were more than forty which had made this conspiracy.",pt:"Eram mais de quarenta os que fizeram esta conjura\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:14,en:"And they came to the chief priests and elders, and said, We have bound ourselves under a great curse, that we will eat nothing until we have slain Paul.",pt:"e estes foram ter com os principais sacerdotes e anci\xe3os, e disseram: Conjuramo-nos sob pena de maldi\xe7\xe3o a n\xe3o provarmos coisa alguma at\xe9 que matemos a Paulo."},{verse:15,en:"Now therefore ye with the council signify to the chief captain that he bring him down unto you to morrow, as though ye would enquire something more perfectly concerning him: and we, or ever he come near, are ready to kill him.",pt:"Agora, pois, v\xf3s, com o sin\xe9drio, rogai ao comandante que o mande descer perante v\xf3s como se houv\xe9sseis de examinar com mais precis\xe3o a sua causa; e n\xf3s estamos prontos para mat\xe1-lo antes que ele chegue."},{verse:16,en:"And when Paul\u2019s sister\u2019s son heard of their lying in wait, he went and entered into the castle, and told Paul.",pt:"Mas o filho da irm\xe3 de Paulo tendo sabido da cilada, foi, entrou na fortaleza e avisou a Paulo."},{verse:17,en:"Then Paul called one of the centurions unto him, and said, Bring this young man unto the chief captain: for he hath a certain thing to tell him.",pt:"Chamando Paulo um dos centuri\xf5es, disse: Leva este mo\xe7o ao comandante, porque tem alguma coisa que lhe comunicar."},{verse:18,en:"So he took him, and brought him to the chief captain, and said, Paul the prisoner called me unto him, and prayed me to bring this young man unto thee, who hath something to say unto thee.",pt:"Tomando-o ele, pois, levou-o ao comandante e disse: O preso Paulo, chamando-me, pediu-me que trouxesse \xe0 tua presen\xe7a este mo\xe7o, que tem alguma coisa a dizer-te."},{verse:19,en:"Then the chief captain took him by the hand, and went with him aside privately, and asked him, What is that thou hast to tell me?",pt:"O comandante tomou-o pela m\xe3o e, retirando-se \xe0 parte, perguntou-lhe em particular: Que \xe9 que tens a contar-me?"},{verse:20,en:"And he said, The Jews have agreed to desire thee that thou wouldest bring down Paul to morrow into the council, as though they would enquire somewhat of him more perfectly.",pt:"Disse ele: Os judeus combinaram rogar-te que amanh\xe3 mandes Paulo descer ao sin\xe9drio, como que tendo de inquirir com mais precis\xe3o algo a seu respeito;"},{verse:21,en:"But do not thou yield unto them: for there lie in wait for him of them more than forty men, which have bound themselves with an oath, that they will neither eat nor drink till they have killed him: and now are they ready, looking for a promise from thee.",pt:"tu, pois, n\xe3o te deixes persuadir por eles; porque mais de quarenta homens dentre eles armaram ciladas, os quais juraram sob pena de maldi\xe7\xe3o n\xe3o comerem nem beberem at\xe9 que o tenham morto; e agora est\xe3o aprestados, esperando a tua promessa."},{verse:22,en:"So the chief captain then let the young man depart, and charged him, See thou tell no man that thou hast shewed these things to me.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o comandante despediu o mo\xe7o, ordenando-lhe que a ningu\xe9m dissesse que lhe havia contado aquilo."},{verse:23,en:"And he called unto him two centurions, saying, Make ready two hundred soldiers to go to Caesarea, and horsemen threescore and ten, and spearmen two hundred, at the third hour of the night;",pt:"Chamando dois centuri\xf5es, disse: Aprontai para a terceira hora da noite duzentos soldados de infantaria, setenta de cavalaria e duzentos lanceiros para irem at\xe9 Cesar\xe9ia;"},{verse:24,en:"And provide them beasts, that they may set Paul on, and bring him safe unto Felix the governor.",pt:"e mandou que aparelhassem cavalgaduras para que Paulo montasse, a fim de o levarem salvo ao governador F\xe9lix."},{verse:25,en:"And he wrote a letter after this manner:",pt:"E escreveu-lhe uma carta nestes termos:"},{verse:26,en:"Claudius Lysias unto the most excellent governor Felix sendeth greeting.",pt:"Cl\xe1udio L\xedsias, ao excelent\xedssimo governador F\xe9lix, sa\xfade."},{verse:27,en:"This man was taken of the Jews, and should have been killed of them: then came I with an army, and rescued him, having understood that he was a Roman.",pt:"Este homem foi preso pelos judeus, e estava a ponto de ser morto por eles quando eu sobrevim com a tropa e o livrei ao saber que era romano."},{verse:28,en:"And when I would have known the cause wherefore they accused him, I brought him forth into their council:",pt:"Querendo saber a causa por que o acusavam, levei-o ao sin\xe9drio deles;"},{verse:29,en:"Whom I perceived to be accused of questions of their law, but to have nothing laid to his charge worthy of death or of bonds.",pt:"e achei que era acusado de quest\xf5es da lei deles, mas que nenhum crime havia nele digno de morte ou pris\xe3o."},{verse:30,en:"And when it was told me how that the Jews laid wait for the man, I sent straightway to thee, and gave commandment to his accusers also to say before thee what they had against him. Farewell.",pt:"E quando fui informado que haveria uma cilada contra o homem, logo to enviei, intimando tamb\xe9m aos acusadores que perante ti se manifestem contra ele. [Passa bem.]"},{verse:31,en:"Then the soldiers, as it was commanded them, took Paul, and brought him by night to Antipatris.",pt:"Os soldados, pois, conforme lhes fora mandado, tomando a Paulo, o levaram de noite a Antip\xe1tride."},{verse:32,en:"On the morrow they left the horsemen to go with him, and returned to the castle:",pt:"Mas no dia seguinte, deixando aos de cavalaria irem com ele, voltaram \xe0 fortaleza;"},{verse:33,en:"Who, when they came to Caesarea, and delivered the epistle to the governor, presented Paul also before him.",pt:"os quais, logo que chegaram a Cesar\xe9ia e entregaram a carta ao governador, apresentaram-lhe tamb\xe9m Paulo."},{verse:34,en:"And when the governor had read the letter, he asked of what province he was. And when he understood that he was of Cilicia;",pt:"Tendo lido a carta, o governador perguntou de que prov\xedncia ele era; e, sabendo que era da Cil\xedcia,"},{verse:35,en:"I will hear thee, said he, when thine accusers are also come. And he commanded him to be kept in Herod\u2019s judgment hall.",pt:"disse: Ouvir-te-ei quando chegarem tamb\xe9m os teus acusadores; e mandou que fosse guardado no pret\xf3rio de Herodes."}]}}),828,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:24,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And after five days Ananias the high priest descended with the elders, and with a certain orator named Tertullus, who informed the governor against Paul.",pt:"Cinco dias depois o sumo sacerdote Ananias desceu com alguns anci\xe3os e um certo Tertulo, orador, os quais fizeram, perante o governador, queixa contra Paulo."},{verse:2,en:"And when he was called forth, Tertullus began to accuse him, saying, Seeing that by thee we enjoy great quietness, and that very worthy deeds are done unto this nation by thy providence,",pt:"Sendo este chamado, Tertulo come\xe7ou a acus\xe1-lo, dizendo: Visto que por ti gozamos de muita paz e por tua provid\xeancia s\xe3o continuamente feitas reformas nesta na\xe7\xe3o,"},{verse:3,en:"We accept it always, and in all places, most noble Felix, with all thankfulness.",pt:"em tudo e em todo lugar reconhecemo-lo com toda a gratid\xe3o, \xf3 excelent\xedssimo F\xe9lix."},{verse:4,en:"Notwithstanding, that I be not further tedious unto thee, I pray thee that thou wouldest hear us of thy clemency a few words.",pt:"Mas, para que n\xe3o te detenha muito rogo-te que, conforme a tua eq\xfcidade, nos ou\xe7as por um momento."},{verse:5,en:"For we have found this man a pestilent fellow, and a mover of sedition among all the Jews throughout the world, and a ringleader of the sect of the Nazarenes:",pt:"Temos achado que este homem \xe9 uma peste, e promotor de sedi\xe7\xf5es entre todos os judeus, por todo o mundo, e chefe da seita dos nazarenos;"},{verse:6,en:"Who also hath gone about to profane the temple: whom we took, and would have judged according to our law.",pt:"o qual tentou profanar o templo; e n\xf3s o prendemos, [e conforme a nossa lei o quisemos julgar."},{verse:7,en:"But the chief captain Lysias came upon us, and with great violence took him away out of our hands,",pt:"Mas sobrevindo o comandante L\xedsias no-lo tirou dentre as m\xe3os com grande viol\xeancia, mandando aos acusadores que viessem a ti.]"},{verse:8,en:"Commanding his accusers to come unto thee: by examining of whom thyself mayest take knowledge of all these things, whereof we accuse him.",pt:"e tu mesmo, examinando-o, poder\xe1s certificar-te de tudo aquilo de que n\xf3s o acusamos."},{verse:9,en:"And the Jews also assented, saying that these things were so.",pt:"Os judeus tamb\xe9m concordam na acusa\xe7\xe3o, afirmando que estas coisas eram assim."},{verse:10,en:"Then Paul, after that the governor had beckoned unto him to speak, answered, Forasmuch as I know that thou hast been of many years a judge unto this nation, I do the more cheerfully answer for myself:",pt:"Paulo, tendo-lhe o governador feito sinal que falasse, respondeu: Porquanto sei que h\xe1 muitos anos \xe9s juiz sobre esta na\xe7\xe3o, com bom \xe2nimo fa\xe7o a minha defesa,"},{verse:11,en:"Because that thou mayest understand, that there are yet but twelve days since I went up to Jerusalem for to worship.",pt:"pois bem podes verificar que n\xe3o h\xe1 mais de doze dias subi a Jerusal\xe9m para adorar,"},{verse:12,en:"And they neither found me in the temple disputing with any man, neither raising up the people, neither in the synagogues, nor in the city:",pt:"e que n\xe3o me acharam no templo discutindo com algu\xe9m nem amotinando o povo, quer nas sinagogas quer na cidade."},{verse:13,en:"Neither can they prove the things whereof they now accuse me.",pt:"Nem te podem provar as coisas de que agora me acusam."},{verse:14,en:"But this I confess unto thee, that after the way which they call heresy, so worship I the God of my fathers, believing all things which are written in the law and in the prophets:",pt:"Mas confesso-te isto: que, seguindo o caminho a que eles chamam seita, assim sirvo ao Deus de nossos pais, crendo tudo quanto est\xe1 escrito na lei e nos profetas,"},{verse:15,en:"And have hope toward God, which they themselves also allow, that there shall be a resurrection of the dead, both of the just and unjust.",pt:"tendo esperan\xe7a em Deus, como estes mesmos tamb\xe9m esperam, de que h\xe1 de haver ressurrei\xe7\xe3o tanto dos justos como dos injustos."},{verse:16,en:"And herein do I exercise myself, to have always a conscience void of offence toward God, and toward men.",pt:"Por isso procuro sempre ter uma consci\xeancia sem ofensas diante de Deus e dos homens."},{verse:17,en:"Now after many years I came to bring alms to my nation, and offerings.",pt:"V\xe1rios anos depois vim trazer \xe0 minha na\xe7\xe3o esmolas e fazer oferendas;"},{verse:18,en:"Whereupon certain Jews from Asia found me purified in the temple, neither with multitude, nor with tumult.",pt:"e ocupado nestas coisas me acharam j\xe1 santificado no templo n\xe3o em ajuntamento, nem com tumulto, alguns judeus da \xc1sia,"},{verse:19,en:"Who ought to have been here before thee, and object, if they had ought against me.",pt:"os quais deviam comparecer diante de ti e acusar-me se tivessem alguma coisa contra mim;"},{verse:20,en:"Or else let these same here say, if they have found any evil doing in me, while I stood before the council,",pt:"ou estes mesmos digam que iniquidade acharam, quando compareci perante o sin\xe9drio,"},{verse:21,en:"Except it be for this one voice, that I cried standing among them, Touching the resurrection of the dead I am called in question by you this day.",pt:"a n\xe3o ser acerca desta \xfanica palavra que, estando no meio deles, bradei: Por causa da ressurrei\xe7\xe3o dos mortos \xe9 que hoje estou sendo julgado por v\xf3s."},{verse:22,en:"And when Felix heard these things, having more perfect knowledge of that way, he deferred them, and said, When Lysias the chief captain shall come down, I will know the uttermost of your matter.",pt:"F\xe9lix, por\xe9m, que era bem informado a respeito do Caminho, adiou a quest\xe3o, dizendo: Quando o comandante L\xedsias tiver descido, ent\xe3o tomarei inteiro conhecimento da vossa causa."},{verse:23,en:"And he commanded a centurion to keep Paul, and to let him have liberty, and that he should forbid none of his acquaintance to minister or come unto him.",pt:"E ordenou ao centuri\xe3o que Paulo ficasse detido, mas fosse tratado com brandura e que a nenhum dos seus proibisse servi-lo."},{verse:24,en:"And after certain days, when Felix came with his wife Drusilla, which was a Jewess, he sent for Paul, and heard him concerning the faith in Christ.",pt:"Alguns dias depois, vindo F\xe9lix com sua mulher Drusila, que era judia, mandou chamar a Paulo, e ouviu-o acerca da f\xe9 em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:25,en:"And as he reasoned of righteousness, temperance, and judgment to come Felix trembled, and answered, Go thy way for this time; when I have a convenient season, I will call for thee.",pt:"E discorrendo ele sobre a justi\xe7a, o dom\xednio pr\xf3prio e o ju\xedzo vindouro, F\xe9lix ficou atemorizado e respondeu: Por ora vai-te, e quando tiver ocasi\xe3o favor\xe1vel, eu te chamarei."},{verse:26,en:"He hoped also that money should have been given him of Paul, that he might loose him: wherefore he sent for him the oftener, and communed with him.",pt:"Esperava ao mesmo tempo que Paulo lhe desse dinheiro, pelo que o mandava chamar mais freq\xfcentemente e conversava com ele."},{verse:27,en:"But after two years Porcius Festus came into Felix\u2019 room: and Felix, willing to shew the Jews a pleasure, left Paul bound.",pt:"Mas passados dois anos, teve F\xe9lix por sucessor a P\xf3rcio Festo; e querendo F\xe9lix agradar aos judeus, deixou a Paulo preso."}]}}),829,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:25,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now when Festus was come into the province, after three days he ascended from Caesarea to Jerusalem.",pt:"Tendo, pois, entrado Festo na prov\xedncia, depois de tr\xeas dias subiu de Cesar\xe9ia a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:2,en:"Then the high priest and the chief of the Jews informed him against Paul, and besought him,",pt:"E os principais sacerdotes e os mais eminentes judeus fizeram-lhe queixa contra Paulo e, em detrimento deste,"},{verse:3,en:"And desired favour against him, that he would send for him to Jerusalem, laying wait in the way to kill him.",pt:"lhe rogavam o favor de o mandar a Jerusal\xe9m, armando ciladas para o matarem no caminho."},{verse:4,en:"But Festus answered, that Paul should be kept at Caesarea, and that he himself would depart shortly thither.",pt:"Mas Festo respondeu que Paulo estava detido em Cesar\xe9ia, e que ele mesmo brevemente partiria para l\xe1."},{verse:5,en:"Let them therefore, said he, which among you are able, go down with me, and accuse this man, if there be any wickedness in him.",pt:"Portanto - disse ele - as autoridades dentre v\xf3s des\xe7am comigo e, se h\xe1 nesse homem algum crime, acusem-no."},{verse:6,en:"And when he had tarried among them more than ten days, he went down unto Caesarea; and the next day sitting on the judgment seat commanded Paul to be brought.",pt:"Tendo-se demorado entre eles n\xe3o mais de oito ou dez dias, desceu a Cesar\xe9ia; e no dia seguinte, sentando-se no tribunal, mandou trazer Paulo."},{verse:7,en:"And when he was come, the Jews which came down from Jerusalem stood round about, and laid many and grievous complaints against Paul, which they could not prove.",pt:"Tendo ele comparecido, rodearam-no os judeus que haviam descido de Jerusal\xe9m, trazendo contra ele muitas e graves acusa\xe7\xf5es, que n\xe3o podiam provar."},{verse:8,en:"While he answered for himself, Neither against the law of the Jews, neither against the temple, nor yet against Caesar, have I offended any thing at all.",pt:"Paulo, por\xe9m, respondeu em sua defesa: Nem contra a lei dos judeus, nem contra o templo, nem contra C\xe9sar, tenho pecado em coisa alguma."},{verse:9,en:"But Festus, willing to do the Jews a pleasure, answered Paul, and said, Wilt thou go up to Jerusalem, and there be judged of these things before me?",pt:"Todavia Festo, querendo agradar aos judeus, respondendo a Paulo, disse: Queres subir a Jerusal\xe9m e ali ser julgado perante mim acerca destas coisas?"},{verse:10,en:"Then said Paul, I stand at Caesar\u2019s judgment seat, where I ought to be judged: to the Jews have I done no wrong, as thou very well knowest.",pt:"Mas Paulo disse: Estou perante o tribunal de C\xe9sar, onde devo ser julgado; nenhum mal fiz aos judeus, como muito bem sabes."},{verse:11,en:"For if I be an offender, or have committed any thing worthy of death, I refuse not to die: but if there be none of these things whereof these accuse me, no man may deliver me unto them. I appeal unto Caesar.",pt:"Se, pois, sou malfeitor e tenho cometido alguma coisa digna de morte, n\xe3o recuso morrer; mas se nada h\xe1 daquilo de que estes me acusam, ningu\xe9m me pode entregar a eles; apelo para C\xe9sar."},{verse:12,en:"Then Festus, when he had conferred with the council, answered, Hast thou appealed unto Caesar? unto Caesar shalt thou go.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Festo, tendo falado com o conselho, respondeu: Apelaste para C\xe9sar; para C\xe9sar ir\xe1s."},{verse:13,en:"And after certain days king Agrippa and Bernice came unto Caesarea to salute Festus.",pt:"Passados alguns dias, o rei Agripa e Berenice vieram a Cesar\xe9ia em visita de sauda\xe7\xe3o a Festo."},{verse:14,en:"And when they had been there many days, Festus declared Paul\u2019s cause unto the king, saying, There is a certain man left in bonds by Felix:",pt:"E, como se demorassem ali muitos dias, Festo exp\xf4s ao rei o caso de Paulo, dizendo: H\xe1 aqui certo homem que foi deixado preso por F\xe9lix,"},{verse:15,en:"About whom, when I was at Jerusalem, the chief priests and the elders of the Jews informed me, desiring to have judgment against him.",pt:"a respeito do qual, quando estive em Jerusal\xe9m, os principais sacerdotes e os anci\xe3os dos judeus me fizeram queixas, pedindo senten\xe7a contra ele;"},{verse:16,en:"To whom I answered, It is not the manner of the Romans to deliver any man to die, before that he which is accused have the accusers face to face, and have licence to answer for himself concerning the crime laid against him.",pt:"aos quais respondi que n\xe3o \xe9 costume dos romanos condenar homem algum sem que o acusado tenha presentes os seus acusadores e possa defender-se da acusa\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:17,en:"Therefore, when they were come hither, without any delay on the morrow I sat on the judgment seat, and commanded the man to be brought forth.",pt:"Quando ent\xe3o eles se haviam reunido aqui, sem me demorar, no dia seguinte sentei-me no tribunal e mandei trazer o homem;"},{verse:18,en:"Against whom when the accusers stood up, they brought none accusation of such things as I supposed:",pt:"contra o qual os acusadores, levantando-se, n\xe3o apresentaram acusa\xe7\xe3o alguma das coisas perversas que eu suspeitava;"},{verse:19,en:"But had certain questions against him of their own superstition, and of one Jesus, which was dead, whom Paul affirmed to be alive.",pt:"tinham, por\xe9m, contra ele algumas quest\xf5es acerca da sua religi\xe3o e de um tal Jesus defunto, que Paulo afirmava estar vivo."},{verse:20,en:"And because I doubted of such manner of questions, I asked him whether he would go to Jerusalem, and there be judged of these matters.",pt:"E, estando eu perplexo quanto ao modo de investigar estas coisas, perguntei se n\xe3o queria ir a Jerusal\xe9m e ali ser julgado no tocante \xe0s mesmas."},{verse:21,en:"But when Paul had appealed to be reserved unto the hearing of Augustus, I commanded him to be kept till I might send him to Caesar.",pt:"Mas apelando Paulo para que fosse reservado ao julgamento do imperador, mandei que fosse detido at\xe9 que o enviasse a C\xe9sar."},{verse:22,en:"Then Agrippa said unto Festus, I would also hear the man myself. To morrow, said he, thou shalt hear him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Agripa disse a Festo: Eu bem quisera ouvir esse homem. Respondeu-lhe ele: Amanh\xe3 o ouvir\xe1s."},{verse:23,en:"And on the morrow, when Agrippa was come, and Bernice, with great pomp, and was entered into the place of hearing, with the chief captains, and principal men of the city, at Festus\u2019 commandment Paul was brought forth.",pt:"No dia seguinte vindo Agripa e Berenice, com muito aparato, entraram no audit\xf3rio com os chefes militares e homens principais da cidade; ent\xe3o, por ordem de Festo, Paulo foi trazido."},{verse:24,en:"And Festus said, King Agrippa, and all men which are here present with us, ye see this man, about whom all the multitude of the Jews have dealt with me, both at Jerusalem, and also here, crying that he ought not to live any longer.",pt:"Disse Festo: Rei Agripa e v\xf3s todos que estais presentes conosco, vedes este homem por causa de quem toda a multid\xe3o dos judeus, tanto em Jerusal\xe9m como aqui, recorreu a mim, clamando que n\xe3o convinha que ele vivesse mais."},{verse:25,en:"But when I found that he had committed nothing worthy of death, and that he himself hath appealed to Augustus, I have determined to send him.",pt:"Eu, por\xe9m, achei que ele n\xe3o havia praticado coisa alguma digna de morte; mas havendo ele apelado para o imperador, resolvi remeter-lho."},{verse:26,en:"Of whom I have no certain thing to write unto my lord. Wherefore I have brought him forth before you, and specially before thee, O king Agrippa, that, after examination had, I might have somewhat to write.",pt:"Do qual n\xe3o tenho coisa certa que escreva a meu senhor, e por isso perante v\xf3s o trouxe, principalmente perante ti, \xf3 rei Agripa, para que, depois de feito o interrogat\xf3rio, tenha eu alguma coisa que escrever."},{verse:27,en:"For it seemeth to me unreasonable to send a prisoner, and not withal to signify the crimes laid against him.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o me parece razo\xe1vel enviar um preso, e n\xe3o notificar as acusa\xe7\xf5es que h\xe1 contra ele."}]}}),830,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:26,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then Agrippa said unto Paul, Thou art permitted to speak for thyself. Then Paul stretched forth the hand, and answered for himself:",pt:"Depois Agripa disse a Paulo: \xc9-te permitido fazer a tua defesa. Ent\xe3o Paulo, estendendo a m\xe3o, come\xe7ou a sua defesa:"},{verse:2,en:"I think myself happy, king Agrippa, because I shall answer for myself this day before thee touching all the things whereof I am accused of the Jews:",pt:"Sinto-me feliz, \xf3 rei Agripa, em poder defender-me hoje perante ti de todas as coisas de que sou acusado pelos judeus;"},{verse:3,en:"Especially because I know thee to be expert in all customs and questions which are among the Jews: wherefore I beseech thee to hear me patiently.",pt:"mormente porque \xe9s versado em todos os costumes e quest\xf5es que h\xe1 entre os judeus; pelo que te rogo que me ou\xe7as com paci\xeancia."},{verse:4,en:"My manner of life from my youth, which was at the first among mine own nation at Jerusalem, know all the Jews;",pt:"A minha vida, pois, desde a mocidade, o que tem sido sempre entre o meu povo e em Jerusal\xe9m, sabem-na todos os judeus,"},{verse:5,en:"Which knew me from the beginning, if they would testify, that after the most straitest sect of our religion I lived a Pharisee.",pt:"pois me conhecem desde o princ\xedpio e, se quiserem, podem dar testemunho de que, conforme a mais severa seita da nossa religi\xe3o, vivi fariseu."},{verse:6,en:"And now I stand and am judged for the hope of the promise made of God unto our fathers:",pt:"E agora estou aqui para ser julgado por causa da esperan\xe7a da promessa feita por Deus a nossos pais,"},{verse:7,en:"Unto which promise our twelve tribes, instantly serving God day and night, hope to come. For which hope\u2019s sake, king Agrippa, I am accused of the Jews.",pt:"a qual as nossas doze tribos, servindo a Deus fervorosamente noite e dia, esperam alcan\xe7ar; \xe9 por causa desta esperan\xe7a, \xf3 rei, que eu sou acusado pelos judeus."},{verse:8,en:"Why should it be thought a thing incredible with you, that God should raise the dead?",pt:"Por que \xe9 que se julga entre v\xf3s incr\xedvel que Deus ressuscite os mortos?"},{verse:9,en:"I verily thought with myself, that I ought to do many things contrary to the name of Jesus of Nazareth.",pt:"Eu, na verdade, cuidara que devia praticar muitas coisas contra o nome de Jesus, o nazareno;"},{verse:10,en:"Which thing I also did in Jerusalem: and many of the saints did I shut up in prison, having received authority from the chief priests; and when they were put to death, I gave my voice against them.",pt:"o que, com efeito, fiz em Jerusal\xe9m. Pois havendo recebido autoridade dos principais dos sacerdotes, n\xe3o somente encerrei muitos dos santos em pris\xf5es, como tamb\xe9m dei o meu voto contra eles quando os matavam."},{verse:11,en:"And I punished them oft in every synagogue, and compelled them to blaspheme; and being exceedingly mad against them, I persecuted them even unto strange cities.",pt:"E, castigando-os muitas vezes por todas as sinagogas, obrigava-os a blasfemar; e enfurecido cada vez mais contra eles, perseguia-os at\xe9 nas cidades estrangeiras."},{verse:12,en:"Whereupon as I went to Damascus with authority and commission from the chief priests,",pt:"Indo com este encargo a Damasco, munido de poder e comiss\xe3o dos principais sacerdotes,"},{verse:13,en:"At midday, O king, I saw in the way a light from heaven, above the brightness of the sun, shining round about me and them which journeyed with me.",pt:"ao meio-dia, \xf3 rei vi no caminho uma luz do c\xe9u, que excedia o esplendor do sol, resplandecendo em torno de mim e dos que iam comigo."},{verse:14,en:"And when we were all fallen to the earth, I heard a voice speaking unto me, and saying in the Hebrew tongue, Saul, Saul, why persecutest thou me? it is hard for thee to kick against the pricks.",pt:"E, caindo n\xf3s todos por terra, ouvi uma voz que me dizia em l\xedngua hebr\xe1ica: Saulo, Saulo, por que me persegues? Dura coisa te \xe9 recalcitrar contra os aguilh\xf5es."},{verse:15,en:"And I said, Who art thou, Lord? And he said, I am Jesus whom thou persecutest.",pt:"Disse eu: Quem \xe9s, Senhor? Respondeu o Senhor: Eu sou Jesus, a quem tu persegues;"},{verse:16,en:"But rise, and stand upon thy feet: for I have appeared unto thee for this purpose, to make thee a minister and a witness both of these things which thou hast seen, and of those things in the which I will appear unto thee;",pt:"mas levanta-te e p\xf5e-te em p\xe9; pois para isto te apareci, para te fazer ministro e testemunha tanto das coisas em que me tens visto como daquelas em que te hei de aparecer;"},{verse:17,en:"Delivering thee from the people, and from the Gentiles, unto whom now I send thee,",pt:"livrando-te deste povo e dos gentios, aos quais te envio,"},{verse:18,en:"To open their eyes, and to turn them from darkness to light, and from the power of Satan unto God, that they may receive forgiveness of sins, and inheritance among them which are sanctified by faith that is in me.",pt:"para lhes abrir os olhos a fim de que se convertam das trevas \xe0 luz, e do poder de Satan\xe1s a Deus, para que recebam remiss\xe3o de pecados e heran\xe7a entre aqueles que s\xe3o santificados pela f\xe9 em mim."},{verse:19,en:"Whereupon, O king Agrippa, I was not disobedient unto the heavenly vision:",pt:"Pelo que, \xf3 rei Agripa, n\xe3o fui desobediente \xe0 vis\xe3o celestial,"},{verse:20,en:"But shewed first unto them of Damascus, and at Jerusalem, and throughout all the coasts of Judaea, and then to the Gentiles, that they should repent and turn to God, and do works meet for repentance.",pt:"antes anunciei primeiramente aos que est\xe3o em Damasco, e depois em Jerusal\xe9m, e por toda a terra da Jud\xe9ia e tamb\xe9m aos gentios, que se arrependessem e se convertessem a Deus, praticando obras dignas de arrependimento."},{verse:21,en:"For these causes the Jews caught me in the temple, and went about to kill me.",pt:"Por causa disto os judeus me prenderam no templo e procuravam matar-me."},{verse:22,en:"Having therefore obtained help of God, I continue unto this day, witnessing both to small and great, saying none other things than those which the prophets and Moses did say should come:",pt:"Tendo, pois, alcan\xe7ado socorro da parte de Deus, ainda at\xe9 o dia de hoje permane\xe7o, dando testemunho tanto a pequenos como a grandes, n\xe3o dizendo nada sen\xe3o o que os profetas e Mois\xe9s disseram que devia acontecer;"},{verse:23,en:"That Christ should suffer, and that he should be the first that should rise from the dead, and should shew light unto the people, and to the Gentiles.",pt:"isto \xe9, como o Cristo devia padecer, e como seria ele o primeiro que, pela ressurrei\xe7ao dos mortos, devia anunciar a luz a este povo e tamb\xe9m aos gentios."},{verse:24,en:"And as he thus spake for himself, Festus said with a loud voice, Paul, thou art beside thyself; much learning doth make thee mad.",pt:"Fazendo ele deste modo a sua defesa, disse Festo em alta voz: Est\xe1s louco, Paulo; as muitas letras te fazem delirar."},{verse:25,en:"But he said, I am not mad, most noble Festus; but speak forth the words of truth and soberness.",pt:"Mas Paulo disse: N\xe3o deliro, \xf3 excelent\xedssimo Festo, antes digo palavras de verdade e de perfeito ju\xedzo."},{verse:26,en:"For the king knoweth of these things, before whom also I speak freely: for I am persuaded that none of these things are hidden from him; for this thing was not done in a corner.",pt:"Porque o rei, diante de quem falo com liberdade, sabe destas coisas, pois n\xe3o creio que nada disto lhe \xe9 oculto; porque isto n\xe3o se fez em qualquer canto."},{verse:27,en:"King Agrippa, believest thou the prophets? I know that thou believest.",pt:"Cr\xeas tu nos profetas, \xf3 rei Agripa? Sei que cr\xeas."},{verse:28,en:"Then Agrippa said unto Paul, Almost thou persuadest me to be a Christian.",pt:"Disse Agripa a Paulo: Por pouco me persuades a fazer-me crist\xe3o."},{verse:29,en:"And Paul said, I would to God, that not only thou, but also all that hear me this day, were both almost, and altogether such as I am, except these bonds.",pt:"Respondeu Paulo: Prouvera a Deus que, ou por pouco ou por muito, n\xe3o somente tu, mas tamb\xe9m todos quantos hoje me ouvem, se tornassem tais qual eu sou, menos estas cadeias."},{verse:30,en:"And when he had thus spoken, the king rose up, and the governor, and Bernice, and they that sat with them:",pt:"E levantou-se o rei, e o governador, e Berenice, e os que com eles estavam sentados,"},{verse:31,en:"And when they were gone aside, they talked between themselves, saying, This man doeth nothing worthy of death or of bonds.",pt:"e retirando-se falavam uns com os outros, dizendo: Este homem n\xe3o fez nada digno de morte ou pris\xe3o."},{verse:32,en:"Then said Agrippa unto Festus, This man might have been set at liberty, if he had not appealed unto Caesar.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Agripa disse a Festo: Este homem bem podia ser solto, se n\xe3o tivesse apelado para C\xe9sar."}]}}),831,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:27,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And when it was determined that we should sail into Italy, they delivered Paul and certain other prisoners unto one named Julius, a centurion of Augustus\u2019 band.",pt:"E, como se determinou que naveg\xe1ssemos para a It\xe1lia, entregaram Paulo e alguns outros presos a um centuri\xe3o por nome J\xfalio, da coorte augusta."},{verse:2,en:"And entering into a ship of Adramyttium, we launched, meaning to sail by the coasts of Asia; one Aristarchus, a Macedonian of Thessalonica, being with us.",pt:"E, embarcando em um navio de Adram\xedtio, que estava prestes a navegar em demanda dos portos pela costa da \xc1sia, fizemo-nos ao mar, estando conosco Aristarco, maced\xf4nio de Tessal\xf4nica."},{verse:3,en:"And the next day we touched at Sidon. And Julius courteously entreated Paul, and gave him liberty to go unto his friends to refresh himself.",pt:"No dia seguinte chegamos a Sidom, e J\xfalio, tratando Paulo com bondade, permitiu-lhe ir ver os amigos e receber deles os cuidados necess\xe1rios."},{verse:4,en:"And when we had launched from thence, we sailed under Cyprus, because the winds were contrary.",pt:"Partindo dali, fomos navegando a sotavento de Chipre, porque os ventos eram contr\xe1rios."},{verse:5,en:"And when we had sailed over the sea of Cilicia and Pamphylia, we came to Myra, a city of Lycia.",pt:"Tendo atravessado o mar ao longo da Cil\xedcia e Panf\xedlia, chegamos a Mirra, na L\xedcia."},{verse:6,en:"And there the centurion found a ship of Alexandria sailing into Italy; and he put us therein.",pt:"Ali o centuri\xe3o achou um navio de Alexandria que navegava para a It\xe1lia, e nos fez embarcar nele."},{verse:7,en:"And when we had sailed slowly many days, and scarce were come over against Cnidus, the wind not suffering us, we sailed under Crete, over against Salmone;",pt:"Navegando vagarosamente por muitos dias, e havendo chegado com dificuldade defronte de Cnido, n\xe3o nos permitindo o vento ir mais adiante, navegamos a sotavento de Creta, \xe0 altura de Salmone;"},{verse:8,en:"And, hardly passing it, came unto a place which is called The fair havens; nigh whereunto was the city of Lasea.",pt:"e, costeando-a com dificuldade, chegamos a um lugar chamado Bons Portos, perto do qual estava a cidade de Las\xe9ia."},{verse:9,en:"Now when much time was spent, and when sailing was now dangerous, because the fast was now already past, Paul admonished them,",pt:"Havendo decorrido muito tempo e tendo-se tornado perigosa a navega\xe7\xe3o, porque j\xe1 havia passado o jejum, Paulo os advertia,"},{verse:10,en:"And said unto them, Sirs, I perceive that this voyage will be with hurt and much damage, not only of the lading and ship, but also of our lives.",pt:"dizendo-lhes: Senhores, vejo que a viagem vai ser com avaria e muita perda n\xe3o s\xf3 para a carga e o navio, mas tamb\xe9m para as nossas vidas."},{verse:11,en:"Nevertheless the centurion believed the master and the owner of the ship, more than those things which were spoken by Paul.",pt:"Mas o centuri\xe3o dava mais cr\xe9dito ao piloto e ao dono do navio do que \xe0s coisas que Paulo dizia."},{verse:12,en:"And because the haven was not commodious to winter in, the more part advised to depart thence also, if by any means they might attain to Phenice, and there to winter; which is an haven of Crete, and lieth toward the south west and north west.",pt:"E n\xe3o sendo o porto muito pr\xf3prio para invernar, os mais deles foram de parecer que da\xed se fizessem ao mar para ver se de algum modo podiam chegar a F\xeanice, um porto de Creta que olha para o nordeste e para o sueste, para ali invernar."},{verse:13,en:"And when the south wind blew softly, supposing that they had obtained their purpose, loosing thence, they sailed close by Crete.",pt:"Soprando brandamente o vento sul, e supondo eles terem alcan\xe7ado o que desejavam, levantaram ferro e iam costeando Creta bem de perto."},{verse:14,en:"But not long after there arose against it a tempestuous wind, called Euroclydon.",pt:"Mas n\xe3o muito depois desencadeou-se do lado da ilha um tuf\xe3o de vento chamado euro-aquil\xe3o;"},{verse:15,en:"And when the ship was caught, and could not bear up into the wind, we let her drive.",pt:"e, sendo arrebatado o navio e n\xe3o podendo navegar contra o vento, cedemos \xe0 sua for\xe7a e nos deix\xe1vamos levar."},{verse:16,en:"And running under a certain island which is called Clauda, we had much work to come by the boat:",pt:"Correndo a sota-vento de uma pequena ilha chamada Clauda, somente a custo pudemos segurar o batel,"},{verse:17,en:"Which when they had taken up, they used helps, undergirding the ship; and, fearing lest they should fall into the quicksands, strake sail, and so were driven.",pt:"o qual recolheram, usando ent\xe3o os meios dispon\xedveis para cingir o navio; e, temendo que fossem lan\xe7ados na Sirte, arriaram os aparelhos e se deixavam levar."},{verse:18,en:"And we being exceedingly tossed with a tempest, the next day they lightened the ship;",pt:"Como f\xf4ssemos violentamente a\xe7oitados pela tempestade, no dia seguinte come\xe7aram a alijar a carga ao mar."},{verse:19,en:"And the third day we cast out with our own hands the tackling of the ship.",pt:"E ao terceiro dia, com as pr\xf3prias m\xe3os lan\xe7aram os aparelhos do navio."},{verse:20,en:"And when neither sun nor stars in many days appeared, and no small tempest lay on us, all hope that we should be saved was then taken away.",pt:"N\xe3o aparecendo por muitos dia nem sol nem estrelas, e sendo n\xf3s ainda batidos por grande tempestade, fugiu-nos afinal toda a esperan\xe7a de sermos salvos."},{verse:21,en:"But after long abstinence Paul stood forth in the midst of them, and said, Sirs, ye should have hearkened unto me, and not have loosed from Crete, and to have gained this harm and loss.",pt:"Havendo eles estado muito tempo sem comer, Paulo, pondo-se em p\xe9 no meio deles, disse: Senhores, dev\xedeis ter-me ouvido e n\xe3o ter partido de Creta, para evitar esta avaria e perda."},{verse:22,en:"And now I exhort you to be of good cheer: for there shall be no loss of any man\u2019s life among you, but of the ship.",pt:"E agora vos exorto a que tenhais bom \xe2nimo, pois n\xe3o se perder\xe1 vida alguma entre v\xf3s, mas somente o navio."},{verse:23,en:"For there stood by me this night the angel of God, whose I am, and whom I serve,",pt:"Porque esta noite me apareceu um anjo do Deus de quem eu sou e a quem sirvo,"},{verse:24,en:"Saying, Fear not, Paul; thou must be brought before Caesar: and, lo, God hath given thee all them that sail with thee.",pt:"dizendo: N\xe3o temas, Paulo, importa que compare\xe7as perante C\xe9sar, e eis que Deus te deu todos os que navegam contigo."},{verse:25,en:"Wherefore, sirs, be of good cheer: for I believe God, that it shall be even as it was told me.",pt:"Portanto, senhores, tende bom \xe2nimo; pois creio em Deus que h\xe1 de suceder assim como me foi dito."},{verse:26,en:"Howbeit we must be cast upon a certain island.",pt:"Contudo \xe9 necess\xe1rio irmos dar em alguma ilha."},{verse:27,en:"But when the fourteenth night was come, as we were driven up and down in Adria, about midnight the shipmen deemed that they drew near to some country;",pt:"Quando chegou a d\xe9cima quarta noite, sendo n\xf3s ainda impelidos pela tempestade no mar de \xc1dria, pela meia-noite, suspeitaram os marinheiros a proximidade de terra;"},{verse:28,en:"And sounded, and found it twenty fathoms: and when they had gone a little further, they sounded again, and found it fifteen fathoms.",pt:"e lan\xe7ando a sonda, acharam vinte bra\xe7as; passando um pouco mais adiante, e tornando a lan\xe7ar a sonda, acharam quinze bra\xe7as."},{verse:29,en:"Then fearing lest we should have fallen upon rocks, they cast four anchors out of the stern, and wished for the day.",pt:"Ora, temendo irmos dar em rochedos, lan\xe7aram da popa quatro \xe2ncoras, e esperaram ansiosos que amanhecesse."},{verse:30,en:"And as the shipmen were about to flee out of the ship, when they had let down the boat into the sea, under colour as though they would have cast anchors out of the foreship,",pt:"Procurando, entrementes, os marinheiros fugir do navio, e tendo arriado o batel ao mar sob pretexto de irem lan\xe7ar \xe2ncoras pela proa,"},{verse:31,en:"Paul said to the centurion and to the soldiers, Except these abide in the ship, ye cannot be saved.",pt:"disse Paulo ao centuri\xe3o e aos soldados: Se estes n\xe3o ficarem no navio, n\xe3o podereis salvar-vos."},{verse:32,en:"Then the soldiers cut off the ropes of the boat, and let her fall off.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os soldados cortaram os cabos do batel e o deixaram cair."},{verse:33,en:"And while the day was coming on, Paul besought them all to take meat, saying, This day is the fourteenth day that ye have tarried and continued fasting, having taken nothing.",pt:"Enquanto amanhecia, Paulo rogava a todos que comessem alguma coisa, dizendo: \xc9 j\xe1 hoje o d\xe9cimo quarto dia que esperais e permaneceis em jejum, n\xe3o havendo provado coisa alguma."},{verse:34,en:"Wherefore I pray you to take some meat: for this is for your health: for there shall not an hair fall from the head of any of you.",pt:"Rogo-vos, portanto, que comais alguma coisa, porque disso depende a vossa seguran\xe7a; porque nem um cabelo cair\xe1 da cabe\xe7a de qualquer de v\xf3s."},{verse:35,en:"And when he had thus spoken, he took bread, and gave thanks to God in presence of them all: and when he had broken it, he began to eat.",pt:"E, havendo dito isto, tomou o p\xe3o, deu gra\xe7as a Deus na presen\xe7a de todos e, partindo-o come\xe7ou a comer."},{verse:36,en:"Then were they all of good cheer, and they also took some meat.",pt:"Ent\xe3o todos cobraram \xe2nimo e se puseram tamb\xe9m a comer."},{verse:37,en:"And we were in all in the ship two hundred threescore and sixteen souls.",pt:"\xc9ramos ao todo no navio duzentas e setenta e seis almas."},{verse:38,en:"And when they had eaten enough, they lightened the ship, and cast out the wheat into the sea.",pt:"Depois de saciados com a comida, come\xe7aram a aliviar o navio, alijando o trigo no mar."},{verse:39,en:"And when it was day, they knew not the land: but they discovered a certain creek with a shore, into the which they were minded, if it were possible, to thrust in the ship.",pt:"Quando amanheceu, n\xe3o reconheciam a terra; divisavam, por\xe9m, uma enseada com uma praia, e consultavam se poderiam nela encalhar o navio."},{verse:40,en:"And when they had taken up the anchors, they committed themselves unto the sea, and loosed the rudder bands, and hoised up the mainsail to the wind, and made toward shore.",pt:"Soltando as \xe2ncoras, deixaram-nas no mar, largando ao mesmo tempo as amarras do leme; e, i\xe7ando ao vento a vela da proa, dirigiram-se para a praia."},{verse:41,en:"And falling into a place where two seas met, they ran the ship aground; and the forepart stuck fast, and remained unmoveable, but the hinder part was broken with the violence of the waves.",pt:"Dando, por\xe9m, num lugar onde duas correntes se encontravam, encalharam o navio; e a proa, encravando-se, ficou im\xf3vel, mas a popa se desfazia com a for\xe7a das ondas."},{verse:42,en:"And the soldiers\u2019 counsel was to kill the prisoners, lest any of them should swim out, and escape.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o parecer dos soldados era que matassem os presos para que nenhum deles fugisse, escapando a nado."},{verse:43,en:"But the centurion, willing to save Paul, kept them from their purpose; and commanded that they which could swim should cast themselves first into the sea, and get to land:",pt:"Mas o centuri\xe3o, querendo salvar a Paulo, estorvou-lhes este intento; e mandou que os que pudessem nadar fossem os primeiros a lan\xe7ar-se ao mar e alcan\xe7ar a terra;"},{verse:44,en:"And the rest, some on boards, and some on broken pieces of the ship. And so it came to pass, that they escaped all safe to land.",pt:"e que os demais se salvassem, uns em t\xe1buas e outros em quaisquer destro\xe7os do navio. Assim chegaram todos \xe0 terra salvos."}]}}),832,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Acts",bookPt:"Atos",chapter:28,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And when they were escaped, then they knew that the island was called Melita.",pt:"Estando j\xe1 salvos, soubemos ent\xe3o que a ilha se chamava Malta."},{verse:2,en:"And the barbarous people shewed us no little kindness: for they kindled a fire, and received us every one, because of the present rain, and because of the cold.",pt:"Os ind\xedgenas usaram conosco de n\xe3o pouca humanidade; pois acenderam uma fogueira e nos recolheram a todos por causa da chuva que ca\xeda, e por causa do frio."},{verse:3,en:"And when Paul had gathered a bundle of sticks, and laid them on the fire, there came a viper out of the heat, and fastened on his hand.",pt:"Ora havendo Paulo ajuntado e posto sobre o fogo um feixe de gravetos, uma v\xedbora, fugindo do calor, apegou-se-lhe \xe0 m\xe3o."},{verse:4,en:"And when the barbarians saw the venomous beast hang on his hand, they said among themselves, No doubt this man is a murderer, whom, though he hath escaped the sea, yet vengeance suffereth not to live.",pt:"Quando os ind\xedgenas viram o r\xe9ptil pendente da m\xe3o dele, diziam uns aos outros: Certamente este homem \xe9 homicida, pois, embora salvo do mar, a Justi\xe7a n\xe3o o deixa viver."},{verse:5,en:"And he shook off the beast into the fire, and felt no harm.",pt:"Mas ele, sacudindo o r\xe9ptil no fogo, n\xe3o sofreu mal nenhum."},{verse:6,en:"Howbeit they looked when he should have swollen, or fallen down dead suddenly: but after they had looked a great while, and saw no harm come to him, they changed their minds, and said that he was a god.",pt:"Eles, por\xe9m, esperavam que Paulo viesse a inchar ou a cair morto de repente; mas tendo esperado muito tempo e vendo que nada de anormal lhe sucedia, mudaram de parecer e diziam que era um deus."},{verse:7,en:"In the same quarters were possessions of the chief man of the island, whose name was Publius; who received us, and lodged us three days courteously.",pt:"Ora, nos arredores daquele lugar havia umas terras que pertenciam ao homem principal da ilha, por nome P\xfablio, o qual nos recebeu e hospedou bondosamente por tr\xeas dias."},{verse:8,en:"And it came to pass, that the father of Publius lay sick of a fever and of a bloody flux: to whom Paul entered in, and prayed, and laid his hands on him, and healed him.",pt:"Aconteceu estar de cama, enfermo de febre e disenteria, o pai de P\xfablio; Paulo foi visit\xe1-lo, e havendo orado, imp\xf4s-lhe as m\xe3os, e o curou."},{verse:9,en:"So when this was done, others also, which had diseases in the island, came, and were healed:",pt:"Feito isto, vinham tamb\xe9m os demais enfermos da ilha, e eram curados;"},{verse:10,en:"Who also honoured us with many honours; and when we departed, they laded us with such things as were necessary.",pt:"e estes nos distinguiram com muitas honras; e, ao embarcarmos, puseram a bordo as coisas que nos eram necess\xe1rias."},{verse:11,en:"And after three months we departed in a ship of Alexandria, which had wintered in the isle, whose sign was Castor and Pollux.",pt:"Passados tr\xeas meses, partimos em um navio de Alexandria que invernara na ilha, o qual tinha por ins\xedgnia Castor e P\xf3lux."},{verse:12,en:"And landing at Syracuse, we tarried there three days.",pt:"E chegando a Siracusa, ficamos ali tr\xeas dias;"},{verse:13,en:"And from thence we fetched a compass, and came to Rhegium: and after one day the south wind blew, and we came the next day to Puteoli:",pt:"donde, costeando, viemos a R\xe9gio; e, soprando no dia seguinte o vento sul, chegamos em dois dias a Put\xe9oli,"},{verse:14,en:"Where we found brethren, and were desired to tarry with them seven days: and so we went toward Rome.",pt:"onde, achando alguns irm\xe3os, fomos convidados a ficar com eles sete dias; e depois nos dirigimos a Roma."},{verse:15,en:"And from thence, when the brethren heard of us, they came to meet us as far as Appii Forum, and The three taverns: whom when Paul saw, he thanked God, and took courage.",pt:"Ora, os irm\xe3os da l\xe1, havendo recebido not\xedcias nossas, vieram ao nosso encontro at\xe9 a pra\xe7a de \xc1pio e \xe0s Tr\xeas Vendas, e Paulo, quando os viu, deu gra\xe7as a Deus e cobrou \xe2nimo."},{verse:16,en:"And when we came to Rome, the centurion delivered the prisoners to the captain of the guard: but Paul was suffered to dwell by himself with a soldier that kept him.",pt:"Quando chegamos a Roma, [o centuri\xe3o entregou os presos ao general do ex\xe9rcito, mas,] a Paulo se lhe permitiu morar \xe0 parte, com o soldado que o guardava."},{verse:17,en:"And it came to pass, that after three days Paul called the chief of the Jews together: and when they were come together, he said unto them, Men and brethren, though I have committed nothing against the people, or customs of our fathers, yet was I delivered prisoner from Jerusalem into the hands of the Romans.",pt:"Passados tr\xeas dias, ele convocou os principais dentre os judeus; e reunidos eles, disse-lhes: Var\xf5es irm\xe3os, n\xe3o havendo eu feito nada contra o povo, ou contra os ritos paternos, vim contudo preso desde Jerusal\xe9m, entregue nas m\xe3os dos romanos;"},{verse:18,en:"Who, when they had examined me, would have let me go, because there was no cause of death in me.",pt:"os quais, havendo-me interrogado, queriam soltar-me, por n\xe3o haver em mim crime algum que merecesse a morte."},{verse:19,en:"But when the Jews spake against it, I was constrained to appeal unto Caesar; not that I had ought to accuse my nation of.",pt:"Mas opondo-se a isso os judeus, vi-me obrigado a apelar para C\xe9sar, n\xe3o tendo, contudo, nada de que acusar a minha na\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"For this cause therefore have I called for you, to see you, and to speak with you: because that for the hope of Israel I am bound with this chain.",pt:"Por esta causa, pois, vos convidei, para vos ver e falar; porque pela esperan\xe7a de Israel estou preso com esta cadeia."},{verse:21,en:"And they said unto him, We neither received letters out of Judaea concerning thee, neither any of the brethren that came shewed or spake any harm of thee.",pt:"Mas eles lhe disseram: Nem recebemos da Jud\xe9ia cartas a teu respeito, nem veio aqui irm\xe3o algum que contasse ou dissesse mal de ti."},{verse:22,en:"But we desire to hear of thee what thou thinkest: for as concerning this sect, we know that every where it is spoken against.",pt:"No entanto bem quis\xe9ramos ouvir de ti o que pensas; porque, quanto a esta seita, not\xf3rio nos \xe9 que em toda parte \xe9 impugnada."},{verse:23,en:"And when they had appointed him a day, there came many to him into his lodging; to whom he expounded and testified the kingdom of God, persuading them concerning Jesus, both out of the law of Moses, and out of the prophets, from morning till evening.",pt:"Havendo-lhe eles marcado um dia, muitos foram ter com ele \xe0 sua morada, aos quais desde a manh\xe3 at\xe9 a noite explicava com bom testemunho o reino de Deus e procurava persuad\xed-los acerca de Jesus, tanto pela lei de Mois\xe9s como pelos profetas."},{verse:24,en:"And some believed the things which were spoken, and some believed not.",pt:"Uns criam nas suas palavras, mas outros as rejeitavam."},{verse:25,en:"And when they agreed not among themselves, they departed, after that Paul had spoken one word, Well spake the Holy Ghost by Esaias the prophet unto our fathers,",pt:"E estando discordes entre si, retiraram-se, havendo Paulo dito esta palavra: Bem falou o Esp\xedrito Santo aos vossos pais pelo profeta Isa\xedas,"},{verse:26,en:"Saying, Go unto this people, and say, Hearing ye shall hear, and shall not understand; and seeing ye shall see, and not perceive:",pt:"dizendo: Vai a este povo e dize: Ouvindo, ouvireis, e de maneira nenhuma entendereis; e vendo, vereis, e de maneira nenhuma percebereis."},{verse:27,en:"For the heart of this people is waxed gross, and their ears are dull of hearing, and their eyes have they closed; lest they should see with their eyes, and hear with their ears, and understand with their heart, and should be converted, and I should heal them.",pt:"Porque o cora\xe7\xe3o deste povo se endureceu, e com os ouvidos ouviram tardamente, e fecharam os olhos; para que n\xe3o vejam com os olhos, nem ou\xe7am com os ouvidos, nem entendam com o cora\xe7\xe3o nem se convertam e eu os cure."},{verse:28,en:"Be it known therefore unto you, that the salvation of God is sent unto the Gentiles, and that they will hear it.",pt:"Seja-vos pois not\xf3rio que esta salva\xe7\xe3o de Deus \xe9 enviada aos gentios, e eles ouvir\xe3o."},{verse:29,en:"And when he had said these words, the Jews departed, and had great reasoning among themselves.",pt:"[E, havendo ele dito isto, partiram os judeus, tendo entre si grande contenda.]"},{verse:30,en:"And Paul dwelt two whole years in his own hired house, and received all that came in unto him,",pt:"E morou dois anos inteiros na casa que alugara, e recebia a todos os que o visitavam,"},{verse:31,en:"Preaching the kingdom of God, and teaching those things which concern the Lord Jesus Christ, with all confidence, no man forbidding him.",pt:"pregando o reino de Deus e ensinando as coisas concernentes ao Senhor Jesus Cristo, com toda a liberdade, sem impedimento algum."}]}}),833,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Ephesians",bookPt:"Ef\xe9sios",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Paul, an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God, to the saints which are at Ephesus, and to the faithful in Christ Jesus:",pt:"Paulo, ap\xf3stolo de Cristo Jesus pela vontade de Deus, aos santos que est\xe3o em \xc9feso, e fi\xe9is em Cristo Jesus:"},{verse:2,en:"Grace be to you, and peace, from God our Father, and from the Lord Jesus Christ.",pt:"Gra\xe7a a v\xf3s, e paz da parte de Deus nosso Pai, e do Senhor Jesus Cristo."},{verse:3,en:"Blessed be the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, who hath blessed us with all spiritual blessings in heavenly places in Christ:",pt:"Bendito seja o Deus e Pai de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo, o qual nos aben\xe7oou com todas as b\xean\xe7\xe3os espirituais nas regi\xf5es celestes em Cristo;"},{verse:4,en:"According as he hath chosen us in him before the foundation of the world, that we should be holy and without blame before him in love:",pt:"como tamb\xe9m nos elegeu nele antes da funda\xe7\xe3o do mundo, para sermos santos e irrepreens\xedveis diante dele em amor;"},{verse:5,en:"Having predestinated us unto the adoption of children by Jesus Christ to himself, according to the good pleasure of his will,",pt:"e nos predestinou para sermos filhos de ado\xe7\xe3o por Jesus Cristo, para si mesmo, segundo o benepl\xe1cito de sua vontade,"},{verse:6,en:"To the praise of the glory of his grace, wherein he hath made us accepted in the beloved.",pt:"para o louvor da gl\xf3ria da sua gra\xe7a, a qual nos deu gratuitamente no Amado;"},{verse:7,en:"In whom we have redemption through his blood, the forgiveness of sins, according to the riches of his grace;",pt:"em quem temos a reden\xe7\xe3o pelo seu sangue, a reden\xe7\xe3o dos nossos delitos, segundo as riquezas da sua gra\xe7a,"},{verse:8,en:"Wherein he hath abounded toward us in all wisdom and prudence;",pt:"que ele fez abundar para conosco em toda a sabedoria e prud\xeancia,"},{verse:9,en:"Having made known unto us the mystery of his will, according to his good pleasure which he hath purposed in himself:",pt:"fazendo-nos conhecer o mist\xe9rio da sua vontade, segundo o seu benepl\xe1cito, que nele prop\xf4s"},{verse:10,en:"That in the dispensation of the fulness of times he might gather together in one all things in Christ, both which are in heaven, and which are on earth; even in him:",pt:"para a dispensa\xe7\xe3o da plenitude dos tempos, de fazer convergir em Cristo todas as coisas, tanto as que est\xe3o nos c\xe9us como as que est\xe3o na terra,"},{verse:11,en:"In whom also we have obtained an inheritance, being predestinated according to the purpose of him who worketh all things after the counsel of his own will:",pt:"nele, digo, no qual tamb\xe9m fomos feitos heran\xe7a, havendo sido predestinados conforme o prop\xf3sito daquele que faz todas as coisas segundo o conselho da sua vontade,"},{verse:12,en:"That we should be to the praise of his glory, who first trusted in Christ.",pt:"com o fim de sermos para o louvor da sua gl\xf3ria, n\xf3s, os que antes hav\xedamos esperado em Cristo;"},{verse:13,en:"In whom ye also trusted, after that ye heard the word of truth, the gospel of your salvation: in whom also after that ye believed, ye were sealed with that holy Spirit of promise,",pt:"no qual tamb\xe9m v\xf3s, tendo ouvido a palavra da verdade, o evangelho da vossa salva\xe7\xe3o, e tendo nele tamb\xe9m crido, fostes selados com o Esp\xedrito Santo da promessa,"},{verse:14,en:"Which is the earnest of our inheritance until the redemption of the purchased possession, unto the praise of his glory.",pt:"o qual \xe9 o penhor da nossa heran\xe7a, para reden\xe7\xe3o da possess\xe3o de Deus, para o louvor da sua gl\xf3ria."},{verse:15,en:"Wherefore I also, after I heard of your faith in the Lord Jesus, and love unto all the saints,",pt:"Por isso tamb\xe9m eu, tendo ouvido falar da f\xe9 que entre v\xf3s h\xe1 no Senhor Jesus e do vosso amor para com todos os santos,"},{verse:16,en:"Cease not to give thanks for you, making mention of you in my prayers;",pt:"n\xe3o cesso de dar gra\xe7as por v\xf3s, lembrando-me de v\xf3s nas minhas ora\xe7\xf5es,"},{verse:17,en:"That the God of our Lord Jesus Christ, the Father of glory, may give unto you the spirit of wisdom and revelation in the knowledge of him:",pt:"para que o Deus de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo, o Pai da gl\xf3ria, vos d\xea o esp\xedrito de sabedoria e de revela\xe7\xe3o no pleno conhecimento dele;"},{verse:18,en:"The eyes of your understanding being enlightened; that ye may know what is the hope of his calling, and what the riches of the glory of his inheritance in the saints,",pt:"sendo iluminados os olhos do vosso cora\xe7\xe3o, para que saibais qual seja a esperan\xe7a da sua voca\xe7\xe3o, e quais as riquezas da gl\xf3ria da sua heran\xe7a nos santos,"},{verse:19,en:"And what is the exceeding greatness of his power to us-ward who believe, according to the working of his mighty power,",pt:"e qual a suprema grandeza do seu poder para conosco, os que cremos, segundo a opera\xe7\xe3o da for\xe7a do seu poder,"},{verse:20,en:"Which he wrought in Christ, when he raised him from the dead, and set him at his own right hand in the heavenly places,",pt:"que operou em Cristo, ressuscitando-o dentre os mortos e fazendo-o sentar-se \xe0 sua direita nos c\xe9us,"},{verse:21,en:"Far above all principality, and power, and might, and dominion, and every name that is named, not only in this world, but also in that which is to come:",pt:"muito acima de todo principado, e autoridade, e poder, e dom\xednio, e de todo nome que se nomeia, n\xe3o s\xf3 neste s\xe9culo, mas tamb\xe9m no vindouro;"},{verse:22,en:"And hath put all things under his feet, and gave him to be the head over all things to the church,",pt:"e sujeitou todas as coisas debaixo dos seus p\xe9s, e para ser cabe\xe7a sobre todas as coisas o deu \xe0 igreja,"},{verse:23,en:"Which is his body, the fulness of him that filleth all in all.",pt:"que \xe9 o seu corpo, o complemento daquele que cumpre tudo em todas as coisas."}]}}),834,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Ephesians",bookPt:"Ef\xe9sios",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And you hath he quickened, who were dead in trespasses and sins;",pt:"Ele vos vivificou, estando v\xf3s mortos nos vossos delitos e pecados,"},{verse:2,en:"Wherein in time past ye walked according to the course of this world, according to the prince of the power of the air, the spirit that now worketh in the children of disobedience:",pt:"nos quais outrora andastes, segundo o curso deste mundo, segundo o pr\xedncipe das potestades do ar, do esp\xedrito que agora opera nos filhos de desobedi\xeancia,"},{verse:3,en:"Among whom also we all had our conversation in times past in the lusts of our flesh, fulfilling the desires of the flesh and of the mind; and were by nature the children of wrath, even as others.",pt:"entre os quais todos n\xf3s tamb\xe9m antes and\xe1vamos nos desejos da nossa carne, fazendo a vontade da carne e dos pensamentos; e \xe9ramos por natureza filhos da ira, como tamb\xe9m os demais."},{verse:4,en:"But God, who is rich in mercy, for his great love wherewith he loved us,",pt:"Mas Deus, sendo rico em miseric\xf3rdia, pelo seu muito amor com que nos amou,"},{verse:5,en:"Even when we were dead in sins, hath quickened us together with Christ, (by grace ye are saved;)",pt:"estando n\xf3s ainda mortos em nossos delitos, nos vivificou juntamente com Cristo (pela gra\xe7a sois salvos),"},{verse:6,en:"And hath raised us up together, and made us sit together in heavenly places in Christ Jesus:",pt:"e nos ressuscitou juntamente com ele, e com ele nos fez sentar nas regi\xf5es celestes em Cristo Jesus,"},{verse:7,en:"That in the ages to come he might shew the exceeding riches of his grace in his kindness toward us through Christ Jesus.",pt:"para mostrar nos s\xe9culos vindouros a suprema riqueza da sua gra\xe7a, pela sua bondade para conosco em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:8,en:"For by grace are ye saved through faith; and that not of yourselves: it is the gift of God:",pt:"Porque pela gra\xe7a sois salvos, por meio da f\xe9; e isto n\xe3o vem de v\xf3s, \xe9 dom de Deus;"},{verse:9,en:"Not of works, lest any man should boast.",pt:"n\xe3o vem das obras, para que ningu\xe9m se glorie."},{verse:10,en:"For we are his workmanship, created in Christ Jesus unto good works, which God hath before ordained that we should walk in them.",pt:"Porque somos feitura sua, criados em Cristo Jesus para boas obras, as quais Deus antes preparou para que and\xe1ssemos nelas."},{verse:11,en:"Wherefore remember, that ye being in time past Gentiles in the flesh, who are called Uncircumcision by that which is called the Circumcision in the flesh made by hands;",pt:"Portanto, lembrai-vos que outrora v\xf3s, gentios na carne, chamam circuncis\xe3o, feita pela m\xe3o dos homens,"},{verse:12,en:"That at that time ye were without Christ, being aliens from the commonwealth of Israel, and strangers from the covenants of promise, having no hope, and without God in the world:",pt:"est\xe1veis naquele tempo sem Cristo, separados da comunidade de Israel, e estranhos aos pactos da promessa, n\xe3o tendo esperan\xe7a, e sem Deus no mundo."},{verse:13,en:"But now in Christ Jesus ye who sometimes were far off are made nigh by the blood of Christ.",pt:"Mas agora, em Cristo Jesus, v\xf3s, que antes est\xe1veis longe, j\xe1 pelo sangue de Cristo chegastes perto."},{verse:14,en:"For he is our peace, who hath made both one, and hath broken down the middle wall of partition between us;",pt:"Porque ele \xe9 a nossa paz, o qual de ambos os povos fez um; e, derrubando a parede de separa\xe7\xe3o que estava no meio, na sua carne desfez a inimizade,"},{verse:15,en:"Having abolished in his flesh the enmity, even the law of commandments contained in ordinances; for to make in himself of twain one new man, so making peace;",pt:"isto \xe9, a lei dos mandamentos contidos em ordenan\xe7as, para criar, em si mesmo, dos dois um novo homem, assim fazendo a paz,"},{verse:16,en:"And that he might reconcile both unto God in one body by the cross, having slain the enmity thereby:",pt:"e pela cruz reconciliar ambos com Deus em um s\xf3 corpo, tendo por ela matado a inimizade;"},{verse:17,en:"And came and preached peace to you which were afar off, and to them that were nigh.",pt:"e, vindo, ele evangelizou paz a v\xf3s que est\xe1veis longe, e paz aos que estavam perto;"},{verse:18,en:"For through him we both have access by one Spirit unto the Father.",pt:"porque por ele ambos temos acesso ao Pai em um mesmo Esp\xedrito."},{verse:19,en:"Now therefore ye are no more strangers and foreigners, but fellowcitizens with the saints, and of the household of God;",pt:"Assim, pois, n\xe3o sois mais estrangeiros, nem forasteiros, antes sois concidad\xe3os dos santos e membros da fam\xedlia de Deus,"},{verse:20,en:"And are built upon the foundation of the apostles and prophets, Jesus Christ himself being the chief corner stone;",pt:"edificados sobre o fundamento dos ap\xf3stolos e dos profetas, sendo o pr\xf3prio Cristo Jesus a principal pedra da esquina;"},{verse:21,en:"In whom all the building fitly framed together groweth unto an holy temple in the Lord:",pt:"no qual todo o edif\xedcio bem ajustado cresce para templo santo no Senhor,"},{verse:22,en:"In whom ye also are builded together for an habitation of God through the Spirit.",pt:"no qual tamb\xe9m v\xf3s juntamente sois edificados para morada de Deus no Esp\xedrito."}]}}),835,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Ephesians",bookPt:"Ef\xe9sios",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"For this cause I Paul, the prisoner of Jesus Christ for you Gentiles,",pt:"Por esta raz\xe3o eu, Paulo, o prisioneiro de Cristo Jesus por amor de v\xf3s gentios..."},{verse:2,en:"If ye have heard of the dispensation of the grace of God which is given me to youward:",pt:"Se \xe9 que tendes ouvido a dispensa\xe7\xe3o da gra\xe7a de Deus, que para convosco me foi dada;"},{verse:3,en:"How that by revelation he made known unto me the mystery; (as I wrote afore in few words,",pt:"como pela revela\xe7\xe3o me foi manifestado o mist\xe9rio, conforme acima em poucas palavras vos escrevi,"},{verse:4,en:"Whereby, when ye read, ye may understand my knowledge in the mystery of Christ)",pt:"pelo que, quando ledes, podeis perceber a minha compreens\xe3o do mist\xe9rio de Cristo,"},{verse:5,en:"Which in other ages was not made known unto the sons of men, as it is now revealed unto his holy apostles and prophets by the Spirit;",pt:"o qual em outras gera\xe7\xf5es n\xe3o foi manifestado aos filhos dos homens, como se revelou agora no Esp\xedrito aos seus santos ap\xf3stolos e profetas,"},{verse:6,en:"That the Gentiles should be fellowheirs, and of the same body, and partakers of his promise in Christ by the gospel:",pt:"a saber, que os gentios s\xe3o co-herdeiros e membros do mesmo corpo e co-participantes da promessa em Cristo Jesus por meio do evangelho;"},{verse:7,en:"Whereof I was made a minister, according to the gift of the grace of God given unto me by the effectual working of his power.",pt:"do qual fui feito ministro, segundo o dom da gra\xe7a de Deus, que me foi dada conforme a opera\xe7\xe3o do seu poder."},{verse:8,en:"Unto me, who am less than the least of all saints, is this grace given, that I should preach among the Gentiles the unsearchable riches of Christ;",pt:"A mim, o m\xednimo de todos os santos, me foi dada esta gra\xe7a de anunciar aos gentios as riquezas inescrut\xe1veis de Cristo,"},{verse:9,en:"And to make all men see what is the fellowship of the mystery, which from the beginning of the world hath been hid in God, who created all things by Jesus Christ:",pt:"e demonstrar a todos qual seja a dispensa\xe7\xe3o do mist\xe9rio que desde os s\xe9culos esteve oculto em Deus, que tudo criou,"},{verse:10,en:"To the intent that now unto the principalities and powers in heavenly places might be known by the church the manifold wisdom of God,",pt:"para que agora seja manifestada, por meio da igreja, aos principados e potestades nas regi\xf5es celestes,"},{verse:11,en:"According to the eternal purpose which he purposed in Christ Jesus our Lord:",pt:"segundo o eterno prop\xf3sito que fez em Cristo Jesus nosso Senhor,"},{verse:12,en:"In whom we have boldness and access with confidence by the faith of him.",pt:"no qual temos ousadia e acesso em confian\xe7a, pela nossa f\xe9 nele."},{verse:13,en:"Wherefore I desire that ye faint not at my tribulations for you, which is your glory.",pt:"Portanto vos pe\xe7o que n\xe3o desfale\xe7ais diante das minhas tribula\xe7\xf5es por v\xf3s, as quais s\xe3o a vossa gl\xf3ria."},{verse:14,en:"For this cause I bow my knees unto the Father of our Lord Jesus Christ,",pt:"Por esta raz\xe3o dobro os meus joelhos perante o Pai,"},{verse:15,en:"Of whom the whole family in heaven and earth is named,",pt:"do qual toda fam\xedlia nos c\xe9us e na terra toma o nome,"},{verse:16,en:"That he would grant you, according to the riches of his glory, to be strengthened with might by his Spirit in the inner man;",pt:"para que, segundo as riquezas da sua gl\xf3ria, vos conceda que sejais robustecidos com poder pelo seu Esp\xedrito no homem interior;"},{verse:17,en:"That Christ may dwell in your hearts by faith; that ye, being rooted and grounded in love,",pt:"que Cristo habite pela f\xe9 nos vossos cora\xe7\xf5es, a fim de que, estando arraigados e fundados em amor,"},{verse:18,en:"May be able to comprehend with all saints what is the breadth, and length, and depth, and height;",pt:"possais compreender, com todos os santos, qual seja a largura, e o comprimento, e a altura, e a profundidade,"},{verse:19,en:"And to know the love of Christ, which passeth knowledge, that ye might be filled with all the fulness of God.",pt:"e conhecer o amor de Cristo, que excede todo o entendimento, para que sejais cheios at\xe9 a inteira plenitude de Deus."},{verse:20,en:"Now unto him that is able to do exceeding abundantly above all that we ask or think, according to the power that worketh in us,",pt:"Ora, \xe0quele que \xe9 poderoso para fazer tudo muito mais abundantemente al\xe9m daquilo que pedimos ou pensamos, segundo o poder que em n\xf3s opera,"},{verse:21,en:"Unto him be glory in the church by Christ Jesus throughout all ages, world without end. Amen.",pt:"a esse seja gl\xf3ria na igreja e em Cristo Jesus, por todas as gera\xe7\xf5es, para todo o sempre. Am\xe9m."}]}}),836,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Ephesians",bookPt:"Ef\xe9sios",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I therefore, the prisoner of the Lord, beseech you that ye walk worthy of the vocation wherewith ye are called,",pt:"Rogo-vos, pois, eu, o prisioneiro no Senhor, que andeis como \xe9 digno da voca\xe7\xe3o com que fostes chamados,"},{verse:2,en:"With all lowliness and meekness, with longsuffering, forbearing one another in love;",pt:"com toda a humildade e mansid\xe3o, com longanimidade, suportando-vos uns aos outros em amor,"},{verse:3,en:"Endeavouring to keep the unity of the Spirit in the bond of peace.",pt:"procurando diligentemente guardar a unidade do Esp\xedrito no v\xednculo da paz."},{verse:4,en:"There is one body, and one Spirit, even as ye are called in one hope of your calling;",pt:"H\xe1 um s\xf3 corpo e um s\xf3 Esp\xedrito, como tamb\xe9m fostes chamados em uma s\xf3 esperan\xe7a da vossa voca\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:5,en:"One Lord, one faith, one baptism,",pt:"um s\xf3 Senhor, uma s\xf3 f\xe9, um s\xf3 batismo;"},{verse:6,en:"One God and Father of all, who is above all, and through all, and in you all.",pt:"um s\xf3 Deus e Pai de todos, o qual \xe9 sobre todos, e por todos e em todos."},{verse:7,en:"But unto every one of us is given grace according to the measure of the gift of Christ.",pt:"Mas a cada um de n\xf3s foi dada a gra\xe7a conforme a medida do dom de Cristo."},{verse:8,en:"Wherefore he saith, When he ascended up on high, he led captivity captive, and gave gifts unto men.",pt:"Por isso foi dito: Subindo ao alto, levou cativo o cativeiro, e deu dons aos homens."},{verse:9,en:"(Now that he ascended, what is it but that he also descended first into the lower parts of the earth?",pt:"Ora, isto - ele subiu - que \xe9, sen\xe3o que tamb\xe9m desceu \xe0s partes mais baixas da terra?"},{verse:10,en:"He that descended is the same also that ascended up far above all heavens, that he might fill all things.)",pt:"Aquele que desceu \xe9 tamb\xe9m o mesmo que subiu muito acima de todos os c\xe9us, para cumprir todas as coisas."},{verse:11,en:"And he gave some, apostles; and some, prophets; and some, evangelists; and some, pastors and teachers;",pt:"E ele deu uns como ap\xf3stolos, e outros como profetas, e outros como evangelistas, e outros como pastores e mestres,"},{verse:12,en:"For the perfecting of the saints, for the work of the ministry, for the edifying of the body of Christ:",pt:"tendo em vista o aperfei\xe7oamento dos santos, para a obra do minist\xe9rio, para edifica\xe7\xe3o do corpo de Cristo;"},{verse:13,en:"Till we all come in the unity of the faith, and of the knowledge of the Son of God, unto a perfect man, unto the measure of the stature of the fulness of Christ:",pt:"at\xe9 que todos cheguemos \xe0 unidade da f\xe9 e do pleno conhecimento do Filho de Deus, ao estado de homem feito, \xe0 medida da estatura da plenitude de Cristo;"},{verse:14,en:"That we henceforth be no more children, tossed to and fro, and carried about with every wind of doctrine, by the sleight of men, and cunning craftiness, whereby they lie in wait to deceive;",pt:"para que n\xe3o mais sejamos meninos, inconstantes, levados ao redor por todo vento de doutrina, pela fraudul\xeancia dos homens, pela ast\xfacia tendente \xe0 maquina\xe7\xe3o do erro;"},{verse:15,en:"But speaking the truth in love, may grow up into him in all things, which is the head, even Christ:",pt:"antes, seguindo a verdade em amor, cres\xe7amos em tudo naquele que \xe9 a cabe\xe7a, Cristo,"},{verse:16,en:"From whom the whole body fitly joined together and compacted by that which every joint supplieth, according to the effectual working in the measure of every part, maketh increase of the body unto the edifying of itself in love.",pt:"do qual o corpo inteiro bem ajustado, e ligado pelo aux\xedlio de todas as juntas, segundo a justa opera\xe7\xe3o de cada parte, efetua o seu crescimento para edifica\xe7\xe3o de si mesmo em amor."},{verse:17,en:"This I say therefore, and testify in the Lord, that ye henceforth walk not as other Gentiles walk, in the vanity of their mind,",pt:"Portanto digo isto, e testifico no Senhor, para que n\xe3o mais andeis como andam os gentios, na verdade da sua mente,"},{verse:18,en:"Having the understanding darkened, being alienated from the life of God through the ignorance that is in them, because of the blindness of their heart:",pt:"entenebrecidos no entendimento, separados da vida de Deus pela ignor\xe2ncia que h\xe1 neles, pela dureza do seu cora\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:19,en:"Who being past feeling have given themselves over unto lasciviousness, to work all uncleanness with greediness.",pt:"os quais, tendo-se tornado insens\xedveis, entregaram-se \xe0 lasc\xedvia para cometerem com avidez toda sorte de impureza."},{verse:20,en:"But ye have not so learned Christ;",pt:"Mas v\xf3s n\xe3o aprendestes assim a Cristo."},{verse:21,en:"If so be that ye have heard him, and have been taught by him, as the truth is in Jesus:",pt:"se \xe9 que o ouvistes, e nele fostes instru\xeddos, conforme \xe9 a verdade em Jesus,"},{verse:22,en:"That ye put off concerning the former conversation the old man, which is corrupt according to the deceitful lusts;",pt:"a despojar-vos, quanto ao procedimento anterior, do velho homem, que se corrompe pelas concupisc\xeancias do engano;"},{verse:23,en:"And be renewed in the spirit of your mind;",pt:"a vos renovar no esp\xedrito da vossa mente;"},{verse:24,en:"And that ye put on the new man, which after God is created in righteousness and true holiness.",pt:"e a vos revestir do novo homem, que segundo Deus foi criado em verdadeira justi\xe7a e santidade."},{verse:25,en:"Wherefore putting away lying, speak every man truth with his neighbour: for we are members one of another.",pt:"Pelo que deixai a mentira, e falai a verdade cada um com o seu pr\xf3ximo, pois somos membros uns dos outros."},{verse:26,en:"Be ye angry, and sin not: let not the sun go down upon your wrath:",pt:"Irai-vos, e n\xe3o pequeis; n\xe3o se ponha o sol sobre a vossa ira;"},{verse:27,en:"Neither give place to the devil.",pt:"nem deis lugar ao Diabo."},{verse:28,en:"Let him that stole steal no more: but rather let him labour, working with his hands the thing which is good, that he may have to give to him that needeth.",pt:"Aquele que furtava, n\xe3o furte mais; antes trabalhe, fazendo com as m\xe3os o que \xe9 bom, para que tenha o que repartir com o que tem necessidade."},{verse:29,en:"Let no corrupt communication proceed out of your mouth, but that which is good to the use of edifying, that it may minister grace unto the hearers.",pt:"N\xe3o saia da vossa boca nenhuma palavra torpe, mas s\xf3 a que seja boa para a necess\xe1ria edifica\xe7\xe3o, a fim de que ministre gra\xe7a aos que a ouvem."},{verse:30,en:"And grieve not the holy Spirit of God, whereby ye are sealed unto the day of redemption.",pt:"E n\xe3o entriste\xe7ais o Esp\xedrito Santo de Deus, no qual fostes selados para o dia da reden\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:31,en:"Let all bitterness, and wrath, and anger, and clamour, and evil speaking, be put away from you, with all malice:",pt:"Toda a amargura, e c\xf3lera, e ira, e gritaria, e blasf\xeamia sejam tiradas dentre v\xf3s, bem como toda a mal\xedcia."},{verse:32,en:"And be ye kind one to another, tenderhearted, forgiving one another, even as God for Christ\u2019s sake hath forgiven you.",pt:"Antes sede bondosos uns para com os outros, compassivos, perdoando-vos uns aos outros, como tamb\xe9m Deus vos perdoou em Cristo."}]}}),837,[]);
__d((function(e,s,o,a,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Ephesians",bookPt:"Ef\xe9sios",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Be ye therefore followers of God, as dear children;",pt:"Sede pois imitadores de Deus, como filhos amados;"},{verse:2,en:"And walk in love, as Christ also hath loved us, and hath given himself for us an offering and a sacrifice to God for a sweetsmelling savour.",pt:"e andai em amor, como Cristo tamb\xe9m vos amou, e se entregou a si mesmo por n\xf3s, como oferta e sacrif\xedcio a Deus, em cheiro suave."},{verse:3,en:"But fornication, and all uncleanness, or covetousness, let it not be once named among you, as becometh saints;",pt:"Mas a prostitui\xe7\xe3o, e toda sorte de impureza ou cobi\xe7a, nem sequer se nomeie entre v\xf3s, como conv\xe9m a santos,"},{verse:4,en:"Neither filthiness, nor foolish talking, nor jesting, which are not convenient: but rather giving of thanks.",pt:"nem baixeza, nem conversa tola, nem gracejos indecentes, coisas essas que n\xe3o conv\xeam; mas antes a\xe7\xf5es de gra\xe7as."},{verse:5,en:"For this ye know, that no whoremonger, nor unclean person, nor covetous man, who is an idolater, hath any inheritance in the kingdom of Christ and of God.",pt:"Porque bem sabeis isto: que nenhum devasso, ou impuro, ou avarento, o qual \xe9 id\xf3latra, tem heran\xe7a no reino de Cristo e de Deus."},{verse:6,en:"Let no man deceive you with vain words: for because of these things cometh the wrath of God upon the children of disobedience.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m vos engane com palavras v\xe3s; porque por estas coisas vem a ira de Deus sobre os filhos da desobedi\xeancia."},{verse:7,en:"Be not ye therefore partakers with them.",pt:"Portanto n\xe3o sejais participantes com eles;"},{verse:8,en:"For ye were sometimes darkness, but now are ye light in the Lord: walk as children of light:",pt:"pois outrora \xe9reis trevas, mas agora sois luz no Senhor; andai como filhos da luz"},{verse:9,en:"(For the fruit of the Spirit is in all goodness and righteousness and truth;)",pt:"(pois o fruto da luz est\xe1 em toda a bondade, e justi\xe7a e verdade),"},{verse:10,en:"Proving what is acceptable unto the Lord.",pt:"provando o que \xe9 agrad\xe1vel ao Senhor;"},{verse:11,en:"And have no fellowship with the unfruitful works of darkness, but rather reprove them.",pt:"e n\xe3o vos associeis \xe0s obras infrutuosas das trevas, antes, por\xe9m, condenai-as;"},{verse:12,en:"For it is a shame even to speak of those things which are done of them in secret.",pt:"porque as coisas feitas por eles em oculto, at\xe9 o diz\xea-las \xe9 vergonhoso."},{verse:13,en:"But all things that are reproved are made manifest by the light: for whatsoever doth make manifest is light.",pt:"Mas todas estas coisas, sendo condenadas, se manifestam pela luz, pois tudo o que se manifesta \xe9 luz."},{verse:14,en:"Wherefore he saith, Awake thou that sleepest, and arise from the dead, and Christ shall give thee light.",pt:"Pelo que diz: Desperta, tu que dormes, e levanta-te dentre os mortos, e Cristo te iluminar\xe1."},{verse:15,en:"See then that ye walk circumspectly, not as fools, but as wise,",pt:"Portanto, vede diligentemente como andais, n\xe3o como n\xe9scios, mas como s\xe1bios,"},{verse:16,en:"Redeeming the time, because the days are evil.",pt:"usando bem cada oportunidade, porquanto os dias s\xe3o maus."},{verse:17,en:"Wherefore be ye not unwise, but understanding what the will of the Lord is.",pt:"Por isso, n\xe3o sejais insensatos, mas entendei qual seja a vontade do Senhor."},{verse:18,en:"And be not drunk with wine, wherein is excess; but be filled with the Spirit;",pt:"E n\xe3o vos embriagueis com vinho, no qual h\xe1 devassid\xe3o, mas enchei-vos do Esp\xedrito,"},{verse:19,en:"Speaking to yourselves in psalms and hymns and spiritual songs, singing and making melody in your heart to the Lord;",pt:"falando entre v\xf3s em salmos, hinos, e c\xe2nticos espirituais, cantando e salmodiando ao Senhor no vosso cora\xe7\xe3o,"},{verse:20,en:"Giving thanks always for all things unto God and the Father in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ;",pt:"sempre dando gra\xe7as por tudo a Deus, o Pai, em nome de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo,"},{verse:21,en:"Submitting yourselves one to another in the fear of God.",pt:"sujeitando-vos uns aos outros no temor de Cristo."},{verse:22,en:"Wives, submit yourselves unto your own husbands, as unto the Lord.",pt:"V\xf3s, mulheres, submetei-vos a vossos maridos, como ao Senhor;"},{verse:23,en:"For the husband is the head of the wife, even as Christ is the head of the church: and he is the saviour of the body.",pt:"porque o marido \xe9 a cabe\xe7a da mulher, como tamb\xe9m Cristo \xe9 a cabe\xe7a da igreja, sendo ele pr\xf3prio o Salvador do corpo."},{verse:24,en:"Therefore as the church is subject unto Christ, so let the wives be to their own husbands in every thing.",pt:"Mas, assim como a igreja est\xe1 sujeita a Cristo, assim tamb\xe9m as mulheres o sejam em tudo a seus maridos."},{verse:25,en:"Husbands, love your wives, even as Christ also loved the church, and gave himself for it;",pt:"V\xf3s, maridos, amai a vossas mulheres, como tamb\xe9m Cristo amou a igreja, e a si mesmo se entregou por ela,"},{verse:26,en:"That he might sanctify and cleanse it with the washing of water by the word,",pt:"a fim de a santificar, tendo-a purificado com a lavagem da \xe1gua, pela palavra,"},{verse:27,en:"That he might present it to himself a glorious church, not having spot, or wrinkle, or any such thing; but that it should be holy and without blemish.",pt:"para apresent\xe1-la a si mesmo igreja gloriosa, sem m\xe1cula, nem ruga, nem qualquer coisa semelhante, mas santa e irrepreens\xedvel."},{verse:28,en:"So ought men to love their wives as their own bodies. He that loveth his wife loveth himself.",pt:"Assim devem os maridos amar a suas pr\xf3prias mulheres, como a seus pr\xf3prios corpos. Quem ama a sua mulher, ama-se a si mesmo."},{verse:29,en:"For no man ever yet hated his own flesh; but nourisheth and cherisheth it, even as the Lord the church:",pt:"Pois nunca ningu\xe9m aborreceu a sua pr\xf3pria carne, antes a nutre e preza, como tamb\xe9m Cristo \xe0 igreja;"},{verse:30,en:"For we are members of his body, of his flesh, and of his bones.",pt:"porque somos membros do seu corpo."},{verse:31,en:"For this cause shall a man leave his father and mother, and shall be joined unto his wife, and they two shall be one flesh.",pt:"Por isso deixar\xe1 o homem a seu pai e a sua m\xe3e, e se unir\xe1 \xe0 sua mulher, e ser\xe3o os dois uma s\xf3 carne."},{verse:32,en:"This is a great mystery: but I speak concerning Christ and the church.",pt:"Grande \xe9 este mist\xe9rio, mas eu falo em refer\xeancia a Cristo e \xe0 igreja."},{verse:33,en:"Nevertheless let every one of you in particular so love his wife even as himself; and the wife see that she reverence her husband.",pt:"Todavia tamb\xe9m v\xf3s, cada um de per si, assim ame a sua pr\xf3pria mulher como a si mesmo, e a mulher reverencie a seu marido."}]}}),838,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Ephesians",bookPt:"Ef\xe9sios",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Children, obey your parents in the Lord: for this is right.",pt:"V\xf3s, filhos, sede obedientes a vossos pais no Senhor, porque isto \xe9 justo."},{verse:2,en:"Honour thy father and mother; (which is the first commandment with promise;)",pt:"Honra a teu pai e a tua m\xe3e (que \xe9 o primeiro mandamento com promessa),"},{verse:3,en:"That it may be well with thee, and thou mayest live long on the earth.",pt:"para que te v\xe1 bem, e sejas de longa vida sobre a terra."},{verse:4,en:"And, ye fathers, provoke not your children to wrath: but bring them up in the nurture and admonition of the Lord.",pt:"E v\xf3s, pais, n\xe3o provoqueis \xe0 ira vossos filhos, mas criai-os na disciplina e admoesta\xe7\xe3o do Senhor."},{verse:5,en:"Servants, be obedient to them that are your masters according to the flesh, with fear and trembling, in singleness of your heart, as unto Christ;",pt:"V\xf3s, servos, obedecei a vossos senhores segundo a carne, com temor e tremor, na sinceridade de vosso cora\xe7\xe3o, como a Cristo,"},{verse:6,en:"Not with eyeservice, as menpleasers; but as the servants of Christ, doing the will of God from the heart;",pt:"n\xe3o servindo somente \xe0 vista, como para agradar aos homens, mas como servos de Cristo, fazendo de cora\xe7\xe3o a vontade de Deus,"},{verse:7,en:"With good will doing service, as to the Lord, and not to men:",pt:"servindo de boa vontade como ao Senhor, e n\xe3o como aos homens."},{verse:8,en:"Knowing that whatsoever good thing any man doeth, the same shall he receive of the Lord, whether he be bond or free.",pt:"Sabendo que cada um, seja escravo, seja livre, receber\xe1 do Senhor todo bem que fizer."},{verse:9,en:"And, ye masters, do the same things unto them, forbearing threatening: knowing that your Master also is in heaven; neither is there respect of persons with him.",pt:"E v\xf3s, senhores, fazei o mesmo para com eles, deixando as amea\xe7as, sabendo que o Senhor tanto deles como vosso est\xe1 no c\xe9u, e que para com ele n\xe3o h\xe1 acep\xe7\xe3o de pessoas."},{verse:10,en:"Finally, my brethren, be strong in the Lord, and in the power of his might.",pt:"Finalmente, fortalecei-vos no Senhor e na for\xe7a do seu poder."},{verse:11,en:"Put on the whole armour of God, that ye may be able to stand against the wiles of the devil.",pt:"Revesti-vos de toda a armadura de Deus, para poderdes permanecer firmes contra as ciladas do Diabo;"},{verse:12,en:"For we wrestle not against flesh and blood, but against principalities, against powers, against the rulers of the darkness of this world, against spiritual wickedness in high places.",pt:"pois n\xe3o \xe9 contra carne e sangue que temos que lutar, mas sim contra os principados, contra as potestades, conta os pr\xedncipes do mundo destas trevas, contra as hostes espirituais da iniq\xfcidade nas regi\xf5es celestes."},{verse:13,en:"Wherefore take unto you the whole armour of God, that ye may be able to withstand in the evil day, and having done all, to stand.",pt:"Portanto tomai toda a armadura de Deus, para que possais resistir no dia mau e, havendo feito tudo, permanecer firmes."},{verse:14,en:"Stand therefore, having your loins girt about with truth, and having on the breastplate of righteousness;",pt:"Estai, pois, firmes, tendo cingidos os vossos lombos com a verdade, e vestida a coura\xe7a da justi\xe7a,"},{verse:15,en:"And your feet shod with the preparation of the gospel of peace;",pt:"e cal\xe7ando os p\xe9s com a prepara\xe7\xe3o do evangelho da paz,"},{verse:16,en:"Above all, taking the shield of faith, wherewith ye shall be able to quench all the fiery darts of the wicked.",pt:"tomando, sobretudo, o escudo da f\xe9, com o qual podereis apagar todos os dardos inflamados do Maligno."},{verse:17,en:"And take the helmet of salvation, and the sword of the Spirit, which is the word of God:",pt:"Tomai tamb\xe9m o capacete da salva\xe7\xe3o, e a espada do Esp\xedrito, que \xe9 a palavra de Deus;"},{verse:18,en:"Praying always with all prayer and supplication in the Spirit, and watching thereunto with all perseverance and supplication for all saints;",pt:"com toda a ora\xe7\xe3o e s\xfaplica orando em todo tempo no Esp\xedrito e, para o mesmo fim, vigiando com toda a perseveran\xe7a e s\xfaplica, por todos os santos,"},{verse:19,en:"And for me, that utterance may be given unto me, that I may open my mouth boldly, to make known the mystery of the gospel,",pt:"e por mim, para que me seja dada a palavra, no abrir da minha boca, para, com intrepidez, fazer conhecido o mist\xe9rio do evangelho,"},{verse:20,en:"For which I am an ambassador in bonds: that therein I may speak boldly, as I ought to speak.",pt:"pelo qual sou embaixador em cadeias, para que nele eu tenha coragem para falar como devo falar."},{verse:21,en:"But that ye also may know my affairs, and how I do, Tychicus, a beloved brother and faithful minister in the Lord, shall make known to you all things:",pt:"Ora, para que v\xf3s tamb\xe9m possais saber como estou e o que estou fazendo, T\xedquico, irm\xe3o amado e fiel ministro no Senhor, vos informar\xe1 de tudo;"},{verse:22,en:"Whom I have sent unto you for the same purpose, that ye might know our affairs, and that he might comfort your hearts.",pt:"o qual vos envio para este mesmo fim, para que saibais do nosso estado, e ele vos conforte o cora\xe7\xe0o."},{verse:23,en:"Peace be to the brethren, and love with faith, from God the Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.",pt:"Paz seja com os irm\xe3os, e amor com f\xe9, da parte de Deus Pai e do Senhor Jesus Cristo."},{verse:24,en:"Grace be with all them that love our Lord Jesus Christ in sincerity. Amen.",pt:"A gra\xe7a seja com todos os que amam a nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo com amor incorrupt\xedvel."}]}}),839,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The Revelation of Jesus Christ, which God gave unto him, to shew unto his servants things which must shortly come to pass; and he sent and signified it by his angel unto his servant John:",pt:"Revela\xe7\xe3o de Jesus Cristo, que Deus lhe deu para mostrar aos seus servos as coisas que brevemente devem acontecer; e, enviando-as pelo seu anjo, as notificou a seu servo Jo\xe3o;"},{verse:2,en:"Who bare record of the word of God, and of the testimony of Jesus Christ, and of all things that he saw.",pt:"o qual testificou da palavra de Deus, e do testemunho de Jesus Cristo, de tudo quanto viu."},{verse:3,en:"Blessed is he that readeth, and they that hear the words of this prophecy, and keep those things which are written therein: for the time is at hand.",pt:"Bem-aventurado aquele que l\xea e bem-aventurados os que ouvem as palavras desta profecia e guardam as coisas que nela est\xe3o escritas; porque o tempo est\xe1 pr\xf3ximo."},{verse:4,en:"John to the seven churches which are in Asia: Grace be unto you, and peace, from him which is, and which was, and which is to come; and from the seven Spirits which are before his throne;",pt:"Jo\xe3o, \xe0s sete igrejas que est\xe3o na \xc1sia: Gra\xe7a a v\xf3s e paz da parte daquele que \xe9, e que era, e que h\xe1 de vir, e da dos sete esp\xedritos que est\xe3o diante do seu trono;"},{verse:5,en:"And from Jesus Christ, who is the faithful witness, and the first begotten of the dead, and the prince of the kings of the earth. Unto him that loved us, and washed us from our sins in his own blood,",pt:"e da parte de Jesus Cristo, que \xe9 a fiel testemunha, o primog\xeanito dos mortos e o Pr\xedncipe dos reis da terra. \xc2quele que nos ama, e pelo seu sangue nos libertou dos nossos pecados,"},{verse:6,en:"And hath made us kings and priests unto God and his Father; to him be glory and dominion for ever and ever. Amen.",pt:"e nos fez reino, sacerdotes para Deus, seu Pai, a ele seja gl\xf3ria e dom\xednio pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos. Am\xe9m."},{verse:7,en:"Behold, he cometh with clouds; and every eye shall see him, and they also which pierced him: and all kindreds of the earth shall wail because of him. Even so, Amen.",pt:"Eis que vem com as nuvens, e todo olho o ver\xe1, at\xe9 mesmo aqueles que o traspassaram; e todas as tribos da terra se lamentar\xe3o sobre ele. Sim. Am\xe9m."},{verse:8,en:"I am Alpha and Omega, the beginning and the ending, saith the Lord, which is, and which was, and which is to come, the Almighty.",pt:"Eu sou o Alfa e o \xe8mega, diz o Senhor Deus, aquele que \xe9, e que era, e que h\xe1 de vir, o Todo-Poderoso."},{verse:9,en:"I John, who also am your brother, and companion in tribulation, and in the kingdom and patience of Jesus Christ, was in the isle that is called Patmos, for the word of God, and for the testimony of Jesus Christ.",pt:"Eu, Jo\xe3o, irm\xe3o vosso e companheiro convosco na afli\xe7\xe3o, no reino, e na perseveran\xe7a em Jesus, estava na ilha chamada Patmos por causa da palavra de Deus e do testemunho de Jesus."},{verse:10,en:"I was in the Spirit on the Lord\u2019s day, and heard behind me a great voice, as of a trumpet,",pt:"Eu fui arrebatado em esp\xedrito no dia do Senhor, e ouvi por detr\xe1s de mim uma grande voz, como de trombeta,"},{verse:11,en:"Saying, I am Alpha and Omega, the first and the last: and, What thou seest, write in a book, and send it unto the seven churches which are in Asia; unto Ephesus, and unto Smyrna, and unto Pergamos, and unto Thyatira, and unto Sardis, and unto Philadelphia, and unto Laodicea.",pt:"que dizia: O que v\xeas, escreve-o num livro, e envia-o \xe0s sete igrejas: a \xc9feso, a Esmirna, a P\xe9rgamo, a Tiatira, a Sardes, a Filad\xe9lfia e a Laodic\xe9ia."},{verse:12,en:"And I turned to see the voice that spake with me. And being turned, I saw seven golden candlesticks;",pt:"E voltei-me para ver quem falava comigo. E, ao voltar-me, vi sete candeeiros de ouro,"},{verse:13,en:"And in the midst of the seven candlesticks one like unto the Son of man, clothed with a garment down to the foot, and girt about the paps with a golden girdle.",pt:"e no meio dos candeeiros um semelhante a filho de homem, vestido de uma roupa talar, e cingido \xe0 altura do peito com um cinto de ouro;"},{verse:14,en:"His head and his hairs were white like wool, as white as snow; and his eyes were as a flame of fire;",pt:"e a sua cabe\xe7a e cabelos eram brancos como l\xe3 branca, como a neve; e os seus olhos como chama de fogo;"},{verse:15,en:"And his feet like unto fine brass, as if they burned in a furnace; and his voice as the sound of many waters.",pt:"e os seus p\xe9s, semelhantes a lat\xe3o reluzente que fora refinado numa fornalha; e a sua voz como a voz de muitas \xe1guas."},{verse:16,en:"And he had in his right hand seven stars: and out of his mouth went a sharp twoedged sword: and his countenance was as the sun shineth in his strength.",pt:"Tinha ele na sua destra sete estrelas; e da sua boca sa\xeda uma aguda espada de dois gumes; e o seu rosto era como o sol, quando resplandece na sua for\xe7a."},{verse:17,en:"And when I saw him, I fell at his feet as dead. And he laid his right hand upon me, saying unto me, Fear not; I am the first and the last:",pt:"Quando o vi, ca\xed a seus p\xe9s como morto; e ele p\xf4s sobre mim a sua destra, dizendo: N\xe3o temas; eu sou o primeiro e o \xfaltimo,"},{verse:18,en:"I am he that liveth, and was dead; and, behold, I am alive for evermore, Amen; and have the keys of hell and of death.",pt:"e o que vivo; fui morto, mas eis aqui estou vivo pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos; e tenho as chaves da morte e do hades."},{verse:19,en:"Write the things which thou hast seen, and the things which are, and the things which shall be hereafter;",pt:"escreve, pois, as coisas que tens visto, e as que s\xe3o, e as que depois destas h\xe3o de suceder."},{verse:20,en:"The mystery of the seven stars which thou sawest in my right hand, and the seven golden candlesticks. The seven stars are the angels of the seven churches: and the seven candlesticks which thou sawest are the seven churches.",pt:"Eis o mist\xe9rio das sete estrelas, que viste na minha destra, e dos sete candeeiros de ouro: as estrelas s\xe3o os anjos das sete igrejas, e os sete candeeiros s\xe3o as sete igrejas."}]}}),840,[]);
__d((function(e,a,t,o,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Unto the angel of the church of Ephesus write; These things saith he that holdeth the seven stars in his right hand, who walketh in the midst of the seven golden candlesticks;",pt:"Ao anjo da igreja em \xc9feso escreve: Isto diz aquele que tem na sua destra as sete estrelas, que anda no meio dos sete candeeiros de ouro:"},{verse:2,en:"I know thy works, and thy labour, and thy patience, and how thou canst not bear them which are evil: and thou hast tried them which say they are apostles, and are not, and hast found them liars:",pt:"Conhe\xe7o as tuas obras, e o teu trabalho, e a tua perseveran\xe7a; sei que n\xe3o podes suportar os maus, e que puseste \xe0 prova os que se dizem ap\xf3stolos e n\xe3o o s\xe3o, e os achaste mentirosos;"},{verse:3,en:"And hast borne, and hast patience, and for my name\u2019s sake hast laboured, and hast not fainted.",pt:"e tens perseveran\xe7a e por amor do meu nome sofreste, e n\xe3o desfaleceste."},{verse:4,en:"Nevertheless I have somewhat against thee, because thou hast left thy first love.",pt:"Tenho, por\xe9m, contra ti que deixaste o teu primeiro amor."},{verse:5,en:"Remember therefore from whence thou art fallen, and repent, and do the first works; or else I will come unto thee quickly, and will remove thy candlestick out of his place, except thou repent.",pt:"Lembra-te, pois, donde ca\xedste, e arrepende-te, e pratica as primeiras obras; e se n\xe3o, brevemente virei a ti, e removerei do seu lugar o teu candeeiro, se n\xe3o te arrependeres."},{verse:6,en:"But this thou hast, that thou hatest the deeds of the Nicolaitanes, which I also hate.",pt:"Tens, por\xe9m, isto, que aborreces as obras dos nicola\xedtas, as quais eu tamb\xe9m aborre\xe7o."},{verse:7,en:"He that hath an ear, let him hear what the Spirit saith unto the churches; To him that overcometh will I give to eat of the tree of life, which is in the midst of the paradise of God.",pt:"Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a o que o Esp\xedrito diz \xe0s igrejas. Ao que vencer, dar-lhe-ei a comer da \xe1rvore da vida, que est\xe1 no para\xedso de Deus."},{verse:8,en:"And unto the angel of the church in Smyrna write; These things saith the first and the last, which was dead, and is alive;",pt:"Ao anjo da igreja em Esmirna escreve: Isto diz o primeiro e o \xfaltimo, que foi morto e reviveu:"},{verse:9,en:"I know thy works, and tribulation, and poverty, (but thou art rich) and I know the blasphemy of them which say they are Jews, and are not, but are the synagogue of Satan.",pt:"Conhe\xe7o a tua tribula\xe7\xe3o e a tua pobreza (mas tu \xe9s rico), e a blasf\xeamia dos que dizem ser judeus, e n\xe3o o s\xe3o, por\xe9m s\xe3o sinagoga de Satan\xe1s."},{verse:10,en:"Fear none of those things which thou shalt suffer: behold, the devil shall cast some of you into prison, that ye may be tried; and ye shall have tribulation ten days: be thou faithful unto death, and I will give thee a crown of life.",pt:"N\xe3o temas o que h\xe1s de padecer. Eis que o Diabo est\xe1 para lan\xe7ar alguns de v\xf3s na pris\xe3o, para que sejais provados; e tereis uma tribula\xe7\xe3o de dez dias. S\xea fiel at\xe9 a morte, e dar-te-ei a coroa da vida."},{verse:11,en:"He that hath an ear, let him hear what the Spirit saith unto the churches; He that overcometh shall not be hurt of the second death.",pt:"Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a o que o Esp\xedrito diz \xe0s igrejas. O que vencer, de modo algum sofrer\xe1 o dado da segunda morte."},{verse:12,en:"And to the angel of the church in Pergamos write; These things saith he which hath the sharp sword with two edges;",pt:"Ao anjo da igreja em P\xe9rgamo escreve: Isto diz aquele que tem a espada aguda de dois gumes:"},{verse:13,en:"I know thy works, and where thou dwellest, even where Satan\u2019s seat is: and thou holdest fast my name, and hast not denied my faith, even in those days wherein Antipas was my faithful martyr, who was slain among you, where Satan dwelleth.",pt:"Sei onde habitas, que \xe9 onde est\xe1 o trono de Satan\xe1s; mas ret\xe9ns o meu nome e n\xe3o negaste a minha f\xe9, mesmo nos dias de Antipas, minha fiel testemunha, o qual foi morto entre v\xf3s, onde Satan\xe1s habita."},{verse:14,en:"But I have a few things against thee, because thou hast there them that hold the doctrine of Balaam, who taught Balac to cast a stumblingblock before the children of Israel, to eat things sacrificed unto idols, and to commit fornication.",pt:"entretanto, algumas coisas tenho contra ti; porque tens a\xed os que seguem a doutrina de Bala\xe3o, o qual ensinava Balaque a lan\xe7ar trope\xe7os diante dos filhos de Israel, introduzindo-os a comerem das coisas sacrificadas a \xeddolos e a se prostitu\xedrem."},{verse:15,en:"So hast thou also them that hold the doctrine of the Nicolaitanes, which thing I hate.",pt:"Assim tens tamb\xe9m alguns que de igual modo seguem a doutrina dos nicola\xedtas."},{verse:16,en:"Repent; or else I will come unto thee quickly, and will fight against them with the sword of my mouth.",pt:"Arrepende-te, pois; ou se n\xe3o, virei a ti em breve, e contra eles batalharei com a espada da minha boca."},{verse:17,en:"He that hath an ear, let him hear what the Spirit saith unto the churches; To him that overcometh will I give to eat of the hidden manna, and will give him a white stone, and in the stone a new name written, which no man knoweth saving he that receiveth it.",pt:"Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a o que o Esp\xedrito diz \xe0s igrejas. Ao que vencer darei do man\xe1 escondido, e lhe darei uma pedra branca, e na pedra um novo nome escrito, o qual ningu\xe9m conhece sen\xe3o aquele que o recebe."},{verse:18,en:"And unto the angel of the church in Thyatira write; These things saith the Son of God, who hath his eyes like unto a flame of fire, and his feet are like fine brass;",pt:"Ao anjo da igreja em Tiatira escreve: Isto diz o Filho de Deus, que tem os olhos como chama de fogo, e os p\xe9s semelhantes a lat\xe3o reluzente:"},{verse:19,en:"I know thy works, and charity, and service, and faith, and thy patience, and thy works; and the last to be more than the first.",pt:"Conhe\xe7o as tuas obras, e o teu amor, e a tua f\xe9, e o teu servi\xe7o, e a tua perseveran\xe7a, e sei que as tuas \xfaltimas obras s\xe3o mais numerosas que as primeiras."},{verse:20,en:"Notwithstanding I have a few things against thee, because thou sufferest that woman Jezebel, which calleth herself a prophetess, to teach and to seduce my servants to commit fornication, and to eat things sacrificed unto idols.",pt:"Mas tenho contra ti que toleras a mulher Jezabel, que se diz profetisa; ela ensina e seduz os meus servos a se prostitu\xedrem e a comerem das coisas sacrificdas a \xeddolos;"},{verse:21,en:"And I gave her space to repent of her fornication; and she repented not.",pt:"e dei-lhe tempo para que se arrependesse; e ela n\xe3o quer arrepender-se da sua prostitui\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"Behold, I will cast her into a bed, and them that commit adultery with her into great tribulation, except they repent of their deeds.",pt:"Eis que a lan\xe7o num leito de dores, e numa grande tribula\xe7\xe3o os que cometem adult\xe9rio com ela, se n\xe3o se arrependerem das obras dela;"},{verse:23,en:"And I will kill her children with death; and all the churches shall know that I am he which searcheth the reins and hearts: and I will give unto every one of you according to your works.",pt:"e ferirei de morte a seus filhos, e todas as igrejas saber\xe3o que eu sou aquele que esquadrinha os rins e os cora\xe7\xf5es; e darei a cada um de v\xf3s segundo as suas obras."},{verse:24,en:"But unto you I say, and unto the rest in Thyatira, as many as have not this doctrine, and which have not known the depths of Satan, as they speak; I will put upon you none other burden.",pt:"Digo-vos, por\xe9m, a v\xf3s os demais que est\xe3o em Tiatira, a todos quantos n\xe3o t\xeam esta doutrina, e n\xe3o conhecem as chamadas profundezas de Satan\xe1s, que outra carga vos n\xe3o porei;"},{verse:25,en:"But that which ye have already hold fast till I come.",pt:"mas o que tendes, retende-o at\xe9 que eu venha."},{verse:26,en:"And he that overcometh, and keepeth my works unto the end, to him will I give power over the nations:",pt:"Ao que vencer, e ao que guardar as minhas obras at\xe9 o fim, eu lhe darei autoridade sobre as na\xe7\xf5es,"},{verse:27,en:"And he shall rule them with a rod of iron; as the vessels of a potter shall they be broken to shivers: even as I received of my Father.",pt:"e com vara de ferro as reger\xe1, quebrando-as do modo como s\xe3o quebrados os vasos do oleiro, assim como eu recebi autoridade de meu Pai;"},{verse:28,en:"And I will give him the morning star.",pt:"tamb\xe9m lhe darei a estrela da manh\xe3."},{verse:29,en:"He that hath an ear, let him hear what the Spirit saith unto the churches.",pt:"Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a o que o Esp\xedrito dia \xe0s igrejas."}]}}),841,[]);
__d((function(e,a,t,o,n,s,h){n.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And unto the angel of the church in Sardis write; These things saith he that hath the seven Spirits of God, and the seven stars; I know thy works, that thou hast a name that thou livest, and art dead.",pt:"Ao anjo da igreja em Sardes escreve: Isto diz aquele que tem os sete esp\xedritos de Deus, e as estrelas: Conhe\xe7o as tuas obras; tens nome de que vives, e est\xe1s morto."},{verse:2,en:"Be watchful, and strengthen the things which remain, that are ready to die: for I have not found thy works perfect before God.",pt:"S\xea vigilante, e confirma o restante, que estava para morrer; porque n\xe3o tenho achado as tuas obras perfeitas diante do meu Deus."},{verse:3,en:"Remember therefore how thou hast received and heard, and hold fast, and repent. If therefore thou shalt not watch, I will come on thee as a thief, and thou shalt not know what hour I will come upon thee.",pt:"Lembra-te, portanto, do que tens recebido e ouvido, e guarda-o, e arrepende-te. Pois se n\xe3o vigiares, virei como um ladr\xe3o, e n\xe3o saber\xe1s a que hora sobre ti virei."},{verse:4,en:"Thou hast a few names even in Sardis which have not defiled their garments; and they shall walk with me in white: for they are worthy.",pt:"Mas tamb\xe9m tens em Sardes algumas pessoas que n\xe3o contaminaram as suas vestes e comigo andar\xe3o vestidas de branco, porquanto s\xe3o dignas."},{verse:5,en:"He that overcometh, the same shall be clothed in white raiment; and I will not blot out his name out of the book of life, but I will confess his name before my Father, and before his angels.",pt:"O que vencer ser\xe1 assim vestido de vestes brancas, e de maneira nenhuma riscarei o seu nome do livro da vida; antes confessarei o seu nome diante de meu Pai e diante dos seus anjos."},{verse:6,en:"He that hath an ear, let him hear what the Spirit saith unto the churches.",pt:"Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a o que o esp\xedrito diz \xe0s igrejas."},{verse:7,en:"And to the angel of the church in Philadelphia write; These things saith he that is holy, he that is true, he that hath the key of David, he that openeth, and no man shutteth; and shutteth, and no man openeth;",pt:"Ao anjo da igreja em Filad\xe9lfia escreve: Isto diz o que \xe9 santo, o que \xe9 verdadeiro, o que tem a chave de Davi; o que abre, e ningu\xe9m fecha; e fecha, e ningu\xe9m abre:"},{verse:8,en:"I know thy works: behold, I have set before thee an open door, and no man can shut it: for thou hast a little strength, and hast kept my word, and hast not denied my name.",pt:"Conhe\xe7o as tuas obras (eis que tenho posto diante de ti uma porta aberta, que ningu\xe9m pode fechar), que tens pouca for\xe7a, entretanto guardaste a minha palavra e n\xe3o negaste o meu nome."},{verse:9,en:"Behold, I will make them of the synagogue of Satan, which say they are Jews, and are not, but do lie; behold, I will make them to come and worship before thy feet, and to know that I have loved thee.",pt:"Eis que farei aos da sinagoga de Satan\xe1s, aos que se dizem judeus, e n\xe3o o s\xe3o, mas mentem, - eis que farei que venham, e adorem prostrados aos teus p\xe9s, e saibam que eu te amo."},{verse:10,en:"Because thou hast kept the word of my patience, I also will keep thee from the hour of temptation, which shall come upon all the world, to try them that dwell upon the earth.",pt:"Porquanto guardaste a palavra da minha perseveran\xe7a, tamb\xe9m eu te guardarei da hora da prova\xe7\xe3o que h\xe1 de vir sobre o mundo inteiro, para p\xf4r \xe0 prova os que habitam sobre a terra."},{verse:11,en:"Behold, I come quickly: hold that fast which thou hast, that no man take thy crown.",pt:"Venho sem demora; guarda o que tens, para que ningu\xe9m tome a tua coroa."},{verse:12,en:"Him that overcometh will I make a pillar in the temple of my God, and he shall go no more out: and I will write upon him the name of my God, and the name of the city of my God, which is new Jerusalem, which cometh down out of heaven from my God: and I will write upon him my new name.",pt:"A quem vencer, eu o farei coluna no templo do meu Deus, donde jamais sair\xe1; e escreverei sobre ele o nome do meu Deus, e o nome da cidade do meu Deus, a nova Jerusal\xe9m, que desce do c\xe9u, da parte do meu Deus, e tamb\xe9m o meu novo nome."},{verse:13,en:"He that hath an ear, let him hear what the Spirit saith unto the churches.",pt:"Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a o que o Esp\xedrito diz \xe0s igrejas."},{verse:14,en:"And unto the angel of the church of the Laodiceans write; These things saith the Amen, the faithful and true witness, the beginning of the creation of God;",pt:"Ao anjo da igreja em Laodic\xe9ia escreve: Isto diz o Am\xe9m, a testemunha fiel e verdadeira, o pric\xedpio da cria\xe7\xe3o de Deus:"},{verse:15,en:"I know thy works, that thou art neither cold nor hot: I would thou wert cold or hot.",pt:"Conhe\xe7o as tuas obras, que nem \xe9s frio nem quente; oxal\xe1 foras frio ou quente!"},{verse:16,en:"So then because thou art lukewarm, and neither cold nor hot, I will spue thee out of my mouth.",pt:"Assim, porque \xe9s morno, e n\xe3o \xe9s quente nem frio, vomitar-te-ei da minha boca."},{verse:17,en:"Because thou sayest, I am rich, and increased with goods, and have need of nothing; and knowest not that thou art wretched, and miserable, and poor, and blind, and naked:",pt:"Porquanto dizes: Rico sou, e estou enriquecido, e de nada tenho falta; e n\xe3o sabes que \xe9s um coitado, e miser\xe1vel, e pobre, e cego, e nu;"},{verse:18,en:"I counsel thee to buy of me gold tried in the fire, that thou mayest be rich; and white raiment, that thou mayest be clothed, and that the shame of thy nakedness do not appear; and anoint thine eyes with eyesalve, that thou mayest see.",pt:"aconselho-te que de mim compres ouro refinado no fogo, para que te enrique\xe7as; e vestes brancas, para que te vistas, e n\xe3o seja manifesta a vergonha da tua nudez; e col\xedrio, a fim de ungires os teus olhos, para que vejas."},{verse:19,en:"As many as I love, I rebuke and chasten: be zealous therefore, and repent.",pt:"Eu repreendo e castigo a todos quantos amo: s\xea pois zeloso, e arrepende-te."},{verse:20,en:"Behold, I stand at the door, and knock: if any man hear my voice, and open the door, I will come in to him, and will sup with him, and he with me.",pt:"Eis que estou \xe0 porta e bato; se algu\xe9m ouvir a minha voz, e abrir a porta, entrarei em sua casa, e com ele cearei, e ele comigo."},{verse:21,en:"To him that overcometh will I grant to sit with me in my throne, even as I also overcame, and am set down with my Father in his throne.",pt:"Ao que vencer, eu lhe concederei que se assente comigo no meu trono."},{verse:22,en:"He that hath an ear, let him hear what the Spirit saith unto the churches.",pt:"Quem tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a o que o Esp\xedrito diz \xe0s igrejas."}]}}),842,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After this I looked, and, behold, a door was opened in heaven: and the first voice which I heard was as it were of a trumpet talking with me; which said, Come up hither, and I will shew thee things which must be hereafter.",pt:"Depois destas coisas, olhei, e eis que estava uma porta aberta no c\xe9u, e a primeira voz que ouvira, voz como de trombeta, falando comigo, disse: Sobe aqui, e mostrar-te-ei as coisas que depois destas devem acontecer."},{verse:2,en:"And immediately I was in the spirit: and, behold, a throne was set in heaven, and one sat on the throne.",pt:"Imediatamente fui arrebatado em esp\xedrito, e eis que um trono estava posto no c\xe9u, e um assentado sobre o trono;"},{verse:3,en:"And he that sat was to look upon like a jasper and a sardine stone: and there was a rainbow round about the throne, in sight like unto an emerald.",pt:"e aquele que estava assentado era, na apar\xeancia, semelhante a uma pedra de jaspe e s\xe1rdio; e havia ao redor do trono um arco-\xedris semelhante, na apar\xeancia, \xe0 esmeralda."},{verse:4,en:"And round about the throne were four and twenty seats: and upon the seats I saw four and twenty elders sitting, clothed in white raiment; and they had on their heads crowns of gold.",pt:"Havia tamb\xe9m ao redor do trono vinte e quatro tronos; e sobre os tronos vi assentados vinte e quatro anci\xe3os, vestidos de branco, que tinham nas suas cabe\xe7as coroas de ouro."},{verse:5,en:"And out of the throne proceeded lightnings and thunderings and voices: and there were seven lamps of fire burning before the throne, which are the seven Spirits of God.",pt:"E do trono sa\xedam rel\xe2mpagos, e vozes, e trov\xf5es; e diante do trono ardiam sete l\xe2mpadas de fogo, as quais s\xe3o os sete esp\xedritos de Deus;"},{verse:6,en:"And before the throne there was a sea of glass like unto crystal: and in the midst of the throne, and round about the throne, were four beasts full of eyes before and behind.",pt:"tamb\xe9m havia diante do trono como que um mar de vidro, semelhante ao cristal; e ao redor do trono, um ao meio de cada lado, quatro seres viventes cheios de olhos por diante e por detr\xe1s;"},{verse:7,en:"And the first beast was like a lion, and the second beast like a calf, and the third beast had a face as a man, and the fourth beast was like a flying eagle.",pt:"e o primeiro ser era semelhante a um le\xe3o; o segundo ser, semelhante a um touro; tinha o terceiro ser o rosto como de homem; e o quarto ser era semelhante a uma \xe1guia voando."},{verse:8,en:"And the four beasts had each of them six wings about him; and they were full of eyes within: and they rest not day and night, saying, Holy, holy, holy, Lord God Almighty, which was, and is, and is to come.",pt:"Os quatro seres viventes tinham, cada um, seis asas, e ao redor e por dentro estavam cheios de olhos; e n\xe3o t\xeam descanso nem de noite, dizendo: Santo, Santo, Santo \xe9 o Senhor Deus, o Todo-Poderoso, aquele que era, e que \xe9, e que h\xe1 de vir."},{verse:9,en:"And when those beasts give glory and honour and thanks to him that sat on the throne, who liveth for ever and ever,",pt:"E, sempre que os seres viventes davam gl\xf3ria e honra e a\xe7\xf5es de gra\xe7as ao que estava assentado sobre o trono, ao que vive pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos,"},{verse:10,en:"The four and twenty elders fall down before him that sat on the throne, and worship him that liveth for ever and ever, and cast their crowns before the throne, saying,",pt:"os vinte e quatro anci\xe3os prostravam-se diante do que estava assentado sobre o trono, e adoravam ao que vive pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos; e lan\xe7avam as suas coroas diante do trono, dizendo:"},{verse:11,en:"Thou art worthy, O Lord, to receive glory and honour and power: for thou hast created all things, and for thy pleasure they are and were created.",pt:"Digno \xe9s, Senhor nosso e Deus nosso, de receber a gl\xf3ria e a honra e o poder; porque tu criaste todas as coisas, e por tua vontade existiram e foram criadas."}]}}),843,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,n,r,s){n.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And I saw in the right hand of him that sat on the throne a book written within and on the backside, sealed with seven seals.",pt:"Vi na destra do que estava assentado sobre o trono um livro escrito por dentro e por fora, bem selado com sete selos."},{verse:2,en:"And I saw a strong angel proclaiming with a loud voice, Who is worthy to open the book, and to loose the seals thereof?",pt:"Vi tamb\xe9m um anjo forte, clamando com grande voz: Quem \xe9 digno de abrir o livro e de romper os seus selos?"},{verse:3,en:"And no man in heaven, nor in earth, neither under the earth, was able to open the book, neither to look thereon.",pt:"E ningu\xe9m no c\xe9u, nem na terra, nem debaixo da terra, podia abrir o livro, nem olhar para ele."},{verse:4,en:"And I wept much, because no man was found worthy to open and to read the book, neither to look thereon.",pt:"E eu chorava muito, porque n\xe3o fora achado ningu\xe9m digno de abrir o livro nem de olhar para ele."},{verse:5,en:"And one of the elders saith unto me, Weep not: behold, the Lion of the tribe of Juda, the Root of David, hath prevailed to open the book, and to loose the seven seals thereof.",pt:"E disse-me um dentre os anci\xe3os: N\xe3o chores; eis que o Le\xe3o da tribo de Jud\xe1, a raiz de Davi, venceu para abrir o livro e romper os sete selos."},{verse:6,en:"And I beheld, and, lo, in the midst of the throne and of the four beasts, and in the midst of the elders, stood a Lamb as it had been slain, having seven horns and seven eyes, which are the seven Spirits of God sent forth into all the earth.",pt:"Nisto vi, entre o trono e os quatro seres viventes, no meio dos anci\xe3os, um Cordeiro em p\xe9, como havendo sido morto, e tinha sete chifres e sete olhos, que s\xe3o os sete esp\xedritos de Deus, enviados por toda a terra."},{verse:7,en:"And he came and took the book out of the right hand of him that sat upon the throne.",pt:"E veio e tomou o livro da destra do que estava assentado sobre o trono."},{verse:8,en:"And when he had taken the book, the four beasts and four and twenty elders fell down before the Lamb, having every one of them harps, and golden vials full of odours, which are the prayers of saints.",pt:"Logo que tomou o livro, os quatro seres viventes e os vinte e quatro anci\xe3os prostraram-se diante do Cordeiro, tendo cada um deles uma harpa e ta\xe7as de ouro cheias de incenso, que s\xe3o as ora\xe7\xf5es dos santos."},{verse:9,en:"And they sung a new song, saying, Thou art worthy to take the book, and to open the seals thereof: for thou wast slain, and hast redeemed us to God by thy blood out of every kindred, and tongue, and people, and nation;",pt:"E cantavam um c\xe2ntico novo, dizendo: Digno \xe9s de tomar o livro, e de abrir os seus selos; porque foste morto, e com o teu sangue compraste para Deus homens de toda tribo, e l\xedngua, e povo e na\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:10,en:"And hast made us unto our God kings and priests: and we shall reign on the earth.",pt:"e para o nosso Deus os fizeste reino, e sacerdotes; e eles reinar\xe3o sobre a terra."},{verse:11,en:"And I beheld, and I heard the voice of many angels round about the throne and the beasts and the elders: and the number of them was ten thousand times ten thousand, and thousands of thousands;",pt:"E olhei, e vi a voz de muitos anjos ao redor do trono e dos seres viventes e dos anci\xe3os; e o n\xfamero deles era mir\xedades de mir\xedades; e o n\xfamero deles era mir\xedades de mir\xedades e milhares de milhares,"},{verse:12,en:"Saying with a loud voice, Worthy is the Lamb that was slain to receive power, and riches, and wisdom, and strength, and honour, and glory, and blessing.",pt:"que com grande voz diziam: Digno \xe9 o Cordeiro, que foi morto, de receber o poder, e riqueza, e sabedoria, e for\xe7a, e honra, e gl\xf3ria, e louvor."},{verse:13,en:"And every creature which is in heaven, and on the earth, and under the earth, and such as are in the sea, and all that are in them, heard I saying, Blessing, and honour, and glory, and power, be unto him that sitteth upon the throne, and unto the Lamb for ever and ever.",pt:"Ouvi tamb\xe9m a toda criatura que est\xe1 no c\xe9u, e na terra, e debaixo da terra, e no mar, e a todas as coisas que neles h\xe1, dizerem: Ao que est\xe1 assentado sobre o trono, e ao Cordeiro, seja o louvor, e a honra, e a gl\xf3ria, e o dom\xednio pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos:"},{verse:14,en:"And the four beasts said, Amen. And the four and twenty elders fell down and worshipped him that liveth for ever and ever.",pt:"e os quatro seres viventes diziam: Am\xe9m. E os anci\xe3os prostraram-se e adoraram."}]}}),844,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And I saw when the Lamb opened one of the seals, and I heard, as it were the noise of thunder, one of the four beasts saying, Come and see.",pt:"E vi quando o Cordeiro abriu um dos sete selos, e ouvi um dos quatro seres viventes dizer numa voz como de trov\xe3o: Vem!"},{verse:2,en:"And I saw, and behold a white horse: and he that sat on him had a bow; and a crown was given unto him: and he went forth conquering, and to conquer.",pt:"Olhei, e eis um cavalo branco; e o que estava montado nele tinha um arco; e foi-lhe dada uma coroa, e saiu vencendo, e para vencer."},{verse:3,en:"And when he had opened the second seal, I heard the second beast say, Come and see.",pt:"Quando ele abriu o segundo selo, ouvi o segundo ser vivente dizer: Vem!"},{verse:4,en:"And there went out another horse that was red: and power was given to him that sat thereon to take peace from the earth, and that they should kill one another: and there was given unto him a great sword.",pt:"E saiu outro cavalo, um cavalo vermelho; e ao que estava montado nele foi dado que tirasse a paz da terra, de modo que os homens se matassem uns aos outros; e foi-lhe dada uma grande espada."},{verse:5,en:"And when he had opened the third seal, I heard the third beast say, Come and see. And I beheld, and lo a black horse; and he that sat on him had a pair of balances in his hand.",pt:"Quando abriu o terceiro selo, ouvi o terceiro ser vivente dizer: Vem! E olhei, e eis um cavalo preto; e o que estava montado nele tinha uma balan\xe7a na m\xe3o."},{verse:6,en:"And I heard a voice in the midst of the four beasts say, A measure of wheat for a penny, and three measures of barley for a penny; and see thou hurt not the oil and the wine.",pt:"E ouvi como que uma voz no meio dos quatro seres viventes, que dizia: Um queniz de trigo por um den\xe1rio, e tr\xeas quenizes de cevada por um den\xe1rio; e n\xe3o danifiques o azeite e o vinho."},{verse:7,en:"And when he had opened the fourth seal, I heard the voice of the fourth beast say, Come and see.",pt:"Quando abriu o quarto selo, ouvi a voz do quarto ser vivente dizer: Vem!"},{verse:8,en:"And I looked, and behold a pale horse: and his name that sat on him was Death, and Hell followed with him. And power was given unto them over the fourth part of the earth, to kill with sword, and with hunger, and with death, and with the beasts of the earth.",pt:"E olhei, e eis um cavalo amarelo, e o que estava montado nele chamava-se Morte; e o hades seguia com ele; e foi-lhe dada autoridade sobre a quarta parte da terra, para matar com a espada, e com a fome, e com a peste, e com as feras da terra."},{verse:9,en:"And when he had opened the fifth seal, I saw under the altar the souls of them that were slain for the word of God, and for the testimony which they held:",pt:"Quando abriu o quinto selo, vi debaixo do altar as almas dos que tinham sido mortos por causa da palavra de Deus e por causa do testemunho que deram."},{verse:10,en:"And they cried with a loud voice, saying, How long, O Lord, holy and true, dost thou not judge and avenge our blood on them that dwell on the earth?",pt:"E clamaram com grande voz, dizendo: At\xe9 quando, \xf3 Soberano, santo e verdadeiro, n\xe3o julgas e vingas o nosso sangue dos que habitam sobre a terra?."},{verse:11,en:"And white robes were given unto every one of them; and it was said unto them, that they should rest yet for a little season, until their fellowservants also and their brethren, that should be killed as they were, should be fulfilled.",pt:"E foram dadas a cada um deles compridas vestes brancas e foi-lhes dito que repousassem ainda por um pouco de tempo, at\xe9 que se completasse o n\xfamero de seus conservos, que haviam de ser mortos, como tamb\xe9m eles o foram."},{verse:12,en:"And I beheld when he had opened the sixth seal, and, lo, there was a great earthquake; and the sun became black as sackcloth of hair, and the moon became as blood;",pt:"E vi quando abriu o sexto selo, e houve um grande terremoto; e o sol tornou-se negro como saco de cil\xedcio, e a lua toda tornou-se como sangue;"},{verse:13,en:"And the stars of heaven fell unto the earth, even as a fig tree casteth her untimely figs, when she is shaken of a mighty wind.",pt:"e as estrelas do c\xe9u ca\xedram sobre a terra, como quando a figueira, sacudida por um vento forte, deixa cair os seus figos verdes."},{verse:14,en:"And the heaven departed as a scroll when it is rolled together; and every mountain and island were moved out of their places.",pt:"E o c\xe9u recolheu-se como um livro que se enrola; e todos os montes e ilhas foram removidos dos seus lugares."},{verse:15,en:"And the kings of the earth, and the great men, and the rich men, and the chief captains, and the mighty men, and every bondman, and every free man, hid themselves in the dens and in the rocks of the mountains;",pt:"E os reis da terra, e os grandes, e os chefes militares, e os ricos, e os poderosos, e todo escravo, e todo livre, se esconderam nas cavernas e nas rochas das montanhas;"},{verse:16,en:"And said to the mountains and rocks, Fall on us, and hide us from the face of him that sitteth on the throne, and from the wrath of the Lamb:",pt:"e diziam aos montes e aos rochedos: Ca\xed sobre n\xf3s, e escondei-nos da face daquele que est\xe1 assentado sobre o trono, e da ira do Cordeiro;"},{verse:17,en:"For the great day of his wrath is come; and who shall be able to stand?",pt:"porque \xe9 vindo o grande dia da ira deles; e quem poder\xe1 subsistir?"}]}}),845,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And after these things I saw four angels standing on the four corners of the earth, holding the four winds of the earth, that the wind should not blow on the earth, nor on the sea, nor on any tree.",pt:"Depois disto vi quatro anjos em p\xe9 nos quatro cantos da terra, retendo os quatro ventos da terra, para que nenhum vento soprasse sobre a terra, nem sobre o mar, nem contra \xe1rvore alguma."},{verse:2,en:"And I saw another angel ascending from the east, having the seal of the living God: and he cried with a loud voice to the four angels, to whom it was given to hurt the earth and the sea,",pt:"E vi outro anjo subir do lado do sol nascente, tendo o selo do Deus vivo; e clamou com grande voz aos quatro anjos, quem fora dado que danificassem a terra e o mar,"},{verse:3,en:"Saying, Hurt not the earth, neither the sea, nor the trees, till we have sealed the servants of our God in their foreheads.",pt:"dizendo: N\xe3o danifiques a terra, nem o mar, nem as \xe1rvores, at\xe9 que selemos na sua fronte os servos do nosso Deus."},{verse:4,en:"And I heard the number of them which were sealed: and there were sealed an hundred and forty and four thousand of all the tribes of the children of Israel.",pt:"E ouvi o n\xfamero dos que foram assinalados com o selo, cento e quarenta e quatro mil de todas as tribos dos filhos de Israel:"},{verse:5,en:"Of the tribe of Juda were sealed twelve thousand. Of the tribe of Reuben were sealed twelve thousand. Of the tribe of Gad were sealed twelve thousand.",pt:"da tribo de Jud\xe1 havia doze mil assinalados; da tribo de R\xfaben, doze mil; da tribo de Gade, doze mil;"},{verse:6,en:"Of the tribe of Aser were sealed twelve thousand. Of the tribe of Nepthalim were sealed twelve thousand. Of the tribe of Manasses were sealed twelve thousand.",pt:"da tribo de Aser, doze mil; da tribo de Naftali, doze mil; da tribo de Manass\xe9s, doze mil;"},{verse:7,en:"Of the tribe of Simeon were sealed twelve thousand. Of the tribe of Levi were sealed twelve thousand. Of the tribe of Issachar were sealed twelve thousand.",pt:"da tribo de Sime\xe3o, doze mil; da tribo de Levi, doze mil; da tribo de Issacar, doze mil;"},{verse:8,en:"Of the tribe of Zabulon were sealed twelve thousand. Of the tribe of Joseph were sealed twelve thousand. Of the tribe of Benjamin were sealed twelve thousand.",pt:"da tribo de Zabulom, doze mil; da tribo de Jos\xe9, doze mil; da tribo de Benjamim, doze mil assinalados."},{verse:9,en:"After this I beheld, and, lo, a great multitude, which no man could number, of all nations, and kindreds, and people, and tongues, stood before the throne, and before the Lamb, clothed with white robes, and palms in their hands;",pt:"Depois destas coisas olhei, e eis uma grande multid\xe3o, que ningu\xe9m podia contar, de todas as na\xe7\xf5es, tribos, povos e l\xednguas, que estavam em p\xe9 diante do trono e em presen\xe7a do Cordeiro, trajando compridas vestes brancas, e com palmas nas m\xe3os;"},{verse:10,en:"And cried with a loud voice, saying, Salvation to our God which sitteth upon the throne, and unto the Lamb.",pt:"e clamavam com grande voz: Salva\xe7\xe3o ao nosso Deus, que est\xe1 assentado sobre o trono, e ao Cordeiro."},{verse:11,en:"And all the angels stood round about the throne, and about the elders and the four beasts, and fell before the throne on their faces, and worshipped God,",pt:"E todos os anjos estavam em p\xe9 ao redor do trono e dos anci\xe3os e dos quatro seres viventes, e prostraram-se diante do trono sobre seus rostos, e adoraram a Deus,"},{verse:12,en:"Saying, Amen: Blessing, and glory, and wisdom, and thanksgiving, and honour, and power, and might, be unto our God for ever and ever. Amen.",pt:"dizendo: Am\xe9m. Louvor, e gl\xf3ria, e sabedoria, e a\xe7\xf5es de gra\xe7as, e honra, e poder, e for\xe7a ao nosso Deus, pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos. Am\xe9m."},{verse:13,en:"And one of the elders answered, saying unto me, What are these which are arrayed in white robes? and whence came they?",pt:"E um dos anci\xe3os me perguntou: Estes que trajam as compridas vestes brancas, quem s\xe3o eles e donde vieram?"},{verse:14,en:"And I said unto him, Sir, thou knowest. And he said to me, These are they which came out of great tribulation, and have washed their robes, and made them white in the blood of the Lamb.",pt:"Respondi-lhe: Meu Senhor, tu sabes. Disse-me ele: Estes s\xe3o os que v\xeam da grande tribula\xe7\xe3o, e levaram as suas vestes e as branquearam no sangue do Cordeiro."},{verse:15,en:"Therefore are they before the throne of God, and serve him day and night in his temple: and he that sitteth on the throne shall dwell among them.",pt:"Por isso est\xe3o diante do trono de Deus, e o servem de dia e de noite no seu santu\xe1rio; e aquele que est\xe1 assentado sobre o trono estender\xe1 o seu tabern\xe1culo sobre eles."},{verse:16,en:"They shall hunger no more, neither thirst any more; neither shall the sun light on them, nor any heat.",pt:"Nunca mais ter\xe3o fome, nunca mais ter\xe3o sede; nem cair\xe1 sobre eles o sol, nem calor algum;"},{verse:17,en:"For the Lamb which is in the midst of the throne shall feed them, and shall lead them unto living fountains of waters: and God shall wipe away all tears from their eyes.",pt:"porque o Cordeiro que est\xe1 no meio, diante do trono, os apascentar\xe1 e os conduzir\xe1 \xe0s fontes das \xe1guas da vida; e Deus lhes enxugar\xe1 dos olhos toda l\xe1grima."}]}}),846,[]);
__d((function(e,a,t,o,r,n,s){r.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And when he had opened the seventh seal, there was silence in heaven about the space of half an hour.",pt:"Quando abriu o s\xe9timo selo, fez-se sil\xeancio no c\xe9u, quase por meia hora."},{verse:2,en:"And I saw the seven angels which stood before God; and to them were given seven trumpets.",pt:"E vi os sete anjos que estavam em p\xe9 diante de Deus, e lhes foram dadas sete trombetas."},{verse:3,en:"And another angel came and stood at the altar, having a golden censer; and there was given unto him much incense, that he should offer it with the prayers of all saints upon the golden altar which was before the throne.",pt:"Veio outro anjo, e p\xf4s-se junto ao altar, tendo um incens\xe1rio de ouro; e foi-lhe dado muito incenso, para que o oferecesse com as ora\xe7\xf5es de todos os santos sobre o altar de ouro que est\xe1 diante do trono."},{verse:4,en:"And the smoke of the incense, which came with the prayers of the saints, ascended up before God out of the angel\u2019s hand.",pt:"E da m\xe3o do anjo subiu diante de Deus a fuma\xe7a do incenso com as ora\xe7\xf5es dos santos."},{verse:5,en:"And the angel took the censer, and filled it with fire of the altar, and cast it into the earth: and there were voices, and thunderings, and lightnings, and an earthquake.",pt:"Depois do anjo tomou o incens\xe1rio, encheu-o do fogo do altar e o lan\xe7ou sobre a terra; e houve trov\xf5es, vozes, rel\xe2mpagos e terremoto."},{verse:6,en:"And the seven angels which had the seven trumpets prepared themselves to sound.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os sete anjos que tinham as sete trombetas prepararam-se para tocar."},{verse:7,en:"The first angel sounded, and there followed hail and fire mingled with blood, and they were cast upon the earth: and the third part of trees was burnt up, and all green grass was burnt up.",pt:"O primeiro anjo tocou a sua trombeta, e houve saraiva e fogo misturado com sangue, que foram lan\xe7ados na terra; e foi queimada a ter\xe7a parte da terra, a ter\xe7a parte das \xe1rvores, e toda a erva verde."},{verse:8,en:"And the second angel sounded, and as it were a great mountain burning with fire was cast into the sea: and the third part of the sea became blood;",pt:"O segundo anjo tocou a sua trombeta, e foi lan\xe7ado no mar como que um grande monte ardendo em fogo, e tornou-se em sangue a ter\xe7a parte do mar."},{verse:9,en:"And the third part of the creatures which were in the sea, and had life, died; and the third part of the ships were destroyed.",pt:"E morreu a ter\xe7a parte das criaturas viventes que havia no mar, e foi destru\xedda a ter\xe7a parte dos navios."},{verse:10,en:"And the third angel sounded, and there fell a great star from heaven, burning as it were a lamp, and it fell upon the third part of the rivers, and upon the fountains of waters;",pt:"O terceiro anjo tocou a sua trombeta, e caiu do c\xe9u uma grande estrela, ardendo como uma tocha, e caiu sobre a ter\xe7a parte dos rios, e sobre as fontes das \xe1guas."},{verse:11,en:"And the name of the star is called Wormwood: and the third part of the waters became wormwood; and many men died of the waters, because they were made bitter.",pt:"O nome da estrela era Absinto; e a ter\xe7a parte das \xe1guas tornou-se em absinto, e muitos homens morreram das \xe1guas, porque se tornaram amargas."},{verse:12,en:"And the fourth angel sounded, and the third part of the sun was smitten, and the third part of the moon, and the third part of the stars; so as the third part of them was darkened, and the day shone not for a third part of it, and the night likewise.",pt:"O quarto anjo tocou a sua trombeta, e foi ferida a ter\xe7a parte do sol, a ter\xe7a parte da lua, e a ter\xe7a parte das estrelas; para que a ter\xe7a parte deles se escurecesse, e a ter\xe7a parte do dia n\xe3o brilhante, e semelhantemente a da noite."},{verse:13,en:"And I beheld, and heard an angel flying through the midst of heaven, saying with a loud voice, Woe, woe, woe, to the inhabiters of the earth by reason of the other voices of the trumpet of the three angels, which are yet to sound!",pt:"E olhei, e ouvi uma \xe1guia que, voando pelo meio do c\xe9u, dizia com grande voz: Ai, ai, ai dos que habitam sobre a terra! por causa dos outros toques de trombeta dos tr\xeas anjos que ainda v\xe3o tocar."}]}}),847,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And the fifth angel sounded, and I saw a star fall from heaven unto the earth: and to him was given the key of the bottomless pit.",pt:"O quinto anjo tocou a sua trombeta, e vi uma estrela que do c\xe9u ca\xedra sobre a terra; e foi-lhe dada a chave do po\xe7o do abismo."},{verse:2,en:"And he opened the bottomless pit; and there arose a smoke out of the pit, as the smoke of a great furnace; and the sun and the air were darkened by reason of the smoke of the pit.",pt:"E abriu o po\xe7o do abismo, e subiu fuma\xe7a do po\xe7o, como fuma\xe7a de uma grande fornalha; e com a fuma\xe7a do po\xe7o escureceram-se o sol e o ar."},{verse:3,en:"And there came out of the smoke locusts upon the earth: and unto them was given power, as the scorpions of the earth have power.",pt:"Da fuma\xe7a sa\xedram gafanhotos sobre a terra; e foi-lhes dado poder, como o que t\xeam os escorpi\xf5es da terra."},{verse:4,en:"And it was commanded them that they should not hurt the grass of the earth, neither any green thing, neither any tree; but only those men which have not the seal of God in their foreheads.",pt:"Foi-lhes dito que n\xe3o fizessem dano \xe0 erva da terra, nem a verdura alguma, nem a \xe1rvore alguma, mas somente aos homens que n\xe3o t\xeam na fronte o selo de Deus."},{verse:5,en:"And to them it was given that they should not kill them, but that they should be tormented five months: and their torment was as the torment of a scorpion, when he striketh a man.",pt:"Foi-lhes permitido, n\xe3o que os matassem, mas que por cinco meses os atormentassem. E o seu tormento era semelhante ao tormento do escorpi\xe3o, quando fere o homem."},{verse:6,en:"And in those days shall men seek death, and shall not find it; and shall desire to die, and death shall flee from them.",pt:"Naqueles dias os homens buscar\xe3o a morte, e de modo algum a achar\xe3o; e desejar\xe3o morrer, e a morte fugir\xe1 deles."},{verse:7,en:"And the shapes of the locusts were like unto horses prepared unto battle; and on their heads were as it were crowns like gold, and their faces were as the faces of men.",pt:"A apar\xeancia dos gafanhotos era semelhante \xe0 de cavalos aparelhados para a guerra; e sobre as suas cabe\xe7as havia como que umas coroas semelhantes ao ouro; e os seus rostos eram como rostos de homens."},{verse:8,en:"And they had hair as the hair of women, and their teeth were as the teeth of lions.",pt:"Tinham cabelos como cabelos de mulheres, e os seus dentes eram como os de le\xf5es."},{verse:9,en:"And they had breastplates, as it were breastplates of iron; and the sound of their wings was as the sound of chariots of many horses running to battle.",pt:"Tinham coura\xe7as como coura\xe7as de ferro; e o ru\xeddo das suas asas era como o ru\xeddo de carros de muitos cavalos que correm ao combate."},{verse:10,en:"And they had tails like unto scorpions, and there were stings in their tails: and their power was to hurt men five months.",pt:"Tinham caudas com ferr\xf5es, semelhantes \xe0s caudas dos escorpi\xf5es; e nas suas caudas estava o seu poder para fazer dano aos homens por cinco meses."},{verse:11,en:"And they had a king over them, which is the angel of the bottomless pit, whose name in the Hebrew tongue is Abaddon, but in the Greek tongue hath his name Apollyon.",pt:"Tinham sobre si como rei o anjo do abismo, cujo nome em hebraico \xe9 Abadom e em grego Apoliom."},{verse:12,en:"One woe is past; and, behold, there come two woes more hereafter.",pt:"Passado \xe9 j\xe1 um ai; eis que depois disso v\xeam ainda dois ais."},{verse:13,en:"And the sixth angel sounded, and I heard a voice from the four horns of the golden altar which is before God,",pt:"O sexto anjo tocou a sua trombeta; e ouvi uma voz que vinha das quatro pontas do altar de ouro que estava diante de Deus,"},{verse:14,en:"Saying to the sixth angel which had the trumpet, Loose the four angels which are bound in the great river Euphrates.",pt:"a qual dizia ao sexto anjo, que tinha a trombeta: Solta os quatro anjos que se acham presos junto do grande rio Eufrates."},{verse:15,en:"And the four angels were loosed, which were prepared for an hour, and a day, and a month, and a year, for to slay the third part of men.",pt:"E foram soltos os quatro anjos que haviam sido preparados para aquela hora e dia e m\xeas e ano, a fim de matarem a ter\xe7a parte dos homens."},{verse:16,en:"And the number of the army of the horsemen were two hundred thousand thousand: and I heard the number of them.",pt:"O n\xfamero dos ex\xe9rcitos dos cavaleiros era de duas mir\xedades de mir\xedades; pois ouvi o n\xfamero deles."},{verse:17,en:"And thus I saw the horses in the vision, and them that sat on them, having breastplates of fire, and of jacinth, and brimstone: and the heads of the horses were as the heads of lions; and out of their mouths issued fire and smoke and brimstone.",pt:"E assim vi os cavalos nesta vis\xe3o: os que sobre eles estavam montados tinham coura\xe7as de fogo, e de jacinto, e de enxofre; e as cabe\xe7as dos cavalos eram como cabe\xe7as de le\xf5es; e de suas bocas sa\xedam fogo, fuma\xe7a e enxofre."},{verse:18,en:"By these three was the third part of men killed, by the fire, and by the smoke, and by the brimstone, which issued out of their mouths.",pt:"Por estas tr\xeas pragas foi morta a ter\xe7a parte dos homens, isto \xe9, pelo fogo, pela fuma\xe7a e pelo enxofre, que sa\xedam das suas bocas."},{verse:19,en:"For their power is in their mouth, and in their tails: for their tails were like unto serpents, and had heads, and with them they do hurt.",pt:"Porque o poder dos cavalos estava nas suas bocas e nas suas caudas. Porquanto as suas caudas eram semelhantes a serpentes, e tinham cabe\xe7as, e com elas causavam dano."},{verse:20,en:"And the rest of the men which were not killed by these plagues yet repented not of the works of their hands, that they should not worship devils, and idols of gold, and silver, and brass, and stone, and of wood: which neither can see, nor hear, nor walk:",pt:"Os outros homens, que n\xe3o foram mortos por estas pragas, n\xe3o se arrependeram das obras das suas m\xe3os, para deixarem de adorar aos dem\xf4nios, e aos \xeddolos de ouro, de prata, de bronze, de pedra e de madeira, que nem podem ver, nem ouvir, nem andar."},{verse:21,en:"Neither repented they of their murders, nor of their sorceries, nor of their fornication, nor of their thefts.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m n\xe3o se arrependeram dos seus homic\xeddios, nem das suas feiti\xe7arias, nem da sua prostitui\xe7\xe3o, nem dos seus furtos."}]}}),848,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And I saw another mighty angel come down from heaven, clothed with a cloud: and a rainbow was upon his head, and his face was as it were the sun, and his feet as pillars of fire:",pt:"E vi outro anjo forte que descia do c\xe9u, vestido de uma nuvem; por cima da sua cabe\xe7a estava o arco-\xedris; o seu rosto era como o sol, e os seus p\xe9s como colunas de fogo,"},{verse:2,en:"And he had in his hand a little book open: and he set his right foot upon the sea, and his left foot on the earth,",pt:"e tinha na m\xe3o um livrinho aberto. P\xf4s o seu p\xe9 direito sobre o mar, e o esquerdo sobre a terra,"},{verse:3,en:"And cried with a loud voice, as when a lion roareth: and when he had cried, seven thunders uttered their voices.",pt:"e clamou com grande voz, assim como ruge o le\xe3o; e quando clamou, os sete trov\xf5es fizeram soar as suas vozes."},{verse:4,en:"And when the seven thunders had uttered their voices, I was about to write: and I heard a voice from heaven saying unto me, Seal up those things which the seven thunders uttered, and write them not.",pt:"Quando os sete trov\xf5es acabaram de soar eu j\xe1 ia escrever, mas ouvi uma voz do c\xe9u, que dizia: Sela o que os sete trov\xf5es falaram, e n\xe3o o escrevas."},{verse:5,en:"And the angel which I saw stand upon the sea and upon the earth lifted up his hand to heaven,",pt:"O anjo que vi em p\xe9 sobre o mar e sobre a terra levantou a m\xe3o direita ao c\xe9u,"},{verse:6,en:"And sware by him that liveth for ever and ever, who created heaven, and the things that therein are, and the earth, and the things that therein are, and the sea, and the things which are therein, that there should be time no longer:",pt:"e jurou por aquele que vive pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos, o qual criou o c\xe9u e o que nele h\xe1, e a terra e o que nela h\xe1, e o mar e o que nele h\xe1, que n\xe3o haveria mais demora,"},{verse:7,en:"But in the days of the voice of the seventh angel, when he shall begin to sound, the mystery of God should be finished, as he hath declared to his servants the prophets.",pt:"mas que nos dias da voz do s\xe9timo anjo, quando este estivesse para tocar a trombeta, se cumpriria o mist\xe9rio de Deus, como anunciou aos seus servos, os profetas."},{verse:8,en:"And the voice which I heard from heaven spake unto me again, and said, Go and take the little book which is open in the hand of the angel which standeth upon the sea and upon the earth.",pt:"A voz que eu do c\xe9u tinha ouvido tornou a falar comigo, e disse: Vai, e toma o livro que est\xe1 aberto na m\xe3o do anjo que se acha em p\xe9 sobre o mar e sobre a terra."},{verse:9,en:"And I went unto the angel, and said unto him, Give me the little book. And he said unto me, Take it, and eat it up; and it shall make thy belly bitter, but it shall be in thy mouth sweet as honey.",pt:"E fui ter com o anjo e lhe pedi que me desse o livrinho. Disse-me ele: Toma-o, e come-o; ele far\xe1 amargo o teu ventre, mas na tua boca ser\xe1 doce como mel."},{verse:10,en:"And I took the little book out of the angel\u2019s hand, and ate it up; and it was in my mouth sweet as honey: and as soon as I had eaten it, my belly was bitter.",pt:"Tomei o livrinho da m\xe3o do anjo, e o comi; e na minha boca era doce como mel; mas depois que o comi, o meu ventre ficou amargo."},{verse:11,en:"And he said unto me, Thou must prophesy again before many peoples, and nations, and tongues, and kings.",pt:"Ent\xe3o me disseram: Importa que profetizes outra vez a muitos povos, e na\xe7\xf5es, e l\xednguas, e reis."}]}}),849,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And there was given me a reed like unto a rod: and the angel stood, saying, Rise, and measure the temple of God, and the altar, and them that worship therein.",pt:"Foi-me dada uma cana semelhante a uma vara; e foi-me dito: Levanta-te, mede o santu\xe1rio de Deus, e o altar, e os que nele adoram."},{verse:2,en:"But the court which is without the temple leave out, and measure it not; for it is given unto the Gentiles: and the holy city shall they tread under foot forty and two months.",pt:"Mas deixa o \xe1trio que est\xe1 fora do santu\xe1rio, e n\xe3o o me\xe7as; porque foi dado aos gentios; e eles pisar\xe3o a cidade santa por quarenta e dois meses."},{verse:3,en:"And I will give power unto my two witnesses, and they shall prophesy a thousand two hundred and threescore days, clothed in sackcloth.",pt:"E concederei \xe0s minhas duas testemunhas que, vestidas de saco, profetizem por mil duzentos e sessenta dias."},{verse:4,en:"These are the two olive trees, and the two candlesticks standing before the God of the earth.",pt:"Estas s\xe3o as duas oliveiras e os dois candeeiros que est\xe3o diante do Senhor da terra."},{verse:5,en:"And if any man will hurt them, fire proceedeth out of their mouth, and devoureth their enemies: and if any man will hurt them, he must in this manner be killed.",pt:"E, se algu\xe9m lhes quiser fazer mal, das suas bocas sair\xe1 fogo e devorar\xe1 os seus inimigos; pois se algu\xe9m lhes quiser fazer mal, importa que assim seja morto."},{verse:6,en:"These have power to shut heaven, that it rain not in the days of their prophecy: and have power over waters to turn them to blood, and to smite the earth with all plagues, as often as they will.",pt:"Elas t\xeam poder para fechar o c\xe9u, para que n\xe3o chova durante os dias da sua profecia; e t\xeam poder sobre as \xe1guas para convert\xea-las em sangue, e para ferir a terra com toda sorte de pragas, quantas vezes quiserem."},{verse:7,en:"And when they shall have finished their testimony, the beast that ascendeth out of the bottomless pit shall make war against them, and shall overcome them, and kill them.",pt:"E, quando acabarem o seu testemunho, a besta que sobe do abismo lhes far\xe1 guerra e as vencer\xe1 e matar\xe1."},{verse:8,en:"And their dead bodies shall lie in the street of the great city, which spiritually is called Sodom and Egypt, where also our Lord was crucified.",pt:"E jazer\xe3o os seus corpos na pra\xe7a da grande cidade, que espiritualmente se chama Sodoma e Egito, onde tamb\xe9m o seu Senhor foi crucificado."},{verse:9,en:"And they of the people and kindreds and tongues and nations shall see their dead bodies three days and an half, and shall not suffer their dead bodies to be put in graves.",pt:"Homens de v\xe1rios povos, e tribos e l\xednguas, e na\xe7\xf5es ver\xe3o os seus corpos por tr\xeas dias e meio, e n\xe3o permitir\xe3o que sejam sepultados."},{verse:10,en:"And they that dwell upon the earth shall rejoice over them, and make merry, and shall send gifts one to another; because these two prophets tormented them that dwelt on the earth.",pt:"E os que habitam sobre a terra se regozijar\xe3o sobre eles, e se alegrar\xe3o; e mandar\xe3o presentes uns aos outros, porquanto estes dois profetas atormentaram os que habitam sobre a terra."},{verse:11,en:"And after three days and an half the Spirit of life from God entered into them, and they stood upon their feet; and great fear fell upon them which saw them.",pt:"E depois daqueles tr\xeas dias e meio o esp\xedrito de vida, vindo de Deus, entrou neles, e puseram-se sobre seus p\xe9s, e caiu grande temor sobre os que os viram."},{verse:12,en:"And they heard a great voice from heaven saying unto them, Come up hither. And they ascended up to heaven in a cloud; and their enemies beheld them.",pt:"E ouviram uma grande voz do c\xe9u, que lhes dizia: Subi para c\xe1. E subiram ao c\xe9u em uma nuvem; e os seus inimigos os viram."},{verse:13,en:"And the same hour was there a great earthquake, and the tenth part of the city fell, and in the earthquake were slain of men seven thousand: and the remnant were affrighted, and gave glory to the God of heaven.",pt:"E naquela hora houve um grande terremoto, e caiu a d\xe9cima parte da cidade, e no terremoto foram mortos sete mil homens; e os demais ficaram atemorizados, e deram gl\xf3ria ao Deus do c\xe9u."},{verse:14,en:"The second woe is past; and, behold, the third woe cometh quickly.",pt:"\xc9 passado o segundo ai; eis que cedo vem o terceiro."},{verse:15,en:"And the seventh angel sounded; and there were great voices in heaven, saying, The kingdoms of this world are become the kingdoms of our Lord, and of his Christ; and he shall reign for ever and ever.",pt:"E tocou o s\xe9timo anjo a sua trombeta, e houve no c\xe9u grandes vozes, que diziam: O reino do mundo passou a ser de nosso Senhor e do seu Cristo, e ele reinar\xe1 pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos."},{verse:16,en:"And the four and twenty elders, which sat before God on their seats, fell upon their faces, and worshipped God,",pt:"E os vinte e quatro anci\xe3os, que est\xe3o assentados em seus tronos diante de Deus, prostraram-se sobre seus rostos e adoraram a Deus,"},{verse:17,en:"Saying, We give thee thanks, O Lord God Almighty, which art, and wast, and art to come; because thou hast taken to thee thy great power, and hast reigned.",pt:"dizendo: Gra\xe7as te damos, Senhor Deus Todo-Poderoso, que \xe9s, e que eras, porque tens tomado o teu grande poder, e come\xe7aste a reinar."},{verse:18,en:"And the nations were angry, and thy wrath is come, and the time of the dead, that they should be judged, and that thou shouldest give reward unto thy servants the prophets, and to the saints, and them that fear thy name, small and great; and shouldest destroy them which destroy the earth.",pt:"Iraram-se, na verdade, as na\xe7\xf5es; ent\xe3o veio a tua ira, e o tempo de serem julgados os mortos, e o tempo de dares recompensa aos teus servos, os profetas, e aos santos, e aos que temem o teu nome, a pequenos e a grandes, e o tempo de destru\xedres os que destroem a terra."},{verse:19,en:"And the temple of God was opened in heaven, and there was seen in his temple the ark of his testament: and there were lightnings, and voices, and thunderings, and an earthquake, and great hail.",pt:"Abriu-se o santu\xe1rio de Deus que est\xe1 no c\xe9u, e no seu santu\xe1rio foi vista a arca do seu pacto; e houve rel\xe2mpagos, vozes e trov\xf5es, e terremoto e grande saraivada."}]}}),850,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,r,s,n){r.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And there appeared a great wonder in heaven; a woman clothed with the sun, and the moon under her feet, and upon her head a crown of twelve stars:",pt:"E viu-se um grande sinal no c\xe9u: uma mulher vestida do sol, tendo a lua debaixo dos seus p\xe9s, e uma coroa de doze estrelas sobre a sua cabe\xe7a."},{verse:2,en:"And she being with child cried, travailing in birth, and pained to be delivered.",pt:"E estando gr\xe1vida, gritava com as dores do parto, sofrendo tormentos para dar \xe0 luz."},{verse:3,en:"And there appeared another wonder in heaven; and behold a great red dragon, having seven heads and ten horns, and seven crowns upon his heads.",pt:"Viu-se tamb\xe9m outro sinal no c\xe9u: eis um grande drag\xe3o vermelho que tinha sete cabe\xe7as e dez chifres, e sobre as suas cabe\xe7as sete diademas;"},{verse:4,en:"And his tail drew the third part of the stars of heaven, and did cast them to the earth: and the dragon stood before the woman which was ready to be delivered, for to devour her child as soon as it was born.",pt:"a sua cauda levava ap\xf3s si a ter\xe7a parte das estrelas do c\xe9u, e lan\xe7ou-as sobre a terra; e o drag\xe3o parou diante da mulher que estava para dar \xe0 luz, para que, dando ela \xe0 luz, lhe devorasse o filho."},{verse:5,en:"And she brought forth a man child, who was to rule all nations with a rod of iron: and her child was caught up unto God, and to his throne.",pt:"E deu \xe0 luz um filho, um var\xe3o que h\xe1 de reger todas as na\xe7\xf5es com vara de ferro; e o seu filho foi arrebatado para Deus e para o seu trono."},{verse:6,en:"And the woman fled into the wilderness, where she hath a place prepared of God, that they should feed her there a thousand two hundred and threescore days.",pt:"E a mulher fugiu para o deserto, onde j\xe1 tinha lugar preparado por Deus, para que ali fosse alimentada durante mil duzentos e sessenta dias."},{verse:7,en:"And there was war in heaven: Michael and his angels fought against the dragon; and the dragon fought and his angels,",pt:"Ent\xe3o houve guerra no c\xe9u: Miguel e os seus anjos batalhavam contra o drag\xe3o. E o drag\xe3o e os seus anjos batalhavam,"},{verse:8,en:"And prevailed not; neither was their place found any more in heaven.",pt:"mas n\xe3o prevaleceram, nem mais o seu lugar se achou no c\xe9u."},{verse:9,en:"And the great dragon was cast out, that old serpent, called the Devil, and Satan, which deceiveth the whole world: he was cast out into the earth, and his angels were cast out with him.",pt:"E foi precipitado o grande drag\xe3o, a antiga serpente, que se chama o Diabo e Satan\xe1s, que engana todo o mundo; foi precipitado na terra, e os seus anjos foram precipitados com ele."},{verse:10,en:"And I heard a loud voice saying in heaven, Now is come salvation, and strength, and the kingdom of our God, and the power of his Christ: for the accuser of our brethren is cast down, which accused them before our God day and night.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, ouvi uma grande voz no c\xe9u, que dizia: Agora \xe9 chegada a salva\xe7\xe3o, e o poder, e o reino do nosso Deus, e a autoridade do seu Cristo; porque j\xe1 foi lan\xe7ado fora o acusador de nossos irm\xe3os, o qual diante do nosso Deus os acusava dia e noite."},{verse:11,en:"And they overcame him by the blood of the Lamb, and by the word of their testimony; and they loved not their lives unto the death.",pt:"E eles o venceram pelo sangue do Cordeiro e pela palavra do seu testemunho; e n\xe3o amaram as suas vidas at\xe9 a morte."},{verse:12,en:"Therefore rejoice, ye heavens, and ye that dwell in them. Woe to the inhabiters of the earth and of the sea! for the devil is come down unto you, having great wrath, because he knoweth that he hath but a short time.",pt:"Pelo que alegrai-vos, \xf3 c\xe9us, e v\xf3s que neles habitais. Mas ai da terra e do mar! porque o Diabo desceu a v\xf3s com grande ira, sabendo que pouco tempo lhe resta."},{verse:13,en:"And when the dragon saw that he was cast unto the earth, he persecuted the woman which brought forth the man child.",pt:"Quando o drag\xe3o se viu precipitado na terra, perseguiu a mulher que dera \xe0 luz o filho var\xe3o."},{verse:14,en:"And to the woman were given two wings of a great eagle, that she might fly into the wilderness, into her place, where she is nourished for a time, and times, and half a time, from the face of the serpent.",pt:"E foram dadas \xe0 mulher as duas asas da grande \xe1guia, para que voasse para o deserto, ao seu lugar, onde \xe9 sustentada por um tempo, e tempos, e metade de um tempo, fora da vista da serpente."},{verse:15,en:"And the serpent cast out of his mouth water as a flood after the woman, that he might cause her to be carried away of the flood.",pt:"E a serpente lan\xe7ou da sua boca, atr\xe1s da mulher, \xe1gua como um rio, para fazer que ela fosse arrebatada pela corrente."},{verse:16,en:"And the earth helped the woman, and the earth opened her mouth, and swallowed up the flood which the dragon cast out of his mouth.",pt:"A terra, por\xe9m acudiu \xe0 mulher; e a terra abriu a boca, e tragou o rio que o drag\xe3o lan\xe7ara da sua boca."},{verse:17,en:"And the dragon was wroth with the woman, and went to make war with the remnant of her seed, which keep the commandments of God, and have the testimony of Jesus Christ.",pt:"E o drag\xe3o irou-se contra a mulher, e foi fazer guerra aos demais filhos dela, os que guardam os mandamentos de Deus, e mant\xeam o testemunho de Jesus."}]}}),851,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And I stood upon the sand of the sea, and saw a beast rise up out of the sea, having seven heads and ten horns, and upon his horns ten crowns, and upon his heads the name of blasphemy.",pt:"Ent\xe3o vi subir do mar uma besta que tinha dez chifres e sete cabe\xe7as, e sobre os seus chifres dez diademas, e sobre as suas cabe\xe7as nomes de blasf\xeamia."},{verse:2,en:"And the beast which I saw was like unto a leopard, and his feet were as the feet of a bear, and his mouth as the mouth of a lion: and the dragon gave him his power, and his seat, and great authority.",pt:"E a besta que vi era semelhante ao leopardo, e os seus p\xe9s como os de urso, e a sua boca como a de le\xe3o; e o drag\xe3o deu-lhe o seu poder e o seu trono e grande autoridade."},{verse:3,en:"And I saw one of his heads as it were wounded to death; and his deadly wound was healed: and all the world wondered after the beast.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m vi uma de suas cabe\xe7as como se fora ferida de morte, mas a sua ferida mortal foi curada. Toda a terra se maravilhou, seguindo a besta,"},{verse:4,en:"And they worshipped the dragon which gave power unto the beast: and they worshipped the beast, saying, Who is like unto the beast? who is able to make war with him?",pt:"e adoraram o drag\xe3o, porque deu \xe0 besta a sua autoridade; e adoraram a besta, dizendo: Quem \xe9 semelhante \xe0 besta? quem poder\xe1 batalhar contra ela?"},{verse:5,en:"And there was given unto him a mouth speaking great things and blasphemies; and power was given unto him to continue forty and two months.",pt:"Foi-lhe dada uma boca que proferia arrog\xe2ncias e blasf\xeamias; e deu-se-lhe autoridade para atuar por quarenta e dois meses."},{verse:6,en:"And he opened his mouth in blasphemy against God, to blaspheme his name, and his tabernacle, and them that dwell in heaven.",pt:"E abriu a boca em blasf\xeamias contra Deus, para blasfemar do seu nome e do seu tabern\xe1culo e dos que habitam no c\xe9u."},{verse:7,en:"And it was given unto him to make war with the saints, and to overcome them: and power was given him over all kindreds, and tongues, and nations.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m lhe foi permitido fazer guerra aos santos, e venc\xea-los; e deu-se-lhe autoridade sobre toda tribo, e povo, e l\xedngua e na\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:8,en:"And all that dwell upon the earth shall worship him, whose names are not written in the book of life of the Lamb slain from the foundation of the world.",pt:"E adora-la-\xe3o todos os que habitam sobre a terra, esses cujos nomes n\xe3o est\xe3o escritos no livro do Cordeiro que foi morto desde a funda\xe7\xe3o do mundo."},{verse:9,en:"If any man have an ear, let him hear.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m tem ouvidos, ou\xe7a."},{verse:10,en:"He that leadeth into captivity shall go into captivity: he that killeth with the sword must be killed with the sword. Here is the patience and the faith of the saints.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m leva em cativeiro, em cativeiro ir\xe1; se algu\xe9m matar \xe0 espada, necess\xe1rio \xe9 que \xe0 espada seja morto. Aqui est\xe1 a perseveran\xe7a e a f\xe9 dos santos."},{verse:11,en:"And I beheld another beast coming up out of the earth; and he had two horns like a lamb, and he spake as a dragon.",pt:"E vi subir da terra outra besta, e tinha dois chifres semelhantes aos de um cordeiro; e falava como drag\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"And he exerciseth all the power of the first beast before him, and causeth the earth and them which dwell therein to worship the first beast, whose deadly wound was healed.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m exercia toda a autoridade da primeira besta na sua presen\xe7a; e fazia que a terra e os que nela habitavam adorassem a primeira besta, cuja ferida mortal fora curada."},{verse:13,en:"And he doeth great wonders, so that he maketh fire come down from heaven on the earth in the sight of men,",pt:"E operava grandes sinais, de maneira que fazia at\xe9 descer fogo do c\xe9u \xe0 terra, \xe0 vista dos homens;"},{verse:14,en:"And deceiveth them that dwell on the earth by the means of those miracles which he had power to do in the sight of the beast; saying to them that dwell on the earth, that they should make an image to the beast, which had the wound by a sword, and did live.",pt:"e, por meio dos sinais que lhe foi permitido fazer na presen\xe7a da besta, enganava os que habitavam sobre a terra e lhes dizia que fizessem uma imagem \xe0 besta que recebera a ferida da espada e vivia."},{verse:15,en:"And he had power to give life unto the image of the beast, that the image of the beast should both speak, and cause that as many as would not worship the image of the beast should be killed.",pt:"Foi-lhe concedido tamb\xe9m dar f\xf4lego \xe0 imagem da besta, para que a imagem da besta falasse, e fizesse que fossem mortos todos os que n\xe3o adorassem a imagem da besta."},{verse:16,en:"And he causeth all, both small and great, rich and poor, free and bond, to receive a mark in their right hand, or in their foreheads:",pt:"E fez que a todos, pequenos e grandes, ricos e pobres, livres e escravos, lhes fosse posto um sinal na m\xe3o direita, ou na fronte,"},{verse:17,en:"And that no man might buy or sell, save he that had the mark, or the name of the beast, or the number of his name.",pt:"para que ningu\xe9m pudesse comprar ou vender, sen\xe3o aquele que tivesse o sinal, ou o nome da besta, ou o n\xfamero do seu nome."},{verse:18,en:"Here is wisdom. Let him that hath understanding count the number of the beast: for it is the number of a man; and his number is Six hundred threescore and six.",pt:"Aqui h\xe1 sabedoria. Aquele que tem entendimento, calcule o n\xfamero da besta; porque \xe9 o n\xfamero de um homem, e o seu n\xfamero \xe9 seiscentos e sessenta e seis."}]}}),852,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,n,r,s){n.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And I looked, and, lo, a Lamb stood on the mount Sion, and with him an hundred forty and four thousand, having his Father\u2019s name written in their foreheads.",pt:"E olhei, e eis o Cordeiro em p\xe9 sobre o Monte Si\xe3o, e com ele cento e quarenta e quatro mil, que traziam na fronte escrito o nome dele e o nome de seu Pai."},{verse:2,en:"And I heard a voice from heaven, as the voice of many waters, and as the voice of a great thunder: and I heard the voice of harpers harping with their harps:",pt:"E ouvi uma voz do c\xe9u, como a voz de muitas \xe1guas, e como a voz de um grande trov\xe3o e a voz que ouvi era como de harpistas, que tocavam as suas harpas."},{verse:3,en:"And they sung as it were a new song before the throne, and before the four beasts, and the elders: and no man could learn that song but the hundred and forty and four thousand, which were redeemed from the earth.",pt:"E cantavam um c\xe2ntico novo diante do trono, e diante dos quatro seres viventes e dos anci\xe3os; e ningu\xe9m podia aprender aquele c\xe2ntico, sen\xe3o os cento e quarenta e quatro mil, aqueles que foram comprados da terra."},{verse:4,en:"These are they which were not defiled with women; for they are virgins. These are they which follow the Lamb whithersoever he goeth. These were redeemed from among men, being the firstfruits unto God and to the Lamb.",pt:"Estes s\xe3o os que n\xe3o se contaminaram com mulheres; porque s\xe3o virgens. Estes s\xe3o os que seguem o Cordeiro para onde quer que v\xe1. Estes foram comprados dentre os homens para serem as prim\xedcias para Deus e para o Cordeiro."},{verse:5,en:"And in their mouth was found no guile: for they are without fault before the throne of God.",pt:"E na sua boca n\xe3o se achou engano; porque s\xe3o irrepreens\xedveis."},{verse:6,en:"And I saw another angel fly in the midst of heaven, having the everlasting gospel to preach unto them that dwell on the earth, and to every nation, and kindred, and tongue, and people,",pt:"E vi outro anjo voando pelo meio do c\xe9u, e tinha um evangelho eterno para proclamar aos que habitam sobre a terra e a toda na\xe7\xe3o, e tribo, e l\xedngua, e povo,"},{verse:7,en:"Saying with a loud voice, Fear God, and give glory to him; for the hour of his judgment is come: and worship him that made heaven, and earth, and the sea, and the fountains of waters.",pt:"dizendo com grande voz: Temei a Deus, e dai-lhe gl\xf3ria; porque \xe9 chegada a hora do seu ju\xedzo; e adorai aquele que fez o c\xe9u, e a terra, e o mar, e as fontes das \xe1guas."},{verse:8,en:"And there followed another angel, saying, Babylon is fallen, is fallen, that great city, because she made all nations drink of the wine of the wrath of her fornication.",pt:"Um segundo anjo o seguiu, dizendo: Caiu, caiu a grande Babil\xf4nia, que a todas as na\xe7\xf5es deu a beber do vinho da ira da sua prostitui\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:9,en:"And the third angel followed them, saying with a loud voice, If any man worship the beast and his image, and receive his mark in his forehead, or in his hand,",pt:"Seguiu-os ainda um terceiro anjo, dizendo com grande voz: Se algu\xe9m adorar a besta, e a sua imagem, e receber o sinal na fronte, ou na m\xe3o,"},{verse:10,en:"The same shall drink of the wine of the wrath of God, which is poured out without mixture into the cup of his indignation; and he shall be tormented with fire and brimstone in the presence of the holy angels, and in the presence of the Lamb:",pt:"tamb\xe9m o tal beber\xe1 do vinho da ira de Deus, que se acha preparado sem mistura, no c\xe1lice da sua ira; e ser\xe1 atormentado com fogo e enxofre diante dos santos anjos e diante do Cordeiro."},{verse:11,en:"And the smoke of their torment ascendeth up for ever and ever: and they have no rest day nor night, who worship the beast and his image, and whosoever receiveth the mark of his name.",pt:"A fuma\xe7a do seu tormento sobe para todo o sempre; e n\xe3o t\xeam repouso nem de dia nem de noite os que adoram a besta e a sua imagem, nem aquele que recebe o sinal do seu nome."},{verse:12,en:"Here is the patience of the saints: here are they that keep the commandments of God, and the faith of Jesus.",pt:"Aqui est\xe1 a perseveran\xe7a dos santos, daqueles que guardam os mandamentos de Deus e a f\xe9 em Jesus."},{verse:13,en:"And I heard a voice from heaven saying unto me, Write, Blessed are the dead which die in the Lord from henceforth: Yea, saith the Spirit, that they may rest from their labours; and their works do follow them.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ouvi uma voz do c\xe9u, que dizia: Escreve: Bem-aventurados os mortos que desde agora morrem no Senhor. Sim, diz o Esp\xedrito, para que descansem dos seus trabalhos, pois as suas obras os acompanham."},{verse:14,en:"And I looked, and behold a white cloud, and upon the cloud one sat like unto the Son of man, having on his head a golden crown, and in his hand a sharp sickle.",pt:"E olhei, e eis uma nuvem branca, e assentado sobre a nuvem um semelhante a filho de homem, que tinha sobre a cabe\xe7a uma coroa de ouro, e na m\xe3o uma foice afiada."},{verse:15,en:"And another angel came out of the temple, crying with a loud voice to him that sat on the cloud, Thrust in thy sickle, and reap: for the time is come for thee to reap; for the harvest of the earth is ripe.",pt:"E outro anjo saiu do santu\xe1rio, clamando com grande voz ao que estava assentado sobre a nuvem: Lan\xe7a a tua foice e ceifa, porque \xe9 chegada a hora de ceifar, porque j\xe1 a seara da terra est\xe1 madura."},{verse:16,en:"And he that sat on the cloud thrust in his sickle on the earth; and the earth was reaped.",pt:"Ent\xe3o aquele que estava assentado sobre a nuvem meteu a sua foice \xe0 terra, e a terra foi ceifada."},{verse:17,en:"And another angel came out of the temple which is in heaven, he also having a sharp sickle.",pt:"Ainda outro anjo saiu do santu\xe1rio que est\xe1 no c\xe9u, o qual tamb\xe9m tinha uma foice afiada."},{verse:18,en:"And another angel came out from the altar, which had power over fire; and cried with a loud cry to him that had the sharp sickle, saying, Thrust in thy sharp sickle, and gather the clusters of the vine of the earth; for her grapes are fully ripe.",pt:"E saiu do altar outro anjo, que tinha poder sobre o fogo, e clamou com grande voz ao que tinha a foice afiada, dizendo: Lan\xe7a a tua foice afiada, e vindima os cachos da vinha da terra, porque j\xe1 as suas uvas est\xe3o maduras."},{verse:19,en:"And the angel thrust in his sickle into the earth, and gathered the vine of the earth, and cast it into the great winepress of the wrath of God.",pt:"E o anjo meteu a sua foice \xe0 terra, e vindimou as uvas da vinha da terra, e lan\xe7ou-as no grande lagar da ira de Deus."},{verse:20,en:"And the winepress was trodden without the city, and blood came out of the winepress, even unto the horse bridles, by the space of a thousand and six hundred furlongs.",pt:"E o lagar foi pisado fora da cidade, e saiu sangue do lagar at\xe9 os freios dos cavalos, pelo espa\xe7o de mil e seiscentos est\xe1dios."}]}}),853,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And I saw another sign in heaven, great and marvellous, seven angels having the seven last plagues; for in them is filled up the wrath of God.",pt:"Vi no c\xe9u ainda outro sinal, grande e admir\xe1vel: sete anjos, que tinham as sete \xfaltimas pragas; porque nelas \xe9 consumada a ira de Deus."},{verse:2,en:"And I saw as it were a sea of glass mingled with fire: and them that had gotten the victory over the beast, and over his image, and over his mark, and over the number of his name, stand on the sea of glass, having the harps of God.",pt:"E vi como que um mar de vidro misturado com fogo; e os que tinham vencido a besta e a sua imagem e o n\xfamero do seu nome estavam em p\xe9 junto ao mar de vidro, e tinham harpas de Deus."},{verse:3,en:"And they sing the song of Moses the servant of God, and the song of the Lamb, saying, Great and marvellous are thy works, Lord God Almighty; just and true are thy ways, thou King of saints.",pt:"E cantavam o c\xe2ntico de Mois\xe9s, servo de Deus, e o c\xe2ntico do Cordeiro, dizendo: Grandes e admir\xe1veis s\xe3o as tuas obras, \xf3 Senhor Deus Todo-Poderoso; justos e verdadeiros s\xe3o os teus caminhos, \xf3 Rei dos s\xe9culos."},{verse:4,en:"Who shall not fear thee, O Lord, and glorify thy name? for thou only art holy: for all nations shall come and worship before thee; for thy judgments are made manifest.",pt:"Quem n\xe3o te temer\xe1, Senhor, e n\xe3o glorificar\xe1 o teu nome? Pois s\xf3 tu \xe9s santo; por isso todas as na\xe7\xf5es vir\xe3o e se prostrar\xe3o diante de ti, porque os teus ju\xedzos s\xe3o manifestos."},{verse:5,en:"And after that I looked, and, behold, the temple of the tabernacle of the testimony in heaven was opened:",pt:"Depois disto olhei, e abriu-se o santu\xe1rio do tabern\xe1culo do testemunho no c\xe9u;"},{verse:6,en:"And the seven angels came out of the temple, having the seven plagues, clothed in pure and white linen, and having their breasts girded with golden girdles.",pt:"e sa\xedram do santu\xe1rio os sete anjos que tinham as sete pragas, vestidos de linho puro e resplandecente, e cingidos, \xe0 altura do peito com cintos de ouro."},{verse:7,en:"And one of the four beasts gave unto the seven angels seven golden vials full of the wrath of God, who liveth for ever and ever.",pt:"Um dos quatro seres viventes deu aos sete anjos sete ta\xe7as de ouro, cheias da ira do Deus que vive pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos."},{verse:8,en:"And the temple was filled with smoke from the glory of God, and from his power; and no man was able to enter into the temple, till the seven plagues of the seven angels were fulfilled.",pt:"E o santu\xe1rio se encheu de fuma\xe7a pela gl\xf3ria de Deus e pelo seu poder; e ningu\xe9m podia entrar no santu\xe1rio, enquanto n\xe3o se consumassem as sete pragas dos sete anjos."}]}}),854,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And I heard a great voice out of the temple saying to the seven angels, Go your ways, and pour out the vials of the wrath of God upon the earth.",pt:"E ouvi, vinda do santu\xe1rio, uma grande voz, que dizia aos sete anjos: Ide e derramai sobre a terra as sete ta\xe7as, da ira de Deus."},{verse:2,en:"And the first went, and poured out his vial upon the earth; and there fell a noisome and grievous sore upon the men which had the mark of the beast, and upon them which worshipped his image.",pt:"Ent\xe3o foi o primeiro e derramou a sua ta\xe7a sobre a terra; e apareceu uma chaga ruim e maligna nos homens que tinham o sinal da besta e que adoravam a sua imagem."},{verse:3,en:"And the second angel poured out his vial upon the sea; and it became as the blood of a dead man: and every living soul died in the sea.",pt:"O segundo anjo derramou a sua ta\xe7a no mar, que se tornou em sangue como de um morto, e morreu todo ser vivente que estava no mar."},{verse:4,en:"And the third angel poured out his vial upon the rivers and fountains of waters; and they became blood.",pt:"O terceiro anjo derramou a sua ta\xe7a nos rios e nas fontes das \xe1guas, e se tornaram em sangue."},{verse:5,en:"And I heard the angel of the waters say, Thou art righteous, O Lord, which art, and wast, and shalt be, because thou hast judged thus.",pt:"E ouvi o anjo das \xe1guas dizer: Justo \xe9s tu, que \xe9s e que eras, o Santo; porque julgaste estas coisas;"},{verse:6,en:"For they have shed the blood of saints and prophets, and thou hast given them blood to drink; for they are worthy.",pt:"porque derramaram o sangue de santos e de profetas, e tu lhes tens dado sangue a beber; eles o merecem."},{verse:7,en:"And I heard another out of the altar say, Even so, Lord God Almighty, true and righteous are thy judgments.",pt:"E ouvi uma voz do altar, que dizia: Na verdade, \xf3 Senhor Deus Todo-Poderoso, verdadeiros e justos s\xe3o os teus ju\xedzos."},{verse:8,en:"And the fourth angel poured out his vial upon the sun; and power was given unto him to scorch men with fire.",pt:"O quarto anjo derramou a sua ta\xe7a sobre o sol, e foi-lhe permitido que abrasasse os homens com fogo."},{verse:9,en:"And men were scorched with great heat, and blasphemed the name of God, which hath power over these plagues: and they repented not to give him glory.",pt:"E os homens foram abrasados com grande calor; e blasfemaram o nome de Deus, que tem poder sobre estas pragas; e n\xe3o se arrependeram para lhe darem gl\xf3ria."},{verse:10,en:"And the fifth angel poured out his vial upon the seat of the beast; and his kingdom was full of darkness; and they gnawed their tongues for pain,",pt:"O quinto anjo derramou a sua ta\xe7a sobre o trono da besta, e o seu reino se fez tenebroso; e os homens mordiam de dor as suas l\xednguas."},{verse:11,en:"And blasphemed the God of heaven because of their pains and their sores, and repented not of their deeds.",pt:"E por causa das suas dores, e por causa das suas chagas, blasfemaram o Deus do c\xe9u; e n\xe3o se arrependeram das suas obras."},{verse:12,en:"And the sixth angel poured out his vial upon the great river Euphrates; and the water thereof was dried up, that the way of the kings of the east might be prepared.",pt:"O sexto anjo derramou a sua ta\xe7a sobre o grande rio Eufrates; e a sua \xe1gua secou-se, para que se preparasse o caminho dos reis que v\xeam do oriente."},{verse:13,en:"And I saw three unclean spirits like frogs come out of the mouth of the dragon, and out of the mouth of the beast, and out of the mouth of the false prophet.",pt:"E da boca do drag\xe3o, e da boca da besta, e da boca do falso profeta, vi sa\xedrem tr\xeas esp\xedritos imundos, semelhantes a r\xe3s."},{verse:14,en:"For they are the spirits of devils, working miracles, which go forth unto the kings of the earth and of the whole world, to gather them to the battle of that great day of God Almighty.",pt:"Pois s\xe3o esp\xedritos de dem\xf4nios, que operam sinais; os quais v\xe3o ao encontro dos reis de todo o mundo, para os congregar para a batalha do grande dia do Deus Todo-Poderoso."},{verse:15,en:"Behold, I come as a thief. Blessed is he that watcheth, and keepeth his garments, lest he walk naked, and they see his shame.",pt:"(Eis que venho como ladr\xe3o. Bem-aventurado aquele que vigia, e guarda as suas vestes, para que n\xe3o ande nu, e n\xe3o se veja a sua nudez.)"},{verse:16,en:"And he gathered them together into a place called in the Hebrew tongue Armageddon.",pt:"E eles os congregaram no lugar que em hebraico se chama Armagedom."},{verse:17,en:"And the seventh angel poured out his vial into the air; and there came a great voice out of the temple of heaven, from the throne, saying, It is done.",pt:"O s\xe9timo anjo derramou a sua ta\xe7a no ar; e saiu uma grande voz do santu\xe1rio, da parte do trono, dizendo: Est\xe1 feito."},{verse:18,en:"And there were voices, and thunders, and lightnings; and there was a great earthquake, such as was not since men were upon the earth, so mighty an earthquake, and so great.",pt:"E houve rel\xe2mpagos e vozes e trov\xf5es; houve tamb\xe9m um grande terremoto, qual nunca houvera desde que h\xe1 homens sobre a terra, terremoto t\xe3o forte qu\xe3o grande;"},{verse:19,en:"And the great city was divided into three parts, and the cities of the nations fell: and great Babylon came in remembrance before God, to give unto her the cup of the wine of the fierceness of his wrath.",pt:"e a grande cidade fendeu-se em tr\xeas partes, e as cidades das na\xe7\xf5es ca\xedram; e Deus lembrou-se da grande Babil\xf4nia, para lhe dar o c\xe1lice do vinho do furor da sua ira."},{verse:20,en:"And every island fled away, and the mountains were not found.",pt:"Todas ilhas fugiram, e os montes n\xe3o mais se acharam."},{verse:21,en:"And there fell upon men a great hail out of heaven, every stone about the weight of a talent: and men blasphemed God because of the plague of the hail; for the plague thereof was exceeding great.",pt:"E sobre os homens caiu do c\xe9u uma grande saraivada, pedras quase do peso de um talento; e os homens blasfemaram de Deus por causa da praga da saraivada; porque a sua praga era mui grande."}]}}),855,[]);
__d((function(e,a,t,s,o,n,r){o.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:17,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And there came one of the seven angels which had the seven vials, and talked with me, saying unto me, Come hither; I will shew unto thee the judgment of the great whore that sitteth upon many waters:",pt:"Veio um dos sete anjos que tinham as sete ta\xe7as, e falou comigo, dizendo: Vem, mostrar-te-ei a condena\xe7\xe3o da grande prostituta que est\xe1 assentada sobre muitas \xe1guas;"},{verse:2,en:"With whom the kings of the earth have committed fornication, and the inhabitants of the earth have been made drunk with the wine of her fornication.",pt:"com a qual se prostitu\xedram os reis da terra; e os que habitam sobre a terra se embriagaram com o vinho da sua prostitui\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"So he carried me away in the spirit into the wilderness: and I saw a woman sit upon a scarlet coloured beast, full of names of blasphemy, having seven heads and ten horns.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele me levou em esp\xedrito a um deserto; e vi uma mulher montada numa besta cor de escarlata, que estava cheia de nomes de blasf\xeamia, e que tinha sete cabe\xe7as e dez chifres."},{verse:4,en:"And the woman was arrayed in purple and scarlet colour, and decked with gold and precious stones and pearls, having a golden cup in her hand full of abominations and filthiness of her fornication:",pt:"A mulher estava vestida de p\xfarpura e de escarlata, e adornada de ouro, pedras preciosas e p\xe9rolas; e tinha na m\xe3o um c\xe1lice de ouro, cheio das abomina\xe7\xf5es, e da imund\xedcia da prostitui\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:5,en:"And upon her forehead was a name written, MYSTERY, BABYLON THE GREAT, THE MOTHER OF HARLOTS AND ABOMINATIONS OF THE EARTH.",pt:"e na sua fronte estava escrito um nome simb\xf3lico: A grande Babil\xf4nia, a m\xe3e das prostitui\xe7\xf5es e das abomina\xe7\xf5es da terra."},{verse:6,en:"And I saw the woman drunken with the blood of the saints, and with the blood of the martyrs of Jesus: and when I saw her, I wondered with great admiration.",pt:"E vi que a mulher estava embriagada com o sangue dos santos e com o sangue dos m\xe1rtires de Jesus. Quando a vi, maravilhei-me com grande admira\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:7,en:"And the angel said unto me, Wherefore didst thou marvel? I will tell thee the mystery of the woman, and of the beast that carrieth her, which hath the seven heads and ten horns.",pt:"Ao que o anjo me disse: Por que te admiraste? Eu te direi o mist\xe9rio da mulher, e da besta que a leva, a qual tem sete cabe\xe7as e dez chifres."},{verse:8,en:"The beast that thou sawest was, and is not; and shall ascend out of the bottomless pit, and go into perdition: and they that dwell on the earth shall wonder, whose names were not written in the book of life from the foundation of the world, when they behold the beast that was, and is not, and yet is.",pt:"A besta que viste era e j\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9; todavia est\xe1 para subir do abismo, e vai-se para a perdi\xe7\xe3o; e os que habitam sobre a terra e cujos nomes n\xe3o est\xe3o escritos no livro da vida desde a funda\xe7\xe3o do mundo se admirar\xe3o, quando virem a besta que era e j\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9, e que tornar\xe1 a vir."},{verse:9,en:"And here is the mind which hath wisdom. The seven heads are seven mountains, on which the woman sitteth.",pt:"Aqui est\xe1 a mente que tem sabedoria. As sete cabe\xe7as s\xe3o sete montes, sobre os quais a mulher est\xe1 assentada;"},{verse:10,en:"And there are seven kings: five are fallen, and one is, and the other is not yet come; and when he cometh, he must continue a short space.",pt:"s\xe3o tamb\xe9m sete reis: cinco j\xe1 ca\xedram; um existe; e o outro ainda n\xe3o \xe9 vindo; e quando vier, deve permanecer pouco tempo."},{verse:11,en:"And the beast that was, and is not, even he is the eighth, and is of the seven, and goeth into perdition.",pt:"A besta que era e j\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9, \xe9 tamb\xe9m o oitavo rei, e \xe9 dos sete, e vai-se para a perdi\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"And the ten horns which thou sawest are ten kings, which have received no kingdom as yet; but receive power as kings one hour with the beast.",pt:"Os dez chifres que viste s\xe3o dez reis, os quais ainda n\xe3o receberam o reino, mas receber\xe3o autoridade, como reis, por uma hora, juntamente com a besta."},{verse:13,en:"These have one mind, and shall give their power and strength unto the beast.",pt:"Estes t\xeam um mesmo intento, e entregar\xe3o o seu poder e autoridade \xe0 besta."},{verse:14,en:"These shall make war with the Lamb, and the Lamb shall overcome them: for he is Lord of lords, and King of kings: and they that are with him are called, and chosen, and faithful.",pt:"Estes combater\xe3o contra o Cordeiro, e o Cordeiro os vencer\xe1, porque \xe9 o Senhor dos senhores e o Rei dos reis; vencer\xe3o tamb\xe9m os que est\xe3o com ele, os chamados, e eleitos, e fi\xe9is."},{verse:15,en:"And he saith unto me, The waters which thou sawest, where the whore sitteth, are peoples, and multitudes, and nations, and tongues.",pt:"Disse-me ainda: As \xe1guas que viste, onde se assenta a prostituta, s\xe3o povos, multid\xf5es, na\xe7\xf5es e l\xednguas."},{verse:16,en:"And the ten horns which thou sawest upon the beast, these shall hate the whore, and shall make her desolate and naked, and shall eat her flesh, and burn her with fire.",pt:"E os dez chifres que viste, e a besta, estes odiar\xe3o a prostituta e a tornar\xe3o desolada e nua, e comer\xe3o as suas carnes, e a queimar\xe3o no fogo."},{verse:17,en:"For God hath put in their hearts to fulfil his will, and to agree, and give their kingdom unto the beast, until the words of God shall be fulfilled.",pt:"Porque Deus lhes p\xf4s nos cora\xe7\xf5es o executarem o intento dele, chegarem a um acordo, e entregarem \xe0 besta o seu reino, at\xe9 que se cumpram as palavras de Deus."},{verse:18,en:"And the woman which thou sawest is that great city, which reigneth over the kings of the earth.",pt:"E a mulher que viste \xe9 a grande cidade que reina sobre os reis da terra."}]}}),856,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,r,n,s,t){n.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:18,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And after these things I saw another angel come down from heaven, having great power; and the earth was lightened with his glory.",pt:"Depois destas coisas vi descer do c\xe9u outro anjo que tinha grande autoridade, e a terra foi iluminada com a sua gl\xf3ria."},{verse:2,en:"And he cried mightily with a strong voice, saying, Babylon the great is fallen, is fallen, and is become the habitation of devils, and the hold of every foul spirit, and a cage of every unclean and hateful bird.",pt:"E ele clamou com voz forte, dizendo: Caiu, caiu a grande Babil\xf4nia, e se tornou morada de dem\xf4nios, e guarida de todo esp\xedrito imundo, e guarida de toda ave imunda e detest\xe1vel."},{verse:3,en:"For all nations have drunk of the wine of the wrath of her fornication, and the kings of the earth have committed fornication with her, and the merchants of the earth are waxed rich through the abundance of her delicacies.",pt:"Porque todas as na\xe7\xf5es t\xeam bebido do vinho da ira da sua prostitui\xe7\xe3o, e os reis da terra se prostitu\xedram com ela; e os mercadores da terra se enriqueceram com a abund\xe2ncia de suas del\xedcias."},{verse:4,en:"And I heard another voice from heaven, saying, Come out of her, my people, that ye be not partakers of her sins, and that ye receive not of her plagues.",pt:"Ouvi outra voz do c\xe9u dizer: Sai dela, povo meu, para que n\xe3o sejas participante dos sete pecados, e para que n\xe3o incorras nas suas pragas."},{verse:5,en:"For her sins have reached unto heaven, and God hath remembered her iniquities.",pt:"Porque os seus pecados se acumularam at\xe9 o c\xe9u, e Deus se lembrou das iniq\xfcidades dela."},{verse:6,en:"Reward her even as she rewarded you, and double unto her double according to her works: in the cup which she hath filled fill to her double.",pt:"Tornai a dar-lhe como tamb\xe9m ela vos tem dado, e retribu\xed-lhe em dobro conforme as suas obras; no c\xe1lice em que vos deu de beber dai-lhe a ela em dobro."},{verse:7,en:"How much she hath glorified herself, and lived deliciously, so much torment and sorrow give her: for she saith in her heart, I sit a queen, and am no widow, and shall see no sorrow.",pt:"Quanto ela se glorificou, e em del\xedcias esteve, tanto lhe dai de tormento e de pranto; pois que ela diz em seu cora\xe7\xe3o: Estou assentada como rainha, e n\xe3o sou vi\xfava, e de modo algum verei o pranto."},{verse:8,en:"Therefore shall her plagues come in one day, death, and mourning, and famine; and she shall be utterly burned with fire: for strong is the Lord God who judgeth her.",pt:"Por isso, num mesmo dia vir\xe3o as suas pragas, a morte, e o pranto, e a fome; e ser\xe1 consumida no fogo; porque forte \xe9 o Senhor Deus que a julga."},{verse:9,en:"And the kings of the earth, who have committed fornication and lived deliciously with her, shall bewail her, and lament for her, when they shall see the smoke of her burning,",pt:"E os reis da terra, que com ela se prostitu\xedram e viveram em del\xedcias, sobre ela chorar\xe3o e prantear\xe3o, quando virem a fuma\xe7a do seu inc\xeandio;"},{verse:10,en:"Standing afar off for the fear of her torment, saying, Alas, alas, that great city Babylon, that mighty city! for in one hour is thy judgment come.",pt:"e, estando de longe por medo do tormento dela, dir\xe3o: Ai! ai da grande cidade, Babil\xf4nia, a cidade forte! pois numa s\xf3 hora veio o teu julgamento."},{verse:11,en:"And the merchants of the earth shall weep and mourn over her; for no man buyeth their merchandise any more:",pt:"E sobre ela choram e lamentam os mercadores da terra; porque ningu\xe9m compra mais as suas mercadorias:"},{verse:12,en:"The merchandise of gold, and silver, and precious stones, and of pearls, and fine linen, and purple, and silk, and scarlet, and all thyine wood, and all manner vessels of ivory, and all manner vessels of most precious wood, and of brass, and iron, and marble,",pt:"mercadorias de ouro, de prata, de pedras preciosas, de p\xe9rolas, de linho fino, de p\xfarpura, de seda e de escarlata; e toda esp\xe9cie de madeira odor\xedfera, e todo objeto de marfim, de madeira precios\xedssima, de bronze, de ferro e de m\xe1rmore;"},{verse:13,en:"And cinnamon, and odours, and ointments, and frankincense, and wine, and oil, and fine flour, and wheat, and beasts, and sheep, and horses, and chariots, and slaves, and souls of men.",pt:"e canela, especiarias, perfume, mirra e incenso; e vinho, azeite, flor de farinha e trigo; e gado, ovelhas, cavalos e carros; e escravos, e at\xe9 almas de homens."},{verse:14,en:"And the fruits that thy soul lusted after are departed from thee, and all things which were dainty and goodly are departed from thee, and thou shalt find them no more at all.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m os frutos que a tua alma cobi\xe7ava foram-se de ti; e todas as coisas delicadas e suntuosas se foram de ti, e nunca mais se achar\xe3o."},{verse:15,en:"The merchants of these things, which were made rich by her, shall stand afar off for the fear of her torment, weeping and wailing,",pt:"Os mercadores destas coisas, que por ela se enriqueceram, ficar\xe3o de longe por medo do tormento dela, chorando e lamentando,"},{verse:16,en:"And saying, Alas, alas, that great city, that was clothed in fine linen, and purple, and scarlet, and decked with gold, and precious stones, and pearls!",pt:"dizendo: Ai! ai da grande cidade, da que estava vestida de linho fino, de p\xfarpura, de escarlata, e adornada com ouro, e pedras preciosas, e p\xe9rolas! porque numa s\xf3 hora foram assoladas tantas riquezas."},{verse:17,en:"For in one hour so great riches is come to nought. And every shipmaster, and all the company in ships, and sailors, and as many as trade by sea, stood afar off,",pt:"E todo piloto, e todo o que navega para qualquer porto e todos os marinheiros, e todos os que trabalham no mar se puseram de longe;"},{verse:18,en:"And cried when they saw the smoke of her burning, saying, What city is like unto this great city!",pt:"e, contemplando a fuma\xe7a do inc\xeandio dela, clamavam: Que cidade \xe9 semelhante a esta grande cidade?"},{verse:19,en:"And they cast dust on their heads, and cried, weeping and wailing, saying, Alas, alas, that great city, wherein were made rich all that had ships in the sea by reason of her costliness! for in one hour is she made desolate.",pt:"E lan\xe7aram p\xf3 sobre as suas cabe\xe7as, e clamavam, chorando e lamentando, dizendo: Ai! ai da grande cidade, na qual todos os que tinham naus no mar se enriqueceram em raz\xe3o da sua opul\xeancia! porque numa s\xf3 hora foi assolada."},{verse:20,en:"Rejoice over her, thou heaven, and ye holy apostles and prophets; for God hath avenged you on her.",pt:"Exulta sobre ela, \xf3 c\xe9u, e v\xf3s, santos e ap\xf3stolos e profetas; porque Deus vindicou a vossa causa contra ela."},{verse:21,en:"And a mighty angel took up a stone like a great millstone, and cast it into the sea, saying, Thus with violence shall that great city Babylon be thrown down, and shall be found no more at all.",pt:"Um forte anjo levantou uma pedra, qual uma grande m\xf3, e lan\xe7ou-a no mar, dizendo: Com igual \xedmpeto ser\xe1 lan\xe7ada Babil\xf4nia, a grande cidade, e nunca mais ser\xe1 achada."},{verse:22,en:"And the voice of harpers, and musicians, and of pipers, and trumpeters, shall be heard no more at all in thee; and no craftsman, of whatsoever craft he be, shall be found any more in thee; and the sound of a millstone shall be heard no more at all in thee;",pt:"E em ti n\xe3o se ouvir\xe1 mais o som de harpistas, de m\xfasicos, de flautistas e de trombeteiros; e nenhum art\xedfice de arte alguma se achar\xe1 mais em ti; e em ti n\xe3o mais se ouvir\xe1 ru\xeddo de m\xf3;"},{verse:23,en:"And the light of a candle shall shine no more at all in thee; and the voice of the bridegroom and of the bride shall be heard no more at all in thee: for thy merchants were the great men of the earth; for by thy sorceries were all nations deceived.",pt:"e luz de candeia n\xe3o mais brilhar\xe1 em ti, e voz de noivo e de noiva n\xe3o mais em ti se ouvir\xe1; porque os teus mercadores eram os grandes da terra; porque todas as na\xe7\xf5es foram enganadas pelas tuas feiti\xe7arias."},{verse:24,en:"And in her was found the blood of prophets, and of saints, and of all that were slain upon the earth.",pt:"E nela se achou o sangue dos profetas, e dos santos, e de todos os que foram mortos na terra."}]}}),857,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:19,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And after these things I heard a great voice of much people in heaven, saying, Alleluia; Salvation, and glory, and honour, and power, unto the Lord our God:",pt:"Depois destas coisas, ouvi no c\xe9u como que uma grande voz de uma imensa multid\xe3o, que dizia: Aleluia! A salva\xe7\xe3o e a gl\xf3ria e o poder pertencem ao nosso Deus;"},{verse:2,en:"For true and righteous are his judgments: for he hath judged the great whore, which did corrupt the earth with her fornication, and hath avenged the blood of his servants at her hand.",pt:"porque verdadeiros e justos s\xe3o os seus ju\xedzos, pois julgou a grande prostituta, que havia corrompido a terra com a sua prostitui\xe7\xe3o, e das m\xe3os dela vingou o sangue dos seus servos."},{verse:3,en:"And again they said, Alleluia. And her smoke rose up for ever and ever.",pt:"E outra vez disseram: Aleluia. E a fuma\xe7a dela sobe pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos."},{verse:4,en:"And the four and twenty elders and the four beasts fell down and worshipped God that sat on the throne, saying, Amen; Alleluia.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os vinte e quatro anci\xe3os e os quatro seres viventes prostraram-se e adoraram a Deus que est\xe1 assentado no trono, dizendo: Am\xe9m. Aleluia!"},{verse:5,en:"And a voice came out of the throne, saying, Praise our God, all ye his servants, and ye that fear him, both small and great.",pt:"E saiu do trono uma voz, dizendo: Louvai o nosso Deus, v\xf3s, todos os seus servos, e v\xf3s que o temeis, assim pequenos como grandes."},{verse:6,en:"And I heard as it were the voice of a great multitude, and as the voice of many waters, and as the voice of mighty thunderings, saying, Alleluia: for the Lord God omnipotent reigneth.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m ouvi uma voz como a de grande multid\xe3o, como a voz de muitas \xe1guas, e como a voz de fortes trov\xf5es, que dizia: Aleluia! porque j\xe1 reina o Senhor nosso Deus, o Todo-Poderoso."},{verse:7,en:"Let us be glad and rejoice, and give honour to him: for the marriage of the Lamb is come, and his wife hath made herself ready.",pt:"Regozijemo-nos, e exultemos, e demos-lhe a gl\xf3ria; porque s\xe3o chegadas as bodas do Cordeiro, e j\xe1 a sua noiva se preparou,"},{verse:8,en:"And to her was granted that she should be arrayed in fine linen, clean and white: for the fine linen is the righteousness of saints.",pt:"e foi-lhe permitido vestir-se de linho fino, resplandecente e puro; pois o linho fino s\xe3o as obras justas dos santos."},{verse:9,en:"And he saith unto me, Write, Blessed are they which are called unto the marriage supper of the Lamb. And he saith unto me, These are the true sayings of God.",pt:"E disse-me: Escreve: Bem-aventurados aqueles que s\xe3o chamados \xe0 ceia das bodas do Cordeiro. Disse-me ainda: Estas s\xe3o as verdadeiras palavras de Deus."},{verse:10,en:"And I fell at his feet to worship him. And he said unto me, See thou do it not: I am thy fellowservant, and of thy brethren that have the testimony of Jesus: worship God: for the testimony of Jesus is the spirit of prophecy.",pt:"Ent\xe3o me lancei a seus p\xe9s para ador\xe1-lo, mas ele me disse: Olha, n\xe3o fa\xe7as tal: sou conservo teu e de teus irm\xe3os, que t\xeam o testemunho de Jesus; adora a Deus; pois o testemunho de Jesus \xe9 o esp\xedrito da profecia."},{verse:11,en:"And I saw heaven opened, and behold a white horse; and he that sat upon him was called Faithful and True, and in righteousness he doth judge and make war.",pt:"E vi o c\xe9u aberto, e eis um cavalo branco; e o que estava montado nele chama-se Fiel e Verdadeiro; e julga a peleja com justi\xe7a."},{verse:12,en:"His eyes were as a flame of fire, and on his head were many crowns; and he had a name written, that no man knew, but he himself.",pt:"Os seus olhos eram como chama de fogo; sobre a sua cabe\xe7a havia muitos diademas; e tinha um nome escrito, que ningu\xe9m sabia sabia sen\xe3o ele mesmo."},{verse:13,en:"And he was clothed with a vesture dipped in blood: and his name is called The Word of God.",pt:"Estava vestido de um manto salpicado de sangue; e o nome pelo qual se chama \xe9 o Verbo de Deus."},{verse:14,en:"And the armies which were in heaven followed him upon white horses, clothed in fine linen, white and clean.",pt:"Seguiam-no os ex\xe9rcitos que est\xe3o no c\xe9u, em cavalos brancos, e vestidos de linho fino, branco e puro."},{verse:15,en:"And out of his mouth goeth a sharp sword, that with it he should smite the nations: and he shall rule them with a rod of iron: and he treadeth the winepress of the fierceness and wrath of Almighty God.",pt:"Da sua boca sa\xeda uma espada afiada, para ferir com ela as na\xe7\xf5es; ele as reger\xe1 com vara de ferro; e ele mesmo \xe9 o que pisa o lagar do vinho do furor da ira do Deus Todo-Poderoso."},{verse:16,en:"And he hath on his vesture and on his thigh a name written, KING OF KINGS, AND LORD OF LORDS.",pt:"No manto, sobre a sua coxa tem escrito o nome: Rei dos reis e Senhor dos senhores."},{verse:17,en:"And I saw an angel standing in the sun; and he cried with a loud voice, saying to all the fowls that fly in the midst of heaven, Come and gather yourselves together unto the supper of the great God;",pt:"E vi um anjo em p\xe9 no sol; e clamou com grande voz, dizendo a todas as aves que voavam pelo meio do c\xe9u: Vinde, ajuntai-vos para a grande ceia de Deus,"},{verse:18,en:"That ye may eat the flesh of kings, and the flesh of captains, and the flesh of mighty men, and the flesh of horses, and of them that sit on them, and the flesh of all men, both free and bond, both small and great.",pt:"para comerdes carnes de reis, carnes de comandantes, carnes de poderosos, carnes de cavalos e dos que neles montavam, sim, carnes de todos os homens, livres e escravos, pequenos e grandes."},{verse:19,en:"And I saw the beast, and the kings of the earth, and their armies, gathered together to make war against him that sat on the horse, and against his army.",pt:"E vi a besta, e os reis da terra, e os seus ex\xe9rcitos reunidos para fazerem guerra \xe0quele que estava montado no cavalo, e ao seu ex\xe9rcito."},{verse:20,en:"And the beast was taken, and with him the false prophet that wrought miracles before him, with which he deceived them that had received the mark of the beast, and them that worshipped his image. These both were cast alive into a lake of fire burning with brimstone.",pt:"E a besta foi presa, e com ela o falso profeta que fizera diante dela os sinais com que enganou os que receberam o sinal da besta e os que adoraram a sua imagem. Estes dois foram lan\xe7ados vivos no lago de fogo que arde com enxofre."},{verse:21,en:"And the remnant were slain with the sword of him that sat upon the horse, which sword proceeded out of his mouth: and all the fowls were filled with their flesh.",pt:"E os demais foram mortos pela espada que sa\xeda da boca daquele que estava montado no cavalo; e todas as aves se fartaram das carnes deles."}]}}),858,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:20,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And I saw an angel come down from heaven, having the key of the bottomless pit and a great chain in his hand.",pt:"E vi descer do c\xe9u um anjo, que tinha a chave do abismo e uma grande cadeia na sua m\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"And he laid hold on the dragon, that old serpent, which is the Devil, and Satan, and bound him a thousand years,",pt:"Ele prendeu o drag\xe3o, a antiga serpente, que \xe9 o Diabo e Satan\xe1s, e o amarrou por mil anos."},{verse:3,en:"And cast him into the bottomless pit, and shut him up, and set a seal upon him, that he should deceive the nations no more, till the thousand years should be fulfilled: and after that he must be loosed a little season.",pt:"Lan\xe7ou-o no abismo, o qual fechou e selou sobre ele, para que n\xe3o enganasse mais as na\xe7\xf5es at\xe9 que os mil anos se completassem. Depois disto \xe9 necess\xe1rio que ele seja solto por um pouco de tempo."},{verse:4,en:"And I saw thrones, and they sat upon them, and judgment was given unto them: and I saw the souls of them that were beheaded for the witness of Jesus, and for the word of God, and which had not worshipped the beast, neither his image, neither had received his mark upon their foreheads, or in their hands; and they lived and reigned with Christ a thousand years.",pt:"Ent\xe3o vi uns tronos; e aos que se assentaram sobre eles foi dado o poder de julgar; e vi as almas daqueles que foram degolados por causa do testemunho de Jesus e da palavra de Deus, e que n\xe3o adoraram a besta nem a sua imagem, e n\xe3o receberam o sinal na fronte nem nas m\xe3os; e reviveram, e reinaram com Cristo durante mil anos."},{verse:5,en:"But the rest of the dead lived not again until the thousand years were finished. This is the first resurrection.",pt:"Mas os outros mortos n\xe3o reviveram, at\xe9 que os mil anos se completassem. Esta \xe9 a primeira ressurrei\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:6,en:"Blessed and holy is he that hath part in the first resurrection: on such the second death hath no power, but they shall be priests of God and of Christ, and shall reign with him a thousand years.",pt:"Bem-aventurado e santo \xe9 aquele que tem parte na primeira ressurrei\xe7\xe3o; sobre estes n\xe3o tem poder a segunda morte; mas ser\xe3o sacerdotes de Deus e de Cristo, e reinar\xe3o com ele durante os mil anos."},{verse:7,en:"And when the thousand years are expired, Satan shall be loosed out of his prison,",pt:"Ora, quando se completarem os mil anos, Satan\xe1s ser\xe1 solto da sua pris\xe3o,"},{verse:8,en:"And shall go out to deceive the nations which are in the four quarters of the earth, Gog and Magog, to gather them together to battle: the number of whom is as the sand of the sea.",pt:"e sair\xe1 a enganar as na\xe7\xf5es que est\xe3o nos quatro cantos da terra, Gogue e Magogue, cujo n\xfamero \xe9 como a areia do mar, a fim de ajunt\xe1-las para a batalha."},{verse:9,en:"And they went up on the breadth of the earth, and compassed the camp of the saints about, and the beloved city: and fire came down from God out of heaven, and devoured them.",pt:"E subiram sobre a largura da terra, e cercaram o arraial dos santos e a cidade querida; mas desceu fogo do c\xe9u, e os devorou;"},{verse:10,en:"And the devil that deceived them was cast into the lake of fire and brimstone, where the beast and the false prophet are, and shall be tormented day and night for ever and ever.",pt:"e o Diabo, que os enganava, foi lan\xe7ado no lago de fogo e enxofre, onde est\xe3o a besta e o falso profeta; e de dia e de noite ser\xe3o atormentados pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos."},{verse:11,en:"And I saw a great white throne, and him that sat on it, from whose face the earth and the heaven fled away; and there was found no place for them.",pt:"E vi um grande trono branco e o que estava assentado sobre ele, de cuja presen\xe7a fugiram a terra e o c\xe9u; e n\xe3o foi achado lugar para eles."},{verse:12,en:"And I saw the dead, small and great, stand before God; and the books were opened: and another book was opened, which is the book of life: and the dead were judged out of those things which were written in the books, according to their works.",pt:"E vi os mortos, grandes e pequenos, em p\xe9 diante do trono; e abriram-se uns livros; e abriu-se outro livro, que \xe9 o da vida; e os mortos foram julgados pelas coisas que estavam escritas nos livros, segundo as suas obras."},{verse:13,en:"And the sea gave up the dead which were in it; and death and hell delivered up the dead which were in them: and they were judged every man according to their works.",pt:"O mar entregou os mortos que nele havia; e a morte e o hades entregaram os mortos que neles havia; e foram julgados, cada um segundo as suas obras."},{verse:14,en:"And death and hell were cast into the lake of fire. This is the second death.",pt:"E a morte e o hades foram lan\xe7ados no lago de fogo. Esta \xe9 a segunda morte, o lago de fogo."},{verse:15,en:"And whosoever was not found written in the book of life was cast into the lake of fire.",pt:"E todo aquele que n\xe3o foi achado inscrito no livro da vida, foi lan\xe7ado no lago de fogo."}]}}),859,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:21,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And I saw a new heaven and a new earth: for the first heaven and the first earth were passed away; and there was no more sea.",pt:"E vi um novo c\xe9u e uma nova terra. Porque j\xe1 se foram o primeiro c\xe9u e a primeira terra, e o mar j\xe1 n\xe3o existe."},{verse:2,en:"And I John saw the holy city, new Jerusalem, coming down from God out of heaven, prepared as a bride adorned for her husband.",pt:"E vi a santa cidade, a nova Jerusal\xe9m, que descia do c\xe9u da parte de Deus, adere\xe7ada como uma noiva ataviada para o seu noivo."},{verse:3,en:"And I heard a great voice out of heaven saying, Behold, the tabernacle of God is with men, and he will dwell with them, and they shall be his people, and God himself shall be with them, and be their God.",pt:"E ouvi uma grande voz, vinda do trono, que dizia: Eis que o tabern\xe1culo de Deus est\xe1 com os homens, pois com eles habitar\xe1, e eles ser\xe3o o seu povo, e Deus mesmo estar\xe1 com eles."},{verse:4,en:"And God shall wipe away all tears from their eyes; and there shall be no more death, neither sorrow, nor crying, neither shall there be any more pain: for the former things are passed away.",pt:"Ele enxugar\xe1 de seus olhos toda l\xe1grima; e n\xe3o haver\xe1 mais morte, nem haver\xe1 mais pranto, nem lamento, nem dor; porque j\xe1 as primeiras coisas s\xe3o passadas."},{verse:5,en:"And he that sat upon the throne said, Behold, I make all things new. And he said unto me, Write: for these words are true and faithful.",pt:"E o que estava assentado sobre o trono disse: Eis que fa\xe7o novas todas as coisas. E acrescentou: Escreve; porque estas palavras s\xe3o fi\xe9is e verdadeiras."},{verse:6,en:"And he said unto me, It is done. I am Alpha and Omega, the beginning and the end. I will give unto him that is athirst of the fountain of the water of life freely.",pt:"Disse-me ainda: est\xe1 cumprido: Eu sou o Alfa e o \xe8mega, o princ\xedpio e o fim. A quem tiver sede, de gra\xe7a lhe darei a beber da fonte da \xe1gua da vida."},{verse:7,en:"He that overcometh shall inherit all things; and I will be his God, and he shall be my son.",pt:"Aquele que vencer herdar\xe1 estas coisas; e eu serei seu Deus, e ele ser\xe1 meu filho."},{verse:8,en:"But the fearful, and unbelieving, and the abominable, and murderers, and whoremongers, and sorcerers, and idolaters, and all liars, shall have their part in the lake which burneth with fire and brimstone: which is the second death.",pt:"Mas, quanto aos medrosos, e aos incr\xe9dulos, e aos abomin\xe1veis, e aos homicidas, e aos ad\xfalteros, e aos feiticeiros, e aos id\xf3latras, e a todos os mentirosos, a sua parte ser\xe1 no lago ardente de fogo e enxofre, que \xe9 a segunda morte."},{verse:9,en:"And there came unto me one of the seven angels which had the seven vials full of the seven last plagues, and talked with me, saying, Come hither, I will shew thee the bride, the Lamb\u2019s wife.",pt:"E veio um dos sete anjos que tinham as sete ta\xe7as cheias das sete \xfaltimas pragas, e falou comigo, dizendo: Vem, mostrar-te-ei a noiva, a esposa do Cordeiro."},{verse:10,en:"And he carried me away in the spirit to a great and high mountain, and shewed me that great city, the holy Jerusalem, descending out of heaven from God,",pt:"E levou-me em esp\xedrito a um grande e alto monte, e mostrou- me a santa cidade de Jerusal\xe9m, que descia do c\xe9u da parte de Deus,"},{verse:11,en:"Having the glory of God: and her light was like unto a stone most precious, even like a jasper stone, clear as crystal;",pt:"tendo a gl\xf3ria de Deus; e o seu brilho era semelhante a uma pedra precios\xedssima, como se fosse jaspe cristalino;"},{verse:12,en:"And had a wall great and high, and had twelve gates, and at the gates twelve angels, and names written thereon, which are the names of the twelve tribes of the children of Israel:",pt:"e tinha um grande e alto muro com doze portas, e nas portas doze anjos, e nomes escritos sobre elas, que s\xe3o os nomes das doze tribos dos filhos de Israel."},{verse:13,en:"On the east three gates; on the north three gates; on the south three gates; and on the west three gates.",pt:"Ao oriente havia tr\xeas portas, ao norte tr\xeas portas, ao sul tr\xeas portas, e ao ocidente tr\xeas portas."},{verse:14,en:"And the wall of the city had twelve foundations, and in them the names of the twelve apostles of the Lamb.",pt:"O muro da cidade tinha doze fundamentos, e neles estavam os nomes dos doze ap\xf3stolos do Cordeiro."},{verse:15,en:"And he that talked with me had a golden reed to measure the city, and the gates thereof, and the wall thereof.",pt:"E aquele que falava comigo tinha por medida uma cana de ouro, para medir a cidade, as suas portas e o seu muro."},{verse:16,en:"And the city lieth foursquare, and the length is as large as the breadth: and he measured the city with the reed, twelve thousand furlongs. The length and the breadth and the height of it are equal.",pt:"A cidade era quadrangular; e o seu comprimento era igual \xe0 sua largura. E mediu a cidade com a cana e tinha ela doze mil est\xe1dios; e o seu cumprimento, largura e altura eram iguais."},{verse:17,en:"And he measured the wall thereof, an hundred and forty and four cubits, according to the measure of a man, that is, of the angel.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m mediu o seu muro, e era de cento e quarenta e quatro c\xf4vados, segundo a medida de homem, isto \xe9, de anjo."},{verse:18,en:"And the building of the wall of it was of jasper: and the city was pure gold, like unto clear glass.",pt:"O muro era constru\xeddo de jaspe, e a cidade era de ouro puro, semelhante a vidro l\xedmpido."},{verse:19,en:"And the foundations of the wall of the city were garnished with all manner of precious stones. The first foundation was jasper; the second, sapphire; the third, a chalcedony; the fourth, an emerald;",pt:"Os fundamentos do muro da cidade estavam adornados de toda esp\xe9cie de pedras preciosas. O primeiro fundamento era de jaspe; o segundo, de safira; o terceiro, de calced\xf4nia; o quarto, de esmeralda;"},{verse:20,en:"The fifth, sardonyx; the sixth, sardius; the seventh, chrysolite; the eighth, beryl; the ninth, a topaz; the tenth, a chrysoprasus; the eleventh, a jacinth; the twelfth, an amethyst.",pt:"o quinto, de sard\xf4nica; o sexto, de s\xe1rdio; o s\xe9timo, de cris\xf3lito; o oitavo, de berilo; o nono, de top\xe1zio; o d\xe9cimo, de cris\xf3praso; o und\xe9cimo, de jacinto; o duod\xe9cimo, de ametista."},{verse:21,en:"And the twelve gates were twelve pearls; every several gate was of one pearl: and the street of the city was pure gold, as it were transparent glass.",pt:"As doze portas eram doze p\xe9rolas: cada uma das portas era de uma s\xf3 p\xe9rola; e a pra\xe7a da cidade era de ouro puro, transparente como vidro."},{verse:22,en:"And I saw no temple therein: for the Lord God Almighty and the Lamb are the temple of it.",pt:"Nela n\xe3o vi santu\xe1rio, porque o seu santu\xe1rio \xe9 o Senhor Deus Todo-Poderoso, e o Cordeiro."},{verse:23,en:"And the city had no need of the sun, neither of the moon, to shine in it: for the glory of God did lighten it, and the Lamb is the light thereof.",pt:"A cidade n\xe3o necessita nem do sol, nem da lua, para que nela resplande\xe7am, por\xe9m a gl\xf3ria de Deus a tem alumiado, e o Cordeiro \xe9 a sua l\xe2mpada."},{verse:24,en:"And the nations of them which are saved shall walk in the light of it: and the kings of the earth do bring their glory and honour into it.",pt:"As na\xe7\xf5es andar\xe3o \xe0 sua luz; e os reis da terra trar\xe3o para ela a sua gl\xf3ria."},{verse:25,en:"And the gates of it shall not be shut at all by day: for there shall be no night there.",pt:"As suas portas n\xe3o se fechar\xe3o de dia, e noite ali n\xe3o haver\xe1;"},{verse:26,en:"And they shall bring the glory and honour of the nations into it.",pt:"e a ela trar\xe3o a gl\xf3ria e a honra das na\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:27,en:"And there shall in no wise enter into it any thing that defileth, neither whatsoever worketh abomination, or maketh a lie: but they which are written in the Lamb\u2019s book of life.",pt:"E n\xe3o entrar\xe1 nela coisa alguma impura, nem o que pratica abomina\xe7\xe3o ou mentira; mas somente os que est\xe3o inscritos no livro da vida do Cordeiro."}]}}),860,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Revelation",bookPt:"Apocalipse",chapter:22,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And he shewed me a pure river of water of life, clear as crystal, proceeding out of the throne of God and of the Lamb.",pt:"E mostrou-me o rio da \xe1gua da vida, claro como cristal, que procedia do trono de Deus e do Cordeiro."},{verse:2,en:"In the midst of the street of it, and on either side of the river, was there the tree of life, which bare twelve manner of fruits, and yielded her fruit every month: and the leaves of the tree were for the healing of the nations.",pt:"No meio da sua pra\xe7a, e de ambos os lados do rio, estava a \xe1rvore da vida, que produz doze frutos, dando seu fruto de m\xeas em m\xeas; e as folhas da \xe1rvore s\xe3o para a cura das na\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:3,en:"And there shall be no more curse: but the throne of God and of the Lamb shall be in it; and his servants shall serve him:",pt:"Ali n\xe3o haver\xe1 jamais maldi\xe7\xe3o. Nela estar\xe1 o trono de Deus e do Cordeiro, e os seus servos o servir\xe3o,"},{verse:4,en:"And they shall see his face; and his name shall be in their foreheads.",pt:"e ver\xe3o a sua face; e nas suas frontes estar\xe1 o seu nome."},{verse:5,en:"And there shall be no night there; and they need no candle, neither light of the sun; for the Lord God giveth them light: and they shall reign for ever and ever.",pt:"E ali n\xe3o haver\xe1 mais noite, e n\xe3o necessitar\xe3o de luz de l\xe2mpada nem de luz do sol, porque o Senhor Deus os alumiar\xe1; e reinar\xe3o pelos s\xe9culos dos s\xe9culos."},{verse:6,en:"And he said unto me, These sayings are faithful and true: and the Lord God of the holy prophets sent his angel to shew unto his servants the things which must shortly be done.",pt:"E disse-me: Estas palavras s\xe3o fi\xe9is e verdadeiras; e o Senhor, o Deus dos esp\xedritos dos profetas, enviou o seu anjo, para mostrar aos seus servos as coisas que em breve h\xe3o de acontecer."},{verse:7,en:"Behold, I come quickly: blessed is he that keepeth the sayings of the prophecy of this book.",pt:"Eis que cedo venho; bem-aventurado aquele que guarda as palavras da profecia deste livro."},{verse:8,en:"And I John saw these things, and heard them. And when I had heard and seen, I fell down to worship before the feet of the angel which shewed me these things.",pt:"Eu, Jo\xe3o, sou o que ouvi e vi estas coisas. E quando as ouvi e vi, prostrei-me aos p\xe9s do anjo que mas mostrava, para o adorar."},{verse:9,en:"Then saith he unto me, See thou do it not: for I am thy fellowservant, and of thy brethren the prophets, and of them which keep the sayings of this book: worship God.",pt:"Mas ele me disse: Olha, n\xe3o fa\xe7as tal; porque eu sou conservo teu e de teus irm\xe3os, os profetas, e dos que guardam as palavras deste livro. Adora a Deus."},{verse:10,en:"And he saith unto me, Seal not the sayings of the prophecy of this book: for the time is at hand.",pt:"Disse-me ainda: N\xe3o seles as palavras da profecia deste livro; porque pr\xf3ximo est\xe1 o tempo."},{verse:11,en:"He that is unjust, let him be unjust still: and he which is filthy, let him be filthy still: and he that is righteous, let him be righteous still: and he that is holy, let him be holy still.",pt:"Quem \xe9 injusto, fa\xe7a injusti\xe7a ainda: e quem est\xe1 sujo, suje-se ainda; e quem \xe9 justo, fa\xe7a justi\xe7a ainda; e quem \xe9 santo, santifique-se ainda."},{verse:12,en:"And, behold, I come quickly; and my reward is with me, to give every man according as his work shall be.",pt:"Eis que cedo venho e est\xe1 comigo a minha recompensa, para retribuir a cada um segundo a sua obra."},{verse:13,en:"I am Alpha and Omega, the beginning and the end, the first and the last.",pt:"Eu sou o Alfa e o \xe8mega, o primeiro e o derradeiro, o princ\xedpio e o fim."},{verse:14,en:"Blessed are they that do his commandments, that they may have right to the tree of life, and may enter in through the gates into the city.",pt:"Bem-aventurados aqueles que lavam as suas vestes [no sangue do Cordeiro] para que tenham direito \xe0 arvore da vida, e possam entrar na cidade pelas portas."},{verse:15,en:"For without are dogs, and sorcerers, and whoremongers, and murderers, and idolaters, and whosoever loveth and maketh a lie.",pt:"Ficar\xe3o de fora os c\xe3es, os feiticeiros, os ad\xfalteros, os homicidas, os id\xf3latras, e todo o que ama e pratica a mentira."},{verse:16,en:"I Jesus have sent mine angel to testify unto you these things in the churches. I am the root and the offspring of David, and the bright and morning star.",pt:"Eu, Jesus, enviei o meu anjo para vos testificar estas coisas a favor das igrejas. Eu sou a raiz e a gera\xe7\xe3o de Davi, a resplandecente estrela da manh\xe3."},{verse:17,en:"And the Spirit and the bride say, Come. And let him that heareth say, Come. And let him that is athirst come. And whosoever will, let him take the water of life freely.",pt:"E o Esp\xedrito e a noiva dizem: Vem. E quem ouve, diga: Vem. E quem tem sede, venha; e quem quiser, receba de gra\xe7a a \xe1gua da vida."},{verse:18,en:"For I testify unto every man that heareth the words of the prophecy of this book, If any man shall add unto these things, God shall add unto him the plagues that are written in this book:",pt:"Eu testifico a todo aquele que ouvir as palavras da profecia deste livro: Se algu\xe9m lhes acrescentar alguma coisa, Deus lhe acrescentar\xe1 as pragas que est\xe3o escritas neste livro;"},{verse:19,en:"And if any man shall take away from the words of the book of this prophecy, God shall take away his part out of the book of life, and out of the holy city, and from the things which are written in this book.",pt:"e se algu\xe9m tirar qualquer coisa das palavras do livro desta profecia, Deus lhe tirar\xe1 a sua parte da \xe1rvore da vida, e da cidade santa, que est\xe3o descritas neste livro."},{verse:20,en:"He which testifieth these things saith, Surely I come quickly. Amen. Even so, come, Lord Jesus.",pt:"Aquele que testifica estas coisas diz: Certamente cedo venho. Am\xe9m; vem, Senhor Jesus."},{verse:21,en:"The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you all. Amen.",pt:"A gra\xe7a do Senhor Jesus seja com todos."}]}}),861,[]);
